(623,1,'brand',220,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Fairchild Semiconductor\",\"description\":\"Fairchild Semiconductor was a pioneering U.S.-based semiconductor company, famous for its power semiconductors and SMPS ICs\",\"info\":\"Fairchild was acquired by ON Semiconductor (onsemi), and many Fairchild product families continue under the onsemi portfolio.\\r\\n\\r\\n? Main Product Range (Legacy & Ongoing Families)\\r\\n\\r\\nPower MOSFETs\\r\\n\\r\\nDiodes & rectifiers\\r\\n\\r\\nBJTs & small-signal transistors\\r\\n\\r\\nSMPS & power management ICs\\r\\n\\r\\nOptocouplers & isolation components\\r\\n\\r\\n⚙️ Typical Applications\\r\\n\\r\\nSMPS & power supplies\\r\\n\\r\\nChargers & adapters\\r\\n\\r\\nIndustrial electronics\\r\\n\\r\\nConsumer appliances\\r\\n\\r\\nPower & energy-efficient designs\\r\\n\\r\\n? Position in Your PDF\\r\\n\\r\\nListed under Active Components\\r\\n\\r\\nLogo displayed as a stocked/distributed brand by Mercury Electronics Inc.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you want, I can also:\\r\\n\\r\\nMap Fairchild → onsemi replacement parts\\r\\n\\r\\nCompare Fairchild vs IR vs STMicroelectronics\\r\\n\\r\\nCreate website-ready legacy IC descriptions\\r\\n\\r\\nExtract all power-semiconductor brands from your PDF into one table\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1771497918214-267291548.jpg\"}','2026-02-19 10:45:18'),
