(680,1,'sector_title',1,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"name\":\"Manufacturing\",\"description\":\"Manufacturing is the process of converting raw materials or components into finished products through the use of machines, tools, labor, and technology. In common industries such as electronics and electricals, manufacturing involves assembling parts, testing performance, ensuring quality standards, and preparing products for market use.\",\"info\":\"General infIn electronics manufacturing, it includes producing items like circuit boards, semiconductors, computers, mobile phones, and consumer devices. The process typically involves designing circuits, fabricating printed circuit boards (PCBs), assembling electronic components, soldering, programming, and performing functional testing to ensure reliability and safety.o about recharge sector\",\"note\":\"In electrical manufacturing, it focuses on products that generate, distribute, or control electrical power, such as transformers, motors, generators, switchgear, cables, and wiring devices. The process includes material processing, coil winding, insulation, assembly, quality inspection, and compliance with electrical safety standards.\",\"system_note\":\"System generated noteOverall, manufacturing in electronics and electrical sectors emphasizes precision, automation, quality control, safety regulations, efficiency, and continuous improvement to meet industry standards and customer requirements.\",\"icon_name\":\"wallet\",\"link\":\"/recharge\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image_path\":\"sector-titles/1771508049437-492770671.jpg\"}','2026-02-19 13:34:09'),
(681,1,'sector_title',35,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"name\":\"Service\",\"description\":\"A System Note is an internal or technical message generated by a system or software to record actions, updates, warnings, or operational details.\",\"info\":\"Service Info refers to brief and important details that give quick knowledge about a product, feature, or system without lengthy explanation.\",\"note\":\"Covers multiple locations or regions\\r\\nProvides warranty and after-sales support\\r\\nEnsures quick service response\\r\\nMaintains product performance and reliability\\r\\nIncludes trained technicians and spare parts availability\",\"system_note\":\"A System Note is an internal or technical message generated by a system or software to record actions, updates, warnings, or operational details.\",\"icon_name\":\"\",\"link\":\"https://circuitpoint.in/service\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image_path\":\"sector-titles/1771508495546-851931015.png\"}','2026-02-19 13:41:35'),
(682,1,'sector',18,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"sector_title_id\":\"35\",\"sector_name\":\"Internet Connections\",\"description\":\"An internet connection is a communication link that allows devices such as computers, routers, servers, and IoT systems to connect to the global internet for data exchange, communication, and online services. Internet connectivity is provided by Internet Service Providers (ISPs) using different transmission technologies.\",\"info\":\"\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_name\":\"\",\"link\":\"https://circuitpoint.in/internet-connections\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"sectors/1771508904679-799481127.png\"}','2026-02-19 13:48:24'),
(683,1,'sector',19,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"sector_title_id\":\"1\",\"sector_name\":\"Electronics\",\"description\":\"Electronics is a branch of science and engineering that deals with the study, design, and application of devices and systems that control the flow of electrical current. Unlike basic electrical systems that mainly handle power (like motors and lighting), electronics focuses on low-voltage circuits used for signal processing, communication, automation, and computing.\",\"info\":\"\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_name\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"sectors/1771509164287-112150927.jpg\"}','2026-02-19 13:52:44'),
(684,1,'sector',20,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"sector_title_id\":\"1\",\"sector_name\":\"Electrical\",\"description\":\"Electrical items are products and components used for the generation, distribution, control, and safe usage of electrical power in homes, offices, shops, and industries. These items help in wiring, protection, lighting, and operating electrical appliances safely and efficiently. Electrical items are mainly designed to handle high voltage and power loads, ensuring smooth electricity flow and protection against short circuits, overloads, and electrical faults. \",\"info\":\"\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_name\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"sectors/1771509643941-317801056.jpg\"}','2026-02-19 14:00:43'),
(685,1,'sector',21,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"sector_title_id\":\"1\",\"sector_name\":\"Security\",\"description\":\"Manufacturing security refers to the measures, systems, and practices used to protect manufacturing facilities, equipment, data, employees, and products from threats such as theft, sabotage, cyberattacks, and unauthorized access.\",\"info\":\"\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_name\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"sectors/1771510065896-273244665.jpg\"}','2026-02-19 14:07:45'),
(686,1,'sub_sector',13,'create',NULL,'{\"sector_title_id\":\"35\",\"sector_id\":\"18\",\"sub_sector_name\":\"Network\",\"description\":\"Network & Network Accessories focuses on providing connectivity solutions, communication infrastructure, and essential accessories required for building and maintaining reliable computer and mobile networks.\",\"info\":\"They form the backbone of modern networking infrastructure, ensuring smooth and secure communication between multiple devices.\",\"note\":\"Speed measured in Mbps or Gbps\\r\\nLatency affects real-time applications\\r\\nUpload vs Download speeds vary by connection type\\r\\nIP Addressing: Static or Dynamic\\r\\nSecurity: Firewalls, encryption, ISP-level protection\",\"system_note\":\"Networking devices are hardware components used to connect computers, smartphones, and other electronic systems to create communication networks. These devices enable data transfer, internet connectivity, wireless communication, and resource sharing across homes, offices, and industries.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"sub-sectors/1771510507838-780933078.png\"}','2026-02-19 14:15:07'),
(687,1,'sub_sector',14,'create',NULL,'{\"sector_title_id\":\"1\",\"sector_id\":\"19\",\"sub_sector_name\":\"Audio\",\"description\":\"The technology and recorded representation of that sound, making it portable, shareable, and manipulable. Audio refers to sound, especially when recorded, transmitted, or reproduced electronically, encompassing speech, music, and noise, and involves technologies for capturing (microphones), processing (digital signals, formats like MP3), storing, and playing back sound waves, essential in media, communication, and entertainment.\",\"info\":\"Devices like speakers, headphones, and amplifiers play back these electrical signals as audible sound, creating immersive experiences like stereo or surround sound.\",\"note\":\"speakers, headphones, and amplifiers\",\"system_note\":\"MP3, amplifiers, speakers\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"sub-sectors/1771514103865-13433275.jpg\"}','2026-02-19 15:15:03'),
(688,1,'brand',88,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Havells\",\"description\":\"Havells India Ltd. is one of India’s leading and most trusted brands in electrical products and solutions, known for innovation, safety, energy efficiency, and premium design.\",\"info\":\"Havells offers a comprehensive portfolio that serves residential, commercial, and industrial needs across India and international markets.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1771558717042-68470460.jpg\"}','2026-02-20 03:38:37'),
(689,1,'brand',166,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"HB Hornby Electronic\",\"description\":\"Hornby Electronic is an electronics brand primarily associated with passive components, especially aluminum electrolytic capacitors used in general-purpose and power-electronics applications.\",\"info\":\"The brand is typically chosen for cost-effective, dependable performance in high-volume assemblies.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1771558765454-128560265.jpg\"}','2026-02-20 03:39:25'),
(690,1,'brand',124,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Hikvision\",\"description\":\"Hikvision integrates AI-powered analytics, deep learning features, and smart detection capabilities in many of its cameras and systems, providing functions\",\"info\":\"Hikvision is partly state-owned and based in China, some governments have placed restrictions or bans on its use in sensitive government installations due to national security and data privacy concerns.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1771558812710-105958962.png\"}','2026-02-20 03:40:12'),
