(1109,1,'product',733,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"16-Channel 12-bit PWM Servo Motor Driver\",\"description\":\"16-Channel 12-bit PWM Servo Motor Driver Module is a powerful and flexible controller designed for driving multiple servos or LEDs with precise timing and smooth movement. It is based on the popular PCA9685 PWM driver IC, which communicates using the I2C interface, allowing easy control using Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and other microcontrollers.\",\"info\":\"The 16-Channel 12-bit PWM Servo Motor Driver is a dedicated controller used to drive up to 16 servo motors or LEDs with precise timing. Based on an I²C interface, it provides 12-bit resolution (4096 steps) for smooth and accurate control, independent of the microcontroller’s PWM pins. Commonly used in robotics, robotic arms, hexapods, RC projects, and Arduino/Raspberry Pi systems, it ensures stable performance with minimal CPU load.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"799.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":453,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771657005839-739479998.jpg\"}','2026-02-21 06:56:45'),
