(1328,1,'product',2604,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"32 inch smart Tv\",\"description\":\"A 32-inch Smart TV is a compact, connected television designed for modern digital entertainment in bedrooms, small living spaces, kitchens, or offices. It combines a 32-inch HD or Full HD display with built-in smart features such as Wi-Fi connectivity, pre-loaded streaming apps (like YouTube, Netflix, Amazon Prime Video, and more), and an easy-to-navigate user interface , allowing you to watch online content directly without needing external devices.\",\"info\":\"Most 32-inch smart TVs use LED panel technology, providing bright visuals, good color reproduction, and clear picture quality at a small to medium viewing distance. They typically support multiple connectivity options including HDMI, USB, and screen mirroring, so you can connect gaming consoles, set-top boxes, laptops, flash drives, and mobile phones.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"25000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771669272906-388652497.jpg\"}','2026-02-21 10:21:12'),
