(1468,1,'product',2244,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"The 470µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for power supply filtering, energy storage, and voltage smoothing applications. It is commonly used in SMPS power supplies, inverter circuits, LED drivers, and industrial electronic equipment to reduce ripple voltage and stabilize DC output after rectification.This polarized capacitor provides high capacitance with reliable performance, making it suitable for high-voltage and high-current circuits.\",\"info\":\"Built with durable aluminum electrolyte construction, it offers good endurance, stable electrical characteristics, and long operational life when used within rated voltage and temperature limits. Typically available in a radial lead through-hole package, the 470µF 250V capacitor is widely used in power electronics and amplifier power sections for efficient and stable circuit operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771674134362-281815958.jpeg\"}','2026-02-21 11:42:14'),
(1469,1,'product',2199,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 35V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"470µF 35V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and energy storage in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 470 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 35 volts DC, it is ideal for power supply and control circuits that operate at moderate voltages.\",\"info\":\"470µF 35V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS secondary circuits, motor driver boards, LED driver circuits, and consumer electronics. It generally comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum package, designed for easy PCB mounting and long service life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771674160049-188716420.jpg\"}','2026-02-21 11:42:40'),
(1470,1,'category',226,'update',NULL,NULL,'2026-02-21 11:43:25'),
(1471,1,'product',2243,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 450V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"The 470µF 450V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor widely used in power supply and energy storage applications. It is designed to smooth and filter rectified DC voltage by reducing ripple and electrical noise in high-power electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is commonly found in SMPS power supplies, inverters, LED drivers, industrial equipment, and audio amplifier power sections where stable high-voltage operation is required. Being a polarized component, it must be connected with correct polarity for safe operation\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"Built with durable aluminum electrolytic construction, it provides high capacitance, reliable performance, and long service life under proper operating conditions. The capacitor is typically available in a radial lead through-hole package and operates efficiently in circuits requiring high voltage handling and stable DC filtering.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771674256718-225921570.jpeg\"}','2026-02-21 11:44:16'),
(1472,1,'product',2212,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"470µF 50V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and bulk decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 470 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is well suited for power supply and control circuits operating at moderate voltage levels.\",\"info\":\"The 470µF 50V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS secondary circuits, motor driver boards, LED driver circuits, and industrial electronics. It generally comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and long service life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771674285147-290204882.jpeg\"}','2026-02-21 11:44:45'),
(1473,1,'category',80,'update',NULL,NULL,'2026-02-21 11:45:03'),
(1474,1,'product',2234,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 470µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and bulk decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 470 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that require higher voltage tolerance along with moderate energy storage.\",\"info\":\"The 470µF 63V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS secondary circuits, industrial control boards, motor driver circuits, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771674306092-764196123.jpeg\"}','2026-02-21 11:45:06'),
(1475,1,'category',125,'update',NULL,NULL,'2026-02-21 11:47:37'),
(1476,1,'product',2174,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"472 NTC\",\"description\":\"The 472 NTC thermistor is a temperature-sensitive resistor in which resistance decreases as temperature increases, making it suitable for temperature sensing and compensation applications. The “472” marking indicates a resistance value of 4.7KΩ at 25°C, commonly used in electronic control circuits for accurate thermal monitoring.\",\"info\":\"It provides fast thermal response, high sensitivity, and stable performance across a wide temperature range. This thermistor is widely used in battery chargers, power supplies, air conditioners, home appliances, and industrial electronic systems for temperature detection and protection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"Typically available in an epoxy-coated bead type with radial leads, the 472 NTC offers reliable operation, compact size, and easy PCB mounting for various electronic designs.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771674464431-984205884.jpeg\"}','2026-02-21 11:47:44'),
(1477,1,'product',725,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47k ohm Resistor\",\"description\":\"A 47k ohm resistor is one of the most widely used fixed resistors in electronics, offering a resistance value of 47,000 ohms. It is commonly used for voltage dividers, signal conditioning, biasing, filter circuits, and pull-up/pull-down applications in microcontroller circuits.\",\"info\":\"It is commonly used for current limiting, voltage division, pull-up/pull-down, and signal conditioning in electronic circuits. Known for its stability and versatility, it is available in carbon film and metal film types and is suitable for both hobbyist and professional electronics applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"39.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":413,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771674486697-542975093.jpg\"}','2026-02-21 11:48:06'),
(1478,1,'category',375,'update',NULL,NULL,'2026-02-21 11:48:44'),
(1479,1,'product',2253,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47nF (473)\",\"description\":\"A 47 nF (473) ceramic capacitor is a non-polarized capacitor that uses a ceramic dielectric to store and release electrical energy efficiently. The marking 473 represents 47,000 pF, calculated as 47 × 10³ pF, which is equal to 47 nF or 0.047 µF.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor value is widely available in ceramic disc (through-hole) and MLCC / SMD types. It offers good high-frequency performance, low dielectric loss, and stable operation, making it suitable for general-purpose electronic circuits. Typical voltage ratings range from 50 V to 630 V for disc capacitors, while MLCC versions are commonly rated 16 V to 100 V, depending on package size and dielectric class.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771674530490-843083823.jpg\"}','2026-02-21 11:48:50'),
(1480,1,'product',2187,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47uF 100V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"47µF 100V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used for filtering, smoothing, and energy storage in electronic circuits. It has a capacitance of 47 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 100 volts DC, making it suitable for circuits that operate at higher voltages than standard low-voltage electronics.\",\"info\":\"47µF 100V capacitor is widely used in SMPS circuits, audio amplifiers, power adapters, industrial control boards, inverter circuits, and high-voltage DC sections of electronic devices. It is usually available in a radial-lead cylindrical package, designed for reliable PCB mounting and long service life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771674563021-170644771.jpeg\"}','2026-02-21 11:49:23'),
