(2096,1,'product',395,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Dell 19.5V 4.62A Big Pin Laptop adapter\",\"description\":\"The Dell 19.5V 4.62A Laptop Adapter (90W) with 7.4×5.0mm Big Pin connector is a high-quality, durable, and efficient power charger designed to deliver stable DC output and fast charging for Dell laptops. It features OEM-grade build quality, multiple safety protections, and high energy efficiency, making it a perfect replacement or spare adapter for your Dell notebook.\",\"info\":\"A Dell 19.5 V 4.62 A (90 W) big-pin laptop adapter is an AC/DC power supply that converts standard mains power (100–240 V AC) into 19.5 V DC at 4.62 amps (90 W) and delivers it through the large barrel connector (7.4 × 5.0 mm) used by many Dell notebooks.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1299.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":281,\"secondary_id\":61,\"brand_id\":49}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905276182-747546414.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 03:54:36'),
(2097,1,'product',347,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Dell 90W Laptop Adapter\",\"description\":\"The Techie 90W Laptop Adapter is a high-performance universal laptop power supply designed to deliver up to 90 watts of reliable output for a wide range of laptops and notebooks. With multiple interchangeable tips, smart voltage compatibility, and advanced protection features, it’s a perfect replacement or backup adapter for brands like HP, Dell, Lenovo, Acer, Asus, Toshiba, and Samsung.\",\"info\":\"A 90 W replacement laptop power adapter designed for Dell notebooks. Converts standard AC mains power to a stable DC output  with built-in protections against over-current, short circuit, and overheating. Compatible with Dell laptops requiring a 90 W power supply, typically featuring a barrel or proprietary Dell tip.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1299.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":281,\"secondary_id\":61,\"brand_id\":47}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905302671-126287382.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 03:55:02'),
(2098,1,'product',2287,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Desoldering Pump\",\"description\":\"The Soldron SI15-30A is a plug-in variable-wattage soldering iron designed for general-purpose soldering tasks. Instead of a fixed power level, this model lets you adjust the heat output between about 15 W and 30 W, giving you flexibility for light to moderate solder jobs without needing a full soldering station.\",\"info\":\"The process involves heating the parts to be joined, applying flux to clean the surfaces, melting solder onto the hot parts (not the iron tip directly), and letting it cool to form a strong, conductive connection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905330253-308087710.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 03:55:30'),
(2099,1,'product',174,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DF Player mini MP3\",\"description\":\"The DFPlayer Mini is a low-cost MP3 player module with a built-in audio decoder (MP3/WAV) and microSD card reader, controlled via UART serial commands or simple I/O pins.\",\"info\":\"The DFPlayer Mini MP3 Module is a compact and low-cost audio playback module capable of playing MP3 and WAV audio files directly from a microSD card. It features a built-in MP3 decoder and amplifier, allowing direct connection to a speaker without additional audio circuitry.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"450.00\",\"note\":\"The DFPlayer Mini MP3 Module is a compact and low-cost audio playback module capable of playing MP3 and WAV audio files directly from a microSD card. It features a built-in MP3 decoder and amplifier, allowing direct connection to a speaker without additional audio circuitry.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905422165-287025176.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 03:57:02'),
(2100,1,'product',68,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DHT11 Humidity Temperature Module\",\"description\":\"The DHT11 is a digital temperature and humidity sensor that measures the surrounding air and outputs the data as a digital signal through a single pin\",\"info\":\"The DHT11 Humidity Temperature Module is an easy-to-use, beginner-friendly digital sensor for measuring basic environmental conditions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"450.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905450151-379756917.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 03:57:30'),
(2101,1,'product',67,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DHT22 MODULE\",\"description\":\"The DHT22 is a digital temperature and humidity sensor that uses a capacitive humidity sensor and a thermistor to measure the surrounding air\",\"info\":\"The DHT22, also known as AM2302, is a digital temperature and humidity sensor module offering higher accuracy and a wider measurement range than the DHT11.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"950.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905489034-216797492.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 03:58:09'),
(2102,1,'product',1319,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DISCOVERY F407G\",\"description\":\"The Discovery F407G (STM32F407G-DISCOVERY) is an evaluation and development board from STMicroelectronics featuring the STM32F407VGT6 ARM Cortex-M4 microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"It provides a rich set of onboard peripherals (including sensors, audio codec, and connector headers), USB OTG, and integrated ST-LINK debugger/programmer, making it ideal for advanced embedded projects, DSP applications, real-time control, sensor interfacing, and high-performance IoT/robotics prototypes.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"3250.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905546830-326016448.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 03:59:06'),
(2103,1,'product',1317,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DISCOVERY STM32F072\",\"description\":\"The STM32F072 Discovery Kit is a development and evaluation board featuring the STM32F072 microcontroller from STMicroelectronics. It’s designed for rapid prototyping and learning with the ARM Cortex-M0 architecture, offering a range of onboard peripherals (USB, GPIOs, timers, ADC/DAC, communication interfaces) and easy connectivity for debugging and programming.\",\"info\":\"This board is widely used for embedded system development, USB applications, sensor interfacing, motor control, and low-power projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"3500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905568561-525416869.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 03:59:28'),
(2104,1,'product',2319,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DJ Speaker  TT-DJL-2121\",\"description\":\"The DJ Speaker TT-DJL-2121 is a powerful tower-style audio speaker system designed to deliver loud, clear sound for parties, events, home gatherings, and entertainment setups.\",\"info\":\"This model typically features Bluetooth connectivity, allowing you to wirelessly stream music directly from your smartphone, tablet, or laptop. It also supports USB input and Auxiliary connections so you can play music from a range of devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":475,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905595646-863423621.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 03:59:55'),
(2105,1,'product',2492,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DM542 Stepper motor\",\"description\":\"The DM542 is a high-performance two-phase microstepping stepper motor driver commonly used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and other motion control applications\",\"info\":\"It’s designed to precisely control bipolar stepper motors with adjustable current and microstepping settings, giving you smooth motion and good torque across a wide speed range.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905620969-398655404.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:00:20'),
(2106,1,'product',301,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DMG 10600 C101_03 WTC 10.1 inch CAP\",\"description\":\"The DMG10600C101_03WTC is a 10.1-inch industrial-grade TFT LCD display module with a capacitive multi-touch panel and 1024×600 pixel resolution.It delivers crisp visuals, smooth touch performance, and long-term reliability, making it perfect for HMI systems, industrial automation, IoT terminals, and embedded display applications.\",\"info\":\"An industrial-grade 10.1inch capacitive touch IPS display with 1024 × 600 resolution, ideal for HMIs, embedded interfaces, and control panels\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"9750.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905677060-209812562.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:01:17'),
(2107,1,'product',571,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DOT  Board PCB 5x7cm\",\"description\":\"The 5×7 cm Dot PCB is a compact universal prototyping board used for building custom electronic circuits with soldered connections.\",\"info\":\"A 5×7 cm dot board PCB is a solderable prototyping board with evenly spaced copper dots, used to permanently assemble electronic circuits. It is ideal for DIY electronics projects, circuit testing, and small electronic assemblies where a custom PCB is not required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"599.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905884360-572972199.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:04:44'),
(2108,1,'product',569,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Dot Board 4x4 inch\",\"description\":\"The 4×4 inch Dot Board PCB is a high-quality universal prototyping board used to build and solder custom electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"A 4×4 inch dot board is a solderable prototyping PCB with uniformly spaced copper dots, used to permanently build and test electronic circuits. It is ideal for DIY electronics, project development, and small circuit assemblies without needing a custom PCB.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"899.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905914343-843689951.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:05:14'),
(2109,1,'product',567,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DOT BOARD PCB SIZE 4×3 INCHES\",\"description\":\"The 4×3 inch Dot Board PCB is a universal prototyping board used for building custom electronic circuits. It is ideal for DIY electronics, Arduino projects, sensors, small modules, and experimental circuit building.\",\"info\":\"A 4×3 inch dot board PCB is a general-purpose solderable prototyping board with evenly spaced copper dots on one side, used to permanently assemble electronic circuits. It is ideal for DIY projects, circuit testing, and small electronic assemblies where custom PCBs are not required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"699.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905939447-953223216.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:05:39'),
(2110,1,'product',2435,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Drone Transmitter and Recevier\",\"description\":\"A drone transmitter and receiver form the core communication system between the pilot and the drone.\",\"info\":\". The receiver, mounted inside the drone, captures these signals and forwards them to the flight controller, which then drives the motors, servos, and onboard systems accordingly.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771905968878-435615655.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:06:08'),
(2111,1,'product',456,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DRS-716 Drone Set\",\"description\":\"The DRS-716 Drone Set is a complete DIY quadcopter kit designed for students, beginners, and hobbyists who want to learn drone building and flight control.\",\"info\":\"DRS-716 Drone Set is a compact and lightweight educational drone kit designed for learning, experimentation, and basic flight practice\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"599.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":80,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906107451-714620787.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:08:27'),
(2112,1,'product',448,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DS1307\",\"description\":\"DS1307 is a real-time clock (RTC) IC used to keep accurate time and date in electronic systems. It communicates via the I²C interface and includes a battery backup feature to maintain time during power loss.\",\"info\":\"The DS1307 is commonly used in digital clocks, data loggers, embedded systems, and microcontroller-based projects where reliable timekeeping is required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"69.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":73,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906139834-809584198.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:08:59'),
(2113,1,'product',2137,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DS18B20 Waterproof Digital Temperature\",\"description\":\"The DS18B20 Waterproof Digital Temperature Sensor is a high-accuracy, digital temperature sensor sealed in a stainless steel probe, making it suitable for wet, humid, and harsh environments.\",\"info\":\"It uses the 1-Wire communication protocol, allowing multiple sensors to be connected on a single data line, each with a unique ID.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906164498-659586343.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:09:24'),
(2114,1,'product',2373,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Dual Channel PWM\",\"description\":\"The Dual Channel PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) Module is an electronic control module designed to generate two independent PWM output signals. It allows precise control of speed, brightness, power, or position by varying the duty cycle of each channel separately. This makes it ideal for motor control, LED dimming, and power regulation applications.\",\"info\":\"The Dual Channel PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) module is an electronic control unit that produces two separate PWM output signals. Each channel can be adjusted independently, allowing precise control of devices that rely on variable power or signal timing.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906186959-289471420.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:09:46'),
(2115,1,'product',1697,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DVD Motor\",\"description\":\"DVD Motor is a compact, high-speed DC motor commonly used in DVD players, CD drives, and small electronic mechanisms. Designed for smooth and precise rotation, this motor is capable of spinning discs at stable and controlled speeds, making it suitable for various DIY and hobby applications.\",\"info\":\"DVD motors typically operate on 3V–12V DC and are known for their low noise, high RPM, and lightweight design.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"149.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":459,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906281557-176379400.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:11:21'),
(2116,1,'product',2362,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DVD PLAYER TT-444\",\"description\":\"The Target TT-444 MPEG4 Technology 5.1 Channel DVD Player is a versatile multimedia player designed to bring your favorite movies and music to life with crisp video and immersive sound.\",\"info\":\"It supports a wide range of formats including DVD, CD, MP3 and MP4, and comes equipped with HDMI output, built-in amplifier, USB and SD/MMC card ports for easy media playback from multiple sources.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"5999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906365107-172537829.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:12:45'),
(2117,1,'product',485,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Dynamo Motor\",\"description\":\"Dynamo Motor, often called a DC generator, is a device that converts mechanical energy into electrical energy using electromagnetic induction. When the motor’s shaft is rotated by hand, wind, water, or any mechanical source, it produces a DC voltage output, making it ideal for small power generation applications.\",\"info\":\"A Dynamo Motor is an electromechanical device that converts mechanical energy into electrical energy using electromagnetic induction\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"299.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":459,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906466044-439022926.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:14:26'),
(2118,1,'product',124,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ECG MODULE AD8232\",\"description\":\"The AD8232 is an analog front-end for ECG and biopotential measurement made by Analog Devices.\\r\\nIt’s used to amplify, filter, and condition the weak electrical signals generated by the heart, producing a clean, readable ECG waveform output.\",\"info\":\"The AD8232 ECG Module is a biomedical signal conditioning module designed to measure and monitor the electrical activity of the heart (ECG – Electrocardiogram)\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2100.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":23,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906730995-378806164.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:18:51'),
(2119,1,'product',474,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"EL 817\",\"description\":\"EL817 is an optocoupler (optical isolator) IC used to provide electrical isolation between input and output circuits. It contains an infrared LED and a phototransistor in a single package, allowing signals to be transferred optically while protecting low-voltage control circuits from high-voltage or noisy environments.\",\"info\":\"The EL817 is widely used in SMPS, relay driving, microcontroller interfacing, and industrial control applications\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":73,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906755891-962702664.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:19:15'),
(2120,1,'product',2288,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Electric Soldering Iron\",\"description\":\"An electric soldering iron is a handheld tool used to heat solder (metal alloy) and join metal parts together especially in electronics and electrical work. It converts electrical power into heat through a heating element, allowing the tip to melt solder and create strong, conductive connections between wires, components, and circuit boards.\",\"info\":\"An electric soldering iron is a hand-held tool that uses electricity to generate heat for melting solder, the metal alloy used to join metal parts together. It’s one of the most common tools in electronics, electrical work, and DIY projects because it makes permanent, conductive joints between wires and components.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906779240-557099544.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:19:39'),
(2121,1,'product',2143,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Emergency LED Light Circuit PCB Board\",\"description\":\"An Emergency LED Light Circuit PCB Board is a compact electronic board designed to automatically turn on LED lights during a power failure.\",\"info\":\"It typically integrates a battery charging section, power management, and LED driver circuit on a single PCB, ensuring reliable illumination when mains power is unavailable.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906800810-283684017.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:20:00'),
(2122,1,'product',123,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"EMG Muscle Sensor Module V3\",\"description\":\"The EMG Muscle Sensor v3 detects electrical activity generated by muscles when they contract.\\r\\nIt amplifies and filters the small EMG signals from electrodes placed on your skin, producing a clean analog output voltage that corresponds to muscle activity intensity.\",\"info\":\"The EMG Muscle Sensor Module V3 is a biomedical signal acquisition module designed to measure electrical activity produced by skeletal muscles\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"3450.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":23,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771906868145-142327828.jpg\"}','2026-02-24 04:21:08'),
