(2468,1,'product',93,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NPK 7 IN 1 SOIL SENSOR\",\"description\":\"Great—here’s a detailed breakdown of the 7?in?1 Soil Sensor (NPK + EC + pH + Temp + Moisture) (also called “NPK 7-in-1 Soil Sensor”) to help you decide whether it fits your project (given your sensor/IoT/web-stack work) and how to integrate it.\",\"info\":\"The NPK 7-in-1 Soil Sensor is a multifunctional agricultural sensor designed to measure key soil parameters that affect plant growth and crop yield.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"8900.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993567447-631497356.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:26:07'),
(2469,1,'product',160,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NRF Base Board\",\"description\":\"This is a simple socket board which is for NRF24L01 Wireless module.\",\"info\":\"The nRF Base Board is a convenient adapter and power supply board designed for nRF24L01 / nRF24L01+ wireless RF modules, including PA + LNA versions. It provides a stable 3.3V regulated power supply and easy pin access, ensuring reliable operation of nRF modules without power fluctuation issues.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"220.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":177,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993598769-222466075.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:26:38'),
(2470,1,'product',158,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NRF module with Antenna PA+LNA\",\"description\":\"This wireless transceiver module is an easy and suitable module if you want to setup your wireless communication system\\r\\nIt can achieve a good balance between wireless transition performanceYou can easily add it with your own mcu/arm/pic/avr/stm32 system\",\"info\":\"The nRF Module with Antenna (PA + LNA) is a high-power 2.4 GHz wireless transceiver module designed for long-range, stable RF communication. It is based on the nRF24L01+ chipset and includes a Power Amplifier (PA) for increased transmit power and a Low Noise Amplifier (LNA) for improved receiver sensitivity.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"650.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":445,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993623241-76416392.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:27:03'),
(2471,1,'product',697,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NTC Thermistor\",\"description\":\"The NTC Thermistor (Negative Temperature Coefficient Thermistor) is a temperature-sensitive resistor whose resistance decreases as temperature increases. It is made from semiconductor materials such as metal oxides, which provide high sensitivity to temperature changes. When the surrounding temperature rises, the electrical resistance of the thermistor drops significantly, allowing it to accurately measure temperature variations. Due to this characteristic, NTC thermistors are widely used for temperature sensing, monitoring, and compensation applications in electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"NTC thermistors are commonly available in various resistance values such as 10KΩ, 47KΩ, or 100KΩ at 25°C, and they operate with low power consumption. They can be easily interfaced with microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP8266, and ESP32 using a voltage divider circuit to convert resistance changes into measurable voltage signals.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"399.00\",\"note\":\"NTC thermistors are widely used in battery temperature monitoring, power supplies, HVAC systems, medical devices, automotive electronics, home appliances, and IoT temperature control systems. They are also used for inrush current limiting and thermal protection in electronic equipment.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993690483-722960043.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:28:10'),
(2472,1,'product',1318,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO F072\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F072 is a compact development board from STMicroelectronics based on the STM32F072 series ARM Cortex-M0 microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"It provides an affordable, user-friendly platform for prototyping and embedded development, featuring Arduino-compatible headers, ST morpho expansion pins, and integrated ST-LINK debugger/programmer. Ideal for learning, sensor interfacing, USB-based projects, and low-power embedded applications using the STM32 ecosystem.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2100.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993712020-763907508.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:28:32'),
(2473,1,'product',147,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO F303RE\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F303RE is a powerful development board from STMicroelectronics designed for prototyping and developing embedded applications using the STM32F303RE microcontroller, which is based on the ARM Cortex-M4 core. It operates at a clock speed of up to 72 MHz and includes a built-in floating-point unit (FPU) and digital signal processing (DSP) instructions, making it suitable for real-time control, motor control, signal processing, and industrial applications.\",\"info\":\"The board features an onboard ST-LINK/V2-1 debugger and programmer, allowing direct programming and debugging through a USB connection without requiring external hardware. It supports multiple development environments including STM32CubeIDE, Keil MDK, IAR Embedded Workbench, and Arduino IDE\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2100.00\",\"note\":\"The STM32F303RE microcontroller includes rich peripherals such as ADCs, DACs, timers, UART, SPI, I2C, CAN interface, and PWM outputs, making the board ideal for advanced embedded system design. It is widely used in motor control systems, robotics, industrial automation, sensor interfacing, data acquisition, and educational embedded development due to its high processing performance and extensive peripheral support.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993821852-96946252.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:30:21'),
(2474,1,'product',1324,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO F410\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F410 (officially the NUCLEO-F410RB) is a compact STM32 Nucleo-64 development board from STMicroelectronics featuring the STM32F410RB ARM Cortex-M4 microcontroller\",\"info\":\"It offers an integrated ST-LINK/V2-1 debugger/programmer, Arduino Uno R3 expansion headers, and ST Morpho expansion pins, making it ideal for embedded system prototyping, sensor interfacing, and learning ARM development.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2550.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993845579-703925564.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:30:45'),
(2475,1,'product',1326,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO F411RE\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F411RE is a compact and affordable STM32 Nucleo-64 development board from STMicroelectronics built around the STM32F411RET6 32-bit ARM Cortex-M4 microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"It features Arduino Uno R3 compatible headers and ST Morpho expansion pins for easy connection of shields and external modules, plus an integrated ST-LINK/V2-1 debugger/programmer so you can develop and debug firmware without any external tools.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993865030-952595860.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:31:05'),
(2476,1,'product',1323,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO F446RE\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F446RE is a compact STM32 Nucleo-64 development board from STMicroelectronics built around the STM32F446RET6 ARM Cortex-M4 microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"It provides an affordable and flexible platform for embedded system prototyping and learning, with built-in ST-LINK/V2-1 programmer/debugger, Arduino Uno R3 compatibility, and ST Morpho expansion headers to connect shields and modules easily.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"3100.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993887194-368111358.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:31:27'),
(2477,1,'product',1320,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO-F401RE STM32 Development Board\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F401RE is a compact and versatile 32-bit STM32 development board from STMicroelectronics built around the STM32F401RET6 ARM Cortex-M4 microcontroller\",\"info\":\"It’s designed for rapid prototyping and embedded system development, offering Arduino Uno R3 compatibility, ST Morpho expansion headers, and an integrated ST-LINK debugger/programmer — all in a low-cost, flexible platform\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2650.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993907580-152614925.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:31:47'),
(2478,1,'product',1417,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NX3224K028 – Nextion 2.8 inch Enhanced Series HMI Touch Display\",\"description\":\"The NX3224K028 is a 2.8-inch HMI (Human-Machine Interface) touchscreen module from the Nextion Enhanced Series. It’s more than just a display + touch panel: it includes a built-in controller, flash storage for UI data, and supports functions such as RTC, GPIO, etc.\",\"info\":\"A compact 2.8-inch Enhanced Series Human-Machine Interface (HMI) touch display with 320×240 TFT resistive touchscreen, designed for easy graphical interface control in embedded and IoT projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"8000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771993959042-808151769.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:32:39'),
(2479,1,'product',1414,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NX4024K032 – Nextion 3.2” Enhanced Series HMI Touch Display\",\"description\":\"This is the 3.2-inch “Enhanced Series” HMI touchscreen from Nextion (model NX4024K032). The “Enhanced” series means it’s a step up from their Basic line: more flash memory, IO/GPIO support, RTC support, etc.\",\"info\":\"Screen Size: 3.2? diagonal. \\r\\nResolution: 400 × 240 pixels. \\r\\nMemory: 16 MB of Flash (for UI/resources). \\r\\nRAM / EEPROM: 3 584 bytes RAM + 1 024 bytes EEPROM. \\r\\nInterface: TTL serial (4-pin XH2.54) for RX/TX + power.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994003285-221713470.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:33:23'),
(2480,1,'product',1411,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NX8048K070 – Nextion 7.0” Enhanced Series HMI Touch Display\",\"description\":\"The NX8048K070 from the Nextion Enhanced Series is a 7.0-inch HMI (Human-Machine Interface) touch display module that comes with its own on-board microcontroller, GUI capability, and a serial (UART) interface.\",\"info\":\"Screen size: 7.0? diagonal with resolution 800 × 480 pixels. \\r\\nVisual/active area: ~ 154.08 mm × 85.92 mm (visual area) and module layout size ~ 181 mm × 108 mm × 9.3 mm. \\r\\nColours: 65K (65,536) colours. \\r\\nFlash storage: 32 MB for GUI data and resources. \\r\\nRAM: 8192 bytes (8 KB) for runtime.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"11000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994139022-316949962.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:35:39'),
(2481,1,'product',2133,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OLED Display Module\",\"description\":\"The OLED Display Module (Organic Light Emitting Diode Display) is a compact and energy-efficient display device widely used in embedded systems and IoT projects for showing text, graphics, and sensor data. Unlike traditional LCD displays, OLED technology does not require a backlight because each pixel emits its own light, resulting in high contrast, wide viewing angles, faster response time, and lower power consumption. This makes OLED displays highly suitable for portable and battery-powered electronic devices.\",\"info\":\"Most OLED modules commonly use display sizes such as 0.96 inch or 1.3 inch with resolutions like 128×64 or 128×32 pixels. They typically communicate using I2C or SPI interfaces, allowing easy connection with microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and STM32 boards. The module operates at 3.3V or 5V, and includes an onboard controller (commonly SSD1306 or SH1106) that simplifies display control through available software libraries.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"OLED display modules are widely used in IoT dashboards, wearable devices, digital meters, sensor monitoring systems, robotics, smart home projects, and portable instruments. Due to their small size, clear visibility, low power usage, and simple interfacing, OLED displays are one of the most popular display solutions for modern electronics and embedded development projects.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994315781-430576416.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:38:35'),
(2482,1,'product',2057,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OND RC-2213 LCD Remote\",\"description\":\"This remote is sold as a replacement/compatible remote for Onida brand LCD/LED TVs (model remote/no. 2213) rather than an original Onida-branded remote\",\"info\":\"“Compatible Onida LCD/LED TV Remote No. 2213\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"OND RC-2213\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"799.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994338420-214244966.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:38:58'),
(2483,1,'product',2069,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Ondia ADE 135\",\"description\":\"Onida ADE 135 Remote is a reliable and easy-to-use replacement remote control designed specifically for Onida televisions. Built with high-quality materials, it offers durable performance and smooth button operation for effortless navigation. The remote provides all essential TV functions such as power, volume, channel selection, input source, menu control, and more, ensuring a seamless viewing experience.\",\"info\":\"Onida\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"950.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994357034-207142020.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:39:17'),
(2484,1,'product',2260,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"One Bolt ONB-011 Earbuds\",\"description\":\"Bluetooth (wireless, up to ~10 m range)\",\"info\":\"Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994382158-32583980.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:39:42'),
(2485,1,'product',2073,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"oneplus smart tv remote\",\"description\":\"Voice/Google Assistant support: Many newer OnePlus TVs support voice commands via the remote (mic button) or via pairing\",\"info\":\"Model compatibility: OnePlus lists specific remote models. For example: “RC-002B” works with OnePlus TV Y Series (32/40/43 Y1) and “RC-004D” works with U Series (50/55/65 U1S) and Y Series newer models.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994407779-249025206.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:40:07'),
(2486,1,'product',2072,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"oneplus version 3 without voice\",\"description\":\"OnePlus Version 3 Without Voice Remote is a high-quality replacement remote designed for OnePlus Smart TVs. It features a sleek and durable design with a comfortable button layout for smooth navigation. This non-voice remote works perfectly for all OnePlus models that support the Version 3 remote format, offering essential control functions like power, volume, channel, home, back, and menu keys.\",\"info\":\"suitabale for oneplus tv version 3\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"850.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994428049-953540267.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:40:28'),
(2487,1,'product',2055,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ONIDA LED Universal Remote\",\"description\":\"The V4 YY remote is marketed as compatible specifically with Onida LED/LCD TVs\",\"info\":\"includes hot-keys for streaming apps (YouTube, Google Play) in some variants.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1099.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994454844-7991621.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:40:54'),
(2488,1,'product',2071,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"onida smarttv remote\",\"description\":\"Onida Smart TV Remote is a high-quality replacement remote designed to provide smooth and reliable control for Onida Smart LED TVs. It features a user-friendly layout with well-spaced buttons for effortless navigation through apps, menus, volume, and channel controls. The remote supports essential smart functions, including quick access to popular streaming apps, home menu shortcuts, and dedicated navigation keys for easy browsing.\",\"info\":\"suitable for onida\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"850.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994477575-907400518.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:41:17'),
(2489,1,'product',2605,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Oppo K13x 5G Smartphone\",\"description\":\"The Oppo K13x 5G is an affordable 5G-ready Android smartphone designed to deliver a well-rounded performance with strong battery life, a large display, and capable cameras — making it suitable for everyday use like browsing, streaming, gaming, and social media\",\"info\":\"The phone runs Android 15 with ColorOS 15, bringing modern software features, and also includes 5G connectivity, ensuring future-ready mobile internet speeds. Some variants are built with IP65 water and dust resistance and rugged design elements for everyday reliability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Oppo K13x\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"12699.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994919335-476398195.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:48:39'),
(2490,1,'product',2566,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Optical dust sensor\",\"description\":\"An optical dust sensor is an electronic module used to detect and measure particulate matter (dust) in the air.\",\"info\":\"It works by using a light source and a photodetector—when dust particles pass through the sensor’s light beam, they scatter light, which is then detected and converted into an electrical signal proportional to dust concentration.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994942500-301130736.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:49:02'),
(2491,1,'product',60,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ORANGE PI 3 LTS\",\"description\":\"The Orange Pi 3 LTS is an upgraded and energy-efficient version of the original Orange Pi 3.\\r\\nIt uses the Allwinner H6 SoC — a 64-bit Quad-Core ARM Cortex-A53 processor with Mali-T720 GPU — and includes 8 GB of onboard eMMC storage plus 2 GB of LPDDR3 RAM\",\"info\":\"With built-in Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Gigabit Ethernet, and eMMC storage, the Orange Pi 3 LTS is ideal for home automation, network devices, mini servers, digital signage, and Linux-based projects. The LTS version ensures extended software and kernel support, making it suitable for long-running systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"5150.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":177,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771994966170-525308154.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:49:26'),
(2492,1,'product',2167,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"P321J\",\"description\":\"The P321J is a polyester film capacitor commonly used in electronic circuits for signal coupling, filtering, timing, and noise suppression applications. The marking “321J” typically indicates the capacitor value and tolerance, where 321 represents a capacitance value of 320 pF (0.00032 µF) and J denotes a tolerance of ±5%. Polyester film capacitors are known for their stable electrical characteristics, low loss, and good reliability, making them suitable for both analog and digital electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is non-polarized, meaning it can be connected in any direction within a circuit. It provides good insulation resistance and stable performance over a wide temperature range, which makes it useful in audio circuits, oscillators, timing networks, power supply filtering, and general electronic equipment.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"Polyester capacitors like the P321J are widely used in consumer electronics, communication devices, industrial control boards, and DIY electronics projects due to their durability and consistent capacitance performance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995030156-466778425.png\"}','2026-02-25 04:50:30'),
(2493,1,'product',482,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"P621\",\"description\":\"P621 is commonly used as an optocoupler (optical isolator), similar in function to PC817-type devices. It provides electrical isolation between input and output using an infrared LED and phototransistor, helping protect low-voltage control circuits from high-voltage spikes and noise\",\"info\":\"P621 optocouplers are widely used in SMPS, relay driving, microcontroller interfacing, and industrial control circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"60.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":73,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995049855-687647929.png\"}','2026-02-25 04:50:49'),
(2494,1,'product',2265,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic 6V battery\",\"description\":\"A Panasonic 6V battery is a reliable power source manufactured by Panasonic, known worldwide for high-quality batteries and electronic components.\",\"info\":\"Panasonic 6V batteries are widely used in electronics, industrial equipment, medical devices, and backup power systems due to their safety, durability, and consistent performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995070536-461790917.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:51:10'),
(2495,1,'product',2041,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic Android Remote\",\"description\":\"Make sure the remote lists compatibility with Panasonic Android TV / Smart TV models. According to Panasonic’s official parts page:\",\"info\":\"If the original remote is unavailable, you can pick a replacement by key button features (input, home/apps, Netflix, etc).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995090604-373185610.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:51:30'),
(2496,1,'product',2291,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic BR-2/3A 3V battery\",\"description\":\"The Panasonic BR?2/3A Primary Lithium Battery (also seen as BR-2/3AN / BR17335) is a primary (non-rechargeable) cylindrical lithium battery designed for long-lasting, reliable power in various electronic and industrial applications\",\"info\":\"This battery comes from Panasonic Energy, known for quality lithium cells with excellent shelf life and stability\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995117881-813672591.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:51:57'),
(2497,1,'product',2342,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic CR123A 3V battery\",\"description\":\"Panasonic CR123A is a 3 V primary lithium battery widely used for high-performance portable power applications\",\"info\":\"It’s made with lithium manganese dioxide (Li-MnO?) chemistry, offering a high energy density, long shelf life, and reliable performance across a range of devices and environments\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995139831-511283989.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:52:19'),
(2498,1,'product',2283,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic CR123AW Lithium Battery\",\"description\":\"The Panasonic CR123AW/1BE Battery (also sold as Panasonic CR123A 3V Lithium Battery) is a 3 V primary lithium battery designed to deliver high energy, stable voltage, and a long shelf life for a wide range of electronic devices.\",\"info\":\"Nominal Voltage: 3 V DC — ideal for devices that demand high, stable voltage.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995160258-848222748.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:52:40'),
(2499,1,'product',2316,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Party Speaker TT-PSE-10X201\",\"description\":\"The Target TT-PSE-10X201 is a robust and feature-rich party speaker system designed to deliver loud, clear sound for gatherings, events, and outdoor use\",\"info\":\"Many similar models in this series (like the TT-PSE-8X201) are rated around 160 W RMS output with rechargeable battery operation, wireless mic support, and built-in LED lighting that enhances the party atmosphere.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995219392-76874468.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:53:39'),
(2500,1,'product',2317,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Party Speaker TT-PSE-10X202\",\"description\":\"The Target TT-PSE-10X202 is a robust party speaker system designed to deliver powerful sound output suitable for gatherings, celebrations, and events.\",\"info\":\"It typically features dual 6.5? drivers for stereo output, wireless Bluetooth connectivity, FM/USB/AUX playback options, and a trolley/portable design that makes it easy to move around at parties or outdoor functions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"6500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995235660-101377541.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:53:55'),
