(2508,1,'product',558,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PCB Bread Board\",\"description\":\"A PCB breadboard is a solderable prototyping board designed like a breadboard layout, allowing components to be soldered permanently while keeping the same row-and-column connection style.\",\"info\":\"It is used to convert temporary breadboard circuits into strong, long-lasting PCB-based designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995434190-997340980.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:57:14'),
(2509,1,'product',2128,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PCA9685 16 channel Servo Motor Driver\",\"description\":\"The PCA9685 16-Channel Servo Motor Driver is a PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) controller module designed to control multiple servo motors or LEDs using a single microcontroller. It is based on the PCA9685 PWM driver IC, which communicates through the I2C interface, allowing efficient control of up to 16 independent channels while using only two communication pins (SDA and SCL). This greatly reduces the processing load on microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and STM32 boards.\",\"info\":\"The module generates precise 12-bit PWM signals, providing 4096 levels of resolution for accurate servo positioning and smooth motor movement. It includes an onboard clock and supports adjustable PWM frequency, typically ranging from 40 Hz to 1000 Hz, making it suitable for both servo motors and LED dimming applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"800.00\",\"note\":\"The PCA9685 servo driver features dedicated external power input for motors, ensuring stable operation without overloading the microcontroller’s power supply. It is widely used in robotics, robotic arms, humanoid robots, automation systems, RC projects, animatronics, and multi-servo control applications due to its reliability, scalability, and precise PWM control capability.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995509845-736179771.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 04:58:29'),
(2510,1,'product',409,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PCP Step Driver Motor\",\"description\":\"The PCP Step Driver Motor Module is a pulse-controlled stepper motor driver designed for precise motor control in CNC machines, robotics, and automation systems. It offers smooth stepping, high torque output, and easy interface with Arduino, PLCs, and microcontrollers.\",\"info\":\"A PCP Step Driver Motor (stepper motor driver) is an electronic module used to precisely control the movement, speed, and direction of a stepper motor\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":453,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995605375-599868498.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:00:05'),
(2511,1,'product',104,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PH Sensor 3 in 1 Meter\",\"description\":\"pH sensor with a module + probe (often referred to as a “3-in-1” for pH measurement in your water/soil system) — good call. I found several good options and also want to walk you through what to look out for, how to integrate it (Arduino/ESP32 + web) and how to interpret the “3 in 1” terminology.\",\"info\":\"Check soil acidity for optimal plant growth\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1400.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995622016-783143181.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:00:22'),
(2512,1,'product',103,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PH Sensor ELECTRODE with Module PCB\",\"description\":\"pH sensor electrode + module PCB is exactly what you need for measuring pH in solutions or soil (when used properly) and integrating it with your microcontroller/IoT setup. Here’s a full breakdown of how these work, what to check, and some product suggestions that match your criteria.\",\"info\":\"Complete kit with pH electrode probe and module PCB with amplifier\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2650.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995642333-424625348.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:00:42'),
(2513,1,'product',2412,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PH Sensor Kit\",\"description\":\"The pH Sensor Kit is an electronic measurement kit designed to measure the acidity or alkalinity (pH value) of liquids. It typically consists of a pH probe (electrode) and a signal conditioning module, allowing accurate pH readings to be interfaced with Arduino, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and other microcontrollers.\",\"info\":\"The pH Sensor Kit is a measurement system used to determine the acidity or alkalinity of liquids by measuring their pH value. It typically includes a pH probe (electrode) and an interface/conditioning module, enabling easy connection to Arduino and other microcontrollers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995663023-308919672.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:01:03'),
(2514,1,'product',98,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PH sensor pcb\",\"description\":\"the DFRobot?SEN0161 Gravity Analog pH Sensor / Meter Kit (a pH sensor PCB/module) is a widely used, reliable board for measuring liquid pH with microcontrollers such as Arduino or ESP32. I’ll provide a detailed description of how it works, key specs, wiring & integration, plus tips for using it (especially in your environment with soil/IoT context).\",\"info\":\"A pH Sensor PCB is an electronic interface board designed to measure the acidity or alkalinity (pH) of a liquid when used with a pH glass probe-electrode\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1750.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995683799-728690486.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:01:23'),
(2515,1,'product',2476,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PH Tester soil water moisture\",\"description\":\"pH Tester – Soil & Water Moisture Meter is a practical measuring instrument used to check the pH level and moisture content of soil and sometimes water, especially in agriculture, gardening, horticulture, and greenhouse applications. It helps users understand soil conditions so plants receive the right nutrients and water balance.\",\"info\":\"This tester typically uses metal probe electrodes that are inserted directly into the soil. It provides a pH reading to indicate whether the soil is acidic, neutral, or alkaline, which is crucial because different crops and plants grow best within specific pH ranges. Along with pH, the device measures soil moisture levels, helping to avoid over-watering or under-watering plants.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995705783-694930389.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:01:45'),
