(2517,1,'product',469,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Photo Diode\",\"description\":\"Photodiode is a light-sensitive semiconductor device that converts light into an electrical current. When light photons strike the photodiode’s PN-junction, it generates a small current proportional to the light intensity. This makes it ideal for precise light detection and optical sensing applications.\",\"info\":\"Photo Diode is a light-sensitive semiconductor device that converts light energy into electrical current or voltage.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"49.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":78,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995747908-844931795.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:02:27'),
(2518,1,'product',2493,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Photoelectric speed sensor encoder coded disc code\",\"description\":\"Photoelectric Speed Sensor with Encoder Coded Disc is a sensing system used to measure rotational speed (RPM), position, and direction of a rotating shaft. It works on the optical (photoelectric) principle, where a light source and a photodetector detect interruptions caused by a slotted or patterned encoder disc attached to the rotating object.\",\"info\":\"Encoder Coded Disc – a circular disc with evenly spaced slots or markings (transparent/opaque).\\r\\nPhotoelectric Sensor – includes an IR LED (light emitter) and a phototransistor or photodiode (receiver) placed on opposite sides of the disc (or side-by-side in reflective types).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995771950-581997879.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:02:51'),
(2519,1,'product',2430,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PI CAM\",\"description\":\"The Pi Cam, officially known as the Raspberry Pi Camera Module, is a compact digital camera designed specifically for Raspberry Pi boards\",\"info\":\"It connects directly to the Raspberry Pi via the CSI (Camera Serial Interface) port, enabling high-quality image and video capture for embedded vision and multimedia projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995791469-894510921.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:03:11'),
(2520,1,'product',2428,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PI Pico\",\"description\":\"The Pi Pico (Raspberry Pi Pico) is a compact and low-cost microcontroller development board designed by the Raspberry Pi Foundation for embedded systems, automation, and IoT applications. It is built around the RP2040 microcontroller, a dual-core ARM Cortex-M0+ processor running at up to 133 MHz, providing high performance and flexibility for real-time control and electronic projects.\",\"info\":\"The Raspberry Pi Pico features multiple GPIO pins that support digital input/output, PWM, ADC, UART, SPI, and I2C communication interfaces, allowing connection with sensors, displays, motors, and other electronic modules. It operates at 3.3V logic level and can be powered through a Micro-USB port or external power supply.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"The board supports programming using MicroPython, C/C++, and Arduino IDE, offering flexibility for different development environments. Its low power consumption and stable performance make it ideal for portable and battery-powered devices.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995871893-89929671.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:04:31'),
(2521,1,'product',433,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PIC16F676\",\"description\":\"The PIC16F676 is an 8-bit microcontroller from Microchip’s PIC16F family, designed for low-cost, low-power embedded applications.\",\"info\":\"It features on-chip Flash memory, an internal oscillator, analog peripherals, and I/O pins in a compact DIP-14 package, making it ideal for small control and sensor-based projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"60.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":73,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995930673-73023600.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:05:30'),
(2522,1,'product',51,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PICKIT2 Programmer\",\"description\":\"The PICkit 2 Programmer is one of Microchip Technology’s classic USB-based In-Circuit Serial Programmers (ICSP) designed to program and debug PIC microcontrollers (MCUs) and EEPROMs directly from a computer.\",\"info\":\"The PICkit2 is a low-cost in-circuit programmer and debugger designed for Microchip PIC microcontrollers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1900.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":25,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995953314-380557206.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:05:53'),
(2523,1,'product',50,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PICKIT3 clone Programmer\",\"description\":\"While the original Microchip PICkit 3 is now discontinued and replaced by the PICkit 4, clone versions remain extremely popular because they are cheap, reliable, and widely supported for most hobbyist and small-scale embedded projects.\",\"info\":\"A PICkit3 clone is an in-circuit programmer and debugger device for Microchip PIC and dsPIC microcontrollers, modeled after the original Microchip PICkit 3 tool\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":25,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995974304-844461603.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:06:14'),
(2524,1,'product',55,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PICO WITH ETHERNET RJ45\",\"description\":\"you’re referring to a Raspberry Pi Pico (RP2040) that supports Ethernet connectivity through an RJ45 port.\",\"info\":\"An Ethernet controller module or Ethernet HAT (e.g., W6100/W5500 based) with a standard RJ45 jack for 10/100 Mbps wired Ethernet connectivity.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"980.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":16,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771995996670-736212452.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:06:36'),
(2525,1,'product',429,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PIR Motion Sensor\",\"description\":\"The PIR Motion Sensor Module is a highly sensitive passive infrared sensor used to detect human body movement within a certain range.\",\"info\":\"A PIR (Passive Infrared) Motion Sensor detects movement of people or animals by sensing changes in infrared (heat) radiation in its field of view.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":457,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996024032-887069769.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:07:04'),
(2526,1,'product',1182,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Power Adapter 12v 2A\",\"description\":\"Reliable Power Delivery : Keeps your devices running smoothly with a stable 12V 2A output, perfect adapter for uninterrupted performance in CCTV cameras, LED strips, and routers. Universal Compatibility : Ideal for LED TVs, monitors, set-top boxes, routers, water purifiers, and more. Designed to work with 12 Volt devices with a 2.5mm x 5.5mm jack.\",\"info\":\"Brand\\tLTRONIX\\r\\nConnector Type\\tDc Barrel\\r\\nCompatible Devices\\tCameras, Cctv, Monitors, Router, Television\\r\\nIncluded Components\\tAc Dc Power Adapter\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"12v 2A\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"450.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":10,\"secondary_id\":447,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996142726-278256802.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:09:02'),
(2527,1,'product',5,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Power Adapter  12v 1Amp\",\"description\":\"Compact Design: Space-saving and lightweight, making it easy to integrate into various setups.\\r\\nStable Output: Delivers a consistent 12V 2 Amps DC output, ensuring reliable performance for your devices.\",\"info\":\"Electronic Spices 12V 1A DC Power Supply Adapter – Affordable 12 V/1 A adapter with 5.5×2.5 mm barrel plug; ideal for routers, LED strips, CCTV & similar devices\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"250.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":10,\"secondary_id\":447,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996162168-688050997.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:09:22'),
