(2529,1,'product',4,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Power Adapter\",\"description\":\"Reliable Power Delivery : Keeps your devices running smoothly with a stable 12V 2A output, perfect adapter for uninterrupted performance in CCTV cameras, LED strips, and routers.Universal Compatibility : Ideal for LED TVs, monitors, set-top boxes, routers, water purifiers, and more. Designed to work with 12 Volt devices with a 2.5mm x 5.5mm jack.\",\"info\":\"Using the correct adapter protects your device and ensures safe, reliable operation\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"450.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":10,\"secondary_id\":447,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996220040-611423460.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:10:20'),
(2530,1,'product',2,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Power Adapter 12v 5A\",\"description\":\"he Heavy Duty 12V 5A 60W DC Power Supply Adapter is engineered to deliver stable and reliable power for a wide range of 12V electronic devices. Built with high-quality components and advanced safety features, it ensures consistent performance with incredibly low fault rates. Suitable for continuous use, this adapter is ideal for CCTV systems, LED strips, routers, monitors, and other DC-powered equipment requiring up to 5A output.\",\"info\":\"The Power Adapter 12V 5A is an external AC-to-DC power supply designed to convert standard household AC voltage into a stable 12-volt DC output with a maximum current capacity of 5 amperes. It is commonly used to power electronic devices that require a reliable 12V DC source, such as CCTV cameras, LED strip lights, routers, motor drivers, security systems, and embedded electronics projects\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Model demo\",\"series\":\"Series demo\",\"alternative_name\":\"Alternative  demo\",\"mrp\":\"950.00\",\"note\":\"This power adapter typically accepts a wide input voltage range of 100–240V AC, making it suitable for use in different regions without additional converters. It usually comes with protection features such as over-voltage protection, over-current protection, short-circuit protection, and thermal protection to ensure safe operation and protect connected devices\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":281,\"secondary_id\":61,\"brand_id\":46}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996316588-681720772.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:11:56'),
(2531,1,'product',421,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PRODUCT IC 324\",\"description\":\"The IC 324, commonly known as LM324, is a quad operational amplifier (op-amp) IC that contains four independent, high-gain op-amps in a single package\",\"info\":\"It is designed to operate from a single power supply or dual supply, making it very popular in analog signal processing, sensor circuits, and general-purpose electronics. The LM324 is known for its low power consumption and ability to operate close to ground (ground-sensing input).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"40.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":73,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996370728-680486897.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:12:50'),
(2532,1,'product',415,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Product IC 6326\",\"description\":\"A generic replacement 6326V integrated chip sometimes sold as an internal part for mobile devices or small electronics.\",\"info\":\"Exact function depends on where it’s used — typically a replacement logic/communication IC for a specific phone model. Often labeled simply as IC 6326V on service part lists.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"60.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":73,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996446176-660575788.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:14:06'),
(2533,1,'product',2395,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Propeller  1045\",\"description\":\"Manufactured typically from high-strength nylon or reinforced composite plastic, the 1045 propeller offers an excellent balance between durability and lightweight performance\",\"info\":\"The 4.5-inch pitch ensures smooth airflow, providing stable flight, reduced vibration, and better motor efficiency. These propellers are commonly available in CW (Clockwise) and CCW (Counter-Clockwise) pairs to maintain proper balance and control during flight.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996469382-894123148.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:14:29'),
(2534,1,'product',2402,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Prototype shield\",\"description\":\"A Prototype Shield (Proto Shield) is an add-on expansion board designed to fit directly on top of Arduino boards, allowing users to build, test, and solder custom circuits without designing a separate PCB. It is widely used for prototyping, experimentation, and small embedded projects.\",\"info\":\"Prototype shields duplicate the Arduino pin layout and provide a general-purpose prototyping area where components can be soldered permanently.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996489889-202486796.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:14:49'),
(2535,1,'product',2426,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Prototyping shield\",\"description\":\"A prototyping shield is a hardware add-on board used in electronics projects (especially with microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP32, etc.) that gives you a ready-made area to build, connect, and test your circuits easily.\",\"info\":\"A prototyping shield is essentially a mini solderable breadboard on a plug-in board that lets you build and test custom circuits on top of a microcontroller board quickly and reliably.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996511940-20069961.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:15:11'),
(2536,1,'product',122,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PULSE SENSOR Heart Beat\",\"description\":\"the Pulse Sensor (often called Pulse Sensor Amped) is one of the most popular and easy-to-use modules for heart rate (BPM) and pulse waveform detection in Arduino, ESP32, and IoT health monitoring systems. It’s ideal for fitness trackers, medical prototypes, IoT dashboards, and biometric authentication systems.\",\"info\":\"The Pulse Sensor (Heart Beat Sensor Module) is a non-invasive biometric sensor used to measure heart rate (BPM – beats per minute) by detecting tiny changes in blood flow through the fingertip, earlobe, or wrist\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"690.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":23,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996529867-55838984.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:15:29'),
(2537,1,'product',225,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PWM 10 Amp Motor Control\",\"description\":\"A PWM (Pulse-Width Modulation) motor speed controller rated for 10 A is an electronic module designed to adjust the speed of a brushed DC motor by rapidly switching the supply on/off at a high frequency, thereby controlling the motor’s effective voltage and current.\",\"info\":\"PWM 10 Amp Motor Control is a high-power DC motor speed controller designed to handle loads up to 10A.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"899.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":37,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996550012-647813104.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:15:50'),
(2538,1,'product',2473,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PWM 10A DC Motorspeed controller module\",\"description\":\"PWM 10A DC Motor Speed Controller Module is a high-current control module designed to regulate the speed of DC motors efficiently using Pulse Width Modulation (PWM). By varying the PWM duty cycle, it controls motor speed smoothly while maintaining high efficiency and minimal heat loss compared to linear controllers.\",\"info\":\"This module typically supports a wide DC input voltage range (commonly 6V–30V or 9V–36V, depending on model) and can handle up to 10A continuous current, making it suitable for high-power DC motors used in electric scooters, pumps, fans, conveyors, robotic platforms, and automation equipment. Speed control is usually provided through a robust onboard potentiometer for precise and smooth adjustment.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996578503-283140560.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:16:18'),
(2539,1,'product',2359,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Pro Micro ATmega32U4 16MH boards\",\"description\":\"Pro Micro ATmega32U4 boards are small, powerful microcontroller boards based on the ATmega32U4 chip running at 16 MHz, with built-in USB support.\",\"info\":\"They belong to the Arduino-compatible family and are ideal for compact embedded projects, wearables, keyboards, robotics, and USB-based devices because the USB interface is handled directly by the microcontroller.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996609002-160797176.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:16:49'),
(2540,1,'product',223,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PWM 2A Motor Control\",\"description\":\"A PWM (Pulse-Width Modulation) 2 A motor control module is a compact driver/regulator that lets you vary the speed of a DC motor by rapidly switching the supply on/off at a variable duty cycle.\",\"info\":\"PWM 2A Motor Control is a compact DC motor speed controller designed to regulate motor speed using pulse-width modulation (PWM)\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":37,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996678154-689419807.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:17:58'),
(2541,1,'product',224,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PWM 3 Amp Motor Control\",\"description\":\"A PWM (Pulse-Width Modulation) 3 A motor control module is a compact driver/regulator that lets you vary the speed of a DC motor by rapidly switching the supply on/off at a variable duty cycle.\",\"info\":\"PWM 3 Amp Motor Control is a high-current DC motor speed controller that regulates motor speed using pulse-width modulation (PWM).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"599.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":37,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996696448-590094098.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:18:16'),
(2542,1,'product',2471,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PWM 3A DC Motor Speed Controller module\",\"description\":\"PWM 3A DC Motor Speed Controller Module is a compact power control module used to regulate the speed of DC motors using Pulse Width Modulation (PWM). By adjusting the duty cycle of the PWM signal, the module efficiently controls motor speed without significant power loss, making it more efficient than linear control methods.\",\"info\":\"This module typically operates within a wide DC input voltage range (commonly 6V to 28V DC) and can handle up to 3A continuous current, making it suitable for small to medium DC motors used in robotics, DIY projects, fans, pumps, conveyors, and automation systems. Speed adjustment is usually done via an onboard potentiometer, providing smooth and precise control.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996716581-455507115.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:18:36'),
(2543,1,'product',2130,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PWM DC Motor Speed Controller\",\"description\":\"The PWM DC Motor Speed Controller is an electronic control module used to regulate the speed of DC motors efficiently using Pulse Width Modulation (PWM) technology. Instead of reducing voltage directly, the controller rapidly switches the power supply ON and OFF at high frequency, adjusting the duty cycle to control motor speed while maintaining torque and minimizing power loss.\",\"info\":\"The module typically includes a rotary potentiometer knob for manual speed adjustment, power input terminals, motor output terminals, and a driver circuit built using MOSFETs or dedicated control ICs. It supports a wide range of DC motors and commonly operates within voltage ranges such as 6V–28V or 3V–35V DC depending on the model, with current handling capacities ranging from 3A to 10A or higher\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"600.00\",\"note\":\"PWM DC motor speed controllers are widely used in robotics, electric fans, pumps, conveyor systems, DIY motor projects, automation equipment, and battery-powered devices where adjustable motor speed and energy efficiency are required. Their compact size, easy wiring, and reliable performance make them suitable for both hobby electronics and industrial control applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996795403-880987207.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:19:55'),
(2544,1,'product',75,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PZEM 004T- 100A Ver 4.0 with CT coil\",\"description\":\"It’s widely used to measure AC voltage, current, power, energy (kWh), frequency, and power factor — ideal for smart energy meters, IoT dashboards, and home automation.\",\"info\":\"The PZEM-004T Ver 4.0 with 100A CT coil is a compact AC power monitoring module that measures key electrical parameters in single-phase AC circuits such as mains wiring or load outputs\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1350.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":18,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996818618-605387085.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:20:18'),
(2545,1,'product',2434,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Quadcopter Frame\",\"description\":\"A quadcopter frame is the structural body of a quadcopter drone that holds and supports all the essential components such as motors, propellers, flight controller, ESCs, battery, and camera.\",\"info\":\"The frame also provides mounting options and protection for electronics, helping maintain safety and reliability during flight.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996840110-155903568.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:20:40'),
(2546,1,'product',46,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"R4 UNO MINIMA\",\"description\":\"The Arduino R4 Minima is a compact, powerful, and modern Arduino development board in the new R4 family, designed for space-constrained and performance-oriented projects\",\"info\":\"It brings the enhanced capabilities of the Renesas RA4M1 (Arm Cortex-M4) microcontroller into a smaller footprint than the classic UNO boards, while maintaining wide compatibility with Arduino tools and ecosystem.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"850.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":317,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996859504-631449980.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:20:59'),
(2547,1,'product',45,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"R4 UNO WIFI RA4M1 +ESP32 S3\",\"description\":\"Expanded memory and faster clock with extra on-board peripherals: The UNO R4 WiFi empowers you with increased memory and a faster clock speed, enabling more precise calculations, effortless handling of complex projects, and the ability to tackle demanding tasks with ease. Additionally, it introduces a range of on-board peripherals, including a 12-bit DAC, CAN BUS, OP AMP, OFF pin, VRCT pin and Qwiic connector, providing expanded capabilities and design flexibility.\",\"info\":\"The Arduino UNO R4 WiFi is a next-generation official Arduino board that combines the power of the Renesas RA4M1 (Arm Cortex-M4) microcontroller with an onboard ESP32-S3 module for Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2200.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":317,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996883375-57193675.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:21:23'),
(2548,1,'product',756,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Raindrops Sensor Module\",\"description\":\"Raindrops Sensor Module is a simple and sensitive device used to detect the presence and intensity of rain or water drops. It works using a rainboard with conductive tracks and a signal processing module.\",\"info\":\"The raindrops sensor module is used to detect rain or water droplets on its sensing surface. It works by measuring changes in conductivity when water comes into contact with the sensor plate. Commonly used in rain detection systems, weather monitoring, automatic wipers, roof control systems, and Arduino/ESP projects, the module provides analog and digital outputs, adjustable sensitivity, and reliable performance for simple weather-related applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996903199-124352169.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:21:43'),
(2549,1,'product',2529,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RAMPS 1.6 shield for 3d printers\",\"description\":\"RAMPS (RepRap Arduino Mega Pololu Shield) is an expansion/controller board that sits on top of an Arduino Mega 2560 microcontroller\",\"info\":\"It combines the electronics needed to control a 3D printer — stepper drivers, heaters, thermistors, endstop inputs, fans, and more — into a modular, DIY-friendly platform.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771996923195-775226259.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:22:03'),
(2550,1,'product',1237,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ Original \",\"description\":\"Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ Built-in Broadcom 1.4GHz quad-core 64 bit processor with low energy on-board Wi-Fi Bluetooth and USB Port Built on the latest Broadcom 2837 ARMv8 64 bit processor, Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ is faster and more powerful than its predecessors\",\"info\":\"Brand\\tRaspberry Pi\\r\\nCPU Socket\\tBGA 437\\r\\nCompatible Devices\\tPersonal Computer\\r\\nRAM Memory Technology\\tLPDDR2\\r\\nCompatible Processors\\tBroadcom ARMv8\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"4100.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997303403-981565827.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:28:23'),
(2551,1,'product',59,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Raspberry Pi 3 Original\",\"description\":\"Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ Built-in Broadcom 1.4GHz quad-core 64 bit processor with low energy on-board Wi-Fi Bluetooth and USB Port Built on the latest Broadcom 2837 ARMv8 64 bit processor, Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ is faster and more powerful than its predecessors\",\"info\":\"The Raspberry Pi 3 Original is a compact and powerful single-board computer developed by the Raspberry Pi Foundation. It features a 64-bit quad-core processor, built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth, and a full set of connectivity options, making it ideal for learning, programming, IoT, robotics, and embedded applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Raspberry Pi 3\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"4100.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":16,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997334093-229218532.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:28:54'),
(2552,1,'product',802,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Raspberry Pi Camera Module\",\"description\":\"Raspberry Pi Camera Module is a high-quality, compact digital camera designed specifically for Raspberry Pi boards. It connects directly to the Pi’s CSI (Camera Serial Interface) port, allowing fast image and video capture with low latency. Equipped with a high-resolution image sensor and fixed-focus lens, it delivers excellent performance for photography, video recording, computer vision, and AI-based applications.\",\"info\":\"This module is ideal for computer vision, surveillance, robotics, IoT, and DIY projects. It supports high-resolution images and full HD video, making it perfect for applications like motion detection, face recognition, time-lapse photography, and smart monitoring systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":16,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997353535-962780053.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:29:13'),
(2553,1,'product',61,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Raspberry Pi Pico WIFI with Header\",\"description\":\"The Raspberry Pi Pico W is based on the Raspberry Pi RP2040 chip (dual-core ARM Cortex-M0+), enhanced with onboard Wi-Fi (2.4 GHz) via the Infineon CYW43439 wireless chip\",\"info\":\"This board is ideal for IoT applications, smart devices, automation, robotics, and educational projects. With support for MicroPython, C, and C++, and low-power operation, it is perfect for both beginners and advanced developers who want wireless control without soldering.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Raspberry Pi Pico\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"710.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":16,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997377650-218775108.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:29:37'),
(2554,1,'product',56,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Raspberry PI PICO with Header\",\"description\":\"you’re referring to the Raspberry Pi Pico with Header, which is one of the most common and beginner-friendly versions of the Raspberry Pi Pico microcontroller board\",\"info\":\"Designed for learning, prototyping, and embedded applications, the Pico offers high performance with low power consumption. It supports programming in MicroPython, C, and C++, making it suitable for beginners as well as advanced developers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Raspberry Pi Pico\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"360.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":16,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997407285-824017808.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:30:07'),
(2555,1,'product',804,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Raspberry Pi Pico with Pre-Soldered Header Board\",\"description\":\"Raspberry Pi Pico with Pre-Soldered Header is a compact and powerful microcontroller board based on the RP2040 dual-core ARM Cortex-M0+ processor. This version comes with factory-soldered male headers, making it ready for immediate use on breadboards, jumper wires, and prototype circuits without any soldering required.\",\"info\":\"With 26 multifunction GPIO pins, flexible communication interfaces, and low-power operation, the Pico is perfect for embedded systems, IoT projects, robotics, automation, and electronics learning. It supports programming in MicroPython, C, and C++, offering both simplicity and performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":16,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997428765-354772006.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:30:28'),
(2556,1,'product',58,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Raspberry Pi Zero 2-WH (with pre-soldered header)\",\"description\":\"The Raspberry Pi Zero 2 WH is a compact, quad-core single-board computer that delivers the same performance as the Zero 2 W but ships with pre-soldered 40-pin GPIO headers (“H” stands for Header).\\r\\nIt’s designed for makers, educators, and embedded developers who want full Raspberry Pi functionality with built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth, in a very small, plug-and-play format\",\"info\":\"The Raspberry Pi Zero 2 WH is a compact, fully functional single-board computer featuring built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth along with a pre-soldered 40-pin GPIO header for easy connection to breadboards and HATs without any soldering work. It combines small form factor convenience with surprising computing power, making it ideal for IoT, robotics, automation, DIY electronics, and embedded Linux projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2100.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":16,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997451542-718275019.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:30:51'),
(2557,1,'product',57,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Raspberry Pi Zero 2W (Wireless) Wifi and Bluetooth\",\"description\":\"The Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W (“Wireless”) is the upgraded successor to the original Pi Zero W, built around the RP3A0-A0 system-in-package (SiP) — which integrates the same Broadcom BCM2710A1 quad-core Cortex-A53 processor used in the Raspberry Pi 3 — but in a smaller footprin\",\"info\":\"The Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W is a tiny yet powerful single-board computer ideal for compact computing, IoT, robotics, and embedded projects. It builds on the popular Raspberry Pi Zero platform with a quad-core 64-bit processor for significantly improved performance while retaining its small footprint. What sets it apart is built-in wireless connectivity — including Wi-Fi and Bluetooth — so you can connect to networks and devices without extra adapters.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2150.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":16,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997476367-46763375.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:31:16'),
(2558,1,'product',863,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RC-914-OA Panasonic Remote\",\"description\":\"he Panasonic RC-914-0A (sometimes written “RC-914-OA” or “RC-914-0A with USB Function”) is a replacement remote controller often marketed as compatible with Panasonic LED/LCD TVs.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997496822-199947241.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:31:36'),
(2559,1,'product',2169,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Reed Switch Sensor\",\"description\":\"The Reed Switch Sensor is a magnetic proximity sensor used to detect the presence or absence of a magnetic field. It consists of two thin ferromagnetic metal reeds sealed inside a small glass tube filled with inert gas. When a magnet comes close to the sensor, the reeds attract each other and make electrical contact, closing the circuit. When the magnet moves away, the reeds separate, opening the circuit again\",\"info\":\"Reed switch sensors are available in Normally Open (NO), Normally Closed (NC), or changeover types, depending on application requirements. They operate without physical contact, resulting in low wear, long life, and high reliability. The sensor can be directly interfaced with microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, or security control systems, as it works like a standard digital switch. It requires very low power and can operate over a wide voltage range depending on the model.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"Reed switch sensors are widely used in door and window security systems, alarm systems, position detection, speed counting, water level monitoring, automotive sensing, and industrial automation. Because of their compact size, fast response, and simple installation, they are commonly used in both consumer electronics and industrial sensing applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997772516-534274579.jpeg\"}','2026-02-25 05:36:12'),
(2560,1,'product',1167,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"REG 7805\",\"description\":\"The 7805 regulator typically accepts an input voltage between 7V and 35V DC and regulates it down to a steady 5V output with built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection. It is usually available in a TO-220 package with three pins: Input, Ground, and Output. Although simple to use, a heat sink may be required when supplying higher current loads because excess voltage is dissipated as heat.\",\"info\":\"The REG 7805 (7805 Voltage Regulator) is a widely used linear voltage regulator IC designed to provide a stable +5V DC output from a higher input voltage source. It belongs to the popular 78xx series of fixed positive voltage regulators, where “05” indicates the 5-volt output.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"The REG 7805 is widely used in power supply circuits, Arduino and microcontroller projects, embedded systems, battery-powered devices, chargers, and educational electronics kits. Its ease of use, low cost, and reliable voltage regulation make it one of the most commonly used power management ICs in electronics.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":230},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":230}]}','2026-02-25 05:37:10'),
(2561,1,'product',1170,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"REG 7806\",\"description\":\"The REG 7806 (7806 Voltage Regulator) is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC from the 78xx series, designed to provide a stable +6V DC output from a higher input voltage source. It is commonly used in electronic circuits where a constant 6-volt supply is required to power components and devices safely. The regulator maintains a steady output voltage even when there are variations in input voltage or load conditions, ensuring reliable circuit performance.\",\"info\":\"The 7806 typically accepts an input voltage range of about 8V to 35V DC and regulates it down to a fixed 6V output. It includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection, which help prevent damage caused by overheating or excessive current. The IC is usually available in a TO-220 package with three terminals: Input, Ground, and Output. A heat sink may be required when operating at higher current levels because excess voltage is dissipated as heat.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"The REG 7806 is widely used in power supply circuits, battery-operated equipment, audio devices, communication systems, embedded electronics, and general electronic projects that require a regulated 6V power source. Its simple design, reliability, and ease of implementation make it a common choice for voltage regulation applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":230},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997883562-573144718.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:38:03'),
(2562,1,'product',1172,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"REG 7808\",\"description\":\"The REG 7808 (7808 Voltage Regulator) is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC belonging to the 78xx series, designed to deliver a stable +8V DC output from a higher DC input voltage. It is commonly used in electronic circuits that require a regulated 8-volt power supply to ensure stable and reliable operation of components. The regulator maintains constant output voltage even when the input voltage or load current changes, protecting sensitive electronic devices from voltage fluctuations.\",\"info\":\"The 7808 typically operates with an input voltage range of approximately 10V to 35V DC and can supply output current up to 1A under proper cooling conditions. The IC includes internal protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection, which help prevent damage during overload or overheating situations. It is usually available in a TO-220 package with three terminals: Input, Ground, and Output. A heat sink is recommended when operating at higher loads because excess voltage is dissipated as heat.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"The REG 7808 is widely used in power supply units, audio equipment, communication devices, industrial electronics, embedded systems, and general electronic projects that require a steady 8V regulated output. Its simple design, durability, and ease of use make it a reliable solution for voltage regulation applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":230},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997932241-970641113.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:38:52'),
(2563,1,'product',1175,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"REG 7809\",\"description\":\"The REG 7809 (7809 Voltage Regulator) is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC from the popular 78xx series, designed to provide a stable +9V DC output from a higher input voltage source. It is widely used in electronic circuits that require a regulated 9-volt supply for reliable and noise-free operation. The regulator maintains constant output voltage even when there are fluctuations in input voltage or load current, protecting sensitive electronic components.\",\"info\":\"The 7809 typically accepts an input voltage range of about 11V to 35V DC and can deliver output current up to 1A, depending on heat dissipation conditions. It includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection, ensuring safe and durable operation. The IC is commonly available in a TO-220 package with three terminals: Input, Ground, and Output. A heat sink is recommended for higher current applications since excess voltage is dissipated as heat during regulation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"The REG 7809 is commonly used in power supply circuits, audio amplifiers, communication equipment, embedded systems, battery chargers, and general electronic projects where a stable 9V supply is required. Its simplicity, reliability, and low cost make it a standard voltage regulation solution in electronics design.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":230},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771997982482-297298003.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:39:42'),
(2564,1,'product',1169,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"REG 7812\",\"description\":\"The REG 7812 (7812 Voltage Regulator) is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC from the widely used 78xx series, designed to provide a stable +12V DC output from a higher DC input voltage. It is commonly used in power supply circuits to deliver a constant and regulated voltage, ensuring reliable performance of electronic devices even when input voltage or load conditions vary. The regulator helps protect sensitive components from voltage fluctuations and electrical noise.\",\"info\":\"The 7812 typically operates with an input voltage range of about 14V to 35V DC and can supply output current up to 1A, depending on cooling conditions. It includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, internal current limiting, and short-circuit protection, which enhance safety and durability during operation. The IC is usually available in a TO-220 package with three terminals: Input, Ground, and Output. A heat sink is recommended when used in higher current applications because excess voltage is dissipated as heat.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"The REG 7812 is widely used in power adapters, audio amplifiers, motor control circuits, communication equipment, industrial electronics, and embedded system power supplies where a stable 12V output is required. Its simple design, low cost, and dependable voltage regulation make it one of the most commonly used voltage regulator ICs in electronics.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":230},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771998039644-408793475.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:40:39'),
(2565,1,'product',156,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RF 433Mhz 4 Bit Data with Address Select\",\"description\":\"Breakout pins for connecting to the microcontroller.\\r\\nDIP Switch for Address Selection\",\"info\":\"The RF 433 MHz 4-Bit Data with Address Select system is a wireless remote control solution designed for reliable short- to medium-range communication. It operates on the 433 MHz RF frequency and supports 4-bit data transmission along with address selection, allowing multiple receivers to work independently without signal interference.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1150.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":468,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771998066951-682580276.jpeg\"}','2026-02-25 05:41:06'),
(2566,1,'product',159,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RF433 Mhz Module Mini\",\"description\":\"This is RF Wireless Module Pair (433MHZ)\\r\\nWide input supply range of this module is 2.5 V to 12V\\r\\nReceiver frequency: 433.92MHZ; 315 MHz Sensitivity of 105 dB\\r\\nThis RF module comprises an RF Transmitter and an RF Receiver.\",\"info\":\"The RF 433 MHz Mini Module is a compact, low-cost wireless communication module designed for short-range data transmission using the 433 MHz ISM frequency band. Its small size makes it ideal for space-constrained electronics projects and easy integration into existing circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"450.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":29,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771998089174-726369019.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:41:29'),
(2567,1,'product',1585,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RFID 125KHz pcb v2\",\"description\":\"This RF ID pcb has RF coil oscillator coil on board and has TTL Rx/Tx interface.\\r\\nYou can easily connect it with a Microcontroller to receice Data.\\r\\nOperating frequency is 125KHz.\",\"info\":\"RFID 125KHz pcb v2\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"480.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":468,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771998110591-751308204.jpeg\"}','2026-02-25 05:41:50'),
(2568,1,'product',161,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RFID 125KHz with RS232\",\"description\":\"The RFID 125 kHz with RS232 is a reliable low-frequency RFID reader module designed for contactless identification and access control systems. It operates at 125 kHz and communicates with controllers and computers using the RS232 serial interface, allowing easy integration with PCs, PLCs, microcontrollers, and industrial systems.\",\"info\":\"This reader supports common 125 kHz RFID proximity cards and tags (such as EM4100/EM4200) and provides fast, accurate ID data output. Its stable performance and simple serial communication make it ideal for attendance systems, door access control, and automation applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"550.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":469,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771998131103-532585020.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:42:11'),
(2569,1,'product',1167,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"REG 7805\",\"description\":\"The 7805 regulator typically accepts an input voltage between 7V and 35V DC and regulates it down to a steady 5V output with built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection. It is usually available in a TO-220 package with three pins: Input, Ground, and Output. Although simple to use, a heat sink may be required when supplying higher current loads because excess voltage is dissipated as heat.\",\"info\":\"The REG 7805 (7805 Voltage Regulator) is a widely used linear voltage regulator IC designed to provide a stable +5V DC output from a higher input voltage source. It belongs to the popular 78xx series of fixed positive voltage regulators, where “05” indicates the 5-volt output.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"The REG 7805 is widely used in power supply circuits, Arduino and microcontroller projects, embedded systems, battery-powered devices, chargers, and educational electronics kits. Its ease of use, low cost, and reliable voltage regulation make it one of the most commonly used power management ICs in electronics.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":230},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771998163409-199133861.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:42:43'),
(2570,1,'product',303,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RFID MFRC522 13.6MHz\",\"description\":\"MFRC522 chip based board\\r\\nOperating frequency: 13.56MHz\\r\\nSupply Voltage: 3.3V\\r\\nCurrent: 13-26mA\",\"info\":\"The RFID MFRC522 13.56 MHz module is a popular contactless RFID reader/writer based on the NXP MFRC522 chipset. It operates at 13.56 MHz (HF) and supports ISO/IEC 14443A standard RFID cards and tags such as MIFARE Classic.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"350.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":468,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771998565501-994398037.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:49:25'),
(2571,1,'product',306,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RFID NSK 125KHz\",\"description\":\"The RFID NSK 125KHz is a low-frequency RFID reader module designed for reading passive RFID cards and tags operating at 125 KHz. It is widely used for access control systems, attendance tracking, security systems, and automation projects\",\"info\":\"The RFID NSK 125 kHz is a low-frequency contactless RFID reader used for identification and access control applications. Operating at 125 kHz, it is compatible with common EM-based proximity cards and key tags such as EM4100 / EM4200.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"850.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":468,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771998586472-980939659.jpeg\"}','2026-02-25 05:49:46'),
(2572,1,'product',2393,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RGB LED SMD module\",\"description\":\"The RGB LED SMD Module is a compact lighting module that integrates a Surface Mount Device (SMD) RGB LED on a small PCB. It combines Red, Green, and Blue LEDs into a single package, allowing the creation of a wide range of colors by controlling the intensity of each color channel independently.\",\"info\":\"The RGB LED SMD Module is a compact electronic module that uses a surface-mount RGB LED to generate multiple colors by combining red, green, and blue light. Each color channel can be controlled independently, allowing smooth color mixing and brightness adjustment.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771998607753-736833554.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:50:07'),
(2573,1,'product',2021,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RM- L1335 Plus Universal Remote\",\"description\":\"he RM-L1335 Plus is a universal infrared (IR) remote control designed primarily for use with Hisense LCD/LED and Smart TVs. It comes pre-programmed, so for most compatible TVs you can simply insert the required batteries (two AAA) and start using it right away\",\"info\":\"Compatible Types list EN2B27, ER-31607R, ER-22655HS, ER-22642R, ER-22641R, EN-22652A, BGH EN2h27B, EN2h27hs, EN-31906D, EN-31603B\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"RM- L1335 Plus\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1771998648003-799358549.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 05:50:48'),
