(2677,1,'product',248,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Sound Sensor\",\"description\":\"Sound Sensor is a compact audio detection module that senses sound intensity in the environment and outputs a corresponding digital (and sometimes analog) signal\",\"info\":\"It typically uses a built-in microphone and amplifier to detect noise and is widely used with microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP32, and Raspberry Pi for projects such as sound-activated control, clap switches, voice triggers, and ambient noise monitoring.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"180.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":21,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003377808-848330798.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:09:37'),
(2678,1,'product',2357,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Speaker Cable  TT-SWZ-16GA50\",\"description\":\"The TT-SWZ-16GA50 Speaker Cable is a high-quality 16-gauge (AWG) audio speaker wire designed for reliable sound transmission in a variety of audio installations — from home theatres and multimedia systems to public address setups and professional speaker connections.\",\"info\":\"16 AWG speaker cables are widely recommended for standard home audio and commercial sound systems as they support adequate power delivery while minimizing signal loss\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003399936-251841224.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:09:59'),
(2679,1,'product',2358,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Speaker Cable TT-SWZ-18GA50\",\"description\":\"Speaker Cable TT-SWZ-18GA50 is a high-quality 18 gauge (18 AWG) audio speaker cable designed for reliable signal transmission between amplifiers, speakers, and home theatre or car audio systems\",\"info\":\"This type of cable typically features dual conductors with color-coded insulation for easy polarity matching and multi-strand copper or oxygen-free copper conductors for improved conductivity, flexibility\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003423070-265089337.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:10:23'),
(2680,1,'product',149,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ST LINK Programmer clone\",\"description\":\"The single wire interface module (SWIM) and JTAG/serial wire debugging (SWD) interfaces are used to communicate with any STM8 or STM32 microcontroller located on an application board.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1250.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003463112-256377574.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:11:03'),
(2681,1,'product',1322,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ST link v2 Programmer Dongle\",\"description\":\"The ST-Link V2 is a USB in-circuit debugger and programmer tool from STMicroelectronics used to program and debug STM8 and STM32 microcontrollers\",\"info\":\"It connects to a computer via USB and interfaces with target boards through SWD/JTAG or SWIM protocols, allowing you to upload firmware, set breakpoints, and step through code using development environments like STM32CubeIDE. This dongle is essential for embedded development, firmware debugging, and real-time code analysis with STM32/STM8 boards.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003527303-769897028.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:12:07'),
(2682,1,'product',101,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"STC 1000 Temperature Controller 230v AC\",\"description\":\"The STC-1000 is a digital temperature controller / thermostat module that allows you to set a target temperature (set-point) and then control a heating or cooling device (via relay) to maintain that temperature. It supports both heating and cooling modes.\",\"info\":\"Configurable thresholds and protective delay\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1400.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003550407-237326787.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:12:30'),
(2683,1,'product',2488,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"STEPPER  MOTOR 5V 28BYJ\",\"description\":\"The 5V 28BYJ stepper motor is a compact, low-cost unipolar stepper motor widely used in electronics projects, robotics, and automation applications\",\"info\":\"Due to its small size, low power consumption, and smooth step-by-step motion, the 28BYJ is ideal for applications such as robotic arms, camera sliders, valve control systems, small CNC models, and educational learning kits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003573675-579502093.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:12:53'),
(2684,1,'product',1328,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"STM32 BluePill STM32F103 C6T6\",\"description\":\"The STM32 BluePill (STM32F103C6T6) is a low-cost ARM Cortex-M3 development board based on the STM32F103C6T6 microcontroller\",\"info\":\"It offers multiple digital and analog I/O pins, communication interfaces (UART, SPI, I²C, USB), and is compatible with development environments like Arduino (with STM32 support), STM32CubeIDE, and PlatformIO.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"450.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003639042-869546446.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:13:59'),
(2685,1,'product',1321,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"STM32F103 C8 BLUEPILL\",\"description\":\"The STM32F103 C8 “Blue Pill” is a low-cost, compact ARM Cortex-M3 development board based on the STM32F103C8T6 microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"It provides an affordable platform for embedded system prototyping with multiple digital/analog I/O pins, communication interfaces (UART, SPI, I²C, USB), and can be programmed using IDEs like Arduino (with STM32 support), STM32CubeIDE, or PlatformIO. Popular in hobby and professional projects, it’s ideal for motor control, sensor interfacing, robotics, and IoT applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003656647-321964427.jpeg\"}','2026-02-25 07:14:16'),
(2686,1,'product',64,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Strain Gauge Module\",\"description\":\"A strain gauge is a sensor that measures deformation (strain) of an object. When a load or force is applied, the sensor changes resistance — this small change is amplified and converted into a digital signal\",\"info\":\"A Strain Gauge Module is an electronic interface board designed to measure small changes in resistance from strain gauge sensors and convert them into usable electrical signals for data acquisition and control systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"890.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":445,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003677308-344086710.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:14:37'),
(2687,1,'product',2064,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Sun HD Universal Remote\",\"description\":\"The remote needs to explicitly mention compatibility with Sun Direct HD and/or SD set-top boxes. Some listings show: “Sun Direct HD Set Top Box Remote HD ONLY”\",\"info\":\"Ensure it supports the model of your box (HD vs SD version). Some remotes say “HD only” or “HD & normal boxes”\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003695258-479513517.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:14:55'),
(2688,1,'product',48,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"T48 UNIVERSAL PROGRAMMER XGECU\",\"description\":\"he T48 Universal Programmer (from XGecu) is a professional-grade USB device used to program, read, and verify a wide range of IC chips—including EPROMs, EEPROMs, Flash memory, microcontrollers, and PLDs\",\"info\":\"High-performance, USB-powered universal IC programmer with a comprehensive chip support list.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"5500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":25,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772003714311-313525288.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:15:14'),
