(2739,1,'product',2510,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Tsop sensor\",\"description\":\"TSOP Sensor refers to a family of infrared (IR) remote-receiver modules commonly used to detect and decode modulated IR signals from remote controls and other IR transmitters\",\"info\":\"TSOP devices are designed to filter ambient light and noise and respond only to IR signals at specific carrier frequencies (e.g., 36 kHz, 38 kHz, 40 kHz), making them ideal for remote control and wireless communication applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772005898569-262024647.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:51:38'),
(2740,1,'product',2365,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TT-687\",\"description\":\"The Target TT-687 DVD Player is a versatile home entertainment device featuring MPEG4 technology and a 5.1-channel audio system that delivers powerful sound through its 100 W Hi-Fi amplifier and built-in speakers.\",\"info\":\"It supports a wide range of media formats including MP4, DVD, SVCD, VCD, DVCD, CD, MP3, and CD-R, and comes with a wireless remote control, USB and SD/MMC ports, and multiple output options such as analog, coaxial, component, and composite, making it easy to connect to various TV and audio systems\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772005950111-379988870.png\"}','2026-02-25 07:52:30'),
(2741,1,'product',2364,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TT-692\",\"description\":\"It features MPEG4 playback, 5.1 channel surround sound support, a built-in speaker and amplifier with 100 W output, and multiple connectivity options including USB, SD/MMC, CD/DVD/SVCD/VCD playback, and remote control for easy operation.\",\"info\":\"This model also includes CD ripping capabilities, an LED display, and support for various audio and video.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"5999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772005975522-91084733.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:52:55'),
(2742,1,'product',729,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TTP223 Touch Sensor Module\",\"description\":\"The TTP223 Touch Sensor Module is a capacitive touch-based input device that replaces traditional push buttons with a modern, touch-sensitive surface. It uses the TTP223 IC to detect touch or proximity and outputs a digital signal when activated.\",\"info\":\"The TTP223 touch sensor module is a capacitive touch input module used to detect touch without mechanical buttons. It provides a digital output that changes state when touched, making it ideal for touch switches, control panels, home automation, and Arduino/ESP projects\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":63,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772005996495-262126126.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:53:16'),
(2743,1,'product',790,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TYN 612\",\"description\":\"The TYN 612 Audio IC is a compact, reliable audio amplifier component designed for use in small audio output applications. It delivers clear and stable sound amplification, making it suitable for portable audio devices, radios, intercom systems,\",\"info\":\"The TYN612 is a silicon-controlled rectifier (SCR / thyristor) designed for high-current and high-voltage switching applications. It is commonly used in power control circuits, motor speed controllers, rectifiers, and industrial automation, offering reliable performance, high surge current capability, and robust thermal characteristics.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006017240-63762629.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:53:37'),
(2744,1,'product',1582,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Typemate Pro Wired keyboard & mouse combo\",\"description\":\"The Typemate Pro Wired Keyboard & Mouse Combo is a durable, plug-and-play desktop companion designed for comfortable typing and precise control.\",\"info\":\"Model\\tTypemate Pro Wired Keyboard & Mouse Combo\\r\\nKeyboard Type\\tFull-Size Wired Keyboard\\r\\nMouse Type\\tWired Optical Mouse\\r\\nConnectivity\\tUSB Plug-and-Play\\r\\nKeyboard Cable Length\\tApprox. 1.5 meters\\r\\nMouse Cable Length\\tApprox. 1.3 meters\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"995.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":215,\"secondary_id\":454,\"brand_id\":14}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006117243-12193199.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:55:17'),
(2745,1,'product',1157,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UC3842\",\"description\":\"UC3842 is a current-mode PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) controller IC widely used in switch-mode power supplies (SMPS)\",\"info\":\"The UC3842 provides fixed-frequency current-mode control, enabling efficient and stable regulation in flyback, forward, and boost converters. It features a high-current totem-pole gate driver for directly driving power MOSFETs, along with undervoltage lockout (UVLO), current limiting, and thermal protection, making it a popular choice for offline and DC-DC power supply designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":230},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006136424-834964573.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:55:36'),
(2746,1,'product',1158,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UC3843\",\"description\":\"UC3843 is a current-mode PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) controller IC used in switch-mode power supplies (SMPS).\",\"info\":\"The UC3843 provides fixed-frequency current-mode control for efficient and stable SMPS designs such as flyback, forward, and boost converters. Compared to UC3842, it has lower undervoltage lockout (UVLO) thresholds, making it suitable for low-voltage startup applications. It includes a high-current gate driver, current limiting, and thermal protection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":276,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006157437-303796971.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:55:57'),
(2747,1,'product',1159,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UC3844\",\"description\":\"UC3844 is a current-mode PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) controller IC used in switch-mode power supplies (SMPS) such as flyback and forward converters\",\"info\":\"The UC3844 provides fixed-frequency current-mode control for efficient and stable SMPS designs such as flyback and forward converters. Compared to UC3842/3843, it has lower maximum duty cycle and different UVLO thresholds, making it suitable for specific power supply topologies where tighter duty-cycle control is required. It includes a high-current gate driver, current limiting, and undervoltage lockout.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":276,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006175824-982716324.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:56:15'),
(2748,1,'product',1160,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UC3845\",\"description\":\"UC3845 is a current-mode PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) controller IC used in switch-mode power supplies (SMPS) such as flyback and forward converters.\",\"info\":\"The UC3845 provides fixed-frequency current-mode control for efficient SMPS designs such as flyback and forward converters\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":276,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006197765-436587849.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:56:37'),
(2749,1,'product',1162,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UC3854AN\",\"description\":\"UC3854AN is a high-performance Power Factor Correction (PFC) controller IC designed to implement active power factor correction in AC-DC switch-mode power supplies.\",\"info\":\"The UC3854AN is designed to implement average current-mode Power Factor Correction, shaping the input current to follow the AC line voltage and achieve a near-unity power factor. It is commonly used in boost-type PFC front ends for offline power supplies.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"The IC integrates voltage regulation, current control, multiplier, and protection features, making it suitable for high-efficiency power designs.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":276,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006217873-903103631.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:56:57'),
(2750,1,'product',2470,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ULN2003\",\"description\":\"ULN2003 is a widely used Darlington transistor array IC designed to drive high-current, high-voltage loads using low-power logic signals from microcontrollers. It contains seven NPN Darlington pairs in a single 16-pin package, each capable of switching loads that typical microcontroller GPIO pins cannot handle directly.\",\"info\":\"Each channel of the ULN2003 can sink up to 500 mA with load voltages up to 50 V, making it ideal for driving relays, solenoids, LEDs, buzzers, and stepper motors. The IC includes built-in flyback (freewheeling) diodes, which protect the circuit from voltage spikes when driving inductive loads like motors and relays—no external diodes are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006241836-116086896.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:57:21'),
(2751,1,'product',2284,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Ultralife  9V Lithium Battery\",\"description\":\"The Ultralife 9V Lithium Battery is a high-performance, non-rechargeable 9-volt lithium battery designed to deliver long-lasting and reliable power for a wide range of electronic devices.\",\"info\":\"It uses lithium manganese dioxide (LiMnO?) chemistry, which offers much higher energy density and longer life than standard alkaline 9 V batteries.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006272562-141378274.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:57:52'),
(2752,1,'product',2132,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UltraSonic sensor Module\",\"description\":\"The Ultrasonic Sensor Module is an electronic distance measuring device used to detect objects and measure distance using ultrasonic sound waves. It works by transmitting high-frequency sound pulses (usually around 40 kHz) through a transmitter and then receiving the reflected echo from nearby objects using a receiver. The module calculates the distance based on the time taken for the sound wave to travel to the object and return, making it a reliable non-contact measurement sensor.\",\"info\":\"One of the most commonly used ultrasonic modules is the HC-SR04, which provides accurate distance measurement and easy interfacing with microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and STM32 boards. The sensor typically includes four pins: VCC, GND, Trigger, and Echo. A short trigger pulse initiates measurement, and the echo pin outputs a signal whose duration corresponds to the detected distance. The module operates on 5V DC power and offers stable performance in various lighting conditions since it relies on sound instead of light.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"Ultrasonic sensor modules are widely used in obstacle avoidance robots, distance measurement systems, water level monitoring, parking assistance systems, automation projects, and smart IoT applications. Due to their accuracy, low cost, and simple operation, they are highly popular in educational and industrial electronics projects.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006335065-449288448.jpeg\"}','2026-02-25 07:58:55'),
(2753,1,'product',336,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Universal 65W Universal Ac Adapter\",\"description\":\"The Techie 65W Universal AC Adapter is a high-quality multi-brand compatible power adapter designed to charge and power a wide range of laptops and notebooks.With multiple interchangeable tips, intelligent voltage regulation, and 65W power output, it provides a safe, reliable, and efficient charging solution for everyday and professional use.\",\"info\":\"Compact universal adapter with multiple interchangeable tips for laptops and devices — ideal as a replacement or travel power supply.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1400.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":281,\"secondary_id\":61,\"brand_id\":47}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006363776-400986341.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 07:59:23'),
(2754,1,'product',852,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Universal Remote Control for PANASONIC LED TV\",\"description\":\"The remote uses infrared (IR) line-of-sight; it must “see” the TV’s IR receiver. It should explicitly list compatibility with Panasonic LED/LCD/Smart TV models. For example, some replacements list model codes like N2QAYB000486 for Panasonic TVs.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006492558-393567452.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:01:32'),
(2755,1,'product',829,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Universal Smart Remote\",\"description\":\"The Orange ADE-101 TV Remote is a high-quality replacement remote designed to work seamlessly with compatible LED and LCD televisions from the Orange brand.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1299.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006512919-763657319.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:01:52'),
(2756,1,'product',2481,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UNO Cable\",\"description\":\"UNO Cable usually refers to the USB cable used with the Arduino UNO development board. This cable connects the Arduino UNO to a computer for programming, power, and serial communication.\",\"info\":\"The UNO cable isn’t a special board part — it’s simply the USB cable that connects your Arduino UNO to your computer for programming and power. If you need one, get a USB-A to USB-B cable (sometimes called a printer cable) unless your specific board uses a different USB connector.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006531577-111110095.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:02:11'),
(2757,1,'product',2581,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UNO R4 WIFI Board\",\"description\":\"The Arduino UNO R4 WiFi is a next-generation Arduino development board that combines the familiar UNO form factor with significantly upgraded performance, wireless connectivity, and modern features — making it ideal for IoT, robotics, automation, and advanced electronic projects\",\"info\":\"Uno R4 WiFi is its built-in Wi-Fi connectivity, allowing your projects to connect to wireless networks right out of the box without needing extra shields or modules. This opens up possibilities like remote data logging, IoT sensors, or web-controlled devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006553863-598428464.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:02:33'),
(2758,1,'product',35,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB Boost Charger\",\"description\":\"This compact DC-DC Step-Up (Boost) Converter Module efficiently converts low input voltages (as low as 0.9V) to a stable 5V output, allowing you to charge devices or power 5V gadgets from a single AA battery, solar cell, or other low-voltage sources. Equipped with dual USB ports, it can simultaneously charge two devices such as smartphones, Arduino boards, or small electronics.\",\"info\":\"A USB Boost Charger is a DC-to-DC step-up (boost) power module that converts a lower DC voltage up to a regulated 5 V USB output suitable for powering or charging USB devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"125.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":59,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006571705-79925862.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:02:51'),
(2759,1,'product',2363,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB Host Shield For Arduino\",\"description\":\"The USB Host Shield for Arduino is an expansion board that allows an Arduino board to act as a USB host, enabling direct communication with USB devices such as keyboards, mice, game controllers, USB flash drives, barcode scanners, and Bluetooth dongles.\",\"info\":\"The USB Host Shield for Arduino is an add-on board that enables an Arduino to function as a USB host, allowing it to directly connect and control USB devices (normally possible only with computers).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006592467-673404210.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:03:12'),
(2760,1,'product',1629,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to RS232 Converter\",\"description\":\"The USB to RS232 Converter is a reliable USB-to-Serial adapter that allows modern computers without serial ports to communicate with RS232 devices.\",\"info\":\"The adapter uses a high-quality USB-serial chipset (Prolific/CH340/FTDI depending on model) for stable and error-free communication.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1200.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006614422-192633619.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:03:34'),
(2761,1,'product',806,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to RS485 Converter Adapter\",\"description\":\"The USB to RS485 Converter Adapter is a compact and reliable communication interface that allows a computer or laptop to communicate with RS485-compatible devices through a USB port. It is widely used for industrial automation, PLC communication, CNC machines, motor drivers, security systems, and long-distance sensor networks.\",\"info\":\"USB to RS485 Converter Adapter\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006634068-148951055.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:03:54'),
(2762,1,'product',2452,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB TO Serial Cable\",\"description\":\"USB to Serial Cable is a communication interface cable used to connect a computer’s USB port to devices that communicate using serial protocols such as TTL (UART), RS232, or RS485. It acts as a bridge, converting USB signals from a PC or laptop into serial data that microcontrollers, development boards, industrial equipment, and embedded systems can understand.\",\"info\":\"These cables commonly use reliable chipset ICs like FTDI, CP2102, or CH340, which ensure stable data transfer and wide driver support across operating systems such as Windows, Linux, and macOS. Depending on the model, USB to Serial cables may support 3.3V or 5V logic levels, making them suitable for programming and debugging boards like Arduino, ESP8266/ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, routers, and GSM/GPS modules.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006653656-307646238.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:04:13'),
(2763,1,'product',2456,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to serial CP2102 Converter AADD\",\"description\":\"USB to Serial CP2102 Converter (AAD) is a compact and reliable communication module used to convert USB signals from a computer into TTL-level serial (UART) communication. It is based on the CP2102 chipset by Silicon Labs, which is well known for its stability, fast data transfer, and wide operating system support.\",\"info\":\"This converter typically supports 3.3V and 5V TTL logic levels, making it suitable for interfacing with popular development boards and modules such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, GSM/GPS modules, routers, and IoT devices. The board provides standard serial pins like TXD, RXD, GND, VCC, DTR, and RTS, which are commonly used for firmware uploading, serial debugging, and console access.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006673063-168048960.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:04:33'),
(2764,1,'product',267,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to TTL 2303\",\"description\":\"USB to TTL 2303 is a USB-to-serial adapter module based on the Prolific PL2303 chip that converts USB signals from a computer into TTL-level UART signals for microcontrollers.\",\"info\":\"It enables easy programming, debugging, and serial communication with boards like Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, and other embedded devices. Simply connect VCC, GND, TX, and RX to interface and upload code or monitor data via serial terminal.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"280.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":88,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006759379-223554240.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:05:59'),
(2765,1,'product',2466,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to TTL CH340\",\"description\":\"USB to TTL CH340 is a compact and cost-effective USB-to-UART (TTL) converter module based on the CH340 chipset developed by WCH. It is widely used to convert USB communication from a computer into TTL-level serial signals, enabling easy interfacing with microcontrollers and embedded devices.\",\"info\":\"The CH340 module typically supports 5V and 3.3V TTL logic levels, making it suitable for programming and serial communication with boards such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, ARM controllers, GSM/GPS modules, and IoT devices. It provides standard serial pins including TXD, RXD, GND, VCC, DTR, and RTS, which are commonly required for firmware uploading and debugging.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006785439-588241470.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:06:25'),
(2766,1,'product',264,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to TTL CP2102\",\"description\":\"USB to TTL CP2102 is a compact USB-to-serial adapter based on the Silicon Labs CP2102 chip that converts USB signals from your computer into TTL-level serial (UART) signals for microcontrollers.\",\"info\":\"It’s ideal for programming, debugging, and serial communication with boards like Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, and other embedded devices. Simple plug-and-play connectivity makes it essential for uploading code and monitoring serial output over USB.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"400.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":88,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006813868-989805083.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:06:53'),
(2767,1,'product',262,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to TTL CP2102 with DTR\",\"description\":\"USB to TTL CP2102 with DTR is a USB-to-serial adapter module based on the CP2102 chip that provides TTL-level serial communication for microcontrollers\",\"info\":\"It includes a DTR (Data Terminal Ready) pin that enables automatic reset/bootloading on boards like Arduino or ESP8266/ESP32 during programming.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"440.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":88,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006836296-476577176.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:07:16'),
(2768,1,'product',268,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to TTL FT232\",\"description\":\"USB to TTL FT232 is a USB-to-serial adapter module based on the FT232RL chip that converts USB signals from a computer into TTL-level UART signals for microcontrollers and embedded devices.\",\"info\":\"It provides reliable serial communication for programming, debugging, and data transfer with boards like Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, and Raspberry Pi Pico.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"250.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":88,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006861290-771670370.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:07:41'),
(2769,1,'product',2462,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to TTL FT232RL\",\"description\":\"USB to TTL FT232RL is a high-quality USB-to-UART (TTL) converter module based on the FT232RL IC from FTDI. It is widely used to convert USB signals from a computer into TTL-level serial communication, enabling reliable data exchange with microcontrollers and embedded systems.\",\"info\":\"This module supports both 3.3V and 5V TTL logic levels, making it ideal for programming and debugging devices such as Arduino boards, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, ARM controllers, GSM/GPS modules, and routers. It provides standard serial pins like TXD, RXD, GND, VCC, DTR, and RTS, which are especially useful for firmware uploading, serial monitoring, and bootloader access.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006884816-457660896.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:08:04'),
(2770,1,'product',2356,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Varta CR AA 3V Lithium Batteries\",\"description\":\"lithium batteries made by Varta, a reputable German battery manufacturer. These cells are part of Varta’s CR series of 3 V lithium manganese dioxide (Li-MnO?) batteries, designed for long life, high energy density, and stable output.\",\"info\":\"3 V DC — stable for electronic circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006906067-989936199.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:08:26'),
(2771,1,'product',978,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"VGA (Video Graphics Array) Cable\",\"description\":\"1 meter,1.5 meters,3 meters,5 meters,10 meters,15 meters,20 meters,30 meters. A VGA cable is an analog video transmission cable used to connect computers, laptops, and other video sources to displays such as monitors, projectors, and TVs. It uses a 15-pin D-sub connector and is commonly found on older or legacy devices.\",\"info\":\"VGA (Video Graphics Array) Cable is an analog video cable used to connect a computer or laptop to a monitor, projector, or display. It features a 15-pin D-sub connector and supports video resolutions commonly up to 1080p (depending on cable quality and length).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":377,\"secondary_id\":342,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006929554-747514062.jpeg\"}','2026-02-25 08:08:49'),
(2772,1,'product',500,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Vibration Motor\",\"description\":\"Vibration Motor is a compact DC motor fitted with an unbalanced weight on its shaft, which creates a vibration effect when the motor rotates. It is commonly used in mobile phones, wearables, alert systems, toys, robotics, and small electronic projects to generate haptic feedback or tactile alerts.\",\"info\":\"A Vibration Motor is a small DC motor designed to produce vibration instead of continuous rotation. It creates vibration by rotating an off-center (eccentric) weight attached to the motor shaft.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"149.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":460,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006948697-882623137.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:09:08'),
(2773,1,'product',250,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Vibration Sensor SEN043\",\"description\":\"Vibration Sensor (SEN043) is a compact motion-detecting module that senses vibration or shaking\",\"info\":\"It typically uses a spring-mounted switch (such as SW-420) to detect movement and outputs a digital signal when vibration is present. Commonly used with Arduino, ESP32, and Raspberry Pi in projects like security alarms, impact detection, and motion-triggered alerts.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"450.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":67,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772006972749-502233409.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:09:32'),
(2774,1,'product',252,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Vibration Sensor SW420\",\"description\":\"Vibration Sensor SW420 is a compact digital vibration detection module that outputs a HIGH signal when motion or shaking is detected.\",\"info\":\"It uses the SW-420 vibration switch paired with an adjustable potentiometer to set sensitivity\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"180.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":67,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772007448591-25208541.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:17:28'),
(2775,1,'product',251,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Vibration Tilt Sensor\",\"description\":\"Vibration Tilt Sensor is a compact sensor that detects both vibration and tilt movement\",\"info\":\"It typically contains a small internal element (like a spring and ball) that changes position when the module is shaken or tilted, producing a digital signal output.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"150.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":67,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772007497925-261950456.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:18:17'),
(2776,1,'product',846,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"videocon  & Sansui 17-IN-1 VER.2 Remote\",\"description\":\"Universal TV Remote Control Compatible for Videocon LCD LED HD TV – Seamless compatibility with all Videocon models, no setup hassles\\r\\nVideocon TV Remote Old Model & Original Version – Ideal for both old and new models, providing an original remote experience for your Videocon Smart TV\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1100.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772007568232-533756246.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:19:28'),
(2777,1,'product',865,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"VIDEOCON & SANSUI Remote\",\"description\":\"V-2BG / S-2GG Universal TV Remote is a high-quality replacement remote designed for a wide range of CRT, LCD, and LED televisions. It features a user-friendly button layout with smooth key response, making it easy to navigate channels, adjust volume, and access menu settings effortlessly. The remote is built with durable materials and offers strong infrared transmission for reliable long-distance control. With a plug-and-play design, it does not require any setup—simply insert the batteries and start using it instantly.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"550.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772007601666-822912305.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:20:01'),
(2778,1,'product',2065,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Videocon DTH Remote\",\"description\":\"Make sure your set?top box is really the Videocon / Videocon D2H brand (after the merger ?) — remote codes vary by brand/model.\",\"info\":\"Confirm the model of your box (HD / SD / RF / IR version) and whether the remote is labelled for “Videocon D2H”, “Videocon RF DTH”, etc. For example, a product listing says “Works upto 50 meter distance until 360° angle” for the RF version.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772007623394-210393737.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:20:23'),
(2779,1,'product',2104,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"VK Digital Set Top Box Remote\",\"description\":\"The VK Digital Set Top Box Remote is a dependable and easy-to-use controller designed for smooth operation with VK Digital SD and HD set-top boxes.\",\"info\":\"This remote is compatible with VK Digital Set Top Box.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":441,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772007648834-53049921.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:20:48'),
(2780,1,'product',240,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"VOICE 8  Record/Playback  Module\",\"description\":\"The VOICE 8 Record/Playback Module is an electronic audio module designed for recording and playing back voice messages or sound clips in embedded and automation projects. It allows users to record audio directly through an onboard microphone and replay the stored voice using push buttons or external trigger signals. The module typically supports multiple recording channels (up to 8 separate voice messages), making it suitable for applications that require different audio prompts or alerts.\",\"info\":\"The module includes a built-in microphone for recording, onboard memory for storing audio data, and an audio output stage capable of driving a small speaker directly. Recording and playback operations are controlled through dedicated buttons or digital input pins, allowing easy interfacing with microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, or other control systems. It operates on a low DC voltage supply (usually 3V–5V) and consumes minimal power, making it suitable for portable and battery-powered devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"950.00\",\"note\":\"VOICE 8 record/playback modules are widely used in voice announcement systems, talking toys, security alarms, automation alerts, educational devices, interactive projects, and embedded audio notification systems. Due to simple operation, compact size, and easy integration, the module provides a convenient solution for adding voice feedback to electronic projects.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772007739181-160857325.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:22:19'),
(2781,1,'product',172,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"VOICE 8 Channel Record/Playback\",\"description\":\"you’re referring to the Voice 8-Channel Record/Playback Module, a powerful standalone multi-channel voice recorder and playback board widely used for custom voice prompts, security alarms, and industrial announcements.\",\"info\":\"An 8-channel voice record/playback module lets you store and play back up to 8 separate audio messages (voice clips) independently.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1900.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":63,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772007768950-67613423.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:22:48'),
(2782,1,'product',237,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Voice recognition module Nuvoton ISD9160 (Grove)\",\"description\":\"Voice Recognition Module – Nuvoton ISD9160 (Grove) is a ready-to-use voice command recognition board based on the Nuvoton ISD9160 chip, featuring a Grove connector for easy plug-and-play integration with compatible development platforms.\",\"info\":\"It allows recognition of multiple voice commands and provides simple serial/UART interfacing for microcontrollers like Arduino and Raspberry Pi. Ideal for voice-controlled projects, smart assistants, IoT devices, and hands-free command applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":63,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772007788714-920092010.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:23:08'),
(2783,1,'product',164,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"VOICE RECOGNITION MODULE- VC02 -AI THINKER\",\"description\":\"The VC02 Voice Recognition Module by AI Thinker is an advanced and compact voice control solution designed for integrating intelligent voice interaction into embedded systems and IoT devices. It features an offline voice recognition engine, meaning it can process commands locally without relying on an internet connection, ensuring low latency, high privacy, and fast response times..\",\"info\":\"The Ai-Thinker VC-02 is an offline speech recognition module that can detect and act on predefined voice commands without needing Internet or cloud connectivity.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1550.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":230}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772007837281-971087300.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:23:57'),
(2784,1,'product',173,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Voice Recorder ISD1820\",\"description\":\"The ISD1820 is a single-message voice recording and playback module capable of storing up to 10 seconds of audio directly in its on-chip non-volatile memory — no SD card or microcontroller required.\",\"info\":\"The ISD1820 Voice Recorder/Playback Module lets you record and play back short audio messages (typically ~10–20 seconds) directly on the board.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"520.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":63,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772008519361-19641408.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:35:19'),
(2785,1,'product',1258,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Voltage Sensor\",\"description\":\"A Voltage Sensor is an electronic module used to measure the electrical voltage present in a circuit and provide a scaled-down, safe output to a microcontroller or data acquisition device\",\"info\":\"It typically uses a voltage divider or sensing chip to convert high voltages into a lower measurable range compatible with devices like Arduino, Raspberry Pi (via ADC), and other controllers\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"225.00\",\"note\":\"Voltage sensors help monitor battery levels, power supplies, and system voltages in automation, robotics, and electronics projects. They provide real-time voltage feedback for protection, display, logging, or control logic.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":18,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772008570113-71344083.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:36:10'),
(2786,1,'product',2068,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Vu 4K Ultra HD Smart Remote\",\"description\":\"Connectivity: HDMI version (HDMI 2.0/2.1), number of ports, USB, WiFi, Bluetooth etc — important if you use consoles, streaming devices.\",\"info\":\"Smart TV platform & updates: Since you want a “Smart Android” type, verify it uses Google TV / Android-based OS and check support for apps, updates. Some variants may use more generic OS.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772008591431-274716027.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:36:31'),
(2787,1,'product',2112,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"VU LED Universal Remote\",\"description\":\"The VU LED Universal Remote is a versatile and user-friendly replacement controller designed to work seamlessly with a wide range of VU LED and Smart TV models.\",\"info\":\"Compatible for EN3C39V, ER-22645VU, GENUS LCD-1, VU, EN-31906D, BBK EN-31907, EN-21662B, EN-31603A, EN-31603B, ER-31607R, HISENSE ER-32963HS, HISENSE ER-32961HS\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772008612408-782798035.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:36:52'),
(2788,1,'product',2082,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"VU Remote\",\"description\":\"VU ADE 106 Remote is a high-quality replacement remote control designed specifically for VU LED and Smart TV models. It features a comfortable ergonomic design, durable keys, and a strong infrared signal for smooth and responsive performance. The remote supports all essential TV functions such as power on/off, volume control, channel selection, mute, input selection, and menu navigation. It works straight out of the box with most VU TV models—no setup or programming required.\",\"info\":\"Suitable for VU\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772008637937-644841279.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:37:17'),
(2789,1,'product',2075,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"VU smart tv remote\",\"description\":\"The VU Smart TV Remote is a sleek, user-friendly controller designed to provide effortless navigation for all VU LED and Smart TV models. Built with high-quality materials, it ensures comfortable handling and long-lasting durability\",\"info\":\"With a plug-and-play design, no setup or programming is required—simply insert the batteries and start using it instantly. Perfect as a replacement or spare controller, the VU Smart TV Remote guarantees smooth operation and a hassle-free entertainment experience.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772008659482-86716146.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:37:39'),
(2790,1,'product',100,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"W1209 Incubator Thermostat\",\"description\":\"W1209 Digital Temperature Controller Module (widely used as an incubator thermostat) — what it is, what it offers, how you can use it in your projects (especially considering your sensor/IoT context), and things to watch out for.\",\"info\":\"The W1209 thermostat controller is a compact digital temperature controller module designed to monitor and control temperature automatically using an onboard NTC temperature sensor and a built-in relay\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"750.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772008719507-403532718.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:38:39'),
(2791,1,'product',967,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"W600 - ATSAMD21 Cortex-M0 Wireless Board\",\"description\":\"The W600 – ATSAMD21 Cortex-M0 Wireless Board is a compact and efficient development platform designed for low-power IoT applications\",\"info\":\"W600 – ATSAMD21 Cortex-M0 Wireless Board is a compact Wi-Fi-enabled microcontroller board that combines an Atmel/SAMD21 Cortex-M0+ MCU with a W600 Wi-Fi module, allowing you to build connected embedded and IoT projects\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":177,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772008757895-748695177.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:39:17'),
