(2793,1,'product',2345,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Wall Spaeker TT-PAD-WS4\",\"description\":\"The Target TT-PAD-WS4 wall speaker is a compact and efficient audio solution designed for home and commercial use. It features a 4-inch driver with a rated power output of approximately 20–40 watts, delivering clear, balanced sound that’s suitable for background music, announcements, or PA applications.\",\"info\":\"The unit is wall-mountable, making it ideal for spaces where floor-standing speakers aren’t practical, and it connects via a wired setup with an 8-ohm impedance, ensuring stable performance with compatible amplifiers or PA systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"6999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772008819414-370638462.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 08:40:19'),
(2794,1,'product',2346,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Wall Spaeker TT-PAD-WS5\",\"description\":\"The **Target TT-PAD-WS5 is a wall-mount public address (PA) speaker designed for indoor audio applications such as offices, schools, restaurants, halls, and commercial spaces.\",\"info\":\"The compact, mountable design allows it to be installed on walls at optimal positions to cover larger spaces with balanced sound, and its build quality supports long-term use in professional environments.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"3000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772012529653-739896373.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 09:42:09'),
(2795,1,'product',2347,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Wall Spaeker TT-PAD-WS6 BLACK & WHITE\",\"description\":\"This wall speaker is commonly used in PA (Public Address) systems, background music setups, and announcement systems. It delivers clear mid and high frequencies, ensuring that announcements remain audible even in noisy surroundings such as shops or corridors.\",\"info\":\"The TT-PAD-WS6 is ideal for installation in offices, schools, hospitals, showrooms, hotels, malls, conference rooms, places of worship, and waiting areas\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772012562186-800793029.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 09:42:42'),
(2796,1,'product',109,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"WATER FLOAT BLACK L TYPE\",\"description\":\"This is a mechanical float switch designed to detect water level in a tank.It typically has a black plastic housing with a float and switching mechanism; the “L-type” refers to the shape or mounting style (side-mounted/horizontal float arm) which suits tank wall installation. It’s commonly used for automatic tank filling, overflow protection, pump control, etc.\",\"info\":\"The Water Float Black L Type is a compact liquid level sensing switch designed to control water levels in tanks and containers. Its L-shaped design allows side mounting, making it ideal for applications where top mounting is not possible.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"590.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772012588588-218700829.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 09:43:08'),
(2797,1,'product',110,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"WATER FLOAT P45\",\"description\":\"Here’s a detailed overview of the P45 Small Float Level Control Switch (also called “Water Float P45”) — what it is, how you can use it in your tank/IoT system, its specs and integration tips for your sensor + microcontroller + web?dashboard setup.\",\"info\":\"A P45 float switch is a liquid level sensor that uses a buoyant float and a magnetic reed switch to detect water height in a tank or container.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"690.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772012633591-889055247.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 09:43:53'),
(2798,1,'product',2440,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Water Flow sensor with TDS probe MH-01\",\"description\":\"The MH-01 is a 2-in-1 multifunction water sensor that integrates water flow measurement with TDS (Total Dissolved Solids) sensing (and sometimes temperature) in a single compact unit. It’s typically used in smart water monitoring, filtration systems, irrigation systems with quality control, and IoT water analytics modules.\",\"info\":\"Flow measurement (Hall effect pulses)\\r\\nTDS (water quality) sensing\\r\\nOptional temperature reading\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772012666114-324151876.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 09:44:26'),
(2799,1,'product',2437,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"water flow sensor YF-DN50 2inch\",\"description\":\"The YFDN50 Water Flow Sensor, YF?DN50 Water Flow Sensor 2 inch, 2 inch Water Flow Sensor - YF?DN50, Yf?DN50 Water Flow Sensor, SEA YF?DN50?S?3M Stainless Steel Water Flow Sensor, and DN50 Water Flow Sensor Flowmeter Hall Sensor Control are large-diameter inline water flow sensors used to measure the flow rate of water passing through a 2-inch (DN50) pipe.\",\"info\":\"These sensors are mechanical turbine flowmeters that output digital pulses proportional to the flow rate, making them suitable for use with controllers like Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP32, or Pi Pico\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772012694390-452506189.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 09:44:54'),
(2800,1,'product',2438,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Water Flow sensor YF-S201 1/2 inch\",\"description\":\"YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor 1/2 inch, Robodo YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor, Water Flow Sensor YF?S201, Water Flow Sensor / Fluid Flowmeter YF?S201, Robocraze YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor, and YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor by Quartz Components are all versions of the YF-S201 — a compact Hall-effect water flow sensor with a standard 1/2? threaded connection for plumbing systems.\",\"info\":\"This sensor is designed to measure the flow rate of water (or other non-corrosive liquids) passing through a pipe and output a digital pulse signal that can be read by a microcontroller such as Arduino, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, or Raspberry Pi Pico\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772012738805-802442733.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 09:45:38'),
(2801,1,'product',107,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"WATER FLOW SENSOR YFS 201 Hall Effect Pulse\",\"description\":\"The YF-S201 is a Hall-effect turbine flow sensor.\\r\\nAs water passes through the sensor, it spins a small rotor inside.\\r\\nA Hall-effect sensor detects each rotation and produces a pulse signal.\\r\\nBy counting these pulses per second, you can calculate the flow rate (L/min) and total volume (Liters).\",\"info\":\"The Water Flow Sensor YF-S201 is a compact liquid flow measurement sensor that uses a Hall effect pulse output to measure the rate of water flow through a pipe\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"750.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772012775048-656414247.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 09:46:15'),
(2802,1,'product',747,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Water Level Senor Module\",\"description\":\"Water Level Sensor Module is a simple and effective tool used to detect the presence and level of water in a container or tank. It works on the principle of conductivity, using exposed copper traces to measure the water level based on how many traces come in contact with the liquid.\",\"info\":\"It provides an analog or digital output proportional to the water level, making it ideal for water tank monitoring, overflow alarms, irrigation systems, and Arduino/ESP projects. The module is easy to use, low cost, and suitable for non-corrosive liquid level detection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"299.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772012800878-756696568.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 09:46:40'),
(2803,1,'product',2146,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Water Pump DC 6-12Volt 385\",\"description\":\"The DC Water Pump 6–12V (Model 385) is a compact and efficient miniature water pump designed for low-voltage DC operation, commonly used in DIY electronics, automation, and small liquid transfer applications. It operates using a brushed DC motor that drives an internal impeller to move water smoothly through the inlet and outlet ports. The pump is designed for continuous water flow and provides reliable performance when powered by batteries, power adapters, or motor driver circuits.\",\"info\":\"This pump typically works within a voltage range of 6V to 12V DC, with optimal performance around 12V, delivering higher water flow and pressure at increased voltage levels. It features a durable plastic body, low noise operation, and simple two-wire connection for easy installation. The pump is suitable for clean water and light liquid circulation but is not intended for corrosive liquids or dry running operation. Speed and flow rate can also be controlled using a PWM motor speed controller.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"The DC 385 water pump is widely used in automatic plant watering systems, aquarium circulation, water fountains, cooling systems, robotics projects, DIY irrigation setups, and IoT-based fluid control applications. Its small size, low power consumption, and easy interfacing make it ideal for educational and prototype projects.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772012919033-211751472.jpg\"}','2026-02-25 09:48:39'),
