(2943,1,'brand',58,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"ACC\",\"description\":\"ACC Cement is one of India’s oldest and most trusted cement brands, widely used in residential, commercial, and infrastructure construction\",\"info\":\"ACC stands for Associated Cement Companies and is known for consistent quality, strength, and durability across its product range.\",\"note\":\"The brand has built a strong reputation for innovation, sustainability, and environmental responsibility, being among the first cement companies in India to introduce bulk cement supply and ready-mix concrete solutions.\",\"system_note\":\"ACC Cement is widely used in houses, apartments, bridges, roads, industrial structures, and infrastructure development, offering good bonding strength, long service life, and dependable construction performance. Its long legacy, technological advancement, and focus on quality have made ACC one of the most recognized cement brands in India and a trusted name in modern construction\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 04:50:02'),
(2944,1,'brand',15,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Acer\",\"description\":\"Acer is a globally recognized multinational technology brand known for manufacturing computers, electronics, and digital devices for home users, businesses, education, and gaming markets.\",\"info\":\"Acer is a Taiwanese multinational technology brand founded in 1976, specializing in laptops, desktops, monitors, gaming systems, and digital devices. Known for affordable innovation and reliable performance, Acer serves consumers, businesses, gamers, and educational institutions worldwide with a wide range of computing solutions.\",\"note\":\"Acer is known for combining advanced hardware technology with user-friendly features, making its products suitable for students, professionals, gamers, and enterprises.\",\"system_note\":\"The company emphasizes innovation, sustainability, and digital transformation, continuously developing energy-efficient products and smart solutions. Acer products are widely used in education, business environments, home computing, gaming, creative work, and enterprise applications. With a strong global distribution and service network, Acer has established itself as a trusted and accessible technology brand worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 04:54:14'),
(2945,1,'brand',102,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Action Tesa\",\"description\":\"Action Tesa is a well-recognized Indian brand specializing in wood-based building materials and interior panel solutions.\",\"info\":\"The brand focuses on providing durable, quality plywood and engineered wood products that cater to residential, commercial, and industrial interior applications, particularly in furniture, cabinetry, and built-in fixtures.\",\"note\":\"The brand was created to meet the growing demand for modern interior and furniture materials such as MDF boards, particle boards, laminate flooring, and high-performance engineered wood solutions\",\"system_note\":\"Action TESA is recognized as a major player in India’s panel industry, known for innovation, quality manufacturing, and advanced technology.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 04:57:01'),
(2946,1,'brand',242,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Agaro\",\"description\":\"Agaro is a brand that offers a range of consumer electronics and smart home products, particularly known in markets like India for LED lighting, home appliances accessories, power strips, and smart devices\",\"info\":\"The brand focuses on providing affordable, functional, and energy-efficient solutions for modern homes and offices.\",\"note\":\"AGARO offers a wide range of products including vacuum cleaners, air fryers, coffee makers, mixer grinders, garment steamers, grooming devices, massage equipment, and health care appliances. Known for its contemporary styling and reliable performance, the brand has gained strong popularity across India through online and retail distribution channels\",\"system_note\":\"AGARO emphasizes quality manufacturing, practical functionality, and customer satisfaction, making it a trusted choice for modern lifestyle appliances that enhance comfort, convenience, and daily living efficiency.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 04:58:57'),
(2947,1,'brand',121,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Airtel\",\"description\":\"Airtel (Bharti Airtel Limited) is one of India’s leading telecommunications and digital services providers, offering mobile, broadband, digital TV, and enterprise solutions.\",\"info\":\"Airtel is a leading Indian telecom operator providing mobile, broadband, digital TV, and enterprise services, known for strong network performance and wide coverage.\",\"note\":\"The company provides 4G and 5G mobile connectivity, high-speed fiber broadband under Airtel Xstream Fiber, DTH television services, and cloud and business networking solutions for enterprises. Known for its wide network coverage, reliable connectivity, and continuous technological innovation, Airtel serves millions of customers ranging from individual users to large businesses\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on delivering fast data services, digital entertainment, secure communication infrastructure, and advanced network technology, making it one of the most trusted and recognized telecom brands in India and internationally.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 04:59:45'),
(2948,1,'brand',246,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"AKG\",\"description\":\"AKG Acoustics is a world-renowned Austrian audio brand founded in 1947, celebrated for its high-quality headphones, microphones, and professional audio equipment.\",\"info\":\"AKG Acoustics is a world-renowned Austrian audio brand founded in 1947, celebrated for its high-quality headphones, microphones, and professional audio equipment.\",\"note\":\"The brand produces a wide range of audio solutions including studio headphones, wireless earphones, professional microphones, and audio accessories designed for musicians, sound engineers, content creators, and everyday users\",\"system_note\":\"Now operating as part of Harman International, a subsidiary of Samsung Electronics, AKG combines decades of audio expertise with modern technology to deliver balanced sound performance and premium build quality. AKG products are widely trusted in recording studios and live performances worldwide, making the brand a symbol of professional-grade audio excellence.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:00:40'),
