(2950,1,'brand',203,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Allegro\",\"description\":\"Allegro Microsystems is a well-known semiconductor manufacturer specializing in sensor ICs and power ICs, particularly magnetic (Hall-effect) sensing solutions\",\"info\":\"Allegro devices are widely trusted for accuracy, robustness, and automotive-grade reliability.\",\"note\":\"Allegro is well known for its motor driver ICs, current sensors, magnetic sensors, power management ICs, and automotive control solutions that enable efficient energy management and precise motion control.\",\"system_note\":\"The brand plays a significant role in modern technologies such as electric vehicles, robotics, automation systems, and smart electronics. With strong emphasis on innovation, reliability, and energy efficiency, Allegro products are widely trusted by engineers and manufacturers worldwide for delivering accurate performance and durable electronic solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:10:59'),
