(2952,1,'brand',148,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Ambrane\",\"description\":\"Ambrane focuses on creating value-for-money electronic products that combine durability, safety, and modern design. The brand is especially popular in India for its wide range of charging and mobile accessories, catering to students, professionals, and general consumers.\",\"info\":\"Ambrane focuses on creating value-for-money electronic products that combine durability, safety, and modern design. The brand is especially popular in India for its wide range of charging and mobile accessories, catering to students, professionals, and general consumers.\",\"note\":\"Ambrane focuses on delivering high-quality products with modern design, safety features, and efficient performance tailored to everyday consumer needs. The company emphasizes innovation, durability, and value-for-money pricing while expanding its presence through online platforms and retail networks across India\",\"system_note\":\"With a growing reputation for dependable charging solutions and smart gadgets, Ambrane has become a trusted brand among Indian consumers for mobile and lifestyle electronics.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:17:27'),
