(2955,1,'brand',57,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Ambuja\",\"description\":\"Ambuja Cement (now part of the Adani Group) is one of India’s most trusted and widely used cement brands, known for consistent quality, strong performance, and durability across various construction needs.\",\"info\":\"Established in 1983, the company has built a strong reputation for innovation, sustainability, and consistent product performance in the construction industry. Ambuja is known for its advanced manufacturing technology, environmentally responsible practices, and energy-efficient production processes.\",\"note\":\"The brand offers a range of cement products designed to provide superior strength, durability, and long-lasting structural performance\",\"system_note\":\"With an extensive distribution network across India and a strong focus on customer support and sustainable development, Ambuja has become a trusted name among engineers, builders, contractors, and homeowners for reliable construction solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:22:09'),
