(2957,1,'brand',205,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"AMD\",\"description\":\"AMD (Advanced Micro Devices) is a globally recognized U.S.-based semiconductor company known for high-performance processors and graphics solutions\",\"info\":\"AMD products are widely used across consumer computing, data centers, embedded systems, and gaming.\",\"note\":\"AMD has become one of the world’s leading innovators in computing and graphics technology. The company develops Ryzen™ processors for desktops and laptops, Radeon™ graphics cards for gaming and professional applications, and EPYC™ processors for enterprise and cloud servers\",\"system_note\":\"AMD focuses on delivering powerful performance, energy efficiency, and advanced architecture to support modern workloads such as gaming, artificial intelligence, and high-performance computing. With continuous innovation and strong industry partnerships, AMD plays a major role in shaping modern computing experiences for consumers, businesses, and technology professionals worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:29:46'),
