(2959,1,'brand',202,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Analog Devices\",\"description\":\"Analog Devices (ADI) is a world-leading U.S.-based semiconductor manufacturer specializing in high-performance analog, mixed-signal, and digital signal processing ICs.\",\"info\":\"ADI is known for precision, reliability, and innovation in mission-critical electronic systems.\",\"note\":\"Analog Devices manufactures products including data converters, amplifiers, sensors, power management ICs, and embedded processing solutions widely used in industrial automation, automotive systems, healthcare equipment, communications, and consumer electronics.\",\"system_note\":\"Known for innovation, accuracy, and reliability, Analog Devices focuses on enabling intelligent systems and advanced connectivity solutions, making it a trusted partner for engineers and manufacturers worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:34:34'),
(2960,1,'brand',233,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Anchor by Panasonic\",\"description\":\"Anchor by Panasonic is a well-established electrical solutions brand in India owned and operated by Panasonic Life Solutions India Pvt. Ltd., a wholly-owned subsidiary of Panasonic Corporation\",\"info\":\"Originally founded as Anchor Electricals Pvt. Ltd. in 1963, it became part of the Panasonic group in 2007, combining Anchor’s wide distribution and market reach with Panasonic’s global technology and quality standards.\",\"note\":\"Anchor by Panasonic is widely known for its durable, safe, and energy-efficient electrical products used in residential, commercial, and industrial applications. The product portfolio includes switches, sockets, LED lighting, fans, wires and cables, switchgear, and smart electrical solutions designed for modern homes and infrastructure\",\"system_note\":\"With a strong distribution network and a reputation for reliability and safety, Anchor by Panasonic has become one of the most trusted electrical brands in India, combining Japanese technology with locally tailored solutions for everyday electrical needs.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:35:31'),
(2961,1,'brand',240,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Anker\",\"description\":\"Anker (Anker Innovations Co., Ltd.) is a leading global brand in charging technology and smart hardware — known especially for chargers, cables, power banks, car chargers, and more that deliver fast, safe, and reliable power for phones, tablets, laptops, and other devices\",\"info\":\"Anker pioneered technologies like PowerIQ, Power Delivery (PD), and GaN charging to deliver efficient, high-speed charging in compact designs\",\"note\":\"The brand offers a wide range of products including power banks, fast chargers, charging cables, wireless chargers, audio devices, and smart home accessories. Anker is especially known for its PowerIQ and fast-charging technologies that provide efficient and safe power delivery for smartphones, laptops, and other digital devices.\",\"system_note\":\"With a focus on premium build quality, reliable performance, and user-friendly design, Anker products are widely trusted by consumers worldwide, making the brand a leader in modern charging and mobile accessory solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:36:35'),
(2962,1,'brand',140,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Ant Esports\",\"description\":\"Ant Esports is an Indian gaming and PC components brand that designs and sells gaming gear, PC hardware, and accessories targeted at gamers and PC enthusiasts, especially in the budget and value segment.\",\"info\":\"The brand has grown in popularity in India for its combination of affordable pricing, decent quality, and gaming-centric features.\",\"note\":\"Ant Esports offers a wide range of products including gaming keyboards, mice, headsets, cabinets (PC cases), power supplies, cooling solutions, gaming chairs, and accessories. Known for stylish RGB designs and budget-friendly pricing, the brand has gained strong popularity among entry-level and mid-range gaming users, especially in India.\",\"system_note\":\"Ant Esports emphasizes performance, durability, and user comfort, making it a preferred choice for gamers looking for cost-effective gaming setups without compromising essential features and quality.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:37:19'),
(2963,1,'brand',198,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Aplus\",\"description\":\"Aplus Integrated Circuits Inc. is a Taiwanese semiconductor company known for designing and manufacturing integrated circuits, particularly for audio and memory applications. It is recognized in the electronics industry for cost-effective IC solutions used in consumer and industrial products.\",\"info\":\"Aplus’s portfolio includes single-chip voice ICs, flash memory ICs, and microcontrollers designed for low-power applications. Its audio playback chips integrate memory and signal-processing functions, simplifying product design for manufacturers. The company also supplies ROM-based and rewritable voice chips compatible with a variety of encoding formats.\",\"note\":\"Aplus products commonly include computer peripherals, networking accessories, power solutions, and electronic components that emphasize functionality, durability, and ease of use. Known for offering value-for-money technology products, Aplus aims to meet everyday computing and connectivity needs while maintaining consistent quality standards.\",\"system_note\":\"With growing availability through retail and distribution channels, Aplus has become a recognized choice for users seeking dependable electronic accessories and basic technology solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:38:16'),
