(2965,1,'brand',6,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Apple\",\"description\":\"Apple is a globally leading technology company known for designing and manufacturing premium consumer electronics, computer systems, software, and digital services. The brand is recognized worldwide for its innovation, high-quality design, performance, and integrated ecosystem of hardware and software products.\",\"info\":\"Apple is a leading global technology brand founded in 1976, known for premium computers, smartphones, and digital devices. The company delivers innovative products combining powerful hardware, advanced software, and a seamless ecosystem designed for productivity, creativity, and everyday use.\",\"note\":\"he company’s major products include the iPhone smartphones, Mac computers, iPad tablets, Apple Watch, AirPods, and related accessories, along with operating systems such as iOS and macOS. Apple also provides digital services including the App Store, iCloud, Apple Music, and streaming platforms. Known for its sleek design philosophy, strong security features, and seamless integration across devices\",\"system_note\":\"Apple focuses on delivering a superior user experience and cutting-edge performance. With a global customer base and strong brand loyalty, Apple remains one of the most influential and valuable technology brands in the world.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:39:06'),
(2966,1,'brand',38,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Apple imac\",\"description\":\"Apple iMac is a premium all-in-one desktop computer designed and developed by Apple, combining powerful performance, elegant design, and a high-resolution display into a single compact system.\",\"info\":\"The iMac is widely used for home computing, office productivity, creative work, education, and professional content creation.\",\"note\":\"Powered by Apple’s advanced processors, including Apple Silicon chips such as the M-series, the iMac delivers fast performance for everyday computing, creative work, multimedia editing, and professional applications. It features a slim aluminum body, vibrant color options, high-quality speakers, advanced camera systems, and seamless integration with macOS and the Apple ecosystem.\",\"system_note\":\"Known for its reliability, energy efficiency, and premium user experience, the Apple iMac is widely used in homes, offices, educational institutions, and creative studios for productivity, design, and entertainment purposes.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:43:37'),
(2967,1,'brand',66,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"ArcelorMittal\",\"description\":\"ArcelorMittal is one of the largest and most respected steel producers in the world, known for manufacturing a wide range of high-quality steel products for construction, infrastructure, automotive, and industrial use.\",\"info\":\"The company combines the global reach of Arcelor and Mittal Steel, delivering advanced, sustainable steel solutions internationally.\",\"note\":\"ArcelorMittal manufactures a wide range of steel solutions including flat steel, long steel, tubular products, and specialty steels designed for strength, durability, and sustainability.\",\"system_note\":\"The company focuses on innovation, advanced manufacturing technologies, and environmentally responsible steel production, supporting modern infrastructure and industrial development worldwide. With a strong commitment to quality, safety, and sustainable growth, ArcelorMittal plays a key role in supplying materials essential for global construction and engineering industries.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:44:34'),
(2968,1,'brand',114,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Ashirvad pipes\",\"description\":\"Ashirvad Pipes is one of India’s leading piping system brands, widely trusted for residential, commercial, industrial, and agricultural applications.\",\"info\":\"Ashirvad Pipes are commonly used for plumbing, sanitation, water supply, and infrastructure projects across India.\",\"note\":\"Ashirvad Pipes offers a comprehensive range of products including uPVC, CPVC, SWR drainage systems, column pipes, and underground drainage piping designed for efficient water supply and waste management.\",\"system_note\":\"The company focuses on advanced manufacturing technology, strict quality standards, and sustainable practices to ensure long-lasting performance and safety. With an extensive distribution and service network across India, Ashirvad Pipes is trusted by builders, plumbers, engineers, and homeowners for dependable plumbing infrastructure solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:45:38'),
(2969,1,'brand',63,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Asian\",\"description\":\"Asian Paints is India’s leading paint company and one of the most trusted names in decorative and industrial coatings.\",\"info\":\"Its popular ranges like Royale, Apcolite, Ace, and Tractor are widely used in homes, commercial buildings, and infrastructure projects.\",\"note\":\"Asian Paints offers a wide range of products including interior and exterior wall paints, waterproofing solutions, wood finishes, metal coatings, primers, and decorative textures designed to enhance durability and aesthetic appeal.\",\"system_note\":\"The brand is recognized for its innovation, advanced color technology, and customer-focused services such as color consultation and home décor solutions. With a strong distribution network and commitment to quality, sustainability, and modern design trends, Asian Paints has become a preferred choice for homeowners, builders, and professionals in residential and commercial construction projects.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:46:40'),
(2970,1,'brand',81,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Asian Granito (AGL)\",\"description\":\"Asian Granito India Ltd. (AGL) is one of India’s leading tile and surface solution brands, known for its premium quality, innovative designs, and large-format offerings.\",\"info\":\"AGL serves residential, commercial, and industrial projects across India and global markets, delivering products that combine style, strength, and technology.\",\"note\":\"AGL offers a wide range of products including ceramic tiles, vitrified tiles, porcelain tiles, composite marble, quartz surfaces, bathware, and faucets designed for residential, commercial, and architectural applications. The brand focuses on advanced manufacturing technology, contemporary styles, and durable materials that combine aesthetics with long-lasting performance\",\"system_note\":\"With a strong distribution network across India and exports to numerous countries worldwide, Asian Granito (AGL) is trusted by architects, builders, and homeowners for stylish and reliable surface and interior solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:47:20'),
(2971,1,'brand',255,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"ASRock\",\"description\":\"ASRock is especially popular for offering feature-rich motherboards at competitive prices, making it a preferred choice for gamers, PC builders, system integrators, and enthusiasts.\",\"info\":\"The company supports the latest Intel and AMD platforms, delivering strong performance, stability, and compatibility across a wide range of use cases—from everyday computing to high-end gaming and professional workloads.\",\"note\":\"The company offers a wide range of motherboards supporting Intel and AMD processors, along with gaming-focused components featuring advanced cooling, overclocking capabilities, and modern connectivity options.\",\"system_note\":\"ASRock emphasizes quality engineering, affordability, and cutting-edge technology to meet evolving computing demands. With strong global distribution and a reputation for stability and performance, ASRock has become a trusted brand among system builders and technology users worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:48:06'),
(2972,1,'brand',230,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Assembled\",\"description\":\"Assembled refers to items that are fully fitted, connected, and ready for use. All required parts and accessories are properly installed and checked to ensure smooth operation and immediate usability.\",\"info\":\"Item is fully assembled\\r\\nAll parts properly fitted\\r\\nRequired connections completed\\r\\nTested for basic functionality\\r\\nReady for immediate use\",\"note\":\"Item supplied in fully assembled condition\\r\\nAll components are properly fitted and tested\\r\\nReady for immediate use\\r\\n Brand/model may vary based on availability\\r\\nPhysical damage or misuse not covered\",\"system_note\":\"System supplied in fully assembled condition\\r\\nAll required components properly installed\\r\\nBasic configuration completed\\r\\nSystem tested and found working at the time of delivery\\r\\nReady for immediate use\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:48:12'),
(2973,1,'brand',104,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"ASTRAL pipes\",\"description\":\"Astral Pipes is a leading Indian manufacturer of piping systems widely used in plumbing, drainage, sanitation, and industrial applications.\",\"info\":\"The pipes are engineered for high strength, corrosion resistance, smooth inner surfaces, and long service life, making them suitable for residential, commercial, and infrastructure projects.\",\"note\":\"ASTRAL offers a comprehensive range of products including CPVC, uPVC, SWR drainage systems, HDPE pipes, underground drainage solutions, agricultural piping, and industrial piping systems designed for residential, commercial, and infrastructure applications.\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on durability, corrosion resistance, and efficient water management while maintaining strict quality and safety standards. With a strong nationwide distribution network and growing international presence, ASTRAL Pipes is trusted by engineers, builders, plumbers, and homeowners for reliable and long-lasting piping solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:49:14'),
(2974,1,'brand',16,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Asus\",\"description\":\"ASUS is a globally recognized multinational technology brand known for manufacturing computers, laptops, computer hardware, gaming devices, and electronic components\",\"info\":\"The company is widely respected for innovation, performance, reliability, and advanced engineering, serving consumers, gamers, creators, and businesses worldwide.\",\"note\":\"ASUS is a global technology brand founded in 1989, specializing in laptops, desktops, gaming systems, computer components, and networking devices.\",\"system_note\":\"ASUS is a global technology brand founded in 1989, specializing in laptops, desktops, gaming systems, computer components, and networking devices.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:49:19'),
(2975,1,'brand',215,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Atmel\",\"description\":\"Atmel was a renowned microcontroller and memory semiconductor company, best known for its AVR and ARM-based microcontrollers\",\"info\":\"Atmel was acquired by Microchip Technology, and its popular products continue under the Microchip portfolio.\",\"note\":\"The company gained significant popularity among engineers, students, and developers through its ATmega microcontroller series, commonly used in development platforms such as Arduino. Atmel focused on low-power, high-performance solutions that enabled efficient control and communication in electronic systems\",\"system_note\":\"In 2016, Atmel was acquired by Microchip Technology Incorporated, and its product lines continue to be supported and developed under the Microchip brand, maintaining a strong legacy in the embedded electronics industry.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:50:01'),
(2976,1,'brand',247,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Audio Technica\",\"description\":\"Audio-Technica (AT) is a Japanese audio brand founded in 1962, renowned for producing high-quality audio equipment — especially headphones, microphones, turntables, and pro audio gear.\",\"info\":\"Audio-Technica (AT) is a Japanese audio brand founded in 1962, renowned for producing high-quality audio equipment — especially headphones, microphones, turntables, and pro audio gear.\",\"note\":\"Audio-Technica products are widely used in music production studios, broadcasting, live performances, gaming, and personal listening applications. The brand offers a broad range of audio equipment including studio monitoring headphones, wireless earbuds, condenser microphones, vinyl record players, and audio accessories designed for both professionals and everyday users.\",\"system_note\":\"Known for balanced sound quality and reliable performance, Audio-Technica combines advanced acoustic technology with Japanese craftsmanship, making it a trusted choice among musicians, sound engineers, creators, and audio enthusiasts worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:50:55'),
(2977,1,'brand',201,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Avago Technologies\",\"description\":\"Avago Technologies is a well-known semiconductor brand, now part of Broadcom Inc., with a strong reputation in optoelectroniCS\",\"info\":\"RF, and high-speed interface components. Avago products are widely used for isolation, communication, and signal integrity.\",\"note\":\"Originally formed as a spin-off from Hewlett-Packard’s semiconductor division, the company became widely recognized for its high-performance products such as RF components, fiber-optic devices, motion control encoders, and wireless communication chips.\",\"system_note\":\"Headquartered in Singapore and the United States, Avago focused on delivering reliable and efficient semiconductor solutions for networking equipment, data centers, smartphones, and industrial automation systems. In 2016, Avago Technologies acquired Broadcom Corporation and later adopted the name Broadcom Inc., continuing its legacy as a major global provider of advanced semiconductor and infrastructure software solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 05:51:58'),
(2978,1,'brand',201,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Avago Technologies\",\"description\":\"Avago Technologies is a well-known semiconductor brand, now part of Broadcom Inc., with a strong reputation in optoelectroniCS\",\"info\":\"RF, and high-speed interface components. Avago products are widely used for isolation, communication, and signal integrity.\",\"note\":\"Originally formed as a spin-off from Hewlett-Packard’s semiconductor division, the company became widely recognized for its high-performance products such as RF components, fiber-optic devices, motion control encoders, and wireless communication chips.\",\"system_note\":\"Headquartered in Singapore and the United States, Avago focused on delivering reliable and efficient semiconductor solutions for networking equipment, data centers, smartphones, and industrial automation systems. In 2016, Avago Technologies acquired Broadcom Corporation and later adopted the name Broadcom Inc., continuing its legacy as a major global provider of advanced semiconductor and infrastructure software solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:00:28'),
(2979,1,'brand',131,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"BBL\",\"description\":\"BBL is an Indian consumer electronics brand, primarily known for its budget-friendly LED and Smart TVs, as well as other basic home electronics.\",\"info\":\"It caters to value-conscious customers looking for affordable home entertainment solutions without premium pricing.\",\"note\":\"The brand focuses on providing reliable and cost-effective solutions such as LED lighting, electrical accessories, cables, switches, and power-related products that meet everyday installation and usage requirements. BBL products are generally known for practical design, durability, and energy-efficient performance, making them suitable for homes, offices, and small business environments\",\"system_note\":\"With an emphasis on affordability and consistent quality, BBL aims to deliver dependable electrical and lighting solutions through retail and distribution networks, catering to customers seeking value-for-money products for regular electrical and infrastructure needs.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:01:24'),
(2980,1,'brand',241,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Belkin\",\"description\":\"Belkin International, Inc. is a well-known technology accessory brand recognized for high-quality charging cables, power adapters, car chargers, wireless chargers, networking products, and device accessories.\",\"info\":\"Belkin products are widely compatible with smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other electronics, and many are officially certified (MFi for Apple) or support advanced charging standards.\",\"note\":\"The brand focuses on innovation, safety, and reliable performance, offering accessories designed to enhance connectivity and productivity for smartphones, computers, and smart devices.\",\"system_note\":\"Belkin products are widely trusted for their premium build quality and compatibility with leading technology brands, including Apple and Android devices. With a strong global presence and commitment to user-friendly design, Belkin has established itself as a leading name in modern connectivity and mobile accessory solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:03:29'),
