(2982,1,'brand',147,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Boat\",\"description\":\"boAt is a lifestyle-oriented brand that designs and markets trendy, durable, and affordable audio and wearable products. The brand emphasizes powerful bass, stylish design, and everyday usability, making it one of the most popular audio brands in India.\",\"info\":\"Youth-centric and lifestyle-focused branding\\r\\nStrong emphasis on deep bass audio tuning\\r\\nAffordable pricing with modern features\\r\\nTrendy colors and bold designs\",\"note\":\"boAt has quickly become one of the leading wearable and audio brands in the country. The company offers a wide range of products including wireless earbuds, headphones, Bluetooth speakers, smartwatches, charging cables, and mobile accessories that combine trendy design with reliable performance.\",\"system_note\":\"Known for its youth-focused branding and strong online presence, boAt emphasizes high-quality sound, durability, and value-for-money pricing. With continuous innovation and collaborations in music and entertainment segments, boAt has established itself as a trusted brand among young consumers seeking fashionable and performance-driven electronic gadgets.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:11:05'),
(2983,1,'brand',69,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Berger\",\"description\":\"Berger Paints is one of India’s leading paint companies, known for its wide range of decorative and industrial coating solutions.\",\"info\":\"With a strong focus on technology, color excellence, and eco-friendly products, Berger Paints combines modern design trends with long-lasting protection.\",\"note\":\"Berger Paints offers a wide range of products including interior and exterior wall paints, emulsions, enamels, waterproofing solutions, wood coatings, and metal finishes designed to enhance both appearance and surface protection.\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on eco-friendly formulations, modern finishes, and customer-oriented services such as color consultancy and painting solutions. With an extensive distribution network and strong market presence across India and international markets, Berger Paints is trusted by homeowners, builders, architects, and professionals for long-lasting and reliable painting solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:11:40'),
(2984,1,'brand',118,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Brila Opus\",\"description\":\"Birla Opus is a decorative paints and coatings brand launched by Grasim Industries Ltd, a flagship company of the Aditya Birla Group — one of India’s largest conglomerates\",\"info\":\"It entered the paints market to offer high-quality paint solutions for residential and commercial spaces\",\"note\":\"he brand focuses on combining advanced technology, innovative formulations, and contemporary design trends to provide superior performance, durability, and aesthetic appeal. Birla Opus offers a wide range of products including interior and exterior emulsions, primers, waterproofing solutions, enamels, and specialty coatings designed to enhance surface protection and long-lasting color finish.\",\"system_note\":\"With strong manufacturing capabilities, sustainable practices, and customer-centric services, Birla Opus aims to redefine the paint industry in India by offering reliable, eco-conscious, and premium painting solutions for homeowners, builders, and professionals.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:12:21'),
(2985,1,'brand',275,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"BOOM\",\"description\":\"BOOM is a brand commonly associated with modern consumer electronics and audio accessories, offering products designed for entertainment, portability, and everyday digital use. The brand focuses on delivering affordable and stylish audio solutions such as Bluetooth speakers, wireless earphones, headphones, and multimedia accessories that combine practical functionality with contemporary design\",\"info\":\"This multimedia player brings modern entertainment and connectivity to your car journeys.\",\"note\":\"BOOM products are generally developed to provide clear sound performance, easy connectivity, and user-friendly operation suitable for personal listening, outdoor activities, and casual entertainment\",\"system_note\":\"The Boom Multimedia Player for the Hyundai Grand i10 is a high-quality in-car entertainment system designed to enhance your driving experience.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1772086919496-697969347.png\"}','2026-02-26 06:21:59'),
(2986,1,'brand',126,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Bosch\",\"description\":\"Bosch is known as a premium yet functional brand — whether for power tools that professionals trust, household appliances that last for years, or automotive systems that power millions of vehicles worldwide.\",\"info\":\"Bosch (full name Robert Bosch GmbH) is a global German engineering and technology company with a long history of innovation across multiple industries. It’s widely respected for quality, reliability, and advanced engineering.\",\"note\":\"The brand offers a wide range of products such as power tools, home appliances, automotive components, security systems, and smart home solutions known for reliability, precision engineering, and advanced technology\",\"system_note\":\"Bosch emphasizes innovation, energy efficiency, and sustainability while maintaining strict quality standards. With a strong global presence and decades of engineering excellence, Bosch is widely trusted by professionals, industries, and consumers worldwide for durable and high-performance technology solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:23:01'),
(2987,1,'brand',150,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Bose\",\"description\":\"Bose is renowned for delivering clear, powerful, and balanced sound through advanced acoustic research and proprietary technologies. The brand focuses on combining audio performance, elegant design, and user-friendly features, making its products popular for both home and personal use.\",\"info\":\"Bose is renowned for delivering clear, powerful, and balanced sound through advanced acoustic research and proprietary technologies. The brand focuses on combining audio performance, elegant design, and user-friendly features, making its products popular for both home and personal use.\",\"note\":\"Bose offers a wide range of products including noise-cancelling headphones, wireless earbuds, Bluetooth speakers, home theater systems, and automotive audio solutions designed to deliver immersive listening experiences.\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on advanced audio technology, elegant design, and user comfort, making its products popular among music lovers, travelers, and professionals worldwide. With a strong reputation for performance, durability, and cutting-edge research, Bose remains one of the most trusted names in premium audio technology.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:23:54'),
(2988,1,'brand',153,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Boult\",\"description\":\"Boult Audio (commonly referred to as Boult) is an Indian brand that designs and markets affordable, stylish, and high-performance audio products. The brand is known for combining modern design with features suited for everyday use, fitness, gaming, and entertainment.\",\"info\":\"Focus on Made for India use cases\\r\\nStrong emphasis on bass-heavy sound profiles\\r\\nCompetitive pricing with premium features\\r\\nPopular among students, gamers, and fitness users\\r\\nKnown for fast charging technologies and robust build quality\",\"note\":\"Boult offers a wide range of products including true wireless earbuds (TWS), Bluetooth headphones, smartwatches, and audio accessories known for strong battery life, deep bass sound, and comfortable usability. With a strong presence in online marketplaces and retail channels across India, Boult emphasizes innovation, durability, and value-for-money pricing to meet the needs of young consumers and everyday users.\",\"system_note\":\"The brand has gained popularity for providing premium-style features at competitive prices, making it a trusted choice in India’s growing personal audio and wearable technology market.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:25:05'),
(2989,1,'brand',170,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Bourns\",\"description\":\"Bourns designs and manufactures electronic components and engineered solutions used in many applications, including automotive systems, industrial equipment, telecommunications, consumer electronics, power systems, and more.\",\"info\":\"Founded in 1947 and headquartered in Riverside, California, USA, the company is well known for designing high-quality components such as resistors, potentiometers, sensors, inductors, transformers, and protection devices including varistors and surge protectors.\",\"note\":\"Bourns products are widely used in automotive electronics, telecommunications, industrial equipment, consumer electronics, and networking systems. The brand focuses on innovation, precision engineering, and reliability to ensure stable performance and long operational life in electronic circuits\",\"system_note\":\"With decades of experience and strong global distribution, Bourns is trusted by engineers and manufacturers worldwide for dependable electronic component solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:27:02'),
(2990,1,'brand',118,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Brila Opus\",\"description\":\"Birla Opus is a decorative paints and coatings brand launched by Grasim Industries Ltd, a flagship company of the Aditya Birla Group — one of India’s largest conglomerates\",\"info\":\"It entered the paints market to offer high-quality paint solutions for residential and commercial spaces\",\"note\":\"he brand focuses on combining advanced technology, innovative formulations, and contemporary design trends to provide superior performance, durability, and aesthetic appeal. Birla Opus offers a wide range of products including interior and exterior emulsions, primers, waterproofing solutions, enamels, and specialty coatings designed to enhance surface protection and long-lasting color finish.\",\"system_note\":\"With strong manufacturing capabilities, sustainable practices, and customer-centric services, Birla Opus aims to redefine the paint industry in India by offering reliable, eco-conscious, and premium painting solutions for homeowners, builders, and professionals.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:27:27'),
(2991,1,'brand',123,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"BSNL\",\"description\":\"BSNL is a Government of India–owned telecommunications company that provides mobile, broadband, landline, and enterprise communication services across the country.\",\"info\":\"BSNL is a government-owned Indian telecom operator offering mobile, broadband, landline, and enterprise services, known for wide rural coverage and public-sector reliability.\",\"note\":\"BSNL offers mobile network services, landline connections, broadband internet, fiber-to-the-home (FTTH) services, and enterprise communication solutions for individuals, businesses, and government organizations. The company is known for its extensive network coverage, especially in rural and remote areas where connectivity is essential.\",\"system_note\":\"BSNL focuses on delivering affordable communication services, reliable connectivity, and digital infrastructure to support India’s telecommunications growth. With decades of telecom experience and nationwide presence, BSNL remains an important public sector telecom provider serving millions of customers across India.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:28:56'),
(2992,1,'brand',259,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Canon\",\"description\":\"Canon Inc. is a globally renowned Japanese imaging and optical technology company, widely recognized for its cameras, lenses, printers, and imaging solutions\",\"info\":\"Canon is especially famous for its DSLR and mirrorless cameras, which are trusted by photographers, videographers, journalists, and content creators worldwide\",\"note\":\"The company offers a broad range of products such as digital cameras, DSLR and mirrorless cameras, inkjet and laser printers, multifunction devices, lenses, and professional video equipment used by photographers, businesses, and creative professionals worldwide.\",\"system_note\":\"Canon focuses on advanced imaging technology, reliability, and user-friendly design to deliver superior image quality and performance. With a strong global presence and commitment to innovation and sustainability, Canon has become one of the most trusted brands in photography, printing, and visual imaging solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:29:43'),
(2993,1,'brand',165,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"CDIL\",\"description\":\"CDIL (Continental Device India Limited) is a well-known Indian semiconductor manufacturer, specializing in discrete semiconductor components\",\"info\":\"The brand is widely used across India for its reliable quality, wide availability, and cost-effective solutions.\",\"note\":\"The company manufactures a wide range of products including diodes, transistors, rectifiers, voltage regulators, and power modules used in consumer electronics, industrial equipment, automotive systems, telecommunications, and power management applications.\",\"system_note\":\"CDIL focuses on quality manufacturing, reliability, and cost-effective electronic solutions designed to meet global standards. With decades of experience and strong engineering expertise, CDIL has earned a reputation as a trusted supplier of semiconductor components for both domestic and international markets.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:36:56'),
(2994,1,'brand',98,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"CenturyPly\",\"description\":\"CenturyPly (Century Plyboards India Ltd.) is a leading Indian brand in wood-based panel products, plywood, laminates, and engineered timber solutions.\",\"info\":\"CenturyPly has become a trusted choice for interior construction, furniture, and architectural applications across India and global markets.\",\"note\":\"CenturyPly offers a wide range of products including plywood, block boards, decorative laminates, MDF boards, veneers, and particle boards designed for residential, commercial, and architectural interiors. The brand focuses on innovation, eco-friendly manufacturing practices, and advanced technology to ensure long-lasting performance and safety standards\",\"system_note\":\"With a strong nationwide distribution network and trusted reputation among architects, builders, carpenters, and homeowners, CenturyPly has become a preferred choice for modern interior and furniture solutions in India.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:37:54'),
(2995,1,'brand',83,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Cera\",\"description\":\"CERA Sanitaryware Ltd. is one of India’s leading and most trusted brands in sanitaryware, faucets, bathroom fittings, and wellness products.\",\"info\":\"CERA offers complete bathroom solutions for residential, commercial, and hospitality spaces.\",\"note\":\"Cera is known for combining contemporary design, advanced technology, and high-quality manufacturing standards. The company offers a wide range of products including wash basins, water closets, faucets, showers, tiles, mirrors, and bathroom accessories that focus on durability, water efficiency, and aesthetic appeal.\",\"system_note\":\"Cera emphasizes innovation, hygiene, and eco-friendly solutions to enhance comfort and functionality in modern bathrooms. With a strong distribution network and trusted reputation among architects, builders, and homeowners, Cera has become a preferred brand for stylish and reliable bathroom solutions across India.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:38:44'),
(2996,1,'brand',179,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"CNR\",\"description\":\"CNR is an electronics brand best known for circuit protection components, especially MOV (Metal Oxide Varistors).CNR products are widely used for surge suppression and over-voltage protection in power and control circuits.\",\"info\":\"The brand is known for manufacturing and supplying components such as diodes, rectifiers, transistors, voltage regulators, and other circuit-related parts designed to ensure stable performance and reliability in electronic systems.\",\"note\":\"CNR products are widely used in power supplies, consumer electronics, industrial equipment, and repair applications due to their durability and cost-effective performance.\",\"system_note\":\"Focused on quality control and dependable functionality, CNR aims to provide practical electronic component solutions suitable for engineers, technicians, and electronic manufacturers requiring reliable components for everyday electronic circuit applications.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:40:23'),
(2997,1,'brand',208,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Coilcraft\",\"description\":\"Coilcraft is a highly respected U.S.-based manufacturer specializing in magnetic components, particularly inductors and chokes.\",\"info\":\"The brand is known for excellent electrical performance, tight tolerances, and strong application support, making it a preferred choice in high-frequency and power designs.\",\"note\":\"Coilcraft products are widely used in telecommunications, automotive electronics, medical devices, aerospace systems, industrial equipment, and consumer electronics. The brand offers a broad range of components including power inductors, RF inductors, chip inductors, and custom magnetic solutions designed for efficient power management and signal integrity.\",\"system_note\":\"With a strong focus on reliability, performance, and technological innovation, Coilcraft is trusted by engineers and manufacturers worldwide for critical electronic design applications.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:41:20'),
(2998,1,'brand',17,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Compaq\",\"description\":\"Compaq is a well-known computer brand recognized for producing reliable personal computers, laptops, and business systems. Originally an independent company, Compaq became one of the world’s largest PC manufacturers before being acquired by HP (Hewlett-Packard). Today, the Compaq name is associated with affordable and dependable computing solutions for home and office users.\",\"info\":\"Compaq is a historic computer brand founded in 1982 and later acquired by HP. Known for reliable and affordable desktops and laptops, Compaq systems are designed for everyday computing, business productivity, and educational use.\",\"note\":\"The brand gained popularity for producing user-friendly and affordable computers suitable for office work, education, and everyday computing needs.\",\"system_note\":\"In 2002, Compaq merged with Hewlett-Packard (HP), and the brand continues to exist under HP as a value-oriented product line in selected markets. Compaq systems are known for practical design, dependable performance, and accessibility, making them a trusted choice for users seeking reliable computing solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:42:26'),
(2999,1,'brand',257,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Cooler Master\",\"description\":\"Cooler Master is a globally recognized computer hardware and cooling solutions brand, best known for its CPU coolers, PC cabinets, power supplies, and thermal management products.\",\"info\":\"Cooler Master has become a trusted name among PC gamers, enthusiasts, and professional system builders worldwide.\",\"note\":\"Cooler Master offers a wide range of products including CPU air and liquid coolers, PC cabinets (cases), power supplies, cooling fans, gaming keyboards, mice, headsets, and accessories.\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on performance, durability, and modern design, often featuring advanced cooling efficiency and customizable RGB lighting. With a strong reputation for quality engineering and reliable performance, Cooler Master is widely trusted worldwide for building high-performance gaming and workstation systems.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:43:20'),
(3000,1,'brand',144,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Corsair\",\"description\":\"Corsair is a leading American technology company that specializes in high-performance PC components and gaming peripherals and enthusiast PC components\",\"info\":\"It’s widely respected among gamers, content creators, and PC enthusiasts for combining quality engineering, performance, and stylish design.\",\"note\":\"The company offers a broad range of products including gaming keyboards, mice, headsets, PC cases, power supplies, cooling systems, high-speed RAM (memory modules), SSD storage devices, and streaming accessories\",\"system_note\":\"Corsair focuses on performance, reliability, and advanced customization features such as RGB lighting and software control through its ecosystem. With strong innovation and high-quality engineering, Corsair has established itself as a trusted brand for building powerful gaming systems and high-performance workstations worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:44:29'),
(3001,1,'brand',39,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Cyberpower\",\"description\":\"CyberPower (commonly known as CyberPowerPC) is a global technology brand specializing in high-performance desktop computers, gaming PCs, and custom-built computer systems.\",\"info\":\"The company is widely recognized for delivering powerful, customizable, and performance-focused computers designed for gamers, creators, and professional users.\",\"note\":\"CyberPower is a performance computer brand specializing in custom-built gaming PCs and high-performance desktop systems.\",\"system_note\":\"Known for powerful hardware configurations and modern designs, CyberPower delivers reliable computing solutions for gamers, creators, and professional users.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:46:20'),
(3002,1,'brand',207,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Cypress\",\"description\":\"Cypress Semiconductor (now part of Infineon Technologies) is a well-known semiconductor brand specializing in microcontrollers, memory, and connectivity solutions\",\"info\":\"Cypress is especially famous for its PSoC® programmable system-on-chip, which integrates analog, digital, and MCU functions on a single chip.\",\"note\":\"Cypress products were widely used in consumer electronics, automotive systems, industrial automation, and Internet of Things (IoT) devices due to their reliability and flexible design capabilities\",\"system_note\":\"In 2020, Cypress Semiconductor was acquired by Infineon Technologies, and its technologies continue to be developed and supported under the Infineon brand, maintaining Cypress’s legacy in advanced embedded and connectivity semiconductor solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:47:46'),
(3003,1,'brand',45,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"D-link\",\"description\":\"D-Link is a globally recognized networking and connectivity technology brand that designs and manufactures networking equipment for homes, businesses, and enterprise environments.\",\"info\":\"The company is known for delivering reliable, affordable, and easy-to-use networking solutions including routers, switches, wireless devices, and surveillance products.\",\"note\":\"D-Link is a global networking technology brand founded in 1986, specializing in routers, switches, wireless devices, and surveillance solutions. Known for reliability and affordability,\",\"system_note\":\"D-Link provides networking products for homes, businesses, and enterprise environments worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:47:50'),
(3004,1,'brand',125,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Dahua\",\"description\":\"Dahua Technology (full name: Zhejiang Dahua Technology Co., Ltd.) is a major Chinese company specializing in video surveillance and security technology\",\"info\":\"It is one of the largest and most recognized global brands in CCTV and security systems, known for its extensive product portfolio and advanced features\",\"note\":\"The brand focuses on high-definition imaging, intelligent analytics, and reliable performance to enhance safety and monitoring across residential, commercial, industrial, and public infrastructure environments.\",\"system_note\":\"With continuous research and development and a strong global distribution network, Dahua has become one of the leading security technology brands trusted worldwide for efficient and scalable surveillance solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:49:58'),
(3005,1,'brand',171,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Dallas Semiconductor\",\"description\":\"Dallas Semiconductor was a U.S.-based semiconductor manufacturer known for its innovative analog and mixed-signal integrated circuits. The company gained prominence for developing reliable components used in timekeeping, power management, and data communications before being acquired by Maxim Integrated in 2001. Its products continue to influence embedded and industrial design under the Maxim brand.\",\"info\":\"Dallas Semiconductor was established in the mid-1980s to serve the growing need for specialized semiconductor components that bridged analog and digital functions.\",\"note\":\"Founded in 1984 and headquartered in Dallas, Texas, USA, the company became widely recognized for its innovative products such as real-time clock (RTC) ICs, memory devices, temperature sensors, battery management ICs, and the popular 1-Wire communication interface technology.\",\"system_note\":\"Dallas Semiconductor components were valued for their reliability, low power consumption, and ease of integration in electronic designs. In 2001, the company was acquired by Maxim Integrated, and its product technologies continue to be supported under the Maxim Integrated (now part of Analog Devices) portfolio, maintaining its legacy in precision semiconductor solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:52:20'),
(3006,1,'brand',60,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Dalmia\",\"description\":\"Dalmia Cement is one of India’s well-known and trusted cement brands, recognized for quality, durability, and performance in both residential and large infrastructure projects.\",\"info\":\"Dalmia is a well-established Indian industrial brand best known for its cement manufacturing and building materials business under Dalmia Bharat Group. \",\"note\":\"The company is recognized for producing high-quality cement and infrastructure materials used in residential, commercial, and large-scale construction projects across India and international markets.\",\"system_note\":\"The company is recognized for producing high-quality cement and infrastructure materials used in residential, commercial, and large-scale construction projects across India and international markets.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:52:57'),
(3007,1,'brand',161,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Deki\",\"description\":\"Deki is an electronics brand focused mainly on passive components, especially electrolytic capacitors used in everyday electronic assemblies\",\"info\":\"Established in 1984 and headquartered in New Delhi, India, the company has built a strong reputation for precision manufacturing, reliability, and advanced technology, It is commonly chosen for cost-effective and reliable applications.\",\"note\":\"Deki produces metallized polyester and polypropylene film capacitors widely used in power electronics, lighting systems, consumer electronics, renewable energy equipment, automotive electronics, and industrial applications\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on innovation, strict quality control, and international manufacturing standards to ensure consistent performance and long product life. With a strong global export presence and decades of engineering expertise, Deki is recognized as a trusted supplier of electronic components for both domestic and international markets.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:54:31'),
(3008,1,'brand',225,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Dell\",\"description\":\"Dell is a globally recognized American technology brand known for its computers, laptops, servers, and enterprise solutions.\",\"info\":\"The company is respected for its quality, reliability, and business-ready hardware, serving consumers, professionals, businesses, and large enterprises worldwide.\",\"note\":\"Dell offers a wide range of products including laptops, desktop computers, workstations, monitors, servers, networking equipment, and data storage systems under brands such as Dell Inspiron, Latitude, XPS, Precision, and PowerEdge.\",\"system_note\":\"The company focuses on performance, scalability, and advanced security features to support modern computing needs across education, business, and data center environments. With strong global presence and customer-focused innovation, Dell is widely trusted as a leading provider of computing and enterprise technology solutions worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:56:03'),
(3009,1,'brand',168,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"DIODES\",\"description\":\"Diodes Incorporated is a global semiconductor manufacturer specializing in discrete, logic, analog, and mixed-signal devices\",\"info\":\"The brand is widely used for its reliability, broad portfolio, and strong supply availability across industrial and consumer markets.\",\"note\":\"DIODES products are widely used in consumer electronics, automotive systems, industrial automation, computing equipment, and telecommunications infrastructure.\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on energy efficiency, reliability, and compact design solutions that support modern electronic system requirements. With advanced manufacturing facilities and a strong global distribution network, Diodes Incorporated is trusted by engineers and manufacturers worldwide for dependable semiconductor solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:57:39'),
(3010,1,'brand',173,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Diotec Semiconductor\",\"description\":\"Diotec Semiconductor is a specialized German semiconductor manufacturer known for high-quality discrete power semiconductors\",\"info\":\"The brand is valued for robust performance, strict quality control, and long-term reliability, especially in industrial and power-electronics applications.\",\"note\":\"Diotec focuses on precision engineering, strict quality control, and efficient manufacturing processes to ensure durability and consistent electrical performance.\",\"system_note\":\"Its products are widely used in power supplies, industrial electronics, automotive systems, consumer electronics, and renewable energy applications. With decades of experience and strong international distribution, Diotec Semiconductor is trusted by engineers and manufacturers worldwide for dependable and cost-effective semiconductor solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 06:59:08'),
(3011,1,'brand',261,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Dish TV\",\"description\":\"Dish TV is one of India’s leading Direct-to-Home (DTH) television service providers, offering a wide range of digital TV channels and entertainment services across the country\",\"info\":\"Dish TV provides access to hundreds of TV channels, including HD and SD channels, covering categories such as news, movies, sports, entertainment, kids, music, and regional content. The service supports multiple Indian languages, making it suitable for diverse audiences nationwide.\",\"note\":\"The company provides high-definition (HD) channels, digital set-top boxes, recording features, and value-added services designed to enhance the viewing experience.\",\"system_note\":\"Dish TV focuses on reliable signal quality, affordable subscription plans, and extensive channel packages catering to diverse customer preferences across India. With nationwide coverage and continuous technological upgrades, Dish TV has become a well-known brand in India’s home entertainment and satellite television industry.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:06:51'),
(3012,1,'brand',270,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Dropbox\",\"description\":\"Dropbox is a well-known cloud storage and file-syncing service that helps you store, access, and share files online from almost any device — computers, phones, tablets, and the web.\",\"info\":\"Dropbox is a globally popular cloud storage and file-sharing platform that allows users to store, sync, share, and collaborate on files securely over the internet. It is widely used by individuals, businesses, and teams for data backup, remote access, and collaborative work.\",\"note\":\"The platform offers features such as automatic file backup, real-time collaboration, file sharing, and secure data access through desktop and mobile applications\",\"system_note\":\"Known for its simple interface and reliable performance, Dropbox helps improve productivity and teamwork by enabling seamless file management and collaboration. With strong security measures and scalable storage solutions, Dropbox has become a trusted cloud service used worldwide for personal and professional data management.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:08:02'),
