(3014,1,'brand',73,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Dulux\",\"description\":\"Dulux Paints is a well-known premium paint brand recognized for its high-quality finishes, rich colours, and long-lasting performance.\",\"info\":\"It offers a wide range of interior and exterior paints designed for homes, commercial spaces, and industrial applications.\",\"note\":\"The brand offers a wide range of products including interior and exterior wall paints, enamels, primers, waterproofing solutions, and specialty coatings designed to provide long-lasting protection and superior finish\",\"system_note\":\"Dulux is known for its rich color palettes, eco-friendly formulations, and modern painting solutions that enhance both aesthetics and surface durability. With a strong global presence and trusted performance, Dulux is widely preferred by homeowners, architects, and professionals for premium painting and surface protection solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:08:56'),
(3015,1,'brand',271,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Duracell\",\"description\":\"Duracell Inc. is a major American battery manufacturer, founded in the 1920s and today owned by Berkshire Hathaway.\",\"info\":\"It’s widely recognized for producing dependable alkaline batteries, lithium coin cells, button cells, rechargeable batteries, and specialty cells that power a broad range of devices from remotes to medical equipment.\",\"note\":\"The brand offers a wide range of products including alkaline batteries, rechargeable batteries, button cells, and specialty batteries used in remote controls, toys, flashlights, cameras, medical devices, and other portable electronics.\",\"system_note\":\"Duracell is widely known for its reliability, extended battery life, and advanced power preservation technology designed to deliver consistent performance. With a strong global presence and commitment to quality and innovation, Duracell continues to provide dependable energy solutions for both household and professional applications worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:10:13'),
(3016,1,'brand',109,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Duravit\",\"description\":\"Duravit AG is a globally esteemed German manufacturer of premium bathroom fixtures and sanitary solutions, known for its exquisite design, superior quality, and engineering excellence\",\"info\":\"With a strong tradition of collaborating with world-class designers, Duravit offers products that combine aesthetic appeal with functional performance for luxury bathrooms, modern homes, and commercial spaces.\",\"note\":\"The company offers a wide range of products including wash basins, toilets, bathtubs, bathroom furniture, faucets, and spa wellness systems that emphasize comfort, functionality, and aesthetic elegance\",\"system_note\":\"Duravit collaborates with renowned designers to create stylish and ergonomic bathroom solutions while maintaining high standards of sustainability and water management efficiency. With a strong global presence and reputation for luxury and durability, Duravit is trusted by architects, designers, and homeowners seeking premium bathroom and sanitary solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:11:21'),
(3017,1,'product',2257,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"0.012nF (12k)\",\"description\":\"The 0.012nF (12K) capacitor is a small-value ceramic capacitor commonly used in electronic circuits for high-frequency filtering, signal coupling, and noise suppression applications. The value 0.012nF is equal to 12 picofarads (12pF), which makes it suitable for RF circuits, oscillator circuits, tuning networks, and high-frequency signal processing. The marking “12K” typically indicates the capacitance value (12pF) and tolerance, where K represents a tolerance of ±10%\",\"info\":\"This type of capacitor is usually non-polarized, meaning it can be connected in any direction within a circuit. It is often available in ceramic disc or small SMD package form. Due to its very low capacitance value, it is mainly used in high-frequency and precision electronic applications rather than power filtering. The capacitor offers stable performance, low loss, and good reliability over a wide temperature range.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Model demo11\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"It is widely used in RF transmitters and receivers, crystal oscillator circuits, communication devices, timing circuits, antenna matching networks, and general signal processing circuits. Because of its compact size and stable characteristics, the 12pF capacitor is a common component in communication and microcontroller-based systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 07:15:03'),
