(3022,1,'brand',100,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Duro Ply\",\"description\":\"Duro Ply is a well-known brand in the plywood and engineered wood space, offering a range of high-quality plywood sheets and wood-based panels for residential and commercial interiors.\",\"info\":\"precision manufacturing, and consistent performance, Duro Ply products are widely used in furniture, cabinetry, and construction applications.\",\"note\":\"Duro Ply products are widely used in furniture manufacturing, interior decoration, modular kitchens, wardrobes, and construction projects due to their strength and long-lasting performance. The company focuses on advanced manufacturing processes, strict quality control, and eco-friendly production practices to ensure reliable and safe wood products\",\"system_note\":\"With an extensive distribution network across India, Duro Ply has earned the trust of architects, carpenters, builders, and homeowners for dependable and aesthetically appealing interior solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:21:44'),
(3023,1,'brand',49,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"eCloud\",\"description\":\"eCloud is a regional / budget consumer electronics brand in India, mainly associated with LED TVs and Smart TVs\",\"info\":\"The brand focuses on providing cost-effective home entertainment solutions for customers looking for smart features at a lower price point.\",\"note\":\"The brand focuses on providing scalable cloud services such as data hosting, backup solutions, virtualization, and enterprise cloud applications designed for businesses and organizations seeking reliable digital operations. eCloud solutions help users store, manage, and access information from anywhere while ensuring data security, flexibility, and efficient resource utilization\",\"system_note\":\"Widely used in IT environments, business management systems, and online collaboration platforms, eCloud emphasizes performance, reliability, and modern cloud technology to support digital transformation and connected business operations.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:23:01'),
(3024,1,'brand',7,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Electro\",\"description\":\"Electro is a budget battery brand commonly found in India and nearby markets. It is best known for zinc-carbon (heavy-duty) batteries used in low-drain, everyday devices.\",\"info\":\"Electro is a budget battery brand commonly found in India and nearby markets. It is best known for zinc-carbon (heavy-duty) batteries used in low-drain, everyday devices.\",\"note\":\"Electro products are known for durability, user-friendly design, and cost-effective solutions suitable for everyday electrical installations and maintenance needs.\",\"system_note\":\"With an emphasis on quality standards and dependable operation, the brand aims to provide efficient electrical and electronic solutions for technicians, businesses, and general consumers requiring affordable and reliable products.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:24:25'),
(3025,1,'brand',272,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Energizer\",\"description\":\"Energizer Holdings, Inc. is an American battery and portable power company with a global presence. It’s widely known for making reliable alkaline, lithium, and specialty batteries used in everyday devices.\",\"info\":\"It’s widely known for making reliable alkaline, lithium, and specialty batteries used in everyday devices.\",\"note\":\"The brand offers a wide range of products including alkaline batteries, lithium batteries, rechargeable batteries, button cells, power banks, and flashlights designed for use in household electronics, cameras, toys, medical devices, and professional equipment\",\"system_note\":\"Energizer focuses on innovation, energy efficiency, and sustainable battery technology to deliver dependable performance and extended usage life. With a strong global presence and reputation for durability, Energizer remains a preferred choice for consumers seeking reliable portable power solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:25:26'),
(3026,1,'brand',48,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Enter\",\"description\":\"Enter is a regional / local consumer electronics brand in India, commonly seen in LED TVs and basic home electronics.\",\"info\":\"It targets customers looking for affordable, no-frills products for everyday use.\",\"note\":\"The brand provides a wide range of products including computer peripherals, mobile accessories, multimedia speakers, keyboards, mice, headphones, power supplies, cables, and networking accessories suitable for home, office, and commercial environments.\",\"system_note\":\"Enter focuses on delivering value-for-money solutions with reliable performance, user-friendly design, and durable build quality. With strong availability through retail and distribution networks across India, the brand has gained popularity among students, small businesses, and general users seeking cost-effective electronic accessories and basic computing solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:26:53'),
(3027,1,'brand',187,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"EPCOS\",\"description\":\"EPCOS is a renowned electronic components brand that is part of the TDK Group\",\"info\":\"It is especially well known for capacitors, circuit protection components, and EMI/EMC solutions, widely trusted in power and industrial electronics.\",\"note\":\"The brand is well known for producing capacitors, inductors, ferrites, varistors, sensors, and EMI suppression components widely used in consumer electronics, automotive systems, telecommunications, industrial equipment, and power supply applications.\",\"system_note\":\"EPCOS products are valued for their high reliability, precision engineering, and consistent performance under demanding conditions. With strong research and development capabilities and global manufacturing standards, EPCOS remains a trusted brand among engineers and electronics manufacturers worldwide for advanced electronic component solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:28:48'),
(3028,1,'brand',260,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Epson\",\"description\":\"Epson is a globally respected Japanese technology brand, best known for its printers, projectors, scanners, and imaging solutions\",\"info\":\"Epson is especially popular for its EcoTank ink tank printers, which offer low running costs, high page yields, and refillable ink systems, making them ideal for homes, offices, schools, and businesses. Epson printers are widely used for documents, photos, billing, and commercial printing, delivering consistent quality and durability.\",\"note\":\"The company offers a wide range of products including inkjet printers, laser printers, large-format printers, projectors, scanners, and point-of-sale (POS) printing systems used in homes, offices, businesses, and industrial environments\",\"system_note\":\"Epson is known for its energy-efficient EcoTank printing technology, which provides cost-effective and high-volume printing with reduced environmental impact. With a strong focus on precision engineering, sustainability, and advanced technology, Epson has become one of the most trusted brands worldwide for reliable printing and visual display solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:30:04'),
(3029,1,'brand',273,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Eveready\",\"description\":\"Eveready Industries India Ltd. is a major battery manufacturer with a long history of producing household batteries and power solutions.\",\"info\":\"The Eveready brand has been widely recognized for dependable performance in everyday devices.\",\"note\":\"Eveready offers a wide range of products including dry cell batteries, rechargeable batteries, flashlights, LED lighting solutions, and electrical appliances designed for everyday use. Known for durability, affordability, and consistent performance, the brand has become a household name in India.\",\"system_note\":\"With a vast distribution network and a strong focus on innovation and quality, Eveready continues to deliver dependable energy and lighting solutions for millions of consumers.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:31:15'),
(3030,1,'brand',266,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Everest\",\"description\":\"“Everest” is also a brand used on power-related products like voltage stabilizers and similar home electrical accessories.\",\"info\":\"These are common in Indian markets and help protect appliances (TVs, refrigerators, etc.) from voltage fluctuations.\",\"note\":\"The brand focuses on delivering durable and efficient batteries that provide stable power performance for vehicles, home inverters, UPS systems, and other electrical equipment. Everest batteries are developed using quality materials and modern manufacturing processes to ensure long service life, consistent power output, and dependable operation under various usage conditions\",\"system_note\":\"Known for affordability and practical performance, the brand aims to meet everyday energy storage needs for residential, commercial, and transportation applications, making it a suitable choice for users seeking cost-effective and reliable power backup solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:33:49'),
