(3033,1,'brand',9,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Eyeplus\",\"description\":\"The name “Eyeplus” can refer to multiple unrelated brands/businesses rather than a single global company — it’s used by different businesses in different categories (not all connected)\",\"info\":\"Eyeplus Electronics India LLP is a consumer electronics brand that appears to sell LED/Smart TVs and related products\",\"note\":\"The brand focuses on delivering LED and smart TV models equipped with high-definition displays, smart operating systems, and multiple connectivity options such as HDMI, USB, Wi-Fi, and screen mirroring features\",\"system_note\":\"Eyeplus TVs are designed to support streaming applications, digital media playback, and everyday entertainment needs with user-friendly interfaces and energy-efficient performance. Known for budget-friendly pricing and practical functionality, Eyeplus TV aims to make smart television technology accessible to a wide range of consumers seeking reliable and cost-effective home entertainment solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:38:27'),
(3034,1,'brand',220,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Fairchild Semiconductor\",\"description\":\"Fairchild Semiconductor was a pioneering U.S.-based semiconductor company, famous for its power semiconductors and SMPS ICs\",\"info\":\"Fairchild was acquired by ON Semiconductor (onsemi), and many Fairchild product families continue under the onsemi portfolio.\",\"note\":\"Founded in 1957 in California, USA, the company became famous for manufacturing transistors, power management ICs, analog devices, and discrete semiconductor components widely used in consumer electronics, industrial equipment, automotive systems, and power supply applications. Fairchild Semiconductor was recognized for its contributions to semiconductor innovation and efficient power solutions.\",\"system_note\":\"In 2016, the company was acquired by ON Semiconductor (now onsemi), and its product technologies continue to be supported and developed under the onsemi brand, maintaining Fairchild’s legacy in the global semiconductor industry.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:40:26'),
(3035,1,'brand',101,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"FINOLEX  pipes\",\"description\":\"Finolex Pipes are among India’s most trusted and widely used piping solutions for plumbing, sanitation, agriculture, and industrial applications.\",\"info\":\"They are manufactured by Finolex Industries Limited (FIL), one of the largest PVC-U pipe and fitting manufacturers in India with decades of industry experience.\",\"note\":\"Finolex offers a comprehensive range of products including uPVC pipes, CPVC plumbing systems, SWR drainage pipes, agricultural irrigation pipes, and industrial piping solutions designed for efficient water management and fluid transportation.\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on advanced manufacturing technology, strict quality standards, and sustainable practices to ensure reliable performance. With a strong nationwide distribution network and trusted reputation among builders, farmers, engineers, and homeowners, Finolex Pipes has become a preferred choice for dependable piping and plumbing solutions across India.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:41:58'),
(3036,1,'brand',87,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Finolex Cables\",\"description\":\"Finolex Cables Ltd. is one of India’s most trusted manufacturers of electrical wires and cables, known for safety, durability, and consistent quality\",\"info\":\"Finolex delivers reliable wiring solutions for residential, commercial, industrial, and infrastructure projects across India.\",\"note\":\"Finolex Cables offers a wide range of products including house wires, power cables, flexible cables, control cables, instrumentation cables, LAN cables, coaxial cables, and fiber optic communication cables designed for reliable electrical performance and efficient signal transmission\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on innovation, stringent quality testing, and energy-efficient solutions to meet modern electrical requirements. With an extensive distribution network across India and international markets, Finolex Cables is widely trusted by electricians, contractors, engineers, and homeowners for safe and dependable wiring solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:43:24'),
(3037,1,'brand',80,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Fly ash Bricks\",\"description\":\"Fly ash bricks are eco-friendly building materials manufactured using fly ash, a by-product of coal-based thermal power plants\",\"info\":\"These bricks are known for their uniform shape, smooth finish, and high compressive strength, which reduces the need for excessive mortar and plastering.\",\"note\":\"Fly ash bricks offer excellent durability, low water absorption, and better thermal insulation compared to traditional clay bricks, helping improve structural stability and energy efficiency in buildings.\",\"system_note\":\"They are environmentally sustainable as they reduce soil excavation and recycle industrial waste, making them a green alternative in modern construction. Known for consistent quality, reduced mortar consumption, and cost-effective performance, fly ash bricks are increasingly preferred by builders and engineers for sustainable and long-lasting construction projects.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:45:05'),
(3038,1,'brand',278,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"FPV\",\"description\":\"An FPV Camera (First-Person View Camera) is a small, lightweight camera used mainly in drones, RC cars, and robotics to transmit live video in real time to a screen, goggles, or receiver.\",\"info\":\"FPV cameras are designed for low latency, wide viewing angles, and good performance in varying light conditions, making them ideal for racing drones, aerial photography setups, surveillance projects, and DIY electronics applications.\",\"note\":\"FPV systems transmit live video signals to goggles, monitors, or mobile devices, giving the operator an immersive viewing experience as if they are inside the vehicle or aircraft. FPV technology is widely used in drone racing, aerial videography, surveillance, inspection work, and recreational flying due to its precise control and enhanced navigation capabilities.\",\"system_note\":\"Modern FPV setups include cameras, video transmitters, receivers, antennas, and specialized goggles designed for low latency and high-quality video transmission, making FPV an important technology in advanced remote-control and unmanned aerial systems.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:52:38'),
(3039,1,'brand',40,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Fujitsu\",\"description\":\"Fujitsu is a global Japanese technology company specializing in information technology equipment, computing systems, and digital solutions\",\"info\":\"Fujitsu is a global Japanese technology company specializing in information technology equipment, computing systems, and digital solutions\",\"note\":\"The brand is known for innovation, reliability, and energy-efficient technology designed to support businesses, government organizations, and individual users.\",\"system_note\":\"Fujitsu focuses on digital transformation, artificial intelligence, and sustainable technology solutions to improve productivity and connectivity in modern environments. With decades of engineering expertise and a strong global presence, Fujitsu is trusted worldwide for high-performance IT and enterprise technology solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:53:53'),
(3040,1,'brand',199,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Geehy\",\"description\":\"Geehy is a semiconductor company specializing in the design and manufacturing of microcontrollers (MCUs), analog chips, and system-on-chip (SoC) solutions. It focuses on industrial, automotive, and consumer electronics applications, offering high-performance, energy-efficient products for embedded system developers worldwide.\",\"info\":\"Geehy’s product portfolio centers on its APM32 family of 32-bit microcontrollers, which are based on Arm Cortex-M cores. These MCUs target a broad range of embedded applications, supporting functions such as motor control, power management, and wireless connectivity. The company also produces analog signal and power management components to complement its MCU offerings.\",\"note\":\"The brand focuses on innovation, cost-effective design, and reliable performance to provide efficient processing and control solutions for modern electronic products\",\"system_note\":\"Geehy microcontrollers are valued by engineers and developers for their stability, flexible architecture, and compatibility with common development tools, making the company an emerging player in the global semiconductor and embedded systems market.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:56:17'),
(3041,1,'brand',254,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Gigabyte\",\"description\":\"The brand is best known for its motherboards and graphics cards, offering solutions that range from entry-level systems to advanced gaming and workstation builds\",\"info\":\"Gigabyte products are designed with a focus on durability, efficient cooling, stable power delivery, and long-term performance, making them a trusted choice in the PC industry.\",\"note\":\"The company offers a wide range of products including gaming laptops, GPUs, motherboards, monitors, servers, and PC accessories under its popular AORUS gaming brand. Gigabyte focuses on delivering powerful performance, efficient cooling technology, and modern features such as RGB customization and high-speed connectivity to meet the needs of gamers, creators, and professionals\",\"system_note\":\"With a strong global presence and commitment to quality, Gigabyte is widely trusted by PC builders and technology enthusiasts for dependable and high-performance computing solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 07:57:35'),
(3042,1,'brand',206,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"GigaDevice\",\"description\":\"GigaDevice Semiconductor is a leading Chinese semiconductor manufacturer best known for its Flash memory products and GD32 series microcontrollers.\",\"info\":\"The brand is widely adopted for its high performance, cost efficiency, and strong compatibility with industry standards.\",\"note\":\"GigaDevice products are commonly used in consumer electronics, industrial automation, automotive electronics, smart home devices, and Internet of Things (IoT) applications due to their high performance, reliability, and energy efficiency\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on innovation, advanced semiconductor technology, and cost-effective solutions to support modern embedded systems and intelligent devices. With expanding global operations and strong research and development capabilities, GigaDevice has become an important supplier in the international semiconductor and embedded electronics market.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 08:00:30'),
(3043,1,'brand',96,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Goldmedal Wires\",\"description\":\"Goldmedal Wire & Cable Ltd. is a well-established Indian brand specializing in electrical wires, cables, and related products that are designed for safety, performance, and durability\",\"info\":\"Goldmedal products are widely used in residential, commercial, and industrial electrical installations.\",\"note\":\"The product range includes house wires, flexible cables, and specialized wiring solutions designed to meet modern electrical standards and energy efficiency requirements.\",\"system_note\":\"With strong quality control and a wide distribution network across India, Goldmedal Wires are trusted by electricians, builders, and homeowners for reliable and secure electrical wiring solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 08:08:55'),
(3044,1,'brand',157,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Goodsky\",\"description\":\"Goodsky is a well-known Taiwan-based manufacturer specializing in electromechanical relays\",\"info\":\"The brand is widely used in power control, automation, and consumer electronics due to its reliability and broad relay portfolio.\",\"note\":\"Goodsky relays are widely used in consumer electronics, home appliances, industrial automation, Telecommunications equipment, automotive systems, and power management devices.\",\"system_note\":\"The brand focuses on precision engineering, durability, and consistent performance to ensure safe and efficient electrical operation. With strong manufacturing capabilities and international quality standards, Goodsky has earned a trusted reputation among engineers and electronics manufacturers worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 08:10:38'),
(3045,1,'brand',26,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Google\",\"description\":\"Google is a world-leading technology company specializing in internet services, software, cloud computing, artificial intelligence, and consumer electronics. \",\"info\":\"pGoogle is a global technology company founded in 1998, providing internet services, cloud computing, software, and smart devices. \",\"note\":\"The brand is best known for its powerful search engine and a wide ecosystem of digital products used by billions of people worldwide.\",\"system_note\":\"Known for innovation in search, AI, and digital productivity, Google delivers powerful solutions used by individuals and businesses worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 08:10:43'),
(3046,1,'brand',268,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Google Drive  Google One\",\"description\":\"Google Drive is Google’s cloud storage and file-hosting service used to store, sync, share, and access files (documents, photos, videos, PDFs, etc.) online\",\"info\":\"It works on web, desktop, and mobile devices and integrates with Google’s productivity tools (Docs, Sheets, Slides).\",\"note\":\"Google Drive is the cloud storage service that enables users to upload, share, and synchronize documents, photos, videos, and other files across computers and mobile devices, while also supporting real-time collaboration through Google Docs, Sheets, and Slides.\",\"system_note\":\"Google One is a subscription-based service that expands Google Drive storage capacity and provides additional benefits such as automatic phone backup, enhanced security features, family sharing options, and access to Google support. Together, Google Drive and Google One help individuals and businesses manage data efficiently, improve productivity, and access information from anywhere with secure and reliable cloud technology.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 08:12:07'),
(3047,1,'brand',99,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Greenply\",\"description\":\"Greenply Industries Ltd. is one of India’s leading and most trusted manufacturers of wood-based panel products and interior solutions\",\"info\":\"Greenply is known for its consistent quality, durability, and innovative designs, making it a preferred choice for furniture makers, architects, and homeowners.\",\"note\":\"Greenply offers a wide range of products including plywood, block boards, decorative laminates, MDF boards, and veneers designed for residential, commercial, and architectural interiors.\",\"system_note\":\"Greenply offers a wide range of products including plywood, block boards, decorative laminates, MDF boards, and veneers designed for residential, commercial, and architectural interiors.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 08:13:26'),
