(3054,1,'brand',166,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"HB Hornby Electronic\",\"description\":\"Hornby Electronic is an electronics brand primarily associated with passive components, especially aluminum electrolytic capacitors used in general-purpose and power-electronics applications.\",\"info\":\"The brand is typically chosen for cost-effective, dependable performance in high-volume assemblies.\",\"note\":\"HB Hornby Electronic products are commonly utilized in consumer electronics, electrical installations, and technical projects where dependable performance and practical functionality are required.\",\"system_note\":\"Known for affordability and consistent quality, the brand aims to support technicians, engineers, and electronics users with accessible solutions for everyday electronic and electrical needs.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 08:31:42'),
(3055,1,'brand',124,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Hikvision\",\"description\":\"Hikvision integrates AI-powered analytics, deep learning features, and smart detection capabilities in many of its cameras and systems, providing functions\",\"info\":\"Hikvision is partly state-owned and based in China, some governments have placed restrictions or bans on its use in sensitive government installations due to national security and data privacy concerns.\",\"note\":\"Hikvision products are widely used in residential, commercial, industrial, and public infrastructure environments for monitoring and security management. The brand focuses on innovation, high-definition imaging, intelligent analytics, and reliable performance to enhance safety and operational efficiency.\",\"system_note\":\"With strong research and development capabilities and a global distribution network, Hikvision has become one of the most recognized and trusted security technology brands worldwide.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 08:33:32'),
(3056,1,'brand',134,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Hisense\",\"description\":\"Hisense is a major global electronics and home appliance manufacturer headquartered in Qingdao, China.\",\"info\":\"It’s one of the world’s top television and consumer electronics brands, known for delivering innovative, value-oriented products with strong global reach\",\"note\":\"The brand offers a wide range of products including water closets, wash basins, faucets, showers, bathroom accessories, kitchen chimneys, and air coolers that combine functionality with contemporary aesthetics. Hindware focuses on advanced manufacturing technology, water efficiency, and durable materials to ensure long-lasting performance and comfort\",\"system_note\":\"With a wide distribution network across India and growing international presence, Hindware is trusted by homeowners, architects, and builders for reliable and modern home improvement solutions.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 08:36:59'),
(3057,1,'brand',133,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Hitachi\",\"description\":\"Hitachi, Ltd. is a major Japanese multinational engineering and technology conglomerate with a history of more than 110 years.\",\"info\":\"It is known worldwide for its innovation, engineering excellence, and broad range of products and solutions that span multiple industries\",\"note\":\"The brand offers a wide range of products such as air conditioners, refrigerators, storage systems, power solutions, construction equipment, and digital technologies designed for residential, commercial, and industrial applications\",\"system_note\":\"Hitachi is known for innovation, reliability, and energy-efficient engineering, focusing on sustainable development and smart technology solutions. With over a century of technological expertise and a strong global presence, Hitachi is trusted worldwide for high-quality engineering and advanced technology products.\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-02-26 08:40:48'),
