(3160,1,'product',2584,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Single Strand Wire\",\"description\":\"single strand wires are available in different gauge sizes (such as 0.5 sq mm, 1 sq mm, 1.5 sq mm, 2.5 sq mm, etc.), and their current-carrying capacity depends on the thickness (cross-sectional area) of the conductor. Thicker wires can carry higher current safely.\",\"info\":\"A Single Strand Wire is an electrical conductor made from one solid piece of metal, usually copper or aluminum, covered with an insulating material such as PVC or XLPE. Unlike stranded wire, which consists of multiple small wires twisted together, single strand wire (also called solid wire) has a single thick conductor core. It is commonly used in electrical wiring installations, control panels, switchboards, and fixed wiring systems where flexibility is not required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"1/22 Hookup wire coil\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"These wires are typically rated for specific voltage levels like 110V, 230V, or 440V depending on insulation type and application. Copper single strand wire is widely preferred because of its excellent conductivity and durability. It is mostly used in household wiring, lighting circuits, distribution boards, earthing connections, and industrial control systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":484,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:24:31'),
(3161,1,'product',1344,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10 RELAY GSM with DTMF-TIMER- 7 INPUT Trigger\",\"description\":\"10 RELAY GSM board is designed on Renesas Microcontroller and SIM 800C SIMCOM GSM.\",\"info\":\"It supports all models SIM except JIO 4G LTE.\\r\\n\\r\\nIndividual relays can be controlled ON, OFF by sending SMS.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Relay Module\",\"mrp\":\"1000.00\",\"note\":\"A 10 Relay GSM with DTMF Timer – 7 Input Trigger is an advanced remote control switching system used to control multiple electrical devices through a mobile network. This device contains 10 independent relay outputs, allowing users to turn ON or OFF up to ten electrical loads such as lights, motors, pumps, generators, or industrial equipment.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":\"58\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:25:10'),
(3162,1,'product',2454,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"100 RPM Motors\",\"description\":\"100 RPM gear motor provides moderate speed with good torque, making it ideal for wheeled robots, line-following robots, robotic arms, and small lifting mechanisms. The torque rating varies depending on the motor design and gear ratio, and current consumption increases under load.\",\"info\":\"Due to their stable speed, durability, and affordability, 100 RPM motors are a popular choice for both beginners and professional prototyping setups.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"100 RPM Gear Motors\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"A 100 RPM Gear Motor is a DC motor combined with a gearbox that reduces the motor’s high speed and increases torque, delivering an output speed of approximately 100 revolutions per minute (RPM). The gearbox consists of multiple gears that convert the high-speed, low-torque rotation of the motor into low-speed, high-torque output, making it suitable for applications that require controlled movement and stronger rotational force.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"421\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:27:40'),
(3163,1,'product',2556,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10000mah battery\",\"description\":\"10,000mAh lithium battery typically has a full charge voltage of 4.2V per cell and requires a proper lithium battery charging module with CC/CV (Constant Current/Constant Voltage) charging method. Many battery packs include a built-in Battery Management System (BMS) that provides protection against overcharging, over-discharging, short circuits, and overcurrent conditions.\",\"info\":\"It is widely used in power banks, IoT gateways, backup power systems, solar projects, robotics, CCTV, and portable electronics where long backup time is essential.\\r\\nThe mAh (milliampere-hour) rating shows the total charge capacity.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"10000mah Lithium battery\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"A 10,000mAh Lithium Battery is a high-capacity rechargeable battery commonly based on lithium-ion (Li-ion) or lithium-polymer (Li-Po) technology. The capacity rating of 10,000 milliampere-hours (mAh) means the battery can theoretically supply 10,000 mA (10A) for one hour, 1,000 mA for 10 hours, or proportionally lower current for a longer duration.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:30:10'),
(3164,1,'product',2245,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10000uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"10000µF 50V capacitor is widely used in amplifier circuits, SMPS power supplies, inverter systems, motor driver circuits, and battery charging systems. Its main function is to smooth rectified DC voltage by reducing ripple and stabilizing the output voltage. After AC is converted to DC using a rectifier, this capacitor stores energy during voltage peaks and releases it during drops, resulting in a more stable and clean DC output.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is commonly used in amplifiers, power supplies, inverters, and industrial electronic equipment. Designed for stable performance, it provides reliable operation in high-voltage and high-current circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Capacitor\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"10000µF 50V capacitor is a high-capacitance electrolytic capacitor mainly used for power supply filtering and energy storage in electronic circuits. The value 10000 microfarads (µF) indicates that the capacitor can store a large amount of electrical charge, while the 50V rating means it can safely operate at voltages up to 50 volts.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:33:49'),
(3165,1,'product',2158,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1.7m ohm Resistor\",\"description\":\"A 1.7 MΩ (megaohm) resistor is a high-value resistor that provides a resistance of 1,700,000 ohms to limit electrical current flow in a circuit. Because of its large resistance value, it allows only a very small amount of current to pass, making it suitable for low-current and high-voltage applications.\",\"info\":\"It provides a resistance of 1,700,000 ohms and is commonly used in signal sensing, biasing, timing, and protection circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Resistor\",\"mrp\":\"49.00\",\"note\":\"A 1.7 MΩ (megaohm) resistor is a high-resistance electronic component that provides a resistance value of 1.7 million ohms (1,700,000 Ω). It is used to limit current flow to a very small amount and to create high-voltage drops with minimal current consumption in electronic circuits.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":413,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:35:53'),
(3166,1,'product',2180,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1000uF 16V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"1000µF 16V capacitor is a low-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in electronic circuits. With a relatively high capacitance of 1000 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 16 volts, it is ideal for circuits operating at low to moderate DC voltages.\",\"info\":\"Capacitance: 1000µF\\r\\nVoltage rating: 16V DC\\r\\nType: Aluminum electrolytic (polarized)\\r\\nMain uses: Filtering, smoothing, bulk decoupling\\r\\nCommon applications: Audio circuits, power supplies, Arduino/MCU boards\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 1000µF 16V capacitor is an electrolytic capacitor commonly used in power supply and filtering applications. The value 1000 microfarads (µF) indicates its ability to store a relatively large amount of electrical charge, while the 16V rating means it can safely operate at voltages up to 16 volts. This type of capacitor is usually polarized, meaning it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals that must be connected correctly in a DC circuit. Incorrect polarity can cause leakage, overheating, or failure.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:36:48'),
(3167,1,'product',2221,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1000uF 25V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 1000µF 25V capacitor is a high-capacitance aluminum electrolytic capacitor widely used for filtering, smoothing, and bulk energy storage in low- to medium-voltage electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 1000 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is ideal for stabilizing power supplies and handling transient current demands.\",\"info\":\"The 1000µF 25V capacitor is commonly used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, LED driver circuits, motor control boards, SMPS secondary sections, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 1000µF 25V capacitor is a polarized electrolytic capacitor used mainly for power supply filtering and voltage stabilization in electronic circuits. The 1000 microfarad (µF) value indicates its ability to store a significant amount of electrical charge, while the 25V rating means it can safely operate at voltages up to 25 volts. Since it is polarized, it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and correct polarity must be maintained during installation to prevent damage, leakage, or explosion.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:37:29'),
(3168,1,'product',2197,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1000uF 35V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"1000µF 35V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor widely used for bulk energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in electronic circuits. With a high capacitance of 1000 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 35 volts DC, it is well suited for power lines that require stable voltage and high current handling.\",\"info\":\"1000µF 35V capacitor is frequently used in power supplies, audio amplifiers, motor driver circuits, SMPS secondary sections, LED power circuits, and industrial control electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, providing easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 1000µF 35V capacitor is a polarized electrolytic capacitor widely used for power supply filtering, energy storage, and voltage stabilization in electronic circuits. The capacitance value of 1000 microfarads (µF) indicates its ability to store a large amount of electrical charge, while the 35V rating means it can safely handle voltages up to 35 volts. Since it is an electrolytic type, it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and correct polarity must be maintained during installation to prevent damage or failure.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:38:05'),
(3169,1,'product',2225,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1000uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 1000µF 50V capacitor is a high-capacitance, medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor widely used for filtering, smoothing, and bulk energy storage in electronic power circuits. With a capacitance of 1000 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is well suited for applications that require stable voltage and reliable current handling.\",\"info\":\"The 1000µF 50V capacitor is frequently used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, LED driver circuits, motor control boards, SMPS secondary stages, and industrial electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and long-term dependable performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 1000µF 50V capacitor is a polarized electrolytic capacitor designed for energy storage, filtering, and voltage stabilization in medium- to high-voltage DC circuits. The capacitance value of 1000 microfarads (µF) indicates its ability to store a significant amount of electrical charge, while the 50V rating means it can safely operate in circuits with voltages up to 50 volts. Because it is an electrolytic capacitor, it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and correct polarity must be maintained during installation to prevent leakage, overheating, or failure.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:38:46'),
(3170,1,'product',2215,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"100uF 10V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 100µF 10V capacitor is a low-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits that operate at low DC voltages. With a capacitance of 100 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 10 volts DC, it is well suited for compact and low-power electronic applications.\",\"info\":\"The 100µF 10V capacitor is widely used in microcontroller boards, audio circuits, DC-DC converters, voltage regulator outputs, LED circuits, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on printed circuit boards (PCBs).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 100µF 10V capacitor is a polarized electrolytic capacitor commonly used in low-voltage electronic circuits for filtering, coupling, and voltage stabilization. The capacitance value of 100 microfarads (µF) indicates its ability to store a moderate amount of electrical charge, while the 10V rating means it can safely operate in circuits with voltages up to 10 volts. Since it is an electrolytic capacitor, it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and correct polarity must be maintained during installation to prevent damage, leakage, or failure.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:39:20'),
(3171,1,'product',2186,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"100uF 160V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 100µF 160V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed to store electrical energy, smooth DC voltage, and reduce ripple in circuits operating at elevated voltages\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is commonly used in SMPS power supplies, inverter circuits, LED driver circuits, industrial equipment, audio amplifiers, and high-voltage DC filtering applications. It is often placed after a rectifier circuit to smooth high-voltage DC output by reducing ripple voltage. It stores energy when the voltage increases and releases it when the voltage drops, helping to maintain stable and steady DC output in high-voltage systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 100µF 160V capacitor is a high-voltage polarized electrolytic capacitor used in power supply and high-voltage electronic circuits. The capacitance value of 100 microfarads (µF) indicates its ability to store electrical energy, while the 160V rating means it can safely operate at voltages up to 160 volts. Since it is an electrolytic type capacitor, it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and correct polarity must always be maintained during installation to prevent failure or explosion.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:40:19'),
(3172,1,'product',2198,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"100uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 100µF 250V capacitor is a high-capacitance, high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used to store electrical energy, smooth DC voltage, and reduce ripple in power and control circuits that operate at elevated voltages\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is commonly used in SMPS power supplies, inverter circuits, industrial power systems, audio amplifier power sections, LED drivers, and rectified AC mains filtering applications. After AC voltage is converted to DC using a rectifier, this capacitor helps smooth the DC output by reducing ripple voltage and maintaining stable power. It stores energy during voltage peaks and releases it during voltage drops, ensuring consistent system performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 100µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage polarized electrolytic capacitor designed for energy storage and DC filtering in high-voltage electronic circuits. The capacitance value of 100 microfarads (µF) indicates its ability to store electrical charge, while the 250V rating means it can safely operate at voltages up to 250 volts. Because it is an electrolytic capacitor, it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and correct polarity must be observed during installation to prevent leakage, overheating, or explosion.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:41:12'),
(3173,1,'product',2184,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"100uF 25V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"100µF 25V capacitor is a low- to medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor widely used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 100 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is suitable for many general-purpose applications where stable DC voltage is required.\",\"info\":\"100µF 25V capacitor is frequently used in microcontroller boards, audio circuits, DC adapters, voltage regulator outputs, LED drivers, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical package, making it easy to solder onto PCBs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 100µF 25V capacitor is a polarized electrolytic capacitor commonly used in low- to medium-voltage DC electronic circuits for filtering, coupling, and voltage stabilization. The capacitance value of 100 microfarads (µF) indicates its ability to store a moderate amount of electrical energy, while the 25V rating means it can safely operate in circuits with voltages up to 25 volts. Since it is an electrolytic capacitor, it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and correct polarity must be maintained during installation to avoid leakage, overheating, or damage.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:41:56'),
(3174,1,'product',2202,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"100uF 35V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 100µF 35V capacitor is a polarized electrolytic capacitor used for energy storage, filtering, and voltage stabilization in low- to medium-voltage DC circuits. The capacitance value of 100 microfarads (µF) indicates its ability to store electrical charge, while the 35V rating means it can safely operate at voltages up to 35 volts. Since it is an electrolytic capacitor, it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and correct polarity must be followed during installation to prevent leakage, overheating, or failure.\",\"info\":\"A 35V capacitor is suitable for 12V and 24V systems. Proper placement near power supply lines improves filtering efficiency, and adequate ventilation is recommended since electrolytic capacitors can degrade over time due to heat. From a system perspective, the 100µF 35V capacitor enhances voltage stability, reduces electrical noise, supports load variations, and ensures reliable performance in DC electronic systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"This capacitor is commonly used in 24V DC power supplies, audio amplifier circuits, motor driver boards, SMPS outputs, battery charging circuits, and microcontroller-based systems. Its main function is to smooth DC voltage by reducing ripple and stabilizing output after rectification. It also provides temporary energy storage to handle sudden load changes, improving circuit stability and performance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:43:28'),
(3175,1,'product',2227,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"100uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 100µF 50V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 100 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is suitable for applications where higher voltage tolerance and stable performance are required.\",\"info\":\"The 100µF 50V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS circuits, industrial control boards, motor driver circuits, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 100µF 50V capacitor is a polarized electrolytic capacitor designed for energy storage, filtering, and voltage stabilization in DC electronic circuits. The capacitance value of 100 microfarads (µF) allows it to store a moderate amount of electrical charge, while the 50V rating means it can safely operate in circuits with voltages up to 50 volts. Since it is an electrolytic type capacitor, it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and correct polarity must be maintained during installation to prevent leakage, overheating, or damage.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:44:03'),
(3176,1,'product',299,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DWIN Display 10.4inch DMG 80600 C104 01 WTR\",\"description\":\"The DMG80600C104_01WTR is a 10.4-inch industrial-grade TFT LCD module with a resistive touch panel and 800×600 pixel resolution.\\r\\nIt is designed for industrial control, HMI systems, embedded devices, and automation displays, offering long-term stability, clear visibility, and responsive touch performance even in harsh environments.\",\"info\":\"The DMG80600C104_01WTR is a 10.4-inch industrial LCD display module featuring a 800 × 600 (SVGA) resolution TN-TFT panel with capacitive touch support, ideal for human-machine interfaces (HMI) and embedded systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Display\",\"mrp\":\"9350.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"40\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:48:59'),
(3177,1,'product',2194,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"100uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"100µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 100 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that operate at higher voltages than standard low-voltage electronics.\",\"info\":\"100µF 63V capacitor is widely used in power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS circuits, industrial control boards, motor driver circuits, and consumer electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"100µF 63V capacitor is a polarized electrolytic capacitor used for energy storage, filtering, and voltage stabilization in medium-voltage DC circuits. The capacitance value of 100 microfarads (µF) indicates its ability to store electrical charge, while the 63V rating means it can safely operate at voltages up to 63 volts. Because it is an electrolytic capacitor, it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and correct polarity must be maintained during installation to avoid leakage, overheating, or failure.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 12:50:42'),
