(3206,1,'product',2131,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1203B PWM DC Motor Speed Regulator\",\"description\":\"The 1203B PWM DC Motor Speed Regulator is a compact controller used to adjust the speed of DC motors using Pulse Width Modulation (PWM) technology. It provides smooth and efficient speed control without significant power loss\",\"info\":\"The module includes a rotary knob for easy adjustment and a digital display for monitoring speed level. It is widely used in DIY projects, robotics, fans, pumps, and small motor applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"1203B PWM DC Motor Speed Regulator(Motor Drivers)\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"The 1203B PWM DC Motor Speed Regulator is a compact electronic module designed to control the speed of DC motors using Pulse Width Modulation (PWM) technology. It efficiently adjusts motor speed by changing the duty cycle of the output signal instead of reducing voltage directly, which helps maintain motor torque and reduces power loss. This makes it more efficient and generates less heat compared to traditional variable resistors or linear control methods.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"453\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-26 13:47:58'),
