(3302,1,'product',2518,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"12V 40w cartridge heater 6mm for 3d printer\",\"description\":\"A 12V 40W Cartridge Heater (6mm) is a cylindrical electric heating element commonly used in 3D printers, especially in the hotend assembly. It is designed to heat the heater block to melt filament materials such as PLA, ABS, PETG, and other thermoplastics. The heater typically has a 6mm diameter and is inserted into the heater block of the 3D printer hotend. It operates at 12 volts with a power rating of 40 watts, providing fast and stable heating.\",\"info\":\"It provides efficient, concentrated heat to melt filament during printing. These heaters are widely used in RepRap, Prusa, Creality, and other FDM-style printers that operate on 12 V systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Cartridge Heater\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"This cartridge heater is made of a stainless steel outer tube with an internal resistance heating coil insulated by magnesium oxide powder. When electrical power is applied, the resistance coil generates heat, which is transferred to the heater block. The heater works along with a thermistor or temperature sensor, which monitors the temperature and sends feedback to the printer’s control board.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":229,\"secondary_id\":\"119\",\"brand_id\":259}]}','2026-02-27 10:56:50'),
(3303,1,'product',2551,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2000mah battery\",\"description\":\"A 2000mAh battery is a rechargeable or non-rechargeable battery with a capacity of 2000 milliampere-hours (mAh). The mAh rating indicates how much electric charge the battery can store and deliver over time. For example, a 2000mAh battery can supply 2000 milliamps (2A) for 1 hour, or 1000 milliamps (1A) for 2 hours, depending on the load. These batteries are commonly used in portable electronic devices such as flashlights, toys, power banks, wireless devices, and small electronic projects.\",\"info\":\"In rechargeable batteries like Li-ion, the chemical reaction is reversible. When charging, electrical energy is converted back into chemical energy and stored inside the battery. Proper charging and protection circuits help maintain battery life and safety.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"A 2000mAh battery works based on electrochemical reactions that convert chemical energy into electrical energy. Inside the battery, chemical reactions occur between the anode (negative terminal) and cathode (positive terminal) through an electrolyte. When connected to a circuit, electrons flow from the negative terminal to the positive terminal through the external load, supplying power to the device.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-27 11:02:23'),
