(3318,1,'product',2638,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview Bullet Camera 2MP IP Camera \",\"description\":\"It captures clear Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution video using a high-performance progressive scan CMOS sensor, delivering sharp and detailed monitoring for homes, offices, shops, warehouses, parking areas, and perimeter security.\",\"info\":\"The Uniview IPC2122LB-ADF40KM-G is a 2MP fixed bullet-type IP network camera designed for reliable indoor and outdoor surveillance applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[347],\"model\":\"IPC2122LB-ADF40KM-G\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Built-in True WDR and digital noise reduction improve visibility in challenging lighting environments such as strong sunlight or shadows, helping capture accurate security evidence.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772249450626-888371777.jpg\"}','2026-02-28 03:30:50'),
(3319,1,'product',2639,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview Bullet Camera 2MP IP Camera \",\"description\":\"The Uniview IPC2322LB-ADZK-H is a professional-grade 2MP varifocal IR bullet IP camera designed for high-performance outdoor surveillance.\",\"info\":\"The camera supports PoE (Power over Ethernet) for safer and simplified installation with reduced wiring risks, along with stable network transmission for continuous operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[886],\"model\":\"IPC2322LB-ADZK-H\",\"alternative_name\":\"2MP IP Bullet  Camera \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"For enhanced safety protection, the IPC2322LB-ADZK-H is built with a rugged IP67 weatherproof metal housing, safeguarding the device against dust, rain, and harsh environmental conditions.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772250351157-763814605.jpg\"}','2026-02-28 03:45:51'),
(3320,1,'product',2640,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview Dome Camera 2MP IP Camera \",\"description\":\"The Uniview IPC3532LB-ADZK-H is a high-performance 2MP motorized varifocal dome IP camera designed for professional indoor and outdoor surveillance applications.\",\"info\":\" It features a 2-megapixel progressive scan CMOS sensor that delivers clear Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution video, ensuring sharp and detailed monitoring for offices, banks, retail stores, corridors, and commercial buildings.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[346],\"model\":\"IPC3532LB-ADZK-H\",\"alternative_name\":\" Dome Camera 2MP IP Camera \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Use a quality PoE switch or certified power adapter to avoid voltage fluctuations and electrical damage.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772251240160-828992265.png\"}','2026-02-28 04:00:40'),
(3321,1,'product',2257,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"0.012nF (12k)\",\"description\":\"The 0.012nF (12K) capacitor is a small-value ceramic capacitor commonly used in electronic circuits for high-frequency filtering, signal coupling, and noise suppression applications. The value 0.012nF is equal to 12 picofarads (12pF), which makes it suitable for RF circuits, oscillator circuits, tuning networks, and high-frequency signal processing. The marking “12K” typically indicates the capacitance value (12pF) and tolerance, where K represents a tolerance of ±10%\",\"info\":\"This type of capacitor is usually non-polarized, meaning it can be connected in any direction within a circuit. It is often available in ceramic disc or small SMD package form. Due to its very low capacitance value, it is mainly used in high-frequency and precision electronic applications rather than power filtering. The capacitor offers stable performance, low loss, and good reliability over a wide temperature range.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Model demo11\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"It is widely used in RF transmitters and receivers, crystal oscillator circuits, communication devices, timing circuits, antenna matching networks, and general signal processing circuits. Because of its compact size and stable characteristics, the 12pF capacitor is a common component in communication and microcontroller-based systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":416,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 04:20:41'),
(3322,1,'product',2565,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ZMPT101bAC voltage sensor\",\"description\":\"The ZMPT101B AC Voltage Sensor Module is a precision electronic sensor designed to measure alternating current (AC) voltage safely and accurately in electrical and embedded system applications. It uses a high-precision voltage transformer (ZMPT101B) to isolate and step down high AC voltage signals, allowing microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, and other development boards to monitor AC voltage levels without direct exposure to high voltage\",\"info\":\"The module features an adjustable potentiometer for calibration, enabling accurate voltage measurement and signal output in analog form. Commonly used in energy monitoring systems, smart meters, power measurement projects, and home automation applications, the ZMPT101B sensor provides electrical isolation, stable performance, and reliable voltage detection, making it suitable for educational, industrial, and IoT-based electrical monitoring systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"Operating Voltage: 5V DC\\r\\nInput Voltage Range (AC): 0 – 250V AC (typical)\\r\\nMeasurement Type: AC Voltage (Single Phase)\\r\\nOutput Signal: Analog Voltage (0–5V)\\r\\nIsolation: Transformer-based isolation (High electrical isolation)\\r\\nFrequency Range: 50Hz / 60Hz\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"18\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 04:28:04'),
(3323,1,'product',2119,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zeb 9PPM2UM 9 port POE Switch\",\"description\":\"The Zebronics ZEB-9PPM2UM is an unmanaged 9-port PoE (Power over Ethernet) network switch designed mainly for CCTV surveillance systems, IP cameras, wireless access points, and network devices. It allows both power and data transmission through a single Ethernet cable, simplifying installation and reducing wiring cost.\",\"info\":\"This switch is widely used in security camera installations where multiple PoE cameras need centralized power and networking without separate adapters.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Zeb 9PPM2UM\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"5999.00\",\"note\":\"9 Self-adaptive PoE ports\\r\\n2 × 10/100 Mbps uplink ports\\r\\nUp to 30W power per port\\r\\n150W total PoE power budget\\r\\nSupports IEEE 802.3af / 802.3at PoE standards\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":480,\"secondary_id\":\"405\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 04:36:26'),
