(3333,1,'product',759,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Y8429\",\"description\":\"The Y8429 Transistor is a general-purpose NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) commonly used in electronic circuits for switching and signal amplification applications. It is designed to control current flow by using a small input signal at the base terminal to regulate a larger current between the collector and emitter terminals. Due to its reliable performance and fast switching characteristics, the Y8429 transistor is suitable for low to medium power electronic designs.\",\"info\":\"This transistor is typically used in amplifier circuits, driver stages, oscillator circuits, and electronic switching applications. It can be used to drive relays, LEDs, small motors, and other loads when connected with appropriate biasing components. The device is generally available in a compact TO-92 or similar package, making it easy to mount on PCB boards and prototype circuits. Like other NPN transistors, it operates by allowing current flow when the base receives a positive signal relative to the emitter.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"160.00\",\"note\":\"The Y8429 transistor is widely applied in consumer electronics, audio circuits, automation systems, educational electronics projects, and embedded control circuits because of its small size, low cost, and dependable operation.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":414,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 04:50:18'),
(3334,1,'product',2262,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Xtreme Bluetooth Speaker\",\"description\":\"The Xtreme Bluetooth Speaker is a high-performance wireless speaker designed to deliver powerful sound, deep bass, and clear vocals for both indoor and outdoor use. Built with a rugged yet stylish body, it is ideal for music lovers who want loud output, portability, and long-lasting performance in one device.\",\"info\":\"The Xtreme Bluetooth Speaker offers an excellent balance of sound quality, portability, and versatile features, making it a dependable choice for everyday music and entertainment needs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"70\",\"brand_id\":149}]}','2026-02-28 04:52:45'),
(3335,1,'product',2580,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"XH-W3001 Module\",\"description\":\"The HX-W3001 (often labeled XH-W3001) is a digital temperature controller / thermostat module used for automatic temperature monitoring and control in various heating or cooling applications.\",\"info\":\"The XH-W3001 is a simple yet versatile digital temperature controller (thermostat) module used to monitor and control temperature in various electrical and thermal systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"Digital LED temperature display\\r\\nAutomatic Heating / Cooling control\\r\\nWaterproof NTC temperature probe\\r\\nAdjustable start & stop temperature\\r\\n High accuracy control (±0.1°C)\\r\\n Relay output for load switching\\r\\n Plug-and-play operation\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 04:55:34'),
(3336,1,'product',2418,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"XH-W1401 Temperature Sensor Module\",\"description\":\"The XH-W1401 Temperature Sensor Module is a compact digital temperature controller used to automatically control heating or cooling devices based on a preset temperature value. It integrates a digital temperature sensor, a relay output, and a clear LED display, making it suitable for both industrial and DIY temperature control applications.\",\"info\":\"The XH-W1401 Temperature Sensor Module is a digital thermostat controller used to monitor and automatically control temperature by switching an external load such as a heater, fan, or cooler. It combines a temperature sensor probe, relay output, and digital display into a compact, easy-to-use module.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Digital Thermostat Module\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"upply Voltage: DC 9 – 12 V (typically 12 V DC)\\r\\nTemperature Measurement Range: −9 ℃ to 99 ℃\\r\\nAccuracy: approx. ±1 ℃\\r\\nDisplay: LED digital display showing current measured temperature and set points\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"76\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 04:58:38'),
(3337,1,'product',2421,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"XH-W1209 Temperature sensor module\",\"description\":\"The XH W1209 12V Digital Temperature Controller Module (often called W1209) is a compact digital temperature controller module designed for sensing and controlling temperature automatically in a variety of DIY, hobby, and basic automation projects\",\"info\":\"It combines a temperature sensor, display, controller logic, and a relay output in a single low-cost board — no programming knowledge required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"W1209 Digital Thermostat Module\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"76\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 05:07:31'),
(3338,1,'product',2421,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"XH-W1209 Temperature sensor module\",\"description\":\"The XH W1209 12V Digital Temperature Controller Module (often called W1209) is a compact digital temperature controller module designed for sensing and controlling temperature automatically in a variety of DIY, hobby, and basic automation projects\",\"info\":\"It combines a temperature sensor, display, controller logic, and a relay output in a single low-cost board — no programming knowledge required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"W1209 Digital Thermostat Module\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 05:07:56'),
(3339,1,'product',2641,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview  Bullet Camera 2mp IP Camera \",\"description\":\"The UNV IPC2124LB‑SF28(40)‑A (very similar family model to IPC2123LB-SF40-A1) camera you’re asking about refers to the same type of device — a 3 MP HD mini fixed-lens bullet IP/network surveillance camera typically branded by Uniview (UNV).\",\"info\":\"The actual IPC2123LB-SF40-A1 model is a compact outdoor bullet CCTV camera with a 1/2.7″ progressive CMOS sensor delivering up to 3 megapixel resolution (2304×1296) and a fixed 4.0 mm lens that gives a moderate ~89° horizontal field of view and ~30 m infrared night vision range.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[347],\"model\":\"IPC2123LB-SF40-A1\",\"alternative_name\":\"2mp IP Camera Bullet Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"During installation, follow all electrical safety guidelines — turn off power before wiring, and if unsure, consult a professional installer to minimize the risk of shock or equipment damage.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772255444436-445389580.jpg\"}','2026-02-28 05:10:44'),
(3340,1,'product',2425,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"XH-M452 Temperature and humidity module\",\"description\":\"XH?M452 Temperature and Humidity Controller Module is a digital temperature and humidity control module with built-in sensors, digital displays, and relay outputs.\",\"info\":\"It not only measures ambient temperature and relative humidity, but can also control external devices (via relays) to maintain desired environmental conditions automatically\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Digital Temperature and Humidity Controller Module\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"Monitors temperature (approx. −40 ℃ to 120 ℃) and\\r\\nMonitors humidity (0 %–100 % RH)\\r\\nDisplays both values on dual LED displays\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"76\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 05:13:12'),
(3341,1,'product',2642,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview  Bullet Camera 3mp IP Camera \",\"description\":\"It uses a 1/2.7″ progressive CMOS sensor to capture clear 2304×1296 resolution footage, and a fixed 4 mm lens providing a fairly wide field of view (~87° horizontal).\",\"info\":\"The camera has Smart IR night vision up to ~60 m, automatic day/night switching with IR-cut filter, and digital features like DWDR (wide dynamic range), 2D/3D noise reduction, motion detection, privacy masking and multiple video streams with efficient compression (Ultra265/H.265/H.264).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[886],\"model\":\"IPC2A23LB-F40K-A\",\"alternative_name\":\"Bullet 3mp IP Camera \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Use a suitable PoE switch or compliant power supply to avoid damage from incorrect voltage.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772255840392-151508117.jpg\"}','2026-02-28 05:17:20'),
(3342,1,'product',2475,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Xbee S2C\",\"description\":\"XBee S2C is a compact and low-power ZigBee RF communication module designed for reliable wireless data transmission in IoT, industrial automation, and embedded systems.\",\"info\":\"It features UART communication, configurable firmware, and is available with chip or wire antennas, allowing flexible integration into Arduino, Raspberry Pi, sensor networks, smart energy systems, and home automation projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 05:22:12'),
(3343,1,'product',2404,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"WS100 Ethernet shield\",\"description\":\"The WS100 Ethernet Shield is an Arduino-compatible network expansion board that enables wired Ethernet connectivity for microcontroller projects.\",\"info\":\"It is commonly used with Arduino boards to connect devices to LAN networks and the internet for applications such as web servers, data logging, industrial control, and IoT gateways.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 05:32:31'),
(3344,1,'product',2643,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview  Turret Camera 4 MP IP Camera\",\"description\":\"The camera has a fixed 2.8 mm lens that gives a wide field of view, built-in infrared (IR) LEDs for night vision up to about 30 m even in complete darkness, and advanced imaging features such as Wide Dynamic Range (WDR), digital noise reduction, smart IR, BLC/HLC and privacy masking to improve image quality in varying lighting conditions.\",\"info\":\"It compresses video efficiently using Ultra 265, H.265, H.264 and MJPEG formats, supports dual streams for simultaneous local and remote viewing, and can store footage on a Micro SD card when connected.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[867],\"model\":\" IPC3614LE-ADF28K\",\"alternative_name\":\"  Turret 4 MP IP Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Even though the IPC3614LE-ADF28K has a weather-resistant housing (IP67) for dust and water protection, you should still seal and protect exposed cables and connectors, especially outdoors.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772256944832-741284582.jpg\"}','2026-02-28 05:35:44'),
