(3357,1,'product',2646,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview  Turret 4 MP IP Camera\",\"description\":\"The camera features a fixed 2.8 mm wide‑angle lens with a broad field of view, built‑in infrared (IR) LEDs for night vision up to about 30 m, and a wide dynamic range (WDR) to handle scenes with both bright and dark lighting conditions effectively.\",\"info\":\"It also supports PoE (Power over Ethernet), simplifying installation with power and data over a single cable, and includes a slot for a microSD card (up to 256 GB) for local recording.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[886],\"model\":\" IPC3614SR3-ADPF28F\",\"alternative_name\":\"4 MP Turret  IP Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"With an IP‑rated weather‑resistant housing, it’s built to withstand outdoor conditions, making it a reliable choice for everyday security monitoring.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772260679554-3378570.jpg\"}','2026-02-28 06:37:59'),
(3358,1,'product',2414,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"wemos DI wifi shield\",\"description\":\"he Wemos D1 WiFi Shield (Wemos D1 / D1 R2) is an ESP8266-based Wi-Fi development board designed in the Arduino UNO form factor, allowing users to build wireless and IoT projects easily. It combines a microcontroller and Wi-Fi module on a single board, so external Wi-Fi shields are not required.\",\"info\":\"It’s primarily made to work with boards in the WeMos (Wemos) ecosystem, such as WeMos D1 and WeMos D1 Mini, which are themselves based on the ESP8266 Wi-Fi microcontroller. The shield provides a plug-and-play way to add networking capabilities without complex wiring.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"ESP8266 WiFi Board\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"ESP8266EX Wi-Fi microcontroller\\r\\nBuilt-in 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi (802.11 b/g/n)\\r\\nArduino UNO-style board layout\\r\\n3.3 V operating voltage\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 06:45:55'),
(3359,1,'category',560,'create',NULL,NULL,'2026-02-28 06:47:14'),
(3360,1,'product',2375,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"WeMos  ESP Wroom 02 Board\",\"description\":\"The WeMos ESP-WROOM-02 Board is a compact Wi-Fi development board built around the ESP-WROOM-02 module, which itself is based on the ESP8266EX SoC. It combines a 32-bit microcontroller with integrated 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi, allowing direct internet connectivity without an external Wi-Fi shield. This board is widely used for IoT, wireless monitoring, smart home, and embedded web-server projects.\",\"info\":\"The ESP-WROOM-02 module typically includes 4 MB flash memory, onboard PCB antenna, and supports Wi-Fi standards 802.11 b/g/n. The WeMos development board version adds USB-to-Serial interface (usually CH340), voltage regulation, reset/flash buttons, and easy-access GPIO pins, making it simple to program via Arduino IDE, AT firmware, or NodeMCU Lua firmware.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"WeMos D1 ESP8266\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"ESP8266EX 32-bit MCU (80–160 MHz)\\r\\nBuilt-in TCP/IP Wi-Fi stack\\r\\n4 MB flash memory\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 06:50:34'),
(3361,1,'product',2375,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"WeMos  ESP Wroom 02 Board\",\"description\":\"The WeMos ESP-WROOM-02 Board is a compact Wi-Fi development board built around the ESP-WROOM-02 module, which itself is based on the ESP8266EX SoC. It combines a 32-bit microcontroller with integrated 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi, allowing direct internet connectivity without an external Wi-Fi shield. This board is widely used for IoT, wireless monitoring, smart home, and embedded web-server projects.\",\"info\":\"The ESP-WROOM-02 module typically includes 4 MB flash memory, onboard PCB antenna, and supports Wi-Fi standards 802.11 b/g/n. The WeMos development board version adds USB-to-Serial interface (usually CH340), voltage regulation, reset/flash buttons, and easy-access GPIO pins, making it simple to program via Arduino IDE, AT firmware, or NodeMCU Lua firmware.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"WeMos D1 ESP8266\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"ESP8266EX 32-bit MCU (80–160 MHz)\\r\\nBuilt-in TCP/IP Wi-Fi stack\\r\\n4 MB flash memory\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 06:51:11'),
(3362,1,'product',2647,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview  Turret Camera 4 MP IP Camera\",\"description\":\"It also supports PoE (Power over Ethernet), simplifying installation with power and data over a single cable, and includes a slot for a microSD card (up to 256 GB) for local recording.\",\"info\":\"The camera features a fixed 2.8 mm wide‑angle lens with a broad field of view, built‑in infrared (IR) LEDs for night vision up to about 30 m, and a wide dynamic range (WDR) to handle scenes with both bright and dark lighting conditions effectively.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[867],\"model\":\"IPC3614SR3-ADPF28F\",\"alternative_name\":\" Turret  4 MP IP Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"It uses a 1/3″ progressive‑scan CMOS sensor to deliver high‑definition video at up to 2688 × 1520 resolution and 30 fps, providing clear and detailed footage for monitoring areas like entrances, yards, or commercial spaces.\"}','2026-02-28 06:54:46'),
(3363,1,'product',2146,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Water Pump DC 6-12Volt 385\",\"description\":\"The DC Water Pump 6–12V (Model 385) is a compact and efficient miniature water pump designed for low-voltage DC operation, commonly used in DIY electronics, automation, and small liquid transfer applications. It operates using a brushed DC motor that drives an internal impeller to move water smoothly through the inlet and outlet ports. The pump is designed for continuous water flow and provides reliable performance when powered by batteries, power adapters, or motor driver circuits.\",\"info\":\"This pump typically works within a voltage range of 6V to 12V DC, with optimal performance around 12V, delivering higher water flow and pressure at increased voltage levels. It features a durable plastic body, low noise operation, and simple two-wire connection for easy installation. The pump is suitable for clean water and light liquid circulation but is not intended for corrosive liquids or dry running operation. Speed and flow rate can also be controlled using a PWM motor speed controller.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"The DC 385 water pump is widely used in automatic plant watering systems, aquarium circulation, water fountains, cooling systems, robotics projects, DIY irrigation setups, and IoT-based fluid control applications. Its small size, low power consumption, and easy interfacing make it ideal for educational and prototype projects.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"462\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 06:59:19'),
(3364,1,'product',2438,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Water Flow sensor YF-S201 1/2 inch\",\"description\":\"YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor 1/2 inch, Robodo YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor, Water Flow Sensor YF?S201, Water Flow Sensor / Fluid Flowmeter YF?S201, Robocraze YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor, and YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor by Quartz Components are all versions of the YF-S201 — a compact Hall-effect water flow sensor with a standard 1/2? threaded connection for plumbing systems.\",\"info\":\"This sensor is designed to measure the flow rate of water (or other non-corrosive liquids) passing through a pipe and output a digital pulse signal that can be read by a microcontroller such as Arduino, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, or Raspberry Pi Pico\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"77\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 07:00:14'),
(3365,1,'product',2437,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"water flow sensor YF-DN50 2inch\",\"description\":\"The YFDN50 Water Flow Sensor, YF?DN50 Water Flow Sensor 2 inch, 2 inch Water Flow Sensor - YF?DN50, Yf?DN50 Water Flow Sensor, SEA YF?DN50?S?3M Stainless Steel Water Flow Sensor, and DN50 Water Flow Sensor Flowmeter Hall Sensor Control are large-diameter inline water flow sensors used to measure the flow rate of water passing through a 2-inch (DN50) pipe.\",\"info\":\"These sensors are mechanical turbine flowmeters that output digital pulses proportional to the flow rate, making them suitable for use with controllers like Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP32, or Pi Pico\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"DN50 Water Flow Sensor\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"Voltage: 3V–12V DC\\r\\nCurrent: 300mA – 1A\\r\\nFlow Rate: 80–240 L/H\\r\\nPower: 3W–10W\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"77\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 07:02:38'),
(3366,1,'product',2648,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview  Bullet Camera 5MP  IP Camera \",\"description\":\"It features a 1/3″ progressive‑scan CMOS sensor that captures high‑resolution 5 megapixel video (2592 × 1944) and supports multiple video compression formats including Ultra 265, H.265, H.264 and MJPEG for efficient storage and streaming.\",\"info\":\"The camera has a 4.0 mm fixed lens with a roughly 79° horizontal field of view, built‑in Smart IR LEDs that provide clear night vision up to about 30 meters, and day/night functionality with automatic IR‑cut switching.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[347],\"model\":\" IPC2125LB-SF40-A\",\"alternative_name\":\"Bullet Camera 5MP  IP Camera \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Equipped with 2D/3D digital noise reduction and wide dynamic range (DWDR), it ensures improved image clarity in varied lighting conditions.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772262165922-741890588.jpg\"}','2026-02-28 07:02:45'),
(3367,1,'product',2440,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Water Flow sensor with TDS probe MH-01\",\"description\":\"The MH-01 is a 2-in-1 multifunction water sensor that integrates water flow measurement with TDS (Total Dissolved Solids) sensing (and sometimes temperature) in a single compact unit. It’s typically used in smart water monitoring, filtration systems, irrigation systems with quality control, and IoT water analytics modules.\",\"info\":\"The Water Flow Sensor with TDS Probe MH-01 is a dual-function monitoring module designed to measure both water flow rate and Total Dissolved Solids (TDS) in water systems. It is commonly used in RO water purifiers, water quality monitoring systems, IoT water management projects, and industrial filtration systems. The module combines a hall-effect flow sensor\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"DWS-MH-01 Water Flow Sensor\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"Dual measurement: Flow rate + TDS value\\r\\nFlow measurement type: Hall-effect turbine sensor\\r\\nTDS measurement range: 0–1000 ppm\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"77\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 07:04:36'),
