(3384,1,'product',2065,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Videocon DTH Remote\",\"description\":\"Make sure your set?top box is really the Videocon / Videocon D2H brand (after the merger ?) — remote codes vary by brand/model.\",\"info\":\"Confirm the model of your box (HD / SD / RF / IR version) and whether the remote is labelled for “Videocon D2H”, “Videocon RF DTH”, etc. For example, a product listing says “Works upto 50 meter distance until 360° angle” for the RF version.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"125\",\"brand_id\":288}]}','2026-02-28 07:40:36'),
