(3395,1,'product',2456,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to serial CP2102 Converter AADD\",\"description\":\"USB to Serial CP2102 Converter (AAD) is a compact and reliable communication module used to convert USB signals from a computer into TTL-level serial (UART) communication. It is based on the CP2102 chipset by Silicon Labs, which is well known for its stability, fast data transfer, and wide operating system support.\",\"info\":\"This converter typically supports 3.3V and 5V TTL logic levels, making it suitable for interfacing with popular development boards and modules such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, GSM/GPS modules, routers, and IoT devices. The board provides standard serial pins like TXD, RXD, GND, VCC, DTR, and RTS, which are commonly used for firmware uploading, serial debugging, and console access.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":79,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 08:13:06'),
