(3405,1,'product',2581,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UNO R4 WIFI Board\",\"description\":\"The Arduino UNO R4 WiFi is a next-generation Arduino development board that combines the familiar UNO form factor with significantly upgraded performance, wireless connectivity, and modern features — making it ideal for IoT, robotics, automation, and advanced electronic projects\",\"info\":\"Uno R4 WiFi is its built-in Wi-Fi connectivity, allowing your projects to connect to wireless networks right out of the box without needing extra shields or modules. This opens up possibilities like remote data logging, IoT sensors, or web-controlled devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-02-28 09:07:43'),
(3406,1,'product',2637,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview   ECO Bullet Camera 2MP\",\"description\":\"The Uniview IPC2122LB-ASF40 ECO is a 2MP mini fixed bullet IP camera designed for reliable outdoor surveillance and security monitoring. Manufactured by Uniview (UNV), this camera belongs to the Easy/ECO series, offering high-quality Full HD video recording with advanced compression and durable weatherproof construction. It uses a 2-megapixel progressive scan CMOS sensor to capture clear images at 1920 × 1080 (Full HD) resolution, making it suitable for homes, offices, shops, warehouses, and commercial security systems\",\"info\":\"The camera features a 4.0 mm fixed lens, providing a wide viewing angle for monitoring entrances, corridors, parking areas, and perimeter zones. With Smart IR night vision up to 30 meters, it automatically switches between day and night modes using an IR-cut filter to maintain visibility even in complete darkness. Advanced video compression technologies such as Ultra 265, H.265, and H.264 reduce bandwidth and storage usage while maintaining image quality\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"Camera Type: Bullet IP Camera\\r\\nResolution: 2MP (1920 × 1080)\\r\\nImage Sensor: 1/2.8\\\" CMOS\\r\\nLens: 4.0 mm fixed lens\\r\\nNight Vision: Smart IR up to 30 m\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":282,\"secondary_id\":284,\"brand_id\":128}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772270624702-20594541.jpg\"}','2026-02-28 09:23:44'),
(3407,1,'product',829,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Universal Smart Remote\",\"description\":\"The Orange ADE-101 TV Remote is a high-quality replacement remote designed to work seamlessly with compatible LED and LCD televisions from the Orange brand.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1299.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"470\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:26:54'),
(3408,1,'product',2647,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview  Turret Camera 4 MP IP Camera\",\"description\":\"It also supports PoE (Power over Ethernet), simplifying installation with power and data over a single cable, and includes a slot for a microSD card (up to 256 GB) for local recording.\",\"info\":\"The camera features a fixed 2.8 mm wide‑angle lens with a broad field of view, built‑in infrared (IR) LEDs for night vision up to about 30 m, and a wide dynamic range (WDR) to handle scenes with both bright and dark lighting conditions effectively.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"IPC3614SR3-ADPF28F\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\" Turret  4 MP IP Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"It uses a 1/3″ progressive‑scan CMOS sensor to deliver high‑definition video at up to 2688 × 1520 resolution and 30 fps, providing clear and detailed footage for monitoring areas like entrances, yards, or commercial spaces.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":282,\"secondary_id\":285,\"brand_id\":128}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772429316798-186238945.jpg\"}','2026-03-02 05:28:36'),
(3409,1,'product',852,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Universal Remote Control for PANASONIC LED TV\",\"description\":\"The remote uses infrared (IR) line-of-sight; it must “see” the TV’s IR receiver. It should explicitly list compatibility with Panasonic LED/LCD/Smart TV models. For example, some replacements list model codes like N2QAYB000486 for Panasonic TVs.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":11}]}','2026-03-02 05:29:19'),
(3410,1,'product',2132,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UltraSonic sensor Module\",\"description\":\"The Ultrasonic Sensor Module is an electronic distance measuring device used to detect objects and measure distance using ultrasonic sound waves. It works by transmitting high-frequency sound pulses (usually around 40 kHz) through a transmitter and then receiving the reflected echo from nearby objects using a receiver. The module calculates the distance based on the time taken for the sound wave to travel to the object and return, making it a reliable non-contact measurement sensor.\",\"info\":\"One of the most commonly used ultrasonic modules is the HC-SR04, which provides accurate distance measurement and easy interfacing with microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and STM32 boards. The sensor typically includes four pins: VCC, GND, Trigger, and Echo. A short trigger pulse initiates measurement, and the echo pin outputs a signal whose duration corresponds to the detected distance. The module operates on 5V DC power and offers stable performance in various lighting conditions since it relies on sound instead of light.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"Ultrasonic sensor modules are widely used in obstacle avoidance robots, distance measurement systems, water level monitoring, parking assistance systems, automation projects, and smart IoT applications. Due to their accuracy, low cost, and simple operation, they are highly popular in educational and industrial electronics projects.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:30:04'),
(3411,1,'product',2284,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Ultralife  9V Lithium Battery\",\"description\":\"The Ultralife 9V Lithium Battery is a high-performance, non-rechargeable 9-volt lithium battery designed to deliver long-lasting and reliable power for a wide range of electronic devices.\",\"info\":\"It uses lithium manganese dioxide (LiMnO?) chemistry, which offers much higher energy density and longer life than standard alkaline 9 V batteries.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium 9-Volt Battery\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:31:28'),
(3412,1,'product',2470,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ULN2003\",\"description\":\"ULN2003 is a widely used Darlington transistor array IC designed to drive high-current, high-voltage loads using low-power logic signals from microcontrollers. It contains seven NPN Darlington pairs in a single 16-pin package, each capable of switching loads that typical microcontroller GPIO pins cannot handle directly.\",\"info\":\"Each channel of the ULN2003 can sink up to 500 mA with load voltages up to 50 V, making it ideal for driving relays, solenoids, LEDs, buzzers, and stepper motors. The IC includes built-in flyback (freewheeling) diodes, which protect the circuit from voltage spikes when driving inductive loads like motors and relays—no external diodes are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":\"73\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:33:06'),
(3413,1,'product',2300,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PSU-1204\",\"description\":\"The TT-PSU-1204 Trolley Speaker is a portable public-address (PA) and karaoke speaker system designed for outdoor events, functions, announcements, and music playback. It is built with a trolley-style cabinet, including wheels and a pull handle, allowing easy transportation similar to a suitcase. This type of speaker typically features a 12-inch woofer, delivering powerful sound output suitable for small gatherings, classrooms, parties, shops, and stage programs.\",\"info\":\"The speaker integrates multiple audio playback options such as Bluetooth wireless streaming, USB drive, TF card, AUX input, and FM radio, making it a complete multimedia sound system. Most TT-PSU-series trolley speakers also include wireless microphone support, enabling karaoke singing, speeches, or PA announcements without additional equipment.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:35:03'),
(3414,1,'product',2303,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PSH-1501\",\"description\":\"The Trolley Speaker TT-PSH-1501 is a portable Bluetooth trolley speaker designed for powerful audio output and easy mobility.\",\"info\":\"This model typically features wireless connectivity options like Bluetooth, FM radio, USB/SD playback, and microphone inputs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"18999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:35:32'),
(3415,1,'product',2279,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley speaker TT-PSG-802\",\"description\":\"The Target TT-PSG-802 Trolley Speaker is a compact and portable Bluetooth-enabled trolley speaker designed for versatile audio use at small gatherings, parties, and everyday entertainment. It features an 8-inch driver with around 60 W RMS power output, giving clear and loud stereo sound suitable for indoor and light outdoor settings\",\"info\":\"Additional features typically include FM radio, remote control support, and compatibility with external devices, all housed in a black, wheeled cabinet for easy transport.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:38:37'),
(3416,1,'product',2304,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PSG -1502\",\"description\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PSG-1502 in some listings) is a portable Bluetooth-enabled trolley speaker system designed for events, parties, and outdoor use, featuring robust sound output and easy mobility with built-in wheels and a handle.\",\"info\":\"This model delivers powerful audio performance with wireless connectivity options, making it suitable for music playback from phones and other Bluetooth devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"8999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:39:15'),
(3417,1,'product',2299,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PSF-1203\",\"description\":\"Bluetooth wireless connectivity – Stream music from phones, tablets.\\r\\nLarge woofer (around 12?) with decent bass output.\",\"info\":\"Microphone support – Often included for karaoke/announcements. \\r\\nWheels + Telescopic Handle – Easy to move around.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:39:45'),
(3418,1,'product',2299,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PSF-1203\",\"description\":\"The Trolley Speaker TT-PSF-1203 is a portable and powerful Bluetooth party speaker designed for outdoor entertainment, public announcements, and small event sound systems. It features a large woofer-based audio system that delivers strong bass and clear sound output suitable for music playback, karaoke, and microphone use. The speaker supports Bluetooth connectivity, allowing wireless streaming from smartphones, laptops, and other compatible devices, along with multiple input options such as USB, AUX, memory card, and FM radio, making it versatile for different audio sources.\",\"info\":\"Microphone support – Often included for karaoke/announcements. \\r\\nWheels + Telescopic Handle – Easy to move around.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:40:53'),
(3419,1,'product',2295,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PSF -1003\",\"description\":\"A trolley speaker like the TT-PSF-1003 is a portable PA or multimedia speaker with wheels and a pull-handle, designed for outdoor events, parties, public announcements, karaoke, and travel use.\",\"info\":\"Specific specs for TT-PSF-1003 weren’t found online, but similar models provide a good ballpark of features and pricing in India.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"6999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:41:28'),
(3420,1,'product',2302,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PSA-1500\",\"description\":\"class generally feature a trolley-style design with wheels and a handle, making them easy to transport from place to place.\",\"info\":\"They typically offer multiple playback options, such as Bluetooth connectivity for wireless music streaming, USB/SD card inputs, FM radio, and AUX ports for wired connections to phones, laptops, or media players.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:42:04'),
(3421,1,'product',2301,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PAF-1812\",\"description\":\"It features an integrated trolley handle and wheels, making it easy to transport to gatherings, parties, or public speaking events.\",\"info\":\"While the exact TT-PAF-1812 model wasn’t found online, TT-PAF series trolley speakers generally share these multimedia and portable PA features with strong bass and karaoke support.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"6999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:42:32'),
(3422,1,'product',2296,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PAF-1810\",\"description\":\"Target trolley speakers like the TT-PAF models are portable multimedia PA speakers designed for parties, gatherings, events, outdoor use, and announcements.\",\"info\":\"Bluetooth wireless music playback and USB/SD/FM support\\r\\nMicrophone inputs for announcements or karaoke\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"8500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:42:57'),
(3423,1,'product',2305,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PAF-1515\",\"description\":\"The Trolley Speaker TT-PAF-1515 is a portable PA-style trolley speaker designed for events, parties, and public announcements, featuring built-in Bluetooth connectivity, USB/SD playback, rechargeable battery support, and easy mobility with its extendable handle and wheels.\",\"info\":\"This type of speaker typically offers powerful audio output suitable for indoor/outdoor gatherings and can connect wirelessly to smartphones, laptops, and other devices for music streaming.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:43:22'),
(3424,1,'product',2294,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PAF-1408\",\"description\":\"The Target TT-PAF-1408 is a portable trolley PA speaker designed for parties, events, karaoke sessions, and outdoor use.\",\"info\":\"It features built-in transport wheels and a trolley handle so you can easily move it around.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"6999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:43:53'),
(3425,1,'product',2649,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview Turret Camera 8 MP IP Camera\",\"description\":\"The Uniview Turret Camera 8MP IP Camera IPC3618LB-ADF28K-G is a high-resolution 4K turret (eyeball)-type network surveillance camera designed for professional indoor and outdoor security monitoring.\",\"info\":\"It is equipped with a 1/2.7″ progressive scan CMOS sensor that delivers ultra-clear 8-megapixel (3840 × 2160) video resolution, providing detailed images suitable for homes, offices, shops, warehouses, parking areas, and commercial premises.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[867],\"model\":\"IPC3618LB-ADF28K-G\",\"alternative_name\":\" 8 MP Turret Camera \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"A built-in microphone enables audio recording for enhanced surveillance, and the camera supports microSD storage up to 512 GB for local recording backup.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772430291723-306835469.jpg\"}','2026-03-02 05:44:51'),
(3426,1,'product',2297,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speaker TT-PAF-1201\",\"description\":\"These speakers usually feature wireless Bluetooth connectivity, USB/AUX/SD inputs for playback from phones or USB drives, and a trolley with handle and wheels for easy mobility.\",\"info\":\"Some include wireless mic support for announcements or karaoke. Designed for parties, events, public addresses, and entertainment.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"8999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:49:12'),
(3427,1,'product',2298,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trolley Speake2r TT-PSG-120\",\"description\":\"Designed with a 12-inch woofer and advertised as delivering around 100 W RMS (200 W peak) sound output, this speaker is built for small gatherings, parties, and outdoor use with clear audio and decent bass for its class.\",\"info\":\"It easy to move around for events, karaoke, or home entertainment, and many users mention it’s value-for-money at its price point.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"8999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"474\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:49:41'),
(3428,1,'product',2142,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TP4056 USB To V8\",\"description\":\"The TP4056 USB to V8 (Micro-USB) module is a compact single-cell Li-ion / Li-Po battery charger board that accepts 5V input via Micro-USB (V8).\",\"info\":\"Built around the TP4056 linear charging IC, it uses a CC/CV (constant-current / constant-voltage) charging profile to safely charge 3.7V rechargeable batteries.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"59\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:52:01'),
(3429,1,'product',2141,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TP4056 USB to Type-C\",\"description\":\"The TP4056 USB to Type-C module is a compact single-cell Li-ion / Li-Po battery charging board designed for modern Type-C 5V input\",\"info\":\"It is based on the TP4056 linear charger IC and provides safe, constant-current / constant-voltage (CC/CV) charging for 3.7V rechargeable batteries.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"59\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:52:35'),
(3430,1,'product',531,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TOY MOTOR WHEEL SMALL\",\"description\":\"The Small Toy Motor Wheel is a compact, lightweight wheel designed for small DC toy motors commonly used in DIY toys, school projects, mini robots, and battery-operated vehicles.\",\"info\":\"A small toy motor wheel is a compact plastic wheel designed to fit on tiny DC hobby motors (such as 130, 140, or 180 size motors)\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"79.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":320,\"secondary_id\":\"559\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:54:47'),
(3431,1,'product',2370,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TM1638 8 Bit Digital LED Display Module\",\"description\":\"The TM1638 8 Bit Digital LED Display Module is a versatile display and input module that combines an 8-digit 7-segment LED display, 8 individual LEDs, and 8 tactile push buttons on a single board. It is controlled by the TM1638 driver IC and communicates with microcontrollers using a simple 3-wire serial interface, making it ideal for Arduino and other embedded projects.\",\"info\":\"The TM1638 8 Bit Digital LED Display Module is a multifunction display board that integrates output display and user input in a single unit. It is widely used with Arduino and other microcontrollers for creating compact control panels and digital interfaces.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"453\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:55:40'),
(3432,1,'product',2568,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TM1637 Indicator module\",\"description\":\"The TM1637 Indicator Module is a compact digital display unit featuring a 4-digit 7-segment LED display driven by the TM1637 display driver IC\",\"info\":\"It’s widely used for displaying numbers, time, counters, temperatures, and simple data in microcontroller and embedded systems projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:56:28'),
(3433,1,'product',2343,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TL-5903  3.6V Lithium Battery\",\"description\":\"The Tadiran TL-5903 is a primary (non-rechargeable) 3.6 V lithium battery from Tadiran’s iXtra series (long-life lithium-thionyl chloride), built for industrial and professional applications that require high energy, stable voltage, and long service life\",\"info\":\"This battery is often used where batteries must last many years without replacement, such as memory backup, industrial controllers, utilities, and remote sensors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"3.6V AA Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:57:48'),
(3434,1,'product',2290,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TL 5920 C Size Battery\",\"description\":\"The TADIRAN TL?5920 3.6V C Size 8500?mAh Lithium Battery (also sold in various packs) is a 3.6 V primary lithium battery in a standard C-cell form factor designed for long life, high reliability, and stable voltage output\",\"info\":\"It uses lithium thionyl chloride (Li-SOCl?) chemistry, which is ideal for applications that require months or years of dependable power without frequent replacement.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 05:58:16'),
(3435,1,'product',2078,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Thomason remote\",\"description\":\"Thomason Remote is a reliable and user-friendly replacement remote designed to work with a wide range of LED and LCD televisions. It features a durable body, responsive soft-touch buttons, and an easy-to-use layout that makes everyday operation simple and comfortable. The remote supports essential TV controls such as power, volume, channel selection, input/source selection, and menu navigation, allowing you to access all TV functions without any setup in most cases.\",\"info\":\"suitable for Thomason\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"849.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772431194858-404951605.jpg\"}','2026-03-02 05:59:54'),
(3436,1,'product',125,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TFT 2.4inch SHIELD ST7789 for UNO/MEGA\",\"description\":\"This is 1.8 inch serial SPI colour display module\\r\\nSupport analog SPI and hardware SPI, SPI serial\\r\\nThe LCD Display Module can be driven with at least four IO\\r\\nWith SD card slot for convenient function expansion.\",\"info\":\"The 2.4-inch TFT LCD Shield (ST7789 driver) is a color display module designed as a plug-and-play shield for Arduino UNO and Arduino MEGA boards\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"950.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":317,\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772431395390-225919766.jpg\"}','2026-03-02 06:03:15'),
