(3457,1,'product',2653,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview Owl View Series  4MP Camera\",\"description\":\"The Uniview IPC3624LE-ADF28K-WP is a 4 MP fixed turret (eyeball) IP network surveillance camera designed for reliable indoor and outdoor security monitoring.\",\"info\":\"It features a 1/1.8″ progressive scan CMOS sensor with a 2.8 mm F1.0 fixed lens, delivering high-resolution 4 MP (2688 × 1520) video for sharp and detailed imaging.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[867],\"model\":\"IPC3624LE-ADF28K-WP\",\"alternative_name\":\"4MP Owl View Series  Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera is powered by ColorHunter with Wise-ISP technology, which enhances color, detail, and low-light performance so it can produce full-color images around the clock.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772433329891-814771562.jpg\"}','2026-03-02 06:35:29'),
(3458,1,'product',2064,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Sun HD Universal Remote\",\"description\":\"The remote needs to explicitly mention compatibility with Sun Direct HD and/or SD set-top boxes. Some listings show: “Sun Direct HD Set Top Box Remote HD ONLY”\",\"info\":\"Ensure it supports the model of your box (HD vs SD version). Some remotes say “HD only” or “HD & normal boxes”\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 06:35:32'),
(3459,1,'product',2488,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"STEPPER  MOTOR 5V 28BYJ\",\"description\":\"The 5V 28BYJ stepper motor is a compact, low-cost unipolar stepper motor widely used in electronics projects, robotics, and automation applications\",\"info\":\"Due to its small size, low power consumption, and smooth step-by-step motion, the 28BYJ is ideal for applications such as robotic arms, camera sliders, valve control systems, small CNC models, and educational learning kits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"142\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 06:37:44'),
(3460,1,'product',2654,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview Owl View Series  8MP Camera\",\"description\":\"The Uniview IPC3628LE-ADF28K-WP is a 4 MP turret-style IP network surveillance camera built for reliable indoor and outdoor security monitoring.\",\"info\":\"It supports efficient Ultra 265, H.265, and H.264 video compression, reducing bandwidth and storage requirements while preserving high-quality recording.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[867],\"model\":\"IPC3628LE-ADF28K-WP\",\"alternative_name\":\" Owl View Series  8MP Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Wipe the lens and housing periodically with a soft cloth to ensure clear image quality and prevent dust build-up.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772433873340-203540354.jpg\"}','2026-03-02 06:44:33'),
(3461,1,'product',2655,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview   PTZ 2MP CAMERA\",\"description\":\"The PTZ mechanism allows horizontal and vertical movement for dynamic monitoring, making it suitable for tracking movement across wide areas such as offices, retail interiors, hallways, and other indoor spaces.\",\"info\":\"It is a compact PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) dome-style IP camera that delivers high-quality 1080p (1920 × 1080) resolution video using a 1/2.7″ progressive scan CMOS sensor.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[891],\"model\":\"IPC6412LR-X5UPW-VG\",\"alternative_name\":\"  PTZ 2MP CAMERA\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The Uniview IPC6412LR-X5UPW-VG is a high-performance 2 MP motorized PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) IP network camera designed for dynamic surveillance in both indoor and semi-protected outdoor environments.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772435464295-727990620.jpg\"}','2026-03-02 07:11:04'),
(3462,1,'product',2656,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview PTZ Camera 2MP \",\"description\":\"The Uniview IPC6412LR-X16-VG is a 2 MP motorized PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) IP network camera designed for advanced video surveillance.\",\"info\":\"This model features a motorized varifocal lens with 16× optical zoom, allowing users to remotely adjust the zoom level and viewing angle for detailed monitoring across long distances without loss of image quality. \",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[886],\"model\":\"IPC6412LR-X16-VG\",\"alternative_name\":\"2MP PTZ Camera \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera is optimized for digital CCTV systems, offering flexible monitoring and tracking capabilities beyond fixed-lens cameras.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772436185347-544089308.jpg\"}','2026-03-02 07:23:05'),
(3463,1,'product',2657,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview PTZ Camera 4MP \",\"description\":\"The Uniview IPC6624SR-X33-VF is a 4 MP outdoor PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) network dome camera built for advanced, long-range surveillance applications.\",\"info\":\"This model is equipped with a powerful 33× optical zoom motorized varifocal lens (4.5–148.5 mm) that lets you zoom in on distant objects without losing clarity, and it supports up to 16× digital zoom for even more detail when needed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[886],\"model\":\"IPC6624SR-X33-VF\",\"alternative_name\":\"PTZ Camera 4MP \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera uses Uniview’s LightHunter technology for excellent low-light performance and Smart IR night vision up to approximately 150 meters, ensuring visibility even in complete darkness.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772436882316-841469291.jpg\"}','2026-03-02 07:34:42'),
(3464,1,'product',2506,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Slim Battery\",\"description\":\"A slim battery is a compact, lightweight power source designed to deliver reliable energy while occupying minimal space\",\"info\":\". Because of their space-saving form factor and dependable performance, slim batteries are ideal for applications where design, portability, and efficiency are equally important.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 08:29:40'),
(3465,1,'product',2281,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"SIEMENS 575332TA Battery\",\"description\":\"The SIEMENS 575332TA is a 3 V lithium backup battery (CR 1/2 AA form factor) typically used in Siemens PLCs, CNC controllers, industrial automation, and memory backup applications.\",\"info\":\"These batteries provide power to retain program memory, real-time clock, and configuration data when main power is off.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 08:30:27'),
(3466,1,'product',2439,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Side Shift Motor\",\"description\":\"A side shift motor is a specialized motor or actuator used in machinery and material-handling equipment to provide controlled lateral (left-right) movement of a component without changing its forward position.\",\"info\":\"It is commonly used in forklifts, industrial automation systems, CNC machines, robotics, and agricultural equipment where precise side positioning is required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"459\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 08:32:27'),
(3467,1,'product',2564,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"servo tester module\",\"description\":\"A servo tester module is a compact electronic device used to test, control, and calibrate servo motors and ESCs (Electronic Speed Controllers) without the need for a microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"It generates precise PWM signals, allowing users to check servo movement, direction, speed, and response quickly and easily.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 08:34:16'),
(3468,1,'product',2460,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Serial to TTL MAX3232\",\"description\":\"Serial to TTL MAX3232 Module is a communication interface module used to convert RS232 serial signals into TTL-level UART signals and vice versa. It is based on the MAX3232 IC, which is specifically designed to work with low-voltage systems (3.0V to 5.5V), making it suitable for modern microcontrollers and embedded platforms.\",\"info\":\"RS232 communication uses higher voltage levels (typically ±7V to ±12V), which cannot be directly connected to TTL-based devices such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, or other microcontrollers. The MAX3232 module safely converts these voltage levels, allowing reliable serial communication between computers, industrial equipment, GSM modules, GPS devices, and embedded controllers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 08:34:59'),
(3469,1,'product',2416,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"sensor shield\",\"description\":\"A Sensor Shield is an Arduino-compatible expansion board that simplifies connecting sensors, modules, and actuators to an Arduino board.\",\"info\":\"Sensor shields are widely used in robotics, automation, education, and rapid prototyping.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 08:35:41'),
