(3532,1,'product',2428,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PI Pico\",\"description\":\"The Pi Pico (Raspberry Pi Pico) is a compact and low-cost microcontroller development board designed by the Raspberry Pi Foundation for embedded systems, automation, and IoT applications. It is built around the RP2040 microcontroller, a dual-core ARM Cortex-M0+ processor running at up to 133 MHz, providing high performance and flexibility for real-time control and electronic projects.\",\"info\":\"The Raspberry Pi Pico features multiple GPIO pins that support digital input/output, PWM, ADC, UART, SPI, and I2C communication interfaces, allowing connection with sensors, displays, motors, and other electronic modules. It operates at 3.3V logic level and can be powered through a Micro-USB port or external power supply.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"The board supports programming using MicroPython, C/C++, and Arduino IDE, offering flexibility for different development environments. Its low power consumption and stable performance make it ideal for portable and battery-powered devices.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":\"16\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 10:32:15'),
(3533,1,'product',2430,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PI CAM\",\"description\":\"The Pi Cam, officially known as the Raspberry Pi Camera Module, is a compact digital camera designed specifically for Raspberry Pi boards\",\"info\":\"It connects directly to the Raspberry Pi via the CSI (Camera Serial Interface) port, enabling high-quality image and video capture for embedded vision and multimedia projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":\"16\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 10:33:03'),
(3534,1,'product',2476,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PH Tester soil water moisture\",\"description\":\"pH Tester – Soil & Water Moisture Meter is a practical measuring instrument used to check the pH level and moisture content of soil and sometimes water, especially in agriculture, gardening, horticulture, and greenhouse applications. It helps users understand soil conditions so plants receive the right nutrients and water balance.\",\"info\":\"This tester typically uses metal probe electrodes that are inserted directly into the soil. It provides a pH reading to indicate whether the soil is acidic, neutral, or alkaline, which is crucial because different crops and plants grow best within specific pH ranges. Along with pH, the device measures soil moisture levels, helping to avoid over-watering or under-watering plants.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"77\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 10:40:09'),
(3535,1,'product',2128,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PCA9685 16 channel Servo Motor Driver\",\"description\":\"The PCA9685 16-Channel Servo Motor Driver is a PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) controller module designed to control multiple servo motors or LEDs using a single microcontroller. It is based on the PCA9685 PWM driver IC, which communicates through the I2C interface, allowing efficient control of up to 16 independent channels while using only two communication pins (SDA and SCL). This greatly reduces the processing load on microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and STM32 boards.\",\"info\":\"The module generates precise 12-bit PWM signals, providing 4096 levels of resolution for accurate servo positioning and smooth motor movement. It includes an onboard clock and supports adjustable PWM frequency, typically ranging from 40 Hz to 1000 Hz, making it suitable for both servo motors and LED dimming applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"800.00\",\"note\":\"The PCA9685 servo driver features dedicated external power input for motors, ensuring stable operation without overloading the microcontroller’s power supply. It is widely used in robotics, robotic arms, humanoid robots, automation systems, RC projects, animatronics, and multi-servo control applications due to its reliability, scalability, and precise PWM control capability.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"453\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 10:42:51'),
(3536,1,'product',2315,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Party Speaker TT-PSE-8X201\",\"description\":\"The Party Speaker TT-PSE-8X201 is a robust wireless Bluetooth party speaker designed to deliver powerful audio for events, gatherings, and celebrations.\",\"info\":\"The speaker also includes a wireless LED microphone, remote control, and TWS (True Wireless Stereo) functionality to connect two units for stereo sound expansion. Its portable design is complemented by extras like a remote, wide connectivity options, and a rechargeable lithium-ion battery with around 4 hours charging time.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"11000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"473\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 10:43:31'),
