(3565,1,'product',2271,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"SMPS Soldering Station\",\"description\":\"An SMPS Soldering Station is a type of soldering setup that uses a Switched-Mode Power Supply (SMPS) to power the soldering iron. Unlike basic irons that draw raw mains voltage, an SMPS unit converts the mains input into a clean, regulated output, giving more stable performance and better temperature control. SMPS technology also improves efficiency, safety, and energy use compared to older transformer-based stations.\",\"info\":\"An SMPS lets the station deliver stable, efficient power, reducing heat fluctuation compared to basic mains-powered irons. It’s typically lighter and more compact than classic transformer-based solder stations, making it ideal for mobile technicians or small workbenches.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":423,\"secondary_id\":\"496\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:13:03'),
