(3568,1,'product',2155,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Small DC Electric Motor (yellow)\",\"description\":\"The Small DC Electric Motor (Yellow) is a compact and lightweight brushed DC motor commonly used in hobby electronics, robotics, and educational projects. It operates on direct current (DC) power and converts electrical energy into mechanical rotational motion through electromagnetic interaction inside the motor.The motor is typically housed in a yellow plastic gearbox casing, which provides speed reduction and increased torque, making it ideal for small robotic vehicles and moving mechanisms.\",\"info\":\"This motor usually operates within a voltage range of 3V to 12V DC, with optimal performance around 6V, offering moderate speed and good torque suitable for lightweight applications. It features two terminals for simple power connection, where reversing the polarity changes the rotation direction. The integrated gearbox helps improve control and efficiency, allowing the motor to drive wheels, gears, or mechanical parts smoothly.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"The yellow DC geared motor is widely used in robot cars, line follower robots, obstacle avoidance robots, DIY automation projects, educational kits, and small mechanical systems. Due to its low cost, easy operation, and durable design, it is one of the most popular motors for beginner robotics and prototype development.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"459\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:14:18'),
(3569,1,'product',2573,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PCB Board\",\"description\":\"A PCB (Printed Circuit Board) is a flat insulating board used to mechanically support and electrically connect electronic components using copper conductive tracks etched onto its surface. It replaces traditional point-to-point wiring, making circuits compact, organized, and reliable.\",\"info\":\"Most PCBs are made from FR-4 material, which is a fiberglass-reinforced epoxy laminate that provides strength, insulation, and heat resistance. Electronic components such as resistors, capacitors, diodes, transistors, and integrated circuits are mounted on the board either through through-hole technology (THT) or surface mount technology (SMT), depending on the design requirements.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCB Board\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"PCBs improve performance by reducing electrical noise, enhancing signal flow, and increasing durability. Important technical considerations in PCB design include track width, grounding methods, component spacing, heat dissipation, and proper insulation distance to prevent short circuits. Standard PCB thickness is usually around 1.6 mm, and copper thickness commonly used is 1 oz per square foot.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":\"564\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:15:38'),
(3570,1,'product',2412,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PH Sensor Kit\",\"description\":\"The pH Sensor Kit is an electronic measurement kit designed to measure the acidity or alkalinity (pH value) of liquids. It typically consists of a pH probe (electrode) and a signal conditioning module, allowing accurate pH readings to be interfaced with Arduino, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and other microcontrollers.\",\"info\":\"The pH Sensor Kit is a measurement system used to determine the acidity or alkalinity of liquids by measuring their pH value. It typically includes a pH probe (electrode) and an interface/conditioning module, enabling easy connection to Arduino and other microcontrollers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"77\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:16:03'),
