(3579,1,'product',2317,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Party Speaker TT-PSE-10X202\",\"description\":\"The Target TT-PSE-10X202 is a robust party speaker system designed to deliver powerful sound output suitable for gatherings, celebrations, and events.\",\"info\":\"It typically features dual 6.5? drivers for stereo output, wireless Bluetooth connectivity, FM/USB/AUX playback options, and a trolley/portable design that makes it easy to move around at parties or outdoor functions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"6500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"473\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:20:26'),
(3580,1,'product',2516,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"300mm lead screw with Nut\",\"description\":\"A 300mm lead screw with nut is a mechanical component used to convert rotational motion into linear motion. It consists of a threaded rod (lead screw) of 300 millimeters length and a matching nut that moves along the screw when it rotates. When the screw is turned using a motor or hand rotation, the nut travels forward or backward depending on the direction of rotation. Lead screws are commonly used in CNC machines, 3D printers, linear actuators, and automation systems for precise positioning and controlled movement.\",\"info\":\"It consists of a lead screw (threaded rod) that is 300 mm long and a matching nut (often a brass or Delrin nut), which travels up and down the screw as it rotates. These are widely used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and automation systems for accurate positioning.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Screw Driver\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"Lead screws are typically made of stainless steel or carbon steel for strength and durability, while the nut is often made of brass or bronze to reduce friction and wear. A common type is the T8 lead screw, which usually has an 8mm diameter. The pitch (distance between threads) determines how much the nut moves per rotation. For example, in a T8 lead screw with 2mm pitch and 4 starts, the lead may be 8mm per rotation.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:20:34'),
(3581,1,'product',2316,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Party Speaker TT-PSE-10X201\",\"description\":\"The Target TT-PSE-10X201 is a robust and feature-rich party speaker system designed to deliver loud, clear sound for gatherings, events, and outdoor use\",\"info\":\"Many similar models in this series (like the TT-PSE-8X201) are rated around 160 W RMS output with rechargeable battery operation, wireless mic support, and built-in LED lighting that enhances the party atmosphere.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"473\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:21:01'),
(3582,1,'product',2283,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic CR123AW Lithium Battery\",\"description\":\"The Panasonic CR123AW/1BE Battery (also sold as Panasonic CR123A 3V Lithium Battery) is a 3 V primary lithium battery designed to deliver high energy, stable voltage, and a long shelf life for a wide range of electronic devices.\",\"info\":\"Nominal Voltage: 3 V DC — ideal for devices that demand high, stable voltage.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:21:40'),
(3583,1,'product',2342,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic CR123A 3V battery\",\"description\":\"Panasonic CR123A is a 3 V primary lithium battery widely used for high-performance portable power applications\",\"info\":\"It’s made with lithium manganese dioxide (Li-MnO?) chemistry, offering a high energy density, long shelf life, and reliable performance across a range of devices and environments\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:22:08'),
(3584,1,'product',2458,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3060 RPM Motor\",\"description\":\"A 3060 RPM motor is an electric motor that rotates at a speed of approximately 3060 revolutions per minute (RPM) under rated conditions. RPM (Revolutions Per Minute) indicates how many complete rotations the motor shaft makes in one minute. This type of motor is commonly used in small machines, robotics, DIY projects, fans, pumps, and automation systems where moderate to high rotational speed is required. Most 3060 RPM motors are DC motors, although AC versions are also available depending on the application.\",\"info\":\"Due to its stable speed performance, compact size options, and reliable operation, a 3060 RPM motor is widely preferred in both industrial and hobby-level applications where consistent rotational speed is essential.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Gear Motor\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"In DC motors, speed depends on the applied voltage. For example, a 12V DC motor may provide around 3000–3060 RPM at no load. When a mechanical load is connected, the speed slightly decreases due to torque requirements. These motors may be brushed or brushless types. Brushed DC motors are simple and cost-effective, while brushless motors offer higher efficiency, longer life, and less maintenance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"421\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:22:46'),
(3585,1,'product',2291,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic BR-2/3A 3V battery\",\"description\":\"The Panasonic BR?2/3A Primary Lithium Battery (also seen as BR-2/3AN / BR17335) is a primary (non-rechargeable) cylindrical lithium battery designed for long-lasting, reliable power in various electronic and industrial applications\",\"info\":\"This battery comes from Panasonic Energy, known for quality lithium cells with excellent shelf life and stability\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":11}]}','2026-03-02 11:22:50'),
