(3589,1,'product',2604,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"32 inch smart Tv\",\"description\":\"A 32-inch Smart TV is a compact, connected television designed for modern digital entertainment in bedrooms, small living spaces, kitchens, or offices. It combines a 32-inch HD or Full HD display with built-in smart features such as Wi-Fi connectivity, pre-loaded streaming apps (like YouTube, Netflix, Amazon Prime Video, and more), and an easy-to-navigate user interface , allowing you to watch online content directly without needing external devices.\",\"info\":\"Most 32-inch smart TVs use LED panel technology, providing bright visuals, good color reproduction, and clear picture quality at a small to medium viewing distance. They typically support multiple connectivity options including HDMI, USB, and screen mirroring, so you can connect gaming consoles, set-top boxes, laptops, flash drives, and mobile phones.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"25000.00\",\"note\":\"A 32-inch Smart TV is a compact television with a 32-inch screen size (measured diagonally) that includes built-in internet connectivity and smart features. Unlike normal TVs, a smart TV can connect to Wi-Fi or Ethernet and run streaming applications such as YouTube, Netflix, Prime Video, and other OTT platforms. Most 32-inch smart TVs come with HD Ready (1366 × 768) or Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution, LED display technology, and built-in speakers. This size is ideal for bedrooms, small living rooms, offices, and hostels.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":223,\"secondary_id\":\"393\",\"brand_id\":26}]}','2026-03-02 11:24:40'),
(3590,1,'product',2041,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic Android Remote\",\"description\":\"Make sure the remote lists compatibility with Panasonic Android TV / Smart TV models. According to Panasonic’s official parts page:\",\"info\":\"If the original remote is unavailable, you can pick a replacement by key button features (input, home/apps, Netflix, etc).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":11}]}','2026-03-02 11:24:44'),
(3591,1,'product',2265,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic 6V battery\",\"description\":\"A Panasonic 6V battery is a reliable power source manufactured by Panasonic, known worldwide for high-quality batteries and electronic components.\",\"info\":\"Panasonic 6V batteries are widely used in electronics, industrial equipment, medical devices, and backup power systems due to their safety, durability, and consistent performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":11}]}','2026-03-02 11:25:13'),
(3592,1,'product',2167,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"P321J\",\"description\":\"The P321J is a polyester film capacitor commonly used in electronic circuits for signal coupling, filtering, timing, and noise suppression applications. The marking “321J” typically indicates the capacitor value and tolerance, where 321 represents a capacitance value of 320 pF (0.00032 µF) and J denotes a tolerance of ±5%. Polyester film capacitors are known for their stable electrical characteristics, low loss, and good reliability, making them suitable for both analog and digital electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is non-polarized, meaning it can be connected in any direction within a circuit. It provides good insulation resistance and stable performance over a wide temperature range, which makes it useful in audio circuits, oscillators, timing networks, power supply filtering, and general electronic equipment.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"Polyester capacitors like the P321J are widely used in consumer electronics, communication devices, industrial control boards, and DIY electronics projects due to their durability and consistent capacitance performance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":\"73\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:26:01'),
(3593,1,'product',2605,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Oppo K13x 5G Smartphone\",\"description\":\"The Oppo K13x 5G is an affordable 5G-ready Android smartphone designed to deliver a well-rounded performance with strong battery life, a large display, and capable cameras — making it suitable for everyday use like browsing, streaming, gaming, and social media\",\"info\":\"The phone runs Android 15 with ColorOS 15, bringing modern software features, and also includes 5G connectivity, ensuring future-ready mobile internet speeds. Some variants are built with IP65 water and dust resistance and rugged design elements for everyday reliability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"Oppo K13x\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"12699.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":3,\"secondary_id\":\"399\",\"brand_id\":31}]}','2026-03-02 11:29:16'),
