(3599,1,'product',2495,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"320mah battery  for RC Drone 150mah\",\"description\":\"A 320mAh and 150mAh battery used for RC drones are small-capacity Lithium-Polymer (Li-Po) rechargeable batteries designed for lightweight flying applications. These batteries are commonly used in micro and mini RC drones where size, weight, and quick power delivery are very important. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates capacity; a 320mAh battery provides more backup time compared to a 150mAh battery, but it is slightly heavier.\",\"info\":\"Its robust NEMA 34 frame size ensures durability, effective heat dissipation, and reliable operation in continuous industrial environments, making it a preferred choice for applications where strength, precision, and long service life are critical.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"Both batteries are usually 1S (single cell) 3.7V Li-Po batteries, with a full charge voltage of 4.2V and a cut-off voltage around 3.0V. They are capable of delivering high discharge current, which is necessary for drone motors during takeoff and fast movement. Flight time generally ranges from 3 to 8 minutes depending on drone size, motor efficiency, and flying style. Proper charging using a compatible Li-Po charger is essential to maintain safety and battery life.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772451223715-678247889.jpeg\"}','2026-03-02 11:33:43'),
(3600,1,'product',2055,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ONIDA LED Universal Remote\",\"description\":\"The V4 YY remote is marketed as compatible specifically with Onida LED/LCD TVs\",\"info\":\"includes hot-keys for streaming apps (YouTube, Google Play) in some variants.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1099.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":130}]}','2026-03-02 11:33:53'),
(3601,1,'product',2072,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"oneplus version 3 without voice\",\"description\":\"OnePlus Version 3 Without Voice Remote is a high-quality replacement remote designed for OnePlus Smart TVs. It features a sleek and durable design with a comfortable button layout for smooth navigation. This non-voice remote works perfectly for all OnePlus models that support the Version 3 remote format, offering essential control functions like power, volume, channel, home, back, and menu keys.\",\"info\":\"suitabale for oneplus tv version 3\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"850.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":30}]}','2026-03-02 11:34:28'),
(3602,1,'product',2157,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"32k ohm Resistor\",\"description\":\"A 32kΩ (32,000 ohms) resistor is a passive electronic component used to limit or control the flow of electric current in a circuit. The value 32kΩ means the resistor provides 32,000 ohms of resistance to current flow. Resistors are commonly used in voltage divider circuits, signal conditioning, pull-up or pull-down configurations, timing circuits, and current limiting applications. They are available in both through-hole and surface-mount (SMD) types depending on the circuit design.\",\"info\":\"This resistor is widely used in signal conditioning, timing circuits, sensor interfacing, pull-up/pull-down networks, audio circuits, and microcontroller applications where precise resistance values are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Resistor\",\"mrp\":\"49\",\"note\":\"In color-coded through-hole resistors, a 32kΩ resistor typically has the color bands Orange–Red–Orange–Gold (for ±5% tolerance). In SMD form, it may be marked as “3202”, where 320 × 10² equals 32,000 ohms. Resistors are made from materials like carbon film, metal film, or wire-wound elements. Metal film resistors are preferred in precision circuits because of their better accuracy and low noise characteristics.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":413,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:35:33'),
(3603,1,'product',953,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10 RPM Planetary Gear Motor\",\"description\":\"The 10 RPM Planetary Gear Motor is a precision-engineered DC motor designed for applications requiring very high torque, smooth motion, and excellent load-handling capability\",\"info\":\"10 RPM Planetary Gear Motor is a low-speed, high-torque DC motor designed for applications that need smooth, powerful, and precise rotation. Using a planetary gear system, it delivers higher torque, better efficiency, and longer life compared to standard spur gear motors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":421,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:36:56'),
(3604,1,'product',304,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10.1 Inch HMI with Touch\",\"description\":\"The DMG10600C101_15WTR is a 10.1-inch commercial-grade HMI display module featuring a 1024×600 resolution and a resistive touch panel, designed for embedded systems, automation control, and interactive applications. It offers stable performance, responsive touch control, and cost-effective reliability—ideal for commercial-grade HMI and control panel solutions.\",\"info\":\"Industrial-grade 10.1inch resistive touch HMI display with 1024×600 resolution, RS232/RS485 communication, and SD interface — good for automation and control systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"DMG10600C101_15WTR\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"HMI Display\",\"mrp\":\"12000.00\",\"note\":\"A 10.1 inch HMI (Human Machine Interface) with touch is an industrial display panel used to interact with machines, PLCs, and automation systems through a graphical touch screen interface. The 10.1-inch size refers to the diagonal measurement of the display, providing a clear and comfortable viewing area for monitoring data, controlling processes, and displaying system status.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":44,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:48:45'),
(3605,1,'product',302,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10.1 Inch Resistive Touch Display \",\"description\":\"10.1 inch resistive touch display is a touchscreen module that combines a 10.1-inch LCD screen with resistive touch technology, allowing users to interact with the display by applying pressure using a finger, stylus, or even while wearing gloves. The 10.1-inch size refers to the diagonal measurement of the screen, providing a clear and medium-sized viewing area suitable for industrial, medical, and embedded system applications.\",\"info\":\"The DWIN DMG10600Y101_01NR is a 10.1-inch low-cost TN-TFT LCD display with 1024×600 (WSVGA) resolution and resistive touchscreen overlay\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"DMG10600Y101 DMG10600Y101_01NR\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7650.00\",\"note\":\"These displays commonly use TFT LCD technology with resolutions such as 1024×600 or 1280×800 pixels. They are widely used in industrial control panels, POS systems, medical equipment, CNC machines, and HMI systems because of their durability and ability to operate in harsh environments.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":44,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:54:16'),
(3606,1,'product',300,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10.1 Inch Display (Beauty Grade)\",\"description\":\"10.1 Inch Display (Beauty Grade) refers to a high-quality LCD screen that offers superior visual clarity, brightness, and color accuracy compared to standard-grade panels. The term “Beauty Grade” generally indicates better panel finishing, fewer surface defects, improved viewing angles, and enhanced display uniformity\",\"info\":\"The DMG10600Y101-01NC is a 10.1-inch low-cost LCD display module (Beauty Grade) featuring a 1024 × 600 (WSVGA) resolution panel with 16.7 million colors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"DMG10600Y101-01NC\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"DWIN Display\",\"mrp\":\"9000\",\"note\":\"Beauty Grade displays typically support resolutions such as 1024×600 or 1280×800 pixels, delivering sharp text and clear images. They often feature higher brightness levels and better contrast ratios for improved readability, even in well-lit environments.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":44,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 11:57:03'),
(3607,1,'product',305,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10.1 Inch Modbus TFT LCM (Industrial Grade)\",\"description\":\"The DMG10600T101-A5WTC is a 10.1-inch industrial-grade Modbus TFT LCM (Liquid Crystal Module) featuring a 1024×600 resolution and capacitive multi-touch control. It supports Modbus RTU/TCP communication protocols and is designed for industrial HMI, PLC integration, and automation control systems, providing reliable performance, high visibility, and long service life.\",\"info\":\"10.1inch Modbus TFT LCM — DMG10600T101-A5WTC is an industrial-grade, embedded HMI display featuring a 10.1-inch IPS TFT screen (1024×600) with capacitive touch and rugged design\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"DMG10600T101-A5WTC\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"15002\",\"note\":\"A 10.1 Inch Modbus TFT LCM (Industrial Grade) is a robust industrial display module designed for machine control and monitoring applications. TFT LCM stands for Thin Film Transistor Liquid Crystal Module, which provides clear images, stable performance, and long operational life.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":44,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:20:14'),
(3608,1,'product',2220,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10uF 25V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 10µF 25V capacitor is a low- to medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 10 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is suitable for low-power and signal-level applications.\",\"info\":\"The 10µF 25V capacitor is widely used in microcontroller boards, audio circuits, DC adapters, voltage regulator outputs, signal conditioning circuits, and consumer electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on PCBs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 10µF 25V capacitor is an electronic component used to store and release electrical energy in a circuit. The value 10 microfarads (µF) indicates the capacitance, which determines how much charge the capacitor can store, while 25V represents the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely handle.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:21:30'),
(3609,1,'product',2241,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10uF 350V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 10µF 350V capacitor is a high-voltage capacitor commonly used in power supply circuits, SMPS (Switched Mode Power Supplies), amplifiers, and inverter circuits. The value 10 microfarads (µF) indicates the capacitance, which determines how much electrical charge the capacitor can store, while 350V represents the maximum voltage it can safely handle. This type of capacitor is typically used in circuits where high DC voltage is present, such as rectified mains power sections.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor helps smooth DC voltage, reduce ripple noise, and stabilize circuit performance. Built for reliable operation, it offers good endurance and stable electrical characteristics.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"Most 10µF 350V capacitors are electrolytic capacitors, which are polarized components and must be connected with correct polarity (positive and negative terminals). They are designed to smooth high-voltage DC output, filter ripple voltage, and stabilize power supply lines. Because of the high voltage rating, these capacitors are physically larger compared to low-voltage capacitors of the same capacitance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:26:05'),
(3610,1,'product',2177,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10uF 450V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"10µF 450V capacitor is a high-voltage electrolytic capacitor designed to store and release electrical energy while maintaining stable voltage in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 10 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 450 volts, it is commonly used in power electronics where high DC voltage handling is required.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is typically polarized, meaning it has positive and negative terminals that must be connected correctly to avoid damage. It is widely used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in power supply circuits, especially after rectifiers to reduce voltage ripple. Due to its high voltage rating, it is well-suited for SMPS (Switched Mode Power Supplies), inverters, amplifiers, UPS systems, LED drivers, and industrial control circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 10µF 450V capacitor is a high-voltage electrolytic capacitor designed to store electrical energy and filter high DC voltages in electronic circuits. The value 10 microfarads (µF) represents the capacitance, which indicates the amount of charge it can store, while 450 volts (V) is the maximum voltage it can safely withstand.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:27:15'),
(3611,1,'product',2231,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 10µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, coupling, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 10 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that require higher voltage tolerance than standard low-voltage capacitors.\",\"info\":\"The 10µF 63V capacitor is widely used in power supplies, audio circuits, SMPS sections, voltage regulator inputs/outputs, industrial control boards, and general consumer electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on printed circuit boards.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"10µF 63V capacitor is an electronic component used to store and release electrical energy in a circuit. The value 10 microfarads (µF) indicates its capacitance, which determines how much charge it can store, while 63 volts (V) is the maximum voltage it can safely handle.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:28:24'),
(3612,1,'category',567,'create',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-02 12:33:13'),
(3613,1,'category_brand_mapping',567,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[230,228,232]}\"','2026-03-02 12:34:02'),
(3614,1,'product',2139,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"12V Voltage Regulator Power Supply Board\",\"description\":\"Most 12V regulator boards use linear voltage regulator ICs such as 7812 or switching regulator circuits (buck converters). Linear regulators are simple and low-noise but may generate more heat, while switching regulators are more efficient and suitable for higher current applications. The board typically includes components such as filter capacitors, heat sinks, rectifier diodes (if AC input), and protection circuits to improve performance and safety.\",\"info\":\"It ensures consistent voltage for sensitive electronics by filtering noise and compensating for input/load variations. These boards are available in linear (clean output, more heat) and switching/buck (high efficiency, low heat) designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Power Supply Board\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"A 12V Voltage Regulator Power Supply Board is an electronic module designed to provide a stable and regulated 12V DC output from a higher or fluctuating input voltage. It is commonly used in electronic circuits, robotics, Arduino projects, CCTV systems, LED strips, and industrial control systems where a constant 12V supply is required. The board ensures that even if the input voltage changes slightly, the output remains steady at 12V, protecting connected components from voltage variations.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":10,\"secondary_id\":\"567\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:36:23'),
(3615,1,'product',2548,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1300mah battery\",\"description\":\"A 1300mAh battery is a medium-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in portable electronic devices such as RC cars, drones, Bluetooth speakers, emergency lights, and DIY electronics projects. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates the battery’s capacity, meaning a 1300mAh battery can theoretically deliver 1300 milliamps (1.3A) of current for one hour, or lower current for a longer duration depending on the load. The actual backup time depends on the device’s power consumption and operating conditions.\",\"info\":\"It is widely used in portable electronics, IoT devices, robotics, RC equipment, and DIY projects where longer backup time is required compared to smaller cells (400–500 mAh).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"Most 1300mAh batteries are Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) types due to their lightweight design, high energy density, and rechargeable capability. They typically have a nominal voltage of 3.7V per cell, with a full charge voltage of 4.2V and a cut-off voltage around 3.0V. In RC and drone applications, higher discharge rates (C-rating) are important to supply sufficient current to motors during operation.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:37:48'),
(3616,1,'product',296,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"15.6inch DMG 19108 C156 05 WTC 2K HD\",\"description\":\"The DMG19108C156_05WTC is a 15.6-inch industrial-grade capacitive touch display with 2K Full HD (1920×1080) resolution, offering crystal-clear visuals, precise touch response, and durable performance. It’s designed for industrial automation, kiosks, digital signage, embedded systems, and smart HMI panels, ensuring high reliability and long operational life.\",\"info\":\"The 15.6inch DMG19108C156_05WTC is a commercial-grade capacitive touchscreen display featuring a 15.6-inch IPS panel with 1920×1080 (Full HD / 2K HD) resolution.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"DWIN Display\",\"mrp\":\"18400.00\",\"note\":\"It’s designed for industrial automation, kiosks, digital signage, embedded systems, and smart HMI panels, ensuring high reliability and long operational life.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"40\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:38:39'),
(3617,1,'product',1231,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"15.6inch HDMI LCD Monitor with Touch Panel RASPBERRY PI\",\"description\":\"15.6-inch HDMI LCD monitor with touch panel designed for Raspberry Pi is a portable full-size display that supports both video input through HDMI and touch input through USB. The 15.6-inch size (measured diagonally) provides a large and clear viewing area, making it suitable for projects such as kiosks, embedded systems, industrial control panels, smart mirrors, portable PCs, and development setups. It commonly features Full HD resolution (1920×1080) with IPS technology, offering wide viewing angles, good color reproduction, and sharp image clarity.\",\"info\":\"It offers a Full HD (1920×1080) IPS panel with wide viewing angles and vibrant 16.7M color support, making it suitable for multimedia, dashboards, kiosks, and interactive embedded projects\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Display\",\"mrp\":\"15600.00\",\"note\":\"This monitor connects to a Raspberry Pi using an HDMI cable for video output and a USB cable for touch functionality. Most models support plug-and-play operation with Raspberry Pi OS, Windows, and Linux systems. The touch panel is usually capacitive (multi-touch support), providing smooth and responsive interaction similar to a tablet. Some versions may include built-in speakers, audio output jack, and on-screen display (OSD) controls for brightness and contrast adjustment.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":323,\"secondary_id\":\"49\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:41:20'),
(3618,1,'product',2549,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1500mah battery\",\"description\":\"A 1500mAh battery is a rechargeable battery commonly used in portable electronic devices such as Bluetooth speakers, emergency lights, RC toys, medical devices, and DIY electronics projects. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates the battery capacity, meaning a 1500mAh battery can theoretically supply 1500 milliamps (1.5A) for one hour, or 500 milliamps for approximately three hours, depending on the load. The actual backup time varies based on device power consumption and efficiency.\",\"info\":\"It is ideal for portable electronics, IoT, robotics, and DIY projects that need sustained power without frequent recharging.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"Most 1500mAh batteries are Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) types because they offer high energy density, lightweight design, and good recharge cycle life. A typical single-cell battery has a nominal voltage of 3.7V, a full charge voltage of 4.2V, and a cut-off voltage around 3.0V. The stored energy in a 3.7V 1500mAh battery is approximately 5.55Wh (3.7V × 1.5Ah). These batteries usually support 300–800 charge cycles when properly maintained.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:42:39'),
(3619,1,'product',2246,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1500uF 6.3V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"The 1500µF 6.3V capacitor is a low-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor widely used for power filtering and voltage stabilization in electronic circuits. It helps smooth DC output by reducing ripple and electrical noise.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is commonly found in motherboards, SMPS circuits, and low-voltage power supply applications. It offers reliable performance with good capacitance stability and long operating life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"note\":\"A 1500µF 6.3V capacitor is a high-capacitance, low-voltage electrolytic capacitor commonly used in power supply filtering and voltage stabilization circuits. The value 1500 microfarads (µF) indicates a large charge storage capacity, making it suitable for smoothing ripple voltage and stabilizing DC output in low-voltage electronic systems. The 6.3V rating means the capacitor can safely operate in circuits where the voltage does not exceed 6.3 volts.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:43:47'),
(3620,1,'product',2236,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1500uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 1500µF 63V capacitor is a high-capacitance, medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used for bulk filtering, smoothing, and energy storage in electronic power circuits. With a capacitance of 1500 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is well suited for applications that require stable voltage delivery and effective ripple reduction at higher operating voltages.\",\"info\":\"The 1500µF 63V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS secondary sections, motor driver circuits, industrial control boards, and high-power electronic equipment. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and long-term reliable operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"1500µF 63V capacitor is a high-capacitance electrolytic capacitor designed for medium-voltage power supply and filtering applications. The value 1500 microfarads (µF) indicates that it can store a large amount of electrical charge, making it ideal for smoothing ripple voltage and stabilizing DC output. The 63V rating means it can safely operate in circuits where the voltage does not exceed 63 volts. This capacitor is commonly used in amplifier circuits, inverter boards, SMPS outputs, motor driver circuits, and industrial power supply systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:44:43'),
(3621,1,'product',294,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"18.5inch DMG 19108 C185 05 WTC 2K HD\",\"description\":\"The DMG19108C185_05WTC is a large-format 18.5-inch industrial-grade TFT display featuring a 2K HD resolution, capacitive multi-touch, and high-brightness IPS panel.Built for industrial control systems, automation, kiosks, and digital signage, it offers sharp visuals, robust durability, and long-life reliability for 24/7 operation.\",\"info\":\"The 18.5inch DMG19108C185_05WTC 2K HD Commercial-Grade Smart Screen is a large 18.5-inch IPS TFT LCD display with 1920 × 1080 (Full HD) resolution and a capacitive touch panel, designed for commercial applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"DWIN Display\",\"mrp\":\"22500.00\",\"note\":\"Built for industrial control systems, automation, kiosks, and digital signage, it offers sharp visuals, robust durability, and long-life reliability for 24/7 operation.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"40\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:48:39'),
(3622,1,'product',2427,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3.2 inch LCD Display\",\"description\":\"A 3.2-inch display refers to the diagonal size of the screen — about 3.2 inches corner-to-corner — used for showing graphical content like text, images, and user interfaces on small embedded systems, microcontroller projects, handheld devices, and similar applications\",\"info\":\"These displays are typically TFT (Thin Film Transistor) LCD panels with resolutions around 240 × 320 pixels, providing color graphics and touch capability in many cases.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"LCD Display \",\"mrp\":\"494\",\"note\":\"A 3.2 inch LCD display is a compact screen module commonly used in embedded systems, Arduino projects, Raspberry Pi applications, industrial instruments, and DIY electronics. The 3.2-inch measurement refers to the diagonal size of the display, offering a small yet clear viewing area suitable for graphical user interfaces, sensor data display, menus, and touch-based controls. Most 3.2 inch LCD modules use TFT (Thin Film Transistor) technology, providing better color quality and faster response compared to basic character LCDs.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:50:31'),
(3623,1,'product',2196,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3.3uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 3.3µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage capacitor used in electronic circuits for signal coupling, decoupling, timing, and filtering where higher DC voltage handling is required\",\"info\":\"This value is commonly available in aluminum electrolytic (polarized) and film (non-polarized) types.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"3.3µF 250V capacitor is an electronic component used to store and release electrical energy in medium to high-voltage circuits. The value 3.3 microfarads (µF) indicates the capacitance, which determines how much charge it can store, while the 250V rating represents the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely handle.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:51:40'),
(3624,1,'product',2237,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3.3uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 3.3µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for signal coupling, filtering, and decoupling in electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"The 3.3µF 63V capacitor is widely used in audio circuits, power supplies, SMPS sections, voltage regulator stages, timing circuits, and consumer electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on printed circuit boards.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 3.3 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that require small capacitance with higher voltage tolerance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:52:24'),
(3625,1,'product',2263,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3.6V 2000 mAh battery\",\"description\":\"A 3.6V 2000 mAh battery is a rechargeable lithium-based battery commonly used in electronic devices that require stable voltage and long backup time.\",\"info\":\"This battery is often available in Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-thionyl chloride (Li-SOCl?) variants. The rechargeable Li-ion version is widely used due to its high energy density, lightweight design, and long cycle life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"491\",\"note\":\"It provides a nominal voltage of 3.6 volts with a capacity of 2000 milliampere-hours, making it suitable for both low-power and medium-power applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:53:21'),
(3626,1,'product',2312,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3.6V LS Battery\",\"description\":\"3.6V LS battery is a high-performance Lithium Thionyl Chloride (Li-SOCl₂) primary (non-rechargeable) battery commonly used in industrial and long-life electronic applications. The “LS” series batteries are known for their high energy density, stable 3.6V output, and very low self-discharge rate, making them ideal for devices that require long-term, reliable power.\",\"info\":\"They deliver a nominal voltage of ~3.6 V and high energy density with very low self-discharge, making them ideal for devices that need long service life and stable performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"A key feature of the 3.6V LS battery is its long shelf life, often up to 10–20 years depending on usage and storage conditions. It can operate across a wide temperature range, typically from -55°C to +85°C, making it suitable for harsh environments.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:55:00'),
(3627,1,'category_brand_mapping',516,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[230,228,232]}\"','2026-03-02 12:57:17'),
(3628,1,'product',2516,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"300mm lead screw with Nut\",\"description\":\"A 300mm lead screw with nut is a mechanical component used to convert rotational motion into linear motion. It consists of a threaded rod (lead screw) of 300 millimeters length and a matching nut that moves along the screw when it rotates. When the screw is turned using a motor or hand rotation, the nut travels forward or backward depending on the direction of rotation. Lead screws are commonly used in CNC machines, 3D printers, linear actuators, and automation systems for precise positioning and controlled movement.\",\"info\":\"It consists of a lead screw (threaded rod) that is 300 mm long and a matching nut (often a brass or Delrin nut), which travels up and down the screw as it rotates. These are widely used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and automation systems for accurate positioning.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Screw Driver\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"Lead screws are typically made of stainless steel or carbon steel for strength and durability, while the nut is often made of brass or bronze to reduce friction and wear. A common type is the T8 lead screw, which usually has an 8mm diameter. The pitch (distance between threads) determines how much the nut moves per rotation. For example, in a T8 lead screw with 2mm pitch and 4 starts, the lead may be 8mm per rotation.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":516,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:57:50'),
(3629,1,'product',2165,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3055T\",\"description\":\"The 3055T (2N3055T) is a high-power NPN bipolar junction transistor commonly used in power amplifier and voltage regulator circuits.\",\"info\":\"The transistor offers good thermal stability and reliable performance in audio amplifiers, power supplies, and inverter circuits. Its compact TO-220 package allows easy mounting with a heatsink for better heat dissipation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Transistor\",\"mrp\":\"101\",\"note\":\"It is designed for switching and amplification applications requiring high current handling capability.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":414,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 12:59:15');
INSERT INTO `audit_logs` VALUES
(3630,1,'product',2214,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3300uF 16V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 3300µF 16V capacitor is a high-capacitance, low-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for bulk filtering, smoothing, and energy storage in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 3300 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 16 volts DC, it is ideal for low-voltage power applications that require strong ripple suppression and stable voltage delivery.\",\"info\":\"The 3300µF 16V capacitor is widely used in audio amplifiers, DC power supplies, LED driver circuits, motor control boards, SMPS secondary sections, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and long-term durability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 3300µF 16V capacitor is a high-capacitance electrolytic capacitor commonly used in low-voltage power supply and filtering applications. The value 3300 microfarads (µF) indicates a large charge storage capacity, making it highly effective for smoothing ripple voltage and stabilizing DC output. The 16V rating means it can safely operate in circuits where the voltage does not exceed 16 volts. This capacitor is widely used in SMPS output stages, audio amplifier circuits, DC motor driver boards, LED power supplies, and microcontroller-based systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:00:18'),
(3631,1,'product',2207,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3300uF 25V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"3300µF 25V capacitor is a high-capacitance aluminum electrolytic capacitor widely used for bulk energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in low- to medium-voltage electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 3300 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is ideal for applications that require effective ripple reduction and stable power delivery.\",\"info\":\"3300µF 25V capacitor is frequently used in audio amplifiers, DC power supplies, motor driver circuits, LED power supplies, SMPS secondary sections, and consumer electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, suitable for PCB mounting and reliable long-term operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 3300µF 25V capacitor is a high-capacitance electrolytic capacitor mainly used in power supply filtering and voltage stabilization circuits. The value 3300 microfarads (µF) indicates that it can store a large amount of electrical charge, making it very effective in reducing ripple voltage and smoothing DC output after rectification. The 25V rating means the capacitor can safely operate in circuits where the working voltage does not exceed 25 volts. It is commonly used in audio amplifier circuits, SMPS output sections, DC motor drivers, inverter boards, and 12V–24V power supply systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:01:25'),
(3632,1,'product',2218,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"330uF 25V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 330µF 25V capacitor is a low- to medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 330 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is suitable for a wide range of general-purpose power and signal applications.\",\"info\":\"The 330µF 25V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio circuits, microcontroller boards, LED driver circuits, voltage regulator outputs, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 330µF 25V capacitor is an electrolytic capacitor commonly used in low to medium voltage electronic circuits for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling purposes. The value 330 microfarads (µF) indicates the amount of charge it can store, while the 25V rating specifies the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely handle. It is widely used in power supply sections, audio amplifier circuits, voltage regulator outputs, LED driver circuits, and microcontroller boards to reduce ripple voltage and stabilize DC output.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:02:33'),
(3633,1,'product',2226,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"330uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 330µF 50V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 330 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is suitable for power supply and control circuits that operate at moderate voltage levels.\",\"info\":\"The 330µF 50V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS secondary circuits, motor driver boards, LED driver circuits, and industrial electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on printed circuit boards and ensuring reliable long-term operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 330µF 50V capacitor is a medium-capacitance electrolytic capacitor used in electronic circuits for filtering, smoothing, coupling, and decoupling applications. The value 330 microfarads (µF) indicates the charge storage capacity, while the 50V rating specifies the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely withstand. This makes it suitable for circuits operating below 50 volts, such as amplifier circuits, power supply sections, motor driver boards, and industrial control systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:03:23'),
(3634,1,'product',2179,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"33uF 160V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 33µF 160V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used to store energy, smooth DC voltage, and reduce ripple in electronic circuits that operate at higher voltages\",\"info\":\"It is a polarized component, so correct polarity must be observed during installation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 33µF 160V capacitor is a medium-capacitance, high-voltage electrolytic capacitor commonly used in power supply and amplifier circuits. The value 33 microfarads (µF) represents the amount of electrical charge it can store, while the 160V rating indicates the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely handle. It is typically used in rectified DC sections, SMPS circuits, audio amplifiers, inverter boards, and industrial electronic systems where moderate capacitance and higher voltage tolerance are required.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:04:42'),
(3635,1,'product',2193,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"33uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 33µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used to store energy, smooth DC voltage, and reduce ripple in electronic circuits that operate at elevated voltages\",\"info\":\"It is a polarized component, so correct polarity must be maintained during installation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 33µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage electrolytic capacitor used in power supply, SMPS (Switched Mode Power Supply), amplifier, and inverter circuits. The value 33 microfarads (µF) indicates its charge storage capacity, while the 250V rating specifies the maximum voltage it can safely withstand. This makes it suitable for medium to high-voltage DC sections, especially after rectification in AC-to-DC conversion circuits.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:05:48'),
(3636,1,'product',2238,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"33uf 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 33µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, coupling, and decoupling in electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"A 33µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, coupling, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 33 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that require moderate capacitance with higher voltage tolerance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 33 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that require moderate capacitance with higher voltage tolerance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:06:53'),
(3637,1,'product',2525,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"350Mah battery\",\"description\":\"A 350mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth headsets, wearable gadgets, mini speakers, toys, and small IoT modules. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates the battery capacity, meaning a 350mAh battery can theoretically supply 350 milliamps of current for one hour, or 175 milliamps for about two hours, depending on the device load. The actual backup time varies based on power consumption and efficiency of the connected device.\",\"info\":\"Due to their compact size, they are ideal where space is limited, but they are not suitable for high-current or long-duration power needs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"500\",\"note\":\"Most 350mAh batteries are Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) types because they are lightweight, compact, and offer good energy density. A typical single-cell 350mAh battery has a nominal voltage of 3.7V, a full charge voltage of 4.2V, and a cut-off voltage around 3.0V. The approximate energy stored in a 3.7V 350mAh battery is about 1.30Wh (3.7V × 0.35Ah). These batteries generally support several hundred charge cycles when properly maintained.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:08:20'),
(3638,1,'product',2524,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3D printer Auto bed leveling sensor\",\"description\":\"An Auto Bed Leveling (ABL) Sensor for a 3D printer is a probe that automatically measures the height of the print bed at multiple points and lets the printer compensate for surface irregularities during printing.\",\"info\":\"This dramatically improves first-layer adhesion and print quality, especially on large or slightly warped beds.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"A 3D printer auto bed leveling (ABL) sensor is a device used to automatically measure and adjust the distance between the printer nozzle and the print bed.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"63\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:16:46'),
(3639,1,'product',2522,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3D printer Endstop\",\"description\":\"3D Printer Endstop (also called a limit switch) is a sensor used in 3D printers to detect the position of moving parts like the print head or the bed. \",\"info\":\"Endstops tell the controller when an axis has reached its limit, so the printer can accurately home and prevent crashes.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"Endstops tell the controller when an axis has reached its limit, so the printer can accurately home and prevent crashes.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"24\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:20:26'),
(3640,1,'product',2526,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3D printer Filament ABS 1.7mm\",\"description\":\"ABS (Acrylonitrile Butadiene Styrene) is a widely used thermoplastic filament for FDM/FFF 3D printers. It offers good strength, impact resistance, and durability, making it ideal for functional parts rather than just decorative prints\",\"info\":\"1.75 mm is the standard for most consumer FDM printers today. A few older or specialty printers use 3.0/3.00 mm (2.85 mm) filament\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"ABS (Acrylonitrile Butadiene Styrene) 1.75mm filament is a popular thermoplastic material used in FDM (Fused Deposition Modeling) 3D printers. The 1.75mm refers to the filament diameter, which is the standard size compatible with most desktop 3D printers. ABS is known for its strength, durability, impact resistance, and heat resistance, making it suitable for functional parts, mechanical components, automotive parts, and enclosures.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"18\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:23:50'),
