(3643,1,'product',2558,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3MM-Heat Shrink sleeve-black\",\"description\":\"Heat shrink sleeve is an insulating tube used to protect and cover electrical wire joints, soldered connections, and cable terminals. It shrinks tightly around wires when heat is applied using a heat gun, providing strong insulation and mechanical protection.\",\"info\":\"Manufactured from high-quality polyolefin material, it shrinks evenly when heat is applied, forming a tight, durable, and moisture-resistant covering around conductors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Heat Shrink Sleeve\",\"mrp\":\"99\",\"note\":\"It is commonly made from polyolefin material and is available in different sizes, colors, and shrink ratios such as 2:1 or 3:1. Heat shrink sleeves help prevent short circuits, protect against moisture and dust, and improve the overall durability of wiring connections.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":568,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:32:31'),
(3644,1,'product',2285,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3V CR6 L battery\",\"description\":\"The CR6 battery is typically cylindrical or specially shaped depending on the manufacturer and application. It is designed to deliver steady voltage even under moderate load conditions, which is important for camera flash systems and precision electronics. These batteries usually have a long storage life (up to 5–10 years) when kept in proper conditions.\",\"info\":\"CR6 is a primary lithium battery, it should not be recharged, as this can cause leakage or damage. Proper polarity installation is important for safe operation. The battery is widely valued for its compact size, lightweight design, and dependable performance in portable electronic devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"A 3V CR6 battery is a lithium primary (non-rechargeable) battery commonly used in cameras, photo equipment, medical devices, and certain electronic instruments. It provides a stable 3 volts DC output, making it suitable for devices that require consistent and reliable power.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:36:45'),
(3645,1,'product',2309,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3V CR6.L Battery\",\"description\":\"The 3V CR6.L Lithium Battery is a high-capacity, non-rechargeable lithium battery designed for devices that demand reliable power, long operating life, and consistent voltage output. \",\"info\":\"The CR6.L 3V lithium battery is typically available in single-pack or bulk packaging, suitable for both retail and industrial use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"Known for its strong performance and durability, the CR6.L battery is commonly used in cameras, medical devices, and professional electronic equipment.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:37:18'),
(3646,1,'product',2309,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3V CR6.L Battery\",\"description\":\"The 3V CR6.L Lithium Battery is a high-capacity, non-rechargeable lithium battery designed for devices that demand reliable power, long operating life, and consistent voltage output. \",\"info\":\"The CR6.L 3V lithium battery is typically available in single-pack or bulk packaging, suitable for both retail and industrial use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"Known for its strong performance and durability, the CR6.L battery is commonly used in cameras, medical devices, and professional electronic equipment.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":62,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:38:32'),
(3647,1,'product',2185,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4.7uF 160V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"4.7µF 160V capacitor is a medium-capacitance, high-voltage capacitor commonly used in power supply and amplifier circuits. The value 4.7 microfarads (µF) indicates the amount of electrical charge it can store, while the 160V rating represents the maximum voltage it can safely withstand. It is typically used in rectified DC sections, SMPS (Switched Mode Power Supply) circuits, inverter boards, and audio systems where moderate capacitance and higher voltage tolerance are required.\",\"info\":\"This value is commonly available as an aluminum electrolytic (polarized) or a film capacitor (non-polarized), depending on stability and lifetime requirements.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"Most 4.7µF 160V capacitors are electrolytic capacitors, which are polarized components and must be connected with correct positive (+) and negative (–) polarity. They help smooth DC voltage, reduce ripple, filter noise, and stabilize circuit performance. Because of the higher voltage rating, they are physically larger than low-voltage capacitors of similar capacitance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:39:40'),
(3648,1,'product',2188,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4.7uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"4.7µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage capacitor commonly used in power supply circuits, SMPS (Switched Mode Power Supply) units, audio amplifiers, and inverter boards. The value 4.7 microfarads (µF) indicates its charge storage capacity, while the 250V rating specifies the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely handle. It is typically used in rectified DC sections and high-voltage filtering applications where moderate capacitance and reliable voltage stability are required.\",\"info\":\"This value is commonly available as an aluminum electrolytic (polarized) or a film capacitor (non-polarized), depending on application requirements.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"Most 4.7µF 250V capacitors are electrolytic capacitors, which are polarized and must be connected with correct positive (+) and negative (–) terminals. They help smooth DC voltage, reduce ripple, suppress noise, and stabilize circuit performance. Due to the higher voltage rating, these capacitors are larger in size compared to low-voltage types.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:41:08'),
(3649,1,'product',2190,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4.7uF 400V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 4.7µF 400V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used in electronic circuits that require reliable performance at elevated DC voltages.\",\"info\":\"4.7µF 400V capacitor is widely used in SMPS power supplies, LED drivers, inverters, audio amplifiers, UPS systems, and industrial electronic equipment. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical package with an insulated aluminum body for durability and safe PCB mounting.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 4.7 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 400 volts DC, it is ideal for applications where voltage handling is more critical than large capacitance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:41:43'),
(3650,1,'product',2192,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4.7uF 450V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"4.7µF 450V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for use in electronic circuits that operate at very high DC voltages.\",\"info\":\"4.7µF 450V capacitor is widely used in SMPS power supplies, LED drivers, inverters, audio amplifiers, UPS systems, and industrial electronic equipment. It is typically available in a radial-leaded cylindrical aluminum body, insulated for safety and reliable PCB mounting.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 4.7 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 450 volts DC, it is commonly used where compact size and high voltage tolerance are required.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:42:43'),
(3651,1,'product',2232,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4.7uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 4.7µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, coupling, and decoupling in electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"The 4.7µF 63V capacitor is widely used in audio circuits, power supplies, SMPS sections, voltage regulator outputs, control circuits, and consumer electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 4.7 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that require modest capacitance with higher voltage tolerance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:43:31'),
(3652,1,'product',2577,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"400KV Step up power module\",\"description\":\"A 400 kV Step-Up Power Module is a small high-voltage boost converter that takes a low DC input (typically 3 V–6 V) and generates a very high-voltage output (up to ~400,000 V) using pulse transformer/boost circuitry.\",\"info\":\"These modules are often used in novelty high-voltage generators, science experiments, ion/ozone generators, or educational demonstrations\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Step up power module\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"A 400KV step-up power module is a high-voltage DC boost converter designed to convert low DC input voltage (typically 3V–6V or 5V–12V) into a very high voltage output. Despite the “400KV” label, most small modules do not actually produce a continuous 400 kilovolts; instead, they generate high-voltage pulses capable of producing visible electric arcs.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"59\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-02 13:45:22'),
