(3654,1,'product',2073,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"oneplus smart tv remote\",\"description\":\"Voice/Google Assistant support: Many newer OnePlus TVs support voice commands via the remote (mic button) or via pairing\",\"info\":\"Model compatibility: OnePlus lists specific remote models. For example: “RC-002B” works with OnePlus TV Y Series (32/40/43 Y1) and “RC-004D” works with U Series (50/55/65 U1S) and Y Series newer models.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"470\",\"brand_id\":30}]}','2026-03-03 03:24:58'),
(3655,1,'product',2260,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"One Bolt ONB-011 Earbuds\",\"description\":\"One Bolt ONB-011 Earbuds are stylish and compact true wireless Bluetooth earbuds designed for everyday music listening and calling. These earbuds provide clear sound quality with balanced bass, making them suitable for music, online classes, and hands-free calls. The lightweight in-ear design ensures a comfortable fit for long usage, while the portable charging case allows easy carrying and extended battery backup.\",\"info\":\"The ONB-011 earbuds typically support Bluetooth connectivity for quick pairing with smartphones, tablets, and laptops. They come with built-in microphones for clear voice calls and touch/button controls for managing music and calls. With rechargeable battery support and a sleek modern look, One Bolt ONB-011 earbuds are ideal for daily use at home, office, travel, or workouts.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":212,\"secondary_id\":\"97\",\"brand_id\":147}]}','2026-03-03 03:30:21'),
(3656,1,'product',2069,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Ondia ADE 135\",\"description\":\"Onida ADE 135 Remote is a reliable and easy-to-use replacement remote control designed specifically for Onida televisions. Built with high-quality materials, it offers durable performance and smooth button operation for effortless navigation. The remote provides all essential TV functions such as power, volume, channel selection, input source, menu control, and more, ensuring a seamless viewing experience.\",\"info\":\"Onida\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"950.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":130}]}','2026-03-03 03:30:54'),
(3657,1,'product',2057,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OND RC-2213 LCD Remote\",\"description\":\"This remote is sold as a replacement/compatible remote for Onida brand LCD/LED TVs (model remote/no. 2213) rather than an original Onida-branded remote\",\"info\":\"“Compatible Onida LCD/LED TV Remote No. 2213\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"OND RC-2213\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"799.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:31:26'),
(3658,1,'product',2133,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OLED Display Module\",\"description\":\"The OLED Display Module (Organic Light Emitting Diode Display) is a compact and energy-efficient display device widely used in embedded systems and IoT projects for showing text, graphics, and sensor data. Unlike traditional LCD displays, OLED technology does not require a backlight because each pixel emits its own light, resulting in high contrast, wide viewing angles, faster response time, and lower power consumption. This makes OLED displays highly suitable for portable and battery-powered electronic devices.\",\"info\":\"Most OLED modules commonly use display sizes such as 0.96 inch or 1.3 inch with resolutions like 128×64 or 128×32 pixels. They typically communicate using I2C or SPI interfaces, allowing easy connection with microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and STM32 boards. The module operates at 3.3V or 5V, and includes an onboard controller (commonly SSD1306 or SH1106) that simplifies display control through available software libraries.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"OLED display modules are widely used in IoT dashboards, wearable devices, digital meters, sensor monitoring systems, robotics, smart home projects, and portable instruments. Due to their small size, clear visibility, low power usage, and simple interfacing, OLED displays are one of the most popular display solutions for modern electronics and embedded development projects.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"438\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:32:10'),
(3659,1,'product',232,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OLED 1.3inch Blue 4 pin\",\"description\":\"OLED 1.3inch Blue 4-Pin Display is a compact OLED screen offering a bright blue display with high contrast and low power consumption\",\"info\":\"It typically uses a 4-pin I²C interface (VCC, GND, SDA, SCL), making it easy to connect with Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and other microcontrollers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1300.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"438\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:32:43'),
(3660,1,'product',209,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OLED 0.96inch Blue 4 pin\",\"description\":\"OLED 0.96inchBlue 4-Pin Display is a compact OLED screen commonly used in microcontroller projects. It features a bright blue display with high contrast and low power consumption.\",\"info\":\"The 4-pin interface (VCC, GND, SDA, SCL) typically supports I²C communication, making it easy to connect with Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and similar boards\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"540.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"438\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:33:14'),
(3661,1,'product',1411,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NX8048K070 – Nextion 7.0 inchs HMI Touch Display\",\"description\":\"The NX8048K070 from the Nextion Enhanced Series is a 7.0-inch HMI (Human-Machine Interface) touch display module that comes with its own on-board microcontroller, GUI capability, and a serial (UART) interface.\",\"info\":\"Screen size: 7.0? diagonal with resolution 800 × 480 pixels. Visual/active area: ~ 154.08 mm × 85.92 mm (visual area) and module layout size ~ 181 mm × 108 mm × 9.3 mm.  Colours: 65K (65,536) colours. \\r\\nFlash storage: 32 MB for GUI data and resources. \\r\\nRAM: 8192 bytes (8 KB) for runtime.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"11000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"52\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:34:26'),
(3662,1,'product',1416,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NX4832K035 – Nextion 3.5inch HMI Touch Display\",\"description\":\"The NX4832K035 is a 3.5-inch (diagonal) HMI touch display module from the Nextion Enhanced Series. It’s not just a raw TFT + touch panel: it incorporates a built-in controller + flash storage + user I/O so you can design user interfaces (UI) using Nextion’s editor and interact over UART from a microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"Display resolution: 480 × 320 pixels. \\r\\nColour depth: 65K colours (16-bit, 5R-6G-5B). \\r\\nFlash memory: 32 MB for storing images, fonts and UI resources. \\r\\nRAM: 8192 bytes (8 KB) for variables, etc. \\r\\nEEPROM user storage: 1024 bytes.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7800.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"52\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:35:20'),
(3663,1,'product',1414,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NX4024K032 – Nextion 3.2inch HMI Touch Display\",\"description\":\"This is the 3.2-inch “Enhanced Series” HMI touchscreen from Nextion (model NX4024K032). The “Enhanced” series means it’s a step up from their Basic line: more flash memory, IO/GPIO support, RTC support, etc.\",\"info\":\"Screen Size: 3.2? diagonal. \\r\\nResolution: 400 × 240 pixels. \\r\\nMemory: 16 MB of Flash (for UI/resources). \\r\\nRAM / EEPROM: 3 584 bytes RAM + 1 024 bytes EEPROM. \\r\\nInterface: TTL serial (4-pin XH2.54) for RX/TX + power.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"7500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"52\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:36:09'),
(3664,1,'product',1417,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NX3224K028 – Nextion 2.8 inch HMI Touch Display\",\"description\":\"The NX3224K028 is a 2.8-inch HMI (Human-Machine Interface) touchscreen module from the Nextion Enhanced Series. It’s more than just a display + touch panel: it includes a built-in controller, flash storage for UI data, and supports functions such as RTC, GPIO, etc.\",\"info\":\"A compact 2.8-inch Enhanced Series Human-Machine Interface (HMI) touch display with 320×240 TFT resistive touchscreen, designed for easy graphical interface control in embedded and IoT projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"8000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"52\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:36:45'),
(3665,1,'product',1320,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO-F401RE STM32 Development Board\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F401RE is a compact and versatile 32-bit STM32 development board from STMicroelectronics built around the STM32F401RET6 ARM Cortex-M4 microcontroller\",\"info\":\"It’s designed for rapid prototyping and embedded system development, offering Arduino Uno R3 compatibility, ST Morpho expansion headers, and an integrated ST-LINK debugger/programmer — all in a low-cost, flexible platform\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2650.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"177\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:37:29'),
(3666,1,'product',1323,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO F446RE\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F446RE is a compact STM32 Nucleo-64 development board from STMicroelectronics built around the STM32F446RET6 ARM Cortex-M4 microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"It provides an affordable and flexible platform for embedded system prototyping and learning, with built-in ST-LINK/V2-1 programmer/debugger, Arduino Uno R3 compatibility, and ST Morpho expansion headers to connect shields and modules easily.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"3100.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"177\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:37:56'),
(3667,1,'product',1326,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO F411RE\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F411RE is a compact and affordable STM32 Nucleo-64 development board from STMicroelectronics built around the STM32F411RET6 32-bit ARM Cortex-M4 microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"It features Arduino Uno R3 compatible headers and ST Morpho expansion pins for easy connection of shields and external modules, plus an integrated ST-LINK/V2-1 debugger/programmer so you can develop and debug firmware without any external tools.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"177\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:38:19'),
(3668,1,'product',1324,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO F410\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F410 (officially the NUCLEO-F410RB) is a compact STM32 Nucleo-64 development board from STMicroelectronics featuring the STM32F410RB ARM Cortex-M4 microcontroller\",\"info\":\"It offers an integrated ST-LINK/V2-1 debugger/programmer, Arduino Uno R3 expansion headers, and ST Morpho expansion pins, making it ideal for embedded system prototyping, sensor interfacing, and learning ARM development.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2550.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"177\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:38:43'),
(3669,1,'product',147,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO F303RE\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F303RE is a powerful development board from STMicroelectronics designed for prototyping and developing embedded applications using the STM32F303RE microcontroller, which is based on the ARM Cortex-M4 core. It operates at a clock speed of up to 72 MHz and includes a built-in floating-point unit (FPU) and digital signal processing (DSP) instructions, making it suitable for real-time control, motor control, signal processing, and industrial applications.\",\"info\":\"The board features an onboard ST-LINK/V2-1 debugger and programmer, allowing direct programming and debugging through a USB connection without requiring external hardware. It supports multiple development environments including STM32CubeIDE, Keil MDK, IAR Embedded Workbench, and Arduino IDE\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2100.00\",\"note\":\"The STM32F303RE microcontroller includes rich peripherals such as ADCs, DACs, timers, UART, SPI, I2C, CAN interface, and PWM outputs, making the board ideal for advanced embedded system design. It is widely used in motor control systems, robotics, industrial automation, sensor interfacing, data acquisition, and educational embedded development due to its high processing performance and extensive peripheral support.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"177\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:39:13'),
(3670,1,'product',1318,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NUCLEO F072\",\"description\":\"The NUCLEO-F072 is a compact development board from STMicroelectronics based on the STM32F072 series ARM Cortex-M0 microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"It provides an affordable, user-friendly platform for prototyping and embedded development, featuring Arduino-compatible headers, ST morpho expansion pins, and integrated ST-LINK debugger/programmer. Ideal for learning, sensor interfacing, USB-based projects, and low-power embedded applications using the STM32 ecosystem.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2100.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"177\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:39:39'),
(3671,1,'product',697,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NTC Thermistor\",\"description\":\"The NTC Thermistor (Negative Temperature Coefficient Thermistor) is a temperature-sensitive resistor whose resistance decreases as temperature increases. It is made from semiconductor materials such as metal oxides, which provide high sensitivity to temperature changes. When the surrounding temperature rises, the electrical resistance of the thermistor drops significantly, allowing it to accurately measure temperature variations. Due to this characteristic, NTC thermistors are widely used for temperature sensing, monitoring, and compensation applications in electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"NTC thermistors are commonly available in various resistance values such as 10KΩ, 47KΩ, or 100KΩ at 25°C, and they operate with low power consumption. They can be easily interfaced with microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP8266, and ESP32 using a voltage divider circuit to convert resistance changes into measurable voltage signals.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"399.00\",\"note\":\"NTC thermistors are widely used in battery temperature monitoring, power supplies, HVAC systems, medical devices, automotive electronics, home appliances, and IoT temperature control systems. They are also used for inrush current limiting and thermal protection in electronic equipment.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":546,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:40:33'),
(3672,1,'product',518,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NOEL Soldering Stand\",\"description\":\"NOEL Soldering Stand is a durable and stable holder designed to safely support your soldering iron when not in use. Built with a strong metal base and heat-resistant spring holder, it ensures your workspace remains clean, organized, and protected from accidental burns or damage.\",\"info\":\"A soldering stand safely holds your hot soldering iron when it’s not in use, preventing burns, accidental contact, and workspace clutter. Most models feature a metal base and spring or coil holder to grip the hot iron tip securely.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":423,\"secondary_id\":\"501\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:41:37'),
(3673,1,'product',477,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NOEL 8W Soldering Iron\",\"description\":\"NOEL 8W Soldering Iron is a compact and lightweight soldering tool designed for precision electronic work, small repairs, and delicate soldering tasks. With its 8-watt heating element, it heats up quickly while maintaining a safe temperature suitable for fine components, PCB soldering, and hobby electronics.\",\"info\":\"NOEL 8W Soldering Iron is a low-power, lightweight soldering tool designed for precision electronics work\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":423,\"secondary_id\":\"424\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:42:15'),
(3674,1,'product',478,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NOEL 25W Soldering(HQ)\",\"description\":\"NOEL 25W Soldering Iron (High Quality) is a durable and reliable tool designed for general-purpose soldering in electronics, electrical repairs, and hobby projects. With its 25-watt heating element, it heats up quickly and provides a stable temperature ideal for soldering wires, components, connectors, and PCB work.\",\"info\":\"NOEL 25W Soldering Iron (HQ) is a high-quality, general-purpose soldering tool designed for electronics assembly and repair\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"399.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":423,\"secondary_id\":\"501\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:42:44'),
(3675,1,'product',479,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NOEL 25W Soldering Iron\",\"description\":\"NOEL 25W Soldering Iron is a versatile and efficient tool designed for general electronic soldering, electrical maintenance, and DIY applications. With its reliable 25-watt heating element, it heats up quickly and maintains a steady working temperature, making it ideal for soldering components, wires, connectors, and small circuit boards.\",\"info\":\"NOEL 25W Soldering Iron is a reliable, general-purpose soldering tool suitable for electronics repair and PCB assembly. It features a 25-watt heating element that provides steady heat for clean and efficient soldering.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"399.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":423,\"secondary_id\":\"424\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:43:19'),
(3676,1,'product',321,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NodeMCU Cp2102 ESP-12E WIFI Development Board\",\"description\":\"The NodeMCU CP2102 ESP-12E WiFi Development Board is a popular open-source IoT development board based on the ESP8266 ESP-12E WiFi module, designed for easy prototyping and wireless application development. It integrates a powerful 32-bit microcontroller with built-in WiFi capability, allowing devices to connect directly to wireless networks and communicate with web servers, cloud platforms, and mobile applications\",\"info\":\"ESP8266-01 NodeMCU CP2102 WiFi Development Board is a development platform based on the ESP8266 Wi-Fi microcontroller (ESP-12E module) that integrates a CP2102 USB-to-serial converter, onboard 3.3 V regulator, and breadboard-compatible pin headers\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"550.00\",\"note\":\"The NodeMCU board operates at 3.3V logic level and features multiple GPIO pins along with communication interfaces such as UART, SPI, I2C, PWM, and ADC, making it suitable for connecting sensors, relays, displays, and other electronic components. It is programmable using Arduino IDE, Lua scripting, and MicroPython, making it beginner-friendly while still powerful enough for advanced IoT solutions.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"177\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:43:43'),
(3677,1,'product',1413,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Nextion Basic Display 7.0 inch Display\",\"description\":\"This display is part of the Nextion Basic Series, size 7.0?, resolution 800×480, with integrated touch and an onboard HMI controller. It’s designed to simplify GUI development: you design the UI in Nextion Editor, upload it to the display, and your host MCU just communicates via UART.\",\"info\":\"Resolution: 800 × 480 pixels. \\r\\nColour depth: 65K (65,536 colours). \\r\\nDisplay size: Layout roughly 181 mm × 108 mm × ~9 mm (for the version with touch) \\r\\nActive/Visual area: Visual area ~ 154.08 mm × 85.92 mm. \\r\\nTouch type: Resistive touch panel (for “011R” suffix variant) in this Basic Series model. \\r\\nSupply voltage: 4.75 V to 7 V recommended (typical 5 V\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"13500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"52\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:44:22'),
(3678,1,'product',2485,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NEMA 3487 Kg cm Hybrid bipolar\",\"description\":\"The NEMA 34 87 kg·cm Hybrid Bipolar Stepper Motor is a high-torque industrial motor widely used in CNC machines, robotics, automation systems, and heavy-duty positioning applications.\",\"info\":\"Built with a robust frame size of NEMA 34, it ensures durability, efficient heat dissipation, and reliable performance in continuous industrial operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"142\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:45:23'),
(3679,1,'product',2490,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NEMA 34 68 kg HybridBipolar\",\"description\":\"The NEMA 34 68 kg Hybrid Bipolar Stepper Motor is a high-torque, industrial-grade motor widely used in CNC machines, automation systems, robotics, and heavy linear motion applications.\",\"info\":\"while bipolar wiring provides stronger torque and improved control compared to unipolar motors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"142\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:45:55'),
(3680,1,'product',2491,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NEMA 34 122 KG cm HybridBipolar\",\"description\":\"The NEMA 34 122 kg·cm Hybrid Bipolar Stepper Motor is a high-torque industrial-grade motor designed for demanding motion-control applications such as CNC machines.\",\"info\":\"cally operates with a 1.8° step angle (200 steps per revolution) and requires a compatible bipolar stepper driver to achieve optimal torque and speed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"142\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:46:24'),
(3681,1,'product',2483,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NEMA 237.2\",\"description\":\"NEMA 23 (7.2A) stepper motor is a high-torque, precision motor commonly used in CNC machines, 3D printers, industrial automation, and robotics.\",\"info\":\"Known for their reliability, smooth motion, and repeatable performance, NEMA 23 7.2A stepper motors are ideal for applications requiring precise speed control, high torque at low speeds, and continuous operation in demanding environments.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"142\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:46:51'),
(3682,1,'product',2482,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NEMA 176.1\",\"description\":\"NEMA 17 (6.1 kg·cm) stepper motor is a compact and high-torque bipolar stepper motor widely used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, camera sliders, and automation projects.\",\"info\":\"NEMA 17 (6.1 kg·cm) stepper motor is a compact and high-torque bipolar stepper motor widely used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, camera sliders, and automation projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"142\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:47:28'),
(3683,1,'product',2486,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NEMA 175.5\",\"description\":\"NEMA 17 5.5R stepper motor is a compact, high-torque stepper motor commonly used in precision motion applications such as 3D printers, CNC machines, robotics, and automation projects.\",\"info\":\"popular motor drivers and microcontrollers like Arduino and CNC controllers, making it a reliable choice for linear actuators, belt drives, lead screws, and other precise mechanical systems where consistent torque and repeatability are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"142\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:47:56'),
(3684,1,'product',2484,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NEMA  2318.9\",\"description\":\"The NEMA 23 18.9 stepper motor is a high-torque motor commonly used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, automation systems, and industrial positioning equipment.\",\"info\":\"Known for its reliability, smooth stepping, and compatibility with popular motor drivers, the NEMA 23 18.9 is widely preferred in medium-to-heavy duty motion control projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"142\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:48:26'),
(3685,1,'product',2381,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NE555 Timer Switch Adjustable Relay Board\",\"description\":\"The NE555 Timer Switch Adjustable Relay Board is a compact timing control module based on the popular NE555 timer IC. It is designed to control a relay ON/OFF operation with an adjustable delay time, making it ideal for automation, protection circuits, and time-based switching applications.\",\"info\":\"The NE555 Timer Switch Adjustable Relay Board is a timing control module used to switch electrical loads after a preset time delay. It is based on the widely used NE555 timer IC, known for its stability and reliability in timing applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"58\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:49:57'),
(3686,1,'product',2398,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NE555 Pulse Signal Generator Module\",\"description\":\"The NE555 Pulse Signal Generator Module is a compact electronic module based on the popular NE555 timer IC, designed to generate square-wave or pulse signals with adjustable frequency and duty cycle. It is commonly used for testing, timing, clock generation, and control applications in electronics projects.\",\"info\":\"The NE555 Pulse Signal Generator Module is an electronic module used to produce continuous pulse or square-wave signals. It is based on the widely used NE555 timer IC, which operates in astable mode to generate a repeating HIGH–LOW output. The frequency and duty cycle can be adjusted using onboard components.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"58\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 03:50:49'),
