(3781,1,'product',2472,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L298 Motor Drives - Red\",\"description\":\"L298 Motor Driver – Red Module is a popular dual H-bridge motor driver board used to control DC motors and stepper motors in electronics and robotics projects. It is based on the L298 dual full-bridge driver IC and is easily recognizable by its red PCB and onboard heatsink, which helps dissipate heat during operation.\",\"info\":\"This module can independently drive two DC motors or one bipolar stepper motor, allowing control of direction, speed, and braking. It supports a motor supply voltage typically from 5V up to 35V, while the logic control section works at 5V TTL, making it compatible with controllers such as Arduino, Raspberry Pi Pico, ESP32, and other microcontrollers. Speed control is achieved using PWM signals applied to the enable pins.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"453\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:09:12'),
(3782,1,'product',2079,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Kodak Google Smart Tv Remote\",\"description\":\"The Kodak Google Smart TV Remote is a stylish, easy-to-use controller designed specifically for Kodak Android and Google Smart TVs.\",\"info\":\"Compatible with Kodak CA Pro TV models such as 43mt5055, 43capro5022, 50caprogt5012, 55ca0909, and 55caprogt5014, ensuring full compatibility and optimal performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"470\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:11:32'),
(3783,1,'product',2203,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4700uF 25V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"4700µF 25V capacitor is a high-capacitance aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for bulk energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in low- to medium-voltage electronic circuits. With a very large capacitance of 4700 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is ideal for applications that require strong ripple reduction and stable power delivery.\",\"info\":\"4700µF 25V capacitor is widely used in audio amplifiers, DC power supplies, motor driver circuits, LED power supplies, SMPS secondary sections, and consumer electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, suitable for PCB mounting and long-term reliable operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"A 4700µF 25V capacitor is a high-capacity electrolytic capacitor commonly used in power supply filtering and energy storage applications in electronic circuits. The value 4700 microfarads (µF) indicates a large capacitance, making it suitable for smoothing ripple voltage in DC power supplies, especially after rectification in AC-to-DC converters.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:11:44'),
(3784,1,'product',2210,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4700uF 35V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"4700µF 35V capacitor is a high-capacitance, medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for bulk energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in electronic power circuits. With a large capacitance of 4700 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 35 volts DC, it is ideal for applications that require strong ripple reduction and stable voltage under varying load conditions.\",\"info\":\"4700µF 35V capacitor is widely used in audio amplifiers, DC power supplies, SMPS secondary circuits, motor driver boards, LED power supplies, and industrial electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it suitable for PCB mounting and long-term reliable operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 4700µF 35V capacitor is a high-capacitance electrolytic capacitor mainly used in power supply filtering, voltage smoothing, and energy storage applications in electronic circuits. The 4700 microfarads (µF) value indicates a large charge storage capacity, making it ideal for reducing ripple voltage in DC power supplies, especially after rectifier circuits in transformers and SMPS systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:12:38'),
(3785,1,'product',2205,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4700uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"4700µF 50V capacitor is a high-capacitance, medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used mainly for bulk energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in electronic power circuits. With a large capacitance of 4700 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is well suited for applications that demand strong ripple suppression and stable voltage under high current loads.\",\"info\":\"4700µF 50V capacitor is commonly used in power amplifiers, DC power supplies, SMPS secondary stages, motor driver circuits, industrial control boards, and high-power LED drivers. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for reliable PCB mounting and long operational life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 4700µF 50V capacitor is a large-value electrolytic capacitor widely used in high-voltage DC filtering, power supply smoothing, and bulk energy storage applications. The capacitance value of 4700 microfarads (µF) indicates a high ability to store electrical charge, making it highly effective in reducing ripple voltage after rectification in AC-to-DC power supplies.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:13:50'),
