(3788,1,'product',2672,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4Ch 5MP Record  XVR\",\"description\":\"The Uniview XVR301-04Q3 (often sold under the XVR301-04G3/Q3 platform) is a hybrid digital video recorder (XVR) designed for CCTV and security camera systems in homes, shops, offices, and small-to-medium surveillance installations.\",\"info\":\". It acts as the central unit that records, stores, displays, and manages video feeds from multiple cameras over time.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1197],\"model\":\"XVR301-04Q3\",\"alternative_name\":\"4Ch 5MP Record\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Place the recorder in a dry, well-ventilated area to avoid overheating.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772518537207-83015454.png\"}','2026-03-03 06:15:37'),
(3789,1,'product',2244,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"The 470µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for power supply filtering, energy storage, and voltage smoothing applications. It is commonly used in SMPS power supplies, inverter circuits, LED drivers, and industrial electronic equipment to reduce ripple voltage and stabilize DC output after rectification.This polarized capacitor provides high capacitance with reliable performance, making it suitable for high-voltage and high-current circuits.\",\"info\":\"Built with durable aluminum electrolyte construction, it offers good endurance, stable electrical characteristics, and long operational life when used within rated voltage and temperature limits. Typically available in a radial lead through-hole package, the 470µF 250V capacitor is widely used in power electronics and amplifier power sections for efficient and stable circuit operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"note\":\"A 470µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage electrolytic capacitor designed for applications that require large capacitance with the ability to handle high DC voltage. The capacitance value of 470 microfarads (µF) allows it to store a significant amount of electrical energy, while the 250V rating means it can safely operate in circuits up to 250 volts DC. For reliability and longer life, it is recommended to use the capacitor at least 15–20% below its maximum rated voltage.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:15:39'),
(3790,1,'product',537,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"JUMPERS Wires M-M\",\"description\":\"The Male-to-Male Jumper Wire Set (40 pcs) is ideal for breadboards, Arduino, Raspberry Pi, sensor modules, and general electronic prototyping.\",\"info\":\"Jumper wires M–M are flexible connecting wires with male pins on both ends, used mainly for breadboard-to-breadboard or breadboard-to-module connections\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"149.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":203,\"secondary_id\":\"482\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:15:52'),
(3791,1,'product',535,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"JUMPERS Wires M-F\",\"description\":\"The Male-to-Female Jumper Wire Set (40 pcs) contains high-quality, flexible jumper cables used for breadboards, Arduino, Raspberry Pi, sensors, and electronic prototyping.\",\"info\":\"Jumper wires M–F are flexible connecting wires with a male pin on one end and a female socket on the other\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"149.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":203,\"secondary_id\":\"482\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:16:18'),
(3792,1,'product',539,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"JUMPERS Wires F-F\",\"description\":\"The Female-to-Female Jumper Wire Set (40 pcs) contains high-quality flexible wires ideal for connecting modules, sensors, ESP/Arduino headers, and Raspberry Pi GPIO pins.\",\"info\":\"Jumper wires F–F are flexible connecting wires with female sockets on both ends, used to connect male header pins, sensors, and modules directly.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"149.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":203,\"secondary_id\":\"482\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:16:43'),
(3793,1,'product',2199,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 35V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"470µF 35V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and energy storage in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 470 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 35 volts DC, it is ideal for power supply and control circuits that operate at moderate voltages.\",\"info\":\"470µF 35V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS secondary circuits, motor driver boards, LED driver circuits, and consumer electronics. It generally comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum package, designed for easy PCB mounting and long service life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 470µF 35V capacitor is a medium-to-high value electrolytic capacitor commonly used for power supply filtering, decoupling, and energy storage in low to medium voltage electronic circuits. The 470 microfarads (µF) capacitance allows it to store a moderate amount of electrical charge, making it effective for smoothing DC voltage and reducing ripple after rectification.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:17:02'),
(3794,1,'product',540,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"JUMPER Wires COMBO\",\"description\":\"The Jumper Combo (30 pcs) is a mixed set of high-quality jumper wires including Male-to-Male, Male-to-Female, and Female-to-Female wires.\",\"info\":\"A Jumper Combo is a mixed set of jumper wires that typically includes Male–Male (M–M), Male–Female (M–F), and Female–Female (F–F) cables.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"149.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":203,\"secondary_id\":\"482\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:17:24'),
(3795,1,'product',2243,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 450V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"The 470µF 450V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor widely used in power supply and energy storage applications. It is designed to smooth and filter rectified DC voltage by reducing ripple and electrical noise in high-power electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is commonly found in SMPS power supplies, inverters, LED drivers, industrial equipment, and audio amplifier power sections where stable high-voltage operation is required. Being a polarized component, it must be connected with correct polarity for safe operation\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"198\",\"note\":\"Built with durable aluminum electrolytic construction, it provides high capacitance, reliable performance, and long service life under proper operating conditions. The capacitor is typically available in a radial lead through-hole package and operates efficiently in circuits requiring high voltage handling and stable DC filtering.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:17:36'),
(3796,1,'product',2212,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"470µF 50V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and bulk decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 470 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is well suited for power supply and control circuits operating at moderate voltage levels.\",\"info\":\"The 470µF 50V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS secondary circuits, motor driver boards, LED driver circuits, and industrial electronics. It generally comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and long service life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 470µF 50V capacitor is a high-voltage electrolytic capacitor commonly used in power supply circuits for filtering, smoothing, and bulk energy storage. The 470 microfarads (µF) capacitance value allows it to store a moderate amount of electrical charge, helping to reduce ripple voltage and stabilize DC output after rectification.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:18:47'),
(3797,1,'product',2592,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Jackma JAC-999 6-Inch speaker\",\"description\":\"According to the specification section, the speaker model is JAC-999, with a continuous power handling of 100W and a peak power handling of 1000W.\",\"info\":\"It features a sensitivity of 94 dB, which helps produce loud and clear sound, and a frequency response range of 55Hz to 20kHz, covering deep bass to high-frequency details.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"70\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:19:20'),
(3798,1,'product',2593,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Jackma JAC-666 (6 inch) speaker\",\"description\":\"The speaker has a sensitivity of 90 dB, allowing efficient sound output, and a frequency response range of 55Hz to 20kHz, covering both low and high audio frequencies.\",\"info\":\"It features a nominal impedance of 4 ohms, making it compatible with most standard car stereos and amplifiers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"70\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:19:51'),
(3799,1,'product',2234,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 470µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and bulk decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 470 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that require higher voltage tolerance along with moderate energy storage.\",\"info\":\"The 470µF 63V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS secondary circuits, industrial control boards, motor driver circuits, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 470µF 63V capacitor is a high-voltage electrolytic capacitor used in power supply filtering, voltage smoothing, and energy storage applications where higher voltage handling is required. The capacitance value of 470 microfarads (µF) enables it to store a moderate amount of electrical charge, making it effective for reducing ripple voltage and stabilizing DC output in power circuits.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:20:11'),
(3800,1,'product',2591,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"JACKMA JAC-444 4-inch Audio Speaker\",\"description\":\"The specification panel lists the model number JAC-444, with a continuous power handling of 60W and a peak power handling of 600W.\",\"info\":\"The JACKMA JAC-444 4-inch Audio Speaker is a compact yet powerful audio speaker designed to deliver crisp and clear sound in small to medium audio setups, especially in car audio systems and multimedia installations. Featuring a 4-inch driver size, it balances bass response and mid-range clarity, making music sound fuller and more enjoyable compared to standard factory speakers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"70\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:20:31'),
(3801,1,'product',2174,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"472 NTC\",\"description\":\"The 472 NTC thermistor is a temperature-sensitive resistor in which resistance decreases as temperature increases, making it suitable for temperature sensing and compensation applications. The “472” marking indicates a resistance value of 4.7KΩ at 25°C, commonly used in electronic control circuits for accurate thermal monitoring.\",\"info\":\"It provides fast thermal response, high sensitivity, and stable performance across a wide temperature range. This thermistor is widely used in battery chargers, power supplies, air conditioners, home appliances, and industrial electronic systems for temperature detection and protection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"NTC Thermistor\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"note\":\"Typically available in an epoxy-coated bead type with radial leads, the 472 NTC offers reliable operation, compact size, and easy PCB mounting for various electronic designs.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":546,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:20:59'),
(3802,1,'product',2400,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ISD1820 Voice Recording Module\",\"description\":\"The ISD1820 Voice Recording Module is a compact and easy-to-use audio record and playback module designed for recording short voice messages. It is based on the ISD1820 voice recording IC, which stores audio in non-volatile memory, ensuring that recordings are retained even when power is removed.\",\"info\":\"The ISD1820 Voice Recording Module is a small, standalone audio module used to record and play back short voice messages. It is built around the ISD1820 voice IC, which stores audio in non-volatile memory, so recordings are ????? even when power is turned off.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"63\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:21:29'),
(3803,1,'product',2385,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ISD1760 Voice Recording\",\"description\":\"The ISD1760 Voice Recording Module is a non-volatile audio record and playback module based on the ISD1760 voice IC. It allows users to record, store, and play back human voice or audio messages without losing data when power is removed. This makes it ideal for message playback, alerts, and interactive embedded projects.\",\"info\":\"The ISD1760 Voice Recording Module is an audio module used to record, store, and play back voice messages. It is based on the ISD1760 ChipCorder® IC, which stores recorded audio in non-volatile memory, ensuring the message is retained even when power is removed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"63\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:22:10'),
(3804,1,'product',801,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IR Wireless TV Remote Control Module\",\"description\":\"IR Wireless TV Remote Control Module is a compact, easy-to-use infrared transmitter system designed to control TVs, set-top boxes, and IR-enabled devices. It uses a 38kHz IR LED transmitter and a compatible IR receiver module (optional) to send standard IR remote control commands. This module is widely used for DIY home automation, universal remote projects, robotics, and electronics learning kits.\",\"info\":\"IR Wireless TV Remote Control Module\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:22:38'),
(3805,1,'product',2505,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IR Sensor Array 8\",\"description\":\"IR Sensor Array 8 is a compact and integrated sensing module that includes eight infrared (IR) emitter–receiver pairs arranged in a row on a single board.\",\"info\":\"It’s designed for multi-point detection of surfaces or objects and is especially useful in robotics and automation projects where finer spatial resolution is needed compared to smaller arrays.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"166\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:23:15'),
(3806,1,'product',2253,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47nF (473)\",\"description\":\"A 47 nF (473) ceramic capacitor is a non-polarized capacitor that uses a ceramic dielectric to store and release electrical energy efficiently. The marking 473 represents 47,000 pF, calculated as 47 × 10³ pF, which is equal to 47 nF or 0.047 µF.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor value is widely available in ceramic disc (through-hole) and MLCC / SMD types. It offers good high-frequency performance, low dielectric loss, and stable operation, making it suitable for general-purpose electronic circuits. Typical voltage ratings range from 50 V to 630 V for disc capacitors, while MLCC versions are commonly rated 16 V to 100 V, depending on package size and dielectric class.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Ceramic Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"A 47nF (473) ceramic capacitor is a small, non-polarized capacitor widely used in electronic circuits for filtering, noise suppression, coupling, and decoupling applications. The value 47nF (nanofarads) is equal to 0.047µF, and the marking “473” follows the standard capacitor code system, where the first two digits (47) represent the significant figures and the third digit (3) represents the number of zeros in picofarads. So, 47 × 10³ pF = 47,000 pF, which equals 47nF.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":416,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:23:41'),
(3807,1,'product',2501,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IR Sensor Array 5\",\"description\":\"IR Sensor Array 5 is a compact sensing module that integrates five infrared (IR) transmitter–receiver pairs on a single PCB. It is designed for applications that require multi-point surface or object detection with higher accuracy than single or dual sensors. By reading reflected IR light, the array can detect line position, edges, obstacles, and surface contrast in real time.\",\"info\":\"The array generally operates on a 3.3V–5V DC supply, making it compatible with Arduino, ESP8266/ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, and other microcontrollers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"166\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:23:49'),
(3808,1,'product',2443,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IR Sensor Array 4\",\"description\":\"IR Sensor Array 4 is a compact sensing module that consists of four infrared (IR) transmitter–receiver pairs mounted on a single PCB. It is mainly used in robotics and automation projects where multiple points of surface or object detection are required at the same time\",\"info\":\"Each sensor detects reflected infrared light, making the array ideal for identifying line position, edge detection, obstacle presence, or surface color contrast.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"166\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:24:20'),
(3809,1,'product',2205,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4700uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"4700µF 50V capacitor is a high-capacitance, medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used mainly for bulk energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in electronic power circuits. With a large capacitance of 4700 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is well suited for applications that demand strong ripple suppression and stable voltage under high current loads.\",\"info\":\"4700µF 50V capacitor is commonly used in power amplifiers, DC power supplies, SMPS secondary stages, motor driver circuits, industrial control boards, and high-power LED drivers. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for reliable PCB mounting and long operational life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 4700µF 50V capacitor is a large-value electrolytic capacitor mainly used for high-voltage DC filtering, bulk energy storage, and ripple reduction in power supply circuits. The capacitance value of 4700 microfarads (µF) allows it to store a significant amount of electrical charge, making it highly effective in smoothing DC output after rectification in AC-to-DC converters.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:24:36'),
(3810,1,'product',2442,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IR Sensor Array 3\",\"description\":\"An IR (Infrared) Sensor Array 3-channel is a compact module that integrates three IR transmitters and receivers in a row. It’s designed to detect contrast differences (such as black/white lines) on surfaces by measuring reflected infrared light\",\"info\":\"These sensor arrays are widely used in line-following robots, edge detection systems, and simple object detection where you need to detect patterns or boundaries on the ground.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"166\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:24:53'),
(3811,1,'product',2512,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IR Proximity obstacle sensor\",\"description\":\"IR Proximity / Obstacle Sensor is an electronic sensing module used to detect nearby objects or obstacles using infrared (IR) light.\",\"info\":\"It works on the principle of IR reflection—an IR LED emits infrared light, and when an object is present in front of the sensor, the reflected IR light is detected by a photodiode or phototransistor.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"166\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:25:34'),
(3812,1,'product',2244,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"470uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"The 470µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for power supply filtering, energy storage, and voltage smoothing applications. It is commonly used in SMPS power supplies, inverter circuits, LED drivers, and industrial electronic equipment to reduce ripple voltage and stabilize DC output after rectification.This polarized capacitor provides high capacitance with reliable performance, making it suitable for high-voltage and high-current circuits.\",\"info\":\"Built with durable aluminum electrolyte construction, it offers good endurance, stable electrical characteristics, and long operational life when used within rated voltage and temperature limits. Typically available in a radial lead through-hole package, the 470µF 250V capacitor is widely used in power electronics and amplifier power sections for efficient and stable circuit operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"A 470µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage electrolytic capacitor designed for applications that require large capacitance with the ability to handle high DC voltage. The capacitance value of 470 microfarads (µF) allows it to store a significant amount of electrical energy, while the 250V rating means it can safely operate in circuits up to 250 volts DC. For reliability and longer life, it is recommended to use the capacitor at least 15–20% below its maximum rated voltage.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:25:38'),
(3813,1,'product',1343,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Industrial Modbus RTU 8-Ch Relay Module\",\"description\":\"Industrial Modbus RTU 8-ch Relay Module, RS485 Bus, Communication interface: RS485. Communication protocol: Standard Modbus RTU protocol\",\"info\":\"Onboard unibody power supply isolation, provides stable isolated voltage, needs no extra power supply for the isolated terminal. Onboard unibody ADI magnetical isolation, allows signal isolation, high reliability, strong anti-interference, low power consumption.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"3550.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"58\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:26:13'),
(3814,1,'product',2039,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Impex Remote\",\"description\":\"Impex Remote is a reliable and user-friendly replacement remote designed to work seamlessly with a wide range of Impex LED and Smart TVs. Built with durable materials and responsive soft-touch buttons, it ensures smooth navigation and easy access to essential TV functions such as power, volume, channel change, menu, and input selection.\",\"info\":\"IMPEX\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"850.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:28:07'),
(3815,1,'product',2673,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniarch 8 ch  XVR 5MP Record\",\"description\":\"The Uniview XVR301-08Q3 is a professional 8-channel hybrid digital video recorder (XVR) designed to manage and record video from CCTV security systems. \",\"info\":\"It acts as the central unit that records, stores, displays, and manages video feeds from multiple cameras over time.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1197],\"model\":\" XVR301-08Q3 \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Set up remote viewing through the official mobile app or desktop client securely — avoid shared public credentials.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772519341915-231534761.png\"}','2026-03-03 06:29:01'),
