(3819,1,'product',2204,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47uF 35V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 47µF 35V capacitor is a medium-value electrolytic capacitor commonly used in electronic circuits for filtering, decoupling, coupling, and energy storage applications. The capacitance value of 47 microfarads (µF) allows it to store a moderate amount of electrical charge, making it suitable for smoothing DC voltage and reducing ripple in low to medium voltage power supplies. The 35V rating indicates the maximum DC voltage the capacitor can safely handle; for better durability and longer lifespan, it is recommended to operate it below 25–30V.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is polarized, meaning it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals and must be connected correctly. Incorrect polarity can cause overheating, leakage, bulging, or failure. It typically comes in a cylindrical aluminum casing with radial leads for PCB mounting and is usually available with temperature ratings of 85°C or 105°C.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"The 47µF 35V capacitor is widely used in 12V–24V DC power supplies, audio amplifier circuits, voltage regulator output filtering, microcontroller boards, LED driver circuits, motor driver boards, and general electronic applications. It helps stabilize voltage, reduce noise, and provide temporary energy during sudden load changes.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:31:52'),
(3820,1,'product',2098,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU SW-V6 VOICE Remote\",\"description\":\"The HUAYU SW-V6 Voice Remote is a universal smart-TV remote designed for brands like Skyworth, Sansui, Lloyd, Kodak, Thomson and Croma.  It features voice-control capability, meaning you can press a dedicated microphone button to speak commands instead of only using buttons. Its layout includes hotkeys for streaming services like Netflix, YouTube, and Prime Video (depending on the seller listing) and it pairs via IR to the TV (though the listing emphasizes “Pairing Must”).\",\"info\":\"suitable for Skyworth, sansui,kodak,Thomson,Lloyd,croma, SMART tV.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"HUAYU SW-V6\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:32:06'),
(3821,1,'product',2037,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RM-SNS1102 SANSUI Remote\",\"description\":\"HUAYU RM-SNS1102 Remote is a high-quality universal replacement remote control designed to deliver smooth and reliable operation for a wide range of LED, LCD, and Smart TVs. Built with durable materials and an easy-to-use button layout, this remote provides quick access to essential functions such as volume control, channel switching, menu navigation, input selection, and more.\",\"info\":\"use for SANSUI LCD /LED TV\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"RM-SNS1102\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"900.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":290}]}','2026-03-03 06:32:59'),
(3822,1,'product',830,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RM-RC1100 Remote\",\"description\":\"HUAYU RM-RC1100 is a high-quality universal replacement remote control designed for a wide range of TV brands and models. Built with reliable HUAYU engineering, this remote provides stable performance, strong signal transmission, and long-distance operation. It features a simple and user-friendly button layout, making it easy to navigate channels, adjust volume, access menus, and control essential TV functions without any setup in most cases.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"600.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:33:32'),
(3823,1,'product',2674,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\" Uniarch 16ch XVR  5MP Record \",\"description\":\"The Uniview XVR302-16Q3 is an advanced hybrid digital video recorder (XVR) used in comprehensive CCTV surveillance systems for homes, businesses, warehouses, shops, or offices.\",\"info\":\"It combines traditional analog camera support with modern IP camera connectivity, giving flexibility to integrate different types of cameras — including HD-TVI, AHD, CVI, CVBS, and IP cameras — on a single platform.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1197],\"model\":\" XVR302-16Q3\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Install the recorder in a dry, well-ventilated area to prevent overheating.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772519621426-458074945.png\"}','2026-03-03 06:33:41'),
(3824,1,'product',2223,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47uF 450V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 47µF 450V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for electronic circuits that operate at very high DC voltages. With a capacitance of 47 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 450 volts DC, it provides effective energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in high-voltage power sections.\",\"info\":\"The 47µF 450V capacitor is widely used in SMPS power supplies, inverters, LED drivers, audio amplifiers, UPS systems, and industrial electronic equipment. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, insulated for safety and suitable for long-term PCB mounting.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"This capacitor is polarized, with clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and must be connected with correct polarity. Reversing the polarity can result in overheating, leakage, bulging, or explosion. It is typically housed in a cylindrical aluminum casing with radial leads or snap-in terminals and commonly comes with 85°C or 105°C temperature ratings.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:33:55'),
(3825,1,'product',843,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RM-LY1716 Universal Remote\",\"description\":\"Before Placing The Order Please compare The Image With Your Existing Remote\\r\\nWe Are All Products are checked by Testing machine Before Shipment\\r\\nPlease Use Best Quality New Battery Before Use Remote\\r\\nIt has an ergonomic handle that provides you a precise grip\\r\\nCompatible With : Lloyd Tv Remote (Suitable for Lloyd Led Tv Remote)\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:34:00'),
(3826,1,'product',848,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RM-L1535 PLUS\",\"description\":\"The RM-L1535 PLUS by HUAYU is a replacement/in-universal remote designed specifically for many models of Haier TVs. According to the manufacturer, it is IR-based (infra-red) and requires no programming or pairing in many cases: simply insert batteries and use.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1200.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:34:26'),
(3827,1,'product',2101,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RM-L1690\",\"description\":\"The HUAYU RM-L1690 is a universal replacement remote control designed primarily for use with Sony brand LCD/LED Smart TVs (especially the RMF-TX / RMT-TX series) and is offered by the manufacturer HUAYU.Smart TV’s original remote is lost or damaged, the RM-L1690 offers a cost-effective compatible alternative with most standard TV functions and streaming-hotkey convenience.\",\"info\":\"RM-ED049      RMT-TX101E     RM-ED002\\r\\nRM-ED005     RM-ED050       RMT-EX101P\\r\\nRM-ED007    RM-E0052       RMT-TX1028\\r\\nRM-EDX008   RM-ED053    RMT-TX102D\\r\\nRM-ED009     RM-ED054    RMT-TX102U\\r\\nRM-ED011    RM-ED058     RMT-TX201P\\r\\nRM-ED011W   RM-ED059   RMT-TX200E\\r\\nRM-ED012    RM-ED060     RMT-TX300E\\r\\nRM-ED013      RM-ED061   RMT-TX300P\\r\\nRM-ED014     RM-ED062     RMT-TX300U\\r\\nRM-ED016   RMF-TX200E    RMF-TX500P\\r\\nRM-ED016W   RMF-TX201ES   RMF-TX500U\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"HUAYU RM-L1690\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1200.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:34:54'),
(3828,1,'product',835,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RM-L1210+H PRO\",\"description\":\"UNIVERSAL COMPATIBILITY: Works with most LCD and LED TV brands, offering seamless control for various television models\\r\\nSTREAMING SHORTCUTS: Features dedicated buttons for Netflix, YouTube, and Prime Video for quick access to popular streaming services\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1200.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:35:19'),
(3829,1,'product',2228,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 47µF 50V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 47 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is suitable for both power supply and signal-conditioning applications.\",\"info\":\"The 47µF 50V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio circuits, SMPS secondary sections, voltage regulator outputs, motor driver boards, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on printed circuit boards and ensuring reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"The 47µF 50V capacitor is widely used in audio amplifier circuits, 24V–48V DC power supplies, voltage regulator output filtering, LED driver circuits, motor control boards, inverter circuits, and embedded system power sections. It helps stabilize voltage during load variations by storing and releasing energy as required.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:35:32'),
(3830,1,'product',2027,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RM-L 1818 AS  LCD/LED Remote\",\"description\":\"HUAYU RM-L 1818 AS is a high-quality universal remote designed for LCD and LED TVs, offering reliable performance and wide compatibility with many popular TV brands. It features a simple and ergonomic button layout, making it easy for users of all ages to operate their television functions such as power, volume, channel navigation, menu control, and more. The remote is ready to use with most supported TVs and usually requires no setup, ensuring a smooth plug-and-play experience.\",\"info\":\"MR 18BA , MR 19BA , MR 20GA ,MR 21GA , MR22GA ,AN-MR400 ,AN-MR500 , AN-MR600 ,AN-MR650 ,AN-MR700\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"RM-L 1818 AS\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"900.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:35:42'),
