(3832,1,'product',854,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RM-HYD1105 Remote\",\"description\":\"This model is listed as a “LCD / LED Smart TV Universal Remote Control (Please Check Your Old Remote and Match Second Image)” — meaning it’s a generic replacement, not necessarily the original remote for Hyundai TVs.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"950.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:36:39'),
(3833,1,'product',869,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RM-710R+ Remote\",\"description\":\"HUAYU RM-710R+ Remote is a high-quality replacement remote control designed to work seamlessly with a wide range of LCD and LED televisions. Built with durable materials and responsive soft-touch keys, it ensures smooth navigation and easy access to all essential TV functions including power, volume, channel selection, menu control, and input switching. The RM-710R+ is engineered for plug-and-play use, requiring no setup or programming for most compatible TV models.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"850.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:37:10'),
(3834,1,'product',2239,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 47µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor widely used for filtering, smoothing, coupling, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 47 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that require moderate capacitance with higher voltage tolerance.\",\"info\":\"The 47µF 63V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio circuits, SMPS sections, voltage regulator outputs, industrial control boards, and consumer electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on PCBs and ensuring reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"This capacitor is polarized, with clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals, and must be connected correctly. Reversing polarity can cause overheating, leakage, bulging, or failure. It typically comes in a cylindrical aluminum body with radial leads for PCB mounting and is commonly available with 85°C or 105°C temperature ratings.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:37:14'),
(3835,1,'product',2029,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RM -D1170+\",\"description\":\"HUAYU RM-D1170+ is a high-quality universal replacement remote designed for a wide range of LED, LCD, and Smart TVs. Built with durable materials, it offers responsive buttons and a user-friendly layout that makes navigation easy for all age groups. The remote supports multiple TV brands without requiring complex setup—simply insert the batteries and it works instantly with most compatible models. With essential control functions such as power, volume, channel, mute, menu, and numeric inputs, the RM-D1170+ ensures smooth and reliable TV operation.\",\"info\":\"Panasonic LCD/LED TVs\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"RM -D1170+\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"949.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:37:36'),
(3836,1,'product',833,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU RECONNECT LED UNIVERSAL REMOTE\",\"description\":\"HUAYU Reconnect LED Universal Remote is a high-quality replacement remote designed to work seamlessly with Reconnect LED TVs and a wide range of other popular LED television brands. Built with durable materials and an ergonomic design, it ensures comfortable handling and long-lasting performance.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"600.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:38:06'),
(3837,1,'product',2047,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU LED 100 V.2-UNI Universal Remote\",\"description\":\"The HUAYU universal remote is a convenient replacement remote designed for LCD and LED TVs across many brands. It features a pre-programmed design so you can use it right out of the box—no complex programming required—making it well suited for homes where the original remote is lost, broken or incompatible. Many HUAYU models support fast access to streaming services like Netflix and YouTube, and they cover a wide compatibility range with most modern TV brands.\",\"info\":\"suitable for HUAYULED 100 V.2\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"RM-MX1138+3\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"850.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:38:38'),
(3838,1,'product',845,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HUAYU Common LCD /LED Remote\",\"description\":\"Perfectly compatible with ONIDA LED/LCD TVs, offering a seamless replacement for your original remote.\\r\\n Made from premium-quality plastic with a rigid body, ensuring long-lasting performance and enhanced durability.\\r\\n Soft rubber keypad provides a smooth tactile feel for easy and comfortable operation.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1200.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:39:07'),
(3839,1,'product',2086,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HTS-064 smart tv remote\",\"description\":\"The HTS-064 Smart TV Remote is a reliable and user-friendly controller designed to provide smooth operation for supported LED and Smart TV models.\",\"info\":\"Compatible Device: for Thomson Smart LED TV (Without Voice Function)\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"470\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:39:52'),
(3840,1,'product',2559,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4MM-Heat shrink sleeve-black\",\"description\":\"A 4mm black heat shrink sleeve is an insulating plastic tube used to protect, insulate, and organize electrical wires and connections. The 4mm size refers to the inner diameter of the tube before shrinking. When heat is applied using a heat gun, lighter, or hot air blower, the sleeve shrinks tightly around the wire or joint, providing secure insulation and mechanical protection. It is commonly made from polyolefin material, which offers flexibility, flame resistance, and good electrical insulation properties.\",\"info\":\"The 4mm heat shrink sleeve protects wires from short circuits, moisture, dust, abrasion, and minor mechanical stress. It also improves the durability and appearance of soldered joints. Important specifications to consider include shrink ratio, temperature range (typically -55°C to 125°C), dielectric strength, and flame-retardant rating to ensure safe and long-lasting performance in electrical applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Heat Shrink Sleeve\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"note\":\"This sleeve typically has a 2:1 shrink ratio, meaning it can shrink to half of its original diameter (4mm to approximately 2mm). Some variants may have a 3:1 shrink ratio for tighter fitting. The black color provides a clean professional finish and is widely used in electronics projects, automotive wiring, battery connections, LED installations, motor wiring, DIY kits, and industrial cable management.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":568,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:42:40'),
(3841,1,'product',2574,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4x4 PCB Board\",\"description\":\"A 4 × 4 General Purpose PCB (G.PCB) is a universal prototyping printed circuit board used for building and soldering electronic circuits. With a square form factor, this board provides a flexible platform for assembling components and converting breadboard prototypes into permanent soldered designs.\",\"info\":\"A 4x4 PCB board refers to a printed circuit board with dimensions of 4 cm × 4 cm or sometimes 4 inch × 4 inch, depending on specification. It is commonly used as a base platform for building and assembling electronic circuits. The board is usually made of FR4 (fiber-reinforced epoxy laminate) or phenolic material and coated with a thin layer of copper for circuit tracing.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCB Board\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"note\":\"This size is widely used for DIY electronics projects, Arduino circuits, robotics modules, power supply boards, prototype circuits, student lab experiments, and small embedded system designs. The compact 4x4 size makes it ideal for small to medium circuits that require neat layout and easy mounting inside enclosures.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":\"564\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:44:46'),
(3842,1,'product',2378,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5.1 Channel TT-K1010\",\"description\":\"5.1-channel multimedia speaker system designed for home audio entertainment. As a 5.1-channel setup, it includes five satellite speakers plus one subwoofer, providing surround-sound audio for movies, music, games, and multimedia playback. These systems aim to deliver richer, more immersive sound than traditional 2.0 or 2.1 speaker sets by positioning sound around the listener to create a “surround” effect.\",\"info\":\"It features a 5.1 channel configuration with five satellite speakers and one subwoofer, providing immersive audio suitable for movies, music, and TV shows\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"5.1 Home Theatre\",\"mrp\":\"9000.00\",\"note\":\"Typical features of such a system include multiple input options like Bluetooth, USB, AUX, and sometimes FM radio, allowing connection to phones, laptops, TVs, and media players. They often support high-impact audio output (with ratings such as RMS power indicating loudness capability) and enhanced bass from the subwoofer for deeper, more powerful low frequencies. Some models also include control knobs or remote control for adjusting volume, bass, treble, and input source.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":330,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":277}]}','2026-03-03 06:47:50'),
(3843,1,'category_brand_mapping',330,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[277,279]}\"','2026-03-03 06:49:14'),
(3844,1,'product',2384,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HC-05 TTL Bluetooth Module\",\"description\":\"The HC-05 TTL Bluetooth Module is a Bluetooth Classic (v2.0 + EDR) wireless communication module that provides TTL-level serial (UART) connectivity between microcontrollers and Bluetooth-enabled devices such as smartphones, tablets, and PCs. It is widely used in Arduino and embedded electronics projects for short-range wireless data transfer.\",\"info\":\"A key advantage of the HC-05 is that it supports both Master and Slave modes, giving it more flexibility than slave-only modules like HC-06.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"28\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:49:32'),
(3845,1,'product',2380,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HC-05 Bluetooth Module\",\"description\":\"The HC-05 Bluetooth module is a popular Bluetooth Classic (v2.0 + EDR) wireless communication module used to add serial (UART) Bluetooth connectivity to microcontroller projects.\",\"info\":\"It is widely used with Arduino, AVR, PIC, and ARM boards for short-range wireless data transfer.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"28\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:50:04'),
(3846,1,'product',2379,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5.1 Channel TT-K1150\",\"description\":\"The TARGET TT-K1150 5.1 Channel Multimedia Speaker System is a consumer home theatre speaker set designed to deliver surround sound audio for movies, music, gaming, and multimedia playback with better immersion than basic stereo speakers. It’s part of Target’s range of affordable 5.1-channel audio systems suited for living rooms, bedrooms, or entertainment setups.\",\"info\":\"The system supports Bluetooth wireless connectivity, letting you stream music directly from your smartphone or other Bluetooth-enabled devices, and also includes a memory card slot, USB port, and FM radio, making it versatile for various media sources.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"5.1 Home Theatre\",\"mrp\":\"11999.00\",\"note\":\"This system features five satellite speakers plus a larger subwoofer, creating a 5.1 configuration that spreads sound around the listener for a richer audio experience. The combined output power is around 170 W, which provides decent loudness for everyday use and casual home audio setups.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":330,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":279}]}','2026-03-03 06:50:41'),
(3847,1,'product',528,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HARD WHEEL 8 X 2.5 CM\",\"description\":\"The Hard Wheel 8 × 2.5 cm is a strong, durable, solid plastic/rubber wheel designed for robotics, mini carts, DIY vehicles, school projects, and engineering models.\",\"info\":\"Its designed to fit standard hobby motor shafts (often 6 mm) and is ideal for robot cars, DIY platforms, and educational projects, providing stable motion and good traction on smooth surfaces.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":320,\"secondary_id\":\"559\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:52:55'),
(3848,1,'product',2382,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5.1 Chaneel TT-K1710\",\"description\":\"The TT-K1710 5.1 Channel Multimedia Speaker System from Target is a budget-friendly surround sound audio setup designed to enhance the listening experience for movies, music, gaming, and TV playback. It features a 5.1 channel configuration, which means it includes five satellite speakers and one subwoofer to create a more immersive audio environment compared to basic stereo speakers.\",\"info\":\"It features a total RMS power output of around 45 W with a 5.25-inch subwoofer and five satellite speakers that together create balanced audio with decent bass and clear mids and highs, making it suitable for small to medium-sized rooms.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"5.1 Home Theatre\",\"mrp\":\"11999.00\",\"note\":\"This system delivers around 45 W RMS total output, providing balanced sound with decent volume for small to medium-sized rooms. The 5.25-inch subwoofer produces deeper bass tones, while the smaller satellite speakers handle mid and high frequencies for fuller audio reproduction.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":330,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":279}]}','2026-03-03 06:54:18'),
(3849,1,'product',2424,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GY-SHT31-D Digital Module\",\"description\":\"GY?SHT31?D Digital Temperature and Humidity Sensor is a digital environmental sensing module that measures both temperature and relative humidity with high precision\",\"info\":\"It’s based on the Sensirion SHT31 sensor chip, a reliable and factory-calibrated digital sensor widely used in environmental monitoring and control systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"76\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:54:39'),
(3850,1,'product',2382,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5.1 Channel TT-K1710\",\"description\":\"The TT-K1710 5.1 Channel Multimedia Speaker System from Target is a budget-friendly surround sound audio setup designed to enhance the listening experience for movies, music, gaming, and TV playback. It features a 5.1 channel configuration, which means it includes five satellite speakers and one subwoofer to create a more immersive audio environment compared to basic stereo speakers.\",\"info\":\"It features a total RMS power output of around 45 W with a 5.25-inch subwoofer and five satellite speakers that together create balanced audio with decent bass and clear mids and highs, making it suitable for small to medium-sized rooms.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"5.1 Home Theatre\",\"mrp\":\"11999.00\",\"note\":\"This system delivers around 45 W RMS total output, providing balanced sound with decent volume for small to medium-sized rooms. The 5.25-inch subwoofer produces deeper bass tones, while the smaller satellite speakers handle mid and high frequencies for fuller audio reproduction.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":330,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":279}]}','2026-03-03 06:54:54'),
(3851,1,'product',2420,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GY-213-SI7021 Temperature and Humidity Sensor\",\"description\":\"The GY-213-SI7021 Temperature and Humidity Sensor is a compact, high-accuracy digital environmental sensor module based on the SI7021 sensor IC. It measures relative humidity and ambient temperature and provides stable, calibrated digital readings via the I²C interface, making it ideal for Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, and other microcontroller platforms.\",\"info\":\"The GY-213-SI7021 is a compact digital temperature and humidity sensor module that measures ambient temperature and relative humidity with good accuracy and long-term stability. It is based on the SI7021 sensor IC and communicates via the I²C interface, making it easy to use with Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, Raspberry Pi, and other microcontrollers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"76\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:55:13'),
(3852,1,'product',1373,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GSM Security Board with Battery & Cabinet\",\"description\":\"The main objective of GSM Based Home Security is to alert the owner by  SMS and Phone calling if any trespass in the security zones.\",\"info\":\"1 GSM Security Module with Antenna\\r\\n1 3.7V 3000mAh Battery\\r\\n1 Power Adapter 12v 2A \\r\\n1 NO type DOOR Sensor\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"3500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"32\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:55:59'),
(3853,1,'product',532,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GEAR MOTOR WHEEL 7.5 X 1.3 CM\",\"description\":\"The 7.5 × 1.3 cm Gear Motor Wheel is a durable, lightweight wheel designed for DC geared motors used in robotics, smart car kits, and DIY engineering projects.\",\"info\":\"A 7.5 × 1.3 cm gear motor wheel is a medium-sized robot wheel (75 mm diameter × 13 mm width) designed to fit gear motors with compatible shaft sizes.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":320,\"secondary_id\":\"559\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:56:42'),
(3854,1,'product',2465,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Gear Motor\",\"description\":\"A gear motor is an integrated mechanical unit that combines an electric motor with a gearbox to deliver high torque at low speed.\",\"info\":\"Their compact design, energy efficiency, and ability to handle heavy loads make gear motors a reliable solution for both industrial and hobby electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"421\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:57:14'),
(3855,1,'product',2376,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5.1 Channel  TT-5090\",\"description\":\"The 5.1 Channel TT-5090 is a multimedia home theatre speaker system designed to provide immersive surround sound for movies, music, gaming, and TV entertainment. As a 5.1-channel setup, it includes five satellite speakers and one subwoofer, allowing sound to be distributed around the listener for a more cinematic experience compared to regular stereo speakers.\",\"info\":\"The subwoofer is responsible for producing deep bass tones, while the satellite speakers handle mid and high frequencies, creating balanced and dynamic audio output. This system typically supports multiple connectivity options such as Bluetooth, AUX input, USB, memory card (SD), and sometimes FM radio, making it compatible with smartphones, laptops, TVs, and other media devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"5.1 Home Theatre\",\"mrp\":\"10500.00\",\"note\":\"Many versions also include a remote control for convenient adjustment of volume, bass, treble, and input selection. The TT-5090 is generally suitable for small to medium-sized rooms and offers an affordable solution for users who want a home theatre-style audio setup with enhanced sound clarity and bass performance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":330,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":279}]}','2026-03-03 06:57:24'),
(3856,1,'product',2436,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"FPV Camera\",\"description\":\"An FPV (First Person View) camera is a compact, lightweight camera used mainly in drones, RC vehicles, robotics, and surveillance systems to provide a real-time video feed from the device’s point of view.\",\"info\":\"FPV cameras are widely used in drone racing, aerial photography assistance, robotics, security, and DIY electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"80\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:58:20'),
(3857,1,'product',2151,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"FP280-CN/11415 mini electric motor\",\"description\":\"The FP280-CN / 11415 is a miniature DC electric motor from the popular 280 series of small motors commonly used in hobby, robotics, and low-power applications\",\"info\":\"These motors are known for their compact size, reliable performance, and ease of use, running on low DC voltages such as 3 V to 12 V.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"459\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 06:59:32'),
(3858,1,'product',2429,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Flight Controller k.k.2.1.5\",\"description\":\"The Flight Controller KK 2.1.5 is a widely used multicopter control board designed for hobby drones and DIY UAV projects.\",\"info\":\"It supports multiple flight modes such as self-leveling and acrobatic mode, making it suitable for both beginners and experienced pilots.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"80\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 07:00:36'),
(3859,1,'product',2311,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5V 1650mAh Maxell Battery\",\"description\":\"The Maxell 1650 mAh lithium battery is a high-capacity power cell engineered to deliver stable, long-lasting performance for a variety of electronic devices. Built with reliable lithium chemistry, it provides consistent energy output and dependable service life in demanding applications.\",\"info\":\"These are high-capacity lithium batteries designed to supply stable DC power to electronic equipment that demands consistent voltage over a long period. They are manufactured with robust lithium chemistry for reliable performance and extended service life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"A 5V 1650mAh Maxell battery is a rechargeable or primary (non-rechargeable) battery pack manufactured by Maxell, a well-known brand in the energy storage industry. With a capacity of 1650 mAh (milliampere-hours), it can theoretically deliver 1650 milliamps of current for one hour or proportionally lower current for a longer duration, depending on the load.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 07:01:03'),
(3860,1,'product',2675,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview NVR IN-BUILT POE\",\"description\":\"The NVR301-04S2-P4 is a 4-channel network video recorder (NVR) designed for IP-based CCTV and video surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It acts as the central device that receives, processes, records, and manages video feeds from multiple IP cameras over a network.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1194],\"model\":\" NVR301-04S2-P4\",\"alternative_name\":\" NVR IN-BUILT POE\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Mount in a dry, stable location: Place the NVR away from moisture, direct sunlight, and heat sources to avoid overheating.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772521347674-79096569.jpg\"}','2026-03-03 07:02:27'),
(3861,1,'product',2455,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"500 RPM Motor\",\"description\":\"A 500 RPM motor is typically a DC geared motor designed to rotate at approximately 500 revolutions per minute (RPM) under rated voltage conditions. Unlike high-speed DC motors, this motor includes a built-in gearbox that reduces speed while increasing torque, making it suitable for applications that require controlled movement and higher pulling power.\",\"info\":\"It commonly operates at 6V, 9V, or 12V DC, depending on the model, and is widely used in robotics, DIY projects, conveyor systems, small automation setups, and motorized mechanisms.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Gear Motor\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"Because of the gear reduction, a 500 RPM motor provides better torque compared to standard high-speed motors, allowing it to drive wheels, pulleys, and mechanical linkages effectively. The motor usually has a metal or plastic gearbox, a straight or D-shaped output shaft, and can be easily mounted on robot chassis or mechanical frames. Speed can be controlled using PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) through motor driver modules like L298N or other H-bridge controllers.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"421\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 07:03:39'),
(3862,1,'product',2229,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"6.8uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 6.8µF 50V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, coupling, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 6.8 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is suitable for signal-level and low-power supply applications where moderate voltage tolerance is required.\",\"info\":\"The 6.8µF 50V capacitor is widely used in audio amplifiers, preamplifier circuits, voltage regulator inputs/outputs, timing circuits, and general-purpose electronics. \",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term operation.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 07:05:06'),
(3863,1,'product',2431,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Flight Controller A.P.M\",\"description\":\"Flight Controller A.P.M (ArduPilot Mega) is an open-source autopilot system widely used in drones, quadcopters, hexacopters, planes, and rovers.\",\"info\":\"Known for its reliability, flexibility, and strong community support, the APM flight controller is commonly used for learning, research, and hobby-level autonomous drone projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"C\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"80\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 07:07:23'),
(3864,1,'product',2552,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"600mah battery\",\"description\":\"A 600mAh battery is a small to medium capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in portable electronic devices such as Bluetooth speakers, wireless headphones, GPS trackers, handheld gadgets, toys, and embedded IoT systems. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates the battery’s storage capacity, meaning a 600mAh battery can theoretically supply 600 milliamps for one hour, 300mA for two hours, or lower current for a longer duration depending on the connected load and circuit efficiency.\",\"info\":\"It is widely used in portable and low-to-moderate power electronic devices where a balance of small size, light weight, and decent backup time is required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"note\":\"These batteries require a proper constant current–constant voltage (CC-CV) charging method, typically charged up to 4.2V maximum using a suitable lithium battery charging module. The recommended charging current is usually around 0.5C to 1C (300mA to 600mA) for safe and efficient charging.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 07:08:10'),
(3865,1,'product',2216,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"6800uF 25V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 6800µF 25V capacitor is a high-capacitance aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for bulk energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in low- to medium-voltage electronic circuits. With a very large capacitance of 6800 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is especially effective in applications that demand strong ripple reduction and stable power delivery under high current loads.\",\"info\":\"The 6800µF 25V capacitor is widely used in audio power amplifiers, DC power supplies, motor driver circuits, LED power supplies, SMPS secondary sections, and consumer electronics. \",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, suitable for PCB mounting and long-term reliable operation.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 07:09:31'),
