(3888,1,'product',2145,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ESP32 expansion board\",\"description\":\"The ESP32 Expansion Board is a development support board designed to enhance the usability and connectivity of ESP32 development modules by providing easy access to all input and output pins. It acts as an interface platform that simplifies circuit connections, making prototyping and project development faster and more reliable\",\"info\":\"The board typically includes clearly labeled GPIO pin headers, power input terminals, voltage regulation circuits, and multiple interface options such as UART, I2C, SPI, and PWM connections. Many ESP32 expansion boards also provide additional features like 5V/3.3V power output pins, USB power support, reset and boot buttons, and screw terminals for secure wiring of sensors, relays, and external devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"This expansion board is commonly used in IoT development, home automation, robotics, industrial monitoring, and embedded system projects where multiple sensors and modules need to be connected easily. It helps reduce wiring errors and eliminates the need for breadboards in permanent setups.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"443\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 07:24:39'),
