(3986,1,'product',2468,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"A3967 Motor\",\"description\":\"A3967 Motor Driver Module is a popular stepper motor driver based on the A3967 microstepping driver IC from Allegro. It is designed to control bipolar stepper motors with high precision, making it widely used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, camera sliders, and automation projects.\",\"info\":\"The A3967 supports full-step, half-step, quarter-step, and eighth-step microstepping, allowing smoother motor movement, reduced vibration, and quieter operation compared to basic stepper drivers. It operates with a motor supply voltage typically from 6V to 30V and logic control voltage of 3.3V or 5V, making it compatible with controllers such as Arduino, Raspberry Pi Pico, ESP32, and other microcontrollers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"A3967 Motor Driver\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"It operates with a motor supply voltage typically from 6V to 30V and logic control voltage of 3.3V or 5V, making it compatible with controllers such as Arduino, Raspberry Pi Pico, ESP32, and other microcontrollers.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":453,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:17:16'),
(3987,1,'product',2076,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Acer Remote\",\"description\":\"Acer TV Remote is a user-friendly and reliable controller designed to work seamlessly with Acer LED, LCD, and Smart TVs. It features a comfortable ergonomic design with soft, responsive buttons for easy navigation of channels, volume control, input selection, and menu settings. The remote provides stable performance with long-range infrared transmission, ensuring smooth operation from anywhere in the room. \",\"info\":\"The remote provides stable performance with long-range infrared transmission, ensuring smooth operation from anywhere in the room. Built with durable materials and simple plug-and-play functionality, it requires no setup—just insert the batteries and start using it instantly.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Acer Remote\",\"mrp\":\"900.00\",\"note\":\"Built with durable materials and simple plug-and-play functionality, it requires no setup—just insert the batteries and start using it instantly.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"470\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:18:33'),
(3988,1,'product',2579,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ADIY PICO TYPE C\",\"description\":\"The ADIY PICO Type-C is a compact microcontroller development board based on the RP2040 chipset, similar in functionality to the Raspberry Pi Pico but upgraded with a USB Type-C connector for improved durability and modern connectivity. It is ideal for embedded systems, IoT projects, robotics, and DIY electronics.\",\"info\":\"It is ideal for embedded systems, IoT projects, robotics, and DIY electronics.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"It is ideal for embedded systems, IoT projects, robotics, and DIY electronics.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"59\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:20:36'),
(3989,1,'product',231,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"E PAPER 2.9inch Display\",\"description\":\"E-paper (or e-ink) displays use microcapsule electrophoretic technology to display images and text with very low power consumption. Once an image is rendered, it can stay visible indefinitely without power — making them ideal for low-power and always-on applications.\",\"info\":\"E-PAPER 2.9inch Display is a low-power electronic paper (e-ink) screen featuring high contrast and excellent readability in sunlight.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"6500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":\"52\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:21:18'),
(3990,1,'product',936,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"AHD/CVI/TVI/CVBS Video Balun\",\"description\":\"The AHD/CVI/TVI/CVBS Video Balun is a versatile and high-performance transmission device designed to send HD and analog CCTV video signals over long distances using CAT5/CAT6 twisted-pair cables. Compatible with multiple video formats—including AHD, HD-CVI, HD-TVI, and CVBS—it ensures stable, clear, and interference-free video quality without compression or delay.\",\"info\":\"A video balun converts video signals between unbalanced (coaxial) and balanced (twisted-pair) formats. This lets you transmit HD CCTV signals (AHD, HD-CVI, HD-TVI) and standard CVBS analog video over Cat5e/Cat6 network cables, often up to several hundred meters with minimal interference\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":304,\"secondary_id\":\"308\",\"brand_id\":125}]}','2026-03-03 09:22:01'),
(3991,1,'product',2147,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Air Pump Motor\",\"description\":\"An air pump motor is an electric motor designed to generate airflow by converting electrical energy into mechanical motion, which drives a diaphragm, piston, or rotary vane mechanism to push air. These motors are commonly available in DC (3V, 6V, 9V, 12V) and AC versions, depending on the application. Mini DC air pump motors are widely used in aquariums, medical devices, air purifiers, inflatable products, DIY science projects, pneumatic systems, and small automation setups.\",\"info\":\"Air pump motors are available in DC and AC versions and come in various sizes depending on airflow and pressure requirements.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"Air pump motor include operating voltage, current consumption, airflow rate (L/min), pressure rating (kPa or PSI), noise level, and power consumption. Proper ventilation and correct power supply are essential to ensure safe and long-lasting performance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"461\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:23:21'),
(3992,1,'product',2680,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Uniview NVR - S SERIES\",\"description\":\"The Uniview NVR304-64E2 is a professional 64-channel IP Network Video Recorder designed for large CCTV/IP camera surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It serves as the central unit that receives, manages, records, and plays back video feeds from up to 64 network (IP) cameras — suitable for large facilities, campuses, offices, warehouses, or multi-location security needs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1194],\"model\":\" NVR304-64E2\",\"alternative_name\":\" NVR - S SERIES\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Use a surge protector or UPS (uninterruptible power supply) to protect the device from power spikes and outages.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772529815244-195169632.jpg\"}','2026-03-03 09:23:35'),
(3993,1,'product',2137,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DS18B20 Waterproof Digital Temperature\",\"description\":\"The DS18B20 Waterproof Digital Temperature Sensor is a high-accuracy, digital temperature sensor sealed in a stainless steel probe, making it suitable for wet, humid, and harsh environments.\",\"info\":\"It uses the 1-Wire communication protocol, allowing multiple sensors to be connected on a single data line, each with a unique ID.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"76\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:24:25'),
(3994,1,'product',2061,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Airtel DTH Remote\",\"description\":\"The Airtel DTH Remote is a handheld remote control device used to operate the set-top box of Airtel Digital TV, a direct-to-home (DTH) television service in India. It allows users to control various functions such as changing channels, adjusting volume, accessing the program guide, navigating menus, recording programs (on supported models), and managing settings. The remote typically works using infrared (IR) technology, which communicates with the set-top box when pointed directly at it.\",\"info\":\"The remote typically works using infrared (IR) technology, which communicates with the set-top box when pointed directly at it.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Airtel DTH Remote\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"The remote usually operates on AAA batteries (2 pieces) and is designed for easy handling with clearly labeled buttons for user convenience. It is an essential accessory for controlling the Airtel Digital TV set-top box and enhancing the overall home entertainment experience.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"125\",\"brand_id\":121}]}','2026-03-03 09:24:59'),
