(4017,1,'product',2537,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Antenna GSM Sticker\",\"description\":\"A GSM Antenna Sticker (also called an adhesive or patch GSM antenna) is a flat, lightweight antenna designed to receive and transmit GSM cellular signals (typically in the 850/900/1800/1900 MHz bands) without the bulk of a traditional “whip” antenna.\",\"info\":\"These antennas are made using printed traces on a flexible substrate and come with an adhesive backing so they can stick directly onto enclosures, metal surfaces, or plastic cases.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Antenna GSM Sticker\",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"note\":\"These antennas are made using printed traces on a flexible substrate and come with an adhesive backing so they can stick directly onto enclosures, metal surfaces, or plastic cases.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"571\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:46:11'),
(4018,1,'product',2120,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"D-Link CAT6 Networking Cable\",\"description\":\"The D-Link cable you asked about is a Category-6 (CAT6) Ethernet cable. CAT6 cables are a standard for wired networking that support higher performance than older standards (like CAT5 or CAT5e).\",\"info\":\"Brand\\tD-Link\\r\\nConnector Gender\\tMale-to-Male\\r\\nItem Weight\\t10570 Grams\\r\\nItem Length\\t30500 Centimetres\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"14999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":115,\"secondary_id\":\"406\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:46:49'),
(4019,1,'product',2247,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Current Sensor Module\",\"description\":\"A Current Sensor Module is an electronic device used to measure the flow of electrical current in a circuit and convert it into a readable voltage signal. Most commonly based on Hall-effect sensing technology (such as ACS712 or ACS758), the module can measure both AC and DC current safely without direct electrical contact with the measuring circuit.\",\"info\":\"It provides an analog output proportional to the current, allowing easy interfacing with microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP32, and Raspberry Pi. These modules are widely used in power monitoring, battery management systems, motor control, and energy measurement applications due to their accuracy, electrical isolation, and simple integration.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"399.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"18\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:47:41'),
(4020,1,'product',2340,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CR2 Panasonic  3V battery\",\"description\":\"The Panasonic CR2 is a 3 V primary lithium battery manufactured by Panasonic, known for reliable, high-quality batteries with long life and stable voltage.\",\"info\":\"This compact cell is widely used in devices that require high energy output in a small form factor.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":11}]}','2026-03-03 09:48:20'),
(4021,1,'product',2280,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CR14250SE 3V PLC Lithium Batteries\",\"description\":\"The FDK CR14250SE 3V lithium battery for PLC and similar variants (like Sanyo Lithium Batteries or Compatible Sanyo CR14250SE 3V battery with connector) are primary (non-rechargeable) lithium batteries designed to deliver a stable 3 V DC output and long service life for industrial electronics.\",\"info\":\"The CR14250SE battery is commonly used as a PLC/CNC backup battery because it reliably supplies low current over many years without maintenance, making it perfect for electronic memory retention\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:48:54'),
(4022,1,'product',832,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Compatible Remote for Model No. URC 151\",\"description\":\"The Compatible Remote for Model No. URC-151 is a high-quality replacement remote designed to work flawlessly with TVs originally operated using the URC-151 remote model. It features a durable build, responsive soft-touch keys, and a user-friendly layout that mirrors the original remote’s functions. No programming or setup is required—simply insert the batteries and start using it.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"799.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:49:38'),
(4023,1,'product',850,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Common LCD / LED TV Remote RM-L1346 +\",\"description\":\"A budget friendly IR universal remote designed for use with many LCD/LED TVs, particularly compatible with the Sharp brand.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":230,\"secondary_id\":\"124\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:50:13'),
(4024,1,'product',2124,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Color Sensor Module TCS3200D/TCS2300\",\"description\":\"High-resolution conversion of light intensity to frequency.\\r\\nThe pins have 2.54 mm pitch.\\r\\nMil-convenient for bitmap board.\\r\\nProgrammable color and full-scale output frequency.\\r\\nCommunicate directly with a microcontroller.\\r\\nLow-profile surface mount package.\",\"info\":\"Operating Voltage: 3V-5V\\r\\nHigh-resolution conversion of light intensity to frequency.\\r\\nChip pins all has drawn for standard 100.\\r\\nPut the needle (2.54 mm).\\r\\nMil-convenient for bitmap board.\\r\\nProgrammable color and full-scale output frequency.\\r\\nCommunicate directly with a microcontroller.\\r\\nLow-profile surface mount package.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"900.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"71\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 09:50:50'),
(4025,1,'product',2536,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GSM Antenna \",\"description\":\"A GSM Antenna is a dedicated radio antenna designed to transmit and receive GSM (Global System for Mobile communications) signals.\",\"info\":\"These antennas connect to GSM modems, modules, or routers (like SIM800, SIM900, A6, M590, Quectel, etc.) and ensure reliable cellular connectivity for voice, SMS, and data communication. \",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"GSM Antenna \",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"note\":\"They are a crucial part of any GSM-based project, whether it’s a GSM tracker, IoT device, alarm system, or remote controller.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"571\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 10:00:50'),
(4026,1,'product',1136,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"AP89170\",\"description\":\"AP89170 is an integrated circuit commonly used in electronic control and signal-processing applications where stable and reliable performance is required.\",\"info\":\"The AP89170 allows recording and playback of voice or audio using non-volatile memory, so recorded messages are retained even after power is removed. It supports push-button control or microcontroller interfacing and provides clear audio output through an external speaker or amplifier, making it suitable for standalone voice modules.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"AP89170 IC\",\"mrp\":\"99\",\"note\":\"It supports push-button control or microcontroller interfacing and provides clear audio output through an external speaker or amplifier, making it suitable for standalone voice modules.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 10:01:49'),
(4027,1,'product',1137,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"AP9010\",\"description\":\"AP9010 is a compact power-management integrated circuit designed to provide stable and efficient voltage regulation in electronic systems.\",\"info\":\"The AP9010 allows recording and playback of voice or audio through an external microphone and speaker. It uses non-volatile memory, so recorded messages are retained even when power is turned off. \",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"AP9010 IC\",\"mrp\":\"99\",\"note\":\"With simple key control and low component count, it’s well suited for small, low-cost voice modules.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 10:02:33'),
(4028,1,'product',2413,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"APDS-9930 Gesture\",\"description\":\"The APDS-9930 Gesture Sensor is a multifunction optical sensing module that combines gesture detection, proximity sensing, and ambient light measurement in a single compact IC. It is designed to detect hand gestures (near/far), object proximity, and light intensity, making it ideal for touchless control and smart device interfaces.\",\"info\":\"The APDS-9930 Gesture Sensor is a multifunction optical sensor used for gesture detection, proximity sensing, and ambient light measurement. It integrates an infrared (IR) LED, photodiodes, and processing circuitry in a single package and communicates with microcontrollers via the I²C interface.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"APDS-9930 Gesture\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"It is designed to detect hand gestures (near/far), object proximity, and light intensity, making it ideal for touchless control and smart device interfaces.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"77\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 10:06:48'),
(4029,1,'product',2389,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"APR33A3 Voice Recorder & Playback(ZA)\",\"description\":\"The APR33A3 Voice Recorder & Playback (ZA) is a compact audio recording and playback module designed to store and reproduce voice messages with good clarity. It is based on the APR33A3 voice IC and uses non-volatile memory, so recorded audio is retained even when power is removed. \",\"info\":\"The APR33A3 Voice Recorder & Playback (ZA) module is an audio module used to record, store, and play back voice messages. It is built around the APR33A3 voice IC, which stores audio in non-volatile memory, ensuring that recorded messages are retained even when power is removed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"APR33A3 Voice Recorder & Playback(ZA)\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"The module supports simple push-button control as well as microcontroller interfacing, making it suitable for both standalone and embedded applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"63\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 10:10:02'),
