(4051,1,'product',1349,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Audio Playback Board\",\"description\":\"An Audio Playback Board is an electronic module designed to play pre-recorded audio files such as MP3 or WAV from storage devices like microSD cards, USB drives, or onboard memory. These boards are commonly used in embedded systems and DIY electronics projects to add sound output without needing complex audio processing circuits.\",\"info\":\"Most audio playback boards include a built-in audio decoder IC, small amplifier section, and output pins for connecting directly to a speaker or to an external amplifier for louder sound.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Audio Playback Board\",\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"note\":\"Many modules support common audio formats such as MP3 and WAV, and can be controlled through push buttons, serial communication (UART), or microcontrollers like Arduino and ESP32. Some popular versions include compact boards with integrated amplifiers capable of directly driving small 3W or 5W speakers. They typically operate at 3.3V or 5V DC and are designed for low-power applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":448,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:04:04'),
(4052,1,'product',170,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Audio Playback Board Pen Drive version CW\",\"description\":\"The Audio Playback Board (Pendrive version CW) — often labeled as MP3 Player Board CW, USB Audio Module, or CW-Audio Module — is a compact MP3 playback circuit capable of playing audio files (MP3/WAV) stored in a USB Pendrive or TF (MicroSD) card, without needing a microcontroller.\",\"info\":\"The Audio Playback Board (Pendrive Version – CW) is a compact digital audio decoder module designed to play MP3 audio files directly from a USB pendrive. It supports plug-and-play operation, allowing users to store audio tracks on a USB drive and play them through connected speakers or an external amplifier.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Audio Playback Board Pen Drive version CW\",\"mrp\":\"2200.00\",\"note\":\"The board typically includes onboard audio decoding circuitry, control buttons, and output terminals for easy integration into electronic projects. It is widely used in announcement systems, DIY audio players, toys, automation alerts, and embedded audio applications due to its simple operation and reliable playback performance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":448,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:05:00'),
(4053,1,'product',2433,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"B3 Charger\",\"description\":\"The B3 Charger is a compact and easy-to-use LiPo (Lithium Polymer) battery balance charger, commonly used in RC hobby applications such as drones, RC cars, helicopters, and airplanes.\",\"info\":\"The B3 charger features LED indicators that clearly show charging status for each cell, making it beginner-friendly and reliable for daily use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"B3 Charger\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"The B3 charger features LED indicators that clearly show charging status for each cell, making it beginner-friendly and reliable for daily use.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":534,\"secondary_id\":\"518\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:06:28'),
(4054,1,'product',2164,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"B764\",\"description\":\"The B764 (2SB764) is a PNP power transistor commonly used in audio amplifier and power regulation circuits. It is designed for medium to high-power switching and amplification applications, providing stable performance and good thermal reliability.\",\"info\":\"The transistor is typically paired with complementary NPN transistors in push-pull amplifier stages to deliver efficient audio output. With its TO-220 package, the B764 allows easy mounting with a heatsink for improved heat dissipation, making it suitable for amplifier boards, power supplies, and electronic control circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Transistor\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"With its TO-220 package, the B764 allows easy mounting with a heatsink for improved heat dissipation, making it suitable for amplifier boards, power supplies, and electronic control circuits.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":414,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:07:12'),
