(4056,1,'product',2497,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Battery  for RC Drone 180mah\",\"description\":\"A 180mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight Lithium-Polymer (Li-Po) power source designed mainly for mini and nano drones.\",\"info\":\"Due to its small size and quick charging capability, the 180mAh RC drone battery is widely used in toy drones, micro quadcopters, and DIY lightweight aerial projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"Due to its small size and quick charging capability, the 180mAh RC drone battery is widely used in toy drones, micro quadcopters, and DIY lightweight aerial projects.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:08:39'),
(4057,1,'product',2504,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Battery for RC Drone 1200 mah\",\"description\":\"An RC drone’s battery with a 1200 mAh capacity is typically a 3.7 V lithium-polymer (LiPo) rechargeable battery designed to provide lightweight yet reliable power for small to medium-sized quadcopters and hobby drones.\",\"info\":\"Charging with the correct charger and avoiding over-discharge helps maintain performance and safety over many flights.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"Charging with the correct charger and avoiding over-discharge helps maintain performance and safety over many flights.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:09:27'),
(4058,1,'product',2500,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Battery for RC Drone 500 mah\",\"description\":\"A 500 mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight, and rechargeable power source specifically designed to provide the energy needed for small remote-controlled aircraft to fly.\",\"info\":\"Proper charging and handling according to manufacturer guidelines is essential for safety and longevity of the battery.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"Proper charging and handling according to manufacturer guidelines is essential for safety and longevity of the battery.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:10:03'),
(4059,1,'product',2502,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Battery for RC Drone 800 mah\",\"description\":\"An 800 mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight power source designed to supply sufficient energy for small to medium-sized remote-controlled aircraft\",\"info\":\"Always ensure proper charging, storage, and handling to maximize performance and longevity.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"An 800 mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight power source designed to supply sufficient energy for small to medium-sized remote-controlled aircraft\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:10:37'),
(4060,1,'product',2503,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Battery for RC Drone 850 mah\",\"description\":\"An 850 mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight power source designed to deliver a balance of flight time and agility for small to medium-sized remote-controlled aircraft.\",\"info\":\"Overall, an 850 mAh RC drone battery is ideal for hobbyists seeking good performance in a lightweight package for casual flying, aerial photography, or racing drones in its class.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"An 850 mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight power source designed to deliver a balance of flight time and agility for small to medium-sized remote-controlled aircraft.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:11:38'),
(4061,1,'product',2163,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BF422\",\"description\":\"The BF422 is a high-voltage NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) designed for amplification and switching applications in electronic circuits. It is especially suitable for video amplifier stages, television circuits, and high-voltage signal processing, where stable operation and reliable performance are required.\",\"info\":\"The transistor supports high collector-emitter voltage handling while maintaining low power consumption and good signal gain. Packaged in a compact TO-92 through-hole case, the BF422 is easy to mount on PCBs and is widely used in analog circuits, driver stages, and general-purpose electronic designs requiring moderate current and high voltage capability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Transistor\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"note\":\"It is especially suitable for video amplifier stages, television circuits, and high-voltage signal processing, where stable operation and reliable performance are required.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":414,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:12:22'),
(4062,1,'product',2161,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BF495\",\"description\":\"BF495 is an NPN RF (Radio Frequency) transistor designed for high-frequency amplification and switching applications.\",\"info\":\"It is commonly used in VHF/UHF amplifiers, RF oscillators, IF stages, and communication equipment where stable performance at higher frequencies is required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Transistor\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"It is commonly used in VHF/UHF amplifiers, RF oscillators, IF stages, and communication equipment where stable performance at higher frequencies is required.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":414,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:12:54'),
(4063,1,'product',2457,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Bi-Directional Logic Level\",\"description\":\"Bi-Directional Logic Level Converter is an electronic interface module designed to safely translate digital signals between two different voltage logic levels, most commonly 5V and 3.3V TTL, in both directions automatically. Unlike simple one-way converters, this module allows signals to flow from low-voltage to high-voltage and from high-voltage to low-voltage without any manual switching or control signals.\",\"info\":\"The module typically uses a MOSFET-based level shifting circuit, making it highly reliable for mixed-voltage systems. It has clearly labeled HV (high-voltage) and LV (low-voltage) power pins, along with multiple independent signal channels. Once powered, each channel automatically detects the signal direction and converts the voltage level accordingly.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Bi-Directional Logic Level\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\" Unlike simple one-way converters, this module allows signals to flow from low-voltage to high-voltage and from high-voltage to low-voltage without any manual switching or control signals.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"21\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:15:12'),
(4064,1,'product',2156,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Big DC Electric Motor (yellow)\",\"description\":\"The Big Yellow DC Electric Motor, commonly known as a yellow gear motor or TT motor, is a high-torque DC motor widely used in robotics and DIY electronic projects. It includes an internal gearbox that reduces speed while increasing torque, making it ideal for robot cars and automation applications.\",\"info\":\"The motor operates on low DC voltage and provides stable rotation with efficient power consumption. Its lightweight plastic housing and easy mounting design make it suitable for educational kits, prototype development, and hobby electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Big DC Electric Motor (yellow)\",\"mrp\":\"299\",\"note\":\"It includes an internal gearbox that reduces speed while increasing torque, making it ideal for robot cars and automation applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"418\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-03 11:15:54'),
