(4093,1,'product',2209,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2200uF 25V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"2200µF 25V capacitor is a high-capacitance aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for bulk energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in low- to medium-voltage electronic circuits. \",\"info\":\"2200µF 25V capacitor is widely used in audio amplifiers, DC power supplies, LED driver circuits, motor control boards, SMPS secondary sections, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and long-term durability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 2200 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is ideal for applications that require effective ripple reduction and stable power delivery.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 10:59:14'),
(4094,1,'product',2213,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2200uF 35V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 2200µF 35V capacitor is a high-capacitance, medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used for bulk energy storage, filtering, and smoothing in electronic power circuits. \",\"info\":\"The 2200µF 35V capacitor is widely used in audio amplifiers, DC power supplies, SMPS secondary circuits, motor driver boards, LED power supplies, and industrial electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it suitable for PCB mounting and long-term reliable operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 2200 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 35 volts DC, it is ideal for applications that require strong ripple reduction and stable voltage under varying load conditions.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:00:14'),
(4095,1,'product',2182,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"220uF 160V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 220µF 160V capacitor is a high-capacitance, high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used to store energy, smooth DC output, and reduce ripple voltage in power and control circuits operating at elevated voltages\",\"info\":\"It is a polarized component, so correct polarity is essential during installation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"It is a polarized component, so correct polarity is essential during installation.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:04:34'),
(4096,1,'product',2217,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"220uF 25V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 220µF 25V capacitor is a low- to medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor widely used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 220 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is suitable for many general-purpose power and signal applications.\",\"info\":\"The 220µF 25V capacitor is frequently used in DC power supplies, audio circuits, microcontroller boards, LED driver circuits, voltage regulator outputs, and consumer electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on PCBs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 220 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is suitable for many general-purpose power and signal applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:05:12'),
(4097,1,'product',2206,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"220uF 35V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 220µF 35V capacitor is an electrolytic capacitor commonly used in electronic circuits for power supply filtering, voltage smoothing, and energy storage. The capacitance value of 220 microfarads (µF) allows it to store a moderate amount of electrical charge, which helps reduce voltage fluctuations and ripple in DC power supplies.\",\"info\":\"The 35V rating indicates the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely handle; for better reliability and longer life, it is recommended to use it in circuits operating below 25–30V. This capacitor is polarized, meaning it has clearly marked positive (+) and negative (–) terminals and must be connected with the correct polarity to avoid damage, leakage, or failure.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"It usually comes in a cylindrical aluminum casing with radial leads for easy PCB mounting and is available with 85°C or 105°C temperature ratings. The 220µF 35V capacitor is widely used in audio amplifier circuits, voltage regulator output filtering, motor driver circuits, power supply circuits, LED driver circuits, and microcontroller-based systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:07:04'),
(4098,1,'product',2242,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"220uF 450V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"The 220µF 450V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for power supply filtering and energy storage in electronic circuits\",\"info\":\"It is commonly used in SMPS power supplies, LED drivers, inverters, and amplifier systems to smooth rectified DC voltage and reduce ripple noise. Built for high reliability, it ensures stable operation in high-voltage applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"note\":\"The 220µF 450V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for power supply filtering and energy storage in electronic circuits\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:07:49'),
(4099,1,'product',2211,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"220uF 50V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"220µF 50V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 220 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that operate at moderate DC voltage levels.\",\"info\":\"The 220µF 50V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS circuits, industrial control boards, motor driver circuits, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 220 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 50 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that operate at moderate DC voltage levels.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:08:27'),
(4100,1,'product',2235,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"220uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 220µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 220 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is well suited for applications that require higher voltage tolerance with moderate energy storage.\",\"info\":\"The 220µF 63V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio amplifiers, SMPS sections, motor driver circuits, industrial control boards, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, designed for easy PCB mounting and reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 220 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is well suited for applications that require higher voltage tolerance with moderate energy storage.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:08:48'),
(4101,1,'product',2176,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1uF 160V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 1µF 160V capacitor is a high-voltage capacitor used for signal coupling, decoupling, timing, and filtering in electronic circuits that operate at elevated voltages\",\"info\":\"Depending on the application, this value is commonly available as an electrolytic (polarized) or a film capacitor (non-polarized).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"Depending on the application, this value is commonly available as an electrolytic (polarized) or a film capacitor (non-polarized).\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:09:12'),
(4102,1,'product',2201,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 1µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage capacitor widely used for signal coupling, decoupling, timing, and filtering in electronic circuits that operate at elevated DC voltages.\",\"info\":\"This value is commonly available as an aluminum electrolytic (polarized) or a film capacitor (non-polarized), depending on stability and longevity requirements.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"This value is commonly available as an aluminum electrolytic (polarized) or a film capacitor (non-polarized), depending on stability and longevity requirements.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:09:34'),
(4103,1,'product',2222,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1uF 450V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 1µF 450V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for use in electronic circuits that operate at very high DC voltages. With a capacitance of 1 microfarad and a maximum rated voltage of 450 volts DC, it is mainly used where voltage endurance is critical rather than large energy storage.\",\"info\":\"The 1µF 450V capacitor is widely used in SMPS power supplies, LED drivers, inverters, CRT/TV circuits, industrial control systems, and high-voltage amplifier stages. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, insulated for safe and reliable PCB mounting.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 1 microfarad and a maximum rated voltage of 450 volts DC, it is mainly used where voltage endurance is critical rather than large energy storage.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:09:58'),
(4104,1,'product',2208,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 1µF 63V capacitor is a low-to-medium voltage capacitor commonly used for signal coupling, decoupling, timing, and noise filtering in electronic circuits\",\"info\":\"It is available in both electrolytic (polarized) and film (non-polarized) types, depending on the application.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"It is available in both electrolytic (polarized) and film (non-polarized) types, depending on the application.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:10:20'),
