(4107,1,'product',2374,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2.0 Chaneel Tower Speaker  TT-66\",\"description\":\"The 2.0 Channel Tower Speaker TT-66 is a tall, floor-standing stereo speaker system designed to deliver rich and immersive audio for home entertainment, parties, and multimedia setups.\",\"info\":\"It features dual full-range drivers that provide clear highs and deep lows across a wide frequency range, ensuring balanced sound quality for movies, music, and games. Built with a sleek and modern cabinet design, this tower speaker not only enhances your audio experience but also adds a stylish look to your living room or entertainment space.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Bluetooth Speaker\",\"mrp\":\"8999.00\",\"note\":\"Built with a sleek and modern cabinet design, this tower speaker not only enhances your audio experience but also adds a stylish look to your living room or entertainment space.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":\"573\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:20:15'),
(4108,1,'product',2252,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2.2nF (222)\",\"description\":\"A 2.2 nF (222) ceramic capacitor is a small-value, non-polarized capacitor that uses a ceramic dielectric to store and release electrical charge efficiently. The marking 222 represents 2,200 pF, calculated as 22 × 10² pF, which equals 2.2 nF or 0.0022 µF.\",\"info\":\"This capacitor is available in ceramic disc (through-hole) and MLCC / SMD forms. It offers good high-frequency characteristics, low dielectric loss, and stable performance across a wide temperature range. \",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"Typical voltage ratings include 50 V, 100 V, 250 V, 400 V, and 630 V for disc capacitors, while MLCC versions usually range from 16 V to 100 V, depending on size and dielectric type.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:20:46'),
(4109,1,'product',2183,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2.2uF 160V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 2.2µF 160V capacitor is an electronic component used to store and release electrical energy in a circuit. The value 2.2µF (microfarads) represents the capacitance, which indicates the amount of electrical charge the capacitor can store, while 160V represents the maximum voltage that the capacitor can safely handle without damage. These capacitors are commonly available as electrolytic capacitors or sometimes film capacitors, and they are widely used in electronic circuits for filtering, coupling, decoupling, and timing applications.\",\"info\":\"In electronic circuits, a 2.2µF 160V capacitor is often used in power supply filtering, audio circuits, signal coupling, and voltage smoothing. Because of its relatively high voltage rating, it can be used in circuits where voltage levels are higher, such as in power adapters, amplifier circuits, LED drivers, and switching power supplies.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"These capacitors typically come in a cylindrical aluminum body with two radial leads at the bottom. The body is marked with its capacitance value (2.2µF) and voltage rating (160V) for easy identification. They are designed to operate within a specified temperature range, commonly –40°C to +105°C, depending on the manufacturer.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:22:56'),
(4110,1,'product',2200,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2.2uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 2.2µF 250V capacitor is an electronic component used to store electrical energy and release it when required in an electronic circuit. The value 2.2 microfarads (µF) indicates the capacitance, which represents the amount of electric charge the capacitor can hold, while 250 volts (V) indicates the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely withstand.\",\"info\":\"These capacitors are commonly available as electrolytic capacitors or polyester/film capacitors, and they are widely used in power supply circuits, audio equipment, and electronic control systems. Because of the higher voltage rating of 250V, this capacitor can operate safely in circuits that handle relatively high voltage levels such as power converters, amplifier circuits, LED drivers, and switching power supplies.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"2.2µF 250V capacitor is often used for filtering, coupling, decoupling, and signal smoothing. In power supply sections, it helps reduce voltage ripple and stabilize the output voltage. In audio circuits, it can be used for signal coupling between amplifier stages to block DC while allowing AC signals to pass.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:34:42'),
(4111,1,'product',2233,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2.2uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 2.2µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for signal coupling, filtering, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 2.2 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that require small capacitance with higher voltage tolerance.\",\"info\":\"The 2.2µF 63V capacitor is widely used in audio circuits, power supplies, SMPS sections, voltage regulator stages, timing circuits, and consumer electronics. It typically comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on PCBs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 2.2 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that require small capacitance with higher voltage tolerance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:35:31'),
(4112,1,'product',2480,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"20KG Servo motor\",\"description\":\"A 20KG Servo Motor is a high-torque servo motor commonly used in robotics, RC vehicles, automation systems, and mechanical control applications. The term 20KG refers to the torque rating of the servo motor, which means it can provide approximately 20 kilograms-centimeter (kg·cm) of torque, allowing it to move or hold relatively heavy loads.\",\"info\":\"This means it can exert enough rotational force to lift or move a load of 20 kg at 1 cm from the shaft, making it suitable for large robots, RC vehicles, heavy-load mechanisms, steering systems, and industrial applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Servo motor\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"Most 20KG servo motors operate within a voltage range of about 4.8V to 7.4V, and they typically use metal gears for higher strength and durability compared to plastic gear servos. The motor contains several internal components such as a DC motor, gear reduction system, control circuit, and position feedback potentiometer, which work together to provide accurate movement.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"422\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:36:47'),
(4113,1,'product',2399,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2200mah Drone battery\",\"description\":\"A 2200 mAh drone battery is a rechargeable power pack commonly used in hobby and small to medium-sized quadcopters, UAVs, and RC aircraft. The “2200 mAh” figure means the battery has a capacity of 2200 milliamp hours — essentially how much electrical charge it can store.\",\"info\":\"Most 2200 mAh drone batteries are 3-cell (3S) designs providing around 11.1 V nominal voltage, making them suitable for a broad range of consumer drones and hobby multirotors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"The “2200 mAh” figure means the battery has a capacity of 2200 milliamp hours — essentially how much electrical charge it can store.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:37:17'),
