(4123,1,'product',2251,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"22nF (223)\",\"description\":\"This capacitor value is commonly available in ceramic disc (through-hole) and MLCC / SMD packages. It offers good stability, low dielectric loss, and reliable high-frequency performance. Typical voltage ratings range from 50 V to 630 V for disc types, while MLCC versions usually range from 16 V to 100 V, depending on size and dielectric class.\",\"info\":\"A 22 nF ceramic capacitor is widely used for signal coupling, noise filtering, decoupling, and EMI/RFI suppression in analog, digital, and power-supply circuits. Because it is non-polarized, it can be connected in either direction and works well in both AC and DC applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Ceramic Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"Typical voltage ratings range from 50 V to 630 V for disc types, while MLCC versions usually range from 16 V to 100 V, depending on size and dielectric class.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":416,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:46:23'),
(4124,1,'product',2175,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"22uF 160V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"22µF 160V capacitor is an electronic component used in electrical and electronic circuits to store and release electrical energy when required. The value 22 microfarads (µF) represents the capacitance, which indicates how much electrical charge the capacitor can store, while 160 volts (V) represents the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely handle without failure. This type of capacitor is commonly available as an aluminum electrolytic capacitor, which usually has a cylindrical body with two leads and is marked with its capacitance and voltage rating for identification.\",\"info\":\"22µF 160V capacitor is widely used for power supply filtering, voltage smoothing, signal coupling, and decoupling applications. It helps stabilize voltage levels by reducing ripple in power supplies and allows AC signals to pass while blocking DC in amplifier circuits. Because of its 160V rating, it can be safely used in circuits that operate at relatively high voltages such as power supply units, LED drivers, audio amplifier circuits, and switching power supplies.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"Electrolytic capacitors of this type are polarized components, meaning they have positive and negative terminals that must be connected correctly in the circuit. Incorrect polarity may damage the capacitor or cause it to fail. These capacitors are typically designed to operate within temperature ranges such as –40°C to +105°C, depending on the manufacturer. Proper selection and correct installation ensure reliable operation, longer lifespan, and stable performance in electronic systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:47:45'),
(4125,1,'product',2195,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"22uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 22µF 250V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed to store energy, smooth DC voltage, and reduce ripple in electronic circuits operating at elevated voltages\",\"info\":\"It is a polarized component, so correct polarity must be observed during installation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"Electrolytic capacitors of this type are polarized components, meaning they have positive and negative terminals that must be connected correctly in the circuit. Incorrect polarity may damage the capacitor or cause it to fail. These capacitors are typically designed to operate within temperature ranges such as –40°C to +105°C, depending on the manufacturer. \",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:48:16'),
(4126,1,'product',2219,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"22uF 25V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 22µF 25V capacitor is a low- to medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 22 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 25 volts DC, it is ideal for small-signal and low-power applications.\",\"info\":\"The 22µF 25V capacitor is widely used in microcontroller boards, audio circuits, DC adapters, voltage regulator outputs, LED driver circuits, and consumer electronics. \",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on PCBs.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:48:38'),
(4127,1,'product',2224,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"22uF 450V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 22µF 450V capacitor is a high-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor designed for electronic circuits that operate at very high DC voltages. With a capacitance of 22 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 450 volts DC, it is commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and energy storage in high-voltage power sections.\",\"info\":\"The 22µF 450V capacitor is widely used in SMPS power supplies, LED drivers, inverters, audio amplifiers, UPS systems, and industrial electronic equipment. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, insulated for safety and suitable for long-term PCB mounting.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 22 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 450 volts DC, it is commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and energy storage in high-voltage power sections.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:49:01'),
(4128,1,'product',2230,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"22uF 63V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"A 22µF 63V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor commonly used for filtering, smoothing, and decoupling in electronic circuits. With a capacitance of 22 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that operate at higher voltages than standard low-voltage circuits.\",\"info\":\"The 22µF 63V capacitor is widely used in DC power supplies, audio circuits, SMPS sections, voltage regulator outputs, industrial control boards, and consumer electronics. It usually comes in a radial-lead cylindrical aluminum body, making it easy to mount on PCBs and ensuring reliable long-term performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"With a capacitance of 22 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 63 volts DC, it is suitable for applications that operate at higher voltages than standard low-voltage circuits.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":228}]}','2026-03-04 11:49:17'),
(4129,1,'product',2240,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"23uF 16V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"The 23µF 16V capacitor is a low-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used for filtering, coupling, and voltage stabilization in electronic circuits\",\"info\":\"It helps smooth DC signals by reducing ripple and electrical noise. This capacitor is commonly used in audio circuits, power supply sections, and general electronic devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"It provides reliable performance with stable capacitance in compact circuit designs.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:49:47'),
(4130,1,'product',2267,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"25W-230V Soldron\",\"description\":\"The Soldron 25 W/230 V soldering iron is a basic electric soldering tool designed for soldering tasks in electronics, electrical work, and small DIY projects. \",\"info\":\"Product: Soldron 25 Watt/230 Volt Soldering Iron (and equivalents from similar listings)\\r\\nType: Electric soldering iron tool for electronics and general soldering.\\r\\nPower: 25 Watt — moderate power ideal for light-to-medium electronics soldering work.\\r\\nVoltage: Designed for 230 V AC mains (standard in India and many other countries).\\r\\nMaximum Temperature: Around ~380 °C at the tip. \\r\\nColor: Typically yellow handle.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Soldering\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"It’s one of the most popular entry-level soldering irons in India and other regions using 230 V mains.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":423,\"secondary_id\":\"424\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772625072225-810307892.jpeg\"}','2026-03-04 11:51:12'),
(4131,1,'product',2557,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2MM-Heat shrink sleeve-black\",\"description\":\"A high-quality 2 mm black heat shrink sleeve designed for reliable insulation and protection of wires, cables, and electrical connections\",\"info\":\"Made from durable, flexible polyolefin material, this heat shrink tubing shrinks uniformly when heat is applied, providing a tight, moisture-resistant seal and excellent mechanical protection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Heat Shrink Sleeve\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"note\":\"Made from durable, flexible polyolefin material, this heat shrink tubing shrinks uniformly when heat is applied, providing a tight, moisture-resistant seal and excellent mechanical protection.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":568,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:51:34'),
(4132,1,'product',2313,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3V Samsung Lithium Battery\",\"description\":\"The Samsung 3 V lithium battery (CR-V3) is a high-performance disposable lithium battery designed to deliver longer life, stable power output, and consistent performance in devices such as digital cameras and portable electronics. \",\"info\":\"The 3 V Samsung lithium battery often designated CR-V3 is a disposable (non-rechargeable) lithium power cell designed mainly for digital cameras and other portable electronics where a reliable 3 V supply is needed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Lithium Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"It’s an excellent upgrade over traditional AA alkaline cells in many applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":\"62\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:52:16'),
(4133,1,'product',2187,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47uF 100V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"47µF 100V capacitor is a medium-voltage aluminum electrolytic capacitor used for filtering, smoothing, and energy storage in electronic circuits. It has a capacitance of 47 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 100 volts DC, making it suitable for circuits that operate at higher voltages than standard low-voltage electronics.\",\"info\":\"47µF 100V capacitor is widely used in SMPS circuits, audio amplifiers, power adapters, industrial control boards, inverter circuits, and high-voltage DC sections of electronic devices. It is usually available in a radial-lead cylindrical package, designed for reliable PCB mounting and long service life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"It has a capacitance of 47 microfarads and a maximum rated voltage of 100 volts DC, making it suitable for circuits that operate at higher voltages than standard low-voltage electronics.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:52:44'),
(4134,1,'product',2181,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47uF 160V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"47µF 160V capacitor is an electronic component used to store electrical energy and release it when required in an electronic circuit. The capacitance value 47 microfarads (µF) indicates the amount of electric charge the capacitor can store, while the 160 volts (V) rating specifies the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely handle without breakdown.\",\"info\":\"47µF 160V capacitor is an electronic component used to store electrical energy and release it when required in an electronic circuit. The capacitance value 47 microfarads (µF) indicates the amount of electric charge the capacitor can store, while the 160 volts (V) rating specifies the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely handle without breakdown.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"47µF 160V capacitor is widely used for power supply filtering, voltage smoothing, signal coupling, and decoupling applications. It helps reduce voltage ripple in power supplies and ensures a stable DC output. In audio and amplifier circuits, it can be used to block DC components while allowing AC signals to pass between stages.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:53:44'),
(4135,1,'product',2191,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"47uF 250V Capacitor\",\"description\":\"47µF 250V capacitor is an electronic component used in electrical and electronic circuits to store and release electrical energy when needed. The value 47 microfarads (µF) represents the capacitance, which indicates the amount of electrical charge the capacitor can store, while 250 volts (V) represents the maximum voltage the capacitor can safely withstand.\",\"info\":\"This type of capacitor is commonly available as an aluminum electrolytic capacitor, which usually has a cylindrical body with two leads and is marked with its capacitance value and voltage rating for easy identification.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Capacitor\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"47µF 250V capacitor is widely used for power supply filtering, voltage smoothing, signal coupling, and decoupling applications. It helps reduce voltage ripple in power supply circuits and stabilizes the output voltage. In amplifier circuits, it allows AC signals to pass while blocking DC components between different stages.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":415,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:55:08'),
(4136,1,'product',2401,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BLDC Motor\",\"description\":\"A BLDC Motor (Brushless DC Motor) is an electric motor that operates without brushes, using electronic controllers to energize the motor windings.\",\"info\":\"They deliver better performance, higher speed ranges, smoother operation, and less noise, which is why they are widely used in robots, drones, electric vehicles, industrial automation, fans, pumps, and appliances.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Brushless DC Motor\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"They deliver better performance, higher speed ranges, smoother operation, and less noise, which is why they are widely used in robots, drones, electric vehicles, industrial automation, fans, pumps, and appliances.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"459\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:55:51'),
(4137,1,'product',2496,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BMS 2S 20Amp\",\"description\":\"A BMS 2S 20A (Battery Management System) is an electronic protection circuit designed for 2-cell lithium-ion or lithium-polymer battery packs connected in series. The term 2S means the system is designed for two battery cells in series, typically giving a nominal voltage of 7.4V (8.4V when fully charged).\",\"info\":\"The 20A rating indicates the maximum current the BMS can safely handle during charging or discharging. This module protects lithium batteries from unsafe conditions such as over-charging, over-discharging, short circuits, and over-current, which helps extend battery life and ensures safe operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"BMS Board\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"13\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:58:28'),
(4138,1,'product',2498,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BMS 5S 15Amp\",\"description\":\"A Battery Management System (BMS) for 5S 15A is a protection board used with lithium battery packs that have five cells in series (5S), giving a nominal pack voltage around 18.5 V (fully charged ~21 V).\",\"info\":\"The “15A” rating means the board is designed to handle up to 15 A continuous discharge current safely, protecting the battery from harmful conditions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"BMS Board\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"13\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:58:53'),
(4139,1,'product',2499,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BMS 6S 15 Amp\",\"description\":\"A Battery Management System (BMS) for 6S is a protective circuit board designed for lithium battery packs made of six cells in series (6S). A 6S pack has a nominal voltage of about 22.2 V and a fully charged voltage up to ~25.2 V.\",\"info\":\"The “15 A” rating means the BMS can safely handle continuous discharge currents up to ~15 amps, protecting the pack under normal use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"BMS Board\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"13\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 11:59:53'),
