(4212,1,'product',113,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IMU Module 9250 - 6DOF\",\"description\":\"IMU (Inertial Measurement Unit) module 9250 – 6 DOF (or more accurately the MPU?9250 9?Axis Module which gives 9 DOF) here’s a detailed breakdown of what it does, why it’s useful, how you can integrate it into your microcontroller + IoT + dashboard setup, and things to watch for.\",\"info\":\"An IMU like the MPU-9250 uses tiny MEMS sensors to convert physical motion into digital data.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1200.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":\"22\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 12:56:32'),
