(4215,1,'product',1874,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Joystick Module\",\"description\":\"The KY-023 Dual Axis Joystick module uses a uses a biaxial potentiometer to control the X and Y axis. When pushed down, it activates a switch. Based on the PS2 controller’s joystick, it’s used to control a wide range of projects from RC vehicles to color LEDs.\",\"info\":\"This module consists of two 10k? potentiometers perpendicularly placed to control the X and Y axes by changing resistance when moving the joystick. A push button is activated when the joystick is pushed down on the Z axis. It has 5 male header pins.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"578\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-04 12:58:56'),
