(4249,1,'product',2688,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Plastic gear set kit\",\"description\":\"A Plastic Gear Set Kit is a collection of small plastic gears and mechanical transmission parts used in robotics, toy repairs, and DIY engineering projects. The kit usually contains different types of gears such as spur gears, crown gears, bevel gears, worm gears, pulleys, racks, axles, and belts, allowing users to build gear mechanisms and experiment with motion transfer\",\"info\":\"These kits are widely used in robot car projects, science experiments, model making, and educational learning because they help demonstrate how gears change speed, direction, and torque in mechanical systems. Most plastic gear kits include 30–90 pieces with different sizes and shaft holes (commonly around 2 mm–3 mm) so they can be attached to small DC motors and shafts\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1283],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772690332594-981584354.jpg\"}','2026-03-05 05:58:52'),
