(4283,1,'product',2696,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PCT-211 Connector\",\"description\":\"The PCT-211 / LT-211 connector is a single-pole quick connection terminal block designed for easy and secure electrical wire connections without the need for special tools. It uses a spring-lever or push-in mechanism to clamp wires, allowing fast installation and removal in wiring applications.\",\"info\":\"These connectors are typically used in distribution boxes, junction boxes, control panels, and other electrical systems where quick and reliable splicing of single conductor wires is needed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"1-1 [LT-211] \",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772705462648-997094279.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:11:02'),
(4284,1,'product',2697,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2-2 PCT 222 Connector\",\"description\":\"The PCT-222 Connector is a 2-in, 2-out lever-type quick wire connector designed for fast, secure, and tool-free electrical connections. It allows two wires to be easily connected or spliced using a simple flip-lever mechanism, ensuring strong contact for both solid and stranded conductors. This makes installation, removal, and re-wiring quick and convenient compared to traditional screw terminals.\",\"info\":\"The PCT-222 connector is suitable for household, commercial, and light industrial wiring applications. It is commonly used in junction boxes, lighting circuits, control panels, and electrical repairs where neat, reusable, a\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"2-2 PCT 222\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772705555209-673991065.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:12:35'),
(4285,1,'product',2698,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3-3 PCT 223 Connector\",\"description\":\"The PCT-223 Connector is a 3-in, 3-out lever-type quick wire connector that lets you join three pairs of wires securely without using screws or tools. Each channel has its own flip-down lever that clamps the wire in place, making it easy to insert or remove both solid and stranded conductors.\",\"info\":\"the PCT-223 is ideal for general electrical and lighting installations, junction boxes, control panels, and DIY wiring tasks. Its reusable and vibration-resistant design simplifies maintenance and re-wiring, especially in applications where quick and dependable connections are needed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"3-3 PCT 223 \",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772705650972-727356467.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:14:10'),
(4286,1,'product',2699,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4-4 PCT 224 Connector\",\"description\":\"The PCT-224 Connector is a 4-in, 4-out lever-type quick wire connector designed for fast, secure, and tool-free electrical connections. It features four individual channels with flip-down levers that clamp wires firmly in place, allowing easy insertion and removal of both solid and stranded conductors. This lever mechanism simplifies installation compared to traditional screw terminals, saving time and effort.\",\"info\":\"Built with a durable insulated housing and reliable internal contacts, the PCT-224 is suitable for a variety of wiring applications such as lighting circuits, junction boxes, control panels, and household or industrial electrical projects. Its reusable and vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for situations where dependable and maintainable connections are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"4-4 PCT 224\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772705754963-826470833.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:15:54'),
(4287,1,'product',2700,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5-5 PCT 225 Connector\",\"description\":\"The PCT-225 Connector is a 5-in, 5-out lever-type quick wire connector that provides a fast, secure, and tool-free way to join five pairs of wires. Each connection point has its own lever that flips down to clamp the wire firmly, making it easy to insert and remove both solid and stranded conductors while ensuring reliable electrical contact. This lever mechanism speeds up installation and reduces the effort compared to traditional screw-type terminals.\",\"info\":\"Built with a durable insulated housing and reliable internal contacts, the PCT-224 is suitable for a variety of wiring applications such as lighting circuits, junction boxes, control panels, and household or industrial electrical projects. Its reusable and vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for situations where dependable and maintainable connections are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"5-5 PCT 225\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772705845340-147868243.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:17:25'),
(4288,1,'product',2701,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"6-6 PCT 223-6P Connector\",\"description\":\"The PCT 223-6P Connector is a 6-in, 6-out lever-type quick wire connector designed for fast, secure, and tool-free electrical connections. It features six individual channels with flip-down levers that clamp wires firmly in place, allowing easy insertion and removal of both solid and stranded conductors while ensuring reliable electrical contact. This lever mechanism makes installation and maintenance quicker and easier than traditional screw-type terminals.\",\"info\":\"Built with a durable insulated housing and dependable internal contacts, the PCT 223-6P is suitable for a range of wiring applications, including lighting circuits, junction boxes, control panels, and general household or industrial electrical projects. Its reusable, vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for situations where quick, maintainable, and dependable multi-wire connections are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"6-6 PCT 223-6P Connector\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772705975977-839236293.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:19:35'),
(4289,1,'product',2702,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"8-8 PCT 223-8P Connector\",\"description\":\"The PCT 223-8P Connector is an 8-in, 8-out lever-type quick wire connector designed to make secure electrical connections without the need for tools. It features eight individual channels, each with a flip-down lever that clamps wires firmly in place, allowing easy insertion and removal of both solid and stranded conductors while ensuring consistent, reliable contact. This lever mechanism simplifies installation and reduces wiring time compared to traditional screw-type terminals.\",\"info\":\"Constructed with a sturdy insulated housing and reliable internal contacts, the PCT 223-8P is suitable for a wide range of wiring tasks, including lighting circuits, junction boxes, control panels, and general household or commercial electrical projects. Its reusable, vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for applications that require quick, maintainable, and dependable multi-wire connections.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"8-8 PCT 223-8P Connector\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772706043447-621256044.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:20:43'),
(4290,1,'product',2703,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10-10 PCT 223 10P Connector\",\"description\":\"The PCT 223-10P Connector is a 10-in, 10-out lever-type quick wire connector designed for fast, tool-free electrical connections. It has ten individual channels with flip-down levers that securely clamp both solid and stranded wires, making installation and removal quick while ensuring reliable electrical contact. This lever mechanism speeds up wiring work compared to traditional screw terminals and helps keep connections neat and consistent.\",\"info\":\"The PCT 223-10P is suitable for a variety of applications including lighting circuits, junction boxes, control panels, and general household or commercial electrical projects. Its reusable, vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for multi-wire installations that require dependable, maintainable, and easy-to-service connections.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"10-10 PCT 223 10P Connector\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772706224665-654046060.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:23:44'),
(4291,1,'product',2704,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"12-12 PCT 12P Connector\",\"description\":\"The PCT 12P Connector is a 12-in, 12-out lever-type quick wire connector designed to make secure electrical connections quickly and without tools. It features twelve individual channels with flip-down levers that clamp both solid and stranded wires firmly in place, allowing easy insertion and removal while ensuring reliable electrical contact. This lever mechanism speeds up installation and simplifies maintenance compared to traditional screw-type terminals.\",\"info\":\"PCT 12P is suitable for a wide range of wiring tasks such as lighting circuits, junction boxes, control panels, and general household or commercial electrical projects. Its reusable, vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for multi-wire applications that require dependable, maintainable, and easy-to-service connections.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"12-12 PCT 12P Connector\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772706319356-556174366.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:25:19'),
(4292,1,'product',2705,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LT 1-2 PCT Connector\",\"description\":\"The LT-2 PCT Connector is a 2-way quick wire connector designed for fast, secure, and tool-free electrical connections. It allows two wires to be easily joined using a simple push-in or lever mechanism that clamps the conductors firmly in place, providing reliable electrical contact for both solid and stranded wires. This makes it much quicker and more convenient to install and remove wires compared to traditional screw-type terminals.\",\"info\":\"Built with a compact insulated housing and dependable internal contacts, the LT-2 PCT connector is suitable for a variety of general wiring tasks, including household electrical repairs, lighting circuits, junction boxes, and small control panels. Its reusable and vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for applications where quick, maintainable, and dependable connections are needed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"LT 1-2 PCT Connector\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772706411127-700638496.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:26:51'),
