(4296,1,'product',2709,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LT 6-2-6 PCT Connector\",\"description\":\"The LT 6-2-6 PCT Connector is a multi-way quick wire connector designed to provide secure, tool-free electrical connections across three grouped sections: six channels on one side, two in the middle, and six on the other side. Each channel uses a push-in or lever clamp mechanism to hold both solid and stranded wires firmly in place, ensuring reliable electrical contact while making installation and removal fast and easy compared to traditional screw-type terminals.\",\"info\":\"With a compact insulated housing and dependable internal contacts, the LT 6-2-6 PCT connector is well-suited for complex wiring tasks in junction boxes, control panels, lighting systems, and general household or commercial electrical projects. Its reusable, vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for applications that require neat, maintainable, and dependable multi-wire connections in grouped configurations.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"model\":\"LT 6-2-6 PCT Connector\",\"alternative_name\":\"PCT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772706773532-899067866.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 10:32:53'),
