(4308,1,'product',2719,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"XT30 Connector\",\"description\":\"The XT30 Connector is a compact high-current electrical connector commonly used in radio-controlled (RC) models, drones, and small battery-powered devices. It features a polarized two-pin design with gold-plated male and female terminals that ensure a secure, low-resistance connection and prevent reverse polarity, helping protect electronics from damage.\",\"info\":\"Its simple plug-and-play design allows for quick battery and power module connections, and the durable housing resists vibration and heat during use. Because of these qualities, the XT30 has become a popular choice in the hobbyist and UAV communities for connecting batteries, speed controllers, motors, and power distribution systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1300],\"model\":\"XT30 Connector\",\"alternative_name\":\"XT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772709539739-869705686.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 11:18:59'),
(4309,1,'product',2720,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"XT60 Connector\",\"description\":\"The XT60 Connector is a high-current DC power connector widely used in RC vehicles, drones, electric scooters, and battery-powered electronic systems. It features a polarized two-pin design with gold-plated contacts that provide a secure, low-resistance connection while preventing reverse polarity. The XT60 connector is typically rated to handle currents up to 60 A, making it suitable for medium-to-high power applications.\",\"info\":\"Made with a durable, heat-resistant nylon housing, the XT60 offers excellent mechanical strength and resistance to vibration during operation. Its reliable performance, ease of soldering, and long service life have made it a popular standard for connecting lithium battery packs, ESCs, chargers, and power distribution units in both hobbyist and professional electronics applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1300],\"model\":\"XT60 Connector\",\"alternative_name\":\"XT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772709618862-691775144.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 11:20:18'),
(4310,1,'product',2721,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"XT90 Connector\",\"description\":\"The XT90 Connector is a high-current DC power connector designed for demanding power applications such as electric bikes, electric vehicles, high-power drones, RC cars, and battery energy systems. It features a polarized two-pin design with gold-plated contacts that ensure a secure, low-resistance connection while preventing reverse polarity. The XT90 is typically rated to handle currents up to 90 A, making it suitable for high-load power transfer.\",\"info\":\"Constructed with a heat-resistant nylon housing, the XT90 offers excellent durability, vibration resistance, and long service life. Many XT90 variants also include an anti-spark feature, which reduces arcing during connection and helps protect connectors and electronic components. Due to its reliability and high current capacity, the XT90 is widely used in professional and heavy-duty battery-powered systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1300],\"model\":\"XT90 Connector\",\"alternative_name\":\"XT Connector\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772710228104-944082113.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 11:30:28'),
