(4313,1,'product',2722,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"V8 Socket Wire Type PVC\",\"description\":\"V8 Socket Wire (PVC Type) is a compact and reliable electrical accessory commonly used for connecting small bulbs, indicator lamps, and decorative lighting systems. It comes with a V8 socket fitted to flexible PVC-insulated wires, making installation quick and safe. The PVC insulation provides good resistance to heat, moisture, and minor mechanical wear, ensuring stable performance in both indoor and light-duty outdoor applications.\",\"info\":\"This type of socket wire is widely used in home lighting, panel indicators, temporary test setups, and festival or decorative lighting.Overall, the V8 Socket Wire (PVC type) is a cost-effective and practical solution for low-voltage and standard lighting connections where safety, durability, and ease of use are important.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1302],\"model\":\"V8\",\"alternative_name\":\"V8 Socket Wire Type PVC\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772712278184-325890813.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 12:04:38'),
(4314,1,'product',2723,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Type C Socket Wire Type PVC\",\"description\":\"Type-C Socket Wire (PVC Type) is a modern and versatile connector assembly used for power charging and data transfer applications. It consists of a USB Type-C female socket pre-connected with PVC-insulated wires, allowing easy integration into electronic projects, devices, and custom power solutions. The PVC insulation offers good electrical safety, flexibility, and resistance to heat and wear, making it suitable for regular usage.\",\"info\":\"This socket wire is widely used in mobile charging modules, DIY electronics, power banks, embedded systems, and repair or replacement of damaged charging ports. The reversible Type-C design ensures user convenience, while the durable PVC wire ensures reliable current flow and long service life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1302],\"model\":\"Type C Socket Wire\",\"alternative_name\":\"Type C Socket Wire Type PVC\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772712355238-979406562.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 12:05:55'),
(4315,1,'product',2724,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB Socket\",\"description\":\"USB Socket is a commonly used power and data interface designed to provide convenient USB connectivity in electronic devices and electrical installations. It allows users to charge devices such as mobile phones, tablets, Bluetooth accessories, and other USB-powered equipment, as well as support data transfer when required. USB sockets are available in different types (USB-A, USB-B, Micro-USB, and Type-C) and can be panel-mounted, PCB-mounted, or supplied with wires for easy integration.\",\"info\":\"USB sockets are widely used in home charging panels, power strips, automobiles, electronic enclosures, DIY projects, and industrial control panels. Built with durable materials and reliable internal contacts, they ensure stable power output and long service life. Overall, a USB socket offers a compact, user-friendly, and efficient solution for modern charging and connectivity needs in both residential and commercial applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1302],\"model\":\"USB Socket\",\"alternative_name\":\"USB Socket\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772712487663-940384323.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 12:08:07'),
(4316,1,'product',2725,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4LS Speaker Socket\",\"description\":\"4LS Speaker Socket is a multi-pin audio connector commonly used for connecting speakers to amplifiers, sound systems, and public address (PA) equipment. It features four terminals or pins, allowing secure and organized connection of speaker wires, often used in dual-channel or multi-speaker configurations. The socket is designed to provide firm contact, reducing signal loss and ensuring clear audio output.\",\"info\":\"This type of speaker socket is widely used in DJ systems, PA systems, stage sound setups, and custom audio panels. Made from durable insulating material with strong metal contacts, the 4LS Speaker Socket offers reliable performance, easy installation, and long service life. It is an ideal choice for professional and semi-professional audio applications where stable and safe speaker connections are essential.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[837],\"alternative_name\":\"4LS Speaker Socket\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772712626733-284679496.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 12:10:26'),
