(4326,1,'product',2728,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Car Set Wire\",\"description\":\"Car Set Wire is a specially designed wiring harness used for connecting car audio systems such as stereos, speakers, amplifiers, and accessories to a vehicle’s electrical system. It typically consists of color-coded, insulated wires that simplify installation and ensure correct connections for power, ground, speakers, and control signals. The insulation is made to withstand heat, vibration, and electrical load commonly found in automotive environments.\",\"info\":\"Car set wires are widely used in car stereo installation, speaker upgrades, amplifier connections, and replacement of damaged or factory wiring. Designed for durability and reliable signal transmission, these wires help maintain clear audio output and stable power supply. Overall, car set wire provides a safe, organized, and efficient solution for automotive audio and electrical installations.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1310],\"model\":\"Car Set Wire\",\"alternative_name\":\"Car Set Wire\",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772715293939-684251428.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 12:54:53'),
(4327,1,'product',2729,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GBU810 Bridge\",\"description\":\"GBU810J Bridge Rectifier is a high-current, single-phase diode bridge used for converting AC (alternating current) into DC (direct current) in power electronic circuits. It is rated for 8A average forward current and can withstand up to 1000V peak reverse voltage, making it suitable for medium- to high-power applications. The compact GBU package provides good heat dissipation and reliable electrical performance.\",\"info\":\"This bridge rectifier is widely used in SMPS, inverters, UPS systems, battery chargers, adapters, motor drives, and industrial power supplies. Built with high-quality silicon diodes, the GBU810J offers low forward voltage drop, strong surge current handling, and long service life. It is an efficient and durable solution for rectification needs where stability, safety, and consistent DC output are essential.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"alternative_name\":\"Diode\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772715915688-610413459.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 13:05:15'),
(4328,1,'product',2730,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"D25XB80 Bridge\",\"description\":\"D25XB80 Bridge Rectifier is a heavy-duty, single-phase diode bridge designed for high-current AC to DC conversion in power electronic applications. It is typically rated for 25A average forward current with a maximum repetitive reverse voltage of around 800V, making it suitable for high-power rectification requirements. The robust block-type package allows easy mounting on heat sinks for efficient thermal management.\",\"info\":\"This bridge rectifier is commonly used in inverters, welding machines, battery chargers, industrial power supplies, motor drives, and high-capacity UPS systems. With strong surge current capability, reliable insulation, and stable electrical performance, the D25XB80 Bridge Rectifier ensures efficient rectification and long-term durability in demanding electrical and industrial environments.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"model\":\"D25XB80 Bridge\",\"alternative_name\":\"Diode\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772716001043-768442354.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 13:06:41'),
(4329,1,'product',2731,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BR1010 Diode\",\"description\":\"BR1010 Diode is a high-current rectifier diode used for converting AC to DC and for general-purpose rectification in power electronic circuits. It is typically rated for 10A average forward current with a maximum reverse voltage of around 1000V, making it suitable for medium- to high-power applications. The diode is designed to handle high surge currents and provides stable performance under continuous load conditions.\",\"info\":\"BR1010 diodes are widely used in power supplies, battery chargers, inverters, adapters, welding equipment, and other industrial electronic systems. Built with durable semiconductor material and a robust package for effective heat dissipation, the BR1010 ensures reliable operation, low forward voltage drop, and long service life, helping protect and enhance overall circuit efficiency.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"model\":\"BR1010 Diode\",\"alternative_name\":\"Diode\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772716160540-981742980.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 13:09:20'),
