(4333,1,'product',2732,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NANO V3 Cable\",\"description\":\"NANO V3 Cable is a USB data and power cable specifically used to connect an Arduino Nano V3 board to a computer or USB power source. It typically features a USB-A to Mini-USB connector, enabling reliable data transfer for program uploading, serial communication, and providing 5V power to the Nano board. The cable is designed to ensure stable connectivity during coding and testing.\",\"info\":\"This cable is widely used in electronics labs, DIY projects, robotics, IoT development, and educational environments. With durable insulation and secure connectors, the NANO V3 Cable supports consistent performance and long-term use. It is an essential accessory for programming, debugging, and powering Arduino Nano V3 microcontroller boards.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1313],\"model\":\"NANO V3 Cable\",\"alternative_name\":\"Nano Cable\",\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772716465479-96328462.jpeg\"}','2026-03-05 13:14:25'),
