(4355,1,'product',2470,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ULN2003\",\"description\":\"ULN2003 is a widely used Darlington transistor array IC designed to drive high-current, high-voltage loads using low-power logic signals from microcontrollers. It contains seven NPN Darlington pairs in a single 16-pin package, each capable of switching loads that typical microcontroller GPIO pins cannot handle directly.\",\"info\":\"Each channel of the ULN2003 can sink up to 500 mA with load voltages up to 50 V, making it ideal for driving relays, solenoids, LEDs, buzzers, and stepper motors. The IC includes built-in flyback (freewheeling) diodes, which protect the circuit from voltage spikes when driving inductive loads like motors and relays—no external diodes are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"ULN 2003 MOTOR DRIVER MODULE\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":453,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 03:38:46'),
(4356,1,'product',179,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Servo 9G\",\"description\":\"you’re referring to the 9G Micro Servo Motor, often labeled as SG90, TG9e, or TowerPro 9G — the most popular and economical servo for small robotics, model planes, and educational Arduino projects.\",\"info\":\"The 9g micro servo (often called SG90) is a very compact, lightweight PWM-controlled servo widely used in hobby and educational projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"MG 9G Servo Motor\",\"mrp\":\"400.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":422,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 03:39:34'),
(4357,1,'product',177,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Servo MG995 Metal Gear\",\"description\":\"The MG995 is a high-torque standard servo motor made by TowerPro (and compatible versions by others).\\r\\nIt’s equipped with metal gears, providing long life, strength, and less wear than plastic-gear servos.\",\"info\":\"The MG995 Metal Gear Servo is a high-torque hobby servo with all-metal gears for enhanced strength and durability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"MG995 SERVO MOTOR\",\"mrp\":\"900.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":422,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 03:42:03'),
(4358,1,'product',226,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Servo MG996 Metal Gear Motor\",\"description\":\"The MG996R is a high-torque, metal-gear standard servo motor commonly used in robotics, RC vehicles, and hobbyist applications.\",\"info\":\"Servo MG996 Metal Gear Motor is a high-torque standard-size servo featuring durable metal gears for improved strength and longevity\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"MG996R SERVO\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":422,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 03:43:05'),
(4359,1,'product',252,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Vibration Sensor SW420\",\"description\":\"Vibration Sensor SW420 is a compact digital vibration detection module that outputs a HIGH signal when motion or shaking is detected.\",\"info\":\"It uses the SW-420 vibration switch paired with an adjustable potentiometer to set sensitivity\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"VIBRATION SENSOR MODULE\",\"mrp\":\"180.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":67,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 03:48:53'),
(4360,1,'product',132,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Arduino UNO SMD -ATMEGA 328-CH340\",\"description\":\"The Arduino UNO SMD (ATmega328P + CH340) is a compact, Arduino-compatible development board that uses the SMD (surface-mount) version of the ATmega328P microcontroller and the CH340 USB-to-Serial interface\",\"info\":\"It delivers the same functionality and pinout as the classic Arduino Uno, while being more robust for permanent installations and cost-effective.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"ATMEGA 328P NANO\",\"mrp\":\"450.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":\"441\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 03:57:39'),
(4361,1,'product',129,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ARDUINO MEGA 2560 ORIGINAL\",\"description\":\"The Arduino MEGA 2560 (Original) is an official Arduino development board designed for large and complex projects that require many input/output pins, high memory capacity, and multiple serial interfaces.\",\"info\":\"Based on the powerful ATmega2560 microcontroller, the original Mega 2560 offers maximum stability, long-term reliability, and full Arduino ecosystem support.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"MEGA 2560 BOARD\",\"mrp\":\"3500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 03:59:27'),
(4362,1,'product',406,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L298N Dc Motor driver Module\",\"description\":\"The L298N Motor Driver Module is a dual H-bridge DC motor controller capable of driving two DC motors or one stepper motor simultaneously.\",\"info\":\"The L298N motor driver module is a dual H-bridge controller board based around the L298N IC, designed to control two DC motors independently — both direction and speed — using simple logic signals and PWM from a microcontroller like an Arduino or ESP32.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"L298N Motor driver Module\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":453,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:00:44'),
(4363,1,'product',406,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L298N Dc Motor driver Module\",\"description\":\"The L298N Motor Driver Module is a dual H-bridge DC motor controller capable of driving two DC motors or one stepper motor simultaneously.\",\"info\":\"The L298N motor driver module is a dual H-bridge controller board based around the L298N IC, designed to control two DC motors independently — both direction and speed — using simple logic signals and PWM from a microcontroller like an Arduino or ESP32.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"L298N Motor driver Module Board\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":453,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:01:42'),
(4364,1,'product',223,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PWM 2A Motor Control\",\"description\":\"A PWM (Pulse-Width Modulation) 2 A motor control module is a compact driver/regulator that lets you vary the speed of a DC motor by rapidly switching the supply on/off at a variable duty cycle.\",\"info\":\"PWM 2A Motor Control is a compact DC motor speed controller designed to regulate motor speed using pulse-width modulation (PWM)\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"PWM 2A Module\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":37,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:12:38'),
(4365,1,'product',407,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L293 D Motor Driver Module\",\"description\":\"The L293D Motor Driver Module is a dual H-bridge motor controller capable of driving two DC motors or one stepper motor simultaneously.\",\"info\":\"The L293D module is a dual H-bridge motor driver board based on the L293D IC, designed to control two DC motors independently (or one bipolar stepper motor) from a microcontroller like Arduino, ESP32, PIC, or Raspberry Pi. It lets you control the direction and speed (with PWM) of motors easily.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"L293 D Board\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":453,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:13:49'),
(4366,1,'product',731,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"A4988 Stepper Motor Driver\",\"description\":\"A4988 Stepper Motor Driver is a compact and powerful microstepping driver designed to control bipolar stepper motors with high precision and smooth operation. It can drive a stepper motor in full, half, quarter, eighth, and sixteenth microstepping modes, allowing finer movement control for CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and automation projects.\",\"info\":\"The A4988 stepper motor driver is a compact microstepping driver module used to control bipolar stepper motors. It supports up to 1/16 microstepping, providing smooth and precise motor movement.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"A4988 Module\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":453,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:14:47'),
(4367,1,'product',2734,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HIKVISION ECO Series Camera\",\"description\":\"The Hikvision DS-2CE5AD0T-ITP/ECO is a 2-megapixel analog dome CCTV camera designed for indoor or basic outdoor surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"The device typically uses a 2.8 mm or 3.6 mm lens to provide a wide viewing angle and supports features like automatic exposure control, digital noise reduction, and internal synchronization for stable video output.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[341],\"model\":\"DS-2CE5AD0T-ITP\\\\ECO\",\"alternative_name\":\" ECO Series Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"It includes True Day/Night functionality with Smart IR LEDs, allowing the camera to automatically switch between day and night modes and provide infrared night vision up to about 20 meters in low-light or dark environments\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772770562339-470456961.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 04:16:02'),
(4368,1,'product',2129,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BTS7960B  Motor Driver Module\",\"description\":\"The BTS7960B Motor Driver Module is a high-power H-bridge motor driver used to control large DC motors with high current requirements. It is commonly used in robotics, electric vehicles, CNC machines, and automation systems where powerful motors need precise speed and direction control. The module is based on the BTS7960B half-bridge driver IC and is often arranged as a dual H-bridge configuration to drive motors forward and reverse\",\"info\":\"This driver uses chips BTS7960 composed of high-power drive full H-bridge driver module with thermal over-current protection. Double BTS7960 H-bridge driver circuit, with a strong drive and braking, effectively isolating the microcontroller and motor driver, high-current 43A\\r\\n5V isolate with MCU, and effectively protect MCU\\r\\n5V power indicator on board\\r\\nVoltage indication of motor driver output end\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Motor Driver Module BTS7960B\",\"mrp\":\"800.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":143,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:18:06'),
(4369,1,'product',2735,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PWM 5A Module\",\"description\":\"The PWM 5A Module is a compact DC motor speed controller that uses Pulse Width Modulation (PWM) technology to regulate the speed of DC motors or control the brightness of DC loads such as LEDs. It adjusts the motor speed by changing the PWM duty cycle through a built-in rotary potentiometer\",\"info\":\"This module supports a wide input voltage range and can handle moderate current loads, making it suitable for robotics, DIY electronics projects, and small automation systems. The PWM control method provides smooth speed control with high efficiency and minimal power loss\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[617],\"mrp\":\"199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772770942620-241879002.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 04:22:22'),
(4370,1,'product',2736,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2000W SCR Voltage Controller AC\",\"description\":\"The 2000W SCR Voltage Controller AC is an electronic power control module used to regulate the voltage supplied to AC appliances. It uses an SCR (Silicon Controlled Rectifier) or TRIAC-based circuit to control the amount of power delivered to a load by adjusting the firing angle of the AC waveform. This allows smooth control of speed, brightness, or temperature in connected devices.\",\"info\":\"This module typically works with AC 220V mains supply and can handle loads up to 2000 watts, making it suitable for various household and workshop applications. The output voltage can usually be adjusted from about 50V to 220V AC using an onboard rotary potentiometer\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[503],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772771355158-570438569.jpeg\"}','2026-03-06 04:29:15'),
(4371,1,'product',2128,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PCA9685 16 channel Servo Motor Driver\",\"description\":\"The PCA9685 16-Channel Servo Motor Driver is a PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) controller module designed to control multiple servo motors or LEDs using a single microcontroller. It is based on the PCA9685 PWM driver IC, which communicates through the I2C interface, allowing efficient control of up to 16 independent channels while using only two communication pins (SDA and SCL). This greatly reduces the processing load on microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and STM32 boards.\",\"info\":\"The module generates precise 12-bit PWM signals, providing 4096 levels of resolution for accurate servo positioning and smooth motor movement. It includes an onboard clock and supports adjustable PWM frequency, typically ranging from 40 Hz to 1000 Hz, making it suitable for both servo motors and LED dimming applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"16 Channel servo bit module\",\"mrp\":\"800.00\",\"note\":\"The PCA9685 servo driver features dedicated external power input for motors, ensuring stable operation without overloading the microcontroller’s power supply. It is widely used in robotics, robotic arms, humanoid robots, automation systems, RC projects, animatronics, and multi-servo control applications due to its reliability, scalability, and precise PWM control capability.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":453,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:32:17'),
(4372,1,'product',248,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Sound Sensor\",\"description\":\"Sound Sensor is a compact audio detection module that senses sound intensity in the environment and outputs a corresponding digital (and sometimes analog) signal\",\"info\":\"It typically uses a built-in microphone and amplifier to detect noise and is widely used with microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP32, and Raspberry Pi for projects such as sound-activated control, clap switches, voice triggers, and ambient noise monitoring.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"sound sensor module\",\"mrp\":\"180.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":21,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:45:48'),
(4373,1,'product',2737,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision HD bullet CCTV camera\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE1AD0T-ITP/ECO is a 2-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed for outdoor or indoor surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It uses a high-performance CMOS image sensor to capture Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080) video, providing clear and detailed monitoring for homes, shops, offices, and commercial locations.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE1AD0T-ITP\\\\ECO\",\"alternative_name\":\"CCTV HD bullet camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"This camera works with HD-TVI DVR systems and connects through a BNC coaxial cable with a 12 V DC power supply\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772772416491-1230717.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 04:46:56'),
(4374,1,'product',209,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OLED 0.96inch Blue 4 pin\",\"description\":\"OLED 0.96inchBlue 4-Pin Display is a compact OLED screen commonly used in microcontroller projects. It features a bright blue display with high contrast and low power consumption.\",\"info\":\"The 4-pin interface (VCC, GND, SDA, SCL) typically supports I²C communication, making it easy to connect with Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and similar boards\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"OLED 0.96inch 12C 128*64\",\"mrp\":\"540.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":436,\"secondary_id\":438,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:47:36'),
(4375,1,'product',106,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Soil Moisture Sensor\",\"description\":\"A Soil Moisture Sensor measures how much water is present in the soil — giving an analog or digital signal that represents the moisture level.\",\"info\":\"A Soil Moisture Sensor is an electronic sensing device used to measure the amount of water in soil.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"soil sensor\",\"mrp\":\"440.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:48:39'),
(4376,1,'product',756,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Raindrops Sensor Module\",\"description\":\"Raindrops Sensor Module is a simple and sensitive device used to detect the presence and intensity of rain or water drops. It works using a rainboard with conductive tracks and a signal processing module.\",\"info\":\"The raindrops sensor module is used to detect rain or water droplets on its sensing surface. It works by measuring changes in conductivity when water comes into contact with the sensor plate. Commonly used in rain detection systems, weather monitoring, automatic wipers, roof control systems, and Arduino/ESP projects, the module provides analog and digital outputs, adjustable sensitivity, and reliable performance for simple weather-related applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Rain Sensor\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:49:18'),
(4377,1,'product',429,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PIR Motion Sensor\",\"description\":\"The PIR Motion Sensor Module is a highly sensitive passive infrared sensor used to detect human body movement within a certain range.\",\"info\":\"A PIR (Passive Infrared) Motion Sensor detects movement of people or animals by sensing changes in infrared (heat) radiation in its field of view.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"PIR Sensor Module\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":457,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:50:11'),
(4378,1,'product',2132,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UltraSonic sensor Module\",\"description\":\"The Ultrasonic Sensor Module is an electronic distance measuring device used to detect objects and measure distance using ultrasonic sound waves. It works by transmitting high-frequency sound pulses (usually around 40 kHz) through a transmitter and then receiving the reflected echo from nearby objects using a receiver. The module calculates the distance based on the time taken for the sound wave to travel to the object and return, making it a reliable non-contact measurement sensor.\",\"info\":\"One of the most commonly used ultrasonic modules is the HC-SR04, which provides accurate distance measurement and easy interfacing with microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and STM32 boards. The sensor typically includes four pins: VCC, GND, Trigger, and Echo. A short trigger pulse initiates measurement, and the echo pin outputs a signal whose duration corresponds to the detected distance. The module operates on 5V DC power and offers stable performance in various lighting conditions since it relies on sound instead of light.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"HC-SRO4 Ultrasonic module\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"Ultrasonic sensor modules are widely used in obstacle avoidance robots, distance measurement systems, water level monitoring, parking assistance systems, automation projects, and smart IoT applications. Due to their accuracy, low cost, and simple operation, they are highly popular in educational and industrial electronics projects.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:51:52'),
(4379,1,'product',251,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Vibration Tilt Sensor\",\"description\":\"A Tilt Sensor is an electronic sensor used to detect the tilting or orientation change of an object. It works by using a small conductive ball or mercury inside a sealed tube that moves when the device is tilted. When the ball moves, it either opens or closes the circuit, allowing the sensor to detect motion or position change.\",\"info\":\"It typically contains a small internal element (like a spring and ball) that changes position when the module is shaken or tilted, producing a digital signal output.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Tilt Sensor\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":67,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 04:59:40'),
(4380,1,'product',2738,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 2 MP HD mini bullet Camera\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE16D0T-ITPFS is a 2-megapixel analog HD mini bullet CCTV camera designed for reliable indoor and outdoor surveillance.\",\"info\":\"It uses a 2 MP CMOS image sensor to capture Full HD video with a resolution of 1920 × 1080, delivering clear images for monitoring homes, shops, offices, and parking areas.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE16D0T-ITPFS\",\"alternative_name\":\"mini bullet Camera \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772773368130-952853711.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 05:02:48'),
(4381,1,'product',2739,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 2 MP Dome Camera\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE76D0T-ITPFS is a 2-megapixel analog HD dome (turret-style) CCTV camera designed for indoor surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It uses a 2 MP CMOS image sensor to capture Full-HD video with a resolution of 1920 × 1080, providing clear images for monitoring homes, offices, shops, and corridors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[341],\"model\":\"DS-2CE76D0T-ITPFS\",\"alternative_name\":\"Dome Camera  2 MP \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"It usually comes with fixed lens options (2.8 mm, 3.6 mm, or 6 mm) to provide different viewing angles depending on the installation location.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772773887032-780570223.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 05:11:27'),
(4382,1,'product',2740,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision \",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE16D0T-ITFS (commonly listed as DS-2CE16D0T-ITPFS) is a 2-megapixel analog HD mini bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It uses a 2 MP CMOS image sensor that captures Full-HD video at 1920 × 1080 resolution, providing clear images for monitoring homes, offices, shops, and outdoor areas.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE16D0T-ITFS\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Use a surge protector or UPS with the DVR system to protect the camera from voltage spikes or power fluctuations.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772774655710-281010434.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 05:24:15'),
(4383,1,'product',2741,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 2 MP turret CCTV camera\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE76D0T-ITMFS is a 2-megapixel analog HD turret (dome-style) CCTV camera designed for use with DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It uses a 2 MP CMOS image sensor that captures Full-HD video at 1920 × 1080 resolution, providing clear monitoring for homes, offices, shops, and indoor or outdoor security areas.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[349],\"model\":\"DS-2CE76D0T-ITMFS\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera supports audio over coaxial cable because it has a built-in microphone, allowing both video and sound to be transmitted through the same cable to the DVR.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772775234208-449339137.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 05:33:54'),
(4384,1,'product',743,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LM393 Speed Measuring Sensor\",\"description\":\"LM393 Speed Measuring Sensor Module is an optical sensing module designed to detect rotational speed, motor RPM, and object movement using an infrared emitter and receiver pair. It works by sending infrared light and detecting the interruption caused by slotted discs or moving objects.\",\"info\":\"It provides a digital output that changes with object movement or rotation, making it suitable for RPM measurement, motor speed detection, and encoder applications. Commonly used in robotics, automation, and Arduino/ESP projects, the module offers adjustable sensitivity, fast response, and reliable performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"speed sensor module\",\"mrp\":\"399.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":21,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 05:39:50'),
(4385,1,'product',118,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MPU 6050 Accelerometer and Gyroscope Original\",\"description\":\"The MPU-6050 is a 6-DOF (degrees of freedom) motion sensor module that outputs both acceleration and angular velocity data via the I²C bus.It also includes a built-in Digital Motion Processor (DMP) for computing motion fusion (pitch, roll, yaw).\",\"info\":\"The MPU-6050 (Original) is a 6-axis motion tracking sensor that combines a 3-axis accelerometer and a 3-axis gyroscope on a single chip\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"GYROSCOPE MODULE - MPU6050\",\"mrp\":\"900.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":22,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 05:46:37'),
(4386,1,'product',729,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TTP223 Touch Sensor Module\",\"description\":\"The TTP223 Touch Sensor Module is a capacitive touch-based input device that replaces traditional push buttons with a modern, touch-sensitive surface. It uses the TTP223 IC to detect touch or proximity and outputs a digital signal when activated.\",\"info\":\"The TTP223 touch sensor module is a capacitive touch input module used to detect touch without mechanical buttons. It provides a digital output that changes state when touched, making it ideal for touch switches, control panels, home automation, and Arduino/ESP projects\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"TTP223 TOUCH MODULE\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":63,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 05:50:03'),
(4387,1,'product',68,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DHT11 Humidity Temperature Module\",\"description\":\"The DHT11 is a digital temperature and humidity sensor that measures the surrounding air and outputs the data as a digital signal through a single pin\",\"info\":\"The DHT11 Humidity Temperature Module is an easy-to-use, beginner-friendly digital sensor for measuring basic environmental conditions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"DHT 11 SENSOR MODULE\",\"mrp\":\"450.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 05:51:19'),
(4388,1,'product',67,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DHT22 MODULE\",\"description\":\"The DHT22 is a digital temperature and humidity sensor that uses a capacitive humidity sensor and a thermistor to measure the surrounding air\",\"info\":\"The DHT22, also known as AM2302, is a digital temperature and humidity sensor module offering higher accuracy and a wider measurement range than the DHT11.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"DHT 22 SENSOR\",\"mrp\":\"950.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 05:51:41'),
(4389,1,'product',2742,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision HD bullet CCTV camera\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE1AD0T-IT1F is a 2-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based security systems.\",\"info\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE1AD0T-IT1F\",\"mrp\":\"1\"}','2026-03-06 05:52:25'),
(4390,1,'product',2742,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 2 MP HD bullet CCTV camera\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE1AD0T-IT1F is a 2-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based security systems.\",\"info\":\"The camera works using HD-TVI technology, allowing high-quality video transmission over standard coaxial cable (BNC) to a DVR recorder.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"DS-2CE1AD0T-IT1F\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"It also supports switchable video formats (TVI / AHD / CVI / CVBS), making it compatible with many types of CCTV DVRs.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":282,\"secondary_id\":284,\"brand_id\":124}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772776480353-529776685.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 05:54:40'),
(4391,1,'product',2743,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Bullet Camera 2 MP\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE1AD0T-IT3F is a 2-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It uses a high-performance 2 MP CMOS image sensor to capture Full-HD video at 1920 × 1080 resolution, providing clear and detailed monitoring for homes, offices, shops, and outdoor security areas.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE1AD0T-IT3F\",\"alternative_name\":\"2-megapixel analog HD bullet Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The IP66 weather-resistant housing protects the camera from dust and rain, making it suitable for both indoor and outdoor installations.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772776789754-475520934.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 05:59:49'),
(4392,1,'product',454,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MQ-3 Gas Sensor\",\"description\":\"MQ-3 Gas Sensor without Module. MQ-3 Gas Sensor is a highly sensitive alcohol detection sensor commonly used for breath analyzers, alcohol detectors, safety devices, and embedded electronics projects. It is designed to detect alcohol vapors (ethanol) in the air with good accuracy and fast response.\",\"info\":\"MQ-3 Gas Sensor is a semiconductor-based sensor specifically designed to detect alcohol vapors (ethanol) in the air.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":78,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:12:04'),
(4393,1,'product',386,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MQ-3 Gas Sensor Module\",\"description\":\"MQ-3 Gas Sensor is a semiconductor-based alcohol sensor designed to detect the presence of alcohol vapors in the air.\",\"info\":\"The MQ-3 gas sensor is a semiconductor gas sensor primarily used to detect alcohol vapors (especially ethanol) in the air — commonly used in breathalyzer systems, alcohol detectors, safety systems, and monitoring projects\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":19,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:12:39'),
(4394,1,'product',2744,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 2MP Bullet Camera \",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE1AD0T-IT5F is a 2-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed by Hikvision for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\". It uses a high-performance CMOS image sensor to capture Full-HD video with a resolution of 1920 × 1080, delivering clear and detailed images for security monitoring in homes, offices, shops, warehouses, and outdoor areas.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE1AD0T-IT5F\",\"alternative_name\":\" Bullet Camera \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera supports switchable video formats (TVI / AHD / CVI / CVBS) so it can work with many different DVR systems.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772777618051-735120041.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 06:13:38'),
(4395,1,'product',2438,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"12V Water Flow sensor \",\"description\":\"YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor 1/2 inch, Robodo YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor, Water Flow Sensor YF?S201, Water Flow Sensor / Fluid Flowmeter YF?S201, Robocraze YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor, and YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor by Quartz Components are all versions of the YF-S201 — a compact Hall-effect water flow sensor with a standard 1/2? threaded connection for plumbing systems.\",\"info\":\"This sensor is designed to measure the flow rate of water (or other non-corrosive liquids) passing through a pipe and output a digital pulse signal that can be read by a microcontroller such as Arduino, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, or Raspberry Pi Pico\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"YF-S201 1/2 inch\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:14:04'),
(4396,1,'product',1258,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Voltage Sensor\",\"description\":\"A Voltage Sensor is an electronic module used to measure the electrical voltage present in a circuit and provide a scaled-down, safe output to a microcontroller or data acquisition device\",\"info\":\"It typically uses a voltage divider or sensing chip to convert high voltages into a lower measurable range compatible with devices like Arduino, Raspberry Pi (via ADC), and other controllers\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"VOLTAGE SENSOR MODULE\",\"mrp\":\"225.00\",\"note\":\"Voltage sensors help monitor battery levels, power supplies, and system voltages in automation, robotics, and electronics projects. They provide real-time voltage feedback for protection, display, logging, or control logic.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":18,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:25:32'),
(4397,1,'product',2565,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ZMPT101AC voltage sensor\",\"description\":\"The ZMPT101B AC Voltage Sensor Module is a precision electronic sensor designed to measure alternating current (AC) voltage safely and accurately in electrical and embedded system applications. It uses a high-precision voltage transformer (ZMPT101B) to isolate and step down high AC voltage signals, allowing microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, and other development boards to monitor AC voltage levels without direct exposure to high voltage\",\"info\":\"The module features an adjustable potentiometer for calibration, enabling accurate voltage measurement and signal output in analog form. Commonly used in energy monitoring systems, smart meters, power measurement projects, and home automation applications, the ZMPT101B sensor provides electrical isolation, stable performance, and reliable voltage detection, making it suitable for educational, industrial, and IoT-based electrical monitoring systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"Operating Voltage: 5V DC\\r\\nInput Voltage Range (AC): 0 – 250V AC (typical)\\r\\nMeasurement Type: AC Voltage (Single Phase)\\r\\nOutput Signal: Analog Voltage (0–5V)\\r\\nIsolation: Transformer-based isolation (High electrical isolation)\\r\\nFrequency Range: 50Hz / 60Hz\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":18,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:26:08'),
(4398,1,'product',81,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"AC712 CURRENT SENSOR\",\"description\":\"ACS712 Current Sensor Module (based on the ACS712 IC) is a versatile, widely-used sensor module for measuring both AC and DC currents via a microcontroller (Arduino, ESP32, etc.). Here’s a complete guide to help you understand its specs, use-cases, wiring, code, calibration, and practical considerations.\",\"info\":\"The ACS712 Current Sensor Module is a Hall-effect based current sensor that measures AC or DC current flowing through a conductor and outputs a proportional analog voltage\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"550.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":18,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:27:05'),
(4399,1,'product',2137,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DS18B20 Waterproof Digital Temperature\",\"description\":\"The DS18B20 Waterproof Digital Temperature Sensor is a high-accuracy, digital temperature sensor sealed in a stainless steel probe, making it suitable for wet, humid, and harsh environments.\",\"info\":\"It uses the 1-Wire communication protocol, allowing multiple sensors to be connected on a single data line, each with a unique ID.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"DS18B20 TEMPERATURE SENSOR WITH WIRE\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:28:47'),
(4400,1,'product',2745,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Bullet Camera 2 MP\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE19D0T-VFIR3F is a 2-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera from Hikvision designed for DVR-based surveillance systems. \",\"info\":\"It uses a 2 MP CMOS image sensor to record Full-HD video at 1920 × 1080 resolution, delivering clear and detailed monitoring for homes, offices, shops, and outdoor areas.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE19D0T-VFIR3F\",\"alternative_name\":\"Bullet Camera 2 MP\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772779038900-885276315.png\"}','2026-03-06 06:37:18'),
(4401,1,'product',747,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Water Level Senor Module\",\"description\":\"Water Level Sensor Module is a simple and effective tool used to detect the presence and level of water in a container or tank. It works on the principle of conductivity, using exposed copper traces to measure the water level based on how many traces come in contact with the liquid.\",\"info\":\"It provides an analog or digital output proportional to the water level, making it ideal for water tank monitoring, overflow alarms, irrigation systems, and Arduino/ESP projects. The module is easy to use, low cost, and suitable for non-corrosive liquid level detection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"water level sensor\",\"mrp\":\"299.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:38:51'),
(4402,1,'product',121,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"FINGER PRINT MODULE R307\",\"description\":\"It’s perfect for projects like attendance systems, secure door locks, ATM-style authentication, and IoT user verification — and it integrates beautifully with Arduino, ESP32, and even PHP/MySQL dashboards for cloud-based logging or verification.\",\"info\":\"The R307 Fingerprint Module is an optical fingerprint recognition sensor used for biometric identification and access control\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Fingerprint sensor R307 module\",\"mrp\":\"3500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":23,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:39:44'),
(4403,1,'product',84,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HX711 Load Cell Pcb\",\"description\":\"HX711 Load Cell Amplifier PCB is one of the most commonly used modules for weight measurement, load sensing, and pressure-based IoT systems. It’s reliable, inexpensive, and perfect for integration with Arduino, ESP32, or even your PHP/IoT backend systems.\",\"info\":\"The HX711 Load Cell PCB is a high-precision 24-bit analog-to-digital converter (ADC) module specially designed for weighing scale and force measurement applications\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"HX711 24 BIT\",\"mrp\":\"520.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":20,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:41:06'),
(4404,1,'product',122,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"PULSE SENSOR Heart Beat\",\"description\":\"the Pulse Sensor (often called Pulse Sensor Amped) is one of the most popular and easy-to-use modules for heart rate (BPM) and pulse waveform detection in Arduino, ESP32, and IoT health monitoring systems. It’s ideal for fitness trackers, medical prototypes, IoT dashboards, and biometric authentication systems.\",\"info\":\"The Pulse Sensor (Heart Beat Sensor Module) is a non-invasive biometric sensor used to measure heart rate (BPM – beats per minute) by detecting tiny changes in blood flow through the fingertip, earlobe, or wrist\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Pulse Sensor\",\"mrp\":\"690.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":23,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:43:14'),
(4405,1,'product',2746,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 5MP  Bullet Camera\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE16H0T-ITFS is a 5-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\" It uses a high-performance 5 MP CMOS image sensor that captures video with a maximum resolution of 2560 × 1944, delivering clear and detailed monitoring for homes, offices, shops, and outdoor security areas.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE16H0T-ITFS\",\"alternative_name\":\"Bullet Camera 5MP \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"A built-in microphone enables audio transmission over the same coaxial cable, providing both video and sound monitoring.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772779444737-716587833.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 06:44:04'),
(4406,1,'product',2501,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IR Sensor Array 5\",\"description\":\"IR Sensor Array 5 is a compact sensing module that integrates five infrared (IR) transmitter–receiver pairs on a single PCB. It is designed for applications that require multi-point surface or object detection with higher accuracy than single or dual sensors. By reading reflected IR light, the array can detect line position, edges, obstacles, and surface contrast in real time.\",\"info\":\"The array generally operates on a 3.3V–5V DC supply, making it compatible with Arduino, ESP8266/ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, and other microcontrollers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"IR Module 5 Array\",\"mrp\":\"899\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":166,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:45:17'),
(4407,1,'product',82,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BMP280 Pressure Sensor\",\"description\":\"BMP280 Barometric Pressure & Temperature Sensor and the more advanced BME280 Environmental Sensor (Pressure, Temperature, Humidity), including what they can do, how to use them, and which might best fit your projects.\",\"info\":\"The BMP280 and BME280 are compact, high-precision barometric pressure sensors widely used in electronics and IoT projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"BMP280 Pressure Sensor Module\",\"mrp\":\"520.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":20,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:46:33'),
(4408,1,'product',774,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Inductive Proximity Sensor\",\"description\":\"Inductive Proximity Sensor is a non-contact metal detection sensor designed to detect the presence of metallic objects without any physical touch. It works on the principle of electromagnetic induction, generating a high-frequency magnetic field that changes when a metal object comes close.\",\"info\":\"An Inductive Proximity Sensor is a non-contact sensor used to detect the presence of metal objects without physically touching them. It works on the principle of electromagnetic induction, making it highly reliable in industrial environments.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Proximity Sensor\",\"mrp\":\"799.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":20,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:47:58'),
(4409,1,'product',2566,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Optical dust sensor\",\"description\":\"An optical dust sensor is an electronic module used to detect and measure particulate matter (dust) in the air.\",\"info\":\"It works by using a light source and a photodetector—when dust particles pass through the sensor’s light beam, they scatter light, which is then detected and converted into an electrical signal proportional to dust concentration.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":575,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:48:33'),
(4410,1,'product',2124,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Color Sensor Module TCS3200D/TCS2300\",\"description\":\"High-resolution conversion of light intensity to frequency.\\r\\nThe pins have 2.54 mm pitch.\\r\\nMil-convenient for bitmap board.\\r\\nProgrammable color and full-scale output frequency.\\r\\nCommunicate directly with a microcontroller.\\r\\nLow-profile surface mount package.\",\"info\":\"Operating Voltage: 3V-5V\\r\\nHigh-resolution conversion of light intensity to frequency.\\r\\nChip pins all has drawn for standard 100.\\r\\nPut the needle (2.54 mm).\\r\\nMil-convenient for bitmap board.\\r\\nProgrammable color and full-scale output frequency.\\r\\nCommunicate directly with a microcontroller.\\r\\nLow-profile surface mount package.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"TCS 3200 colour sensor\",\"mrp\":\"900.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":71,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:49:41'),
(4411,1,'product',2747,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Bullet Camera Hikvision \",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE16H0T-ITPFS is a 5-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It also supports Smart IR / EXIR night-vision technology with an infrared range of about 25 meters, allowing the camera to record clear images even in complete darkness.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE16H0T-ITPFS \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera works with HD-TVI technology, which allows high-resolution video transmission through a coaxial cable (BNC) directly to a DVR recorder.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772779804994-639632947.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 06:50:04'),
(4412,1,'product',108,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"WATER TANK FLOAT SWITCH\",\"description\":\"the Water Tank Float Switch (also called a liquid level sensor or float level controller) is one of the simplest and most reliable ways to detect water level in tanks and automate pumps or send IoT alerts.\",\"info\":\"A water tank float switch is a simple and reliable liquid level control device used to automatically turn a water pump ON or OFF based on the water level in a tank.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Float sensor switch\",\"mrp\":\"940.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:50:35'),
(4413,1,'product',119,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MLX 90614Contactless IR Temperature\",\"description\":\"It’s widely used in medical thermometers, industrial temperature monitoring, IoT systems, and embedded automation where non-contact temperature measurement is needed.\",\"info\":\"The MLX90614 is a contactless infrared (IR) temperature sensor that measures the temperature of an object without physical contact.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"MLX9061 Module\",\"mrp\":\"1950.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:52:05'),
(4414,1,'product',697,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NTC Thermistor\",\"description\":\"The NTC Thermistor (Negative Temperature Coefficient Thermistor) is a temperature-sensitive resistor whose resistance decreases as temperature increases. It is made from semiconductor materials such as metal oxides, which provide high sensitivity to temperature changes. When the surrounding temperature rises, the electrical resistance of the thermistor drops significantly, allowing it to accurately measure temperature variations. Due to this characteristic, NTC thermistors are widely used for temperature sensing, monitoring, and compensation applications in electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"NTC thermistors are commonly available in various resistance values such as 10KΩ, 47KΩ, or 100KΩ at 25°C, and they operate with low power consumption. They can be easily interfaced with microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP8266, and ESP32 using a voltage divider circuit to convert resistance changes into measurable voltage signals.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"NTC Module\",\"mrp\":\"399.00\",\"note\":\"NTC thermistors are widely used in battery temperature monitoring, power supplies, HVAC systems, medical devices, automotive electronics, home appliances, and IoT temperature control systems. They are also used for inrush current limiting and thermal protection in electronic equipment.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":546,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:52:54'),
(4415,1,'product',2568,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TM1637 Indicator module\",\"description\":\"The TM1637 Indicator Module is a compact digital display unit featuring a 4-digit 7-segment LED display driven by the TM1637 display driver IC\",\"info\":\"It’s widely used for displaying numbers, time, counters, temperatures, and simple data in microcontroller and embedded systems projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"299\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 06:59:56'),
(4416,1,'product',2570,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MAX 7219 Dot Matrix 8x8 Led SMD Version\",\"description\":\"The MAX7219 Dot Matrix 8×8 LED Module (SMD Version) is an 8×8 surface-mount LED matrix display driven by the MAX7219 LED driver IC\",\"info\":\"This SMD (Surface-Mount Device) version features compact SMD LEDs for improved visual clarity and sleek integration, making it perfect for text scrolling, patterns, animations, and numerical displays in microcontroller projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"899\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":23,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 07:00:34'),
(4417,1,'product',230,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MAX 7219 Module\",\"description\":\"The MAX7219 is an LED-display driver chip that handles multiplexing, current-limiting, and data input for LED displays (7-segment digits, LED matrices) with minimal microcontroller overhead.\",\"info\":\"MAX7219 Module is an LED driver board based on the MAX7219 IC, designed to control LED matrices or multiple 7-segment displays with minimal wiring\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"MAX 7219 Dot Matrix 8*8 Led Module\",\"mrp\":\"599.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":23,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 07:02:09'),
(4418,1,'product',419,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Traffic Light Sensor\",\"description\":\"The Traffic Light Sensor Module is a compact LED signal indicator module featuring Red, Yellow, and Green LEDs for use in robotics, smart traffic models, school projects, automation systems, and Arduino-based simulations.\",\"info\":\"A Traffic Light Sensor is an electronic sensing module used in traffic signal control systems to detect the presence, movement, or density of vehicles and pedestrians at an intersection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Traffic Signal Module\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":139,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 07:03:21'),
(4419,1,'product',2415,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MT3608 DC-DC Step UP Power Module\",\"description\":\"The MT3608 DC-DC Step-Up Power Module is a compact boost converter designed to raise a lower DC input voltage to a higher, stable DC output. Built around the MT3608 switching regulator IC, this module is highly efficient and widely used in battery-powered and portable electronics where voltage boosting is required.\",\"info\":\"The MT3608 DC-DC Step-Up Power Module is a compact boost converter used to increase a low DC input voltage to a higher, regulated DC output. It is based on the MT3608 switching regulator IC and is commonly used in battery-powered and portable electronic projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"MT3608 DC Voltage Step down module\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":59,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 07:05:16'),
(4420,1,'product',2748,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Bullet Camera 5 MP \",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE1AH0T-IT1F is a 5-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed by Hikvision for DVR-based surveillance systems. \",\"info\":\"It uses a high-performance CMOS image sensor capable of capturing high-resolution video at 2560 × 1944, providing clear and detailed monitoring for homes, shops, offices, and outdoor areas.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE1AH0T-IT1F \",\"alternative_name\":\"5-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera works with HD-TVI technology, which allows high-quality video transmission over a standard coaxial cable (BNC) directly to a DVR recorder.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772781297785-952711477.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 07:14:57'),
(4421,1,'product',39,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BMS 3S 20A\",\"description\":\"crucially safeguards 3-cell Li-ion battery cases | protects against overcharging, overdischarging, short circuits, and overcurrent.\\r\\nA balanced charging system is included for longer battery life | Suitable for DIY projects, power banks, and electric car applications.\",\"info\":\"A 3S 20A BMS is a compact electronic protection circuit designed specifically for 3-cell lithium battery packs (commonly Li-ion or LiPo) connected in series (3S).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"3S-20A BMS Module\",\"mrp\":\"350.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":13,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 07:17:57'),
(4422,1,'product',2571,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Bread Board\",\"description\":\"The Breadboard GL-12 is a high-quality solderless prototyping board used for building and testing electronic circuits without soldering\",\"info\":\"It provides a flexible platform to mount and interconnect components like ICs, resistors, capacitors, sensors, and modules during design, development, and experimentation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Bread Board GL-12\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"It provides a flexible platform to mount and interconnect components like ICs, resistors, capacitors, sensors, and modules during design, development, and experimentation.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":565,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 07:23:24'),
(4423,1,'product',566,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Breadboard with 400 Tie Points\",\"description\":\"This Pack of 3 Breadboards (400 Tie Points) provides high-quality solderless prototyping boards ideal for Arduino, Raspberry Pi, sensor interfacing, robotics, and DIY electronics projects.\",\"info\":\"A set of 3 mini solderless breadboards, each with 400 tie points, ideal for prototyping and testing electronic circuits. These compact breadboards are reusable, easy to interconnect, and perfect for DIY projects, Arduino experiments, and learning electronics.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Breadboard medium 400point\",\"mrp\":\"699.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 07:24:32'),
(4424,1,'product',2574,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4x4 PCB Board\",\"description\":\"A 4 × 4 General Purpose PCB (G.PCB) is a universal prototyping printed circuit board used for building and soldering electronic circuits. With a square form factor, this board provides a flexible platform for assembling components and converting breadboard prototypes into permanent soldered designs.\",\"info\":\"A 4x4 PCB board refers to a printed circuit board with dimensions of 4 cm × 4 cm or sometimes 4 inch × 4 inch, depending on specification. It is commonly used as a base platform for building and assembling electronic circuits. The board is usually made of FR4 (fiber-reinforced epoxy laminate) or phenolic material and coated with a thin layer of copper for circuit tracing.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"4*4 G.PCB\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"This size is widely used for DIY electronics projects, Arduino circuits, robotics modules, power supply boards, prototype circuits, student lab experiments, and small embedded system designs. The compact 4x4 size makes it ideal for small to medium circuits that require neat layout and easy mounting inside enclosures.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":564,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 07:30:23'),
(4425,1,'product',2575,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"6x4 PCB Board\",\"description\":\"A 6x4 PCB board refers to a printed circuit board with dimensions of 6 cm × 4 cm or sometimes 6 inch × 4 inch, depending on the specification. It is commonly used as a base platform for assembling and soldering electronic components in DIY and prototype circuits. The board is typically made of FR4 (fiber-reinforced epoxy laminate) or phenolic material and coated with a thin copper layer for creating circuit connections.\",\"info\":\"6x4 PCB boards are available in single-sided, double-sided, and general-purpose perforated (zero PCB) types. Single-sided boards have copper on one side only, while double-sided boards have copper layers on both sides for more complex circuit layouts. Zero PCBs feature evenly spaced holes (usually 2.54mm pitch) that allow components like resistors, capacitors, ICs, transistors, and connectors to be manually soldered.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"6*4 G.PCB\",\"mrp\":\"399.00\",\"note\":\"This size is suitable for medium-sized electronic projects, power supply circuits, Arduino and microcontroller-based projects, robotics modules, amplifier circuits, and educational lab experiments. The 6x4 size provides more working area compared to smaller boards, allowing better component spacing and organized layout inside enclosures.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":564,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 07:30:56'),
(4426,1,'product',2749,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2x3 PCB BOARD\",\"description\":\"A 2×3 PCB Board is a small general-purpose prototype printed circuit board used for building and testing electronic circuits. The board typically measures 2 inches × 3 inches and contains a grid of pre-drilled holes with copper pads that allow electronic components to be soldered and connected easily.\",\"info\":\"These boards are widely used in DIY electronics, Arduino projects, circuit prototyping, and repair work. Components such as resistors, capacitors, IC sockets, transistors, and connectors can be mounted on the board and wired together using solder or jumper wires to create custom circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1116],\"alternative_name\":\"2*3 G.PCB\",\"mrp\":\"98\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772783023148-627367608.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 07:43:43'),
(4427,1,'product',2750,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GSM Module SIM900A\",\"description\":\"The SIM900A GSM Module is a compact wireless communication module used to enable GSM and GPRS connectivity in electronic devices. It allows microcontrollers and embedded systems to send and receive SMS messages, make voice calls, and transmit data over the GSM network using a standard SIM card.\",\"info\":\"The module operates on dual-band GSM frequencies (900 MHz and 1800 MHz) and communicates with microcontrollers such as Arduino, Raspberry Pi, or other development boards through a UART serial interface using AT commands. Because of its reliable cellular communication, it is widely used in IoT systems, remote monitoring, security devices, and automation projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[575],\"mrp\":\"2998\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772784020296-63732141.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 08:00:20'),
(4428,1,'product',210,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GPS NEO 6M\",\"description\":\"GPS module for Arduino and microcontrollers, based on the Ublox model NEO 6M receiver, the module includes its ceramic antenna to be placed directly on the PCB, so it comes ready to operate without requiring further accessories.\",\"info\":\"GPS NEO-6M Module is a popular GPS receiver used for accurate position, speed, and time data.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"GY-NEO6MV2 GPS Module\",\"mrp\":\"950.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":32,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 08:02:12'),
(4429,1,'product',154,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BLUETOOTH Module HC05\",\"description\":\"The HC-05 Bluetooth Module is a classic wireless communication module widely used for serial data exchange between microcontrollers (like Arduino, ESP32, STM32) and Bluetooth-enabled devices such as smartphones, tablets, and laptops\",\"info\":\"It operates over Bluetooth Classic (2.0 + EDR) and supports SPP (Serial Port Profile), making it perfect for remote control, data logging, and wireless sensor communication projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"HC05 Bluetooth module\",\"mrp\":\"650.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":28,\"brand_id\":230}]}','2026-03-06 08:03:05'),
(4430,1,'product',2134,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Buzzer Small\",\"description\":\"A Small Buzzer is a compact electronic sound-producing component used to generate beeps, alerts, and warning tones in electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"Small buzzers are available as active (built-in oscillator, works directly with DC supply) and passive (requires an external signal or PWM)\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"12V Golli buzzer 12mm\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":434,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 08:19:46'),
(4431,1,'product',2580,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"XH-W3001 Module\",\"description\":\"The HX-W3001 (often labeled XH-W3001) is a digital temperature controller / thermostat module used for automatic temperature monitoring and control in various heating or cooling applications.\",\"info\":\"The XH-W3001 is a simple yet versatile digital temperature controller (thermostat) module used to monitor and control temperature in various electrical and thermal systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10.00\",\"note\":\"Digital LED temperature display\\r\\nAutomatic Heating / Cooling control\\r\\nWaterproof NTC temperature probe\\r\\nAdjustable start & stop temperature\\r\\n High accuracy control (±0.1°C)\\r\\n Relay output for load switching\\r\\n Plug-and-play operation\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":8,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 08:21:10'),
(4432,1,'product',2751,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Bullet Camera \",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE1AH0T-IT3F is a 5-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It features EXIR 2.0 infrared night-vision technology with a viewing distance of up to 40 meters, enabling reliable recording even in complete darkness.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE1AH0T-IT3F \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"It uses a high-performance 5 MP CMOS image sensor capable of capturing video at a resolution of 2560 × 1944, delivering clear and detailed monitoring for homes, shops, offices, warehouses, and outdoor areas.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772785279480-148705798.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 08:21:19'),
(4433,1,'product',100,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"W1209 Incubator Thermostat\",\"description\":\"W1209 Digital Temperature Controller Module (widely used as an incubator thermostat) — what it is, what it offers, how you can use it in your projects (especially considering your sensor/IoT context), and things to watch out for.\",\"info\":\"The W1209 thermostat controller is a compact digital temperature controller module designed to monitor and control temperature automatically using an onboard NTC temperature sensor and a built-in relay\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"W1209 \",\"mrp\":\"750.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 08:22:37'),
(4434,1,'product',100,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"W1209 Incubator Thermostat\",\"description\":\"W1209 Digital Temperature Controller Module (widely used as an incubator thermostat) — what it is, what it offers, how you can use it in your projects (especially considering your sensor/IoT context), and things to watch out for.\",\"info\":\"The W1209 thermostat controller is a compact digital temperature controller module designed to monitor and control temperature automatically using an onboard NTC temperature sensor and a built-in relay\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"W1209 Thernostat Module\",\"mrp\":\"750.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":76,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 08:23:12'),
(4435,1,'product',2581,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UNO R4 WIFI Board\",\"description\":\"The Arduino UNO R4 WiFi is a next-generation Arduino development board that combines the familiar UNO form factor with significantly upgraded performance, wireless connectivity, and modern features — making it ideal for IoT, robotics, automation, and advanced electronic projects\",\"info\":\"Uno R4 WiFi is its built-in Wi-Fi connectivity, allowing your projects to connect to wireless networks right out of the box without needing extra shields or modules. This opens up possibilities like remote data logging, IoT sensors, or web-controlled devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"3999\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":465,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 08:23:58'),
(4436,1,'product',2583,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"SMPS Soldron Micro station\",\"description\":\"The SMPS Soldron Micro Station is a portable, variable-wattage soldering station ideal for electronics assembly, repair, and rework—especially for fine SMD/SMT work.\",\"info\":\"Unlike simple plug-in irons, it uses SMPS (Switched-Mode Power Supply) technology to deliver a clean, stable power output that ensures consistent heat control and better performance\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":423,\"secondary_id\":496,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 08:25:20'),
(4437,1,'product',2752,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 5MP HD dome Camera\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE5AH0T-ITMF is a 5-megapixel analog HD dome (turret-style) CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"The camera uses HD-TVI technology, which allows high-quality video transmission through a standard coaxial cable (BNC) directly to a DVR recorder.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[341],\"model\":\"DS-2CE5AH0T-ITMF\",\"alternative_name\":\"Hikvision 5MP HD Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera usually comes with 2.8 mm, 3.6 mm, or 6 mm fixed lens options, offering different viewing angles depending on the installation area.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772785810295-989622597.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 08:30:10'),
(4438,1,'product',2753,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Turret Camera 5 MP\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE76H0T-ITPFS is a 5-megapixel analog HD turret (dome-style) CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"The camera operates with HD-TVI technology, allowing high-quality video transmission through a standard coaxial cable (BNC) to a DVR recorder.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[349],\"model\":\"DS-2CE76H0T-ITPFS\",\"alternative_name\":\" Turret Camera 5 MP \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"It also features a built-in microphone, enabling audio over coaxial cable so both sound and video can be recorded together.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772786156084-191864155.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 08:35:56'),
(4439,1,'product',303,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RFID MFRC522 13.6MHz\",\"description\":\"The RC522 Module (MFRC522 RFID Module) is a low-cost RFID reader and writer module used for contactless communication with RFID cards and tags. It operates at a frequency of 13.56 MHz and can read or write data to compatible RFID cards such as MIFARE 1K, MIFARE S50, and other ISO14443A cards.\",\"info\":\"The RFID MFRC522 13.56 MHz module is a popular contactless RFID reader/writer based on the NXP MFRC522 chipset. It operates at 13.56 MHz (HF) and supports ISO/IEC 14443A standard RFID cards and tags such as MIFARE Classic.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"RC522 Module\",\"mrp\":\"350.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":30,\"secondary_id\":468,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 08:41:11'),
(4440,1,'product',2754,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Bullet Camera 5MP \",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE11H0T-PIRLO is a 5-megapixel analog HD mini bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It also includes a strobe light alarm that flashes when motion is detected to help deter intruders.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE11H0T-PIRLO\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"A key feature of this model is the PIR (Passive Infrared) motion detection sensor, which can detect human movement and trigger alarms or alerts in real time.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772786559025-406472969.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 08:42:39'),
(4441,1,'product',47,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CNC SHIELD V 3.0\",\"description\":\"CNC shield v3 engraving machine 3D Printer + 4Piece A4988 driver expansion board, Engraver CNC Shield Board Version:3.0\\r\\nA4988 motor drivers.The extension board can be used for carving machine, 3d printer driver expansion board GRBL 0.8 compatible. (Open source firmware that runs on an for arduino UNO that turns G-code commands into stepper signals)\",\"info\":\"The CNC Shield V3.0 is an Arduino expansion board (shield) designed to make it easy to control stepper motors for CNC machines, 3D printers, laser engravers, plotters, and other motion-control applications\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"CNC sheild Module\",\"mrp\":\"560.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":142,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 08:42:58'),
(4442,1,'product',2755,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Turret Camera 5 MP\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE71H0T-PIRLO is a 5-megapixel analog HD turret (dome-style) CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"A special feature of this model is the built-in PIR (Passive Infrared) motion detection sensor, which detects human movement and can trigger alarms when motion is detected.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[349],\"model\":\"DS-2CE71H0T-PIRLO\",\"alternative_name\":\"5 MP  Turret Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera is available with 2.8 mm or 3.6 mm fixed lens options to provide different viewing angles.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772787081007-750556446.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 08:51:21'),
(4443,1,'product',2756,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Basic Calculator\",\"description\":\"A Basic Calculator is a simple electronic device used to perform fundamental mathematical operations quickly and accurately. It is commonly used by students, office workers, shopkeepers, and engineers for everyday calculations. A basic calculator typically supports essential arithmetic functions such as addition (+), subtraction (−), multiplication (×), and division (÷). Most models also include extra keys for percentage (%), square root (√), memory functions, and clear/reset operations, making calculations easier and more efficient\",\"info\":\"Basic calculators are designed with a numeric keypad, function buttons, and an LCD or LED display to show numbers and results. They are usually battery-powered or solar-powered, making them portable and convenient to use anywhere. These calculators are widely used in schools, offices, retail shops, laboratories, and homes for tasks such as accounting, budgeting, and simple mathematical problem-solving. Because of their simplicity, reliability, and low cost, basic calculators remain one of the most commonly used electronic calculation tools\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[856],\"mrp\":\"599\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772788309988-462141358.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 09:11:49'),
(4444,1,'product',2757,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Bullet Camera 2 MP\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE10DF0T-PFS is a 2-megapixel analog HD ColorVu mini bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"It uses a 2 MP CMOS image sensor to capture Full-HD video at 1920 × 1080 resolution, providing clear monitoring for homes, offices, shops, and outdoor areas.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE10DF0T-PFS\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera supports white-light night illumination up to about 20 meters, ensuring bright color images at night instead of traditional black-and-white infrared footage.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772788342810-951345031.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 09:12:22'),
(4445,1,'product',2758,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GST Calculator\",\"description\":\"A GST Calculator is a tool used to calculate the Goods and Services Tax (GST) amount on products or services. It helps businesses, shopkeepers, accountants, and customers quickly determine the GST amount and the final price including or excluding tax. GST calculators are widely used in countries like India where GST is applied to goods and services at different tax rates such as 5%, 12%, 18%, and 28%.\",\"info\":\"The calculator works by entering the original price of the product or service and selecting the applicable GST percentage. It then automatically calculates the GST amount and shows the total price including GST. Some GST calculators also allow reverse calculation, where users can find the original price and GST amount from a GST-inclusive price. This tool helps simplify tax calculations, reduce manual errors, and save time in billing, invoicing, and financial management. GST calculators are commonly available as online tools, mobile apps, and built-in features in accounting software and billing systems\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[858],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772788401125-674235437.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 09:13:21'),
(4446,1,'product',2759,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Scientific Calculator\",\"description\":\"A Scientific Calculator is an advanced electronic calculator designed to perform complex mathematical and scientific calculations. Unlike a basic calculator that handles simple arithmetic operations, a scientific calculator can perform functions such as trigonometry (sin, cos, tan), logarithms (log, ln), exponents, powers, roots, fractions, and statistical calculations. These calculators are widely used by students, engineers, scientists, and professionals in fields such as mathematics, physics, chemistry, and engineering.\",\"info\":\"Scientific calculators usually feature a large keypad with multiple function buttons and a digital display, allowing users to perform advanced calculations quickly and accurately. Many models support bracket operations, memory storage, angle conversions (degrees, radians, grads), and scientific notation, which are essential for solving complex equations and formulas. Some modern scientific calculators also include multi-line displays, equation solving, and programming features. Because of their ability to handle advanced mathematical functions efficiently, scientific calculators are commonly used in schools, colleges, laboratories, and technical work environments\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[859],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772788501286-17743886.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 09:15:01'),
