(4464,1,'product',2767,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Bullet Camera Two-Way Audio Camera\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE10DF3T-LPTS is a high-performance Full HD 2-megapixel surveillance camera that provides clear video with a resolution of 1920 × 1080 pixels.\",\"info\":\"It uses ColorVu technology, which allows the camera to capture bright full-color images 24/7, even in very low-light environments, thanks to its F1.0 large-aperture lens and Smart Hybrid Light system.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE10DF3T-LPTS\",\"alternative_name\":\" Two-Way Audio Camera\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"This camera also supports two-way audio, with a built-in microphone and speaker, allowing real-time communication through the camera.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772793531084-507120451.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 10:38:51'),
(4465,1,'product',3,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Power Supply Adapter 12v 3A\",\"description\":\"Compact Design: Space-saving and lightweight, making it easy to integrate into various setups.\\r\\nStable Output: Delivers a consistent 12V 2 Amps DC output, ensuring reliable performance for your devices.\",\"info\":\"12V 3A DC Power Supply Adapter – Standard 12 V 3 A adapter ideal for CCTV, routers, displays, and general DIY projects\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":10,\"secondary_id\":\"593\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 10:39:45'),
(4466,1,'product',2768,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Bullet Camera Two-Way Audio Camera\",\"description\":\"The DS-2CE16D0T-LPTS is a high-quality surveillance camera that provides Full HD 1080p resolution (1920 × 1080) for clear and detailed video recording.\",\"info\":\"It features Smart Hybrid Light technology, which combines IR light and white light to deliver clear images during night surveillance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera supports 2.8 mm or 3.6 mm fixed lenses, offering a wide viewing angle for monitoring entrances, shops, homes, offices, and parking areas.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772793746343-527515033.jfif\"}','2026-03-06 10:42:26'),
(4467,1,'product',2769,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Power Supply Adapter 12v 1A\",\"description\":\"12V 1Amp Power Supply Adapter is an electrical device used to convert standard AC power from a wall outlet into a stable 12-volt DC output with a maximum current capacity of 1 ampere (1000mA). It is commonly used to power small electronic devices such as routers, LED strips, CCTV cameras, audio modules, development boards, and other low-power electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"The adapter typically operates with an input voltage range of 100–240V AC and provides a regulated 12V DC output through a DC barrel connector. Most modern adapters use Switch Mode Power Supply (SMPS) technology, making them compact, energy efficient, and capable of providing stable voltage with minimal heat generation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1321],\"model\":\"12V 1A\",\"alternative_name\":\"Power Supply Adapter\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772793886480-845531009.jpeg\"}','2026-03-06 10:44:46'),
(4468,1,'product',2,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Power Supply Adapter 12v 5A\",\"description\":\"he Heavy Duty 12V 5A 60W DC Power Supply Adapter is engineered to deliver stable and reliable power for a wide range of 12V electronic devices. Built with high-quality components and advanced safety features, it ensures consistent performance with incredibly low fault rates. Suitable for continuous use, this adapter is ideal for CCTV systems, LED strips, routers, monitors, and other DC-powered equipment requiring up to 5A output.\",\"info\":\"The Power Adapter 12V 5A is an external AC-to-DC power supply designed to convert standard household AC voltage into a stable 12-volt DC output with a maximum current capacity of 5 amperes. It is commonly used to power electronic devices that require a reliable 12V DC source, such as CCTV cameras, LED strip lights, routers, motor drivers, security systems, and embedded electronics projects\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Alternative  demo\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"This power adapter typically accepts a wide input voltage range of 100–240V AC, making it suitable for use in different regions without additional converters. It usually comes with protection features such as over-voltage protection, over-current protection, short-circuit protection, and thermal protection to ensure safe operation and protect connected devices\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":10,\"secondary_id\":\"593\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"base_image\":\"products/1772793976306-200993201.jpeg\"}','2026-03-06 10:46:16'),
(4469,1,'product',2770,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Bullet Camera Two-Way Audio Camera\",\"description\":\"The Hikvision DS-2CE16K0T-LPTS is a high-resolution security camera that delivers 3K video quality (2960 × 1665 pixels), providing clear and detailed images for surveillance applications.\",\"info\":\"The camera is equipped with a 2.8 mm or 3.6 mm fixed lens, offering a wide field of view for monitoring entrances, shops, homes, offices, and parking areas.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[344],\"model\":\"DS-2CE16K0T-LPTS\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"It also supports two-way audio, with a built-in microphone and speaker, allowing real-time communication through the camera.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772793980621-699282313.png\"}','2026-03-06 10:46:20'),
(4470,1,'product',2771,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5V 1A Power Supply Adapter\",\"description\":\"5V 1A Power Supply Adapter is an electronic power device designed to convert high-voltage AC power from a wall outlet into a stable 5-volt DC output with a maximum current capacity of 1 ampere (1000mA). It is commonly used to power small electronic devices such as microcontroller boards, USB devices, Bluetooth modules, LED lights, small audio modules, and other low-power electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"The adapter usually supports an input voltage range of 100–240V AC, making it suitable for use in different regions. Most modern adapters use Switch Mode Power Supply (SMPS) technology, which makes them lightweight, energy efficient, and capable of providing stable output voltage.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1321],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"When using a 5V 1A adapter, ensure that the connected device requires 5V DC input and does not exceed the 1A current limit. Supplying higher voltage can damage the device, while devices requiring more than 1A may not operate properly.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772794165871-190229967.jpeg\"}','2026-03-06 10:49:25'),
(4471,1,'product',2772,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5V 2A Power Supply Adapter\",\"description\":\"5V 2A Power Supply Adapter is an electrical device that converts high-voltage AC power from a wall outlet into a regulated 5-volt DC output with a maximum current capacity of 2 amperes (2000mA). It is widely used to power electronic devices that require a stable 5V supply with moderate current consumption. Common applications include Raspberry Pi boards, microcontroller projects, USB-powered devices, Bluetooth speakers, LED modules, development boards, and small electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"The adapter typically supports an input voltage range of 100–240V AC, making it suitable for use in different countries. Most modern adapters use Switch Mode Power Supply (SMPS) technology, which provides efficient power conversion, compact size, and stable output with minimal heat generation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1321],\"alternative_name\":\"Power Supply Adapter\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"When using a 5V 2A adapter, ensure that the device operates on 5V DC and does not require a higher voltage. Devices can safely draw only the current they need, up to the 2A limit of the adapter. Always verify the connector type, USB output or DC plug size, and polarity before connecting the adapter. Using a good-quality adapter with proper insulation and protection features such as overcurrent, overvoltage, and short-circuit protection helps ensure reliable performance and extends the lifespan of the connected electronic devices.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772794305800-314425609.jpeg\"}','2026-03-06 10:51:45'),
(4472,1,'product',2773,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Turret Camera Two way Camera \",\"description\":\"The Hikvision DS-2CE72DF3T-LTS delivers Full HD 1080p resolution (1920 × 1080) for clear and detailed video surveillance.\",\"info\":\"It features ColorVu technology, allowing the camera to capture 24-hour full-color images even in very low-light conditions using an F1.0 large-aperture lens and advanced sensor technology.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[349],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The camera supports 2.8 mm or 3.6 mm fixed lenses, providing a wide viewing angle for monitoring homes, offices, shops, corridors, and building entrances.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772794330488-122039482.jpg\"}','2026-03-06 10:52:10'),
(4473,1,'product',2774,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"9V 1A Power Supply Adapter\",\"description\":\"9V 1A Power Supply Adapter is an electrical device that converts high-voltage AC power from a wall outlet into a regulated 9-volt DC output with a maximum current capacity of 1 ampere (1000mA). It is commonly used to power small electronic devices such as WiFi routers, radio receivers, guitar effect pedals, small audio devices, Arduino projects, and other electronic circuits that require a stable 9V supply.\",\"info\":\"The adapter usually supports an input voltage range of 100–240V AC, making it suitable for use in different countries. Most modern adapters are designed using Switch Mode Power Supply (SMPS) technology, which ensures efficient power conversion, compact size, lightweight design, and stable voltage output.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1321],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"When using a 9V 1A power adapter, it is important to confirm that the connected device requires 9V DC input and does not draw more than 1A current. Using the correct DC plug size and polarity (commonly center-positive) is essential to prevent damage to the device. An adapter with a higher current rating can be used safely, but the voltage must always match the device requirement.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772794494156-9686432.jpeg\"}','2026-03-06 10:54:54'),
(4474,1,'product',2775,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"9V 2A Power Supply Adapter\",\"description\":\"9V 2A Power Supply Adapter is an electronic power device designed to convert high-voltage AC input (typically 100–240V AC) from a wall outlet into a regulated 9-volt DC output with a maximum current capacity of 2 amperes (2000mA). It is commonly used to power electronic devices that require a stable 9V power source with higher current demand. Typical applications include WiFi routers, CCTV cameras, audio amplifiers, digital instruments, development boards, and other electronic modules.\",\"info\":\"When using a 9V 2A power adapter, ensure that the connected device requires 9V DC input and the current requirement does not exceed 2A. Devices will draw only the amount of current they need up to the adapter’s limit, so using a higher current-rated adapter is generally safe if the voltage matches. Always check the DC connector size, polarity (usually center-positive), and cable condition before connecting the adapter.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1321],\"alternative_name\":\"Power Supply Adapter\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"Using a good quality adapter with protection features such as overcurrent, short-circuit, and overvoltage protection helps ensure safe and reliable operation of the powered electronic device.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772794644591-69202644.jpeg\"}','2026-03-06 10:57:24'),
(4475,1,'product',2776,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"24V 1A Power Supply Adapter\",\"description\":\"24V 1A Power Supply Adapter is an electrical device used to convert high-voltage AC input (usually 100–240V AC) from a wall outlet into a regulated 24-volt DC output with a maximum current capacity of 1 ampere (1000mA). It is commonly used to power electronic devices and equipment that require a stable 24V DC supply. Typical applications include CCTV cameras, LED strip lighting systems, industrial sensors, routers, motor controllers, and automation modules.\",\"info\":\"When using a 24V 1A power adapter, it is important to verify that the connected device requires 24V DC input and does not exceed the 1A current limit. Using an adapter with the correct voltage is essential, as higher voltage can damage electronic components.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1321],\"alternative_name\":\"Power Supply Adapter\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"The connector type, DC plug size, and polarity (commonly center-positive) should also be checked before connecting the device. Choosing a reliable adapter with built-in protection features such as overcurrent, short-circuit, and overvoltage protection helps ensure safe operation and improves the lifespan of the connected electronic equipment.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772794847988-440284306.jpeg\"}','2026-03-06 11:00:47'),
(4476,1,'category_group',15,'create',NULL,'{\"name\":\"Mobile Phones\",\"description\":\"Mobile phones are portable electronic communication devices that allow users to make voice calls, send text messages, and access wireless communication networks. Modern mobile phones, commonly known as smartphones, offer advanced features such as internet connectivity, touchscreen interfaces, cameras, multimedia playback, GPS navigation, and the ability to install applications.\",\"info\":\"Mobile phones consist of several key components including a processor, battery, display screen, camera modules, memory, sensors, and wireless communication systems such as 4G or 5G. They run on operating systems like Android or iOS, which manage hardware functions and allow users to use various applications for communication, entertainment, productivity, and social networking.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"categoryGroup/1772795114294-389849287.png\"}','2026-03-06 11:05:14'),
