(4503,1,'product',2121,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CAT6 flat cctv cable\",\"description\":\"Category 6 cable (CAT6) is a widely used standard Ethernet cable type supporting up to ~250 MHz bandwidth; over short to moderate distances it can support high-speed data transfer, often up to 1 Gbps, making it enough for IP-camera video streams, DVR/NVR data transfer, etc.\",\"info\":\"Introducing Indoplast\'s Cat 6 flat cable, designed specifically for CCTV applications in elevators. Engineered with precision and reliability in mind, this cable ensures seamless transmission of high-definition video signals, providing clear and crisp footage for enhanced security monitoring.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"9999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":115,\"secondary_id\":406,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-03-06 16:15:10'),
