(4587,1,'sector_title',35,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"name\":\"Service\",\"description\":\"A System Note is an internal or technical message generated by a system or software to record actions, updates, warnings, or operational details.\",\"info\":\"Service Info refers to brief and important details that give quick knowledge about a product, feature, or system without lengthy explanation.\",\"note\":\"Covers multiple locations or regions\\r\\nProvides warranty and after-sales support\\r\\nEnsures quick service response\\r\\nMaintains product performance and reliability\\r\\nIncludes trained technicians and spare parts availability\",\"system_note\":\"A System Note is an internal or technical message generated by a system or software to record actions, updates, warnings, or operational details.\",\"icon_name\":\"\",\"link\":\"https://circuitpoint.in/service\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image_path\":null}','2026-03-07 07:38:02'),
(4588,1,'product',2822,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"32 inch Normal TV\",\"description\":\"HDMI, USB, AV, ATV, HD RESOLUTION\\r\\n(1366*768) \",\"info\":\"A 32-inch Normal TV (also called a Non-Smart LED TV) is a basic television that does not support internet or apps. It is mainly used for watching cable TV or DTH channels through a set-top box. These TVs are simple, affordable, and suitable for bedrooms, small living rooms, offices, and shops.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[338],\"model\":\"EYE 32W 202GCS\",\"mrp\":\"9899\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772869202150-330915667.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 07:40:02'),
(4589,1,'product',2823,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"24 inch Normal TV\",\"description\":\"HDMI, USB, AV\",\"info\":\"A 24-inch Normal TV is a compact LED television without smart features such as Wi-Fi, streaming apps, or an operating system. It is mainly used for watching cable TV, DTH channels, or connecting external devices like set-top boxes, DVD players, and CCTV systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[338],\"model\":\"EYE 24P 413 GG\",\"mrp\":\"8599\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772869838110-312066475.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 07:50:38'),
(4590,1,'product',2824,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1N5408 Power Diode\",\"description\":\"The 1N5408 is a high-current rectifier power diode commonly used in power supply circuits. It is designed to allow current to flow in one direction while blocking current in the opposite direction. Because of its high current capacity and high reverse voltage rating, it is widely used in AC to DC rectification, power adapters, battery chargers, and power regulation circuits.\",\"info\":\"This diode belongs to the 1N5400 series and is capable of handling high surge currents, making it suitable for heavy-duty electronic and electrical applications. The device is usually available in a DO-201AD axial lead package, which makes it easy to mount on printed circuit boards\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772871770193-69391483.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 08:22:50'),
(4591,1,'product',2825,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1N4007 DIODE \",\"description\":\"The 1N4007 is a general-purpose silicon rectifier diode widely used in electronic circuits for converting AC (alternating current) into DC (direct current). It allows current to flow in only one direction and blocks current in the opposite direction, protecting circuits from reverse voltage damage.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high reverse voltage rating and reliability, the 1N4007 is one of the most commonly used diodes in power supplies, adapters, battery chargers, and electronic equipment. It is usually available in a DO-41 axial lead package, which makes it easy to install on PCBs and breadboards.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772871991323-497427672.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 08:26:31'),
(4592,1,'product',2826,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"1N4148 DIODE\",\"description\":\"The 1N4148 is a high-speed switching diode widely used in electronic circuits. It is designed for fast switching applications, allowing signals to pass quickly with minimal delay. This diode is commonly used in logic circuits, signal processing, and high-frequency applications where quick response time is required.\",\"info\":\"The 1N4148 diode is usually available in a small DO-35 glass package, making it lightweight and suitable for compact electronic designs. Because of its fast switching speed and reliability, it is one of the most commonly used small-signal diodes in electronic devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772872077407-941152641.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 08:27:57'),
(4593,1,'product',2827,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"6A4 DIODE 6 AMPS\",\"description\":\"The 6A4 diode is a high-current rectifier diode designed for power supply and heavy-duty rectification circuits. It allows electric current to flow in one direction and blocks it in the opposite direction, making it useful for converting AC voltage into DC voltage. Because of its 6-ampere current capacity, it is commonly used in power adapters, battery chargers, inverters, and power supply circuits.\",\"info\":\"The diode is usually available in a DO-201 or similar axial package, which is suitable for PCB mounting and high-current applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772872233674-518662491.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 08:30:33'),
(4594,1,'product',2828,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"KBPC3510W Module\",\"description\":\"The KBPC3510W is a high-current bridge rectifier module used to convert AC (alternating current) into DC (direct current) in power supply circuits. It contains four diodes internally connected in a bridge configuration, allowing full-wave rectification from an AC input. Because of its high current capacity, this component is widely used in power supplies, motor controllers, battery chargers, welding machines, and industrial equipment.\",\"info\":\"The KBPC3510W is typically built in a square metal or epoxy package with four terminals, labeled AC (~), AC (~), + (positive), and – (negative). The metal body and center hole allow it to be mounted on a heat sink for better heat dissipation in high-power applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"mrp\":\"299\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772872540228-141533745.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 08:35:40'),
(4595,1,'product',2829,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"W10 BRIDGE MODULE\",\"description\":\"The W10 Bridge Rectifier Module is a compact electronic component used to convert AC (Alternating Current) into DC (Direct Current). Inside the module, four diodes are connected in a bridge configuration, which allows full-wave rectification. This means both halves of the AC input signal are converted into usable DC output.\",\"info\":\"Because of its small size, reliability, and high voltage rating, the W10 bridge rectifier is widely used in power supplies, adapters, battery chargers, LED drivers, and small electronic circuits. It usually comes in a round or square 4-pin package with clearly marked terminals.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772872975529-460159134.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 08:42:55'),
(4596,1,'product',2830,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"JUMPER PINS\",\"description\":\"Jumper pins are small metal connector pins used to make temporary or permanent electrical connections between circuits on a PCB (Printed Circuit Board), breadboard, or electronic modules. They are commonly arranged in single-row or double-row header strips with a standard 2.54 mm pitch spacing.\",\"info\":\"These pins are widely used in electronics prototyping, Arduino projects, Raspberry Pi circuits, and PCB development. Jumper pins allow easy connection of wires, modules, or jumpers without soldering complex connectors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1203],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772873432793-959805016.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 08:50:32'),
(4597,1,'product',2831,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"6 PIN IC BASE\",\"description\":\"A 6-Pin IC Base (also called a 6-Pin IC Socket or DIP-6 Socket) is an electronic component used to hold and connect a 6-pin integrated circuit (IC) to a PCB without soldering the IC directly. The IC is inserted into the socket, which protects it from heat damage during soldering and makes replacement easy.\",\"info\":\"This socket is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs and is commonly used in electronic circuits, microcontroller projects, and prototyping boards. By using an IC base, the IC can be removed, replaced, or upgraded without desoldering.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[654],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772873728714-755786879.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 08:55:28'),
(4598,1,'product',2832,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 4-Channel PoE NVR\",\"description\":\"The DS-7108NI-Q1/8p/M is a compact Mini-1U NVR designed for small surveillance systems such as homes, shops, and offices.\",\"info\":\"The recorder uses advanced H.265+, H.265, H.264+, and H.264 video compression, which reduces storage usage while maintaining high video quality.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[359],\"model\":\"DS-7108NI-Q1/8p/M\",\"alternative_name\":\"NVR 4-Channel PoE\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"With 4 independent PoE ports, cameras can be connected directly to the NVR without using a separate.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772873884138-839453654.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 08:58:04'),
(4599,1,'product',2833,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision NVR 4-Channel\",\"description\":\"The DS-7604NI-Q1 is designed to connect and record video from four network cameras with resolutions up to 8 MP, providing clear and high-quality surveillance footage.\",\"info\":\"The recorder provides 40 Mbps incoming bandwidth and 80 Mbps outgoing bandwidth, ensuring smooth recording and streaming from multiple cameras simultaneously.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[359],\"model\":\"DS-7604NI-Q1\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Regularly check the hard disk and back up important recordings.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772875793646-338377145.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:29:53'),
(4600,1,'product',2834,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 4-Channel PoE NVR\",\"description\":\"The DS-7604NI-Q1 is designed to connect and record video from four network cameras with resolutions up to 8 MP, providing clear and high-quality surveillance footage.\",\"info\":\"Remote monitoring is possible through the Hik-Connect mobile app or PC software, allowing users to watch live camera feeds and playback recordings from anywhere via the internet.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[359],\"model\":\"DS-7608NI-Q1\",\"alternative_name\":\"4-Channel 4K Network Video Recorder\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Ensure proper network cable connections for stable camera communication.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772876184797-177761830.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:36:24'),
(4601,1,'product',2835,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"8 PIN IC BASE\",\"description\":\"An 8-Pin IC Base (also called an 8-Pin IC Socket or DIP-8 Socket) is an electronic component used to hold an 8-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). Instead of soldering the IC directly to the board, the socket is soldered first, and the IC is inserted into it. This protects the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows it to be easily replaced or removed.\",\"info\":\"The 8-pin IC base is commonly used in many electronic circuits and projects, especially for timer ICs, operational amplifiers, and microcontroller circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[654],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772876224024-484803372.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:37:04'),
(4602,1,'product',2836,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"18 PIN IC BASE\",\"description\":\"An 18-Pin IC Base (also called an 18-Pin IC Socket or DIP-18 Socket) is an electronic component used to mount and hold an 18-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). Instead of soldering the IC directly to the board, the socket is soldered to the PCB and the IC is inserted into it. This helps protect the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows easy replacement or testing.\",\"info\":\"The socket is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is widely used in microcontroller circuits, interface ICs, and electronic development boards.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[654],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772876399866-368168481.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:39:59'),
(4603,1,'product',2837,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"16 PIN IC BASE\",\"description\":\"A 16-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-16 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to mount a 16-pin integrated circuit (IC) onto a printed circuit board (PCB) without soldering the IC directly. The socket is soldered to the PCB first, and then the IC is inserted into the socket. This protects the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows it to be easily removed or replaced if needed.\",\"info\":\"The 16-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is commonly used in digital logic circuits, microcontroller boards, driver IC circuits, and electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[654],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772876510076-461411024.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:41:50'),
(4604,1,'product',2838,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"14 PIN IC BASE\",\"description\":\"A 14-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-14 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to hold a 14-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). The socket is soldered to the PCB first, and then the IC is inserted into it. This helps protect the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows the IC to be easily removed or replaced.\",\"info\":\"The 14-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is widely used in digital logic circuits, amplifier circuits, and microcontroller interface circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[654],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772876772809-841558010.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:46:12'),
(4605,1,'product',2839,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision IP-based CCTV surveillance systems\",\"description\":\"This NVR offers 160 Mbps incoming bandwidth and 80 Mbps outgoing bandwidth, allowing stable recording from many cameras at the same time.\",\"info\":\"The DS-7616NI-Q1 supports IP cameras with resolutions up to 8 MP, providing high-quality video recording and monitoring.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[359],\"model\":\"DS-7616NI-Q1\",\"alternative_name\":\"NVR 4-Channel PoE\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Use a UPS or surge protector to protect against voltage fluctuations.\"}','2026-03-07 09:47:48'),
(4606,1,'product',2840,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"20 PIN IC BASE\",\"description\":\"A 20-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-20 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to mount a 20-pin integrated circuit (IC) onto a printed circuit board (PCB). Instead of soldering the IC directly to the PCB, the socket is soldered first and the IC is inserted into it. This helps protect the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows easy replacement or testing.\",\"info\":\"The 20-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is commonly used in microcontroller circuits, interface ICs, and digital electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[654],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772877117693-361541617.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:51:57'),
(4607,1,'product',2841,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 4-Channel 4K PoE Network Video Recorder\",\"description\":\"The DS-7604NI-Q1/4P is a compact 4-channel NVR used to manage and store video from network cameras in homes, offices, shops, and small business security systems.\",\"info\":\"The recorder uses H.265+, H.265, H.264+, and H.264 video compression, which helps reduce storage usage while maintaining good video quality.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[359],\"model\":\"DS-7604NI-Q1/4p\",\"alternative_name\":\" NVR \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"The built-in 4 PoE ports simplify installation by allowing cameras to connect directly to the NVR without separate power adapters or PoE switches.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772877152013-856782733.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:52:32'),
(4608,1,'category',597,'create',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-07 09:54:43'),
(4609,1,'product',2842,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"40 PIN IC BASE\",\"description\":\"A 40-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-40 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to hold and connect a 40-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). Instead of soldering the IC directly onto the board, the socket is soldered first, and the IC is inserted into the socket. This protects the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows easy removal or replacement.\",\"info\":\"The 40-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is commonly used in microcontroller circuits, development boards, embedded systems, and digital electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[654],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772877304269-633858810.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:55:04'),
(4610,1,'product',2843,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision NVR 4-Channel\",\"description\":\"The DS-7604NI-Q1/4P is a compact 4-channel NVR used to manage and store video from network cameras in homes, offices, shops, and small business security systems.\",\"info\":\"This NVR supports 40 Mbps incoming bandwidth and 80 Mbps outgoing bandwidth, ensuring smooth recording and video streaming from multiple cameras simultaneously.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[359],\"model\":\"DS-7608NI-Q1/8p\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Use high-quality Cat5e or Cat6 Ethernet cables for PoE camera connections.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772877386330-274338944.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:56:26'),
(4611,1,'product',2844,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"24 PIN IC BASE\",\"description\":\"A 24-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-24 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to mount and hold a 24-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). The socket is soldered to the PCB first, and the IC is inserted into it. This protects the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows the IC to be easily removed or replaced if necessary.\",\"info\":\"The 24-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is commonly used in microcontroller circuits, memory IC circuits, and digital electronic systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[654],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772877420822-329693107.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:57:00'),
