(4613,1,'product',2845,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"28 PIN IC BASE\",\"description\":\"A 28-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-28 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to hold a 28-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). The socket is soldered to the PCB first, and then the IC is inserted into the socket. This method protects the IC from heat damage during soldering and makes it easy to remove, replace, or test the IC without desoldering.\",\"info\":\"The 28-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is commonly used in microcontroller boards, memory IC circuits, and embedded electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[654],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"base_image\":\"products/1772877543523-633528463.jpg\"}','2026-03-07 09:59:03'),
