(4718,1,'product',2894,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DC POWER MALE SCREW\",\"description\":\"A DC Power Male Screw Connector is an electrical connector used to provide DC power connections without soldering. It usually has a DC male plug (commonly 5.5 mm × 2.1 mm) on one side and two screw terminals on the other side. Wires can be inserted and tightened with screws, making it easy to connect power to electronic devices.\",\"info\":\"This connector is widely used in CCTV cameras, LED strip lights, routers, Arduino projects, and other DC-powered devices. The screw terminals allow quick wiring of positive (+) and negative (−) wires using a screwdriver. Because it does not require soldering, it is very convenient for DIY electronics and quick installations.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[839],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1773037378800-780281831.jpg\"}','2026-03-09 06:22:58'),
(4719,1,'product',2895,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DC POWER FEMALE SCREW\",\"description\":\"A DC Power Female Screw Connector is an electrical adapter used to connect DC power wires to devices using a female DC jack. It usually features a 5.5 mm × 2.1 mm female DC socket on one side and two screw terminals on the other side. The screw terminals allow wires to be connected quickly without soldering.\",\"info\":\"This connector is commonly used in CCTV camera installations, LED strip lighting systems, routers, Arduino projects, and other DC-powered electronics. The screw terminals make it easy to attach positive (+) and negative (−) wires using a small screwdriver. It is especially useful for quick installation, testing, and DIY electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[839],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1773037939693-579250750.jpg\"}','2026-03-09 06:32:19'),
(4720,1,'product',2896,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MALE DC PIN\",\"description\":\"A Male DC Pin (also called a DC Power Plug or DC Male Connector) is a connector used to supply DC power from an adapter or power supply to electronic devices. It usually fits into a female DC socket to complete the power connection. The most common size used in electronics is 5.5 mm outer diameter and 2.1 mm inner diameter.\",\"info\":\"Male DC pins are widely used in CCTV cameras, LED strip lights, routers, modems, Arduino projects, and other DC-powered equipment. These connectors are available in different types such as solder type, screw terminal type, and molded cable type. They provide a stable and secure power connection for low-voltage DC devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[839],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1773038827388-867384405.jpg\"}','2026-03-09 06:47:07'),
(4721,1,'product',2897,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"FEMALE DC SOCKET \",\"description\":\"A Female DC Socket (also called a DC Power Jack) is an electrical connector used to receive power from a DC male plug. It is commonly installed on electronic devices, circuit boards, and panels to allow a DC power adapter to supply electricity to the device.\",\"info\":\"The most common size is 5.5 mm outer diameter and 2.1 mm inner diameter, which matches standard DC power adapters. Female DC sockets are widely used in CCTV cameras, routers, LED lights, Arduino boards, power supply modules, and other electronic equipment. They can be PCB-mounted, panel-mounted, or wired depending on the application.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[839],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1773039025425-84387206.jpg\"}','2026-03-09 06:50:25'),
(4722,1,'product',2898,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"STEREO PIN\",\"description\":\"A Stereo Pin is an audio connector used to transfer stereo sound signals between electronic audio devices. It is commonly known as a 3.5 mm stereo jack plug or AUX pin. The connector is widely used in headphones, speakers, amplifiers, mobile phones, laptops, and audio systems.\",\"info\":\"The stereo pin usually has three metal sections called Tip, Ring, and Sleeve (TRS). These sections carry left audio signal, right audio signal, and ground. Stereo pins are available in different sizes such as 3.5 mm (commonly used in portable devices) and 6.35 mm (used in professional audio equipment). They provide a simple and reliable method for connecting audio devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[839],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1773039752232-209010677.jpg\"}','2026-03-09 07:02:32'),
(4723,1,'product',2899,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2 PIN PUSH BUTTON\",\"description\":\"A 2 Pin Push Button Switch is a simple electrical switch used to temporarily connect or disconnect a circuit when the button is pressed. It usually works as a momentary switch, meaning the circuit is active only while the button is being pressed and returns to its original state when released.\",\"info\":\"This switch has two terminals (pins) that connect or break the circuit when the button is pressed. It is commonly used in electronic circuits, control panels, doorbells, calculators, toys, and DIY electronics projects. Because of its simple design and compact size, it is widely used in PCB-mounted circuits and small devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1425],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1773039871622-907275759.jpg\"}','2026-03-09 07:04:31'),
(4724,1,'product',2900,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4 PIN PUSH BUTTON\",\"description\":\"A 4 Pin Push Button Switch is a small momentary tactile switch commonly used in electronic circuits and PCB boards. When the button is pressed, it temporarily connects the circuit, and when released, it returns to the OFF position automatically.\",\"info\":\"This switch has four terminals, where two pins on each side are internally connected. Pressing the button connects both sides of the circuit. These switches are widely used in microcontroller boards, Arduino projects, remote controls, calculators, control panels, and electronic devices due to their compact size and reliable operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1425],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1773039987297-170140745.jpg\"}','2026-03-09 07:06:27'),
(4725,1,'product',2901,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision DVR\",\"description\":\"The DS-7108HQHI-M1/T is a compact Mini-1U DVR that supports 8 analog camera inputs through BNC connectors and can also connect additional IP cameras in hybrid mode.\",\"info\":\"The recorder uses advanced H.265 Pro+ / H.265 / H.264+ compression technologies, which reduce storage usage while maintaining clear video quality.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[361],\"model\":\"DS-7108HQHI-M1/T\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Install the DVR in a cool and ventilated place to prevent overheating.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1773040545631-883790105.jpg\"}','2026-03-09 07:15:45'),
(4726,1,'product',2902,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 16-Channel DVR\",\"description\":\"The DS-7116HQHI-M1/T is a compact Mini-1U DVR designed for medium-size CCTV systems such as shops, offices, and buildings.\",\"info\":\"The recorder uses advanced H.265 Pro+, H.265, and H.264 compression technologies, which help reduce storage usage and network bandwidth while maintaining clear video quality.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[361],\"model\":\"DS-7116HQHI-M1/T\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Install the DVR in a cool, ventilated place to prevent overheating.\",\"base_image\":\"products/1773045028780-281565941.jpg\"}','2026-03-09 08:30:28'),
(4727,1,'product',2903,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision 32-Channel DVR\",\"description\":\"The DS-7232HQHI-M2/X is designed for medium-to-large CCTV setups like offices, warehouses, schools, and commercial buildings.\",\"info\":\"The DVR supports advanced H.265 Pro+ / H.265 / H.264+ / H.264 video compression, which reduces storage usage while maintaining clear video quality. \",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[361],\"model\":\"DS-7232HQHI-M2/X\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Supports HDTVI / AHD / HDCVI / CVBS / IP cameras\",\"base_image\":\"products/1773045886345-817139147.jpg\"}','2026-03-09 08:44:46'),
