(4737,1,'sub_sector',25,'update',NULL,'{\"sector_title_id\":\"35\",\"sector_id\":\"18\",\"sub_sector_name\":\"Network1\",\"description\":\"Network & Network Accessories focuses on providing connectivity solutions, communication infrastructure, and essential accessories required for building and maintaining reliable computer and mobile networks.\",\"info\":\"They form the backbone of modern networking infrastructure, ensuring smooth and secure communication between multiple devices.\",\"note\":\"Speed measured in Mbps or Gbps\\r\\nLatency affects real-time applications\\r\\nUpload vs Download speeds vary by connection type\\r\\nIP Addressing: Static or Dynamic\\r\\nSecurity: Firewalls, encryption, ISP-level protection\",\"system_note\":\"Networking devices are hardware components used to connect computers, smartphones, and other electronic systems to create communication networks. These devices enable data transfer, internet connectivity, wireless communication, and resource sharing acros\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-03-09 12:24:19'),
