(4751,1,'product',2908,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Led Strip Lights\",\"description\":\"LED Strip Lights are flexible lighting solutions made with small Light Emitting Diodes (LEDs) mounted on a thin, flexible circuit board. These strips can be easily installed in various places such as ceilings, cabinets, showcases, TVs, vehicles, and decorative setups. LED strip lights usually come with adhesive backing, allowing quick installation on different surfaces. They are available in different colors including single color, warm white, cool white, and RGB multicolor options.\",\"info\":\"LED strip lights typically operate on low voltage such as 5V, 12V, or 24V using a power adapter or LED driver. The strips contain multiple LEDs arranged in series and parallel sections that can be cut at marked intervals to adjust the length. They are available in different LED types such as 3528, 5050, and 2835, each providing different brightness levels.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1372],\"alternative_name\":\"Led Strip Lights\",\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"note\":\"When installing LED strip lights, ensure that the correct voltage power supply is used to avoid damage to the LEDs. Proper heat dissipation and ventilation can improve the lifespan of the strip. If the strip is cut, it must be cut only at the marked cutting points to maintain circuit continuity. For longer installations, connectors or soldering may be required to extend the strip length. Always check polarity when connecting the power supply to avoid reverse connection.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773066340073-298737160.jpeg\"}','2026-03-09 14:25:40'),
(4752,1,'product',2909,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"100 WATTS GLUE GUN\",\"description\":\"A 100 Watts Glue Gun is a powerful hot melt adhesive tool used to melt glue sticks and apply hot glue for bonding different materials. It operates using electricity to heat the internal heating element, which melts the glue stick and allows it to flow through the nozzle when the trigger is pressed. This type of glue gun is commonly used for craft work, repair jobs, DIY projects, packaging, and industrial applications.\",\"info\":\"The 100W glue gun heats up quickly and provides a strong and continuous flow of melted adhesive, making it suitable for heavy-duty work. It works with standard glue sticks and can bond materials such as plastic, wood, paper, cardboard, fabric, foam, and some metals. Many models include a trigger feed mechanism and a metal stand for easy and safe use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1285],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773114169941-805862317.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 03:42:49'),
(4753,1,'product',2910,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"20 WATTS MINI GLUE GUN\",\"description\":\"A 20 Watts Mini Glue Gun is a compact electric tool used to melt glue sticks and apply hot adhesive for bonding materials. It is smaller and lighter than heavy-duty glue guns, making it ideal for craft work, school projects, electronics repair, and DIY applications.\",\"info\":\"The glue gun works by heating solid glue sticks (usually 7 mm diameter) until they melt. When the trigger is pressed, the melted glue flows out of the nozzle to join materials together. Most 20W glue guns heat up in about 3–7 minutes and operate on AC 110–230 V power\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1285],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773114373246-785686409.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 03:46:13'),
(4754,1,'product',2911,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"60 WATTS GLUE GUN\",\"description\":\"A 60 Watts Glue Gun is a medium-power hot melt adhesive tool used to melt glue sticks and apply hot glue for bonding different materials. It is commonly used for craft work, electronics repair, packaging, woodworking, and DIY projects. The glue stick melts inside the heating chamber, and the melted adhesive flows through the nozzle when the trigger is pressed.\",\"info\":\"A typical 60W glue gun operates on 110–220V AC power and usually uses 11 mm diameter glue sticks. It heats up quickly (about 2–5 minutes) and can reach a melting temperature around 190 °C, allowing strong bonding of materials like plastic, wood, fabric, and cardboard\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1285],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773114488584-584918854.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 03:48:08'),
(4755,1,'product',2912,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"NIPPER (MULTI TEC)\",\"description\":\"A MULTITEC Nipper is a precision cutting tool used to cut small wires, component leads, and soft metal conductors in electronics and electrical work. It is designed with sharp cutting edges and comfortable insulated handles, allowing accurate cutting without damaging nearby components.\",\"info\":\"Multitec nippers are commonly used in electronics assembly, PCB repair, telecommunications, and DIY projects. The tool is usually made from high-grade alloy steel or stainless steel with heat-treated cutting edges to ensure durability and long life. It can typically cut copper or aluminum wires around 0.8 mm–1.2 mm diameter, making it suitable for trimming component leads on circuit boards.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1159],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773114609920-851328234.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 03:50:09'),
(4756,1,'product',2913,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"K71 VOLTAGE DETECTOR\",\"description\":\"The K71 Voltage Detector is a compact electronic testing device used to detect the presence of voltage in electrical wires, sockets, and circuits. It is commonly used by electricians, technicians, and maintenance workers to check whether a line is live before working on electrical equipment.\",\"info\":\"The K71 tester usually works as a multi-function voltage detector that can identify live electrical lines safely. It is built with a plastic (ABS) body and may use small button batteries for operation. The tester is lightweight and portable, making it suitable for industrial, electrical maintenance, and household electrical testing\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1159],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773114722443-655956491.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 03:52:02'),
(4757,1,'product',2914,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CONTINUITY TESTER\",\"description\":\"A Continuity Tester is an electronic testing device used to check whether an electrical circuit is complete or broken. It helps determine if current can flow through a wire, component, or connection. When the circuit is continuous, the tester usually lights an LED or produces a buzzer sound.\",\"info\":\"Continuity testers are commonly used in electronics repair, electrical wiring inspection, and circuit troubleshooting. The device typically consists of a small battery, test probes, and an indicator (LED or buzzer). When the probes touch two points of a closed circuit, the tester indicates continuity. It is widely used for checking wires, fuses, switches, PCB tracks, and cable connections.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1159],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773114803274-435546190.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 03:53:23'),
(4758,1,'product',2915,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"555 DC MOTOR Collet Micro\",\"description\":\"A 555 DC Motor Collet Micro is a small metal collet or chuck adapter designed to attach drill bits or small tools to a 555 DC motor shaft. It converts a standard RS-555 DC motor into a micro drill or mini rotary tool, allowing it to hold small drill bits, grinding bits, or polishing tools.\",\"info\":\"The collet is usually made from brass or aluminum and fits tightly onto the motor shaft (commonly 3.17 mm). It includes a tightening nut that secures drill bits of different sizes. This accessory is widely used in DIY electronics, PCB drilling, robotics projects, mini CNC machines, and hobby tools where precise drilling or rotating tools are needed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1159],\"mrp\":\"699\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773114912637-575145983.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 03:55:12'),
(4759,1,'product',2916,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HAND DRILL TOOL\",\"description\":\"A Hand Drill Tool is a small manual tool used to drill tiny holes in materials like PCB boards, plastic, wood, and soft metal. It works without electricity and is operated by rotating the handle manually, which gives better control for precise drilling work.\",\"info\":\"This tool usually comes with a collet or chuck that can hold different sizes of micro drill bits. Because it is hand-operated, it is commonly used for electronics PCB drilling, craft work, model making, jewelry work, and DIY hobby projects. Hand drill tools are lightweight, portable, and easy to use for small precision tasks.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1159],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773115246030-25243338.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 04:00:46'),
