(4765,1,'product',2918,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"JACKLY 31 IN 1 SCREW DRIVER\",\"description\":\"The Jackly 31-in-1 Screwdriver Set is a precision tool kit designed for repairing electronic devices such as mobile phones, laptops, cameras, watches, and small appliances. It includes a screwdriver handle and multiple interchangeable bits that allow the user to open many different types of screws. The kit is compact and usually comes in a plastic storage case for easy carrying and organization.\",\"info\":\"The Jackly 31-in-1 Screwdriver Set is a precision tool kit designed for repairing electronic devices such as mobile phones, laptops, cameras, watches, and small appliances. It includes a screwdriver handle and multiple interchangeable bits that allow the user to open many different types of screws. The kit is compact and usually comes in a plastic storage case for easy carrying and organization.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1159],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773115981461-779503234.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 04:13:01'),
(4766,1,'product',2919,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ASSORTED DRILL BIT\",\"description\":\"An Assorted Drill Bit Set is a collection of drill bits of different sizes and types used for drilling holes in materials such as wood, plastic, metal, and PCB boards. The set contains multiple drill bits organized in one box so users can easily choose the correct size for different drilling tasks.\",\"info\":\"Assorted drill bit sets are commonly made from high-speed steel (HSS) or carbide materials for durability and precision. Many small sets contain micro drill bits ranging from about 0.3 mm to 3 mm, which are ideal for electronics work, PCB drilling, jewelry making, and hobby projects\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1159],\"mrp\":\"699\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773116233855-178196836.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 04:17:13'),
(4767,1,'product',2920,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MAXICOM M325\",\"description\":\"The MAXICOM M325 is a 32-in-1 precision screwdriver tool kit designed for repairing and assembling small electronic devices. It includes a screwdriver handle and multiple interchangeable bits that allow users to work with many types of screws. This kit is commonly used for mobile phone repair, laptop servicing, camera repair, and other electronics maintenance tasks.\",\"info\":\"The MAXICOM M325 set usually contains 32 pieces, including a handle and several precision bits made from steel for durability. Different bit types such as Phillips, Flat, Torx, Hex, and special bits are included so the user can open many kinds of electronic devices. These kits are compact and normally come in a plastic storage box to keep the bits organized.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1159],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773116516380-847014473.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 04:21:56'),
(4768,1,'product',2921,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"V8 DATA CABLE\",\"description\":\"A V8 Data Cable is a USB cable used to charge mobile phones and transfer data between devices. It has a USB Type-A connector on one side and a Micro-USB (V8) connector on the other side. This type of cable was widely used in many Android smartphones, tablets, power banks, and electronic modules before USB-C became common.\",\"info\":\"The name “V8 cable” is a popular market name for the Micro-USB cable. It features a small trapezoid-shaped connector that plugs into Micro-USB ports. The cable can be used for charging devices and transferring files between a phone and a computer\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1170],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773116883629-927075075.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 04:28:03'),
