(4771,1,'product',2922,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"UNEplus 4 LENS AIV Solar Camera\",\"description\":\"The UNEPLUS 4-Lens AOV Solar Camera is designed for remote outdoor security monitoring such as farms, construction sites, warehouses, and parking areas. It works using solar panels and a built-in rechargeable battery, allowing the camera to operate continuously even without a power connection.\",\"info\":\"The camera typically connects through 4G LTE mobile networks, so users can view live video and recordings from anywhere using a mobile application such as HiEasy.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1433],\"alternative_name\":\"Solar CCTV Camera \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Install the solar panel facing direct sunlight for proper charging.Mount the camera 2–4 meters above ground for wider coverage.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773118520553-813990110.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 04:55:20'),
(4772,1,'product',2923,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DC PIN MALE\",\"description\":\"A DC Pin Male is a power connector plug used to supply DC electricity from a power adapter or battery to electronic devices. It connects to a DC female socket to create a secure electrical connection. These connectors are commonly used in CCTV systems, LED lights, routers, modems, and electronic projects.\",\"info\":\"The most common DC male plug size is 5.5 mm outer diameter and 2.1 mm inner diameter. It usually has two terminals inside for positive (+) and negative (−) connections. DC male pins are available in solder type, screw terminal type, and molded cable type, making them easy to use for different applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1434],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773118549171-858956317.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 04:55:49'),
(4773,1,'product',2924,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DC PIN FEMALE\",\"description\":\"A DC Pin Female is a DC power socket connector used to receive power from a DC male plug. It is commonly installed in electronic devices so that a power adapter can be connected easily. This connector helps provide a stable and secure DC power connection for many electronic systems.\",\"info\":\"A DC Pin Female is a DC power socket connector used to receive power from a DC male plug. It is commonly installed in electronic devices so that a power adapter can be connected easily. This connector helps provide a stable and secure DC power connection for many electronic systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1434],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773118635176-892726327.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 04:57:15'),
(4774,1,'product',2925,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5 PIN RMC\",\"description\":\"A 5 Pin RMC Connector is a circular multi-pin electrical connector commonly used for audio, communication, and electronic equipment connections. It contains five metal pins inside a round metal housing, allowing multiple signals or power lines to pass through a single connector.\",\"info\":\"This connector is often used in microphones, audio amplifiers, communication devices, and control systems. The pins allow transmission of audio signals, control signals, or low-voltage power. The circular metal body provides a secure and durable connection, and many models include a locking mechanism to prevent accidental disconnection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1434],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773118790510-796920082.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 04:59:50'),
(4775,1,'product',2926,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"6 PIN RMC\",\"description\":\"A 6 Pin RMC Connector is a round multi-pin electrical connector used to connect audio or control signals between electronic devices. It has six metal pins inside a circular metal body, allowing multiple wires to be connected through a single plug.\",\"info\":\"These connectors are commonly used in microphones, audio amplifiers, communication equipment, and electronic control systems. The pins are connected by soldering wires to the terminals, and the round metal housing provides a secure and durable connection. Some models also include a locking mechanism to keep the connector firmly attached.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1434],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773118907667-386615844.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 05:01:47'),
(4776,1,'product',2927,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"8 PIN RMC\",\"description\":\"An 8 Pin RMC Connector is a circular multi-pin electrical connector used to connect multiple signal or power lines between electronic devices. It contains eight metal pins arranged inside a round metal housing, allowing several connections through a single plug.\",\"info\":\"This connector is commonly used in audio systems, microphones, communication equipment, industrial electronics, and control devices. The wires are typically soldered to the internal terminals, and the metal body provides mechanical strength and reliable connection. The design helps keep multiple wires organized in a compact connector.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1434],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773119369067-107462308.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 05:09:29'),
(4777,1,'product',2928,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4 PIN RMC\",\"description\":\"A 4 Pin RMC Connector is a round multi-pin electrical connector used to connect signals or power between electronic devices. It has four metal pins arranged inside a circular metal body, allowing multiple wires to be connected through a single plug.\",\"info\":\"This connector is commonly used in microphones, audio amplifiers, communication equipment, intercom systems, and electronic control devices. The wires are usually soldered to the internal pins, and the metal housing provides strong and reliable connections. The circular design also helps keep the connector firmly attached to the socket.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1434],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773119463979-222513687.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 05:11:03'),
(4778,1,'product',2929,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3 PIN RMC\",\"description\":\"A 3 Pin RMC Connector is a round multi-pin electrical connector used to connect audio signals or power between electronic devices. It contains three metal pins arranged inside a circular metal body, allowing multiple wires to be connected through a single plug.\",\"info\":\"These connectors are commonly used in microphones, audio amplifiers, communication equipment, intercom systems, and electronic control devices. The wires are usually soldered to the internal pins, and the strong metal housing provides durability and secure connection. The circular design helps maintain a stable plug-and-socket connection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1434],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773119570601-314953898.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 05:12:50'),
(4779,1,'product',2930,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10 PIN RMC\",\"description\":\"A 10 Pin RMC Connector is a circular multi-pin electrical connector used to connect multiple signal or power lines between electronic devices. It has ten metal pins arranged inside a round metal housing, allowing several wires to be connected through a single plug.\",\"info\":\"This connector is commonly used in audio equipment, communication systems, industrial electronics, control panels, and specialized electronic devices. The wires are connected to the pins by soldering, and the metal outer body provides strong mechanical support and reliable electrical contact. These connectors help organize many connections in a compact and secure interface.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1434],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773119672259-392440025.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 05:14:32'),
(4780,1,'product',2931,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"12 PIN RMC\",\"description\":\"A 12 Pin RMC Connector is a circular multi-pin electrical connector used to connect multiple signal or power lines between electronic devices. It contains twelve metal pins inside a round metal housing, allowing many wires to pass through a single compact connector.\",\"info\":\"This connector is commonly used in audio equipment, communication systems, industrial electronics, control panels, and specialized electronic devices. The wires are typically soldered to the internal terminals, and the strong metal body ensures durability and reliable electrical contact. RMC connectors help keep multiple connections organized and secure.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1434],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773119839852-153307984.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 05:17:19'),
(4781,1,'brand',296,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"THINKWILL \",\"description\":\"THINKWILL produces different types of smart surveillance devices and networking equipment for security applications.\",\"info\":\"Many THINKWILL cameras support Wi-Fi or 4G SIM connectivity, allowing users to watch live video and recordings remotely through a mobile application.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1773122000171-696928350.png\"}','2026-03-10 05:53:20'),
