(4788,1,'product',2606,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\" 55 inch Smart Android Tv\",\"description\":\"The Eyepluse 55 LED Smart Android TV is a large-screen 4K UHD 3840 × 2160 television running on Android Smart TV platform — designed for immersive home entertainment with a frameless IPS panel and smart features. It brings vibrant visuals, smart connectivity, and multiple ports for connecting external devices.\",\"info\":\"55-inch 4K UHD LED display3840 × 2160 with HDR support for sharp, detailed image quality.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"46999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":223,\"secondary_id\":393,\"brand_id\":9}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-10 09:41:55'),
(4789,1,'product',2606,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\" 55 inch Smart Android Tv\",\"description\":\"The Eyepluse 55 LED Smart Android TV is a large-screen 4K UHD 3840 × 2160 television running on Android Smart TV platform — designed for immersive home entertainment with a frameless IPS panel and smart features. It brings vibrant visuals, smart connectivity, and multiple ports for connecting external devices.\",\"info\":\"55-inch 4K UHD LED display3840 × 2160 with HDR support for sharp, detailed image quality.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"46999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":223,\"secondary_id\":393,\"brand_id\":9}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-10 09:43:46'),
(4790,1,'product',2254,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"0.047nF (47)\",\"description\":\"A 0.047 nF ceramic capacitor is equivalent to 47 pF and is identified by the marking 47 on the capacitor body. It is a small-value, non-polarized capacitor that uses a ceramic dielectric, designed mainly for high-frequency applications.\",\"info\":\"Because of its very low capacitance, this value is commonly used in RF circuits, oscillators, tuning networks, and signal shaping applications. Ceramic capacitors of this value offer low loss, good stability, and fast response at high frequencies. They are most often found in ceramic disc (through-hole) form, though SMD versions are also available.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"A 0.047 nF (47) capacitor is a very small-value capacitor commonly used in high-frequency electronic circuits. The marking “47” follows the standard capacitor code system where two digits indicate the value directly in picofarads (pF). Therefore, “47” means 47 pF, which is equal to 0.047 nF (since 1000 pF = 1 nF). This type of capacitor is typically non-polarized, so it can be connected in any direction in a circuit.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":416,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-10 09:43:53'),
(4791,1,'product',2934,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MAXELON Ear Buds \",\"description\":\"Maxelon earbuds are compact in-ear wireless earphones that come with a portable charging case.\",\"info\":\"They use modern Bluetooth technology to provide stable wireless connectivity and allow users to enjoy clear audio and deep bass while moving freely without cables.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1445],\"alternative_name\":\"Ear Buds \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Avoid exposure to water unless the model supports water resistance.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773135996255-551739992.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 09:46:36'),
(4792,1,'product',2935,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"SOLAR SINGLE LIGHT\",\"description\":\"A Solar Single Light is a small lighting system that works using solar energy. It usually consists of a solar panel, rechargeable battery, LED light, and control circuit. The solar panel converts sunlight into electrical energy during the day, and the stored energy in the battery powers the LED light at night.\",\"info\":\"Solar single lights are commonly used for home lighting, garden lights, street lights, and school science projects. They are energy-efficient and environmentally friendly because they use renewable solar power instead of electricity from the grid. These systems are easy to install and require very little maintenance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773136688968-455430434.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 09:58:08'),
(4793,1,'product',2936,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"WATER ALARM WITH VOICE\",\"description\":\"A Water Alarm with Voice is an electronic device used to detect water level or leakage and provide a voice alert when water reaches a certain level. It helps prevent water tank overflow or water leakage by notifying the user through a recorded voice message or sound alert.\",\"info\":\"This system typically includes water level sensors, a control circuit, and a small speaker or voice module. When the water touches the sensor probes, the circuit activates and plays a voice message such as “Water Tank Full” or a warning sound. These devices are commonly used in overhead water tanks, sump tanks, bathrooms, and industrial water monitoring systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773136798174-391154454.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 09:59:58'),
(4794,1,'product',2937,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"JD188 DOOR ALARM SYSTEM\",\"description\":\"The JD188 Door Alarm System is a compact magnetic security alarm designed to protect doors and windows. When the door or window is opened, the magnetic contact between the sensor parts is broken, which triggers a loud siren alarm to alert people and scare away intruders\",\"info\":\"This alarm system consists of two main parts: the alarm unit and a magnetic sensor strip. Both parts are placed close to each other on the door or window frame. When the door or window is opened and the magnet separates from the main unit, the device activates a loud alarm (around 90 dB) until the parts are reconnected or the switch is turned off\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773136906215-744112247.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 10:01:46'),
(4795,1,'product',2938,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MOBILE CHARGING HOLDER\",\"description\":\"A Mobile Charging Holder is a small stand or wall-mounted holder designed to hold a smartphone safely while it is charging. It is usually attached near a wall socket, allowing the phone to rest on the holder while the charging cable is connected.\",\"info\":\"Most charging holders are made from plastic, ABS material, or metal and are designed to fit all common smartphones. They are widely used in homes, offices, hostels, and shops to keep phones safe while charging and prevent them from hanging by the cable. Many models include hooks or slots for the charging adapter and cable to keep the setup organized\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773137200124-570145317.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 10:06:40'),
(4796,1,'product',2939,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB LIGHT\",\"description\":\"A USB Light is a small LED lamp powered through a USB port. It can be connected to devices such as laptops, power banks, USB chargers, computers, or car USB ports to provide instant lighting. These lights are compact and portable, making them useful for reading, emergency lighting, travel, and computer keyboard lighting\",\"info\":\"USB lights normally operate at 5V power supplied by a USB port. Many models have a flexible neck or compact plug-in design, allowing the user to adjust the direction of light easily. Because USB ports are widely available, these lights can be used almost anywhere with a USB power source\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773137556301-914272727.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 10:12:36'),
(4797,1,'product',2940,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB FAN\",\"description\":\"A USB Fan is a small portable fan powered through a USB port. It can be connected to devices such as laptops, computers, power banks, USB chargers, or mobile phones to produce cooling airflow. Because it uses low-voltage USB power, it is convenient for desk use, travel, and personal cooling.\",\"info\":\"USB fans normally operate using 5-volt DC power supplied by the USB port. When electricity flows through the small motor inside the fan, the blades rotate and move air to create a cooling effect.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773137722102-177718456.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 10:15:22'),
(4798,1,'product',2941,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BIKE MOBILE CHARGER\",\"description\":\"A Bike Mobile Charger is a device that allows you to charge a mobile phone directly from a motorcycle or scooter battery. It connects to the vehicle’s 12 V battery system and converts the voltage to 5 V USB output suitable for charging smartphones and other USB devices\",\"info\":\"Most bike chargers are designed with USB ports, allowing you to plug in your phone’s charging cable. They usually have features such as waterproof protection, short-circuit protection, and an on/off switch for safe operation on the road. These chargers are commonly mounted on the handlebar or near the dashboard of the bike\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773137971249-159304826.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 10:19:31'),
(4799,1,'product',2942,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OTG C -TYPE\",\"description\":\"An OTG C-Type (USB-C OTG adapter) is a small connector that allows a USB-C mobile phone or tablet to connect directly to USB devices such as pen drives, keyboards, mice, card readers, or game controllers. It converts the Type-C charging port into a standard USB-A port so external devices can be used with the phone\",\"info\":\"OTG stands for “On-The-Go.” It is a USB technology that allows devices like smartphones or tablets to act as a USB host, meaning they can control other USB devices without needing a computer.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773138394083-970224461.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 10:26:34'),
(4800,1,'product',2943,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OTG B -TYPE\",\"description\":\"An OTG B-Type usually refers to a Micro-USB OTG adapter (often called V8 OTG). It allows a smartphone or tablet with a Micro-USB port to connect directly to USB devices such as pen drives, keyboards, mice, card readers, and cameras\",\"info\":\"OTG stands for “On-The-Go”, a USB technology that lets a mobile device act as a USB host, meaning it can control other USB devices without needing a computer.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773138559946-5736876.jpg\"}','2026-03-10 10:29:19'),
(4801,1,'category_group',16,'create',NULL,'{\"name\":\"Electronics\",\"description\":\"Electronics is a branch of technology and engineering that deals with the study, design, and application of electronic circuits and devices that control the flow of electrons to perform various functions. It involves components such as resistors, capacitors, diodes, transistors, integrated circuits, and microcontrollers which are used to build electronic systems. Electronics is widely used in everyday devices like mobile phones, televisions, computers, home appliances, communication equipment, and industrial machines. The field plays an important role in modern technology by enabling automation, communication, entertainment, and smart systems.\",\"info\":\"Electronic systems operate using electrical energy and electronic components to process signals, store data, and control devices. Electronics can be classified into several categories such as consumer electronics, industrial electronics, communication electronics, power electronics, and embedded systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"categoryGroup/1773140687160-973957175.jpeg\"}','2026-03-10 11:04:47'),
