(4804,1,'product',2935,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"SOLAR SINGLE LIGHT\",\"description\":\"A Solar Single Light is a small lighting system that works using solar energy. It usually consists of a solar panel, rechargeable battery, LED light, and control circuit. The solar panel converts sunlight into electrical energy during the day, and the stored energy in the battery powers the LED light at night.\",\"info\":\"Solar single lights are commonly used for home lighting, garden lights, street lights, and school science projects. They are energy-efficient and environmentally friendly because they use renewable solar power instead of electricity from the grid. These systems are easy to install and require very little maintenance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":442,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-10 11:39:09'),
(4805,1,'product',2936,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"WATER ALARM WITH VOICE\",\"description\":\"A Water Alarm with Voice is an electronic device used to detect water level or leakage and provide a voice alert when water reaches a certain level. It helps prevent water tank overflow or water leakage by notifying the user through a recorded voice message or sound alert.\",\"info\":\"This system typically includes water level sensors, a control circuit, and a small speaker or voice module. When the water touches the sensor probes, the circuit activates and plays a voice message such as “Water Tank Full” or a warning sound. These devices are commonly used in overhead water tanks, sump tanks, bathrooms, and industrial water monitoring systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"77\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-10 11:40:07'),
(4806,1,'product',2937,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"JD188 DOOR ALARM SYSTEM\",\"description\":\"The JD188 Door Alarm System is a compact magnetic security alarm designed to protect doors and windows. When the door or window is opened, the magnetic contact between the sensor parts is broken, which triggers a loud siren alarm to alert people and scare away intruders\",\"info\":\"This alarm system consists of two main parts: the alarm unit and a magnetic sensor strip. Both parts are placed close to each other on the door or window frame. When the door or window is opened and the magnet separates from the main unit, the device activates a loud alarm (around 90 dB) until the parts are reconnected or the switch is turned off\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":\"24\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-10 11:43:53'),
