(4809,1,'product',2938,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MOBILE CHARGING HOLDER\",\"description\":\"A Mobile Charging Holder is a small stand or wall-mounted holder designed to hold a smartphone safely while it is charging. It is usually attached near a wall socket, allowing the phone to rest on the holder while the charging cable is connected.\",\"info\":\"Most charging holders are made from plastic, ABS material, or metal and are designed to fit all common smartphones. They are widely used in homes, offices, hostels, and shops to keep phones safe while charging and prevent them from hanging by the cable. Many models include hooks or slots for the charging adapter and cable to keep the setup organized\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":212,\"secondary_id\":\"627\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-10 11:52:48'),
(4810,1,'product',2939,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB LIGHT\",\"description\":\"A USB Light is a small LED lamp powered through a USB port. It can be connected to devices such as laptops, power banks, USB chargers, computers, or car USB ports to provide instant lighting. These lights are compact and portable, making them useful for reading, emergency lighting, travel, and computer keyboard lighting\",\"info\":\"USB lights normally operate at 5V power supplied by a USB port. Many models have a flexible neck or compact plug-in design, allowing the user to adjust the direction of light easily. Because USB ports are widely available, these lights can be used almost anywhere with a USB power source\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":614,\"secondary_id\":\"616\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-10 11:58:53'),
(4811,1,'product',2940,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB FAN\",\"description\":\"A USB Fan is a small portable fan powered through a USB port. It can be connected to devices such as laptops, computers, power banks, USB chargers, or mobile phones to produce cooling airflow. Because it uses low-voltage USB power, it is convenient for desk use, travel, and personal cooling.\",\"info\":\"USB fans normally operate using 5-volt DC power supplied by the USB port. When electricity flows through the small motor inside the fan, the blades rotate and move air to create a cooling effect.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":219,\"secondary_id\":\"373\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-10 12:01:45'),
(4812,1,'product',2941,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BIKE MOBILE CHARGER\",\"description\":\"A Bike Mobile Charger is a device that allows you to charge a mobile phone directly from a motorcycle or scooter battery. It connects to the vehicle’s 12 V battery system and converts the voltage to 5 V USB output suitable for charging smartphones and other USB devices\",\"info\":\"Most bike chargers are designed with USB ports, allowing you to plug in your phone’s charging cable. They usually have features such as waterproof protection, short-circuit protection, and an on/off switch for safe operation on the road. These chargers are commonly mounted on the handlebar or near the dashboard of the bike\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":212,\"secondary_id\":\"609\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-10 12:06:19'),
