(4828,1,'product',2946,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"One plus C-type Mobile Charger\",\"description\":\"OnePlus C-Type Charger is a fast-charging power adapter designed to efficiently charge smartphones, tablets, and other compatible electronic devices that support USB Type-C connectivity. It is built with advanced charging technology to deliver stable power output while maintaining device safety. The charger typically features a compact and lightweight design, making it convenient for everyday use at home, office, or while traveling.\",\"info\":\"OnePlus C-Type Charger usually supports fast charging standards such as Warp Charge or other quick-charge technologies depending on the model. It operates with a standard AC input and converts it into a stable DC output suitable for USB-C powered devices. The charger is compatible with most smartphones, Bluetooth accessories, power banks, and other gadgets that support Type-C charging.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[156],\"alternative_name\":\"Mobile Charger\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"Use the charger with a good quality USB Type-C cable for best performance and fast charging capability. Always connect it to a stable power source to avoid voltage fluctuations. Avoid exposing the charger to water, excessive heat, or physical damage. For safety and optimal performance, it is recommended to use the charger with compatible devices and certified cables.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773234231433-527578692.jpeg\"}','2026-03-11 13:03:51'),
