(4831,1,'product',2947,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Vivo C type Mobile Charger\",\"description\":\"The Vivo C-Type Mobile Charger is a fast-charging power adapter designed to charge Vivo smartphones and other USB Type-C compatible devices quickly and safely. It typically comes with a USB to Type-C cable and a compact travel-friendly adapter that converts AC power into stable DC power for mobile charging. The charger is built with durable materials and advanced charging technology to provide efficient and reliable performance.\",\"info\":\"Vivo C-Type chargers are available in different power capacities such as 18W, 33W, 44W, 66W, and even higher depending on the phone model. These chargers support Vivo’s FlashCharge or Dual-Engine Fast Charging technology to reduce charging time while maintaining battery safety. Most models operate with an input of about 100-240V AC and provide multiple output levels such as 5V/2A, 9V/2A, or higher depending on the charger type. They are compatible with Vivo smartphones, tablets, Bluetooth accessories, and other USB-C powered devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1463],\"alternative_name\":\"Mobile Charger\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"For best charging performance, use the original Vivo Type-C cable along with the charger. Avoid using damaged cables or low-quality adapters, as they may slow down charging or damage the device. Keep the charger away from moisture, extreme heat, or physical damage.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773235528102-947042922.jpeg\"}','2026-03-11 13:25:28'),
(4832,1,'product',2948,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Vivo V8 Mobile Charger\",\"description\":\"The Vivo V8 Mobile Charger is a standard wall charger designed to charge smartphones and other electronic devices that use a Micro-USB (V8) charging port. It usually comes with a USB wall adapter and a V8 data cable, allowing users to charge their mobile phones quickly and reliably. The charger is compact, lightweight, and easy to carry, making it suitable for daily use at home, office, or during travel. It is commonly used with older Android smartphones and many electronic gadgets that support Micro-USB charging.\",\"info\":\"The Vivo V8 charger generally operates with an input voltage of 100–240V AC and converts it into a 5V DC output with about 2A current, which provides stable and efficient charging for compatible devices. The V8 cable typically has a USB Type-A connector on one side and a Micro-USB connector on the other, allowing it to connect to the charger or computer USB ports. It usually includes a cable length of around 1 meter and supports charging as well as data transfer.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[156],\"alternative_name\":\"Mobile Charger\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"Always use a good quality V8 cable and charger to maintain proper charging speed and device safety. Avoid bending the cable excessively or using damaged connectors. Keep the charger away from moisture, dust, and high temperatures. Disconnect the charger from the power outlet when not in use to extend its lifespan.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773235905982-514396030.jpeg\"}','2026-03-11 13:31:45'),
(4833,1,'product',2949,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BNC Male Connector\",\"description\":\"BNC Male Connector is a type of coaxial RF connector commonly used for connecting coaxial cables in electronic and communication systems. It features a bayonet locking mechanism that allows quick and secure connection to a matching BNC female connector. The connector is widely used in video transmission systems, CCTV cameras, oscilloscopes, radio frequency equipment, and networking devices. Its durable metal construction and secure locking design ensure stable signal transmission with minimal signal loss.\",\"info\":\"BNC stands for Bayonet Neill–Concelman, the name derived from its inventors. The BNC male connector is designed to terminate coaxial cables such as RG59 or RG6 and provides reliable connectivity for both analog and digital signals. It supports frequencies up to several GHz depending on the cable and connector quality. The bayonet coupling mechanism requires a simple push and twist motion to lock the connector securely into place, making installation quick and convenient.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[929],\"alternative_name\":\"BNC Connector\",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"note\":\"BNC Male Connector is an RF interface component used in coaxial cable systems for transmitting radio frequency signals, video signals, and test signals. It is widely used in CCTV surveillance systems, broadcast equipment, laboratory instruments, and telecommunications devices. The connector provides a stable impedance connection (usually 50Ω or 75Ω) to ensure efficient signal transfer and reduced interference.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773239024263-658808246.jpeg\"}','2026-03-11 14:23:44'),
