(4839,1,'brand',152,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"U&I\",\"description\":\"U&i focuses on delivering value-for-money electronics that cater to everyday users, students, and budget-conscious consumers. The brand combines modern design, essential features, and competitive pricing, making its products widely popular in the Indian market.\",\"info\":\"U&i focuses on delivering value-for-money electronics that cater to everyday users, students, and budget-conscious consumers. The brand combines modern design, essential features, and competitive pricing, making its products widely popular in the Indian market.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-03-11 14:37:52'),
(4840,1,'product',2950,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"U&I Smart Watch with Charger\",\"description\":\"U&i Smart Watch with Charger is a modern wearable device designed to help users monitor fitness, receive smartphone notifications, and manage daily activities conveniently from their wrist. It features a stylish design with a touch display and comfortable strap suitable for everyday use. The smartwatch usually comes with a dedicated magnetic or wireless charger that allows easy and safe charging. It combines technology and convenience, making it useful for both fitness tracking and smart connectivity.\",\"info\":\"Most U&i smartwatches include features such as heart-rate monitoring, step counting, sleep tracking, calorie tracking, and multiple sports modes for fitness monitoring. Many models support Bluetooth connectivity for notifications, call alerts, and music control when connected to Android or iOS smartphones. Some models feature a large display around 1.8–2.2 inches, IP68 water resistance, and wireless magnetic charging docks for convenient charging.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1492],\"alternative_name\":\"Smart Watch Charger\",\"mrp\":\"5999\",\"note\":\"Charge the smartwatch using the original magnetic charger or charging dock provided with the device. Avoid using incompatible chargers or cables. Keep the charging pins clean and dry for proper charging. Do not expose the watch to extreme heat, water (if not fully waterproof), or strong impacts to maintain long-term performance.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773240048730-862871429.jpeg\"}','2026-03-11 14:40:48'),
