(4843,1,'product',2951,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4 inch K Sonic Speaker\",\"description\":\"K-Sonic 4-inch speaker is a compact loudspeaker driver designed for small audio systems such as portable speaker boxes, home audio setups, and DIY amplifier projects. It produces clear mid-range sound and moderate bass despite its small size. The speaker typically uses a lightweight cone, strong magnet, and durable frame to deliver stable sound output. Because of its compact design, it is commonly installed in small cabinets, multimedia speakers, and mini sound systems.\",\"info\":\"A typical 4-inch speaker has a 100 mm woofer size and is designed to handle a wide range of audio frequencies for balanced sound. Many small speakers of this size use an impedance around 4 ohms and provide good sound sensitivity for use with amplifiers or audio boards. Frequency response in similar speakers can range roughly from 70 Hz to 23 kHz, allowing them to reproduce both low and high sound frequencies clearly.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1496],\"alternative_name\":\"Speaker\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"4-inch K-Sonic speaker is an electro-acoustic component that converts electrical audio signals from an amplifier into sound waves. It operates based on a voice coil and magnet system that vibrates the speaker cone to produce sound. The speaker usually works with audio amplifiers designed for 4 Ω or 8 Ω impedance loads, which helps maintain proper power transfer and safe operation in audio systems.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773240449460-331864267.jpeg\"}','2026-03-11 14:47:29'),
(4844,1,'product',2952,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"8 inch K Sonic Speaker\",\"description\":\"K-Sonic 8-inch speaker is a larger loudspeaker driver designed to deliver stronger bass and higher sound output compared to smaller speakers. It is commonly used in home audio systems, Bluetooth speaker boxes, PA systems, DJ sound setups, and DIY amplifier projects. The speaker typically features a durable cone, foam or rubber surround, and a powerful magnet that helps produce deep bass and clear mid-range audio. Because of its larger size, it is ideal for medium-sized speaker cabinets and sound systems.\",\"info\":\"A typical K-Sonic 8-inch woofer (such as model KS-840) can handle around 80 watts of power and is designed with a foam cone and strong magnet system to produce balanced sound performance. The magnet size is usually around 90 × 17 mm, which helps generate stronger magnetic force for better sound output. These speakers are commonly used in speaker boxes, home theater systems, stage speakers, and portable sound systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1496],\"alternative_name\":\"Speaker\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"K-Sonic 8-inch speaker is an electro-acoustic component that converts electrical audio signals into sound waves. It works using a voice coil, magnet, and diaphragm (cone) that vibrates when current passes through the coil. This vibration produces sound waves that we hear as music or audio output. The speaker is widely used in audio amplification systems, public address systems, and multimedia speaker setups.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773240565462-512132254.jpeg\"}','2026-03-11 14:49:25'),
(4845,1,'product',2951,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4 inch K Sonic woofer\",\"description\":\"K-Sonic 4-inch speaker is a compact loudspeaker driver designed for small audio systems such as portable speaker boxes, home audio setups, and DIY amplifier projects. It produces clear mid-range sound and moderate bass despite its small size. The speaker typically uses a lightweight cone, strong magnet, and durable frame to deliver stable sound output. Because of its compact design, it is commonly installed in small cabinets, multimedia speakers, and mini sound systems.\",\"info\":\"A typical 4-inch speaker has a 100 mm woofer size and is designed to handle a wide range of audio frequencies for balanced sound. Many small speakers of this size use an impedance around 4 ohms and provide good sound sensitivity for use with amplifiers or audio boards. Frequency response in similar speakers can range roughly from 70 Hz to 23 kHz, allowing them to reproduce both low and high sound frequencies clearly.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"woofer\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"4-inch K-Sonic speaker is an electro-acoustic component that converts electrical audio signals from an amplifier into sound waves. It operates based on a voice coil and magnet system that vibrates the speaker cone to produce sound. The speaker usually works with audio amplifiers designed for 4 Ω or 8 Ω impedance loads, which helps maintain proper power transfer and safe operation in audio systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":252}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-11 14:53:07'),
(4846,1,'product',2952,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"8 inch K Sonic Woofer\",\"description\":\"K-Sonic 8-inch speaker is a larger loudspeaker driver designed to deliver stronger bass and higher sound output compared to smaller speakers. It is commonly used in home audio systems, Bluetooth speaker boxes, PA systems, DJ sound setups, and DIY amplifier projects. The speaker typically features a durable cone, foam or rubber surround, and a powerful magnet that helps produce deep bass and clear mid-range audio. Because of its larger size, it is ideal for medium-sized speaker cabinets and sound systems.\",\"info\":\"A typical K-Sonic 8-inch woofer (such as model KS-840) can handle around 80 watts of power and is designed with a foam cone and strong magnet system to produce balanced sound performance. The magnet size is usually around 90 × 17 mm, which helps generate stronger magnetic force for better sound output. These speakers are commonly used in speaker boxes, home theater systems, stage speakers, and portable sound systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"K SONIC Woofer\",\"mrp\":\"999.00\",\"note\":\"K-Sonic 8-inch speaker is an electro-acoustic component that converts electrical audio signals into sound waves. It works using a voice coil, magnet, and diaphragm (cone) that vibrates when current passes through the coil. This vibration produces sound waves that we hear as music or audio output. The speaker is widely used in audio amplification systems, public address systems, and multimedia speaker setups.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":332,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":252}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-11 14:53:40'),
(4847,1,'product',2953,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Buck Converter LM2596\",\"description\":\"The LM2596 Buck Converter is a DC-DC step-down voltage regulator module used to convert a higher DC voltage into a lower adjustable DC voltage. It is widely used in electronics projects, battery-powered systems, robotics, LED power supplies, and DIY circuits.\",\"info\":\"This module is based on the LM2596 switching regulator IC, which provides efficient voltage conversion with low heat generation. The output voltage can be adjusted using a preset potentiometer on the board. It supports a wide input voltage range and delivers stable output for powering various electronic devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[26],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773287158635-747588196.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 03:45:58'),
(4848,1,'product',31,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"32 inch Android Motherboard\",\"description\":\"A 32-inch Android Motherboard is the main control board used inside a smart LED TV. It runs the Android operating system, manages display processing, sound output, internet connectivity, and all input/output functions of the TV.These motherboards are available in universal models (suitable for many TV panels) and brand-specific models (designed for particular TV brands). Most Android TV boards include RAM, internal storage, Wi-Fi module, HDMI ports, USB ports, AV input, and audio amplifier circuit. They support features such as YouTube, Play Store apps, screen mirroring, and smart remote control.\",\"info\":\"A 32-inch TV motherboard (also called TV main board or main PCB) is the central control circuit board used in 32-inch LED/LCD televisions. It manages all major TV functions including video processing, audio control, input/output handling, and system control.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"4900.00\",\"note\":\"A 32-inch TV motherboard, also known as the main board, is the primary control circuit board used in 32-inch LED/LCD televisions. It is responsible for managing and coordinating all major television functions, including video processing, audio control, signal input handling, and system operations.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":86,\"secondary_id\":\"446\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773287513722-873837755.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 03:51:53'),
(4849,1,'product',2954,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"12.1 inch HDMI LCD Monitor with Touch Raspberry PI\",\"description\":\"A 12.1-inch HDMI LCD Monitor with Touch for Raspberry Pi is a medium-size external display module mainly used in electronics projects, embedded systems, and mini-computer applications. This type of monitor connects directly to the Raspberry Pi through the HDMI port for video output and USB interface for touch control, making it easy to install and operate without complex drivers\",\"info\":\"Most models feature a TFT or IPS LCD panel with resolutions such as 1280 × 800 or 800 × 600, providing clear image quality suitable for graphical interfaces and multimedia use. Many displays support capacitive multi-touch technology with toughened glass protection, ensuring smooth smartphone-like interaction and durability for continuous use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[436],\"model\":\"HDW121_001L\",\"mrp\":\"13800\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773288134490-637887456.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 04:02:14'),
(4850,1,'product',2955,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LM317T\",\"description\":\"The LM317T is a popular adjustable positive voltage regulator IC widely used in power supply circuits and electronic projects. It is designed to provide a stable output voltage that can be adjusted from about 1.25 V to 37 V, with an output current capability of up to 1.5 A when proper heat-sinking is provided. This regulator comes in a TO-220 package, making it easy to mount on a heat sink for better thermal performance\",\"info\":\"The output voltage is set using two external resistors or a variable potentiometer, which allows flexible voltage control for applications such as battery chargers, bench power supplies, LED drivers, and voltage regulation stages in electronic circuits. The LM317T also includes built-in protection features like thermal shutdown, current limiting, and safe-area protection, ensuring reliable and safe operation under varying load conditions. Because of its simplicity, low cost, and versatility, the LM317T is commonly used by students, hobbyists, and engineers in both DIY and industrial electronic designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773290309127-373133610.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 04:38:29'),
