(4860,1,'product',2376,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5.1 Channel TT-5090\",\"description\":\"The 5.1 Channel TT-5090 is a multimedia home theatre speaker system designed to provide immersive surround sound for movies, music, gaming, and TV entertainment. As a 5.1-channel setup, it includes five satellite speakers and one subwoofer, allowing sound to be distributed around the listener for a more cinematic experience compared to regular stereo speakers.\",\"info\":\"The subwoofer is responsible for producing deep bass tones, while the satellite speakers handle mid and high frequencies, creating balanced and dynamic audio output. This system typically supports multiple connectivity options such as Bluetooth, AUX input, USB, memory card (SD), and sometimes FM radio, making it compatible with smartphones, laptops, TVs, and other media devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"10500.00\",\"note\":\"Many versions also include a remote control for convenient adjustment of volume, bass, treble, and input selection. The TT-5090 is generally suitable for small to medium-sized rooms and offers an affordable solution for users who want a home theatre-style audio setup with enhanced sound clarity and bass performance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":330,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":279}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-12 06:16:50'),
(4861,1,'product',2959,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Arduino Lilypad Attiny85\",\"description\":\"The Arduino LilyPad ATtiny85 is a tiny, sewable microcontroller board designed specifically for wearable electronics and e-textile projects.\",\"info\":\"It is based on the ATtiny85 microcontroller and features large conductive pads that make it easy to stitch into fabric using conductive thread.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1200],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773296695006-420367799.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 06:24:55'),
(4862,1,'product',2960,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CJMCU-6075 UV Light Intensity Sensor\",\"description\":\"The CJMCU-6075 UV Light Intensity Sensor is a compact sensor module designed to measure ultraviolet (UV) light intensity, including UVA and UVB radiation. It is based on the VEML6075 UV sensor, which provides accurate UV measurements and allows calculation of the UV Index for environmental and safety monitoring applications.\",\"info\":\"The CJMCU-6075 UV Light Intensity Sensor is a digital sensing module used to measure ultraviolet (UV) radiation. It is based on the VEML6075 sensor IC, which can detect UVA and UVB light and enables accurate calculation of the UV Index. The sensor stores calibration data internally, allowing reliable measurements without complex calibration.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[85],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773296814881-806469255.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 06:26:54'),
(4863,1,'product',2961,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MCP2515 CAN BUS Module\",\"description\":\"The MCP2515 CAN Bus Module is a communication module used to enable CAN (Controller Area Network) protocol on microcontrollers that do not have built-in CAN support. It is based on the MCP2515 standalone CAN controller IC from Microchip and typically works together with a CAN transceiver such as TJA1050 or SN65HVD230.\",\"info\":\"The MCP2515 CAN Bus Module is a communication interface used to add CAN (Controller Area Network) capability to microcontrollers that do not have a built-in CAN controller. It uses the MCP2515 standalone CAN controller IC and communicates with the host MCU via the SPI interface. Most modules also include a CAN transceiver (such as TJA1050 or SN65HVD230) to connect directly to the CAN bus lines.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[602],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773297542682-362127481.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 06:39:02'),
(4864,1,'product',2962,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Prototype shield\",\"description\":\"A Prototype Shield (Proto Shield) is an add-on expansion board designed to fit directly on top of Arduino boards, allowing users to build, test, and solder custom circuits without designing a separate PCB. It is widely used for prototyping, experimentation, and small embedded projects.\",\"info\":\"Prototype shields duplicate the Arduino pin layout and provide a general-purpose prototyping area where components can be soldered permanently.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773297762846-545283278.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 06:42:42'),
(4865,1,'product',2963,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HLK-B20 bluetooth board\",\"description\":\"The HLK-B20 Bluetooth board is a compact Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) wireless communication module used in embedded electronics and IoT projects for short-distance data transmission. It is designed to provide transparent serial communication, allowing microcontrollers such as Arduino, STM32, or other development boards to send and receive data wirelessly through a simple UART (TX / RX) interface\",\"info\":\"This Bluetooth board typically includes an integrated antenna, onboard microcontroller, internal memory, and multiple peripheral interfaces such as GPIO, PWM, ADC, SPI, and I²C, enabling flexible use in various circuit designs. It works with a 3.3 V supply voltage and logic level, so level shifting may be required when interfacing with 5 V systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[31],\"mrp\":\"998\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773298191613-855962917.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 06:49:51'),
(4866,1,'product',2964,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HLK-B30 bluetooth board\",\"description\":\"The HLK-B30 Bluetooth board is a compact wireless communication module developed by Shenzhen Hi-Link Electronic Co., Ltd., designed for IoT and embedded system applications. It is a dual-mode module that combines Wi-Fi (802.11 n) and Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE 4.2) in a single board, allowing devices to communicate both over wireless networks and short-range Bluetooth connections.\",\"info\":\"The HLK-B30 supports transparent serial communication through interfaces such as UART, SPI, PWM, and GPIO, enabling microcontrollers and control systems to exchange data wirelessly without complex networking development. It can operate in different modes such as serial-to-Wi-Fi station mode, access-point mode, and serial-to-BLE mode, making it suitable for applications like smart home controllers, industrial monitoring systems, wireless data loggers, and mobile-connected devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[587],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773298359337-888767986.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 06:52:39'),
(4867,1,'product',2965,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Clip for N20 Motor\",\"description\":\"The clip for N20 motor is a compact mounting accessory designed to securely hold N20 micro DC gear motors in place during operation.\",\"info\":\"By ensuring proper alignment and stability of the N20 motor, the clip helps improve performance, accuracy, and overall reliability of the mechanical setup.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[678],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773300105668-783409376.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 07:21:45'),
(4868,1,'product',2606,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"55 inch Smart Android Tv\",\"description\":\"The Eyepluse 55 LED Smart Android TV is a large-screen 4K UHD 3840 × 2160 television running on Android Smart TV platform — designed for immersive home entertainment with a frameless IPS panel and smart features. It brings vibrant visuals, smart connectivity, and multiple ports for connecting external devices.\",\"info\":\"55-inch 4K UHD LED display3840 × 2160 with HDR support for sharp, detailed image quality.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"46999.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":223,\"secondary_id\":393,\"brand_id\":9}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-12 07:29:08'),
(4869,1,'product',2966,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Battery for RC Drone 180mah\",\"description\":\"A 180mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight Lithium-Polymer (Li-Po) power source designed mainly for mini and nano drones.\",\"info\":\"Due to its small size and quick charging capability, the 180mAh RC drone battery is widely used in toy drones, micro quadcopters, and DIY lightweight aerial projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[628],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773301213074-728410852.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 07:40:13'),
(4870,1,'product',2967,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"250mah Battery\",\"description\":\"A 250mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as wearable gadgets, Bluetooth accessories, small IoT modules, remote controls, toys, and DIY electronics projects.\",\"info\":\"250mAh batteries are ideal where space is limited, though runtime depends on the device’s power consumption and efficiency.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[628],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773301961307-745005070.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 07:52:41'),
(4871,1,'product',2968,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"280mah Battery\",\"description\":\"A 280mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth modules, wearable gadgets, wireless sensors, mini IoT boards, and DIY electronics projects.\",\"info\":\"with proper charging protection and is often paired with a PCM/BMS protection circuit to prevent over-charge, over-discharge, and short-circuit conditions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[628],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773302037046-63086108.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 07:53:57'),
(4872,1,'product',2969,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"400Mah battery\",\"description\":\"A 400 mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery, most commonly available as a 3.7 V Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (LiPo) cell.\",\"info\":\"It is widely used in compact, low-power electronic devices where small size, light weight, and portability are important.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[628],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773303377771-998065250.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 08:16:17'),
(4873,1,'product',2970,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"450mah battery\",\"description\":\"A 450 mAh battery is a compact rechargeable battery, most commonly available as a 3.7 V Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) cell.\",\"info\":\"It’s used in portable and low-power electronics where a balance of small size, light weight, and longer backup time is required compared to lower-capacity cells.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[628],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773303496984-754731155.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 08:18:16'),
