(4904,1,'product',2972,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Soldron BIT 25W Flat\",\"description\":\"The Soldron 25W Flat Bit is a replacement soldering iron tip specially designed for use with 25-watt Soldron soldering irons. It features a flat (spade-type) tip shape, which provides better heat transfer and wider contact area compared to pointed tips, making it ideal for general-purpose soldering work such as joining wires, PCB pads, terminals, and small electronic components. These bits are usually made from high-quality copper with nickel or iron plating, which helps improve durability, corrosion resistance, and consistent heat conduction during soldering operations.\",\"info\":\"This flat bit is suitable for electronics repair, DIY circuit assembly, school laboratory work, and service-center applications, where moderate heating power and precise solder flow are required. The tip heats up quickly when fitted into a compatible 25 W soldering iron and helps create strong and reliable solder joints while reducing the risk of damaging delicate components. Because of its simple installation, low cost, and long service life, the Soldron 25W flat soldering bit is widely used by technicians, students, and hobbyists in everyday electronic soldering tasks.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1509],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773309988975-893856696.jpeg\"}','2026-03-12 10:06:28'),
(4905,1,'product',2973,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Soldron Pointed Bit 25w\",\"description\":\"The Soldron Pointed Bit 25W is a fine-tip replacement soldering iron bit specially designed for 25-watt Soldron soldering irons. It features a needle-type pointed tip, which provides precise heat transfer and allows accurate soldering of small electronic components, PCB tracks, IC pins, and delicate connections. These bits are generally made from high-quality copper with nickel or iron plating, ensuring good thermal conductivity, corrosion resistance, and longer service life during continuous use.\",\"info\":\"Because of its sharp and narrow tip shape, this soldering bit is ideal for precision electronics work, mobile repairing, circuit prototyping, and laboratory applications, where controlled solder flow and detailed work are required. The bit heats up quickly and helps form clean and reliable solder joints without applying excessive heat to surrounding components. With its simple fitting design, low cost, and dependable performance, the Soldron 25W pointed bit is widely used by technicians, students, and hobbyists for everyday fine soldering tasks.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1509],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773310177984-924675320.jpeg\"}','2026-03-12 10:09:37'),
(4906,1,'product',2974,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"9V Cap to Dc Pin\",\"description\":\"The 9 V Cap to DC Pin connector is a small power adapter cable used to convert a standard 9-volt battery connection into a DC barrel plug output. It consists of a 9 V battery snap cap (with positive and negative terminals) on one side and a male DC plug (commonly 5.5 mm × 2.1 mm) on the other side. This connector allows easy powering of electronic devices and DIY circuits that require a DC input, without the need for soldering directly to the battery.\",\"info\":\"It is commonly used in Arduino projects, wireless modules, CCTV cameras, routers, LED circuits, toys, and portable electronic devices, where a compact battery power source is needed. The cable is usually made with insulated copper wires and molded plastic connectors for safe handling and reliable power transfer. Because of its simple plug-and-play design, low cost, and convenience, the 9 V cap to DC pin adapter is widely used by students, hobbyists, and technicians for temporary power supply and testing applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[818],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773310560280-997936052.jpeg\"}','2026-03-12 10:16:00'),
(4907,1,'product',2975,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BAFO 810 Connector\",\"description\":\"The BAFO BF-810 is a USB-to-Serial (RS-232) adapter cable that lets you convert a modern computer’s USB port into a traditional DB-9 RS-232 serial port. It’s widely used to connect devices that require serial communication (like modems, POS systems, barcode scanners, routers, industrial equipment, GPS units, etc.) to computers that no longer include native serial ports.\",\"info\":\"The BAFO 810 Connector (BF-810) is a USB-to-Serial RS-232 adapter designed to connect legacy serial devices to modern computers that no longer have a built-in COM port. It converts a standard USB port into a DB9 (RS-232) serial interface, making it ideal for use with devices such as industrial controllers, modems, routers, POS machines, barcode scanners, and measurement equipment.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773311045540-146384525.jpeg\"}','2026-03-12 10:24:05'),
(4908,1,'product',2976,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HDMI Jointer\",\"description\":\"HDMI Jointer (also known as an HDMI coupler) is a compact connector used to join two HDMI cables together, effectively extending the overall cable length without signal conversion. It features HDMI female ports on both sides, allowing quick and secure connection between standard HDMI cables while maintaining high-definition audio and video quality.\",\"info\":\"HDMI jointers are widely used in home theaters, LED/LCD TVs, monitors, projectors, gaming consoles, and conference room setups where longer cable runs are required. Designed to support HD, Full HD, and even 4K resolution (depending on quality), the HDMI jointer ensures stable signal transmission with minimal loss. It is a simple, cost-effective, and practical solution for extending HDMI connections without replacing existing cables.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"mrp\":\"299\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773311541646-24048347.jpeg\"}','2026-03-12 10:32:21'),
(4909,1,'product',2977,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10D431 MOV Thermister\",\"description\":\"10D431 MOV Thermistor is a protective electronic component used to limit inrush current and suppress voltage surges in power circuits. The NTC (Negative Temperature Coefficient) thermistor characteristic means its resistance is high at room temperature and decreases as it heats up, helping to control sudden current spikes when equipment is switched ON. The 10D431 rating typically indicates a disc-type component designed to handle high energy and surge conditions.\",\"info\":\"This component is commonly used in SMPS, inverters, UPS systems, adapters, battery chargers, motor drives, and other AC-powered electronic equipment. When combined with surge protection functionality (often associated with MOV behavior), it helps protect sensitive components from voltage transients, spikes, and electrical stress. Reliable, cost-effective, and easy to integrate, the NTC 10D431 MOV thermistor improves circuit safety, stability, and overall lifespan of electronic devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[938],\"mrp\":\"199\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773312502777-841431696.jpeg\"}','2026-03-12 10:48:22'),
(4910,1,'product',2978,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"6 inch K Sonic Woofer\",\"description\":\"6 Inch K Sonic Woofer is a compact yet powerful speaker driver designed to reproduce low-frequency bass sounds in audio systems. It is commonly used in home theatre systems, portable speakers, sound boxes, and multimedia speaker setups. The woofer features a durable cone, strong magnet, and stable suspension that helps deliver clear bass and balanced sound output.\",\"info\":\"This woofer is typically available in impedance ratings such as 4 ohms or 8 ohms and supports moderate power handling suitable for small to medium amplifier systems. The frame is usually made from metal or reinforced material to maintain stability and reduce distortion during high volume output. The K Sonic woofer is compatible with various audio devices including amplifiers, DJ speaker boxes, and DIY sound systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1496],\"alternative_name\":\"Woofer Speaker\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"6 inch K Sonic woofer should be installed in a properly sized speaker cabinet to achieve optimal bass response and sound quality. Using the correct amplifier power rating will help prevent damage to the voice coil and ensure long-term durability. Proper wiring with good quality speaker cables is recommended for efficient audio transmission. Avoid exposing the woofer to moisture, dust, or extreme heat to maintain its performance.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773312869606-33594535.jpeg\"}','2026-03-12 10:54:29'),
(4911,1,'brand',298,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Top Sound\",\"description\":\"Top Sound in a K Sonic 6-inch woofer refers to the strong, clear, and powerful audio output produced by the speaker, especially in the low-frequency bass range. The woofer is designed with a durable cone, voice coil, and magnet structure that allows it to move air efficiently and generate deep bass tones with minimal distortion.\",\"info\":\"To achieve the best top sound quality, the woofer should be installed in a properly designed speaker cabinet that supports bass resonance. Pairing it with a good amplifier and crossover circuit helps balance the bass, mid, and high frequencies. Using good quality speaker wires and maintaining correct polarity also improves overall sound clarity.\",\"note\":\"This makes it suitable for speaker boxes, home audio systems, DJ setups, and multimedia speakers where rich bass and balanced sound quality are required.\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1773313033570-547905919.png\"}','2026-03-12 10:57:13'),
(4912,1,'category_brand_mapping',332,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[11,228,230,232,249,251,252,298]}\"','2026-03-12 10:57:58'),
(4913,1,'product',2979,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"12V Clip\",\"description\":\"12V Clip is a practical electrical connector used to quickly connect or disconnect a 12V DC power source, such as batteries, power supplies, or test equipment. It typically consists of insulated alligator-type clips or snap connectors with attached wires, allowing secure temporary connections without soldering. The insulation helps prevent short circuits and ensures safe handling during use.\",\"info\":\"This clip is widely used in battery testing, automotive work, electronics servicing, DIY projects, and laboratory experiments. Designed for ease of use and reliable contact, the 12V clip provides stable power transfer and flexibility for quick setups and troubleshooting. It is a convenient and cost-effective accessory for 12V power applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773313119231-711261211.jpeg\"}','2026-03-12 10:58:39'),
(4914,1,'product',2980,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB Male Socket\",\"description\":\"USB Male Socket (USB Male Connector) is a standard plug-type interface used to supply power and enable data transfer between electronic devices. It is designed to be inserted into a USB female port, such as those found on computers, chargers, power banks, and adapters. Commonly available in USB-A, Micro-USB, and Type-C formats, the male USB socket ensures a secure and stable connection.\",\"info\":\"USB male sockets are widely used in charging cables, data cables, DIY electronics projects, power modules, and device repair applications. Built with durable metal contacts and insulated housing, they provide reliable current flow and consistent data transmission. Compact and easy to use, the USB male socket is an essential component for modern electronic connectivity and power solutions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1297],\"mrp\":\"199\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773313216484-505798247.jpeg\"}','2026-03-12 11:00:16'),
(4915,1,'product',2981,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10 RELAY GSM with DTMF-TIMER- 7 INPUT Trigger\",\"description\":\"The 10 Relay GSM Controller with DTMF Timer and 7-Input Trigger is an advanced remote switching and automation control module used to operate multiple electrical devices through mobile phone networks or external trigger signals. This system typically includes 10 independent relay outputs, allowing users to turn ON or OFF appliances such as pumps, lights, motors, gates, and industrial equipment from a remote location using a GSM SIM-based connection\",\"info\":\"The controller also features a built-in timer function, enabling scheduled switching of connected loads for applications like irrigation systems, street lighting, generator control, and energy management. In addition, the 7 external trigger input ports allow sensors, switches, or alarm devices to automatically activate specific relays or send alerts based on predefined conditions\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[17],\"mrp\":\"299\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773313845906-758212077.jpg\"}','2026-03-12 11:10:45'),
(4916,1,'product',2982,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RM-L 1659 Universal Remote\",\"description\":\"This remote works using infrared (IR) signal and is designed to support several Smart TV brands and universal TV motherboards.\",\"info\":\"Compatible list of tv skyworth, yasin, ecostar, onida, panasonic, nokia, vu, motorola, thomson, kodak\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[989],\"model\":\"RM-L1659\",\"alternative_name\":\"Universal Remote\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Do not drop or hit the remote on hard surfaces.\",\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-12 11:20:45'),
