(4931,1,'product',2983,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BAR CODE SCANNER - USB HOST for Arduino\",\"description\":\"The USB Host Barcode Scanner for Arduino is an input device used to read printed barcodes and send the decoded data directly to an Arduino or compatible microcontroller. These scanners are designed to work through a USB Host interface, which means the Arduino must be connected using a USB Host Shield or a microcontroller board with built-in USB Host support.\",\"info\":\"When a barcode is scanned, the scanner converts the pattern into digital characters (numbers or letters) and transmits the data to the Arduino as a serial or keyboard-emulation (HID) signal, making it easy to process product IDs, inventory codes, or access information in embedded projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[617],\"mrp\":\"1999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773375427049-708062464.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 04:17:07'),
(4932,1,'product',2984,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LCD Display 16x2 with I2C\",\"description\":\"The 16×2 LCD Display with I²C interface is a commonly used alphanumeric display module in electronics and Arduino projects, designed to show 16 characters per line across 2 lines. Unlike standard parallel LCD modules, this version includes an I²C backpack (adapter board) that allows communication through only two data lines – SDA (data) and SCL (clock), along with power connections. This greatly reduces the number of microcontroller pins required and simplifies wiring, making it ideal for beginners and compact circuit designs.\",\"info\":\"The display is typically based on the HD44780 controller, operates at 5 V supply voltage, and features an adjustable contrast potentiometer and backlight control on the I²C board. It can be easily interfaced with Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP8266, ESP32, and other microcontrollers using available libraries, allowing users to display sensor readings, menu systems, time, temperature, or status messages.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[581],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773375788119-293344913.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 04:23:08'),
(4933,1,'brand',299,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"RR\",\"description\":\"RR universal remotes work using infrared (IR) signal technology to communicate with the TV sensor.\",\"info\":\"These remotes usually have a plastic body with rubber keypad buttons and support basic TV operations such as power, volume, channel, menu, input, and navigation controls.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"UNIVERSAL COMPATIBILITY: Works with multiple LCD TV brands including Genus, Star, Futec, and Intex LCD models with model LC-1672\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-03-13 04:26:06'),
(4934,1,'product',2985,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LCD 16X2 with Female Header\",\"description\":\"The LCD 16×2 with Female Header is a standard alphanumeric liquid crystal display module designed to show 16 characters in each line and a total of 2 lines. In this version, the display comes with a pre-soldered female header connector, which makes it easy to plug jumper wires or male pin connectors directly without soldering. This simplifies circuit assembly and is especially useful for breadboard prototyping, Arduino projects, and educational electronics experiments.\",\"info\":\"These LCD modules are usually based on the HD44780 controller, operate on a 5 V power supply, and use a parallel communication interface that requires multiple data and control pins (such as RS, EN, D4–D7). They also include pins for contrast adjustment and LED backlight, allowing clear visibility of displayed text in different lighting conditions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[581],\"mrp\":\"699\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773376008966-105466872.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 04:26:48'),
(4935,1,'category_brand_mapping',124,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[5,8,9,10,11,12,25,30,33,34,37,130,131,134,138,222,232,288,290,299]}\"','2026-03-13 04:27:33'),
(4936,1,'product',2986,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RR LC-1672 UNI-47 remote \",\"description\":\"This remote works using infrared (IR) signal technology to communicate with the TV sensor. It is usually pre-programmed to support multiple TV brands, so in many cases it works plug-and-play without setup, while some TVs may require simple code matching.\",\"info\":\"Universal models like LC-1672 are designed to provide basic TV operations such as power, volume, channel change, menu navigation, input selection, and settings control.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1518],\"model\":\"LC-1672\",\"alternative_name\":\"RR LC-1672\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Do not drop or hit the remote on hard surfaces.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773376590295-357304667.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 04:36:30'),
(4937,1,'product',2987,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Breadboard 840 Tie Points\",\"description\":\"The Breadboard 840 Tie Points is a reusable solderless prototyping board widely used in electronics for building and testing circuits without permanent soldering. It typically features 840 connection points (tie points) arranged in a grid pattern, including two long power rails on both sides for easy distribution of VCC and GND across the circuit. The central area is divided by a gap, allowing DIP ICs, microcontrollers, and modules to be mounted conveniently. Each row of tie points is internally connected, enabling quick insertion of resistors, capacitors, LEDs, transistors, jumper wires, and other components to form working circuits.\",\"info\":\"Breadboards are commonly made with a durable ABS plastic body and phosphor bronze or nickel-plated spring clips inside, ensuring good electrical contact and long service life. The 840-point size provides ample space for medium to large projects, making it ideal for Arduino prototyping, educational experiments, circuit design testing, robotics projects, and DIY electronics development.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1113],\"mrp\":\"699\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773381507728-785863032.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 05:58:27'),
(4938,1,'product',2988,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zeb 9PPM2UM 9 port POE Switch\",\"description\":\"The 8-Port 10/100 Mbps Desktop Switch is a compact networking device used to connect multiple computers, printers, IP cameras, smart TVs, and other Ethernet-enabled devices within a local area network (LAN). It provides eight RJ-45 Ethernet ports, each supporting data transfer speeds of up to 10 Mbps or 100 Mbps (Fast Ethernet) with automatic speed detection and duplex mode adjustment.\",\"info\":\"Most desktop switches feature plug-and-play operation, meaning they do not require software configuration and can start working immediately after connecting the power adapter and network cables. They often include auto-MDI/MDIX support, eliminating the need for crossover cables, along with LED indicators for power, link, and activity status. Because of their simple installation, stable performance, and cost-effective networking capability, 8-port 10/100 Mbps switches are widely used in homes, small offices, shops, classrooms, CCTV installations, and small business networks to expand wired network connectivity efficiently.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[500],\"mrp\":\"1999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773386843145-151455820.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 07:27:23'),
(4939,1,'product',2989,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CAT6 Networking Cable\",\"description\":\"The CAT6 Networking Cable (Category 6 cable) is a high-performance Ethernet cable used for connecting network devices such as computers, routers, switches, IP cameras, and smart TVs in local area networks. It is designed to support high-speed data transmission up to 1 Gbps for distances up to 100 meters, and can handle frequencies up to 250 MHz, which helps reduce signal interference and maintain stable connectivity. CAT6 cables usually contain four twisted pairs of insulated copper wires, along with improved internal separation or shielding that minimizes crosstalk and electromagnetic interference compared to older CAT5 cables.\",\"info\":\"These cables are commonly available in UTP (Unshielded Twisted Pair) and STP (Shielded Twisted Pair) types, with standard RJ-45 connectors for easy plug-and-play installation. Because of their fast speed, reliable performance, and compatibility with modern networking equipment, CAT6 networking cables are widely used in home internet connections, office LAN setups, CCTV camera installations, data centers, and industrial network systems. They are also suitable for future-ready networking, as they can support higher bandwidth applications like HD video streaming, online gaming, and large data transfers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[497],\"mrp\":\"14999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773387360381-272865326.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 07:36:00'),
(4940,1,'product',2990,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Mist Maker\",\"description\":\"A Mist Maker is an electronic device used to produce cool water mist or fog for decorative, humidifying, or environmental control purposes. It works using ultrasonic vibration technology, where a small ceramic diaphragm vibrates at a very high frequency to break water into fine microscopic droplets, creating a visible mist without heating the water. Mist makers usually operate on low-voltage DC power through an external adapter and are designed to be placed in a water container such as a bowl, fountain, or humidifier tank.\",\"info\":\"These devices are commonly used in indoor fountains, aquariums, terrariums, plant nurseries, stage effects, air humidifiers, and decorative lighting setups, as they help maintain moisture levels and enhance visual appearance with a fog-like effect. Many models include LED lights that illuminate the mist, adding aesthetic value for home décor and event displays. Because of their silent operation, low power consumption, and simple installation, mist makers are widely used in homes, shops, gardens, and electronic DIY projects where controlled mist or humidity is required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[82],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773387857656-504483416.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 07:44:17'),
(4941,1,'product',2986,'delete',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-13 07:47:09'),
(4942,1,'product',2991,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"mi voice remote ver 8\",\"description\":\"This remote usually works through Bluetooth or infrared (IR) connection depending on the model. It is made with a lightweight plastic body and soft rubber keypad.\",\"info\":\"The Mi Voice Remote Version 8 is a replacement / universal smart TV remote designed for many Mi / Xiaomi Android LED TVs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[276],\"alternative_name\":\"remote ver 8 mi voice\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Easy search using Google voice assistant\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773388422474-534117157.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 07:53:42'),
(4943,1,'product',2992,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LM35 DZ\",\"description\":\"The LM35DZ is a precision analog temperature sensor IC widely used in electronic circuits to measure ambient temperature. It provides an output voltage that is directly proportional to temperature in degrees Celsius, with a typical scale factor of 10 mV per °C (for example, 250 mV output at 25 °C). This makes it very easy to interface with microcontrollers such as Arduino, PIC, AVR, and other data-acquisition systems, since no external calibration is generally required.\",\"info\":\"The sensor operates over a temperature range of approximately 0 °C to 100 °C (LM35DZ version) and requires only a low supply voltage (about 4 V to 30 V) with very low current consumption, making it suitable for battery-powered applications. It is usually available in a TO-92 transistor-type package, which is compact and convenient for PCB mounting or breadboard use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[660],\"mrp\":\"10\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773388460103-178011737.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 07:54:20'),
(4944,1,'product',2993,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC74\",\"description\":\"The 74HC74 is a high-speed CMOS dual D-type flip-flop integrated circuit commonly used in digital electronics for storing and controlling binary data. It contains two independent flip-flops, each having data (D), clock (CLK), set (PRE), reset (CLR), and complementary outputs (Q and Q̅). The flip-flop transfers the logic level present at the D input to the Q output on the rising edge of the clock signal, making it useful for synchronized data storage and timing applications.\",\"info\":\"This IC operates with a wide supply voltage range (typically 2 V to 6 V) and offers low power consumption with high noise immunity, which are key advantages of CMOS logic devices. It is usually available in DIP and SMD packages, allowing easy use in breadboard circuits as well as compact PCB designs. Because of its reliable edge-triggered operation and built-in preset and clear functions, the 74HC74 is widely used in frequency dividers, data registers, counters, shift registers, timing circuits, and digital control systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773389597594-316697697.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:13:17'),
(4945,1,'product',2994,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC132\",\"description\":\"The 74HC132 is a high-speed CMOS logic integrated circuit that contains four independent 2-input NAND gates with Schmitt-trigger inputs. These Schmitt-trigger inputs provide hysteresis, which improves noise immunity and allows the IC to work reliably with slow-changing or noisy signals such as those from switches, sensors, or RC timing circuits. The device typically operates over a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption and fast switching performance suitable for modern digital electronics designs.\",\"info\":\"Each gate produces a logic LOW output only when both inputs are HIGH, otherwise the output remains HIGH, following standard NAND logic operation. The IC is commonly available in DIP-14 and surface-mount packages, making it easy to use in breadboard prototypes as well as compact PCB assemblies. Because of its built-in noise filtering capability and versatile logic function, the 74HC132 is widely used in oscillator circuits, waveform shaping, debounce circuits, timing applications, digital control systems, and signal conditioning stages in embedded and electronic projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773389692203-363871292.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:14:52'),
(4946,1,'product',2995,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC154\",\"description\":\"The 74HC154 is a high-speed CMOS 4-to-16 line decoder / demultiplexer integrated circuit used in digital electronics for selecting one output line from many using binary input signals. It accepts four binary address inputs (A0–A3) and activates one of the sixteen output lines, making it useful for applications that require device selection or data routing. The outputs of this IC are active-LOW, meaning the selected output becomes LOW while all other outputs remain HIGH.\",\"info\":\"This device typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, providing low power consumption and good noise immunity compared to standard TTL logic. It also includes two enable inputs, which allow the decoder to be easily controlled or cascaded with other logic devices in complex digital systems. The 74HC154 is usually available in DIP and SMD packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773389786953-72675812.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:16:26'),
(4947,1,'product',2996,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC163\",\"description\":\"The 74HC163 is a high-speed CMOS synchronous 4-bit binary counter integrated circuit used in digital electronics for counting pulses and timing operations. It features four internal flip-flops that count in binary sequence from 0000 to 1111 (0 to 15) based on the rising edge of the clock signal, making it suitable for precise and synchronized counting applications. Unlike ripple counters, the 74HC163 is a synchronous counter, meaning all flip-flops are triggered at the same time, which helps reduce propagation delay and improves overall circuit performance.\",\"info\":\"This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption and good noise immunity. It includes useful control inputs such as clear (reset), load (parallel preset), count enable, and terminal count output, allowing it to be easily cascaded with other counters to create higher-bit counting systems. The 74HC163 is commonly available in DIP-16 and SMD packages, making it convenient for both breadboard prototyping and PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773389872992-158617382.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:17:52'),
(4948,1,'product',2997,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC164\",\"description\":\"The 74HC164 is a high-speed CMOS 8-bit serial-in, parallel-out shift register integrated circuit used in digital electronics for data storage, signal conversion, and output expansion. It accepts data serially through its input pins (A and B) and shifts the data into the internal register on each rising edge of the clock signal, making the stored bits available simultaneously at the eight parallel output pins (Q0–Q7). This allows a microcontroller or logic circuit to control multiple outputs using only a few input lines.\",\"info\":\"The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, providing low power consumption, fast switching performance, and good noise immunity typical of CMOS logic devices. It also includes a clear (reset) input that quickly resets all outputs to LOW when activated, which is useful in initialization and timing control applications. The 74HC164 is generally available in DIP-14 and SMD packages, making it suitable for breadboard experiments as well as compact PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773390155288-439954463.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:22:35'),
(4949,1,'product',2998,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC193\",\"description\":\"The 74HC193 is a high-speed CMOS synchronous 4-bit up/down binary counter integrated circuit used in digital electronics for counting applications that require both incrementing and decrementing functions. It contains four internal flip-flops that allow the counter to count from 0 to 15 in binary form, either in the upward direction or downward direction depending on which clock input is triggered. The device has separate clock inputs for UP count and DOWN count, enabling flexible control in timing circuits, frequency division, and sequence generation systems.\",\"info\":\"This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption and fast switching performance. It also includes useful control features such as asynchronous clear (reset) and parallel load inputs, which allow the counter to be preset to a specific value or quickly reset during operation. The outputs are available in parallel binary form, making it easy to interface with displays, decoders, and microcontrollers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773390849457-210606213.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:34:09'),
(4950,1,'product',2999,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC244\",\"description\":\"The 74HC244 is a high-speed CMOS octal buffer / line driver integrated circuit used in digital electronics to increase signal driving capability and isolate data lines between different parts of a circuit. It contains eight non-inverting buffer channels arranged in two groups of four, each controlled by a separate output enable (OE) input. When the enable pin is activated, the input signals are passed to the outputs; when disabled, the outputs go into a high-impedance (tri-state) condition, allowing multiple devices to share the same data bus without interference.\",\"info\":\"This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, fast switching speed, and high noise immunity characteristic of CMOS logic. The 74HC244 is commonly available in DIP-20 and SMD packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs. Because of its ability to strengthen digital signals and provide bus control, it is widely used in microcontroller interfacing, memory address buffering, data bus expansion, display driving, and general digital signal transmission applications in both educational and industrial electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773390909832-126698071.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:35:09'),
(4951,1,'product',3000,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC245\",\"description\":\"The 74HC245 is a high-speed CMOS octal bidirectional bus transceiver integrated circuit used in digital electronics to transfer data between two buses or groups of digital lines. It contains eight bidirectional data channels, allowing signals to flow either from the A bus to the B bus or from the B bus to the A bus. The direction of data flow is controlled by a DIR (direction) input pin, while an OE (output enable) pin allows the outputs to be placed in a high-impedance (tri-state) mode, making it possible for multiple devices to share the same data bus without conflict.\",\"info\":\"This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, providing low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance. It is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs. Because of its reliable bidirectional buffering capability, the 74HC245 is widely used in microcontroller and memory interfacing, data bus expansion, communication systems, display control circuits, and general digital signal transmission applications in both educational and industrial electronic designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773391101556-843921886.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:38:21'),
(4952,1,'product',3001,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC259\",\"description\":\"The 74HC259 is a high-speed CMOS 8-bit addressable latch integrated circuit used in digital electronics for storing and controlling individual output states. It allows a microcontroller or logic circuit to select one of eight output lines using three address inputs (A0–A2) and then set or reset that selected output through the data input and control signals. This makes it possible to control multiple devices such as LEDs, relays, or logic lines using only a few control pins.\",\"info\":\"The IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, fast switching speed, and good noise immunity typical of CMOS devices. It includes clear and enable control features, allowing all outputs to be reset simultaneously or placed under controlled operation during system initialization. The outputs remain latched until a new command is given, making the device suitable for memory-type control functions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773391291482-307514270.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:41:31'),
(4953,1,'product',3002,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RM-L1729 IN Remote\",\"description\":\"The RM-L1729 IN Remote is a high-quality universal TV remote designed to work seamlessly with a wide range of LED, LCD, and Smart TV brands.\",\"info\":\"This remote works using infrared (IR) signal and in some versions Bluetooth (voice models). Many RM-L1729 remotes are non-voice types, meaning they support normal TV controls but do not have microphone or voice assistant.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[792],\"model\":\"RM-L1729 IN\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Compatible with Samsung Smart LED Tv (Non Voice)\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773391292766-114717394.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:41:32'),
(4954,1,'product',3003,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC273\",\"description\":\"The 74HC273 is a high-speed CMOS octal D-type flip-flop integrated circuit used in digital electronics for storing and transferring 8-bit parallel data. It contains eight edge-triggered D flip-flops with common clock and asynchronous clear inputs, allowing data present at the input pins (D0–D7) to be transferred simultaneously to the output pins (Q0–Q7) on the rising edge of the clock signal. This makes it useful for temporary data storage, synchronization, and buffering between digital circuits.\",\"info\":\"The IC typically operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, providing low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance characteristic of CMOS logic devices. It includes a master reset (clear) input, which allows all outputs to be set to LOW instantly during system initialization or fault conditions. The outputs remain stable until the next clock pulse updates the stored data.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"48\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773391364636-952003063.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:42:44'),
(4955,1,'product',3004,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC367\",\"description\":\"The 74HC367 is a high-speed CMOS hex buffer / line driver integrated circuit used in digital electronics to strengthen logic signals and isolate different sections of a circuit. It contains six non-inverting buffer channels, arranged in two groups, each controlled by a separate output enable (OE) input. When the enable pin is active, the input signals are passed to the outputs; when disabled, the outputs go into a high-impedance (tri-state) condition, allowing multiple devices to share the same signal lines or data bus without interference.\",\"info\":\"This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, fast switching speed, and good noise immunity typical of CMOS logic families. It is commonly available in DIP-16 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs. Because of its signal buffering and bus-control capability, the 74HC367 is widely used in microcontroller interfacing, memory addressing circuits, display driving systems, communication lines, and general digital signal transmission applications where stable and reliable logic levels are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773391442852-633857554.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:44:02'),
(4956,1,'product',3005,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC373\",\"description\":\"The 74HC373 is a high-speed CMOS octal transparent latch integrated circuit used in digital electronics for temporary storage and buffering of 8-bit parallel data. It contains eight D-type latches with three-state outputs, allowing data applied at the input pins (D0–D7) to appear at the outputs (Q0–Q7) whenever the Latch Enable (LE) input is HIGH. When the LE signal goes LOW, the data present at that moment is latched and held at the outputs until the next update.\",\"info\":\"The IC also includes an Output Enable (OE) control pin, which can place all outputs in a high-impedance (tri-state) condition, making it suitable for shared data bus applications and microcontroller interfacing. The 74HC373 typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, fast switching speed, and high noise immunity typical of CMOS logic devices. It is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773391655797-728724102.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:47:35'),
(4957,1,'product',3006,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC374\",\"description\":\"The 74HC374 is a high-speed CMOS octal D-type edge-triggered flip-flop integrated circuit used in digital electronics for storing and transferring 8-bit parallel data. It contains eight flip-flops with a common clock input and three-state outputs, allowing data present at the input pins (D0–D7) to be transferred to the output pins (Q0–Q7) on the rising edge of the clock signal. Once latched, the outputs remain stable until the next clock pulse updates the stored information, making it suitable for synchronized data handling in digital systems.\",\"info\":\"The IC also features an Output Enable (OE) control, which can place all outputs in a high-impedance (tri-state) condition so that multiple devices can share the same data bus without conflict. It typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, providing low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance typical of the HC CMOS logic family. The 74HC374 is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773391713083-21424086.png\"}','2026-03-13 08:48:33'),
(4958,1,'product',3007,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC541\",\"description\":\"The 74HC541 is a high-speed CMOS octal buffer / line driver integrated circuit used in digital electronics to strengthen logic signals and isolate data buses between different sections of a circuit. It contains eight non-inverting buffer channels with three-state (tri-state) outputs, allowing the device to drive multiple loads or share a common data bus without signal interference. The outputs are controlled by two Output Enable (OE) pins, which can place all outputs into a high-impedance state when disabled, making the IC suitable for bus-controlled systems and microcontroller interfacing.\",\"info\":\"This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance characteristic of CMOS logic devices. It is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs. Because of its signal buffering and bus-driving capability, the 74HC541 is widely used in memory address buffering, data line isolation, display driving circuits, communication interfaces, and general digital signal transmission applications where stable and reliable logic levels are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773391784667-601783397.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:49:44'),
(4959,1,'product',3008,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Realme Smart TV Remote \",\"description\":\"The Realme Smart TV remote is a replacement or original remote control used to operate Realme Android / Google Smart TVs.\",\"info\":\"compatible for Realme TV Remote control.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[275],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Realme TV remotes work using infrared (IR), Bluetooth, or USB-dongle wireless connection depending on the model.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773392389883-241190306.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:59:49'),
(4960,1,'product',3009,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC573\",\"description\":\"The 74HC573 is a high-speed CMOS octal transparent latch integrated circuit used in digital electronics for temporary storage and buffering of 8-bit parallel data. It contains eight D-type latches with three-state outputs, allowing data present at the input pins (D0–D7) to appear at the outputs (Q0–Q7) whenever the Latch Enable (LE) input is HIGH. When the LE signal goes LOW, the current data is latched and held at the outputs until a new enable signal is applied, making it useful for synchronized data transfer and bus control applications.\",\"info\":\"The IC also includes an Output Enable (OE) control pin, which can place all outputs in a high-impedance (tri-state) condition so that multiple devices can safely share the same data lines. The 74HC573 typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance typical of the HC CMOS logic family. It is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773392392745-337675150.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 08:59:52'),
(4961,1,'product',3010,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC574\",\"description\":\"The 74HC574 is a high-speed CMOS octal D-type edge-triggered flip-flop integrated circuit used in digital electronics for storing and transferring 8-bit parallel data in a synchronized manner. It contains eight flip-flops with a common clock input, so the logic levels present at the input pins (D0–D7) are transferred simultaneously to the output pins (Q0–Q7) on the rising edge of the clock signal. Once stored, the outputs remain stable until the next clock pulse updates the data, making the device suitable for timing-controlled data handling and register applications.\",\"info\":\"The IC also includes a three-state output enable (OE) control, which allows all outputs to be placed in a high-impedance state so multiple devices can share the same data bus without interference. The 74HC574 typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, fast switching performance, and good noise immunity typical of CMOS logic. It is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for both breadboard prototyping and compact PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773392482496-647992848.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 09:01:22'),
(4962,1,'product',3011,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC4052\",\"description\":\"The 74HC4052 is a high-speed CMOS dual 4-channel analog multiplexer / demultiplexer integrated circuit used in electronic circuits to select and route analog or digital signals. It contains two independent switching sections, each capable of connecting one common input/output pin to one of four selectable channels, allowing signal sharing and efficient input expansion. The selection of channels is controlled by two address (select) inputs, while an additional enable (inhibit) pin can disconnect all channels when required.\",\"info\":\"This IC typically operates with a wide supply voltage range, supporting single-supply operation (about 2 V to 10 V) or dual-supply operation (up to ±5 V), which makes it suitable for handling both positive and negative analog signals. It offers low ON resistance, low power consumption, and good signal isolation, ensuring accurate signal switching in measurement and communication circuits. The 74HC4052 is commonly available in DIP-16 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773392944274-821598312.jpeg\"}','2026-03-13 09:09:04'),
(4963,1,'product',3012,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC4075\",\"description\":\"The 74HC4075 is a high-speed CMOS logic integrated circuit that contains three independent 3-input OR gates. Each gate produces a HIGH output when any one or more of its three inputs are HIGH, making the device useful for combining multiple logic signals in digital circuits. Because it belongs to the HC logic family, the IC offers low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance, which are important for reliable operation in modern electronic designs.\",\"info\":\"The 74HC4075 typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, allowing it to be used with both low-voltage and standard 5-volt digital systems. It is commonly available in DIP-14 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB layouts. Due to its simple OR logic function and stable performance, the IC is widely used in digital control circuits, signal combining stages, alarm logic systems, microcontroller interfacing, and general-purpose logic design applications in educational, hobby, and industrial electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773393052659-185706659.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 09:10:52'),
(4964,1,'product',3013,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HC4538\",\"description\":\"The 74HC4538 is a high-speed CMOS dual precision monostable multivibrator (one-shot timer) integrated circuit used in digital and timing applications to generate accurate pulse widths. It contains two independent monostable circuits, each capable of producing a single output pulse when triggered by an input signal. The duration of the output pulse can be set using external resistor and capacitor components, allowing designers to create precise delays or timing intervals.\",\"info\":\"This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, high noise immunity, and stable operation typical of CMOS logic devices. It supports triggering from both rising and falling edges, and includes features such as retriggerable operation and reset control, which provide flexibility in pulse generation and timing control circuits. The device is commonly available in DIP-16 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for both breadboard prototyping and compact PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773393398425-991589316.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 09:16:38'),
(4965,1,'product',3014,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74F74\",\"description\":\"The 74F74 is a high-speed TTL dual D-type positive-edge-triggered flip-flop integrated circuit used in digital electronics for storing and synchronizing binary data. It contains two independent flip-flops, each having inputs for Data (D), Clock (CLK), Preset (PRE), and Clear (CLR) along with complementary outputs Q and Q̅. On the rising edge of the clock signal, the logic level present at the D input is transferred to the Q output, allowing reliable data storage and timing control in sequential logic circuits.\",\"info\":\"This device belongs to the Fast TTL (74F) logic family, which provides very high switching speed and low propagation delay compared to standard TTL devices, making it suitable for high-frequency digital systems. The IC typically operates with a 5 V power supply, and its asynchronous preset and clear inputs allow immediate setting or resetting of the flip-flop outputs independent of the clock. It is usually available in DIP-14 and surface-mount packages, enabling easy use in breadboard prototypes as well as compact PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773394476561-404364682.png\"}','2026-03-13 09:34:36'),
(4966,1,'product',3015,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"75150\",\"description\":\"The 75150 is a 16-channel digital multiplexer integrated circuit commonly used in digital electronics to select one input signal from multiple data lines and route it to a single output. It features sixteen input channels and four binary select (address) inputs, which determine which input is connected to the output at any given time. This makes it useful for expanding data handling capability in microcontroller systems, communication circuits, and digital control applications where multiple signals must be monitored or processed using limited input lines.\",\"info\":\"The device is typically designed to operate with a standard 5 V logic supply, and many versions use TTL-compatible logic levels, allowing easy interfacing with microprocessors, memory circuits, and other logic devices. Some variants provide inverted or active-LOW output logic, so designers must consider this while integrating the IC into their circuit. The 75150 is usually available in DIP packages, making it suitable for breadboard experiments as well as PCB implementations.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773394714690-155543322.jpeg\"}','2026-03-13 09:38:34'),
(4967,1,'product',3016,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ULN2003 IC\",\"description\":\"The ULN2003 IC is a popular 7-channel Darlington transistor driver array used in electronic circuits to control high-voltage or high-current loads using low-power logic signals from microcontrollers and digital ICs. Each channel consists of a pair of transistors connected in a Darlington configuration, which provides high current gain and allows output currents up to about 500 mA per channel with load voltages up to around 50 V. This makes the IC suitable for driving devices such as relays, stepper motors, solenoids, lamps, buzzers, and LED arrays.\",\"info\":\"The ULN2003 features open-collector outputs and includes built-in flyback protection diodes connected to a common COM pin, which helps protect the circuit from voltage spikes produced by inductive loads. It is designed to work directly with TTL and CMOS logic levels, making it easy to interface with controllers like Arduino, PIC, AVR, and other embedded systems. The IC usually operates from a standard logic input supply and does not require a separate driver stage, simplifying circuit design.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773396606560-724352896.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 10:10:06'),
(4968,1,'product',3017,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ULN2004 IC\",\"description\":\"The ULN2004 IC is a 7-channel high-current Darlington transistor array designed to drive relays, solenoids, stepper motors, lamps, LED strips, and other inductive or high-power loads from digital control circuits. Each channel consists of a Darlington pair configuration, providing high current gain and allowing the device to switch load voltages up to about 50 V and currents up to around 500 mA per channel. This makes the IC suitable for interfacing control systems with external devices that require higher current than standard logic outputs can provide.\",\"info\":\"Unlike the ULN2003, the ULN2004 is intended for higher input logic voltage levels (typically 6 V to 15 V), making it compatible with certain CMOS or PMOS logic families and industrial control circuits. The IC features open-collector outputs and includes built-in flyback protection diodes connected to a common COM pin, which helps protect the circuit from voltage spikes generated by inductive loads. It is commonly available in DIP-16 and surface-mount packages, allowing easy use in prototyping as well as production PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773396804103-359397396.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 10:13:24'),
(4969,1,'product',3018,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ULN2803 IC\",\"description\":\"The ULN2803 IC is a widely used 8-channel Darlington transistor driver array designed to interface low-power digital logic circuits with high-current or high-voltage loads. It contains eight Darlington pair transistor stages, each capable of switching load voltages up to about 50 V and currents up to around 500 mA per channel, making it suitable for driving relays, stepper motors, solenoids, lamps, buzzers, and LED arrays. Because of the high current gain of the Darlington configuration, the IC allows microcontrollers and logic ICs to control larger electrical devices safely and efficiently.\",\"info\":\"The ULN2803 features open-collector outputs and includes built-in flyback protection diodes connected to a common COM pin, which help protect the circuit from voltage spikes generated by inductive loads. It is compatible with TTL and CMOS logic levels, so it can be easily interfaced with controllers such as Arduino, PIC, AVR, and other digital systems. The device is commonly available in DIP-18 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for both breadboard prototyping and compact PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773398037703-976719069.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 10:33:57'),
(4970,1,'product',3019,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ULN2804 IC\",\"description\":\"The ULN2804 IC is an 8-channel Darlington transistor driver array used in electronic circuits to control high-current or higher-voltage loads from logic-level control signals. It contains eight Darlington pair driver stages, each capable of switching load voltages up to about 50 V and currents up to around 500 mA per channel, making it suitable for driving devices such as relays, solenoids, stepper motors, lamps, and LED arrays. The Darlington configuration provides high current gain, allowing low-power control circuits to operate larger electrical loads safely.\",\"info\":\"Unlike the ULN2803, the ULN2804 is designed for higher input logic voltage levels (typically 6 V to 15 V CMOS / PMOS logic systems), which makes it suitable for certain industrial and control applications. The IC features open-collector outputs and includes built-in flyback (clamp) diodes connected to a common COM pin, protecting the circuit from voltage spikes generated by inductive loads. It is commonly available in DIP-18 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773398167018-63548521.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 10:36:07'),
(4971,1,'product',3020,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IC KP1010\",\"description\":\"The KP1010 IC is an electronic siren / alarm sound generator integrated circuit commonly used in security alarms, warning systems, and sound effect applications. It is designed to produce loud multi-tone or sweeping siren sounds when triggered, making it suitable for burglar alarms, fire alarms, vehicle security systems, and emergency alert devices. The IC typically works with a simple external circuit consisting of a few resistors, capacitors, and an audio amplifier or speaker, allowing easy integration into alarm designs.\",\"info\":\"This sound generator IC usually operates from a low DC supply voltage (around 3 V to 12 V depending on circuit design) and offers low power consumption with stable oscillation performance. It can generate different sound patterns such as wailing, warble, or continuous tone, depending on the external component values and triggering method. The KP1010 is generally available in DIP packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as PCB assembly.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773398563886-950114146.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 10:42:43'),
(4972,1,'product',3020,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\" KP1010 IC\",\"description\":\"The KP1010 IC is an electronic siren / alarm sound generator integrated circuit commonly used in security alarms, warning systems, and sound effect applications. It is designed to produce loud multi-tone or sweeping siren sounds when triggered, making it suitable for burglar alarms, fire alarms, vehicle security systems, and emergency alert devices. The IC typically works with a simple external circuit consisting of a few resistors, capacitors, and an audio amplifier or speaker, allowing easy integration into alarm designs.\",\"info\":\"This sound generator IC usually operates from a low DC supply voltage (around 3 V to 12 V depending on circuit design) and offers low power consumption with stable oscillation performance. It can generate different sound patterns such as wailing, warble, or continuous tone, depending on the external component values and triggering method. The KP1010 is generally available in DIP packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as PCB assembly.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"49.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":73,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-13 10:43:13'),
(4973,1,'product',3021,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"KP2010 IC\",\"description\":\"The KP2010 IC is an electronic melody / siren sound generator integrated circuit commonly used in alarm systems, doorbells, toys, and simple audio alert devices. It is designed to produce predefined musical tones or warning sound patterns when triggered, allowing designers to create attention-grabbing sound indications with minimal external components. The IC typically requires only a few resistors, capacitors, and a small audio amplifier or transistor stage to drive a speaker or buzzer, making circuit design simple and cost-effective.\",\"info\":\"The KP2010 usually operates from a low DC supply voltage (around 3 V to 12 V depending on the application circuit) and offers stable oscillation and low power consumption, which makes it suitable for battery-powered products. It is generally available in a DIP package, allowing easy use in breadboard prototyping as well as PCB assembly. Because of its compact design and reliable sound generation capability, the KP2010 IC is widely used in security alarms, calling bells, electronic toys, industrial warning systems, and DIY sound effect projects where audible alerts or melody tones are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773398710186-710478606.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 10:45:10'),
(4974,1,'product',3022,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"KP3010 IC\",\"description\":\"The KP3010 IC is an electronic siren / melody sound generator integrated circuit used in alarm and alert applications to produce loud warning tones or musical sound patterns. It is designed for simple implementation in circuits such as security alarms, fire warning systems, calling bells, electronic toys, and attention-signal devices. The IC generally requires only a few external components like resistors, capacitors, and a transistor or small audio amplifier stage to drive a speaker, making it easy to design compact and cost-effective sound circuits.\",\"info\":\"The KP3010 typically operates from a low DC supply voltage (about 3 V to 12 V depending on circuit configuration) and provides stable oscillation with low power consumption, which makes it suitable for battery-powered systems. It is commonly available in DIP packages, allowing convenient use in breadboard experiments as well as permanent PCB assembly. Because of its simple circuit requirement, reliable sound generation, and wide usability, the KP3010 IC is widely used in alarm units, door chimes, industrial warning indicators, and DIY electronic sound projects where clear audible alerts are needed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773398839902-692061918.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 10:47:19'),
(4975,1,'product',3023,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"74HCT373\",\"description\":\"The 74HCT373 is a high-speed TTL-compatible CMOS octal transparent latch integrated circuit used in digital electronics for temporary storage and buffering of 8-bit parallel data. It contains eight D-type latches with three-state outputs, allowing data applied at the input pins (D0–D7) to appear at the output pins (Q0–Q7) whenever the Latch Enable (LE) input is HIGH. When the LE signal goes LOW, the data present at that moment is latched and held at the outputs until a new enable signal is applied, making the device useful for synchronized data transfer and bus management.\",\"info\":\"The IC also features an Output Enable (OE) control, which can place all outputs into a high-impedance (tri-state) state, allowing multiple devices to share the same data bus without interference. Unlike standard HC devices, the HCT series provides TTL-level input compatibility, so the 74HCT373 can be easily interfaced with older TTL logic systems as well as modern CMOS circuits. It typically operates from a 5 V supply voltage, offering low power consumption, fast switching speed, and reliable performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773399583726-995735903.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 10:59:43'),
(4976,1,'product',3024,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"HT9370\",\"description\":\"The HT9370 is a DTMF (Dual Tone Multi-Frequency) receiver / decoder integrated circuit commonly used in communication and remote-control systems to detect telephone keypad tones and convert them into digital output signals. It is designed to recognize the standard DTMF tone pairs generated when a key is pressed on a telephone or GSM module, making it useful for applications such as remote switching, IVRS systems, security control units, and automation projects.\",\"info\":\"This IC typically works with a low DC supply voltage (around 5 V) and requires only a few external components such as resistors, capacitors, and a crystal or timing network for stable tone decoding. The HT9370 provides binary-coded digital outputs corresponding to the pressed key, which can be directly interfaced with microcontrollers, logic circuits, or relay driver stages. It also includes features like tone detection indication and data valid output, helping ensure reliable operation in noisy communication environments.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773400074222-570857564.jpg\"}','2026-03-13 11:07:54'),
(4977,1,'product',3025,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CAT6 1.5  Networking Cable\",\"description\":\"This cable is made with twisted copper wire pairs and RJ45 connectors on both ends. The 1.5 meter length makes it suitable for neat and short connections such as router-to-computer or switch-to-Smart TV links.\",\"info\":\"CAT6 cables provide better performance and reduced signal interference compared to older CAT5e cables.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[497],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Do not bend the cable sharply or pull it forcefully.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773457879822-448702457.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 03:11:19'),
(4978,1,'product',3026,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CAT6 3 Meter  Networking Cable\",\"description\":\"CAT6 stands for Category-6 network cable, designed for high-speed data transmission.Supports Gigabit speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for short distances.\",\"info\":\"The 3-meter length is ideal for connecting devices placed a few feet apart.Available in UTP (unshielded), FTP or STP (shielded) variants depending on requirement.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[497],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Avoid sharp bending or twisting of the cable\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773458311718-673545562.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 03:18:31'),
(4979,1,'product',3027,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Cat 5 Meter Network Cable  \",\"description\":\"CAT6 means Category-6 networking cable designed for high-speed data transfer.Supports Gigabit internet speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for short distances.\",\"info\":\"Usually comes with RJ45 connectors on both ends for plug-and-play installation.The 5-meter length is suitable when devices are not very close to the router.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[497],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Keep away from water, heat, and heavy objects\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773459299182-448521519.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 03:34:59'),
(4980,1,'product',3028,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"APR33A3 C2\",\"description\":\"APR33A3-C2 is a compact voice recording and playback integrated circuit used for storing and reproducing audio messages in electronic applications. It features built-in non-volatile flash memory, which allows recorded sound to be retained even when the power supply is turned off.\",\"info\":\"The IC supports direct connection of a microphone for recording and a small speaker for playback, and it can be operated using simple push-button controls or through a microcontroller interface. It works with a low operating voltage of about 2.4V to 5.5V, making it suitable for battery-powered devices. APR33A3-C2 is widely used in voice alarm systems, talking toys, announcement devices, educational projects, and DIY sound recorder modules due to its easy circuit design and reliable performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773459762497-715467842.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 03:42:42'),
(4981,1,'product',3028,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"APR33A3 C2\",\"description\":\"APR33A3-C2 is a compact voice recording and playback integrated circuit used for storing and reproducing audio messages in electronic applications. It features built-in non-volatile flash memory, which allows recorded sound to be retained even when the power supply is turned off.\",\"info\":\"The IC supports direct connection of a microphone for recording and a small speaker for playback, and it can be operated using simple push-button controls or through a microcontroller interface. It works with a low operating voltage of about 2.4V to 5.5V, making it suitable for battery-powered devices. APR33A3-C2 is widely used in voice alarm systems, talking toys, announcement devices, educational projects, and DIY sound recorder modules due to its easy circuit design and reliable performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"49.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":\"90\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-14 03:43:35'),
(4982,1,'product',3029,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CAT6 10 Meter  Networking Cable\",\"description\":\"A CAT6 10-meter networking cable is a medium-long Ethernet (LAN) cable used to connect devices like routers, computers, Smart TVs, switches, CCTV DVR/NVR, and gaming consoles.\",\"info\":\"It is suitable for room-to-room or longer indoor network connections.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[497],\"alternative_name\":\"Networking Cable\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Do not run parallel to high-voltage power cables\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773459860618-781133272.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 03:44:20'),
(4983,1,'product',3030,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CAT6   15 Meter Networking Cable\",\"description\":\"CAT6 means Category-6 cable, designed for high-speed and stable data transmission.Supports Gigabit internet speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for shorter distances.\",\"info\":\"A CAT6 15-meter networking cable is a medium-long Ethernet (LAN) cable used to connect devices like routers, computers, Smart TVs, switches, CCTV DVR/NVR, gaming consoles, and network printers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[497],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Avoid sharp bending, twisting, or stretching the cable\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773460046049-766553276.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 03:47:26'),
(4984,1,'product',3031,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"AP89010\",\"description\":\"AP89010 is a compact voice recording and playback integrated circuit designed for storing and reproducing audio messages in various electronic applications. It features built-in non-volatile memory, which allows recorded voice data to be retained even after the power supply is turned off. The IC supports direct connection of an electret microphone for recording and a small speaker for playback, enabling simple sound module design without the need for complex programming or external memory components.\",\"info\":\"It operates on a low DC supply voltage, making it suitable for battery-powered devices such as talking toys, voice alarm systems, door announcement units, and educational electronics projects. Due to its easy interfacing, low power consumption, and reliable audio performance, the AP89010 is widely used in DIY sound recorder modules and embedded voice indication systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773460175149-685432768.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 03:49:35'),
(4985,1,'product',3032,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4013\",\"description\":\"CD4013 is a CMOS dual D-type flip-flop integrated circuit widely used in digital electronics for data storage, signal control, and timing operations. It contains two independent flip-flops, each provided with Data (D), Clock (CLK), Set, Reset, and complementary outputs (Q and Q̅), allowing flexible logic design. The IC stores the logic level present at the D input when a clock pulse is applied and holds this state until the next triggering event. It operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, making it suitable for both battery-powered and regulated power supply circuits.\",\"info\":\"CD4013 offers low power consumption, high noise immunity, and stable CMOS performance, which helps in reliable digital switching applications. It can also be configured as a toggle flip-flop, frequency divider, or simple memory element in sequential logic systems. The IC is commonly used in LED flasher circuits, digital counters, timing circuits, debounce systems, alarm controllers, and electronic project designs. Due to its simple interfacing and versatile operation, CD4013 remains a popular choice for students, hobbyists, and embedded circuit developers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773460463544-585473202.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 03:54:23'),
(4986,1,'product',3033,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CAT6   20 Meter Networking Cable\",\"description\":\"A CAT6 20-meter networking cable is a long-length Ethernet (LAN) cable used to connect network devices such as routers, computers, Smart TVs, switches, CCTV DVR/NVR, gaming consoles, and access points.\",\"info\":\"It is suitable for room-to-room or floor-to-floor wired internet connections in homes, offices, and shops.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[497],\"alternative_name\":\"Networking Cable CAT6   \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Keep away from water, heat sources, and heavy pressure\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773460584459-470868640.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 03:56:24'),
(4987,1,'product',1147,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4023\",\"description\":\"The CD4023 is a CMOS logic integrated circuit that contains three independent 3-input NAND gates within a single package.\",\"info\":\"The CD4023 contains three independent NAND gates, each with three inputs. Using CMOS technology, it offers very low power consumption, high noise immunity, and a wide operating voltage range, making it suitable for low-power and general digital logic applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":230},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":230}],\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773460616214-979017243.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 03:56:56'),
(4988,1,'product',3034,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4051\",\"description\":\"D4051 is a CMOS 8-channel analog multiplexer / demultiplexer integrated circuit used to select one signal from multiple analog or digital inputs. It allows eight input channels (X0 to X7) to be connected to a single common output using three control select lines\",\"info\":\"The IC can handle both analog and digital signals, making it useful in signal routing, data acquisition, and switching applications. It operates over a wide supply voltage range (about 3V to 18V) and offers low power consumption with high noise immunity, typical of CMOS devices. CD4051 is commonly used in sensor selection circuits, audio signal switching, microcontroller input expansion, communication systems, and various electronic projects due to its simple control and reliable performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773460888604-77500329.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 04:01:28'),
(4989,1,'product',3035,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CAT6   25 Meter Networking Cable\",\"description\":\"CAT6 means Category-6 cable, designed for high-speed and stable data transmission.Supports Gigabit speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for shorter distances.\",\"info\":\"Usually fitted with RJ45 connectors on both ends for plug-and-play use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[497],\"alternative_name\":\" Networking Cable\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Keep away from water, heat, and heavy pressure\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773460898159-37702541.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 04:01:38'),
(4990,1,'product',3036,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4066\",\"description\":\"CD4066 is a CMOS quad bilateral switch integrated circuit used for switching and controlling analog or digital signals in electronic circuits. It contains four independent electronic switches, each having input, output, and control pins that allow signals to pass when the control input is HIGH. The IC can handle both AC and DC signals and is commonly used for signal gating, audio switching, and data routing applications.\",\"info\":\"CD4066 operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 3V to 15V, offering low power consumption and high noise immunity typical of CMOS technology. It is widely used in audio mixers, sample-and-hold circuits, analog signal selection, digital switching circuits, and microcontroller-based projects due to its simple operation and reliable performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773461690384-789502283.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 04:14:50'),
(4991,1,'product',3037,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4068\",\"description\":\"CD4068 is a CMOS 8-input NAND gate integrated circuit used in digital logic and control applications. It combines eight input signals into a single NAND output, which becomes LOW only when all inputs are HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, offering low power consumption and high noise immunity, typical of CMOS devices\",\"info\":\"CD4068 is commonly used in logic control circuits, alarm systems, timing circuits, industrial control units, and electronic project designs where multiple signal conditions must be monitored simultaneously. Its simple design, reliable operation, and easy interfacing make it useful for both educational and practical digital electronics applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773461810546-262512592.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 04:16:50'),
(4992,1,'product',3038,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CAT6    30 Meter Networking Cable\",\"description\":\"CAT6 means Category-6 network cable, designed for high-speed and stable data transmission.Supports Gigabit speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for shorter distances.\",\"info\":\"It is suitable for floor-to-floor or long room-to-room wired internet connections in homes, offices, and shops.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[497],\"model\":\" Networking Cable\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Do not run parallel to high-voltage power cables to reduce interference\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773462089851-378370622.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 04:21:29'),
(4993,1,'product',3039,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4069\",\"description\":\"CD4069 is a CMOS hex inverter integrated circuit that contains six independent NOT gates used for logic signal inversion in digital electronic circuits. Each inverter gate produces an output that is the opposite logic level of its input, converting HIGH to LOW and LOW to HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, making it suitable for both low-power battery devices and regulated power supply systems. It offers low power consumption, high input impedance, and good noise immunity, which are important features of CMOS technology.\",\"info\":\"D4069 is commonly used in oscillator circuits, waveform generators, signal shaping, logic level conversion, and timing applications. It can also be used as a simple amplifier for low-frequency analog signals when properly biased. The IC is helpful in digital switching circuits, LED flasher circuits, alarm systems, and pulse generation designs\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773462275877-868179883.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 04:24:35'),
(4994,1,'product',3040,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4071\",\"description\":\"CD4071 is a CMOS quad 2-input OR gate integrated circuit used in digital logic and control applications. It contains four independent OR gates, each designed to produce a HIGH output when any one or both of its inputs are HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 3V to 15V, making it suitable for battery-powered as well as regulated electronic circuits. It features low power consumption, high noise immunity, and high input impedance, which are typical advantages of CMOS technology.\",\"info\":\"CD4071 is commonly used in logic decision circuits, alarm and security systems, digital switching, signal combining, and timing control circuits. It can also be applied in microcontroller interface projects, automation systems, and educational electronics experiments where multiple input conditions must be logically combined. Due to its simple operation, reliable performance, and easy interfacing, CD4071 is widely used in hobby circuits and industrial digital control designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773462696180-669856318.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 04:31:36'),
(4995,1,'product',3041,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4073\",\"description\":\"CD4073 is a CMOS triple 3-input AND gate integrated circuit used in digital logic and control applications. It contains three independent AND gates, each designed to produce a HIGH output only when all three inputs of that gate are HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, making it suitable for both battery-operated and regulated power supply circuits. It offers low power consumption, high noise immunity, and high input impedance, which are key advantages of CMOS technology.\",\"info\":\"CD4073 is commonly used in logic decision circuits, timing control systems, alarm and security circuits, digital switching applications, and automation projects. It is also useful in microcontroller interface designs, condition monitoring systems, and educational electronics experiments where multiple signal conditions must be satisfied before generating an output. Due to its simple design, reliable operation, and easy interfacing, CD4073 is widely used in hobby electronics and industrial digital control circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773462816290-680300555.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 04:33:36'),
(4996,1,'product',3042,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4081\",\"description\":\"CD4081 is a CMOS quad 2-input AND gate integrated circuit used in digital logic and control applications. It contains four independent AND gates, each producing a HIGH output only when both of its inputs are HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, making it suitable for battery-powered as well as regulated electronic circuits. It features low power consumption, high noise immunity, and high input impedance, which are important advantages of CMOS technology.\",\"info\":\"CD4081 is commonly used in logic decision circuits, timing and control systems, digital switching, automation circuits, and alarm systems. It is also applied in microcontroller interface projects, counters, LED control circuits, and educational electronics experiments where multiple conditions must be satisfied to produce an output. Due to its simple operation, reliable performance, and easy interfacing, CD4081 is widely used in hobby electronics and industrial digital control designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773462918439-316137115.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 04:35:18'),
(4997,1,'product',3027,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Cat6   5 Meter Network Cable  \",\"description\":\"CAT6 means Category-6 networking cable designed for high-speed data transfer.Supports Gigabit internet speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for short distances.\",\"info\":\"Usually comes with RJ45 connectors on both ends for plug-and-play installation.The 5-meter length is suitable when devices are not very close to the router.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"Keep away from water, heat, and heavy objects\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":115,\"secondary_id\":406,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-14 04:36:07'),
(4998,1,'product',3043,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4082\",\"description\":\"CD4082 is a CMOS dual 4-input AND gate integrated circuit used in digital logic and control systems. It contains two independent AND gates, and each gate produces a HIGH output only when all four of its input signals are HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 3V to 15V, making it suitable for both battery-powered and regulated power supply circuits. It offers low power consumption, high noise immunity, and high input impedance, which are key advantages of CMOS technology.\",\"info\":\"CD4082 is commonly used in logic decision circuits, timing and control applications, digital switching systems, alarm circuits, and automation projects where multiple input conditions must be satisfied before generating an output. It is also useful in microcontroller interface designs, signal gating, industrial control units, and educational electronics experiments due to its simple operation, reliable performance, and easy interfacing.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773463871222-702518090.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 04:51:11'),
(4999,1,'product',3044,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"VGA to HDMI Cable \",\"description\":\"VGA is an analog video signal, while HDMI is a digital audio-video signal.Therefore, most VGA to HDMI cables include an active converter circuit to change the signal format.\",\"info\":\"Commonly used in offices, schools, presentations, and home TV connections\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[485],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Use the cable only with compatible devices (VGA output → HDMI input).\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773463872257-177136915.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 04:51:12'),
(5000,1,'product',3045,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4093\",\"description\":\"CD4093 is a CMOS quad 2-input NAND gate integrated circuit with Schmitt trigger inputs, widely used in digital and timing applications. It contains four independent NAND gates, each designed to produce a LOW output only when both inputs are HIGH, while the Schmitt trigger feature provides improved noise immunity and clean switching action. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, making it suitable for battery-powered and regulated electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"Due to its hysteresis characteristics, CD4093 is commonly used in oscillator circuits, waveform shaping, debounce circuits, pulse generation, timing control, and signal conditioning applications. It is also applied in alarm systems, digital switching circuits, automation projects, and microcontroller interface designs where stable logic transitions are required. With its low power consumption, simple interfacing, and reliable performance, CD4093 is popular in educational electronics projects, hobby circuits, and industrial control systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773464038137-490141426.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 04:53:58'),
(5001,1,'product',3046,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD4094\",\"description\":\"CD4094 is a CMOS 8-stage shift and store register integrated circuit used for serial-to-parallel data conversion and digital output expansion. It allows data to be shifted in serially through a data input and clock signal, then stored and made available simultaneously at the parallel output pins. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 3V to 15V, offering low power consumption, high noise immunity, and stable CMOS performance.\",\"info\":\"CD4094 is commonly used in LED display control, output port expansion for microcontrollers, digital data storage, signal sequencing, and automation circuits. It also finds applications in timing systems, light chaser circuits, and educational electronics projects where multiple outputs need to be controlled using fewer control lines. Due to its simple interfacing, reliable operation, and flexible data handling capability, CD4094 is widely used in hobby electronics and embedded digital designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773464132519-63911782.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 04:55:32'),
(5002,1,'product',3047,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"USB to hdmi cable \",\"description\":\"A USB to HDMI cable (or adapter) is used to connect a computer or laptop USB port to an HDMI display like LED TV, monitor, or projector.\",\"info\":\"It converts the USB data signal into digital HDMI audio-video output.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[485],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"Keep the cable and adapter away from direct sunlight, heaters, and hot surfaces.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773464520232-384690945.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 05:02:00'),
(5003,1,'product',3048,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD40106\",\"description\":\"CD40106 is a CMOS hex Schmitt trigger inverter integrated circuit used in digital and timing applications. It contains six independent inverter gates, each with Schmitt trigger input characteristics that provide hysteresis for clean and stable switching of slow or noisy signals. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, offering low power consumption, high noise immunity, and high input impedance, which are typical advantages of CMOS technology.\",\"info\":\"CD40106 is commonly used in oscillator circuits, waveform generators, debounce circuits, pulse shaping, timing circuits, and signal conditioning applications. It is also useful in LED flashers, tone generators, alarm systems, and microcontroller interface designs where reliable logic transitions are required. Due to its simple operation, versatility, and stable performance, CD40106 is widely used in educational electronics projects, hobby circuits, and industrial control systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773465035338-945714227.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 05:10:35'),
(5004,1,'product',3049,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CD40193\",\"description\":\"CD40193 is a CMOS presettable up/down binary counter integrated circuit used in digital counting and sequencing applications. It is a 4-bit synchronous counter, meaning it can count both upward and downward in binary form depending on the control inputs. The IC includes separate clock inputs for UP and DOWN counting, as well as parallel preset inputs that allow a specific count value to be loaded directly. It operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, providing low power consumption and high noise immunity, which are key features of CMOS devices.\",\"info\":\"CD40193 is commonly used in digital clocks, event counters, frequency division circuits, display systems, automation controls, and microcontroller interface projects. It can also be applied in timing circuits, sequence generators, and electronic measurement systems where accurate counting in both directions is required. Due to its flexible operation, simple interfacing, and reliable performance, CD40193 is widely used in educational electronics experiments, hobby designs, and industrial digital control circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773465111009-550260454.jpeg\"}','2026-03-14 05:11:51'),
(5005,1,'product',3050,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"REG 7815\",\"description\":\"7815 is a fixed positive voltage regulator integrated circuit used to provide a stable +15V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It belongs to the popular 78xx voltage regulator series, where the last two digits indicate the output voltage value. The IC accepts a higher unregulated DC input voltage (typically around 17V to 35V) and regulates it to a constant 15V output.\",\"info\":\"The 7815 regulator includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and safe operating area protection, which help prevent damage due to overheating or short circuits. It is commonly used in power supply units, amplifier circuits, industrial control systems, communication equipment, and electronic project designs that require a reliable +15V supply. For proper operation and stability, input and output filter capacitors are usually connected near the IC terminals. Due to its simple usage, stable output voltage, and rugged performance, the 7815 is widely used in analog and digital electronic circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773465562242-391664520.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 05:19:22'),
(5006,1,'product',3051,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"REG 7818\",\"description\":\"7818 is a fixed positive voltage regulator integrated circuit designed to provide a stable +18V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It is part of the widely used 78xx regulator series, where the number indicates the regulated output voltage. The IC accepts a higher unregulated DC input voltage (typically about 20V to 35V) and converts it into a constant 18V output suitable for various electronic devices.\",\"info\":\"The 7818 includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection, which help ensure safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in audio amplifier power supplies, communication equipment, industrial control circuits, laboratory power units, and general electronic projects that require a stable +18V supply. For best performance, input and output capacitors are connected near the regulator pins to improve filtering and stability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773466676356-681640828.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 05:37:56'),
(5007,1,'product',3052,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"7905\",\"description\":\"7905 is a fixed negative voltage regulator integrated circuit used to provide a stable –5V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It belongs to the 79xx series of negative voltage regulators, where the last two digits indicate the regulated output voltage value. The IC accepts a more negative unregulated DC input voltage (typically around –7V to –25V) and regulates it to a constant –5V output.\",\"info\":\"The 7905 regulator includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, internal current limiting, and short-circuit protection to ensure safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in dual power supply systems, operational amplifier circuits, communication equipment, industrial control units, and electronic project designs that require a stable negative voltage\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[657],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773467433141-932645228.jpg\"}','2026-03-14 05:50:33'),
