(5141,1,'product',3177,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TOP234Y\",\"description\":\"TOP234Y is an integrated offline switch-mode power supply (SMPS) controller IC designed for efficient AC-DC power conversion in compact electronic devices. It combines a high-voltage power MOSFET, PWM control circuitry, oscillator, current limiting, thermal shutdown, and fault protection features within a single package, which helps reduce external component count and simplifies power supply design. The IC is intended to operate directly from rectified AC mains input, making it suitable for low-to-medium power offline converter applications.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high efficiency and built-in protection functions, the TOP234Y is widely used in battery chargers, TV and set-top box power supplies, standby SMPS units, LED driver circuits, adapters, and various consumer or industrial power conversion systems. It is typically available in a TO-220 style package, allowing effective heat dissipation when mounted on a suitable heat sink or PCB copper area. For reliable operation, designers usually include proper input EMI filtering, snubber networks, feedback regulation circuitry, and careful PCB layout techniques to ensure safe and stable power conversion.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773718822685-467935071.jpeg\"}','2026-03-17 03:40:22'),
(5142,1,'product',3178,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TOP243Y\",\"description\":\"TOP243Y is an integrated offline switch-mode power supply (SMPS) controller IC from Power Integrations, designed for efficient and compact AC-DC power conversion. The device combines a high-voltage power MOSFET, PWM controller, oscillator, current limit protection, thermal shutdown, and auto-restart fault protection within a single chip. This integration reduces the number of external components and simplifies the design of offline flyback or forward converter power supplies. It is intended to operate directly from rectified AC mains, making it suitable for cost-effective and reliable power supply solutions.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high efficiency, built-in protection features, and simple implementation, the TOP243Y is widely used in battery chargers, adapters, standby power supplies, TV and set-top box SMPS circuits, LED driver units, industrial auxiliary power supplies, and consumer electronic equipment. It is typically available in a TO-220 style package, which allows effective heat dissipation when mounted on a suitable heat sink or PCB copper area. For stable and reliable performance, designers usually include proper input EMI filtering, snubber networks, feedback regulation components, and careful PCB layout practices to ensure safe and efficient power conversion.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773718922491-733636336.jpeg\"}','2026-03-17 03:42:02'),
