(5151,1,'product',3186,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TOP254EN\",\"description\":\"TOP254EN is an advanced offline switch-mode power supply (SMPS) controller IC from Power Integrations, designed for efficient AC-DC conversion in medium-power electronic equipment. It integrates a high-voltage power MOSFET, PWM controller, oscillator, current limiting, thermal shutdown, line under-voltage detection, and auto-restart protection within a single device. This high level of integration reduces external component count, improves reliability, and simplifies the design of flyback and forward converter power supplies. The IC is intended to operate directly from rectified AC mains input, making it suitable for compact and cost-effective power supply solutions.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high efficiency and comprehensive protection features, the TOP254EN is widely used in LCD/LED TV SMPS units, adapters, battery chargers, standby power supplies, industrial auxiliary supplies, LED driver circuits, and other consumer or industrial offline power conversion systems. It is typically available in an eSIP / TO-220-style package, which allows effective heat dissipation when mounted on a heat sink or PCB copper area. For reliable operation, designers generally include proper input EMI filtering, snubber networks, feedback regulation circuitry, and careful PCB layout practices to ensure safe and stable power conversion.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773720137349-396904421.jpeg\"}','2026-03-17 04:02:17'),
