(5156,1,'product',3191,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TOP260EN\",\"description\":\"TOP260EN is a high-efficiency offline switch-mode power supply (SMPS) controller IC from Power Integrations, designed for compact and reliable AC-DC power conversion in medium-to-high power applications. The device integrates a high-voltage power MOSFET, PWM controller, oscillator, current-limit protection, thermal shutdown, line under-voltage detection, and auto-restart fault protection within a single package. This high level of integration reduces the need for external components, simplifies circuit design, and improves overall system reliability. It is intended to operate directly from rectified AC mains input, making it suitable for offline flyback and forward converter topologies.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high efficiency and built-in safety features, the TOP260EN is widely used in LCD/LED TV power supplies, power adapters, battery chargers, standby SMPS units, industrial auxiliary supplies, LED driver circuits, and various consumer or industrial AC-DC converter systems. It is typically available in an eSIP / TO-220-style package, allowing effective heat dissipation when mounted on a suitable heat sink or PCB copper area. For stable and safe operation, designers usually include proper input EMI filtering, snubber networks, feedback regulation circuitry, and careful PCB layout techniques to ensure efficient and long-term power conversion performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773721066870-561001210.jpeg\"}','2026-03-17 04:17:46'),
