(5158,1,'product',3193,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TNY253PN\",\"description\":\"TNY253PN is an integrated offline switch-mode power supply (SMPS) controller IC from Power Integrations, belonging to the TinySwitch series. It combines a high-voltage power MOSFET, PWM controller, oscillator, current limiting, thermal shutdown, and auto-restart protection within a single device, which helps reduce external component count and simplifies the design of compact AC-DC power supplies. The IC is designed to operate directly from rectified AC mains input, making it suitable for low-power offline converter applications.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high efficiency, low standby power consumption, and built-in protection features, the TNY253PN is widely used in mobile chargers, standby power supplies, small adapters, TV auxiliary supplies, LED driver circuits, and various consumer electronic SMPS designs. It is typically available in a DIP-8 package, allowing easy PCB mounting for both prototype and production designs. For reliable performance, designers generally include proper input EMI filtering, snubber networks, feedback regulation components, and careful PCB layout to ensure stable and safe power conversion.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773721982049-177334523.jpeg\"}','2026-03-17 04:33:02'),
