(5175,1,'product',3209,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LNK302PN\",\"description\":\"LNK302PN is an integrated offline switch-mode power supply (SMPS) switching IC from the LinkSwitch-TN series by Power Integrations. It combines a high-voltage power MOSFET, oscillator, simple ON/OFF control, current-limit protection, thermal shutdown, and auto-restart fault protection in a single compact device. This high level of integration helps reduce the number of external components and simplifies the design of low-power non-isolated AC-DC converter circuits. The IC is designed to operate directly from rectified AC mains input, making it suitable for compact and cost-effective power supply solutions.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high efficiency and low standby power consumption, the LNK302PN is widely used in LED driver circuits, small battery chargers, appliance control power supplies, standby SMPS units, industrial control circuits, and various consumer electronic auxiliary power supplies. It is typically available in a DIP-7 package, allowing convenient PCB mounting and reliable operation in practical designs. For stable and safe performance, designers generally include proper input EMI filtering, snubber or surge protection components, output filtering, and careful PCB layout techniques to ensure efficient and long-term power conversion\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773729490005-547013280.jpg\"}','2026-03-17 06:38:10'),
(5176,1,'product',3210,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LNK305PN\",\"description\":\"LNK305PN is an integrated offline switch-mode power supply (SMPS) switching IC from the LinkSwitch-TN series by Power Integrations. It incorporates a high-voltage power MOSFET, internal oscillator, ON/OFF control scheme, current-limit protection, thermal shutdown, and auto-restart fault protection within a single compact device. This high level of integration significantly reduces external component count and simplifies the design of low-power non-isolated AC-DC converter circuits. The IC is designed to operate directly from rectified AC mains input, making it suitable for compact and cost-effective auxiliary power supplies.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high efficiency, low standby power consumption, and simple circuit implementation, the LNK305PN is widely used in LED driver circuits, small battery chargers, appliance control power supplies, industrial control modules, standby SMPS units, and other consumer electronic auxiliary power applications. It is typically available in a DIP-7 package, allowing easy PCB mounting and reliable performance in production designs. For stable and safe operation, designers generally include proper input EMI filtering, surge/snubber protection components, output filtering, and careful PCB layout techniques to ensure efficient and long-term power conversion.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773729601985-903711818.jpg\"}','2026-03-17 06:40:02'),
