(5186,1,'product',3220,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LNK6663VG\",\"description\":\"LNK6663VG is an advanced offline switch-mode power supply (SMPS) controller IC from the LinkSwitch-HP family by Power Integrations, designed mainly for high-efficiency LED driver and compact AC-DC converter applications. It integrates a high-voltage power MOSFET, PWM control circuitry, oscillator, precise constant-current control, current limiting, thermal shutdown, and auto-restart protection within a single device. This high level of integration helps reduce external component count, simplify circuit design, and improve overall system reliability. The IC is intended to operate directly from rectified AC mains input, making it suitable for modern energy-efficient power supply designs.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high efficiency, low standby power consumption, and accurate output current regulation, the LNK6663VG is widely used in LED bulb drivers, LED panel light power supplies, street lighting systems, appliance auxiliary power units, industrial lighting control circuits, and various consumer electronic AC-DC converter applications. It is typically available in an eSIP-7C / eSIP-style power package, allowing effective heat dissipation when mounted on a suitable heat sink or PCB copper area. For stable and reliable operation, designers generally include proper input EMI filtering, surge/snubber protection networks, feedback regulation components, and careful PCB layout techniques to ensure efficient and long-term power conversion performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773734522487-706940483.jpg\"}','2026-03-17 08:02:02'),
