(5188,1,'product',3222,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DPA423PN\",\"description\":\"DPA423PN is an integrated offline switch-mode power supply (SMPS) controller IC from the TOPSwitch-FX / DPA series by Power Integrations. It combines a high-voltage power MOSFET, PWM controller, oscillator, current-limit protection, thermal shutdown, and auto-restart fault protection within a single compact device. This high level of integration helps reduce external component count, simplifies circuit design, and improves reliability in AC-DC power conversion applications. The IC is designed to operate directly from rectified AC mains input, making it suitable for compact offline flyback and forward converter power supplies.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high efficiency, low standby power consumption, and built-in safety features, the DPA423PN is widely used in battery chargers, TV and monitor SMPS units, power adapters, standby power supplies, LED driver circuits, industrial auxiliary power supplies, and various consumer electronic AC-DC converter systems. It is typically available in a DIP-8 package, allowing convenient PCB mounting and dependable performance in practical designs. For stable and safe operation, designers generally include proper input EMI filtering, snubber or surge protection networks, feedback regulation components, and careful PCB layout techniques to ensure efficient and long-term power conversion.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773734964082-368750902.jpg\"}','2026-03-17 08:09:24'),
