(5190,1,'product',3224,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DPA425PN\",\"description\":\"DPA425PN is an integrated offline switch-mode power supply (SMPS) controller IC from the DPA / TOPSwitch-FX series by Power Integrations. It combines a high-voltage power MOSFET, PWM controller, oscillator, current-limit protection, thermal shutdown, and auto-restart fault protection in a single compact device. This high level of integration helps reduce external component count, simplifies circuit design, and improves overall reliability in AC-DC converter applications. The IC is designed to operate directly from rectified AC mains input, making it suitable for compact offline flyback and forward converter power supplies.\",\"info\":\"Because of its high efficiency, low standby power consumption, and built-in safety features, the DPA425PN is widely used in TV and monitor SMPS units, battery chargers, power adapters, standby power supplies, LED driver circuits, industrial auxiliary supplies, and various consumer electronic AC-DC power systems. It is typically available in a DIP-8 package, allowing easy PCB mounting and dependable operation in practical designs. For stable and safe performance, designers generally include proper input EMI filtering, snubber or surge protection networks, feedback regulation circuitry, and careful PCB layout techniques to ensure efficient and long-term power conversion.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1773735324532-285646947.jpg\"}','2026-03-17 08:15:24'),
