(5315,1,'category_group',16,'update',NULL,'{\"name\":\"Electronics Basic Components\",\"info\":\"Electronic systems operate using electrical energy and electronic components to process signals, store data, and control devices. Electronics can be classified into several categories such as consumer electronics, industrial electronics, communication electronics, power electronics, and embedded systems.\",\"description\":\"Electronics is a branch of technology and engineering that deals with the study, design, and application of electronic circuits and devices that control the flow of electrons to perform various functions. It involves components such as resistors, capacitors, diodes, transistors, integrated circuits, and microcontrollers which are used to build electronic systems. Electronics is widely used in everyday devices like mobile phones, televisions, computers, home appliances, communication equipment, and industrial machines. The field plays an important role in modern technology by enabling automation, communication, entertainment, and smart systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-03-18 13:04:56'),
