(5352,1,'product',1258,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Voltage Sensor\",\"description\":\"A Voltage Sensor is an electronic module used to measure the electrical voltage present in a circuit and provide a scaled-down, safe output to a microcontroller or data acquisition device\",\"info\":\"It typically uses a voltage divider or sensing chip to convert high voltages into a lower measurable range compatible with devices like Arduino, Raspberry Pi (via ADC), and other controllers\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"Voltage sensors help monitor battery levels, power supplies, and system voltages in automation, robotics, and electronics projects. They provide real-time voltage feedback for protection, display, logging, or control logic.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":18,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-20 10:23:33'),
(5353,1,'product',2156,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Big DC Electric Motor (yellow)\",\"description\":\"The Big Yellow DC Electric Motor, commonly known as a yellow gear motor or TT motor, is a high-torque DC motor widely used in robotics and DIY electronic projects. It includes an internal gearbox that reduces speed while increasing torque, making it ideal for robot cars and automation applications.\",\"info\":\"The motor operates on low DC voltage and provides stable rotation with efficient power consumption. Its lightweight plastic housing and easy mounting design make it suitable for educational kits, prototype development, and hobby electronics projects.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"299.00\",\"note\":\"It includes an internal gearbox that reduces speed while increasing torque, making it ideal for robot cars and automation applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"459\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-21 04:46:01'),
(5354,1,'product',411,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"28BYJ-48 Step Motor\",\"description\":\"The 28BYJ-48 Stepper Motor is a compact, low-power unipolar stepper motor widely used in robotics, automation, and DIY electronics.\",\"info\":\"The 28BYJ-48 stepper motor is a 5 V unipolar stepper motor widely used in Arduino and DIY electronics projects for precise position control.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"549.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":\"142\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-21 08:33:53'),
(5355,1,'product',2263,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3.6V 2000 mAh battery\",\"description\":\"A 3.6V 2000 mAh battery is a rechargeable lithium-based battery commonly used in electronic devices that require stable voltage and long backup time.\",\"info\":\"This battery is often available in Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-thionyl chloride (Li-SOCl?) variants. The rechargeable Li-ion version is widely used due to its high energy density, lightweight design, and long cycle life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"491.00\",\"note\":\"It provides a nominal voltage of 3.6 volts with a capacity of 2000 milliampere-hours, making it suitable for both low-power and medium-power applications.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":62,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774082596042-592155652.jpg\"}','2026-03-21 08:43:16'),
(5356,1,'product',731,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"A4988 Stepper Motor Driver\",\"description\":\"A4988 Stepper Motor Driver is a compact and powerful microstepping driver designed to control bipolar stepper motors with high precision and smooth operation. It can drive a stepper motor in full, half, quarter, eighth, and sixteenth microstepping modes, allowing finer movement control for CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and automation projects.\",\"info\":\"The A4988 stepper motor driver is a compact microstepping driver module used to control bipolar stepper motors. It supports up to 1/16 microstepping, providing smooth and precise motor movement.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":453,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-23 06:05:27'),
(5357,1,'product',192,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4G LTE GSM GNSS 7672S\",\"description\":\" 4G LTE GSM GNSS 7672S series (A7672S) is a versatile cellular & positioning module family that integrates modern LTE internet speed, fallback GSM connectivity, and satellite positioning in a compact form — ideal for IoT, vehicle tracking, telematics, remote monitoring, and similar applications\",\"info\":\" 4G LTE GSM GNSS 7672S series (A7672S) is a versatile cellular & positioning module family that integrates modern LTE internet speed, fallback GSM connectivity, and satellite positioning in a compact form — ideal for IoT, vehicle tracking, telematics, remote monitoring, and similar applications\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2850.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":32,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-23 06:49:46'),
(5358,1,'product',273,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CAN 2551 Transceiver\",\"description\":\"The CJMCU-2551 is a fault tolerant high-speed CAN device that acts as a CAN protocol controller and a physical bus interface. The MCP2551 provides differential transceiver capability for the CAN protocol controller, which fully complies with the ISO-11898 standard, including 24V voltage requirements.\",\"info\":\"CAN 2551 Transceiver module options you might be referring to (based on the MCP2551 CAN transceiver, a high-speed CAN interface IC used to connect microcontrollers to a CAN bus physical layer\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"280.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":453,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-23 09:53:58'),
(5359,1,'category',635,'create',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-24 07:40:56'),
(5360,1,'product',2584,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Yellow Single Strand Wire\",\"description\":\"single strand wires are available in different gauge sizes (such as 0.5 sq mm, 1 sq mm, 1.5 sq mm, 2.5 sq mm, etc.), and their current-carrying capacity depends on the thickness (cross-sectional area) of the conductor. Thicker wires can carry higher current safely.\",\"info\":\"A Single Strand Wire is an electrical conductor made from one solid piece of metal, usually copper or aluminum, covered with an insulating material such as PVC or XLPE. Unlike stranded wire, which consists of multiple small wires twisted together, single strand wire (also called solid wire) has a single thick conductor core. It is commonly used in electrical wiring installations, control panels, switchboards, and fixed wiring systems where flexibility is not required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"Single Strand Wire\",\"mrp\":\"49.00\",\"note\":\"These wires are typically rated for specific voltage levels like 110V, 230V, or 440V depending on insulation type and application. Copper single strand wire is widely preferred because of its excellent conductivity and durability. It is mostly used in household wiring, lighting circuits, distribution boards, earthing connections, and industrial control systems.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":203,\"secondary_id\":484,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-24 07:55:07'),
(5361,1,'category',635,'update',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-24 07:56:17'),
(5362,1,'category_brand_mapping',635,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[232,230,228]}\"','2026-03-24 07:59:20'),
(5363,1,'product',3354,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Black Single Strand Wire\",\"description\":\"Black Single Strand Wire is a type of electrical wire made from a single solid conductor, usually composed of copper or aluminum, and covered with a black insulating layer such as PVC. It is widely used in low-voltage electrical installations, circuit wiring, control panels, and basic electronic applications where a stable and secure connection is required. The solid core provides better mechanical strength and ensures minimal signal loss, making it suitable for fixed wiring rather than flexible movements.\",\"info\":\"The black color is often used for phase or live connections in certain wiring standards, though color codes may vary by region. This wire is easy to strip, solder, and terminate, making it convenient for electricians and technicians.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[934],\"alternative_name\":\"Single Strand Wire\",\"mrp\":\"49\",\"note\":\"However, due to its rigidity, it is not ideal for applications requiring frequent bending or movement. Overall, Black Single Strand Wire is reliable, durable, and commonly used in residential, commercial, and industrial electrical systems.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774339409030-708881307.jpeg\"}','2026-03-24 08:03:29'),
(5364,1,'product',3355,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Red Single Strand Wire\",\"description\":\"Red Single Strand Wire is a solid-core electrical wire made from a single conductor, typically copper or aluminum, and insulated with a red-colored PVC or similar protective coating. It is commonly used in electrical wiring, electronic circuits, control panels, and power distribution systems where a consistent and stable connection is required. The red color is generally used to indicate live or positive connections, especially in DC circuits and battery systems, though color coding may vary depending on standards.\",\"info\":\"Due to its single solid core, the wire offers good conductivity, low resistance, and strong mechanical stability, making it suitable for fixed installations. It is easy to strip and connect, which simplifies installation work for technicians and electricians.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[934],\"alternative_name\":\"Single Strand Wire\",\"mrp\":\"49\",\"note\":\"However, it is less flexible compared to multi-strand wires and is not ideal for applications involving frequent bending or movement. Overall, Red Single Strand Wire is a durable and efficient choice for reliable electrical connections in various applications.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774339588175-722858404.jpeg\"}','2026-03-24 08:06:28'),
(5365,1,'product',3356,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Yellow Multi Strand Wire\",\"description\":\"Yellow Multi Strand Wire is an electrical wire composed of multiple thin strands of copper or aluminum bundled together and covered with a yellow insulating layer, typically made of PVC or similar material. This type of wire is widely used in electrical systems, control panels, automotive wiring, and electronic circuits where flexibility and durability are essential.\",\"info\":\"The multi-strand construction provides excellent flexibility, making it suitable for applications that involve frequent bending, vibration, or movement without breaking. The yellow color is often used for specific identification purposes, such as signaling, grounding, or phase indication, depending on wiring standards and regional practices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1553],\"alternative_name\":\"Multi Strand Wire\",\"mrp\":\"99\",\"note\":\"It offers good conductivity, reduced risk of breakage, and improved performance in dynamic conditions compared to single strand wires. Additionally, it is easy to route through tight spaces and is convenient for installation in complex wiring setups. Overall, Yellow Multi Strand Wire is a reliable, flexible, and efficient solution for both industrial and domestic electrical applications.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774339728155-889165083.jpeg\"}','2026-03-24 08:08:48'),
(5366,1,'product',3357,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Black Multi Strand Wire\",\"description\":\"Black Multi Strand Wire is an electrical wire made up of multiple fine strands of copper or aluminum conductors twisted together and coated with a black insulating material, typically PVC. This construction provides high flexibility and durability, making it ideal for applications where the wire needs to bend, move, or withstand vibrations, such as in control panels, automotive wiring, appliances, and electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"The multi-strand design reduces the chances of breakage and ensures consistent electrical performance even under dynamic conditions. The black color is commonly used for phase, live, or neutral connections depending on regional wiring standards and application requirements.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1553],\"alternative_name\":\"Multi Strand Wire\",\"mrp\":\"99\",\"note\":\"It offers excellent conductivity, easy handling, and smooth installation, especially in tight or complex wiring spaces. Overall, Black Multi Strand Wire is a versatile and dependable choice for both residential and industrial electrical systems where flexibility and strength are important.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774339839353-676211400.jpeg\"}','2026-03-24 08:10:39'),
(5367,1,'product',3358,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Red Multi strand Wire\",\"description\":\"Red Multi Strand Wire is an electrical conductor made up of multiple fine strands of copper or aluminum twisted together and insulated with a red-colored PVC or similar protective coating. This type of wire is widely used in electrical systems, battery connections, automotive wiring, control panels, and electronic circuits where flexibility and durability are important.\",\"info\":\"he multi-strand construction allows the wire to bend easily and withstand continuous movement or vibration without breaking, making it more reliable than single strand wires in dynamic applications. The red color is typically used to indicate live or positive connections, especially in DC circuits and power supply systems, though color standards may vary by region.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1553],\"alternative_name\":\"Multi Strand Wire\",\"mrp\":\"99\",\"note\":\"It offers good conductivity, low resistance, and ease of installation, even in tight or complex wiring setups. Overall, Red Multi Strand Wire is a flexible, durable, and efficient solution for a wide range of residential, commercial, and industrial electrical applications.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774339947587-473045309.jpeg\"}','2026-03-24 08:12:27'),
(5368,1,'product',3359,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Green Multi Strand Wire\",\"description\":\"Green Multi Strand Wire is an electrical wire made of multiple fine strands of copper or aluminum twisted together and covered with a green insulating layer, usually PVC or similar material. It is commonly used in electrical installations, control panels, and electronic systems where flexibility and durability are required. The multi-strand construction provides excellent flexibility, allowing the wire to bend easily and withstand vibrations or repeated movement without breaking.\",\"info\":\"The green color is typically used to represent grounding or earthing connections in most wiring standards, ensuring safety in electrical systems by directing fault currents safely to the ground.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1553],\"alternative_name\":\"Multi Strand Wire\",\"mrp\":\"99\",\"note\":\"It offers good conductivity, reduced risk of damage, and easy handling during installation, especially in tight or complex spaces. Overall, Green Multi Strand Wire is a reliable, flexible, and essential component for safe and efficient electrical grounding and wiring applications.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774340048016-181503781.jpeg\"}','2026-03-24 08:14:08'),
(5369,1,'category_group_mapping',17,'create',NULL,'{\"category_group_id\":17,\"category_ids\":[13,585,565,59,71,18,459,563,623,177,436,440,80,576,40,583,570,443,20,451,88,421,571,32,574,65,42,31,578,11,579,557,446,55,139,24,86,37,549,143,453,196,19,635,592,52,444,438,575,564,25,457,584,15,445,465,203,323,16,467,49,458,58,432,468,30,469,87,165,78,422,439,566,21,142,27,76,550,562,581,548,460,67,63,36,462,77,145,35,320,68,586,560,559]}','2026-03-24 08:25:48'),
(5370,1,'product',3360,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Rainbow Wire\",\"description\":\"Rainbow wire refers to a bundle of multicolored electrical jumper wires commonly used in electronics and DIY projects. These wires are typically arranged in a ribbon format or separated strands, making circuit connections easy and organized. They are widely used with breadboards, Arduino, Raspberry Pi, and other development boards for prototyping without soldering.\",\"info\":\"The different colors help users quickly identify connections such as power, ground, and signal lines, reducing wiring mistakes. Rainbow wires are available in various types like Male-to-Male, Male-to-Female, and Female-to-Female, depending on connector requirements.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1205],\"mrp\":\"149\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774340791239-553005119.jpg\"}','2026-03-24 08:26:31'),
(5371,1,'product',3361,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Blue Multi Strand Wire\",\"description\":\"Blue multi-strand wire is a flexible electrical wire made of many thin copper strands twisted together and covered with blue insulation. It is widely used in electronics projects, internal wiring, power distribution, and domestic electrical installations due to its durability and ease of handling.The blue color is typically used for neutral wiring identification or organized circuit layout, helping electricians and hobbyists avoid wiring mistakes.\",\"info\":\"Multi-strand wires provide better flexibility and conductivity compared to single-core wires, making them suitable for connections that may bend or move frequently. They are usually insulated with PVC or silicone, which offers electrical safety and protection from heat or mechanical damage.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1553],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774341223550-883492348.jpg\"}','2026-03-24 08:33:43'),
(5372,1,'category',484,'update',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-24 10:24:24'),
(5373,1,'category_group',16,'update',NULL,'{\"name\":\"Electronics Basic Components\",\"info\":\"Electronic systems operate using electrical energy and electronic components to process signals, store data, and control devices. Electronics can be classified into several categories such as consumer electronics, industrial electronics, communication electronics, power electronics, and embedded systems.\",\"description\":\"Electronics is a branch of technology and engineering that deals with the study, design, and application of electronic circuits and devices that control the flow of electrons to perform various functions. It involves components such as resistors, capacitors, diodes, transistors, integrated circuits, and microcontrollers which are used to build electronic systems. Electronics is widely used in everyday devices like mobile phones, televisions, computers, home appliances, communication equipment, and industrial machines. The field plays an important role in modern technology by enabling automation, communication, entertainment, and smart systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-03-24 10:27:48'),
