(5564,1,'product',3370,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Buzzer Module\",\"description\":\"A Buzzer Module is a small electronic sound-producing device commonly used in embedded systems, alarms, and notification circuits. It typically consists of a piezoelectric buzzer mounted on a compact PCB along with supporting components, making it easy to interface with microcontrollers like Arduino, Raspberry Pi, or other digital systems.\",\"info\":\"The module operates on low voltage (usually 3.3V to 5V DC) and produces a beeping or buzzing sound when an electrical signal is applied. There are two main types—active buzzers, which generate sound automatically when powered, and passive buzzers, which require a frequency signal (PWM) to produce different tones.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[566],\"alternative_name\":\"Buzzer Module\",\"mrp\":\"90\",\"note\":\"Buzzer modules are widely used in applications such as alarm systems, timers, security devices, user alerts, and IoT projects due to their simplicity, low power consumption, compact size, and reliable performance.\",\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-26 11:12:18'),
(5565,1,'product',3370,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Buzzer Module\",\"description\":\"A Buzzer Module is a small electronic sound-producing device commonly used in embedded systems, alarms, and notification circuits. It typically consists of a piezoelectric buzzer mounted on a compact PCB along with supporting components, making it easy to interface with microcontrollers like Arduino, Raspberry Pi, or other digital systems.\",\"info\":\"The module operates on low voltage (usually 3.3V to 5V DC) and produces a beeping or buzzing sound when an electrical signal is applied. There are two main types—active buzzers, which generate sound automatically when powered, and passive buzzers, which require a frequency signal (PWM) to produce different tones.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"note\":\"Buzzer modules are widely used in applications such as alarm systems, timers, security devices, user alerts, and IoT projects due to their simplicity, low power consumption, compact size, and reliable performance.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":434,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774523574041-402987224.jpeg\"}','2026-03-26 11:12:54'),
(5566,1,'product',3371,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Arduino UNO Board\",\"description\":\"The Arduino UNO Board is one of the most popular and widely used microcontroller boards in electronics and embedded systems. It is based on the ATmega328P microcontroller and is designed to make programming and hardware interfacing simple for beginners as well as professionals.\",\"info\":\"The board can read inputs such as sensors, buttons, or signals, and control outputs like LEDs, motors, displays, and relays. It is programmed using the Arduino IDE via a USB connection, making it easy to upload code and power the board simultaneously. Operating at 5V, the Arduino UNO provides multiple digital and analog input/output pins, allowing it to interact with a wide range of electronic components.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[403],\"alternative_name\":\"Arduino Uno Board\",\"mrp\":\"799\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774524053189-363395888.jpeg\"}','2026-03-26 11:20:53'),
(5567,1,'product',45,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Arduino R4 Wifi Board\",\"description\":\"Expanded memory and faster clock with extra on-board peripherals: The UNO R4 WiFi empowers you with increased memory and a faster clock speed, enabling more precise calculations, effortless handling of complex projects, and the ability to tackle demanding tasks with ease. Additionally, it introduces a range of on-board peripherals, including a 12-bit DAC, CAN BUS, OP AMP, OFF pin, VRCT pin and Qwiic connector, providing expanded capabilities and design flexibility.\",\"info\":\"The Arduino UNO R4 WiFi is a next-generation official Arduino board that combines the power of the Renesas RA4M1 (Arm Cortex-M4) microcontroller with an onboard ESP32-S3 module for Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2200.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":317,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-26 11:56:27'),
(5568,1,'product',45,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Arduino R4 Wifi Board\",\"description\":\"Expanded memory and faster clock with extra on-board peripherals: The UNO R4 WiFi empowers you with increased memory and a faster clock speed, enabling more precise calculations, effortless handling of complex projects, and the ability to tackle demanding tasks with ease. Additionally, it introduces a range of on-board peripherals, including a 12-bit DAC, CAN BUS, OP AMP, OFF pin, VRCT pin and Qwiic connector, providing expanded capabilities and design flexibility.\",\"info\":\"The Arduino UNO R4 WiFi is a next-generation official Arduino board that combines the power of the Renesas RA4M1 (Arm Cortex-M4) microcontroller with an onboard ESP32-S3 module for Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":317,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-26 11:59:02'),
(5569,1,'product',131,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Arduino Nano Board\",\"description\":\"The Arduino Nano CH340 (ATmega328P – IC-O.G) is a compact Arduino-compatible development board that uses the original ATmega328P microcontroller and the CH340 USB-to-Serial interface\",\"info\":\"This version comes with unsoldered header pins, allowing flexible mounting directly onto PCBs, breadboards, or custom enclosures.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"350.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":441,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-26 12:07:28'),
(5570,1,'product',3372,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"A3144 Hall Effect Sensor\",\"description\":\"The A3144 Hall Effect Sensor is a widely used magnetic field detection device that operates based on the Hall Effect principle. It is a digital Hall effect switch designed to detect the presence of a magnetic field and provide a simple HIGH or LOW output signal, making it easy to interface with microcontrollers like Arduino. The sensor consists of three pins—VCC, GND, and OUT—and typically operates within a voltage range of 4.5V to 24V.\",\"info\":\"When no magnetic field is present, the output remains HIGH, but when a magnet is brought near the sensor, the output switches to LOW. This sensor is known for its fast response time, reliability, and built-in protection features such as reverse polarity protection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1259],\"alternative_name\":\"Hall Effect Sensor\",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774531161184-193966102.jpg\"}','2026-03-26 13:19:21'),
(5571,1,'product',3373,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"A3144 Sensor\",\"description\":\"The A3144 Hall Effect Sensor is a digital magnetic field sensor widely used in electronic and embedded systems to detect the presence of a magnet. It operates based on the Hall Effect, where a voltage is generated when a magnetic field is applied perpendicular to the flow of current. The A3144 sensor has three pins—VCC (power supply), GND (ground), and OUT (output)—and typically works with a voltage range of 4.5V to 24V.\",\"info\":\"The A3144 is known for its compact size, fast switching speed, durability, and reliable performance. It is commonly used in applications such as speed detection, position sensing, proximity sensing, door sensors, and automation systems, making it a popular choice for student projects and IoT-based applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1259],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774531302812-87031474.jpg\"}','2026-03-26 13:21:42'),
(5572,1,'product',3374,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Limit Switch Module\",\"description\":\"The Limit Switch Module is an electromechanical device used to detect the physical position or movement of an object. It works by making or breaking an electrical connection when an object presses or releases the switch lever. This module typically includes a mechanical switch mounted on a small circuit board with three pins: VCC, GND, and OUT, making it easy to interface with microcontrollers like Arduino. When the switch is pressed, the output signal changes (HIGH to LOW or LOW to HIGH depending on the wiring), allowing the system to detect whether a limit or boundary has been reached.\",\"info\":\"Limit switch modules are simple, reliable, and widely used in automation systems, robotics, and safety mechanisms. They are commonly used to detect end positions in machines, such as in 3D printers, CNC machines, elevators, and conveyor systems. Because of their durability and accurate physical feedback, they are ideal for applications where precise position detection is required. Overall, the limit switch module is an essential component for controlling motion and ensuring safety in mechanical and electronic systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[52],\"mrp\":\"399\",\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-26 13:38:14'),
(5573,1,'product',731,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"A4988 Stepper Motor Driver\",\"description\":\"A4988 Stepper Motor Driver is a compact and powerful microstepping driver designed to control bipolar stepper motors with high precision and smooth operation. It can drive a stepper motor in full, half, quarter, eighth, and sixteenth microstepping modes, allowing finer movement control for CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and automation projects.\",\"info\":\"The A4988 stepper motor driver is a compact microstepping driver module used to control bipolar stepper motors. It supports up to 1/16 microstepping, providing smooth and precise motor movement.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":143,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-26 14:24:17'),
(5574,1,'brand',302,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"GEONIX\",\"description\":\"The GEONIX is an emerging electronics brand in India that focuses on providing affordable and performance-oriented IT and computer hardware products. The company is operated by Geonix International Pvt. Ltd., based in New Delhi, and offers a wide range of products including SSD storage drives, hard disks, Wi-Fi routers, monitors, adapters, and computer accessories\",\"info\":\"\",\"note\":\"GEONIX is particularly known for its solid-state drives (SSDs), which are designed to deliver high-speed performance using SATA III (6Gb/s) and NVMe interfaces, offering read speeds up to around 550–570 MB/s for SATA models and much higher for NVMe drives\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1774583747934-560708799.png\"}','2026-03-27 03:55:47'),
(5575,1,'category_brand_mapping',367,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[8,234,235,236,302]}\"','2026-03-27 03:57:08'),
(5576,1,'product',3375,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GEONIX 128GB SSD SATA\",\"description\":\"The GEONIX 128GB SSD SATA is a compact and high-performance storage device designed to replace traditional hard drives in laptops and desktop computers. It uses a SATA III (6Gb/s) interface, which allows fast data transfer speeds, significantly improving system performance compared to HDDs. This SSD typically offers sequential read speeds up to around 560–570 MB/s and write speeds up to 500 MB/s, enabling quicker boot times, faster file transfers, and smooth application loading\",\"info\":\"The GEONIX 128GB SSD is suitable for everyday computing, office work, basic gaming, and upgrading older systems, offering a noticeable boost in speed and responsiveness. It also supports multiple operating systems such as Windows, Linux, and macOS, and often comes with a 3 to 5-year warranty, making it a cost-effective and dependable storage upgrade solution.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1556],\"mrp\":\"3499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774583922619-786645643.jpg\"}','2026-03-27 03:58:42'),
(5577,1,'product',3376,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Ram 8GB DDR4\",\"description\":\"An 8GB DDR4 RAM is a widely used computer memory module designed to improve system performance, speed, and multitasking capability in desktops and laptops. It belongs to the DDR4 (Double Data Rate 4) generation, which offers higher bandwidth and lower power consumption compared to older DDR3 memory. Typically operating at speeds ranging from 2133 MHz to 3200 MHz or higher, 8GB DDR4 RAM allows smooth handling of everyday tasks such as web browsing, office work, programming, and moderate gaming.\",\"info\":\"It works by temporarily storing data that the CPU needs quickly, resulting in faster application loading and better overall responsiveness. DDR4 RAM modules are available in different types such as DIMM for desktops and SO-DIMM for laptops, and they usually operate at a low voltage of around 1.2V, improving energy efficiency. Popular brands like Corsair, Kingston, Crucial, and ADATA offer reliable options, and this capacity is considered ideal for students, professionals, and casual users who need balanced performance without high cost\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[106],\"mrp\":\"6999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774584304069-754674302.jpg\"}','2026-03-27 04:05:04'),
(5578,1,'product',3377,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DP to HDMI 4K\",\"description\":\"A DP to HDMI 4K adapter converts digital video and audio signals from a DisplayPort source into HDMI format, allowing compatibility between modern computers and HDMI displays. These adapters support Ultra HD resolutions like 3840×2160 (4K), depending on the version—many basic adapters support 4K at 30Hz, while advanced or active adapters support 4K at 60Hz for smoother visuals.\",\"info\":\"They are typically plug-and-play devices, requiring no additional drivers, and are widely used in desktop PCs, laptops, gaming setups, projectors, and office displays. Most DP to HDMI adapters are unidirectional, meaning they only convert from DisplayPort to HDMI\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[485],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774584999250-294028149.jpg\"}','2026-03-27 04:16:39'),
(5579,1,'product',3378,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"DVI to VGA\",\"description\":\"A DVI to VGA adapter is a video converter used to connect a device with a DVI (Digital Visual Interface) output to a monitor or projector that uses a VGA (Video Graphics Array) input. It is commonly used to connect modern computers or graphics cards to older display devices that only support VGA. This adapter typically has a DVI male connector on one side and a VGA female port on the other, allowing a standard VGA cable to be connected.\",\"info\":\"A DVI to VGA adapter works by converting the video signal so that devices with different display interfaces can communicate. VGA is an analog signal, while DVI can carry both analog (DVI-I) and digital (DVI-D) signals\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[97],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774585511837-964982312.jpg\"}','2026-03-27 04:25:11'),
(5580,1,'product',3379,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hp 65w Blue C type Laptop Adaptor\",\"description\":\"The HP 65W Blue Tip / USB-C Laptop Adapter is a reliable power supply designed to charge HP laptops efficiently using either USB Type-C or traditional blue-pin (4.5mm) connectors, depending on the model. This adapter delivers a maximum output of 65 watts, which is suitable for most HP laptops such as Pavilion, ProBook, EliteBook, Envy, and Spectre series. It supports fast charging technology, allowing the battery to charge quickly while also powering the laptop during use.\",\"info\":\"The adapter operates on a wide input voltage range (100–240V AC), making it ideal for both home and travel use. It provides multiple output levels such as 5V, 9V, 12V, 15V, and 20V, automatically adjusting power based on the device requirement for safe and efficient charging. Built with over-voltage, short-circuit, and thermal protection, it ensures safe operation and long-term durability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[310],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774586182632-534116432.jpg\"}','2026-03-27 04:36:22'),
(5581,1,'product',3380,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"19V 3.42A C Type Laptop Adaptor\",\"description\":\"A 19V 3.42A C-Type laptop adapter is a power supply designed to deliver approximately 65W (watts) of power (19V × 3.42A) for charging laptops and compatible devices. It converts AC mains power (100–240V) into stable DC output required by laptops. While traditional adapters with 19V 3.42A usually come with round pin connectors, modern versions use USB Type-C (PD – Power Delivery) technology, which automatically adjusts voltage levels such as 5V, 9V, 12V, 15V, and 20V depending on the device.\",\"info\":\"A 19V 3.42A (65W) USB-C laptop adapter is widely used for modern laptops, ultrabooks, and tablets that support USB-C charging. Unlike fixed 19V adapters, USB-C chargers use Power Delivery (PD) to dynamically supply the correct voltage, ensuring safe and efficient charging. Most adapters include over-voltage, over-current, and short-circuit protection, improving safety and device lifespan.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[620],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774588087737-112707796.jpg\"}','2026-03-27 05:08:07'),
(5582,1,'product',3381,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"90W C-Type Laptop Adaptor\",\"description\":\"A 90W C-Type laptop adapter is a high-power charger designed for modern laptops that support USB Type-C Power Delivery (PD). It provides up to 90 watts of power, making it suitable for high-performance laptops, ultrabooks, and some workstations that require more power than standard 45W or 65W chargers.\",\"info\":\"A 90W USB-C laptop adapter converts AC power (100–240V) into regulated DC output and uses USB-C Power Delivery technology to automatically adjust voltage levels such as 5V, 9V, 12V, 15V, and 20V, depending on the device requirement\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[620],\"mrp\":\"1999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774588265475-530831974.jpg\"}','2026-03-27 05:11:05'),
(5583,1,'product',3382,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"65W C-Type Laptop Adaptor\",\"description\":\"A 65W C-Type laptop adapter is a modern power supply designed to charge laptops and compatible devices using USB Type-C Power Delivery (PD) technology. It delivers up to 65 watts of power, making it ideal for most ultrabooks, business laptops, and mid-range devices.\",\"info\":\"A 65W USB-C laptop adapter converts AC power (100–240V) into regulated DC output and uses USB-C Power Delivery to automatically adjust voltage levels such as 5V, 9V, 12V, 15V, and 20V depending on the device requirement.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[620],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774588532331-915788931.jpg\"}','2026-03-27 05:15:32'),
