(5610,1,'product',3385,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Dual Battery Charger\",\"description\":\"A dual battery charger is an electronic device designed to charge two batteries simultaneously, offering convenience and efficiency for users who rely on multiple rechargeable batteries. It is commonly used for lithium-ion, NiMH, or lead-acid batteries depending on the model, and is widely applied in devices such as cameras, power tools, drones, and backup systems.\",\"info\":\"These chargers typically feature independent charging channels, allowing each battery to be monitored and charged separately for optimal performance and safety. Built-in protection mechanisms such as overcharge protection, short-circuit protection, temperature control, and reverse polarity protection ensure safe operation and extend battery life.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[853],\"alternative_name\":\"Battery Charger\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774951996153-725987318.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 10:13:16'),
(5611,1,'product',3386,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Single Battery charger\",\"description\":\"A single battery charger is a compact and efficient device designed to charge one rechargeable battery at a time. It is commonly used for various battery types such as lithium-ion, nickel-metal hydride (NiMH), and lead-acid batteries, depending on the charger model. These chargers are widely used in applications like mobile devices, cameras, power tools, and small electronic gadgets.\",\"info\":\"A single battery charger typically provides stable current and voltage to ensure safe and effective charging, helping to maintain battery health and extend its lifespan. Most models include safety features such as overcharge protection, short-circuit protection, and temperature control to prevent damage. Additionally, LED indicators or simple display systems are often included to show charging status, making the device easy to use for everyday applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[853],\"alternative_name\":\"Battery Charger\",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774952189210-324440037.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 10:16:29'),
(5612,1,'product',3387,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Single Side Battery Charger\",\"description\":\"A single battery charger is a compact and efficient device designed to charge one rechargeable battery at a time. It is commonly used for various battery types such as lithium-ion, nickel-metal hydride (NiMH), and lead-acid batteries, depending on the charger model. These chargers are widely used in applications like mobile devices, cameras, power tools, and small electronic gadgets.\",\"info\":\"A single battery charger typically provides stable current and voltage to ensure safe and effective charging, helping to maintain battery health and extend its lifespan. Most models include safety features such as overcharge protection, short-circuit protection, and temperature control to prevent damage.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[853],\"alternative_name\":\"Battery Charger\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774952304748-677791328.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 10:18:24'),
