(5618,1,'product',2146,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Water Pump DC 6-12Volt 385\",\"description\":\"The DC Water Pump 6–12V (Model 385) is a compact and efficient miniature water pump designed for low-voltage DC operation, commonly used in DIY electronics, automation, and small liquid transfer applications. It operates using a brushed DC motor that drives an internal impeller to move water smoothly through the inlet and outlet ports. The pump is designed for continuous water flow and provides reliable performance when powered by batteries, power adapters, or motor driver circuits.\",\"info\":\"This pump typically works within a voltage range of 6V to 12V DC, with optimal performance around 12V, delivering higher water flow and pressure at increased voltage levels. It features a durable plastic body, low noise operation, and simple two-wire connection for easy installation. The pump is suitable for clean water and light liquid circulation but is not intended for corrosive liquids or dry running operation. Speed and flow rate can also be controlled using a PWM motor speed controller.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"note\":\"The DC 385 water pump is widely used in automatic plant watering systems, aquarium circulation, water fountains, cooling systems, robotics projects, DIY irrigation setups, and IoT-based fluid control applications. Its small size, low power consumption, and easy interfacing make it ideal for educational and prototype projects.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":196,\"secondary_id\":462,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-31 11:13:30'),
