(5620,1,'product',3388,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"12V DC Cooling Fan\",\"description\":\"A 12V DC cooling fan is an electrical device designed to provide efficient airflow for cooling electronic components and enclosed systems. It operates on a 12-volt direct current (DC) power supply, making it ideal for use in computers, power supplies, inverters, automotive applications, and various electronic projects. These fans are typically available in different sizes such as 40mm, 60mm, 80mm, and 120mm, allowing them to fit a wide range of cooling requirements.\",\"info\":\"Most 12V DC fans use brushless motor technology, which ensures low noise operation, longer lifespan, and reduced maintenance compared to traditional fans. They are easy to install and usually come with two or three wires for power and speed control. Built for continuous operation, these fans help maintain optimal temperatures, prevent overheating, and improve the overall performance and durability of electronic devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1590],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-31 11:28:51'),
(5621,1,'product',3389,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"24V DC Cooling fan\",\"description\":\"24V DC cooling fan is a high-performance airflow device designed to cool electrical and electronic systems that operate on a 24-volt direct current power supply. It is widely used in industrial equipment, control panels, telecom systems, automation setups, and heavy-duty electronics where stable and continuous cooling is required. These fans are commonly built with brushless motor technology, ensuring efficient operation, low power consumption, reduced noise, and a longer service life.\",\"info\":\"Available in various sizes and airflow capacities, 24V DC fans can effectively dissipate heat from components, preventing overheating and improving system reliability. They typically come with two or three wires for power connection and optional speed monitoring. With features like durable construction, high airflow output, and built-in protection against overheating and voltage fluctuations, 24V DC cooling fans are ideal for demanding environments and continuous operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1590],\"alternative_name\":\"Cooling Fan\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774956770500-245267545.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 11:32:50'),
(5622,1,'product',3390,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"5V DC Cooling Fan\",\"description\":\"A 5V DC cooling fan is a compact and energy-efficient device used to provide cooling for small electronic systems and portable devices. It operates on a 5-volt direct current power supply, making it ideal for applications such as USB-powered gadgets, microcontroller boards, Raspberry Pi projects, routers, and small enclosures. These fans are typically designed with brushless motor technology, ensuring low noise operation, longer lifespan, and minimal power consumption.\",\"info\":\"Due to their small size and lightweight construction, 5V DC fans are easy to install and suitable for tight spaces where effective heat dissipation is required. They usually come with simple two-wire or USB connections for easy power supply. By maintaining proper airflow, 5V DC cooling fans help prevent overheating, enhance device performance, and extend the life of sensitive electronic components.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1590],\"alternative_name\":\"Cooling Fan\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774956854429-322345068.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 11:34:14'),
(5623,1,'product',2438,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"12V Water Flow sensor \",\"description\":\"YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor 1/2 inch, Robodo YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor, Water Flow Sensor YF?S201, Water Flow Sensor / Fluid Flowmeter YF?S201, Robocraze YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor, and YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor by Quartz Components are all versions of the YF-S201 — a compact Hall-effect water flow sensor with a standard 1/2? threaded connection for plumbing systems.\",\"info\":\"This sensor is designed to measure the flow rate of water (or other non-corrosive liquids) passing through a pipe and output a digital pulse signal that can be read by a microcontroller such as Arduino, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, or Raspberry Pi Pico\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"YF-S201 1/2 inch\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":165,\"secondary_id\":77,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-31 12:15:02'),
