(5631,1,'product',554,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2 CELL AA HOLDER\",\"description\":\"The 2-Cell AA Battery Holder is a compact and durable case designed to hold two AA batteries, providing a stable power source for DIY electronics, robotics, LED circuits, and small Arduino projects.\",\"info\":\"A compact battery holder designed to securely hold two AA batteries in series, providing about 3 V of power with easy access to positive and negative terminals for wiring into your electronic projects, portable devices, or DIY circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":82,\"secondary_id\":\"491\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-31 12:44:04'),
(5632,1,'product',553,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"4 CELL AA HOLDER\",\"description\":\"The 4-Cell AA Battery Holder securely holds four AA batteries and provides a reliable power source for DIY electronics, robotics, LED circuits, Arduino projects, and portable devices.\",\"info\":\"A 4-cell AA battery holder is a molded plastic compartment that securely holds four AA batteries in series and makes electrical contacts so you can easily draw power  via leads, clips, or connectors\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":82,\"secondary_id\":\"493\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-31 12:44:27'),
(5633,1,'product',3391,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2 AA Battery Holder With Cover\",\"description\":\"A 2 AA battery holder with cover is a compact and protective enclosure designed to securely hold two AA batteries while providing a stable power supply for electronic devices and DIY projects. It is typically made from durable plastic and features metal spring contacts to ensure reliable electrical connectivity. The built-in cover helps protect the batteries from dust, moisture, and accidental contact, enhancing safety and durability during use.\",\"info\":\"These holders are commonly used in applications such as remote controls, toys, LED projects, Arduino circuits, and portable devices. Most models come with pre-attached wires or terminals for easy connection, and some variants include an ON/OFF switch for convenient power control. By keeping the batteries securely in place and protected, this holder ensures efficient power delivery and long-lasting performance in various low-voltage applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[822],\"mrp\":\"199\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774961897651-878700321.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 12:58:17'),
(5634,1,'product',3392,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3 AA Battery Holder With Cover\",\"description\":\"A 3 AA battery holder with cover is a sturdy and reliable enclosure designed to hold three AA batteries securely while providing a consistent power source for electronic devices and DIY applications. Made from high-quality plastic, it includes metal spring contacts that ensure strong electrical conductivity and stable battery placement. The protective cover helps shield the batteries from dust, moisture, and accidental short circuits, improving safety and durability.\",\"info\":\"This type of holder typically provides a 4.5V output when using standard 1.5V AA batteries, making it suitable for use in toys, LED lighting, Arduino projects, portable gadgets, and small electronic circuits. Many models come with pre-attached wires or terminals for easy connectivity, and some include an integrated ON/OFF switch for added convenience.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[828],\"mrp\":\"199\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774962059442-325581540.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 13:00:59'),
(5635,1,'product',3393,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2 Slot AA Battery Holder\",\"description\":\"A 2 slot AA battery holder is a simple and practical component designed to hold two AA batteries securely and provide a stable power supply for electronic circuits and devices. Typically made from durable plastic, it features metal spring contacts that ensure proper electrical connection and firm battery placement. This type of holder usually provides an output of 3V when using standard 1.5V AA batteries connected in series.\",\"info\":\"It is widely used in DIY electronics, Arduino projects, toys, LED circuits, and portable devices. Most 2 slot holders come with pre-attached wires or metal terminals for easy integration into circuits, while some variants are designed for PCB mounting. Its compact design, ease of use, and reliable performance make it an essential component for low-voltage power applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[822],\"mrp\":\"199\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774963789322-25823843.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 13:29:49'),
(5636,1,'product',2399,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2200mah Drone battery\",\"description\":\"A 2200 mAh battery is a rechargeable power pack commonly used in hobby and small to medium-sized quadcopters, UAVs, and RC aircraft. The “2200 mAh” figure means the battery has a capacity of 2200 milliamp hours — essentially how much electrical charge it can store.\",\"info\":\"Most 2200 mAh batteries are 3-cell (3S) designs providing around 11.1 V nominal voltage, making them suitable for a broad range of consumer drones and hobby multirotors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"The “2200 mAh” figure means the battery has a capacity of 2200 milliamp hours — essentially how much electrical charge it can store.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":62,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774967865141-205559344.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 14:37:45'),
(5637,1,'product',2399,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2200mah Drone battery\",\"description\":\"A 2200 mAh battery is a rechargeable power pack commonly used in hobby and small to medium-sized quadcopters, UAVs, and RC aircraft. The “2200 mAh” figure means the battery has a capacity of 2200 milliamp hours — essentially how much electrical charge it can store.\",\"info\":\"Most 2200 mAh batteries are 3-cell (3S) designs providing around 11.1 V nominal voltage, making them suitable for a broad range of consumer drones and hobby multirotors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"The “2200 mAh” figure means the battery has a capacity of 2200 milliamp hours — essentially how much electrical charge it can store.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":62,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-31 14:38:48'),
