(5646,1,'product',2977,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"10D431 MOV Thermister\",\"description\":\"10D431 MOV Thermistor is a protective electronic component used to limit inrush current and suppress voltage surges in power circuits. The NTC (Negative Temperature Coefficient) thermistor characteristic means its resistance is high at room temperature and decreases as it heats up, helping to control sudden current spikes when equipment is switched ON. The 10D431 rating typically indicates a disc-type component designed to handle high energy and surge conditions.\",\"info\":\"This component is commonly used in SMPS, inverters, UPS systems, adapters, battery chargers, motor drives, and other AC-powered electronic equipment. When combined with surge protection functionality (often associated with MOV behavior), it helps protect sensitive components from voltage transients, spikes, and electrical stress. Reliable, cost-effective, and easy to integrate, the NTC 10D431 MOV thermistor improves circuit safety, stability, and overall lifespan of electronic devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":640,\"secondary_id\":\"643\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-31 14:50:03'),
(5647,1,'product',2718,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"14D431 MOV Thermistor\",\"description\":\"The 14D431 MOV (Metal Oxide Varistor) is a surge protection component designed to protect electronic circuits and devices from voltage spikes and transient electrical surges. It has a nonlinear resistance that remains high under normal voltage conditions but drops sharply when the voltage exceeds its threshold (around 431 V), allowing it to absorb and divert excess energy away from sensitive components.\",\"info\":\"MOVs like the 14D431 are commonly used in power supplies, surge protectors, household appliances, industrial equipment, and electrical panels to guard against lightning strikes, switching surges, and other unexpected voltage spikes. By limiting surge energy, they help prevent damage, improve reliability, and extend the life of electronic systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"99.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":640,\"secondary_id\":\"641\",\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-31 14:50:27'),
(5648,1,'product',2399,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2200mah Li-ion Battery\",\"description\":\"A 2200 mAh battery is a rechargeable power pack commonly used in hobby and small to medium-sized quadcopters, UAVs, and RC aircraft. The “2200 mAh” figure means the battery has a capacity of 2200 milliamp hours — essentially how much electrical charge it can store.\",\"info\":\"Most 2200 mAh batteries are 3-cell (3S) designs providing around 11.1 V nominal voltage, making them suitable for a broad range of consumer drones and hobby multirotors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"The “2200 mAh” figure means the battery has a capacity of 2200 milliamp hours — essentially how much electrical charge it can store.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":62,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-31 14:53:52'),
(5649,1,'product',3394,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2500mAh Li-ion Battery\",\"description\":\"A 2500mAh Li-ion battery is a rechargeable energy storage device widely used in portable electronic applications due to its high energy density and reliable performance. Typically rated at 3.7V, this battery can deliver a capacity of 2500 milliampere-hours, meaning it can supply a steady current over an extended period depending on the load. It is commonly available in cylindrical forms such as the popular 18650 cell, as well as in flat pouch designs for compact devices.\",\"info\":\"These batteries are widely used in applications such as laptops, power banks, LED lights, medical devices, handheld gadgets, and DIY electronics projects. Lithium-ion batteries are known for their lightweight construction, low self-discharge rate, and absence of memory effect, making them more efficient compared to traditional battery types. They also support multiple charge and discharge cycles, providing long-term usability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[628],\"alternative_name\":\"Li-ion Battery\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774968968070-756337589.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 14:56:08'),
(5650,1,'product',3394,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2500mAh long Li-ion Battery\",\"description\":\"A 2500mAh Li-ion battery is a rechargeable energy storage device widely used in portable electronic applications due to its high energy density and reliable performance. Typically rated at 3.7V, this battery can deliver a capacity of 2500 milliampere-hours, meaning it can supply a steady current over an extended period depending on the load. It is commonly available in cylindrical forms such as the popular 18650 cell, as well as in flat pouch designs for compact devices.\",\"info\":\"These batteries are widely used in applications such as laptops, power banks, LED lights, medical devices, handheld gadgets, and DIY electronics projects. Lithium-ion batteries are known for their lightweight construction, low self-discharge rate, and absence of memory effect, making them more efficient compared to traditional battery types. They also support multiple charge and discharge cycles, providing long-term usability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":62,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1774969166876-1733813.jpeg\"}','2026-03-31 14:59:26'),
(5651,1,'product',3394,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3.6V 2500mAh long Li-ion Battery\",\"description\":\"A 2500mAh Li-ion battery is a rechargeable energy storage device widely used in portable electronic applications due to its high energy density and reliable performance. Typically rated at 3.7V, this battery can deliver a capacity of 2500 milliampere-hours, meaning it can supply a steady current over an extended period depending on the load. It is commonly available in cylindrical forms such as the popular 18650 cell, as well as in flat pouch designs for compact devices.\",\"info\":\"These batteries are widely used in applications such as laptops, power banks, LED lights, medical devices, handheld gadgets, and DIY electronics projects. Lithium-ion batteries are known for their lightweight construction, low self-discharge rate, and absence of memory effect, making them more efficient compared to traditional battery types. They also support multiple charge and discharge cycles, providing long-term usability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"499.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":408,\"secondary_id\":62,\"brand_id\":232}],\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-03-31 15:00:02'),
(5652,1,'product',3395,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LR1130 Alkaline Coin Cell\",\"description\":\"The LR1130 Alkaline Coin Cell is a small, round, button-type battery commonly used in compact electronic devices. It operates at a nominal voltage of 1.5V and is designed to provide reliable, low-drain power for devices such as calculators, watches, toys, laser pointers, and small medical instruments.\",\"info\":\"Known for its compact size and lightweight design, the LR1130 battery is easy to install and replace. It is also referred to by equivalent names like AG10, 389, or LR54, depending on the manufacturer. This alkaline coin cell offers stable performance and a reasonable shelf life, making it a popular choice for everyday portable electronics.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[672],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775016763905-53939514.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 04:12:43'),
