(5655,1,'product',3396,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"SR521 Maxell Battery\",\"description\":\"The SR521 Maxell Battery is a high-quality silver oxide coin cell battery designed for precision and long-lasting performance in small electronic devices. Manufactured by Maxell, this battery delivers a stable output voltage of 1.55V, making it ideal for sensitive devices like watches, calculators, medical instruments, and small electronic gadgets.\",\"info\":\"Compared to alkaline coin cells, silver oxide batteries like the SR521 provide more consistent voltage over their lifespan and better reliability. It is commonly known by other equivalent names such as SR521SW, 379, or LR521 (alkaline equivalent).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[396],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775016945656-407467070.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 04:15:45'),
