(5657,1,'product',3397,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"CR1616 Lithum Battery\",\"description\":\"he CR1616 Lithium Battery is a compact coin cell battery commonly used in small electronic devices that require reliable and long-lasting power. It operates at a nominal voltage of 3V and uses lithium chemistry, which provides a higher energy density and longer shelf life compared to alkaline batteries.\",\"info\":\"Due to its slim profile and lightweight design, the CR1616 is widely used in car key fobs, watches, calculators, fitness devices, and computer motherboards. It delivers stable voltage output over time, making it suitable for precision electronics.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[672],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775017348783-955086321.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 04:22:28'),
(5658,1,'product',3398,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LR626 Giga-tek battery\",\"description\":\"The LR626 Giga-Zek battery is a compact alkaline button cell designed to provide reliable 1.5V power for small electronic devices. Commonly known by equivalent names such as AG4, LR66, or 377A, this battery is widely used in wristwatches, calculators, toys, laser pointers, and other low-drain gadgets. Manufactured under the Giga-Zek brand, it offers stable performance and easy compatibility with a variety of devices requiring this size\",\"info\":\"The LR626 features a lightweight and space-saving design, making it ideal for portable electronics. While it provides cost-effective power, its alkaline chemistry typically has a shorter lifespan compared to silver oxide alternatives, but it remains a popular choice for everyday applications due to its affordability and availability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[672],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775017636708-184970521.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 04:27:16'),
(5659,1,'product',3399,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"SR920SW vinnic Battery\",\"description\":\"The SR920SW Vinnic battery is a high-performance silver oxide coin cell designed for precision electronic devices that require stable and long-lasting power. Produced by Vinnic, this battery delivers a consistent 1.55V output, making it ideal for wristwatches, calculators, medical instruments, and other compact electronics. It is commonly known by equivalent codes such as 371 or SR69, ensuring broad compatibility across different devices and brands\",\"info\":\"Thanks to its silver oxide chemistry, the SR920SW provides a more stable voltage and longer lifespan compared to alkaline alternatives, making it especially suitable for sensitive equipment. Its compact size, leak-resistant design, and reliable performance make it a popular choice for everyday and professional use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[672],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775018256343-127766284.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 04:37:36'),
