(5663,1,'product',3400,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LR41 Maxell Battery\",\"description\":\"The LR41 Maxell Battery is a compact alkaline button cell designed to provide reliable power for small electronic devices. Manufactured by Maxell, it delivers a nominal voltage of 1.5V and is commonly used in watches, calculators, toys, laser pointers, and medical devices like thermometers. This battery is also known by equivalent names such as AG3, 192, or LR736, making it widely compatible across various devices\",\"info\":\"This battery is also known by equivalent names such as AG3, 192, or LR736, making it widely compatible across various devices. Its lightweight and compact design make it ideal for space-constrained electronics, while its alkaline chemistry offers an economical solution for low-drain applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[396],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775018388160-857970397.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 04:39:48'),
