(5673,1,'product',3404,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"14D911 MOV Thermistor\",\"description\":\"The 14D911 MOV is a Metal Oxide Varistor used for protecting electronic circuits from high-voltage surges and transient spikes. It is often mistakenly called a thermistor, but it is actually a voltage-dependent resistor. The code “14D911” indicates a 14 mm disc diameter and a varistor voltage of approximately 910V. Under normal voltage conditions, the MOV remains in a high-resistance state.\",\"info\":\"The code “14D911” indicates a 14 mm disc diameter and a varistor voltage of approximately 910V. Under normal voltage conditions, the MOV remains in a high-resistance state. When a sudden voltage surge occurs, its resistance drops instantly, allowing it to absorb and divert excess energy, thereby protecting sensitive electronic components from damage.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1603],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775021184625-815756774.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 05:26:24'),
(5674,1,'product',3405,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"14D751 MOV Thermistor\",\"description\":\"The 14D751 MOV (Metal Oxide Varistor) is a voltage-dependent protection component used to safeguard electronic circuits from sudden voltage surges and spikes. Although sometimes incorrectly referred to as a thermistor, it actually responds to voltage changes rather than temperature. The “14D751” designation indicates a 14 mm disc size and a varistor voltage of approximately 750V. Under normal operating conditions, the MOV maintains a very high resistance and allows minimal current flow.\",\"info\":\"However, when a high-voltage transient occurs, its resistance drops rapidly, enabling it to absorb and divert excess energy away from sensitive components. This makes it an essential component in power supplies, home appliances, and industrial equipment, ensuring reliable protection against electrical surges.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1603],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775021387281-187027438.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 05:29:47'),
