(5684,1,'product',3408,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"14D511 MOV Thermistor\",\"description\":\"The 14D511 MOV is a Metal Oxide Varistor used for protecting electronic circuits from voltage surges and transient spikes. Although sometimes incorrectly called a thermistor, it actually functions as a voltage-dependent resistor. The code “14D511” indicates a 14 mm disc diameter and a varistor voltage of approximately 510V. Under normal operating conditions, the MOV remains in a high-resistance state and allows minimal current flow.\",\"info\":\"The code “14D511” indicates a 14 mm disc diameter and a varistor voltage of approximately 510V. Under normal operating conditions, the MOV remains in a high-resistance state and allows minimal current flow. When a sudden voltage surge occurs, its resistance drops rapidly, enabling it to absorb and divert excess voltage away from sensitive components, thus preventing damage.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1603],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775021703207-794523571.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 05:35:03'),
