(5687,1,'product',3409,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"7D241 MOV Thermistor\",\"description\":\"The 7D241 MOV is a Metal Oxide Varistor used for protecting electronic circuits from voltage surges and transient spikes. It is often mistakenly referred to as a thermistor, but it actually responds to changes in voltage rather than temperature. The code “7D241” indicates a 7 mm disc size and a varistor voltage of approximately 240V.\",\"info\":\"The code “7D241” indicates a 7 mm disc size and a varistor voltage of approximately 240V. Under normal operating conditions, the MOV maintains very high resistance and allows minimal current flow. When a voltage surge occurs, its resistance drops rapidly, enabling it to absorb and clamp excess voltage, thereby protecting sensitive electronic components from damage.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1606],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775022067721-633251241.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 05:41:07'),
(5688,1,'product',3410,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"7D471 MOV Thermistor\",\"description\":\"The 7D471 MOV (Metal Oxide Varistor) is a compact voltage-dependent resistor designed to protect electronic circuits from sudden voltage surges and transient spikes. Despite sometimes being incorrectly referred to as a thermistor, it actually responds to changes in voltage rather than temperature. The designation “7D471” indicates a disc diameter of 7 mm and a varistor voltage of approximately 470V. Under normal operating conditions, the MOV maintains a very high resistance, allowing only minimal current to pass through the circuit.\",\"info\":\"When a high-voltage surge occurs, its resistance drops rapidly, enabling it to absorb and clamp the excess voltage to a safe level. This fast response helps prevent damage to sensitive electronic components. Due to its small size, the 7D471 is ideal for compact circuit designs and low to medium power applications. It is commonly used in power adapters, LED drivers, consumer electronics, and small power supply units. The device is easy to mount on printed circuit boards and offers reliable, long-term protection under normal conditions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1606],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775022372296-856593511.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 05:46:12'),
(5689,1,'brand',305,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"Akari\",\"description\":\"AKARI is a well-known brand under Akari Global, focused on rechargeable power solutions and lighting products. The company manufactures a wide range of VRLA (Sealed Lead Acid) batteries, along with emergency lights, flashlights, and other household electrical products.\",\"info\":\"The brand is especially popular in India and Asian markets for providing affordable and reliable backup power products, mainly used in small electronic devices.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1775022474269-882344498.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 05:47:54'),
