(5718,1,'product',3424,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ZEB Energipod PB17 Power Bank\",\"description\":\"The ZEB Energipod PB17 from Zebronics is a compact and reliable 10000mAh power bank designed for everyday charging needs. It supports smartphones and tablets with dual USB output ports, allowing you to charge two devices simultaneously. The power bank features both Type-C and Micro USB input options, making it convenient for different charging cables.\",\"info\":\"It also includes an LED indicator to display battery status. Built with multiple safety protections such as overcharge, overload, and short circuit protection, the PB17 ensures safe and stable charging. Its lightweight and portable design make it ideal for travel, office, and daily use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1623],\"mrp\":\"1999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775026507158-880186095.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 06:55:07'),
(5719,1,'product',3425,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ZEB MB20000R5 Pro Power Bank\",\"description\":\"The ZEB MB20000R5 Pro Power Bank from Zebronics is a high-capacity portable charging solution designed for heavy daily use. With a 20000mAh battery, it provides multiple full charges for smartphones, tablets, and other USB-powered devices. It supports fast charging up to 22.5W, ensuring quick and efficient power delivery. The power bank features dual USB outputs along with a Type-C PD 3.0 port, allowing you to charge multiple devices simultaneously.\",\"info\":\"The power bank features dual USB outputs along with a Type-C PD 3.0 port, allowing you to charge multiple devices simultaneously. It also includes an LED percentage display for accurate battery level monitoring and a built-in torch light for emergency use. With advanced safety features like overcharge, overload, and short-circuit protection, it ensures safe and reliable operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1623],\"mrp\":\"2499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775026975617-369398321.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 07:02:55'),
(5720,1,'product',3426,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RD BLITZ P -210 Wireless Power Bank\",\"description\":\"The RD BLITZ P-210 Power Bank is a compact and efficient portable charging solution designed for everyday use. It comes with a 10000mAh lithium-polymer battery, providing sufficient backup to charge smartphones multiple times while on the go. This model supports wireless charging functionality, making it convenient for modern smartphones without needing cables. It also includes standard USB output and Type-C input options for flexible charging.\",\"info\":\"It also includes standard USB output and Type-C input options for flexible charging. The power bank is built with safety features such as overcharge, short circuit, and heat protection to ensure safe and stable performance. Its sleek and lightweight design makes it easy to carry, making it ideal for travel, office, and daily backup needs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1631],\"mrp\":\"3999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775027198234-113233656.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 07:06:38'),
(5721,1,'product',3427,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Selfie Stick R1\",\"description\":\"The Selfie Stick R1 is a versatile and portable photography accessory designed for capturing selfies, group photos, and videos with ease. It typically features a Bluetooth-enabled remote control, allowing users to take photos wirelessly from a distance of up to around 10 meters . Most R1 models come with a 3-in-1 multifunction design, combining a selfie stick, tripod stand, and mobile holder in one compact device. The stick is extendable, usually up to 2–3 feet or more, making it easier to capture wider angles and better shots\",\"info\":\"Built using lightweight materials like ABS plastic and stainless steel, the R1 selfie stick is easy to carry and durable for everyday use. It includes an adjustable phone holder compatible with most smartphones and often supports 360° rotation for flexible shooting angles. Some variants also come with additional features like LED fill light or enhanced grip for stability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1411],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775028197100-842004143.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 07:23:17'),
(5722,1,'product',3428,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Selfie Stick R1S\",\"description\":\"The Selfie Stick R1S is a multifunctional and portable mobile accessory designed for capturing selfies, group photos, and videos with ease. It features a 3-in-1 design, combining a selfie stick, tripod stand, and mobile holder into one compact device. Equipped with a Bluetooth remote control, it allows users to take photos wirelessly from a distance of up to around 10 meters, making it ideal for hands-free shooting. Many R1S models also include an LED fill light, improving image quality in low-light conditions.\",\"info\":\"The stick is extendable and foldable, typically reaching around 60–70 cm or more, while remaining compact enough to fit in a pocket or bag . It supports 360° rotation, enabling flexible angle adjustments for both portrait and landscape shots. Built using lightweight materials like ABS plastic and aluminum, it is easy to carry and durable for daily use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1411],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775029051491-14311404.png\"}','2026-04-01 07:37:31'),
(5723,1,'product',3429,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Fitgear FG-9966 Tripod\",\"description\":\"The Fitgear FG-9966 Tripod is a professional and durable stand designed for photography, videography, and content creation. With a maximum height of around 2.1 meters (7 feet), it provides excellent elevation for capturing wide-angle shots, group photos, and studio-style recordings. Built using lightweight yet मजबूत aluminum alloy, this tripod offers both portability and stability.\",\"info\":\"It features adjustable legs with multiple height levels, allowing users to set the desired position easily. The tripod comes with a universal mobile holder and standard screw mount, making it compatible with smartphones, cameras, and ring lights. A 3-way pan head enables smooth 360° rotation and tilt adjustments for flexible shooting angles.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1401],\"mrp\":\"2499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775032513179-557411120.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 08:35:13'),
