(5748,1,'product',3443,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BS Power BS-BT519 Wireless Neckband\",\"description\":\"The BS Power BS-BT519 Wireless Neckband is a budget-friendly audio device designed for users who want reliable wireless connectivity and strong sound performance at an affordable price. It features Bluetooth connectivity, ensuring quick pairing and a stable connection with smartphones and other devices for seamless music and calling.This neckband delivers clear audio with enhanced bass, making it suitable for everyday entertainment, including music, videos, and voice calls. It is designed to provide a balanced listening experience for regular users.\",\"info\":\"One of its key highlights is the long battery life, offering extended playback time on a single charge, making it ideal for all-day usage without frequent charging. Many similar models in this category are built for continuous use during travel, work, or workouts\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1685],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775039841081-263276259.jpg\"}','2026-04-01 10:37:21'),
