(5760,1,'product',3446,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Duracell 2x Longer battery\",\"description\":\"The Duracell 2X Longer Battery refers to Duracell Ultra alkaline batteries, which are designed to last up to 2 times longer compared to standard zinc or basic alkaline batteries in high-drain devices. These batteries are ideal for powering devices like digital cameras, toys, wireless accessories, remotes, and flashlights.\",\"info\":\"Duracell Ultra batteries use advanced alkaline technology with Duralock power preservation, ensuring long-lasting and consistent energy output. This helps devices run smoothly for extended periods without frequent battery replacement.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1700],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775102780116-736181847.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:06:20'),
(5761,1,'product',3447,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Duracell Ultra AA Battery\",\"description\":\"The Duracell Ultra AA Battery is a premium alkaline battery designed to deliver long-lasting and reliable power for everyday and high-drain electronic devices. It is widely used in devices like remote controls, toys, cameras, wireless accessories, flashlights, and gaming controllers.\",\"info\":\"The Duracell Ultra AA Battery is a premium alkaline battery designed to deliver long-lasting and reliable power for everyday and high-drain electronic devices. It is widely used in devices like remote controls, toys, cameras, wireless accessories, flashlights, and gaming controllers.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1703],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775103193074-864924021.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:13:13'),
(5762,1,'product',3448,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GP Green Cell AA Battery\",\"description\":\"The GP Green Cell AA Battery is a cost-effective power solution designed for daily-use electronic devices. It belongs to GP’s Greencell (Extra Heavy Duty) range, which uses zinc-carbon technology, making it ideal for low to medium-drain devices such as remote controls, clocks, toys, flashlights, and radios. These batteries provide reliable and consistent power output, ensuring smooth operation for everyday gadgets. They are especially suitable for devices that do not require high power consumption, offering a balance between performance and affordability.\",\"info\":\"One of the key advantages of GP Green Cell batteries is their budget-friendly pricing, making them a popular choice for households and bulk usage. They are also mercury-free, making them safer for the environment compared to older battery types.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[846],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775103332026-759354913.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:15:32'),
(5763,1,'product',3449,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GP Power HeavyDuty AA Battery\",\"description\":\"The GP Power Heavy Duty AA Battery (also known as GP Greencell Extra Heavy Duty) is a cost-effective and reliable power solution designed for everyday household devices. It uses zinc-carbon technology, making it ideal for low to medium-drain applications such as remote controls, wall clocks, flashlights, radios, and toys\",\"info\":\"These batteries provide stable and consistent power output, ensuring smooth operation of basic electronic devices. They are especially suitable for users who need affordable batteries for regular use, rather than high-performance or heavy-drain applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[846],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775103539681-201176335.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:18:59'),
(5764,1,'product',3450,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"zebronics K65 WIRED KEYBOARD\",\"description\":\"The Zebronics K65 is a budget-friendly wired keyboard designed for everyday use such as office work, typing, and basic home computing. It offers a full-size layout with essential features while keeping the price very low.\",\"info\":\"USB wired connectivity\\r\\nSimple plug-and-play support—no drivers required.\\r\\nUV-coated keys\\r\\nKeys are coated to prevent fading and improve durability over time.\\r\\nRetractable stand\\r\\nAdjustable tilt helps provide a better typing angle and comfort.\\r\\nSlim & lightweight design\\r\\nCompact and easy to place on any desk (approx. 390g weight).\\r\\nDurable key life\\r\\nSupports up to 5 million keystrokes.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[185],\"mrp\":\"1200\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775103668171-14138538.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 04:21:08'),
(5765,1,'product',3451,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic Speciall AA Battery\",\"description\":\"The Panasonic Special AA Battery is a budget-friendly zinc-carbon battery designed for everyday low-power devices. It provides a reliable and economical power solution, making it ideal for household and office use. These batteries are commonly used in TV remotes, wall clocks, toys, torches, and radios, where consistent but low energy is required\",\"info\":\"The Panasonic Special AA Battery is a budget-friendly zinc-carbon battery designed for everyday low-power devices. It provides a reliable and economical power solution, making it ideal for household and office use. These batteries are commonly used in TV remotes, wall clocks, toys, torches, and radios, where consistent but low energy is required\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1704],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775103698979-554513225.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:21:38'),
