(5767,1,'product',3452,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Duracell 2x Longer AAA Battery\",\"description\":\"The Duracell 2X Longer AAA Battery refers to the Duracell Ultra AAA alkaline series, which is engineered to deliver up to 2 times longer life compared to ordinary zinc-carbon batteries in high-drain devices. These batteries are ideal for powering gadgets like remote controls, wireless accessories, toys, cameras, and flashlights.\",\"info\":\"Duracell Ultra AAA batteries use advanced alkaline technology, ensuring strong and consistent power output for both everyday and high-performance devices. They are specially designed to handle high energy demand, making them a reliable choice for modern electronics.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1708],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775104023494-502494767.png\"}','2026-04-02 04:27:03'),
(5768,1,'product',3453,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zebronics KM2000 Wired keyboard\",\"description\":\"The Zebronics KM2000 is an affordable wired multimedia keyboard designed for daily typing, office work, and basic home use. It features a full-size ergonomic layout, extra hotkeys, and simple plug-and-play functionality, making it suitable for students and professionals.\",\"info\":\"Full-size 115 keys layout\\r\\nIncludes standard keys, numeric keypad, and additional function keys for productivity.\\r\\n8 dedicated multimedia hotkeys\\r\\nQuick access to functions like volume control, media, and shortcuts.\\r\\nUSB wired connectivity\\r\\nEasy plug-and-play usage without installing drivers.\\r\\nErgonomic design\\r\\nComfortable layout suitable for long typing sessions.\\r\\nLaser-printed keycaps\\r\\nEnsures durability and prevents fading of letters over time.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[185],\"mrp\":\"1140\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775104148285-782943422.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 04:29:08'),
(5769,1,'product',3454,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Duracell Ultra AAA Battery\",\"description\":\"The Duracell Ultra AAA Battery is a premium alkaline battery designed to deliver long-lasting and reliable power for modern electronic devices. It is specially built for high-drain gadgets such as digital cameras, toys, wireless accessories, and gaming controllers.\",\"info\":\"With advanced technology and durable construction, these batteries ensure consistent performance, longer usage time, and dependable energy output compared to standard batteries.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1708],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775104159194-877781751.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:29:19'),
(5770,1,'product',3455,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Duracell Heavy duty AAA Battery\",\"description\":\"The Duracell Heavy Duty AAA Battery is a reliable and cost-effective power solution designed for everyday low-drain devices. It uses zinc-carbon technology, making it ideal for products that do not require continuous high power, such as remote controls, wall clocks, radios, and basic flashlights. These batteries are built to provide stable and consistent energy output for regular household use. Compared to alkaline batteries,\",\"info\":\"Duracell Heavy Duty batteries are more affordable, making them a practical choice for bulk usage. They are lightweight and easy to install in all standard AAA-compatible devices. The batteries are designed with good leak resistance to help protect your devices during normal usage. While they may not last as long as premium alkaline options, they perform efficiently in low-power applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1708],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775104576006-816886307.png\"}','2026-04-02 04:36:16'),
(5771,1,'product',3456,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Nippo AAA Battery\",\"description\":\"The Nippo AAA Battery is a popular and budget-friendly power solution widely used in Indian households. It typically provides 1.5V output, making it suitable for a variety of small electronic devices such as remote controls, wall clocks, toys, and flashlights. These batteries are commonly available in zinc-carbon and alkaline variants, offering options for both basic and higher performance needs.\",\"info\":\"Nippo batteries are designed to deliver stable and consistent power for low to moderate drain devices, ensuring reliable everyday usage. The brand is known for its affordability and wide availability, making it a practical choice for bulk usage in homes, shops, and offices. Many Nippo AAA batteries come with leak-resistant construction, helping protect devices from damage during regular use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[848],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775104695865-386644337.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:38:15'),
(5772,1,'product',3457,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zebronics K20 Wired keyboard\",\"description\":\"The Zebronics K20 is a standard full-size wired keyboard designed for everyday use in homes, offices, and basic computing tasks. It connects via USB and offers a simple, reliable typing experience with a durable build.\",\"info\":\"Full-size layout (104 keys): Includes all standard keys plus a dedicated ₹ (rupee) keyUSB wired connectivity: Easy plug-and-play, no drivers neededUV-coated keys: Helps prevent key fading and improves durabilityRetractable stand: Adjustable tilt for comfortable typingCompact & lightweight design: Suitable for desks with limited spaceCompatible with multiple systems: Works with Windows, Linux, and other OS\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[185],\"mrp\":\"1140\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775104843150-818564750.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 04:40:43'),
(5773,1,'product',3458,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panasonic Special AAA Battery\",\"description\":\"The Panasonic Special AAA Battery is a cost-effective and reliable power solution designed for everyday household devices. It is typically made using zinc-carbon technology, making it suitable for low-drain applications such as remote controls, wall clocks, radios, and basic flashlights. These batteries provide a stable 1.5V output, ensuring consistent performance for regular use.\",\"info\":\"Panasonic Special batteries are known for being economical and widely available, making them a practical choice for bulk usage in homes, offices, and shops. They are designed to deliver steady and dependable power for devices that do not require high energy consumption. The batteries also feature a leak-resistant construction, helping to protect your devices during normal operation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1709],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775105127859-19346778.png\"}','2026-04-02 04:45:27'),
(5774,1,'product',3459,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Green Power AAA Battery\",\"description\":\"The Green Power AAA Battery is designed as a reliable and eco-friendly power solution for various household and electronic devices. It is available in both rechargeable (Ni-MH) and non-rechargeable (heavy-duty/zinc-carbon) variants, depending on usage requirements. Rechargeable versions typically offer multiple charge cycles, making them cost-effective and environmentally friendly over time.\",\"info\":\"These batteries deliver stable and consistent power output, making them suitable for devices like toys, cordless phones, remote controls, and small electronic gadgets. Rechargeable models often come with capacities around 700mAh, ensuring longer operation and repeated usage without frequent replacement.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[848],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775105217404-95017569.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:46:57'),
(5775,1,'product',3460,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"GP Green Cell AAA Battery\",\"description\":\"The GP Green Cell AAA Battery from GP Batteries is a reliable and economical power source designed for everyday use. It is typically a zinc-carbon (heavy-duty) battery, providing a standard 1.5V output, making it suitable for low-drain devices such as remote controls, wall clocks, radios, and basic flashlights. These batteries are built to deliver stable and consistent power for regular household applications.\",\"info\":\"GP Green Cell batteries are known for their affordability and wide availability, making them ideal for bulk usage in homes, shops, and offices. They are designed with an eco-friendly composition, free from harmful materials like mercury and cadmium, ensuring safer usage and disposal.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[848],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775105300172-315824448.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:48:20'),
(5776,1,'product',3461,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Skotch AAA Battery\",\"description\":\"The Skotch AAA Battery is a budget-friendly power solution designed for everyday household use. It is typically a zinc-carbon (heavy-duty) battery, delivering a standard 1.5V output, making it suitable for low-drain devices such as remote controls, wall clocks, radios, and small flashlights. These batteries are built to provide consistent and stable power for basic electronic applications.\",\"info\":\"Skotch batteries are known for their affordability and practicality, making them ideal for bulk usage in homes, shops, and offices where frequent battery replacement is needed. They are lightweight and compatible with all standard AAA battery slots, ensuring easy installation and wide usability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[848],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775105458230-787014699.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:50:58'),
(5777,1,'product',3462,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Enter Typist mini wired slim keyboard\",\"description\":\"The Enter Typist Mini Wired Slim Keyboard is a compact and lightweight keyboard designed for users who prefer portability and space-saving setups. With its slim profile and reduced key layout, it is ideal for laptops, small desks, and travel use.\",\"info\":\"Compact mini design (78 keys): Saves desk space while retaining essential keys\\r\\nSlim profile: Lightweight and easy to carry\\r\\nChocolate-style keys: Flat, soft-touch keys for smooth and quiet typing\\r\\nUSB wired connectivity: Plug-and-play (no drivers required)\\r\\nSilent keystrokes: Comfortable typing with minimal noise\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[179],\"mrp\":\"1650\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775105529440-607292244.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 04:52:09'),
(5778,1,'product',3463,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"9V Battery\",\"description\":\"A 9V battery is a compact, rectangular-shaped battery that provides a standard output of 9 volts and is widely used in various electronic devices. It is commonly used in applications such as smoke detectors, wireless microphones, multimeters, toys, and portable radios, where a steady and reliable power supply is required. These batteries are available in different types, including alkaline, zinc-carbon (heavy-duty), lithium, and rechargeable variants like Ni-MH.\",\"info\":\"The most popular type is the alkaline 9V battery, which offers longer life and better performance compared to heavy-duty versions. A typical 9V battery has snap-type connectors on the top, making it easy to attach and replace. It is designed to deliver consistent voltage, which is important for safety devices and precision instruments.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1607],\"mrp\":\"299\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775105643678-444456439.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:54:03'),
(5779,1,'product',3464,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Dell KB216 Wired Multimedia keyboard\",\"description\":\"The Dell KB216 Wired Multimedia Keyboard is a full-size, reliable USB keyboard built for everyday computing tasks. It features a slim, modern design with chiclet-style keys, offering comfortable and quiet typing for office, school, or home use.\",\"info\":\"Full-size layout: Includes standard keys with a dedicated numeric keypad\\r\\nChiclet-style keys: Laptop-like keys for smooth and comfortable typing\\r\\nMultimedia hotkeys: Quick access to volume, play/pause, rewind, and forward functions\\r\\nUSB wired connectivity: Plug-and-play, no drivers required\\r\\nQuiet typing: Rubber dome (plunger) keys reduce typing noise\\r\\nSlim & ergonomic design: Comfortable for long typing sessions without wrist strain\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[178],\"mrp\":\"3000\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775105799664-278440940.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 04:56:39'),
(5780,1,'product',3465,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"9V Battery charger\",\"description\":\"A 9V battery charger is a device used to recharge rechargeable 9V batteries (Ni-MH, Ni-Cd, or lithium types), helping save money and reduce battery waste. When choosing one, the most important factors are battery compatibility, charging slots, safety features, and charging speed.\",\"info\":\"A 9V battery charger is a compact electronic device designed to recharge rechargeable 9-volt batteries commonly used in devices like smoke detectors, microphones, multimeters, toys, and remote controls. It works with battery types such as NiMH (Nickel Metal Hydride) or Li-ion 9V batteries, ensuring safe and efficient charging.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[853],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775105841754-316496796.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 04:57:21'),
