(5782,1,'product',3466,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Eveready heavy duty big battery\",\"description\":\"A heavy-duty 9V battery from Eveready is a reliable power source designed for everyday electronic devices such as smoke detectors, microphones, toys, multimeters, and radios. These batteries are typically made using zinc-carbon technology, offering steady performance and good power retention for low to moderate drain devices.\",\"info\":\"Eveready heavy-duty 9V batteries (commonly model 1216 / 6F22) are known for features like leak resistance, long shelf life (up to a few years when unused), and a sealed design that prevents spillage and damage. They are non-rechargeable and ready to use instantly, making them ideal for household and professional applications where dependable, cost-effective power is required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1712],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775106479112-910074838.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 05:07:59'),
(5783,1,'product',3467,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Enter Standard E-WKB-A Wireless keyboard and Mouse combo\",\"description\":\"The Enter E-WKB-A Wireless Keyboard and Mouse Combo is a basic desktop combo set designed for everyday use. It offers wireless convenience, a full-size keyboard layout, and a responsive optical mouse, making it suitable for home, office, and student use.\",\"info\":\"2.4 GHz wireless connectivity: Stable connection with a USB nano receiver\\r\\nPlug-and-play: No drivers required—just connect and start using\\r\\nWireless range: Up to 8–10 meters for flexible usage\\r\\nFull-size keyboard: Includes standard keys and multimedia shortcuts\\r\\nMultimedia hotkeys: Quick access to volume, media, and internet controls\\r\\nErgonomic design: Comfortable for long typing sessions\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[643],\"mrp\":\"2700\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775106484766-267363651.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 05:08:04'),
(5784,1,'product',3468,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Eveready AA Small Battery\",\"description\":\"An Eveready AA small battery is a widely used 1.5V power source designed for everyday electronic devices such as remote controls, clocks, toys, flashlights, and wireless accessories. These batteries are available in different types like zinc-carbon for basic usage, alkaline for longer-lasting performance, and rechargeable NiMH for repeated use.\",\"info\":\"Eveready AA batteries are known for their reliable power, leak-resistant design, and long shelf life, making them suitable for both household and professional applications. They provide consistent energy output and are compatible with a wide range of devices, ensuring convenience and efficiency in daily use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1712],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775106627940-673555701.png\"}','2026-04-02 05:10:27'),
(5785,1,'product',3469,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zebronics Companion 151 Wireless keyboard and mouse combo \",\"description\":\"The Zebronics Companion 151 is a reliable wireless keyboard and mouse combo designed for everyday home and office use. It offers a full-size keyboard, stable wireless connectivity, and a compact mouse, making it a good choice for basic computing tasks without cable clutter.\",\"info\":\"2.4 GHz wireless connectivity: Stable and lag-free performance using a USB nano receiver\\r\\nFull-size keyboard (107 keys): Includes number pad and dedicated ₹ (rupee) key\\r\\n8 multimedia hotkeys: Quick access to media and system functions\\r\\nUV-coated keycaps: Prevent fading and improve durability\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[649],\"mrp\":\"3000\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775106821458-965795349.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 05:13:41'),
