(5787,1,'product',3470,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Citical CT991ms Scientific Calculator\",\"description\":\"The Citical CT-991MS Scientific Calculator is an affordable and practical calculator designed for students and basic engineering use. It typically features a 2-line display, allowing users to view both the input and result at the same time, making calculations easier and more accurate. This model supports a wide range of mathematical functions including algebra, trigonometry, statistics, and basic scientific calculations. It is powered by battery (and sometimes dual power in similar models), ensuring long-lasting usage. The calculator is compact, lightweight, and comes with a protective sliding cover for durability.\",\"info\":\"With around 240–400+ functions depending on variant, it is suitable for school and college-level calculations. It is often compared to models like Casio 991MS, offering similar features at a much lower price. According to available listings, it is commonly priced in the budget range and widely used for educational purposes\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[859],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775107436077-705165653.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 05:23:56'),
(5788,1,'product',3471,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Live Tech WMK09 Wireless keyboard and Mouse combo\",\"description\":\"The Live Tech WMK09 is a budget‑friendly wireless keyboard and mouse combo designed for everyday use on desktops and laptops. It offers a simple, reliable wireless setup with a full‑size keyboard and a responsive optical mouse — ideal for home, office, or student use without the hassle of cables.\",\"info\":\"Full‑size keyboard: Standard layout with number pad (typically ~106‑107 keys) for easy typing and productivity.\\r\\nQuiet/silent keys: Low‑noise keypresses make typing comfortable without loud clicks.\\r\\n12 FN multimedia keys: Quick access to volume, play/pause, email, web browser and other functions (depending on model).\\r\\nErgonomic wireless mouse: Responsive optical sensor with 1200 DPI for accurate cursor control.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1715],\"mrp\":\"4350\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775107544062-836714288.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 05:25:44'),
(5789,1,'product',3472,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Oreva OR-240 MS Scientific calculator\",\"description\":\"The Oreva OR-240 MS Scientific Calculator is a budget-friendly and reliable calculator designed mainly for students, school exams, and basic engineering calculations. It features a 2-line display, allowing users to see both the input and output simultaneously, which helps reduce errors and improves calculation clarity. The calculator supports a wide range of functions including trigonometry, algebra, logarithms, statistics, and complex number calculations, making it suitable for academic use.\",\"info\":\"This model typically offers around 131 to 240 functions depending on variant, along with features like multi-replay function, easy-to-read display, and compact design. It is powered by battery or dual power (battery + solar in some versions), ensuring long usage without frequent battery changes.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[859],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775107573715-195474588.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 05:26:13'),
(5790,1,'product',3473,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Enter Typemate Pro Wied keyboard and Mouse cobo\",\"description\":\"The Enter TypeMate Pro is a budget‑friendly wired keyboard and mouse combo that provides a reliable and straightforward input solution for everyday desktop and laptop use. It’s ideal for basic typing, browsing, and office work without the need for separate peripherals.\",\"info\":\"Full‑size layout (104 keys): Standard key arrangement with all essential keys for productivity.\\r\\nSlim design: Low‑profile keyboard that fits well on most desks.\\r\\nUSB wired interface: Easy plug‑and‑play setup – no drivers required.\\r\\nMouse\\r\\nOptical sensor: Provides smooth tracking and responsive movement.\\r\\n1000 DPI resolution: Good balance of speed and precision for general use\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[634],\"mrp\":\"2400\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775108366281-386118386.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 05:39:26'),
(5791,1,'product',3474,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zebronics Judwaa 541 Wired Keyboard and Mouse combo\",\"description\":\"The Zebronics Judwaa 541 is an affordable wired keyboard and mouse combo ideal for everyday computing tasks like typing, browsing, and basic office work. It’s designed as a plug‑and‑play solution that connects via USB, making it suitable for desktops and laptops without any extra setup.\",\"info\":\"Keyboard\\r\\nFull‑size 104‑key layout: Includes alphanumeric keys and number pad for productivity.\\r\\nMatte finish: Comfortable feel and easy to clean.\\r\\nUSB wired connection: Simple plug‑and‑play with no drivers needed.\\r\\nRetractable stand: Adjustable tilt for comfortable typing angles.\\r\\nMouse\\r\\nOptical sensor: Accurate and smooth tracking suitable for daily tasks.\\r\\n1200 DPI resolution: Good balance of speed and precision.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[640],\"mrp\":\"2250\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775108727534-935343876.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 05:45:27'),
(5792,1,'product',3475,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Citical CT-512B Basic Calculator\",\"description\":\"The Citical CT-512B Basic Calculator is a simple and efficient desktop calculator designed for everyday calculations in offices, shops, and schools. It comes with a 12-digit large LCD display, making numbers easy to read and reducing calculation errors. The calculator supports all basic arithmetic functions such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division, along with useful features like check & correct function that allows you to review and edit previous entries.\",\"info\":\"This model typically includes dual power support (solar + battery), ensuring continuous operation even in low-light conditions. Its big buttons and comfortable keypad layout make it easy to use for long hours. The compact yet sturdy design makes it suitable for desk use as well as portability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[856],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775109073560-534780756.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 05:51:13'),
(5793,1,'product',3476,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zebronics Judwaa 555 Wired Keyboard and Mouse combo\",\"description\":\"The ZEBRONICS Judwaa 555 is an affordable wired keyboard and mouse combo from Zebronics designed for basic everyday computing tasks. It’s ideal for home, office, classroom, or general laptop use, offering a simple plug‑and‑play experience without extra software or setup.\",\"info\":\"Keyboard\\r\\nFull‑size layout: Standard keyboard with about 105 keys plus 9 dedicated hotkeys for quick access to media functions.\\r\\nSuper slim design: Low‑profile look that fits neatly on most desks.\\r\\nComfortable typing: Quiet and comfortable keystrokes for everyday use.\\r\\nMouse\\r\\nErgonomic design: Comfortable shape for regular use.\\r\\nOptical sensor: Responsive and smooth tracking for daily tasks.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[640],\"mrp\":\"1650\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775109088995-44126983.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 05:51:28'),
(5794,1,'product',3477,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Oreva OR-400 GST Calculator\",\"description\":\"The Oreva OR-400 GST Calculator is a practical financial calculator specially designed for GST calculations, billing, and business use. It features a 12-digit large display that ensures clear visibility of numbers, making it ideal for shops, offices, and accounting work. The calculator includes dedicated GST keys (GST+, GST–) for quick tax calculations, helping users easily add or remove GST values during billing.\",\"info\":\"It comes with a check & correct function and 120-step memory, allowing users to review and edit previous entries, reducing calculation errors. The calculator supports auto replay, enabling step-by-step verification of calculations. Powered by dual power (solar + battery), it ensures uninterrupted performance even in low-light conditions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[858],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775109272288-532814259.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 05:54:32'),
(5795,1,'product',3478,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Oreva OR-512 GST Calculator\",\"description\":\"The Oreva OR-512 GST Calculator is a popular desktop calculator designed for GST billing, accounting, and office work. It comes with a 12-digit large display for clear visibility and includes dedicated GST keys (GST+, GST–) that allow quick tax calculations such as adding or removing GST from prices. This makes it highly useful for shopkeepers, accountants, and business professionals.\",\"info\":\"One of its standout features is the 120-step check & correct function, which lets users review and edit previous calculations, reducing errors during billing. It also supports auto replay, enabling step-by-step verification. The calculator runs on dual power (solar + battery), ensuring uninterrupted usage even in low-light conditions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[858],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775109384004-337001967.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 05:56:24'),
(5796,1,'product',3479,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Citical CT-210N Basic Calculator\",\"description\":\"The Citical CT-210N Basic Calculator is a compact pocket-size calculator designed for simple and quick calculations. It features an 8-digit LCD display, making it suitable for basic arithmetic tasks such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division. This model is lightweight and easy to carry, making it ideal for students, shopkeepers, and everyday use.\",\"info\":\"The calculator operates on battery power and is built for convenience, with a clear display and responsive keys for fast input. Its small size and durable design allow it to fit easily in pockets, pencil boxes, or desk drawers. It is mainly used for basic calculations in schools, shops, and offices, especially where portability is important.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[856],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775109668995-666491573.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 06:01:09'),
(5797,1,'product',3480,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Orbit OT-512WT Basic Calculator\",\"description\":\"The Orbit OT-512WT Basic Calculator is a practical desktop calculator designed for daily office, shop, and student use. It features a 12-digit large LCD display, making numbers easy to read and reducing calculation errors during billing or accounting work. This model supports all basic arithmetic operations and often includes a check & correct function, allowing users to review and edit previous calculations for better accuracy.\",\"info\":\"It is equipped with dual power support (solar + battery), ensuring continuous performance even in low-light conditions. The calculator also has big, responsive keys that provide comfortable typing for long hours. Its sturdy build and simple layout make it suitable for business counters, offices, and home use. Similar 512-series calculators typically include step memory functions (around 100–120 steps), enhancing usability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[856],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775110003108-232004634.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 06:06:43'),
(5798,1,'product',3481,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Githzen CT-512WT Basic Calculator\",\"description\":\"The Githzen CT-512WT is a 12-digit basic desktop calculator designed for everyday calculations in offices, shops, and schools. It features a large LCD display for clear number visibility and supports all standard arithmetic operations such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division. This model typically includes a check & correct function, allowing users to review and edit previous entries, which helps reduce calculation errors during billing or accounting work.\",\"info\":\"It is powered by dual power (solar + battery), ensuring reliable performance even in low-light conditions. The calculator also has big, easy-to-press keys for comfortable long-term use. With its compact yet sturdy design, it is ideal for business counters, office desks, and daily household calculations.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[856],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775110133608-255433063.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 06:08:53'),
(5799,1,'product',3482,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Citical CT-120VII Basic Calculator\",\"description\":\"The Citical CT-120VII is a desktop basic calculator designed for business, office, and daily calculations. It comes with a large LCD display and supports up to 12 digits, making it suitable for handling bigger numbers accurately. The calculator includes a check & correct function, allowing users to review and edit previous entries, which helps reduce mistakes during billing or accounting work.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"info\":\"This model features dual power (solar + battery), ensuring continuous operation even in low-light conditions. It also includes smooth touch keys for comfortable typing and long usage. The CT-120VII is commonly used in shops, offices, and by students for quick and efficient calculations\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[856],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775110328271-136485092.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 06:12:08'),
(5800,1,'product',3483,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Citical CT-900GC Basic Calculator\",\"description\":\"The Citical CT-900GC is a premium desktop calculator designed for office, shop, and accounting work. It features a 12-digit large LCD display, making it easy to read long numbers and perform accurate calculations. This model includes a check & correct function, allowing users to review and edit previous steps, which is especially useful for billing and financial tasks.\",\"info\":\"It comes with dual power support (solar + battery), ensuring uninterrupted performance even in low-light conditions. The calculator is built with smooth touch keys and a durable body, offering comfortable usage for long working hours. Compared to standard models, the CT-900GC is slightly more advanced with a better build and premium design.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[856],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775110603774-410506325.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 06:16:43'),
(5801,1,'product',3484,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Citical CT-512GST Basic Calculator\",\"description\":\"The Citical CT-512GST Basic Calculator is a 12-digit desktop calculator specially designed for GST billing, shop use, and office calculations. It features a large LCD display that ensures clear visibility of numbers, making it ideal for handling financial and tax-related calculations. This model includes dedicated GST keys (GST+ and GST–), which allow users to quickly add or remove tax values during billing, saving time and effort.\",\"info\":\"It also comes with a check & correct function with step memory, enabling users to review previous entries and correct mistakes easily. The calculator is powered by dual power (solar + battery), ensuring continuous operation even in low-light conditions. Similar CT-512 models are known for 12-digit display, dual power, and check/correct functionality, making them suitable for daily business use\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[856],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775113307962-878083964.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 07:01:47'),
(5802,1,'product',3485,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zebronics Alex Wired mouse\",\"description\":\"The Zebronics Alex Wired Mouse is a basic, budget-friendly USB mouse designed for everyday computing tasks like browsing, office work, and casual use. It features a compact design with reliable performance, making it suitable for desktops and laptops.\",\"info\":\"Compact & stylish design: Easy to handle and suitable for both left and right-handed users\\r\\nAdvanced optical sensor: Ensures smooth and accurate cursor movement\\r\\n1200 DPI resolution: Provides good precision for daily tasks\\r\\nWorks on most surfaces: Can be used without a mouse pad in many cases\\r\\nPlug-and-play: No drivers required—just connect via USB and use instantly\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[200],\"mrp\":\"897\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775113738728-422225290.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 07:08:58'),
(5803,1,'product',3486,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Dell MS116 Wired Optical mouse\",\"description\":\"The Dell MS116 is a simple, reliable wired optical mouse designed for everyday computing needs — perfect for home, office, school, or general laptop use. It pairs a comfortable ambidextrous design with basic but accurate optical tracking for smooth navigation on most surfaces.\",\"info\":\"Wired USB connectivity: Easy plug‑and‑play—just connect the USB cable and start using, no drivers needed.\\r\\nOptical LED tracking: Provides 1000 DPI sensitivity for responsive, smooth cursor control during browsing or office work.\\r\\nErgonomic and ambidextrous design: Comfortable for both right‑ and left‑handed users throughout long periods of use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[196],\"mrp\":\"1890\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775114223840-436832164.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 07:17:03'),
