(5806,1,'product',3487,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Sri sakthi 1m Soldering lead packet\",\"description\":\"The Sri Sakthi 1 meter soldering lead packet is a compact and affordable solder wire used for electronic repairs, circuit work, and small DIY soldering tasks. It is made with a 60/40 tin-lead composition, which provides smooth melting and strong electrical joints. This solder wire comes with a rosin core, which helps in better flux action and clean soldering without the need for extra flux in most cases.\",\"info\":\"With a 22 SWG thickness and approx. 1-meter length, it is suitable for small jobs like mobile repair, PCB soldering, wire joining, and hobby electronics. The melting point is around 183–190°C, making it easy to use with standard soldering irons. This product is widely used by technicians and students due to its ease of use, good conductivity, and low cost.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1109],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775114524745-83205135.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 07:22:04'),
(5807,1,'product',3488,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Oswal 1M soldering lead \",\"description\":\"The Oswal 1M soldering lead is a small-length solder wire designed for quick and simple electronic repairs. It is commonly made with a 60% tin and 40% lead composition, which provides good conductivity and strong joints while ensuring smooth melting during soldering.\",\"info\":\"This solder wire typically includes a rosin core flux, which helps clean the joint and improves solder flow, eliminating the need for extra flux in most cases. It melts at a medium temperature (around 180–190°C), making it easy to use with standard soldering irons.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1109],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775114707925-616453051.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 07:25:07'),
(5808,1,'product',3489,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ACE 1m Soldering lead\",\"description\":\"The ACE 1 meter soldering lead is a compact solder wire designed for small electronic and electrical repair tasks. It is typically made with a 60% tin and 40% lead composition, which provides good conductivity and strong solder joints. The wire also includes a rosin core flux, helping the solder to melt smoothly and form clean connections without needing extra flux in most cases.\",\"info\":\"This solder wire has a low melting point (around 180–190°C), making it easy to use with standard soldering irons. It is suitable for mobile repairing, PCB soldering, wire joining, and DIY electronics projects. Similar solder wires are widely used because they flow easily and create reliable joints for electronic work\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1109],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775114824989-800419640.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 07:27:04'),
(5809,1,'product',3490,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Supertop 1m soldering lead\",\"description\":\"The Supertop 1M soldering lead is a small, ready-to-use solder wire designed for quick electronic repairs and basic soldering work. Like most 1-meter solder wires, it is made using a 60% tin and 40% lead alloy, which provides good electrical conductivity and strong joints. It also typically includes a rosin core flux, allowing smooth solder flow and clean connections without requiring additional flux.\",\"info\":\"This type of solder wire melts at a low temperature (around 183–190°C), making it easy to use with standard soldering irons. It is widely used for PCB soldering, mobile repair, wire joining, and DIY electronics projects. 1-meter solder wires are commonly preferred for small jobs because they are compact, affordable, and easy to handle\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1109],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775114935795-303863761.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 07:28:55'),
(5810,1,'product',3491,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Metsol 40g soldering lead\",\"description\":\"The Metsol 40g soldering lead is a high-quality solder wire widely used for electronics repair, PCB work, and electrical connections. It is typically made with a 60% tin and 40% lead composition (Sn60/Pb40), which ensures strong joints, good conductivity, and smooth solder flow. Metsol is a known manufacturer of solder materials, offering various types like rosin core and lead-free solder wires for industrial and electronic use\",\"info\":\"This solder wire comes with a rosin core flux, which helps clean the surface and improves soldering quality without needing additional flux. The 40-gram weight makes it suitable for multiple repair jobs compared to small 1-meter wires. It melts at a medium temperature (~183–190°C), making it compatible with most soldering irons.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1109],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775115051731-791301926.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 07:30:51'),
(5811,1,'product',3492,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Maxicom M285 Wired Optical Mouse\",\"description\":\"The Maxicom M285 Wired Optical Mouse (also listed in some marketplaces as a compact Rmac M285) is a basic USB wired mouse designed for everyday computer use. It’s a plug‑and‑play device ideal for students, office work, web browsing, and general laptop/desktop navigation.\",\"info\":\"Wired USB connection: Just plug into a USB port — no drivers or setup required.\\r\\nOptical sensor: Ensures smooth and responsive cursor movement across most surfaces.\\r\\n1000 DPI resolution: Good tracking precision for everyday tasks like browsing and document editing.\\r\\nCompact & ambidextrous design: Comfortable grip for both right‑ and left‑handed users and easy portability.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1725],\"mrp\":\"840\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775115053083-198958375.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 07:30:53'),
(5812,1,'product',3493,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Oswal 40g soldering lead\",\"description\":\"The Oswal 40g soldering lead is a reliable solder wire designed for electronics repair, PCB work, and general electrical connections. It is typically made with a 60% tin and 40% lead (Sn60/Pb40) composition, which ensures strong joints, smooth flow, and good electrical conductivity.\",\"info\":\"This solder wire comes with a rosin core (flux inside the wire) that helps clean the surface and improves soldering quality, eliminating the need for extra flux in most cases. It melts at a low temperature of around 183–190°C, making it easy to use with standard soldering irons.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1109],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775115196052-915682199.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 07:33:16'),
