(5843,1,'product',3521,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Oswal soldering iron 8w\",\"description\":\"The Oswal 8W soldering iron is a low-power, precision soldering tool specially designed for delicate electronic work such as small PCB components, micro circuits, and fine wire soldering. It operates on 220V AC power and uses a very low 8-watt heating element, which produces controlled heat suitable for sensitive components without the risk of damage. This type of soldering iron usually comes with a fine pointed copper tip, allowing accurate and detailed soldering in tight spaces.\",\"info\":\"Due to its low wattage, the Oswal 8W iron heats up quickly but maintains a lower temperature compared to 25W irons, making it ideal for precision tasks rather than heavy soldering. It is lightweight, easy to handle, and commonly used by students, hobbyists, and technicians working on SMD components, small circuits, and repair work. The iron is also compatible with standard soldering bits and offers stable heating performance for consistent results.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1509],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775120723459-447048568.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 09:05:23'),
(5844,1,'product',3522,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Maxx Micro soldering iron 12w\",\"description\":\"The Maxx Micro soldering iron 12W (commonly known as Maxx Pamma micro iron pen) is a low-power, precision soldering tool specially designed for delicate electronics and mobile repair work. Unlike standard 25W irons, this model operates on 12V DC power and uses a 12-watt heating element, making it ideal for fine soldering tasks such as SMD components, IC work, and small PCB repairs. It heats up quickly and provides controlled temperature, which helps avoid damage to sensitive electronic parts\",\"info\":\"This micro soldering iron features a thin, pointed tip (micro bit) that allows accurate work in tight spaces. It is lightweight and pen-shaped, offering better control for precision soldering. The tool is commonly used in mobile servicing, chip-level repair, watch repair, and small DIY electronics projects. It also includes a heat-resistant handle and durable construction for safe and long-term use.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1509],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775120849255-112889223.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 09:07:29'),
(5845,1,'product',3523,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Ego soldering iron 12w\",\"description\":\"The Ego 12W soldering iron is a micro-type, low-power soldering tool specially designed for precision electronics work such as mobile repair, SMD components, and small PCB soldering. It operates on 12V power and uses a 12-watt heating element, providing controlled heat that is safe for delicate components. This model (commonly SI-37) is known for its pen-like design, making it easy to handle and ideal for working in tight spaces.\",\"info\":\"This soldering iron features a fine pointed tip (micro bit) that allows accurate soldering on very small joints. It is lightweight (around 155 mm length) and equipped with a firm grip for comfortable long-term use. The iron heats up quickly and reaches a stable working temperature within seconds, improving efficiency during repair work\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1509],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775121037986-642475385.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 09:10:37'),
(5846,1,'product',3524,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Foxin Smart Blue Wired Optical Mouse\",\"description\":\"The Foxin Smart Blue Wired Optical Mouse is a budget‑friendly wired USB mouse designed for everyday computing tasks. It offers a simple plug‑and‑play experience with responsive tracking and a comfortable grip, making it suitable for laptops, desktops, and basic office or home use.\",\"info\":\"Wired USB connection: Easy plug‑and‑play — just connect to a USB port and start using immediately, with no drivers needed.\\r\\nOptical tracking sensor: Provides smooth and accurate cursor movement for everyday tasks like browsing, document editing, and basic navigation.\\r\\n800 DPI sensitivity: Standard resolution suitable for general use (some listings reference up to 6400 DPI software resolution).\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1735],\"mrp\":\"540\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775121045337-11013259.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 09:10:45'),
(5847,1,'product',3525,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"JYD-JD020 soldering iron 30w\",\"description\":\"The JYD-JD020 soldering iron (30W) is a mid-power electric soldering tool designed for general electronics work, PCB soldering, and medium-duty applications. It operates on 220–240V AC power and provides a 30-watt heating output, which is slightly higher than 25W irons, offering better heat capacity for stronger and faster solder joints.\",\"info\":\"This model typically features a nichrome heating element and a replaceable copper tip (bit), ensuring efficient heat transfer and smooth solder flow. It heats up quickly (usually within 1–2 minutes) and maintains a stable working temperature, making it suitable for both beginners and technicians. Similar JYD JD020 series irons are also available in higher wattages with temperature control (200°C–450°C range), showing the series is designed for versatility and reliable performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1509],\"mrp\":\"1499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775121159312-861324426.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 09:12:39'),
(5848,1,'product',3526,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Lapcare Safari 111 LWM-003 Wireless Mouse\",\"description\":\"The Lapcare Safari 111 / Safari III (LWM-003) is a reliable wireless optical mouse designed for everyday use in homes, offices, and study environments. It offers smooth wireless performance, ergonomic comfort, and easy plug-and-play functionality, making it a practical choice for laptops and desktops.\",\"info\":\"2.4 GHz wireless connectivity: Stable and lag-free connection using a USB nano receiver\\r\\nPlug-and-play: No drivers required—just connect and start using instantly\\r\\nOptical tracking sensor: Smooth and accurate cursor movement across most surfaces\\r\\n1600 DPI resolution: Good precision for daily tasks like browsing, office work, and study\\r\\nErgonomic design: Comfortable grip for long usage sessions\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[186],\"mrp\":\"1399\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775122118830-467075598.jpeg\"}','2026-04-02 09:28:38'),
