(5860,1,'product',3532,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"20mm LDR Sensor\",\"description\":\"A 20mm LDR sensor is an electronic component whose resistance changes according to the intensity of light falling on it. When exposed to bright light, its resistance decreases, and in darkness, the resistance increases significantly. This sensor is commonly used in automatic lighting systems, street lights, light-controlled switches, and Arduino-based projects\",\"info\":\"The larger 20mm size provides better light sensitivity and wider detection area compared to smaller LDRs. It usually has two terminals, operates in a wide temperature range, and can handle moderate voltage levels. Due to its simple working principle and low cost, the 20mm LDR is widely used in both educational and industrial applications\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[942],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775129334720-634017217.jpg\"}','2026-04-02 11:28:54'),
