(5895,1,'product',3546,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Samsung c to c cable \",\"description\":\"The Samsung USB-C to USB-C Cable provides a reliable, fast, and versatile solution for charging and data transfer. Compatible with a wide range of devices, including Samsung smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other USB-C enabled devices, this cable ensures a seamless and efficient connection for both power delivery and data synchronization.\",\"info\":\"Fast Charging & Power Delivery: Supports high-speed charging with USB-C Power Delivery (PD), capable of providing the necessary power to quickly charge your Samsung devices and other USB-C compatible devices.\\r\\nHigh-Speed Data Transfer: With USB 3.1 or higher standards cable.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[154],\"model\":\"EP DA7058\",\"alternative_name\":\"Samsung c to c cable model EP DA7058\",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775194737643-937605089.jpeg\"}','2026-04-03 05:38:57'),
(5896,1,'product',3547,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"One plus og c to c cable  \",\"description\":\"The OnePlus USB-C to USB-C Cable is designed to deliver fast, reliable charging and data transfer for your OnePlus devices and other USB-C enabled electronics. Crafted with durability and performance in mind, this cable is perfect for charging smartphones, tablets, laptops, and syncing data between USB-C devices.\",\"info\":\"Fast Charging with Warp Charge Support: This cable is engineered to support Warp Charge, OnePlus\' fast charging technology, providing up to 65W or more of power delivery for super-fast charging on compatible devices. Perfect for quickly charging your OnePlus phone and other USB-C devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1758],\"alternative_name\":\"One plus og c to c cable  \",\"mrp\":\"399\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775195032796-567071637.jpeg\"}','2026-04-03 05:43:52'),
(5897,1,'product',3548,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Rd c to c  cables \",\"description\":\"The RD C18 USB-C to USB-C Cable is a high-quality, reliable cable designed to provide fast charging and efficient data transfer for a wide range of USB-C enabled devices. Whether you need to charge your smartphone, tablet, laptop, or sync files between devices, the RD C18 cable ensures a secure and dependable connection.\",\"info\":\"Fast Charging with Power Delivery (PD): This cable supports USB Power Delivery (PD), allowing for quick and efficient charging of your devices. With the ability to deliver up to 60W or 100W of power (depending on model specifics), it’s perfect for fast charging laptops, smartphones, tablets, and other high-power USB-C devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1757],\"model\":\"Model C18\",\"alternative_name\":\"Rd c to c  cables model c18\",\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775195338229-860718273.jpg\"}','2026-04-03 05:48:58'),
(5898,1,'product',3549,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Sm gold c to c cable \",\"description\":\"The SM Gold USB-C to USB-C Cable combines premium quality, high-speed performance, and elegant design. Ideal for those seeking both functionality and style, this cable provides fast charging and data transfer for a wide range of USB-C devices. Whether you\'re charging your smartphone, tablet, laptop, or syncing files, the SM Gold cable ensures a secure and reliable connection every time.\",\"info\":\"Fast Charging with Power Delivery (PD): The SM Gold USB-C cable supports USB Power Delivery (PD) for fast, efficient charging, capable of delivering high power (up to 100W). Perfect for quickly charging laptops, smartphones, tablets, and other USB-C enabled devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1768],\"alternative_name\":\"Sm gold c to c cable\",\"mrp\":\"299\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775195532877-928279319.jpg\"}','2026-04-03 05:52:12'),
