(5957,1,'brand',321,'update',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"1\",\"brand_name\":\"SEW\",\"description\":\"A SEW digital multimeter is a reliable electronic measuring instrument used to test and analyze electrical parameters such as voltage (AC/DC), current, resistance, continuity, and sometimes additional functions like capacitance, frequency, and diode testing. Manufactured by SEW, these multimeters are widely used by electricians, technicians, engineers, and hobbyists\",\"info\":\"Many models include safety features like overload protection and fuse protection, making them suitable for both industrial and domestic applications. They are commonly used in power distribution, appliance repair, circuit testing, and installation work .\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1775219707871-535989919.png\"}','2026-04-03 12:35:07'),
