(5962,5,'product',3566,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"6A10 Diode \",\"description\":\"The 6A10 diode is a high-current general-purpose rectifier diode widely used in power supply circuits. It is designed to convert alternating current (AC) into direct current (DC) and handle relatively high current loads efficiently.\",\"info\":\"The 6A10 diode is commonly used in bridge rectifiers and high-power DC power supplies where both high voltage and current handling are required. Its rugged construction allows it to withstand surge currents, making it suitable for industrial and heavy-duty electronics.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"mrp\":\"49\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775224155337-669398581.jpg\"}','2026-04-03 13:49:15'),
(5963,5,'product',3567,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"KBPC3510 SEP RJ DIODE\",\"description\":\"The KBPC3510 SEP RJ is a high-power bridge rectifier diode module designed to convert AC (Alternating Current) into DC (Direct Current) efficiently. It integrates four high-current diodes in a single compact metal package, making it ideal for heavy-duty power applications.\",\"info\":\"The KBPC3510 SEP RJ bridge rectifier is widely used where high current rectification is required. Its robust metal casing allows effective heat transfer, making it suitable for high-load and continuous operation systems. It simplifies circuit design by combining four diodes into one module.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"mrp\":\"199\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775224515059-410026678.jpg\"}','2026-04-03 13:55:15'),
(5964,5,'product',3568,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2A diode\",\"description\":\" 2A diode is widely used in electronic circuits where moderate current rectification is needed. Depending on the type (standard or faA 2A diode is a rectifier diode designed to handle a maximum forward current of 2 Amperes. It is commonly used in power supply and rectification circuits where moderate current handling is required.Ast recovery), it can be used in both low-frequency and high-frequency applications. It is a cost-effective and essential component in power electronics.\",\"info\":\"2A diode is widely used in electronic circuits where moderate current rectification is needed. Depending on the type (standard or faA 2A diode is a rectifier diode designed to handle a maximum forward current of 2 Amperes. I\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"mrp\":\"59\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775224905527-233397360.jpg\"}','2026-04-03 14:01:45'),
(5965,5,'product',3569,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"15SB80 Diode\",\"description\":\"The 15SB80 diode is a high-efficiency power diode that combines high current handling (15A) with low voltage loss, making it ideal for modern electronic circuits that demand energy efficiency and fast switching. Its Schottky design ensures minimal heat generation and improved overall performance.\",\"info\":\"The 15SB80 is a Schottky Barrier Rectifier (SBR) diode designed for high-efficiency power rectification. It is widely used in SMPS (Switch Mode Power Supplies) and high-frequency circuits due to its low forward voltage drop and fast switching performance.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[551],\"mrp\":\"58\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775225252020-118627907.jpg\"}','2026-04-03 14:07:32'),
(5966,5,'product',3570,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trueone Win/Mac Wired Mouse\",\"description\":\"The Trueone Win/Mac Wired Mouse is a reliable and user-friendly input device designed for smooth performance across both Windows and macOS systems. Built for everyday use, it offers plug-and-play convenience, eliminating the need for additional drivers or software installation.\",\"info\":\"Universal Compatibility\\r\\nWorks seamlessly with Windows PCs and macOS devices, making it ideal for home, office, and student use.\\r\\nPlug & Play USB Connectivity\\r\\nSimply connect via USB port and start using instantly—no setup required.\\r\\nOptical Tracking Technology\\r\\nEquipped with a precise optical sensor for smooth cursor movement and accurate tracking on most surfaces.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1735],\"mrp\":\"399\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775277981464-686913340.webp\"}','2026-04-04 04:46:21'),
(5967,5,'brand',326,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"5\",\"brand_name\":\"DPlus\",\"description\":\"DPlus is a growing electronics and mobile accessories brand known for offering stylish, affordable, and reliable products for everyday use. The brand focuses on delivering modern designs combined with practical functionality, making it popular among budget-conscious users.\",\"info\":\"Affordable pricing\\r\\nTrendy and lightweight designs\\r\\nDecent sound and performance\\r\\nReliable for daily use\\r\\nWide range of accessories\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-04-04 09:12:26'),
