(6012,5,'product',3588,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zebronics Dome Camera\",\"description\":\"The Zebronics ZEB-AHDPDSL24 Dome Camera is a high-performance CCTV surveillance camera designed for indoor security in homes, offices, shops, and commercial spaces. With its compact dome design and advanced imaging features, it delivers clear and reliable monitoring both day and night. This camera features a high-resolution CMOS sensor (up to 2MP/5MP variants) that captures sharp and detailed video. It supports multiple video formats like AHD, TVI, CVI, and CVBS, ensuring compatibility with most DVR systems.\",\"info\":\"Equipped with IR night vision up to 20 meters, the camera provides clear footage even in complete darkness. It also includes advanced image enhancement technologies like WDR, DNR, BLC, and AGC, which improve video quality in challenging lighting conditions.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[342],\"model\":\"AHDPDL24\",\"mrp\":\"7999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775449455024-598062450.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 04:24:15'),
(6013,5,'product',3589,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Desktop Switch \",\"description\":\"It helps expand network connectivity and ensures fast, stable data transfer between connected devices.\",\"info\":\"A TP-Link desktop switch is an easy-to-use networking device that expands your wired network by allowing multiple devices to connect simultaneously.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1803],\"alternative_name\":\"Tp-Link Destop switch \",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"With plug-and-play setup, high-speed performance, and reliable build quality, it is perfect for homes, offices, and small business environments.\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775449945865-535003702.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 04:32:25'),
(6014,5,'product',3590,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zebronics Dome Camera IPPDSL5\",\"description\":\"The Zebronics IPPDSL5 Dome Camera is a high-performance IP-based CCTV camera designed for advanced indoor surveillance. With its 5MP ultra-clear resolution, it delivers sharp, detailed video, making it ideal for homes, offices, shops, and commercial spaces.Equipped with a CMOS sensor and H.265 video compression, this camera ensures efficient storage and smooth streaming over networks. It supports IP (network) connectivity, allowing remote monitoring via mobile apps or NVR systems\",\"info\":\"One of its standout features is full-color night vision, powered by warm LED lights and IR LEDs, enabling clear footage even in low-light or complete darkness up to 20 meters range. The camera also includes advanced image processing technologies like WDR, DNR, BLC, AGC, and AWB, which enhance video quality in challenging lighting conditions\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[342],\"model\":\"IPPDSL5\",\"mrp\":\"9999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775450137362-531268479.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 04:35:37'),
(6015,5,'product',3591,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zebronics Bullet Camera\",\"description\":\"The Zebronics AHDPBSL24 Bullet Camera is a powerful HD CCTV surveillance camera designed for outdoor security applications such as homes, shops, offices, and warehouses. With its rugged bullet design and advanced imaging features, it ensures reliable monitoring in both day and night conditions. This camera features a 5MP high-resolution CMOS sensor, delivering sharp and detailed video footage. It supports multiple video formats like AHD, TVI, CVI, and CVBS, making it compatible with most DVR systems.\",\"info\":\"The camera also includes advanced image processing technologies such as WDR, DNR, BLC, AGC, AWB, and HLC, ensuring better clarity in different lighting environments. Built with an IP66 weatherproof body, it is ideal for outdoor installation, offering protection against dust and rain.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[345],\"model\":\"AHDPBSL24\",\"mrp\":\"8999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775450327743-597064990.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 04:38:47'),
(6016,5,'category_brand_mapping',407,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[228,230,232,14]}\"','2026-04-06 05:41:04'),
(6017,5,'product',3592,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zeb-Smart CAM 102 Smart WiFi PTZ Indoor Camera\",\"description\":\"The Zebronics ZEB-Smart CAM 102 is a compact and intelligent WiFi PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) indoor security camera designed for real-time monitoring of homes, offices, and shops. With smart connectivity and mobile app control, it allows you to keep an eye on your space from anywhere.This camera features Full HD 1080p resolution, delivering clear and detailed video footage. Its PTZ functionality enables remote control of pan and tilt movements through the mobile app, ensuring wider coverage of the room.\",\"info\":\"Equipped with IR night vision, the camera can capture footage even in complete darkness up to 5 meters, making it suitable for 24/7 surveillance. It also includes motion detection and motion tracking, sending alerts to your smartphone when activity is detected. The built-in microphone and speaker support two-way audio communication, allowing you to talk and listen remotely\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[892],\"mrp\":\"4999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775454207397-142587658.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 05:43:27'),
(6018,5,'product',3593,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"6 port poe Switch\",\"description\":\"It combines data transmission + power supply (PoE), making installation simple and efficient—especially for surveillance systems.\",\"info\":\"Zebronics 6 Port PoE Switch (like model ZEB-6PPM2UM / 4+2 configuration) is a networking device used to connect and power multiple devices such as CCTV cameras, IP cameras, and wireless access points using a single Ethernet cable.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1986],\"model\":\"4PM2UM-65\",\"alternative_name\":\" poe Switch 6 port\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"alternative_names\":[]}','2026-04-06 05:58:12'),
(6019,5,'category_brand_mapping',286,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[10,14,124,125,126,128,287,232]}\"','2026-04-06 06:06:46'),
(6020,5,'product',3594,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Mini Wifi Wireless pan-tilt IP Camera\",\"description\":\"A Mini WiFi PTZ IP Camera is a compact, wireless CCTV camera that connects to your home or office WiFi network. It allows remote viewing, pan-tilt control, motion alerts, and two-way communication through a mobile app.\",\"info\":\"These cameras offer wide-area coverage thanks to motorized movement (pan & tilt), enabling you to monitor an entire room without installing multiple cameras. Many models support HD/Full HD/2K resolution, ensuring clear video quality.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1990],\"mrp\":\"12999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775455743677-944760926.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 06:09:03'),
(6021,5,'product',3595,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Zebronics 4 Port Poe Switch\",\"description\":\"Zebronics 4 Port PoE Switch  is a compact networking device used to connect and power IP cameras, CCTV systems, and network devices through a single Ethernet cable.\",\"info\":\"It combines data + power (PoE – Power over Ethernet), making installation simple and reducing the need for extra wiring.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1986],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775455809679-617673348.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 06:10:09'),
(6022,5,'brand',332,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"5\",\"brand_name\":\"Trueview\",\"description\":\"Trueview is a leading Indian brand in the field of electronic security and surveillance solutions, owned by Warner Electronics (I) Pvt. Ltd.. Established around 2011, the brand has gained strong recognition for offering reliable and cost-effective CCTV products across India. Trueview specializes in a wide range of security equipment including dome cameras, bullet cameras, PTZ cameras, IP cameras, DVR/NVR systems, and advanced solutions like WiFi, 4G SIM-based, and solar-powered surveillance systems. Known for combining modern technology with affordability,\",\"info\":\"Trueview products feature high-definition video quality, night vision, motion detection, and mobile app connectivity for remote monitoring. The brand focuses on delivering solutions suitable for Indian conditions such as power fluctuations and rural environments, making it popular among homes, shops, offices, and commercial users. With a growing dealer network, quality certifications, and emphasis on innovation, Trueview has become a trusted choice for users looking for dependable and budget-friendly security systems.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1775456226096-297790395.png\"}','2026-04-06 06:17:06'),
(6023,5,'category_brand_mapping',284,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[10,14,124,125,128,287,332]}\"','2026-04-06 06:17:37'),
(6024,5,'product',3593,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Desktop Top switch 5 port\",\"description\":\"A desktop 5 port network switch is a compact and efficient networking device used to connect multiple devices such as computers, printers, routers, and CCTV systems within a local area network (LAN).\",\"info\":\"It typically comes with five Ethernet ports that support automatic speed detection (10/100 Mbps or Gigabit), allowing smooth data transfer between connected devices.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"DES-1005C\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_name\":\"\",\"mrp\":\"1\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":480,\"secondary_id\":\"199\",\"brand_id\":45}],\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775456362068-11313214.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 06:19:22'),
(6025,5,'category_brand_mapping',283,'update',NULL,'\"{\\\"assigned_brands\\\":[10,14,124,125,128,287,332]}\"','2026-04-06 06:19:36'),
(6026,5,'product',3596,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Trueview all time color 4g camera\",\"description\":\"The Trueview All Time Color 4G Camera is an advanced SIM-based CCTV security camera designed for locations where WiFi or broadband is not available. It works using a 4G SIM card, allowing you to monitor your property remotely from anywhere through a mobile app. One of its main highlights is All-Time Color Vision, which provides full-color video even at night, unlike traditional cameras that switch to black & white. This ensures better identification of people, vehicles, and objects in low-light conditions.\",\"info\":\"The camera typically comes with 3MP (1296p) HD resolution, delivering clear and detailed footage. It also supports two-way audio, enabling communication through the built-in microphone and speaker.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2005],\"mrp\":\"9999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775456457485-725431852.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 06:20:57'),
(6027,5,'product',3597,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Tenda AC1200 Smart Dual-Bond Wifi Router\",\"description\":\"The Tenda AC1200 Smart Dual-Band WiFi Router is a reliable and affordable networking device designed for home and small office internet use. It supports the latest Wi-Fi 5 (802.11ac) standard, providing faster speeds, better coverage, and smoother connectivity for multiple devices.\",\"info\":\"Dual-Band High-Speed Performance\\r\\nCombined speed up to 1200 Mbps (AC1200 class)\\r\\n2.4GHz: up to 300 Mbps\\r\\n5GHz: up to 867 Mbps\\r\\nAutomatically assigns devices to the best band for performance\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1805],\"model\":\"AC5\",\"mrp\":\"2099\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775456762125-157753178.jpeg\"}','2026-04-06 06:26:02'),
