(6040,5,'product',3602,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Lapcare LDF72 4G Modem\",\"description\":\"The Lapcare LDF72 is a compact and portable 4G LTE USB WiFi modem (dongle) designed to provide high-speed internet access anywhere using a SIM card. It works as both a USB data card and a WiFi hotspot device.\",\"info\":\"4G LTE High-Speed Internet\\r\\nDownload speeds up to 150 Mbps\\r\\nUpload speeds up to 50 Mbps (depends on network)\\r\\nWiFi Hotspot Function\\r\\nCan connect up to 10 devices simultaneously\\r\\nWorks like a mini portable router\\r\\nAll SIM Support\\r\\nCompatible with Jio, Airtel, Vi, BSNL\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2012],\"model\":\" LDF72 \",\"alternative_names\":[\"USB Modem\",\"Wifi Modem\"],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775459855170-459232206.jpeg\"}','2026-04-06 07:17:35'),
(6041,5,'product',3603,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Kensonic HD Audio Digital Surround Sound Decoder\",\"description\":\"The Kensonic HD Audio Digital Surround Sound Decoder is an electronic audio device used to convert digital audio signals into 5.1 channel analog surround sound output. It supports inputs like optical (SPDIF) and coaxial cables from TVs, set-top boxes, gaming consoles, and media players\",\"info\":\"The decoder processes audio formats such as Dolby Digital (AC3) and DTS, delivering clear, immersive sound through home theater speaker systems. These devices use digital signal processing to enhance sound quality and are commonly used in home entertainment setups.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1756],\"mrp\":\"1\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775461228524-31642854.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 07:40:28'),
(6042,5,'product',3604,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hikvision Turbo HD DVR 7100 series\",\"description\":\"The Hikvision Turbo HD DVR 7100 Series is a reliable and widely used CCTV digital video recorder designed for small to medium surveillance systems. It supports HD-TVI, AHD, CVI, CVBS, and IP cameras, making it highly flexible for both new and existing CCTV setups.This DVR series supports high-resolution recording up to 5MP / 3K / 1080p, ensuring clear video quality for security monitoring. It also uses H.265 / H.265+ compression technology, which significantly reduces storage usage while maintaining video clarity.\",\"info\":\"It comes with HDMI and VGA output, enabling connection to monitors for live viewing and playback. The DVR supports hard disk storage up to 6TB, providing ample space for continuous recording.Advanced versions (AcuSense models) include smart features like human & vehicle detection, reducing false alarms and improving security efficiency.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[361],\"model\":\"DS-7108GHI-K1\",\"mrp\":\"4999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775461623280-41114978.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 07:47:03'),
(6043,5,'product',3605,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Dahua DH-XVR4B04-I Digital Video Recorder\",\"description\":\"The Dahua DH-XVR4B04-I is a compact and powerful 4-channel digital video recorder (DVR) from Dahua’s WizSense (AI) series, designed for small CCTV setups like homes, shops, and offices. It supports multiple camera formats and smart AI features, making it a flexible and modern surveillance solution.\",\"info\":\"This DVR is a penta-brid recorder, meaning it supports HDCVI, AHD, TVI, CVBS, and IP cameras, allowing easy integration with both old and new CCTV systems. \\r\\nIt uses H.265+ video compression, which significantly reduces storage usage while maintaining high video quality\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[362],\"model\":\"DH-XVR4B04-I\",\"mrp\":\"5999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775464951714-795481827.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 08:42:31'),
