(6065,5,'product',3614,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Lapcare type c and USB 3 in 1  ethernet connector \",\"description\":\"The Lapcare Type-C & USB 3.0 (3-in-1 Ethernet Connector) is a versatile networking adapter designed to provide stable wired internet connectivity along with additional USB expansion. It features a dual interface (USB + Type-C), making it compatible with a wide range of devices including laptops, desktops, and modern smartphones.\",\"info\":\"This adapter typically includes RJ45 Ethernet port + USB 3.0 ports, allowing users to connect to high-speed wired networks while simultaneously using peripherals like keyboard, mouse, or pen drive. It supports Gigabit Ethernet speeds (10/100/1000 Mbps), ensuring fast and reliable internet for streaming, gaming, video calls, and office work.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2088],\"alternative_names\":[\"Lapcare type c and USB 3 in 1  ethernet connector \"],\"mrp\":\"1699\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775477051558-290692122.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 12:04:11'),
