(6099,5,'product',3621,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Hammok VGA to HDTV with audio and power \",\"description\":\"The Hammok VGA to HDTV Converter with Audio & Power is a useful device designed to connect older VGA-output devices like computers and laptops to modern HDTVs, monitors, or projectors with HDMI input. It converts analog VGA signals into digital HDMI output, allowing seamless compatibility between old and new display technologies.\",\"info\":\"This converter supports Full HD 1080p resolution, ensuring clear and sharp video output. It also includes a 3.5mm audio input, which allows audio signals to be combined with video and transmitted through the HDMI output—since VGA alone carries only video signals.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2122],\"alternative_names\":[\"Hammok VGA to HDTV with audio and power \"],\"mrp\":\"899\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775486695390-313833208.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 14:44:55'),
(6100,5,'product',3622,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IC SN74LS83N\",\"description\":\"The SN54/74LS283 is often recommended for new designs, as it is functionally identical but features a standard corner power pinout, unlike the 74LS83A, which has central power pins\",\"info\":\"The SN54/74LS283 is often recommended for new designs, as it is functionally identical but features a standard corner power pinout, unlike the 74LS83A, which has central power pins\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"alternative_names\":[\"IC 7483\"],\"mrp\":\"99\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775486819260-549236403.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 14:46:59'),
(6101,5,'product',430,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IC SN74HC08N\",\"description\":\"The IC SN74HC08N is a TTL Quad 2-Input AND Gate integrated circuit. It contains four independent AND gates in a single DIP-14 package, operating typically at a 5 V supply.\",\"info\":\"IC SN74HC08N Each gate produces a logic HIGH output only when both inputs are HIGH, making it a basic and essential component in digital logic circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[\"IC 7408\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"50.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":73,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-04-06 14:49:30'),
(6102,5,'product',3623,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Enter usb bluetooth dongle\",\"description\":\"The Enter USB Bluetooth Dongle V5.0 is a compact and efficient device designed to add Bluetooth functionality to desktops and laptops that do not have built-in wireless connectivity. By simply plugging it into a USB port, users can connect various Bluetooth-enabled devices such as headphones, speakers, keyboards, mice, and smartphones.\",\"info\":\"This dongle features Bluetooth 5.0 technology, which provides faster data transfer speeds, improved signal stability, and better energy efficiency compared to older versions. It ensures a smooth and reliable connection for both data transfer and audio streaming.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2080],\"alternative_names\":[\"enter usb bluetooth dongle 5.0\"],\"mrp\":\"1199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775487132604-510556713.jpg\"}','2026-04-06 14:52:12'),
(6103,5,'product',413,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IC CD4017BE\",\"description\":\"IC CD4017BE Supply voltage range: typically 3 V to 15 V (some specs up to ~20 V). \\r\\nIt has a carry-out pin (to cascade to another counter) and control pins for reset and clock inhibit/enable.\",\"info\":\"IC CD4017BE The CD4017 is a CMOS decade counter / divider IC that produces 10 sequential decoded outputs from a single clock input.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[\"IC 4017\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"50.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":73,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-04-06 14:55:13'),
(6104,5,'product',3624,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Wireless usb dongle \",\"description\":\"A Wireless USB Dongle is a compact plug-and-play device that enables wireless connectivity (Wi-Fi and/or Bluetooth) on computers and laptops.\",\"info\":\"A Wireless USB Dongle is used to add or upgrade wireless features on a device. It connects through a USB port and allows systems to access Wi-Fi networks or Bluetooth devices without internal hardware installation.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1982],\"alternative_names\":[\"Wireless usb dongle \"],\"mrp\":\"999\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775487422850-886233466.webp\"}','2026-04-06 14:57:02'),
(6105,5,'product',1167,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"REG 7805\",\"description\":\"The 7805 regulator typically accepts an input voltage between 7V and 35V DC and regulates it down to a steady 5V output with built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection. It is usually available in a TO-220 package with three pins: Input, Ground, and Output. Although simple to use, a heat sink may be required when supplying higher current loads because excess voltage is dissipated as heat.\",\"info\":\"The REG 7805 (7805 Voltage Regulator) is a widely used linear voltage regulator IC designed to provide a stable +5V DC output from a higher input voltage source. It belongs to the popular 78xx series of fixed positive voltage regulators, where “05” indicates the 5-volt output.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"The REG 7805 is widely used in power supply circuits, Arduino and microcontroller projects, embedded systems, battery-powered devices, chargers, and educational electronics kits. Its ease of use, low cost, and reliable voltage regulation make it one of the most commonly used power management ICs in electronics.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":230}]}','2026-04-06 14:57:46'),
(6106,5,'product',1167,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IC 78M05\",\"description\":\"The IC 78M05 regulator typically accepts an input voltage between 7V and 35V DC and regulates it down to a steady 5V output with built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection. It is usually available in a TO-220 package with three pins: Input, Ground, and Output. Although simple to use, a heat sink may be required when supplying higher current loads because excess voltage is dissipated as heat.\",\"info\":\"The IC 78M05 (7805 Voltage Regulator) is a widely used linear voltage regulator IC designed to provide a stable +5V DC output from a higher input voltage source. It belongs to the popular 78xx series of fixed positive voltage regulators, where “05” indicates the 5-volt output.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[\"78M05 Voltage Regulator\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"1.00\",\"note\":\"The IC 78M05 is widely used in power supply circuits, Arduino and microcontroller projects, embedded systems, battery-powered devices, chargers, and educational electronics kits. Its ease of use, low cost, and reliable voltage regulation make it one of the most commonly used power management ICs in electronics.\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":90,\"brand_id\":230}]}','2026-04-06 15:02:40'),
(6107,5,'brand',335,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"5\",\"brand_name\":\"RAVTRON \",\"description\":\"The Ravtron Mini Stand is a compact and foldable stand designed to support laptops, tablets, and mobile phones for comfortable viewing and better ergonomics. It is ideal for both home and office use, helping improve posture by elevating your device to a convenient angle.\",\"info\":\"The stand features an anti-slip base and rubber pads, ensuring stability and preventing scratches on devices. It also helps improve airflow around laptops, reducing overheating during long usage.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1775487899238-734297122.jpeg\"}','2026-04-06 15:04:59'),
