(6133,5,'product',3632,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"D Plus CCTV Power Supply – 8 Channel\",\"description\":\"The D Plus 8 Channel CCTV Power Supply is a centralized power distribution unit designed to supply power to multiple CCTV cameras from a single device.\",\"info\":\"It is commonly used in surveillance systems for homes, shops, offices, and commercial installations.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[952],\"model\":\"8 Channel D Plus CCTV Power Supply\",\"alternative_names\":[\"8 Channel D Plus CCTV Power Supply\",\"8 Channel SMPS Power Supply\",\"CCTV SMPS Box (8 Way)\"],\"mrp\":\"1599\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775544723577-556889753.jpg\"}','2026-04-07 06:52:03'),
(6134,5,'brand',337,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"5\",\"brand_name\":\"Foxin\",\"description\":\"Foxin is an Indian electronics brand that offers a wide range of computer accessories, mobile accessories, and consumer electronics products. It is known for providing budget-friendly and reliable products suitable for everyday use in homes, offices, and small businesses. The brand has gained popularity in India for its affordable pricing and wide product availability across both online and offline markets.\",\"info\":\"Foxin manufactures and sells various categories such as power supplies (SMPS), UPS systems, monitors, power banks, chargers, USB hubs, keyboards, mouse, speakers, and networking accessories. Many of its products are designed for basic to mid-level usage, making them ideal for retail shops, office setups, and system builders. According to its official store, Foxin also offers items like SSDs, gaming accessories, and toner cartridges, serving both personal and professional needs.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1775544860819-883709420.png\"}','2026-04-07 06:54:20'),
(6135,5,'product',3633,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Dell WM118 Wireless Mouse\",\"description\":\"The Dell WM118 Wireless Mouse is a simple and reliable input device designed for everyday computing tasks at home, office, or on the go. It features a 2.4GHz wireless connection with a USB nano receiver, providing a stable and clutter-free experience without the need for cables.\",\"info\":\" 2.4GHz wireless connectivity with USB nano receiver\\r\\n 1000 DPI optical tracking for smooth performance\\r\\n Plug & play – no driver required\\r\\n Ambidextrous design (left & right-hand use)\\r\\n 3-button control with scroll wheel\\r\\n Long battery life (up to 18 months)\\r\\n Lightweight and portable design\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2155],\"model\":\" WM118 \",\"alternative_names\":[\"USB Wireless Mouse\"],\"mrp\":\"1199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775545074783-209461923.jpeg\"}','2026-04-07 06:57:54'),
(6136,5,'brand',338,'create',NULL,'{\"user_id\":\"5\",\"brand_name\":\"Zebster\",\"description\":\"Zebster is a budget monitor series from the Indian electronics brand Zebronics. These monitors are mainly designed for basic computer use, such as office work, billing systems, CCTV display, and home desktops. Zebster monitors are popular because they offer low-cost display solutions with essential features and simple design.\",\"info\":\"Zebster monitors typically come in sizes like 18.5-inch, 19-inch, 20-inch, and 22-inch, with resolutions ranging from HD (1366×768) to Full HD (1920×1080). Most models include HDMI and VGA input ports, making them compatible with both modern and older computers. They also feature LED backlit panels, wall-mount support, and built-in power supply, which makes them compact and easy to install.\",\"note\":\"\",\"system_note\":\"\",\"icon_text\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":\"brands/1775545116143-105840796.jpg\"}','2026-04-07 06:58:36'),
