(6183,5,'product',3656,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"A966Y transistor \",\"description\":\"The 2SA966Y (often marked as A966Y or simply A966) is a PNP bipolar junction transistor (BJT) produced by manufacturers like Toshiba. It is primarily designed for high-voltage and power amplification applications, commonly packaged in a TO-92L (long lead) or sometimes TO-92 casing, making it suitable for through-hole PCB assembly.\",\"info\":\"The 2SA966 transistor (marked as A966Y) is a low-power PNP bipolar junction transistor (BJT) used for audio amplification and general-purpose switching.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"alternative_names\":[\"A966Y transistor \"],\"mrp\":\"149\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775572945497-45005913.jpg\"}','2026-04-07 14:42:25'),
(6184,5,'product',3657,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"F422 transistor \",\"description\":\"The F422 transistor (commonly marked as F422) is a general-purpose NPN transistor used in low-power amplification and switching circuits. It is typically found in audio devices, signal circuits, and consumer electronics boards.\",\"info\":\"AI Overview\\r\\nBF422 NPN High Voltage Transistor - DatasheetThe BF422 is a high-voltage, silicon NPN bipolar junction transistor designed for high-voltage switching and amplifier applications, particularly in video output stages of televisions and monitors.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"alternative_names\":[\"F422 transistor \"],\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775574871389-223629167.jpg\"}','2026-04-07 15:14:31'),
(6185,5,'product',3658,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BF494 transistor \",\"description\":\"The BF494 is a silicon NPN medium-frequency transistor designed for low-voltage, low-current applications, primarily in RF amplifiers, FM tuners, and AM mixers/oscillators\",\"info\":\"The BF494 transistor is a high-frequency NPN bipolar junction transistor specially designed for radio frequency (RF) and VHF applications. It is widely used in FM transmitters, RF amplifiers, and oscillator circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"alternative_names\":[\"BF494 transistor \"],\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775575093264-101857829.jpg\"}','2026-04-07 15:18:13'),
(6186,5,'product',3659,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"F421 transistor \",\"description\":\"The F421 transistor (marked as F421) is a general-purpose NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) used in low-power amplification and switching applications. It is commonly found in **audio circuits, small electronic devices, and signal processing\",\"info\":\"The BF421 (often marked F421) is a high-voltage, low-current PNP transistor designed for high-voltage switching and amplification, typically packaged in TO-92. It is commonly used in video output stages, telephony applications, and industrial electronics requiring high \\r\\n up to 300V\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"alternative_names\":[\"F421 transistor \"],\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775575327157-813263841.jpg\"}','2026-04-07 15:22:07'),
(6187,5,'product',3660,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"C2785F transistor \",\"description\":\"The 2SC2785 (often marked as C2785) is a silicon NPN epitaxial planar transistor designed primarily for use in driver stages of audio frequency (AF) amplifiers and low-speed switching applications. It is known for high voltage, low noise, and good linearity.\",\"info\":\"The 2SC2785 is an NPN silicon transistor designed for use in amplifier driver stages and low-speed switching. It has excellent high voltage performance with a minimum collector-emitter break.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"alternative_names\":[\"C2785F transistor \"],\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775575598412-203908302.jpg\"}','2026-04-07 15:26:38'),
(6188,5,'product',3661,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panaphone KX-TS670\",\"description\":\"The Panaphone KX-TS670 is a simple and reliable corded landline telephone designed for everyday communication in homes, offices, and commercial environments. It is a plug-and-play device that works directly with a telephone line without requiring any external power supply, making it highly convenient and maintenance-free. The phone features a compact and lightweight design with anti-slip support, allowing it to be placed securely on a desk or mounted on a wall using its adjustable stand.\",\"info\":\"It includes essential calling functions such as last number redial, hold option, and pause function, which make handling calls easier and more efficient. Built with durable ABS material and available in standard colors like black and white, the KX-TS670 offers a practical and long-lasting solution for basic telecommunication needs. It is commonly used in places like homes, hotels, shops, offices, and customer service counters where a dependable wired phone is preferred.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2154],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775621178563-384434098.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 04:06:18'),
(6189,5,'product',3662,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LEBOSS B222 Desktop Phone\",\"description\":\"The LEBOSS B222 desktop phone is a basic corded landline telephone designed for simple and reliable voice communication in homes, offices, shops, and reception areas. It operates directly through a telephone line without requiring an external power supply, ensuring uninterrupted performance even during power outages. The device features a compact desktop design with a sturdy body, making it suitable for everyday use on tables or counters\",\"info\":\"It typically includes essential functions such as last number redial, mute option, and call hold feature, allowing users to manage calls efficiently. The keypad is user-friendly with clearly visible buttons for easy dialing, and the handset provides clear audio quality for both incoming and outgoing calls. Like other Leboss landline models, it focuses on durability, ease of use, and affordability, making it a practical choice for users who need a straightforward wired communication device.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2154],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775621443065-40702050.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 04:10:43'),
(6190,5,'product',3663,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"LEBOSS B633 Desktop Phone\",\"description\":\"The LEBOSS B633 desktop phone is a compact and durable corded landline telephone designed for basic communication needs in homes, offices, shops, and reception counters. It works directly through a telephone line without requiring an external power source, ensuring reliable operation even during power failures. The phone features a simple yet sturdy design that can be used as a desktop unit or mounted on a wall, making it suitable for space-saving installations.\",\"info\":\"It comes with essential calling features such as last number redial, mute function, and call hold option, allowing users to manage calls efficiently. The keypad is designed with clearly visible buttons for easy dialing, and the handset provides clear voice quality for both incoming and outgoing calls. Built for everyday use, the LEBOSS B633 focuses on simplicity, durability, and cost-effectiveness, making it a practical choice for users who need a dependable wired telephone solution.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2154],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775621628810-204857486.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 04:13:48'),
(6191,5,'product',3664,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"ANT Esports Pro Backlit Gaming combo kit\",\"description\":\"The ANT Esports KM500W Pro Backlit Gaming Combo Kit is a stylish and performance-oriented wireless keyboard and mouse combo designed for gamers and everyday users. It offers a clean, cable-free setup with vibrant RGB lighting, responsive controls, and ergonomic comfort, making it suitable for gaming, office work, and multimedia use.\",\"info\":\" RGB Backlit Keyboard – Multi-color lighting effects for a gaming look\\r\\n Full-Size Layout – Includes numeric keypad and function keys\\r\\n Ergonomic Design – Detachable wrist rest for comfort\\r\\n Wireless Gaming Mouse – Adjustable DPI for precision control\\r\\n 2.4GHz Wireless Connectivity – Stable, lag-free performance\\r\\n Power Efficient – Long battery life for extended use\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[1715],\"model\":\"KM500W\",\"mrp\":\"2100\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775621746050-943001154.jpeg\"}','2026-04-08 04:15:46'),
(6192,5,'product',3665,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panaphone KX-T580\",\"description\":\"The Panaphone KX-T580 (similar to Panasonic KX-TS580 series) is a feature-rich corded landline telephone designed for both home and office communication. It operates on a direct telephone line without requiring an external power source, ensuring continuous operation even during power outages. This model comes with an LCD display that supports caller ID functionality, allowing users to view incoming call details\",\"info\":\"It offers convenient features such as a phonebook memory that can store up to 50 contacts, along with multiple redial memory options for quickly dialing recently called numbers. The phone also includes adjustable ringer volume levels, speakerphone (handsfree) capability, and clear keypad buttons for easy operation. Built with a durable and compact design, it can be used as a desktop unit or mounted on a wall, making it suitable for offices, shops, reception areas, and households where reliable wired communication is essential.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2154],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775621841293-52592370.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 04:17:21'),
(6193,5,'product',3666,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panaphone KX-T2017\",\"description\":\"The Panaphone KX-T2017 is a feature-enhanced corded desktop telephone designed for efficient communication in homes, offices, and business environments. It operates directly through a telephone line without requiring an external power supply, ensuring reliable performance even during power outages. This model is equipped with an LCD display that supports caller ID functionality, allowing users to easily view incoming call details. It also includes a built-in data port, which enables connection to devices like modems or fax machines, making it suitable for office use where line sharing is needed.\",\"info\":\"The phone offers handsfree (speakerphone) capability for convenient calling, along with multiple one-touch memory buttons (such as M1–M7) for quick dialing of frequently used numbers. Additional features like redial, pause function, adjustable ringer volume, and clear audio output enhance usability. With its sturdy design, comfortable handset, and easy plug-and-play installation, the KX-T2017 is a practical and dependable wired telephone solution for everyday communication needs\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2154],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775622026488-954902353.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 04:20:26'),
(6194,5,'product',3667,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Panaphone KXT-3014 Desktop Phone\",\"description\":\"The Panaphone KXT-3014 is a basic and dependable corded desktop telephone designed for simple communication in homes, offices, shops, and reception areas. It operates directly through a telephone line without requiring an external power supply, ensuring uninterrupted usage even during power cuts. The phone is built with a compact and sturdy design, making it suitable for both desk placement and wall mounting\",\"info\":\"It features essential calling functions such as last number redial, mute option, pause function, and tone/pulse switching, allowing compatibility with different telephone line systems. The device also includes adjustable ringer settings (high/low) and a visual ringer indicator for incoming calls, making it convenient in both quiet and noisy environments. Known for its clear audio quality and ease of use, the KXT-3014 is a practical and cost-effective solution for users who need a straightforward, reliable wired telephone for everyday communication needs\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2154],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775622160437-749283064.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 04:22:40'),
