(6214,5,'product',3675,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"S.R.C - 008 car multimedia player small display\",\"description\":\"The S.R.C 008 car multimedia player is a compact single-DIN car audio system designed for basic multimedia playback with a small digital display. It is commonly used in budget or entry-level car setups where a full touchscreen system is not required. The unit typically features a small LED/LCD screen that shows track details, FM frequency, and playback status, along with physical buttons for easy control while driving. It supports multiple input sources such as USB drive, memory card (TF/SD), AUX input, and FM radio, allowing users to play MP3 audio files directly from external storage devices. The SRC (Source) button is used to switch between different input modes like radio, USB, Bluetooth, or AUX.\",\"info\":\"In many models under this category, basic Bluetooth connectivity is included for wireless music streaming and hands-free calling. The player is powered by the car’s 12V supply and connects to speakers through standard wiring, making it compatible with most vehicles. Additional features may include remote control support, preset equalizer settings, folder navigation, and memory resume function. Due to its small display and simple interface, the SRC 008 is ideal for users who want an affordable, durable, and easy-to-use car audio player without advanced touchscreen features.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2205],\"mrp\":\"3999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775629565165-764301519.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 06:26:05'),
(6215,5,'product',2339,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Target Sound Bar TT-SBT-102\",\"description\":\"The TARGET TT-SBT-102 Soundbar is a sleek and stylish audio accessory designed to enhance your home entertainment experience with louder, clearer, and more immersive sound compared to built-in TV speakers.\",\"info\":\"combines modern design with versatile connectivity options, making it suitable for TVs, laptops, smartphones\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"5000.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":270,\"secondary_id\":476,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-04-08 06:34:57'),
(6216,5,'product',2321,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Target Sound Bar with Subwoofer TT-SSA-902\",\"description\":\"Target TT-SSA-902 Sound Bar with Subwoofer is a 2.1-channel audio system designed to enhance your home entertainment experience with rich, immersive sound and deep bass.\",\"info\":\"The included wired subwoofer adds powerful low-end response, while selectable equalizer modes let you tailor the sound to your liking.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"6600.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":270,\"secondary_id\":476,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-04-08 06:35:28'),
(6217,5,'product',3676,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"S.R.C - 005 Car Multimedia speaker big display\",\"description\":\"The S.R.C-005 car multimedia player is a large-display double-DIN car audio system designed for enhanced in-car entertainment and smart connectivity. Unlike small-display players, this model features a big touchscreen display (typically 7-inch or more) that allows easy control of music, videos, and settings. It supports multiple media sources such as USB, SD card, AUX input, and FM radio, along with Bluetooth connectivity for wireless music streaming and hands-free calling. Many variants also include mirror link or Android-based interface, enabling users to connect their smartphones and access apps, navigation, and media directly on the screen.\",\"info\":\"This type of multimedia player is powered by the vehicle’s 12V system and offers features like touch controls, remote control support, equalizer settings, reverse camera input, and steering wheel control compatibility. With its larger display and advanced functionality, the SRC-005 is ideal for users who want a modern infotainment system with better visibility, multimedia playback, and smartphone integration in their vehicle.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2205],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775630238679-710204324.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 06:37:18'),
(6218,5,'product',2323,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Target Sound Bar with Subwoofer TT-SSA-903\",\"description\":\"It features a sleek, modern soundbar unit paired with a dedicated subwoofer, offering immersive sound suitable for movies, music, and gaming. With Bluetooth connectivity, you can easily stream audio wirelessly from your smartphone, tablet, or laptop, while wired options like Aux and USB inputs ensure compatibility with a wide range of devices.\",\"info\":\"The TT-SSA-903 Sound Bar with Subwoofer is a powerful 2.1-channel audio solution designed to elevate your home entertainment experience with rich, deep bass and clear audio output. It features a sleek, modern soundbar unit paired with a dedicated subwoofer, offering immersive sound suitable for movies, music, and gaming.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"8500.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":270,\"secondary_id\":476,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-04-08 06:40:17'),
