(6231,5,'product',3679,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Arihant Multimedia speaker\",\"description\":\"The Arihant computer multimedia speaker generally refers to desktop multimedia speakers sold or distributed by Arihant computer shops, rather than a single fixed branded model. These speakers are designed for use with PCs, laptops, and small entertainment setups, offering clear stereo sound with built-in amplifiers for everyday audio needs. Typically, they come in 2.0 or 2.1 channel configurations, where 2.0 includes two satellite speakers and 2.1 adds a subwoofer for deeper bass. Most models support 3.5mm AUX input, USB power supply, and sometimes Bluetooth connectivity, making them compatible with computers, TVs, and mobile devices\",\"info\":\"They are usually compact in size, making them ideal for desks, and are built with plastic or wooden cabinets depending on the variant. Some Arihant-supplied models also include volume control knobs, LED indicators, and bass enhancement features, providing a balanced audio experience for music, movies, gaming, and online content. In higher variants (like wooden or home-theatre style), you may also get strong bass output, better sound clarity, and wider sound coverage\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2205],\"model\":\"625\",\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775632262655-51726152.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 07:11:02'),
