(6233,5,'product',3681,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Target TT-BK-IPL 3802 Multimedia player\",\"description\":\"The TT-BK-IPL 3802 multimedia player (often sold under Target or similar brands) is a powerful FM USB multimedia speaker system designed for vehicles like trucks, tractors, autos, and also for small outdoor or shop use. It is an all-in-one unit that combines a built-in speaker, audio player, and amplifier, making it a convenient solution for loud and clear sound output. The device typically delivers around 40W output power and includes a 4-inch internal speaker, providing strong audio suitable for open environments.\",\"info\":\"It supports multiple playback options such as Bluetooth connectivity, USB drive, TF (memory card), AUX input, and FM radio, allowing users to play music from different sources easily. The system operates on 12V DC power, making it compatible with vehicle batteries and widely used in mobile setups. It also comes with a remote control for easy operation and simple front-panel controls for volume, track change, and mode selection.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2203],\"model\":\"TT-BK-IPL 3802\",\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775635850808-981663700.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 08:10:50'),
