(6254,5,'product',3687,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Target TT-D5 198 5.1 channel multimedia speaker\",\"description\":\"The Target TT-D5 198 5.1 channel multimedia speaker is a home theatre-style audio system designed to deliver immersive surround sound for music, movies, and TV entertainment. It consists of a subwoofer (bass unit) and five satellite speakers, creating a full 5.1 channel audio setup that enhances sound depth and direction. This system is ideal for users who want a cinematic experience at home or powerful audio for shops and small events.\",\"info\":\"It typically supports multiple input options such as Bluetooth, USB, AUX, SD card, and FM radio, allowing easy connection with TVs, mobile phones, laptops, and pen drives. Similar Target audio systems provide strong bass output with clear treble, making them suitable for both indoor entertainment and moderate outdoor use. High-power configurations in this category often deliver around 200W–300W output with multi-channel support, ensuring loud and balanced sound performance\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2203],\"mrp\":\"5999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775637893629-955836268.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 08:44:53'),
(6255,5,'product',3688,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TARGET TT-MS-203 Multimedia speaker\",\"description\":\"The TARGET TT-MS-203 is a mid-level multimedia speaker system offering better sound power and bass than entry-level models, making it ideal for daily entertainment and small to medium room usage.\",\"info\":\"Speaker Type: Multimedia Speaker System\\r\\nConfiguration: 2.0 Channel\\r\\nOutput Power: Approx. 20W – 40W (varies by variant)\\r\\nConnectivity: Wired (3.5mm AUX / USB)\\r\\nCompatibility: TV, PC, Laptop, Mobile\\r\\nPower Source: AC Powered\\r\\nDesign: Desktop / Home audio setup\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2203],\"model\":\"TT-MS-203\",\"alternative_names\":[\" Audio Speakers\"],\"mrp\":\"1199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775637924624-653248878.jpeg\"}','2026-04-08 08:45:24'),
