(6268,5,'product',3696,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Target Car MP3 Player\",\"description\":\"The TARGET TT-CMS-767FM-UMB Car MP3 Player is a feature-rich car stereo system designed to enhance in-car entertainment with modern connectivity and powerful sound output. It delivers up to 200W power (4×50W), providing clear and loud audio for music and calls. Equipped with Bluetooth functionality, it allows wireless music streaming and hands-free calling for safe driving.\",\"info\":\"Model: TT-CMS-767FM-UMB\\r\\nType: Car MP3 Player / Car Stereo\\r\\nOutput Power: 200W (4×50W)\\r\\nConnectivity: Bluetooth, USB, AUX\\r\\nDisplay: Color LCD\\r\\nFunctions: Music playback, FM radio, hands-free calling\\r\\nCompatibility: Smartphones, USB drives, car speakers\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2203],\"model\":\" TT-CMS-767FM-UMB \",\"alternative_names\":[\"Car Stereo System\",\"Car Media Player\",\"Car Music Player\"],\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775640585422-757903930.jpeg\"}','2026-04-08 09:29:45'),
(6269,5,'product',3697,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Target Car MP3 Player\",\"description\":\"The TARGET TT-CMS-766FM-UMB Car MP3 Player is a budget-friendly in-dash car stereo designed to provide reliable music playback and modern connectivity features. It typically offers Bluetooth support for wireless music streaming and hands-free calling, making driving safer and more convenient. The unit also includes USB and AUX input options, allowing users to play songs directly from pen drives or mobile devices.\",\"info\":\"Bluetooth Connectivity – Wireless music & hands-free calling\\r\\n Power Output (Approx. 200W – 4×50W) – Loud and clear sound (similar models)\\r\\n USB & AUX Input – Multiple playback options\\r\\n FM Radio – Listen to local stations\\r\\n EQ Controls – Adjust bass, treble, balance\\r\\n Remote Control Support – Easy operation\\r\\n Digital Display – Clear interface for navigation\\r\\n Typical Specifications\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2203],\"model\":\" TT-CMS-766FM-UMB\",\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775641211639-757936238.jpeg\"}','2026-04-08 09:40:11'),
(6270,5,'product',3698,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Target Car MP3 Player\",\"description\":\"The TARGET TT-CMS-765FM-UMB Car MP3 Player is a compact and affordable Single DIN car stereo system designed to upgrade your vehicle’s audio experience. It supports Bluetooth connectivity for wireless music streaming and hands-free calling, allowing safe and convenient use while driving. The player also includes USB and AUX input options, enabling playback from pen drives and mobile devices.\",\"info\":\"Type: Car MP3 Player / Car Stereo\\r\\nSize: Single DIN\\r\\nConnectivity: Bluetooth, USB, AUX\\r\\nFunctions: Music playback, FM radio, calling\\r\\nCompatibility: Smartphone, USB drive, car speakers\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2203],\"model\":\" TT-CMS-765FM-UMB \",\"mrp\":\"2999\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775642753773-522135012.jpeg\"}','2026-04-08 10:05:53'),
(6271,5,'product',3699,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"MAGNETZ Audio system-MG-222A\",\"description\":\"The MAGNETZ MG-222A is a budget 2.1 multimedia speaker system that offers good sound output, deep bass, and multiple connectivity options, making it a great choice for affordable home entertainment.\",\"info\":\"Model: MG-222A\\r\\nType: Multimedia / Home Audio Speaker\\r\\nConfiguration: 2.1 Channel\\r\\nOutput Power: Approx. 30W – 60W (varies by version)\\r\\nConnectivity: Bluetooth / USB / AUX\\r\\nCompatibility: TV, PC, Laptop, Mobile\\r\\nPower Source: AC powered\\r\\n\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2214],\"model\":\"MG-222A\",\"mrp\":\"1699\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775644412326-291197037.jpeg\"}','2026-04-08 10:33:32'),
(6272,5,'product',3700,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"C9014 transistor \",\"description\":\"The C9014 transistor is a widely used NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) designed for general-purpose amplification and switching applications. It is commonly found in audio circuits, small signal amplification, and low-power electronic devices\",\"info\":\"The C9014 transistor works like a switch or amplifier. A small current at the base controls a larger current flowing from collector to emitter, making it useful in many electronic circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"alternative_names\":[\"C9014 transistor \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"160\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775644424817-306876516.webp\"}','2026-04-08 10:33:44'),
(6273,5,'product',3701,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"187P transistor \",\"description\":\"The 187P transistor (often marked as C187P / 2SC187P) is a general-purpose NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) used mainly for signal amplification and switching applications. The “P” suffix usually indicates a specific gain group or manufacturer variant of the standard C187 transistor.\",\"info\":\"The 187P transistor works like a mini switch or amplifier. A small current at the base controls a larger current between collector and emitter, making it useful in many low-power electronics.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"alternative_names\":[\"187P transistor \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775645254635-835239428.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 10:47:34'),
(6274,5,'product',3702,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"C828 transistor\",\"description\":\"The C828 transistor (also known as 2SC828) is a general-purpose NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) widely used in audio, switching, and small signal amplification circuits. It is popular in consumer electronics due to its reliability and low cost\",\"info\":\"The C828 transistor acts as a small amplifier or electronic switch, where a tiny base current controls a larger current flowing from collector to emitter.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"alternative_names\":[\"C828 transistor\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775645544364-587835183.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 10:52:24'),
(6275,5,'product',3703,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"BC327 transistor \",\"description\":\"The BC327 transistor is a PNP bipolar junction transistor (BJT) designed for general-purpose amplification and switching applications. It is commonly used in audio circuits, driver stages, and low-power control circuits.\",\"info\":\"The BC327 is a PNP transistor, meaning current flows when the base is pulled low. It is often used with an NPN transistor like BC337 to form push-pull or switching circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"alternative_names\":[\"BC327 transistor \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775645723403-27975221.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 10:55:23'),
(6276,5,'product',3704,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"iplay mp3 multimedia player\",\"description\":\"The iPlay MP3 Multimedia Player is a compact and portable digital device designed for music lovers who want simple, on-the-go entertainment. It supports playback of MP3 audio files and often includes additional multimedia features like video playback, FM radio, and image viewing, making it a versatile pocket-sized gadget.\",\"info\":\"MP3 Audio Playback – Clear and smooth sound quality for music and recordings\\r\\nMultimedia Support – Plays MP3, WAV audio and sometimes MP4/AMV video formats\\r\\nBuilt-in Display – Small LCD screen for song navigation and media control\\r\\nFM Radio – Listen to local radio stations anytime\\r\\nUSB Rechargeable – Easy charging via USB cable\\r\\nExpandable Storage – Supports microSD/TF cards for additional storage\\r\\nLightweight & Portable – Easy to carry in pocket or bag\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2214],\"mrp\":\"499\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775646012244-605234897.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 11:00:12'),
(6277,5,'product',3705,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"C1674 transistor \",\"description\":\"The C1674 transistor (also written as 2SC1674) is a low-noise NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) mainly designed for audio amplification and signal processing circuits. It is commonly used in pre-amplifier stages, tone control circuits, and radio frequency (RF) applications.\",\"info\":\"The C1674 transistor is mainly used where clean (low-noise) signal amplification is required. A small input signal at the base gets amplified into a larger output signal at the collector, making it perfect for audio circuits\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[533],\"alternative_names\":[\"C1674 transistor \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775646167395-488766567.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 11:02:47'),
(6278,5,'product',3706,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Arihant Digital Car Multimedia Player\",\"description\":\"The Arihant Digital Car Multimedia Player is a modern in-dash entertainment system designed to enhance the driving experience with advanced audio, video, and connectivity features. It combines music playback, smartphone connectivity, and navigation support in a single compact unit, making it a popular choice for upgrading car interiors.\",\"info\":\"Digital Multimedia Playback – Supports MP3, WAV, WMA and video formats for full entertainment\\r\\nTouchscreen Display – Clear screen (commonly around 800×480 resolution) for easy control and navigation\\r\\nBluetooth Connectivity – Enables hands-free calling and wireless music streaming\\r\\nUSB & AUX Support – Connect pendrive, mobile, or other external devices\\r\\nFM Radio Tuner – Built-in radio for live channels and news\\r\\nAndroid-Based System (in many models) – Allows apps, navigation, and smart features\\r\\nMulti-Speaker Output – Supports 4.1 channel audio system for better sound experience\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2214],\"model\":\"0011\",\"alternative_names\":[\"Car Stereo System\",\"Car Music System\"],\"mrp\":\"1399\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775646969145-769823230.jpeg\"}','2026-04-08 11:16:09'),
(6279,5,'product',3707,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"XINIA Car Stereo Cabinet Multimedia Player\",\"description\":\"The Xinia Car Stereo Cabinet Multimedia Player is a car audio entertainment system that combines a multimedia player with an external cabinet (speaker box or amplifier enclosure). It is designed to deliver powerful sound output and enhanced bass performance, making it suitable for vehicles and custom audio setups.\",\"info\":\"Multimedia Playback – Supports MP3, USB, SD card, and AUX input\\r\\nHigh-Power Audio Output – Works with external cabinet speakers for strong bass and loud sound\\r\\nBuilt-in FM Radio – Tune into local stations\\r\\nBluetooth Connectivity (in some models) – Wireless music streaming and hands-free calling\\r\\nRemote Control Support – Easy operation from a distance\\r\\nMultiple Input Options – USB, AUX, and memory card support\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2214],\"alternative_names\":[\"Car Audio Cabinet System\",\"Car Sound Box System\"],\"mrp\":\"1199\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775647498868-519357894.jpeg\"}','2026-04-08 11:24:58'),
(6280,5,'product',3708,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Oswal 109 car stereo cabinet with USB/MMC\",\"description\":\"The Oswal 109 Car Stereo Cabinet with USB/MMC is a budget-friendly car audio system that combines a multimedia player with a cabinet (speaker box) to deliver loud and bass-rich sound. It is designed for users who want simple music playback with strong audio output in cars or small outdoor setups.\",\"info\":\"USB & MMC Card Support – Play music directly from pendrive and memory card\\r\\nMP3 Playback – Supports common audio formats for easy music listening\\r\\nBuilt-in FM Radio – Tune into local radio stations\\r\\nHigh Sound Output – Cabinet speaker provides louder volume and better bass\\r\\nFront Control Panel – Buttons for play, pause, volume, and track control\\r\\nRemote Control Support (in some units) – Easy operation\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2214],\"model\":\"109\",\"mrp\":\"1398\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775648475719-36597725.jpeg\"}','2026-04-08 11:41:15'),
(6281,5,'product',3709,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"24C16N IC\",\"description\":\"The 24C16N IC is a 16-kilobit (2KB) serial EEPROM (Electrically Erasable Programmable Read-Only Memory) that communicates using the I²C (Inter-Integrated Circuit) protocol. It is widely used in electronic systems to store small but important data permanently, such as device settings, calibration values, and configuration parameters.\",\"info\":\"The 24C16N IC stores data in memory cells that can be electrically written and erased. It communicates with a microcontroller using only two wires (SDA and SCL), making it simple and efficient for embedded systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[761],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"base_image\":\"products/1775648567954-299539793.png\"}','2026-04-08 11:42:47'),
(6282,5,'product',3710,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"24C32N IC\",\"description\":\"The 24C32N IC is a 32K-bit (4KB) serial EEPROM (Electrically Erasable Programmable Read-Only Memory) used for storing small amounts of data that must be retained even when power is turned off. It communicates using the I²C (Inter-Integrated Circuit) protocol, making it very popular in microcontroller-based projects.\",\"info\":\"The 24C32N is a serial EEPROM memory IC widely used in embedded systems for permanent data storage. It belongs to the 24Cxx family, where “32” indicates 32 kilobits (4KB) of storage.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"alternative_names\":[\"24C32N IC\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775649358444-469365948.png\"}','2026-04-08 11:55:58'),
(6283,5,'product',3709,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"24C16N IC\",\"description\":\"The 24C16N IC is a 16-kilobit (2KB) serial EEPROM (Electrically Erasable Programmable Read-Only Memory) that communicates using the I²C (Inter-Integrated Circuit) protocol. It is widely used in electronic systems to store small but important data permanently, such as device settings, calibration values, and configuration parameters.\",\"info\":\"The 24C16N IC stores data in memory cells that can be electrically written and erased. It communicates with a microcontroller using only two wires (SDA and SCL), making it simple and efficient for embedded systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[\"24C16N IC\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232},{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":\"73\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-04-08 11:57:00'),
(6284,5,'product',3711,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"24C64BN IC\",\"description\":\"The 24C64BN IC is a 64K-bit (8KB) serial EEPROM memory device that stores data permanently, even when power is removed. It is an improved version of the standard 24C64 series and uses the I²C (Inter-Integrated Circuit) communication protocol, requiring only two lines—SDA (data) and SCL (clock)—to interface with microcontrollers.\",\"info\":\"This IC contains 8192 bytes of non-volatile memory, organized into pages that allow efficient data storage and faster writing. It supports both byte write and page write operations, making it suitable for applications where small but reliable data storage is needed.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"alternative_names\":[\"24C64BN IC\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775650206616-311098227.png\"}','2026-04-08 12:10:06'),
(6285,5,'product',3712,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"24C08WP IC\",\"description\":\"The 24C08WP IC is an 8K-bit (1KB) serial EEPROM memory device used for storing small amounts of data permanently, even when power is turned off. It operates using the I²C (two-wire) communication protocol, making it easy to interface with microcontrollers like Arduino, PIC, and AVR.\",\"info\":\"The 24C08WP is a compact, reliable EEPROM IC with 1KB storage, ideal for storing small but important data using a simple I²C interface, with added write protection for safety.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"alternative_names\":[\"24C08WP IC\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775650507042-601127414.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 12:15:07'),
(6286,5,'product',3713,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"93C46W6 IC\",\"description\":\"The 93C46W6 IC is a 1K-bit (128 × 8 or 64 × 16) serial EEPROM memory device used for storing small amounts of data permanently. Unlike the 24C series, it uses the Microwire (3-wire) communication interface, making it suitable for systems that require simple and fast serial data transfer.\",\"info\":\"The 93C46W6 is a compact and reliable EEPROM IC with a Microwire interface, ideal for applications requiring small data storage with flexible 8-bit/16-bit organization and controlled write operations.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"alternative_names\":[\"93C46W6 IC\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775650751702-182916718.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 12:19:11'),
(6287,5,'product',3714,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Opto coupler B321 IC\",\"description\":\"The B321 IC is an optocoupler (opto-isolator) used to transfer electrical signals between two circuits while keeping them electrically isolated. It works using light (optical coupling) instead of direct electrical connection, which protects sensitive components from high voltage, noise, and spikes.\",\"info\":\"The B321 optocoupler IC is a simple and effective isolation device that safely transfers signals using light, making it essential in circuits where protection and noise isolation are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[651],\"alternative_names\":[\"Opto coupler B321 IC\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775651602977-50665064.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 12:33:22'),
(6288,5,'product',3715,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OPTO COUPLER P521 IC\",\"description\":\"The P521 IC is an optocoupler (opto-isolator) used to transfer signals between two circuits while providing electrical isolation. It uses light to transmit signals, ensuring that high-voltage or noisy circuits do not damage sensitive components like microcontrollers.\",\"info\":\"The P521 optocoupler IC is a reliable isolation component that safely transfers signals using light, making it essential for protecting circuits and improving system stability in electronic designs.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2196],\"alternative_names\":[\"OPTO COUPLER P521 IC\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775651858768-206502808.jpg\"}','2026-04-08 12:37:38'),
(6289,5,'product',3714,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"OPTO COUPLER B321 IC\",\"description\":\"The B321 IC is an optocoupler (opto-isolator) used to transfer electrical signals between two circuits while keeping them electrically isolated. It works using light (optical coupling) instead of direct electrical connection, which protects sensitive components from high voltage, noise, and spikes.\",\"info\":\"The B321 optocoupler IC is a simple and effective isolation device that safely transfers signals using light, making it essential in circuits where protection and noise isolation are required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[\"OPTO COUPLER B321 IC\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":275,\"secondary_id\":73,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-04-08 12:39:56'),
