(6343,5,'product',3733,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"RECORD Classic Car USB/MMC Player\",\"description\":\"The RECORD Classic Car USB/MMC Player (DC 12V) is a compact and reliable car stereo audio system designed for basic music playback and FM listening. It is widely used in cars, auto rickshaws, buses, and DIY speaker cabinets due to its simple design and easy installation.This player supports USB drives and MMC/SD memory cards, allowing direct playback of MP3 songs without the need for CDs. It features a built-in FM tuner with stable reception, so users can enjoy local radio stations anytime.\\r\\nThe LED digital display shows track details and FM frequency, while front-panel control buttons provide smooth and easy operation. Designed to run on a standard 12V DC power supply, it is compatible with most vehicle electrical systems.\",\"info\":\"DC 12V power supply (vehicle compatible)\\r\\nBuilt-in FM radio tuner\\r\\nSupports USB & MMC/SD card playback\\r\\nCompatible with MP3 audio format\\r\\nLED display panel for track & frequency\\r\\nSimple button controls\\r\\nCompact universal dashboard fit\\r\\n\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2227],\"model\":\"DC12V\",\"alternative_names\":[\"Car Audio Player\",\"Car MP3 Player\",\"Digital Car Music System\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775715680034-44414141.jpeg\"}','2026-04-09 06:21:20'),
