(6348,5,'product',3735,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Samcon Car Stereo Cabinet\",\"description\":\"The Samcon Car Stereo Cabinet is a budget-friendly car audio system commonly used in cars, auto rickshaws, buses, and DIY speaker boxes. It typically includes a front panel player + cabinet housing, making it easy to install and use.It supports multiple input options like USB, MMC/SD card, AUX, and features a built-in FM radio tuner for listening to local stations. Many Samcon models also come with a remote control and basic amplifier support, making them suitable for simple sound setups.\",\"info\":\" Supports USB / MMC / SD card playback\\r\\n Built-in FM radio tuner\\r\\n Simple control buttons + remote\\r\\n Stereo output with basic amplifier support\\r\\n Compact cabinet design for easy installation\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2227],\"alternative_names\":[\"USB FM Player Cabinet\",\"MP3 Player Cabinet\",\"Car Stereo Box\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"999\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775716839495-133567148.jpeg\"}','2026-04-09 06:40:39'),
