(6426,5,'product',3391,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2 AA Battery Holder With Cover\",\"description\":\"A 2 AA battery holder with cover is a compact and protective enclosure designed to securely hold two AA batteries while providing a stable power supply for electronic devices and DIY projects. It is typically made from durable plastic and features metal spring contacts to ensure reliable electrical connectivity. The built-in cover helps protect the batteries from dust, moisture, and accidental contact, enhancing safety and durability during use.\",\"info\":\"These holders are commonly used in applications such as remote controls, toys, LED projects, Arduino circuits, and portable devices. Most models come with pre-attached wires or terminals for easy connection, and some variants include an ON/OFF switch for convenient power control. By keeping the batteries securely in place and protected, this holder ensures efficient power delivery and long-lasting performance in various low-voltage applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":316,\"secondary_id\":\"442\",\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-04-09 09:32:37'),
