(6428,5,'product',3738,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"3055T\",\"description\":\"The 3055T power transistor is a high-power NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) designed for general-purpose power amplification and switching. It is widely used in electronic circuits that require handling high current and high voltage, making it a popular choice in audio and power supply systems.\",\"info\":\"It is capable of delivering high output power with stable performance, making it suitable for audio amplifiers, voltage regulators, motor drivers, and inverter circuits. However, because of its low switching speed, it is mainly used in low-frequency and linear applications rather than high-speed switching circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2218],\"alternative_names\":[\"3055T power transistor \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775731549646-81153913.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 10:45:49'),
(6429,5,'product',3739,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"TTC5200\",\"description\":\"The TTC5200 power transistor is a high-performance NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) designed mainly for audio power amplification and high-current applications. It is an improved and reliable version similar to the famous 2SC5200, widely used in professional amplifier circuits.\",\"info\":\"This transistor comes in a TO-264 package, which provides excellent heat dissipation and allows it to handle high power levels efficiently. Due to its high current capacity and low distortion characteristics, the TTC5200 is commonly used in high-quality audio amplifiers and sound systems.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2218],\"alternative_names\":[\"TTC5200 power transistor \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775731781016-1165607.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 10:49:41'),
(6430,5,'product',3740,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"IRFBC40\",\"description\":\"The IRFBC40 power transistor is a high-voltage N-channel MOSFET designed for fast switching and power control applications. Unlike bipolar transistors, it operates using voltage control, which makes it highly efficient and suitable for modern electronic circuits.\",\"info\":\"It is housed in a TO-220 package, allowing for easy mounting on heat sinks and efficient heat dissipation. The IRFBC40 is well-known for its high-speed switching capability, low ON resistance, and ability to handle high voltage loads, making it ideal for switching power supplies and inverter circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2218],\"alternative_names\":[\"IRFBC40 power transistor \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775731984150-622781117.webp\"}','2026-04-09 10:53:04'),
(6431,5,'product',3741,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"P213J\",\"description\":\"The P213J power transistor is a general-purpose NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) commonly used in audio amplification and medium-power electronic circuits. It is designed to handle moderate voltage and current levels, making it suitable for both amplification and switching applications.\",\"info\":\"This transistor typically comes in a TO-220 package, which allows easy mounting with a heat sink for better thermal performance. The P213J is known for its stable operation and reliability, especially in low to medium power amplifier circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2218],\"alternative_names\":[\"P213J power transistor \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775732674535-486609025.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 11:04:34'),
