(6436,5,'product',3742,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L7808CV\",\"description\":\"The L7808CV is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +8V DC output. It belongs to the widely used 78xx series of voltage regulators, where the last two digits indicate the output voltage (7808 = 8V).\",\"info\":\"This regulator is designed to deliver a constant output voltage even when there are fluctuations in the input voltage or load conditions. It is commonly used in electronic circuits where a reliable 8V power supply is required.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2256],\"alternative_names\":[\"L7808CV regulator\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775733859217-555885936.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 11:24:19'),
(6437,5,'product',3743,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L7805CV\",\"description\":\"The L7805CV is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +5V DC output. It is part of the widely used 78xx series, where “05” indicates a 5V output.\\r\\nThis regulator is designed to maintain a constant output voltage even when the input voltage or load conditions change, making it ideal for powering sensitive electronic components like microcontrollers and digital circuits.\",\"info\":\"The L7805CV is one of the most commonly used 5V regulators, perfect for delivering a reliable and stable power supply in electronics projects and circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2256],\"alternative_names\":[\"L7805CV regulator\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775735107494-648617180.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 11:45:07'),
(6438,5,'product',3744,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L7806CV\",\"description\":\"The L7806CV is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that delivers a stable +6V DC output. It belongs to the popular 78xx series of voltage regulators, where “06” represents a 6V output voltage.\\r\\nThis regulator is designed to provide a constant and reliable voltage, even when the input voltage fluctuates or the load changes. It is widely used in circuits that require a steady 6V power supply.\",\"info\":\"The L7806CV regulator is a simple and effective solution for providing a stable 6V output, making it useful in a wide range of electronic applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2256],\"alternative_names\":[\"L7806cv regulator\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775735292158-911949677.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 11:48:12'),
(6439,5,'product',3745,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"78L05\",\"description\":\"The 78L05 is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +5V DC output. It is a low-current version of the popular 7805 regulator, designed for small electronic circuits where high current is not required.\\r\\nUnlike the larger TO-220 regulators, the 78L05 typically comes in a compact TO-92 package, making it ideal for space-saving and low-power applications.\",\"info\":\"The 78L05 regulator is perfect for low-power applications, providing a stable 5V supply in compact electronic designs\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2256],\"alternative_names\":[\"78L05 regulator \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775735679954-250933088.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 11:54:39'),
(6440,5,'product',3746,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L7809CV \",\"description\":\"The L7809CV is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +9V DC output. It is part of the well-known 78xx series, where “09” indicates a 9V output voltage.\\r\\nThis regulator is designed to maintain a constant output voltage even when the input voltage fluctuates or the load changes. It is widely used in circuits that require a reliable 9V power supply.\",\"info\":\"The L7809CV regulator is a reliable and widely used solution for providing a stable 9V output in many electronic applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2256],\"alternative_names\":[\"L7809CV regulator\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775735997544-982505906.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 11:59:57'),
(6441,5,'product',3747,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L805CV\",\"description\":\"The L7805CV is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +5V DC output. It belongs to the widely used 78xx series, where “05” indicates a 5V regulated output.\\r\\nThis IC is designed to keep the output voltage constant and steady, even if the input voltage changes or the load varies. It is one of the most commonly used regulators for powering digital electronics and microcontroller circuits.\",\"info\":\"The L7805CV is one of the most popular 5V regulators, ideal for providing a reliable and stable power source in electronic circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2256],\"alternative_names\":[\"L805CV original regulator\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775736211470-642745655.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 12:03:31'),
(6442,5,'product',3748,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L7824CV \",\"description\":\"The L7824CV is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +24V DC output. It belongs to the widely used 78xx series, where “24” indicates a 24V regulated output.\\r\\nThis regulator is designed to maintain a constant output voltage even when the input voltage fluctuates or the load varies, making it suitable for circuits that require a reliable 24V supply.\",\"info\":\"The L7824CV regulator is a robust solution for providing a stable 24V output, especially in industrial and high-voltage electronic applications\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2256],\"alternative_names\":[\"L7824CV regulator\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775736634205-879361592.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 12:10:34'),
(6443,5,'product',3749,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"AS7821A\",\"description\":\"The AS7821A is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +21V DC output. It belongs to the 78xx series family, where the number “21” indicates a 21V regulated output voltage.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis regulator is designed to maintain a constant output voltage even when there are variations in input voltage or load conditions. It is suitable for circuits that require a stable 21V power supply, especially in industrial and analog applications.\",\"info\":\"The AS7821A regulator is a reliable choice for generating a stable 21V output, especially in industrial and analog electronic applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2256],\"alternative_names\":[\"AS7821A regulator\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775736950013-898281367.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 12:15:50'),
(6444,5,'product',3750,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"AS7805A \",\"description\":\"The AS7805A is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +5V DC output. It is a variant of the popular 7805 regulator from the 78xx series, designed to deliver a constant and reliable 5V supply for electronic circuits.\\r\\nThis regulator ensures that the output voltage remains steady and unaffected by input fluctuations or load changes, making it ideal for powering digital and low-voltage electronic devices.\",\"info\":\"The AS7805A regulator is a reliable and commonly used 5V regulator, perfect for providing a stable power source in a wide range of electronic applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2256],\"alternative_names\":[\"AS7805A regulator\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"157\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775737150292-778642581.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 12:19:10'),
(6445,5,'product',3751,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"L7905CV\",\"description\":\"The L7905CV is a fixed negative linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable −5V DC output. It belongs to the 79xx series, which are designed for negative voltage regulation (unlike the 78xx series for positive voltage).\\r\\nThis regulator is commonly used in circuits that require a dual power supply (positive and negative voltage), such as audio amplifiers, operational amplifiers, and analog systems.\",\"info\":\"The L7905CV regulator is an essential component when a stable −5V supply is required, especially in analog and audio electronic circuits.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2256],\"alternative_names\":[\"L7905CV regulator\"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"159\",\"base_image\":\"products/1775737355365-253463871.jpg\"}','2026-04-09 12:22:35'),
