(6636,5,'product',3779,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Sony sub woofer \",\"description\":\"A Sony 8-inch 100W subwoofer is a compact yet powerful speaker designed to produce deep bass (low-frequency sound) for car audio systems or home theatre setups. It enhances music by adding strong punch and vibration, especially for beats and bass-heavy tracks.\",\"info\":\"Sony subwoofers are known for their solid build quality and clean bass performance. Some versions include a built-in amplifier (active subwoofer), while others require an external amplifier (passive subwoofer). They may also support frequency ranges around 25Hz–250Hz, focusing on low-end sound reproduction.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2265],\"model\":\"Model : XS-GTF840B \",\"alternative_names\":[\"Sony sub woofer 8\\\" 100w \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"799\",\"base_image\":\"products/1776248593405-271836069.jpg\"}','2026-04-15 10:23:13'),
(6637,5,'product',3780,'create',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"Sony sub woofer \",\"description\":\"A Sony 6-inch 80W subwoofer is a compact bass speaker designed to deliver clear and punchy low-frequency sound in small audio setups. It is ideal for car audio systems, mini home theatre setups, and DIY speaker projects.\",\"info\":\"The speaker usually features a durable cone material and strong magnet structure, allowing efficient vibration and better bass response. Compared to larger subwoofers (8\\\" or 10\\\"), a 6-inch version is more space-saving and can be easily installed in car doors, rear trays, or compact enclosures.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"mappings\":[2265],\"model\":\"Model : XS-GTF640\",\"alternative_names\":[\"sony sub woofer 6\\\" 80w \"],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"799\",\"base_image\":\"products/1776249125832-200119189.jpg\"}','2026-04-15 10:32:05'),
