(6735,5,'category_group',15,'update',NULL,'{\"name\":\"Mobile Phones\",\"description\":\"Mobile phones are portable electronic communication devices that allow users to make voice calls, send text messages, and access wireless communication networks. Modern mobile phones, commonly known as smartphones, offer advanced features such as internet connectivity, touchscreen interfaces, cameras, multimedia playback, GPS navigation, and the ability to install applications.\",\"info\":\"Mobile phones cssssonsist of several key components including a processor, battery, display screen, camera modules, memory, sensors, and wireless communication systems such as 4G or 5G. They run on operating systems like Android or iOS, which manage hardware functions and allow users to use various applications for communication, entertainment, productivity, and social networking.\",\"status\":\"Active\",\"image\":null}','2026-04-17 09:43:04'),
