(6769,5,'sub_sector',20,'update',NULL,'{\"sector_title_id\":\"1\",\"sector_id\":\"19\",\"sub_sector_name\":\"Basic Electronics Components\",\"description\":\"Basic electronic components are the fundamental building blocks used to design and assemble electronic circuits. Each component has a specific function that helps control, store, or modify electrical signals in electronic devices.\",\"info\":\"Basic electronic components are the essential elements used to design and build electronic circuits. These components control the flow of electricity, store energy, convert signals, and perform switching or amplification operations in electronic systemss.\",\"note\":\"All electronic circuits are built using basic components.Each component has a symbol, value, and specific function. Understanding basics is essential for electronics, ECE, and electrical studies\",\"system_note\":\"Basic components are the foundation of all electronic circuits. Each component has a symbol, value, and specific function. Used in power supplies, communication systems, control circuits, and devices\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image\":null}','2026-04-18 04:43:36'),
