(6987,5,'product',3393,'update',NULL,'{\"product_name\":\"2 Slot AA Battery Holder\",\"description\":\"A 2 slot AA battery holder is a simple and practical component designed to hold two AA batteries securely and provide a stable power supply for electronic circuits and devices. Typically made from durable plastic, it features metal spring contacts that ensure proper electrical connection and firm battery placement. This type of holder usually provides an output of 3V when using standard 1.5V AA batteries connected in series.\",\"info\":\"It is widely used in DIY electronics, Arduino projects, toys, LED circuits, and portable devices. Most 2 slot holders come with pre-attached wires or metal terminals for easy integration into circuits, while some variants are designed for PCB mounting. Its compact design, ease of use, and reliable performance make it an essential component for low-voltage power applications.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"model\":\"\",\"series\":\"\",\"alternative_names\":[],\"option_set\":\"0\",\"mrp\":\"199.00\",\"note\":\"\",\"dynamic_fields\":[],\"mappings\":[{\"primary_id\":491,\"secondary_id\":0,\"brand_id\":232}]}','2026-05-02 03:16:39'),
