INSERT INTO `brand` VALUES
(2,'Hp','HP (Hewlett-Packard) is a globally recognized American technology company, best known for its laptops, desktops, printers, and IT solutions.','HP offers a wide range of consumer and business laptops, including popular series such as Pavilion, Envy, Victus, Omen, and EliteBook, designed for students, professionals, gamers, and enterprises. HP systems are known for reliable performance, modern design, and strong after-sales support.','p','p','brands/1771559242753-144905304.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 03:47:22'),
(4,'Lenovo','Lenovo is a global technology brand known for designing and manufacturing a wide range of computers, smartphones, and smart devices.','Founded in 1984 and headquartered in Beijing, China, Lenovo is one of the world’s leading PC makers, offering laptops, desktops, workstations, tablets, and accessories under popular series like ThinkPad, IdeaPad, and Legion for gaming','The company also produces servers, storage systems, and smart home products. Lenovo is recognized for innovation, strong build quality, and a broad global presence across consumer and enterprise markets.','p','brands/1771563629012-211181157.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:00:29'),
(5,'LG','LG (short for Lucky Goldstar) is a major global consumer electronics and technology brand headquartered in Seoul, South Korea. LG is known for a wide range of products including televisions, home appliances (like refrigerators and washing machines), air conditioners, smartphones, and audio systems.','The brand emphasizes innovation, quality, and stylish design, and has been a pioneer in displays (OLED TVs), smart home technology, and energy‑efficient appliances. LG products are sold in markets around the world, making it one of the most recognizable names in electronics.','p','p','brands/1771563894178-128210153.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:04:54'),
(6,'Apple','Apple is a globally leading technology company known for designing and manufacturing premium consumer electronics, computer systems, software, and digital services. The brand is recognized worldwide for its innovation, high-quality design, performance, and integrated ecosystem of hardware and software products.','Apple is a leading global technology brand founded in 1976, known for premium computers, smartphones, and digital devices. The company delivers innovative products combining powerful hardware, advanced software, and a seamless ecosystem designed for productivity, creativity, and everyday use.','he company’s major products include the iPhone smartphones, Mac computers, iPad tablets, Apple Watch, AirPods, and related accessories, along with operating systems such as iOS and macOS. Apple also provides digital services including the App Store, iCloud, Apple Music, and streaming platforms. Known for its sleek design philosophy, strong security features, and seamless integration across devices','Apple focuses on delivering a superior user experience and cutting-edge performance. With a global customer base and strong brand loyalty, Apple remains one of the most influential and valuable technology brands in the world.','brands/1771485436854-697619098.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:39:06'),
(7,'Electro','Electro is a budget battery brand commonly found in India and nearby markets. It is best known for zinc-carbon (heavy-duty) batteries used in low-drain, everyday devices.','Electro is a budget battery brand commonly found in India and nearby markets. It is best known for zinc-carbon (heavy-duty) batteries used in low-drain, everyday devices.','Electro products are known for durability, user-friendly design, and cost-effective solutions suitable for everyday electrical installations and maintenance needs.','With an emphasis on quality standards and dependable operation, the brand aims to provide efficient electrical and electronic solutions for technicians, businesses, and general consumers requiring affordable and reliable products.','brands/1771497376075-109457301.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:24:25'),
(8,'Samsung','Samsung is a South Korean multinational conglomerate and one of the largest electronics companies in the world, famous for its wide range of products including smartphones, TVs, home appliances, and semiconductors.','Samsung is a versatile technology powerhouse, spanning consumer electronics, semiconductors, and home appliances, with Samsung Electronics being its flagship global brand for smartphones and high-tech devices','p','p','brands/1771569232741-248434053.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:33:52'),
(9,'Eyeplus','The name “Eyeplus” can refer to multiple unrelated brands/businesses rather than a single global company — it’s used by different businesses in different categories (not all connected)','Eyeplus Electronics India LLP is a consumer electronics brand that appears to sell LED/Smart TVs and related products','The brand focuses on delivering LED and smart TV models equipped with high-definition displays, smart operating systems, and multiple connectivity options such as HDMI, USB, Wi-Fi, and screen mirroring features','Eyeplus TVs are designed to support streaming applications, digital media playback, and everyday entertainment needs with user-friendly interfaces and energy-efficient performance. Known for budget-friendly pricing and practical functionality, Eyeplus TV aims to make smart television technology accessible to a wide range of consumers seeking reliable and cost-effective home entertainment solutions.','brands/1771497870854-694075085.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:38:27'),
(10,'Sony','Sony Corporation is a major Japanese multinational conglomerate known for its electronics, gaming, entertainment, and financial services. It is one of the most recognized technology and media brands worldwide.','Televisions, audio equipment, cameras, and smartphones, Known for innovations in consumer electronics like the Trinitron TV and PlayStation-compatible cameras.','p','p','brands/1771569887301-497578911.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:44:47'),
(11,'Panasonic','Panasonic is a Japanese multinational electronics brand known worldwide for its reliability, innovation, and long product life','Panasonic operates worldwide with manufacturing, R&D and sales operations in many countries. It is a globally recognized brand and one of the long‑standing leaders in consumer electronics and electrical equipment','p','p','brands/1771567083316-89632146.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:58:03'),
(12,'Philips','Philips is a globally trusted Dutch brand known for innovation, quality, and long-lasting performance.','Philips has evolved from a lighting company into a leading health technology and consumer electronics brand.','p','p','brands/1771567211105-293485382.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:00:11'),
(13,'Haier','Haier is a globally recognized home appliance and consumer electronics brand known for manufacturing innovative and energy-efficient products designed for modern living. Founded in 1984 and headquartered in Qingdao, China, Haier has grown into one of the world’s leading appliance manufacturers with a strong presence in international markets.','The company offers a wide range of products including refrigerators, washing machines, air conditioners, televisions, water heaters, kitchen appliances, and smart home solutions.','Haier focuses on advanced technology, user-centric design, and energy efficiency to deliver reliable performance and convenience.','With continuous innovation, strong after-sales support, and a wide distribution network, Haier has become a trusted brand among households and businesses worldwide for durable and smart home appliance solutions.','brands/1771499430067-528574862.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 08:28:53'),
(14,'Zebronics','Zebronics is a popular Indian consumer electronics and IT accessories brand known for offering affordable and innovative technology products such as speakers, headphones, computer peripherals, and gaming accessories.','The brand is widely recognized for stylish designs, modern features, and value-for-money products.','Zebronics is an Indian electronics brand founded in 1997, offering affordable audio products, computer accessories, and gaming devices.','Known for stylish designs and reliable performance, Zebronics provides technology solutions for home, office, and entertainment use.','brands/1771644474967-877207073.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-21 03:27:54'),
(15,'Acer','Acer is a globally recognized multinational technology brand known for manufacturing computers, electronics, and digital devices for home users, businesses, education, and gaming markets.','Acer is a Taiwanese multinational technology brand founded in 1976, specializing in laptops, desktops, monitors, gaming systems, and digital devices. Known for affordable innovation and reliable performance, Acer serves consumers, businesses, gamers, and educational institutions worldwide with a wide range of computing solutions.','Acer is known for combining advanced hardware technology with user-friendly features, making its products suitable for students, professionals, gamers, and enterprises.','The company emphasizes innovation, sustainability, and digital transformation, continuously developing energy-efficient products and smart solutions. Acer products are widely used in education, business environments, home computing, gaming, creative work, and enterprise applications. With a strong global distribution and service network, Acer has established itself as a trusted and accessible technology brand worldwide.','brands/1771485226928-870590370.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 04:54:14'),
(16,'Asus','ASUS is a globally recognized multinational technology brand known for manufacturing computers, laptops, computer hardware, gaming devices, and electronic components','The company is widely respected for innovation, performance, reliability, and advanced engineering, serving consumers, gamers, creators, and businesses worldwide.','ASUS is a global technology brand founded in 1989, specializing in laptops, desktops, gaming systems, computer components, and networking devices.','ASUS is a global technology brand founded in 1989, specializing in laptops, desktops, gaming systems, computer components, and networking devices.','brands/1771492486794-779412610.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-19 09:14:46'),
(17,'Compaq','Compaq is a well-known computer brand recognized for producing reliable personal computers, laptops, and business systems. Originally an independent company, Compaq became one of the world’s largest PC manufacturers before being acquired by HP (Hewlett-Packard). Today, the Compaq name is associated with affordable and dependable computing solutions for home and office users.','Compaq is a historic computer brand founded in 1982 and later acquired by HP. Known for reliable and affordable desktops and laptops, Compaq systems are designed for everyday computing, business productivity, and educational use.','The brand gained popularity for producing user-friendly and affordable computers suitable for office work, education, and everyday computing needs.','In 2002, Compaq merged with Hewlett-Packard (HP), and the brand continues to exist under HP as a value-oriented product line in selected markets. Compaq systems are known for practical design, dependable performance, and accessibility, making them a trusted choice for users seeking reliable computing solutions.','brands/1771495115610-282765870.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:42:26'),
(18,'Huawei','Huawei is a global technology company specializing in telecommunications equipment, consumer electronics, and smart devices.','Founded in 1987 and headquartered in Shenzhen, China, Huawei has grown into one of the world’s leading providers of ICT (Information and Communications Technology) infrastructure and smart devices.','p','p','brands/1771559520841-408464319.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 03:52:00'),
(19,'ibm','IBM (International Business Machines Corporation) is a global technology and consulting company headquartered in Armonk, New York. Founded in 1911, IBM is a leader in hybrid cloud, artificial intelligence, and enterprise IT solutions.','The company provides technology infrastructure, software, and consulting services to businesses and governments worldwide. Known for its innovation and research excellence, IBM also pioneers advancements in quantum computing and AI-driven technologies.','p','p','brands/1771561074324-609672882.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:17:54'),
(20,'intel','Intel is a leading global technology company specializing in semiconductor design and manufacturing. Founded in 1968 and headquartered in Santa Clara, California, Intel is best known for its microprocessors that power millions of personal computers and servers worldwide','The company develops CPUs, GPUs, chipsets, and data center solutions, playing a major role in advancing computing performance and innovation. Intel focuses on AI, cloud computing, and next-generation chip technologies, positioning itself as a key driver of the digital world.','p','p','brands/1771561531229-419466248.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:25:31'),
(21,'Microsoft','Microsoft is a global technology company headquartered in Redmond, Washington, USA. Founded in 1975 by Bill Gates and Paul Allen, Microsoft is best known for its software products, including the Windows operating system, Microsoft Office suite, and cloud platform Azure','The company also develops hardware such as Surface devices, Xbox gaming consoles, and accessories. Microsoft focuses on cloud computing, AI, productivity software, and enterprise solutions, making it one of the world’s most influential technology brands.','p','p','brands/1771564939360-896763810.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:22:19'),
(22,'Microsoft surface','Microsoft Surface is a family of touchscreen‑based personal computers, tablets, and interactive devices designed and sold by Microsoft.','It’s Microsoft’s own line of premium Windows‑powered hardware, first introduced in 2012 as the company’s move into building its own branded computers rather than just supplying software for other PC makers.','p','p','brands/1771565324910-261393198.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:28:44'),
(23,'Msi','p','p','p','p','1760608514_58a20caca1ad.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-10 06:07:04'),
(24,'Razer','Razer Inc. is a multinational technology company and one of the most recognized brands in gaming hardware, software and services.','Razer is widely known in the esports and gaming community, sponsoring teams and events and often leading innovations in gaming tech','p','p','brands/1771567995651-873717927.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:13:15'),
(25,'Toshiba','Toshiba is a Japanese multinational conglomerate known for innovation in electronics, energy systems, and digital technology','Founded in 1875, the brand has a legacy of producing reliable consumer electronics such as laptops, storage devices, and home appliances, while also delivering industrial solutions in semiconductors, power generation, and infrastructure','Toshiba emphasizes quality, technological advancement, and sustainability, making it a trusted name in both consumer and industrial markets worldwide.','p','brands/1771571110857-581828356.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 07:05:10'),
(26,'Google','Google is a world-leading technology company specializing in internet services, software, cloud computing, artificial intelligence, and consumer electronics. ','pGoogle is a global technology company founded in 1998, providing internet services, cloud computing, software, and smart devices. ','The brand is best known for its powerful search engine and a wide ecosystem of digital products used by billions of people worldwide.','Known for innovation in search, AI, and digital productivity, Google delivers powerful solutions used by individuals and businesses worldwide.','brands/1771499108292-220882243.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-19 11:05:08'),
(27,'infinix','Infinix is a global smartphone and consumer electronics brand known for offering feature-rich devices at competitive prices.','Founded in 2013 and headquartered in Hong Kong, Infinix focuses on delivering stylish design, long-lasting batteries, and performance-oriented phones powered by Android','The brand targets young, tech-savvy users by combining modern features like large displays, fast charging, and capable cameras with affordable pricing.','Infinix has expanded its presence across Asia, Africa, and the Middle East, building a reputation for value-driven mobile technology.','brands/1771561464831-264650501.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:24:24'),
(28,'Motorola','Motorola is a well‑known American technology and consumer electronics brand that primarily makes smartphones, accessories, and mobile devices today — but it has a long history that goes back nearly a century','Motorola today is a consumer electronics brand best known for Android smartphones and mobile gadgets, carrying forward a nearly century‑old legacy in communications and mobile tech','p','p','brands/1771565742984-705182477.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:35:42'),
(29,'Nokia','Nokia is a historic Finnish technology company best known around the world for its role in mobile communications and network technology. Today it’s a major global player in telecommunications infrastructure, patents and connectivity solutions — and its name also appears on mobile phones licensed to other manufacturers.','Nokia is a long‑established Finnish tech company that today focuses on global telecom networks, connectivity technology and innovation, while the Nokia name continues on smartphones and feature phones licensed to partners.','p','p','brands/1771566635717-934473564.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:50:35'),
(30,'Oneplus','OnePlus is a Chinese technology brand best known for its Android‑powered smartphones and consumer gadgets, headquartered in Shenzhen, Guangdong, China','It was founded in December 2013 by former Oppo executive Pete Lau (and Carl Pei), with the ambition of building high‑quality devices that deliver premium performance without excessively high prices','p','p','brands/1771566838475-714722430.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:53:58'),
(31,'Oppo','Oppo (stylized as OPPO) is a Chinese consumer electronics and technology company best known worldwide for its smartphones and smart devices. It’s one of the major global smartphone manufacturers, competing with brands like Samsung, Xiaomi and Apple.','Oppo is one of the top smartphone manufacturers globally, regularly ranking among the top brands for shipments and market share in several regions','p','p','brands/1771566955799-770909331.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:55:55'),
(32,'Poco','POCO (stylized as POCO) is a Chinese smartphone and consumer tech brand that started as a sub‑brand of Xiaomi and has since operated as an independent label under the Xiaomi umbrella','Mainly Android‑based smartphones, and in some markets also headphones, smartwatches and tablets.','p','p','brands/1771567372065-349783783.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:02:52'),
(33,'Realme','Realme is a technology company best known for designing and selling smartphones and connected devices, especially in the affordable and mid‑range segments','Realme began as a sub‑brand of Oppo and quickly grew into one of the fastest‑growing smartphone brands globally, gaining major popularity in markets like India, Southeast Asia and Europe.','p','p','brands/1771568060010-599745987.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:14:20'),
(34,'Redmi','Redmi is a well‑known Chinese smartphone and electronics brand owned by the consumer electronics giant Xiaomi. It started as a product line and later became a distinct sub‑brand focused on delivering value‑for‑money mobile devices and gadgets globally.','Redmi is a major budget‑focused technology brand owned by Xiaomi that offers a broad lineup of smartphones and smart devices aimed at giving good performance at accessible prices.','p','p','brands/1771568670172-126422915.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:24:30'),
(35,'Tecno','TECNO (Tecno Mobile) is a Chinese smartphone and consumer electronics brand known for offering feature-rich devices at affordable to mid‑range prices, especially in emerging markets.','Tecno’s focus on affordability and region-specific innovation has reshaped smartphone access in developing economies.','p','p','brands/1771570858305-943185147.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 07:00:58'),
(36,'Vivo','Vivo is a global smartphone and consumer electronics brand known for producing innovative, stylish, and performance-focused mobile devices.','Vivo is a global smartphone and consumer electronics brand known for producing innovative, stylish, and performance-focused mobile devices.','Vivo is part of BBK Electronics, a major global electronics group, and has become one of the leading smartphone brands worldwide.','Vivo is a global smartphone brand founded in 2009, offering innovative mobile devices known for advanced camera features, stylish design, and reliable performance.','brands/1771643747134-357812089.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-21 03:15:47'),
(37,'Xiaomi','Xiaomi is a global consumer electronics and smart technology brand known for producing high-performance smartphones, smart devices, and lifestyle electronics at competitive prices','The company focuses on delivering advanced technology, modern design, and innovation accessible to a wide range of users.','Xiaomi is a global technology brand founded in 2010, offering smartphones, smart home devices, and consumer electronics known for innovation, performance, and value. Xiaomi delivers advanced technology solutions designed for modern digital lifestyles.','p','brands/1771644219925-520287933.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-21 03:23:39'),
(38,'Apple imac','Apple iMac is a premium all-in-one desktop computer designed and developed by Apple, combining powerful performance, elegant design, and a high-resolution display into a single compact system.','The iMac is widely used for home computing, office productivity, creative work, education, and professional content creation.','Powered by Apple’s advanced processors, including Apple Silicon chips such as the M-series, the iMac delivers fast performance for everyday computing, creative work, multimedia editing, and professional applications. It features a slim aluminum body, vibrant color options, high-quality speakers, advanced camera systems, and seamless integration with macOS and the Apple ecosystem.','Known for its reliability, energy efficiency, and premium user experience, the Apple iMac is widely used in homes, offices, educational institutions, and creative studios for productivity, design, and entertainment purposes.','brands/1771485571556-322091509.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:43:37'),
(39,'Cyberpower','CyberPower (commonly known as CyberPowerPC) is a global technology brand specializing in high-performance desktop computers, gaming PCs, and custom-built computer systems.','The company is widely recognized for delivering powerful, customizable, and performance-focused computers designed for gamers, creators, and professional users.','CyberPower is a performance computer brand specializing in custom-built gaming PCs and high-performance desktop systems.','Known for powerful hardware configurations and modern designs, CyberPower delivers reliable computing solutions for gamers, creators, and professional users.','brands/1771495387054-826290034.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-19 10:03:07'),
