(148,'Ambrane','Ambrane focuses on creating value-for-money electronic products that combine durability, safety, and modern design. The brand is especially popular in India for its wide range of charging and mobile accessories, catering to students, professionals, and general consumers.','Ambrane focuses on creating value-for-money electronic products that combine durability, safety, and modern design. The brand is especially popular in India for its wide range of charging and mobile accessories, catering to students, professionals, and general consumers.','Ambrane focuses on delivering high-quality products with modern design, safety features, and efficient performance tailored to everyday consumer needs. The company emphasizes innovation, durability, and value-for-money pricing while expanding its presence through online platforms and retail networks across India','With a growing reputation for dependable charging solutions and smart gadgets, Ambrane has become a trusted brand among Indian consumers for mobile and lifestyle electronics.','brands/1771487439362-849181286.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:17:27'),
(149,'JBL','JBL is a leading brand in the audio industry, specializing in speakers, headphones, earphones, soundbars, and professional audio systems. Founded in 1946, JBL has built a strong reputation for its signature deep bass, clear sound quality, and rugged designs.','The brand serves both consumer and professional markets, including home audio, portable Bluetooth speakers, car audio systems, cinemas, concerts, and studios.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771562089623-646401075.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:34:49'),
(150,'Bose','Bose is renowned for delivering clear, powerful, and balanced sound through advanced acoustic research and proprietary technologies. The brand focuses on combining audio performance, elegant design, and user-friendly features, making its products popular for both home and personal use.','Bose is renowned for delivering clear, powerful, and balanced sound through advanced acoustic research and proprietary technologies. The brand focuses on combining audio performance, elegant design, and user-friendly features, making its products popular for both home and personal use.','Bose offers a wide range of products including noise-cancelling headphones, wireless earbuds, Bluetooth speakers, home theater systems, and automotive audio solutions designed to deliver immersive listening experiences.','The brand focuses on advanced audio technology, elegant design, and user comfort, making its products popular among music lovers, travelers, and professionals worldwide. With a strong reputation for performance, durability, and cutting-edge research, Bose remains one of the most trusted names in premium audio technology.','brands/1771494409506-887579421.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:23:54'),
(151,'Noise','Noise is a popular Indian consumer electronics brand best known for its smart wearables and audio products. Founded in India, Noise has become one of the leading brands in the affordable tech segment, especially among youth and fitness-focused users.','Noise is a popular Indian consumer electronics brand best known for its smart wearables and audio products. Founded in India, Noise has become one of the leading brands in the affordable tech segment, especially among youth and fitness-focused users.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771566557913-633692005.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:49:17'),
