(153,'Boult','Boult Audio (commonly referred to as Boult) is an Indian brand that designs and markets affordable, stylish, and high-performance audio products. The brand is known for combining modern design with features suited for everyday use, fitness, gaming, and entertainment.','Focus on Made for India use cases\r\nStrong emphasis on bass-heavy sound profiles\r\nCompetitive pricing with premium features\r\nPopular among students, gamers, and fitness users\r\nKnown for fast charging technologies and robust build quality','Boult offers a wide range of products including true wireless earbuds (TWS), Bluetooth headphones, smartwatches, and audio accessories known for strong battery life, deep bass sound, and comfortable usability. With a strong presence in online marketplaces and retail channels across India, Boult emphasizes innovation, durability, and value-for-money pricing to meet the needs of young consumers and everyday users.','The brand has gained popularity for providing premium-style features at competitive prices, making it a trusted choice in India’s growing personal audio and wearable technology market.','brands/1771494532900-956598757.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:25:05'),
