(161,'Deki','Deki is an electronics brand focused mainly on passive components, especially electrolytic capacitors used in everyday electronic assemblies','Established in 1984 and headquartered in New Delhi, India, the company has built a strong reputation for precision manufacturing, reliability, and advanced technology, It is commonly chosen for cost-effective and reliable applications.','Deki produces metallized polyester and polypropylene film capacitors widely used in power electronics, lighting systems, consumer electronics, renewable energy equipment, automotive electronics, and industrial applications','The brand focuses on innovation, strict quality control, and international manufacturing standards to ensure consistent performance and long product life. With a strong global export presence and decades of engineering expertise, Deki is recognized as a trusted supplier of electronic components for both domestic and international markets.','brands/1771496213533-535440517.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:54:31'),
