(165,'CDIL','CDIL (Continental Device India Limited) is a well-known Indian semiconductor manufacturer, specializing in discrete semiconductor components','The brand is widely used across India for its reliable quality, wide availability, and cost-effective solutions.','The company manufactures a wide range of products including diodes, transistors, rectifiers, voltage regulators, and power modules used in consumer electronics, industrial equipment, automotive systems, telecommunications, and power management applications.','CDIL focuses on quality manufacturing, reliability, and cost-effective electronic solutions designed to meet global standards. With decades of experience and strong engineering expertise, CDIL has earned a reputation as a trusted supplier of semiconductor components for both domestic and international markets.','brands/1771494778497-647498617.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:36:56'),
(166,'HB Hornby Electronic','Hornby Electronic is an electronics brand primarily associated with passive components, especially aluminum electrolytic capacitors used in general-purpose and power-electronics applications.','The brand is typically chosen for cost-effective, dependable performance in high-volume assemblies.','HB Hornby Electronic products are commonly utilized in consumer electronics, electrical installations, and technical projects where dependable performance and practical functionality are required.','Known for affordability and consistent quality, the brand aims to support technicians, engineers, and electronics users with accessible solutions for everyday electronic and electrical needs.','brands/1771558765454-128560265.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 08:31:42'),
(167,'Kyocera AVX','Kyocera AVX is a globally respected electronic components manufacturer, formed after Kyocera’s acquisition of AVX Corporation.','The brand is especially known for high-reliability capacitors and advanced interconnect solutions, widely used in demanding industrial and automotive applications.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771563391326-145419590.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:56:31'),
(168,'DIODES','Diodes Incorporated is a global semiconductor manufacturer specializing in discrete, logic, analog, and mixed-signal devices','The brand is widely used for its reliability, broad portfolio, and strong supply availability across industrial and consumer markets.','DIODES products are widely used in consumer electronics, automotive systems, industrial automation, computing equipment, and telecommunications infrastructure.','The brand focuses on energy efficiency, reliability, and compact design solutions that support modern electronic system requirements. With advanced manufacturing facilities and a strong global distribution network, Diodes Incorporated is trusted by engineers and manufacturers worldwide for dependable semiconductor solutions.','brands/1771496315769-960978476.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:57:39'),
(169,'Royalohm','Royalohm is a reputed Taiwan-based manufacturer specializing in resistors and resistor networks.','The brand is widely preferred for consistent quality, wide value range, and cost efficiency, making it popular in mass-production electronics.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771568880279-782696883.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:28:00'),
(170,'Bourns','Bourns designs and manufactures electronic components and engineered solutions used in many applications, including automotive systems, industrial equipment, telecommunications, consumer electronics, power systems, and more.','Founded in 1947 and headquartered in Riverside, California, USA, the company is well known for designing high-quality components such as resistors, potentiometers, sensors, inductors, transformers, and protection devices including varistors and surge protectors.','Bourns products are widely used in automotive electronics, telecommunications, industrial equipment, consumer electronics, and networking systems. The brand focuses on innovation, precision engineering, and reliability to ensure stable performance and long operational life in electronic circuits','With decades of experience and strong global distribution, Bourns is trusted by engineers and manufacturers worldwide for dependable electronic component solutions.','brands/1771494591818-568837901.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:27:02'),
(171,'Dallas Semiconductor','Dallas Semiconductor was a U.S.-based semiconductor manufacturer known for its innovative analog and mixed-signal integrated circuits. The company gained prominence for developing reliable components used in timekeeping, power management, and data communications before being acquired by Maxim Integrated in 2001. Its products continue to influence embedded and industrial design under the Maxim brand.','Dallas Semiconductor was established in the mid-1980s to serve the growing need for specialized semiconductor components that bridged analog and digital functions.','Founded in 1984 and headquartered in Dallas, Texas, USA, the company became widely recognized for its innovative products such as real-time clock (RTC) ICs, memory devices, temperature sensors, battery management ICs, and the popular 1-Wire communication interface technology.','Dallas Semiconductor components were valued for their reliability, low power consumption, and ease of integration in electronic designs. In 2001, the company was acquired by Maxim Integrated, and its product technologies continue to be supported under the Maxim Integrated (now part of Analog Devices) portfolio, maintaining its legacy in precision semiconductor solutions.','brands/1771495997336-797548494.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:52:20'),
(172,'Silicon Labs','Silicon Labs is a U.S.-based semiconductor company that designs and manufactures mixed-signal integrated circuits (ICs) for the Internet of Things (IoT), industrial automation, and smart infrastructure. Its products combine analog and digital technologies to enable wireless connectivity, sensing, and energy efficiency in connected devices worldwide.','Silicon Labs was founded in 1996 by former Crystal Semiconductor engineers. The company initially focused on high-performance mixed-signal chips for communications, then expanded into wireless connectivity and IoT solutions.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771569675452-787456772.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:41:15'),
(173,'Diotec Semiconductor','Diotec Semiconductor is a specialized German semiconductor manufacturer known for high-quality discrete power semiconductors','The brand is valued for robust performance, strict quality control, and long-term reliability, especially in industrial and power-electronics applications.','Diotec focuses on precision engineering, strict quality control, and efficient manufacturing processes to ensure durability and consistent electrical performance.','Its products are widely used in power supplies, industrial electronics, automotive systems, consumer electronics, and renewable energy applications. With decades of experience and strong international distribution, Diotec Semiconductor is trusted by engineers and manufacturers worldwide for dependable and cost-effective semiconductor solutions.','brands/1771496396201-371127479.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:59:08'),
(174,'Linear Technology','Linear Technology was an American company specializing in high-performance analog integrated circuits (ICs). Founded in 1981, it became one of the most respected analog semiconductor manufacturers before being acquired by Analog Devices in 2017. The company’s precision analog products were widely used in industrial, automotive, communications, and high-end consumer electronics.','Linear Technology was established by engineers from National Semiconductor seeking to focus exclusively on analog design. Its early success came from precision voltage regulators and amplifiers targeting industrial and instrumentation markets, where accuracy and reliability were crucial.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771563933590-574985143.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:05:33'),
(175,'Murata','Murata is a world-leading Japanese electronic components manufacturer, best known for its ceramic capacitors (MLCCs) and advanced passive components','Murata parts are widely trusted for miniaturization, high reliability, and consistent electrical performance across demanding applications.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771566154652-404921011.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:42:34'),
(176,'Titan Microelectronics','Titan Microelectronics is a Chinese integrated circuit design company known for low-to-medium power driver and interface ICs, particularly the TM16xx family used in LED and LCD display modules. Its chips are widely used in consumer appliances, hobbyist boards, and other small embedded products where simple display and key-scan control is needed.','Titan MicroElectronics” or “Titan Micro”) appears in datasheets and module descriptions as the originator of several popular LED/LCD driver ICs such as TM1637, TM1638, TM1640, TM1650, TM1680 and the LCD driver TM1722.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771571019110-162790482.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 07:03:39'),
(177,'Molex','Molex is a globally renowned electronic connectors and interconnect solutions manufacturer, trusted across industries for high-quality, durable, and precision-engineered connectivity products.','Molex is a globally renowned electronic connectors and interconnect solutions manufacturer, trusted across industries for high-quality, durable, and precision-engineered connectivity products.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771565673107-993490394.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:34:33'),
(178,'Micron','Micron Technology, Inc. is an American semiconductor company specializing in memory and storage solutions, including DRAM, NAND, and NOR flash. Headquartered in Boise, Idaho, it is one of the largest memory manufacturers globally, serving industries from consumer electronics to artificial intelligence and data centers.','Micron develops a full portfolio of memory and storage products, including dynamic random-access memory (DRAM), NAND and NOR flash, and solid-state drives (SSDs). Its products power data-intensive applications such as cloud computing, smartphones, automotive electronics, and edge AI systems. In 2025, Micron introduced its ninth-generation 3D NAND and high-capacity SOCAMM2 modules for AI data centers, reinforcing its role in next-generation computing performance.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771564867905-753155025.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:21:07'),
(179,'CNR','CNR is an electronics brand best known for circuit protection components, especially MOV (Metal Oxide Varistors).CNR products are widely used for surge suppression and over-voltage protection in power and control circuits.','The brand is known for manufacturing and supplying components such as diodes, rectifiers, transistors, voltage regulators, and other circuit-related parts designed to ensure stable performance and reliability in electronic systems.','CNR products are widely used in power supplies, consumer electronics, industrial equipment, and repair applications due to their durability and cost-effective performance.','Focused on quality control and dependable functionality, CNR aims to provide practical electronic component solutions suitable for engineers, technicians, and electronic manufacturers requiring reliable components for everyday electronic circuit applications.','brands/1771494950196-203360026.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:40:23'),
(180,'Power Integrations','Power Integrations is a semiconductor company specializing in high-voltage integrated circuits for energy-efficient power conversion. Its products are widely used in consumer electronics, appliances, industrial systems, and renewable-energy applications, helping reduce standby power waste and simplify power-supply design.','Its ICs are embedded in chargers, LED lighting, appliances, industrial automation, and data-center power supplies. By integrating control and switching elements, the devices help manufacturers meet energy-efficiency standards such as ENERGY STAR and reduce component counts in designs from a few watts to several kilowatts.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771567558670-543390726.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:05:58'),
(181,'ROHM Semiconductor','ROHM Semiconductor is a leading Japanese semiconductor manufacturer, globally recognized for its high-quality power, analog, and discrete semiconductor solutions.','ROHM is especially strong in automotive-grade and industrial electronics.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771568848067-351101912.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:27:28'),
(182,'NIK Semicon','NIK Semicon is a semiconductor manufacturing company specializing in advanced electronic components and materials used in integrated circuits, optoelectronics, and power devices. The company operates within the global semiconductor supply chain, providing essential parts for consumer electronics, automotive systems, and industrial applications.','The firm supplies OEMs and electronic component distributors across Asia and beyond. Partnerships with equipment makers and research institutions support product innovation, particularly in high-efficiency power semiconductors and LED chips. Its components are integrated into end products ranging from smartphones and vehicles to industrial automation systems.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771566387443-5485911.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:46:27'),
(183,'Walsin','Walsin Technology is a leading Taiwan-based manufacturer of passive components, widely recognized for its strong portfolio of MLCC capacitors and chip resistors','Walsin products are known for stable quality, wide value coverage, and competitive pricing, making them popular in high-volume electronics.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771643881973-901176809.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-21 03:18:01'),
(184,'Infineon','Infineon Technologies AG is a leading German semiconductor manufacturer headquartered in Neubiberg, near Munich. The company specializes in power systems and Internet of Things (IoT) semiconductors that drive energy efficiency, mobility, and security solutions. It is recognized globally for enabling decarbonization and digitalization through advanced microelectronics.','Infineon is the world’s top producer of power semiconductors, offering silicon, silicon-carbide (SiC), and gallium-nitride (GaN) technologies. Its portfolio includes microcontrollers, driver ICs, sensors, and security chips.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771561379551-616900248.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:22:59'),
(185,'Texas Instruments','Texas Instruments (TI) is an American semiconductor company headquartered in Dallas, Texas, recognized as one of the world’s leading designers and manufacturers of analog and embedded processing chips. Founded in 1930, TI’s innovations—such as the integrated circuit and handheld calculator—have profoundly shaped modern electronics and computing.','TI focuses on analog semiconductors—which manage power, signals, and data conversion—and embedded processors, including microcontrollers and digital signal processors. Its chips serve sectors such as automotive, industrial automation, personal electronics, and communications infrastructure',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771570907958-716305301.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 07:01:47'),
(186,'HONGFA','Hongfa is a globally recognized Chinese manufacturer specializing in electromechanical relays','It is one of the world’s largest relay producers and is known for high reliability, wide product range, and competitive pricing, especially in power and industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771559161983-623892195.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 03:46:01'),
(187,'EPCOS','EPCOS is a renowned electronic components brand that is part of the TDK Group','It is especially well known for capacitors, circuit protection components, and EMI/EMC solutions, widely trusted in power and industrial electronics.','The brand is well known for producing capacitors, inductors, ferrites, varistors, sensors, and EMI suppression components widely used in consumer electronics, automotive systems, telecommunications, industrial equipment, and power supply applications.','EPCOS products are valued for their high reliability, precision engineering, and consistent performance under demanding conditions. With strong research and development capabilities and global manufacturing standards, EPCOS remains a trusted brand among engineers and electronics manufacturers worldwide for advanced electronic component solutions.','brands/1771497477079-36817241.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:28:48'),
(188,'Maxim Integrated','Maxim Integrated was an American semiconductor company specializing in analog and mixed-signal integrated circuits (ICs). Founded in 1983 and headquartered in San Jose, California, it became a major supplier of power management and signal-processing chips before being acquired by Analog Devices in 2021. Its technologies continue to operate within ADI’s portfolio of high-performance analog solutions.','Maxim Integrated developed analog and mixed-signal ICs that connect real-world signals—such as temperature, pressure, or sound—to digital systems. Its catalog included power-management ICs, data converters, amplifiers, sensors, interface circuits, and timing devices.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771564718685-990068731.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:18:38'),
(189,'Vishay','Vishay manufactures one of the industry’s broadest portfolios of electronic components, including diodes, rectifiers, MOSFETs, optoelectronics, resistors, capacitors, inductors, sensors, and transducers. Its devices are used in virtually every sector of electronics—from power conversion and signal processing to energy storage and sensing. Vishay holds leading global positions in low-voltage power MOSFETs, glass diodes, infrared components, and foil resistors.','The company maintains production facilities across North America, Europe, Asia, and the Middle East, supporting customers in more than 80 countries. Recent acquisitions include a major semiconductor facility in Newport, UK, expanding its silicon-carbide (SiC) technology footprint for electric-vehicle and renewable-energy markets.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771643387114-139990527.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-21 03:09:47'),
(190,'Raychem Tyco Electronics','Raychem is a globally respected brand under Tyco Electronics (now TE Connectivity), best known for its heat-shrink technology, circuit protection, and cable management solutions.','Raychem products are widely used in power, industrial, telecom, and automotive applications for their durability and safety.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771567742347-483519298.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:09:02'),
(191,'Nuvoton','Nuvoton Technology Corporation is a Taiwanese semiconductor company specializing in microcontrollers, microprocessors, and IC products for embedded applications. Known for its cost-effective and energy-efficient designs, it plays a key role in global markets for consumer, industrial, and computing electronics.','Nuvoton’s core offerings include the NuMicro series of 32-bit ARM Cortex-M microcontrollers, audio and voice ICs, and high-performance microprocessors for industrial and consumer uses. The company also produces PC I/O controllers, power management chips, and security ICs. Its microcontrollers are widely adopted in industrial control, IoT, automotive subsystems, and smart home devices.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771566669336-836452466.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:51:09'),
(192,'Semikron','Semikron is a globally respected German manufacturer specializing in power semiconductor modules','The brand is especially strong in IGBT, diode, and rectifier modules used for high-power and high-reliability applications. Semikron is now part of Semikron Danfoss, further strengthening its position in power electronics.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771569379772-319751235.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:36:19'),
(193,'Renesas','Renesas Electronics Corporation is a Japanese semiconductor manufacturer and global provider of embedded computing and power solutions. Headquartered in Tokyo, it designs and produces microcontrollers, system-on-chips, analog, and power devices that enable intelligent, connected systems across automotive, industrial, infrastructure, and Internet of Things (IoT) markets.','Renesas is the world’s leading supplier of microcontrollers and a major innovator in mixed-signal and power management ICs. Its portfolio spans high-performance computing, embedded processing, analog and connectivity, and power solutions.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771568705780-889590567.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:25:05'),
(194,'Xilinx','Xilinx is an American semiconductor company best known for inventing the field-programmable gate array (FPGA), a technology that enables hardware reconfiguration after manufacturing. Headquartered in San Jose, California, the firm pioneered the fabless semiconductor business model and became a leader in adaptive computing devices. In 2022, it was acquired by Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) to expand AMD’s adaptive and high-performance computing portfolio.','The company’s product lines included programmable logic devices, adaptive system-on-chips (SoCs), and adaptive compute acceleration platforms (ACAPs). These technologies combine configurable logic blocks, high-speed interconnects, and embedded processors to balance performance and flexibility for applications spanning cloud computing, networking, and edge devices.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771644266724-564050604.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-21 03:24:26'),
(195,'TSMC','Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company Limited (TSMC) is the world’s largest dedicated semiconductor foundry and a pioneer of the “pure-play” foundry business model. Founded in 1987 in Hsinchu, Taiwan, it manufactures integrated circuits for global clients that design but do not produce their own chips. TSMC’s advanced technologies underpin much of today’s computing and electronics ecosystem.','TSMC plays a critical role in the global electronics ecosystem by producing chips for leading technology firms in consumer electronics, automotive, AI, telecommunications, industrial control, and data centers. It is especially known for its leadership in advanced process nodes, such as 7nm, 5nm, 3nm, and ongoing development of 2nm technology, enabling smaller, faster, and more energy-efficient chips.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771571306413-867092324.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 07:08:26'),
(196,'Rockwell','Rockwell is an American industrial automation and digital transformation company officially known as Rockwell Automation. It designs, manufactures, and services control systems, software, and information technologies used in manufacturing and industrial processes worldwide. The company is recognized as one of the leading global providers of automation and smart manufacturing solutions.','Rockwell’s offerings center on industrial control and information platforms, including Programmable Logic Controllers (PLCs), drives, sensors, and FactoryTalk software suites for manufacturing intelligence. Its products enable real-time monitoring, predictive maintenance, and system optimization across industries such as automotive, energy, food, and pharmaceuticals.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771568779640-955413972.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:26:19'),
(197,'Megawin','Megawin Technology is a Taiwanese semiconductor company specializing in the design and manufacture of 8-bit and 32-bit microcontrollers. Its products serve consumer electronics, industrial control, and educational markets, emphasizing cost-effective, high-integration chips. The firm is known for its accessible development tools and domestic support ecosystem in Asia.','Megawin’s microcontroller units (MCUs) are organized primarily into 8-bit MGC series and 32-bit MG32 series. The 8-bit line targets cost-sensitive embedded systems, while the 32-bit ARM Cortex-M0 and M3 families offer higher performance and broader peripheral integration. Typical applications include motor control, LED lighting, and sensor interfacing.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771564755403-304030987.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:19:15'),
(198,'Aplus','Aplus Integrated Circuits Inc. is a Taiwanese semiconductor company known for designing and manufacturing integrated circuits, particularly for audio and memory applications. It is recognized in the electronics industry for cost-effective IC solutions used in consumer and industrial products.','Aplus’s portfolio includes single-chip voice ICs, flash memory ICs, and microcontrollers designed for low-power applications. Its audio playback chips integrate memory and signal-processing functions, simplifying product design for manufacturers. The company also supplies ROM-based and rewritable voice chips compatible with a variety of encoding formats.','Aplus products commonly include computer peripherals, networking accessories, power solutions, and electronic components that emphasize functionality, durability, and ease of use. Known for offering value-for-money technology products, Aplus aims to meet everyday computing and connectivity needs while maintaining consistent quality standards.','With growing availability through retail and distribution channels, Aplus has become a recognized choice for users seeking dependable electronic accessories and basic technology solutions.','brands/1771491214566-940601195.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:38:16'),
(199,'Geehy','Geehy is a semiconductor company specializing in the design and manufacturing of microcontrollers (MCUs), analog chips, and system-on-chip (SoC) solutions. It focuses on industrial, automotive, and consumer electronics applications, offering high-performance, energy-efficient products for embedded system developers worldwide.','Geehy’s product portfolio centers on its APM32 family of 32-bit microcontrollers, which are based on Arm Cortex-M cores. These MCUs target a broad range of embedded applications, supporting functions such as motor control, power management, and wireless connectivity. The company also produces analog signal and power management components to complement its MCU offerings.','The brand focuses on innovation, cost-effective design, and reliable performance to provide efficient processing and control solutions for modern electronic products','Geehy microcontrollers are valued by engineers and developers for their stability, flexible architecture, and compatibility with common development tools, making the company an emerging player in the global semiconductor and embedded systems market.','brands/1771498792858-989354454.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:56:17'),
(200,'Microchip','The company’s semiconductors enable systems in EV power management, industrial automation, data centers, IoT edge devices, and aerospace electronics. Automotive products include CAN FD transceivers and Hands-Off Detection solutions, while aerospace and defense offerings leverage radiation-hardened FPGAs from Microsemi (acquired 2018). Consumer and IoT applications use its touch controllers and wireless modules.','Microchip Technology Inc. is a U.S.-based semiconductor manufacturer specializing in microcontrollers, analog integrated circuits, FPGAs, and connectivity solutions. Headquartered in Chandler, Arizona, it provides embedded control products and development tools to over 130,000 customers in industrial, automotive, consumer, aerospace, defense, communications, and computing sectors worldwide.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771564787488-562194210.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:19:47'),
(201,'Avago Technologies','Avago Technologies is a well-known semiconductor brand, now part of Broadcom Inc., with a strong reputation in optoelectroniCS','RF, and high-speed interface components. Avago products are widely used for isolation, communication, and signal integrity.','Originally formed as a spin-off from Hewlett-Packard’s semiconductor division, the company became widely recognized for its high-performance products such as RF components, fiber-optic devices, motion control encoders, and wireless communication chips.','Headquartered in Singapore and the United States, Avago focused on delivering reliable and efficient semiconductor solutions for networking equipment, data centers, smartphones, and industrial automation systems. In 2016, Avago Technologies acquired Broadcom Corporation and later adopted the name Broadcom Inc., continuing its legacy as a major global provider of advanced semiconductor and infrastructure software solutions.','brands/1771492933809-694152100.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:51:58'),
(202,'Analog Devices','Analog Devices (ADI) is a world-leading U.S.-based semiconductor manufacturer specializing in high-performance analog, mixed-signal, and digital signal processing ICs.','ADI is known for precision, reliability, and innovation in mission-critical electronic systems.','Analog Devices manufactures products including data converters, amplifiers, sensors, power management ICs, and embedded processing solutions widely used in industrial automation, automotive systems, healthcare equipment, communications, and consumer electronics.','Known for innovation, accuracy, and reliability, Analog Devices focuses on enabling intelligent systems and advanced connectivity solutions, making it a trusted partner for engineers and manufacturers worldwide.','brands/1771488499708-395727601.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:34:34'),
(203,'Allegro','Allegro Microsystems is a well-known semiconductor manufacturer specializing in sensor ICs and power ICs, particularly magnetic (Hall-effect) sensing solutions','Allegro devices are widely trusted for accuracy, robustness, and automotive-grade reliability.','Allegro is well known for its motor driver ICs, current sensors, magnetic sensors, power management ICs, and automotive control solutions that enable efficient energy management and precise motion control.','The brand plays a significant role in modern technologies such as electric vehicles, robotics, automation systems, and smart electronics. With strong emphasis on innovation, reliability, and energy efficiency, Allegro products are widely trusted by engineers and manufacturers worldwide for delivering accurate performance and durable electronic solutions.','brands/1771487167527-398100929.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:10:59'),
(204,'ON Semiconductor','ON Semiconductor (onsemi) is a global leader in power and sensing semiconductor solutions, widely used for energy-efficient, high-reliability electronic systems.','The brand is especially strong in automotive, industrial, and power-management applications.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771566776320-769065474.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:52:56'),
(205,'AMD','AMD (Advanced Micro Devices) is a globally recognized U.S.-based semiconductor company known for high-performance processors and graphics solutions','AMD products are widely used across consumer computing, data centers, embedded systems, and gaming.','AMD has become one of the world’s leading innovators in computing and graphics technology. The company develops Ryzen™ processors for desktops and laptops, Radeon™ graphics cards for gaming and professional applications, and EPYC™ processors for enterprise and cloud servers','AMD focuses on delivering powerful performance, energy efficiency, and advanced architecture to support modern workloads such as gaming, artificial intelligence, and high-performance computing. With continuous innovation and strong industry partnerships, AMD plays a major role in shaping modern computing experiences for consumers, businesses, and technology professionals worldwide.','brands/1771488406818-749436360.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:29:46'),
(206,'GigaDevice','GigaDevice Semiconductor is a leading Chinese semiconductor manufacturer best known for its Flash memory products and GD32 series microcontrollers.','The brand is widely adopted for its high performance, cost efficiency, and strong compatibility with industry standards.','GigaDevice products are commonly used in consumer electronics, industrial automation, automotive electronics, smart home devices, and Internet of Things (IoT) applications due to their high performance, reliability, and energy efficiency','The brand focuses on innovation, advanced semiconductor technology, and cost-effective solutions to support modern embedded systems and intelligent devices. With expanding global operations and strong research and development capabilities, GigaDevice has become an important supplier in the international semiconductor and embedded electronics market.','brands/1771498843854-393695615.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 08:00:30'),
(207,'Cypress','Cypress Semiconductor (now part of Infineon Technologies) is a well-known semiconductor brand specializing in microcontrollers, memory, and connectivity solutions','Cypress is especially famous for its PSoC® programmable system-on-chip, which integrates analog, digital, and MCU functions on a single chip.','Cypress products were widely used in consumer electronics, automotive systems, industrial automation, and Internet of Things (IoT) devices due to their reliability and flexible design capabilities','In 2020, Cypress Semiconductor was acquired by Infineon Technologies, and its technologies continue to be developed and supported under the Infineon brand, maintaining Cypress’s legacy in advanced embedded and connectivity semiconductor solutions.','brands/1771495473796-419266191.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:47:46'),
(208,'Coilcraft','Coilcraft is a highly respected U.S.-based manufacturer specializing in magnetic components, particularly inductors and chokes.','The brand is known for excellent electrical performance, tight tolerances, and strong application support, making it a preferred choice in high-frequency and power designs.','Coilcraft products are widely used in telecommunications, automotive electronics, medical devices, aerospace systems, industrial equipment, and consumer electronics. The brand offers a broad range of components including power inductors, RF inductors, chip inductors, and custom magnetic solutions designed for efficient power management and signal integrity.','With a strong focus on reliability, performance, and technological innovation, Coilcraft is trusted by engineers and manufacturers worldwide for critical electronic design applications.','brands/1771494986856-223089557.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:41:20'),
(209,'ST','STMicroelectronics (ST) is a global European semiconductor leader known for its broad portfolio covering microcontrollers, power devices, analog ICs, and sensors','ST products are widely adopted for their reliability, scalability, and strong ecosystem support, especially in industrial and automotive markets.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771569931607-385085966.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:45:31'),
(210,'International Rectifier IOR','International Rectifier (IR) is a legendary power semiconductor brand, now integrated into Infineon Technologies','IR is especially famous for its power MOSFETs, IGBTs, and gate driver ICs, widely used in high-efficiency power designs.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771561643223-940362883.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:27:23'),
(211,'Omron','Omron is a globally respected Japanese manufacturer known for high-reliability relays, switches, sensors, and automation components','Omron products are widely used where precision, durability, and safety are critical.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771566736621-435934854.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:52:16'),
(212,'IDT','IDT (Integrated Device Technology) is a well-known semiconductor brand recognized for its expertise in timing, clocking, power management, and interface solutions.','IDT devices are widely used in high-speed, high-reliability electronic systems. The company is now part of Renesas Electronics, strengthening its embedded and industrial portfolio.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771561226374-142603023.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:20:26'),
(213,'National Semiconductor','National Semiconductor was a legendary U.S.-based analog semiconductor company, best known for its LM series analog ICs that became industry standards','In 2011, National Semiconductor was acquired by Texas Instruments (TI), and many of its products continue under the TI portfolio.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771566203701-801555785.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:43:23'),
(214,'UTC','UTC (Unisonic Technologies) is a well-known semiconductor manufacturer focused on cost-effective analog, power, and discrete IC solutions.','UTC components are widely used as drop-in alternatives to popular global ICs, making them common in mass-production and repair markets.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771571506018-141895149.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 07:11:46'),
(215,'Atmel','Atmel was a renowned microcontroller and memory semiconductor company, best known for its AVR and ARM-based microcontrollers','Atmel was acquired by Microchip Technology, and its popular products continue under the Microchip portfolio.','The company gained significant popularity among engineers, students, and developers through its ATmega microcontroller series, commonly used in development platforms such as Arduino. Atmel focused on low-power, high-performance solutions that enabled efficient control and communication in electronic systems','In 2016, Atmel was acquired by Microchip Technology Incorporated, and its product lines continue to be supported and developed under the Microchip brand, maintaining a strong legacy in the embedded electronics industry.','brands/1771492859786-39233626.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:50:01'),
(216,'Winbond','Winbond Electronics is a leading Taiwan-based semiconductor manufacturer specializing in non-volatile memory solutions.','Winbond is especially well known for its SPI NOR Flash memories, which are widely used in embedded systems for their reliability, compatibility, and long-term availability.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771644087531-429299238.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-21 03:21:27'),
(217,'Everlight','Everlight Electronics is a leading Taiwan-based optoelectronics manufacturer, widely known for its LEDs, optocouplers, infrared devices, and optical sensors.','Everlight products are valued for consistent performance, long life, and broad certification support, making them common in industrial and consumer designs.','The company’s products are widely used in consumer electronics, automotive lighting, industrial equipment, telecommunications, and display technologies due to their energy efficiency, reliability, and long operational life','Everlight focuses on innovation, advanced manufacturing technology, and sustainable lighting solutions to support modern electronic design and energy-saving applications. With a strong global presence and commitment to quality, Everlight has become a trusted brand among electronics manufacturers and engineers worldwide.','brands/1771497816210-555196873.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:35:13'),
(218,'Nexperia','Nexperia is a leading Netherlands-based semiconductor manufacturer, well known for high-volume, high-reliability discrete and logic components.','The company focuses on efficient production and long product lifecycles, making its parts popular in both industrial and consumer electronics.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771566311424-38261127.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:45:11'),
(219,'Holtek','Holtek Semiconductor is a well-established Taiwan-based manufacturer specializing in microcontrollers (MCUs) and mixed-signal ICs','Holtek is widely used in cost-sensitive and high-volume designs, especially for appliances and consumer electronics.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771559046196-518448628.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 03:44:06'),
(220,'Fairchild Semiconductor','Fairchild Semiconductor was a pioneering U.S.-based semiconductor company, famous for its power semiconductors and SMPS ICs','Fairchild was acquired by ON Semiconductor (onsemi), and many Fairchild product families continue under the onsemi portfolio.','Founded in 1957 in California, USA, the company became famous for manufacturing transistors, power management ICs, analog devices, and discrete semiconductor components widely used in consumer electronics, industrial equipment, automotive systems, and power supply applications. Fairchild Semiconductor was recognized for its contributions to semiconductor innovation and efficient power solutions.','In 2016, the company was acquired by ON Semiconductor (now onsemi), and its product technologies continue to be supported and developed under the onsemi brand, maintaining Fairchild’s legacy in the global semiconductor industry.','brands/1771497918214-267291548.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:40:26'),
(221,'Littelfuse','Littelfuse is a global U.S.-based leader in circuit protection, power control, and sensing technologies','The brand is best known for its fuses, TVS diodes, and surge protection devices, widely trusted in safety-critical and high-reliability electronics.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771564154934-406748564.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:09:14'),
(222,'Sharp','Sharp is a globally recognized Japanese electronics manufacturer with a strong presence in optoelectronics, display technology, sensors, and power devices','Sharp components are known for reliability, precision, and long-term availability, especially in industrial and consumer electronics.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771569547387-880568229.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:39:07'),
(223,'Lite On','Lite-On Technology is a major Taiwan-based optoelectronics manufacturer, widely known for opto-isolators, LEDs, and optical sensors.','Lite-On components are valued for consistent performance, wide certifications, and strong availability, making them common in power and industrial designs.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771563974145-272137009.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:06:14'),
(224,'ISSI','ISSI (Integrated Silicon Solution Inc.) is a well-known semiconductor manufacturer specializing in memory solutions with a strong focus on industrial and automotive-grade reliability','ISSI is widely respected for its long product lifecycle and stable supply, making it ideal for embedded and mission-critical systems.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771561720526-263579861.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:28:40'),
(225,'Dell','Dell is a globally recognized American technology brand known for its computers, laptops, servers, and enterprise solutions.','The company is respected for its quality, reliability, and business-ready hardware, serving consumers, professionals, businesses, and large enterprises worldwide.','Dell offers a wide range of products including laptops, desktop computers, workstations, monitors, servers, networking equipment, and data storage systems under brands such as Dell Inspiron, Latitude, XPS, Precision, and PowerEdge.','The company focuses on performance, scalability, and advanced security features to support modern computing needs across education, business, and data center environments. With strong global presence and customer-focused innovation, Dell is widely trusted as a leading provider of computing and enterprise technology solutions worldwide.','brands/1771496248421-566226491.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:56:03'),
