(228,'Make In India','Make in India is a flagship initiative launched by the Government of India to transform the country into a global manufacturing and innovation hub. The program encourages domestic and international companies to manufacture products in India, promoting economic growth, job creation, and self-reliance.','Make in India is a flagship initiative launched by the Government of India to transform the country into a global manufacturing and innovation hub. The program encourages domestic and international companies to manufacture products in India, promoting economic growth, job creation, and self-reliance.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771564236015-933315731.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:10:36'),
(230,'Assembled','Assembled refers to items that are fully fitted, connected, and ready for use. All required parts and accessories are properly installed and checked to ensure smooth operation and immediate usability.','Item is fully assembled\r\nAll parts properly fitted\r\nRequired connections completed\r\nTested for basic functionality\r\nReady for immediate use','Item supplied in fully assembled condition\r\nAll components are properly fitted and tested\r\nReady for immediate use\r\n Brand/model may vary based on availability\r\nPhysical damage or misuse not covered','System supplied in fully assembled condition\r\nAll required components properly installed\r\nBasic configuration completed\r\nSystem tested and found working at the time of delivery\r\nReady for immediate use','brands/1771492238829-553357197.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-19 09:10:38'),
(232,'Imported','Imported refers to products that are manufactured or sourced from another country and brought into the local market through authorized import channels. These items are supplied as per international quality standards and are carefully packed, transported, and delivered for end use.\r\nImported products are often chosen for their advanced technology, consistent quality, global standards, and reliable performance.','Product sourced from overseas manufacturer\r\n? Supplied through authorized importer\r\n? Meets international quality standards\r\n? Properly packed for long-distance transport\r\n? Ready for commercial or personal use','Country of origin as mentioned on product/packing\r\n? Brand and model subject to availability\r\n? Warranty applicable as per importer or manufacturer policy\r\n? Minor cosmetic variations may occur\r\n? Physical damage or misuse not covered','System/product supplied in imported condition\r\n? Checked at the time of delivery\r\n? No responsibility for customs/manufacturer packaging variations\r\n? Installation/support as per seller terms','brands/1771561280651-257760613.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:21:20'),
(233,'Anchor by Panasonic','Anchor by Panasonic is a well-established electrical solutions brand in India owned and operated by Panasonic Life Solutions India Pvt. Ltd., a wholly-owned subsidiary of Panasonic Corporation','Originally founded as Anchor Electricals Pvt. Ltd. in 1963, it became part of the Panasonic group in 2007, combining Anchor’s wide distribution and market reach with Panasonic’s global technology and quality standards.','Anchor by Panasonic is widely known for its durable, safe, and energy-efficient electrical products used in residential, commercial, and industrial applications. The product portfolio includes switches, sockets, LED lighting, fans, wires and cables, switchgear, and smart electrical solutions designed for modern homes and infrastructure','With a strong distribution network and a reputation for reliability and safety, Anchor by Panasonic has become one of the most trusted electrical brands in India, combining Japanese technology with locally tailored solutions for everyday electrical needs.','brands/1771491093995-777877536.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:35:31'),
(234,'SanDisk','SanDisk is a globally recognized brand specializing in flash memory and storage solutions.','Portable storage solutions for easy file transfer and backup.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771569296244-93716227.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:34:56'),
(235,'Lexar','Lexar is a well-known memory and flash storage brand founded in 1996, producing reliable SD cards, USB drives, SSDs, and other storage products for consumers and professionals worldwide','Their products are used in PCs, cameras, smartphones, gaming devices, drones, and more, with performance options for general use up to professional workflows.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771563764079-947139598.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:02:44'),
(236,'Kingston','Kingston Technology is a globally recognized leader in memory and storage products. Founded in 1987, Kingston builds reliable solutions for consumers and professionals — from USB flash drives and memory cards to solid-state drives (SSDs) and RAM modules.','Kingston is widely respected for reliable, durable products used by consumers, gamers, and enterprises around the world. Its focus on quality, compatibility, and customer support has made it one of the leading names in memory and storage hardware.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771563246816-740828862.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 04:54:06'),
(237,'PNY','PNY Technologies is a global tech company specializing in memory and storage solutions for consumers, professionals, and enterprise users','PNY products are known for reliable performance, broad device compatibility, and good value across categories like flash drives, memory cards, SSDs, and graphics cards.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771567281417-589544945.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:01:21'),
(238,'Transcend','Transcend Information, Inc. is a well-known global brand specializing in memory and storage solutions for consumers and professionals.','Transcend products are widely used in PCs, cameras, smartphones, gaming consoles, and industrial systems thanks to their reliability, quality manufacturing, and broad compatibility.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771571270075-122574219.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 07:07:50'),
(239,'Sennheiser','Sennheiser is a world-renowned German audio brand known for producing high-quality headphones, microphones, and audio accessories','Sennheiser products are trusted by audiophiles, professionals, musicians, gamers, and everyday listeners for their clarity, fidelity, and durability.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771569430450-908456929.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:37:10'),
(240,'Anker','Anker (Anker Innovations Co., Ltd.) is a leading global brand in charging technology and smart hardware — known especially for chargers, cables, power banks, car chargers, and more that deliver fast, safe, and reliable power for phones, tablets, laptops, and other devices','Anker pioneered technologies like PowerIQ, Power Delivery (PD), and GaN charging to deliver efficient, high-speed charging in compact designs','The brand offers a wide range of products including power banks, fast chargers, charging cables, wireless chargers, audio devices, and smart home accessories. Anker is especially known for its PowerIQ and fast-charging technologies that provide efficient and safe power delivery for smartphones, laptops, and other digital devices.','With a focus on premium build quality, reliable performance, and user-friendly design, Anker products are widely trusted by consumers worldwide, making the brand a leader in modern charging and mobile accessory solutions.','brands/1771491129829-999164340.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:36:35'),
(241,'Belkin','Belkin International, Inc. is a well-known technology accessory brand recognized for high-quality charging cables, power adapters, car chargers, wireless chargers, networking products, and device accessories.','Belkin products are widely compatible with smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other electronics, and many are officially certified (MFi for Apple) or support advanced charging standards.','The brand focuses on innovation, safety, and reliable performance, offering accessories designed to enhance connectivity and productivity for smartphones, computers, and smart devices.','Belkin products are widely trusted for their premium build quality and compatibility with leading technology brands, including Apple and Android devices. With a strong global presence and commitment to user-friendly design, Belkin has established itself as a leading name in modern connectivity and mobile accessory solutions.','brands/1771493016520-265026049.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:03:29'),
(242,'Agaross','Agaro is a brand that offers a range of consumer electronics and smart home products, particularly known in markets like India for LED lighting, home appliances accessories, power strips, and smart devices','The brand focuses on providing affordable, functional, and energy-efficient solutions for modern homes and offices.','AGARO offers a wide range of products including vacuum cleaners, air fryers, coffee makers, mixer grinders, garment steamers, grooming devices, massage equipment, and health care appliances. Known for its contemporary styling and reliable performance, the brand has gained strong popularity across India through online and retail distribution channels','AGARO emphasizes quality manufacturing, practical functionality, and customer satisfaction, making it a trusted choice for modern lifestyle appliances that enhance comfort, convenience, and daily living efficiency.','brands/1771486832058-250446263.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-04-19 04:56:15'),
(243,'Thrustmaster','Thrustmaster is a well-established gaming peripherals brand, best known for its high-performance simulation controllers — especially racing wheels, flight sticks, HOTAS (Hands-On-Throttle-And-Stick) systems, gamepads, and accessories.','The company focuses on delivering immersive, responsive, and precise controls for racing and flight simulator games on PC, PlayStation, and Xbox platforms.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771570983399-755157506.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 07:03:03'),
