(246,'AKG','AKG Acoustics is a world-renowned Austrian audio brand founded in 1947, celebrated for its high-quality headphones, microphones, and professional audio equipment.','AKG Acoustics is a world-renowned Austrian audio brand founded in 1947, celebrated for its high-quality headphones, microphones, and professional audio equipment.','The brand produces a wide range of audio solutions including studio headphones, wireless earphones, professional microphones, and audio accessories designed for musicians, sound engineers, content creators, and everyday users','Now operating as part of Harman International, a subsidiary of Samsung Electronics, AKG combines decades of audio expertise with modern technology to deliver balanced sound performance and premium build quality. AKG products are widely trusted in recording studios and live performances worldwide, making the brand a symbol of professional-grade audio excellence.','brands/1771487128309-296639641.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:00:40'),
(247,'Audio Technica','Audio-Technica (AT) is a Japanese audio brand founded in 1962, renowned for producing high-quality audio equipment — especially headphones, microphones, turntables, and pro audio gear.','Audio-Technica (AT) is a Japanese audio brand founded in 1962, renowned for producing high-quality audio equipment — especially headphones, microphones, turntables, and pro audio gear.','Audio-Technica products are widely used in music production studios, broadcasting, live performances, gaming, and personal listening applications. The brand offers a broad range of audio equipment including studio monitoring headphones, wireless earbuds, condenser microphones, vinyl record players, and audio accessories designed for both professionals and everyday users.','Known for balanced sound quality and reliable performance, Audio-Technica combines advanced acoustic technology with Japanese craftsmanship, making it a trusted choice among musicians, sound engineers, creators, and audio enthusiasts worldwide.','brands/1771492894657-122793533.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:50:55'),
