(251,'S R C','An S.R.C Woofer System generally refers to a Speaker / Sound Reinforcement / Sound Response Control (SRC) based woofer setup designed to deliver enhanced bass output with clear sound reproduction.','The exact expansion of SRC can vary by manufacturer, but in audio products it commonly represents a sound-enhancement or reinforcement technology rather than a strict technical standard.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775829535678-601330580.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-04-10 13:58:55'),
(252,'K SONIC','K SONIC appears to be an audio speaker/woofer component brand commonly used in budget speaker and car audio systems—especially in India.','These products are basic woofer drivers (bass speakers) that can be installed in speaker cabinets, car doors, home audio projects, or custom builds',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775821128635-483534014.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-04-10 11:38:48'),
