(254,'Gigabyte','The brand is best known for its motherboards and graphics cards, offering solutions that range from entry-level systems to advanced gaming and workstation builds','Gigabyte products are designed with a focus on durability, efficient cooling, stable power delivery, and long-term performance, making them a trusted choice in the PC industry.','The company offers a wide range of products including gaming laptops, GPUs, motherboards, monitors, servers, and PC accessories under its popular AORUS gaming brand. Gigabyte focuses on delivering powerful performance, efficient cooling technology, and modern features such as RGB customization and high-speed connectivity to meet the needs of gamers, creators, and professionals','With a strong global presence and commitment to quality, Gigabyte is widely trusted by PC builders and technology enthusiasts for dependable and high-performance computing solutions.','brands/1771498764337-537247851.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:57:35'),
(255,'ASRock','ASRock is especially popular for offering feature-rich motherboards at competitive prices, making it a preferred choice for gamers, PC builders, system integrators, and enthusiasts.','The company supports the latest Intel and AMD platforms, delivering strong performance, stability, and compatibility across a wide range of use cases—from everyday computing to high-end gaming and professional workloads.','The company offers a wide range of motherboards supporting Intel and AMD processors, along with gaming-focused components featuring advanced cooling, overclocking capabilities, and modern connectivity options.','ASRock emphasizes quality engineering, affordability, and cutting-edge technology to meet evolving computing demands. With strong global distribution and a reputation for stability and performance, ASRock has become a trusted brand among system builders and technology users worldwide.','brands/1771491796470-677366877.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 05:48:06'),
(256,'Seagate','Seagate Technology is a world-leading data storage solutions company, widely known for manufacturing hard disk drives (HDDs), solid-state drives (SSDs), and external storage products','Seagate products are used across personal computing, gaming, enterprise servers, cloud data centers, and NAS systems.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771569328664-975655171.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:35:28'),
(257,'Cooler Master','Cooler Master is a globally recognized computer hardware and cooling solutions brand, best known for its CPU coolers, PC cabinets, power supplies, and thermal management products.','Cooler Master has become a trusted name among PC gamers, enthusiasts, and professional system builders worldwide.','Cooler Master offers a wide range of products including CPU air and liquid coolers, PC cabinets (cases), power supplies, cooling fans, gaming keyboards, mice, headsets, and accessories.','The brand focuses on performance, durability, and modern design, often featuring advanced cooling efficiency and customizable RGB lighting. With a strong reputation for quality engineering and reliable performance, Cooler Master is widely trusted worldwide for building high-performance gaming and workstation systems.','brands/1771495193943-5970297.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:43:20'),
(258,'NVIDIA','NVIDIA is a world-leading technology company best known for designing graphics processing units (GPUs) and advanced AI computing platforms','NVIDIA’s GeForce graphics cards are highly popular among gamers and content creators, delivering powerful performance, realistic graphics, and advanced features such as ray tracing and AI-powered DLSS. These GPUs are widely used for PC gaming, video editing, 3D rendering, and streaming.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771566703440-266885700.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:51:43'),
(259,'Canon','Canon Inc. is a globally renowned Japanese imaging and optical technology company, widely recognized for its cameras, lenses, printers, and imaging solutions','Canon is especially famous for its DSLR and mirrorless cameras, which are trusted by photographers, videographers, journalists, and content creators worldwide','The company offers a broad range of products such as digital cameras, DSLR and mirrorless cameras, inkjet and laser printers, multifunction devices, lenses, and professional video equipment used by photographers, businesses, and creative professionals worldwide.','Canon focuses on advanced imaging technology, reliability, and user-friendly design to deliver superior image quality and performance. With a strong global presence and commitment to innovation and sustainability, Canon has become one of the most trusted brands in photography, printing, and visual imaging solutions.','brands/1771494730205-408172283.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 06:29:43'),
(260,'Epson','Epson is a globally respected Japanese technology brand, best known for its printers, projectors, scanners, and imaging solutions','Epson is especially popular for its EcoTank ink tank printers, which offer low running costs, high page yields, and refillable ink systems, making them ideal for homes, offices, schools, and businesses. Epson printers are widely used for documents, photos, billing, and commercial printing, delivering consistent quality and durability.','The company offers a wide range of products including inkjet printers, laser printers, large-format printers, projectors, scanners, and point-of-sale (POS) printing systems used in homes, offices, businesses, and industrial environments','Epson is known for its energy-efficient EcoTank printing technology, which provides cost-effective and high-volume printing with reduced environmental impact. With a strong focus on precision engineering, sustainability, and advanced technology, Epson has become one of the most trusted brands worldwide for reliable printing and visual display solutions.','brands/1771497529315-896444601.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:30:04'),
(261,'Dish TV','Dish TV is one of India’s leading Direct-to-Home (DTH) television service providers, offering a wide range of digital TV channels and entertainment services across the country','Dish TV provides access to hundreds of TV channels, including HD and SD channels, covering categories such as news, movies, sports, entertainment, kids, music, and regional content. The service supports multiple Indian languages, making it suitable for diverse audiences nationwide.','The company provides high-definition (HD) channels, digital set-top boxes, recording features, and value-added services designed to enhance the viewing experience.','Dish TV focuses on reliable signal quality, affordable subscription plans, and extensive channel packages catering to diverse customer preferences across India. With nationwide coverage and continuous technological upgrades, Dish TV has become a well-known brand in India’s home entertainment and satellite television industry.','brands/1771496444382-876215974.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:06:51'),
(262,'Sun Direct','Sun Direct is a leading Direct-to-Home (DTH) television service provider in India, known especially for its strong presence in South Indian states','Sun Direct is a joint venture between the Sun Group and Astra Group, offering affordable and region-focused digital TV services.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771570063291-530830932.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:47:43'),
(263,'Tata Sky','Tata Sky was one of India’s most popular and trusted Direct-to-Home (DTH) television service providers, widely known for its high-quality digital TV services and customer-centric approach.','Tata Sky offered a vast range of SD and HD channels, including sports, movies, news, entertainment, kids, infotainment, and regional content in multiple Indian languages. The service was especially appreciated for its clear picture quality, stable signal, and interactive on-screen features.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771570242947-790061326.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:50:42'),
