(266,'Everest','“Everest” is also a brand used on power-related products like voltage stabilizers and similar home electrical accessories.','These are common in Indian markets and help protect appliances (TVs, refrigerators, etc.) from voltage fluctuations.','The brand focuses on delivering durable and efficient batteries that provide stable power performance for vehicles, home inverters, UPS systems, and other electrical equipment. Everest batteries are developed using quality materials and modern manufacturing processes to ensure long service life, consistent power output, and dependable operation under various usage conditions','Known for affordability and practical performance, the brand aims to meet everyday energy storage needs for residential, commercial, and transportation applications, making it a suitable choice for users seeking cost-effective and reliable power backup solutions.','brands/1771497768914-204300982.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:33:49'),
(267,'STMicroelectronics','STMicroelectronics (ST) is a leading European multinational semiconductor company known for its wide range of microcontrollers, power devices, sensors, and analog ICs used across industrial, automotive, consumer, and IoT applications','STMicroelectronics (ST) is a global leader in microcontrollers, power electronics, and sensors, especially famous for the STM32 family, making it a top choice for students, engineers, and industrial developers worldwide.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771570016193-800080864.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 06:46:56'),
(268,'Google Drive  Google One','Google Drive is Google’s cloud storage and file-hosting service used to store, sync, share, and access files (documents, photos, videos, PDFs, etc.) online','It works on web, desktop, and mobile devices and integrates with Google’s productivity tools (Docs, Sheets, Slides).','Google Drive is the cloud storage service that enables users to upload, share, and synchronize documents, photos, videos, and other files across computers and mobile devices, while also supporting real-time collaboration through Google Docs, Sheets, and Slides.','Google One is a subscription-based service that expands Google Drive storage capacity and provides additional benefits such as automatic phone backup, enhanced security features, family sharing options, and access to Google support. Together, Google Drive and Google One help individuals and businesses manage data efficiently, improve productivity, and access information from anywhere with secure and reliable cloud technology.','brands/1771499166956-114707579.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 08:12:07'),
(269,'Microsoft OneDrive','Microsoft OneDrive is a cloud storage service from Microsoft that lets you store, sync, share, and back up files online so you can access them from any device — Windows, Mac, Android, iPhone, or web. It integrates deeply with Windows and Microsoft 365 (Word, Excel, PowerPoint).','Microsoft OneDrive is a cloud storage and file‑hosting service developed by Microsoft. OneDrive allows users to store files online, sync them across devices, and share them securely with others',NULL,NULL,'brands/1771565025193-112434984.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-20 05:23:45'),
(270,'Dropbox','Dropbox is a well-known cloud storage and file-syncing service that helps you store, access, and share files online from almost any device — computers, phones, tablets, and the web.','Dropbox is a globally popular cloud storage and file-sharing platform that allows users to store, sync, share, and collaborate on files securely over the internet. It is widely used by individuals, businesses, and teams for data backup, remote access, and collaborative work.','The platform offers features such as automatic file backup, real-time collaboration, file sharing, and secure data access through desktop and mobile applications','Known for its simple interface and reliable performance, Dropbox helps improve productivity and teamwork by enabling seamless file management and collaboration. With strong security measures and scalable storage solutions, Dropbox has become a trusted cloud service used worldwide for personal and professional data management.','brands/1771496551390-321897353.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:08:02'),
(271,'Duracell','Duracell Inc. is a major American battery manufacturer, founded in the 1920s and today owned by Berkshire Hathaway.','It’s widely recognized for producing dependable alkaline batteries, lithium coin cells, button cells, rechargeable batteries, and specialty cells that power a broad range of devices from remotes to medical equipment.','The brand offers a wide range of products including alkaline batteries, rechargeable batteries, button cells, and specialty batteries used in remote controls, toys, flashlights, cameras, medical devices, and other portable electronics.','Duracell is widely known for its reliability, extended battery life, and advanced power preservation technology designed to deliver consistent performance. With a strong global presence and commitment to quality and innovation, Duracell continues to provide dependable energy solutions for both household and professional applications worldwide.','brands/1771496668930-775326841.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:10:13'),
(272,'Energizer','Energizer Holdings, Inc. is an American battery and portable power company with a global presence. It’s widely known for making reliable alkaline, lithium, and specialty batteries used in everyday devices.','It’s widely known for making reliable alkaline, lithium, and specialty batteries used in everyday devices.','The brand offers a wide range of products including alkaline batteries, lithium batteries, rechargeable batteries, button cells, power banks, and flashlights designed for use in household electronics, cameras, toys, medical devices, and professional equipment','Energizer focuses on innovation, energy efficiency, and sustainable battery technology to deliver dependable performance and extended usage life. With a strong global presence and reputation for durability, Energizer remains a preferred choice for consumers seeking reliable portable power solutions.','brands/1771497223472-675184353.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:25:26'),
(273,'Eveready','Eveready Industries India Ltd. is a major battery manufacturer with a long history of producing household batteries and power solutions.','The Eveready brand has been widely recognized for dependable performance in everyday devices.','Eveready offers a wide range of products including dry cell batteries, rechargeable batteries, flashlights, LED lighting solutions, and electrical appliances designed for everyday use. Known for durability, affordability, and consistent performance, the brand has become a household name in India.','With a vast distribution network and a strong focus on innovation and quality, Eveready continues to deliver dependable energy and lighting solutions for millions of consumers.','brands/1771497663082-868680499.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:07:04','2026-02-26 07:31:15'),
