(286,'UNV ','UNV (Uniview), officially known as Uniview Technologies Co., Ltd., is a globally recognized manufacturer of professional video surveillance and security solutions. Founded in 2011 and headquartered in Hangzhou, China, UNV is known for developing advanced IP-based video surveillance technology used in residential, commercial, industrial, and public security applications','The brand offers a wide range of products including IP cameras, network video recorders (NVRs), video management software, access control systems, and intelligent AI-powered security solutions designed to deliver high-definition imaging and reliable monitoring performance. UNV focuses on innovation, cybersecurity, and user-friendly system integration to provide efficient and scalable security infrastructure.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1772101164581-378843075.png',0,1,'active','2026-02-26 10:19:24','2026-02-26 10:22:37'),
(287,'Uniarch','Uniarch is a global video surveillance and security technology brand created by Uniview Technologies (UNV), one of the world’s leading manufacturers of IP video surveillance equipment.','Uniarch was developed to provide easy-to-use, reliable, and cost-effective security solutions specially designed for homes, small businesses, and commercial users.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1772172313258-231191743.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 06:05:13','2026-02-27 06:05:13'),
(288,'Videocon','Videocon is a well-known Indian consumer electronics and home appliances brand that was founded in 1979 by Venugopal Dhoot. The company became one of India’s leading manufacturers of televisions, refrigerators, washing machines, air conditioners, and other household appliances. For many years, Videocon was recognized for providing affordable and reliable products across urban and rural markets in India.','During its peak period, Videocon expanded into multiple sectors including consumer electronics, oil & gas exploration, telecom services, and DTH (Direct-to-Home) broadcasting. Its DTH service operated under the brand Videocon d2h, offering digital TV services with HD channels and interactive features. Later, Videocon d2h merged with Dish TV to strengthen its position in the DTH market.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1772264387427-873868986.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 07:39:47','2026-02-28 07:39:47'),
(289,'TCCL ','TCCL (Tamil Nadu Arasu Cable TV Corporation Limited) is a Government of Tamil Nadu–owned cable television service provider established to deliver affordable and reliable digital cable TV services across the state. The organization operates under the control of the Tamil Nadu government and was created to provide transparent pricing, wide channel availability, and quality broadcasting services to households, especially in urban and rural areas.','TCCL offers digital cable television connections through authorized local cable operators and provides set-top boxes that support SD and HD channel viewing. The brand is known for its low-cost subscription plans, stable signal transmission, and extensive regional and national channel coverage.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1772432922371-121189652.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 06:28:42','2026-03-02 06:28:42'),
(290,'sansui ','Sansui is a well-known Japanese electronics brand recognized for manufacturing consumer electronic products with a focus on quality sound and reliable performance. Originally established in Japan, Sansui gained worldwide popularity for its high-fidelity audio equipment such as amplifiers, receivers, speakers, and music systems.','Over the years, the brand expanded into televisions, home entertainment systems, and other electronic appliances. Sansui products are known for offering good performance at affordable prices, making them popular in both home and commercial environments. Today, the brand continues to provide a range of audio and visual electronics designed to deliver clear sound, modern features, and user-friendly operation.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1772441129901-227409641.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 08:45:29','2026-03-02 08:45:29'),
(291,'webos','webOS is a smart operating system developed and maintained by LG Electronics for smart devices such as televisions, projectors, and home appliances. It is designed to provide a simple, fast, and user-friendly interface that allows users to access apps, streaming services, and smart features easily','The platform is widely known for powering LG Smart TVs, where it organizes apps, channels, and settings in a convenient home interface that can be controlled with a remote or voice commands.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1772853242641-947597098.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 03:14:02','2026-03-07 03:14:02'),
(292,'Tizen','Tizen is a Linux-based open-source operating system developed mainly by the Linux Foundation with major contributions from Samsung Electronics. It is designed to power a wide range of smart devices including smart TVs, smartwatches, smartphones, and Internet-of-Things (IoT) devices.','Tizen is best known for being used in Samsung Smart TVs, where it provides a smooth and easy-to-use interface for accessing apps, streaming services, and smart home features. The system is optimized for fast performance and efficient hardware usage, making it suitable for consumer electronics and connected devices.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1772853341871-576240578.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 03:15:41','2026-03-07 03:15:41'),
(293,'Android','Android is a widely used mobile and smart device operating system developed by Google. It is based on the Linux kernel and designed mainly for smartphones, tablets, smart TVs, wearable devices, and many other electronic products. Android provides a flexible and customizable platform that allows manufacturers to build smart devices with powerful features and user-friendly interfaces.','Android is known for its large ecosystem of applications available through the Google Play Store, where users can download millions of apps, games, and utilities. The operating system is used by many brands such as Samsung Electronics, Xiaomi, Oppo, and Vivo.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1772853723962-479554285.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 03:22:03','2026-03-07 03:22:03'),
(294,'Secureye','Secureye has more than 20 years of experience in the security industry and offers a wide range of surveillance and security products.','The brand provides solutions for different sectors such as retail stores, banks, hospitals, schools, offices, and government institutions, helping improve safety and monitoring.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1773035832703-626332775.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 05:57:12','2026-03-09 05:57:12'),
(295,'UNEplus','Many UNEPLUS cameras support modern features such as HD/4MP video resolution, night vision, motion detection alerts, and remote monitoring through mobile apps.','Some models also include two-way audio and pan-tilt (PTZ) movement, allowing users to control the camera from their smartphone.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1773115868371-337081917.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:11:08','2026-03-10 04:11:08'),
(296,'THINKWILL ','THINKWILL produces different types of smart surveillance devices and networking equipment for security applications.','Many THINKWILL cameras support Wi-Fi or 4G SIM connectivity, allowing users to watch live video and recordings remotely through a mobile application.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1773122000171-696928350.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 05:53:20','2026-03-10 05:53:20'),
(297,'MAXELON ','MAXELON Earbuds are true wireless stereo (TWS) Bluetooth earphones designed for listening to music, making calls, gaming, and watching videos without wires. They connect to smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other Bluetooth devices.','Maxelon earbuds are compact in-ear wireless earphones that come with a charging case for convenient storage and charging.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1773135377090-80295040.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 09:36:17','2026-03-10 09:36:17'),
(298,'Top Sound','Top Sound in a K Sonic 6-inch woofer refers to the strong, clear, and powerful audio output produced by the speaker, especially in the low-frequency bass range. The woofer is designed with a durable cone, voice coil, and magnet structure that allows it to move air efficiently and generate deep bass tones with minimal distortion.','To achieve the best top sound quality, the woofer should be installed in a properly designed speaker cabinet that supports bass resonance. Pairing it with a good amplifier and crossover circuit helps balance the bass, mid, and high frequencies. Using good quality speaker wires and maintaining correct polarity also improves overall sound clarity.','This makes it suitable for speaker boxes, home audio systems, DJ setups, and multimedia speakers where rich bass and balanced sound quality are required.',NULL,'brands/1773313033570-547905919.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 10:57:13','2026-03-12 10:57:13'),
(299,'RR','RR universal remotes work using infrared (IR) signal technology to communicate with the TV sensor.','These remotes usually have a plastic body with rubber keypad buttons and support basic TV operations such as power, volume, channel, menu, input, and navigation controls.',NULL,'UNIVERSAL COMPATIBILITY: Works with multiple LCD TV brands including Genus, Star, Futec, and Intex LCD models with model LC-1672',NULL,1,1,'active','2026-03-13 04:26:06','2026-03-13 04:26:06'),
(300,'Huayu','HUAYU is a well-known brand that manufactures universal remote controls for TVs, air conditioners, set-top boxes, and other home electronic devices.','The company focuses on designing, developing, and producing remote control products used worldwide.','Easy plug-and-play operation in many devices',NULL,'brands/1773816942036-326661967.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-18 06:55:42','2026-03-18 06:55:42'),
(301,'YY','YY remotes are mainly used as replacement remote controls for devices like air conditioners, TVs, or set-top boxes.','Many YY remote models are pre-programmed and ready to use without setup.They are designed to work with specific brands or multiple compatible models depending on the remote version.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-03-18 07:05:53','2026-03-18 07:05:53'),
(302,'GEONIX','The GEONIX is an emerging electronics brand in India that focuses on providing affordable and performance-oriented IT and computer hardware products. The company is operated by Geonix International Pvt. Ltd., based in New Delhi, and offers a wide range of products including SSD storage drives, hard disks, Wi-Fi routers, monitors, adapters, and computer accessories',NULL,'GEONIX is particularly known for its solid-state drives (SSDs), which are designed to deliver high-speed performance using SATA III (6Gb/s) and NVMe interfaces, offering read speeds up to around 550–570 MB/s for SATA models and much higher for NVMe drives',NULL,'brands/1774583747934-560708799.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-27 03:55:47','2026-03-27 03:55:47'),
