(306,'SANCA','SANCA is a budget-friendly battery brand known for manufacturing SLA / VRLA (Sealed Lead Acid) batteries. It is commonly found in local electronics markets across India, especially for small backup and low-power applications.','The brand focuses on delivering cost-effective and reliable batteries for everyday devices rather than heavy industrial use',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775022838463-384435182.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 05:53:58','2026-04-01 05:53:58'),
