(308,'R1','An R1 battery is a small cylindrical dry cell battery defined by international standards. It is commonly known as an N-size battery and is used in compact electronic devices.','R1 battery is a small 1.5V dry cell (N-size) used in compact electronic devices. It comes in zinc-carbon (R1) and alkaline (LR1) types and is mainly used where small size is required',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775024610013-493837179.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 06:23:30','2026-04-01 06:23:30'),
