(310,'RD ONE STEP AHEAD','RD One Step Ahead is a brand focused on delivering reliable and innovative electronic components and accessories for a wide range of applications, including consumer electronics, repair solutions, and industrial use. The brand emphasizes quality, performance, and affordability, making it a preferred choice among technicians, hobbyists, and service professionals',NULL,'With a commitment to staying ahead in technology, RD offers products such as batteries, adapters, electronic components, and mobile accessories that meet everyday technical needs. Known for consistent performance and durable build quality, RD One Step Ahead aims to provide practical solutions that simplify repairs and enhance device efficiency, positioning itself as a trusted name in the electronics market.',NULL,'brands/1775025722884-727097823.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 06:42:02','2026-04-01 06:42:02'),
