(315,'DuracellUltra','The Duracell Ultra (often searched as DurocellUltra) is a premium battery series from Duracell, known for delivering long-lasting, high-performance power for a wide range of electronic devices. These batteries are specially designed for high-drain devices such as cameras, toys, remotes, wireless accessories, and more.','Duracell Ultra batteries use advanced alkaline technology that provides consistent and reliable energy output, ensuring devices run smoothly for longer durations. They are built with leak-resistant construction, helping to protect your devices from damage and improve safety',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775102343085-30921434.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 03:59:03','2026-04-02 04:01:48'),
