(318,'VOY ','The Voy Metal C-Type Earphones are a pair of in-ear headphones designed for an enhanced listening experience, combining sleek aesthetics with high-quality sound. Here\'s a breakdown of their key features','C-Type Connectivity: Equipped with a USB Type-C connector, these earphones are compatible with a range of modern smartphones, tablets, and other devices that support USB-C ports. This ensures fast, stable audio transmission and eliminates the need for a 3.5mm headphone jack.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775196694152-892718241.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-03 06:11:34','2026-04-03 06:28:02'),
(319,'WALTA','The Walta Smash C-Type Earphones are another excellent choice for anyone seeking high-quality audio in a stylish and durable package. Here’s a detailed description of what they offer','USB Type-C Connectivity: The Walta Smash C-Type Earphones come with a USB Type-C connector, making them compatible with a variety of modern devices, especially those without a headphone jack. This ensures fast, stable audio transmission and improved overall sound quality.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775197804132-358695843.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-03 06:30:04','2026-04-03 06:30:04'),
(320,'Tenda','A Tenda is a lightweight, temporary shelter structure commonly used for outdoor events, gatherings, and commercial purposes. Typically made with a sturdy metal or aluminum frame and covered with durable, weather-resistant fabric such as PVC or polyester, tendas provide protection from sun, rain, and wind. They are widely used for functions like weddings, exhibitions, parties, street stalls, and camping due to their easy installation and portability.','Tendas come in various sizes and designs, including canopy tents, gazebo-style tents, and large event marquees, allowing flexibility based on space and usage requirements. Many models feature adjustable heights, sidewalls, and ventilation options to enhance comfort and usability. Because of their reusable nature and cost-effectiveness, tendas are a popular choice for both personal and commercial outdoor setups.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775202608693-377777752.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-03 07:50:08','2026-04-03 07:50:08'),
(321,'SEW','A SEW digital multimeter is a reliable electronic measuring instrument used to test and analyze electrical parameters such as voltage (AC/DC), current, resistance, continuity, and sometimes additional functions like capacitance, frequency, and diode testing. Manufactured by SEW, these multimeters are widely used by electricians, technicians, engineers, and hobbyists','Many models include safety features like overload protection and fuse protection, making them suitable for both industrial and domestic applications. They are commonly used in power distribution, appliance repair, circuit testing, and installation work .',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775219707871-535989919.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-03 10:11:00','2026-04-03 12:35:07'),
(322,'UNI-T ','A UNI-T digital multimeter is a versatile and widely used electrical testing instrument designed to measure key parameters such as AC/DC voltage, current, resistance, continuity, and diode function. Produced by UNI-T, these multimeters are known for their affordability, accuracy, and dependable performance.','Many advanced models also include additional functions such as capacitance measurement, frequency testing, temperature sensing, and non-contact voltage detection (NCV). With built-in safety protections like overload protection.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775219782141-240154491.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-03 10:16:31','2026-04-03 12:36:22'),
(323,'UNTTY','A UNTTY digital multimeter is a compact and affordable electrical measuring device used to test basic electrical parameters such as AC/DC voltage, current, resistance, continuity, and diode functionality. It is commonly used by electricians, technicians, students, and hobbyists for everyday electrical testing and troubleshooting tasks.','UNTTY multimeters typically feature a clear digital display, simple rotary switch for function selection, and lightweight design for easy handling. While considered a budget-friendly option, these multimeters provide reliable performance for general-purpose applications like checking batteries, testing circuits, and basic repair work.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775211868223-88177082.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-03 10:24:28','2026-04-03 10:24:28'),
(324,'SKYY MAXX ','A SKYY Max digital multimeter is a compact and economical electrical testing device designed for measuring essential electrical parameters such as AC/DC voltage, DC current, resistance, and continuity. Common models like the DT830 series under the SKYY range.','SKYY Max multimeters are widely used by electricians, technicians, students, and DIY users for routine tasks such as checking batteries, testing wiring, troubleshooting circuits, and basic electronic repairs. They operate on a standard 9V battery and include safety features like overload protection and fuse protection for safe operation.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775219809597-601043335.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-03 10:29:55','2026-04-03 12:36:49'),
(325,'VARR TECH ','The Varr Tech (VAR TECH) Digital Multimeter is a reliable electronic measuring instrument designed for both beginners and professionals. This brand offers a wide range of models—from basic budget meters to advanced True RMS multimeters used in electrical and industrial work','The VAR TECH Digital Multimeter is a versatile and dependable tool suitable for both basic and advanced electrical work. Whether you are a student, DIY user, or professional electrician, VAR TECH offers models that provide accuracy, safety, and durability for everyday testing needs',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775219745705-336597772.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-03 11:38:42','2026-04-03 12:35:45'),
(326,'DPlus','DPlus is a growing electronics and mobile accessories brand known for offering stylish, affordable, and reliable products for everyday use. The brand focuses on delivering modern designs combined with practical functionality, making it popular among budget-conscious users.','Affordable pricing\r\nTrendy and lightweight designs\r\nDecent sound and performance\r\nReliable for daily use\r\nWide range of accessories',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-04-04 09:12:26','2026-04-04 09:12:26'),
(327,'COFE','A COFE wireless 4G/5G SIM router is a SIM-based internet device that allows you to access high-speed internet by inserting a 4G or 5G SIM card, eliminating the need for wired broadband connections. It converts mobile network data into a Wi-Fi hotspot for multiple devices.','COFE routers are designed to provide reliable wireless internet using mobile networks. They are especially useful in areas where fiber or wired broadband is unavailable. With features like multi-device connectivity, long range, and plug-and-play setup, these routers offer a convenient and flexible internet solution',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775297133324-223166496.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 10:05:33','2026-04-04 10:05:33'),
(328,'ELECTRO LINE','Electro Line (also known as Electroline) is a well-known electronics and mobile accessories brand in India, recognized for offering affordable, durable, and practical electronic products for everyday use.\r\nThe brand started its journey around 2006 and has grown steadily by focusing on budget-friendly gadgets and accessories for mass users.',NULL,'Electro Line specializes in manufacturing and supplying a wide range of consumer electronics and mobile accessories, designed to meet daily connectivity and charging needs. It is especially popular in local markets and retail shops for its low-cost and reliable products.',NULL,'brands/1775299457829-515972066.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 10:44:17','2026-04-04 10:44:17'),
(329,'Syrotech','Syrotech is a well-known Indian networking brand that specializes in fiber (FTTH), wireless, and broadband networking equipment. It is widely used by internet service providers (ISPs), cable operators, and home users for delivering stable and high-speed internet connections.','Syrotech routers are mainly designed for fiber broadband connections (FTTH). These devices convert optical signals from internet providers into usable WiFi and LAN internet for homes and businesses',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775300602411-636800173.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 11:03:22','2026-04-04 11:03:22'),
(330,'LIVE TECH ','The Live Tech nano USB wireless adapter is a compact and affordable networking solution designed to provide wireless internet access to computers. It offers stable connectivity and decent speed (150 Mbps), making it ideal for everyday tasks like browsing, streaming, and office work.','The Live Tech Nano USB Wireless Adapter is a small Wi-Fi dongle that allows a desktop or laptop to connect to a wireless network (Wi-Fi). It is especially useful for devices that don’t have built-in Wi-Fi or need improved connectivity.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775304143377-657375804.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 12:02:23','2026-04-04 12:02:23'),
(331,'HAMMOK','The Hammok USB 2.0 to LAN adapter is a simple and affordable networking solution that provides stable wired internet connectivity. It is ideal for users who need reliable internet performance compared to Wi-Fi, especially in offices, homes, and technical setups.','The Hammok USB 2.0 to LAN Ethernet adapter is a wired network converter that allows you to connect your laptop or desktop to a wired Ethernet network using a USB port.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775306132079-518587449.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 12:35:32','2026-04-04 12:35:32'),
(332,'Trueview','Trueview is a leading Indian brand in the field of electronic security and surveillance solutions, owned by Warner Electronics (I) Pvt. Ltd.. Established around 2011, the brand has gained strong recognition for offering reliable and cost-effective CCTV products across India. Trueview specializes in a wide range of security equipment including dome cameras, bullet cameras, PTZ cameras, IP cameras, DVR/NVR systems, and advanced solutions like WiFi, 4G SIM-based, and solar-powered surveillance systems. Known for combining modern technology with affordability,','Trueview products feature high-definition video quality, night vision, motion detection, and mobile app connectivity for remote monitoring. The brand focuses on delivering solutions suitable for Indian conditions such as power fluctuations and rural environments, making it popular among homes, shops, offices, and commercial users. With a growing dealer network, quality certifications, and emphasis on innovation, Trueview has become a trusted choice for users looking for dependable and budget-friendly security systems.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775456226096-297790395.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 06:17:06','2026-04-06 06:17:06'),
(333,'Artis','The Artis 65W Universal Laptop Adapter is a multi‑brand laptop power adapter designed to replace or serve as a spare charger for many different notebook computers. Instead of buying a separate branded charger for each laptop, this universal adapter gives you one solution that fits a wide range of devices.','65 W Output Power:\r\nProvides up to 65 watts of DC power — suitable for many mainstream laptops that normally use ~19 V adapters.\r\nWide Voltage Output Range:\r\nMultiple selectable output voltages (e.g., 14.5 V, 15 V, 16 V, 18.5 V, 19 V, 19.5 V, 20 V) let it work with different laptop models.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775466362726-74045322.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 09:06:02','2026-04-06 09:06:02'),
(334,'UBEST ','The Ubest Wireless Music Receiver is a compact and convenient device designed to turn your wired audio systems into wireless ones. It allows you to stream music from your smartphone, tablet, or laptop directly to speakers, home theaters, or car audio systems using Bluetooth technology.','This receiver connects easily via a 3.5mm AUX input and pairs quickly with Bluetooth-enabled devices, enabling seamless audio playback without the hassle of cables. ',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775482528491-892879783.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 13:35:28','2026-04-06 13:35:28'),
(335,'RAVTRON ','The Ravtron Mini Stand is a compact and foldable stand designed to support laptops, tablets, and mobile phones for comfortable viewing and better ergonomics. It is ideal for both home and office use, helping improve posture by elevating your device to a convenient angle.','The stand features an anti-slip base and rubber pads, ensuring stability and preventing scratches on devices. It also helps improve airflow around laptops, reducing overheating during long usage.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775487899238-734297122.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 15:04:59','2026-04-06 15:04:59'),
(336,'IDEAKARD ','The Ideakard XD300M Wireless USB Adapter is a compact and efficient networking device designed to provide stable Wi-Fi connectivity to desktops and laptops. It supports wireless speeds of up to 300 Mbps, making it ideal for everyday internet activities such as browsing, video streaming, and online communication.','This adapter uses IEEE 802.11 b/g/n standards, ensuring compatibility with most routers and networks. Its plug-and-play design allows easy installation, while the lightweight and portable build makes it convenient to carry and use anywhere.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775488600307-111957780.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 15:16:40','2026-04-06 15:16:40'),
(337,'Foxin','Foxin is an Indian electronics brand that offers a wide range of computer accessories, mobile accessories, and consumer electronics products. It is known for providing budget-friendly and reliable products suitable for everyday use in homes, offices, and small businesses. The brand has gained popularity in India for its affordable pricing and wide product availability across both online and offline markets.','Foxin manufactures and sells various categories such as power supplies (SMPS), UPS systems, monitors, power banks, chargers, USB hubs, keyboards, mouse, speakers, and networking accessories. Many of its products are designed for basic to mid-level usage, making them ideal for retail shops, office setups, and system builders. According to its official store, Foxin also offers items like SSDs, gaming accessories, and toner cartridges, serving both personal and professional needs.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775544860819-883709420.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 06:54:20','2026-04-07 06:54:20'),
(338,'Zebster','Zebster is a budget monitor series from the Indian electronics brand Zebronics. These monitors are mainly designed for basic computer use, such as office work, billing systems, CCTV display, and home desktops. Zebster monitors are popular because they offer low-cost display solutions with essential features and simple design.','Zebster monitors typically come in sizes like 18.5-inch, 19-inch, 20-inch, and 22-inch, with resolutions ranging from HD (1366×768) to Full HD (1920×1080). Most models include HDMI and VGA input ports, making them compatible with both modern and older computers. They also feature LED backlit panels, wall-mount support, and built-in power supply, which makes them compact and easy to install.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775545116143-105840796.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 06:58:36','2026-04-07 06:58:36'),
(339,'MITSUHI ','It mainly produces 4440 IC-based amplifiers, widely used for home speakers, car audio, and DIY sound systems.','Mitsuhi is a budget audio amplifier brand commonly found in local markets.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-04-09 04:28:56','2026-04-09 04:28:56'),
(340,'Mantra','A Mantra Fingerprint Sensor is a biometric device used to capture and verify fingerprints for secure identity authentication. It is widely used in India for Aadhaar-based verification, attendance systems, banking, and e-governance services.','High-accuracy fingerprint scanning\r\nUSB plug-and-play connectivity\r\nSTQC certified (for Aadhaar authentication)\r\nFast identification & verification\r\nCompact and durable design',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775797974246-158176578.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 05:12:54','2026-04-10 05:12:54'),
(341,'MAGENTZ','MAGNETZ Speaker is a multimedia audio speaker system designed to deliver clear sound, powerful bass, and a rich listening experience for music, movies, and gaming. It is commonly used with TVs, computers, mobile phones, and home entertainment setups.','MAGNETZ speakers, especially woofers, are known for their strong magnet structure, which helps produce better sound vibration and enhanced bass performance. These speakers are built with durable materials to ensure long-lasting use and consistent audio output.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775820422468-894989374.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 11:27:02','2026-04-10 11:27:02'),
