(343,'KAVOXTTRON ','KAVOXTRON speaker is a modern multimedia audio system designed to deliver powerful sound output, deep bass, and stylish design. It is suitable for home entertainment, computer setups, and small audio systems.','KAVOXTRON speakers are known for their attractive LED design, strong bass performance, and multiple connectivity options, making them a good choice for everyday use and music lovers.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775821679825-49916893.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 11:47:59','2026-04-10 11:47:59'),
(344,'ARGO','ARGO speaker (commonly seen as 2.1 multimedia speaker sets) is a compact audio system designed for PC, laptop, and home entertainment use. These speakers usually include two satellite speakers and one subwoofer, providing balanced sound with enhanced bass','According to product details, ARGO speaker systems are compact 2.1 sets with wooden subwoofers, designed especially for computers and small rooms',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775822095760-276961888.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 11:54:55','2026-04-10 11:54:55'),
(345,'MZ ','MZ speakers are budget-friendly audio devices widely used for portable music, home entertainment, and small sound setups. The brand offers a variety of products like Bluetooth speakers, mini speakers, soundbars, trolley speakers, and karaoke speakers.','They are popular for their low price, decent sound quality, and easy connectivity, making them a good choice for everyday use.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775822396125-400827252.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 11:59:56','2026-04-10 11:59:56'),
(346,'MILENIUM ','MILENIUM speaker (also written as Millenium / Milinium) is a budget audio brand mainly used for car audio systems, speaker boxes, and tweeters. It is popular in local markets for its high power handling and strong sound output at an affordable price','These speakers are commonly available in 2-way, 3-way, and woofer-based systems, along with tweeters and speaker cabinets',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775822651620-578113349.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 12:04:11','2026-04-10 12:04:11'),
(347,'SPEEDON','SPEEDON speakers are budget audio speakers mainly known for woofer and subwoofer drivers used in car audio systems, home amplifiers, and DIY speaker boxes. They are popular in local markets for strong bass and low price.',', SPEEDON speakers are a good choice if you want low-cost woofers with decent bass for simple audio setups, especially for car or DIY speaker box use.',NULL,NULL,'brands/1775822900150-232170168.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 12:08:20','2026-04-10 12:08:20'),
