INSERT INTO `category` VALUES
(3,1,19,16,'primary',NULL,'Mobile','A mobile phone is a portable smart device used for communication, entertainment, and daily productivity. Modern mobiles come with high-resolution touchscreens, fast processors, powerful cameras, and long-lasting batteries','With features like 4G/5G connectivity, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and GPS, mobile phones provide seamless performance and connectivity. Their lightweight design, advanced features, and wide app support make them essential for everyday use.','Mobile phones are portable electronic communication devices used for calling, messaging, internet browsing, multimedia, and various smart applications. Modern smartphones combine communication technology with advanced computing features such as touchscreen display, camera systems, GPS, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and mobile data connectivity.','Mobiles operate using mobile operating systems such as Android or iOS and support installation of various applications for social media, banking, entertainment, online meetings, and productivity tasks. They are powered by rechargeable lithium-ion batteries and support fast charging technology depending on the model.','categories/1771596698245-323274574.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:11:38'),
(8,1,19,15,'primary',NULL,'Modules','The project consists of several key components that work together to deliver a complete and efficient solution','These components collectively form the backbone of the project, enabling smooth execution, easy customization, and future scalability.','Electronic modules are ready-made circuit boards designed to perform specific functions in electronic projects and embedded systems. These modules simplify circuit design by integrating essential components such as ICs, resistors, capacitors, and connectors into a compact, easy-to-use board. They are widely used in Arduino projects, robotics, IoT systems, automation, and industrial applications.','Electronic modules are known for plug-and-play compatibility, compact design, and reduced development time. Proper voltage supply, correct pin configuration, and secure wiring connections are important to ensure safe operation. Using modules helps beginners and professionals quickly build reliable and functional electronic systems without designing complex circuits from scratch.','categories/1771597152344-677625678.jpeg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-05 14:27:38'),
(9,1,19,14,'primary',NULL,'Audio Accessories','Audio refers to sound that is recorded, transmitted, or reproduced through electronic systems','Audio technology is used in a wide range of applications including home entertainment systems, mobile phones, computers, hearing devices, studio equipment, public-address systems, and automotive sound systems.','c','d','categories/1771664361691-715624214.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-27 09:29:08'),
(10,1,19,20,'primary',NULL,'Power Supply','A Power Supply is an essential electronic component that provides stable and regulated electrical energy to devices and systems.','It converts the input power—often from an AC source—into the required DC voltage levels needed by various circuits','c','d','categories/1771598066906-15599994.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:34:26'),
(11,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Keypads Sensor','A Keypad Sensor (also known as a matrix keypad) is an input device widely used in embedded systems, security systems, automation, and DIY electronics','It allows the user to enter numbers, characters, or commands by pressing physical buttons.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771681187538-49489580.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 13:39:47'),
(12,1,19,17,'secondary',215,'HDMI Cables','HDMI (High-Definition Multimedia Interface) Cables are high-speed digital cables used to transmit audio and video signals between devices.','HDMI cables support modern technologies such as 4K/8K resolution, 3D video, ARC/eARC audio, HDR, and Ethernet over HDMI, depending on the cable version.','HDMI (High-Definition Multimedia Interface) cables are used to transmit high-quality digital audio and video signals between devices such as TVs, monitors, projectors, gaming consoles, laptops, DVD players, and set-top boxes. HDMI cables carry both audio and video signals through a single cable, reducing the need for multiple connections.','HDMI cables are available in different types such as Standard HDMI, High-Speed HDMI, Premium High-Speed HDMI, and Ultra High-Speed HDMI, each supporting different bandwidth capacities. Modern HDMI cables also support features like 3D video, Ethernet channel, ARC (Audio Return Channel), eARC, HDR (High Dynamic Range), and CEC (Consumer Electronics Control).','categories/1771679519082-909133748.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 13:11:59'),
(13,1,19,15,'secondary',86,'BMS Boards','A BMS (Battery Management System) Board is an electronic protection and monitoring circuit used in rechargeable battery packs—especially Li-ion and Li-Po batteries.','These boards are commonly used in electric vehicles, power banks, solar energy systems, e-bikes, UPS units, DIY battery packs, and portable electronic devices.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771667633344-575982467.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 09:53:53'),
(14,1,19,15,'secondary',316,'ARDUINO_AVR','Arduino and AVR are closely related technologies widely used in electronics, embedded systems, and DIY automation projects','AVR = the actual microcontroller family\r\nArduino = easy-to-use development board built on AVR','c','d','categories/1771664272172-67323787.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 08:57:52'),
(15,1,19,15,'primary',NULL,'Programmers Boards','Programmers are professionals who write, test, and maintain the code that makes software applications and systems function. They use various programming languages to solve problems, automate tasks, and create digital solutions such as websites, mobile app','Their work often involves debugging errors, optimizing performance, and collaborating with designers, developers, and engineers to build reliable and innovative technology products.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772013879576-250829498.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:04:39'),
(16,1,19,15,'secondary',323,'Raspberry Pi Boards','Raspberry Pi is a compact, low-cost, single-board computer designed for learning, experimenting, and building electronic projects','Their versatility, affordability, and strong community support have made Raspberry Pi one of the most popular choices for DIY electronics and educational computing.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772014164699-171740128.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:09:24'),
(18,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Current Voltage Sensor Module','A current and voltage sensor module is an electronic device used to accurately measure the electrical current and voltage in a circuit.','These modules help monitor load consumption, detect faults, and protect circuits from overload. Common types include ACS712, INA219, and voltage divider modules, widely used in Arduino, IoT, robotics, and power monitoring systems.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771672048260-536918300.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-26 13:23:41'),
(19,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'MQ Sensor Modules','MQ Sensor Modules are a family of low-cost gas detection sensors widely used in electronics, embedded systems, and environmental monitoring projects. Each MQ module consists of a sensing element made from metal oxide semiconductor (typically tin dioxide) housed inside a protective casing with ventilation holes, along with onboard circuitry that converts the sensor resistance change into an electrical output.','Different MQ sensors are optimized for detecting specific gases or groups of gases. For example, the MQ-2 is sensitive to smoke, LPG, methane, and propane; the MQ-3 is suited for alcohol detection; the MQ-7 targets carbon monoxide; and the MQ-135 detects air quality changes such as ammonia, CO₂, benzene, and other harmful gases.','These modules typically operate at low voltages (5 V) and include a built-in potentiometer to adjust sensitivity. Due to their simplicity and real-time response, MQ sensors are widely used in gas leak detection systems, air quality monitors, safety alarms, industrial controls, and DIY IoT projects.','When certain gases are present, they react with the sensing material and change its conductivity; this change is translated into an analog voltage that microcontrollers (like Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP32) can read and interpret.','categories/1772119895615-864766800.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-26 15:31:35'),
(20,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Force Flex Pressure Sensors','Force Flex Pressure Sensors are thin, flexible, and highly sensitive components designed to measure force, pressure, and weight accurately.','These sensors change resistance based on the amount of pressure applied, making them perfect for environments requiring precision, lightweight design, and durability.','Force-Flex Pressure Sensors are advanced sensing devices designed to measure force, pressure, or load by detecting applied mechanical stress and converting it into an electrical signal.','Force-Flex sensors can be based on technologies such as piezoresistive elements, conductive elastomers, or flexible strain gauges; their unique design enables measurement over a wide range of forces while maintaining a low profile and mechanical flexibility.','categories/1771676495848-7461587.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 12:21:35'),
(21,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Sound Speed sensor modules','Sound Speed Sensor Modules are specialized electronic devices designed to measure the speed of sound in different environments with high accuracy.','Their compact design, fast response time, and reliable performance make them ideal for integration into embedded systems, robotics, and smart measurement devices.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772016945855-392780854.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:55:45'),
(22,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Accelerometer IMU','An accelerometer is a sensor module that measures linear acceleration along one or more axes (X, Y, Z). It detects motion, tilt, vibration, and orientation by sensing changes in velocity.','Accelerometer = measures tilt & linear movement\r\nIMU = all motion + orientation sensing combined',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771663012314-891457783.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-04 13:03:11'),
(23,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Biometric ECG EMG Pulse','Biometric sensors such as ECG, EMG, and Pulse sensors are used to measure physiological signals from the human body for health monitoring, medical research, and wearable electronics.','these biometric sensors allow real-time tracking of vital signs such as heart activity, muscle movement, and pulse rate, providing valuable insight for health monitoring, biofeedback systems, wearable technology, and human–machine interaction.','c','d','categories/1771665781647-560142676.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-26 13:56:26'),
(24,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Magnetic Sensor Module','A Magnetic Sensor Module is used to detect the presence, strength, or movement of magnetic fields.','They are highly reliable, non-contact sensors widely used in automation, security systems, robotics, and position sensing.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771682727267-970914214.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:05:27'),
(25,1,19,15,'secondary',86,'PIC Boards','PIC boards are microcontroller-based modules built using PIC microcontrollers developed by Microchip Technology. These boards are widely used in embedded systems, electronics projects, automation, and education.','Built around PIC microcontroller ICs (PIC16, PIC18, PIC24, dsPIC), Include clock crystal, voltage regulator, reset circuit, Provide GPIO pins, ADC, PWM, UART, SPI, I2C, Often support ICSP programming (In-Circuit Serial Programming)',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771684843813-2214610.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:40:43'),
(26,1,19,15,'secondary',86,'8051_Arm','The 8051 and ARM are two popular microcontroller architectures widely used in embedded electronics. The 8051 microcontroller is an 8-bit architecture known for its simplicity, reliability, and ease of use.','ARM MCUs are used in modern systems like IoT devices, smartphones, automotive electronics, robotics, industrial automation, and consumer gadgets.','c','d','categories/1771599847852-95399656.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 15:04:07'),
(27,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'STM32 Nucleo STM8','STM32 Nucleo / STM8 development boards are versatile and user-friendly platforms designed for rapid prototyping and embedded system development.','Built around STM32 or STM8 microcontrollers, they offer reliable performance, low power consumption, and rich.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772017178737-179710788.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-26 13:59:01'),
(28,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Bluetooth Module','Bluetooth Module is a compact wireless communication device used to enable short-range data exchange between electronic systems.','They are widely used in IoT devices, robotics, home automation, wearable electronics, wireless control systems, and data logging applications',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771665894862-257004815.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-26 13:33:31'),
(29,1,2,1,'secondary',30,'RF Transmitter and Receiver','RF Transmitter and Receiver modules are compact wireless communication devices designed to transmit and receive data over radio frequencies.','RF Transmitter and Receiver modules are a cost-effective solution for building secure and efficient wireless communication systems.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772014615432-347031207.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(30,1,19,15,'primary',NULL,'RFID PRODUCTS','RFID (Radio Frequency Identification) products are advanced identification and tracking solutions used across various industries to improve efficiency, security, and automation. These products typically include RFID tags, readers, antennas, cards, labels,','By using radio waves, RFID systems enable fast, contactless data capture without the need for direct line-of-sight scanning.','c','d','categories/1771598705256-690338339.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:45:05'),
(31,1,19,15,'secondary',86,'Interface boards','Interface Boards are electronic modules designed to enable communication between different devices, sensors, microcontrollers, and external hardware.','These boards are widely used in IoT projects, embedded systems, robotics, industrial automation, and educational electronics.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771680585199-745963204.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 13:29:45'),
(32,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'GSM GPS','A GSM + GPS Module is a compact communication and tracking device that combines GSM (Global System for Mobile Communication) and GPS (Global Positioning System) technologies into one module','These modules are widely used in IoT systems, vehicle tracking, security devices, remote monitoring, asset tracking, and automation projects.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771679188194-632468993.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-26 13:44:47'),
(35,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Xbee module','The XBee Module is a powerful wireless communication device based on ZigBee and IEEE 802.15.4 standards.','It is designed for long-range, low-power, and reliable wireless data transfer between microcontrollers, sensors, and embedded systems.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772020018691-701476135.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-26 14:20:37'),
(36,1,19,15,'primary',NULL,'Robotics All Items','Robotics projects combine mechanical parts, electronic components, sensors, control systems, and power units to build intelligent machines capable of movement, sensing, and decision-making. Below is a complete overview of commonly used robotics items with descriptions and information.','Robotics items include microcontrollers, motors, drivers, sensors, chassis, power systems, communication modules, and display interfaces. Together, these components form intelligent robotic systems capable of automation, sensing, decision-making, and wireless control. Robotics technology is widely used in education, industrial automation, agriculture, medical applications, surveillance systems, and AI-based smart devices.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772015177273-121184961.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:26:17'),
(37,1,19,15,'secondary',196,'Motor Control','Motor Control refers to the technology and methods used to regulate the operation of electric motors in various applications.','It involves starting, stopping, speeding up, slowing down, and protecting the motor to ensure smooth and efficient performance.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771683167318-817425028.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:12:47'),
(39,1,19,15,'primary',NULL,'DWIN Accessories and COF','DWIN Accessories & COF (Chip-on-Film) components are essential add-ons designed to support, enhance, and expand the functionality of DWIN HMI touch displays.','COF modules, specially designed for compact display integration, provide a highly reliable and flexible interconnection solution.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771675358569-514285443.jpeg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 12:02:38'),
(40,1,19,15,'secondary',436,'DWIN Touch Display','A DWIN Touch Display is a smart Human Machine Interface (HMI) module designed for industrial and embedded applications. It is developed by DWIN Technology, a company known for manufacturing intelligent TFT LCD display modules with built-in controllers.','These displays combine a colorful TFT screen, touch panel (resistive or capacitive), internal memory, and a microcontroller into a single module, making them easy to integrate into projects without heavy programming.','DWIN Touch Displays support communication through UART (Serial), RS232, RS485, and sometimes USB interfaces, allowing them to connect easily with microcontrollers like Arduino, PIC, STM32, PLCs, and other embedded systems.','They are widely used in industrial control panels, medical equipment, home automation systems, vending machines, power supply units, security systems, and IoT devices. These modules are available in different screen sizes such as 3.5-inch, 5-inch, 7-inch, and 10.1-inch with various resolutions. The main advantages of DWIN Touch Displays include fast GUI development, stable industrial performance, low power consumption, high brightness, and cost-effective design.','categories/1771675194331-406516651.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 11:59:54'),
(41,1,2,1,'secondary',436,'DWIN 5\" Touch Display','The DWIN 5\" Touch Display is a compact, high-resolution HMI module designed for smart control systems, embedded devices, and industrial applications.','Built on DWIN’s powerful DGUS / DGUS II platform, it enables rapid GUI design without advanced coding—ideal for developers and product designers.','c','d','assets/uploads/category/DWIN_5/DWIN_5_image.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(42,1,19,15,'primary',NULL,'High Brightness DWIN Display','A High Brightness DWIN Display is a specialized version of DWIN’s touchscreen Human Machine Interface (HMI) modules designed to provide enhanced visibility under challenging lighting conditions. These displays feature higher luminance (brightness) levels compared to standard models, allowing the screen content to remain clear and easily readable even in environments with strong ambient light, such as outdoor settings, factory floors with bright overhead lighting, or near windows with direct sunlight. Like other DWIN displays, high brightness models integrate a TFT (Thin-Film Transistor) LCD panel with an intuitive touch interface (typically resistive or capacitive), an onboard controller, and built-in memory, all optimized for fast and reliable graphic performance.','These high brightness modules support common communication interfaces such as UART (serial), RS232, RS485, and sometimes USB, making them easy to interface with microcontrollers (Arduino, STM32, PIC), PLCs, and various embedded systems.','They are particularly suited for industrial automation panels, outdoor kiosks, control systems in transportation and energy sectors, and other applications where screen clarity under bright light is critical. With DWIN’s DGUS (DWIN Graphic Utility Software) platform, designers can create intuitive graphical user interfaces featuring buttons, data displays, animations, and custom graphics without complex coding.','High Brightness DWIN Displays combine robust industrial performance, vivid visuals in high-light environments, and user-friendly GUI development, making them ideal for applications that demand visibility and durability.','categories/1771675660098-222370859.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-04-10 05:26:40'),
(43,1,2,1,'secondary',321,'DWIN 7\" TouchDisplays','The DWIN 7\" Touch Display is a high-resolution HMI module designed for smart industrial control, automation systems, medical devices, smart home panels, and advanced embedded projects.','Featuring a bright 7-inch TFT/IPS display, it delivers vivid colors, wide viewing angles, and sharp visual clarity. Available in both capacitive and resistive touch options, it provides smooth and reliable touch interaction for any environment.','c','d','assets/uploads/category/DWIN_7\"_TouchDisplays/DWIN_7\"_TouchDisplays_image.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(44,1,19,15,'secondary',436,'DWIN TouchDisplays','The DWIN 10.1\" Touch Display is a high-performance, industrial-grade HMI solution designed for advanced control systems, automation panels, smart devices, and embedded applications.','It features a bright 10.1-inch IPS display with wide viewing angles, high contrast, and excellent color reproduction, making it ideal for visually rich user interfaces.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771674682616-166313388.jpeg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 12:01:01'),
(45,1,2,1,'primary',NULL,'DWIN 10.4inch- 12.1inch- 15.6inch- 18.5inch 21.5inch TouchDisplays','The DWIN Industrial Touch Display Series (10.4\", 12.1\", 15.6\", 18.5\", and 21.5\") is a powerful lineup of high-performance HMI screens designed for advanced automation, industrial control, medical equipment, smart terminals, and commercial interfaces','Each display integrates DWIN’s DGUS/DGUS II platform, allowing fast GUI development without complex coding.','c','d','assets/uploads/category/DWIN_10.4/DWIN_10.4_image.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
