(110,1,19,20,'primary',NULL,'UPS','A UPS (Uninterruptible Power Supply) is an essential power protection device that provides backup electricity to connected equipment during power cuts, voltage drops, or fluctuations','It instantly switches to battery mode when main power fails, supplying stable AC power to computers, routers, CCTV systems, medical equipment, and other sensitive electronics.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772017987174-227802944.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 11:13:07'),
(111,1,19,17,'secondary',280,'Monitor','A monitor is an output device used to visually display information generated by a computer or other electronic equipment.','Modern monitors use technologies such as LED, LCD, and IPS panels, which provide bright colors, sharp resolution, and wide viewing angles.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771682894031-611340454.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:08:14'),
(112,1,2,1,'secondary',408,'AA_ AAA Battery','AA and AAA batteries are the most commonly used standard-size dry-cell batteries found in everyday electronic devices.','Both types typically provide a nominal voltage of 1.5V (or 1.2V for rechargeable Ni-MH versions) and are designed to deliver stable, reliable power.','c','d','assets/uploads/category/AA__AAA_Battery/AA__AAA_Battery_image.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(115,35,18,13,'primary',NULL,'Network Cables and Connectors','Network cables are essential components used to connect and transfer data between computers, routers, switches, and other networking devices.','Their reliability, low latency, and stable data transfer make them a preferred choice for secure and uninterrupted network communication.','Network cables and connectors are essential components used to establish wired communication between computers, routers, switches, CCTV systems, and other networking devices. They enable the transmission of data signals within local area networks (LAN) and internet connections. The most commonly used network cable is the Ethernet cable, available in categories such as Cat5e, Cat6, Cat6a, and Cat7, depending on speed and bandwidth requirements.','RJ45 connectors are widely used to terminate Ethernet cables and connect them to networking devices. Proper crimping and secure connection ensure stable data transmission and minimize signal loss. Network cables are designed with twisted pair wiring to reduce interference and improve signal quality. Shielded and unshielded variants are available based on installation environment and interference levels.','categories/1771597706984-430231976.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:28:26'),
(116,1,19,17,'secondary',215,'Computer Cables','Computer cables are essential connectivity accessories used to transfer data, power, audio, and video between computers and peripheral devices.','Common types include USB cables, HDMI cables, VGA cables, LAN (Ethernet) cables, SATA cables, and power cords, ensuring reliable communication and smooth operation of computer systems.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771671084745-880323777.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 10:51:24'),
(117,1,19,16,'secondary',212,'Power Bank','A power bank is a portable energy storage device used to charge smartphones, tablets, Bluetooth devices, and other USB-powered gadgets on the go','They provide a convenient backup power solution to ensure your devices stay charged anytime, anywhere.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771685297515-609831532.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:48:17'),
(118,1,19,17,'secondary',281,'Laptop Cables','Laptop cables are essential accessories used to connect, power, and extend the functionality of laptops','They allow communication with external devices, enable charging, and support high-speed data transfer and display output. These cables come in various types depending on the laptop model and purpose.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771681666889-628523391.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 13:47:46'),
(119,1,19,19,'secondary',229,'Printer Toner Cartridge','A printer toner cartridge is an essential component used in laser printers to produce sharp, high-quality text and images.','They are available in various capacities and color options, including black, cyan, magenta, and yellow, to suit different printing needs. Ideal for home, office, and commercial use, toner cartridges ensure smooth and reliable printing with minimal mainten',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772014035777-445191014.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:07:15'),
(120,1,19,19,'secondary',229,'Printer Cables','Printer cables are essential accessories that connect printers to computers or other devices for smooth data transfer and printing.','Whether for home, office, or professional use, choosing a high-quality printer cable helps maintain consistent print quality and efficient workflow.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771685476992-802769376.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:51:16'),
(123,1,19,20,'primary',NULL,'Fuses','A fuse is a safety device used in electrical and electronic circuits to protect components from damage caused by overcurrent, short circuits, or overloads.','It contains a thin metal wire or strip that melts when excessive current flows through it, breaking the circuit instantly and preventing overheating or fire hazards.','A fuse is a protective electrical device designed to safeguard circuits from overcurrent and short-circuit conditions. It consists of a thin metal wire or strip enclosed inside a protective casing made of glass, ceramic, or plastic.','The fuse rating should be slightly above the normal operating current of the circuit but below the maximum safe current of the components. Proper fuse holders should be used to ensure secure connection and easy replacement.','categories/1771676773429-721992199.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 12:26:13'),
(124,1,19,18,'secondary',230,'Tv Remote','The TV remote is a compact and easy-to-use wireless controller designed to operate your television effortlessly from a distance.','The remote provides strong signal transmission and wide compatibility with most LED, LCD, and Smart TVs.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772017803600-855737759.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 11:10:03'),
(125,1,19,18,'secondary',230,'DTH Remote','The DTH Remote is a high-quality, user-friendly replacement remote designed for smooth and reliable control of your DTH set-top box','It features a strong IR transmitter that ensures excellent signal transmission, allowing you to operate your DTH box from longer distances with ease',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771674457125-918191158.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 11:47:37'),
(126,1,19,18,'secondary',230,'Cable TV Remote','A Cable TV Remote is a handheld infrared (IR) or RF-based controller used to operate cable TV set-top boxes and digital receivers.','Cable TV remotes are available for various platforms such as DTH, DVB, Digital Cable, HD set-top boxes, and IPTV receivers',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771668735389-606960563.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 10:12:15'),
(127,1,19,18,'secondary',230,'USB Remote','A USB Remote Control is a convenient and easy-to-use device designed to control multimedia functions on a computer, laptop, smart TV, media player, or projector','It connects through a USB receiver dongle, enabling wireless control without the need for Bluetooth or Wi-Fi.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772018027001-487497610.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 11:13:47'),
(128,1,19,14,'primary',NULL,'5.1 Amplifier Board','A 5.1 Amplifier Board is an audio amplifier module designed to power a full surround-sound speaker system consisting of five audio channels—Front Left, Front Right, Center, Surround Left, Surround Right—and one subwoofer channel','Most 5.1 amplifier boards are built using ICs such as TDA2030, TDA2050, or TPA3116, offering efficient power delivery for home-theatre setups','c','d','categories/1771599724991-976169218.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-04-10 05:05:57'),
(129,1,19,14,'secondary',534,'2.1 Amplifier Board','A 2.1 Amplifier Board is an electronic audio amplifier module designed to drive three speakers — two satellite speakers (Left & Right) and one Subwoofer. It is commonly used in home audio systems, DIY speaker projects, multimedia speakers, TVs, and computer sound systems.','The board typically includes separate volume controls for the bass (subwoofer) and the stereo channels, allowing users to fine-tune the audio balance','Use correct voltage power supply to avoid damage.\r\n\r\nMatch speaker impedance with board specification.\r\nProvide proper heat ventilation.\r\nUse good quality power adapter for noise-free sound.\r\nAvoid short circuit on speaker outputs.','Connect Left & Right speakers to stereo output terminals.\r\nConnect Subwoofer only to SUB output.\r\nPower ON after completing all wiring.\r\nKeep audio input cable shielded to reduce noise.\r\nRecommended to use SMPS power supply with sufficient current rating.\r\nEnsure polarity (+/–) connection is correct.','categories/1771599600064-574433213.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-04-13 05:31:16'),
(130,1,19,17,'secondary',281,'Laptop HUBS','Hubs are essential connectivity devices used to expand the number of available ports for computers, laptops, or network systems.','Hubs come in various types, including USB hubs, USB-C hubs, and Network (Ethernet) hubs, each serving different data and power needs.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771681762387-171116151.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 13:49:22'),
(131,1,19,17,'secondary',215,'Wi-Fi Dongles','Wi-Fi Dongles are compact USB devices that allow computers, laptops, and other compatible gadgets to connect to wireless networks without needing an internal Wi-Fi card.','Wi-Fi dongles provide fast, reliable wireless performance for everyday browsing, streaming, and online work.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772018876723-571834778.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 11:27:56'),
(132,1,19,16,'secondary',212,'Memory Card','A Memory Card is a compact, removable storage device used to store digital data such as photos, videos, music, documents, and system files','Memory cards come in various formats like SD, Micro-SD, and CompactFlash, making them compatible with devices such as smartphones, cameras, tablets, drones, gaming consoles, and embedded systems',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771682806057-629754865.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:06:46'),
(133,1,19,17,'secondary',215,'Wired MIC','A wired microphone is a reliable audio-capturing device commonly used in recording, public speaking, singing, and various multimedia applications.','Wired mics are known for their clear audio output, low latency, and zero dependency on batteries or wireless connections.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772019091969-160158443.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 11:31:31'),
