(136,1,19,18,'secondary',230,'SETUP BOX Remote','It features well-spaced, responsive buttons that ensure quick access to channels, volume adjustments, menu settings, and multimedia functions.','The Setup Box Remote is a reliable and user-friendly controller designed for smooth navigation and effortless control of your digital set-top box.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772016077542-292213872.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:41:17'),
(137,1,21,24,'secondary',304,'Camera Accessories','Camera accessories include all the supporting components and add-ons used to install, power, connect, and enhance the performance of surveillance cameras.','Common camera accessories include mounting brackets, junction boxes, power adapters, PoE injectors/switches, connectors (BNC/DC), network cables, smoke-type housings, camera enclosures, IR illuminators, and surge protectors.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771669013631-41682731.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-05 13:36:39'),
