(139,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Light Laser Sensor modules','A Light Laser Sensor Module is an optical detection unit designed to sense laser beams or focused light signals with high accuracy','Featuring fast response time, low power consumption, and stable performance, light laser sensor modules offer reliable operation for both indoor and outdoor applications.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771682053480-870205128.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 13:54:13'),
(142,1,19,15,'secondary',196,'Stepper Motor','A Stepper Motor is a precision-controlled motor that rotates in fixed steps, allowing accurate control of position, speed, and direction','A stepper motor moves in small increments called steps, making it ideal for applications requiring precise movement.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771683546664-193793231.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:19:06'),
(143,1,19,15,'primary',NULL,'Motor Driver Stepper','A Stepper Motor Driver (Motor Drive Stepper) is an electronic module designed to control stepper motors with precision and efficiency','It receives low-power control signals from a microcontroller (like Arduino, ESP32, Raspberry Pi) and converts them into high-power pulses that drive the motor coils.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771683168559-979580314.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-03 11:37:31'),
(145,1,19,15,'secondary',165,'Wifi Module','A Wi-Fi Module is a compact wireless communication device used to add Wi-Fi connectivity to embedded systems, IoT projects, and smart devices','These modules typically support 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi, standard 802.11 b-g-n protocols, and feature onboard antennas or external antenna connectors for stable wireless performance.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772018934499-820563242.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-26 14:19:27'),
(165,1,19,15,'primary',NULL,'Sensor Modules','A sensor module converts a physical parameter (temperature, light, motion, gas, distance, humidity, etc.) into an electrical signal. Unlike raw sensors, modules include onboard circuitry, making them beginner-friendly and reliable for projects.','Sensor Modules are ready-to-use electronic boards that combine a sensor element with supporting components such as resistors, amplifiers, voltage regulators, and signal conditioning circuits.\r\nThey are designed for easy connection with Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP8266, ESP32, and other microcontrollers without complex circuit design.','Always check operating voltage before connection.\r\nAvoid reverse polarity connection.\r\nDo not expose sensors to extreme heat or moisture unless specified.\r\nCalibrate sensor sensitivity when required.\r\nUse stable power supply to avoid noisy readings.','Connect VCC and GND first before signal pins.\r\nSelect correct input mode (Analog/Digital) in controller code.\r\nUse pull-up or pull-down configuration if needed.\r\nAllow warm-up time for gas sensors (MQ series).\r\nTest module output using serial monitor before final installation.\r\nKeep sensor away from electrical noise sources.','categories/1772116279838-434441607.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-26 14:31:19'),
(166,1,2,1,'secondary',165,'IR Sensor','It works by emitting IR rays and detecting the reflected rays from nearby objects. IR sensors are widely used in robotics, automation, security systems, and consumer electronics.','An IR Sensor is an electronic sensor that uses infrared light to detect objects, measure distance, or sense motion.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771680731770-921864258.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(175,1,2,1,'secondary',395,'Modules',NULL,NULL,'Modules are ready-made electronic circuits designed to perform a specific function. They combine components like ICs, resistors, capacitors, and connectors on a PCB, making them easy to use, plug-and-play, and beginner-friendly.','Modules are widely used in electronics projects, robotics, IoT, automation, and embedded systems.','assets/uploads/category/Modules/Modules_image.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(177,1,19,15,'secondary',86,'Developer Boards','They integrate a microcontroller or processor along with essential components like USB interface, power regulation, GPIO pins, and communication ports, allowing developers to build projects quickly without complex hardware design.','Developer Boards are ready-to-use electronic boards designed for learning, prototyping, testing, and product development',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771673021072-518547851.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 11:23:41'),
(196,1,19,15,'primary',NULL,'Motors','An electric motor is an electromechanical device that converts electrical energy into mechanical energy. It works on the principle of electromagnetic interaction, where electric current passing through a conductor generates a magnetic field that produces motion. Motors are widely used in household appliances, industrial machines, automobiles, robotics, pumps, fans, and automation systems.','There are different types of motors based on application and power supply. DC motors operate using direct current and are commonly used in small electronics and robotics projects. AC motors run on alternating current and are widely used in industrial and household equipment. Stepper motors provide precise step-by-step movement, making them ideal for CNC machines and 3D printers. Servo motors are used for controlled angular motion in robotics and automation systems.','A Motor is an electrical device that converts electrical energy into mechanical (rotational or linear) motion.','Motors are a core component in electronics, robotics, automation, industrial machinery, home appliances, and electric vehicles.','categories/1771597308514-829744583.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:21:48'),
(199,35,18,13,'secondary',480,'Router','A Router is a networking device that connects multiple devices to the internet and manages data traffic between them. It acts as a central hub in home, office, and industrial networks by directing data packets between computers, smartphones, smart TVs, IoT devices, and external internet servers. Routers connect to a modem through a WAN (Wide Area Network) port and distribute internet access via Ethernet cables or wireless WiFi signals.','Routers include built-in security features such as WPA3 encryption, firewall protection, MAC address filtering, and parental controls to ensure safe and secure internet usage. Advanced routers offer features like Quality of Service (QoS) for prioritizing traffic, guest networks, VPN support, and mesh networking for extended coverage.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772015446593-748588000.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:30:46'),
(202,1,2,1,'primary',NULL,'Convertor','Convertor',NULL,'A Converter is an electronic device or module used to change electrical power from one form to another.','In electronics, converters are mainly used to convert voltage levels or current types so that devices receive the correct and safe power required for operation.','assets/uploads/category/Convertor/Convertor_image.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(203,1,19,15,'primary',NULL,'Project cable and connectors','A Connector Wire is an electrical wire fitted with connectors or terminals at one or both ends, used to create a secure and reliable electrical connection between components, devices, or circuits.','Connector wires help simplify wiring, reduce installation time, and ensure safe power or signal transmission in electrical and electronic systems.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771598358685-911100748.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:39:18'),
(205,1,20,22,'primary',NULL,'Electrical Pin and Block','A Connector Pin is a small metal contact component used to establish an electrical or signal connection between wires, cables, circuit boards, or connectors','Connector pins are designed to ensure reliable conductivity, proper alignment, and secure mating within plugs, sockets, terminals, and electronic connectors.','DisplayPort cables are high-performance digital display cables used to transmit audio and video signals from a computer, laptop, or graphics card to a monitor, projector, or display device. They are commonly used in desktop PCs, gaming systems, professional workstations, and multi-monitor setups. DisplayPort supports high resolutions and refresh rates, making it ideal for Full HD, 2K, 4K, and even 8K displays depending on the version.','They are available in different versions such as DisplayPort 1.2, 1.4, and 2.0, with higher versions supporting greater resolution, refresh rates, and advanced features like HDR and multi-stream transport (MST) for daisy-chaining multiple monitors.','categories/1771594075168-480833515.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 13:27:55'),
(207,1,20,22,'primary',NULL,'Electrical Plug and Joints','A Connector Plug is an electrical or electronic component used to connect a device, cable, or wire to a power source, socket, or another device','Connector plugs are widely used in household appliances, electronics, industrial equipment, and electrical installations.','Electrical plugs and joints are essential components used for connecting electrical devices safely to a power source and for joining electrical wires securely. A plug is used to connect an appliance to a power socket, while electrical joints are used to connect two or more wires to maintain continuous electrical flow. These components are widely used in homes, offices, shops, industries, and electrical installations.','Electrical plugs are available in 2-pin and 3-pin types, designed for different voltage and current ratings. The 3-pin plug includes a live, neutral, and earth connection for enhanced safety. Electrical joints may include screw-type connectors, terminal blocks, crimp connectors, and insulated joint clips.','categories/1771594356050-760419579.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 13:32:36'),
(211,1,19,17,'primary',NULL,'Laptop Spares','Laptop spares are replacement parts used to repair, upgrade, or maintain laptops.','These components help restore performance, extend device lifespan, and ensure smooth functioning when original parts are damaged or worn out. Laptop spares are widely used by service centers, technicians, and end users for maintenance and upgrades.','Laptop spares refer to replacement parts used for repairing, upgrading, or maintaining a laptop. These include internal components such as RAM, SSD/HDD, motherboard, battery, cooling fan, display panel, keyboard, touchpad, hinges, charging port, and power adapter. Laptop spares are essential for restoring performance, fixing hardware issues, or extending the lifespan of the device.','These spare parts are available in different specifications and models depending on laptop brand and configuration. Upgrading components like RAM or SSD can significantly improve system speed and overall performance.','categories/1771596340066-840209815.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:05:40'),
(212,1,19,16,'primary',NULL,'Mobile Phone Accessories','Mobile Phone Accessories are additional products designed to enhance the functionality, protection, performance, and convenience of smartphones.','These accessories improve user experience by offering better charging, audio quality, device protection, connectivity, and smart features. They are widely used by everyday users, businesses, and service providers.','Mobile phone accessories are additional products designed to enhance the functionality, protection, charging, and user experience of a smartphone. These accessories include chargers, USB cables, earphones, Bluetooth headsets, power banks, mobile back covers, screen protectors, car chargers, and stands. They support daily mobile usage by improving convenience, safety, and performance.','Charging accessories such as adapters and cables are available in different power ratings and connector types including USB Type-C, Micro-USB, and Lightning. High-quality accessories ensure stable power delivery, fast charging capability, and protection against overvoltage or short circuits. Protective accessories like cases and tempered glass help safeguard the device from drops, scratches, and dust.','categories/1771596839025-700538651.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:13:59'),
(213,1,19,16,'primary',NULL,'Mobile Phone Spares','Mobile Phone Spares are replacement parts and components used to repair, maintain, or upgrade mobile phones.','These spare parts help restore damaged or faulty smartphones to proper working condition, extending device life and reducing replacement costs. Mobile spares are widely used by service centers, technicians, and mobile repair shops.','Mobile phone spares refer to replacement components used for repairing or restoring damaged or faulty smartphones. These include display screens (LCD/OLED), touch panels, batteries, charging ports, speakers, microphones, cameras, back panels, power buttons, volume buttons, and internal motherboard components. Mobile spares are essential for service centers and technicians to fix hardware issues and extend the lifespan of mobile devices.','Spare parts are available in original, OEM, and compatible versions depending on quality and pricing. Replacing damaged displays or weak batteries helps restore device performance and usability. Charging port and speaker replacements resolve common issues such as charging failure or low sound output. Using high-quality spare parts ensures better durability, performance stability, and user satisfaction.','categories/1771597000979-823463453.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:16:40'),
(214,1,19,17,'primary',NULL,'Laptop Software','Laptop software refers to the programs, applications, and operating systems installed on a laptop to enable it to function, perform tasks, and provide user services.','Software acts as the interface between the user and the laptop hardware, allowing users to work, communicate, create content, browse the internet, and manage data efficiently.','Laptop software consists of system software and application programs installed on a laptop to perform specific tasks and manage overall device operation. It includes operating systems, drivers, productivity applications, antivirus programs, multimedia tools, accounting software, programming tools, and other utility applications. Laptop software enables users to perform office work, online browsing, designing, communication, data management, and entertainment activities efficiently.','Most laptop software is designed to operate smoothly within portable hardware limitations such as battery usage, RAM capacity, and storage space. Genuine and licensed software ensures better security, performance stability, and access to regular updates.','categories/1771596231545-214534777.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:03:51'),
(215,1,19,17,'primary',NULL,'Desktop Accessories','Desktop accessories are additional devices and components used with desktop computers to improve functionality, performance, comfort, and user experience.','These accessories support input, output, connectivity, power management, and system protection, making desktops more efficient for work, learning, gaming, and professional use.','Desktop accessories are essential add-on devices that enhance the functionality, comfort, and efficiency of a desktop computer system. These accessories include keyboards, mice, speakers, webcams, USB hubs, external storage devices, and other peripheral components that improve user interaction and productivity.','They are designed to be compatible with most operating systems and typically connect through USB, Bluetooth, HDMI, or audio ports. Desktop accessories are built for durability, ergonomic comfort, and long-term performance, making them suitable for office, educational, business, and home use. Many modern accessories also support plug-and-play functionality, requiring minimal setup and configuration.','categories/1771590986546-97398243.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 12:36:26'),
(216,1,19,14,'primary',NULL,'Bluetooth Audio Devices','Bluetooth Audio Devices are wireless sound equipment that use Bluetooth technology to transmit audio signals without the need for cables','These devices allow users to connect smartphones, laptops, tablets, TVs, and other Bluetooth-enabled devices easily, providing convenient and portable audio solutions for personal, home, and automotive use.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771665848329-237425578.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-05 13:33:27'),
(218,1,19,14,'primary',NULL,'Car Audio System','Car Audio Systems are electronic sound systems installed in vehicles to provide music, entertainment, communication, and navigation audio while driving','These systems enhance the in-car experience by delivering clear sound, powerful bass, and modern connectivity options such as Bluetooth, USB, and AUX.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771669348037-555212151.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 10:22:28'),
(219,1,19,17,'primary',NULL,'Desktop Spares','Desktop spares are replacement parts used to repair, maintain, or upgrade desktop computers.','These components help restore system functionality, improve performance, and extend the lifespan of desktop PCs. Desktop spares are essential for service centers, IT technicians, and users who want cost-effective repairs instead of replacing entire system','Desktop spares refer to replacement and upgrade components used in desktop computers to maintain, repair, or enhance system performance. These include internal parts such as motherboard, RAM, SMPS (power supply), hard disk drive (HDD), solid-state drive (SSD), processor, cooling fan, graphics card, and connecting cables.','Desktop spares are essential for servicing systems that experience hardware failure or require performance upgrades. They are available in different capacities and specifications to match various desktop configurations. Using high-quality and compatible spare parts ensures stable performance, longer lifespan, and efficient operation of the computer system in offices, homes, institutions, and commercial environments.','categories/1771592622848-151516375.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 13:03:42'),
(221,1,19,17,'primary',NULL,'Desktop Software','Desktop software refers to the programs and applications installed on desktop computers to control hardware, manage system operations, and help users perform various tasks such as office work, design, communication, programming, and entertainment.','Desktop software is essential for making a computer functional, secure, and productive.','Desktop software refers to application programs that are installed and run directly on a desktop or laptop computer. These software applications are designed to perform specific tasks such as accounting, billing, office documentation, graphic design, video editing, database management, antivirus protection, and system utilities.','It generally offers higher performance, better data control, and advanced feature access depending on the system configuration. Desktop software is commonly used in offices, businesses, educational institutions, retail shops, and industrial environments for daily operational activities.','categories/1771592361317-84443625.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 12:59:21'),
