(261,1,2,1,'primary',NULL,'Cement','Cement is a fine powdered binding material used in construction to make concrete, mortar, and plaster. When mixed with water, cement reacts chemically and hardens over time, binding materials such as sand, aggregates, and bricks into a strong, solid mass','Cement is one of the most essential materials in residential, commercial, industrial, and infrastructure construction.',NULL,NULL,'assets/uploads/category/Cement/Cement_image.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(262,1,2,1,'primary',NULL,'Steel','Steel is a strong and durable metal alloy primarily made of iron and carbon, widely used in construction, infrastructure, manufacturing, and engineering.','Steel provides excellent resistance to tension, compression, and impact, making it ideal for modern construction and industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,'assets/uploads/category/Steel/Steel_image.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(263,1,2,1,'primary',NULL,'Bricks & Blocks','Bricks & Blocks are essential masonry construction materials used to build walls, partitions, and structural elements in residential, commercial, industrial, and infrastructure projects','They provide strength, stability, thermal insulation, and durability, making them a fundamental part of building construction.',NULL,NULL,'assets/uploads/category/Bricks_&_Blocks/Bricks_&_Blocks_image.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(264,1,2,1,'primary',NULL,'Sand','Sand is a naturally occurring fine aggregate material made up of small rock and mineral particles.','It is one of the most important materials in construction, used mainly for concrete making, plastering, masonry, and flooring work. Sand improves the strength, bonding, and workability of cement-based mixtures.',NULL,NULL,'assets/uploads/category/Sand/Sand_image.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(265,1,2,1,'secondary',264,'M Sand','M-Sand (Manufactured Sand) is an artificial fine aggregate produced by crushing hard stones such as granite into sand-sized particles.','M-Sand is widely used in modern construction due to its consistent quality and availability.',NULL,NULL,'assets/uploads/category/M_Sand/M_Sand_image.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(266,1,2,1,'secondary',264,'River Sand','River Sand is a natural fine aggregate obtained from riverbeds and riverbanks','It is widely used in construction due to its smooth texture, rounded particles, and excellent bonding properties when mixed with cement. River sand plays a vital role in producing strong and workable concrete and mortar.',NULL,NULL,'assets/uploads/category/River_Sand/River_Sand_image.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
