(268,1,2,1,'secondary',262,'TMT Steel',NULL,NULL,'TMT steel bars are high-strength reinforcement steel bars widely used in concrete construction for buildings, bridges, highways, and other structural work.','They undergo a special thermo-mechanical treatment process that gives them a strong outer core and a ductile inner core, combining high strength with flexibility — essential for modern infrastructure','assets/uploads/category/TMT_Steel/TMT_Steel_image.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 11:21:31'),
(270,1,19,14,'primary',NULL,'Soundbars','A soundbar is a slim, elongated speaker system designed to improve TV and home audio quality.','It combines multiple speaker drivers in a single unit to produce clearer dialogue, richer bass, and wider soundstage compared to built-in TV speakers. Soundbars are ideal for home theaters, living rooms, bedrooms, and gaming setups.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771598971681-976493758.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:49:31'),
(271,1,19,14,'primary',NULL,'Woofers and Subwoofers','Woofers and Subwoofers are loudspeaker components designed to reproduce low-frequency sound, adding depth, power, and richness to audio systems. They play a key role in delivering bass notes that smaller speakers and tweeters cannot handle effectively.','Woofers and Subwoofers are speaker components designed to produce low-frequency (bass) sounds, adding depth, power, and richness to audio systems. They handle sounds that smaller speakers cannot reproduce clearly, such as deep musical notes, drum beats, a','These speakers are widely used in home audio systems, home theaters, car audio setups, PA systems, and multimedia speakers. Woofers and subwoofers work together with tweeters and mid-range speakers to ensure balanced sound output across all frequencies.','Overall, they enhance sound quality by delivering strong, clear bass that improves music clarity, speech depth, and cinematic impact.','categories/1771599444806-885312965.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:57:24'),
(272,1,19,14,'primary',NULL,'2.1 Amplifier','A 2.1 amplifier is an audio amplification system designed to drive two satellite speakers (left and right) and one subwoofer. The “2” represents the stereo channels, while the “.1” represents a dedicated low-frequency channel for bass output.','Home audio systems, Computer speakers, DIY audio projects, TV and multimedia setups, Mini home theater systems','Always use proper rated speakers (4Ω or 8Ω).\r\n\r\nProvide adequate cooling using heat sinks.\r\nUse a stable power supply to avoid noise and distortion.\r\nEnsure correct polarity while connecting speakers.\r\nAvoid overloading to prevent amplifier damage.','Output Power: 10W + 10W + 20W (varies by model)\r\nOperating Voltage: 12V – 24V DC\r\nFrequency Response: 20Hz – 20kHz\r\nImpedance: 4Ω – 8Ω speakers supported\r\nSignal-to-Noise Ratio: High clarity output','categories/1771673276669-514607666.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-04-10 05:27:09'),
(273,1,19,14,'secondary',534,'4.1 Amplifier','A 4.1 Amplifier is an audio amplification system designed to drive four satellite speakers and one subwoofer. It offers a balanced surround-sound experience with clear left and right audio separation, enhanced by deep bass from the subwoofer. This type of','4.1 Amplifier delivers immersive sound with strong bass and clear speaker separation, making it ideal for everyday multimedia and electronics project use.','Provides surround sound experience\r\nDeep bass output with subwoofer\r\nClear audio distribution to all speakers\r\nSuitable for home entertainment','Use matching impedance speakers (4Ω or 8Ω).\r\nEnsure proper ventilation and heat dissipation.\r\nUse a stable and adequate power supply.\r\nCheck correct wiring polarity before powering ON.\r\nAvoid overloading to prevent IC damage.','categories/1771599658902-373203671.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-04-13 05:31:16'),
(274,1,19,14,'secondary',329,'5.1 Amplifiers','5.1 Amplifiers, A 5.1 amplifier is an audio amplification system designed to power a surround sound setup with five speakers and one subwoofer. It is widely used in home theaters, multimedia projects, and audio electronics applications to deliver immersiv','5.1 Amplifiers, A 5.1 amplifier receives an audio signal from a source (TV, Bluetooth module, computer, DVD player, or microcontroller-based system).',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771599780494-274041455.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-04-09 06:06:09'),
(275,1,19,20,'primary',NULL,'Integrated Circuit (IC)','An Integrated Circuit (IC) is a miniature electronic circuit in which multiple electronic components—such as transistors, resistors, diodes, and capacitors—are fabricated onto a single semiconductor chip, usually made of silicon','ICs are the backbone of modern electronics, enabling complex functions to be performed in a small, reliable, and cost-effective form.','An Integrated Circuit (IC) is a compact electronic component that contains multiple electronic elements such as transistors, resistors, and capacitors fabricated onto a single semiconductor chip. ICs are the fundamental building blocks of modern electronic devices and are widely used in computers, mobile phones, televisions, power supplies, industrial systems, and embedded projects.','Integrated Circuits are available in different package types such as DIP (Dual In-line Package), SMD (Surface Mount Device), SOP, QFN, and BGA. They perform various functions including amplification, signal processing, voltage regulation, timing control, logic operations, and microcontroller processing.','categories/1771595649621-599848749.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 13:54:09'),
(276,1,19,20,'secondary',275,'LM Series','The LM Series refers to a wide range of linear integrated circuits widely used in electronics projects, education, and industrial applications.','These ICs are popular because they are reliable, low-cost, easy to use, and well-documented, making them ideal for beginners as well as professional designers.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771682674860-152191096.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:04:34'),
(279,1,19,17,'primary',NULL,'New Laptop','A laptop is a portable personal computer that integrates the screen, keyboard, touchpad, battery, and core hardware into a single compact unit','Designed for mobility, laptops let users work, study, and entertain themselves anywhere, without needing a fixed desk setup.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771597999052-34641640.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:33:19'),
(280,1,19,17,'primary',NULL,'Desktop PC Full Set','A desktop computer is a personal computer designed to stay in one place — typically on or under a desk — with separate components such as the CPU tower (or all-in-one unit), monitor, keyboard, and mouse','During installation, ensure proper placement of the CPU cabinet in a well-ventilated area to maintain good airflow and prevent overheating. All connections such as monitor cable (HDMI/VGA/DisplayPort), keyboard, mouse, power cable, and network cable should be securely connected before powering on the system. Use a surge protector or UPS to protect the system from voltage fluctuations and sudden power cuts.','A Desktop PC Full Set typically includes the CPU cabinet (processor system unit), monitor, keyboard, mouse, and necessary connecting cables, providing a complete ready-to-use computing solution. It is designed for office work, educational use, business operations, browsing, accounting, design work, and general home usage. Desktop systems offer better performance stability, upgrade flexibility, and long operating life compared to many portable devices.','They support various processors, RAM capacities, storage options (HDD/SSD), and graphics configurations depending on user requirements. Desktop PC full sets are known for durability, efficient cooling performance, and cost-effective long-term usage. They are suitable for continuous operation in offices, institutions, shops, and industrial environments.','categories/1771591233656-438869616.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 12:40:33'),
(281,1,19,17,'primary',NULL,'Laptop Accessories','Laptop accessories are additional devices or tools that complement your laptop, making it more powerful, comfortable, convenient, safer, or better suited to specific tasks','While the laptop itself provides core computing, accessories help you work faster, stay organized, protect your device, and tailor your experience to your needs.','Laptop accessories are additional devices and supportive items used to enhance the functionality, comfort, protection, and performance of a laptop. These accessories include wireless mouse, laptop cooling pad, charger/adapters, laptop bags, USB hubs, external keyboards, headphones, and external storage devices.','Most laptop accessories support plug-and-play functionality through USB, Type-C, HDMI, Bluetooth, or wireless connectivity. Cooling pads help maintain proper airflow and reduce overheating during long working hours. Original or compatible power adapters ensure stable voltage supply and safe charging.','categories/1771595989698-351866556.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 13:59:49'),
(282,1,21,24,'primary',NULL,'Camera Type','Camera types in CCTV and surveillance systems are classified based on signal technology, design, installation location, and usage','choosing the right camera type depends on area coverage, lighting conditions, installation environment, resolution needs, and system compatibility',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771669205218-852578719.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 10:20:05'),
(283,1,21,24,'secondary',282,'Dome Camera','Dome cameras are often vandal-resistant, discreet, and suitable for indoor and outdoor environments. They are widely used in malls, offices, hotels, hospitals, and retail stores for professional surveillance setups.','A Dome Camera is enclosed in a dome-shaped casing and is typically mounted on ceilings',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771674047573-952856692.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 11:40:47'),
(284,1,21,24,'secondary',282,'Bullet Camera','A Bullet Camera is a cylindrical, long-shaped CCTV camera designed mainly for outdoor surveillance','Bullet cameras are usually weatherproof, feature strong night vision, and can be wall- or pole-mounted. They are commonly used in commercial buildings, factories, warehouses, and open outdoor spaces.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771668244369-878331727.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 10:04:04'),
(285,1,21,24,'secondary',282,'Turret Camera','A Turret Camera, also known as an eyeball camera, is a type of CCTV camera design that allows easy angle adjustment without moving the base.','It provides a wide field of view, strong infrared night vision, and minimal reflection issues compared to dome cameras.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772017764477-628958532.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 11:09:24'),
(286,1,21,24,'secondary',282,'IP Camera','IP Camera (Internet Protocol Camera) is a digital video surveillance camera that transmits video data over a network using internet protocol (IP). Unlike traditional analog CCTV cameras, IP cameras capture and process video internally and send digital signals directly to a network video recorder (NVR), computer, or cloud storage through a LAN or internet connection.','These cameras can be connected via Ethernet cable or wirelessly through Wi-Fi, and many models support PoE (Power over Ethernet), allowing both power and data transmission through a single cable. IP cameras provide high-resolution video quality such as HD, Full HD, 2MP, 4MP, and even 4K, ensuring clear image capture for monitoring purposes.','IP cameras are widely used in homes, offices, shops, industries, banks, schools, and public places for security and surveillance. They often include advanced features such as night vision (IR LEDs), motion detection, two-way audio, remote viewing via mobile apps, cloud recording, and smart alerts.','Installation is flexible, and users can monitor live footage from anywhere using a smartphone, tablet, or computer. Overall, IP cameras provide a modern, scalable, and high-quality security solution suitable for both small and large surveillance systems.','categories/1771680688502-527221689.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 13:31:28'),
(287,1,21,24,'primary',NULL,'Analog CCTV Camera','An analog camera is a traditional type of CCTV camera that captures video and transmits it as an analog signal to a recording device such as a DVR or XVR.','Analog cameras are known for their simple design, reliability, and cost-effectiveness, making them widely used in homes, small shops, offices, schools, and warehouses.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771663470634-226287646.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-04-09 06:48:38'),
(288,1,21,24,'secondary',282,'Smart Wi-Fi Camera','A smart Wi-Fi camera is a modern surveillance camera that connects directly to a Wi-Fi network, allowing users to monitor live video and recordings remotely through a mobile app or web platform','Unlike traditional CCTV systems, it usually does not require a DVR/NVR, making installation simple and cost-effective.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772016416314-48452538.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:46:56'),
(289,1,21,24,'primary',NULL,'CCTV Recorder','CCTV recorders are central devices used in surveillance systems to receive, record, store, and manage video footage from security cameras','The main types of CCTV recorders include DVR (Digital Video Recorder) for analog cameras using coaxial cables','A CCTV Recorder is the central device in a surveillance system that records, stores, and manages video footage from security cameras. It connects to multiple cameras and saves video data to an internal hard disk for playback and monitoring.','DVR (Digital Video Recorder) – Used with analog cameras (HD, AHD, TVI, CVI). NVR (Network Video Recorder) – Used with IP (network) cameras.','categories/1771586971901-526276893.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 11:29:31'),
(290,1,21,24,'secondary',289,'NVR','An NVR (Network Video Recorder) is a recording device used in IP-based CCTV systems to record, store, and manage video footage from network (IP) cameras.','Unlike DVRs, NVRs receive digitally encoded video data over a network using Ethernet (LAN) cables or Wi-Fi, rather than analog signals over coaxial cables.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771684054877-93334807.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:27:34'),
(291,1,21,24,'secondary',289,'DVR','A DVR (Digital Video Recorder) is a core component of analog CCTV systems, used to record, store, and manage video footage from security cameras.','DVRs support multi-channel recording (such as 4, 8, 16 channels), allowing multiple cameras to be monitored simultaneously.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771674581493-323579625.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 11:49:41'),
(292,1,21,24,'secondary',289,'XVR','An XVR (Extended Video Recorder) is a hybrid CCTV recording device designed to support multiple camera technologies on a single platform','nlike traditional DVRs or NVRs, an XVR can work with analog cameras (CVBS) as well as HD analog formats such as AHD, HD-TVI, HD-CVI, and in many models, IP cameras too. This makes XVRs highly flexible and ideal for system upgrades or mixed-camera installa',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772019885050-263521719.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 11:44:45'),
(293,1,21,24,'primary',NULL,'CCTV Storage Device','A CCTV storage device is used to store recorded video footage captured by surveillance cameras for later viewing, backup, and evidence purposes.','Common CCTV storage devices include DVRs (Digital Video Recorders) for analog cameras and NVRs (Network Video Recorders) for IP cameras, both of which typically use surveillance-grade hard disks for continuous 24/7 recording.','A CCTV Storage Device is a dedicated storage component used in surveillance systems to store recorded video footage from CCTV cameras.','It is typically installed inside a DVR (Digital Video Recorder) or NVR (Network Video Recorder) and is designed for 24/7 continuous recording.','categories/1771588720951-326991703.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 11:58:40'),
(294,1,21,24,'secondary',293,'Hard Disk','A hard disk drive (HDD) is a traditional data storage device used to store operating systems, software, and large volumes of data','HDDs are widely used in desktop computers, laptops, servers, DVRs, and NVR-based CCTV systems because they offer high storage capacity at a lower cost per GB.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771679374437-910194149.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 13:09:34'),
(295,1,21,24,'secondary',293,'SSD','An SSD (Solid State Drive) is a high-speed data storage device that stores data using flash memory instead of spinning disks like traditional hard drives (HDDs)','They are available in different form factors such as 2.5-inch SATA SSDs, M.2, and NVMe SSDs, with NVMe offering the highest speeds.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1772017110317-622502434.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:58:30'),
