(503,35,18,25,'secondary',115,'Patch Cord','A Patch Cord, also known as a patch cable, is a short electrical or network cable used to connect electronic or networking devices. In computer networking, patch cords are commonly used to connect devices such as computers, switches, routers, and patch pa','Patch cords are available in different lengths, colors, and categories such as Cat5e, Cat6, and Cat6A, supporting various data speeds and bandwidths.','flexible insulation and high-quality connectors, patch cords ensure stable connections, reduced signal loss, and organized cable management. They are widely used in offices, data centers, homes, and networking setups.','A Patch Cord (also called a Patch Cable) is a short, flexible cable used to connect electronic or networking devices for signal or data transmission. It is most commonly used in computer networks to link devices such as computers, switches, routers, modem','categories/1772013601437-191682537.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:00:01'),
(504,1,18,13,'secondary',115,'Optical Fiber Cable','Optical Fiber Cable is a high-speed communication cable that uses thin strands of glass or plastic fibers to transmit data in the form of light signals. It provides extremely fast data transmission, high bandwidth, and long-distance communication with min','Optical fiber cables are immune to electromagnetic interference, making them ideal for reliable and secure data transfer.','These cables are widely used in telecommunications, internet networks, data centers, cable TV systems, and industrial communication networks. Available in single-mode and multi-mode types, optical fiber cables support applications ranging from long-distan','Durable, lightweight, and energy-efficient, optical fiber cables are the backbone of modern communication infrastructure.','categories/1771684243190-25875577.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:30:43'),
(505,1,18,13,'secondary',115,'Keystone Jack','Keystone Jack is a modular networking connector used to terminate and organize Ethernet cables (such as Cat5e, Cat6, or Cat6A) in a clean and professional way. It snaps easily into keystone wall plates, patch panels, surface boxes, or faceplates, making i','A Keystone Jack is a modular networking connector used to terminate Ethernet cables and provide a secure, organized connection point for data networks. It is commonly used with Cat5e, Cat6, or Cat6A cables and snaps easily into standard keystone wall plat','These jacks support RJ45 connectors and are designed for easy installation using punch-down tools or tool-less mechanisms, depending on the model. By ensuring proper wire termination and reduced signal loss, keystone jacks help deliver stable, high-speed ','Keystone jacks are widely used in homes, offices, commercial buildings, data centers, and CCTV or IP camera installations.','categories/1771681348022-623637665.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 13:42:28'),
(506,35,18,13,'secondary',115,'RJ Connector','An RJ45 connector (Registered Jack-45) is an 8-pin modular connector used to terminate Ethernet network cables such as Cat5e, Cat6, and Cat6A. It connects network devices like computers, switches, routers, IP cameras, and access points, enabling data comm','Connector Type: Modular Ethernet connector\r\nPins: 8P8C (8 positions, 8 contacts)\r\nCable Types: Cat5, Cat5e, Cat6, Cat6A\r\nData Speed Support:\r\n10/100 Mbps (Fast Ethernet)\r\n1 Gbps (Gigabit Ethernet)\r\nUp to 10 Gbps (with Cat6A)\r\nCommon Applications: LAN netw','Always follow one wiring standard end-to-end (don’t mix T568A and T568B)\r\nUse boot covers to protect the connector latch\r\nTest cables using a LAN cable tester after crimping\r\nFor outdoor or CCTV use, prefer shielded RJ45 with pure copper cable','RJ45 connectors must be properly crimped using a crimping tool for reliable connectivity\r\nUse matching cable category and connector type (e.g., Cat6 cable with Cat6 connector)\r\nIncorrect wiring can cause packet loss, low speed, or no network\r\nconnection\r\n','categories/1772014901780-600935149.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:21:41'),
(507,35,18,13,'secondary',115,'Rj 45 Connector','An RJ11 connector (Registered Jack-11) is a small modular connector mainly used for telephone lines and DSL connections. It typically supports 2 or 4 wires and is commonly seen in landline phones, fax machines, modems, and intercom systems.','Connector Type: Telephone modular connector\r\n\r\nPins: 6 positions (usually 2 or 4 contacts used → 6P2C / 6P4C)\r\n\r\nCable Type: Flat or round telephone cable\r\n\r\nSignal Type: Analog voice / low-speed data\r\nCommon Uses:\r\nLandline telephones\r\nDSL / ADSL modems\r\n','RJ11 connectors are smaller than RJ45 and not designed for Ethernet networking\r\nAn RJ11 plug can physically fit into an RJ45 jack, but should not be used, as it may damage contacts\r\nSupports low voltage and low bandwidth only\r\nSimple crimping using an RJ1','Used for voice and DSL, not high-speed data\r\nIncorrect wiring may cause no dial tone or noise\r\nAlways match connector type with cable type (flat vs round)\r\nNot suitable for PoE or LAN networks','categories/1772014973159-825977323.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-25 10:22:53'),
(508,35,18,13,'primary',NULL,'Network Tools','Network tools are specialized tools used for installation, termination, testing, and maintenance of computer and communication networks. They support both copper-based networks (Ethernet) and fiber-optic networks, ensuring reliable connectivity and perfor','Used For: LAN, WAN, FTTH, CCTV, ISP, data center networks\r\nCable Types: UTP, STP, coaxial, fiber optic\r\nConnector Types: RJ45, RJ11, SC, LC, ST, FC\r\nUsers: Network technicians, system integrators, IT engineers','Match tools with cable category (Cat5e/Cat6/Cat6A)\r\nUse shielded tools for STP cables\r\nClean fiber connectors before testing\r\nStore tools properly to maintain accuracy and lifespan','Correct tool usage ensures low signal loss and stable network speed\r\nPoor termination causes packet loss and link failures\r\nFiber tools require high precision and cleanliness\r\nTesting cables after termination is mandatory in professional setups','categories/1771597939671-861546712.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:32:19'),
(509,1,18,13,'secondary',508,'Crimping Tools','A crimping tool is a hand tool used to attach connectors securely to cables by pressing (crimping) metal contacts into the wire conductors.','In networking and telecom work, crimping tools are mainly used for RJ45 (Ethernet) and RJ11 (telephone) connectors to ensure proper electrical contact and mechanical strength.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771671894890-175243800.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 11:04:54'),
(510,1,18,13,'secondary',508,'Lan Cable Tester','A LAN Cable Tester is a device used to test Ethernet (LAN) and telephone cables for proper wiring and continuity. It checks whether all wire pairs are correctly connected from one end to the other','The tester helps identify faults such as open circuits, short circuits, reversed or crossed wires. It is commonly used after crimping RJ45 or RJ11 connectors to ensure reliable network performance. LAN cable testers are essential tools for network install',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771681400249-417645319.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 13:43:20'),
(511,1,18,13,'secondary',508,'POE Injector','A PoE (Power over Ethernet) Injector is a device used to supply power and data through a single Ethernet cable to PoE-enabled devices. It eliminates the need for a separate power adapter by injecting DC power into the LAN cable.','PoE injectors are commonly used for IP cameras, wireless access points, VoIP phones, and network switches. They work with standard Ethernet cables like Cat5e and Cat6.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771685065388-365053300.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-21 14:44:25'),
(512,1,18,25,'secondary',508,'POE Switch','A PoE (Power over Ethernet) Switch is a network switch that delivers both data and electrical power through the same Ethernet cable to connected devices. It removes the need for separate power adapters, making installation cleaner and more efficient.','PoE switches are widely used for IP cameras, wireless access points, VoIP phones, and access control systems. They support standard Ethernet cables such as Cat5e and Cat6.',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771685157877-138088642.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-09 12:09:21'),
(513,1,19,20,'secondary',54,'Basic Calculator','A Basic Calculator is a simple electronic device used for everyday arithmetic calculations such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division. It is easy to operate and usually includes functions like percentage (%) and square root. Basic calcula','They are ideal for quick and accurate calculations without complex features. Due to their simplicity and low cost, basic calculators are widely popular for daily use.','A Basic Calculator is a simple electronic device used to perform fundamental arithmetic operations such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division. It is widely used by students, shopkeepers, office workers, and professionals for everyday calculations. Basic calculators are compact, easy to operate, and designed for quick numerical problem-solving.','A typical basic calculator consists of a numeric keypad (0–9), operation keys (+, −, ×, ÷), an equals (=) key, a clear (C/AC) key, and a digital display screen (usually LCD). Some models may also include percentage (%), square root (√), and memory function keys (M+, M−, MR, MC). The device operates using a battery or solar power and performs calculations through an internal electronic circuit and microprocessor.','categories/1771665024791-754490157.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-27 10:33:18'),
(514,1,19,20,'secondary',54,'GST Calculator','A GST Calculator is a tool used to calculate Goods and Services Tax (GST) on products or services. It helps find the GST amount and final price by applying GST rates such as 5%, 12%, 18%, or 28%. GST calculators are widely used by business owners, account','They reduce manual calculation errors and save time. GST calculators are commonly available as mobile apps, websites, and calculator functions.','While using a GST calculator, it is important to know the correct GST percentage applicable to the product or service. Businesses must also separate GST into CGST (Central GST) and SGST (State GST) for intra-state sales, or IGST (Integrated GST) for inter-state sales. A GST calculator saves time, improves billing accuracy, and helps maintain proper tax compliance. It is an essential tool for financial management and accounting purposes.','A GST Calculator is a tool used to calculate the Goods and Services Tax (GST) amount on goods and services. GST is an indirect tax applied at different rates such as 5%, 12%, 18%, and 28% in India. A GST calculator helps businesses, shop owners, accountants, and customers quickly determine the tax amount and the final price including or excluding GST. It simplifies billing and ensures accurate tax calculation without manual errors.','categories/1771679266531-792371386.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-27 10:32:11'),
(515,1,19,20,'secondary',54,'Scientific Calculator','A Scientific Calculator is an advanced calculator designed to perform complex mathematical and scientific calculations. It supports functions such as trigonometry, logarithms, exponents, square roots, and statistical operations','Scientific calculators are widely used by students, engineers, scientists, and professionals. They are essential for solving algebra, geometry, calculus, and physics problems. Compared to basic calculators, scientific calculators offer higher accuracy and','A Scientific Calculator is an advanced electronic calculating device designed to perform complex mathematical, scientific, and engineering calculations. Unlike a basic calculator, it can handle functions such as trigonometry (sin, cos, tan), logarithms (log, ln), exponents, powers, roots, fractions, permutations, combinations, and statistical calculations. Scientific calculators are widely used by students, engineers, scientists, and professionals for solving higher-level mathematics and technical problems.','A scientific calculator consists of a multi-line display screen, numeric keypad, function keys, and specialized operation buttons. It includes keys for trigonometric functions, inverse functions, logarithmic functions, memory storage, brackets, and mode selection (degree, radian, grad). The device operates using an internal microprocessor that processes mathematical expressions based on programmed algorithms and displays accurate results instantly.','categories/1772015715452-84086174.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-27 10:34:20'),
(516,1,20,23,'primary',NULL,'Tool Kit','A Tool Kit is a collection of essential hand tools kept together in a box or bag for repair, maintenance, and installation work. It usually includes tools like screwdrivers, pliers, spanners, cutters, hammer, and measuring tools','Tool kits are used in homes, workshops, electrical work, networking, and mechanical jobs. Having a tool kit helps perform tasks quickly and efficiently without searching for individual tools. Tool kits are available in basic, professional, and specialized',NULL,NULL,'categories/1771599119202-663049226.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-20 14:51:59'),
(517,1,19,14,'secondary',216,'Bluetooth Tweeter Speaker','A Bluetooth Tweeter Speaker is a compact wireless audio device designed to deliver clear, crisp high-frequency sound, especially vocals, treble notes, and sharp audio details. It combines a built-in tweeter driver with Bluetooth technology, allowing users','Bluetooth tweeter speakers are commonly used in portable speaker systems, home audio setups, DIY speaker projects, and multimedia applications. They often feature lightweight construction, low power consumption, and easy pairing with devices.','Many models include additional features such as rechargeable batteries, compact enclosures, and compatibility with amplifiers or crossover networks for balanced sound output.','Overall, a Bluetooth tweeter speaker is an excellent choice for users who want high-quality treble performance in a wireless and space-saving format. It is especially suitable for music lovers who value sharp sound details, clear speech, and enhanced audi','categories/1771666778271-557595172.jpeg',0,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-03-05 13:32:03'),
(518,1,19,20,'secondary',534,'Lithium Battery Charger','A Lithium Battery Charger is an electronic device designed to safely and efficiently charge lithium-based batteries, such as lithium-ion and lithium-polymer cells. It follows a controlled charging process—typically constant current (CC) followed by consta','Lithium battery chargers are widely used in mobile phones, power banks, laptops, electric vehicles, solar systems, and DIY electronics projects. Many chargers include built-in safety features such as overcharge protection, short-circuit protection, temper','They are available as compact charger modules, adapter-based chargers, or integrated charging circuits depending on the application.','Overall, a lithium battery charger is essential for safe energy management and reliable battery operation. By providing stable charging and multiple safety protections, it ensures efficient power delivery while protecting lithium batteries from damage and','categories/1771596397749-897833658.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-10 06:21:24','2026-02-26 08:56:06'),
