(14,'Computer','High-speed data processing  Large storage capacity ','A computer is an electronic device that processes data and performs tasks according to instructions given by software programs. It can store, retrieve, and manipulate information quickly and accurately.CPU (Central Processing Unit) – The brain of the computer\r\n','categoryGroup/1776074102198-810339972.png','active',NULL,0,1,'2026-02-28 03:31:54','2026-04-13 05:55:35'),
(15,'Mobile Phones','Mobile phones cssssonsist of several key components including a processor, battery, display screen, camera modules, memory, sensors, and wireless communication systems such as 4G or 5G. They run on operating systems like Android or iOS, which manage hardware functions and allow users to use various applications for communication, entertainment, productivity, and social networking.','Mobile phones are portable electronic communication devices that allow users to make voice calls, send text messages, and access wireless communication networks. Modern mobile phones, commonly known as smartphones, offer advanced features such as internet connectivity, touchscreen interfaces, cameras, multimedia playback, GPS navigation, and the ability to install applications.','categoryGroup/1772795114294-389849287.png','active',NULL,1,1,'2026-03-06 06:05:14','2026-04-17 05:43:04'),
(16,'Electronics Basic Componentsss','Electronic systems operate using electrical energy and electronic components to process signals, store data, and control devices. Electronics can be classified into several categories such as consumer electronics, industrial electronics, communication electronics, power electronics, and embedded systems.','Electronics is a branch of technology and engineering that deals with the study, design, and application of electronic circuits and devices that control the flow of electrons to perform various functions. It involves components such as resistors, capacitors, diodes, transistors, integrated circuits, and microcontrollers which are used to build electronic systems. Electronics is widely used in everyday devices like mobile phones, televisions, computers, home appliances, communication equipment, and industrial machines. The field plays an important role in modern technology by enabling automation, communication, entertainment, and smart systems.','categoryGroup/1773140687160-973957175.jpeg','active',NULL,1,1,'2026-03-10 07:04:47','2026-04-17 00:48:30'),
(17,'School college Project items','School college Project items','School college Project items','categoryGroup/1773837986492-418771610.jpeg','active',NULL,1,1,'2026-03-18 08:46:26','2026-03-18 08:46:26'),
(18,'Audio Items','Audio Items','Audio Items','categoryGroup/1773838313106-891571059.jpeg','active',NULL,0,1,'2026-03-18 08:51:53','2026-04-03 01:56:52'),
(19,'Electricals Tools & Connectors',NULL,'Electricals Tools & Connectors','categoryGroup/1774948764239-454058192.jpeg','active',NULL,0,1,'2026-03-31 05:19:24','2026-04-17 00:38:10'),
(20,'Mobile shopkakakka','we','ennnn','categoryGroup/1775122417829-521822301.jpg','active',NULL,1,1,'2026-04-02 05:33:37','2026-04-13 05:42:57'),
(21,'DD',NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',NULL,0,1,'2026-04-03 02:20:45','2026-04-03 02:36:40'),
(22,'Soldering Items','These items are widely used in electronic repairs, DIY projects, circuit assembly, and maintenance tasks, making them indispensable for technicians, hobbyists, and engineers. Proper use and maintenance of soldering tools ensure efficient performance, long-lasting equipment, and high-quality connections.','Soldering items are essential tools and materials used in electronics work to join components, wires, and circuit boards by melting a filler metal called solder. The most important tool is the soldering iron, which provides the heat needed to melt the solder and create a strong electrical connection. Supporting items such as solder wire (tin-lead or lead-free), flux, desoldering pump, and solder wick help ensure clean, reliable joints and allow for corrections when needed.','categoryGroup/1775217503151-794043705.jpg','active',NULL,1,1,'2026-04-03 07:58:23','2026-04-03 07:58:23'),
