(170,'Audio Playback Board Pen Drive version CW',NULL,NULL,'Audio Playback Board Pen Drive version CW',2200.00,'The Audio Playback Board (Pendrive version CW) — often labeled as MP3 Player Board CW, USB Audio Module, or CW-Audio Module — is a compact MP3 playback circuit capable of playing audio files (MP3/WAV) stored in a USB Pendrive or TF (MicroSD) card, without needing a microcontroller.','The Audio Playback Board (Pendrive Version – CW) is a compact digital audio decoder module designed to play MP3 audio files directly from a USB pendrive. It supports plug-and-play operation, allowing users to store audio tracks on a USB drive and play them through connected speakers or an external amplifier.','The board typically includes onboard audio decoding circuitry, control buttons, and output terminals for easy integration into electronic projects. It is widely used in announcement systems, DIY audio players, toys, automation alerts, and embedded audio applications due to its simple operation and reliable playback performance.',NULL,'products/1771835856762-833092776.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:05:00'),
