(240,'VOICE 8  Record/Playback  Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,950.00,'The VOICE 8 Record/Playback Module is an electronic audio module designed for recording and playing back voice messages or sound clips in embedded and automation projects. It allows users to record audio directly through an onboard microphone and replay the stored voice using push buttons or external trigger signals. The module typically supports multiple recording channels (up to 8 separate voice messages), making it suitable for applications that require different audio prompts or alerts.','The module includes a built-in microphone for recording, onboard memory for storing audio data, and an audio output stage capable of driving a small speaker directly. Recording and playback operations are controlled through dedicated buttons or digital input pins, allowing easy interfacing with microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, or other control systems. It operates on a low DC voltage supply (usually 3V–5V) and consumes minimal power, making it suitable for portable and battery-powered devices.','VOICE 8 record/playback modules are widely used in voice announcement systems, talking toys, security alarms, automation alerts, educational devices, interactive projects, and embedded audio notification systems. Due to simple operation, compact size, and easy integration, the module provides a convenient solution for adding voice feedback to electronic projects.',NULL,'products/1772007739181-160857325.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:22:19'),
