(250,'Vibration Sensor SEN043',NULL,NULL,NULL,450.00,'Vibration Sensor (SEN043) is a compact motion-detecting module that senses vibration or shaking','It typically uses a spring-mounted switch (such as SW-420) to detect movement and outputs a digital signal when vibration is present. Commonly used with Arduino, ESP32, and Raspberry Pi in projects like security alarms, impact detection, and motion-triggered alerts.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006972749-502233409.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:09:32'),
(251,'Vibration Tilt Sensor',NULL,NULL,'Tilt Sensor',499.00,'A Tilt Sensor is an electronic sensor used to detect the tilting or orientation change of an object. It works by using a small conductive ball or mercury inside a sealed tube that moves when the device is tilted. When the ball moves, it either opens or closes the circuit, allowing the sensor to detect motion or position change.','It typically contains a small internal element (like a spring and ball) that changes position when the module is shaken or tilted, producing a digital signal output.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772007497925-261950456.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 04:59:40'),
(252,'Vibration Sensor SW420',NULL,NULL,'VIBRATION SENSOR MODULE',180.00,'Vibration Sensor SW420 is a compact digital vibration detection module that outputs a HIGH signal when motion or shaking is detected.','It uses the SW-420 vibration switch paired with an adjustable potentiometer to set sensitivity',NULL,NULL,'products/1772007448591-25208541.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 03:48:53'),
(253,'7inch Raspberry Pi HDMI Touch Display',NULL,NULL,'Raspberry Pi HDMI Touch Display',7800.00,'The 7-inch HDMI Touch Display is a compact, high-resolution screen designed for Raspberry Pi and other HDMI-compatible boards. It features a 1024×600 IPS panel with capacitive multi-touch support, offering smooth touch response and vibrant color reproduction. ','7inch Raspberry Pi HDMI Touch 1024×600 is an HDMI interface touchscreen display with a 7-inch capacitive touch panel and 1024×600 resolution, designed for Raspberry Pi and other HDMI-enabled devices','Perfect for DIY projects, embedded systems, and portable computing setups.',NULL,'products/1771828980926-337247855.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:02:16'),
(254,'5inch Raspberry Pi HDMI Touch Display',NULL,NULL,NULL,9100.00,'The 5-inch Raspberry Pi HDMI Touch Display is a compact and versatile capacitive touchscreen designed for Raspberry Pi and other HDMI-compatible boards.It features an 800×480 resolution display with multi-touch support, offering clear visuals, responsive touch control, and plug-and-play connectivity via HDMI and USB.','5inch Raspberry Pi HDMI Touch Display is a compact touchscreen monitor with HDMI video input and responsive touch capability (usually via USB)',NULL,NULL,'products/1771823222614-711884098.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 05:07:02'),
(255,'3.5inch Raspberry PI Touch Display',NULL,NULL,NULL,4200.00,'The 3.5-inch Raspberry Pi Touch Display is a compact TFT touchscreen that connects directly to the Raspberry Pi’s GPIO pins.\r\nIt features a 480×320 resolution with resistive touch support, making it ideal for compact projects, control panels, and embedded systems that require both display and input in a small form factor.','3.5inch Raspberry Pi Touch Display is a compact touchscreen LCD designed for Raspberry Pi and other HDMI-capable single-board computers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771667316458-993787924.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 09:48:36'),
