(257,'16x2 I2C BLACK LCD with PCF8574',NULL,NULL,NULL,650.00,'The 16x2 I2C Black LCD Display with the PCF8574 I2C interface module is a compact and efficient display solution for microcontroller and Raspberry Pi projects. It allows easy connection using just two data lines (SDA and SCL), significantly reducing the number of GPIO pins required compared to traditional parallel LCDs.','16×2 I2C Black LCD with PCF8574 is a character LCD display that shows 2 lines of 16 characters each and uses an I²C interface with a PCF8574 I/O expander for simplified wiring',NULL,NULL,'products/1771657735540-190818352.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 07:08:55'),
(258,'16x2 I2C Display',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The 16x2 I2C RGB LCD Display based on the AIP31068 controller is a premium character LCD module that supports RGB backlight color control via the I2C interface. It displays 16 characters across 2 lines, combines bright color customization with low pin usage, and is ideal for Raspberry Pi, Arduino, and embedded systems.','16×2 I2C RGB LCD (AIP31068) is a character LCD display module with 2 lines × 16 characters and an RGB backlight that can change colors',NULL,NULL,'products/1774769981390-494127024.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-29 07:39:41'),
