(260,'16x2 I2C LCD Inbuilt AIP31068',NULL,NULL,NULL,520.00,'The 16x2 I2C LCD Display with inbuilt AIP31068 controller is a compact, easy-to-use character LCD module that communicates via the I2C interface, using only two data lines. It displays 16 characters across 2 lines and features the AIP31068 driver IC built into the module, eliminating the need for an external backpack board.','16×2 I2C LCD (Inbuilt AIP31068) is a character LCD module with 2 rows and 16 characters per row, featuring an RGB backlight and an AIP31068 I²C controller built in.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771657774565-223281304.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 07:09:34'),
(262,'USB to TTL CP2102 with DTR',NULL,NULL,NULL,440.00,'USB to TTL CP2102 with DTR is a USB-to-serial adapter module based on the CP2102 chip that provides TTL-level serial communication for microcontrollers','It includes a DTR (Data Terminal Ready) pin that enables automatic reset/bootloading on boards like Arduino or ESP8266/ESP32 during programming.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006836296-476577176.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:07:16'),
(264,'USB to TTL CP2102',NULL,NULL,NULL,400.00,'USB to TTL CP2102 is a compact USB-to-serial adapter based on the Silicon Labs CP2102 chip that converts USB signals from your computer into TTL-level serial (UART) signals for microcontrollers.','It’s ideal for programming, debugging, and serial communication with boards like Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, and other embedded devices. Simple plug-and-play connectivity makes it essential for uploading code and monitoring serial output over USB.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006813868-989805083.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:06:53'),
(265,'LCD 20X4 Blue',NULL,NULL,NULL,1325.00,'The 20x4 Blue Character LCD Display is a high-quality alphanumeric module that can display 4 lines of 20 characters each.It features a bright blue backlight with white text, offering excellent contrast and readability.Fully HD44780 compatible, it’s perfect for Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and other microcontroller projects requiring reliable text output.','LCD 20×4 Blue is a character LCD display module featuring 4 lines of 20 characters per line with a blue backlight for clear visibility',NULL,NULL,'products/1771915149215-639727492.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:39:09'),
(266,'LCD 20X4 Green',NULL,NULL,NULL,1350.00,'The 20x4 Green Character LCD Display is a 20-column by 4-line alphanumeric LCD module that uses the popular HD44780 controller. It features a green backlight with black text, providing excellent contrast and readability. Perfect for Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP32, STM32, and other microcontroller-based projects requiring clear, multi-line text display.','LCD 20×4 Green is a character LCD module with 4 lines × 20 characters and a green backlight for clear visibility.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771915172462-733087351.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:39:32'),
(267,'USB to TTL 2303',NULL,NULL,NULL,280.00,'USB to TTL 2303 is a USB-to-serial adapter module based on the Prolific PL2303 chip that converts USB signals from a computer into TTL-level UART signals for microcontrollers.','It enables easy programming, debugging, and serial communication with boards like Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, and other embedded devices. Simply connect VCC, GND, TX, and RX to interface and upload code or monitor data via serial terminal.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006759379-223554240.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:05:59'),
