(279,'RS485 to RS232 Converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,480.00,'This converter is widely used in industrial automation, PLC communication, data acquisition systems, energy meters, and access control systems. It ensures stable data transmission over long distances while maintaining reliable serial communication.','The RS485 to RS232 Converter is a communication interface device used to convert RS485 differential signals into RS232 serial signals, enabling seamless communication between RS485-based industrial devices and RS232-based equipment such as PCs, controllers, and legacy systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772000019169-700649929.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:13:39'),
(280,'Pixhawk PX4 Autopilot With GPS PIX 2.4.8 Drone Flight Controller kit',NULL,NULL,NULL,15600.00,'The Pixhawk PX4 2.4.8 Autopilot with GPS Kit is a professional-grade open-source flight controller designed for multirotors, fixed-wing aircraft, VTOLs, and autonomous drones.Equipped with a 32-bit ARM processor, integrated sensors, and external GPS module, this controller provides stable flight control, autonomous navigation, and precise GPS positioning using the PX4 or ArduPilot firmware.','The Pixhawk PX4 2.4.8 is a 32-bit autopilot flight controller based on the PX4 open-source platform (also compatible with ArduPilot), used as the core controller for drones, multirotors, fixed wings, and autonomous vehicles',NULL,NULL,'products/1771996049490-849619704.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:07:29'),
