(286,'4CH 12v Relay Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'4CH 12V Relay Module is a board with four independent 12 V-powered electromechanical relays that let you control four separate high-power loads (like lights, fans, motors, appliances, etc.) using low-voltage control signals from microcontrollers (Arduino, Raspberry Pi with level shifting, PIC, etc.)','Each relay typically provides Common (COM), Normally Open (NO), and Normally Closed (NC) contacts and has LED indicators for status. These modules are commonly used in home automation, industrial control, robotics, and IoT projects to safely switch AC/DC loads with electrical isolation between the control and power sides.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771821029121-126754691.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-25 12:52:20'),
