(289,'Android 10.1inch 1024*600 Capacitive','DMG10600C101_32WTCZ01',NULL,NULL,19250.00,'The DMG10600C101_32WTCZ01 is a 10.1-inch industrial-grade Android capacitive touch display with 1024×600 resolution, designed for embedded control systems, HMI panels, and industrial automation.It integrates a powerful Android operating system, multi-touch support, and robust communication interfaces, making it ideal for smart device and automation applications.','The Android DMG10600C101_32WTCZ01 10.1inch Capacitive Display is a commercial/industrial-grade touchscreen terminal featuring a 10.1-inch IPS display (1024 × 600) with smooth capacitive touch and built-in Android 11 OS powered by a quad-core RK3566 CPU.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771831582379-713277311.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:30:05'),
(290,'1CH 12V Relay Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,150.00,'1CH 12V Relay Module is a small control board that contains a single electromechanical relay powered by 12 V DC. It lets a low-power control signal (from a microcontroller like Arduino, Raspberry Pi (with level shifting), PIC, etc.) switch a higher-power electrical load such as a lamp, motor, fan, or appliance','The module typically provides Common (COM), Normally Open (NO), and Normally Closed (NC) terminals for flexible switching and often includes an LED indicator to show relay activation. It’s commonly used in home automation, robotics, industrial control, and IoT projects to safely interface logic circuits with mains or DC loads.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771658531366-879938552.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 07:22:11'),
