(293,'4CH 5v RELAY Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,399.00,'4CH 5V Relay Module is a control board that contains four independent 5 V-powered electromechanical relays, allowing a low-voltage control signal (from microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP32, PIC, AVR, Raspberry Pi with level shifting, etc.) to safely switch higher-power AC/DC loads such as lights, motors, fans, and appliances.','Each relay provides Common (COM), Normally Open (NO), and Normally Closed (NC) contacts and usually has LED indicators showing relay status. These modules are commonly used in home automation, robotics, IoT systems, and embedded control projects to interface logic-level electronics with real-world power circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771821052495-950262613.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-25 12:52:44'),
(294,'18.5inch DMG 19108 C185 05 WTC 2K HD',NULL,NULL,'DWIN Display',22500.00,'The DMG19108C185_05WTC is a large-format 18.5-inch industrial-grade TFT display featuring a 2K HD resolution, capacitive multi-touch, and high-brightness IPS panel.Built for industrial control systems, automation, kiosks, and digital signage, it offers sharp visuals, robust durability, and long-life reliability for 24/7 operation.','The 18.5inch DMG19108C185_05WTC 2K HD Commercial-Grade Smart Screen is a large 18.5-inch IPS TFT LCD display with 1920 × 1080 (Full HD) resolution and a capacitive touch panel, designed for commercial applications.','Built for industrial control systems, automation, kiosks, and digital signage, it offers sharp visuals, robust durability, and long-life reliability for 24/7 operation.',NULL,'products/1771658042212-865761859.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 12:48:39'),
(295,'2CH 5V RELAY Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,399.00,'2CH 5V Relay Module is a compact control board containing two electromechanical relays that operate on a 5 V DC supply. It allows low-voltage logic signals from microcontrollers (like Arduino, ESP32, PIC, AVR, or Raspberry Pi with proper level shifting) to switch higher-power AC/DC loads such as lights, motors, fans, pumps, and appliances.','Each relay provides Common (COM), Normally Open (NO), and Normally Closed (NC) terminals, and the module typically includes LED indicators showing when each relay is active. These modules are widely used in home automation, robotics, IoT systems, and embedded control projects to safely interface digital logic with real-world power circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771665804145-126747082.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 09:23:24'),
(296,'15.6inch DMG 19108 C156 05 WTC 2K HD',NULL,NULL,'DWIN Display',18400.00,'The DMG19108C156_05WTC is a 15.6-inch industrial-grade capacitive touch display with 2K Full HD (1920×1080) resolution, offering crystal-clear visuals, precise touch response, and durable performance. It’s designed for industrial automation, kiosks, digital signage, embedded systems, and smart HMI panels, ensuring high reliability and long operational life.','The 15.6inch DMG19108C156_05WTC is a commercial-grade capacitive touchscreen display featuring a 15.6-inch IPS panel with 1920×1080 (Full HD / 2K HD) resolution.','It’s designed for industrial automation, kiosks, digital signage, embedded systems, and smart HMI panels, ensuring high reliability and long operational life.',NULL,'products/1771656423499-689849427.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 12:38:39'),
(297,'DWIN Display 12.1inch DMG 12800 Y121 01 NC',NULL,NULL,'DWIN Display',11500.00,'The DMG12800Y121_01NC is a 12.1-inch industrial-grade TFT LCD module featuring a 1280×800 high-resolution display.\r\nDesigned for industrial control systems, embedded devices, and automation panels, this non-touch display provides sharp visuals, wide viewing angles, and long-life reliability in demanding environments.','The 12.1inch DMG12800Y121_01NC is a 12.1-inch 1280 × 800 pixel TN-TFT LCD display with a capacitive touch panel, designed for HMI (Human-Machine Interface) and commercial display applications','Designed for industrial control systems, embedded devices, and automation panels, this non-touch display provides sharp visuals, wide viewing angles, and long-life reliability in demanding environments.',NULL,'products/1771654467690-783620073.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 13:29:02'),
(298,'1CH 5V Relay Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,399.00,'1CH 5V Relay Module is a small control board with a single 5 V-powered electromechanical relay that lets a low-voltage logic signal from a microcontroller (like Arduino, ESP32, PIC, AVR, or Raspberry Pi with level shifting) switch a higher-power AC or DC load such as lights, motors, fans, or appliances','COM (Common), NO (Normally Open), and NC (Normally Closed) terminals for flexible switching.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771658564731-31985365.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-25 12:38:52'),
(299,'DWIN Display 10.4inch DMG 80600 C104 01 WTR',NULL,NULL,'Display',9350.00,'The DMG80600C104_01WTR is a 10.4-inch industrial-grade TFT LCD module with a resistive touch panel and 800×600 pixel resolution.\r\nIt is designed for industrial control, HMI systems, embedded devices, and automation displays, offering long-term stability, clear visibility, and responsive touch performance even in harsh environments.','The DMG80600C104_01WTR is a 10.4-inch industrial LCD display module featuring a 800 × 600 (SVGA) resolution TN-TFT panel with capacitive touch support, ideal for human-machine interfaces (HMI) and embedded systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771650492964-657597956.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 12:48:59'),
(300,'10.1 Inch Display (Beauty Grade)','DMG10600Y101-01NC',NULL,'DWIN Display',9000.00,'10.1 Inch Display (Beauty Grade) refers to a high-quality LCD screen that offers superior visual clarity, brightness, and color accuracy compared to standard-grade panels. The term “Beauty Grade” generally indicates better panel finishing, fewer surface defects, improved viewing angles, and enhanced display uniformity','The DMG10600Y101-01NC is a 10.1-inch low-cost LCD display module (Beauty Grade) featuring a 1024 × 600 (WSVGA) resolution panel with 16.7 million colors.','Beauty Grade displays typically support resolutions such as 1024×600 or 1280×800 pixels, delivering sharp text and clear images. They often feature higher brightness levels and better contrast ratios for improved readability, even in well-lit environments.',NULL,'products/1771650284146-21655714.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 11:57:03'),
(301,'DMG 10600 C101_03 WTC 10.1 inch CAP',NULL,NULL,NULL,9750.00,'The DMG10600C101_03WTC is a 10.1-inch industrial-grade TFT LCD display module with a capacitive multi-touch panel and 1024×600 pixel resolution.It delivers crisp visuals, smooth touch performance, and long-term reliability, making it perfect for HMI systems, industrial automation, IoT terminals, and embedded display applications.','An industrial-grade 10.1inch capacitive touch IPS display with 1024 × 600 resolution, ideal for HMIs, embedded interfaces, and control panels',NULL,NULL,'products/1771905677060-209812562.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:01:17'),
(302,'10.1 Inch Resistive Touch Display ','DMG10600Y101 DMG10600Y101_01NR',NULL,NULL,7650.00,'10.1 inch resistive touch display is a touchscreen module that combines a 10.1-inch LCD screen with resistive touch technology, allowing users to interact with the display by applying pressure using a finger, stylus, or even while wearing gloves. The 10.1-inch size refers to the diagonal measurement of the screen, providing a clear and medium-sized viewing area suitable for industrial, medical, and embedded system applications.','The DWIN DMG10600Y101_01NR is a 10.1-inch low-cost TN-TFT LCD display with 1024×600 (WSVGA) resolution and resistive touchscreen overlay','These displays commonly use TFT LCD technology with resolutions such as 1024×600 or 1280×800 pixels. They are widely used in industrial control panels, POS systems, medical equipment, CNC machines, and HMI systems because of their durability and ability to operate in harsh environments.',NULL,'products/1771650239548-718334436.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 10:54:35'),
(303,'RFID MFRC522 13.6MHz',NULL,NULL,'RC522 Module',350.00,'The RC522 Module (MFRC522 RFID Module) is a low-cost RFID reader and writer module used for contactless communication with RFID cards and tags. It operates at a frequency of 13.56 MHz and can read or write data to compatible RFID cards such as MIFARE 1K, MIFARE S50, and other ISO14443A cards.','The RFID MFRC522 13.56 MHz module is a popular contactless RFID reader/writer based on the NXP MFRC522 chipset. It operates at 13.56 MHz (HF) and supports ISO/IEC 14443A standard RFID cards and tags such as MIFARE Classic.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771998565501-994398037.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 08:41:11'),
(304,'10.1 Inch HMI with Touch','DMG10600C101_15WTR',NULL,'HMI Display',12000.00,'The DMG10600C101_15WTR is a 10.1-inch commercial-grade HMI display module featuring a 1024×600 resolution and a resistive touch panel, designed for embedded systems, automation control, and interactive applications. It offers stable performance, responsive touch control, and cost-effective reliability—ideal for commercial-grade HMI and control panel solutions.','Industrial-grade 10.1inch resistive touch HMI display with 1024×600 resolution, RS232/RS485 communication, and SD interface — good for automation and control systems.','A 10.1 inch HMI (Human Machine Interface) with touch is an industrial display panel used to interact with machines, PLCs, and automation systems through a graphical touch screen interface. The 10.1-inch size refers to the diagonal measurement of the display, providing a clear and comfortable viewing area for monitoring data, controlling processes, and displaying system status.',NULL,'products/1771650174729-18423740.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 11:48:45'),
(305,'10.1 Inch Modbus TFT LCM (Industrial Grade)','DMG10600T101-A5WTC',NULL,NULL,15002.00,'The DMG10600T101-A5WTC is a 10.1-inch industrial-grade Modbus TFT LCM (Liquid Crystal Module) featuring a 1024×600 resolution and capacitive multi-touch control. It supports Modbus RTU/TCP communication protocols and is designed for industrial HMI, PLC integration, and automation control systems, providing reliable performance, high visibility, and long service life.','10.1inch Modbus TFT LCM — DMG10600T101-A5WTC is an industrial-grade, embedded HMI display featuring a 10.1-inch IPS TFT screen (1024×600) with capacitive touch and rugged design','A 10.1 Inch Modbus TFT LCM (Industrial Grade) is a robust industrial display module designed for machine control and monitoring applications. TFT LCM stands for Thin Film Transistor Liquid Crystal Module, which provides clear images, stable performance, and long operational life.',NULL,'products/1771650337969-873160550.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 10:54:27'),
(306,'RFID NSK 125KHz',NULL,NULL,NULL,850.00,'The RFID NSK 125KHz is a low-frequency RFID reader module designed for reading passive RFID cards and tags operating at 125 KHz. It is widely used for access control systems, attendance tracking, security systems, and automation projects','The RFID NSK 125 kHz is a low-frequency contactless RFID reader used for identification and access control applications. Operating at 125 kHz, it is compatible with common EM-based proximity cards and key tags such as EM4100 / EM4200.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771998586472-980939659.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:49:46'),
(307,'LORA E32 EBYTE SX1278 30D 433MHZ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1500.00,'The E32 EBYTE SX1278 30D (433 MHz) is a LoRa (Long Range) RF communication module based on the Semtech SX1278 chip, designed for long-distance, low-power wireless data transmission in the 433 MHz ISM band (license-free).','It uses LoRa spread spectrum technology for excellent range and interference resistance and communicates via a standard UART serial interface, making it easy to integrate with microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP32, STM32, and Raspberry Pi (via TTL/USB-serial).',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989191691-42947462.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:13:11'),
(308,'LORA E32 EBYTE SX1278 433MHZ 20D',NULL,NULL,NULL,1350.00,'Support advanced LoRa modulation , with the advantage of long-distance anti-interference \r\nUnder ideal conditions, the communication distance can reach 1km , and the transmission distance is better thanthat oftraditional G FSK','The Ebyte E32-433T20D-V8 (and similar 20 dBm versions) is a LoRa (Long Range) wireless RF module built around the Semtech SX1278 chipset, operating in the 433 MHz ISM band',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989210043-239861241.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:13:30'),
(309,'LORA Module RA02 on pcb',NULL,NULL,NULL,950.00,'Module Model: LoRa-RA-02, Input Supply Range: 2.5 ~ 3.7VDC, Interface: SPI, Programmable bit Rate: UP to 300Kbps\r\nAntenna Type: IPEX, Frequency Range: 410-525 MHz, Transmit Power: 18±1 dBm (Max), Operating Temperature: -10 to 85°C, LoRa Spread Spectrum modulation technology','An RA-02 LoRa module is a 433 MHz (or sub-GHz) LoRa transceiver based on the Semtech SX1278 RF chip. It uses LoRa spread spectrum modulation for long-range and low-power wireless data communication with strong resistance to interference',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989228777-438000570.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:13:48'),
(310,'LORAWAN GPS LILYGO 433MHZ',NULL,NULL,NULL,3750.00,'Integrated ESP32 board with 433 MHz LoRa and GPS (NEO-M8N) support, ideal for building LoRaWAN GPS trackers and long-range IoT nodes (as noted on product pages — ESP32 + LoRa + GPS all on one board)','Popular LilyGO T-Beam variant for Meshtastic and LoRa mesh networking using 433 MHz LoRa + ESP32. Typically includes Wi-Fi/Bluetooth and is great for low-power wireless messaging networks',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989346221-199299437.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:15:46'),
(311,'HELTEK ESP32 LORA with OLED',NULL,NULL,NULL,2500.00,'This product is based on the WIFI Kit 32 added SX1278 chip, that is, LoRa remote modem, 433MHz frequency, about -148dBm high sensitivity, +20 dBm power output, high reliability, transmission distance (measured open area communication distance 2.6Km).','These are ideal for building LoRaWAN nodes, Meshtastic handhelds, sensor gateways, remote controllers, and other IoT devices where you want both communication and a local display.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910473992-718871956.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:21:13'),
(312,'LIDAR TF LUNA 8mtr',NULL,NULL,NULL,2500.00,'TF-Luna LiDAR 8 m Time-of-Flight distance sensor modules you can use for robotics, obstacle detection, UAV altitude sensing, level measurement, and other range detection projects','The TF-Luna LiDAR is a compact single-point distance sensor based on Time-of-Flight (ToF) laser ranging',NULL,NULL,'products/1771916105766-205167209.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:55:05'),
(313,'4G GSM SIM7000 +ESP32',NULL,NULL,NULL,5500.00,'VVM501 Module combines the features of ESP32 and 4G based on SIMCOM A7670C (upgraded to A7672 on newer boards) providing high speed wireless communication via 4G LTE, Wi-Fi and Bluetooth','These boards often also include onboard USB-to-serial, Li-ion battery support, microSD slots, and antenna connectors — making them ready for real-world IoT, telemetry, tracking, and remote sensing applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771821084395-656370157.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 04:31:24'),
(314,'ESP32-S3 zero Mini Development Board',NULL,NULL,NULL,600.00,'ESP32-S3 Zero Mini Development Board is a compact, low-cost microcontroller board powered by the ESP32-S3 dual-core processor, featuring 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi and Bluetooth LE connectivity','Designed for space-constrained IoT and embedded applications, it includes onboard USB-C for programming and power, ample GPIO pins for sensors and peripherals, and typically Flash memory + PSRAM for efficient code execution and data handling. It’s ideal for wireless IoT nodes, wearable devices, sensor hubs, and smart home projects, and can be programmed using Arduino IDE, ESP-IDF, or MicroPython.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908051213-865912523.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:40:51'),
(315,'ESP32-C3 Super Mini USB C - Development Board',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'Compact & Lightweight – Fits into tight spaces without compromising performance\r\nWi-Fi 4 & Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) – Reliable wireless communication for IoT applications','The ESP32-C3 Super Mini USB-C Development Board is a compact and feature-rich microcontroller board based on the ESP32-C3 RISC-V core, offering 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi and Bluetooth LE 5.0 connectivity.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908000210-981954484.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:40:00'),
(316,'ESP 8266-01 Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,'NodeMCU is built based on the mature ESP8266 technology to take advantage the abundant resources available on the web.\r\n11 digital input/output pins, all pins have interrupt/pwm/12C/one-wire supported(except DO)','The ESP8266-01 is a small, low-cost Wi-Fi module based on the ESP8266 SoC that adds 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi connectivity to microcontroller projects',NULL,NULL,'products/1771907381281-167466989.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:29:41'),
(317,'ESP32 CAMERA MODULE',NULL,NULL,NULL,1999.00,'?Useful?The HK-ESP32-CAM-MB module is a small camera module with a size of 39.8MM*27MM,our esp32 cam can work independently as smallest system and also Support secondary development.','Versatile ESP32-CAM board with onboard micro USB (CH-340) for easy programming, Wi-Fi + Bluetooth, and 2 MP OV2640 camera — great for DIY IP camera, streaming, image capture, and IoT projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771907441232-205183993.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:30:41'),
(318,'ESP32 Development Board WiFi+Bluetooth 30 Pin',NULL,NULL,NULL,650.00,'ESP32 Development Board Wi-Fi + Bluetooth (30 Pin) is a compact microcontroller board based on the ESP-WROOM-32 module (dual-core Tensilica LX6), with built-in 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi and Bluetooth (Classic + BLE) for wireless connectivity','It exposes about 30 pins (GPIOs) including interfaces like ADC, DAC, PWM, UART, SPI, I²C, and capacitive touch, plus onboard USB-to-serial (CP2102/CH340) for easy programming and power through USB Type-C or Micro-USB. This makes it ideal for IoT sensors, automation, robotics, smart home nodes, and wireless communication projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771907487121-165507917.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:31:27'),
(319,'ESP8266-01 Base Board',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'Ready to use ESP-01 WIFI Board.\r\nOn board 3.3v regulator & power indicator LED.\r\nRx level converted to 3.3v , can be used directly with Arduino\r\nAll GPIO pins extended using berg pins .','The ESP8266-01 itself is a tiny Wi-Fi module with an integrated TCP/IP stack and 3.3 V Wi-Fi SoC that supports 802.11 b/g/n wireless networking and can be commanded via UART/serial or even programmed directly for standalone Wi-Fi tasks.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908144731-321088919.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:42:24'),
(320,'ESP32 Development Board WiFi+Bluetooth 38 Pin',NULL,NULL,NULL,650.00,'ESP32 Development Board (38-Pin) is a microcontroller board based on the ESP32 (ESP-WROOM-32) module with built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth (Classic + BLE) connectivity','It uses a dual-core 32-bit Tensilica LX6 processor running up to 240 MHz and integrates Wi-Fi 802.11 b/g/n and Bluetooth v4.2/BLE for wireless communication.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771907512796-35290061.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:31:52'),
(321,'NodeMCU Cp2102 ESP-12E WIFI Development Board',NULL,NULL,NULL,550.00,'The NodeMCU CP2102 ESP-12E WiFi Development Board is a popular open-source IoT development board based on the ESP8266 ESP-12E WiFi module, designed for easy prototyping and wireless application development. It integrates a powerful 32-bit microcontroller with built-in WiFi capability, allowing devices to connect directly to wireless networks and communicate with web servers, cloud platforms, and mobile applications','ESP8266-01 NodeMCU CP2102 WiFi Development Board is a development platform based on the ESP8266 Wi-Fi microcontroller (ESP-12E module) that integrates a CP2102 USB-to-serial converter, onboard 3.3 V regulator, and breadboard-compatible pin headers','The NodeMCU board operates at 3.3V logic level and features multiple GPIO pins along with communication interfaces such as UART, SPI, I2C, PWM, and ADC, making it suitable for connecting sensors, relays, displays, and other electronic components. It is programmable using Arduino IDE, Lua scripting, and MicroPython, making it beginner-friendly while still powerful enough for advanced IoT solutions.',NULL,'products/1771993117422-467939552.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:18:37'),
