(324,'7.0 Inch High Bright TFT (Industial grade)','DMG80480T070_09WTC',NULL,NULL,9800.00,'The DMG80480T070_09WTC is a 7-inch high-brightness industrial-grade TFT display featuring a capacitive multi-touch panel and 800×480 resolution (WVGA). It is designed for outdoor visibility, industrial control, HMI systems, and embedded applications, offering superior brightness, durability, and 24/7 operational stability.','The DWIN DMG80480T070_09WTC is a 7.0-inch high-brightness industrial-grade TFT LCD display with a 800 × 480 (WVGA) resolution and 262K colors',NULL,NULL,'products/1771824923498-454402637.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 05:35:23'),
