(555,'1 Cell Lithium Charger',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Charger',99.00,'1 Cell Lithium Charger is an electronic charging module designed to safely charge a single lithium-ion (Li-ion) or lithium-polymer (Li-Po) battery cell, which typically has a nominal voltage of 3.7 V and a full charge voltage of 4.2 V. It operates using a controlled charging method known as Constant Current/Constant Voltage (CC/CV), where the charger first supplies a steady current to the battery and then maintains a fixed voltage of 4.2 V while gradually reducing the current as the battery reaches full capacity.','This method ensures safe and efficient charging while preventing overcharging, overheating, and battery damage. Most 1-cell lithium chargers accept a 5 V input supply through USB or DC input and are commonly used in power banks, small electronic projects, robotics kits, portable devices, and 18650 battery applications. Many modules include built-in protection features such as over-current protection, short-circuit protection, thermal regulation, and charge status indicators (LED lights showing charging and full charge status).','It is important to use the correct charging current, usually around 0.5C to 1C of the battery capacity, to maintain battery health and extend lifespan. Proper polarity connection (positive to B+ and negative to B–) must be ensured during installation. In system operation, the charger may include a pre-charge phase for deeply discharged batteries, followed by constant current charging, constant voltage topping, and automatic charge termination when the current drops to a small threshold value.',NULL,'products/1771645452699-571354552.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 11:09:40'),
(556,'2 CELL LITHUIM CHARGER',NULL,NULL,NULL,399.00,'The 2-Cell Lithium Charger is designed for safely charging 2-series (2S) lithium-ion or lithium-polymer batteries, giving a regulated 8.4V charging output.','A 2-cell lithium charger is designed to safely charge two lithium batteries connected in series, giving a nominal 7.4 V and ~8.4 V when fully charged.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771658898738-395841499.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 07:28:18'),
(557,'3V BATTERY HOLDER',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 3V Battery Holder is a compact and durable coin-cell holder designed for standard 3V lithium batteries such as CR2032, CR2025, and CR2016.','A 3 V battery holder is a compact case designed to hold two AA or AAA batteries in series (each ~1.5 V) to produce ~3 V, with accessible terminals for easy wiring into electronic circuits, projects, or portable devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771670409963-416201174.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 10:40:09'),
