(728,'INMP441 Microphone Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'INMP441 is a high-performance, low-power I2S digital microphone module designed for accurate audio capture and voice recognition applications. Unlike traditional analog microphones, the INMP441 outputs data in digital I2S format, delivering cleaner audio with reduced noise and no need for an external ADC.','The INMP441 microphone module is a high-performance digital MEMS microphone with an I²S interface, designed for clear and accurate audio capture. It offers low noise, high sensitivity, and wide dynamic range, making it ideal for voice recognition, sound recording, smart devices, IoT projects, and ESP32/Arduino applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771912714833-71741351.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:58:34'),
(729,'TTP223 Touch Sensor Module',NULL,NULL,'TTP223 TOUCH MODULE',499.00,'The TTP223 Touch Sensor Module is a capacitive touch-based input device that replaces traditional push buttons with a modern, touch-sensitive surface. It uses the TTP223 IC to detect touch or proximity and outputs a digital signal when activated.','The TTP223 touch sensor module is a capacitive touch input module used to detect touch without mechanical buttons. It provides a digital output that changes state when touched, making it ideal for touch switches, control panels, home automation, and Arduino/ESP projects',NULL,NULL,'products/1772005996495-262126126.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 05:50:03'),
(730,'ZMCT103C 5A AC Current Sensor Transformer Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,799.00,'ZMCT103C 5A AC Current Sensor Module is a compact, high-precision current transformer module used to measure AC currents up to 5A. It provides an isolated and safe method to sense AC loads by converting the current into a small, proportional voltage signal.','The ZMCT103C 5A AC current sensor transformer module is used for non-invasive AC current measurement. It can sense AC currents up to 5A and provides an isolated analog output proportional to the current, ensuring safe measurement.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772015761596-485295803.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 10:36:01'),
(731,'A4988 Stepper Motor Driver',NULL,NULL,'A4988 Module',499.00,'A4988 Stepper Motor Driver is a compact and powerful microstepping driver designed to control bipolar stepper motors with high precision and smooth operation. It can drive a stepper motor in full, half, quarter, eighth, and sixteenth microstepping modes, allowing finer movement control for CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and automation projects.','The A4988 stepper motor driver is a compact microstepping driver module used to control bipolar stepper motors. It supports up to 1/16 microstepping, providing smooth and precise motor movement.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771830583267-549455570.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 04:14:47'),
(732,'TB6612FNG Dual Motor Driver Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'TB6612FNG Dual Motor Driver Module is a high-efficiency motor driver used to control two DC motors independently with excellent power handling and low heat generation. It offers better performance than the classic L298N driver, providing higher current output, lower voltage drop, and quieter motor operation.','It supports high-current output with low power loss, making it ideal for robotics, smart cars, and microcontroller-based projects. The module features direction control, PWM speed control, low standby power, and built-in thermal protection, ensuring smooth and reliable motor operation with Arduino, ESP, and similar controllers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772004315999-543376606.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:25:16'),
(733,'16-Channel 12-bit PWM Servo Motor Driver',NULL,NULL,NULL,799.00,'16-Channel 12-bit PWM Servo Motor Driver Module is a powerful and flexible controller designed for driving multiple servos or LEDs with precise timing and smooth movement. It is based on the popular PCA9685 PWM driver IC, which communicates using the I2C interface, allowing easy control using Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and other microcontrollers.','The 16-Channel 12-bit PWM Servo Motor Driver is a dedicated controller used to drive up to 16 servo motors or LEDs with precise timing. Based on an I²C interface, it provides 12-bit resolution (4096 steps) for smooth and accurate control, independent of the microcontroller’s PWM pins. Commonly used in robotics, robotic arms, hexapods, RC projects, and Arduino/Raspberry Pi systems, it ensures stable performance with minimal CPU load.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771657005839-739479998.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 06:56:45'),
(734,'L9110 Motor Driver',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'L9110 Motor Driver Module is a compact and efficient dual-channel motor driver designed to control small DC motors and geared motors with ease. It provides smooth bidirectional control (forward and reverse) for two independent DC motors, making it ideal for robotics, smart cars, DIY projects, and small mechatronic systems.','It supports forward and reverse direction control with simple digital inputs and operates at low voltage, making it ideal for small robots, toy cars, and Arduino-based projects. The L9110 offers low power consumption, stable performance, and easy interfacing for basic motor control applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771914596992-593578085.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:29:56'),
(735,'MAX30102 Pulse Oximeter Heart Rate Sensor Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'MAX30102 is a high-precision biomedical sensor module designed to measure heart rate and blood oxygen levels (SpO?) using advanced optical sensing technology. It integrates two LEDs (red and IR), a photodetector, optics, and a powerful analog front end in a compact package, making it ideal for wearable health devices and fitness monitoring applications.','It combines red and IR LEDs with a photodetector and communicates via an I²C interface. Commonly used in health monitoring devices, wearable electronics, fitness trackers, and Arduino/ESP projects, it offers low power consumption, high sensitivity, and reliable physiological measurements.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989912046-474177606.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:25:12'),
(736,'MAX30100 heart rate sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'MAX30100 is an integrated pulse oximetry and heart-rate sensor module designed for accurate and real-time monitoring of heart rate and blood oxygen saturation (SpO?).','The MAX30100 heart rate sensor module is an integrated pulse oximeter and heart rate monitoring sensor that measures heart rate and blood oxygen saturation  using optical technology. It combines IR and red LEDs with a photodetector and communicates via an I²C interface.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989893847-479498699.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:24:53'),
(737,'HMC5883L Magnetic Field Sensor Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'HMC5883L is a high-precision 3-axis digital magnetometer module used to measure magnetic field strength and direction. It is widely used for electronic compass applications, navigation systems, robotics, mapping, and motion sensing. The sensor provides accurate heading data by detecting Earth’s magnetic field and outputting digital readings through the I2C interface.','The HMC5883L magnetic field sensor module is a 3-axis digital compass sensor used to measure the Earth’s magnetic field for heading and orientation detection. It communicates via an I²C interface and provides accurate X, Y, and Z axis magnetic data',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910628393-824907796.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:23:48'),
