(785,'Capacitive Soil Moisture Sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,799.00,'Capacitive Soil Moisture Sensor is a durable and corrosion-resistant sensor designed to measure the moisture content of soil for smart gardening and irrigation systems. Unlike traditional resistive moisture sensors, this sensor uses capacitive sensing technology, which eliminates the problem of metal corrosion and ensures long-term stable performance in wet environments.','Unlike resistive sensors, capacitive soil moisture sensors are corrosion-resistant because they do not rely on direct electrical contact with the soil. They provide more stable and long-term readings and are ideal for continuous monitoring. The sensor outputs an analog signal that varies with soil moisture, making it easy to interface with Arduino, ESP32, and other microcontrollers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771844417937-546260849.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 11:00:17'),
