(801,'IR Wireless TV Remote Control Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'IR Wireless TV Remote Control Module is a compact, easy-to-use infrared transmitter system designed to control TVs, set-top boxes, and IR-enabled devices. It uses a 38kHz IR LED transmitter and a compatible IR receiver module (optional) to send standard IR remote control commands. This module is widely used for DIY home automation, universal remote projects, robotics, and electronics learning kits.','IR Wireless TV Remote Control Module',NULL,NULL,'products/1771913976295-838439758.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:19:36'),
(802,'Raspberry Pi Camera Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,'Raspberry Pi Camera Module is a high-quality, compact digital camera designed specifically for Raspberry Pi boards. It connects directly to the Pi’s CSI (Camera Serial Interface) port, allowing fast image and video capture with low latency. Equipped with a high-resolution image sensor and fixed-focus lens, it delivers excellent performance for photography, video recording, computer vision, and AI-based applications.','This module is ideal for computer vision, surveillance, robotics, IoT, and DIY projects. It supports high-resolution images and full HD video, making it perfect for applications like motion detection, face recognition, time-lapse photography, and smart monitoring systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771997353535-962780053.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:29:13'),
(803,'CD2025CP',NULL,NULL,NULL,149.00,'The CD2025CP is a dual-channel (stereo) audio power amplifier IC designed for low-voltage audio amplification. It is capable of driving small speakers directly and is commonly used in radios, mini audio systems, TVs, and DIY audio amplifier projects.','This IC provides clear sound output with low noise and low distortion while requiring only a few external components. It supports stereo operation and can also be configured in bridge mode for higher output power, making it suitable for compact and cost-effective audio designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771844605769-337641934.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 11:03:25'),
(804,'Raspberry Pi Pico with Pre-Soldered Header Board',NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,'Raspberry Pi Pico with Pre-Soldered Header is a compact and powerful microcontroller board based on the RP2040 dual-core ARM Cortex-M0+ processor. This version comes with factory-soldered male headers, making it ready for immediate use on breadboards, jumper wires, and prototype circuits without any soldering required.','With 26 multifunction GPIO pins, flexible communication interfaces, and low-power operation, the Pico is perfect for embedded systems, IoT projects, robotics, automation, and electronics learning. It supports programming in MicroPython, C, and C++, offering both simplicity and performance.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771997428765-354772006.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:30:28'),
(805,'ESP32-CAM-MB Micro USB Download Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The ESP32-CAM-MB is a convenient USB-to-ESP32-CAM programming and power interface module designed to make uploading code to the ESP32-CAM quick and hassle-free. It includes an onboard CH340/CH9102 USB-to-Serial converter and a Micro USB port, eliminating the need for external FTDI programmers or jumper wires.','This module allows you to easily program and power the ESP32-CAM using a Micro-USB cable, eliminating the need for external USB-to-TTL converters or manual wiring. It features an onboard USB-to-serial interface and auto-boot circuitry, making firmware uploading simple and reliable through the Arduino IDE or other ESP32 tools.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908025432-41451300.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:40:25'),
(806,'USB to RS485 Converter Adapter',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The USB to RS485 Converter Adapter is a compact and reliable communication interface that allows a computer or laptop to communicate with RS485-compatible devices through a USB port. It is widely used for industrial automation, PLC communication, CNC machines, motor drivers, security systems, and long-distance sensor networks.','USB to RS485 Converter Adapter',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006634068-148951055.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:03:54'),
(807,'SMPS 5V 10 A',NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,'A 5V 10A SMPS (Switched Mode Power Supply) is a compact and highly efficient power unit designed to deliver a stable 5-volt DC output with a maximum current capacity of 10 amperes, making it suitable for a wide range of electronic applications. It features advanced switching technology, ensuring low power loss, fast response, and reliable voltage regulation even under varying load conditions.','This SMPS efficiently converts AC mains power into regulated 5V DC, offering high efficiency, low heat generation, and reliable performance. It includes built-in protections such as over-voltage, over-current, and short-circuit protection, ensuring safe operation for connected devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001460450-889303260.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:37:40'),
(808,'125khz RFID Proximity Card',NULL,NULL,NULL,399.00,'The 125kHz RFID Proximity Card is a contactless identification card commonly used for access control, attendance systems, security authentication, and RFID-enabled devices. It contains a passive RFID chip and coil antenna that allow it to be read by any standard 125kHz RFID reader without the need for physical contact or a power source.','The card is made from high-quality PVC material, ensuring durability, flexibility, and long service life. It does not require a battery and works by drawing power from the RFID reader’s electromagnetic field. The card is ideal for secure entry systems, attendance management, and identification applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771654843938-982585543.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 06:20:43'),
(809,'5V 60A SMPS',NULL,NULL,NULL,6999.00,'The 5V 60A SMPS (Switch Mode Power Supply) is a high-performance DC power source designed for applications that require stable, high-current 5-volt output. Built with advanced switching technology, this SMPS delivers up to 300W of continuous power with excellent efficiency and low heat generation.','This SMPS efficiently converts AC mains power into regulated 5V DC, ensuring high efficiency, low heat loss, and reliable continuous operation. It is built with a robust metal enclosure and includes multiple protection features to safeguard connected devices, making it ideal for demanding power requirements.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771823288919-828367677.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 05:08:08'),
