(818,'12V 2A SMPS',NULL,NULL,NULL,799.00,'The 12V 2A SMPS (Switch Mode Power Supply) is a compact and highly efficient power adapter designed to deliver a stable 12-volt DC output with a current capacity of 2 amps. With a power rating of 24W, this SMPS is suitable for powering small to medium electronic devices, LED products, communication equipment, and DIY projects.','This SMPS efficiently converts AC mains power into regulated 12V DC, offering good efficiency, low heat generation, and reliable performance. It includes basic protection features such as over-current and short-circuit protection, ensuring safe operation of connected devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771655109486-506297419.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 06:25:09'),
