(820,'Small Toy Motor (Yellow)',NULL,NULL,NULL,199.00,'The Small Toy Motor (Yellow) is a lightweight, low-voltage DC motor commonly used in hobby projects, DIY toys, school experiments, and small robotic mechanisms. Known for its compact size and reliable operation, this motor provides smooth rotation and is perfect for building simple vehicles, fans, windmill projects, and battery-powered models.','This lightweight motor operates on low DC voltage (typically 3V–6V) and is easy to power using batteries or adapters. Its small size, low cost, and simple two-wire connection make it ideal for beginners, students, and DIY hobbyists.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001440842-854679144.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:37:20'),
(821,'Big Toy DC Motors (Yellow)',NULL,NULL,NULL,299.00,'The Big Toy DC Motor (Yellow) is a powerful and durable DC motor designed for larger DIY toys, school projects, robotics, and motorized mechanisms. With a stronger build and higher torque than smaller toy motors, it is ideal for applications that require more power, such as robot cars, mechanical models, motorized machines, and science experiments.','This motor typically operates on 6V–12V DC, offering stronger rotation and better load handling. Its sturdy build and simple two-wire connection make it easy to use with batteries, switches, or motor driver modules. It is widely used in educational kits and DIY robotics.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771840341914-933047234.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 09:52:21'),
(822,'12V 6A SMPS',NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,'The 12V 6A SMPS (Switch Mode Power Supply) is a high-efficiency DC power unit designed to provide a stable 12-volt output with a current capacity of 6 amps. Delivering up to 72W of power, it is ideal for medium to high-power devices requiring reliable, noise-free, and continuous operation. Built with advanced switching technology, this SMPS ensures excellent voltage regulation, low ripple, and high efficiency under varying loads.','This SMPS efficiently converts AC mains power into regulated 12V DC, ensuring high efficiency, low heat generation, and reliable continuous operation. It features a durable metal enclosure with ventilation and built-in protection circuits for safe use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771655500064-996856566.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 06:31:40'),
(823,'BO Gear Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The BO Gear Motor (Battery Operated Gear Motor) is a lightweight, compact DC geared motor widely used in DIY robotics, school projects, and hobby electronics. It features an integrated gearbox that provides high torque at low RPM, making it ideal for driving small robot wheels, mini vehicles, and mechanical models.','This motor combines a small DC motor with a plastic gearbox to reduce speed and increase torque, making it ideal for driving wheels and small mechanisms. It typically operates on 3V–12V DC (most commonly 6V) and is easy to control using motor drivers or simple switches.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771842879968-779684705.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 10:34:39'),
(824,'19.5V 4.7A SMPS',NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,'The 24V 3.5A SMPS (Switch Mode Power Supply) is a compact, efficient, and reliable DC power source designed to deliver a stable 24-volt output with a current capacity of 3.5 amps','This SMPS efficiently converts AC mains power into regulated 19.5V DC, offering high efficiency, low heat generation, and reliable performance. It includes built-in protection features such as over-voltage, over-current, and short-circuit protection, ensuring safe operation for connected devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771658457654-665158759.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 07:20:57'),
(825,'24V 3.5A SMPS',NULL,NULL,NULL,3299.00,'The 24V 3.5A SMPS (Switch Mode Power Supply) is a compact and efficient power unit designed to deliver a stable 24-volt DC output with a current capacity of 3.5 amps. With a total power rating of 84W, this SMPS is ideal for powering medium-power industrial devices, controllers, sensors, and LED applications. It uses advanced switching technology to ensure high efficiency, low heat generation, and reliable long-term performance.','This SMPS efficiently converts AC mains power into regulated 24V DC, providing high efficiency, low heat generation, and reliable continuous operation. It is built with a durable metal enclosure and includes protection features such as over-current and short-circuit protection for safe use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771664897936-819996766.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 09:08:17'),
(826,'14V 3A SMPS',NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,'The 14V 3A SMPS is a switched-mode power supply designed to provide a stable 14V DC output with a current capacity of 3 amperes, suitable for medium-power electronic applications.','This SMPS efficiently converts AC mains power into regulated 14V DC, offering high efficiency, low heat generation, and reliable performance. It includes built-in protection features such as over-current and short-circuit protection, ensuring safe operation of connected devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771656011323-116381098.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 06:40:11'),
