(862,'SANYO SN-80 Remote',NULL,NULL,NULL,550.00,'SANYO SN-80 Remote is a reliable and easy-to-use replacement remote designed for Sanyo LCD/LED TVs. It features a comfortable ergonomic design, soft responsive keys, and precise signal transmission for smooth operation. The SN-80 requires no programming for most Sanyo TV models—simply insert the batteries and start using it instantly.','',NULL,NULL,'products/1772000462831-349319250.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:21:02'),
