(865,'VIDEOCON & SANSUI Remote',NULL,NULL,NULL,550.00,'V-2BG / S-2GG Universal TV Remote is a high-quality replacement remote designed for a wide range of CRT, LCD, and LED televisions. It features a user-friendly button layout with smooth key response, making it easy to navigate channels, adjust volume, and access menu settings effortlessly. The remote is built with durable materials and offers strong infrared transmission for reliable long-distance control. With a plug-and-play design, it does not require any setup—simply insert the batteries and start using it instantly.','',NULL,NULL,'products/1772007601666-822912305.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:20:01'),
