(869,'HUAYU RM-710R+ Remote',NULL,NULL,NULL,850.00,'HUAYU RM-710R+ Remote is a high-quality replacement remote control designed to work seamlessly with a wide range of LCD and LED televisions. Built with durable materials and responsive soft-touch keys, it ensures smooth navigation and easy access to all essential TV functions including power, volume, channel selection, menu control, and input switching. The RM-710R+ is engineered for plug-and-play use, requiring no setup or programming for most compatible TV models.','',NULL,NULL,'products/1771911099543-654994082.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:31:39'),
(934,'8-PORT 10/100 Mbps Desktop Switch',NULL,NULL,NULL,1500.00,'8× 10/100Mbps Auto-Negotiation RJ45 port, supporting Auto-MDI/MDIX\r\nGreen Ethernet technology saves power\r\nIEEE 802.3X flow control provides reliable data transfer\r\nPlastic casing and desktop design','An 8-port 10/100 Mbps desktop switch lets you connect up to eight wired Ethernet devices (PCs, printers, cameras, etc.) within a local area network (LAN).',NULL,NULL,'products/1771829346134-897560229.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 06:49:06'),
(935,'HD-CVI/TVI/AHD video balun',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The HD-CVI/TVI/AHD Video Balun is a high-performance signal transmission device designed to send HD video signals over long distances using standard twisted-pair cables such as CAT5 or CAT6. Compatible with HD-CVI, HD-TVI, AHD, and traditional analog CCTV formats, it ensures excellent video quality without compression or delay','A video balun enables you to transmit analog HD CCTV video signals (such as AHD, HD-TVI, and HD-CVI) over twisted-pair cable (Cat5e/Cat6) instead of traditional coaxial wiring.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910224840-937039022.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:17:04'),
(936,'AHD/CVI/TVI/CVBS Video Balun',NULL,NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The AHD/CVI/TVI/CVBS Video Balun is a versatile and high-performance transmission device designed to send HD and analog CCTV video signals over long distances using CAT5/CAT6 twisted-pair cables. Compatible with multiple video formats—including AHD, HD-CVI, HD-TVI, and CVBS—it ensures stable, clear, and interference-free video quality without compression or delay.','A video balun converts video signals between unbalanced (coaxial) and balanced (twisted-pair) formats. This lets you transmit HD CCTV signals (AHD, HD-CVI, HD-TVI) and standard CVBS analog video over Cat5e/Cat6 network cables, often up to several hundred meters with minimal interference',NULL,NULL,'products/1771831217130-74814624.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 07:20:17'),
(937,'BTI CCTV Audio Mic',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The BTI CCTV Audio Mic is a high-sensitivity surveillance microphone designed to capture clear and crisp audio for CCTV and security systems. Built with a compact and durable housing, it is suitable for indoor installations and integrates easily with DVRs, NVRs, and standalone CCTV cameras that support audio input.','A CCTV audio microphone lets your surveillance system capture sound along with video, enhancing security monitoring and event analysis. BTI-branded mics are designed to work with analog and digital CCTV cameras, providing high sensitivity and clear audio pickup over moderate distances.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771844069397-530594997.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 10:54:29'),
(938,'Hdmi Extender',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'An HDMI Extender is a compact device designed to transmit high-definition audio and video signals over long distances without losing quality. Instead of using a standard HDMI cable (which typically supports only up to 10–15 meters), this extender uses Cat5e/Cat6 LAN cables to carry the HDMI signal up to 30m, 50m, 60m, 100m or more depending on the model.','An HDMI extender helps send HD audio and video signals from a source (like a set-top box, media player, gaming console, or PC) to a distant display (TV/monitor/projector) where a normal HDMI cable isn’t long enough',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910447855-211745372.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:20:47'),
(939,'7075 stepper motor-5v',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The 7075 stepper motor is a compact, 5-volt precision motor designed for applications that require accurate and repeatable motion control.','This motor operates on 5V DC and moves in fixed steps, allowing accurate control of rotation without feedback sensors. It is commonly used with driver boards (like ULN2003) and microcontrollers such as Arduino. Due to its small size and low power requirement, it is ideal for educational and DIY projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771825176472-312029196.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 05:39:36'),
(940,'7081-42SHT40-NEMA17-2.6KG Stepper Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,'The 7081-42SHT40-NEMA17-2.6KG is a NEMA-17 size hybrid stepper motor designed for precision motion control applications such as CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and automation equipment. It features a 42 mm frame size with a 40 mm body length and delivers a holding torque of approximately 2.6 kg-cm, providing accurate positioning and stable low-speed performance.','This motor operates using step pulses, typically with a 1.8° step angle (200 steps per revolution), allowing precise control without feedback systems. Built as a 2-phase brushless motor, it offers reliable operation, long service life, and excellent response to start, stop, and reverse commands.','The motor includes a standard 5 mm shaft for easy coupling with gears or pulleys and is commonly driven using stepper drivers like A4988, DRV8825, or TB6600 for smooth motion control.',NULL,'products/1771825392846-874011352.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 05:43:12'),
(941,'NEMA17-4.4KG Stepper Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,'The NEMA17 4.4 kg·cm stepper motor is a high-torque, precision-controlled motor widely used in 3D printers, CNC machines, robotics, and automated mechanisms.','NEMA17-4.4KG Stepper Motor is a high-torque bipolar stepper motor commonly used in 3D printers, CNC machines, robotics, and automation projects. It delivers around 4.4 kg·cm holding torque, providing precise position control and smooth motion.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992861720-498368293.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:14:21'),
(942,'NEMA 23-10.1KG Stepper Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,'The NEMA 23 10.1 kg·cm stepper motor is a robust, high-torque motor designed for demanding industrial and automation applications.','NEMA 23-10.1KG Stepper Motor is a powerful high-torque stepper motor designed for CNC machines, automation systems, engraving machines, and industrial motion control applications. It offers approximately 10.1 kg·cm holding torque, making it suitable for driving heavier loads with excellent accuracy and stability.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992633642-884141613.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:10:33'),
(943,'NEMA 23-18.9KG Stepper Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,3499.00,'The NEMA 23 18.9 kg·cm stepper motor is a high-torque, industrial-grade motor built for applications that require powerful and precise motion control.','NEMA 23-18.9KG Stepper Motor is a high-torque stepper motor built for heavy-duty CNC machines, automation equipment, laser cutters, and industrial motion control systems. It delivers an impressive 18.9 kg·cm holding torque, making it ideal for applications that require strong load handling, high precision, and stable performance.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992664903-304964693.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:11:04'),
(944,'301-Rasberry -pi',NULL,NULL,NULL,15499.00,'301 – Raspberry Pi is a compact single-board computer widely used for learning programming, electronics projects, IoT applications, home automation, and prototyping. It supports popular operating systems like Raspberry Pi OS and Linux, and comes with USB ports, HDMI output, GPIO pins, Wi-Fi/Bluetooth (model-dependent), and microSD storage support.','This board is ideal for students, hobbyists, and developers who need an affordable yet powerful platform for coding, hardware interfacing, media centers, and embedded projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771668313426-848793689.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 10:05:13'),
(945,'302 -Rasiberry -pi-zero-w',NULL,NULL,NULL,3899.00,'302 – Raspberry Pi Zero W is a compact and low-power single-board computer designed for IoT projects, embedded systems, robotics, and DIY electronics. It features built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth, a 1GHz single-core processor, and GPIO support for easy hardware interfacing.','With its small form factor and low energy consumption, the Raspberry Pi Zero W is ideal for portable projects, smart devices, automation, and learning Linux-based programming at an affordable cost.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771668387377-251183968.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 10:06:27'),
(946,'305-pico',NULL,NULL,NULL,2100.00,'305 – Raspberry Pi Pico is a microcontroller development board based on the RP2040 dual-core ARM Cortex-M0+ processor, designed for embedded systems, IoT prototypes, robotics, and electronics learning. It features flexible GPIO pins, PWM, ADC, UART, SPI, and I²C support, making it easy to interface with sensors, displays, and modules.','The Raspberry Pi Pico is ideal for real-time control applications, offering low power consumption, fast performance, and support for MicroPython and C/C++, making it perfect for both beginners and advanced developers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771668828506-61733900.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 10:13:48'),
(947,'Tauren Gear Motor 100RPM',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'Tauren Gear Motor 100RPM is a high-torque DC gear motor designed for robotics, automation, DIY projects, and small machinery. With a stable 100 RPM speed, it provides a good balance between speed and torque, making it suitable for applications like robot wheels, conveyor models, line-following robots, and actuator mechanisms.','This motor is known for its durable metal gear system, smooth operation, and reliable performance, and it works well with common motor drivers and power supplies used in educational and hobby electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772004117495-992669584.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:21:57'),
