(949,'4535-NODEMCU CH340 BASE',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'4535 – NodeMCU CH340 Base is a convenient expansion and mounting board designed specifically for NodeMCU (ESP8266) development boards with the CH340 USB-to-serial interface. It provides a stable base, easy pin access, and simple power connectivity, making development and testing more convenient.','This base board allows quick plug-and-play setup, supports external power input, and helps protect the NodeMCU from short circuits during prototyping. It is ideal for IoT projects, firmware testing, and ESP8266 application development.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771673026176-337179268.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 11:23:46'),
