(995,'BERGER Silk Glamor Luxury Interior Emulsion',NULL,NULL,NULL,2.00,'Berger Silk Glamor Luxury Interior Emulsion is a premium interior wall paint formulated with advanced acrylic emulsion technology to provide a rich, silky smooth and high-sheen finish. Designed for modern interiors, it enhances wall appearance with a glossy, elegant look while maintaining long-lasting colour brightness.','The paint uses Crystal Reflective Technology, which improves adhesion and gives walls a smooth and luxurious surface. It also forms an elastomeric protective film that helps cover minor hairline cracks and improves durability. The product is low in VOC, free from added APEO and formaldehyde, and produces minimal odour, making it suitable for residential and commercial indoor spaces.','With excellent washability and stain resistance, Berger Silk Glamor keeps walls clean and fresh for years while offering a wide range of colour shades for decorative interiors.',NULL,'products/1771840029604-885121548.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 09:47:09'),
