(1182,'Power Adapter 12v 2A','12v 2A',NULL,NULL,450.00,'Reliable Power Delivery : Keeps your devices running smoothly with a stable 12V 2A output, perfect adapter for uninterrupted performance in CCTV cameras, LED strips, and routers. Universal Compatibility : Ideal for LED TVs, monitors, set-top boxes, routers, water purifiers, and more. Designed to work with 12 Volt devices with a 2.5mm x 5.5mm jack.','Brand	LTRONIX\r\nConnector Type	Dc Barrel\r\nCompatible Devices	Cameras, Cctv, Monitors, Router, Television\r\nIncluded Components	Ac Dc Power Adapter',NULL,NULL,'products/1771996142726-278256802.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:09:02'),
(1191,'4056 3.7V Charging Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,199.00,'4056 3.7V Charging Module is a single-cell Li-ion / Li-Po battery charger designed for safely charging 3.7V lithium batteries such as 18650 cells.','It is based on the TP4056 IC and uses the CC/CV (Constant Current / Constant Voltage) charging method.\r\nThe module provides a regulated 4.2V charging output with adjustable charging current.','LED indicators show charging (RED) and full charge (BLUE/GREEN) status.',NULL,'products/1771672537513-832432007.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 11:15:37'),
(1209,'32',NULL,NULL,NULL,4900.00,'2?Inch Universal Android TV Motherboard SP35229E.5 with Bluetooth & Voice Remote: Premium for the category: supports Bluetooth, voice remote, designed for 32? size. \r\nAndroid TV Board Universal Motherboard S368A1.5 (1?GB/8?GB): Universal board for multiple sizes (32-inch among them) with 1GB RAM, 8GB storage spec. Good flexibility.','Ensure the board’s power supply matches your TV/panel. Voltage/current requirements must align.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771669138863-33512576.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:39:24'),
(1230,'12.1inch HDMI LCD Monitor with Touch Raspberry','PI:HDW121_001L',NULL,NULL,13800.00,'A 12.1inch HDMI LCD Touch Monitor like the HDW121_001L is a 12.1-inch touchscreen display designed for use with Raspberry Pi, Linux, Android, Windows, and other HDMI devices.','It provides a visual interface and touch control through HDMI for video and USB for touch input, making it ideal for embedded projects, DIY systems, kiosks, or portable monitoring setups.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771654508464-470068647.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 06:15:08'),
(1231,'15.6inch HDMI LCD Monitor with Touch Panel RASPBERRY PI',NULL,NULL,'Display',15600.00,'15.6-inch HDMI LCD monitor with touch panel designed for Raspberry Pi is a portable full-size display that supports both video input through HDMI and touch input through USB. The 15.6-inch size (measured diagonally) provides a large and clear viewing area, making it suitable for projects such as kiosks, embedded systems, industrial control panels, smart mirrors, portable PCs, and development setups. It commonly features Full HD resolution (1920×1080) with IPS technology, offering wide viewing angles, good color reproduction, and sharp image clarity.','It offers a Full HD (1920×1080) IPS panel with wide viewing angles and vibrant 16.7M color support, making it suitable for multimedia, dashboards, kiosks, and interactive embedded projects','This monitor connects to a Raspberry Pi using an HDMI cable for video output and a USB cable for touch functionality. Most models support plug-and-play operation with Raspberry Pi OS, Windows, and Linux systems. The touch panel is usually capacitive (multi-touch support), providing smooth and responsive interaction similar to a tablet. Some versions may include built-in speakers, audio output jack, and on-screen display (OSD) controls for brightness and contrast adjustment.',NULL,'products/1771656459932-887724987.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 12:40:23'),
(1237,'Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ Original ',NULL,NULL,NULL,4100.00,'Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ Built-in Broadcom 1.4GHz quad-core 64 bit processor with low energy on-board Wi-Fi Bluetooth and USB Port Built on the latest Broadcom 2837 ARMv8 64 bit processor, Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ is faster and more powerful than its predecessors','Brand	Raspberry Pi\r\nCPU Socket	BGA 437\r\nCompatible Devices	Personal Computer\r\nRAM Memory Technology	LPDDR2\r\nCompatible Processors	Broadcom ARMv8',NULL,NULL,'products/1771997303403-981565827.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:28:23'),
(1244,'GESTURE SENSOR and  RGB APDS9600',NULL,NULL,NULL,1100.00,'The APDS-9600 is a compact digital sensor module that integrates Gesture Recognition, Proximity Detection, Ambient Light, and RGB Color Sensing in a single device.','It uses infrared and optical sensing to detect hand gestures (up, down, left, right), measure distance (proximity), and read ambient light intensity and RGB color values','This makes it ideal for touchless control, interactive projects, robotics, automatic lighting, and wearable interfaces',NULL,'products/1771908838041-890283485.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-05-02 08:27:10'),
(1258,'Voltage Sensor',NULL,NULL,'VOLTAGE SENSOR MODULE',499.00,'A Voltage Sensor is an electronic module used to measure the electrical voltage present in a circuit and provide a scaled-down, safe output to a microcontroller or data acquisition device','It typically uses a voltage divider or sensing chip to convert high voltages into a lower measurable range compatible with devices like Arduino, Raspberry Pi (via ADC), and other controllers','Voltage sensors help monitor battery levels, power supplies, and system voltages in automation, robotics, and electronics projects. They provide real-time voltage feedback for protection, display, logging, or control logic.',NULL,'products/1772008570113-71344083.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-20 10:23:33'),
(1261,'BMP 180 GY-68 Barometric Pressure Sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,410.00,'The BMP180 (GY-68) is a compact digital barometric pressure sensor module used to measure atmospheric pressure and temperature.','It communicates with microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP32, and Raspberry Pi using the I²C interface, making it easy to integrate into weather stations, altitude sensing projects, and environmental data logging systems','The sensor outputs digital data that can be read directly with standard libraries, offering good accuracy in a small, low-power package.',NULL,'products/1771840894866-700963360.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 10:01:34'),
(1292,'GY-30 BH1750FVI Digital Light Intensity Illumination Sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,500.00,'The GY-30 is a compact digital light intensity sensor module based on the BH1750FVI IC. It measures ambient light (lux) with high precision and outputs the data directly over I²C (two-wire digital interface)','This sensor is ideal for applications like automatic brightness control, light monitoring systems, photometry projects, and environment sensing in microcontroller platforms such as Arduino, ESP32, and Raspberry Pi.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771909818090-767137267.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:10:18'),
(1315,'LPC2148 ARM DEVELPOMENT KIT',NULL,NULL,NULL,4500.00,'The LPC2148 ARM Development Kit is an educational and prototyping board built around the NXP (formerly Philips) LPC2148 microcontroller, based on the ARM7-TDMI-S core','It’s designed for learning, experimenting, and building embedded applications, offering on-board peripherals, GPIOs, communication interfaces (UART, SPI, I²C), and easy programming/debugging support. This kit is suitable for embedded systems development, real-time control, interfacing sensors/actuators, and hands-on ARM programming projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989256241-356328193.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:14:16'),
(1316,'8051 NUVOTON LEARNER KIT',NULL,NULL,'8051 NUVOTON LEARNER KIT',2900.00,'The 8051 Nuvoton Learner Kit is an educational microcontroller development board built around a Nuvoton 8051-series MCU. It’s designed for beginners to learn 8051 architecture, programming, and embedded system interfacing.','The kit typically includes onboard peripherals, input/output interfaces, expansion ports, and example projects, making it ideal for hands-on learning in microcontroller fundamentals, digital I/O, timers, serial communication, and real-world interfacing.','It ideal for hands-on learning in microcontroller fundamentals, digital I/O, timers, serial communication, and real-world interfacing.',NULL,'products/1771829455540-444333294.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:11:49'),
(1317,'DISCOVERY STM32F072',NULL,NULL,NULL,3500.00,'The STM32F072 Discovery Kit is a development and evaluation board featuring the STM32F072 microcontroller from STMicroelectronics. It’s designed for rapid prototyping and learning with the ARM Cortex-M0 architecture, offering a range of onboard peripherals (USB, GPIOs, timers, ADC/DAC, communication interfaces) and easy connectivity for debugging and programming.','This board is widely used for embedded system development, USB applications, sensor interfacing, motor control, and low-power projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771905568561-525416869.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 03:59:28'),
(1318,'NUCLEO F072',NULL,NULL,NULL,2100.00,'The NUCLEO-F072 is a compact development board from STMicroelectronics based on the STM32F072 series ARM Cortex-M0 microcontroller.','It provides an affordable, user-friendly platform for prototyping and embedded development, featuring Arduino-compatible headers, ST morpho expansion pins, and integrated ST-LINK debugger/programmer. Ideal for learning, sensor interfacing, USB-based projects, and low-power embedded applications using the STM32 ecosystem.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771993712020-763907508.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:28:32'),
(1319,'DISCOVERY F407G',NULL,NULL,NULL,3250.00,'The Discovery F407G (STM32F407G-DISCOVERY) is an evaluation and development board from STMicroelectronics featuring the STM32F407VGT6 ARM Cortex-M4 microcontroller.','It provides a rich set of onboard peripherals (including sensors, audio codec, and connector headers), USB OTG, and integrated ST-LINK debugger/programmer, making it ideal for advanced embedded projects, DSP applications, real-time control, sensor interfacing, and high-performance IoT/robotics prototypes.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771905546830-326016448.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:02:21'),
