(1344,'8 Channel Relay module with GSM',NULL,NULL,'Relay Module',2998.00,'10 RELAY GSM board is designed on Renesas Microcontroller and SIM 800C SIMCOM GSM.','It supports all models SIM except JIO 4G LTE.\r\n\r\nIndividual relays can be controlled ON, OFF by sending SMS.','A 10 Relay GSM with DTMF Timer – 7 Input Trigger is an advanced remote control switching system used to control multiple electrical devices through a mobile network. This device contains 10 independent relay outputs, allowing users to turn ON or OFF up to ten electrical loads such as lights, motors, pumps, generators, or industrial equipment.',NULL,'products/1771649974947-677835842.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 10:54:01'),
(1349,'Audio Playback Board',NULL,NULL,'Audio Playback Board',2999.00,'An Audio Playback Board is an electronic module designed to play pre-recorded audio files such as MP3 or WAV from storage devices like microSD cards, USB drives, or onboard memory. These boards are commonly used in embedded systems and DIY electronics projects to add sound output without needing complex audio processing circuits.','Most audio playback boards include a built-in audio decoder IC, small amplifier section, and output pins for connecting directly to a speaker or to an external amplifier for louder sound.','Many modules support common audio formats such as MP3 and WAV, and can be controlled through push buttons, serial communication (UART), or microcontrollers like Arduino and ESP32. Some popular versions include compact boards with integrated amplifiers capable of directly driving small 3W or 5W speakers. They typically operate at 3.3V or 5V DC and are designed for low-power applications.',NULL,'products/1771835762101-574556691.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:04:04'),
(1361,'7 Inch PCAP Touch Panel I2C Interface 85% Transmittance',NULL,NULL,NULL,2250.00,'you’re referring to a 7-inch PCAP Touch Panel (Projected Capacitive Touch) with an I²C (Inter-Integrated Circuit) interface and 85% light transmittance — typically used for embedded displays, DWIN HMIs, Raspberry Pi projects, industrial panels, or custom touchscreen systems.','Touch Type	Projected Capacitive (PCAP)\r\nScreen Size	7.0 inch (diagonal)\r\nActive Area	~154.2 × 85.9 mm\r\nCover Glass	1.1–1.8 mm tempered glass\r\nTransmittance	~85% (light transmission through glass)\r\nTouch Points	5-point or 10-point (depends on controller)\r\nInterface	I²C (4-wire)\r\nController IC	GT911 / FT5426 / FT5206 / Goodix or similar\r\nSupply Voltage	3.3V (typical), some support 5V tolerant I/O\r\nOperating Current	~10–15 mA\r\nTouch Accuracy	±1 mm\r\nSurface Hardness	?6H\r\nOperating Temp.	-20°C to +70°C\r\nStorage Temp.	-30°C to +85°C',NULL,NULL,'products/1771824758053-628538098.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 07:40:45'),
(1373,'GSM Security Board with Battery & Cabinet',NULL,NULL,NULL,3500.00,'The main objective of GSM Based Home Security is to alert the owner by  SMS and Phone calling if any trespass in the security zones.','1 GSM Security Module with Antenna\r\n1 3.7V 3000mAh Battery\r\n1 Power Adapter 12v 2A \r\n1 NO type DOOR Sensor',NULL,NULL,'products/1771909578878-75127466.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:06:18'),
(1392,'Level Shifter 8 Way',NULL,NULL,NULL,240.00,'Raspberry Pi 8 channel Level Switching (3.5V to 5V) IO Module Logic Level Converter is able to convert signals from 5V down to 3.3V (and vice versa) meaning you can safely use 5V or 3.3V devices with the Raspberry Pi (compatible)','When Ax has TTL 3.3V input, Bx will get TTL 5V output\r\n    When Bx has TTL 5V input, Ax will get TTL 3.3V output\r\n    NO direction control required',NULL,NULL,'products/1771916032775-16064180.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:53:52'),
(1411,'NX8048K070 – Nextion 7.0 inchs HMI Touch Display',NULL,NULL,NULL,11000.00,'The NX8048K070 from the Nextion Enhanced Series is a 7.0-inch HMI (Human-Machine Interface) touch display module that comes with its own on-board microcontroller, GUI capability, and a serial (UART) interface.','Screen size: 7.0? diagonal with resolution 800 × 480 pixels. Visual/active area: ~ 154.08 mm × 85.92 mm (visual area) and module layout size ~ 181 mm × 108 mm × 9.3 mm.  Colours: 65K (65,536) colours. \r\nFlash storage: 32 MB for GUI data and resources. \r\nRAM: 8192 bytes (8 KB) for runtime.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771994139022-316949962.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 03:34:26'),
(1413,'Nextion Basic Display 7.0 inch Display',NULL,NULL,NULL,13500.00,'This display is part of the Nextion Basic Series, size 7.0?, resolution 800×480, with integrated touch and an onboard HMI controller. It’s designed to simplify GUI development: you design the UI in Nextion Editor, upload it to the display, and your host MCU just communicates via UART.','Resolution: 800 × 480 pixels. \r\nColour depth: 65K (65,536 colours). \r\nDisplay size: Layout roughly 181 mm × 108 mm × ~9 mm (for the version with touch) \r\nActive/Visual area: Visual area ~ 154.08 mm × 85.92 mm. \r\nTouch type: Resistive touch panel (for “011R” suffix variant) in this Basic Series model. \r\nSupply voltage: 4.75 V to 7 V recommended (typical 5 V',NULL,NULL,'products/1771993053595-189056081.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 03:44:22'),
(1414,'NX4024K032 – Nextion 3.2inch HMI Touch Display',NULL,NULL,NULL,7500.00,'This is the 3.2-inch “Enhanced Series” HMI touchscreen from Nextion (model NX4024K032). The “Enhanced” series means it’s a step up from their Basic line: more flash memory, IO/GPIO support, RTC support, etc.','Screen Size: 3.2? diagonal. \r\nResolution: 400 × 240 pixels. \r\nMemory: 16 MB of Flash (for UI/resources). \r\nRAM / EEPROM: 3 584 bytes RAM + 1 024 bytes EEPROM. \r\nInterface: TTL serial (4-pin XH2.54) for RX/TX + power.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771994003285-221713470.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 03:36:09'),
(1416,'NX4832K035 – Nextion 3.5inch HMI Touch Display',NULL,NULL,NULL,7800.00,'The NX4832K035 is a 3.5-inch (diagonal) HMI touch display module from the Nextion Enhanced Series. It’s not just a raw TFT + touch panel: it incorporates a built-in controller + flash storage + user I/O so you can design user interfaces (UI) using Nextion’s editor and interact over UART from a microcontroller.','Display resolution: 480 × 320 pixels. \r\nColour depth: 65K colours (16-bit, 5R-6G-5B). \r\nFlash memory: 32 MB for storing images, fonts and UI resources. \r\nRAM: 8192 bytes (8 KB) for variables, etc. \r\nEEPROM user storage: 1024 bytes.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771994109630-344422361.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 03:35:20'),
(1417,'NX3224K028 – Nextion 2.8 inch HMI Touch Display',NULL,NULL,NULL,8000.00,'The NX3224K028 is a 2.8-inch HMI (Human-Machine Interface) touchscreen module from the Nextion Enhanced Series. It’s more than just a display + touch panel: it includes a built-in controller, flash storage for UI data, and supports functions such as RTC, GPIO, etc.','A compact 2.8-inch Enhanced Series Human-Machine Interface (HMI) touch display with 320×240 TFT resistive touchscreen, designed for easy graphical interface control in embedded and IoT projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771993959042-808151769.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 03:36:45'),
(1423,'7',NULL,NULL,NULL,9500.00,'The 7-inch Capacitive Touch DSI Interface Display by Waveshare is a high-quality touchscreen designed specifically for Raspberry Pi boards.\r\nUsing the official DSI (Display Serial Interface) port, it ensures a smooth, plug-and-play experience with no HDMI cable required. The display supports multi-touch gestures, delivers 800×480 pixel resolution, and provides excellent color reproduction and wide viewing angles thanks to its IPS panel.','Display Size: 7.0 inches\r\nResolution: 800×480 pixels\r\nTouch Technology: 5-point capacitive touch\r\nInterface: DSI (Display Serial Interface)\r\nPower Supply: Powered via Raspberry Pi DSI port (no external power needed)\r\nDisplay Type: IPS LCD with vivid colors and wide viewing angles\r\nTouch Interface: Connected via I2C through DSI cable\r\nPlug & Play: No driver required for Raspberry Pi OS\r\nMounting: Compatible with Raspberry Pi 3B/3B+/4B/5 (mounted directly)\r\nCase/Stand Options: Optional acrylic or ABS case support (varies by kit)\r\nAdjustable Orientation: Supports screen rotation via Raspberry Pi config',NULL,NULL,'displays___raspberry_pi_displays/1766728550_49f4e1d07e37.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 06:29:51'),
(1427,'7',NULL,NULL,NULL,12000.00,'The 7-inch WaveShare HDMI Touch Display is a high-quality touchscreen designed for Raspberry Pi and other HDMI-compatible devices.\r\nIt features a 1024×600 pixel resolution panel with capacitive multi-touch support, providing smooth, smartphone-like touch control and vivid display performance.','Display Size: 7.0 inches\r\nResolution: 1024×600 pixels\r\nTouch Technology: Capacitive 5-point touch\r\nInterface: HDMI for display + USB for touch control\r\nPlug & Play: Works directly with Raspberry Pi (no drivers required)\r\nDisplay Type: IPS screen with wide viewing angle and vibrant colors\r\nMounting: Supports case mounting or stand use\r\nCompatibility: Raspberry Pi 5, 4, 3B+, 3, Jetson Nano, BeagleBone, and PCs\r\nPower Supply: 5V via USB\r\nOrientation: Supports screen rotation (horizontal or vertical)',NULL,NULL,'raspberry_pi_displays/1762409018_97c7ab48e46b.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 06:30:34'),
(1431,'7',NULL,NULL,NULL,7800.00,'The 7-inch HDMI Touch Display is a compact, high-resolution screen designed for Raspberry Pi and other HDMI-compatible boards. It features a 1024×600 IPS panel with capacitive multi-touch support, offering smooth touch response and vibrant color reproduction. Perfect for DIY projects, embedded systems, and portable computing setups.','Screen Size: 7 inches\r\nResolution: 1024×600 pixels\r\nTouch Type: Capacitive multi-touch (5-point)\r\nInterface: HDMI (video) + USB (touch)\r\nCompatibility: Raspberry Pi 5, 4, 3B+, Jetson Nano, BeagleBone, and PCs\r\nDisplay Type: IPS panel (wide viewing angle, vivid color)\r\nPower Input: 5V via USB',NULL,NULL,'raspberry_pi_displays/1762409682_61da6843adb9.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 06:30:42'),
(1432,'5-inch Raspberry Pi HDMI Touch Display',NULL,NULL,NULL,9100.00,'The 5-inch Raspberry Pi HDMI Touch Display is a compact and versatile capacitive touchscreen designed for Raspberry Pi and other HDMI-compatible boards.\r\nIt features an 800×480 resolution display with multi-touch support, offering clear visuals, responsive touch control, and plug-and-play connectivity via HDMI and USB.','Display Size: 5 inches\r\nResolution: 800×480 pixels\r\nTouch Type: Capacitive 5-point multi-touch\r\nInterface: HDMI for video + USB for touch\r\nPlug & Play: Works with Raspberry Pi OS, Ubuntu, Windows, and Android\r\nDisplay Type: IPS/TFT panel (wide viewing angle, bright colors)\r\nPower Input: 5V via USB\r\nCompatibility: Raspberry Pi 5, 4, 3B+, Jetson Nano, BeagleBone, and other HDMI devices\r\nOrientation: Landscape or portrait display rotation supported\r\n Mounting: Suitable for cases, enclosures, or standalone use',NULL,NULL,'products/1771821438031-844067607.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:41:13'),
(1441,'LCD 128X64 Graphical',NULL,NULL,NULL,1950.00,'The 128x64 Graphical LCD Display is a monochrome dot-matrix module ideal for displaying both text and graphics.With its 128×64 pixel resolution, it provides clear, crisp output suitable for embedded systems, industrial control panels, and DIY electronics.It uses a ST7920 or KS0108 compatible controller, making it easy to interface with Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and other microcontrollers.','Display Type	128×64 Graphic LCD\r\nController IC	ST7920 / KS0108\r\nResolution	128 × 64 pixels\r\nOperating Voltage	5V DC\r\nBacklight	LED (blue or white)\r\nDisplay Color	Monochrome',NULL,NULL,'products/1771914940534-275885517.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:35:40'),
(1512,'7 inch Touch DMG 80480 C070_04WTR ',NULL,NULL,NULL,2200.00,'The DMG80480C070_04WTR is a 7-inch industrial HMI touch display developed by DWIN for embedded control and automation applications. It features an 800×480 resolution TFT LCD with a resistive touch panel, providing reliable user interaction for industrial environments.','Powered by the DWIN T5L processor and DGUS II development system, the display allows easy GUI design without complex coding, making it suitable for rapid HMI development. The module supports TTL/RS232 communication, enabling direct connection with microcontrollers such as Arduino, STM32, PIC, and PLC systems.','Designed for commercial and industrial use, it offers stable performance, onboard flash storage for graphics and data, and convenient firmware download through SD card or serial interface, making it ideal for control panels, medical devices, smart equipment, and automation systems.',NULL,'products/1771824867245-791255269.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 07:41:32'),
(1513,'5 inch HD  Intelligent Display','DMG12720C050_03WTC',NULL,NULL,4500.00,'WIDE TEMPERATURE: Industrial LCD display screen could work at the temperature of ?20? to +70?, enables adapting various scenes.\r\nTOUCH MODE: This TFT LCD display screen can be matched with capacitive for more convenient .\r\nRESOLUTION AND VIEW ANGLE: The industrial LCD display module has 800x480 resolution, 70x70x55x70 angle of view, the display is clear and intuitive.','MULTI FUNCTION: The TFT screen can be used for security doorbell, vehicle products, industrial display, face recognition, handheld devices, smart home appliances, etc.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771821342734-7348397.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 04:35:42'),
