(1536,'4.3 inch High Bright Display : (Industrial grade)','DMG80480T043_09WTC',NULL,NULL,5200.00,'The 4.3-inch High Bright Industrial Display is a rugged TFT LCD module designed for industrial control, automation, and embedded systems. It offers high brightness for clear visibility even in outdoor or high-light environments','Built with industrial-grade components, the display provides stable performance, wide viewing angles, and reliable operation across extended temperature ranges. It is suitable for HMI panels, monitoring systems, medical devices, and automation equipment.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771671307287-961465354.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 10:55:07'),
(1537,'Dell 19.5V 3.34A DC: 4.5*3.0 Small Pin Laptop Adapter',NULL,NULL,NULL,1299.00,'The Techie 19.5V 3.34A Laptop Adapter (65W) with 4.5×3.0mm small pin connector is a high-performance, energy-efficient power charger designed for HP, Dell, and compatible laptops. It delivers stable 19.5V DC output, fast charging, and reliable protection, making it the perfect replacement or backup adapter for modern slim laptops.','Model	Techie 19.5V 3.34A Laptop Adapter\r\nInput Voltage	100–240V AC, 50–60Hz\r\nOutput Voltage	19.5V DC\r\nOutput Current	3.34A\r\nPower Output	65W\r\nConnector Type	4.5mm × 3.0mm Small Barrel Plug\r\nCable Length	Approx. 1.5–2 meters\r\nEfficiency	>85%\r\nProtection	Over-voltage, Over-current, Short-circuit, Over-temperature\r\nMaterial	High-quality ABS plastic casing\r\nWeight	~250 grams\r\nOperating Temperature	0°C to 50°C\r\nCategory	Laptop Power Adapter',NULL,NULL,'laptop__adaptor/1762842926_95a21be3450e.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 03:53:43'),
(1552,'Lenovo 20V 3.25A DC 4.0x1.7 Laptop Adaptor',NULL,NULL,NULL,1299.00,'The Techie 20V 3.25A Laptop Adapter (65W) with 4.0×1.7mm DC connector is a high-quality replacement charger built to deliver stable 20V DC output and safe, efficient charging for laptops such as Lenovo, Acer, and other compatible brands.','Model	Techie 20V 3.25A Laptop Adapter\r\nInput Voltage	100–240V AC, 50–60Hz\r\nOutput Voltage	20V DC\r\nOutput Current	3.25A\r\nPower Output	65W\r\nConnector Type	4.0mm × 1.7mm Barrel Plug\r\nCable Length	Approx. 1.5–2 meters\r\nEfficiency	>85%\r\nProtection	Over-voltage, Over-current, Short-circuit, Over-temperature\r\nMaterial	High-quality ABS plastic body\r\nWeight	~250 grams',NULL,NULL,'products/1771916226805-471413854.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:57:06'),
(1581,'Bmp180 barometric pressure sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The BMP180 Barometric Pressure Sensor is a high-precision digital sensor used to measure atmospheric pressure and temperature. Developed by Bosch, it communicates using the I²C interface, making it easy to connect with microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, and Raspberry Pi.','The sensor can calculate altitude based on pressure readings, making it ideal for weather monitoring and altitude measurement applications. With low power consumption, compact size, and accurate measurements, the BMP180 is widely used in IoT devices, drones, GPS systems, and environmental monitoring projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771841083702-183412206.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 10:04:43'),
(1582,'Typemate Pro Wired keyboard & mouse combo',NULL,NULL,NULL,995.00,'The Typemate Pro Wired Keyboard & Mouse Combo is a durable, plug-and-play desktop companion designed for comfortable typing and precise control.','Model	Typemate Pro Wired Keyboard & Mouse Combo\r\nKeyboard Type	Full-Size Wired Keyboard\r\nMouse Type	Wired Optical Mouse\r\nConnectivity	USB Plug-and-Play\r\nKeyboard Cable Length	Approx. 1.5 meters\r\nMouse Cable Length	Approx. 1.3 meters',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006117243-12193199.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:55:17'),
(1583,'Zeb Judwaa 555 keyboard & Mouse Combo',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'The Zebronics Judwaa 555 Wired Keyboard & Mouse Combo is a durable and ergonomic desktop solution designed for smooth typing and precise navigation.','Model	Zebronics Judwaa 555\r\nKeyboard Type	Full-size Wired Keyboard\r\nMouse Type	Wired Optical Mouse\r\nConnectivity	USB (Plug & Play)\r\nKeyboard Cable Length	Approx. 1.5 meters\r\nMouse Cable Length	Approx. 1.2 meters',NULL,NULL,'products/1772015726670-735635508.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 10:35:26'),
(1585,'RFID 125KHz pcb v2',NULL,NULL,NULL,480.00,'This RF ID pcb has RF coil oscillator coil on board and has TTL Rx/Tx interface.\r\nYou can easily connect it with a Microcontroller to receice Data.\r\nOperating frequency is 125KHz.','RFID 125KHz pcb v2',NULL,NULL,'products/1771998110591-751308204.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:41:50'),
(1629,'USB to RS232 Converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,1200.00,'The USB to RS232 Converter is a reliable USB-to-Serial adapter that allows modern computers without serial ports to communicate with RS232 devices.','The adapter uses a high-quality USB-serial chipset (Prolific/CH340/FTDI depending on model) for stable and error-free communication.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006614422-192633619.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:03:34'),
(1638,'74CH595',NULL,NULL,'74CH595 IC',99.00,'The 74HC595 is an 8-bit serial-in, parallel-out shift register IC widely used to expand digital output pins in microcontroller and digital logic applications. It allows multiple outputs to be controlled using only a few input pins by shifting data serially and then outputting it in parallel.','The IC includes an internal storage register and output latches, enabling stable and synchronized output control. Operating at high speed with low power consumption, the 74HC595 is commonly used for driving LEDs, seven-segment displays, relays, and other digital loads in Arduino, robotics, and embedded systems projects.','74HC595 is commonly used for driving LEDs, seven-segment displays, relays, and other digital loads in Arduino, robotics, and embedded systems projects.',NULL,'products/1771825716010-710675644.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 07:53:47'),
(1643,'MQ-4 Gas Methane Sensor only',NULL,NULL,NULL,199.00,'MQ-4 Gas Sensor is a highly sensitive methane (CH?) detection sensor commonly used for gas leakage detection, safety monitoring systems, and industrial applications. It is specifically designed to detect methane with good accuracy, along with other natural gases such as CNG and LPG in smaller concentrations.','sensor operates using a SnO? (tin dioxide) semiconductor material whose resistance drops when exposed to methane gas. This change in resistance is converted into an analog voltage output that can be easily read by microcontrollers like Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP8266, and PIC.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771991374808-206418600.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:49:34'),
(1671,'12V Water Pump Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,399.00,'12V Water Pump is a compact and efficient DC-powered pump designed for water transfer, circulation, cooling, and small-scale fluid movement applications. Operating on 12V DC, it is safe, energy-efficient, and suitable for a wide range of DIY, hobby, and practical uses.','Pump features a quiet and reliable motor capable of providing a steady water flow for projects such as mini fountains, aquarium systems, hydroponics, water cooling setups, model building, and home automation projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771655619661-393747003.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 06:33:39'),
(1697,'DVD Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,149.00,'DVD Motor is a compact, high-speed DC motor commonly used in DVD players, CD drives, and small electronic mechanisms. Designed for smooth and precise rotation, this motor is capable of spinning discs at stable and controlled speeds, making it suitable for various DIY and hobby applications.','DVD motors typically operate on 3V–12V DC and are known for their low noise, high RPM, and lightweight design.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771906281557-176379400.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:11:21'),
(1703,'40 MM BO/TT SLIMEST WHEEL',NULL,NULL,NULL,39.00,'The 40mm BO/TT Slimmest Wheel is an ultra-thin, lightweight wheel designed for BO and TT DC gear motors.','The 40mm Slimmest Wheel is specially designed to fit standard BO motors and TT gear motors, offering an extremely narrow profile that reduces friction and allows for sharp turning and precise control.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771672365583-864172715.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 11:12:45'),
(1709,'BF494',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The BF494 is a high-frequency NPN bipolar junction transistor specially designed for radio frequency (RF) amplification and oscillator circuits. It provides stable performance at high frequencies, making it suitable for FM transmitters, RF amplifiers, and signal processing applications.','The transistor offers low noise operation, good gain characteristics, and reliable switching performance. Packaged in a compact TO-92 through-hole case, the BF494 is widely used in communication equipment, tuner circuits, and general high-frequency electronic designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771840182113-888533831.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 09:49:42'),
(1724,'RED BLACK WIRE',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The Red & Black Wire (1 Meter) is a flexible 2-core power cable ideal for DC power supply wiring, battery connections, LED strip installation, robotics, and general electronics projects.','The Red & Black Wire (1 Meter) is commonly used for low-voltage DC circuits, providing a convenient and safe way to connect components while maintaining proper polarity.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771997519072-776683289.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:31:59'),
(1874,'Joystick Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The KY-023 Dual Axis Joystick module uses a uses a biaxial potentiometer to control the X and Y axis. When pushed down, it activates a switch. Based on the PS2 controller’s joystick, it’s used to control a wide range of projects from RC vehicles to color LEDs.','This module consists of two 10k? potentiometers perpendicularly placed to control the X and Y axes by changing resistance when moving the joystick. A push button is activated when the joystick is pushed down on the Z axis. It has 5 male header pins.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771914201997-88526374.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:23:22'),
(2011,'LLOYD Dk 25 tv remote','DK 25',NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Lloyd DK-25 Remote is a dedicated original/replacement remote for Lloyd LED TVs that support the DK-25 remote code. It provides full control of TV functions like power, volume, channel, input source, picture/sound menu, and multimedia keys. Works instantly with compatible Lloyd TV models—no setup needed.','support to LLOYD tv',NULL,NULL,'products/1771916386974-974062225.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:59:46'),
