(2061,'Airtel DTH Remote',NULL,NULL,'Airtel DTH Remote',499.00,'The Airtel DTH Remote is a handheld remote control device used to operate the set-top box of Airtel Digital TV, a direct-to-home (DTH) television service in India. It allows users to control various functions such as changing channels, adjusting volume, accessing the program guide, navigating menus, recording programs (on supported models), and managing settings. The remote typically works using infrared (IR) technology, which communicates with the set-top box when pointed directly at it.','The remote typically works using infrared (IR) technology, which communicates with the set-top box when pointed directly at it.','The remote usually operates on AAA batteries (2 pieces) and is designed for easy handling with clearly labeled buttons for user convenience. It is an essential accessory for controlling the Airtel Digital TV set-top box and enhancing the overall home entertainment experience.',NULL,'products/1771831320583-464790405.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:24:59'),
