(2267,'25W-230V Soldron',NULL,NULL,'Soldering',499.00,'The Soldron 25 W/230 V soldering iron is a basic electric soldering tool designed for soldering tasks in electronics, electrical work, and small DIY projects. ','Product: Soldron 25 Watt/230 Volt Soldering Iron (and equivalents from similar listings)\r\nType: Electric soldering iron tool for electronics and general soldering.\r\nPower: 25 Watt — moderate power ideal for light-to-medium electronics soldering work.\r\nVoltage: Designed for 230 V AC mains (standard in India and many other countries).\r\nMaximum Temperature: Around ~380 °C at the tip. \r\nColor: Typically yellow handle.','It’s one of the most popular entry-level soldering irons in India and other regions using 230 V mains.',NULL,'products/1772625072225-810307892.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:51:12'),
(2269,'Soldron',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Soldron 25 W – 230 V soldering iron is a basic electric soldering tool designed for general-purpose soldering tasks. It’s a popular choice among engineers, hobbyists, students, and technicians because it’s simple, reliable, and easy to use.','The Soldron 25 W / 230 V soldering iron is a basic, fixed-temperature electric soldering tool widely used for general electronics and electrical soldering tasks. Soldron is a well-known Indian brand in soldering and desoldering tools, trusted for decades in workshops, labs, and hobbyist applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001899487-355462891.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:44:59'),
(2270,'soldron kit',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Soldron Soldering and Desoldering Kit is a complete electronics toolset designed to help you solder and remove solder from printed circuit boards (PCBs) and electrical components. It’s ideal for hobbyists, students, repair technicians, and anyone working with electronics. The Soldron Soldering and Desoldering Kit is a complete electronics toolset designed to help you solder and remove solder from printed circuit boards (PCBs) and electrical components. It’s ideal for hobbyists, students, repair technicians, and anyone working with electronics.','The Soldron Soldering and Desoldering Kit is a comprehensive electronics toolset designed for both soldering and desoldering tasks. It’s suitable for beginners, hobbyists, technicians, and anyone working on PCB assembly, repair, or small electrical projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001936070-238488776.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:45:36'),
(2271,'SMPS Soldering Station',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'An SMPS Soldering Station is a type of soldering setup that uses a Switched-Mode Power Supply (SMPS) to power the soldering iron. Unlike basic irons that draw raw mains voltage, an SMPS unit converts the mains input into a clean, regulated output, giving more stable performance and better temperature control. SMPS technology also improves efficiency, safety, and energy use compared to older transformer-based stations.','An SMPS lets the station deliver stable, efficient power, reducing heat fluctuation compared to basic mains-powered irons. It’s typically lighter and more compact than classic transformer-based solder stations, making it ideal for mobile technicians or small workbenches.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001500449-459456735.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:38:20'),
(2272,'ER17500V/3.6V Lithium battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The ER17500V / 3.6V lithium battery is a primary (non-rechargeable) lithium-thionyl chloride (Li-SOCl?) cell designed for long-term, low-to-medium current applications where reliability and long life are essential.','High energy density: Lithium thionyl chloride cells store significant energy per unit volume.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771907028303-82075563.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:23:48'),
(2273,'Soldron SL-938',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Soldron SL-938 is a temperature-controlled digital soldering station designed for electronics work — suitable for professionals, hobbyists, and repair technicians. It combines precise digital temperature control, reliable heating performance, and added efficiency features like sleep mode to make soldering easier and safer.','The SOLDRON SL938 Temperature Controlled Digital Soldering Station is a digital temperature-controlled soldering unit designed for reliable, professional-grade soldering work. It’s suitable for electronics assembly, repair, hobbyist projects, and fine-detail soldering tasks where temperature stability and control are important.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001975876-461002099.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:46:15'),
