(2275,'Soldron 878D',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Soldron 878D is a 2-in-1 Hot Air and Soldering Rework Station designed for professional electronics soldering and surface-mount device (SMD) rework. It integrates a temperature-controlled soldering iron and a hot air blower into one versatile unit making it ideal for PCB repair, component removal, and precision work on modern electronics.','The Soldron 878D is a multifunctional 2-in-1 Hot Air and Soldering (Rework) Station designed for professional and hobby electronics work.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001916857-395641347.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:45:16'),
(2276,'Soldering Iron Stand',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A soldering iron stand (also called a soldering iron holder) is a support accessory used to safely hold a hot soldering iron when it’s not in use. It prevents accidental burns, keeps your work area organized, and protects surfaces from heat damage.','It prevents accidental burns, keeps your work area organized, and protects surfaces from heat damage.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001881087-403838869.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:44:41'),
(2277,'EU FANUC A98l-0031-0028 battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The FANUC A98L-0031-0028 battery is a 3 V lithium backup battery designed for use in FANUC CNC controllers, PLCs (Programmable Logic Controllers), servo drives, and industrial automation systems','It provides reliable memory backup power so critical data (like machine parameters, real-time clock, position data, and settings) aren’t lost during power outages or shutdowns',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908189272-417287449.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:43:09'),
(2278,'Soldron SI15-30A',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Soldron SI15-30A is a plug-in variable wattage soldering iron designed for a wide range of general soldering tasks. It allows the user to adjust the power output between 15 W and 30 W, giving flexibility for light and medium-level soldering without needing a separate soldering station.','The Soldron SI15-30A is a plug-in variable-wattage soldering iron designed for general-purpose soldering tasks. Instead of a fixed power level, this model lets you adjust the heat output between about 15 W and 30 W, giving you flexibility for light to moderate solder jobs without needing a full soldering station.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001955774-214508990.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:45:55'),
(2279,'Trolley speaker TT-PSG-802',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,'The Target TT-PSG-802 Trolley Speaker is a compact and portable Bluetooth-enabled trolley speaker designed for versatile audio use at small gatherings, parties, and everyday entertainment. It features an 8-inch driver with around 60 W RMS power output, giving clear and loud stereo sound suitable for indoor and light outdoor settings','Additional features typically include FM radio, remote control support, and compatibility with external devices, all housed in a black, wheeled cabinet for easy transport.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772005836855-64697129.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 05:38:37'),
(2280,'CR14250SE 3V PLC Lithium Batteries',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The FDK CR14250SE 3V lithium battery for PLC and similar variants (like Sanyo Lithium Batteries or Compatible Sanyo CR14250SE 3V battery with connector) are primary (non-rechargeable) lithium batteries designed to deliver a stable 3 V DC output and long service life for industrial electronics.','The CR14250SE battery is commonly used as a PLC/CNC backup battery because it reliably supplies low current over many years without maintenance, making it perfect for electronic memory retention',NULL,NULL,'products/1771904132461-71002506.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 03:35:32'),
