(2284,'Ultralife  9V Lithium Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium 9-Volt Battery',10.00,'The Ultralife 9V Lithium Battery is a high-performance, non-rechargeable 9-volt lithium battery designed to deliver long-lasting and reliable power for a wide range of electronic devices.','It uses lithium manganese dioxide (LiMnO?) chemistry, which offers much higher energy density and longer life than standard alkaline 9 V batteries.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006272562-141378274.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 05:31:28'),
(2285,'3V CR6 L battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The CR6 battery is typically cylindrical or specially shaped depending on the manufacturer and application. It is designed to deliver steady voltage even under moderate load conditions, which is important for camera flash systems and precision electronics. These batteries usually have a long storage life (up to 5–10 years) when kept in proper conditions.','CR6 is a primary lithium battery, it should not be recharged, as this can cause leakage or damage. Proper polarity installation is important for safe operation. The battery is widely valued for its compact size, lightweight design, and dependable performance in portable electronic devices.','A 3V CR6 battery is a lithium primary (non-rechargeable) battery commonly used in cameras, photo equipment, medical devices, and certain electronic instruments. It provides a stable 3 volts DC output, making it suitable for devices that require consistent and reliable power.',NULL,'products/1771670463060-251652789.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:39:53'),
(2286,'MR-BAT6V1 5V 1650mAh battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The MR-BAT6V1 (also labeled 2CR17335A WK17) is a primary (non-rechargeable) lithium battery designed to supply a stable 6 V DC output with a capacity of about 1650 mAh.','It’s widely used as a reliable backup or main power source in industrial and electronic applications, especially in automation systems like PLCs, industrial controllers, IoT devices, and smart meters.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771991891966-431412141.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 13:03:51'),
(2287,'Desoldering Pump',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Soldron SI15-30A is a plug-in variable-wattage soldering iron designed for general-purpose soldering tasks. Instead of a fixed power level, this model lets you adjust the heat output between about 15 W and 30 W, giving you flexibility for light to moderate solder jobs without needing a full soldering station.','The process involves heating the parts to be joined, applying flux to clean the surfaces, melting solder onto the hot parts (not the iron tip directly), and letting it cool to form a strong, conductive connection.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771905330253-308087710.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 03:55:30'),
(2288,'Electric Soldering Iron',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'An electric soldering iron is a handheld tool used to heat solder (metal alloy) and join metal parts together especially in electronics and electrical work. It converts electrical power into heat through a heating element, allowing the tip to melt solder and create strong, conductive connections between wires, components, and circuit boards.','An electric soldering iron is a hand-held tool that uses electricity to generate heat for melting solder, the metal alloy used to join metal parts together. It’s one of the most common tools in electronics, electrical work, and DIY projects because it makes permanent, conductive joints between wires and components.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771906779240-557099544.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:19:39'),
(2289,'Saft LS 20 3.6V battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The SAFT LSH 20 3.6?V Lithium Battery (D?Size) (also seen as Saft LSH20 3.6?V Size?D Li?SOCl? Battery) is a primary (non-rechargeable) lithium battery manufactured by Saft, designed for demanding applications that require long-term, high-reliability power.','Nominal Voltage: 3.6 V DC — delivers a stable voltage throughout most of its service life.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772000239369-385208052.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:17:19'),
(2290,'TL 5920 C Size Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The TADIRAN TL?5920 3.6V C Size 8500?mAh Lithium Battery (also sold in various packs) is a 3.6 V primary lithium battery in a standard C-cell form factor designed for long life, high reliability, and stable voltage output','It uses lithium thionyl chloride (Li-SOCl?) chemistry, which is ideal for applications that require months or years of dependable power without frequent replacement.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772004556512-820308435.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:29:16'),
(2291,'Panasonic BR-2/3A 3V battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Panasonic BR?2/3A Primary Lithium Battery (also seen as BR-2/3AN / BR17335) is a primary (non-rechargeable) cylindrical lithium battery designed for long-lasting, reliable power in various electronic and industrial applications','This battery comes from Panasonic Energy, known for quality lithium cells with excellent shelf life and stability',NULL,NULL,'products/1771995117881-813672591.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:51:57'),
(2292,'Maxell ER6C 3.6V 1800mAh battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Maxell ER6C 3.6V 1800mAh Lithium Thionyl Chloride Battery and related ER6C models are primary (non-rechargeable) lithium batteries designed to deliver stable 3.6 V DC power with high capacity (~1800 mAh) for long durations in critical devices','They use lithium thionyl chloride (Li-SOCl?) chemistry, known for very low self-discharge, long shelf life, and stable voltage output — ideal for memory backup and low-drain electronics.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990061463-457055084.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:27:41'),
