(2299,'Trolley Speaker TT-PSF-1203',NULL,NULL,NULL,7999.00,'The Trolley Speaker TT-PSF-1203 is a portable and powerful Bluetooth party speaker designed for outdoor entertainment, public announcements, and small event sound systems. It features a large woofer-based audio system that delivers strong bass and clear sound output suitable for music playback, karaoke, and microphone use. The speaker supports Bluetooth connectivity, allowing wireless streaming from smartphones, laptops, and other compatible devices, along with multiple input options such as USB, AUX, memory card, and FM radio, making it versatile for different audio sources.','Microphone support – Often included for karaoke/announcements. \r\nWheels + Telescopic Handle – Easy to move around.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772005756665-256560254.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 05:40:53'),
