(2307,'9V Lithium Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 9V Lithium Battery is a high-performance power source designed for devices that require stable voltage, long life, and reliable operation. Compared to traditional alkaline 9V batteries, lithium versions offer lighter weight, higher energy density, and superior durability, making them ideal for both professional and everyday applications.','9V lithium batteries are available in single packs and bulk packaging, with both non-rechargeable and rechargeable (Li-ion with USB charging) options depending on the brand.','Compared to traditional alkaline 9V batteries, lithium versions offer lighter weight, higher energy density, and superior durability, making them ideal for both professional and everyday applications.',NULL,'products/1771830692428-339810492.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:14:48'),
