(2311,'5V 1650mAh Maxell Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'The Maxell 1650 mAh lithium battery is a high-capacity power cell engineered to deliver stable, long-lasting performance for a variety of electronic devices. Built with reliable lithium chemistry, it provides consistent energy output and dependable service life in demanding applications.','These are high-capacity lithium batteries designed to supply stable DC power to electronic equipment that demands consistent voltage over a long period. They are manufactured with robust lithium chemistry for reliable performance and extended service life.','A 5V 1650mAh Maxell battery is a rechargeable or primary (non-rechargeable) battery pack manufactured by Maxell, a well-known brand in the energy storage industry. With a capacity of 1650 mAh (milliampere-hours), it can theoretically deliver 1650 milliamps of current for one hour or proportionally lower current for a longer duration, depending on the load.',NULL,'products/1771823267405-823600863.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 07:01:03'),
(2312,'3.6V LS Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'3.6V LS battery is a high-performance Lithium Thionyl Chloride (Li-SOCl₂) primary (non-rechargeable) battery commonly used in industrial and long-life electronic applications. The “LS” series batteries are known for their high energy density, stable 3.6V output, and very low self-discharge rate, making them ideal for devices that require long-term, reliable power.','They deliver a nominal voltage of ~3.6 V and high energy density with very low self-discharge, making them ideal for devices that need long service life and stable performance.','A key feature of the 3.6V LS battery is its long shelf life, often up to 10–20 years depending on usage and storage conditions. It can operate across a wide temperature range, typically from -55°C to +85°C, making it suitable for harsh environments.',NULL,'products/1771667480076-94472484.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 12:55:00'),
(2313,'3V Samsung Lithium Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'The Samsung 3 V lithium battery (CR-V3) is a high-performance disposable lithium battery designed to deliver longer life, stable power output, and consistent performance in devices such as digital cameras and portable electronics. ','The 3 V Samsung lithium battery often designated CR-V3 is a disposable (non-rechargeable) lithium power cell designed mainly for digital cameras and other portable electronics where a reliable 3 V supply is needed.','It’s an excellent upgrade over traditional AA alkaline cells in many applications.',NULL,'products/1771670508106-411437968.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:52:16'),
