(2356,'Varta CR AA 3V Lithium Batteries',NULL,NULL,'AA 3V Lithium Battery',10.00,'lithium batteries made by Varta, a reputable German battery manufacturer. These cells are part of Varta’s CR series of 3 V lithium manganese dioxide (Li-MnO?) batteries, designed for long life, high energy density, and stable output.','Unlike standard 1.5 V AA batteries, the CR-AA battery provides a nominal voltage of 3 volts, making it suitable for specialized equipment that requires higher and stable voltage output. These batteries are commonly used as memory backup batteries, CMOS batteries in computers, PLC systems, meters, security devices, and instrumentation electronics','Battery Type: Lithium Primary (Non-rechargeable)\r\nModel: CR-AA / CR14505\r\nNominal Voltage: 3V\r\nCapacity: Up to 2000 mAh',NULL,'products/1772006906067-989936199.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-28 07:53:23'),
