(2363,'USB Host Shield For Arduino',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The USB Host Shield for Arduino is an expansion board that allows an Arduino board to act as a USB host, enabling direct communication with USB devices such as keyboards, mice, game controllers, USB flash drives, barcode scanners, and Bluetooth dongles.','The USB Host Shield for Arduino is an add-on board that enables an Arduino to function as a USB host, allowing it to directly connect and control USB devices (normally possible only with computers).',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006592467-673404210.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:03:12'),
(2364,'TT-692',NULL,NULL,NULL,5999.00,'It features MPEG4 playback, 5.1 channel surround sound support, a built-in speaker and amplifier with 100 W output, and multiple connectivity options including USB, SD/MMC, CD/DVD/SVCD/VCD playback, and remote control for easy operation.','This model also includes CD ripping capabilities, an LED display, and support for various audio and video.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772005975522-91084733.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:52:55'),
(2365,'TT-687',NULL,NULL,NULL,7500.00,'The Target TT-687 DVD Player is a versatile home entertainment device featuring MPEG4 technology and a 5.1-channel audio system that delivers powerful sound through its 100 W Hi-Fi amplifier and built-in speakers.','It supports a wide range of media formats including MP4, DVD, SVCD, VCD, DVCD, CD, MP3, and CD-R, and comes with a wireless remote control, USB and SD/MMC ports, and multiple output options such as analog, coaxial, component, and composite, making it easy to connect to various TV and audio systems',NULL,NULL,'products/1772005950111-379988870.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:52:30'),
(2366,'Data Logging Shield for Arduino',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Data Logging Shield for Arduino is an expansion board designed to record, store, and time-stamp data collected from sensors and modules connected to an Arduino. It is widely used for monitoring environmental, electrical, and system parameters over long periods.','The Data Logging Shield for Arduino is a hardware expansion board used to store sensor and system data over time. It enables Arduino boards to record data with accurate timestamps and save it on removable storage for later analysis.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771904637654-70707847.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 03:43:57'),
(2367,'Arduino pro mini',NULL,NULL,'Arduino pro mini',999.00,'The Arduino Pro Mini is a compact, low-cost microcontroller board based on the ATmega328 microcontroller. It is designed for embedded and space-constrained projects where a full-size Arduino board is not required.','Programming is done using an external USB-to-TTL (FTDI) adapter, which keeps the board minimal and ideal for permanent installations.','It is designed for embedded and space-constrained projects where a full-size Arduino board is not required.',NULL,'products/1771834676983-179616599.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 10:56:35'),
(2368,'TDA2030A Power Amplifier Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The TDA2030A Power Amplifier Module is a compact and efficient audio amplifier board based on the popular TDA2030A integrated circuit. It is designed to amplify low-level audio signals and drive speakers with clear and powerful sound, making it ideal for DIY audio, electronics learning, and small sound systems.','The TDA2030A Power Amplifier Module is a ready-made audio amplification board used to boost low-level audio signals to a power level capable of driving speakers. It is based on the well-known TDA2030A IC, widely used for small to medium power audio applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772432499366-445321790.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 06:21:39'),
(2369,'Arduino Leonardo board',NULL,NULL,'Arduino Leonardo board',2999.00,'The Arduino Leonardo is a microcontroller development board based on the ATmega32U4. Unlike most Arduino boards, the Leonardo has built-in USB communication directly inside the microcontroller, which allows it to act as a USB keyboard, mouse, joystick, or other Human Interface Device (HID) without additional hardware.','This makes the Arduino Leonardo especially useful for USB-based projects and advanced input/output applications.','which allows it to act as a USB keyboard, mouse, joystick, or other Human Interface Device (HID) without additional hardware.',NULL,'products/1771833254272-257719603.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 10:48:39'),
(2370,'TM1638 8 Bit Digital LED Display Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The TM1638 8 Bit Digital LED Display Module is a versatile display and input module that combines an 8-digit 7-segment LED display, 8 individual LEDs, and 8 tactile push buttons on a single board. It is controlled by the TM1638 driver IC and communicates with microcontrollers using a simple 3-wire serial interface, making it ideal for Arduino and other embedded projects.','The TM1638 8 Bit Digital LED Display Module is a multifunction display board that integrates output display and user input in a single unit. It is widely used with Arduino and other microcontrollers for creating compact control panels and digital interfaces.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772004623566-365280555.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:30:23'),
(2371,'Rotary Angle Sensor Module For Arduino',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Rotary Angle Sensor Module for Arduino is an analog input module used to measure rotational position or angle. It is typically based on a rotary potentiometer, which converts the angular movement of the knob or shaft into a variable voltage that can be read by an Arduino’s analog input pin.','The Rotary Angle Sensor Module for Arduino is an input module used to detect rotational position or angular movement. It works by converting the rotation of a knob or shaft into a proportional analog voltage, which can be read by an Arduino or other microcontrollers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771999717356-900773072.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:08:37'),
(2372,'ESP8285 wifi module',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,'The ESP8285 Wi-Fi module is a compact, low-power wireless microcontroller developed by Espressif Systems','It is very similar to the popular ESP8266 but with a key difference: the ESP8285 has built-in flash memory, eliminating the need for an external SPI flash chip. This makes it smaller, more reliable, and easier to design into compact IoT products.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908168750-610403505.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:42:48'),
(2373,'Dual Channel PWM',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The Dual Channel PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) Module is an electronic control module designed to generate two independent PWM output signals. It allows precise control of speed, brightness, power, or position by varying the duty cycle of each channel separately. This makes it ideal for motor control, LED dimming, and power regulation applications.','The Dual Channel PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) module is an electronic control unit that produces two separate PWM output signals. Each channel can be adjusted independently, allowing precise control of devices that rely on variable power or signal timing.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771906186959-289471420.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-11 11:16:57'),
(2374,'2.0 Chaneel Tower Speaker  TT-66',NULL,NULL,'Bluetooth Speaker',8999.00,'The 2.0 Channel Tower Speaker TT-66 is a tall, floor-standing stereo speaker system designed to deliver rich and immersive audio for home entertainment, parties, and multimedia setups.','It features dual full-range drivers that provide clear highs and deep lows across a wide frequency range, ensuring balanced sound quality for movies, music, and games. Built with a sleek and modern cabinet design, this tower speaker not only enhances your audio experience but also adds a stylish look to your living room or entertainment space.','Built with a sleek and modern cabinet design, this tower speaker not only enhances your audio experience but also adds a stylish look to your living room or entertainment space.',NULL,'products/1771658971183-720835943.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:20:15'),
(2375,'WeMos  ESP Wroom 02 Board',NULL,NULL,'WeMos D1 ESP8266',0.00,'The WeMos ESP-WROOM-02 Board is a compact Wi-Fi development board built around the ESP-WROOM-02 module, which itself is based on the ESP8266EX SoC. It combines a 32-bit microcontroller with integrated 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi, allowing direct internet connectivity without an external Wi-Fi shield. This board is widely used for IoT, wireless monitoring, smart home, and embedded web-server projects.','The ESP-WROOM-02 module typically includes 4 MB flash memory, onboard PCB antenna, and supports Wi-Fi standards 802.11 b/g/n. The WeMos development board version adds USB-to-Serial interface (usually CH340), voltage regulation, reset/flash buttons, and easy-access GPIO pins, making it simple to program via Arduino IDE, AT firmware, or NodeMCU Lua firmware.','ESP8266EX 32-bit MCU (80–160 MHz)\r\nBuilt-in TCP/IP Wi-Fi stack\r\n4 MB flash memory',NULL,'products/1772014130279-994562309.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-28 06:50:34'),
(2376,'5.1 Channel TT-5090',NULL,NULL,'5.1 Home Theatre',10500.00,'The 5.1 Channel TT-5090 is a multimedia home theatre speaker system designed to provide immersive surround sound for movies, music, gaming, and TV entertainment. As a 5.1-channel setup, it includes five satellite speakers and one subwoofer, allowing sound to be distributed around the listener for a more cinematic experience compared to regular stereo speakers.','The subwoofer is responsible for producing deep bass tones, while the satellite speakers handle mid and high frequencies, creating balanced and dynamic audio output. This system typically supports multiple connectivity options such as Bluetooth, AUX input, USB, memory card (SD), and sometimes FM radio, making it compatible with smartphones, laptops, TVs, and other media devices.','Many versions also include a remote control for convenient adjustment of volume, bass, treble, and input selection. The TT-5090 is generally suitable for small to medium-sized rooms and offers an affordable solution for users who want a home theatre-style audio setup with enhanced sound clarity and bass performance.',NULL,'products/1771821637572-20605456.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-12 06:16:50'),
(2377,'5.1 Chaneel TT-K1000',NULL,NULL,NULL,8999.00,'The 5.1-channel home theater system, often referenced under models like the TARGET/TT-series or similar multimedia speaker sets, delivers surround-sound audio ideal for movies, music, and TV.','These systems typically include five satellite speakers with a subwoofer for deep bass and offer multiple connectivity options such as FM radio, USB, Bluetooth, SD card, AUX, and remote control for easy operation.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771821542071-592401759.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 04:39:02'),
(2378,'5.1 Channel TT-K1010',NULL,NULL,'5.1 Home Theatre',9000.00,'5.1-channel multimedia speaker system designed for home audio entertainment. As a 5.1-channel setup, it includes five satellite speakers plus one subwoofer, providing surround-sound audio for movies, music, games, and multimedia playback. These systems aim to deliver richer, more immersive sound than traditional 2.0 or 2.1 speaker sets by positioning sound around the listener to create a “surround” effect.','It features a 5.1 channel configuration with five satellite speakers and one subwoofer, providing immersive audio suitable for movies, music, and TV shows','Typical features of such a system include multiple input options like Bluetooth, USB, AUX, and sometimes FM radio, allowing connection to phones, laptops, TVs, and media players. They often support high-impact audio output (with ratings such as RMS power indicating loudness capability) and enhanced bass from the subwoofer for deeper, more powerful low frequencies. Some models also include control knobs or remote control for adjusting volume, bass, treble, and input source.',NULL,'products/1771821563315-413088248.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 06:47:50'),
(2379,'5.1 Channel TT-K1150',NULL,NULL,'5.1 Home Theatre',11999.00,'The TARGET TT-K1150 5.1 Channel Multimedia Speaker System is a consumer home theatre speaker set designed to deliver surround sound audio for movies, music, gaming, and multimedia playback with better immersion than basic stereo speakers. It’s part of Target’s range of affordable 5.1-channel audio systems suited for living rooms, bedrooms, or entertainment setups.','The system supports Bluetooth wireless connectivity, letting you stream music directly from your smartphone or other Bluetooth-enabled devices, and also includes a memory card slot, USB port, and FM radio, making it versatile for various media sources.','This system features five satellite speakers plus a larger subwoofer, creating a 5.1 configuration that spreads sound around the listener for a richer audio experience. The combined output power is around 170 W, which provides decent loudness for everyday use and casual home audio setups.',NULL,'products/1771821589579-439118017.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 06:50:41'),
(2380,'HC-05 Bluetooth Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,'The HC-05 Bluetooth module is a popular Bluetooth Classic (v2.0 + EDR) wireless communication module used to add serial (UART) Bluetooth connectivity to microcontroller projects.','It is widely used with Arduino, AVR, PIC, and ARM boards for short-range wireless data transfer.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910164017-666004777.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:16:04'),
(2381,'NE555 Timer Switch Adjustable Relay Board',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The NE555 Timer Switch Adjustable Relay Board is a compact timing control module based on the popular NE555 timer IC. It is designed to control a relay ON/OFF operation with an adjustable delay time, making it ideal for automation, protection circuits, and time-based switching applications.','The NE555 Timer Switch Adjustable Relay Board is a timing control module used to switch electrical loads after a preset time delay. It is based on the widely used NE555 timer IC, known for its stability and reliability in timing applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992431694-624243483.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:07:11'),
(2382,'5.1 Channel TT-K1710',NULL,NULL,'5.1 Home Theatre',11999.00,'The TT-K1710 5.1 Channel Multimedia Speaker System from Target is a budget-friendly surround sound audio setup designed to enhance the listening experience for movies, music, gaming, and TV playback. It features a 5.1 channel configuration, which means it includes five satellite speakers and one subwoofer to create a more immersive audio environment compared to basic stereo speakers.','It features a total RMS power output of around 45 W with a 5.25-inch subwoofer and five satellite speakers that together create balanced audio with decent bass and clear mids and highs, making it suitable for small to medium-sized rooms.','This system delivers around 45 W RMS total output, providing balanced sound with decent volume for small to medium-sized rooms. The 5.25-inch subwoofer produces deeper bass tones, while the smaller satellite speakers handle mid and high frequencies for fuller audio reproduction.',NULL,'products/1771821615713-656588366.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 06:54:54'),
(2384,'HC-05 TTL Bluetooth Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,'The HC-05 TTL Bluetooth Module is a Bluetooth Classic (v2.0 + EDR) wireless communication module that provides TTL-level serial (UART) connectivity between microcontrollers and Bluetooth-enabled devices such as smartphones, tablets, and PCs. It is widely used in Arduino and embedded electronics projects for short-range wireless data transfer.','A key advantage of the HC-05 is that it supports both Master and Slave modes, giving it more flexibility than slave-only modules like HC-06.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910187908-151124185.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:16:27'),
(2385,'ISD1760 Voice Recording',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The ISD1760 Voice Recording Module is a non-volatile audio record and playback module based on the ISD1760 voice IC. It allows users to record, store, and play back human voice or audio messages without losing data when power is removed. This makes it ideal for message playback, alerts, and interactive embedded projects.','The ISD1760 Voice Recording Module is an audio module used to record, store, and play back voice messages. It is based on the ISD1760 ChipCorder® IC, which stores recorded audio in non-volatile memory, ensuring the message is retained even when power is removed.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771914000296-632826643.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:20:00'),
(2386,'Lilypad Attiny85',NULL,NULL,'Arduino Lilypad Attiny85',999.00,'The Arduino LilyPad ATtiny85 is a tiny, sewable microcontroller board designed specifically for wearable electronics and e-textile projects.','It is based on the ATtiny85 microcontroller and features large conductive pads that make it easy to stitch into fabric using conductive thread.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771833337904-140160300.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:25:57'),
(2387,'CJMCU-6075 UV Light Intensity Sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The CJMCU-6075 UV Light Intensity Sensor is a compact sensor module designed to measure ultraviolet (UV) light intensity, including UVA and UVB radiation. It is based on the VEML6075 UV sensor, which provides accurate UV measurements and allows calculation of the UV Index for environmental and safety monitoring applications.','The CJMCU-6075 UV Light Intensity Sensor is a digital sensing module used to measure ultraviolet (UV) radiation. It is based on the VEML6075 sensor IC, which can detect UVA and UVB light and enables accurate calculation of the UV Index. The sensor stores calibration data internally, allowing reliable measurements without complex calibration.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771903618153-234095414.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:01:29'),
(2388,'Arduino Lilypad Atmega328',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Arduino LilyPad ATmega328 is a wearable-friendly microcontroller board designed for e-textiles and soft electronics projects.','Built around the ATmega328 microcontroller, it features a round, thin form factor with large sewable pads, allowing components to be stitched into fabric using conductive thread.','Built around the ATmega328 microcontroller, it features a round, thin form factor with large sewable pads, allowing components to be stitched into fabric using conductive thread.',NULL,'products/1771833253469-823569529.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 10:51:34'),
(2389,'APR33A3 Voice Recorder & Playback(ZA)',NULL,NULL,'APR33A3 Voice Recorder & Playback(ZA)',999.00,'The APR33A3 Voice Recorder & Playback (ZA) is a compact audio recording and playback module designed to store and reproduce voice messages with good clarity. It is based on the APR33A3 voice IC and uses non-volatile memory, so recorded audio is retained even when power is removed. ','The APR33A3 Voice Recorder & Playback (ZA) module is an audio module used to record, store, and play back voice messages. It is built around the APR33A3 voice IC, which stores audio in non-volatile memory, ensuring that recorded messages are retained even when power is removed.','The module supports simple push-button control as well as microcontroller interfacing, making it suitable for both standalone and embedded applications.',NULL,'products/1771832444528-384327867.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 10:10:02'),
(2390,'Bluetooth module',NULL,NULL,'HC-05 Bluetooth module',999.00,'The Arduino Due does not have built-in Bluetooth, but it can easily be connected to external Bluetooth modules to enable wireless communication.','Bluetooth modules are commonly used with Arduino Due for wireless control, data transmission, IoT, robotics, and mobile app integration.','Bluetooth modules are commonly used with Arduino Due for wireless control, data transmission, IoT, robotics, and mobile app integration.',NULL,'products/1771833171078-566370775.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 10:40:31'),
(2391,'Arduino Esplora',NULL,NULL,'Arduino Esplora',3999.00,'A GSM antenna is a communication antenna designed to transmit and receive signals over the Global System for Mobile Communications (GSM) network, typically operating in frequency bands such as 850 MHz, 900 MHz, 1800 MHz, and 1900 MHz. It is commonly used with GSM modules like SIM800, SIM900, and other cellular communication devices to enable SMS, voice calls, and mobile data transmission. The antenna improves signal strength, coverage range, and communication reliability in embedded and IoT applications.','These antennas are widely used in IoT systems, GPS trackers, vehicle tracking devices, smart meters, security systems, remote monitoring systems, industrial automation, and GSM-based alarm systems.','GSM antennas are available in various types, including external magnetic-mount antennas, PCB antennas, spring antennas, and stub (rubber duck) antennas. External antennas usually connect via connectors such as SMA, u.FL, or IPEX, providing better reception compared to onboard PCB antennas. Magnetic base antennas are often used in vehicles or metal surfaces to enhance signal performance.',NULL,'products/1771833253043-872426524.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 10:43:42'),
(2392,'MCU-2317 MCP23017 I2C Microchip',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The MCU-2317 MCP23017 I²C Microchip module is an I/O expansion board based on the MCP23017 integrated circuit from Microchip. It allows a microcontroller to expand its digital input/output pins by 16 lines using only the I²C communication interface, making it ideal for projects with limited GPIO availability.','The MCU-2317 MCP23017 I²C Microchip module is a 16-bit digital I/O expander used to increase the number of GPIO pins available to a microcontroller through the I²C bus. It is based on the MCP23017 IC and is commonly used when projects require many inputs or outputs but have limited MCU pins.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990098899-193271334.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:26:57'),
(2393,'RGB LED SMD module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The RGB LED SMD Module is a compact lighting module that integrates a Surface Mount Device (SMD) RGB LED on a small PCB. It combines Red, Green, and Blue LEDs into a single package, allowing the creation of a wide range of colors by controlling the intensity of each color channel independently.','The RGB LED SMD Module is a compact electronic module that uses a surface-mount RGB LED to generate multiple colors by combining red, green, and blue light. Each color channel can be controlled independently, allowing smooth color mixing and brightness adjustment.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771998607753-736833554.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:50:07'),
(2394,'Mega 2560 mini pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,'The Arduino Mega 2560 Mini Pro is a compact version of the Arduino Mega 2560, designed to provide the same powerful ATmega2560 microcontroller in a much smaller form factor.','The Arduino Mega 2560 Mini Pro is a compact version of the Arduino Mega 2560, designed to provide the same powerful ATmega2560 microcontroller in a much smaller form factor.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990125849-524661904.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:28:45'),
(2395,'Propeller  1045',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'Manufactured typically from high-strength nylon or reinforced composite plastic, the 1045 propeller offers an excellent balance between durability and lightweight performance','The 4.5-inch pitch ensures smooth airflow, providing stable flight, reduced vibration, and better motor efficiency. These propellers are commonly available in CW (Clockwise) and CCW (Counter-Clockwise) pairs to maintain proper balance and control during flight.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771996469382-894123148.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:45:28'),
(2396,'MCP2515 CAN BUS Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The MCP2515 CAN Bus Module is a communication module used to enable CAN (Controller Area Network) protocol on microcontrollers that do not have built-in CAN support. It is based on the MCP2515 standalone CAN controller IC from Microchip and typically works together with a CAN transceiver such as TJA1050 or SN65HVD230.','The MCP2515 CAN Bus Module is a communication interface used to add CAN (Controller Area Network) capability to microcontrollers that do not have a built-in CAN controller. It uses the MCP2515 standalone CAN controller IC and communicates with the host MCU via the SPI interface. Most modules also include a CAN transceiver (such as TJA1050 or SN65HVD230) to connect directly to the CAN bus lines.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990079679-717493740.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:27:02'),
(2397,'Arduino Mega 2560 with ESP',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,'The Arduino Mega 2560 with ESP is a combined development board that integrates the Arduino Mega 2560 (ATmega2560) with an ESP8266 Wi-Fi module from Espressif Systems on a single PCB.','This board is designed to offer high I/O capability + built-in Wi-Fi connectivity, making it ideal for IoT, automation, robotics, and network-connected embedded systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771834675810-413319465.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 10:55:54'),
(2398,'NE555 Pulse Signal Generator Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The NE555 Pulse Signal Generator Module is a compact electronic module based on the popular NE555 timer IC, designed to generate square-wave or pulse signals with adjustable frequency and duty cycle. It is commonly used for testing, timing, clock generation, and control applications in electronics projects.','The NE555 Pulse Signal Generator Module is an electronic module used to produce continuous pulse or square-wave signals. It is based on the widely used NE555 timer IC, which operates in astable mode to generate a repeating HIGH–LOW output. The frequency and duty cycle can be adjusted using onboard components.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992397767-395332635.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:06:37'),
(2399,'2200mah Li-ion Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 2200 mAh battery is a rechargeable power pack commonly used in hobby and small to medium-sized quadcopters, UAVs, and RC aircraft. The “2200 mAh” figure means the battery has a capacity of 2200 milliamp hours — essentially how much electrical charge it can store.','Most 2200 mAh batteries are 3-cell (3S) designs providing around 11.1 V nominal voltage, making them suitable for a broad range of consumer drones and hobby multirotors.','The “2200 mAh” figure means the battery has a capacity of 2200 milliamp hours — essentially how much electrical charge it can store.',NULL,'products/1774967865141-205559344.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-31 14:53:52'),
(2400,'ISD1820 Voice Recording Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The ISD1820 Voice Recording Module is a compact and easy-to-use audio record and playback module designed for recording short voice messages. It is based on the ISD1820 voice recording IC, which stores audio in non-volatile memory, ensuring that recordings are retained even when power is removed.','The ISD1820 Voice Recording Module is a small, standalone audio module used to record and play back short voice messages. It is built around the ISD1820 voice IC, which stores audio in non-volatile memory, so recordings are ????? even when power is turned off.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771914030996-23225984.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:20:30'),
(2401,'BLDC Motor',NULL,NULL,'Brushless DC Motor',499.00,'A BLDC Motor (Brushless DC Motor) is an electric motor that operates without brushes, using electronic controllers to energize the motor windings.','They deliver better performance, higher speed ranges, smoother operation, and less noise, which is why they are widely used in robots, drones, electric vehicles, industrial automation, fans, pumps, and appliances.','They deliver better performance, higher speed ranges, smoother operation, and less noise, which is why they are widely used in robots, drones, electric vehicles, industrial automation, fans, pumps, and appliances.',NULL,'products/1771840453385-387974220.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:55:51'),
(2402,'Prototype shield',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,'A Prototype Shield (Proto Shield) is an add-on expansion board designed to fit directly on top of Arduino boards, allowing users to build, test, and solder custom circuits without designing a separate PCB. It is widely used for prototyping, experimentation, and small embedded projects.','Prototype shields duplicate the Arduino pin layout and provide a general-purpose prototyping area where components can be soldered permanently.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771996489889-202486796.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:29:11'),
(2403,'ESC 30A',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'ESC 30A (Electronic Speed Controller) is a widely used component in RC models, drones, quadcopters, airplanes, and robotics projects where precise motor speed control is required.','It acts as the bridge between the battery and motor, interpreting throttle signals from the flight controller or receiver and converting them into smooth, controlled motor rotation.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771907092402-302336409.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:24:52'),
(2404,'WS100 Ethernet shield',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,'The WS100 Ethernet Shield is an Arduino-compatible network expansion board that enables wired Ethernet connectivity for microcontroller projects.','It is commonly used with Arduino boards to connect devices to LAN networks and the internet for applications such as web servers, data logging, industrial control, and IoT gateways.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772014714464-727244054.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 10:18:34'),
(2405,'Motor/Stepper/Servo shield v2',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Motor/Stepper/Servo Shield v2 is an Arduino-compatible expansion board designed to make it easy to control DC motors, stepper motors, and servos from an Arduino','It provides power drivers, connectors, and libraries to handle high-current motor control without directly stressing the microcontroller.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771991050722-149942809.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:44:10'),
(2406,'HLK-B10 bluetooth board',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The HLK-B10 is a Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE 5.0 serial communication module (also marketed as a Bluetooth board) designed for wireless data transmission between microcontrollers and Bluetooth host devices such as smartphones, tablets, or other BLE-capable equipment.','It is made by Shenzhen Hi-Link Electronic Co., Ltd. and is used particularly in IoT, smart home, industrial, and embedded systems where BLE connectivity is needed.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910516531-622039921.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 13:04:42'),
(2407,'KY-036 Metal Detector Sensor for Arduino',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The KY-036 Metal Detector Sensor Module is a simple metal and touch detection sensor designed for use with Arduino and other microcontrollers. It detects the presence of metal objects or conductive touch by sensing changes in capacitance or signal interference near its sensing pad.','The KY-036 Metal Detector Sensor Module is a simple sensing module used to detect the presence of metal objects or conductive touch. It is commonly used with Arduino and other microcontrollers for basic detection and educational projects. The module responds to changes in electrical characteristics when metal or a conductive object comes close to the sensing area.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771914478790-15643977.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:27:58'),
(2408,'HLK-B20 bluetooth board',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The HLK-B20 is a low-power Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) module made by Shenzhen Hi-Link Electronic Co., Ltd','It’s designed for wireless serial communication between microcontrollers and BLE-capable devices like smartphones, tablets, and other BLE hosts. It works as a BLE 4.2 serial-to-Bluetooth adapter with multiple peripheral interfaces, making it useful in IoT and embedded systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910538253-497218038.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:23:16'),
(2410,'HLK-B30 bluetooth board',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The HLK-B30 is a combined Wi-Fi and Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) wireless communication module from Shenzhen Hi-Link Electronic Co., Ltd','It supports both 802.11 b/g/n Wi-Fi and BLE 4.2, making it capable of dual wireless connectivity for modern IoT and embedded systems',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910560242-514387198.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:23:23'),
(2411,'HB100 Microwave Sensor Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The HB100 Microwave Sensor Module is a high-frequency Doppler radar motion detection sensor used to detect movement by transmitting and receiving microwave signals. Unlike infrared sensors, the HB100 can detect motion through certain non-metallic materials such as plastic, glass, or thin walls, making it suitable for advanced motion sensing applications.','The HB100 Microwave Sensor Module is a Doppler radar–based motion detection sensor that operates using high-frequency microwave signals. It detects movement by measuring the Doppler frequency shift of reflected microwaves from moving objects. Unlike PIR sensors, the HB100 can detect motion independent of temperature and lighting conditions and can sense through some non-metallic materials.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910136648-597268761.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:03:43'),
(2412,'PH Sensor Kit',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The pH Sensor Kit is an electronic measurement kit designed to measure the acidity or alkalinity (pH value) of liquids. It typically consists of a pH probe (electrode) and a signal conditioning module, allowing accurate pH readings to be interfaced with Arduino, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, and other microcontrollers.','The pH Sensor Kit is a measurement system used to determine the acidity or alkalinity of liquids by measuring their pH value. It typically includes a pH probe (electrode) and an interface/conditioning module, enabling easy connection to Arduino and other microcontrollers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771995663023-308919672.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:01:03'),
(2413,'APDS-9930 Gesture',NULL,NULL,'APDS-9930 Gesture',499.00,'The APDS-9930 Gesture Sensor is a multifunction optical sensing module that combines gesture detection, proximity sensing, and ambient light measurement in a single compact IC. It is designed to detect hand gestures (near/far), object proximity, and light intensity, making it ideal for touchless control and smart device interfaces.','The APDS-9930 Gesture Sensor is a multifunction optical sensor used for gesture detection, proximity sensing, and ambient light measurement. It integrates an infrared (IR) LED, photodiodes, and processing circuitry in a single package and communicates with microcontrollers via the I²C interface.','It is designed to detect hand gestures (near/far), object proximity, and light intensity, making it ideal for touchless control and smart device interfaces.',NULL,'products/1771832310133-118455518.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 10:06:48'),
(2414,'wemos DI wifi shield',NULL,NULL,'ESP8266 WiFi Board',10.00,'he Wemos D1 WiFi Shield (Wemos D1 / D1 R2) is an ESP8266-based Wi-Fi development board designed in the Arduino UNO form factor, allowing users to build wireless and IoT projects easily. It combines a microcontroller and Wi-Fi module on a single board, so external Wi-Fi shields are not required.','It’s primarily made to work with boards in the WeMos (Wemos) ecosystem, such as WeMos D1 and WeMos D1 Mini, which are themselves based on the ESP8266 Wi-Fi microcontroller. The shield provides a plug-and-play way to add networking capabilities without complex wiring.','ESP8266EX Wi-Fi microcontroller\r\nBuilt-in 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi (802.11 b/g/n)\r\nArduino UNO-style board layout\r\n3.3 V operating voltage',NULL,'products/1772014185468-535976407.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-28 06:45:55'),
(2415,'MT3608 DC-DC Step UP Power Module',NULL,NULL,'MT3608 DC Voltage Step down module',10.00,'The MT3608 DC-DC Step-Up Power Module is a compact boost converter designed to raise a lower DC input voltage to a higher, stable DC output. Built around the MT3608 switching regulator IC, this module is highly efficient and widely used in battery-powered and portable electronics where voltage boosting is required.','The MT3608 DC-DC Step-Up Power Module is a compact boost converter used to increase a low DC input voltage to a higher, regulated DC output. It is based on the MT3608 switching regulator IC and is commonly used in battery-powered and portable electronic projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771991922932-832461856.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 07:05:16'),
(2416,'sensor shield',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A Sensor Shield is an Arduino-compatible expansion board that simplifies connecting sensors, modules, and actuators to an Arduino board.','Sensor shields are widely used in robotics, automation, education, and rapid prototyping.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772000504148-400841257.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:21:44'),
(2417,'MP1584EN Step Down Converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The MP1584EN Step-Down Converter Module is a high-efficiency DC-DC buck (step-down) power module used to convert a higher DC input voltage to a lower, stable, adjustable DC output. It is built around the MP1584EN switching regulator IC and is widely used in embedded systems, Arduino projects, battery supplies, and power management applications.','The MP1584EN Step-Down (Buck) Converter Module is a compact DC-DC power regulator used to convert a higher input voltage into a lower, stable, adjustable output voltage. It is based on the MP1584EN switching regulator IC and is commonly used in Arduino projects, embedded systems, and power supply designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771991071932-471720004.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:44:31'),
(2418,'XH-W1401 Temperature Sensor Module',NULL,NULL,'Digital Thermostat Module',10.00,'The XH-W1401 Temperature Sensor Module is a compact digital temperature controller used to automatically control heating or cooling devices based on a preset temperature value. It integrates a digital temperature sensor, a relay output, and a clear LED display, making it suitable for both industrial and DIY temperature control applications.','The XH-W1401 Temperature Sensor Module is a digital thermostat controller used to monitor and automatically control temperature by switching an external load such as a heater, fan, or cooler. It combines a temperature sensor probe, relay output, and digital display into a compact, easy-to-use module.','upply Voltage: DC 9 – 12 V (typically 12 V DC)\r\nTemperature Measurement Range: −9 ℃ to 99 ℃\r\nAccuracy: approx. ±1 ℃\r\nDisplay: LED digital display showing current measured temperature and set points',NULL,'products/1772015046965-845173954.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-28 04:58:38'),
(2419,'Nano Expansion shield',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Nano Expansion Shield is an Arduino Nano–compatible add-on board that makes it easy to connect sensors, modules, and actuators without messy wiring.','It breaks out all Arduino Nano pins into standard 3-pin headers (GND–VCC–Signal) and often includes dedicated ports for servos, I²C, SPI, and UART.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992119185-1376648.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:01:59'),
(2420,'GY-213-SI7021 Temperature and Humidity Sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The GY-213-SI7021 Temperature and Humidity Sensor is a compact, high-accuracy digital environmental sensor module based on the SI7021 sensor IC. It measures relative humidity and ambient temperature and provides stable, calibrated digital readings via the I²C interface, making it ideal for Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, and other microcontroller platforms.','The GY-213-SI7021 is a compact digital temperature and humidity sensor module that measures ambient temperature and relative humidity with good accuracy and long-term stability. It is based on the SI7021 sensor IC and communicates via the I²C interface, making it easy to use with Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, Raspberry Pi, and other microcontrollers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771909792298-921345380.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:09:52'),
(2421,'XH-W1209 Temperature sensor module',NULL,NULL,'W1209 Digital Thermostat Module',10.00,'The XH W1209 12V Digital Temperature Controller Module (often called W1209) is a compact digital temperature controller module designed for sensing and controlling temperature automatically in a variety of DIY, hobby, and basic automation projects','It combines a temperature sensor, display, controller logic, and a relay output in a single low-cost board — no programming knowledge required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772015017580-954541027.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-28 05:07:31'),
(2422,'GY-906 MLX90614ESF Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The GY-906 MLX90614ESF Module is a non-contact infrared (IR) temperature sensor based on the Melexis MLX90614ESF chip.','It allows you to measure the temperature of objects or surfaces without touching them by sensing the infrared radiation they emit. This makes it ideal for a wide range of applications where physical contact is impractical or unwanted.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771909845607-899048813.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:17:43'),
(2423,'LM75 Temperature sensor module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The LM75 Temperature Sensor Module is a digital temperature sensing module built around the LM75 (or LM75A/LM75B) temperature sensor IC, a widely used industry-standard thermal sensor.','It measures ambient temperature and provides digital temperature readings over a 2-wire I²C serial interface, making it easy to interface with microcontrollers like Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP32, etc.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771918282494-648143926.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 07:31:22'),
(2424,'GY-SHT31-D Digital Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'GY?SHT31?D Digital Temperature and Humidity Sensor is a digital environmental sensing module that measures both temperature and relative humidity with high precision','It’s based on the Sensirion SHT31 sensor chip, a reliable and factory-calibrated digital sensor widely used in environmental monitoring and control systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771909871260-187284607.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:11:11'),
(2425,'XH-M452 Temperature and humidity module',NULL,NULL,'Digital Temperature and Humidity Controller Module',10.00,'XH?M452 Temperature and Humidity Controller Module is a digital temperature and humidity control module with built-in sensors, digital displays, and relay outputs.','It not only measures ambient temperature and relative humidity, but can also control external devices (via relays) to maintain desired environmental conditions automatically','Monitors temperature (approx. −40 ℃ to 120 ℃) and\r\nMonitors humidity (0 %–100 % RH)\r\nDisplays both values on dual LED displays',NULL,'products/1772014995009-423882574.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-28 05:13:12'),
(2426,'Prototyping shield',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A prototyping shield is a hardware add-on board used in electronics projects (especially with microcontrollers like Arduino, ESP32, etc.) that gives you a ready-made area to build, connect, and test your circuits easily.','A prototyping shield is essentially a mini solderable breadboard on a plug-in board that lets you build and test custom circuits on top of a microcontroller board quickly and reliably.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771996511940-20069961.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:29:19'),
(2427,'3.2 inch LCD Display',NULL,NULL,'LCD Display ',494.00,'A 3.2-inch display refers to the diagonal size of the screen — about 3.2 inches corner-to-corner — used for showing graphical content like text, images, and user interfaces on small embedded systems, microcontroller projects, handheld devices, and similar applications','These displays are typically TFT (Thin Film Transistor) LCD panels with resolutions around 240 × 320 pixels, providing color graphics and touch capability in many cases.','A 3.2 inch LCD display is a compact screen module commonly used in embedded systems, Arduino projects, Raspberry Pi applications, industrial instruments, and DIY electronics. The 3.2-inch measurement refers to the diagonal size of the display, offering a small yet clear viewing area suitable for graphical user interfaces, sensor data display, menus, and touch-based controls. Most 3.2 inch LCD modules use TFT (Thin Film Transistor) technology, providing better color quality and faster response compared to basic character LCDs.',NULL,'products/1771667036423-282779830.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 12:50:31'),
(2428,'PI Pico',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Pi Pico (Raspberry Pi Pico) is a compact and low-cost microcontroller development board designed by the Raspberry Pi Foundation for embedded systems, automation, and IoT applications. It is built around the RP2040 microcontroller, a dual-core ARM Cortex-M0+ processor running at up to 133 MHz, providing high performance and flexibility for real-time control and electronic projects.','The Raspberry Pi Pico features multiple GPIO pins that support digital input/output, PWM, ADC, UART, SPI, and I2C communication interfaces, allowing connection with sensors, displays, motors, and other electronic modules. It operates at 3.3V logic level and can be powered through a Micro-USB port or external power supply.','The board supports programming using MicroPython, C/C++, and Arduino IDE, offering flexibility for different development environments. Its low power consumption and stable performance make it ideal for portable and battery-powered devices.',NULL,'products/1771995871893-89929671.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:04:31'),
(2429,'Flight Controller k.k.2.1.5',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Flight Controller KK 2.1.5 is a widely used multicopter control board designed for hobby drones and DIY UAV projects.','It supports multiple flight modes such as self-leveling and acrobatic mode, making it suitable for both beginners and experienced pilots.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908491711-233047121.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:48:11'),
(2430,'PI CAM',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The Pi Cam, officially known as the Raspberry Pi Camera Module, is a compact digital camera designed specifically for Raspberry Pi boards','It connects directly to the Raspberry Pi via the CSI (Camera Serial Interface) port, enabling high-quality image and video capture for embedded vision and multimedia projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771995791469-894510921.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:03:11'),
(2431,'Flight Controller A.P.M','C',NULL,NULL,10.00,'Flight Controller A.P.M (ArduPilot Mega) is an open-source autopilot system widely used in drones, quadcopters, hexacopters, planes, and rovers.','Known for its reliability, flexibility, and strong community support, the APM flight controller is commonly used for learning, research, and hobby-level autonomous drone projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908469728-848898280.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:47:49'),
(2432,'Landing Gear',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A Landing Gear project focuses on the design, analysis, and implementation of the system that supports an aircraft during ground operations such as takeoff, landing, and taxiing.','Key objectives include ensuring high load-bearing capacity, impact energy absorption during landing, stability on runways, and reliable operation under varying speeds and weights',NULL,NULL,'assets/uploads/products/product-unknow.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:25:32'),
(2433,'B3 Charger',NULL,NULL,'B3 Charger',499.00,'The B3 Charger is a compact and easy-to-use LiPo (Lithium Polymer) battery balance charger, commonly used in RC hobby applications such as drones, RC cars, helicopters, and airplanes.','The B3 charger features LED indicators that clearly show charging status for each cell, making it beginner-friendly and reliable for daily use.','The B3 charger features LED indicators that clearly show charging status for each cell, making it beginner-friendly and reliable for daily use.',NULL,'products/1771835946506-288483779.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:06:28'),
(2434,'Quadcopter Frame',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A quadcopter frame is the structural body of a quadcopter drone that holds and supports all the essential components such as motors, propellers, flight controller, ESCs, battery, and camera.','The frame also provides mounting options and protection for electronics, helping maintain safety and reliability during flight.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771996840110-155903568.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:20:40'),
(2435,'Drone Transmitter and Recevier',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A drone transmitter and receiver form the core communication system between the pilot and the drone.','. The receiver, mounted inside the drone, captures these signals and forwards them to the flight controller, which then drives the motors, servos, and onboard systems accordingly.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771905968878-435615655.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:06:08'),
(2436,'FPV Camera',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'An FPV (First Person View) camera is a compact, lightweight camera used mainly in drones, RC vehicles, robotics, and surveillance systems to provide a real-time video feed from the device’s point of view.','FPV cameras are widely used in drone racing, aerial photography assistance, robotics, security, and DIY electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908722090-137000668.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:52:02'),
(2437,'water flow sensor YF-DN50 2inch',NULL,NULL,'DN50 Water Flow Sensor',10.00,'The YFDN50 Water Flow Sensor, YF?DN50 Water Flow Sensor 2 inch, 2 inch Water Flow Sensor - YF?DN50, Yf?DN50 Water Flow Sensor, SEA YF?DN50?S?3M Stainless Steel Water Flow Sensor, and DN50 Water Flow Sensor Flowmeter Hall Sensor Control are large-diameter inline water flow sensors used to measure the flow rate of water passing through a 2-inch (DN50) pipe.','These sensors are mechanical turbine flowmeters that output digital pulses proportional to the flow rate, making them suitable for use with controllers like Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP32, or Pi Pico','Voltage: 3V–12V DC\r\nCurrent: 300mA – 1A\r\nFlow Rate: 80–240 L/H\r\nPower: 3W–10W',NULL,'products/1772012694390-452506189.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-28 07:02:38'),
(2438,'12V Water Flow sensor ','YF-S201 1/2 inch',NULL,NULL,499.00,'YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor 1/2 inch, Robodo YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor, Water Flow Sensor YF?S201, Water Flow Sensor / Fluid Flowmeter YF?S201, Robocraze YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor, and YF?S201 Water Flow Sensor by Quartz Components are all versions of the YF-S201 — a compact Hall-effect water flow sensor with a standard 1/2? threaded connection for plumbing systems.','This sensor is designed to measure the flow rate of water (or other non-corrosive liquids) passing through a pipe and output a digital pulse signal that can be read by a microcontroller such as Arduino, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, or Raspberry Pi Pico',NULL,NULL,'products/1772012738805-802442733.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-31 12:15:02'),
(2439,'Side Shift Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A side shift motor is a specialized motor or actuator used in machinery and material-handling equipment to provide controlled lateral (left-right) movement of a component without changing its forward position.','It is commonly used in forklifts, industrial automation systems, CNC machines, robotics, and agricultural equipment where precise side positioning is required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772000942194-241512100.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:29:02'),
(2440,'Water Flow sensor with TDS probe MH-01',NULL,NULL,'DWS-MH-01 Water Flow Sensor',10.00,'The MH-01 is a 2-in-1 multifunction water sensor that integrates water flow measurement with TDS (Total Dissolved Solids) sensing (and sometimes temperature) in a single compact unit. It’s typically used in smart water monitoring, filtration systems, irrigation systems with quality control, and IoT water analytics modules.','The Water Flow Sensor with TDS Probe MH-01 is a dual-function monitoring module designed to measure both water flow rate and Total Dissolved Solids (TDS) in water systems. It is commonly used in RO water purifiers, water quality monitoring systems, IoT water management projects, and industrial filtration systems. The module combines a hall-effect flow sensor','Dual measurement: Flow rate + TDS value\r\nFlow measurement type: Hall-effect turbine sensor\r\nTDS measurement range: 0–1000 ppm',NULL,'products/1772012666114-324151876.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-28 07:04:36'),
(2441,'BO  Motor L1 shift 1:120 (150RPM)',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The BO Motor L1 Shift 1:120 (150 RPM) is a compact DC geared motor widely used in robotics, DIY electronics, and small automation projects.','Its lightweight plastic gearbox, durable metal motor core, and L-shaped shaft design make it easy to mount in tight spaces, especially in educational and hobby robotics platforms.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771842850591-865837148.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:17:56'),
(2442,'IR Sensor Array 3',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'An IR (Infrared) Sensor Array 3-channel is a compact module that integrates three IR transmitters and receivers in a row. It’s designed to detect contrast differences (such as black/white lines) on surfaces by measuring reflected infrared light','These sensor arrays are widely used in line-following robots, edge detection systems, and simple object detection where you need to detect patterns or boundaries on the ground.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771913846143-867316743.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:17:26'),
(2443,'IR Sensor Array 4',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'IR Sensor Array 4 is a compact sensing module that consists of four infrared (IR) transmitter–receiver pairs mounted on a single PCB. It is mainly used in robotics and automation projects where multiple points of surface or object detection are required at the same time','Each sensor detects reflected infrared light, making the array ideal for identifying line position, edge detection, obstacle presence, or surface color contrast.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771913869498-462921900.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:17:49'),
(2444,'Bo Motor L1 Shift 1:48(300RPM)',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The BO Motor L1 Shift 1:48 (300 RPM) is a compact DC geared motor widely used in robotics, DIY electronics, and educational projects.','It operates at low voltage (typically 3–12 V DC) and uses a 1:48 gear reduction, which delivers a balanced combination of high torque and moderate speed (around 300 RPM).',NULL,NULL,'products/1771843013220-540974365.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:18:46'),
(2445,'Bo Motor L2 Shaft 1:120 (150 RPM)',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The BO Motor L2 Shaft 1:120 (150 RPM) is a compact DC geared motor widely used in robotics, DIY electronics, and small automation projects.','The L2 shaft design allows easy coupling with wheels, encoders, and other mechanical attachments. Lightweight, cost-effective, and easy to integrate, the BO Motor L2 150 RPM is a reliable choice for beginners and professionals working on educational and hobby robotics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771843039087-847406805.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:18:54'),
(2446,'Bo Motors Ltype  150RPM (VIGOR)',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The BO Motors L-Type 150 RPM (VIGOR) is a compact DC geared motor widely used in robotics, DIY electronics, and automation projects.','Known for its reliability and efficiency, the VIGOR BO motor is beginner-friendly, power-efficient, and well-suited for educational as well as hobby-level projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771843169920-625647270.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:19:26'),
(2447,'Bo Motors  ST 1 Shift 1:48 (300RPM)',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'BO Motors ST-1 Shift 1:48 (300 RPM) is a compact and reliable DC geared motor designed especially for robotics, DIY electronics, and automation projects.','This motor is widely used in educational kits, prototypes, and hobby robotics due to its balance of speed, torque, and reliability.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771843145433-390401881.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:19:18'),
(2448,'Bo Motors ST 2 Shift 1:120 (150RPM)',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Bo Motors ST-2 Shift 1:120 (150 RPM) is a compact and efficient DC geared motor widely used in robotics, automation, and DIY electronics projects.','Due to its lightweight body, easy mounting, and reliable torque output, the ST-2 Shift motor is commonly used in line-following robots, robotic cars, conveyor mechanisms, small actuators, and educational robotics kits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771843197323-573811847.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:19:43'),
(2449,'N20 Micro Gear Motor 3v  100 rpm',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The N20 Micro Gear Motor 3V 100 RPM is a compact and efficient DC geared motor widely used in robotics, DIY electronics, and automation projects.','Operating at 3 volts, it delivers a stable speed of approximately 100 RPM, making it ideal for applications that require controlled motion and moderate torque.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992089765-790845706.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:01:29'),
(2450,'ROUND TOY Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A round toy motor is a small, lightweight DC motor commonly used in toys, DIY electronics projects, and beginner robotics applications.','Due to their compact size, low cost, and easy availability, round toy motors are ideal for learning basic motor control, speed variation using voltage changes, and simple mechanical motion systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771999736079-894401112.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:08:56'),
(2451,'Logic Level converter module 3.3V to 5V TTL',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'Logic Level Converter Module (3.3V to 5V TTL) is a bidirectional voltage translation module used to safely interface electronic circuits operating at different logic levels. It is commonly used when connecting 3.3V devices (such as modern microcontrollers and sensors) with 5V TTL devices (such as Arduino boards, LCDs, and legacy modules).','This module typically features bidirectional MOSFET-based level shifting, allowing signals to pass automatically in both directions without manual control. It supports high-voltage (HV) and low-voltage (LV) sides, where the LV side is powered at 3.3V and the HV side at 5V.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989144640-957735039.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:12:24'),
(2452,'USB TO Serial Cable',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'USB to Serial Cable is a communication interface cable used to connect a computer’s USB port to devices that communicate using serial protocols such as TTL (UART), RS232, or RS485. It acts as a bridge, converting USB signals from a PC or laptop into serial data that microcontrollers, development boards, industrial equipment, and embedded systems can understand.','These cables commonly use reliable chipset ICs like FTDI, CP2102, or CH340, which ensure stable data transfer and wide driver support across operating systems such as Windows, Linux, and macOS. Depending on the model, USB to Serial cables may support 3.3V or 5V logic levels, making them suitable for programming and debugging boards like Arduino, ESP8266/ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, routers, and GSM/GPS modules.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006653656-307646238.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 13:13:09'),
(2453,'Logic Level Converter module 5V to 3.3V TTL',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'Logic Level Converter Module (5V to 3.3V TTL) is an electronic interface module used to safely convert 5V TTL logic signals down to 3.3V TTL levels. It is essential when connecting 5V microcontrollers or modules (such as Arduino, sensors, or displays) with 3.3V-based devices like ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi, Raspberry Pi Pico, and modern sensor modules.','The module typically works on a bidirectional MOSFET-based level shifting design, allowing automatic voltage translation without additional control signals. It has clearly marked HV (5V side) and LV (3.3V side) pins, along with multiple independent signal channels. Each channel converts digital signals reliably while maintaining proper logic timing and signal integrity.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989167503-289915534.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:12:47'),
(2454,'100 RPM Motors',NULL,NULL,'100 RPM Gear Motors',1.00,'100 RPM gear motor provides moderate speed with good torque, making it ideal for wheeled robots, line-following robots, robotic arms, and small lifting mechanisms. The torque rating varies depending on the motor design and gear ratio, and current consumption increases under load.','Due to their stable speed, durability, and affordability, 100 RPM motors are a popular choice for both beginners and professional prototyping setups.','A 100 RPM Gear Motor is a DC motor combined with a gearbox that reduces the motor’s high speed and increases torque, delivering an output speed of approximately 100 revolutions per minute (RPM). The gearbox consists of multiple gears that convert the high-speed, low-torque rotation of the motor into low-speed, high-torque output, making it suitable for applications that require controlled movement and stronger rotational force.',NULL,'products/1771651139295-880421081.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 12:27:40'),
(2455,'500 RPM Motor',NULL,NULL,'Gear Motor',999.00,'A 500 RPM motor is typically a DC geared motor designed to rotate at approximately 500 revolutions per minute (RPM) under rated voltage conditions. Unlike high-speed DC motors, this motor includes a built-in gearbox that reduces speed while increasing torque, making it suitable for applications that require controlled movement and higher pulling power.','It commonly operates at 6V, 9V, or 12V DC, depending on the model, and is widely used in robotics, DIY projects, conveyor systems, small automation setups, and motorized mechanisms.','Because of the gear reduction, a 500 RPM motor provides better torque compared to standard high-speed motors, allowing it to drive wheels, pulleys, and mechanical linkages effectively. The motor usually has a metal or plastic gearbox, a straight or D-shaped output shaft, and can be easily mounted on robot chassis or mechanical frames. Speed can be controlled using PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) through motor driver modules like L298N or other H-bridge controllers.',NULL,'products/1771821910471-951594956.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 07:03:39'),
(2456,'USB to serial CP2102 Converter AADD',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'USB to Serial CP2102 Converter (AAD) is a compact and reliable communication module used to convert USB signals from a computer into TTL-level serial (UART) communication. It is based on the CP2102 chipset by Silicon Labs, which is well known for its stability, fast data transfer, and wide operating system support.','This converter typically supports 3.3V and 5V TTL logic levels, making it suitable for interfacing with popular development boards and modules such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, GSM/GPS modules, routers, and IoT devices. The board provides standard serial pins like TXD, RXD, GND, VCC, DTR, and RTS, which are commonly used for firmware uploading, serial debugging, and console access.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006673063-168048960.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:04:33'),
(2457,'Bi-Directional Logic Level',NULL,NULL,'Bi-Directional Logic Level',999.00,'Bi-Directional Logic Level Converter is an electronic interface module designed to safely translate digital signals between two different voltage logic levels, most commonly 5V and 3.3V TTL, in both directions automatically. Unlike simple one-way converters, this module allows signals to flow from low-voltage to high-voltage and from high-voltage to low-voltage without any manual switching or control signals.','The module typically uses a MOSFET-based level shifting circuit, making it highly reliable for mixed-voltage systems. It has clearly labeled HV (high-voltage) and LV (low-voltage) power pins, along with multiple independent signal channels. Once powered, each channel automatically detects the signal direction and converts the voltage level accordingly.',' Unlike simple one-way converters, this module allows signals to flow from low-voltage to high-voltage and from high-voltage to low-voltage without any manual switching or control signals.',NULL,'products/1771840240077-377408044.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:15:12'),
(2458,'3060 RPM Motor',NULL,NULL,'Gear Motor',999.00,'A 3060 RPM motor is an electric motor that rotates at a speed of approximately 3060 revolutions per minute (RPM) under rated conditions. RPM (Revolutions Per Minute) indicates how many complete rotations the motor shaft makes in one minute. This type of motor is commonly used in small machines, robotics, DIY projects, fans, pumps, and automation systems where moderate to high rotational speed is required. Most 3060 RPM motors are DC motors, although AC versions are also available depending on the application.','Due to its stable speed performance, compact size options, and reliable operation, a 3060 RPM motor is widely preferred in both industrial and hobby-level applications where consistent rotational speed is essential.','In DC motors, speed depends on the applied voltage. For example, a 12V DC motor may provide around 3000–3060 RPM at no load. When a mechanical load is connected, the speed slightly decreases due to torque requirements. These motors may be brushed or brushless types. Brushed DC motors are simple and cost-effective, while brushless motors offer higher efficiency, longer life, and less maintenance.',NULL,'products/1771668995453-639007755.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 11:22:46'),
(2459,'Clip for N20 Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The clip for N20 motor is a compact mounting accessory designed to securely hold N20 micro DC gear motors in place during operation.','By ensuring proper alignment and stability of the N20 motor, the clip helps improve performance, accuracy, and overall reliability of the mechanical setup.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771903753406-766054539.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:01:39'),
(2460,'Serial to TTL MAX3232',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'Serial to TTL MAX3232 Module is a communication interface module used to convert RS232 serial signals into TTL-level UART signals and vice versa. It is based on the MAX3232 IC, which is specifically designed to work with low-voltage systems (3.0V to 5.5V), making it suitable for modern microcontrollers and embedded platforms.','RS232 communication uses higher voltage levels (typically ±7V to ±12V), which cannot be directly connected to TTL-based devices such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, or other microcontrollers. The MAX3232 module safely converts these voltage levels, allowing reliable serial communication between computers, industrial equipment, GSM modules, GPS devices, and embedded controllers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772000535031-739093466.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:22:15'),
(2461,'AMS1117 Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'AMS1117 Module is a compact linear voltage regulator module commonly used to provide a stable DC output voltage from a higher input voltage. It is based on the AMS1117 low-dropout (LDO) regulator IC, which is widely used in electronics and embedded systems for reliable power regulation.','The module is most commonly available in fixed output versions such as 3.3V, 5V, and 1.8V, with AMS1117-3.3 being the most popular for powering 3.3V devices like ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, sensors, and logic modules. It typically accepts an input voltage of around 4.5V to 12V (depending on load and dropout voltage) and provides a clean, regulated output.','It typically accepts an input voltage of around 4.5V to 12V (depending on load and dropout voltage) and provides a clean, regulated output.',NULL,'products/1771831494219-19486384.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:39:57'),
(2462,'USB to TTL FT232RL',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'USB to TTL FT232RL is a high-quality USB-to-UART (TTL) converter module based on the FT232RL IC from FTDI. It is widely used to convert USB signals from a computer into TTL-level serial communication, enabling reliable data exchange with microcontrollers and embedded systems.','This module supports both 3.3V and 5V TTL logic levels, making it ideal for programming and debugging devices such as Arduino boards, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, ARM controllers, GSM/GPS modules, and routers. It provides standard serial pins like TXD, RXD, GND, VCC, DTR, and RTS, which are especially useful for firmware uploading, serial monitoring, and bootloader access.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006884816-457660896.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:08:04'),
(2463,'DC Water Pump R385',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DC Water Pump R385 is a compact and powerful high-speed water pump widely used in DIY projects, RO systems, battery-operated sprayers, robotics, and small water circulation applications.','Its small size makes it easy to install in space-constrained projects, while simple wiring allows quick integration with batteries, adapters, or controllers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771905032674-612910923.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 03:50:32'),
(2465,'Gear Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,'A gear motor is an integrated mechanical unit that combines an electric motor with a gearbox to deliver high torque at low speed.','Their compact design, energy efficiency, and ability to handle heavy loads make gear motors a reliable solution for both industrial and hobby electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908757238-486750959.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:52:37'),
(2466,'USB to TTL CH340',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'USB to TTL CH340 is a compact and cost-effective USB-to-UART (TTL) converter module based on the CH340 chipset developed by WCH. It is widely used to convert USB communication from a computer into TTL-level serial signals, enabling easy interfacing with microcontrollers and embedded devices.','The CH340 module typically supports 5V and 3.3V TTL logic levels, making it suitable for programming and serial communication with boards such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, ARM controllers, GSM/GPS modules, and IoT devices. It provides standard serial pins including TXD, RXD, GND, VCC, DTR, and RTS, which are commonly required for firmware uploading and debugging.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006785439-588241470.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 08:06:25'),
(2467,'Xbee Pro S2C',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The XBee Pro S2C is a high-power wireless communication module based on the ZigBee (IEEE 802.15.4) standard, designed for reliable long-range and low-power networking.','The XBee Pro S2C is commonly used with microcontrollers like Arduino, Raspberry Pi, and industrial controllers for robust, scalable wireless data transmission.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772014778447-194372307.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 13:15:29'),
(2468,'A3967 Motor',NULL,NULL,'A3967 Motor Driver',999.00,'A3967 Motor Driver Module is a popular stepper motor driver based on the A3967 microstepping driver IC from Allegro. It is designed to control bipolar stepper motors with high precision, making it widely used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, camera sliders, and automation projects.','The A3967 supports full-step, half-step, quarter-step, and eighth-step microstepping, allowing smoother motor movement, reduced vibration, and quieter operation compared to basic stepper drivers. It operates with a motor supply voltage typically from 6V to 30V and logic control voltage of 3.3V or 5V, making it compatible with controllers such as Arduino, Raspberry Pi Pico, ESP32, and other microcontrollers.','It operates with a motor supply voltage typically from 6V to 30V and logic control voltage of 3.3V or 5V, making it compatible with controllers such as Arduino, Raspberry Pi Pico, ESP32, and other microcontrollers.',NULL,'products/1771830552515-544000478.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:17:16'),
(2469,'TB6612FNG Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'TB6612FNG Motor Driver Module is a compact and efficient dual H-bridge motor driver IC widely used to control DC motors and small stepper motors in robotics and automation projects. Manufactured by Toshiba, the TB6612FNG is known for its high efficiency, low heat generation, and reliable performance, making it a popular upgrade over older drivers like the L298N.','The module can independently control two DC motors or one bipolar stepper motor, with support for direction control, braking, and speed control via PWM. It operates with a motor supply voltage (VM) of up to 13.5V and a logic voltage (VCC) of 2.7V to 5.5V, making it fully compatible with Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, and other microcontrollers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772004341726-183141005.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:25:41'),
(2470,'ULN2003',NULL,NULL,'ULN 2003 MOTOR DRIVER MODULE',10.00,'ULN2003 is a widely used Darlington transistor array IC designed to drive high-current, high-voltage loads using low-power logic signals from microcontrollers. It contains seven NPN Darlington pairs in a single 16-pin package, each capable of switching loads that typical microcontroller GPIO pins cannot handle directly.','Each channel of the ULN2003 can sink up to 500 mA with load voltages up to 50 V, making it ideal for driving relays, solenoids, LEDs, buzzers, and stepper motors. The IC includes built-in flyback (freewheeling) diodes, which protect the circuit from voltage spikes when driving inductive loads like motors and relays—no external diodes are required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006241836-116086896.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 03:38:46'),
(2471,'PWM 3A DC Motor Speed Controller module',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'PWM 3A DC Motor Speed Controller Module is a compact power control module used to regulate the speed of DC motors using Pulse Width Modulation (PWM). By adjusting the duty cycle of the PWM signal, the module efficiently controls motor speed without significant power loss, making it more efficient than linear control methods.','This module typically operates within a wide DC input voltage range (commonly 6V to 28V DC) and can handle up to 3A continuous current, making it suitable for small to medium DC motors used in robotics, DIY projects, fans, pumps, conveyors, and automation systems. Speed adjustment is usually done via an onboard potentiometer, providing smooth and precise control.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771996716581-455507115.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:46:12'),
(2472,'L298 Motor Drives - Red',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'L298 Motor Driver – Red Module is a popular dual H-bridge motor driver board used to control DC motors and stepper motors in electronics and robotics projects. It is based on the L298 dual full-bridge driver IC and is easily recognizable by its red PCB and onboard heatsink, which helps dissipate heat during operation.','This module can independently drive two DC motors or one bipolar stepper motor, allowing control of direction, speed, and braking. It supports a motor supply voltage typically from 5V up to 35V, while the logic control section works at 5V TTL, making it compatible with controllers such as Arduino, Raspberry Pi Pico, ESP32, and other microcontrollers. Speed control is achieved using PWM signals applied to the enable pins.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771914531441-328004143.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:28:51'),
(2473,'PWM 10A DC Motorspeed controller module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'PWM 10A DC Motor Speed Controller Module is a high-current control module designed to regulate the speed of DC motors efficiently using Pulse Width Modulation (PWM). By varying the PWM duty cycle, it controls motor speed smoothly while maintaining high efficiency and minimal heat loss compared to linear controllers.','This module typically supports a wide DC input voltage range (commonly 6V–30V or 9V–36V, depending on model) and can handle up to 10A continuous current, making it suitable for high-power DC motors used in electric scooters, pumps, fans, conveyors, robotic platforms, and automation equipment. Speed control is usually provided through a robust onboard potentiometer for precise and smooth adjustment.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771996578503-283140560.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:16:18'),
(2474,'MACH3 Interface Board for 5 axis CNC',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A MACH3 Interface Board is essentially a breakout/motion control board that allows your PC with MACH3 software to control a CNC machine — especially when you have up to 5 axes of motion','MACH3 generates step/direction signals based on G-code, and the interface board translates these into electrical signals your motor drivers and peripherals can understand',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989471841-920092924.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:17:51'),
(2475,'Xbee S2C',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'XBee S2C is a compact and low-power ZigBee RF communication module designed for reliable wireless data transmission in IoT, industrial automation, and embedded systems.','It features UART communication, configurable firmware, and is available with chip or wire antennas, allowing flexible integration into Arduino, Raspberry Pi, sensor networks, smart energy systems, and home automation projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772014813065-546979498.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 13:15:44'),
(2476,'PH Tester soil water moisture',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'pH Tester – Soil & Water Moisture Meter is a practical measuring instrument used to check the pH level and moisture content of soil and sometimes water, especially in agriculture, gardening, horticulture, and greenhouse applications. It helps users understand soil conditions so plants receive the right nutrients and water balance.','This tester typically uses metal probe electrodes that are inserted directly into the soil. It provides a pH reading to indicate whether the soil is acidic, neutral, or alkaline, which is crucial because different crops and plants grow best within specific pH ranges. Along with pH, the device measures soil moisture levels, helping to avoid over-watering or under-watering plants.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771995705783-694930389.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 05:01:45'),
(2477,'Xbee Base',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'An XBee Base is a support or adapter board designed to easily interface XBee wireless modules with other hardware such as microcontrollers, computers, or development boards.','Overall, the XBee Base is an essential accessory for rapid prototyping, configuration, and reliable deployment of XBee wireless communication projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772014746719-880283120.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 13:15:00'),
(2478,'MG996 Servo motor 180 degree',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'MG996 Servo Motor (180°) is a popular high-torque, hobby-grade RC servo widely used in robotics, automation, RC vehicles, and DIY electronics projects.','It typically rotates up to 180 degrees, making it suitable for applications that require precise angular motion within a limited range.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990209858-701090751.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-25 11:15:08'),
(2479,'MG996 Servo motor 360 degree',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'MG996 Servo Motor (360° Continuous Rotation) is a variant of the standard MG996 hobby servo that has been modified or designed to provide continuous rotation instead of the usual ~180° position control.','Instead of moving to a specific angle, a continuous-rotation MG996 behaves more like a motor with directional and speed control, making it suitable for robot drive wheels, mobile robots, conveyor direction control, and differential steering platforms.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990263641-938462106.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-25 11:14:54'),
(2480,'20KG Servo motor',NULL,NULL,'Servo motor',999.00,'A 20KG Servo Motor is a high-torque servo motor commonly used in robotics, RC vehicles, automation systems, and mechanical control applications. The term 20KG refers to the torque rating of the servo motor, which means it can provide approximately 20 kilograms-centimeter (kg·cm) of torque, allowing it to move or hold relatively heavy loads.','This means it can exert enough rotational force to lift or move a load of 20 kg at 1 cm from the shaft, making it suitable for large robots, RC vehicles, heavy-load mechanisms, steering systems, and industrial applications.','Most 20KG servo motors operate within a voltage range of about 4.8V to 7.4V, and they typically use metal gears for higher strength and durability compared to plastic gear servos. The motor contains several internal components such as a DC motor, gear reduction system, control circuit, and position feedback potentiometer, which work together to provide accurate movement.',NULL,'products/1771660531878-186987574.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:36:47'),
(2481,'UNO Cable',NULL,NULL,NULL,199.00,'UNO Cable usually refers to the USB cable used with the Arduino UNO development board. This cable connects the Arduino UNO to a computer for programming, power, and serial communication.','The UNO cable isn’t a special board part — it’s simply the USB cable that connects your Arduino UNO to your computer for programming and power. If you need one, get a USB-A to USB-B cable (sometimes called a printer cable) unless your specific board uses a different USB connector.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006531577-111110095.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 13:11:35'),
(2482,'NEMA 176.1',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'NEMA 17 (6.1 kg·cm) stepper motor is a compact and high-torque bipolar stepper motor widely used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, camera sliders, and automation projects.','NEMA 17 (6.1 kg·cm) stepper motor is a compact and high-torque bipolar stepper motor widely used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, camera sliders, and automation projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992581712-85992000.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:09:41'),
(2483,'NEMA 237.2',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'NEMA 23 (7.2A) stepper motor is a high-torque, precision motor commonly used in CNC machines, 3D printers, industrial automation, and robotics.','Known for their reliability, smooth motion, and repeatable performance, NEMA 23 7.2A stepper motors are ideal for applications requiring precise speed control, high torque at low speeds, and continuous operation in demanding environments.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992695340-595284752.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:11:35'),
(2484,'NEMA  2318.9',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The NEMA 23 18.9 stepper motor is a high-torque motor commonly used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, automation systems, and industrial positioning equipment.','Known for its reliability, smooth stepping, and compatibility with popular motor drivers, the NEMA 23 18.9 is widely preferred in medium-to-heavy duty motion control projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992470877-886306243.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:07:50'),
(2485,'NEMA 3487 Kg cm Hybrid bipolar',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The NEMA 34 87 kg·cm Hybrid Bipolar Stepper Motor is a high-torque industrial motor widely used in CNC machines, robotics, automation systems, and heavy-duty positioning applications.','Built with a robust frame size of NEMA 34, it ensures durability, efficient heat dissipation, and reliable performance in continuous industrial operation.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992835670-607056034.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:13:55'),
(2486,'NEMA 175.5',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'NEMA 17 5.5R stepper motor is a compact, high-torque stepper motor commonly used in precision motion applications such as 3D printers, CNC machines, robotics, and automation projects.','popular motor drivers and microcontrollers like Arduino and CNC controllers, making it a reliable choice for linear actuators, belt drives, lead screws, and other precise mechanical systems where consistent torque and repeatability are required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992541873-806239354.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:09:01'),
(2487,'Linear motion solenoid Electromagnet JF-0630B',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'JF?0630B DC 24V 1A 10mm 6N Push Pull Solenoid Electromagnet / JF?0630B 12VDC 1A 10mm 6N Push Pull Solenoid Electromagnet / JF?0630B DC 12V 2A 10mm 6N Push Pull Solenoid (and similar variants) are linear motion solenoid actuators — essentially electromagnets that convert electrical energy into straight-line mechanical motion. When powered, they pull or push a metal plunger to perform work like locking, latching, pulling, or pushing mechanisms','A solenoid like the JF-0630B has a coil of wire around a metal core and a plunger inside. When electricity flows through the coil, it becomes an electromagnet',NULL,NULL,'products/1771916187850-699458772.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:26:07'),
(2488,'STEPPER  MOTOR 5V 28BYJ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The 5V 28BYJ stepper motor is a compact, low-cost unipolar stepper motor widely used in electronics projects, robotics, and automation applications','Due to its small size, low power consumption, and smooth step-by-step motion, the 28BYJ is ideal for applications such as robotic arms, camera sliders, valve control systems, small CNC models, and educational learning kits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772003573675-579502093.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:12:53'),
(2489,'BTS7960 43A H-Bridge High-power Driver',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The BTS7960 is a high-power H-bridge motor driver module capable of driving DC motors (and with some setups, stepper motors) that draw up to ~43 A of current. It uses the BTS7960 integrated driver IC (from Infineon/NovalithIC) arranged as an H-bridge for full bidirectional control — forward, reverse, braking, and PWM speed-control','An H-bridge arrangement is a special transistor/MOSFET network that lets you reverse the polarity of the motor supply, enabling forward/reverse rotation without mechanical switches. The BTS7960 integrates powerful MOSFET switches and driver circuitry into compact modules',NULL,NULL,'products/1771844114348-641762515.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:06:01'),
(2490,'NEMA 34 68 kg HybridBipolar',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The NEMA 34 68 kg Hybrid Bipolar Stepper Motor is a high-torque, industrial-grade motor widely used in CNC machines, automation systems, robotics, and heavy linear motion applications.','while bipolar wiring provides stronger torque and improved control compared to unipolar motors.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992809355-632888378.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:13:29'),
(2491,'NEMA 34 122 KG cm HybridBipolar',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The NEMA 34 122 kg·cm Hybrid Bipolar Stepper Motor is a high-torque industrial-grade motor designed for demanding motion-control applications such as CNC machines.','cally operates with a 1.8° step angle (200 steps per revolution) and requires a compatible bipolar stepper driver to achieve optimal torque and speed.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771992781114-464719853.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:13:01'),
(2492,'DM542 Stepper motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The DM542 is a high-performance two-phase microstepping stepper motor driver commonly used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and other motion control applications','It’s designed to precisely control bipolar stepper motors with adjustable current and microstepping settings, giving you smooth motion and good torque across a wide speed range.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771905620969-398655404.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:00:20'),
(2493,'Photoelectric speed sensor encoder coded disc code',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'Photoelectric Speed Sensor with Encoder Coded Disc is a sensing system used to measure rotational speed (RPM), position, and direction of a rotating shaft. It works on the optical (photoelectric) principle, where a light source and a photodetector detect interruptions caused by a slotted or patterned encoder disc attached to the rotating object.','Encoder Coded Disc – a circular disc with evenly spaced slots or markings (transparent/opaque).\r\nPhotoelectric Sensor – includes an IR LED (light emitter) and a phototransistor or photodiode (receiver) placed on opposite sides of the disc (or side-by-side in reflective types).',NULL,NULL,'products/1771995771950-581997879.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:42:10'),
(2494,'TB6600 Stepper motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'TB6600 Stepper Motor Driver is a popular high-performance stepper motor driver module commonly used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and automation projects.','It’s designed to drive 2-phase stepper motors with high current, adjustable microstepping, and robust protection features.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772004295711-472074781.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:24:55'),
(2495,'320mah battery  for RC Drone 150mah',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 320mAh and 150mAh battery used for RC drones are small-capacity Lithium-Polymer (Li-Po) rechargeable batteries designed for lightweight flying applications. These batteries are commonly used in micro and mini RC drones where size, weight, and quick power delivery are very important. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates capacity; a 320mAh battery provides more backup time compared to a 150mAh battery, but it is slightly heavier.','Its robust NEMA 34 frame size ensures durability, effective heat dissipation, and reliable operation in continuous industrial environments, making it a preferred choice for applications where strength, precision, and long service life are critical.','Both batteries are usually 1S (single cell) 3.7V Li-Po batteries, with a full charge voltage of 4.2V and a cut-off voltage around 3.0V. They are capable of delivering high discharge current, which is necessary for drone motors during takeoff and fast movement. Flight time generally ranges from 3 to 8 minutes depending on drone size, motor efficiency, and flying style. Proper charging using a compatible Li-Po charger is essential to maintain safety and battery life.',NULL,'products/1772451223715-678247889.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 11:33:43'),
(2496,'BMS 2S 20Amp',NULL,NULL,'BMS Board',499.00,'A BMS 2S 20A (Battery Management System) is an electronic protection circuit designed for 2-cell lithium-ion or lithium-polymer battery packs connected in series. The term 2S means the system is designed for two battery cells in series, typically giving a nominal voltage of 7.4V (8.4V when fully charged).','The 20A rating indicates the maximum current the BMS can safely handle during charging or discharging. This module protects lithium batteries from unsafe conditions such as over-charging, over-discharging, short circuits, and over-current, which helps extend battery life and ensures safe operation.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771841549727-204609525.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:58:28'),
(2497,'Battery  for RC Drone 180mah',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 180mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight Lithium-Polymer (Li-Po) power source designed mainly for mini and nano drones.','Due to its small size and quick charging capability, the 180mAh RC drone battery is widely used in toy drones, micro quadcopters, and DIY lightweight aerial projects.','Due to its small size and quick charging capability, the 180mAh RC drone battery is widely used in toy drones, micro quadcopters, and DIY lightweight aerial projects.',NULL,'products/1771836851592-450238570.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:08:39'),
(2498,'BMS 5S 15Amp',NULL,NULL,'BMS Board',499.00,'A Battery Management System (BMS) for 5S 15A is a protection board used with lithium battery packs that have five cells in series (5S), giving a nominal pack voltage around 18.5 V (fully charged ~21 V).','The “15A” rating means the board is designed to handle up to 15 A continuous discharge current safely, protecting the battery from harmful conditions.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771842754364-77170944.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:58:53'),
(2499,'BMS 6S 15 Amp',NULL,NULL,'BMS Board',499.00,'A Battery Management System (BMS) for 6S is a protective circuit board designed for lithium battery packs made of six cells in series (6S). A 6S pack has a nominal voltage of about 22.2 V and a fully charged voltage up to ~25.2 V.','The “15 A” rating means the BMS can safely handle continuous discharge currents up to ~15 amps, protecting the pack under normal use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771842787979-912872504.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:59:53'),
(2500,'Battery for RC Drone 500 mah',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 500 mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight, and rechargeable power source specifically designed to provide the energy needed for small remote-controlled aircraft to fly.','Proper charging and handling according to manufacturer guidelines is essential for safety and longevity of the battery.','Proper charging and handling according to manufacturer guidelines is essential for safety and longevity of the battery.',NULL,'products/1771839393134-568044865.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:10:03'),
(2501,'IR Sensor Array 5',NULL,NULL,'IR Module 5 Array',899.00,'IR Sensor Array 5 is a compact sensing module that integrates five infrared (IR) transmitter–receiver pairs on a single PCB. It is designed for applications that require multi-point surface or object detection with higher accuracy than single or dual sensors. By reading reflected IR light, the array can detect line position, edges, obstacles, and surface contrast in real time.','The array generally operates on a 3.3V–5V DC supply, making it compatible with Arduino, ESP8266/ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico, and other microcontrollers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771913895295-895928777.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 06:45:17'),
(2502,'Battery for RC Drone 800 mah',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'An 800 mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight power source designed to supply sufficient energy for small to medium-sized remote-controlled aircraft','Always ensure proper charging, storage, and handling to maximize performance and longevity.','An 800 mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight power source designed to supply sufficient energy for small to medium-sized remote-controlled aircraft',NULL,'products/1771839416038-474217584.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:10:37'),
(2503,'Battery for RC Drone 850 mah',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'An 850 mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight power source designed to deliver a balance of flight time and agility for small to medium-sized remote-controlled aircraft.','Overall, an 850 mAh RC drone battery is ideal for hobbyists seeking good performance in a lightweight package for casual flying, aerial photography, or racing drones in its class.','An 850 mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight power source designed to deliver a balance of flight time and agility for small to medium-sized remote-controlled aircraft.',NULL,'products/1771839440367-763086961.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:11:38'),
(2504,'Battery for RC Drone 1200 mah',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'An RC drone’s battery with a 1200 mAh capacity is typically a 3.7 V lithium-polymer (LiPo) rechargeable battery designed to provide lightweight yet reliable power for small to medium-sized quadcopters and hobby drones.','Charging with the correct charger and avoiding over-discharge helps maintain performance and safety over many flights.','Charging with the correct charger and avoiding over-discharge helps maintain performance and safety over many flights.',NULL,'products/1771839371381-999580013.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:09:27'),
(2505,'IR Sensor Array 8',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'IR Sensor Array 8 is a compact and integrated sensing module that includes eight infrared (IR) emitter–receiver pairs arranged in a row on a single board.','It’s designed for multi-point detection of surfaces or objects and is especially useful in robotics and automation projects where finer spatial resolution is needed compared to smaller arrays.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771913912604-267738531.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:18:32'),
(2506,'Slim Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A slim battery is a compact, lightweight power source designed to deliver reliable energy while occupying minimal space','. Because of their space-saving form factor and dependable performance, slim batteries are ideal for applications where design, portability, and efficiency are equally important.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001525159-891585250.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:38:45'),
(2507,'TCRT5000 sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'TCRT5000 Sensor is a commonly used infrared reflective optical sensor that detects objects or surface contrast by sensing reflected IR light','It combines an IR LED emitter and a phototransistor receiver in a single package, making it ideal for proximity sensing, line detection, and edge sensing in robotics and automation projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772004404129-944132690.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:26:44'),
(2508,'40mah  Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 40 mAh battery is a very small-capacity rechargeable or non-rechargeable battery commonly used in low-power electronic devices such as wearable gadgets, wireless earbuds components.','These batteries are typically available in lithium-ion or lithium-polymer (Li-Po) form, offering stable voltage output, lightweight construction, and good charge–discharge reliability for micro-electronics.','A 40mAh battery is a very small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth headsets, smart wearables, mini wireless earbuds, small IoT modules, hearing aids, and tiny embedded systems.',NULL,'products/1771672666354-589491151.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 05:41:18'),
(2509,'75mah  Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'The 75mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly available in lithium-polymer (Li-Po) or lithium-ion type, designed for compact electronic devices requiring lightweight and portable power. It typically provides a nominal voltage of 3.7V, making it suitable for low-power applications such as wearable electronics, Bluetooth devices, miniature IoT modules, and DIY electronics projects.','The battery offers stable discharge performance, rechargeable capability, and compact size for space-constrained designs. With proper charging using a compatible lithium battery charger module (such as TP4056), the 75mAh battery delivers reliable operation and long cycle life for small electronic systems.','It typically provides a nominal voltage of 3.7V, making it suitable for low-power applications such as wearable electronics, Bluetooth devices, miniature IoT modules, and DIY electronics projects.',NULL,'products/1771828939202-163546908.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:07:04'),
(2510,'Tsop sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'TSOP Sensor refers to a family of infrared (IR) remote-receiver modules commonly used to detect and decode modulated IR signals from remote controls and other IR transmitters','TSOP devices are designed to filter ambient light and noise and respond only to IR signals at specific carrier frequencies (e.g., 36 kHz, 38 kHz, 40 kHz), making them ideal for remote control and wireless communication applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772005898569-262024647.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 07:51:38'),
(2511,'90mah  Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 90mAh battery is a very small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth headsets, smart wearables, mini MP3 players, small IoT modules, toys, and lightweight embedded systems.','can be safely charged using a proper protection circuit to prevent overcharging or deep discharge.','These batteries require a proper CC-CV (constant current–constant voltage) charging method and are typically charged up to 4.2V maximum using a suitable lithium battery charging module.',NULL,'products/1771830610556-718025416.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:13:10'),
(2512,'IR Proximity obstacle sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'IR Proximity / Obstacle Sensor is an electronic sensing module used to detect nearby objects or obstacles using infrared (IR) light.','It works on the principle of IR reflection—an IR LED emits infrared light, and when an object is present in front of the sensor, the reflected IR light is detected by a photodiode or phototransistor.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771912760938-35205828.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 05:59:20'),
(2513,'110mah Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',399.00,'A 110mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices. The term 110mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates that the battery can supply 110 milliamps for 1 hour, or lower current for a longer duration (for example, 55mA for 2 hours). These batteries are most commonly available in Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-Polymer (Li-Po) chemistry with a nominal voltage of 3.7V and a fully charged voltage of 4.2V.','While not suitable for high-current applications, a 110 mAh battery provides efficient backup and short-duration power for low-energy electronics.','This type of battery is mainly used in Bluetooth headsets, small IoT modules, wearable devices, mini drones, MP3 players, smart bands, and microcontroller-based compact projects. Due to its small size and lightweight design, it is ideal for portable and space-constrained applications.',NULL,'products/1771654303856-940939982.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 13:27:43'),
(2514,'130mah Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A 130mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable or non-rechargeable power source commonly used in compact electronic devices where size and weight are critical.','with low current consumption, making it ideal for short-duration or standby-based operation where compact form factor is essential.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771655926656-683591241.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-11 11:17:45'),
(2515,'150mah Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',500.00,'A 150 mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable power source commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth earbuds, fitness bands, smartwatches, small sensors, wearable electronics, and DIY electronics projects','While not suitable for high-power applications, a 150 mAh battery is ideal for low-power devices where small size, portability, and reliability are essential.','A 150mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable or non-rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth earphones, small toys, mini MP3 players, wearable gadgets, and IoT modules. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) represents the battery’s capacity, meaning a 150mAh battery can theoretically supply 150 milliamps of current for one hour, or 75 milliamps for two hours, depending on the load. The actual backup time varies based on device power consumption and efficiency.',NULL,'products/1771656789986-129464581.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 10:59:36'),
(2516,'300mm lead screw with Nut',NULL,NULL,'Screw Driver',999.00,'A 300mm lead screw with nut is a mechanical component used to convert rotational motion into linear motion. It consists of a threaded rod (lead screw) of 300 millimeters length and a matching nut that moves along the screw when it rotates. When the screw is turned using a motor or hand rotation, the nut travels forward or backward depending on the direction of rotation. Lead screws are commonly used in CNC machines, 3D printers, linear actuators, and automation systems for precise positioning and controlled movement.','It consists of a lead screw (threaded rod) that is 300 mm long and a matching nut (often a brass or Delrin nut), which travels up and down the screw as it rotates. These are widely used in CNC machines, 3D printers, robotics, and automation systems for accurate positioning.','Lead screws are typically made of stainless steel or carbon steel for strength and durability, while the nut is often made of brass or bronze to reduce friction and wear. A common type is the T8 lead screw, which usually has an 8mm diameter. The pitch (distance between threads) determines how much the nut moves per rotation. For example, in a T8 lead screw with 2mm pitch and 4 starts, the lead may be 8mm per rotation.',NULL,'products/1771668257388-746520656.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 11:20:34'),
(2517,'180mah Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A 180mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable power source commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth earphones, fitness bands, wireless sensors, miniature IoT modules, and wearable electronics.','They are rechargeable, support hundreds of charge cycles, and are widely used in low-power portable electronics.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771658190288-689621512.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-11 11:18:38'),
(2518,'12V 40w cartridge heater 6mm for 3d printer',NULL,NULL,'Cartridge Heater',499.00,'A 12V 40W Cartridge Heater (6mm) is a cylindrical electric heating element commonly used in 3D printers, especially in the hotend assembly. It is designed to heat the heater block to melt filament materials such as PLA, ABS, PETG, and other thermoplastics. The heater typically has a 6mm diameter and is inserted into the heater block of the 3D printer hotend. It operates at 12 volts with a power rating of 40 watts, providing fast and stable heating.','It provides efficient, concentrated heat to melt filament during printing. These heaters are widely used in RepRap, Prusa, Creality, and other FDM-style printers that operate on 12 V systems.','This cartridge heater is made of a stainless steel outer tube with an internal resistance heating coil insulated by magnesium oxide powder. When electrical power is applied, the resistance coil generates heat, which is transferred to the heater block. The heater works along with a thermistor or temperature sensor, which monitors the temperature and sends feedback to the printer’s control board.',NULL,'products/1771655229635-651320444.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-27 10:56:50'),
(2519,'200mah Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',998.00,'A 200mAh battery is a small-capacity battery that can deliver 200 milliampere-hours (mAh) of electrical charge. The mAh rating indicates how much current the battery can supply over a period of time. For example, a 200mAh battery can provide 200mA for 1 hour or 100mA for 2 hours, depending on the device’s power consumption.','Due to their limited capacity, they are best suited for devices with short operating times or low current requirements, and they typically support USB or module-based charging circuits for safe and efficient recharging.','A 200mAh battery works on the principle of electrochemical energy conversion. Inside the battery, chemical reactions occur between the anode (negative terminal) and cathode (positive terminal) through an electrolyte. When connected to a circuit, electrons flow from the negative terminal to the positive terminal through the external load, providing electrical energy to power the device.',NULL,'products/1771660447956-895273624.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-27 11:38:52'),
(2520,'250mah Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A 250mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as wearable gadgets, Bluetooth accessories, small IoT modules, remote controls, toys, and DIY electronics projects.','250mAh batteries are ideal where space is limited, though runtime depends on the device’s power consumption and efficiency.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771664982017-767040232.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:38:26'),
(2521,'280mah Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,'A 280mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth modules, wearable gadgets, wireless sensors, mini IoT boards, and DIY electronics projects.','with proper charging protection and is often paired with a PCM/BMS protection circuit to prevent over-charge, over-discharge, and short-circuit conditions.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771665706740-872441114.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:38:45');
INSERT INTO `product` VALUES
(2522,'3D printer Endstop',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'3D Printer Endstop (also called a limit switch) is a sensor used in 3D printers to detect the position of moving parts like the print head or the bed. ','Endstops tell the controller when an axis has reached its limit, so the printer can accurately home and prevent crashes.','Endstops tell the controller when an axis has reached its limit, so the printer can accurately home and prevent crashes.',NULL,'products/1771670268249-804720166.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 13:20:26'),
(2523,'300mah Battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 300mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth headsets, small toys, mini speakers, wearable devices, and IoT modules. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) represents the battery capacity, meaning a 300mAh battery can theoretically supply 300 milliamps of current for one hour, or 100 milliamps for about three hours, depending on the load. The actual backup time depends on the power consumption of the connected device.','A 300mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable or non-rechargeable power source commonly used in compact electronic devices where low power consumption','Most 300mAh batteries are Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) types because they are lightweight, rechargeable, and provide good energy density. These batteries typically have a nominal voltage of 3.7V and a full charge voltage of 4.2V. Proper charging using a suitable charging module with overcharge and over-discharge protection is important to maintain safety and extend battery life.',NULL,'products/1771668233982-222059438.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 11:18:35'),
(2524,'3D printer Auto bed leveling sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'An Auto Bed Leveling (ABL) Sensor for a 3D printer is a probe that automatically measures the height of the print bed at multiple points and lets the printer compensate for surface irregularities during printing.','This dramatically improves first-layer adhesion and print quality, especially on large or slightly warped beds.','A 3D printer auto bed leveling (ABL) sensor is a device used to automatically measure and adjust the distance between the printer nozzle and the print bed.',NULL,'products/1771670244293-212212663.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 13:16:46'),
(2525,'350Mah battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',500.00,'A 350mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth headsets, wearable gadgets, mini speakers, toys, and small IoT modules. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates the battery capacity, meaning a 350mAh battery can theoretically supply 350 milliamps of current for one hour, or 175 milliamps for about two hours, depending on the device load. The actual backup time varies based on power consumption and efficiency of the connected device.','Due to their compact size, they are ideal where space is limited, but they are not suitable for high-current or long-duration power needs.','Most 350mAh batteries are Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) types because they are lightweight, compact, and offer good energy density. A typical single-cell 350mAh battery has a nominal voltage of 3.7V, a full charge voltage of 4.2V, and a cut-off voltage around 3.0V. The approximate energy stored in a 3.7V 350mAh battery is about 1.30Wh (3.7V × 0.35Ah). These batteries generally support several hundred charge cycles when properly maintained.',NULL,'products/1771669839814-262131221.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 13:08:20'),
(2526,'3D printer Filament ABS 1.7mm',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'ABS (Acrylonitrile Butadiene Styrene) is a widely used thermoplastic filament for FDM/FFF 3D printers. It offers good strength, impact resistance, and durability, making it ideal for functional parts rather than just decorative prints','1.75 mm is the standard for most consumer FDM printers today. A few older or specialty printers use 3.0/3.00 mm (2.85 mm) filament','ABS (Acrylonitrile Butadiene Styrene) 1.75mm filament is a popular thermoplastic material used in FDM (Fused Deposition Modeling) 3D printers. The 1.75mm refers to the filament diameter, which is the standard size compatible with most desktop 3D printers. ABS is known for its strength, durability, impact resistance, and heat resistance, making it suitable for functional parts, mechanical components, automotive parts, and enclosures.',NULL,'products/1771670290688-534490461.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 13:23:50'),
(2527,'30Mah battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A 400 mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices.','These batteries are widely used in Bluetooth devices, wireless earphones, fitness bands, IoT modules, mini robots, remote controls, GPS trackers, small medical devices, and DIY electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771669052143-143825210.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-21 10:17:32'),
(2528,'MK2B PCB Heatbed 12/24 for  3D printer',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A PCB heatbed is the heated build platform in many FDM/FFF 3D printers that helps the first layer of filament stick to the bed and reduces warping during printing','The MK2B version is a classic style of PCB heatbed originally used on RepRap/Prusa/Mendel printer',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990895027-351444067.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:27:28'),
(2529,'RAMPS 1.6 shield for 3d printers',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'RAMPS (RepRap Arduino Mega Pololu Shield) is an expansion/controller board that sits on top of an Arduino Mega 2560 microcontroller','It combines the electronics needed to control a 3D printer — stepper drivers, heaters, thermistors, endstop inputs, fans, and more — into a modular, DIY-friendly platform.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771996923195-775226259.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:30:02'),
(2530,'LCD Display Screen Controller Module','2004',NULL,'LCD Display ',999.00,'An LCD (Liquid Crystal Display) is an electronic display device used to show text, numbers, images, and graphics. It works by using liquid crystals that control light passing through them to create visible characters or images. LCDs are widely used in electronic devices such as calculators, digital clocks, televisions, computers, industrial equipment, and embedded systems like Arduino projects.','It combines a 20×4 character LCD screen with navigation buttons and often an encoder (knob) plus an SD card reader, making it ideal for REP-based controllers like RAMPS, MKS, Creality boards, etc.','LCD controller modules are widely used in monitors, televisions, digital signage systems, embedded systems, DIY display projects, and industrial applications. They are especially useful when converting a raw LCD panel into a standalone monitor.',NULL,'products/1771660333981-699147643.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-27 11:37:09'),
(2531,'Flexible shaft coupling 5mm to 5mm for 3d printer',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A Flexible Shaft Coupling 5 mm to 5 mm is a precision mechanical connector used to join two shafts with 5 mm diameter ends — typically between a stepper motor shaft and a lead screw, threaded rod, or another shaft in a 3D printer','A Flexible Shaft Coupling 5 mm to 5 mm is a precision mechanical connector used to join two shafts with 5 mm diameter ends — typically between a stepper motor shaft and a lead screw, threaded rod, or another shaft in a 3D printer',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908446832-283794092.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 04:47:26'),
(2532,'Bracket for steppet motor NEMA17',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A Bracket for Stepper Motor NEMA17 is a mounting support used to securely fix a NEMA17 stepper motor into a 3D printer, CNC machine, robot, or any mechanical assembly','It provides a rigid and precise mechanical interface between the motor and the machine’s frame, ensuring accurate motion transfer and alignment.','It provides a rigid and precise mechanical interface between the motor and the machine’s frame, ensuring accurate motion transfer and alignment.',NULL,'products/1771843359546-866559000.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:38:35'),
(2533,'DYS Brushless motor ',NULL,NULL,'DYS Brushless motor ',699.00,'DYS Brushless Motors (1000 KV / 1400 KV / 1800 KV) are a family of high-performance outrunner brushless DC motors widely used in RC aircraft, multirotor drones (quadcopters, hexacopters), RC cars, and robotics.','DYS Brushless Motors (1000 KV / 1400 KV / 1800 KV) are a family of high-performance outrunner brushless DC motors widely used in RC aircraft, multirotor drones (quadcopters, hexacopters), RC cars, and robotics.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771843914079-743265119.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:57:23'),
(2534,'A2212 Brushless motor ',NULL,NULL,'A2212 Brushless motor ',699.00,'A2212 refers to a size class of three-phase brushless DC (BLDC) outrunner motors. These motors are lightweight, efficient, and designed to be driven by an Electronic Speed Controller (ESC).','A2212 refers to a size class of three-phase brushless DC (BLDC) outrunner motors. ','These motors are lightweight, efficient, and designed to be driven by an Electronic Speed Controller (ESC).',NULL,'products/1771843497109-763863897.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:44:04'),
(2535,'IMAX B6/B6AC battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'IMAX B6 and B6AC are microprocessor-controlled battery chargers with balancing for multi-cell packs. They are designed to charge, discharge, and balance a wide range of rechargeable battery chemistries safely and efficiently.','IMAX B6 and B6AC are microprocessor-controlled battery chargers with balancing for multi-cell packs. They are designed to charge, discharge, and balance a wide range of rechargeable battery chemistries safely and efficiently.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771912595206-83849411.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:55:14'),
(2536,'GSM Antenna ',NULL,NULL,'GSM Antenna ',399.00,'A GSM Antenna is a dedicated radio antenna designed to transmit and receive GSM (Global System for Mobile communications) signals.','These antennas connect to GSM modems, modules, or routers (like SIM800, SIM900, A6, M590, Quectel, etc.) and ensure reliable cellular connectivity for voice, SMS, and data communication. ','They are a crucial part of any GSM-based project, whether it’s a GSM tracker, IoT device, alarm system, or remote controller.',NULL,'products/1771832309368-443463258.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 10:00:50'),
(2537,'Antenna GSM Sticker',NULL,NULL,'Antenna GSM Sticker',399.00,'A GSM Antenna Sticker (also called an adhesive or patch GSM antenna) is a flat, lightweight antenna designed to receive and transmit GSM cellular signals (typically in the 850/900/1800/1900 MHz bands) without the bulk of a traditional “whip” antenna.','These antennas are made using printed traces on a flexible substrate and come with an adhesive backing so they can stick directly onto enclosures, metal surfaces, or plastic cases.','These antennas are made using printed traces on a flexible substrate and come with an adhesive backing so they can stick directly onto enclosures, metal surfaces, or plastic cases.',NULL,'products/1771832169260-8405297.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:46:11'),
(2538,'Wheel for N20 Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A Wheel for N20 Motor is a small wheel designed to be driven directly by an N20 geared DC motor — a compact, low-voltage motor commonly used in small robots, rovers, line followers, and DIY electronics projects.','A Wheel for N20 Motor is a small wheel designed to be driven directly by an N20 geared DC motor — a compact, low-voltage motor commonly used in small robots, rovers, line followers, and DIY electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772014312539-211693162.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 10:11:52'),
(2539,'Tec1-12710',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The TEC1-12710 is a thermoelectric cooling module (also called a Peltier cooler). It’s a solid-state heat pump that transfers heat from one side to the other when powered with DC voltag','One side becomes cold, while the opposite side becomes hot. Reversing the power polarity switches the hot/cold sides.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772431708088-209289947.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 06:08:28'),
(2540,'1264TEP1 thermoelectric cooling module',NULL,NULL,'Thermoelectric cooling module',399.00,'The 1264TEP1 is a thermoelectric cooling module (commonly similar to TEC1-12604 type) based on the Peltier effect. It is designed to create a temperature difference when DC power is applied. When current flows through the module, one side becomes cold while the opposite side becomes hot. This module is widely used in small cooling systems, mini refrigerators, water coolers, CPU cooling experiments, medical storage boxes, and scientific projects.','It’s part of a family of Bismuth-Telluride (Bi-Te) thermoelectric modules designed to convert heat directly into electrical power using the Seebeck effect when a temperature difference is applied across the device','The device operates based on the Peltier Effect, where heat is transferred between two different materials when electric current passes through them. Reversing the polarity will swap the hot and cold sides.',NULL,'products/1771654883245-823087421.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 14:50:05'),
(2541,'Tec1-12709',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'TEC1-12709 is a thermoelectric cooling module (also called a Peltier cooler) — a compact solid-state heat pump that transfers heat from one side to the other when powered with DC voltage.','These modules are often used in electronics cooling, small refrigerators, CPU coolers, project boxes, portable coolers, and temperature control experiments.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772431762274-812478209.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 06:09:22'),
(2542,'12706 Peltier',NULL,NULL,'Thermoelectric cooling module',399.00,'The 12706 Peltier module (commonly marked as TEC1-12706) is a thermoelectric cooling device that operates using the Peltier effect. When DC power is applied, one side of the module becomes cold while the opposite side becomes hot. It is widely used in mini refrigerators, water coolers, CPU cooling systems, laboratory devices, and portable cooling applications.','One side becomes cold while the other becomes hot, allowing you to cool or heat small spaces or components.','The module consists of multiple P-type and N-type semiconductor elements placed between two ceramic plates. When current flows, heat is absorbed from one surface (cold side) and transferred to the other surface (hot side). Reversing the power polarity swaps the heating and cooling sides.',NULL,'products/1771654955073-260288400.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 14:53:51'),
(2543,'12704 Peltier',NULL,NULL,'Thermoelectric cooling',396.00,'The 12704 Peltier module (commonly labeled TEC1-12704) is a thermoelectric cooling device that works based on the Peltier effect. When DC voltage is applied, one side of the module becomes cold while the opposite side becomes hot. It is widely used in small cooling systems, portable refrigerators, electronic cooling applications, and DIY thermal projects.','These modules are common in DIY refrigeration, electronics temperature control, and small cooling projects','The module contains multiple P-type and N-type semiconductor junctions sandwiched between ceramic plates. When current flows through the junctions, heat is absorbed on one side and released on the other. Reversing the polarity swaps the hot and cold sides.',NULL,'products/1771654921673-692525697.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 14:52:20'),
(2544,'320Mah battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 320mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth headsets, smart bands, mini speakers, toys, and IoT modules. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) represents the battery capacity, meaning a 320mAh battery can theoretically supply 320 milliamps of current for one hour, or 160 milliamps for about two hours, depending on the device load. The actual backup time varies based on power consumption and operating conditions.','Most 320mAh batteries are Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) types because they are lightweight, rechargeable, and offer good energy density. These batteries usually have a nominal voltage of 3.7V and a full charge voltage of 4.2V. They are designed for low-power applications and typically support several hundred charge cycles if properly maintained.','320mAh battery include its key technical specifications and operating conditions. It is typically a Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) rechargeable battery with a nominal voltage of 3.7V and a full charge voltage of 4.2V.',NULL,'products/1771669450174-556549758.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 11:30:52'),
(2545,'400Mah battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A 400 mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery, most commonly available as a 3.7 V Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (LiPo) cell.','It is widely used in compact, low-power electronic devices where small size, light weight, and portability are important.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771672510024-161359639.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:40:18'),
(2546,'420Mah battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'420mAh battery is a small rechargeable battery commonly used in compact portable electronic devices such as Bluetooth speakers, wireless headphones, GPS trackers, small cameras, IoT modules, toys, and handheld gadgets. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates the battery’s capacity, meaning a 420mAh battery can theoretically supply 420 milliamps for one hour, 210mA for two hours, or 84mA for five hours, depending on the connected load and efficiency of the circuit. Most 420mAh batteries are 3.7V Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium Polymer (Li-Po) types because these batteries are lightweight, rechargeable, and provide high energy density in a small size.','A 420 mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery, most commonly available as a 3.7 V Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) cell.','These batteries are typically charged using a 5V lithium battery charging module that follows the constant current–constant voltage (CC-CV) charging method, with a maximum charging voltage of 4.2V. The recommended charging current is usually around 0.5C to 1C, which means approximately 210mA to 420mA for safe and efficient charging.',NULL,'products/1771672726907-960356387.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 05:49:53'),
(2547,'450mah battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A 450 mAh battery is a compact rechargeable battery, most commonly available as a 3.7 V Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) cell.','It’s used in portable and low-power electronics where a balance of small size, light weight, and longer backup time is required compared to lower-capacity cells.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771672938429-925141551.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:40:36'),
(2548,'1300mah battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 1300mAh battery is a medium-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in portable electronic devices such as RC cars, drones, Bluetooth speakers, emergency lights, and DIY electronics projects. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates the battery’s capacity, meaning a 1300mAh battery can theoretically deliver 1300 milliamps (1.3A) of current for one hour, or lower current for a longer duration depending on the load. The actual backup time depends on the device’s power consumption and operating conditions.','It is widely used in portable electronics, IoT devices, robotics, RC equipment, and DIY projects where longer backup time is required compared to smaller cells (400–500 mAh).','Most 1300mAh batteries are Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) types due to their lightweight design, high energy density, and rechargeable capability. They typically have a nominal voltage of 3.7V per cell, with a full charge voltage of 4.2V and a cut-off voltage around 3.0V. In RC and drone applications, higher discharge rates (C-rating) are important to supply sufficient current to motors during operation.',NULL,'products/1771655838370-515676843.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 12:37:48'),
(2549,'1500mah battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 1500mAh battery is a rechargeable battery commonly used in portable electronic devices such as Bluetooth speakers, emergency lights, RC toys, medical devices, and DIY electronics projects. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates the battery capacity, meaning a 1500mAh battery can theoretically supply 1500 milliamps (1.5A) for one hour, or 500 milliamps for approximately three hours, depending on the load. The actual backup time varies based on device power consumption and efficiency.','It is ideal for portable electronics, IoT, robotics, and DIY projects that need sustained power without frequent recharging.','Most 1500mAh batteries are Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) types because they offer high energy density, lightweight design, and good recharge cycle life. A typical single-cell battery has a nominal voltage of 3.7V, a full charge voltage of 4.2V, and a cut-off voltage around 3.0V. The stored energy in a 3.7V 1500mAh battery is approximately 5.55Wh (3.7V × 1.5Ah). These batteries usually support 300–800 charge cycles when properly maintained.',NULL,'products/1771656589417-232465034.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 12:42:39'),
(2550,'1800mah battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'An 1800 mAh battery is a medium-to-high capacity rechargeable battery, most commonly available as a 3.7 V Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) cell.','It is widely used in portable electronics, IoT devices, robotics, DIY projects, and backup power applications where longer runtime is required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771658117432-475262164.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-11 11:18:13'),
(2551,'2000mah battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',999.00,'A 2000mAh battery is a rechargeable or non-rechargeable battery with a capacity of 2000 milliampere-hours (mAh). The mAh rating indicates how much electric charge the battery can store and deliver over time. For example, a 2000mAh battery can supply 2000 milliamps (2A) for 1 hour, or 1000 milliamps (1A) for 2 hours, depending on the load. These batteries are commonly used in portable electronic devices such as flashlights, toys, power banks, wireless devices, and small electronic projects.','In rechargeable batteries like Li-ion, the chemical reaction is reversible. When charging, electrical energy is converted back into chemical energy and stored inside the battery. Proper charging and protection circuits help maintain battery life and safety.','A 2000mAh battery works based on electrochemical reactions that convert chemical energy into electrical energy. Inside the battery, chemical reactions occur between the anode (negative terminal) and cathode (positive terminal) through an electrolyte. When connected to a circuit, electrons flow from the negative terminal to the positive terminal through the external load, supplying power to the device.',NULL,'products/1771660301014-389862192.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-27 11:02:23'),
(2552,'600mah battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',399.00,'A 600mAh battery is a small to medium capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in portable electronic devices such as Bluetooth speakers, wireless headphones, GPS trackers, handheld gadgets, toys, and embedded IoT systems. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates the battery’s storage capacity, meaning a 600mAh battery can theoretically supply 600 milliamps for one hour, 300mA for two hours, or lower current for a longer duration depending on the connected load and circuit efficiency.','It is widely used in portable and low-to-moderate power electronic devices where a balance of small size, light weight, and decent backup time is required.','These batteries require a proper constant current–constant voltage (CC-CV) charging method, typically charged up to 4.2V maximum using a suitable lithium battery charging module. The recommended charging current is usually around 0.5C to 1C (300mA to 600mA) for safe and efficient charging.',NULL,'products/1771823655549-542279288.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 07:08:10'),
(2553,'1100mah battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',10.00,'1100mAh battery is a rechargeable or non-rechargeable power source with a capacity of 1100 milliampere-hours, meaning it can theoretically supply 1100 milliamps (1.1A) for one hour, 550mA for two hours, or lower current for a longer duration depending on load conditions. These batteries are commonly available in chemistries such as Lithium-ion (Li-ion), Lithium-polymer (Li-Po), Nickel-Metal Hydride (NiMH), and sometimes Nickel-Cadmium (NiCd). In most electronics and robotics applications, 1100mAh Li-ion or Li-Po batteries are popular due to their high energy density, lightweight design, and stable output voltage (typically 3.7V nominal for single-cell lithium types).','It is widely used in portable electronics, IoT devices, DIY projects, robotics, and backup power applications where moderate runtime is required while keeping size and weight low.','When integrating a 1100mAh battery into a circuit, always use a protection circuit module (PCM/BMS) for lithium types to safeguard against over-voltage, under-voltage, and over-current conditions. Ensure proper voltage regulation using buck or boost converters if the system requires stable 5V or 12V output. Consider the device’s total current consumption to estimate backup time using the formula: Backup Time (hours) ≈ Battery Capacity (mAh) ÷ Load Current (mA).',NULL,'products/1771654066526-323709298.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 13:21:57'),
(2554,'3000mah battery',NULL,NULL,'Lithium Battery',499.00,'A 3000mAh battery is a medium-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in smartphones, power banks, Bluetooth devices, portable electronics, and small electronic projects. The term mAh (milliampere-hour) indicates the battery capacity, meaning a 3000mAh battery can theoretically supply 3000 milliamps (3A) of current for one hour, or 1000 milliamps for approximately three hours, depending on the load and efficiency of the device.','It is widely used in portable electronics, IoT systems, robotics, power banks, backup supplies, and DIY projects where long operating time is required.','Most 3000mAh batteries are Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) types because they offer high energy density, lightweight design, and good recharge cycles. These batteries are widely used in mobile phones and portable gadgets due to their compact size and reliable performance. Proper charging using a compatible charger and protection circuit helps increase battery life and safety.',NULL,'products/1771668167239-178270291.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 11:17:39'),
(2555,'5000mah battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'A 5000 mAh battery is a high-capacity rechargeable battery, most commonly available as a 3.7 V Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) cell','It is widely used in power banks, IoT gateways, robotics, portable electronics, solar projects, and backup power systems where long runtime and reliable energy storage are required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771821943360-551962306.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-23 04:45:43'),
(2556,'10000mah battery','10000mah Lithium battery',NULL,NULL,10.00,'10,000mAh lithium battery typically has a full charge voltage of 4.2V per cell and requires a proper lithium battery charging module with CC/CV (Constant Current/Constant Voltage) charging method. Many battery packs include a built-in Battery Management System (BMS) that provides protection against overcharging, over-discharging, short circuits, and overcurrent conditions.','It is widely used in power banks, IoT gateways, backup power systems, solar projects, robotics, CCTV, and portable electronics where long backup time is essential.\r\nThe mAh (milliampere-hour) rating shows the total charge capacity.','A 10,000mAh Lithium Battery is a high-capacity rechargeable battery commonly based on lithium-ion (Li-ion) or lithium-polymer (Li-Po) technology. The capacity rating of 10,000 milliampere-hours (mAh) means the battery can theoretically supply 10,000 mA (10A) for one hour, 1,000 mA for 10 hours, or proportionally lower current for a longer duration.',NULL,'products/1771651317729-475873087.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 12:30:10'),
(2557,'2MM-Heat shrink sleeve-black',NULL,NULL,'Heat Shrink Sleeve',199.00,'A high-quality 2 mm black heat shrink sleeve designed for reliable insulation and protection of wires, cables, and electrical connections','Made from durable, flexible polyolefin material, this heat shrink tubing shrinks uniformly when heat is applied, providing a tight, moisture-resistant seal and excellent mechanical protection.','Made from durable, flexible polyolefin material, this heat shrink tubing shrinks uniformly when heat is applied, providing a tight, moisture-resistant seal and excellent mechanical protection.',NULL,'products/1771665900727-834066031.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 11:51:34'),
(2558,'3MM-Heat Shrink sleeve-black',NULL,NULL,'Heat Shrink Sleeve',99.00,'Heat shrink sleeve is an insulating tube used to protect and cover electrical wire joints, soldered connections, and cable terminals. It shrinks tightly around wires when heat is applied using a heat gun, providing strong insulation and mechanical protection.','Manufactured from high-quality polyolefin material, it shrinks evenly when heat is applied, forming a tight, durable, and moisture-resistant covering around conductors.','It is commonly made from polyolefin material and is available in different sizes, colors, and shrink ratios such as 2:1 or 3:1. Heat shrink sleeves help prevent short circuits, protect against moisture and dust, and improve the overall durability of wiring connections.',NULL,'products/1771670389664-487342517.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 13:32:31'),
(2559,'4MM-Heat shrink sleeve-black',NULL,NULL,'Heat Shrink Sleeve',199.00,'A 4mm black heat shrink sleeve is an insulating plastic tube used to protect, insulate, and organize electrical wires and connections. The 4mm size refers to the inner diameter of the tube before shrinking. When heat is applied using a heat gun, lighter, or hot air blower, the sleeve shrinks tightly around the wire or joint, providing secure insulation and mechanical protection. It is commonly made from polyolefin material, which offers flexibility, flame resistance, and good electrical insulation properties.','The 4mm heat shrink sleeve protects wires from short circuits, moisture, dust, abrasion, and minor mechanical stress. It also improves the durability and appearance of soldered joints. Important specifications to consider include shrink ratio, temperature range (typically -55°C to 125°C), dielectric strength, and flame-retardant rating to ensure safe and long-lasting performance in electrical applications.','This sleeve typically has a 2:1 shrink ratio, meaning it can shrink to half of its original diameter (4mm to approximately 2mm). Some variants may have a 3:1 shrink ratio for tighter fitting. The black color provides a clean professional finish and is widely used in electronics projects, automotive wiring, battery connections, LED installations, motor wiring, DIY kits, and industrial cable management.',NULL,'products/1771821308838-268650939.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 06:42:40'),
(2560,'LDR Day Night sensor P/E/C',NULL,NULL,NULL,299.00,'The LDR Day–Night Sensor (P/E/C) is a light-sensitive electronic module designed to automatically detect daylight and darkness using an LDR (Light Dependent Resistor). It is commonly used in automatic lighting systems, energy-saving applications, and smart control circuits.','The sensor changes its output based on ambient light intensity—activating connected devices such as relays, lights, or controllers during night and switching them off during daytime.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771915198511-622167595.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 03:27:05'),
(2561,'17mm LDR Sensor',NULL,NULL,'LDR Sensor 17mm',80.00,'The 17 mm LDR is a large-size light dependent resistor designed to detect and respond to changes in ambient light intensity','Its resistance decreases in bright light and increases in darkness, making it ideal for day/night sensing and light-controlled automation applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771657918295-684710157.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-26 14:56:26'),
(2562,'HLK-PM01 Power',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The HLK-PM01 Power Module is a compact, isolated AC-DC power supply designed to convert 100–240V AC mains voltage into a stable 5V DC output.','It delivers up to 600 mA current (3W power) with high efficiency and built-in protections such as over-current, over-voltage, and short-circuit protection, ensuring safe and reliable operation.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910587309-20068608.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:24:27'),
(2563,'HLK-PM03 Power',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The HLK-PM03 Power Module is a compact AC to DC isolated power supply designed to convert 85–265V AC mains voltage directly into a stable 3.3V DC output','It delivers up to 1W power (300mA current) with high efficiency and excellent electrical isolation, making it ideal for low-power embedded systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771910607606-494540382.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:24:31'),
(2564,'servo tester module',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A servo tester module is a compact electronic device used to test, control, and calibrate servo motors and ESCs (Electronic Speed Controllers) without the need for a microcontroller.','It generates precise PWM signals, allowing users to check servo movement, direction, speed, and response quickly and easily.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772000771199-555545136.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-29 06:54:55'),
(2565,'ZMPT101AC voltage sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The ZMPT101B AC Voltage Sensor Module is a precision electronic sensor designed to measure alternating current (AC) voltage safely and accurately in electrical and embedded system applications. It uses a high-precision voltage transformer (ZMPT101B) to isolate and step down high AC voltage signals, allowing microcontrollers such as Arduino, ESP8266, ESP32, and other development boards to monitor AC voltage levels without direct exposure to high voltage','The module features an adjustable potentiometer for calibration, enabling accurate voltage measurement and signal output in analog form. Commonly used in energy monitoring systems, smart meters, power measurement projects, and home automation applications, the ZMPT101B sensor provides electrical isolation, stable performance, and reliable voltage detection, making it suitable for educational, industrial, and IoT-based electrical monitoring systems.','Operating Voltage: 5V DC\r\nInput Voltage Range (AC): 0 – 250V AC (typical)\r\nMeasurement Type: AC Voltage (Single Phase)\r\nOutput Signal: Analog Voltage (0–5V)\r\nIsolation: Transformer-based isolation (High electrical isolation)\r\nFrequency Range: 50Hz / 60Hz',NULL,'products/1772015786759-194387586.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 06:26:08'),
(2566,'Optical dust sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'An optical dust sensor is an electronic module used to detect and measure particulate matter (dust) in the air.','It works by using a light source and a photodetector—when dust particles pass through the sensor’s light beam, they scatter light, which is then detected and converted into an electrical signal proportional to dust concentration.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771994942500-301130736.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 06:48:33'),
(2567,'9V Cap',NULL,NULL,'HW Battery Cap',99.00,'A 9V battery cap, also known as a 9V battery snap connector, is a small accessory used to easily connect a 9-volt battery to electronic circuits.','It securely clips onto the battery terminals and provides pre-attached wires for quick and reliable power connections.','It securely clips onto the battery terminals and provides pre-attached wires for quick and reliable power connections.',NULL,'products/1771830510991-272043498.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:14:05'),
(2568,'TM1637 Indicator module',NULL,NULL,NULL,299.00,'The TM1637 Indicator Module is a compact digital display unit featuring a 4-digit 7-segment LED display driven by the TM1637 display driver IC','It’s widely used for displaying numbers, time, counters, temperatures, and simple data in microcontroller and embedded systems projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772004600607-975602983.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 06:59:56'),
(2569,'MAX7219 Dot matrix 8x8 Led module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The MAX7219 8×8 Dot Matrix LED Module is a compact display unit that combines an 8×8 LED matrix with a MAX7219 driver IC for easy and efficient control of multiple LEDs','It’s widely used in microcontroller projects to show text, numbers, icons, patterns, and animations with minimal wiring and effort.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989944274-305830821.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:25:44'),
(2570,'MAX 7219 Dot Matrix 8x8 Led SMD Version',NULL,NULL,NULL,899.00,'The MAX7219 Dot Matrix 8×8 LED Module (SMD Version) is an 8×8 surface-mount LED matrix display driven by the MAX7219 LED driver IC','This SMD (Surface-Mount Device) version features compact SMD LEDs for improved visual clarity and sleek integration, making it perfect for text scrolling, patterns, animations, and numerical displays in microcontroller projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771989814148-245040987.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 07:00:34'),
(2571,'Bread Board',NULL,NULL,'Bread Board GL-12',199.00,'The Breadboard GL-12 is a high-quality solderless prototyping board used for building and testing electronic circuits without soldering','It provides a flexible platform to mount and interconnect components like ICs, resistors, capacitors, sensors, and modules during design, development, and experimentation.','It provides a flexible platform to mount and interconnect components like ICs, resistors, capacitors, sensors, and modules during design, development, and experimentation.',NULL,'products/1771843384724-408111072.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 07:23:24'),
(2572,'Bread Board MINI - 170 point',NULL,NULL,'Bread Board',199.00,'The Mini Breadboard 170-Point is a compact and solderless prototyping board used for building and testing electronic circuits quickly and without soldering.','Its small form factor makes it ideal for portable projects, small experiments, and tight spaces.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771843414338-766507371.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 11:46:42'),
(2573,'PCB Board',NULL,NULL,'PCB Board',499.00,'A PCB (Printed Circuit Board) is a flat insulating board used to mechanically support and electrically connect electronic components using copper conductive tracks etched onto its surface. It replaces traditional point-to-point wiring, making circuits compact, organized, and reliable.','Most PCBs are made from FR-4 material, which is a fiberglass-reinforced epoxy laminate that provides strength, insulation, and heat resistance. Electronic components such as resistors, capacitors, diodes, transistors, and integrated circuits are mounted on the board either through through-hole technology (THT) or surface mount technology (SMT), depending on the design requirements.','PCBs improve performance by reducing electrical noise, enhancing signal flow, and increasing durability. Important technical considerations in PCB design include track width, grounding methods, component spacing, heat dissipation, and proper insulation distance to prevent short circuits. Standard PCB thickness is usually around 1.6 mm, and copper thickness commonly used is 1 oz per square foot.',NULL,'products/1771660128727-955221906.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 11:16:37'),
(2574,'4x4 PCB Board',NULL,NULL,'4*4 G.PCB',199.00,'A 4 × 4 General Purpose PCB (G.PCB) is a universal prototyping printed circuit board used for building and soldering electronic circuits. With a square form factor, this board provides a flexible platform for assembling components and converting breadboard prototypes into permanent soldered designs.','A 4x4 PCB board refers to a printed circuit board with dimensions of 4 cm × 4 cm or sometimes 4 inch × 4 inch, depending on specification. It is commonly used as a base platform for building and assembling electronic circuits. The board is usually made of FR4 (fiber-reinforced epoxy laminate) or phenolic material and coated with a thin layer of copper for circuit tracing.','This size is widely used for DIY electronics projects, Arduino circuits, robotics modules, power supply boards, prototype circuits, student lab experiments, and small embedded system designs. The compact 4x4 size makes it ideal for small to medium circuits that require neat layout and easy mounting inside enclosures.',NULL,'products/1771672310747-734706561.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 07:30:23'),
(2575,'6x4 PCB Board',NULL,NULL,'6*4 G.PCB',399.00,'A 6x4 PCB board refers to a printed circuit board with dimensions of 6 cm × 4 cm or sometimes 6 inch × 4 inch, depending on the specification. It is commonly used as a base platform for assembling and soldering electronic components in DIY and prototype circuits. The board is typically made of FR4 (fiber-reinforced epoxy laminate) or phenolic material and coated with a thin copper layer for creating circuit connections.','6x4 PCB boards are available in single-sided, double-sided, and general-purpose perforated (zero PCB) types. Single-sided boards have copper on one side only, while double-sided boards have copper layers on both sides for more complex circuit layouts. Zero PCBs feature evenly spaced holes (usually 2.54mm pitch) that allow components like resistors, capacitors, ICs, transistors, and connectors to be manually soldered.','This size is suitable for medium-sized electronic projects, power supply circuits, Arduino and microcontroller-based projects, robotics modules, amplifier circuits, and educational lab experiments. The 6x4 size provides more working area compared to smaller boards, allowing better component spacing and organized layout inside enclosures.',NULL,'products/1771823608926-294752320.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 07:30:56'),
(2576,'Mitsun MIT-BRAVO',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'It supports SD card, USB, FM radio, and Bluetooth, and comes with front control access for convenient operation.','The system includes an LED display, FM radio, remote and button controls, USB/SD card reader, and functional options such as standby, source select, program logic, volume up/down, and IR remote support.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990737545-431418268.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:38:57'),
(2577,'400KV Step up power module',NULL,NULL,'Step up power module',499.00,'A 400 kV Step-Up Power Module is a small high-voltage boost converter that takes a low DC input (typically 3 V–6 V) and generates a very high-voltage output (up to ~400,000 V) using pulse transformer/boost circuitry.','These modules are often used in novelty high-voltage generators, science experiments, ion/ozone generators, or educational demonstrations','A 400KV step-up power module is a high-voltage DC boost converter designed to convert low DC input voltage (typically 3V–6V or 5V–12V) into a very high voltage output. Despite the “400KV” label, most small modules do not actually produce a continuous 400 kilovolts; instead, they generate high-voltage pulses capable of producing visible electric arcs.',NULL,'products/1771672479827-687344394.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 13:45:22'),
(2578,'Mitsun Corona -5',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'Mitsun 5.1 Channel Multimedia Speaker System, designed to deliver immersive home audio entertainment. The system supports FM radio, USB and SD card playback, and offers both remote control and front button control, along with volume and volume-VR adjustment for easy operation.','It features a dynamic design with LED display and provides 5.1 surround sound, delivering an engaging movie and music experience with superior audio clarity, low-distortion amplifier design, and high-definition sound with clear channel separation.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990464284-501391170.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:34:24'),
(2579,'ADIY PICO TYPE C',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The ADIY PICO Type-C is a compact microcontroller development board based on the RP2040 chipset, similar in functionality to the Raspberry Pi Pico but upgraded with a USB Type-C connector for improved durability and modern connectivity. It is ideal for embedded systems, IoT projects, robotics, and DIY electronics.','It is ideal for embedded systems, IoT projects, robotics, and DIY electronics.','It is ideal for embedded systems, IoT projects, robotics, and DIY electronics.',NULL,'products/1771830873397-868547774.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 09:20:36'),
(2580,'XH-W3001 Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The HX-W3001 (often labeled XH-W3001) is a digital temperature controller / thermostat module used for automatic temperature monitoring and control in various heating or cooling applications.','The XH-W3001 is a simple yet versatile digital temperature controller (thermostat) module used to monitor and control temperature in various electrical and thermal systems.','Digital LED temperature display\r\nAutomatic Heating / Cooling control\r\nWaterproof NTC temperature probe\r\nAdjustable start & stop temperature\r\n High accuracy control (±0.1°C)\r\n Relay output for load switching\r\n Plug-and-play operation',NULL,'products/1772015067249-610159687.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-28 04:55:34'),
(2581,'UNO R4 WIFI Board',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The Arduino UNO R4 WiFi is a next-generation Arduino development board that combines the familiar UNO form factor with significantly upgraded performance, wireless connectivity, and modern features — making it ideal for IoT, robotics, automation, and advanced electronic projects','Uno R4 WiFi is its built-in Wi-Fi connectivity, allowing your projects to connect to wireless networks right out of the box without needing extra shields or modules. This opens up possibilities like remote data logging, IoT sensors, or web-controlled devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772006553863-598428464.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 08:23:58'),
(2582,'Mitsun  MT-5454',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The box highlights a 1200W power rating, emphasizing high output performance suitable for music, movies, and general entertainment.','It supports advanced audio features such as FM radio, DTS digital output, Dolby Digital, and 3D surround sound, aiming to provide an immersive and enhanced listening experience.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990444786-399880415.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:34:04'),
(2583,'SMPS Soldron Micro station',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The SMPS Soldron Micro Station is a portable, variable-wattage soldering station ideal for electronics assembly, repair, and rework—especially for fine SMD/SMT work.','Unlike simple plug-in irons, it uses SMPS (Switched-Mode Power Supply) technology to deliver a clean, stable power output that ensures consistent heat control and better performance',NULL,NULL,'products/1772001580426-720651879.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-06 08:25:20'),
(2584,'Yellow Single Strand Wire',NULL,NULL,'1/22 Hookup wire coil',49.00,'single strand wires are available in different gauge sizes (such as 0.5 sq mm, 1 sq mm, 1.5 sq mm, 2.5 sq mm, etc.), and their current-carrying capacity depends on the thickness (cross-sectional area) of the conductor. Thicker wires can carry higher current safely.','A Single Strand Wire is an electrical conductor made from one solid piece of metal, usually copper or aluminum, covered with an insulating material such as PVC or XLPE. Unlike stranded wire, which consists of multiple small wires twisted together, single strand wire (also called solid wire) has a single thick conductor core. It is commonly used in electrical wiring installations, control panels, switchboards, and fixed wiring systems where flexibility is not required.','These wires are typically rated for specific voltage levels like 110V, 230V, or 440V depending on insulation type and application. Copper single strand wire is widely preferred because of its excellent conductivity and durability. It is mostly used in household wiring, lighting circuits, distribution boards, earthing connections, and industrial control systems.',NULL,'products/1771649754076-167391648.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-24 07:55:07'),
(2585,'M2101 Vartech Meter',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The M2101 Vartech Meter is a compact digital multimeter designed for accurate measurement of essential electrical parameters. It is suitable for technicians, electricians, students, and DIY users who need a reliable and easy-to-use testing instrument for everyday electrical and electronic work.','The Vartech M2101 Digital Clamp Meter is a versatile electrical measuring instrument designed for electricians, technicians, and advanced DIY users. It combines the convenience of a clamp meter with the functionality of a digital multimeter, allowing users to measure AC/DC current without disconnecting the circuit. With True RMS measurement, it ensures accurate readings even for non-linear loads commonly found in modern electrical and electronic systems.','This meter supports a wide measurement range, including AC/DC current up to 1000 A, AC voltage up to 750 V, and DC voltage up to 1000 V. In addition to current and voltage, the M2101 can measure resistance, capacitance, frequency, and temperature, and it includes diode and continuity testing.',NULL,'products/1771989451977-866465003.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:17:31'),
(2586,'40x1 BERG Strip male',NULL,NULL,'BERG Strip male',499.00,'40x1 BERG Strip Male is a single-row male header connector containing 40 pins arranged in one straight line, commonly used in electronic circuit boards and development modules. It follows the standard 2.54mm (0.1 inch) pitch spacing, which makes it compatible with most breadboards, female BERG connectors, jumper wires, Arduino boards, Raspberry Pi GPIO headers, and other embedded development platforms.','It is widely used for PCB connections, jumper wiring, and module interfacing in electronic and embedded projects. The strip can be used as-is or easily cut to required pin lengths.','40x1 BERG male strips are mainly used for low-voltage signal connections and small current applications, not for high-power transmission.',NULL,'products/1771672448809-28415938.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 05:48:23'),
(2587,'40x1 BERG Strip Female',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'BERG Strip Female connector is a commonly used single-row female header connector in electronics, designed to mate with male pin headers on printed circuit boards (PCBs). It typically has a 2.54mm (0.1 inch) pitch, which is the standard spacing used in most development boards, microcontrollers, and prototyping circuits.','It is commonly used to create plug-in connections with male header pins on PCBs, development boards, and modules. The strip can be cut to required lengths, making it highly versatile for electronics projects.','The connector consists of a plastic insulating housing (usually black) with embedded metal socket contacts that securely grip the male pins, ensuring reliable electrical connection. BERG female strips are widely used in Arduino boards, Raspberry Pi GPIO connections, embedded systems, breadboards, sensor modules, and DIY electronics projects.',NULL,'products/1771672410217-44028270.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-03 05:45:15'),
(2588,'Mitsun Mt-5757',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The image shows the packaging of a Mitsun multimedia speaker system, featuring a 5.1 channel setup with one large subwoofer in the center and five satellite speakers arranged around it.','The box highlights the specifications, stating an output power (RMS) of 1×50W + 5×18W, with a frequency response of 40Hz–20kHz.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990762866-550470608.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:39:22'),
(2589,'Mitsun Maxi-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Mitsun Maxi-2 (often referenced in listings similar to the Mitsun MIT-Mini 2.1) is a compact 2.1-channel home theatre audio system designed to enhance your TV, music, or multimedia sound experience beyond basic speakers.','A budget-friendly 2.1-channel multimedia speaker system designed to boost audio from TVs, computers, phones and other devices. It’s similar in purpose to what some sellers list as Mitsun Maxi-2.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990635809-404020057.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:37:15'),
(2590,'Harnam HN -1080 Dual Cone Speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The Harnam HN-1080 Dual Cone Speaker is a versatile audio speaker designed to deliver enhanced sound quality with rich mid-range and bass performance. As a dual cone speaker, it combines two speaker cones in one unit — typically a larger main cone for deeper tones and a smaller secondary cone for mid-range frequencies. This configuration allows the speaker to produce a broader and more balanced sound spectrum compared with a single-cone driver.','Built for car audio systems, home audio setups, and multimedia applications, the Harnam HN-1080 is ideal for upgrading stock speakers and improving overall listening experience. Its compact design makes it easy to install in various speaker enclosures or vehicle compartments, while the robust materials help ensure reliable performance even at higher volume levels.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771909964513-428826065.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:21:36'),
(2591,'JACKMA JAC-444 4-inch Audio Speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The specification panel lists the model number JAC-444, with a continuous power handling of 60W and a peak power handling of 600W.','The JACKMA JAC-444 4-inch Audio Speaker is a compact yet powerful audio speaker designed to deliver crisp and clear sound in small to medium audio setups, especially in car audio systems and multimedia installations. Featuring a 4-inch driver size, it balances bass response and mid-range clarity, making music sound fuller and more enjoyable compared to standard factory speakers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771914083162-237786483.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:21:23'),
(2592,'Jackma JAC-999 6-Inch speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'According to the specification section, the speaker model is JAC-999, with a continuous power handling of 100W and a peak power handling of 1000W.','It features a sensitivity of 94 dB, which helps produce loud and clear sound, and a frequency response range of 55Hz to 20kHz, covering deep bass to high-frequency details.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771914171585-420489061.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:22:51'),
(2593,'Jackma JAC-666 (6 inch) speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The speaker has a sensitivity of 90 dB, allowing efficient sound output, and a frequency response range of 55Hz to 20kHz, covering both low and high audio frequencies.','It features a nominal impedance of 4 ohms, making it compatible with most standard car stereos and amplifiers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771914151655-969437226.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-24 06:22:31'),
(2594,'Harnam HN-1111 mP3 player',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'FM electronic tuning with 18 preset stations, auto seek and auto store functions, and preset equalizer modes such as Pop, Rock, Classical, and Flat.','It supports treble, bass, balance, and fader controls for customized sound output. The system includes USB and TF card slots and supports the MP3 audio format.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771909988866-655467487.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-04 12:22:03'),
