(2597,'Mitsun kiwi 006 Multimedia speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A feature panel on the top right highlights multiple connectivity options including MP3, AUX, and USB, along with an aero dynamic design for enhanced sound output.','The Mitsun KIWI-006 Multimedia Speaker is a compact and versatile audio speaker system designed to deliver clear and balanced sound for everyday entertainment. It’s made to work with a variety of audio sources, making it suitable for use with computers, laptops, TVs, phones, and other media devices. The system typically focuses on producing rich audio for music, movies, and other multimedia content, helping enhance the listening experience compared with built-in device speakers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771990617397-394376032.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:36:57'),
(2598,'Mitsun MIT 021 Multimedia speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'On the left side of the packaging, multiple feature icons are shown, including support for DTS sound, DVD player connectivity, Dolby Digital, FM radio, 3D surround sound, and USB input, suggesting wide multimedia compatibility.','The Mitsun MIT-021 Multimedia Speaker is a compact and versatile audio speaker system designed for use with computers, laptops, televisions, and other audio sources. It supports Bluetooth 5.0 wireless connectivity, allowing you to stream music easily from smartphones or tablets without cables. The speaker typically includes multiple input options such as USB, TF (microSD) card, AUX (3.5 mm), making it flexible for different devices and media.','Overall, the Mitsun MIT-021 provides a simple plug-and-play audio solution with both wired and Bluetooth functionality, making it suitable for everyday entertainment in bedrooms, offices, or small living spaces.',NULL,'products/1771990660147-380484084.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 03:37:40'),
