(2604,'32 inch smart Tv',NULL,NULL,NULL,25000.00,'A 32-inch Smart TV is a compact, connected television designed for modern digital entertainment in bedrooms, small living spaces, kitchens, or offices. It combines a 32-inch HD or Full HD display with built-in smart features such as Wi-Fi connectivity, pre-loaded streaming apps (like YouTube, Netflix, Amazon Prime Video, and more), and an easy-to-navigate user interface , allowing you to watch online content directly without needing external devices.','Most 32-inch smart TVs use LED panel technology, providing bright visuals, good color reproduction, and clear picture quality at a small to medium viewing distance. They typically support multiple connectivity options including HDMI, USB, and screen mirroring, so you can connect gaming consoles, set-top boxes, laptops, flash drives, and mobile phones.','A 32-inch Smart TV is a compact television with a 32-inch screen size (measured diagonally) that includes built-in internet connectivity and smart features. Unlike normal TVs, a smart TV can connect to Wi-Fi or Ethernet and run streaming applications such as YouTube, Netflix, Prime Video, and other OTT platforms. Most 32-inch smart TVs come with HD Ready (1366 × 768) or Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution, LED display technology, and built-in speakers. This size is ideal for bedrooms, small living rooms, offices, and hostels.',NULL,'products/1771669272906-388652497.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 11:24:40'),
(2605,'Oppo K13x 5G Smartphone','Oppo K13x',NULL,NULL,12699.00,'The Oppo K13x 5G is an affordable 5G-ready Android smartphone designed to deliver a well-rounded performance with strong battery life, a large display, and capable cameras — making it suitable for everyday use like browsing, streaming, gaming, and social media','The phone runs Android 15 with ColorOS 15, bringing modern software features, and also includes 5G connectivity, ensuring future-ready mobile internet speeds. Some variants are built with IP65 water and dust resistance and rugged design elements for everyday reliability.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771994919335-476398195.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 04:48:39'),
(2606,'55 inch Smart Android Tv',NULL,NULL,NULL,46999.00,'The Eyepluse 55 LED Smart Android TV is a large-screen 4K UHD 3840 × 2160 television running on Android Smart TV platform — designed for immersive home entertainment with a frameless IPS panel and smart features. It brings vibrant visuals, smart connectivity, and multiple ports for connecting external devices.','55-inch 4K UHD LED display3840 × 2160 with HDR support for sharp, detailed image quality.',NULL,NULL,'products/1771908259352-525557537.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-12 07:29:08'),
(2607,'Samsung Galaxy A36 5G mobile','Samsung Galaxy A36',NULL,NULL,39499.00,'The Samsung Galaxy A36 5G is a stylish and powerful mid-range 5G smartphone from Samsung’s popular Galaxy A-series, designed for everyday use with smooth performance, long battery life, and strong camera capabilities','On the photography side, the Galaxy A36 5G comes with a triple rear camera setup highlighted by a 50 MP main sensor, along with 8 MP ultra-wide and 5 MP macro lenses, plus a 12 MP front camera for selfies and video calls.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772000424361-770283375.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-02-25 06:20:24'),
(2608,'TG113 Bluetooth Speaker Circuit Board','TG113','TG113','Audio Board',10.00,'The TG113 Bluetooth Speaker Circuit Board is a compact audio control and amplifier board used in portable Bluetooth speakers, especially in TG113-type speaker models. It integrates Bluetooth audio reception, audio amplification, battery charging, and control functions into a single board.','The TG113 Bluetooth speaker circuit board is an integrated audio control module used in TG113 and similar portable Bluetooth speakers. It combines Bluetooth connectivity, audio decoding, power amplification, and battery management into a single compact board.','This board enables wireless audio streaming from Bluetooth-enabled devices such as smartphones, tablets, and laptops. It receives digital audio via Bluetooth, processes the signal, amplifies it, and delivers sound to the connected speaker.',NULL,'products/1772431280477-340990123.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-13 10:15:23','2026-03-02 06:01:20'),
