(2622,'Dome camera 2MP IPC3612LB AF28 A2',' IPC3612LB-AF28-A2',NULL,' 2MP Full HD Dome Camera ',1.00,'The IPC3612LB-AF28-A2 is a 2MP Full HD IP Dome Camera from Uniview (UNV), designed for reliable indoor and outdoor surveillance applications such as offices, shops, homes, warehouses, and commercial buildings.','It delivers clear 1080P high-definition video, intelligent human detection, and stable night monitoring performance.','Use correct voltage to avoid camera damage.\r\nSecure camera properly to reduce vibration.\r\nAvoid direct water exposure.\r\nUse compatible video transmitter (VTX).',NULL,'products/1772100517164-521267192.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-26 10:08:37','2026-02-26 10:34:35'),
