(2624,'Dome Camera vandal proof ','IPC322LB-SF28-A',NULL,'Dome Camera 2MP Camera',1.00,'The Uniview IPC322LB-SF-A series is a 2MP vandal-proof IP dome camera designed for high-security surveillance environments where protection against tampering or physical damage is important.','It provides Full HD 1080P video monitoring, smart infrared night vision, and durable metal housing suitable for indoor and outdoor installations.','Keep wiring properly insulated and protected from water, dust, or physical damage, especially in outdoor installations.',NULL,'products/1772166133216-557200071.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 04:22:13','2026-02-27 04:22:13'),
(2625,'4 MP Dual Light Audio IP Camera','IPC2124B-AF40K-DL2',NULL,'Bullet Camera ',1.00,'The Uniview IPC2124B-AF40K-DL2 is a 4 megapixel (4 MP) high-resolution IP bullet camera designed for outdoor and indoor surveillance.','It features Dual Light technology with both infrared (IR) and warm white light, providing high-quality colour imaging in low-light and complete darkness, plus built-in audio support to capture sound along with video.','This camera is ideal for homes, offices, retail stores, warehouses, and perimeter monitoring where clear detail and reliable performance are needed.',NULL,'products/1772167246890-330522615.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 04:40:46','2026-02-27 04:40:46'),
(2626,'4 MP Dual Light Audio  Dome Camera','IPC3614LB-AF28K-DL2',NULL,'Dome Camera 4mp Ip camera',1.00,'The Uniview IPC3614LB-AF28K-DL2 is a 4MP Dual Light Audio Dome IP Camera designed for high-quality indoor and outdoor surveillance.It provides 2560×1440 (4MP) high-resolution video, built-in audio recording, and advanced dual-light technology that combines infrared (IR) night vision with warm white light for full-color monitoring even in total darkness.','This dome-style camera offers a compact and vandal-resistant design suitable for offices, homes, shops, corridors, entrances, and commercial security systems.','Use only the specified DC 12V adapter or PoE power supply (IEEE 802.3af) to avoid voltage damage or overheating.',NULL,'products/1772170280774-47904627.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 05:31:20','2026-02-27 05:31:20'),
(2627,'Uniarch 2MP Bullet HD Camera ','UAC-B112-AF40-H',NULL,' Bullet HD Camera ',1.00,'The Uniarch UAC-B112-AF40-H is a 2 MP Full HD bullet-style security camera designed for reliable video surveillance in both indoor and outdoor settings.','This camera delivers clear 1080p resolution, robust weatherproof housing, and flexible installation options — making it ideal for homes, retail stores, offices, and small business surveillance systems.','Built with Uniarch’s commitment to easy-to-use and cost-effective security solutions.',NULL,'products/1772173172547-935603753.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 06:19:32','2026-02-27 06:19:32'),
(2628,'Uniarch 5MP Dome HD Camera ','UAC-T115-AF28W-H',NULL,'Dome 5MP HD Camera ',1.00,'The Uniarch UAC-T115-AF28W-H is a 5 Megapixel high-resolution dome security camera designed for reliable indoor and outdoor video surveillance.','Built with a durable dome-style housing and weather-resistant design, this camera is suitable for homes, offices, retail shops, warehouses, and other environments that require dependable monitoring.','Uniarch combines user-friendly installation and operation with quality imaging technology derived from Uniview (UNV), providing a cost-effective solution for modern CCTV systems.',NULL,'products/1772173770239-93149638.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 06:29:30','2026-02-27 06:29:30'),
(2629,'Uniarch Bullet 5MP Camera ','UAC-B115-AF40-H',NULL,' Bullet Camera 5MP ',1.00,'Built using Uniview (UNV) technology, this camera delivers sharp video quality, reliable night monitoring, and durable weatherproof protection, making it suitable for homes, shops, offices, warehouses, and perimeter security.','The Uniarch UAC-B115-AF40-H is a 5MP HD Bullet CCTV Camera designed for clear, high-resolution surveillance in indoor and outdoor environments.','Always use the recommended DC 12V power supply and ensure cables are correctly insulated and protected from moisture or physical damage.',NULL,'products/1772174393422-319020322.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 06:39:53','2026-02-27 06:39:53'),
(2630,'Uniarch Dome Camera ','UAC-T115-AF28-H',NULL,'Dome Camera ',1.00,'The Uniarch UAC-T115-AF28-H is a 5MP HD Dome (Turret) CCTV Camera designed for clear and reliable surveillance in residential, commercial, and office environments.','It provides high-resolution 5-megapixel video, allowing detailed monitoring of entrances, corridors, shops, and indoor or outdoor areas.','Use only the specified DC 12V power supply and ensure cables are properly insulated and protected from moisture, dust, and physical stress.',NULL,'products/1772175139251-554896051.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 06:52:19','2026-02-27 06:52:19'),
(2631,'Uniview 2MP Bullet Camera','IPC2122LB-ASF40-DL ECO',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Uniview IPC2122LB-ASF40-DL ECO (also referenced under similar model names like IPC2122LB-SF40-A) is a 2 Megapixel (2 MP) Full HD IP bullet surveillance camera designed for reliable outdoor and indoor security monitoring.','It belongs to Uniview’s economical ECO / Easy series, delivering clear Full HD resolution and essential smart features at a cost-effective price point, making it ideal for homes, shops, offices, warehouses, and small business CCTV systems.','Use only the specified DC 12V power supply and ensure cables are properly insulated and protected from moisture, dust, and physical stress.',NULL,'products/1772176865246-156278286.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 07:21:05','2026-02-27 07:21:05'),
(2632,'Uniview Dome 2MP Camera ','IPC3612LB-ASF28-DL ECO',NULL,'Dome 2MP Camera ',1.00,'The camera supports advanced Ultra 265, H.265, and H.264 video compression, which reduces bandwidth and storage usage while maintaining excellent image quality.','The Uniview Dome 2MP Camera IPC3612LB-ASF28-DL ECO is a reliable IP surveillance camera designed for high-quality indoor and outdoor security monitoring.','The camera also features a built-in microphone for audio monitoring, enabling better incident verification and security control.',NULL,'products/1772177433682-619702190.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 07:30:33','2026-02-27 07:30:33'),
(2633,'Uniview Bullet 2MP 2 Way Camera','IPC2122LE-ADF40KMC-WL',NULL,'Bullet  2 Way Camera',1.00,'The Uniview Bullet 2MP 2-Way Camera IPC2122LE-ADF40KMC-WL is a high-performance IP bullet-type surveillance camera designed for reliable indoor and outdoor security monitoring.','Equipped with a 4.0 mm fixed lens, the camera provides a wide and stable viewing angle suitable for entrance and perimeter monitoring.','The built-in microphone and speaker enable two-way audio communication, making it useful for live interaction and security alerts.',NULL,'products/1772182154806-123306646.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 08:49:14','2026-02-27 08:49:14'),
(2634,'Uniview Turret Camera 2 way 2MP  Camera ','IPC3612LE-ADF28KC-WL ',NULL,' Turret Camera 2 way 2MP  Camera ',1.00,'The Uniview Turret 2-Way 2MP Camera IPC3612LE-ADF28KC-WL is a versatile IP turret-style security camera engineered for high-quality video surveillance in both residential and commercial environments.','Supporting advanced video compression standards like Ultra 265, H.265, and H.264, the IPC3612LE-ADF28KC-WL minimizes storage and bandwidth demands without sacrificing video quality.','The Uniview Turret 2-Way 2MP Camera IPC3612LE-ADF28KC-WL is designed with advanced safety protection features to ensure secure and reliable surveillance in various environments.',NULL,'products/1772183007767-526107632.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 09:03:27','2026-02-27 09:03:27'),
(2635,'Uniview Bullet Camera 2MP','IPC2122LB-ASF40 - ECO',NULL,'Bullet Camera 2MP',1.00,'The Uniview Bullet Camera 2MP IPC2122LB-ASF40-ECO is a compact and reliable IP bullet-type surveillance camera designed for effective indoor and outdoor security monitoring.','It is equipped with a 2-megapixel progressive scan CMOS sensor that delivers clear Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution video, providing sharp images suitable for homes, offices, shops, warehouses, and commercial areas.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772184776048-153221257.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 09:32:56','2026-02-27 09:32:56'),
(2636,'Uniview Bullet Camera 2MP ','IPC2122LB-ASF40 - ECO',NULL,NULL,1.00,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,'active','2026-02-27 09:34:41','2026-02-27 09:36:31'),
(2637,'Uniview   ECO Bullet Camera 2MP',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Uniview IPC2122LB-ASF40 ECO is a 2MP mini fixed bullet IP camera designed for reliable outdoor surveillance and security monitoring. Manufactured by Uniview (UNV), this camera belongs to the Easy/ECO series, offering high-quality Full HD video recording with advanced compression and durable weatherproof construction. It uses a 2-megapixel progressive scan CMOS sensor to capture clear images at 1920 × 1080 (Full HD) resolution, making it suitable for homes, offices, shops, warehouses, and commercial security systems','The camera features a 4.0 mm fixed lens, providing a wide viewing angle for monitoring entrances, corridors, parking areas, and perimeter zones. With Smart IR night vision up to 30 meters, it automatically switches between day and night modes using an IR-cut filter to maintain visibility even in complete darkness. Advanced video compression technologies such as Ultra 265, H.265, and H.264 reduce bandwidth and storage usage while maintaining image quality','Camera Type: Bullet IP Camera\r\nResolution: 2MP (1920 × 1080)\r\nImage Sensor: 1/2.8\" CMOS\r\nLens: 4.0 mm fixed lens\r\nNight Vision: Smart IR up to 30 m',NULL,'products/1772270624702-20594541.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-27 09:38:03','2026-02-28 09:23:44'),
(2638,'Uniview Bullet Camera 2MP IP Camera ','IPC2122LB-ADF40KM-G',NULL,NULL,1.00,'It captures clear Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution video using a high-performance progressive scan CMOS sensor, delivering sharp and detailed monitoring for homes, offices, shops, warehouses, parking areas, and perimeter security.','The Uniview IPC2122LB-ADF40KM-G is a 2MP fixed bullet-type IP network camera designed for reliable indoor and outdoor surveillance applications.','Built-in True WDR and digital noise reduction improve visibility in challenging lighting environments such as strong sunlight or shadows, helping capture accurate security evidence.',NULL,'products/1772249450626-888371777.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 03:30:50','2026-02-28 03:30:50'),
(2639,'Uniview Bullet Camera 2MP IP Camera ','IPC2322LB-ADZK-H',NULL,'2MP IP Bullet  Camera ',1.00,'The Uniview IPC2322LB-ADZK-H is a professional-grade 2MP varifocal IR bullet IP camera designed for high-performance outdoor surveillance.','The camera supports PoE (Power over Ethernet) for safer and simplified installation with reduced wiring risks, along with stable network transmission for continuous operation.','For enhanced safety protection, the IPC2322LB-ADZK-H is built with a rugged IP67 weatherproof metal housing, safeguarding the device against dust, rain, and harsh environmental conditions.',NULL,'products/1772250351157-763814605.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 03:45:51','2026-02-28 03:45:51'),
(2640,'Uniview Dome Camera 2MP IP Camera ','IPC3532LB-ADZK-H',NULL,' Dome Camera 2MP IP Camera ',1.00,'The Uniview IPC3532LB-ADZK-H is a high-performance 2MP motorized varifocal dome IP camera designed for professional indoor and outdoor surveillance applications.',' It features a 2-megapixel progressive scan CMOS sensor that delivers clear Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution video, ensuring sharp and detailed monitoring for offices, banks, retail stores, corridors, and commercial buildings.','Use a quality PoE switch or certified power adapter to avoid voltage fluctuations and electrical damage.',NULL,'products/1772251240160-828992265.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 04:00:40','2026-02-28 04:00:40'),
(2641,'Uniview  Bullet Camera 2mp IP Camera ','IPC2123LB-SF40-A1',NULL,'2mp IP Camera Bullet Camera',1.00,'The UNV IPC2124LB‑SF28(40)‑A (very similar family model to IPC2123LB-SF40-A1) camera you’re asking about refers to the same type of device — a 3 MP HD mini fixed-lens bullet IP/network surveillance camera typically branded by Uniview (UNV).','The actual IPC2123LB-SF40-A1 model is a compact outdoor bullet CCTV camera with a 1/2.7″ progressive CMOS sensor delivering up to 3 megapixel resolution (2304×1296) and a fixed 4.0 mm lens that gives a moderate ~89° horizontal field of view and ~30 m infrared night vision range.','During installation, follow all electrical safety guidelines — turn off power before wiring, and if unsure, consult a professional installer to minimize the risk of shock or equipment damage.',NULL,'products/1772255444436-445389580.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 05:10:44','2026-02-28 05:10:44'),
(2642,'Uniview  Bullet Camera 3mp IP Camera ','IPC2A23LB-F40K-A',NULL,'Bullet 3mp IP Camera ',1.00,'It uses a 1/2.7″ progressive CMOS sensor to capture clear 2304×1296 resolution footage, and a fixed 4 mm lens providing a fairly wide field of view (~87° horizontal).','The camera has Smart IR night vision up to ~60 m, automatic day/night switching with IR-cut filter, and digital features like DWDR (wide dynamic range), 2D/3D noise reduction, motion detection, privacy masking and multiple video streams with efficient compression (Ultra265/H.265/H.264).','Use a suitable PoE switch or compliant power supply to avoid damage from incorrect voltage.',NULL,'products/1772255840392-151508117.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 05:17:20','2026-02-28 05:17:20'),
(2643,'Uniview  Turret Camera 4 MP IP Camera',' IPC3614LE-ADF28K',NULL,'  Turret 4 MP IP Camera',1.00,'The camera has a fixed 2.8 mm lens that gives a wide field of view, built-in infrared (IR) LEDs for night vision up to about 30 m even in complete darkness, and advanced imaging features such as Wide Dynamic Range (WDR), digital noise reduction, smart IR, BLC/HLC and privacy masking to improve image quality in varying lighting conditions.','It compresses video efficiently using Ultra 265, H.265, H.264 and MJPEG formats, supports dual streams for simultaneous local and remote viewing, and can store footage on a Micro SD card when connected.','Even though the IPC3614LE-ADF28K has a weather-resistant housing (IP67) for dust and water protection, you should still seal and protect exposed cables and connectors, especially outdoors.',NULL,'products/1772256944832-741284582.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 05:35:44','2026-02-28 05:35:44'),
(2644,'Uniview  Bullet Camera 4mp IP Camera ','IPC324LB-ADF28K-H',NULL,' Bullet Camera 4mp IP Camera ',1.00,'It uses a 1/2.9″ progressive scan CMOS sensor to capture crisp high‑resolution video at up to 2560×1440 (4 MP), and a fixed 2.8 mm lens that gives a wide approximately 101° field of view, making it well‑suited for watching entrances, driveways, hallways, yards or other spaces.','It also includes a Micro SD card slot for local recording, an integrated microphone for audio capture, and intelligent functions such as motion detection and basic analytics.','Standard network protocols and ONVIF compatibility let it integrate with network video recorders (NVRs) and remote viewing apps for comprehensive security system setups.',NULL,'products/1772258011171-997570563.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 05:53:31','2026-02-28 05:53:31'),
(2645,'Uniview Bullet Camera 4 MP IP Camera','IPC2124SR3-ADPF40M-F',NULL,' Bullet 4 MP IP Camera',1.00,'The Uniview IPC2124SR3‑ADPF40M‑F is a 4 megapixel fixed‑lens IP mini bullet network security camera designed for outdoor and indoor video surveillance.','It uses a 1/3″ progressive‑scan CMOS sensor to capture detailed 4 MP (2688 × 1520) resolution footage and has a 4.0 mm fixed lens that provides a wide field of view ideal for monitoring driveways, entrances, yards or business perimeters.','With an IP67 weather‑resistant housing, it’s suitable for varied environmental conditions, and it can be powered through a PoE (Power over Ethernet) connection or a 12 V DC supply.',NULL,'products/1772258635164-860623479.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 06:03:55','2026-02-28 06:03:55'),
(2646,'Uniview  Turret 4 MP IP Camera',' IPC3614SR3-ADPF28F',NULL,'4 MP Turret  IP Camera',1.00,'The camera features a fixed 2.8 mm wide‑angle lens with a broad field of view, built‑in infrared (IR) LEDs for night vision up to about 30 m, and a wide dynamic range (WDR) to handle scenes with both bright and dark lighting conditions effectively.','It also supports PoE (Power over Ethernet), simplifying installation with power and data over a single cable, and includes a slot for a microSD card (up to 256 GB) for local recording.','With an IP‑rated weather‑resistant housing, it’s built to withstand outdoor conditions, making it a reliable choice for everyday security monitoring.',NULL,'products/1772260679554-3378570.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 06:37:59','2026-02-28 06:37:59'),
(2647,'Uniview  Turret Camera 4 MP IP Camera','IPC3614SR3-ADPF28F',NULL,' Turret  4 MP IP Camera',1.00,'It also supports PoE (Power over Ethernet), simplifying installation with power and data over a single cable, and includes a slot for a microSD card (up to 256 GB) for local recording.','The camera features a fixed 2.8 mm wide‑angle lens with a broad field of view, built‑in infrared (IR) LEDs for night vision up to about 30 m, and a wide dynamic range (WDR) to handle scenes with both bright and dark lighting conditions effectively.','It uses a 1/3″ progressive‑scan CMOS sensor to deliver high‑definition video at up to 2688 × 1520 resolution and 30 fps, providing clear and detailed footage for monitoring areas like entrances, yards, or commercial spaces.',NULL,'products/1772429316798-186238945.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 06:54:46','2026-03-02 05:28:36'),
(2648,'Uniview  Bullet Camera 5MP  IP Camera ',' IPC2125LB-SF40-A',NULL,'Bullet Camera 5MP  IP Camera ',1.00,'It features a 1/3″ progressive‑scan CMOS sensor that captures high‑resolution 5 megapixel video (2592 × 1944) and supports multiple video compression formats including Ultra 265, H.265, H.264 and MJPEG for efficient storage and streaming.','The camera has a 4.0 mm fixed lens with a roughly 79° horizontal field of view, built‑in Smart IR LEDs that provide clear night vision up to about 30 meters, and day/night functionality with automatic IR‑cut switching.','Equipped with 2D/3D digital noise reduction and wide dynamic range (DWDR), it ensures improved image clarity in varied lighting conditions.',NULL,'products/1772262165922-741890588.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-28 07:02:45','2026-02-28 07:02:45'),
(2649,'Uniview Turret Camera 8 MP IP Camera','IPC3618LB-ADF28K-G',NULL,' 8 MP Turret Camera ',1.00,'The Uniview Turret Camera 8MP IP Camera IPC3618LB-ADF28K-G is a high-resolution 4K turret (eyeball)-type network surveillance camera designed for professional indoor and outdoor security monitoring.','It is equipped with a 1/2.7″ progressive scan CMOS sensor that delivers ultra-clear 8-megapixel (3840 × 2160) video resolution, providing detailed images suitable for homes, offices, shops, warehouses, parking areas, and commercial premises.','A built-in microphone enables audio recording for enhanced surveillance, and the camera supports microSD storage up to 512 GB for local recording backup.',NULL,'products/1772430291723-306835469.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 05:44:51','2026-03-02 05:44:51'),
(2650,'Uniview Owl View Series  2MP Camera','PC2312LE-ADF40KM-WP',NULL,' 2MP Owl View Series Camera',1.00,'The Uniview IPC2312LE-ADF40KM-WP is a 2 MP fixed bullet-type IP network camera designed for reliable outdoor surveillance.','It features a 1/2.7″ CMOS sensor paired with a large F1.0 aperture lens, delivering Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080) video at up to 30 fps, which ensures sharp and detailed footage for homes, offices, shops, and perimeter security.','The camera uses ColorHunter technology with Wise-ISP image processing, enabling 24-hour full-color monitoring even in low-light conditions',NULL,'products/1772431794370-127321636.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 06:09:54','2026-03-02 06:09:54'),
(2651,'Uniview Owl View Series  2MP Camera','IPC3622LE-ADF28K-WP',NULL,' 2MP Owl View Series Turret Camera',1.00,'The Uniview IPC3622LE-ADF28K-WP is a 2MP turret-type (eyeball) IP network camera designed for high-quality indoor and outdoor surveillance.','It is equipped with a 1/2.7″ progressive scan CMOS sensor that delivers clear Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution video at up to 30 fps, providing sharp and detailed monitoring for homes, offices, shops, and commercial security areas.','The camera features a 2.8 mm fixed lens with a large F1.0 aperture, allowing excellent light sensitivity and improved performance in low-light environments.',NULL,'products/1772432310398-457766802.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 06:18:30','2026-03-02 06:18:30'),
(2652,'Uniview Owl View Series  4MP Camera','IPC2314LE-ADF40KM-WP',NULL,'  4MP Owl View Series Camera',1.00,'The Uniview IPC2314LE-ADF40KM-WP is a high-performance 4MP fixed bullet-type IP network camera designed for professional indoor and outdoor surveillance applications.','It features a 1/1.8″ progressive scan CMOS sensor with a large F1.0 aperture lens, delivering sharp 4MP resolution (2688 × 1520) video with excellent clarity and brightness.','The camera includes 120 dB True WDR for balanced images in strong backlight conditions, a built-in microphone for audio recording, and warm white light illumination up to 30 meters for clear night surveillance.',NULL,'products/1772432906789-414451915.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 06:28:26','2026-03-02 06:28:26'),
(2653,'Uniview Owl View Series  4MP Camera','IPC3624LE-ADF28K-WP',NULL,'4MP Owl View Series  Camera',1.00,'The Uniview IPC3624LE-ADF28K-WP is a 4 MP fixed turret (eyeball) IP network surveillance camera designed for reliable indoor and outdoor security monitoring.','It features a 1/1.8″ progressive scan CMOS sensor with a 2.8 mm F1.0 fixed lens, delivering high-resolution 4 MP (2688 × 1520) video for sharp and detailed imaging.','The camera is powered by ColorHunter with Wise-ISP technology, which enhances color, detail, and low-light performance so it can produce full-color images around the clock.',NULL,'products/1772433329891-814771562.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 06:35:29','2026-03-02 06:35:29'),
(2654,'Uniview Owl View Series  8MP Camera','IPC3628LE-ADF28K-WP',NULL,' Owl View Series  8MP Camera',1.00,'The Uniview IPC3628LE-ADF28K-WP is a 4 MP turret-style IP network surveillance camera built for reliable indoor and outdoor security monitoring.','It supports efficient Ultra 265, H.265, and H.264 video compression, reducing bandwidth and storage requirements while preserving high-quality recording.','Wipe the lens and housing periodically with a soft cloth to ensure clear image quality and prevent dust build-up.',NULL,'products/1772433873340-203540354.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 06:44:33','2026-03-02 06:44:33'),
(2655,'Uniview   PTZ 2MP CAMERA','IPC6412LR-X5UPW-VG',NULL,'  PTZ 2MP CAMERA',1.00,'The PTZ mechanism allows horizontal and vertical movement for dynamic monitoring, making it suitable for tracking movement across wide areas such as offices, retail interiors, hallways, and other indoor spaces.','It is a compact PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) dome-style IP camera that delivers high-quality 1080p (1920 × 1080) resolution video using a 1/2.7″ progressive scan CMOS sensor.','The Uniview IPC6412LR-X5UPW-VG is a high-performance 2 MP motorized PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) IP network camera designed for dynamic surveillance in both indoor and semi-protected outdoor environments.',NULL,'products/1772435464295-727990620.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 07:11:04','2026-03-02 07:11:04'),
(2656,'Uniview PTZ Camera 2MP ','IPC6412LR-X16-VG',NULL,'2MP PTZ Camera ',1.00,'The Uniview IPC6412LR-X16-VG is a 2 MP motorized PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) IP network camera designed for advanced video surveillance.','This model features a motorized varifocal lens with 16× optical zoom, allowing users to remotely adjust the zoom level and viewing angle for detailed monitoring across long distances without loss of image quality. ','The camera is optimized for digital CCTV systems, offering flexible monitoring and tracking capabilities beyond fixed-lens cameras.',NULL,'products/1772436185347-544089308.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 07:23:05','2026-03-02 07:23:05'),
(2657,'Uniview PTZ Camera 4MP ','IPC6624SR-X33-VF',NULL,'PTZ Camera 4MP ',1.00,'The Uniview IPC6624SR-X33-VF is a 4 MP outdoor PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) network dome camera built for advanced, long-range surveillance applications.','This model is equipped with a powerful 33× optical zoom motorized varifocal lens (4.5–148.5 mm) that lets you zoom in on distant objects without losing clarity, and it supports up to 16× digital zoom for even more detail when needed.','The camera uses Uniview’s LightHunter technology for excellent low-light performance and Smart IR night vision up to approximately 150 meters, ensuring visibility even in complete darkness.',NULL,'products/1772436882316-841469291.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 07:34:42','2026-03-02 07:34:42'),
(2658,'Uniarch 2 MP Bullet Camera',' IPC B122-APF40',NULL,'Bullet Camera ',1.00,'The Uniview IPC-B122-APF40 is a reliable 2MP fixed bullet-type IP network surveillance camera designed for continuous indoor and outdoor security monitoring.','The camera supports advanced Ultra 265, H.265, and H.264 video compression, which helps reduce bandwidth and storage usage while maintaining high video quality.','It features a 1/2.8″ progressive scan CMOS sensor that delivers clear Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution video, ensuring sharp image quality for homes, offices, shops, entrances, and perimeter protection.',NULL,'products/1772444121755-375518816.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-02 09:35:21','2026-03-02 09:35:21'),
(2659,'Uniarch Turret Camera  3MP IP Camera',' IPC-T213-APF28W',NULL,'  3MP IP Turret Camera ',1.00,'The Uniarch IPC-T213-APF28W is a reliable 3MP fixed turret (eyeball) IP network camera designed for high-quality indoor and outdoor CCTV surveillance.','It is equipped with a 1/2.7″ progressive scan CMOS sensor that delivers clear 3-megapixel resolution (2304 × 1296) video, providing sharper images than standard 2MP cameras.',' It uses dual-light technology, combining Smart IR night vision up to 30 meters and white light illumination up to 15 meters, allowing clear monitoring both in darkness and low-light color conditions.',NULL,'products/1772510257037-644953968.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 03:57:37','2026-03-03 03:57:37'),
(2660,'Uniarch Bullet Camera  4MP IP Camera','IPC-B124-APF40',NULL,' Bullet Camera  4MP IP Camera',1.00,'The Uniview IPC-B124-APF40 is a 4 MP fixed bullet-type IP network surveillance camera engineered for dependable indoor and outdoor security monitoring.','The camera is equipped with a 4.0 mm fixed lens that offers a stable field of view, and it features Smart IR night vision up to approximately 30 meters, enabling effective monitoring even in total darkness.','Advanced video compression technologies like Ultra 265, H.265, and H.264 help reduce bandwidth and storage usage while maintaining high-quality footage.',NULL,'products/1772510657916-108943011.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 04:04:17','2026-03-03 04:04:17'),
(2661,'Uniarch Turret Camera 4MP IP Camera','IPC-T124-APF28',NULL,' 4MP IP Turret Camera ',1.00,'The IPC-T124-APF28 is a professional 4 MP fixed turret network (IP) security camera used for video surveillance in homes, businesses, and outdoor environments.','The camera has infrared (IR) illumination up to about 30 meters, allowing it to see in low-light or complete darkness, and it uses an automatic day/night IR-cut filter to switch modes based on lighting conditions.','It’s weather-resistant with an IP67 rating, meaning it’s sealed against dust and can withstand rain and harsh outdoor weather, and supports PoE (Power over Ethernet) for easier installation, plus a built-in microphone for optional audio capture.',NULL,'products/1772511227808-65457036.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 04:13:47','2026-03-03 04:13:47'),
(2662,'Uniarch Bullet  5MP Camera','IPC-B125-PF40 ',NULL,'Bullet  5MP Camera',1.00,'The IPC-B125-PF40 is a 5 MP mini fixed bullet network security camera designed for outdoor and indoor surveillance.','The camera supports efficient video compression formats like Ultra 265, H.265, H.264, and MJPEG to help reduce bandwidth and storage usage while maintaining image quality.','Regularly check the recording system and storage to ensure footage is being captured and stored correctly.',NULL,'products/1772511523927-471213903.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 04:18:43','2026-03-03 04:18:43'),
(2663,'Uniarch UHO-S2E Wi-Fi Camera','UHO-S2E',NULL,'2 MP Wi-Fi Camera ',1.00,'The UHO-S2E is a 2 MP Smart Pan & Tilt Wi-Fi indoor security camera designed for home or office surveillance. It’s part of the Uniarch/Uniview smart camera lineup and provides Full HD 1080p (2 megapixel) resolution for clear video monitoring.','The camera has a motorized pan (horizontal) and tilt (vertical) mechanism, allowing it to rotate and cover a wide area (up to a full 360° pan and significant tilt range) rather than being fixed in one direction — this gives much better coverage of rooms compared to static cameras.','It supports both Wi-Fi (2.4 GHz) and wired Ethernet connections, making setup flexible.',NULL,'products/1772511985454-317156844.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 04:26:25','2026-03-03 04:26:25'),
(2664,'Uniarch 2 MP  Wi-Fi Camera','C1L-2WN-G',NULL,' Wi-Fi Camera  2 MP',1.00,'The C1L-2WN-G is a 2 MP (Full HD) indoor Wi-Fi smart cube IP security camera designed for home or small office monitoring.','It captures clear 1080p (1920×1080) video at up to 30 fps, giving a detailed view of indoor spaces.','The camera supports motion detection, tampering alarm, human body detection, and audio detection to help trigger alerts when activity is detected.',NULL,'products/1772512348213-606675262.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 04:32:28','2026-03-03 04:32:28'),
(2665,'Uniarch 3MP Wi-Fi Camera ','UHO-S3E-M3',NULL,' 3MP Uniarch Camera ',1.00,'The UHO-S3E-M3 is a 3 MP indoor Wi-Fi smart pan & tilt IP security camera designed for home or small-business surveillance. ','It delivers high-definition video up to 2304 × 1296 (3 MP) and also supports 1080p (2 MP) and 720p resolutions, giving flexibility in quality vs. bandwidth/storage usage.','The pan/tilt motor lets the camera pan nearly 360° horizontally and tilt vertically so it can monitor an entire room without blind spots.',NULL,'products/1772512875586-934107940.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 04:41:15','2026-03-03 04:41:15'),
(2666,'Uniarch 3MP Wi-Fi Camera ','UHO-S3E-M3TD',NULL,'Wi-Fi Camera 3MP',1.00,'The UHO-S3E-M3TD is a **3 megapixel (2304 × 1296) smart indoor pan-tilt Wi-Fi IP camera designed for home or small-business video surveillance.','It has both Wi-Fi (2.4 GHz) and RJ45 Ethernet connectivity, making setup flexible. This model features pan and tilt motorized control to cover a wide area indoors,','It works with the Uniarch app and common network protocols for remote viewing and control.',NULL,'products/1772513198921-235820798.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 04:46:38','2026-03-03 04:46:38'),
(2667,'Uniarch Wi-Fi Camera 3MP','UHO-S3S-M33D',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The UHO-S3S-M33D is a 3 MP + 3 MP dual-lens smart indoor Wi-Fi IP security camera from Uniarch’s Panda S Series, designed to give you comprehensive room coverage with a single device.','The camera supports Wi-Fi (IEEE 802.11b/g/n/ax) and Ethernet connection, night vision up to about 10 m with dual lighting (IR + warm light), two-way audio (built-in microphone and speaker), and smart detection for humans, vehicles, pets, loud sounds, and even baby cries.','Use the correct power adapter (typically DC 5 V / 1.5 A) and protect wiring from damage or bending stress.',NULL,'products/1772513496097-339693159.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 04:51:36','2026-03-03 04:51:36'),
(2668,'Uniarch 5MP Wi Fi Camera','UHO-S3E-M5TD',NULL,'Wi Fi 5MP  Camera',1.00,'The UHO-S3E-M5TD is a 5 megapixel (2880 × 1620) indoor Pan-Tilt Wi-Fi IP security camera from Uniarch’s Panda S-Series designed for home and small-business monitoring.','It features a high-resolution 1/3″ CMOS sensor that provides sharp video and supports multiple resolution settings (5 MP, 4 MP, 3 MP, 2 MP, 720p) to balance detail and storage needs.','Local storage via micro SD (up to 512 GB) and connectivity over Wi-Fi (2.4 GHz) make it easy to install and use.',NULL,'products/1772513731100-777237802.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 04:55:31','2026-03-03 04:55:31'),
(2669,'8 Ch 2MP Supported XVR  ','XVR-108F',NULL,'XVR 2MP Supported 8 Ch ',1.00,'The Uniarch UV-XVR-108F is an 8-channel hybrid digital video recorder (XVR) (also called a DVR for mixed analog/IP systems).',' It’s designed to collect, process, record, and manage video feeds from multiple security cameras in homes, offices, or small businesses.','Place the XVR unit in a dry, stable, well-ventilated area away from direct sunlight and moisture to prevent overheating or electrical hazards.',NULL,'products/1772515353874-854139488.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 05:22:33','2026-03-03 05:22:33'),
(2670,'Ch 2MP Record 5MP XVR','XVR-104G3',NULL,' Record 5MP XVR  2MP',1.00,'The Uniarch UV-XVR-104G3 is a 4-channel hybrid XVR (digital video recorder) designed for CCTV surveillance systems in homes, shops, and small business environments.','It supports multiple video formats including TVI, AHD, CVI, CVBS, and IP cameras with adaptive access, allowing you to mix traditional analog cameras with newer IP models in a single recorder.','Change the default admin username and password during setup to prevent unauthorized access.',NULL,'products/1772516634402-26404213.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 05:43:54','2026-03-03 05:43:54'),
(2671,'bk',NULL,NULL,NULL,1000.00,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,'active','2026-03-03 05:50:05','2026-03-03 11:16:19'),
(2672,'4Ch 5MP Record  XVR','XVR301-04Q3',NULL,'4Ch 5MP Record',1.00,'The Uniview XVR301-04Q3 (often sold under the XVR301-04G3/Q3 platform) is a hybrid digital video recorder (XVR) designed for CCTV and security camera systems in homes, shops, offices, and small-to-medium surveillance installations.','. It acts as the central unit that records, stores, displays, and manages video feeds from multiple cameras over time.','Place the recorder in a dry, well-ventilated area to avoid overheating.',NULL,'products/1772518537207-83015454.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 06:15:37','2026-03-03 06:15:37'),
(2673,'Uniarch 8 ch  XVR 5MP Record',' XVR301-08Q3 ',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Uniview XVR301-08Q3 is a professional 8-channel hybrid digital video recorder (XVR) designed to manage and record video from CCTV security systems. ','It acts as the central unit that records, stores, displays, and manages video feeds from multiple cameras over time.','Set up remote viewing through the official mobile app or desktop client securely — avoid shared public credentials.',NULL,'products/1772519341915-231534761.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 06:29:01','2026-03-03 06:29:01'),
(2674,' Uniarch 16ch XVR  5MP Record ',' XVR302-16Q3',NULL,'5MP Record 16ch XVR',1.00,'The Uniview XVR302-16Q3 is an advanced hybrid digital video recorder (XVR) used in comprehensive CCTV surveillance systems for homes, businesses, warehouses, shops, or offices.','It combines traditional analog camera support with modern IP camera connectivity, giving flexibility to integrate different types of cameras — including HD-TVI, AHD, CVI, CVBS, and IP cameras — on a single platform.','Install the recorder in a dry, well-ventilated area to prevent overheating.',NULL,'products/1772519621426-458074945.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 06:33:41','2026-03-05 09:13:20'),
(2675,'Uniview NVR IN-BUILT POE',' NVR301-04S2-P4',NULL,' NVR IN-BUILT POE',1.00,'The NVR301-04S2-P4 is a 4-channel network video recorder (NVR) designed for IP-based CCTV and video surveillance systems.','It acts as the central device that receives, processes, records, and manages video feeds from multiple IP cameras over a network.','Mount in a dry, stable location: Place the NVR away from moisture, direct sunlight, and heat sources to avoid overheating.',NULL,'products/1772521347674-79096569.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 07:02:27','2026-03-03 07:02:27'),
(2676,'Uniview NVR',' NVR301-08S',NULL,'Easy -S SERIES',1.00,'The NVR301-08S/NVR301-08S3 is an 8-channel IP camera network video recorder designed to centralize, store, and manage video feeds from multiple network cameras in a surveillance system.1','It’s ideal for homes, offices, shops, warehouses, and small-to-medium CCTV setups where you need reliable monitoring and recording of activities.','Change the default admin username and password before connecting the unit to your network.',NULL,'products/1772522140632-540096854.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 07:15:40','2026-03-03 07:15:40'),
(2677,'Uniview NVR - S SERIES',' NVR301-04S3',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Uniview NVR301-04S3 is a 4-channel network video recorder (NVR) from Uniview’s Easy Series, designed to act as the central recording and management unit for IP camera surveillance systems.','It lets you connect, view, record, and playback video from multiple IP cameras — ideal for homes, small offices, retail shops, and compact security setups.','Change the default admin password and username right after setup to secure against unauthorized access.',NULL,'products/1772522741421-514121620.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 07:25:41','2026-03-03 07:25:41'),
(2678,'Uniview NVR - S SERIES','  NVR301-08S3 ',NULL,' NVR - S SERIES',1.00,'The NVR301-08S3 is an 8-channel IP Network Video Recorder designed to work with digital IP cameras, acting as the central hub that receives, records, displays, and manages video streams in a surveillance system.','It acts as the central unit that receives, records, manages, and plays back video streams from multiple connected IP cameras.','Avoid moist or dusty areas to reduce the risk of overheating or component corrosion.',NULL,'products/1772522978036-943138484.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 07:29:38','2026-03-03 07:29:38'),
(2679,'Uniview NVR - S SERIES','NVR301-16S3',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Uniview NVR301-16S3 is a 16-channel IP network video recorder designed to centralize, record, manage, and play back video footage from up to sixteen IP security cameras.','It\'s part of Uniview’s Easy Series of NVRs, offering a reliable, scalable solution for home, office, retail, warehouse, or commercial video surveillance setups.','Dry, Ventilated Setup: Place the NVR in a dry, cool, well-ventilated area away from moisture, direct sunlight, and dust to prevent overheating and hardware issues.',NULL,'products/1772523177564-661956798.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 07:32:57','2026-03-03 07:32:57'),
(2680,'Uniview NVR - S SERIES',' NVR304-64E2',NULL,' NVR - S SERIES',1.00,'The Uniview NVR304-64E2 is a professional 64-channel IP Network Video Recorder designed for large CCTV/IP camera surveillance systems.','It serves as the central unit that receives, manages, records, and plays back video feeds from up to 64 network (IP) cameras — suitable for large facilities, campuses, offices, warehouses, or multi-location security needs.','Use a surge protector or UPS (uninterruptible power supply) to protect the device from power spikes and outages.',NULL,'products/1772529815244-195169632.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 09:23:35','2026-03-03 09:23:35'),
(2681,'Uniview NVR - S SERIES',' NVR504-16B ',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Uniview NVR504-16B is a professional-grade IP Network Video Recorder (NVR) designed for medium to large CCTV surveillance systems in offices, shops, factories, warehouses, campuses, and residential complexes.','It functions as the central hub that connects, records, processes, and manages video streams from up to 16 network (IP) cameras — with support that can scale up in hybrid models.','Set up secure remote access using the official mobile or PC apps and use unique, strong passwords.',NULL,'products/1772530894717-467112101.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 09:41:34','2026-03-03 09:41:34'),
(2682,'Uniview NVR - S SERIES',' NVR504-32B',NULL,' NVR - S SERIES',1.00,'The Uniview NVR504-32B is a powerful 32-channel IP network video recorder (NVR) designed for medium to large-scale CCTV/IP camera systems commonly used in offices, shops, warehouses, residential complexes, and commercial installations.','','Place the NVR in a cool, dry and well-ventilated area to avoid overheating and maintain long-term reliability.',NULL,'products/1772533059611-438558237.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 10:17:39','2026-03-03 10:17:39'),
(2683,'Hikvision 2 MP Dome Camera',NULL,NULL,' Dome Camera',1.00,'A Hikvision 2 MP Dome Camera is a compact and reliable CCTV surveillance camera designed for indoor and outdoor security monitoring.','It delivers Full HD 1080p (1920×1080) resolution, providing clear and detailed video for homes, offices, shops, and small commercial spaces.','Use the correct power adapter (12V DC) or PoE source as specified by the model to prevent damage.',NULL,'products/1772809754953-647579621.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-03 10:41:57','2026-03-06 15:09:14'),
(2684,'Hikvision Turret Camera 2 mp ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A Hikvision 2 MP Turret Camera is a compact and widely used CCTV camera designed for both indoor and outdoor surveillance. It delivers Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution using a progressive scan CMOS sensor, producing clear and detailed video images.','Many models (such as the DS-2CD1323 series) include infrared night vision that can illuminate up to about 20–30 m in darkness, enabling reliable monitoring 24/7.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772620077771-12260833.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-04 10:27:57','2026-03-04 10:27:57'),
(2685,'Hikvision IP camera',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A Hikvision IP camera (Internet Protocol camera) is a modern network-based CCTV camera that captures and transmits digital video over a network such as Ethernet or Wi-Fi.','Unlike traditional analog cameras, IP cameras send video data directly to a Network Video Recorder (NVR) or cloud system using an IP network.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-03-04 10:40:24','2026-03-04 10:40:24'),
(2686,'Vartech MAS830L Digital Multimeter',NULL,NULL,'VMAS830LB Vartech Meter',1299.00,'The Vartech MAS830L Digital Multimeter is a compact handheld electronic measuring instrument used to test and troubleshoot electrical circuits. It is widely used by electricians, electronics technicians, students, and hobbyists for measuring AC/DC voltage, DC current, resistance, and performing diode and continuity tests. The device features a clear LCD display with manual range selection and is powered by a 9V battery.','This multimeter provides a 3½-digit display with about 1999 counts, allowing accurate measurement readings. It supports voltage measurements up to 600V AC/DC, DC current up to 10A, and resistance measurement up to 2MΩ. Additional functions such as transistor (hFE) testing, data hold, backlight display, and audible continuity buzzer make it useful for electronics repair, laboratory work, and home electrical maintenance',NULL,NULL,'products/1772687877424-285259098.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 05:17:57','2026-03-05 05:23:37'),
(2687,'Mixing Resister 1/4W',NULL,NULL,NULL,199.00,'A Mixing Resistor 1/4W (often called a 1/4-watt resistor assortment or mixed resistor kit) is a set of fixed resistors with different resistance values, each rated at 0.25 watt (¼ watt) power capacity. These resistors are commonly used in electronic circuits to limit current, divide voltage, and control signal levels. The 1/4W rating means the resistor can safely dissipate up to 0.25 watts of electrical power as heat without damage, 1OE, 15E, 22E, 33E, 47E, 68E, 100E, 220E, 330E, 470E, 1K,1K5, 2K2, 3K3, 4K7,5K6, 6K8, 8K2, 10K, 15K inside in the box','Mixing resistor packs typically include many different resistance values (for example 10Ω, 100Ω, 1kΩ, 10kΩ, etc.) so they are useful for electronics repair, prototyping, Arduino projects, and breadboard experiments. These resistors usually have color bands on their body that indicate the resistance value and tolerance.','1OE, 15E, 22E, 33E, 47E, 68E, 100E, 220E, 330E, 470E, 1K,1K5, 2K2, 3K3, 4K7,5K6, 6K8, 8K2, 10K, 15K inside in the box',NULL,'products/1772688649156-888623875.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 05:30:49','2026-03-05 05:30:49'),
(2688,'Plastic gear set kit',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A Plastic Gear Set Kit is a collection of small plastic gears and mechanical transmission parts used in robotics, toy repairs, and DIY engineering projects. The kit usually contains different types of gears such as spur gears, crown gears, bevel gears, worm gears, pulleys, racks, axles, and belts, allowing users to build gear mechanisms and experiment with motion transfer','These kits are widely used in robot car projects, science experiments, model making, and educational learning because they help demonstrate how gears change speed, direction, and torque in mechanical systems. Most plastic gear kits include 30–90 pieces with different sizes and shaft holes (commonly around 2 mm–3 mm) so they can be attached to small DC motors and shafts',NULL,NULL,'products/1772690332594-981584354.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 05:58:52','2026-03-05 05:58:52'),
(2689,'Small Glue Gun Stick',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A Small Glue Gun Stick is a cylindrical adhesive stick used with a mini hot glue gun to bond different materials together. These sticks are made of thermoplastic adhesive that melts when heated inside the glue gun and quickly hardens after application, creating a strong bond. Small glue sticks typically have a diameter of 7 mm (0.27 inch) and are commonly used in craft projects, electronics work, DIY repairs, and decoration tasks.','When inserted into a mini glue gun, the stick melts and flows through the nozzle, allowing precise application of hot glue on surfaces such as plastic, wood, fabric, paper, cardboard, and light metal parts. Due to their quick drying time and strong adhesion, small glue gun sticks are widely used in schools, workshops, and home projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772690934542-995742876.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 06:08:54','2026-03-05 06:08:54'),
(2690,'Big Glue gun Stick',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A Big Glue Gun Stick is a large hot-melt adhesive stick used with standard or heavy-duty glue guns to bond different materials quickly and strongly. These glue sticks are made from thermoplastic adhesive that melts inside the glue gun and solidifies within seconds after application, creating a strong and durable bond.','Large glue sticks usually have a diameter of about 11 mm and a length of 150–200 mm, making them suitable for medium and heavy-duty glue guns such as 40W, 60W, or 100W glue guns.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772691039722-631490892.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 06:10:39','2026-03-05 06:10:39'),
(2691,'Hot Melt Glue Gun 25W',NULL,NULL,NULL,1299.00,'A Hot Melt Glue Gun 25W is a small electric adhesive tool used to melt glue sticks and apply hot adhesive to bond materials quickly. It operates with 25-watt heating power and typically uses 7 mm diameter glue sticks, making it ideal for craft work, electronics fixing, and DIY projects. When the glue stick is heated inside the gun, it melts and is pushed through the nozzle to form a strong bond that hardens within seconds.','These glue guns are compact and easy to use. They usually have a trigger-feed mechanism to control the glue flow, a heat-resistant nozzle for precise application, and a small stand for safe placement during use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772691449379-601805638.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 06:17:29','2026-03-05 06:17:29'),
(2692,'Hot Melt Glue Gun 40W',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A Hot Melt Glue Gun 40W is a medium-power electric adhesive tool used to melt hot glue sticks and apply strong bonding to different materials. It operates at 40 watts of heating power, allowing the glue to melt quickly and flow smoothly through the nozzle for efficient bonding. These glue guns commonly use 11 mm diameter glue sticks and are suitable for craft work, electronics repair, packaging, and general DIY applications','The tool has a trigger-feed mechanism that pushes the glue stick toward the heating element, melting the thermoplastic adhesive and dispensing it through the nozzle. The hot glue remains sticky when applied and solidifies within seconds, creating a durable bond between materials.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772691785270-350173009.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 06:23:05','2026-03-05 06:23:05'),
(2693,'BO Motor straight Double Shaft',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A BO Motor Straight Double Shaft is a small DC geared motor commonly used in robotics and educational electronics projects. It is called a double-shaft motor because it has output shafts on both sides of the gearbox, allowing wheels, encoders, or other mechanical parts to be attached on either side. This design makes it useful for balanced robot movement and motion-tracking applications.','The motor typically operates at 3V to 12V DC and is available in various speeds such as 60 RPM, 100 RPM, or 150 RPM depending on the gear ratio. Its internal plastic gearbox reduces the motor speed and increases torque, enabling it to drive robot wheels or small mechanical systems efficiently',NULL,NULL,'products/1772692632045-556511084.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 06:37:12','2026-03-05 06:37:12'),
(2694,'BO Motor straight single shaft',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A BO Motor Straight Single Shaft is a compact DC geared motor widely used in robotics, educational kits, and DIY electronics projects. It is called a single-shaft motor because the output shaft is available on only one side of the gearbox, allowing wheels or gears to be attached easily for motion. These motors provide good torque and speed at low voltages, making them suitable for battery-powered devices.','This motor typically operates on 3V–12V DC and comes with different speed options such as 60 RPM, 100 RPM, 150 RPM, or 300 RPM depending on the internal gear ratio. The built-in plastic gearbox reduces the motor speed and increases torque so it can drive robot wheels and small mechanical loads effectively.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772692784724-100951010.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 06:39:44','2026-03-05 06:39:44'),
(2695,'DS1307 Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS1307 module is a Real-Time Clock (RTC) module used in electronic and embedded systems to maintain accurate time and date information.','The module keeps track of seconds, minutes, hours, day, date, month, and year, including automatic adjustment for leap years.','The module usually operates at 5 V and provides a simple and reliable way to add real-time clock functionality to many electronics projects.',NULL,'products/1772701239854-428068147.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-03-05 09:00:39','2026-03-05 09:02:37'),
(2696,'PCT-211 Connector','1-1 [LT-211] ',NULL,'PCT Connector',199.00,'The PCT-211 / LT-211 connector is a single-pole quick connection terminal block designed for easy and secure electrical wire connections without the need for special tools. It uses a spring-lever or push-in mechanism to clamp wires, allowing fast installation and removal in wiring applications.','These connectors are typically used in distribution boxes, junction boxes, control panels, and other electrical systems where quick and reliable splicing of single conductor wires is needed.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772705462648-997094279.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:11:02','2026-03-05 10:11:02'),
(2697,'2-2 PCT 222 Connector','2-2 PCT 222',NULL,'PCT Connector',199.00,'The PCT-222 Connector is a 2-in, 2-out lever-type quick wire connector designed for fast, secure, and tool-free electrical connections. It allows two wires to be easily connected or spliced using a simple flip-lever mechanism, ensuring strong contact for both solid and stranded conductors. This makes installation, removal, and re-wiring quick and convenient compared to traditional screw terminals.','The PCT-222 connector is suitable for household, commercial, and light industrial wiring applications. It is commonly used in junction boxes, lighting circuits, control panels, and electrical repairs where neat, reusable, a',NULL,NULL,'products/1772705555209-673991065.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:12:35','2026-03-05 10:12:35'),
(2698,'3-3 PCT 223 Connector','3-3 PCT 223 ',NULL,'PCT Connector',199.00,'The PCT-223 Connector is a 3-in, 3-out lever-type quick wire connector that lets you join three pairs of wires securely without using screws or tools. Each channel has its own flip-down lever that clamps the wire in place, making it easy to insert or remove both solid and stranded conductors.','the PCT-223 is ideal for general electrical and lighting installations, junction boxes, control panels, and DIY wiring tasks. Its reusable and vibration-resistant design simplifies maintenance and re-wiring, especially in applications where quick and dependable connections are needed.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772705650972-727356467.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:14:10','2026-03-05 10:14:10'),
(2699,'4-4 PCT 224 Connector','4-4 PCT 224',NULL,'PCT Connector',199.00,'The PCT-224 Connector is a 4-in, 4-out lever-type quick wire connector designed for fast, secure, and tool-free electrical connections. It features four individual channels with flip-down levers that clamp wires firmly in place, allowing easy insertion and removal of both solid and stranded conductors. This lever mechanism simplifies installation compared to traditional screw terminals, saving time and effort.','Built with a durable insulated housing and reliable internal contacts, the PCT-224 is suitable for a variety of wiring applications such as lighting circuits, junction boxes, control panels, and household or industrial electrical projects. Its reusable and vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for situations where dependable and maintainable connections are required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772705754963-826470833.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:15:54','2026-03-05 10:15:54'),
(2700,'5-5 PCT 225 Connector','5-5 PCT 225',NULL,'PCT Connector',199.00,'The PCT-225 Connector is a 5-in, 5-out lever-type quick wire connector that provides a fast, secure, and tool-free way to join five pairs of wires. Each connection point has its own lever that flips down to clamp the wire firmly, making it easy to insert and remove both solid and stranded conductors while ensuring reliable electrical contact. This lever mechanism speeds up installation and reduces the effort compared to traditional screw-type terminals.','Built with a durable insulated housing and reliable internal contacts, the PCT-224 is suitable for a variety of wiring applications such as lighting circuits, junction boxes, control panels, and household or industrial electrical projects. Its reusable and vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for situations where dependable and maintainable connections are required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772705845340-147868243.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:17:25','2026-03-05 10:17:25'),
(2701,'6-6 PCT 223-6P Connector','6-6 PCT 223-6P Connector',NULL,'PCT Connector',199.00,'The PCT 223-6P Connector is a 6-in, 6-out lever-type quick wire connector designed for fast, secure, and tool-free electrical connections. It features six individual channels with flip-down levers that clamp wires firmly in place, allowing easy insertion and removal of both solid and stranded conductors while ensuring reliable electrical contact. This lever mechanism makes installation and maintenance quicker and easier than traditional screw-type terminals.','Built with a durable insulated housing and dependable internal contacts, the PCT 223-6P is suitable for a range of wiring applications, including lighting circuits, junction boxes, control panels, and general household or industrial electrical projects. Its reusable, vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for situations where quick, maintainable, and dependable multi-wire connections are required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772705975977-839236293.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:19:35','2026-03-05 10:19:35'),
