(2709,'LT 6-2-6 PCT Connector','LT 6-2-6 PCT Connector',NULL,'PCT Connector',199.00,'The LT 6-2-6 PCT Connector is a multi-way quick wire connector designed to provide secure, tool-free electrical connections across three grouped sections: six channels on one side, two in the middle, and six on the other side. Each channel uses a push-in or lever clamp mechanism to hold both solid and stranded wires firmly in place, ensuring reliable electrical contact while making installation and removal fast and easy compared to traditional screw-type terminals.','With a compact insulated housing and dependable internal contacts, the LT 6-2-6 PCT connector is well-suited for complex wiring tasks in junction boxes, control panels, lighting systems, and general household or commercial electrical projects. Its reusable, vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for applications that require neat, maintainable, and dependable multi-wire connections in grouped configurations.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772706773532-899067866.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:32:53','2026-03-05 10:32:53'),
