(2712,'LT 9-3-9 PCT Connector','LT 9-3-9 PCT Connector',NULL,'PCT Connector',299.00,'The LT 9-3-9 PCT Connector is a multi-way quick wire connector designed for fast, secure, and tool-free electrical connections across three grouped sections: nine channels on each outer side and three in the center. It uses push-in or lever clamp mechanisms that hold both solid and stranded wires firmly in place, ensuring dependable electrical contact while making installation and removal much quicker compared to traditional screw-type terminals.','LT 9-3-9 PCT connector is suitable for complex wiring tasks such as junction boxes, control panels, lighting circuits, and general household or commercial electrical projects. Its reusable and vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for applications that require neat, maintainable, and dependable multi-wire connections in a grouped configuration.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772707062740-130755960.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:37:42','2026-03-05 10:37:42'),
