(2714,'LT 03-12 PCT Connector','LT 03-12 PCT Connector',NULL,'PCT Connector',499.00,'The LT 03-12 PCT Connector is a multi-way quick wire connector designed for fast, secure, and tool-free electrical connections across two grouped sections: three channels on one side and twelve on the other. It uses simple push-in or lever clamp mechanisms that hold both solid and stranded wires firmly in place, ensuring dependable electrical contact while making installation and removal much quicker and easier than traditional screw-type terminals.','LT 03-12 PCT connector is suitable for varied wiring tasks such as junction boxes, lighting circuits, control panels, and general household or commercial electrical projects. Its reusable, vibration-resistant design makes it ideal for applications that require neat, maintainable, and dependable multi-wire connections in mixed channel configurations.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772707236017-670059693.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:40:36','2026-03-05 10:40:36'),
(2715,'10D9 NTC Thermistor',NULL,NULL,'NTC Thermisor',99.00,'The 10D9 NTC Thermistor is a negative temperature coefficient (NTC) temperature sensor whose resistance decreases as temperature rises. It’s made from semiconductor materials that exhibit predictable changes in resistance with temperature, making it useful for precise temperature measurement, monitoring, and control in electronic systems.','Typically used in applications like thermostats, temperature compensation circuits, battery packs, and thermal protection, the 10D9 thermistor provides reliable, repeatable readings over a wide temperature range. Its compact size and fast thermal response make it suitable for both industrial and consumer electronics where accurate temperature sensing or over-temperature protection is required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772707730565-601963171.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:48:50','2026-03-05 10:48:50'),
(2716,'Metal Sensor Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A Metal Sensor Module is an electronic detection module used to identify the presence of metal objects without physical contact.','Most metal sensor modules work using the inductive sensing principle, where the sensor generates an electromagnetic field.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:54:06','2026-03-05 10:54:06'),
(2717,'7D431 MOV Thermistor',NULL,NULL,'NTC Thermisor',99.00,'The 7D431 MOV (Metal Oxide Varistor) is a surge protection device that helps safeguard electronic circuits from voltage spikes and transient surges. Its resistance decreases sharply when the voltage across it exceeds a certain threshold, allowing it to absorb and divert excess energy away from sensitive components. The “7D431” designation typically refers to a specific size and voltage rating (e.g., 430 V clamping level), making it suitable for protecting AC mains and other power lines.','MOVs like the 7D431 are commonly used in power strips, surge protectors, industrial equipment, and appliances to defend against lightning strikes, switching transients, and other high-voltage events. By limiting potentially damaging voltage surges, they help improve the reliability and lifespan of electronic systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772708081359-323445987.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 10:54:41','2026-03-05 10:54:41'),
(2718,'14D431 MOV Thermistor',NULL,NULL,'NTC Thermistor',99.00,'The 14D431 MOV (Metal Oxide Varistor) is a surge protection component designed to protect electronic circuits and devices from voltage spikes and transient electrical surges. It has a nonlinear resistance that remains high under normal voltage conditions but drops sharply when the voltage exceeds its threshold (around 431 V), allowing it to absorb and divert excess energy away from sensitive components.','MOVs like the 14D431 are commonly used in power supplies, surge protectors, household appliances, industrial equipment, and electrical panels to guard against lightning strikes, switching surges, and other unexpected voltage spikes. By limiting surge energy, they help prevent damage, improve reliability, and extend the life of electronic systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772708562035-163215768.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 11:02:42','2026-03-05 11:02:42'),
(2719,'XT30 Connector','XT30 Connector',NULL,'XT Connector',199.00,'The XT30 Connector is a compact high-current electrical connector commonly used in radio-controlled (RC) models, drones, and small battery-powered devices. It features a polarized two-pin design with gold-plated male and female terminals that ensure a secure, low-resistance connection and prevent reverse polarity, helping protect electronics from damage.','Its simple plug-and-play design allows for quick battery and power module connections, and the durable housing resists vibration and heat during use. Because of these qualities, the XT30 has become a popular choice in the hobbyist and UAV communities for connecting batteries, speed controllers, motors, and power distribution systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772709539739-869705686.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 11:18:59','2026-03-05 11:18:59'),
(2720,'XT60 Connector','XT60 Connector',NULL,'XT Connector',199.00,'The XT60 Connector is a high-current DC power connector widely used in RC vehicles, drones, electric scooters, and battery-powered electronic systems. It features a polarized two-pin design with gold-plated contacts that provide a secure, low-resistance connection while preventing reverse polarity. The XT60 connector is typically rated to handle currents up to 60 A, making it suitable for medium-to-high power applications.','Made with a durable, heat-resistant nylon housing, the XT60 offers excellent mechanical strength and resistance to vibration during operation. Its reliable performance, ease of soldering, and long service life have made it a popular standard for connecting lithium battery packs, ESCs, chargers, and power distribution units in both hobbyist and professional electronics applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772709618862-691775144.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 11:20:18','2026-03-05 11:20:18'),
(2721,'XT90 Connector','XT90 Connector',NULL,'XT Connector',199.00,'The XT90 Connector is a high-current DC power connector designed for demanding power applications such as electric bikes, electric vehicles, high-power drones, RC cars, and battery energy systems. It features a polarized two-pin design with gold-plated contacts that ensure a secure, low-resistance connection while preventing reverse polarity. The XT90 is typically rated to handle currents up to 90 A, making it suitable for high-load power transfer.','Constructed with a heat-resistant nylon housing, the XT90 offers excellent durability, vibration resistance, and long service life. Many XT90 variants also include an anti-spark feature, which reduces arcing during connection and helps protect connectors and electronic components. Due to its reliability and high current capacity, the XT90 is widely used in professional and heavy-duty battery-powered systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772710228104-944082113.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 11:30:28','2026-03-05 11:30:28'),
(2722,'V8 Socket Wire Type PVC','V8',NULL,'V8 Socket Wire Type PVC',199.00,'V8 Socket Wire (PVC Type) is a compact and reliable electrical accessory commonly used for connecting small bulbs, indicator lamps, and decorative lighting systems. It comes with a V8 socket fitted to flexible PVC-insulated wires, making installation quick and safe. The PVC insulation provides good resistance to heat, moisture, and minor mechanical wear, ensuring stable performance in both indoor and light-duty outdoor applications.','This type of socket wire is widely used in home lighting, panel indicators, temporary test setups, and festival or decorative lighting.Overall, the V8 Socket Wire (PVC type) is a cost-effective and practical solution for low-voltage and standard lighting connections where safety, durability, and ease of use are important.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772712278184-325890813.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 12:04:38','2026-03-05 12:04:38'),
(2723,'Type C Socket Wire Type PVC','Type C Socket Wire',NULL,'Type C Socket Wire Type PVC',199.00,'Type-C Socket Wire (PVC Type) is a modern and versatile connector assembly used for power charging and data transfer applications. It consists of a USB Type-C female socket pre-connected with PVC-insulated wires, allowing easy integration into electronic projects, devices, and custom power solutions. The PVC insulation offers good electrical safety, flexibility, and resistance to heat and wear, making it suitable for regular usage.','This socket wire is widely used in mobile charging modules, DIY electronics, power banks, embedded systems, and repair or replacement of damaged charging ports. The reversible Type-C design ensures user convenience, while the durable PVC wire ensures reliable current flow and long service life.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772712355238-979406562.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 12:05:55','2026-03-05 12:05:55'),
(2724,'USB Socket','USB Socket',NULL,'USB Socket',199.00,'USB Socket is a commonly used power and data interface designed to provide convenient USB connectivity in electronic devices and electrical installations. It allows users to charge devices such as mobile phones, tablets, Bluetooth accessories, and other USB-powered equipment, as well as support data transfer when required. USB sockets are available in different types (USB-A, USB-B, Micro-USB, and Type-C) and can be panel-mounted, PCB-mounted, or supplied with wires for easy integration.','USB sockets are widely used in home charging panels, power strips, automobiles, electronic enclosures, DIY projects, and industrial control panels. Built with durable materials and reliable internal contacts, they ensure stable power output and long service life. Overall, a USB socket offers a compact, user-friendly, and efficient solution for modern charging and connectivity needs in both residential and commercial applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772712487663-940384323.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 12:08:07','2026-03-05 12:08:07'),
(2725,'4LS Speaker Socket',NULL,NULL,'4LS Speaker Socket',199.00,'4LS Speaker Socket is a multi-pin audio connector commonly used for connecting speakers to amplifiers, sound systems, and public address (PA) equipment. It features four terminals or pins, allowing secure and organized connection of speaker wires, often used in dual-channel or multi-speaker configurations. The socket is designed to provide firm contact, reducing signal loss and ensuring clear audio output.','This type of speaker socket is widely used in DJ systems, PA systems, stage sound setups, and custom audio panels. Made from durable insulating material with strong metal contacts, the 4LS Speaker Socket offers reliable performance, easy installation, and long service life. It is an ideal choice for professional and semi-professional audio applications where stable and safe speaker connections are essential.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772712626733-284679496.jpeg',0,1,'active','2026-03-05 12:10:26','2026-04-09 09:19:43'),
(2726,'12V 7530 Blower Fan','12V 7530 Blower Fan',NULL,'Cooling Fan',599.00,'12V 7530 Blower Fan is a compact and high-efficiency DC cooling fan designed for effective air circulation and heat dissipation in electronic and electrical systems. The model number 7530 refers to its approximate dimensions of 75 × 75 × 30 mm, making it suitable for applications where strong airflow is required in a limited space. Operating on a 12V DC power supply, this blower fan delivers focused airflow through a side outlet, ideal for targeted cooling.','This blower fan is widely used in inverters, UPS systems, power supplies, 3D printers, industrial control panels, LED lighting systems, and electronic enclosures. Built with durable plastic housing and a high-speed motor, the 12V 7530 Blower Fan ensures reliable performance, low noise operation, and long service life. It is an excellent choice for maintaining optimal operating temperatures and improving the overall efficiency and lifespan of electronic equipment.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772714838610-80365601.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 12:47:18','2026-03-05 12:47:18'),
