(2728,'Car Set Wire','Car Set Wire',NULL,'Car Set Wire',399.00,'Car Set Wire is a specially designed wiring harness used for connecting car audio systems such as stereos, speakers, amplifiers, and accessories to a vehicle’s electrical system. It typically consists of color-coded, insulated wires that simplify installation and ensure correct connections for power, ground, speakers, and control signals. The insulation is made to withstand heat, vibration, and electrical load commonly found in automotive environments.','Car set wires are widely used in car stereo installation, speaker upgrades, amplifier connections, and replacement of damaged or factory wiring. Designed for durability and reliable signal transmission, these wires help maintain clear audio output and stable power supply. Overall, car set wire provides a safe, organized, and efficient solution for automotive audio and electrical installations.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772715293939-684251428.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 12:54:53','2026-03-05 12:54:53'),
(2729,'GBU810 Bridge',NULL,NULL,'Diode',199.00,'GBU810J Bridge Rectifier is a high-current, single-phase diode bridge used for converting AC (alternating current) into DC (direct current) in power electronic circuits. It is rated for 8A average forward current and can withstand up to 1000V peak reverse voltage, making it suitable for medium- to high-power applications. The compact GBU package provides good heat dissipation and reliable electrical performance.','This bridge rectifier is widely used in SMPS, inverters, UPS systems, battery chargers, adapters, motor drives, and industrial power supplies. Built with high-quality silicon diodes, the GBU810J offers low forward voltage drop, strong surge current handling, and long service life. It is an efficient and durable solution for rectification needs where stability, safety, and consistent DC output are essential.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772715915688-610413459.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 13:05:15','2026-03-05 13:05:15'),
(2730,'D25XB80 Bridge','D25XB80 Bridge',NULL,'Diode',199.00,'D25XB80 Bridge Rectifier is a heavy-duty, single-phase diode bridge designed for high-current AC to DC conversion in power electronic applications. It is typically rated for 25A average forward current with a maximum repetitive reverse voltage of around 800V, making it suitable for high-power rectification requirements. The robust block-type package allows easy mounting on heat sinks for efficient thermal management.','This bridge rectifier is commonly used in inverters, welding machines, battery chargers, industrial power supplies, motor drives, and high-capacity UPS systems. With strong surge current capability, reliable insulation, and stable electrical performance, the D25XB80 Bridge Rectifier ensures efficient rectification and long-term durability in demanding electrical and industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772716001043-768442354.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 13:06:41','2026-03-05 13:06:41'),
(2731,'BR1010 Diode','BR1010 Diode',NULL,'Diode',199.00,'BR1010 Diode is a high-current rectifier diode used for converting AC to DC and for general-purpose rectification in power electronic circuits. It is typically rated for 10A average forward current with a maximum reverse voltage of around 1000V, making it suitable for medium- to high-power applications. The diode is designed to handle high surge currents and provides stable performance under continuous load conditions.','BR1010 diodes are widely used in power supplies, battery chargers, inverters, adapters, welding equipment, and other industrial electronic systems. Built with durable semiconductor material and a robust package for effective heat dissipation, the BR1010 ensures reliable operation, low forward voltage drop, and long service life, helping protect and enhance overall circuit efficiency.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772716160540-981742980.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 13:09:20','2026-03-05 13:09:20'),
(2732,'NANO V3 Cable','NANO V3 Cable',NULL,'Nano Cable',199.00,'NANO V3 Cable is a USB data and power cable specifically used to connect an Arduino Nano V3 board to a computer or USB power source. It typically features a USB-A to Mini-USB connector, enabling reliable data transfer for program uploading, serial communication, and providing 5V power to the Nano board. The cable is designed to ensure stable connectivity during coding and testing.','This cable is widely used in electronics labs, DIY projects, robotics, IoT development, and educational environments. With durable insulation and secure connectors, the NANO V3 Cable supports consistent performance and long-term use. It is an essential accessory for programming, debugging, and powering Arduino Nano V3 microcontroller boards.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772716465479-96328462.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-05 13:14:25','2026-03-05 13:14:25'),
(2733,'3.7 Lithium 4 Cell Battery Holder',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'An 18650 4 Cell Holder is a plastic battery holder designed to hold four 18650 lithium-ion rechargeable batteries securely in place while providing electrical connections to power electronic circuits. The holder contains spring metal contacts and wires or terminals that allow the batteries to supply power to devices or projects.','Most 4-cell holders connect the batteries in series, producing an output voltage of about 14.8 V (4 × 3.7 V) when using standard 18650 Li-ion cells. These holders are commonly used in DIY electronics, robotics, power banks, LED lighting systems, and portable devices that require higher battery capacity',NULL,NULL,'products/1772767404790-748101274.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 03:23:24','2026-04-02 03:55:39'),
(2734,'HIKVISION ECO Series Camera','DS-2CE5AD0T-ITP\\ECO',NULL,' ECO Series Camera',1.00,'The Hikvision DS-2CE5AD0T-ITP/ECO is a 2-megapixel analog dome CCTV camera designed for indoor or basic outdoor surveillance systems.','The device typically uses a 2.8 mm or 3.6 mm lens to provide a wide viewing angle and supports features like automatic exposure control, digital noise reduction, and internal synchronization for stable video output.','It includes True Day/Night functionality with Smart IR LEDs, allowing the camera to automatically switch between day and night modes and provide infrared night vision up to about 20 meters in low-light or dark environments',NULL,'products/1772770562339-470456961.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 04:16:02','2026-03-06 04:16:02'),
(2735,'PWM 5A Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,199.00,'The PWM 5A Module is a compact DC motor speed controller that uses Pulse Width Modulation (PWM) technology to regulate the speed of DC motors or control the brightness of DC loads such as LEDs. It adjusts the motor speed by changing the PWM duty cycle through a built-in rotary potentiometer','This module supports a wide input voltage range and can handle moderate current loads, making it suitable for robotics, DIY electronics projects, and small automation systems. The PWM control method provides smooth speed control with high efficiency and minimal power loss',NULL,NULL,'products/1772770942620-241879002.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 04:22:22','2026-03-06 04:22:22'),
(2736,'2000W SCR Voltage Controller AC',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The 2000W SCR Voltage Controller AC is an electronic power control module used to regulate the voltage supplied to AC appliances. It uses an SCR (Silicon Controlled Rectifier) or TRIAC-based circuit to control the amount of power delivered to a load by adjusting the firing angle of the AC waveform. This allows smooth control of speed, brightness, or temperature in connected devices.','This module typically works with AC 220V mains supply and can handle loads up to 2000 watts, making it suitable for various household and workshop applications. The output voltage can usually be adjusted from about 50V to 220V AC using an onboard rotary potentiometer',NULL,NULL,'products/1772771355158-570438569.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 04:29:15','2026-03-06 04:29:15'),
(2737,'Hikvision HD bullet CCTV camera','DS-2CE1AD0T-ITP\\ECO',NULL,'CCTV HD bullet camera',1.00,'The DS-2CE1AD0T-ITP/ECO is a 2-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed for outdoor or indoor surveillance systems.','It uses a high-performance CMOS image sensor to capture Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080) video, providing clear and detailed monitoring for homes, shops, offices, and commercial locations.','This camera works with HD-TVI DVR systems and connects through a BNC coaxial cable with a 12 V DC power supply',NULL,'products/1772772416491-1230717.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 04:46:56','2026-03-06 04:46:56'),
