(2740,'Hikvision ','DS-2CE16D0T-ITFS',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS-2CE16D0T-ITFS (commonly listed as DS-2CE16D0T-ITPFS) is a 2-megapixel analog HD mini bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.','It uses a 2 MP CMOS image sensor that captures Full-HD video at 1920 × 1080 resolution, providing clear images for monitoring homes, offices, shops, and outdoor areas.','Use a surge protector or UPS with the DVR system to protect the camera from voltage spikes or power fluctuations.',NULL,'products/1772774655710-281010434.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 05:24:15','2026-03-06 05:24:15'),
