(2742,'Hikvision 2 MP HD bullet CCTV camera','DS-2CE1AD0T-IT1F',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS-2CE1AD0T-IT1F is a 2-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based security systems.','The camera works using HD-TVI technology, allowing high-quality video transmission over standard coaxial cable (BNC) to a DVR recorder.','It also supports switchable video formats (TVI / AHD / CVI / CVBS), making it compatible with many types of CCTV DVRs.',NULL,'products/1772776480353-529776685.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 05:52:25','2026-03-06 05:54:40'),
