(2749,'2x3 PCB BOARD',NULL,NULL,'2*3 G.PCB',98.00,'A 2×3 PCB Board is a small general-purpose prototype printed circuit board used for building and testing electronic circuits. The board typically measures 2 inches × 3 inches and contains a grid of pre-drilled holes with copper pads that allow electronic components to be soldered and connected easily.','These boards are widely used in DIY electronics, Arduino projects, circuit prototyping, and repair work. Components such as resistors, capacitors, IC sockets, transistors, and connectors can be mounted on the board and wired together using solder or jumper wires to create custom circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772783023148-627367608.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 07:43:43','2026-03-06 07:43:43'),
(2750,'GSM Module SIM900A',NULL,NULL,NULL,2998.00,'The SIM900A GSM Module is a compact wireless communication module used to enable GSM and GPRS connectivity in electronic devices. It allows microcontrollers and embedded systems to send and receive SMS messages, make voice calls, and transmit data over the GSM network using a standard SIM card.','The module operates on dual-band GSM frequencies (900 MHz and 1800 MHz) and communicates with microcontrollers such as Arduino, Raspberry Pi, or other development boards through a UART serial interface using AT commands. Because of its reliable cellular communication, it is widely used in IoT systems, remote monitoring, security devices, and automation projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772784020296-63732141.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 08:00:20','2026-03-06 08:00:20'),
(2751,'Hikvision Bullet Camera ','DS-2CE1AH0T-IT3F ',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS-2CE1AH0T-IT3F is a 5-megapixel analog HD bullet CCTV camera designed for DVR-based surveillance systems.','It features EXIR 2.0 infrared night-vision technology with a viewing distance of up to 40 meters, enabling reliable recording even in complete darkness.','It uses a high-performance 5 MP CMOS image sensor capable of capturing video at a resolution of 2560 × 1944, delivering clear and detailed monitoring for homes, shops, offices, warehouses, and outdoor areas.',NULL,'products/1772785279480-148705798.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 08:21:19','2026-03-06 08:21:19'),
