(2765,'Hikvision Fixed Mini Bullet Camera','DS-2CE10KF0T-PFS',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Hikvision DS-2CE10KF0T-PFS is a 3K ColorVu Audio Fixed Mini Bullet CCTV Camera. It is an analog HD (Turbo HD) bullet-type surveillance camera designed for outdoor security monitoring with full-color night vision and built-in audio recording.','It also includes a built-in microphone with audio over coaxial cable, enabling both video and audio recording through the same cable connection.','It also supports multiple video output formats (TVI, AHD, CVI, CVBS) for compatibility with different DVR systems.',NULL,'products/1772791677607-779508497.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-03-06 10:07:57','2026-03-06 10:07:57'),
