(2822,'32 inch Normal TV','EYE 32W 202GCS',NULL,NULL,9899.00,'HDMI, USB, AV, ATV, HD RESOLUTION\r\n(1366*768) ','A 32-inch Normal TV (also called a Non-Smart LED TV) is a basic television that does not support internet or apps. It is mainly used for watching cable TV or DTH channels through a set-top box. These TVs are simple, affordable, and suitable for bedrooms, small living rooms, offices, and shops.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772869202150-330915667.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 07:40:02','2026-03-07 07:40:02'),
(2823,'24 inch Normal TV','EYE 24P 413 GG',NULL,NULL,8599.00,'HDMI, USB, AV','A 24-inch Normal TV is a compact LED television without smart features such as Wi-Fi, streaming apps, or an operating system. It is mainly used for watching cable TV, DTH channels, or connecting external devices like set-top boxes, DVD players, and CCTV systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772869838110-312066475.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 07:50:38','2026-03-07 07:50:38'),
(2824,'1N5408 Power Diode',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 1N5408 is a high-current rectifier power diode commonly used in power supply circuits. It is designed to allow current to flow in one direction while blocking current in the opposite direction. Because of its high current capacity and high reverse voltage rating, it is widely used in AC to DC rectification, power adapters, battery chargers, and power regulation circuits.','This diode belongs to the 1N5400 series and is capable of handling high surge currents, making it suitable for heavy-duty electronic and electrical applications. The device is usually available in a DO-201AD axial lead package, which makes it easy to mount on printed circuit boards',NULL,NULL,'products/1772871770193-69391483.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 08:22:50','2026-03-07 08:22:50'),
(2825,'1N4007 DIODE ',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The 1N4007 is a general-purpose silicon rectifier diode widely used in electronic circuits for converting AC (alternating current) into DC (direct current). It allows current to flow in only one direction and blocks current in the opposite direction, protecting circuits from reverse voltage damage.','Because of its high reverse voltage rating and reliability, the 1N4007 is one of the most commonly used diodes in power supplies, adapters, battery chargers, and electronic equipment. It is usually available in a DO-41 axial lead package, which makes it easy to install on PCBs and breadboards.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772871991323-497427672.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 08:26:31','2026-03-07 08:26:31'),
(2826,'1N4148 DIODE',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The 1N4148 is a high-speed switching diode widely used in electronic circuits. It is designed for fast switching applications, allowing signals to pass quickly with minimal delay. This diode is commonly used in logic circuits, signal processing, and high-frequency applications where quick response time is required.','The 1N4148 diode is usually available in a small DO-35 glass package, making it lightweight and suitable for compact electronic designs. Because of its fast switching speed and reliability, it is one of the most commonly used small-signal diodes in electronic devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772872077407-941152641.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 08:27:57','2026-03-07 08:27:57'),
(2827,'6A4 DIODE 6 AMPS',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The 6A4 diode is a high-current rectifier diode designed for power supply and heavy-duty rectification circuits. It allows electric current to flow in one direction and blocks it in the opposite direction, making it useful for converting AC voltage into DC voltage. Because of its 6-ampere current capacity, it is commonly used in power adapters, battery chargers, inverters, and power supply circuits.','The diode is usually available in a DO-201 or similar axial package, which is suitable for PCB mounting and high-current applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772872233674-518662491.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 08:30:33','2026-03-07 08:30:33'),
(2828,'KBPC3510W Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,299.00,'The KBPC3510W is a high-current bridge rectifier module used to convert AC (alternating current) into DC (direct current) in power supply circuits. It contains four diodes internally connected in a bridge configuration, allowing full-wave rectification from an AC input. Because of its high current capacity, this component is widely used in power supplies, motor controllers, battery chargers, welding machines, and industrial equipment.','The KBPC3510W is typically built in a square metal or epoxy package with four terminals, labeled AC (~), AC (~), + (positive), and – (negative). The metal body and center hole allow it to be mounted on a heat sink for better heat dissipation in high-power applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772872540228-141533745.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 08:35:40','2026-03-07 08:35:40'),
(2829,'W10 BRIDGE MODULE',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The W10 Bridge Rectifier Module is a compact electronic component used to convert AC (Alternating Current) into DC (Direct Current). Inside the module, four diodes are connected in a bridge configuration, which allows full-wave rectification. This means both halves of the AC input signal are converted into usable DC output.','Because of its small size, reliability, and high voltage rating, the W10 bridge rectifier is widely used in power supplies, adapters, battery chargers, LED drivers, and small electronic circuits. It usually comes in a round or square 4-pin package with clearly marked terminals.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772872975529-460159134.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 08:42:55','2026-03-07 08:42:55'),
(2830,'JUMPER PINS',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'Jumper pins are small metal connector pins used to make temporary or permanent electrical connections between circuits on a PCB (Printed Circuit Board), breadboard, or electronic modules. They are commonly arranged in single-row or double-row header strips with a standard 2.54 mm pitch spacing.','These pins are widely used in electronics prototyping, Arduino projects, Raspberry Pi circuits, and PCB development. Jumper pins allow easy connection of wires, modules, or jumpers without soldering complex connectors.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772873432793-959805016.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 08:50:32','2026-03-07 08:50:32'),
(2831,'6 PIN IC BASE',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 6-Pin IC Base (also called a 6-Pin IC Socket or DIP-6 Socket) is an electronic component used to hold and connect a 6-pin integrated circuit (IC) to a PCB without soldering the IC directly. The IC is inserted into the socket, which protects it from heat damage during soldering and makes replacement easy.','This socket is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs and is commonly used in electronic circuits, microcontroller projects, and prototyping boards. By using an IC base, the IC can be removed, replaced, or upgraded without desoldering.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772873728714-755786879.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 08:55:28','2026-03-07 08:55:28'),
(2832,'Hikvision 4-Channel PoE NVR','DS-7108NI-Q1/8p/M',NULL,'NVR 4-Channel PoE',1.00,'The DS-7108NI-Q1/8p/M is a compact Mini-1U NVR designed for small surveillance systems such as homes, shops, and offices.','The recorder uses advanced H.265+, H.265, H.264+, and H.264 video compression, which reduces storage usage while maintaining high video quality.','With 4 independent PoE ports, cameras can be connected directly to the NVR without using a separate.',NULL,'products/1772873884138-839453654.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 08:58:04','2026-03-07 08:58:04'),
(2833,'Hikvision NVR 4-Channel','DS-7604NI-Q1',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS-7604NI-Q1 is designed to connect and record video from four network cameras with resolutions up to 8 MP, providing clear and high-quality surveillance footage.','The recorder provides 40 Mbps incoming bandwidth and 80 Mbps outgoing bandwidth, ensuring smooth recording and streaming from multiple cameras simultaneously.','Regularly check the hard disk and back up important recordings.',NULL,'products/1772875793646-338377145.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:29:53','2026-03-07 09:29:53'),
(2834,'Hikvision 4-Channel PoE NVR','DS-7608NI-Q1',NULL,'4-Channel 4K Network Video Recorder',1.00,'The DS-7604NI-Q1 is designed to connect and record video from four network cameras with resolutions up to 8 MP, providing clear and high-quality surveillance footage.','Remote monitoring is possible through the Hik-Connect mobile app or PC software, allowing users to watch live camera feeds and playback recordings from anywhere via the internet.','Ensure proper network cable connections for stable camera communication.',NULL,'products/1772876184797-177761830.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:36:24','2026-03-07 09:36:24'),
(2835,'8 PIN IC BASE',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'An 8-Pin IC Base (also called an 8-Pin IC Socket or DIP-8 Socket) is an electronic component used to hold an 8-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). Instead of soldering the IC directly to the board, the socket is soldered first, and the IC is inserted into it. This protects the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows it to be easily replaced or removed.','The 8-pin IC base is commonly used in many electronic circuits and projects, especially for timer ICs, operational amplifiers, and microcontroller circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772876224024-484803372.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:37:04','2026-03-07 09:37:04'),
(2836,'18 PIN IC BASE',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'An 18-Pin IC Base (also called an 18-Pin IC Socket or DIP-18 Socket) is an electronic component used to mount and hold an 18-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). Instead of soldering the IC directly to the board, the socket is soldered to the PCB and the IC is inserted into it. This helps protect the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows easy replacement or testing.','The socket is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is widely used in microcontroller circuits, interface ICs, and electronic development boards.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772876399866-368168481.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:39:59','2026-03-07 09:39:59'),
(2837,'16 PIN IC BASE',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 16-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-16 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to mount a 16-pin integrated circuit (IC) onto a printed circuit board (PCB) without soldering the IC directly. The socket is soldered to the PCB first, and then the IC is inserted into the socket. This protects the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows it to be easily removed or replaced if needed.','The 16-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is commonly used in digital logic circuits, microcontroller boards, driver IC circuits, and electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772876510076-461411024.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:41:50','2026-03-07 09:41:50'),
(2838,'14 PIN IC BASE',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 14-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-14 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to hold a 14-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). The socket is soldered to the PCB first, and then the IC is inserted into it. This helps protect the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows the IC to be easily removed or replaced.','The 14-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is widely used in digital logic circuits, amplifier circuits, and microcontroller interface circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772876772809-841558010.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:46:12','2026-03-07 09:46:12'),
(2839,'Hikvision IP-based CCTV surveillance systems','DS-7616NI-Q1',NULL,'NVR 4-Channel PoE',1.00,'This NVR offers 160 Mbps incoming bandwidth and 80 Mbps outgoing bandwidth, allowing stable recording from many cameras at the same time.','The DS-7616NI-Q1 supports IP cameras with resolutions up to 8 MP, providing high-quality video recording and monitoring.','Use a UPS or surge protector to protect against voltage fluctuations.',NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:47:48','2026-03-07 09:47:48'),
(2840,'20 PIN IC BASE',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 20-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-20 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to mount a 20-pin integrated circuit (IC) onto a printed circuit board (PCB). Instead of soldering the IC directly to the PCB, the socket is soldered first and the IC is inserted into it. This helps protect the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows easy replacement or testing.','The 20-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is commonly used in microcontroller circuits, interface ICs, and digital electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772877117693-361541617.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:51:57','2026-03-07 09:51:57'),
(2841,'Hikvision 4-Channel 4K PoE Network Video Recorder','DS-7604NI-Q1/4p',NULL,' NVR ',1.00,'The DS-7604NI-Q1/4P is a compact 4-channel NVR used to manage and store video from network cameras in homes, offices, shops, and small business security systems.','The recorder uses H.265+, H.265, H.264+, and H.264 video compression, which helps reduce storage usage while maintaining good video quality.','The built-in 4 PoE ports simplify installation by allowing cameras to connect directly to the NVR without separate power adapters or PoE switches.',NULL,'products/1772877152013-856782733.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:52:32','2026-03-07 09:52:32'),
(2842,'40 PIN IC BASE',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 40-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-40 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to hold and connect a 40-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). Instead of soldering the IC directly onto the board, the socket is soldered first, and the IC is inserted into the socket. This protects the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows easy removal or replacement.','The 40-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is commonly used in microcontroller circuits, development boards, embedded systems, and digital electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772877304269-633858810.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:55:04','2026-03-07 09:55:04'),
(2843,'Hikvision NVR 4-Channel','DS-7608NI-Q1/8p',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS-7604NI-Q1/4P is a compact 4-channel NVR used to manage and store video from network cameras in homes, offices, shops, and small business security systems.','This NVR supports 40 Mbps incoming bandwidth and 80 Mbps outgoing bandwidth, ensuring smooth recording and video streaming from multiple cameras simultaneously.','Use high-quality Cat5e or Cat6 Ethernet cables for PoE camera connections.',NULL,'products/1772877386330-274338944.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:56:26','2026-03-07 09:56:26'),
(2844,'24 PIN IC BASE',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 24-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-24 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to mount and hold a 24-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). The socket is soldered to the PCB first, and the IC is inserted into it. This protects the IC from heat damage during soldering and allows the IC to be easily removed or replaced if necessary.','The 24-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is commonly used in microcontroller circuits, memory IC circuits, and digital electronic systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772877420822-329693107.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:57:00','2026-03-07 09:57:00'),
(2845,'28 PIN IC BASE',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 28-Pin IC Base (also called a DIP-28 IC Socket) is an electronic component used to hold a 28-pin integrated circuit (IC) on a printed circuit board (PCB). The socket is soldered to the PCB first, and then the IC is inserted into the socket. This method protects the IC from heat damage during soldering and makes it easy to remove, replace, or test the IC without desoldering.','The 28-pin IC base is designed for DIP (Dual In-Line Package) ICs, where the pins are arranged in two parallel rows. It is commonly used in microcontroller boards, memory IC circuits, and embedded electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772877543523-633528463.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 09:59:03','2026-03-07 09:59:03'),
(2846,'GLASS FUSE 0.5 A',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 0.5 Amp Glass Fuse is a safety protection device used in electrical and electronic circuits. It protects equipment from overcurrent or short circuits by breaking the circuit when the current exceeds 0.5 amperes. Inside the transparent glass tube is a thin metal wire that melts when excessive current flows, stopping the electrical flow and preventing damage to devices.','Glass fuses are widely used in power supplies, adapters, chargers, televisions, amplifiers, and electronic appliances. The transparent body allows easy visual inspection to see if the fuse is blown.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772877757650-901778420.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:02:37','2026-03-07 10:02:37'),
(2847,'GLASS FUSE 5 A',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 Amp Glass Fuse is a protective electrical component used to safeguard circuits from overcurrent and short circuits. It contains a thin metal filament enclosed inside a transparent glass tube. When the current flowing through the circuit exceeds 5 amperes, the filament heats up and melts, breaking the circuit and stopping the current flow to prevent damage to the equipment.','Glass fuses are commonly used in power supplies, televisions, amplifiers, battery chargers, and household electronic appliances. The transparent body allows users to easily see whether the fuse has blown or not.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772877854942-102000448.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:04:14','2026-03-07 10:04:14'),
(2848,'GLASS FUSE 1 A',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 1 Amp Glass Fuse is a protective electrical component used in electronic circuits to prevent damage caused by excessive current. It consists of a thin metal wire sealed inside a transparent glass tube with metal caps at both ends. When the current in the circuit exceeds 1 ampere, the internal fuse wire heats up and melts, breaking the circuit and stopping the current flow.','Glass fuses are widely used in power supplies, televisions, adapters, battery chargers, amplifiers, and other electronic appliances. The transparent glass body allows users to easily check if the fuse has blown.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772877986714-166372673.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:06:26','2026-03-07 10:06:26'),
(2849,'GLASS FUSE 3 A',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 3 Amp Glass Fuse is a protective component used in electrical and electronic circuits to prevent damage from excessive current. It consists of a thin metal filament sealed inside a transparent glass tube with metal caps at both ends. When the current flowing through the circuit exceeds 3 amperes, the filament heats up and melts, breaking the circuit and stopping the current flow.','Glass fuses are commonly used in power supplies, televisions, amplifiers, battery chargers, adapters, and other electronic appliances. The transparent body allows users to easily check if the fuse has blown.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772878066488-235714882.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:07:46','2026-03-07 10:07:46'),
(2850,'Hikvision 8 Channel NVR ','DS-7608NI-Q2',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS-7608NI-Q2 supports IP cameras with resolutions up to 8 MP, allowing high-quality surveillance recording.','It uses advanced H.265+, H.265, H.264+, and H.264 compression technologies, which reduce storage space and network bandwidth while maintaining clear video quality.','Install the NVR in a cool, well-ventilated place to prevent overheating.',NULL,'products/1772878184785-658184497.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:09:44','2026-03-07 10:09:44'),
(2851,'Hikvision 16-Channel NVR ','DS-7616NI-Q2',NULL,'NVR   16-Channel',1.00,'The DS-7616NI-Q2 allows connection of up to 16 IP cameras and supports recording resolutions up to 8 MP, providing high-quality surveillance video.','It also supports 2 SATA hard-disk drives, allowing large storage capacity for long-term video recording and backup.','Install the NVR in a cool, well-ventilated location to prevent overheating.',NULL,'products/1772878438976-763141985.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:13:58','2026-03-07 10:13:58'),
(2852,'GLASS FUSE 2 A',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 2 Amp Glass Fuse is a safety protection device used in electrical and electronic circuits to prevent damage caused by overcurrent or short circuits. It contains a thin metal wire sealed inside a transparent glass tube with metal caps on both ends. When the current flowing through the circuit exceeds 2 amperes, the fuse wire heats up and melts, breaking the circuit and stopping the flow of electricity.','Glass fuses are widely used in power supplies, televisions, audio amplifiers, battery chargers, adapters, and household electronic equipment. The transparent glass body allows users to easily check whether the fuse is blown or still working.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772878505806-503039972.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:15:05','2026-03-07 10:15:05'),
(2853,'GLASS FUSE 10 A',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 10 Amp Glass Fuse is a protective electrical component used to safeguard circuits from excessive current or short circuits. It consists of a thin metal filament sealed inside a transparent glass tube with metal caps at both ends. When the current flowing through the circuit exceeds 10 amperes, the filament heats up and melts, breaking the circuit and stopping the electrical flow.','Glass fuses are widely used in power supplies, battery chargers, inverters, audio amplifiers, televisions, and various household electronic appliances. The transparent glass body allows users to visually inspect whether the fuse has blown.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772878574400-260045362.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:16:14','2026-03-07 10:16:14'),
(2854,'NXI 4-Channel NVR','DS-7604NXI-K1 ',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS-7604NXI-K1 supports IP cameras with resolutions up to 12 MP, allowing very detailed surveillance recording.','This NVR includes AcuSense technology, which can detect humans and vehicles and filter out false alarms caused by moving objects like leaves, animals, or rain.','Install the NVR in a cool, well-ventilated place to prevent overheating.',NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:17:45','2026-03-07 10:17:45'),
(2855,'GLASS FUSE 6 A',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 6 Amp Glass Fuse is a safety protection device used in electrical and electronic circuits to protect equipment from overcurrent and short circuits. It contains a thin metal wire sealed inside a transparent glass tube with metal caps on both ends. When the current flowing through the circuit exceeds 6 amperes, the wire heats up and melts, breaking the circuit and stopping the current flow.','Glass fuses are commonly used in power supplies, audio amplifiers, battery chargers, televisions, adapters, and various electronic appliances. The transparent glass body allows users to easily see whether the fuse has blown or is still intact.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772878683187-606179046.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:18:03','2026-03-07 10:18:03'),
(2856,'40 AMPS FUSE',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 40 Amps Fuse is a high-current protection device used in electrical and electronic systems to protect circuits from overcurrent and short circuits. When the current flowing through the circuit exceeds 40 amperes, the internal fuse element melts and breaks the circuit, preventing damage to wires, devices, and equipment.','40A fuses are commonly used in automotive electrical systems, power distribution panels, inverters, battery systems, and industrial electrical equipment where higher current protection is required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772878955686-519629161.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:22:35','2026-03-07 10:22:35'),
(2857,'5 MM GREEN LED',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 mm Green LED (Light Emitting Diode) is a small electronic component that emits green light when electric current flows through it. It is one of the most commonly used LEDs in electronic circuits for indication, display, and decorative lighting. The LED has two leads: a long lead (anode, positive) and a short lead','When a suitable voltage is applied, the semiconductor inside the LED produces light through a process called electroluminescence. The 5 mm size refers to the diameter of the LED lens, which is a standard size used in many electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772880395056-445183517.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:46:35','2026-03-07 10:46:35'),
(2858,'5 MM YELLOW LED',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 mm Yellow LED (Light Emitting Diode) is a small electronic component that emits yellow light when electrical current passes through it. It is widely used in electronic circuits as a status indicator, signal light, or decorative lighting element. The 5 mm size refers to the diameter of the LED lens, which is a standard size commonly used in electronics projects.','The LED has two leads: the long lead is the anode (positive) and the short lead is the cathode (negative). When a suitable voltage is applied in the correct direction, the LED produces light through a process called electroluminescence.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772880509395-954114025.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:48:29','2026-03-07 10:48:29'),
(2859,'5 MM ORANGE LED',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 mm Orange LED (Light Emitting Diode) is a small electronic component that emits orange light when electrical current flows through it. It is widely used in electronic circuits as an indicator light, signal lamp, or decorative lighting element. The 5 mm size refers to the diameter of the LED lens, which is a common standard size used in many electronic devices and DIY projects.','The LED has two terminals (leads): the long lead is the anode (positive) and the short lead is the cathode (negative). When the correct voltage is applied in the forward direction, the semiconductor inside the LED produces light through electroluminescence.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772880650050-39712967.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:50:50','2026-03-07 10:50:50'),
(2860,'5 MM RED LED',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 mm Red LED (Light Emitting Diode) is a small electronic component that emits red light when electrical current flows through it. It is one of the most commonly used LEDs in electronic circuits for power indicators, signal lights, and display applications. The 5 mm size refers to the diameter of the LED lens, which is a standard size used in many electronic devices and projects.','The LED has two leads (pins): the long lead is the anode (positive) and the short lead is the cathode (negative). When the LED is connected with the correct polarity and suitable voltage, the semiconductor inside produces light through electroluminescence.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772880754758-308538520.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:52:34','2026-03-07 10:52:34'),
(2861,'5 MM BLUE LED',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 mm Blue LED (Light Emitting Diode) is a small electronic component that emits blue light when electrical current flows through it. It is widely used in electronic circuits, indicator lights, decorative lighting, and microcontroller projects. The 5 mm size refers to the diameter of the LED lens, which is a common standard used in many electronic devices.','The LED has two terminals (leads): the long lead is the anode (positive) and the short lead is the cathode (negative). When the LED is connected with the correct polarity and suitable voltage, the semiconductor inside the LED produces light through electroluminescence.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772880854236-416482076.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:54:14','2026-03-07 10:54:14'),
(2862,'5 MM BLUE LED TR',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 mm Blue LED TR (Transparent) is a light-emitting diode with a clear transparent lens that produces bright blue light when electric current flows through it. The TR (Transparent) type has a clear water-clear lens, which gives a brighter and more focused light output compared to diffused LEDs.','The 5 mm size refers to the diameter of the LED body, which is one of the most common LED sizes used in electronic circuits, Arduino projects, indicators, and decorative lighting.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772881122076-698541403.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 10:58:42','2026-03-07 10:58:42'),
(2863,'1 WATT WHITE LED',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 1 Watt White LED is a high-power light emitting diode designed to produce bright white light with low power consumption. Unlike standard indicator LEDs, this LED operates at higher power and brightness, making it suitable for lighting applications.','Most 1W LEDs are mounted on a small aluminum star PCB (heat sink base) to help dissipate heat generated during operation. Because of their brightness and efficiency, they are widely used in LED lamps, flashlights, spotlights, decorative lighting, and DIY lighting projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772881452785-152806844.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 11:04:12','2026-03-07 11:04:12'),
(2864,'5 MM WHITE LED',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 mm White LED (Light Emitting Diode) is a small electronic component that emits bright white light when electric current flows through it. It is widely used in electronic circuits, indicator lights, display panels, and decorative lighting. The 5 mm size refers to the diameter of the LED lens, which is a standard size commonly used in electronic devices and DIY projects.','The LED has two terminals (leads): the long lead is the anode (positive) and the short lead is the cathode (negative). When the LED is connected with the correct polarity and appropriate voltage, it produces light through a process called electroluminescence.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772881561915-33898832.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 11:06:01','2026-03-07 11:06:01'),
(2865,'5 MM LED COMBO',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 mm LED Combo is a set of different colored 5 mm LEDs commonly used in electronic projects and indicator circuits. These LEDs usually come in multiple colors such as Red, Green, Blue, Yellow, Orange, and White. The 5 mm size refers to the diameter of the LED lens, which is the most common size used in electronics.','LED combo packs are popular in DIY electronics, Arduino projects, school experiments, and circuit prototyping because they provide multiple colors for different indication or lighting purposes.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772881672910-245958160.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 11:07:52','2026-03-07 11:07:52'),
(2866,'5 MM RED LED TR',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 mm Red LED TR (Transparent) is a light-emitting diode with a clear transparent lens that produces bright red light when electric current flows through it. The TR (Transparent) type LED has a clear water-clear lens, which gives higher brightness and a more focused beam compared to diffused LEDs.','The 5 mm size refers to the diameter of the LED body, which is one of the most commonly used LED sizes in electronic circuits, indicator lights, Arduino projects, and display panels.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772881784084-984846765.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 11:09:44','2026-03-07 11:09:44'),
(2867,'5 MM GREEN LED TR',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 5 mm Green LED TR (Transparent) is a light-emitting diode with a clear transparent lens that produces bright green light when electric current flows through it. The TR (Transparent) type has a water-clear lens, which provides higher brightness and a more focused light beam compared to diffused LEDs.','The 5 mm size refers to the diameter of the LED body, which is a common standard size used in indicator circuits, electronic projects, Arduino boards, and display panels.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772881917551-933781658.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 11:11:57','2026-03-07 11:11:57'),
(2868,'1 WATT BLUE LED',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 1 Watt Blue LED is a high-power light emitting diode designed to produce bright blue light with high efficiency. Unlike small indicator LEDs, this LED operates at higher power and brightness, making it suitable for lighting and display applications.','Most 1W LEDs are mounted on a small aluminum star PCB (heat sink base) to help dissipate heat generated during operation. Because of their high brightness and energy efficiency, they are commonly used in LED lamps, decorative lighting, sign boards, aquarium lighting, and DIY electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1772882172883-897800197.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-07 11:16:12','2026-03-07 11:16:12'),
(2869,'9V DISCO LED',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 9V Disco LED is a small electronic lighting module designed to produce colorful flashing or rotating light effects. It usually operates with a 9-volt power supply or 9V battery and contains multiple LEDs that blink or change colors automatically. These lights are commonly used in mini party lights, decorative lighting, electronic projects, toys, and DIY lighting systems.','The 9V Disco LED typically includes RGB LEDs or multicolor LEDs controlled by a small built-in circuit that creates blinking, chasing, or rotating light patterns. Because it uses low voltage (9V), it is safe and easy to use in hobby electronics and school projects. The module consumes very little power and can run directly from a 9V battery, DC adapter, or power supply.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773027945771-577637841.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 03:45:45','2026-03-09 03:45:45'),
(2870,'9V LED STRIP WITH SNAP',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 9V LED Strip with Snap is a compact lighting strip designed to operate directly with a 9-volt battery using a snap connector. The snap connector easily attaches to the terminals of a 9V battery, allowing the LED strip to light up instantly without additional wiring or soldering. These strips are commonly used for small lighting projects, hobby electronics, decorations, and portable lighting applications.','The LED strip usually contains several small high-brightness LEDs mounted on a narrow PCB strip. The attached 9V snap clip connector provides a quick and convenient power connection. Because of its simple setup, it is widely used in DIY circuits, school projects, emergency lighting, and prototype electronics.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773028326686-467885868.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 03:52:06','2026-03-09 03:52:06'),
(2871,'Hikvision 16-Channel NVR ','DS-7616NXI-K1',NULL,'NVR 16-Channel',1.00,'The DS-7616NXI-K1 supports IP cameras with resolutions up to 12 MP, allowing high-detail surveillance recording.','This NVR features Hikvision AcuSense technology, which uses AI to detect human and vehicle movement, reducing false alarms caused by animals, rain, or moving objects.','Install the NVR in a cool, well-ventilated area to prevent overheating.',NULL,'products/1773028800875-823876645.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:00:00','2026-03-09 04:00:00'),
(2872,'Hikvision 32-Channel NVR','DS-7632NXI-K2 ',NULL,'NVR 32-Channel',1.00,'The recorder supports IP cameras with resolutions up to 12 MP, providing very detailed surveillance recording.','This NVR provides up to 256 Mbps incoming bandwidth, allowing stable recording from many cameras simultaneously.','The NVR can also be accessed remotely through Hik-Connect mobile or PC software, enabling users to view live cameras and playback recordings from anywhere via the internet.',NULL,'products/1773029187615-569912716.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:06:27','2026-03-09 04:06:27'),
(2873,'ROCKER SWITCH',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A Rocker Switch is a common electrical switch used to turn a device ON or OFF by rocking one side of the switch up or down. When one side is pressed, the opposite side rises, creating a simple and reliable switching action. Rocker switches are widely used in home appliances, power supplies, extension boards, electronic projects, and industrial equipment.','Rocker switches are designed for panel mounting and are available in various types such as 2-pin, 3-pin, and illuminated switches. Some models include a built-in LED or neon light that glows when the switch is turned ON. They are typically used with AC 110V–250V or DC circuits, depending on the model and rating.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773029353740-399346323.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:09:13','2026-03-09 04:09:13'),
(2874,'Hikvision 32-Channel NVR','DS-7732NXI-K4',NULL,' NVR 4K 32-Channel ',1.00,'The DS-7732NXI-K4 belongs to Hikvision’s K-Series AcuSense NVR line, which uses deep-learning AI technology to detect humans and vehicles.','This recorder supports cameras with resolutions up to 12 MP, enabling high-detail surveillance recording.','Install the NVR in a cool and well-ventilated location to avoid overheating.',NULL,'products/1773029413942-20487346.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:10:13','2026-03-09 04:10:13'),
(2875,'TOGGLE SWITCH 3 PIN',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 3-Pin Toggle Switch is a small mechanical switch used to control the flow of electricity in a circuit. It has a lever (toggle) that can be moved up or down to change the switching position. This type of switch usually works as an SPDT (Single Pole Double Throw) switch, allowing one input to connect to one of two outputs.','The switch contains three terminals (pins): one common pin and two output pins. When the lever is moved, the common pin connects to either of the other two pins. These switches are widely used in electronic projects, control panels, robotics, power circuits, DIY equipment, and hobby electronics because they are durable and easy to operate.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773029579023-816840100.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:12:59','2026-03-09 04:12:59'),
(2876,'Hikvision 8-Channel Network Video Recorder ','DS-7608NXI-K2  ',NULL,' Network Video Recorder ',1.00,'The DS-7608NXI-K2 is part of Hikvision’s K-Series AcuSense NVR lineup, which uses deep-learning algorithms to detect humans and vehicles.','The recorder supports IP cameras with resolutions up to 12 MP, allowing high-quality and detailed surveillance recording.','The NVR provides 80 Mbps incoming bandwidth and up to 160 Mbps outgoing bandwidth, ensuring smooth recording and live streaming from multiple cameras.',NULL,'products/1773029739309-916721147.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:15:39','2026-03-09 04:15:39'),
(2877,'6 PIN SELF LOCKING SWITCH',NULL,NULL,NULL,47.00,'A 6 Pin Self Locking Switch is a push-button switch that stays in its position after being pressed. When the button is pressed once, the switch locks in the ON position, and pressing it again releases it back to OFF. This type of switch is commonly used for power control, machine control panels, electronic projects, and industrial equipment.','The switch usually works as a DPDT (Double Pole Double Throw) switch with six terminals (pins). These terminals allow the switch to control two separate circuits at the same time. Because of its locking mechanism, the switch maintains its state without needing continuous pressure, making it useful in many electronic and electrical applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773029837979-76523645.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:17:17','2026-03-09 04:17:17'),
(2878,'ON OFF SWITCH 2A',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A 2A ON/OFF Switch is a small electrical switch used to control the power supply of electronic devices. It allows the user to easily turn a circuit ON or OFF by pressing or toggling the switch. The 2A rating means the switch can safely handle a current of up to 2 amperes, making it suitable for low-power electronic circuits and small electrical devices.','This type of switch usually works as an SPST (Single Pole Single Throw) switch, which simply connects or disconnects the circuit. It is commonly used in DIY electronics, small appliances, battery-powered devices, power adapters, toys, and project boards. The switch is compact, easy to install, and reliable for basic power control.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773029968585-319057710.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:19:28','2026-03-09 04:19:28'),
(2879,'SLIDE SWITCH',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'A Slide Switch is a small electrical switch used to open or close a circuit by sliding a small lever from one position to another. It is commonly used in electronic devices, DIY projects, toys, and battery-operated equipment because of its compact size and simple operation.','Slide switches are available in different types such as 2-pin (ON/OFF), 3-pin (SPDT), and multi-position switches. When the slider is moved, it changes the electrical connection between the terminals. These switches are widely used in PCB circuits, small gadgets, remote controls, and portable electronics due to their reliability and easy installation.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773030084854-390767608.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:21:24','2026-03-09 04:21:24'),
(2880,'ROUND SWITCH',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A Round Switch is a circular-shaped electrical switch commonly used to control the power supply of electronic and electrical devices. It usually works as an ON/OFF switch, allowing the user to easily turn equipment on or off. The round shape makes it suitable for panel mounting in appliances, control boxes, and electronic devices.','Round switches are widely used in home appliances, power supplies, extension boards, automotive devices, and DIY electronic projects. Some models include a built-in LED or neon indicator that lights up when the switch is in the ON position. They are available in different current and voltage ratings depending on the application.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773030156491-871758489.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:22:36','2026-03-09 04:22:36'),
(2881,'TOGGLE SWITCH 6 PIN',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 6 Pin Toggle Switch is a mechanical switch used to control electrical circuits by moving a metal lever up or down. It contains six terminals (pins) and usually works as a DPDT (Double Pole Double Throw) switch. This allows the switch to control two separate circuits or change the direction of current flow.','The switch has two sets of three terminals, where each set controls one circuit. By toggling the lever, the internal contacts change the connection between the terminals. Because of this feature, 6-pin toggle switches are commonly used in motor control circuits, robotics, electronic projects, audio equipment, and control panels.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773030228293-27525231.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:23:48','2026-03-09 04:23:48'),
(2882,'3 PIN DIP SWITCH',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 3 Pin DIP Switch is a small electronic switch designed for PCB (Printed Circuit Board) mounting. It is commonly used to select or configure different settings in electronic circuits. The switch is operated by sliding or toggling a tiny lever, which changes the electrical connection between its pins.','The 3-pin DIP switch usually functions as an SPDT (Single Pole Double Throw) switch. It has one common pin and two selectable pins, allowing the circuit to connect to one of two paths. DIP switches are widely used in microcontroller circuits, configuration settings, embedded systems, and electronic modules because they are compact and easy to integrate into PCBs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773030328952-122166927.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:25:28','2026-03-09 04:25:28'),
(2883,'4 PIN DIP SWITCH',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 4 Pin DIP Switch is a small PCB-mounted configuration switch used in electronic circuits to manually set different operating modes or settings. It is part of the DIP (Dual In-line Package) switch family, designed to be soldered directly onto a printed circuit board.','The 4-pin DIP switch usually contains two independent ON/OFF switches, each controlling a separate circuit path. Each switch connects or disconnects two pins when toggled. These switches are commonly used in microcontroller boards, communication devices, embedded systems, and electronic modules for configuration and addressing purposes.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773030588227-518578548.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:29:48','2026-03-09 04:29:48'),
(2884,'2 PIN DIP SWITCH',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 2 Pin DIP Switch is a small PCB-mounted ON/OFF switch used in electronic circuits to manually control or configure a connection. It is part of the DIP (Dual In-line Package) switch family and is designed to be soldered directly onto a printed circuit board.','This switch usually works as an SPST (Single Pole Single Throw) switch, meaning it simply connects or disconnects the circuit when the switch is toggled. Due to its compact size, it is widely used in embedded systems, microcontroller circuits, communication devices, and electronic modules for enabling or disabling specific circuit functions.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773030670774-442607592.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:31:10','2026-03-09 04:31:10'),
(2885,'8 PIN DIP SWITCH',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'An 8 Pin DIP Switch is a compact PCB-mounted configuration switch used in electronic circuits to manually set different operating modes. It belongs to the DIP (Dual In-line Package) switch family and is designed to be soldered directly onto a printed circuit board. The switch contains multiple small ON/OFF levers that allow users to control circuit connections easily.','An 8-pin DIP switch typically contains four individual ON/OFF switches, with each switch controlling a pair of pins. By toggling the small switches, users can enable or disable certain functions within a circuit. These switches are widely used in microcontroller boards, communication devices, embedded systems, industrial electronics, and configuration settings.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773030780093-313249665.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:33:00','2026-03-09 04:33:00'),
