(2888,'DC PUMP TUBE ',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A DC Pump Tube is a flexible pipe used to carry water or liquid from a DC water pump to another location. It is usually made from plastic, silicone, or PVC material, which makes it lightweight, flexible, and easy to connect to small DC pumps. These tubes are commonly used in water pumping projects, aquarium systems, DIY electronics projects, and small irrigation systems.','The tube is connected to the inlet or outlet nozzle of a DC water pump to allow smooth flow of water or other liquids. It is available in different diameters and lengths depending on the pump size. Because of its flexibility, it can easily be routed through small spaces in robotics projects, cooling systems, and laboratory setups.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773032321920-756313045.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 04:58:41','2026-03-09 04:58:41'),
(2889,'Hikvision 16-Channel NVR ','DS-8616NXI-K8 ',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The recorder supports IP cameras with resolutions up to 12 MP, allowing high-detail recording and monitoring.','This NVR provides 160 Mbps incoming and outgoing bandwidth, enabling stable recording from multiple cameras simultaneously.','Use a UPS or surge protector to protect the system from voltage fluctuations.',NULL,'products/1773032591306-156122568.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 05:03:11','2026-03-09 05:03:11'),
(2890,'Hikvision 16-Channel NVR ','DS-8632NXI-K8 ',NULL,'4K Network Video Recorder',1.00,'The DS-8616NXI-K8 belongs to Hikvision’s AcuSense NVR series, which uses deep-learning AI technology to identify humans and vehicles in video streams.','The recorder supports IP cameras with resolutions up to 12 MP, allowing high-detail recording and monitoring.','Keep the recorder away from moisture, dust, and direct sunlight.',NULL,'products/1773032910269-587050498.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 05:08:30','2026-03-09 05:08:30'),
(2891,'Hikvision Digital Video Recorder','DS-7104HQHI-M1/T',NULL,'DVR',1.00,'The DS-7104HQHI-M1/T is a compact Mini 1U DVR that supports 4 analog camera inputs through BNC connectors and can also connect additional IP cameras in hybrid mode.','This recorder also features Motion Detection 2.0 with deep-learning technology, which can classify human and vehicle movements and reduce false alarms caused by objects like leaves, shadows, or lights.','Use high-quality coaxial cables and connectors for stable camera signals.',NULL,'products/1773033923576-421330681.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 05:25:23','2026-03-09 05:25:23'),
(2892,'STRIPPER (MULTITEC) High Quality',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A MULTITEC High-Quality Wire Stripper is a professional hand tool used to remove insulation from electrical wires without damaging the conductor. It is designed for electricians, technicians, and electronics hobbyists who need accurate wire preparation for connections, soldering, or terminals. Wire strippers are specifically made to cut only the insulation layer while keeping the internal wire intact.','MULTITEC wire strippers are made from high-grade steel or stainless steel and often include features such as sharp cutting edges, gauge adjusters, and ergonomic PVC-coated handles for better grip. Many models can strip and cut wires in the range of about 0.5–4 sq mm or similar sizes, making them suitable for electrical, electronic, and industrial work.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773034518208-245112318.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 05:35:18','2026-03-09 05:35:18'),
(2893,'TESTER',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'An Electrical Tester (also called a Line Tester or Voltage Tester) is a simple tool used to check the presence of electrical voltage in a wire, socket, or electrical device. It usually looks like a screwdriver and contains a small neon lamp or LED inside the handle that glows when voltage is detected.','The tester is commonly used by electricians, technicians, and household users to check whether a wire or socket is live (has electricity). When the metal tip touches a live terminal and the user places a finger on the tester’s metal cap, the internal lamp lights up, indicating the presence of voltage. It is widely used in electrical installation, maintenance, and repair work.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773034632093-293007297.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 05:37:12','2026-03-09 05:37:12'),
(2894,'DC POWER MALE SCREW',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A DC Power Male Screw Connector is an electrical connector used to provide DC power connections without soldering. It usually has a DC male plug (commonly 5.5 mm × 2.1 mm) on one side and two screw terminals on the other side. Wires can be inserted and tightened with screws, making it easy to connect power to electronic devices.','This connector is widely used in CCTV cameras, LED strip lights, routers, Arduino projects, and other DC-powered devices. The screw terminals allow quick wiring of positive (+) and negative (−) wires using a screwdriver. Because it does not require soldering, it is very convenient for DIY electronics and quick installations.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773037378800-780281831.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 06:22:58','2026-03-09 06:22:58'),
(2895,'DC POWER FEMALE SCREW',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A DC Power Female Screw Connector is an electrical adapter used to connect DC power wires to devices using a female DC jack. It usually features a 5.5 mm × 2.1 mm female DC socket on one side and two screw terminals on the other side. The screw terminals allow wires to be connected quickly without soldering.','This connector is commonly used in CCTV camera installations, LED strip lighting systems, routers, Arduino projects, and other DC-powered electronics. The screw terminals make it easy to attach positive (+) and negative (−) wires using a small screwdriver. It is especially useful for quick installation, testing, and DIY electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773037939693-579250750.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 06:32:19','2026-03-09 06:32:19'),
(2896,'MALE DC PIN',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A Male DC Pin (also called a DC Power Plug or DC Male Connector) is a connector used to supply DC power from an adapter or power supply to electronic devices. It usually fits into a female DC socket to complete the power connection. The most common size used in electronics is 5.5 mm outer diameter and 2.1 mm inner diameter.','Male DC pins are widely used in CCTV cameras, LED strip lights, routers, modems, Arduino projects, and other DC-powered equipment. These connectors are available in different types such as solder type, screw terminal type, and molded cable type. They provide a stable and secure power connection for low-voltage DC devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773038827388-867384405.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 06:47:07','2026-03-09 06:47:07'),
(2897,'FEMALE DC SOCKET ',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A Female DC Socket (also called a DC Power Jack) is an electrical connector used to receive power from a DC male plug. It is commonly installed on electronic devices, circuit boards, and panels to allow a DC power adapter to supply electricity to the device.','The most common size is 5.5 mm outer diameter and 2.1 mm inner diameter, which matches standard DC power adapters. Female DC sockets are widely used in CCTV cameras, routers, LED lights, Arduino boards, power supply modules, and other electronic equipment. They can be PCB-mounted, panel-mounted, or wired depending on the application.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773039025425-84387206.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 06:50:25','2026-03-09 06:50:25'),
(2898,'STEREO PIN',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A Stereo Pin is an audio connector used to transfer stereo sound signals between electronic audio devices. It is commonly known as a 3.5 mm stereo jack plug or AUX pin. The connector is widely used in headphones, speakers, amplifiers, mobile phones, laptops, and audio systems.','The stereo pin usually has three metal sections called Tip, Ring, and Sleeve (TRS). These sections carry left audio signal, right audio signal, and ground. Stereo pins are available in different sizes such as 3.5 mm (commonly used in portable devices) and 6.35 mm (used in professional audio equipment). They provide a simple and reliable method for connecting audio devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773039752232-209010677.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 07:02:32','2026-03-09 07:02:32'),
(2899,'2 PIN PUSH BUTTON',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 2 Pin Push Button Switch is a simple electrical switch used to temporarily connect or disconnect a circuit when the button is pressed. It usually works as a momentary switch, meaning the circuit is active only while the button is being pressed and returns to its original state when released.','This switch has two terminals (pins) that connect or break the circuit when the button is pressed. It is commonly used in electronic circuits, control panels, doorbells, calculators, toys, and DIY electronics projects. Because of its simple design and compact size, it is widely used in PCB-mounted circuits and small devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773039871622-907275759.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 07:04:31','2026-03-09 07:04:31'),
(2900,'4 PIN PUSH BUTTON',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 4 Pin Push Button Switch is a small momentary tactile switch commonly used in electronic circuits and PCB boards. When the button is pressed, it temporarily connects the circuit, and when released, it returns to the OFF position automatically.','This switch has four terminals, where two pins on each side are internally connected. Pressing the button connects both sides of the circuit. These switches are widely used in microcontroller boards, Arduino projects, remote controls, calculators, control panels, and electronic devices due to their compact size and reliable operation.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773039987297-170140745.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 07:06:27','2026-03-09 07:06:27'),
(2901,'Hikvision DVR','DS-7108HQHI-M1/T',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS-7108HQHI-M1/T is a compact Mini-1U DVR that supports 8 analog camera inputs through BNC connectors and can also connect additional IP cameras in hybrid mode.','The recorder uses advanced H.265 Pro+ / H.265 / H.264+ compression technologies, which reduce storage usage while maintaining clear video quality.','Install the DVR in a cool and ventilated place to prevent overheating.',NULL,'products/1773040545631-883790105.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 07:15:45','2026-03-09 07:15:45'),
(2902,'Hikvision 16-Channel DVR','DS-7116HQHI-M1/T',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS-7116HQHI-M1/T is a compact Mini-1U DVR designed for medium-size CCTV systems such as shops, offices, and buildings.','The recorder uses advanced H.265 Pro+, H.265, and H.264 compression technologies, which help reduce storage usage and network bandwidth while maintaining clear video quality.','Install the DVR in a cool, ventilated place to prevent overheating.',NULL,'products/1773045028780-281565941.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 08:30:28','2026-03-09 08:30:28'),
(2903,'Hikvision 32-Channel DVR','DS-7232HQHI-M2/X',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The DS-7232HQHI-M2/X is designed for medium-to-large CCTV setups like offices, warehouses, schools, and commercial buildings.','The DVR supports advanced H.265 Pro+ / H.265 / H.264+ / H.264 video compression, which reduces storage usage while maintaining clear video quality. ','Supports HDTVI / AHD / HDCVI / CVBS / IP cameras',NULL,'products/1773045886345-817139147.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 08:44:46','2026-03-09 08:44:46'),
(2904,'Hikvision DVR 32-Channel','iDS-7204HQHI-M1/XT',NULL,'32-Channel DVR ',1.00,'The DS-7232HQHI-M2/X is designed for medium-to-large CCTV setups like offices, warehouses, schools, and commercial buildings. ','The DVR supports advanced H.265 Pro+ / H.265 / H.264+ / H.264 video compression, which reduces storage usage while maintaining clear video quality.','Keep the recorder away from dust, water, and direct sunlight.',NULL,'products/1773047333068-568217018.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 09:08:53','2026-03-09 09:08:53'),
(2905,'Hikvision 8-Channel Turbo DVR ','IDS-7208HQHI-M1/XT',NULL,'DVR 8-Channel',1.00,'The iDS-7208HQHI-M1/XT is a compact 1U DVR used for small-to-medium CCTV setups such as homes, shops, offices, and warehouses.','This DVR supports recording resolutions up to 3K Lite / 5 MP Lite, delivering clear surveillance footage','Use high-quality coaxial cables and connectors for stable camera signals.',NULL,'products/1773048005352-334025659.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 09:20:05','2026-03-09 09:20:05'),
(2906,'Hikvision 8-Channel Digital Video Recorder ','IDS-7208HQHI-M2/FA',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The iDS-7208HQHI-M2/FA is designed for small-to-medium CCTV installations like homes, shops, offices, and warehouses.','The recorder is equipped with AcuSense deep-learning technology, which can detect humans and vehicles to reduce false alarms caused by animals, shadows, or moving objects like leaves','Do not open the DVR casing; repairs should be done by qualified technicians.',NULL,'products/1773051936284-61577787.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 10:25:36','2026-03-09 10:25:36'),
(2907,'Hikvision DVR ','IDS-7216HQHI-M1/XT',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The iDS-7216HQHI-M1/XT is a compact 1U DVR used for medium-size CCTV systems like offices, shops, warehouses, and residential complexes.','This recorder supports recording resolutions up to 3K Lite / 5 MP Lite, delivering clear surveillance footage.','Use high-quality coaxial cables and connectors for stable camera signals.',NULL,'products/1773052778131-963389485.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 10:39:38','2026-03-09 10:39:38'),
(2908,'Led Strip Lights',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'LED Strip Lights are flexible lighting solutions made with small Light Emitting Diodes (LEDs) mounted on a thin, flexible circuit board. These strips can be easily installed in various places such as ceilings, cabinets, showcases, TVs, vehicles, and decorative setups. LED strip lights usually come with adhesive backing, allowing quick installation on different surfaces. They are available in different colors including single color, warm white, cool white, and RGB multicolor options.','LED strip lights typically operate on low voltage such as 5V, 12V, or 24V using a power adapter or LED driver. The strips contain multiple LEDs arranged in series and parallel sections that can be cut at marked intervals to adjust the length. They are available in different LED types such as 3528, 5050, and 2835, each providing different brightness levels.','When installing LED strip lights, ensure that the correct voltage power supply is used to avoid damage to the LEDs. Proper heat dissipation and ventilation can improve the lifespan of the strip. If the strip is cut, it must be cut only at the marked cutting points to maintain circuit continuity. For longer installations, connectors or soldering may be required to extend the strip length. Always check polarity when connecting the power supply to avoid reverse connection.',NULL,'products/1773066340073-298737160.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-09 14:25:40','2026-03-09 14:25:40'),
(2909,'100 WATTS GLUE GUN',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A 100 Watts Glue Gun is a powerful hot melt adhesive tool used to melt glue sticks and apply hot glue for bonding different materials. It operates using electricity to heat the internal heating element, which melts the glue stick and allows it to flow through the nozzle when the trigger is pressed. This type of glue gun is commonly used for craft work, repair jobs, DIY projects, packaging, and industrial applications.','The 100W glue gun heats up quickly and provides a strong and continuous flow of melted adhesive, making it suitable for heavy-duty work. It works with standard glue sticks and can bond materials such as plastic, wood, paper, cardboard, fabric, foam, and some metals. Many models include a trigger feed mechanism and a metal stand for easy and safe use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773114169941-805862317.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 03:42:49','2026-03-10 03:42:49'),
(2910,'20 WATTS MINI GLUE GUN',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A 20 Watts Mini Glue Gun is a compact electric tool used to melt glue sticks and apply hot adhesive for bonding materials. It is smaller and lighter than heavy-duty glue guns, making it ideal for craft work, school projects, electronics repair, and DIY applications.','The glue gun works by heating solid glue sticks (usually 7 mm diameter) until they melt. When the trigger is pressed, the melted glue flows out of the nozzle to join materials together. Most 20W glue guns heat up in about 3–7 minutes and operate on AC 110–230 V power',NULL,NULL,'products/1773114373246-785686409.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 03:46:13','2026-03-10 03:46:13'),
(2911,'60 WATTS GLUE GUN',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A 60 Watts Glue Gun is a medium-power hot melt adhesive tool used to melt glue sticks and apply hot glue for bonding different materials. It is commonly used for craft work, electronics repair, packaging, woodworking, and DIY projects. The glue stick melts inside the heating chamber, and the melted adhesive flows through the nozzle when the trigger is pressed.','A typical 60W glue gun operates on 110–220V AC power and usually uses 11 mm diameter glue sticks. It heats up quickly (about 2–5 minutes) and can reach a melting temperature around 190 °C, allowing strong bonding of materials like plastic, wood, fabric, and cardboard',NULL,NULL,'products/1773114488584-584918854.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 03:48:08','2026-03-10 03:48:08'),
(2912,'NIPPER (MULTI TEC)',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A MULTITEC Nipper is a precision cutting tool used to cut small wires, component leads, and soft metal conductors in electronics and electrical work. It is designed with sharp cutting edges and comfortable insulated handles, allowing accurate cutting without damaging nearby components.','Multitec nippers are commonly used in electronics assembly, PCB repair, telecommunications, and DIY projects. The tool is usually made from high-grade alloy steel or stainless steel with heat-treated cutting edges to ensure durability and long life. It can typically cut copper or aluminum wires around 0.8 mm–1.2 mm diameter, making it suitable for trimming component leads on circuit boards.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773114609920-851328234.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 03:50:09','2026-03-10 03:50:09'),
(2913,'K71 VOLTAGE DETECTOR',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The K71 Voltage Detector is a compact electronic testing device used to detect the presence of voltage in electrical wires, sockets, and circuits. It is commonly used by electricians, technicians, and maintenance workers to check whether a line is live before working on electrical equipment.','The K71 tester usually works as a multi-function voltage detector that can identify live electrical lines safely. It is built with a plastic (ABS) body and may use small button batteries for operation. The tester is lightweight and portable, making it suitable for industrial, electrical maintenance, and household electrical testing',NULL,NULL,'products/1773114722443-655956491.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 03:52:02','2026-03-10 03:52:02'),
(2914,'CONTINUITY TESTER',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A Continuity Tester is an electronic testing device used to check whether an electrical circuit is complete or broken. It helps determine if current can flow through a wire, component, or connection. When the circuit is continuous, the tester usually lights an LED or produces a buzzer sound.','Continuity testers are commonly used in electronics repair, electrical wiring inspection, and circuit troubleshooting. The device typically consists of a small battery, test probes, and an indicator (LED or buzzer). When the probes touch two points of a closed circuit, the tester indicates continuity. It is widely used for checking wires, fuses, switches, PCB tracks, and cable connections.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773114803274-435546190.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 03:53:23','2026-03-10 03:53:23'),
(2915,'555 DC MOTOR Collet Micro',NULL,NULL,NULL,699.00,'A 555 DC Motor Collet Micro is a small metal collet or chuck adapter designed to attach drill bits or small tools to a 555 DC motor shaft. It converts a standard RS-555 DC motor into a micro drill or mini rotary tool, allowing it to hold small drill bits, grinding bits, or polishing tools.','The collet is usually made from brass or aluminum and fits tightly onto the motor shaft (commonly 3.17 mm). It includes a tightening nut that secures drill bits of different sizes. This accessory is widely used in DIY electronics, PCB drilling, robotics projects, mini CNC machines, and hobby tools where precise drilling or rotating tools are needed.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773114912637-575145983.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 03:55:12','2026-03-10 03:55:12'),
(2916,'HAND DRILL TOOL',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A Hand Drill Tool is a small manual tool used to drill tiny holes in materials like PCB boards, plastic, wood, and soft metal. It works without electricity and is operated by rotating the handle manually, which gives better control for precise drilling work.','This tool usually comes with a collet or chuck that can hold different sizes of micro drill bits. Because it is hand-operated, it is commonly used for electronics PCB drilling, craft work, model making, jewelry work, and DIY hobby projects. Hand drill tools are lightweight, portable, and easy to use for small precision tasks.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773115246030-25243338.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:00:46','2026-03-10 04:00:46'),
(2917,'JACKLY 32 IN 1 SCREW DRIVER',NULL,NULL,NULL,899.00,'The Jackly 32-in-1 Screwdriver is a precision tool kit used for repairing electronic devices such as mobile phones, laptops, cameras, and small appliances. It contains a handle and multiple interchangeable screwdriver bits that allow users to work with many types of screws. The compact case keeps all parts organized and easy to carry','This tool kit usually includes 30 different screwdriver bits, one magnetic handle, and accessories like a tweezer. The bits cover several types such as Torx, Phillips, Hex, and Flat, making it suitable for most electronic repair tasks. The magnetic holder helps keep the screw firmly attached while working.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773115730291-547199821.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:08:50','2026-03-10 04:08:50'),
(2918,'JACKLY 31 IN 1 SCREW DRIVER',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Jackly 31-in-1 Screwdriver Set is a precision tool kit designed for repairing electronic devices such as mobile phones, laptops, cameras, watches, and small appliances. It includes a screwdriver handle and multiple interchangeable bits that allow the user to open many different types of screws. The kit is compact and usually comes in a plastic storage case for easy carrying and organization.','The Jackly 31-in-1 Screwdriver Set is a precision tool kit designed for repairing electronic devices such as mobile phones, laptops, cameras, watches, and small appliances. It includes a screwdriver handle and multiple interchangeable bits that allow the user to open many different types of screws. The kit is compact and usually comes in a plastic storage case for easy carrying and organization.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773115981461-779503234.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:13:01','2026-03-10 04:13:01'),
(2919,'ASSORTED DRILL BIT',NULL,NULL,NULL,699.00,'An Assorted Drill Bit Set is a collection of drill bits of different sizes and types used for drilling holes in materials such as wood, plastic, metal, and PCB boards. The set contains multiple drill bits organized in one box so users can easily choose the correct size for different drilling tasks.','Assorted drill bit sets are commonly made from high-speed steel (HSS) or carbide materials for durability and precision. Many small sets contain micro drill bits ranging from about 0.3 mm to 3 mm, which are ideal for electronics work, PCB drilling, jewelry making, and hobby projects',NULL,NULL,'products/1773116233855-178196836.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:17:13','2026-03-10 04:17:13'),
(2920,'MAXICOM M325',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The MAXICOM M325 is a 32-in-1 precision screwdriver tool kit designed for repairing and assembling small electronic devices. It includes a screwdriver handle and multiple interchangeable bits that allow users to work with many types of screws. This kit is commonly used for mobile phone repair, laptop servicing, camera repair, and other electronics maintenance tasks.','The MAXICOM M325 set usually contains 32 pieces, including a handle and several precision bits made from steel for durability. Different bit types such as Phillips, Flat, Torx, Hex, and special bits are included so the user can open many kinds of electronic devices. These kits are compact and normally come in a plastic storage box to keep the bits organized.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773116516380-847014473.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:21:56','2026-03-10 04:21:56'),
(2921,'V8 DATA CABLE',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A V8 Data Cable is a USB cable used to charge mobile phones and transfer data between devices. It has a USB Type-A connector on one side and a Micro-USB (V8) connector on the other side. This type of cable was widely used in many Android smartphones, tablets, power banks, and electronic modules before USB-C became common.','The name “V8 cable” is a popular market name for the Micro-USB cable. It features a small trapezoid-shaped connector that plugs into Micro-USB ports. The cable can be used for charging devices and transferring files between a phone and a computer',NULL,NULL,'products/1773116883629-927075075.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:28:03','2026-03-10 04:28:03'),
(2922,'UNEplus 4 LENS AIV Solar Camera',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The UNEPLUS 4-Lens AOV Solar Camera is designed for remote outdoor security monitoring such as farms, construction sites, warehouses, and parking areas. It works using solar panels and a built-in rechargeable battery, allowing the camera to operate continuously even without a power connection.','The camera typically connects through 4G LTE mobile networks, so users can view live video and recordings from anywhere using a mobile application such as HiEasy.','Install the solar panel facing direct sunlight for proper charging.Mount the camera 2–4 meters above ground for wider coverage.',NULL,'products/1773118520553-813990110.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:55:20','2026-03-10 04:55:20'),
(2923,'DC PIN MALE',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A DC Pin Male is a power connector plug used to supply DC electricity from a power adapter or battery to electronic devices. It connects to a DC female socket to create a secure electrical connection. These connectors are commonly used in CCTV systems, LED lights, routers, modems, and electronic projects.','The most common DC male plug size is 5.5 mm outer diameter and 2.1 mm inner diameter. It usually has two terminals inside for positive (+) and negative (−) connections. DC male pins are available in solder type, screw terminal type, and molded cable type, making them easy to use for different applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773118549171-858956317.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:55:49','2026-03-10 04:55:49'),
(2924,'DC PIN FEMALE',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A DC Pin Female is a DC power socket connector used to receive power from a DC male plug. It is commonly installed in electronic devices so that a power adapter can be connected easily. This connector helps provide a stable and secure DC power connection for many electronic systems.','A DC Pin Female is a DC power socket connector used to receive power from a DC male plug. It is commonly installed in electronic devices so that a power adapter can be connected easily. This connector helps provide a stable and secure DC power connection for many electronic systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773118635176-892726327.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:57:15','2026-03-10 04:57:15'),
(2925,'5 PIN RMC',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 5 Pin RMC Connector is a circular multi-pin electrical connector commonly used for audio, communication, and electronic equipment connections. It contains five metal pins inside a round metal housing, allowing multiple signals or power lines to pass through a single connector.','This connector is often used in microphones, audio amplifiers, communication devices, and control systems. The pins allow transmission of audio signals, control signals, or low-voltage power. The circular metal body provides a secure and durable connection, and many models include a locking mechanism to prevent accidental disconnection.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773118790510-796920082.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 04:59:50','2026-03-10 04:59:50'),
(2926,'6 PIN RMC',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 6 Pin RMC Connector is a round multi-pin electrical connector used to connect audio or control signals between electronic devices. It has six metal pins inside a circular metal body, allowing multiple wires to be connected through a single plug.','These connectors are commonly used in microphones, audio amplifiers, communication equipment, and electronic control systems. The pins are connected by soldering wires to the terminals, and the round metal housing provides a secure and durable connection. Some models also include a locking mechanism to keep the connector firmly attached.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773118907667-386615844.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 05:01:47','2026-03-10 05:01:47'),
(2927,'8 PIN RMC',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'An 8 Pin RMC Connector is a circular multi-pin electrical connector used to connect multiple signal or power lines between electronic devices. It contains eight metal pins arranged inside a round metal housing, allowing several connections through a single plug.','This connector is commonly used in audio systems, microphones, communication equipment, industrial electronics, and control devices. The wires are typically soldered to the internal terminals, and the metal body provides mechanical strength and reliable connection. The design helps keep multiple wires organized in a compact connector.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773119369067-107462308.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 05:09:29','2026-03-10 05:09:29'),
(2928,'4 PIN RMC',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 4 Pin RMC Connector is a round multi-pin electrical connector used to connect signals or power between electronic devices. It has four metal pins arranged inside a circular metal body, allowing multiple wires to be connected through a single plug.','This connector is commonly used in microphones, audio amplifiers, communication equipment, intercom systems, and electronic control devices. The wires are usually soldered to the internal pins, and the metal housing provides strong and reliable connections. The circular design also helps keep the connector firmly attached to the socket.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773119463979-222513687.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 05:11:03','2026-03-10 05:11:03'),
(2929,'3 PIN RMC',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 3 Pin RMC Connector is a round multi-pin electrical connector used to connect audio signals or power between electronic devices. It contains three metal pins arranged inside a circular metal body, allowing multiple wires to be connected through a single plug.','These connectors are commonly used in microphones, audio amplifiers, communication equipment, intercom systems, and electronic control devices. The wires are usually soldered to the internal pins, and the strong metal housing provides durability and secure connection. The circular design helps maintain a stable plug-and-socket connection.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773119570601-314953898.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 05:12:50','2026-03-10 05:12:50'),
(2930,'10 PIN RMC',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 10 Pin RMC Connector is a circular multi-pin electrical connector used to connect multiple signal or power lines between electronic devices. It has ten metal pins arranged inside a round metal housing, allowing several wires to be connected through a single plug.','This connector is commonly used in audio equipment, communication systems, industrial electronics, control panels, and specialized electronic devices. The wires are connected to the pins by soldering, and the metal outer body provides strong mechanical support and reliable electrical contact. These connectors help organize many connections in a compact and secure interface.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773119672259-392440025.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 05:14:32','2026-03-10 05:14:32'),
(2931,'12 PIN RMC',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 12 Pin RMC Connector is a circular multi-pin electrical connector used to connect multiple signal or power lines between electronic devices. It contains twelve metal pins inside a round metal housing, allowing many wires to pass through a single compact connector.','This connector is commonly used in audio equipment, communication systems, industrial electronics, control panels, and specialized electronic devices. The wires are typically soldered to the internal terminals, and the strong metal body ensures durability and reliable electrical contact. RMC connectors help keep multiple connections organized and secure.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773119839852-153307984.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 05:17:19','2026-03-10 05:17:19'),
(2932,'THINKWILL 4G  Solar CCTV Camera',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The THINKWILL 4G Solar Camera is designed for surveillance in locations where power supply or internet cables are not available, such as farms, construction sites, or remote areas.','The camera usually connects to a mobile application where users can watch live video, receive motion alerts, and control camera movement remotely.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773123559397-325600323.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 06:19:19','2026-03-10 06:19:19'),
(2933,'THINKWILL 4G  Wi-Fi Camera ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The THINKWILL 4G Wi-Fi camera is designed for home, office, and outdoor surveillance. It can transmit live video over the internet so users can watch footage from anywhere using a mobile application.','Some models feature PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) movement, allowing the camera to rotate and monitor a wider area. Motion detection sensors can trigger alerts on the user’s smartphone whenever movement is detected.','Install the camera at 2–3 m height for better coverage. ',NULL,'products/1773124505019-421097675.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 06:35:05','2026-03-10 06:35:05'),
(2934,'MAXELON Ear Buds ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'Maxelon earbuds are compact in-ear wireless earphones that come with a portable charging case.','They use modern Bluetooth technology to provide stable wireless connectivity and allow users to enjoy clear audio and deep bass while moving freely without cables.','Avoid exposure to water unless the model supports water resistance.',NULL,'products/1773135996255-551739992.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 09:46:36','2026-03-10 09:46:36'),
(2935,'SOLAR SINGLE LIGHT',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A Solar Single Light is a small lighting system that works using solar energy. It usually consists of a solar panel, rechargeable battery, LED light, and control circuit. The solar panel converts sunlight into electrical energy during the day, and the stored energy in the battery powers the LED light at night.','Solar single lights are commonly used for home lighting, garden lights, street lights, and school science projects. They are energy-efficient and environmentally friendly because they use renewable solar power instead of electricity from the grid. These systems are easy to install and require very little maintenance.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773136688968-455430434.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 09:58:08','2026-03-10 09:58:08'),
(2936,'WATER ALARM WITH VOICE',NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,'A Water Alarm with Voice is an electronic device used to detect water level or leakage and provide a voice alert when water reaches a certain level. It helps prevent water tank overflow or water leakage by notifying the user through a recorded voice message or sound alert.','This system typically includes water level sensors, a control circuit, and a small speaker or voice module. When the water touches the sensor probes, the circuit activates and plays a voice message such as “Water Tank Full” or a warning sound. These devices are commonly used in overhead water tanks, sump tanks, bathrooms, and industrial water monitoring systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773136798174-391154454.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 09:59:58','2026-03-10 09:59:58'),
(2937,'JD188 DOOR ALARM SYSTEM',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The JD188 Door Alarm System is a compact magnetic security alarm designed to protect doors and windows. When the door or window is opened, the magnetic contact between the sensor parts is broken, which triggers a loud siren alarm to alert people and scare away intruders','This alarm system consists of two main parts: the alarm unit and a magnetic sensor strip. Both parts are placed close to each other on the door or window frame. When the door or window is opened and the magnet separates from the main unit, the device activates a loud alarm (around 90 dB) until the parts are reconnected or the switch is turned off',NULL,NULL,'products/1773136906215-744112247.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 10:01:46','2026-03-10 10:01:46'),
(2938,'MOBILE CHARGING HOLDER',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A Mobile Charging Holder is a small stand or wall-mounted holder designed to hold a smartphone safely while it is charging. It is usually attached near a wall socket, allowing the phone to rest on the holder while the charging cable is connected.','Most charging holders are made from plastic, ABS material, or metal and are designed to fit all common smartphones. They are widely used in homes, offices, hostels, and shops to keep phones safe while charging and prevent them from hanging by the cable. Many models include hooks or slots for the charging adapter and cable to keep the setup organized',NULL,NULL,'products/1773137200124-570145317.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 10:06:40','2026-03-10 10:06:40'),
(2939,'USB LIGHT',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A USB Light is a small LED lamp powered through a USB port. It can be connected to devices such as laptops, power banks, USB chargers, computers, or car USB ports to provide instant lighting. These lights are compact and portable, making them useful for reading, emergency lighting, travel, and computer keyboard lighting','USB lights normally operate at 5V power supplied by a USB port. Many models have a flexible neck or compact plug-in design, allowing the user to adjust the direction of light easily. Because USB ports are widely available, these lights can be used almost anywhere with a USB power source',NULL,NULL,'products/1773137556301-914272727.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 10:12:36','2026-03-10 10:12:36'),
(2940,'USB FAN',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A USB Fan is a small portable fan powered through a USB port. It can be connected to devices such as laptops, computers, power banks, USB chargers, or mobile phones to produce cooling airflow. Because it uses low-voltage USB power, it is convenient for desk use, travel, and personal cooling.','USB fans normally operate using 5-volt DC power supplied by the USB port. When electricity flows through the small motor inside the fan, the blades rotate and move air to create a cooling effect.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773137722102-177718456.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 10:15:22','2026-03-10 10:15:22'),
(2941,'BIKE MOBILE CHARGER',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A Bike Mobile Charger is a device that allows you to charge a mobile phone directly from a motorcycle or scooter battery. It connects to the vehicle’s 12 V battery system and converts the voltage to 5 V USB output suitable for charging smartphones and other USB devices','Most bike chargers are designed with USB ports, allowing you to plug in your phone’s charging cable. They usually have features such as waterproof protection, short-circuit protection, and an on/off switch for safe operation on the road. These chargers are commonly mounted on the handlebar or near the dashboard of the bike',NULL,NULL,'products/1773137971249-159304826.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 10:19:31','2026-03-10 10:19:31'),
(2942,'OTG C -TYPE',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'An OTG C-Type (USB-C OTG adapter) is a small connector that allows a USB-C mobile phone or tablet to connect directly to USB devices such as pen drives, keyboards, mice, card readers, or game controllers. It converts the Type-C charging port into a standard USB-A port so external devices can be used with the phone','OTG stands for “On-The-Go.” It is a USB technology that allows devices like smartphones or tablets to act as a USB host, meaning they can control other USB devices without needing a computer.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773138394083-970224461.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 10:26:34','2026-03-10 10:26:34'),
(2943,'OTG B -TYPE',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'An OTG B-Type usually refers to a Micro-USB OTG adapter (often called V8 OTG). It allows a smartphone or tablet with a Micro-USB port to connect directly to USB devices such as pen drives, keyboards, mice, card readers, and cameras','OTG stands for “On-The-Go”, a USB technology that lets a mobile device act as a USB host, meaning it can control other USB devices without needing a computer.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773138559946-5736876.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-10 10:29:19','2026-03-10 10:29:19'),
(2944,'Maxelon Phone Charger Adapter',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'Maxelon charger adapters are designed with fast-charging technology and multiple safety protections to ensure stable and quick charging for modern smartphones.','Many models include USB-A and Type-C ports, allowing compatibility with Android devices, iPhones, tablets, and other gadgets.','Use the correct charging cable (Type-C / Micro-USB / Lightning).',NULL,'products/1773201643444-731027617.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-11 04:00:43','2026-03-11 04:00:43'),
(2945,'Maxelon Phone Charger Cable ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'Maxelon MEGA Data Cable is a high-speed charging and data transfer cable designed for smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other USB devices.','It supports fast charging technology and allows quick synchronization of files between devices.','Avoid bending the cable sharply near the connector.',NULL,'products/1773202311339-628684492.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-11 04:11:51','2026-03-11 04:11:51'),
(2946,'One plus C-type Mobile Charger',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'OnePlus C-Type Charger is a fast-charging power adapter designed to efficiently charge smartphones, tablets, and other compatible electronic devices that support USB Type-C connectivity. It is built with advanced charging technology to deliver stable power output while maintaining device safety. The charger typically features a compact and lightweight design, making it convenient for everyday use at home, office, or while traveling.','OnePlus C-Type Charger usually supports fast charging standards such as Warp Charge or other quick-charge technologies depending on the model. It operates with a standard AC input and converts it into a stable DC output suitable for USB-C powered devices. The charger is compatible with most smartphones, Bluetooth accessories, power banks, and other gadgets that support Type-C charging.','Use the charger with a good quality USB Type-C cable for best performance and fast charging capability. Always connect it to a stable power source to avoid voltage fluctuations. Avoid exposing the charger to water, excessive heat, or physical damage. For safety and optimal performance, it is recommended to use the charger with compatible devices and certified cables.',NULL,'products/1773234231433-527578692.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-11 13:03:51','2026-03-11 13:03:51'),
(2947,'Vivo C type Mobile Charger',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Vivo C-Type Mobile Charger is a fast-charging power adapter designed to charge Vivo smartphones and other USB Type-C compatible devices quickly and safely. It typically comes with a USB to Type-C cable and a compact travel-friendly adapter that converts AC power into stable DC power for mobile charging. The charger is built with durable materials and advanced charging technology to provide efficient and reliable performance.','Vivo C-Type chargers are available in different power capacities such as 18W, 33W, 44W, 66W, and even higher depending on the phone model. These chargers support Vivo’s FlashCharge or Dual-Engine Fast Charging technology to reduce charging time while maintaining battery safety. Most models operate with an input of about 100-240V AC and provide multiple output levels such as 5V/2A, 9V/2A, or higher depending on the charger type. They are compatible with Vivo smartphones, tablets, Bluetooth accessories, and other USB-C powered devices.','For best charging performance, use the original Vivo Type-C cable along with the charger. Avoid using damaged cables or low-quality adapters, as they may slow down charging or damage the device. Keep the charger away from moisture, extreme heat, or physical damage.',NULL,'products/1773235528102-947042922.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-11 13:25:28','2026-03-11 13:25:28'),
(2948,'Vivo V8 Mobile Charger',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Vivo V8 Mobile Charger is a standard wall charger designed to charge smartphones and other electronic devices that use a Micro-USB (V8) charging port. It usually comes with a USB wall adapter and a V8 data cable, allowing users to charge their mobile phones quickly and reliably. The charger is compact, lightweight, and easy to carry, making it suitable for daily use at home, office, or during travel. It is commonly used with older Android smartphones and many electronic gadgets that support Micro-USB charging.','The Vivo V8 charger generally operates with an input voltage of 100–240V AC and converts it into a 5V DC output with about 2A current, which provides stable and efficient charging for compatible devices. The V8 cable typically has a USB Type-A connector on one side and a Micro-USB connector on the other, allowing it to connect to the charger or computer USB ports. It usually includes a cable length of around 1 meter and supports charging as well as data transfer.','Always use a good quality V8 cable and charger to maintain proper charging speed and device safety. Avoid bending the cable excessively or using damaged connectors. Keep the charger away from moisture, dust, and high temperatures. Disconnect the charger from the power outlet when not in use to extend its lifespan.',NULL,'products/1773235905982-514396030.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-11 13:31:45','2026-03-11 13:31:45'),
(2949,'BNC Male Connector',NULL,NULL,NULL,399.00,'BNC Male Connector is a type of coaxial RF connector commonly used for connecting coaxial cables in electronic and communication systems. It features a bayonet locking mechanism that allows quick and secure connection to a matching BNC female connector. The connector is widely used in video transmission systems, CCTV cameras, oscilloscopes, radio frequency equipment, and networking devices. Its durable metal construction and secure locking design ensure stable signal transmission with minimal signal loss.','BNC stands for Bayonet Neill–Concelman, the name derived from its inventors. The BNC male connector is designed to terminate coaxial cables such as RG59 or RG6 and provides reliable connectivity for both analog and digital signals. It supports frequencies up to several GHz depending on the cable and connector quality. The bayonet coupling mechanism requires a simple push and twist motion to lock the connector securely into place, making installation quick and convenient.','BNC Male Connector is an RF interface component used in coaxial cable systems for transmitting radio frequency signals, video signals, and test signals. It is widely used in CCTV surveillance systems, broadcast equipment, laboratory instruments, and telecommunications devices. The connector provides a stable impedance connection (usually 50Ω or 75Ω) to ensure efficient signal transfer and reduced interference.',NULL,'products/1773239024263-658808246.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-11 14:23:44','2026-03-11 14:23:44'),
(2950,'U&I Smart Watch with Charger',NULL,NULL,NULL,5999.00,'U&i Smart Watch with Charger is a modern wearable device designed to help users monitor fitness, receive smartphone notifications, and manage daily activities conveniently from their wrist. It features a stylish design with a touch display and comfortable strap suitable for everyday use. The smartwatch usually comes with a dedicated magnetic or wireless charger that allows easy and safe charging. It combines technology and convenience, making it useful for both fitness tracking and smart connectivity.','Most U&i smartwatches include features such as heart-rate monitoring, step counting, sleep tracking, calorie tracking, and multiple sports modes for fitness monitoring. Many models support Bluetooth connectivity for notifications, call alerts, and music control when connected to Android or iOS smartphones. Some models feature a large display around 1.8–2.2 inches, IP68 water resistance, and wireless magnetic charging docks for convenient charging.','Charge the smartwatch using the original magnetic charger or charging dock provided with the device. Avoid using incompatible chargers or cables. Keep the charging pins clean and dry for proper charging. Do not expose the watch to extreme heat, water (if not fully waterproof), or strong impacts to maintain long-term performance.',NULL,'products/1773240048730-862871429.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-11 14:40:48','2026-03-11 14:40:48'),
(2951,'4 inch K Sonic woofer',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'K-Sonic 4-inch speaker is a compact loudspeaker driver designed for small audio systems such as portable speaker boxes, home audio setups, and DIY amplifier projects. It produces clear mid-range sound and moderate bass despite its small size. The speaker typically uses a lightweight cone, strong magnet, and durable frame to deliver stable sound output. Because of its compact design, it is commonly installed in small cabinets, multimedia speakers, and mini sound systems.','A typical 4-inch speaker has a 100 mm woofer size and is designed to handle a wide range of audio frequencies for balanced sound. Many small speakers of this size use an impedance around 4 ohms and provide good sound sensitivity for use with amplifiers or audio boards. Frequency response in similar speakers can range roughly from 70 Hz to 23 kHz, allowing them to reproduce both low and high sound frequencies clearly.','4-inch K-Sonic speaker is an electro-acoustic component that converts electrical audio signals from an amplifier into sound waves. It operates based on a voice coil and magnet system that vibrates the speaker cone to produce sound. The speaker usually works with audio amplifiers designed for 4 Ω or 8 Ω impedance loads, which helps maintain proper power transfer and safe operation in audio systems.',NULL,'products/1773240449460-331864267.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-11 14:47:29','2026-03-11 14:53:07'),
(2952,'8 inch K Sonic Woofer',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'K-Sonic 8-inch speaker is a larger loudspeaker driver designed to deliver stronger bass and higher sound output compared to smaller speakers. It is commonly used in home audio systems, Bluetooth speaker boxes, PA systems, DJ sound setups, and DIY amplifier projects. The speaker typically features a durable cone, foam or rubber surround, and a powerful magnet that helps produce deep bass and clear mid-range audio. Because of its larger size, it is ideal for medium-sized speaker cabinets and sound systems.','A typical K-Sonic 8-inch woofer (such as model KS-840) can handle around 80 watts of power and is designed with a foam cone and strong magnet system to produce balanced sound performance. The magnet size is usually around 90 × 17 mm, which helps generate stronger magnetic force for better sound output. These speakers are commonly used in speaker boxes, home theater systems, stage speakers, and portable sound systems.','K-Sonic 8-inch speaker is an electro-acoustic component that converts electrical audio signals into sound waves. It works using a voice coil, magnet, and diaphragm (cone) that vibrates when current passes through the coil. This vibration produces sound waves that we hear as music or audio output. The speaker is widely used in audio amplification systems, public address systems, and multimedia speaker setups.',NULL,'products/1773240565462-512132254.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-11 14:49:25','2026-03-11 14:53:40'),
(2953,'Buck Converter LM2596',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The LM2596 Buck Converter is a DC-DC step-down voltage regulator module used to convert a higher DC voltage into a lower adjustable DC voltage. It is widely used in electronics projects, battery-powered systems, robotics, LED power supplies, and DIY circuits.','This module is based on the LM2596 switching regulator IC, which provides efficient voltage conversion with low heat generation. The output voltage can be adjusted using a preset potentiometer on the board. It supports a wide input voltage range and delivers stable output for powering various electronic devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773287158635-747588196.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 03:45:58','2026-03-12 03:45:58'),
(2954,'12.1 inch HDMI LCD Monitor with Touch Raspberry PI','HDW121_001L',NULL,NULL,13800.00,'A 12.1-inch HDMI LCD Monitor with Touch for Raspberry Pi is a medium-size external display module mainly used in electronics projects, embedded systems, and mini-computer applications. This type of monitor connects directly to the Raspberry Pi through the HDMI port for video output and USB interface for touch control, making it easy to install and operate without complex drivers','Most models feature a TFT or IPS LCD panel with resolutions such as 1280 × 800 or 800 × 600, providing clear image quality suitable for graphical interfaces and multimedia use. Many displays support capacitive multi-touch technology with toughened glass protection, ensuring smooth smartphone-like interaction and durability for continuous use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773288134490-637887456.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 04:02:14','2026-03-12 04:02:14'),
(2955,'LM317T',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The LM317T is a popular adjustable positive voltage regulator IC widely used in power supply circuits and electronic projects. It is designed to provide a stable output voltage that can be adjusted from about 1.25 V to 37 V, with an output current capability of up to 1.5 A when proper heat-sinking is provided. This regulator comes in a TO-220 package, making it easy to mount on a heat sink for better thermal performance','The output voltage is set using two external resistors or a variable potentiometer, which allows flexible voltage control for applications such as battery chargers, bench power supplies, LED drivers, and voltage regulation stages in electronic circuits. The LM317T also includes built-in protection features like thermal shutdown, current limiting, and safe-area protection, ensuring reliable and safe operation under varying load conditions. Because of its simplicity, low cost, and versatility, the LM317T is commonly used by students, hobbyists, and engineers in both DIY and industrial electronic designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773290309127-373133610.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 04:38:29','2026-03-12 04:38:29'),
(2956,'Wired mic TT-MIR-BETA58',NULL,NULL,NULL,1999.00,'The TT-MIR-BETA58 wired microphone is a dynamic vocal microphone commonly used for stage performances, public speaking, karaoke singing, and sound system applications. It is designed with a directional pickup pattern (usually super-cardioid or cardioid) that helps focus on the main voice while reducing background noise and feedback, making it suitable for live sound environments. Such microphones generally provide a frequency response around 50 Hz to 16 kHz, allowing clear reproduction of vocals with enhanced mid-range presence and controlled bass effect for close-up singing.','This type of wired mic normally uses a durable metal body, steel mesh grille, and internal shock-mount system to reduce handling noise and withstand rough usage during stage or outdoor programs. It connects through a standard XLR cable or 6.35 mm jack, so it can be easily used with mixers, amplifiers, PA systems, and karaoke machines without requiring external power. Because of its simple operation, reliable performance, and affordable price, the TT-MIR-BETA58 style microphone is widely used in schools, temples, events, and small orchestra setups for clear and powerful voice output.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773294476203-748782050.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 05:47:56','2026-03-12 05:47:56'),
(2957,'Pro Micro ATmega32U4 16MH boards',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'Pro Micro ATmega32U4 boards are small, powerful microcontroller boards based on the ATmega32U4 chip running at 16 MHz, with built-in USB support.','They belong to the Arduino-compatible family and are ideal for compact embedded projects, wearables, keyboards, robotics, and USB-based devices because the USB interface is handled directly by the microcontroller.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773295313756-322750359.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 06:01:53','2026-03-12 06:01:53'),
(2958,'DVD PLAYER TT-444',NULL,NULL,NULL,5998.00,'The Target TT-444 MPEG4 Technology 5.1 Channel DVD Player is a versatile multimedia player designed to bring your favorite movies and music to life with crisp video and immersive sound.','It supports a wide range of formats including DVD, CD, MP3 and MP4, and comes equipped with HDMI output, built-in amplifier, USB and SD/MMC card ports for easy media playback from multiple sources.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773295738412-851738971.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 06:08:58','2026-03-12 06:08:58'),
(2959,'Arduino Lilypad Attiny85',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Arduino LilyPad ATtiny85 is a tiny, sewable microcontroller board designed specifically for wearable electronics and e-textile projects.','It is based on the ATtiny85 microcontroller and features large conductive pads that make it easy to stitch into fabric using conductive thread.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773296695006-420367799.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 06:24:55','2026-03-12 06:24:55'),
(2960,'CJMCU-6075 UV Light Intensity Sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The CJMCU-6075 UV Light Intensity Sensor is a compact sensor module designed to measure ultraviolet (UV) light intensity, including UVA and UVB radiation. It is based on the VEML6075 UV sensor, which provides accurate UV measurements and allows calculation of the UV Index for environmental and safety monitoring applications.','The CJMCU-6075 UV Light Intensity Sensor is a digital sensing module used to measure ultraviolet (UV) radiation. It is based on the VEML6075 sensor IC, which can detect UVA and UVB light and enables accurate calculation of the UV Index. The sensor stores calibration data internally, allowing reliable measurements without complex calibration.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773296814881-806469255.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 06:26:54','2026-03-12 06:26:54'),
(2961,'MCP2515 CAN BUS Module',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The MCP2515 CAN Bus Module is a communication module used to enable CAN (Controller Area Network) protocol on microcontrollers that do not have built-in CAN support. It is based on the MCP2515 standalone CAN controller IC from Microchip and typically works together with a CAN transceiver such as TJA1050 or SN65HVD230.','The MCP2515 CAN Bus Module is a communication interface used to add CAN (Controller Area Network) capability to microcontrollers that do not have a built-in CAN controller. It uses the MCP2515 standalone CAN controller IC and communicates with the host MCU via the SPI interface. Most modules also include a CAN transceiver (such as TJA1050 or SN65HVD230) to connect directly to the CAN bus lines.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773297542682-362127481.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 06:39:02','2026-03-12 06:39:02'),
(2962,'Prototype shield',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A Prototype Shield (Proto Shield) is an add-on expansion board designed to fit directly on top of Arduino boards, allowing users to build, test, and solder custom circuits without designing a separate PCB. It is widely used for prototyping, experimentation, and small embedded projects.','Prototype shields duplicate the Arduino pin layout and provide a general-purpose prototyping area where components can be soldered permanently.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773297762846-545283278.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 06:42:42','2026-03-12 06:42:42'),
(2963,'HLK-B20 bluetooth board',NULL,NULL,NULL,998.00,'The HLK-B20 Bluetooth board is a compact Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) wireless communication module used in embedded electronics and IoT projects for short-distance data transmission. It is designed to provide transparent serial communication, allowing microcontrollers such as Arduino, STM32, or other development boards to send and receive data wirelessly through a simple UART (TX / RX) interface','This Bluetooth board typically includes an integrated antenna, onboard microcontroller, internal memory, and multiple peripheral interfaces such as GPIO, PWM, ADC, SPI, and I²C, enabling flexible use in various circuit designs. It works with a 3.3 V supply voltage and logic level, so level shifting may be required when interfacing with 5 V systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773298191613-855962917.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 06:49:51','2026-03-12 06:49:51'),
(2964,'HLK-B30 bluetooth board',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The HLK-B30 Bluetooth board is a compact wireless communication module developed by Shenzhen Hi-Link Electronic Co., Ltd., designed for IoT and embedded system applications. It is a dual-mode module that combines Wi-Fi (802.11 n) and Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE 4.2) in a single board, allowing devices to communicate both over wireless networks and short-range Bluetooth connections.','The HLK-B30 supports transparent serial communication through interfaces such as UART, SPI, PWM, and GPIO, enabling microcontrollers and control systems to exchange data wirelessly without complex networking development. It can operate in different modes such as serial-to-Wi-Fi station mode, access-point mode, and serial-to-BLE mode, making it suitable for applications like smart home controllers, industrial monitoring systems, wireless data loggers, and mobile-connected devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773298359337-888767986.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 06:52:39','2026-03-12 06:52:39'),
(2965,'Clip for N20 Motor',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The clip for N20 motor is a compact mounting accessory designed to securely hold N20 micro DC gear motors in place during operation.','By ensuring proper alignment and stability of the N20 motor, the clip helps improve performance, accuracy, and overall reliability of the mechanical setup.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773300105668-783409376.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 07:21:45','2026-03-12 07:21:45'),
(2966,'Battery for RC Drone 180mah',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A 180mAh battery for an RC drone is a compact, lightweight Lithium-Polymer (Li-Po) power source designed mainly for mini and nano drones.','Due to its small size and quick charging capability, the 180mAh RC drone battery is widely used in toy drones, micro quadcopters, and DIY lightweight aerial projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773301213074-728410852.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 07:40:13','2026-03-12 07:40:13'),
(2967,'250mah Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 250mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as wearable gadgets, Bluetooth accessories, small IoT modules, remote controls, toys, and DIY electronics projects.','250mAh batteries are ideal where space is limited, though runtime depends on the device’s power consumption and efficiency.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773301961307-745005070.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 07:52:41','2026-03-12 07:52:41'),
(2968,'280mah Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 280mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery commonly used in compact electronic devices such as Bluetooth modules, wearable gadgets, wireless sensors, mini IoT boards, and DIY electronics projects.','with proper charging protection and is often paired with a PCM/BMS protection circuit to prevent over-charge, over-discharge, and short-circuit conditions.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773302037046-63086108.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 07:53:57','2026-03-12 07:53:57'),
(2969,'400Mah battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A 400 mAh battery is a small-capacity rechargeable battery, most commonly available as a 3.7 V Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (LiPo) cell.','It is widely used in compact, low-power electronic devices where small size, light weight, and portability are important.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773303377771-998065250.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 08:16:17','2026-03-12 08:16:17'),
(2970,'450mah battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A 450 mAh battery is a compact rechargeable battery, most commonly available as a 3.7 V Lithium-ion (Li-ion) or Lithium-polymer (Li-Po) cell.','It’s used in portable and low-power electronics where a balance of small size, light weight, and longer backup time is required compared to lower-capacity cells.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773303496984-754731155.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 08:18:16','2026-03-12 08:18:16'),
(2971,'ATMEGA328P NANO',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The ATmega328P Nano is a compact microcontroller development board based on the ATmega328P AVR microcontroller, widely used in electronics learning, prototyping, and embedded system projects. It is similar in functionality to the Arduino Uno but comes in a small breadboard-friendly form factor, making it ideal for space-constrained applications. The board typically operates at a 5 V logic level with a 16 MHz clock speed and provides 32 KB Flash memory, 2 KB SRAM, and 1 KB EEPROM for program storage and data handling.','The Nano includes 14 digital input/output pins (6 PWM outputs), 8 analog input pins, UART serial communication, SPI and I²C interfaces, allowing easy connection to sensors, displays, relays, and communication modules. It can be powered through a Mini-USB port, VIN pin (about 7–12 V), or regulated 5 V supply, and supports simple programming using the Arduino IDE via USB bootloader.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773305771406-548861433.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 08:56:11','2026-03-12 08:56:11'),
(2972,'Soldron BIT 25W Flat',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The Soldron 25W Flat Bit is a replacement soldering iron tip specially designed for use with 25-watt Soldron soldering irons. It features a flat (spade-type) tip shape, which provides better heat transfer and wider contact area compared to pointed tips, making it ideal for general-purpose soldering work such as joining wires, PCB pads, terminals, and small electronic components. These bits are usually made from high-quality copper with nickel or iron plating, which helps improve durability, corrosion resistance, and consistent heat conduction during soldering operations.','This flat bit is suitable for electronics repair, DIY circuit assembly, school laboratory work, and service-center applications, where moderate heating power and precise solder flow are required. The tip heats up quickly when fitted into a compatible 25 W soldering iron and helps create strong and reliable solder joints while reducing the risk of damaging delicate components. Because of its simple installation, low cost, and long service life, the Soldron 25W flat soldering bit is widely used by technicians, students, and hobbyists in everyday electronic soldering tasks.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773309988975-893856696.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 10:06:28','2026-03-12 10:06:28'),
(2973,'Soldron Pointed Bit 25w',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The Soldron Pointed Bit 25W is a fine-tip replacement soldering iron bit specially designed for 25-watt Soldron soldering irons. It features a needle-type pointed tip, which provides precise heat transfer and allows accurate soldering of small electronic components, PCB tracks, IC pins, and delicate connections. These bits are generally made from high-quality copper with nickel or iron plating, ensuring good thermal conductivity, corrosion resistance, and longer service life during continuous use.','Because of its sharp and narrow tip shape, this soldering bit is ideal for precision electronics work, mobile repairing, circuit prototyping, and laboratory applications, where controlled solder flow and detailed work are required. The bit heats up quickly and helps form clean and reliable solder joints without applying excessive heat to surrounding components. With its simple fitting design, low cost, and dependable performance, the Soldron 25W pointed bit is widely used by technicians, students, and hobbyists for everyday fine soldering tasks.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773310177984-924675320.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 10:09:37','2026-03-12 10:09:37'),
(2974,'9V Cap to Dc Pin',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 9 V Cap to DC Pin connector is a small power adapter cable used to convert a standard 9-volt battery connection into a DC barrel plug output. It consists of a 9 V battery snap cap (with positive and negative terminals) on one side and a male DC plug (commonly 5.5 mm × 2.1 mm) on the other side. This connector allows easy powering of electronic devices and DIY circuits that require a DC input, without the need for soldering directly to the battery.','It is commonly used in Arduino projects, wireless modules, CCTV cameras, routers, LED circuits, toys, and portable electronic devices, where a compact battery power source is needed. The cable is usually made with insulated copper wires and molded plastic connectors for safe handling and reliable power transfer. Because of its simple plug-and-play design, low cost, and convenience, the 9 V cap to DC pin adapter is widely used by students, hobbyists, and technicians for temporary power supply and testing applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773310560280-997936052.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 10:16:00','2026-03-12 10:16:00'),
(2975,'BAFO 810 Connector',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The BAFO BF-810 is a USB-to-Serial (RS-232) adapter cable that lets you convert a modern computer’s USB port into a traditional DB-9 RS-232 serial port. It’s widely used to connect devices that require serial communication (like modems, POS systems, barcode scanners, routers, industrial equipment, GPS units, etc.) to computers that no longer include native serial ports.','The BAFO 810 Connector (BF-810) is a USB-to-Serial RS-232 adapter designed to connect legacy serial devices to modern computers that no longer have a built-in COM port. It converts a standard USB port into a DB9 (RS-232) serial interface, making it ideal for use with devices such as industrial controllers, modems, routers, POS machines, barcode scanners, and measurement equipment.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773311045540-146384525.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 10:24:05','2026-03-12 10:24:05'),
(2976,'HDMI Jointer',NULL,NULL,NULL,299.00,'HDMI Jointer (also known as an HDMI coupler) is a compact connector used to join two HDMI cables together, effectively extending the overall cable length without signal conversion. It features HDMI female ports on both sides, allowing quick and secure connection between standard HDMI cables while maintaining high-definition audio and video quality.','HDMI jointers are widely used in home theaters, LED/LCD TVs, monitors, projectors, gaming consoles, and conference room setups where longer cable runs are required. Designed to support HD, Full HD, and even 4K resolution (depending on quality), the HDMI jointer ensures stable signal transmission with minimal loss. It is a simple, cost-effective, and practical solution for extending HDMI connections without replacing existing cables.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773311541646-24048347.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 10:32:21','2026-03-12 10:32:21'),
(2977,'10D431 MOV Thermister',NULL,NULL,NULL,199.00,'10D431 MOV Thermistor is a protective electronic component used to limit inrush current and suppress voltage surges in power circuits. The NTC (Negative Temperature Coefficient) thermistor characteristic means its resistance is high at room temperature and decreases as it heats up, helping to control sudden current spikes when equipment is switched ON. The 10D431 rating typically indicates a disc-type component designed to handle high energy and surge conditions.','This component is commonly used in SMPS, inverters, UPS systems, adapters, battery chargers, motor drives, and other AC-powered electronic equipment. When combined with surge protection functionality (often associated with MOV behavior), it helps protect sensitive components from voltage transients, spikes, and electrical stress. Reliable, cost-effective, and easy to integrate, the NTC 10D431 MOV thermistor improves circuit safety, stability, and overall lifespan of electronic devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773312502777-841431696.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 10:48:22','2026-03-12 10:48:22'),
(2978,'6 inch K Sonic Woofer',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'6 Inch K Sonic Woofer is a compact yet powerful speaker driver designed to reproduce low-frequency bass sounds in audio systems. It is commonly used in home theatre systems, portable speakers, sound boxes, and multimedia speaker setups. The woofer features a durable cone, strong magnet, and stable suspension that helps deliver clear bass and balanced sound output.','This woofer is typically available in impedance ratings such as 4 ohms or 8 ohms and supports moderate power handling suitable for small to medium amplifier systems. The frame is usually made from metal or reinforced material to maintain stability and reduce distortion during high volume output. The K Sonic woofer is compatible with various audio devices including amplifiers, DJ speaker boxes, and DIY sound systems.','6 inch K Sonic woofer should be installed in a properly sized speaker cabinet to achieve optimal bass response and sound quality. Using the correct amplifier power rating will help prevent damage to the voice coil and ensure long-term durability. Proper wiring with good quality speaker cables is recommended for efficient audio transmission. Avoid exposing the woofer to moisture, dust, or extreme heat to maintain its performance.',NULL,'products/1773312869606-33594535.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 10:54:29','2026-03-12 10:54:29'),
(2979,'12V Clip',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'12V Clip is a practical electrical connector used to quickly connect or disconnect a 12V DC power source, such as batteries, power supplies, or test equipment. It typically consists of insulated alligator-type clips or snap connectors with attached wires, allowing secure temporary connections without soldering. The insulation helps prevent short circuits and ensures safe handling during use.','This clip is widely used in battery testing, automotive work, electronics servicing, DIY projects, and laboratory experiments. Designed for ease of use and reliable contact, the 12V clip provides stable power transfer and flexibility for quick setups and troubleshooting. It is a convenient and cost-effective accessory for 12V power applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773313119231-711261211.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 10:58:39','2026-03-12 10:58:39'),
(2980,'USB Male Socket',NULL,NULL,NULL,199.00,'USB Male Socket (USB Male Connector) is a standard plug-type interface used to supply power and enable data transfer between electronic devices. It is designed to be inserted into a USB female port, such as those found on computers, chargers, power banks, and adapters. Commonly available in USB-A, Micro-USB, and Type-C formats, the male USB socket ensures a secure and stable connection.','USB male sockets are widely used in charging cables, data cables, DIY electronics projects, power modules, and device repair applications. Built with durable metal contacts and insulated housing, they provide reliable current flow and consistent data transmission. Compact and easy to use, the USB male socket is an essential component for modern electronic connectivity and power solutions.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773313216484-505798247.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 11:00:16','2026-03-12 11:00:16'),
(2981,'10 RELAY GSM with DTMF-TIMER- 7 INPUT Trigger',NULL,NULL,NULL,299.00,'The 10 Relay GSM Controller with DTMF Timer and 7-Input Trigger is an advanced remote switching and automation control module used to operate multiple electrical devices through mobile phone networks or external trigger signals. This system typically includes 10 independent relay outputs, allowing users to turn ON or OFF appliances such as pumps, lights, motors, gates, and industrial equipment from a remote location using a GSM SIM-based connection','The controller also features a built-in timer function, enabling scheduled switching of connected loads for applications like irrigation systems, street lighting, generator control, and energy management. In addition, the 7 external trigger input ports allow sensors, switches, or alarm devices to automatically activate specific relays or send alerts based on predefined conditions',NULL,NULL,'products/1773313845906-758212077.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-12 11:10:45','2026-03-12 11:10:45'),
(2982,'RM-L 1659 Universal Remote','RM-L1659',NULL,NULL,1.00,'This remote works using infrared (IR) signal and is designed to support several Smart TV brands and universal TV motherboards.','Compatible list of tv skyworth, yasin, ecostar, onida, panasonic, nokia, vu, motorola, thomson, kodak','Do not drop or hit the remote on hard surfaces.',NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-03-12 11:20:45','2026-03-12 11:20:45'),
(2983,'BAR CODE SCANNER - USB HOST for Arduino',NULL,NULL,NULL,1999.00,'The USB Host Barcode Scanner for Arduino is an input device used to read printed barcodes and send the decoded data directly to an Arduino or compatible microcontroller. These scanners are designed to work through a USB Host interface, which means the Arduino must be connected using a USB Host Shield or a microcontroller board with built-in USB Host support.','When a barcode is scanned, the scanner converts the pattern into digital characters (numbers or letters) and transmits the data to the Arduino as a serial or keyboard-emulation (HID) signal, making it easy to process product IDs, inventory codes, or access information in embedded projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773375427049-708062464.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 04:17:07','2026-03-13 04:17:07'),
(2984,'LCD Display 16x2 with I2C',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The 16×2 LCD Display with I²C interface is a commonly used alphanumeric display module in electronics and Arduino projects, designed to show 16 characters per line across 2 lines. Unlike standard parallel LCD modules, this version includes an I²C backpack (adapter board) that allows communication through only two data lines – SDA (data) and SCL (clock), along with power connections. This greatly reduces the number of microcontroller pins required and simplifies wiring, making it ideal for beginners and compact circuit designs.','The display is typically based on the HD44780 controller, operates at 5 V supply voltage, and features an adjustable contrast potentiometer and backlight control on the I²C board. It can be easily interfaced with Arduino, Raspberry Pi, ESP8266, ESP32, and other microcontrollers using available libraries, allowing users to display sensor readings, menu systems, time, temperature, or status messages.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773375788119-293344913.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 04:23:08','2026-03-13 04:23:08'),
(2985,'LCD 16X2 with Female Header',NULL,NULL,NULL,699.00,'The LCD 16×2 with Female Header is a standard alphanumeric liquid crystal display module designed to show 16 characters in each line and a total of 2 lines. In this version, the display comes with a pre-soldered female header connector, which makes it easy to plug jumper wires or male pin connectors directly without soldering. This simplifies circuit assembly and is especially useful for breadboard prototyping, Arduino projects, and educational electronics experiments.','These LCD modules are usually based on the HD44780 controller, operate on a 5 V power supply, and use a parallel communication interface that requires multiple data and control pins (such as RS, EN, D4–D7). They also include pins for contrast adjustment and LED backlight, allowing clear visibility of displayed text in different lighting conditions.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773376008966-105466872.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 04:26:48','2026-03-13 04:26:48'),
(2986,'RR LC-1672 UNI-47 remote ','LC-1672',NULL,NULL,1.00,'This remote works using infrared (IR) signal technology to communicate with the TV sensor. It is usually pre-programmed to support multiple TV brands, so in many cases it works plug-and-play without setup, while some TVs may require simple code matching.','Universal models like LC-1672 are designed to provide basic TV operations such as power, volume, channel change, menu navigation, input selection, and settings control.','Do not drop or hit the remote on hard surfaces.',NULL,'products/1773376590295-357304667.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-03-13 04:36:30','2026-03-13 07:47:09'),
(2987,'Breadboard 840 Tie Points',NULL,NULL,NULL,699.00,'The Breadboard 840 Tie Points is a reusable solderless prototyping board widely used in electronics for building and testing circuits without permanent soldering. It typically features 840 connection points (tie points) arranged in a grid pattern, including two long power rails on both sides for easy distribution of VCC and GND across the circuit. The central area is divided by a gap, allowing DIP ICs, microcontrollers, and modules to be mounted conveniently. Each row of tie points is internally connected, enabling quick insertion of resistors, capacitors, LEDs, transistors, jumper wires, and other components to form working circuits.','Breadboards are commonly made with a durable ABS plastic body and phosphor bronze or nickel-plated spring clips inside, ensuring good electrical contact and long service life. The 840-point size provides ample space for medium to large projects, making it ideal for Arduino prototyping, educational experiments, circuit design testing, robotics projects, and DIY electronics development.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773381507728-785863032.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 05:58:27','2026-03-13 05:58:27'),
(2988,'Zeb 9PPM2UM 9 port POE Switch',NULL,NULL,NULL,1999.00,'The 8-Port 10/100 Mbps Desktop Switch is a compact networking device used to connect multiple computers, printers, IP cameras, smart TVs, and other Ethernet-enabled devices within a local area network (LAN). It provides eight RJ-45 Ethernet ports, each supporting data transfer speeds of up to 10 Mbps or 100 Mbps (Fast Ethernet) with automatic speed detection and duplex mode adjustment.','Most desktop switches feature plug-and-play operation, meaning they do not require software configuration and can start working immediately after connecting the power adapter and network cables. They often include auto-MDI/MDIX support, eliminating the need for crossover cables, along with LED indicators for power, link, and activity status. Because of their simple installation, stable performance, and cost-effective networking capability, 8-port 10/100 Mbps switches are widely used in homes, small offices, shops, classrooms, CCTV installations, and small business networks to expand wired network connectivity efficiently.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773386843145-151455820.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 07:27:23','2026-03-13 07:27:23'),
(2989,'CAT6 Networking Cable',NULL,NULL,NULL,14999.00,'The CAT6 Networking Cable (Category 6 cable) is a high-performance Ethernet cable used for connecting network devices such as computers, routers, switches, IP cameras, and smart TVs in local area networks. It is designed to support high-speed data transmission up to 1 Gbps for distances up to 100 meters, and can handle frequencies up to 250 MHz, which helps reduce signal interference and maintain stable connectivity. CAT6 cables usually contain four twisted pairs of insulated copper wires, along with improved internal separation or shielding that minimizes crosstalk and electromagnetic interference compared to older CAT5 cables.','These cables are commonly available in UTP (Unshielded Twisted Pair) and STP (Shielded Twisted Pair) types, with standard RJ-45 connectors for easy plug-and-play installation. Because of their fast speed, reliable performance, and compatibility with modern networking equipment, CAT6 networking cables are widely used in home internet connections, office LAN setups, CCTV camera installations, data centers, and industrial network systems. They are also suitable for future-ready networking, as they can support higher bandwidth applications like HD video streaming, online gaming, and large data transfers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773387360381-272865326.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 07:36:00','2026-03-13 07:36:00'),
(2990,'Mist Maker',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'A Mist Maker is an electronic device used to produce cool water mist or fog for decorative, humidifying, or environmental control purposes. It works using ultrasonic vibration technology, where a small ceramic diaphragm vibrates at a very high frequency to break water into fine microscopic droplets, creating a visible mist without heating the water. Mist makers usually operate on low-voltage DC power through an external adapter and are designed to be placed in a water container such as a bowl, fountain, or humidifier tank.','These devices are commonly used in indoor fountains, aquariums, terrariums, plant nurseries, stage effects, air humidifiers, and decorative lighting setups, as they help maintain moisture levels and enhance visual appearance with a fog-like effect. Many models include LED lights that illuminate the mist, adding aesthetic value for home décor and event displays. Because of their silent operation, low power consumption, and simple installation, mist makers are widely used in homes, shops, gardens, and electronic DIY projects where controlled mist or humidity is required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773387857656-504483416.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 07:44:17','2026-03-13 07:44:17'),
(2991,'mi voice remote ver 8',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'This remote usually works through Bluetooth or infrared (IR) connection depending on the model. It is made with a lightweight plastic body and soft rubber keypad.','The Mi Voice Remote Version 8 is a replacement / universal smart TV remote designed for many Mi / Xiaomi Android LED TVs.','Easy search using Google voice assistant',NULL,'products/1773388422474-534117157.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 07:53:42','2026-03-13 07:53:42'),
(2992,'LM35 DZ',NULL,NULL,NULL,10.00,'The LM35DZ is a precision analog temperature sensor IC widely used in electronic circuits to measure ambient temperature. It provides an output voltage that is directly proportional to temperature in degrees Celsius, with a typical scale factor of 10 mV per °C (for example, 250 mV output at 25 °C). This makes it very easy to interface with microcontrollers such as Arduino, PIC, AVR, and other data-acquisition systems, since no external calibration is generally required.','The sensor operates over a temperature range of approximately 0 °C to 100 °C (LM35DZ version) and requires only a low supply voltage (about 4 V to 30 V) with very low current consumption, making it suitable for battery-powered applications. It is usually available in a TO-92 transistor-type package, which is compact and convenient for PCB mounting or breadboard use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773388460103-178011737.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 07:54:20','2026-03-13 07:54:20'),
(2993,'74HC74',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC74 is a high-speed CMOS dual D-type flip-flop integrated circuit commonly used in digital electronics for storing and controlling binary data. It contains two independent flip-flops, each having data (D), clock (CLK), set (PRE), reset (CLR), and complementary outputs (Q and Q̅). The flip-flop transfers the logic level present at the D input to the Q output on the rising edge of the clock signal, making it useful for synchronized data storage and timing applications.','This IC operates with a wide supply voltage range (typically 2 V to 6 V) and offers low power consumption with high noise immunity, which are key advantages of CMOS logic devices. It is usually available in DIP and SMD packages, allowing easy use in breadboard circuits as well as compact PCB designs. Because of its reliable edge-triggered operation and built-in preset and clear functions, the 74HC74 is widely used in frequency dividers, data registers, counters, shift registers, timing circuits, and digital control systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773389597594-316697697.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:13:17','2026-03-13 08:13:17'),
(2994,'74HC132',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC132 is a high-speed CMOS logic integrated circuit that contains four independent 2-input NAND gates with Schmitt-trigger inputs. These Schmitt-trigger inputs provide hysteresis, which improves noise immunity and allows the IC to work reliably with slow-changing or noisy signals such as those from switches, sensors, or RC timing circuits. The device typically operates over a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption and fast switching performance suitable for modern digital electronics designs.','Each gate produces a logic LOW output only when both inputs are HIGH, otherwise the output remains HIGH, following standard NAND logic operation. The IC is commonly available in DIP-14 and surface-mount packages, making it easy to use in breadboard prototypes as well as compact PCB assemblies. Because of its built-in noise filtering capability and versatile logic function, the 74HC132 is widely used in oscillator circuits, waveform shaping, debounce circuits, timing applications, digital control systems, and signal conditioning stages in embedded and electronic projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773389692203-363871292.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:14:52','2026-03-13 08:14:52'),
(2995,'74HC154',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC154 is a high-speed CMOS 4-to-16 line decoder / demultiplexer integrated circuit used in digital electronics for selecting one output line from many using binary input signals. It accepts four binary address inputs (A0–A3) and activates one of the sixteen output lines, making it useful for applications that require device selection or data routing. The outputs of this IC are active-LOW, meaning the selected output becomes LOW while all other outputs remain HIGH.','This device typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, providing low power consumption and good noise immunity compared to standard TTL logic. It also includes two enable inputs, which allow the decoder to be easily controlled or cascaded with other logic devices in complex digital systems. The 74HC154 is usually available in DIP and SMD packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773389786953-72675812.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:16:26','2026-03-13 08:16:26'),
(2996,'74HC163',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC163 is a high-speed CMOS synchronous 4-bit binary counter integrated circuit used in digital electronics for counting pulses and timing operations. It features four internal flip-flops that count in binary sequence from 0000 to 1111 (0 to 15) based on the rising edge of the clock signal, making it suitable for precise and synchronized counting applications. Unlike ripple counters, the 74HC163 is a synchronous counter, meaning all flip-flops are triggered at the same time, which helps reduce propagation delay and improves overall circuit performance.','This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption and good noise immunity. It includes useful control inputs such as clear (reset), load (parallel preset), count enable, and terminal count output, allowing it to be easily cascaded with other counters to create higher-bit counting systems. The 74HC163 is commonly available in DIP-16 and SMD packages, making it convenient for both breadboard prototyping and PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773389872992-158617382.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:17:52','2026-03-13 08:17:52'),
(2997,'74HC164',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC164 is a high-speed CMOS 8-bit serial-in, parallel-out shift register integrated circuit used in digital electronics for data storage, signal conversion, and output expansion. It accepts data serially through its input pins (A and B) and shifts the data into the internal register on each rising edge of the clock signal, making the stored bits available simultaneously at the eight parallel output pins (Q0–Q7). This allows a microcontroller or logic circuit to control multiple outputs using only a few input lines.','The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, providing low power consumption, fast switching performance, and good noise immunity typical of CMOS logic devices. It also includes a clear (reset) input that quickly resets all outputs to LOW when activated, which is useful in initialization and timing control applications. The 74HC164 is generally available in DIP-14 and SMD packages, making it suitable for breadboard experiments as well as compact PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773390155288-439954463.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:22:35','2026-03-13 08:22:35'),
(2998,'74HC193',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC193 is a high-speed CMOS synchronous 4-bit up/down binary counter integrated circuit used in digital electronics for counting applications that require both incrementing and decrementing functions. It contains four internal flip-flops that allow the counter to count from 0 to 15 in binary form, either in the upward direction or downward direction depending on which clock input is triggered. The device has separate clock inputs for UP count and DOWN count, enabling flexible control in timing circuits, frequency division, and sequence generation systems.','This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption and fast switching performance. It also includes useful control features such as asynchronous clear (reset) and parallel load inputs, which allow the counter to be preset to a specific value or quickly reset during operation. The outputs are available in parallel binary form, making it easy to interface with displays, decoders, and microcontrollers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773390849457-210606213.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:34:09','2026-03-13 08:34:09'),
(2999,'74HC244',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC244 is a high-speed CMOS octal buffer / line driver integrated circuit used in digital electronics to increase signal driving capability and isolate data lines between different parts of a circuit. It contains eight non-inverting buffer channels arranged in two groups of four, each controlled by a separate output enable (OE) input. When the enable pin is activated, the input signals are passed to the outputs; when disabled, the outputs go into a high-impedance (tri-state) condition, allowing multiple devices to share the same data bus without interference.','This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, fast switching speed, and high noise immunity characteristic of CMOS logic. The 74HC244 is commonly available in DIP-20 and SMD packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs. Because of its ability to strengthen digital signals and provide bus control, it is widely used in microcontroller interfacing, memory address buffering, data bus expansion, display driving, and general digital signal transmission applications in both educational and industrial electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773390909832-126698071.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:35:09','2026-03-13 08:35:09'),
(3000,'74HC245',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC245 is a high-speed CMOS octal bidirectional bus transceiver integrated circuit used in digital electronics to transfer data between two buses or groups of digital lines. It contains eight bidirectional data channels, allowing signals to flow either from the A bus to the B bus or from the B bus to the A bus. The direction of data flow is controlled by a DIR (direction) input pin, while an OE (output enable) pin allows the outputs to be placed in a high-impedance (tri-state) mode, making it possible for multiple devices to share the same data bus without conflict.','This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, providing low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance. It is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs. Because of its reliable bidirectional buffering capability, the 74HC245 is widely used in microcontroller and memory interfacing, data bus expansion, communication systems, display control circuits, and general digital signal transmission applications in both educational and industrial electronic designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773391101556-843921886.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:38:21','2026-03-13 08:38:21'),
(3001,'74HC259',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC259 is a high-speed CMOS 8-bit addressable latch integrated circuit used in digital electronics for storing and controlling individual output states. It allows a microcontroller or logic circuit to select one of eight output lines using three address inputs (A0–A2) and then set or reset that selected output through the data input and control signals. This makes it possible to control multiple devices such as LEDs, relays, or logic lines using only a few control pins.','The IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, fast switching speed, and good noise immunity typical of CMOS devices. It includes clear and enable control features, allowing all outputs to be reset simultaneously or placed under controlled operation during system initialization. The outputs remain latched until a new command is given, making the device suitable for memory-type control functions.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773391291482-307514270.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:41:31','2026-03-13 08:41:31'),
(3002,'RM-L1729 IN Remote','RM-L1729 IN',NULL,NULL,1.00,'The RM-L1729 IN Remote is a high-quality universal TV remote designed to work seamlessly with a wide range of LED, LCD, and Smart TV brands.','This remote works using infrared (IR) signal and in some versions Bluetooth (voice models). Many RM-L1729 remotes are non-voice types, meaning they support normal TV controls but do not have microphone or voice assistant.','Compatible with Samsung Smart LED Tv (Non Voice)',NULL,'products/1773391292766-114717394.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:41:32','2026-03-13 08:41:32'),
(3003,'74HC273',NULL,NULL,NULL,48.00,'The 74HC273 is a high-speed CMOS octal D-type flip-flop integrated circuit used in digital electronics for storing and transferring 8-bit parallel data. It contains eight edge-triggered D flip-flops with common clock and asynchronous clear inputs, allowing data present at the input pins (D0–D7) to be transferred simultaneously to the output pins (Q0–Q7) on the rising edge of the clock signal. This makes it useful for temporary data storage, synchronization, and buffering between digital circuits.','The IC typically operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, providing low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance characteristic of CMOS logic devices. It includes a master reset (clear) input, which allows all outputs to be set to LOW instantly during system initialization or fault conditions. The outputs remain stable until the next clock pulse updates the stored data.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773391364636-952003063.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:42:44','2026-03-13 08:42:44'),
(3004,'74HC367',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC367 is a high-speed CMOS hex buffer / line driver integrated circuit used in digital electronics to strengthen logic signals and isolate different sections of a circuit. It contains six non-inverting buffer channels, arranged in two groups, each controlled by a separate output enable (OE) input. When the enable pin is active, the input signals are passed to the outputs; when disabled, the outputs go into a high-impedance (tri-state) condition, allowing multiple devices to share the same signal lines or data bus without interference.','This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, fast switching speed, and good noise immunity typical of CMOS logic families. It is commonly available in DIP-16 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs. Because of its signal buffering and bus-control capability, the 74HC367 is widely used in microcontroller interfacing, memory addressing circuits, display driving systems, communication lines, and general digital signal transmission applications where stable and reliable logic levels are required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773391442852-633857554.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:44:02','2026-03-13 08:44:02'),
(3005,'74HC373',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC373 is a high-speed CMOS octal transparent latch integrated circuit used in digital electronics for temporary storage and buffering of 8-bit parallel data. It contains eight D-type latches with three-state outputs, allowing data applied at the input pins (D0–D7) to appear at the outputs (Q0–Q7) whenever the Latch Enable (LE) input is HIGH. When the LE signal goes LOW, the data present at that moment is latched and held at the outputs until the next update.','The IC also includes an Output Enable (OE) control pin, which can place all outputs in a high-impedance (tri-state) condition, making it suitable for shared data bus applications and microcontroller interfacing. The 74HC373 typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, fast switching speed, and high noise immunity typical of CMOS logic devices. It is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773391655797-728724102.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:47:35','2026-03-13 08:47:35'),
(3006,'74HC374',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC374 is a high-speed CMOS octal D-type edge-triggered flip-flop integrated circuit used in digital electronics for storing and transferring 8-bit parallel data. It contains eight flip-flops with a common clock input and three-state outputs, allowing data present at the input pins (D0–D7) to be transferred to the output pins (Q0–Q7) on the rising edge of the clock signal. Once latched, the outputs remain stable until the next clock pulse updates the stored information, making it suitable for synchronized data handling in digital systems.','The IC also features an Output Enable (OE) control, which can place all outputs in a high-impedance (tri-state) condition so that multiple devices can share the same data bus without conflict. It typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, providing low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance typical of the HC CMOS logic family. The 74HC374 is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773391713083-21424086.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:48:33','2026-03-13 08:48:33'),
(3007,'74HC541',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC541 is a high-speed CMOS octal buffer / line driver integrated circuit used in digital electronics to strengthen logic signals and isolate data buses between different sections of a circuit. It contains eight non-inverting buffer channels with three-state (tri-state) outputs, allowing the device to drive multiple loads or share a common data bus without signal interference. The outputs are controlled by two Output Enable (OE) pins, which can place all outputs into a high-impedance state when disabled, making the IC suitable for bus-controlled systems and microcontroller interfacing.','This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance characteristic of CMOS logic devices. It is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs. Because of its signal buffering and bus-driving capability, the 74HC541 is widely used in memory address buffering, data line isolation, display driving circuits, communication interfaces, and general digital signal transmission applications where stable and reliable logic levels are required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773391784667-601783397.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:49:44','2026-03-13 08:49:44'),
(3008,'Realme Smart TV Remote ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Realme Smart TV remote is a replacement or original remote control used to operate Realme Android / Google Smart TVs.','compatible for Realme TV Remote control.','Realme TV remotes work using infrared (IR), Bluetooth, or USB-dongle wireless connection depending on the model.',NULL,'products/1773392389883-241190306.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:59:49','2026-03-13 08:59:49'),
(3009,'74HC573',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC573 is a high-speed CMOS octal transparent latch integrated circuit used in digital electronics for temporary storage and buffering of 8-bit parallel data. It contains eight D-type latches with three-state outputs, allowing data present at the input pins (D0–D7) to appear at the outputs (Q0–Q7) whenever the Latch Enable (LE) input is HIGH. When the LE signal goes LOW, the current data is latched and held at the outputs until a new enable signal is applied, making it useful for synchronized data transfer and bus control applications.','The IC also includes an Output Enable (OE) control pin, which can place all outputs in a high-impedance (tri-state) condition so that multiple devices can safely share the same data lines. The 74HC573 typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance typical of the HC CMOS logic family. It is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773392392745-337675150.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 08:59:52','2026-03-13 08:59:52'),
(3010,'74HC574',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC574 is a high-speed CMOS octal D-type edge-triggered flip-flop integrated circuit used in digital electronics for storing and transferring 8-bit parallel data in a synchronized manner. It contains eight flip-flops with a common clock input, so the logic levels present at the input pins (D0–D7) are transferred simultaneously to the output pins (Q0–Q7) on the rising edge of the clock signal. Once stored, the outputs remain stable until the next clock pulse updates the data, making the device suitable for timing-controlled data handling and register applications.','The IC also includes a three-state output enable (OE) control, which allows all outputs to be placed in a high-impedance state so multiple devices can share the same data bus without interference. The 74HC574 typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, fast switching performance, and good noise immunity typical of CMOS logic. It is commonly available in DIP-20 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for both breadboard prototyping and compact PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773392482496-647992848.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 09:01:22','2026-03-13 09:01:22'),
(3011,'74HC4052',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC4052 is a high-speed CMOS dual 4-channel analog multiplexer / demultiplexer integrated circuit used in electronic circuits to select and route analog or digital signals. It contains two independent switching sections, each capable of connecting one common input/output pin to one of four selectable channels, allowing signal sharing and efficient input expansion. The selection of channels is controlled by two address (select) inputs, while an additional enable (inhibit) pin can disconnect all channels when required.','This IC typically operates with a wide supply voltage range, supporting single-supply operation (about 2 V to 10 V) or dual-supply operation (up to ±5 V), which makes it suitable for handling both positive and negative analog signals. It offers low ON resistance, low power consumption, and good signal isolation, ensuring accurate signal switching in measurement and communication circuits. The 74HC4052 is commonly available in DIP-16 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773392944274-821598312.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 09:09:04','2026-03-13 09:09:04'),
(3012,'74HC4075',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC4075 is a high-speed CMOS logic integrated circuit that contains three independent 3-input OR gates. Each gate produces a HIGH output when any one or more of its three inputs are HIGH, making the device useful for combining multiple logic signals in digital circuits. Because it belongs to the HC logic family, the IC offers low power consumption, high noise immunity, and fast switching performance, which are important for reliable operation in modern electronic designs.','The 74HC4075 typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, allowing it to be used with both low-voltage and standard 5-volt digital systems. It is commonly available in DIP-14 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB layouts. Due to its simple OR logic function and stable performance, the IC is widely used in digital control circuits, signal combining stages, alarm logic systems, microcontroller interfacing, and general-purpose logic design applications in educational, hobby, and industrial electronics projects.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773393052659-185706659.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 09:10:52','2026-03-13 09:10:52'),
(3013,'74HC4538',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HC4538 is a high-speed CMOS dual precision monostable multivibrator (one-shot timer) integrated circuit used in digital and timing applications to generate accurate pulse widths. It contains two independent monostable circuits, each capable of producing a single output pulse when triggered by an input signal. The duration of the output pulse can be set using external resistor and capacitor components, allowing designers to create precise delays or timing intervals.','This IC typically operates with a supply voltage range of about 2 V to 6 V, offering low power consumption, high noise immunity, and stable operation typical of CMOS logic devices. It supports triggering from both rising and falling edges, and includes features such as retriggerable operation and reset control, which provide flexibility in pulse generation and timing control circuits. The device is commonly available in DIP-16 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for both breadboard prototyping and compact PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773393398425-991589316.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 09:16:38','2026-03-13 09:16:38'),
(3014,'74F74',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74F74 is a high-speed TTL dual D-type positive-edge-triggered flip-flop integrated circuit used in digital electronics for storing and synchronizing binary data. It contains two independent flip-flops, each having inputs for Data (D), Clock (CLK), Preset (PRE), and Clear (CLR) along with complementary outputs Q and Q̅. On the rising edge of the clock signal, the logic level present at the D input is transferred to the Q output, allowing reliable data storage and timing control in sequential logic circuits.','This device belongs to the Fast TTL (74F) logic family, which provides very high switching speed and low propagation delay compared to standard TTL devices, making it suitable for high-frequency digital systems. The IC typically operates with a 5 V power supply, and its asynchronous preset and clear inputs allow immediate setting or resetting of the flip-flop outputs independent of the clock. It is usually available in DIP-14 and surface-mount packages, enabling easy use in breadboard prototypes as well as compact PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773394476561-404364682.png',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 09:34:36','2026-03-13 09:34:36'),
(3015,'75150',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 75150 is a 16-channel digital multiplexer integrated circuit commonly used in digital electronics to select one input signal from multiple data lines and route it to a single output. It features sixteen input channels and four binary select (address) inputs, which determine which input is connected to the output at any given time. This makes it useful for expanding data handling capability in microcontroller systems, communication circuits, and digital control applications where multiple signals must be monitored or processed using limited input lines.','The device is typically designed to operate with a standard 5 V logic supply, and many versions use TTL-compatible logic levels, allowing easy interfacing with microprocessors, memory circuits, and other logic devices. Some variants provide inverted or active-LOW output logic, so designers must consider this while integrating the IC into their circuit. The 75150 is usually available in DIP packages, making it suitable for breadboard experiments as well as PCB implementations.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773394714690-155543322.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 09:38:34','2026-03-13 09:38:34'),
(3016,'ULN2003 IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The ULN2003 IC is a popular 7-channel Darlington transistor driver array used in electronic circuits to control high-voltage or high-current loads using low-power logic signals from microcontrollers and digital ICs. Each channel consists of a pair of transistors connected in a Darlington configuration, which provides high current gain and allows output currents up to about 500 mA per channel with load voltages up to around 50 V. This makes the IC suitable for driving devices such as relays, stepper motors, solenoids, lamps, buzzers, and LED arrays.','The ULN2003 features open-collector outputs and includes built-in flyback protection diodes connected to a common COM pin, which helps protect the circuit from voltage spikes produced by inductive loads. It is designed to work directly with TTL and CMOS logic levels, making it easy to interface with controllers like Arduino, PIC, AVR, and other embedded systems. The IC usually operates from a standard logic input supply and does not require a separate driver stage, simplifying circuit design.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773396606560-724352896.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 10:10:06','2026-03-13 10:10:06'),
(3017,'ULN2004 IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The ULN2004 IC is a 7-channel high-current Darlington transistor array designed to drive relays, solenoids, stepper motors, lamps, LED strips, and other inductive or high-power loads from digital control circuits. Each channel consists of a Darlington pair configuration, providing high current gain and allowing the device to switch load voltages up to about 50 V and currents up to around 500 mA per channel. This makes the IC suitable for interfacing control systems with external devices that require higher current than standard logic outputs can provide.','Unlike the ULN2003, the ULN2004 is intended for higher input logic voltage levels (typically 6 V to 15 V), making it compatible with certain CMOS or PMOS logic families and industrial control circuits. The IC features open-collector outputs and includes built-in flyback protection diodes connected to a common COM pin, which helps protect the circuit from voltage spikes generated by inductive loads. It is commonly available in DIP-16 and surface-mount packages, allowing easy use in prototyping as well as production PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773396804103-359397396.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 10:13:24','2026-03-13 10:13:24'),
(3018,'ULN2803 IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The ULN2803 IC is a widely used 8-channel Darlington transistor driver array designed to interface low-power digital logic circuits with high-current or high-voltage loads. It contains eight Darlington pair transistor stages, each capable of switching load voltages up to about 50 V and currents up to around 500 mA per channel, making it suitable for driving relays, stepper motors, solenoids, lamps, buzzers, and LED arrays. Because of the high current gain of the Darlington configuration, the IC allows microcontrollers and logic ICs to control larger electrical devices safely and efficiently.','The ULN2803 features open-collector outputs and includes built-in flyback protection diodes connected to a common COM pin, which help protect the circuit from voltage spikes generated by inductive loads. It is compatible with TTL and CMOS logic levels, so it can be easily interfaced with controllers such as Arduino, PIC, AVR, and other digital systems. The device is commonly available in DIP-18 and surface-mount packages, making it convenient for both breadboard prototyping and compact PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773398037703-976719069.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 10:33:57','2026-03-13 10:33:57'),
(3019,'ULN2804 IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The ULN2804 IC is an 8-channel Darlington transistor driver array used in electronic circuits to control high-current or higher-voltage loads from logic-level control signals. It contains eight Darlington pair driver stages, each capable of switching load voltages up to about 50 V and currents up to around 500 mA per channel, making it suitable for driving devices such as relays, solenoids, stepper motors, lamps, and LED arrays. The Darlington configuration provides high current gain, allowing low-power control circuits to operate larger electrical loads safely.','Unlike the ULN2803, the ULN2804 is designed for higher input logic voltage levels (typically 6 V to 15 V CMOS / PMOS logic systems), which makes it suitable for certain industrial and control applications. The IC features open-collector outputs and includes built-in flyback (clamp) diodes connected to a common COM pin, protecting the circuit from voltage spikes generated by inductive loads. It is commonly available in DIP-18 and surface-mount packages, making it suitable for breadboard prototyping as well as compact PCB designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773398167018-63548521.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 10:36:07','2026-03-13 10:36:07'),
(3020,' KP1010 IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The KP1010 IC is an electronic siren / alarm sound generator integrated circuit commonly used in security alarms, warning systems, and sound effect applications. It is designed to produce loud multi-tone or sweeping siren sounds when triggered, making it suitable for burglar alarms, fire alarms, vehicle security systems, and emergency alert devices. The IC typically works with a simple external circuit consisting of a few resistors, capacitors, and an audio amplifier or speaker, allowing easy integration into alarm designs.','This sound generator IC usually operates from a low DC supply voltage (around 3 V to 12 V depending on circuit design) and offers low power consumption with stable oscillation performance. It can generate different sound patterns such as wailing, warble, or continuous tone, depending on the external component values and triggering method. The KP1010 is generally available in DIP packages, making it convenient for breadboard prototyping as well as PCB assembly.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773398563886-950114146.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 10:42:43','2026-03-13 10:43:13'),
(3021,'KP2010 IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The KP2010 IC is an electronic melody / siren sound generator integrated circuit commonly used in alarm systems, doorbells, toys, and simple audio alert devices. It is designed to produce predefined musical tones or warning sound patterns when triggered, allowing designers to create attention-grabbing sound indications with minimal external components. The IC typically requires only a few resistors, capacitors, and a small audio amplifier or transistor stage to drive a speaker or buzzer, making circuit design simple and cost-effective.','The KP2010 usually operates from a low DC supply voltage (around 3 V to 12 V depending on the application circuit) and offers stable oscillation and low power consumption, which makes it suitable for battery-powered products. It is generally available in a DIP package, allowing easy use in breadboard prototyping as well as PCB assembly. Because of its compact design and reliable sound generation capability, the KP2010 IC is widely used in security alarms, calling bells, electronic toys, industrial warning systems, and DIY sound effect projects where audible alerts or melody tones are required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773398710186-710478606.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 10:45:10','2026-03-13 10:45:10'),
(3022,'KP3010 IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The KP3010 IC is an electronic siren / melody sound generator integrated circuit used in alarm and alert applications to produce loud warning tones or musical sound patterns. It is designed for simple implementation in circuits such as security alarms, fire warning systems, calling bells, electronic toys, and attention-signal devices. The IC generally requires only a few external components like resistors, capacitors, and a transistor or small audio amplifier stage to drive a speaker, making it easy to design compact and cost-effective sound circuits.','The KP3010 typically operates from a low DC supply voltage (about 3 V to 12 V depending on circuit configuration) and provides stable oscillation with low power consumption, which makes it suitable for battery-powered systems. It is commonly available in DIP packages, allowing convenient use in breadboard experiments as well as permanent PCB assembly. Because of its simple circuit requirement, reliable sound generation, and wide usability, the KP3010 IC is widely used in alarm units, door chimes, industrial warning indicators, and DIY electronic sound projects where clear audible alerts are needed.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773398839902-692061918.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 10:47:19','2026-03-13 10:47:19'),
(3023,'74HCT373',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The 74HCT373 is a high-speed TTL-compatible CMOS octal transparent latch integrated circuit used in digital electronics for temporary storage and buffering of 8-bit parallel data. It contains eight D-type latches with three-state outputs, allowing data applied at the input pins (D0–D7) to appear at the output pins (Q0–Q7) whenever the Latch Enable (LE) input is HIGH. When the LE signal goes LOW, the data present at that moment is latched and held at the outputs until a new enable signal is applied, making the device useful for synchronized data transfer and bus management.','The IC also features an Output Enable (OE) control, which can place all outputs into a high-impedance (tri-state) state, allowing multiple devices to share the same data bus without interference. Unlike standard HC devices, the HCT series provides TTL-level input compatibility, so the 74HCT373 can be easily interfaced with older TTL logic systems as well as modern CMOS circuits. It typically operates from a 5 V supply voltage, offering low power consumption, fast switching speed, and reliable performance.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773399583726-995735903.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 10:59:43','2026-03-13 10:59:43'),
(3024,'HT9370',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'The HT9370 is a DTMF (Dual Tone Multi-Frequency) receiver / decoder integrated circuit commonly used in communication and remote-control systems to detect telephone keypad tones and convert them into digital output signals. It is designed to recognize the standard DTMF tone pairs generated when a key is pressed on a telephone or GSM module, making it useful for applications such as remote switching, IVRS systems, security control units, and automation projects.','This IC typically works with a low DC supply voltage (around 5 V) and requires only a few external components such as resistors, capacitors, and a crystal or timing network for stable tone decoding. The HT9370 provides binary-coded digital outputs corresponding to the pressed key, which can be directly interfaced with microcontrollers, logic circuits, or relay driver stages. It also includes features like tone detection indication and data valid output, helping ensure reliable operation in noisy communication environments.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773400074222-570857564.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-13 11:07:54','2026-03-13 11:07:54'),
(3025,'CAT6 1.5  Networking Cable',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'This cable is made with twisted copper wire pairs and RJ45 connectors on both ends. The 1.5 meter length makes it suitable for neat and short connections such as router-to-computer or switch-to-Smart TV links.','CAT6 cables provide better performance and reduced signal interference compared to older CAT5e cables.','Do not bend the cable sharply or pull it forcefully.',NULL,'products/1773457879822-448702457.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 03:11:19','2026-03-14 03:11:19'),
(3026,'CAT6 3 Meter  Networking Cable',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'CAT6 stands for Category-6 network cable, designed for high-speed data transmission.Supports Gigabit speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for short distances.','The 3-meter length is ideal for connecting devices placed a few feet apart.Available in UTP (unshielded), FTP or STP (shielded) variants depending on requirement.','Avoid sharp bending or twisting of the cable',NULL,'products/1773458311718-673545562.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 03:18:31','2026-03-14 03:18:31'),
(3027,'Cat6   5 Meter Network Cable  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'CAT6 means Category-6 networking cable designed for high-speed data transfer.Supports Gigabit internet speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for short distances.','Usually comes with RJ45 connectors on both ends for plug-and-play installation.The 5-meter length is suitable when devices are not very close to the router.','Keep away from water, heat, and heavy objects',NULL,'products/1773459299182-448521519.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 03:34:59','2026-03-14 04:36:07'),
(3028,'APR33A3 C2',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'APR33A3-C2 is a compact voice recording and playback integrated circuit used for storing and reproducing audio messages in electronic applications. It features built-in non-volatile flash memory, which allows recorded sound to be retained even when the power supply is turned off.','The IC supports direct connection of a microphone for recording and a small speaker for playback, and it can be operated using simple push-button controls or through a microcontroller interface. It works with a low operating voltage of about 2.4V to 5.5V, making it suitable for battery-powered devices. APR33A3-C2 is widely used in voice alarm systems, talking toys, announcement devices, educational projects, and DIY sound recorder modules due to its easy circuit design and reliable performance.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773459762497-715467842.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 03:42:42','2026-03-14 03:42:42'),
(3029,'CAT6 10 Meter  Networking Cable',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A CAT6 10-meter networking cable is a medium-long Ethernet (LAN) cable used to connect devices like routers, computers, Smart TVs, switches, CCTV DVR/NVR, and gaming consoles.','It is suitable for room-to-room or longer indoor network connections.','Do not run parallel to high-voltage power cables',NULL,'products/1773459860618-781133272.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 03:44:20','2026-03-14 03:44:20'),
(3030,'CAT6   15 Meter Networking Cable',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'CAT6 means Category-6 cable, designed for high-speed and stable data transmission.Supports Gigabit internet speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for shorter distances.','A CAT6 15-meter networking cable is a medium-long Ethernet (LAN) cable used to connect devices like routers, computers, Smart TVs, switches, CCTV DVR/NVR, gaming consoles, and network printers.','Avoid sharp bending, twisting, or stretching the cable',NULL,'products/1773460046049-766553276.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 03:47:26','2026-03-14 03:47:26'),
(3031,'AP89010',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'AP89010 is a compact voice recording and playback integrated circuit designed for storing and reproducing audio messages in various electronic applications. It features built-in non-volatile memory, which allows recorded voice data to be retained even after the power supply is turned off. The IC supports direct connection of an electret microphone for recording and a small speaker for playback, enabling simple sound module design without the need for complex programming or external memory components.','It operates on a low DC supply voltage, making it suitable for battery-powered devices such as talking toys, voice alarm systems, door announcement units, and educational electronics projects. Due to its easy interfacing, low power consumption, and reliable audio performance, the AP89010 is widely used in DIY sound recorder modules and embedded voice indication systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773460175149-685432768.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 03:49:35','2026-03-14 03:49:35'),
(3032,'CD4013',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD4013 is a CMOS dual D-type flip-flop integrated circuit widely used in digital electronics for data storage, signal control, and timing operations. It contains two independent flip-flops, each provided with Data (D), Clock (CLK), Set, Reset, and complementary outputs (Q and Q̅), allowing flexible logic design. The IC stores the logic level present at the D input when a clock pulse is applied and holds this state until the next triggering event. It operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, making it suitable for both battery-powered and regulated power supply circuits.','CD4013 offers low power consumption, high noise immunity, and stable CMOS performance, which helps in reliable digital switching applications. It can also be configured as a toggle flip-flop, frequency divider, or simple memory element in sequential logic systems. The IC is commonly used in LED flasher circuits, digital counters, timing circuits, debounce systems, alarm controllers, and electronic project designs. Due to its simple interfacing and versatile operation, CD4013 remains a popular choice for students, hobbyists, and embedded circuit developers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773460463544-585473202.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 03:54:23','2026-03-14 03:54:23'),
(3033,'CAT6   20 Meter Networking Cable',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A CAT6 20-meter networking cable is a long-length Ethernet (LAN) cable used to connect network devices such as routers, computers, Smart TVs, switches, CCTV DVR/NVR, gaming consoles, and access points.','It is suitable for room-to-room or floor-to-floor wired internet connections in homes, offices, and shops.','Keep away from water, heat sources, and heavy pressure',NULL,'products/1773460584459-470868640.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 03:56:24','2026-03-14 03:56:24'),
(3034,'CD4051',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'D4051 is a CMOS 8-channel analog multiplexer / demultiplexer integrated circuit used to select one signal from multiple analog or digital inputs. It allows eight input channels (X0 to X7) to be connected to a single common output using three control select lines','The IC can handle both analog and digital signals, making it useful in signal routing, data acquisition, and switching applications. It operates over a wide supply voltage range (about 3V to 18V) and offers low power consumption with high noise immunity, typical of CMOS devices. CD4051 is commonly used in sensor selection circuits, audio signal switching, microcontroller input expansion, communication systems, and various electronic projects due to its simple control and reliable performance.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773460888604-77500329.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:01:28','2026-04-06 14:33:30'),
(3035,'CAT6   25 Meter Networking Cable',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'CAT6 means Category-6 cable, designed for high-speed and stable data transmission.Supports Gigabit speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for shorter distances.','Usually fitted with RJ45 connectors on both ends for plug-and-play use.','Keep away from water, heat, and heavy pressure',NULL,'products/1773460898159-37702541.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:01:38','2026-03-14 04:01:38'),
(3036,'CD4066',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD4066 is a CMOS quad bilateral switch integrated circuit used for switching and controlling analog or digital signals in electronic circuits. It contains four independent electronic switches, each having input, output, and control pins that allow signals to pass when the control input is HIGH. The IC can handle both AC and DC signals and is commonly used for signal gating, audio switching, and data routing applications.','CD4066 operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 3V to 15V, offering low power consumption and high noise immunity typical of CMOS technology. It is widely used in audio mixers, sample-and-hold circuits, analog signal selection, digital switching circuits, and microcontroller-based projects due to its simple operation and reliable performance.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773461690384-789502283.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:14:50','2026-03-14 04:14:50'),
(3037,'CD4068',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD4068 is a CMOS 8-input NAND gate integrated circuit used in digital logic and control applications. It combines eight input signals into a single NAND output, which becomes LOW only when all inputs are HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, offering low power consumption and high noise immunity, typical of CMOS devices','CD4068 is commonly used in logic control circuits, alarm systems, timing circuits, industrial control units, and electronic project designs where multiple signal conditions must be monitored simultaneously. Its simple design, reliable operation, and easy interfacing make it useful for both educational and practical digital electronics applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773461810546-262512592.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:16:50','2026-03-14 04:16:50'),
(3038,'CAT6    30 Meter Networking Cable',' Networking Cable',NULL,NULL,1.00,'CAT6 means Category-6 network cable, designed for high-speed and stable data transmission.Supports Gigabit speed (up to 1 Gbps) and up to 10 Gbps for shorter distances.','It is suitable for floor-to-floor or long room-to-room wired internet connections in homes, offices, and shops.','Do not run parallel to high-voltage power cables to reduce interference',NULL,'products/1773462089851-378370622.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:21:29','2026-03-14 04:21:29'),
(3039,'CD4069',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD4069 is a CMOS hex inverter integrated circuit that contains six independent NOT gates used for logic signal inversion in digital electronic circuits. Each inverter gate produces an output that is the opposite logic level of its input, converting HIGH to LOW and LOW to HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, making it suitable for both low-power battery devices and regulated power supply systems. It offers low power consumption, high input impedance, and good noise immunity, which are important features of CMOS technology.','D4069 is commonly used in oscillator circuits, waveform generators, signal shaping, logic level conversion, and timing applications. It can also be used as a simple amplifier for low-frequency analog signals when properly biased. The IC is helpful in digital switching circuits, LED flasher circuits, alarm systems, and pulse generation designs',NULL,NULL,'products/1773462275877-868179883.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:24:35','2026-03-14 04:24:35'),
(3040,'CD4071',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD4071 is a CMOS quad 2-input OR gate integrated circuit used in digital logic and control applications. It contains four independent OR gates, each designed to produce a HIGH output when any one or both of its inputs are HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 3V to 15V, making it suitable for battery-powered as well as regulated electronic circuits. It features low power consumption, high noise immunity, and high input impedance, which are typical advantages of CMOS technology.','CD4071 is commonly used in logic decision circuits, alarm and security systems, digital switching, signal combining, and timing control circuits. It can also be applied in microcontroller interface projects, automation systems, and educational electronics experiments where multiple input conditions must be logically combined. Due to its simple operation, reliable performance, and easy interfacing, CD4071 is widely used in hobby circuits and industrial digital control designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773462696180-669856318.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:31:36','2026-03-14 04:31:36'),
(3041,'CD4073',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD4073 is a CMOS triple 3-input AND gate integrated circuit used in digital logic and control applications. It contains three independent AND gates, each designed to produce a HIGH output only when all three inputs of that gate are HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, making it suitable for both battery-operated and regulated power supply circuits. It offers low power consumption, high noise immunity, and high input impedance, which are key advantages of CMOS technology.','CD4073 is commonly used in logic decision circuits, timing control systems, alarm and security circuits, digital switching applications, and automation projects. It is also useful in microcontroller interface designs, condition monitoring systems, and educational electronics experiments where multiple signal conditions must be satisfied before generating an output. Due to its simple design, reliable operation, and easy interfacing, CD4073 is widely used in hobby electronics and industrial digital control circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773462816290-680300555.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:33:36','2026-03-14 04:33:36'),
(3042,'CD4081',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD4081 is a CMOS quad 2-input AND gate integrated circuit used in digital logic and control applications. It contains four independent AND gates, each producing a HIGH output only when both of its inputs are HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, making it suitable for battery-powered as well as regulated electronic circuits. It features low power consumption, high noise immunity, and high input impedance, which are important advantages of CMOS technology.','CD4081 is commonly used in logic decision circuits, timing and control systems, digital switching, automation circuits, and alarm systems. It is also applied in microcontroller interface projects, counters, LED control circuits, and educational electronics experiments where multiple conditions must be satisfied to produce an output. Due to its simple operation, reliable performance, and easy interfacing, CD4081 is widely used in hobby electronics and industrial digital control designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773462918439-316137115.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:35:18','2026-03-14 04:35:18'),
(3043,'CD4082',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD4082 is a CMOS dual 4-input AND gate integrated circuit used in digital logic and control systems. It contains two independent AND gates, and each gate produces a HIGH output only when all four of its input signals are HIGH. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 3V to 15V, making it suitable for both battery-powered and regulated power supply circuits. It offers low power consumption, high noise immunity, and high input impedance, which are key advantages of CMOS technology.','CD4082 is commonly used in logic decision circuits, timing and control applications, digital switching systems, alarm circuits, and automation projects where multiple input conditions must be satisfied before generating an output. It is also useful in microcontroller interface designs, signal gating, industrial control units, and educational electronics experiments due to its simple operation, reliable performance, and easy interfacing.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773463871222-702518090.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:51:11','2026-03-14 04:51:11'),
(3044,'VGA to HDMI Cable ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'VGA is an analog video signal, while HDMI is a digital audio-video signal.Therefore, most VGA to HDMI cables include an active converter circuit to change the signal format.','Commonly used in offices, schools, presentations, and home TV connections','Use the cable only with compatible devices (VGA output → HDMI input).',NULL,'products/1773463872257-177136915.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:51:12','2026-03-14 04:51:12'),
(3045,'CD4093',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD4093 is a CMOS quad 2-input NAND gate integrated circuit with Schmitt trigger inputs, widely used in digital and timing applications. It contains four independent NAND gates, each designed to produce a LOW output only when both inputs are HIGH, while the Schmitt trigger feature provides improved noise immunity and clean switching action. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, making it suitable for battery-powered and regulated electronic circuits.','Due to its hysteresis characteristics, CD4093 is commonly used in oscillator circuits, waveform shaping, debounce circuits, pulse generation, timing control, and signal conditioning applications. It is also applied in alarm systems, digital switching circuits, automation projects, and microcontroller interface designs where stable logic transitions are required. With its low power consumption, simple interfacing, and reliable performance, CD4093 is popular in educational electronics projects, hobby circuits, and industrial control systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773464038137-490141426.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:53:58','2026-03-14 04:53:58'),
(3046,'CD4094',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD4094 is a CMOS 8-stage shift and store register integrated circuit used for serial-to-parallel data conversion and digital output expansion. It allows data to be shifted in serially through a data input and clock signal, then stored and made available simultaneously at the parallel output pins. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of about 3V to 15V, offering low power consumption, high noise immunity, and stable CMOS performance.','CD4094 is commonly used in LED display control, output port expansion for microcontrollers, digital data storage, signal sequencing, and automation circuits. It also finds applications in timing systems, light chaser circuits, and educational electronics projects where multiple outputs need to be controlled using fewer control lines. Due to its simple interfacing, reliable operation, and flexible data handling capability, CD4094 is widely used in hobby electronics and embedded digital designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773464132519-63911782.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 04:55:32','2026-03-14 04:55:32'),
(3047,'USB to hdmi cable ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'A USB to HDMI cable (or adapter) is used to connect a computer or laptop USB port to an HDMI display like LED TV, monitor, or projector.','It converts the USB data signal into digital HDMI audio-video output.','Keep the cable and adapter away from direct sunlight, heaters, and hot surfaces.',NULL,'products/1773464520232-384690945.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 05:02:00','2026-03-14 05:02:00'),
(3048,'CD40106',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD40106 is a CMOS hex Schmitt trigger inverter integrated circuit used in digital and timing applications. It contains six independent inverter gates, each with Schmitt trigger input characteristics that provide hysteresis for clean and stable switching of slow or noisy signals. The IC operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, offering low power consumption, high noise immunity, and high input impedance, which are typical advantages of CMOS technology.','CD40106 is commonly used in oscillator circuits, waveform generators, debounce circuits, pulse shaping, timing circuits, and signal conditioning applications. It is also useful in LED flashers, tone generators, alarm systems, and microcontroller interface designs where reliable logic transitions are required. Due to its simple operation, versatility, and stable performance, CD40106 is widely used in educational electronics projects, hobby circuits, and industrial control systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773465035338-945714227.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 05:10:35','2026-03-14 05:10:35'),
(3049,'CD40193',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'CD40193 is a CMOS presettable up/down binary counter integrated circuit used in digital counting and sequencing applications. It is a 4-bit synchronous counter, meaning it can count both upward and downward in binary form depending on the control inputs. The IC includes separate clock inputs for UP and DOWN counting, as well as parallel preset inputs that allow a specific count value to be loaded directly. It operates over a wide supply voltage range of approximately 3V to 15V, providing low power consumption and high noise immunity, which are key features of CMOS devices.','CD40193 is commonly used in digital clocks, event counters, frequency division circuits, display systems, automation controls, and microcontroller interface projects. It can also be applied in timing circuits, sequence generators, and electronic measurement systems where accurate counting in both directions is required. Due to its flexible operation, simple interfacing, and reliable performance, CD40193 is widely used in educational electronics experiments, hobby designs, and industrial digital control circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773465111009-550260454.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 05:11:51','2026-03-14 05:11:51'),
(3050,'REG 7815',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'7815 is a fixed positive voltage regulator integrated circuit used to provide a stable +15V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It belongs to the popular 78xx voltage regulator series, where the last two digits indicate the output voltage value. The IC accepts a higher unregulated DC input voltage (typically around 17V to 35V) and regulates it to a constant 15V output.','The 7815 regulator includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and safe operating area protection, which help prevent damage due to overheating or short circuits. It is commonly used in power supply units, amplifier circuits, industrial control systems, communication equipment, and electronic project designs that require a reliable +15V supply. For proper operation and stability, input and output filter capacitors are usually connected near the IC terminals. Due to its simple usage, stable output voltage, and rugged performance, the 7815 is widely used in analog and digital electronic circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773465562242-391664520.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 05:19:22','2026-03-14 05:19:22'),
(3051,'REG 7818',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'7818 is a fixed positive voltage regulator integrated circuit designed to provide a stable +18V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It is part of the widely used 78xx regulator series, where the number indicates the regulated output voltage. The IC accepts a higher unregulated DC input voltage (typically about 20V to 35V) and converts it into a constant 18V output suitable for various electronic devices.','The 7818 includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection, which help ensure safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in audio amplifier power supplies, communication equipment, industrial control circuits, laboratory power units, and general electronic projects that require a stable +18V supply. For best performance, input and output capacitors are connected near the regulator pins to improve filtering and stability.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773466676356-681640828.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 05:37:56','2026-03-14 05:37:56'),
(3052,'REG 7905',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'7905 is a fixed negative voltage regulator integrated circuit used to provide a stable –5V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It belongs to the 79xx series of negative voltage regulators, where the last two digits indicate the regulated output voltage value. The IC accepts a more negative unregulated DC input voltage (typically around –7V to –25V) and regulates it to a constant –5V output.','The 7905 regulator includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, internal current limiting, and short-circuit protection to ensure safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in dual power supply systems, operational amplifier circuits, communication equipment, industrial control units, and electronic project designs that require a stable negative voltage',NULL,NULL,'products/1773467433141-932645228.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 05:50:33','2026-03-14 05:51:11'),
(3053,'REG 7906',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'7906 is a fixed negative voltage regulator integrated circuit used to provide a stable –6V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It is part of the 79xx series of negative voltage regulators, where the last two digits represent the regulated output voltage level. The IC accepts a more negative unregulated DC input voltage (typically about –8V to –25V) and regulates it to a constant –6V output.','The 7906 regulator includes internal protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection to ensure safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in dual power supply systems, analog circuits, operational amplifier applications, communication equipment, and laboratory power supplies that require a stable negative voltage',NULL,NULL,'products/1773467641260-880634877.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 05:54:01','2026-03-14 05:54:01'),
(3054,'Optical Cables',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'Optical cables, also called fiber optic cables, are communication cables that transmit data using light signals instead of electrical signals. They are widely used for high-speed internet, telecom networks, data centers, CCTV networking, and long-distance communication systems.','Optical cables are made of very thin glass or plastic fibers protected by multiple outer layers.','Avoid sharp bending or twisting of the fiber cable',NULL,'products/1773468168277-100335019.jfif',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 06:02:48','2026-03-14 06:02:48'),
(3055,'REG 7908',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'7908 is a fixed negative voltage regulator integrated circuit designed to provide a stable –8V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It belongs to the 79xx series of negative voltage regulators, where the number indicates the regulated output voltage value. The IC accepts a more negative unregulated input voltage (typically around –10V to –25V) and regulates it to a constant –8V output suitable for various analog and digital applications.','The 7908 regulator includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, internal current limiting, and short-circuit protection to ensure safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in dual power supply units, operational amplifier circuits, audio systems, communication equipment, and industrial control electronics that require a stable negative voltage. For proper operation and improved stability, input and output filter capacitors are usually connected near the regulator terminals. Due to its simple usage, stable performance, and rugged design, the 7908 is widely used in electronic power supply designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773468747819-760639033.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 06:12:27','2026-03-14 06:12:27'),
(3056,'REG 7909',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'7909 is a fixed negative voltage regulator integrated circuit used to provide a stable –9V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It is part of the 79xx series of negative voltage regulators, where the last two digits indicate the regulated output voltage. The IC accepts a more negative unregulated input voltage (typically around –11V to –25V) and regulates it to a constant –9V output suitable for various electronic devices.','The 7909 regulator includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection to ensure safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in dual power supply systems, operational amplifier circuits, audio equipment, communication devices, laboratory power supplies, and industrial control circuits that require a stable negative voltage.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773468830182-586169558.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 06:13:50','2026-03-14 06:13:50'),
(3057,'REG 7912',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'7912 is a fixed negative voltage regulator integrated circuit used to provide a stable –12V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It belongs to the 79xx series of negative voltage regulators, where the number indicates the regulated output voltage level. The IC accepts a more negative unregulated input voltage (typically around –14V to –30V) and converts it into a constant –12V output suitable for various analog and digital applications.','The 7912 regulator includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, internal current limiting, and short-circuit protection, ensuring safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in dual power supply systems, operational amplifier circuits, audio amplifier supplies, communication equipment, laboratory power units, and industrial control electronics that require a stable negative voltage',NULL,NULL,'products/1773468934767-447811167.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 06:15:34','2026-03-14 06:15:34'),
(3058,'REG 7915',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'7915 is a fixed negative voltage regulator integrated circuit designed to provide a stable –15V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It is part of the 79xx series of negative voltage regulators, where the last two digits represent the regulated output voltage value. The IC accepts a more negative unregulated input voltage (typically around –17V to –30V) and regulates it to a constant –15V output suitable for various analog and digital applications.','The 7915 regulator includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, internal current limiting, and short-circuit protection to ensure safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in dual power supply units, operational amplifier circuits, audio amplifier systems, communication equipment, laboratory power supplies, and industrial control electronics that require a stable negative voltage',NULL,NULL,'products/1773469028533-735053446.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 06:17:08','2026-03-14 06:17:08'),
(3059,'REG 7918',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'7918 is a fixed negative voltage regulator integrated circuit used to provide a stable –18V DC output in electronic power supply circuits. It belongs to the 79xx series of negative voltage regulators, where the number indicates the regulated output voltage level. The IC accepts a more negative unregulated DC input voltage (typically around –20V to –35V) and converts it into a constant –18V output suitable for various electronic applications.','The 7918 regulator includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown, current limiting, and short-circuit protection to ensure safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in dual power supply systems, audio amplifier circuits, operational amplifier applications, communication equipment, laboratory power units, and industrial control electronics that require a stable negative voltage.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773469392679-457447912.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 06:23:12','2026-03-14 06:23:12'),
(3060,'REG 78L05',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'78L05 is a fixed positive voltage regulator integrated circuit designed to provide a stable +5V DC output in low-current electronic applications. It belongs to the 78xx regulator series, and the “L” indicates a low current version (typically up to about 100 mA). The IC accepts a higher unregulated DC input voltage (usually around 7V to 20V) and regulates it to a constant 5V output.','The 78L05 includes internal protection features such as thermal shutdown and current limiting, ensuring safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in microcontroller circuits, sensor modules, small power supplies, communication devices, and DIY electronics projects that require a stable +5V supply.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773469483201-406949951.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 06:24:43','2026-03-14 06:24:43'),
(3061,'REG 78L08',NULL,NULL,NULL,49.00,'78L08 is a fixed positive voltage regulator integrated circuit designed to provide a stable +8V DC output in low-current electronic applications. It belongs to the 78xx regulator series, and the letter “L” indicates a low current version, typically capable of supplying up to about 100 mA. The IC accepts a higher unregulated DC input voltage (generally around 10V to 20V) and regulates it to a constant 8V output.','The 78L08 includes built-in protection features such as thermal shutdown and internal current limiting, which help ensure safe and reliable operation. It is commonly used in small power supply circuits, audio pre-amplifiers, sensor modules, communication devices, and educational electronics projects that require a stable +8V supply.',NULL,NULL,'products/1773469590782-309354578.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-03-14 06:26:30','2026-03-14 06:26:30'),
