(3424,'ZEB Energipod PB17 Power Bank',NULL,NULL,NULL,1999.00,'The ZEB Energipod PB17 from Zebronics is a compact and reliable 10000mAh power bank designed for everyday charging needs. It supports smartphones and tablets with dual USB output ports, allowing you to charge two devices simultaneously. The power bank features both Type-C and Micro USB input options, making it convenient for different charging cables.','It also includes an LED indicator to display battery status. Built with multiple safety protections such as overcharge, overload, and short circuit protection, the PB17 ensures safe and stable charging. Its lightweight and portable design make it ideal for travel, office, and daily use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775026507158-880186095.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 06:55:07','2026-04-01 06:55:07'),
(3425,'ZEB MB20000R5 Pro Power Bank',NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,'The ZEB MB20000R5 Pro Power Bank from Zebronics is a high-capacity portable charging solution designed for heavy daily use. With a 20000mAh battery, it provides multiple full charges for smartphones, tablets, and other USB-powered devices. It supports fast charging up to 22.5W, ensuring quick and efficient power delivery. The power bank features dual USB outputs along with a Type-C PD 3.0 port, allowing you to charge multiple devices simultaneously.','The power bank features dual USB outputs along with a Type-C PD 3.0 port, allowing you to charge multiple devices simultaneously. It also includes an LED percentage display for accurate battery level monitoring and a built-in torch light for emergency use. With advanced safety features like overcharge, overload, and short-circuit protection, it ensures safe and reliable operation.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775026975617-369398321.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 07:02:55','2026-04-01 07:02:55'),
(3426,'RD BLITZ P -210 Wireless Power Bank',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The RD BLITZ P-210 Power Bank is a compact and efficient portable charging solution designed for everyday use. It comes with a 10000mAh lithium-polymer battery, providing sufficient backup to charge smartphones multiple times while on the go. This model supports wireless charging functionality, making it convenient for modern smartphones without needing cables. It also includes standard USB output and Type-C input options for flexible charging.','It also includes standard USB output and Type-C input options for flexible charging. The power bank is built with safety features such as overcharge, short circuit, and heat protection to ensure safe and stable performance. Its sleek and lightweight design makes it easy to carry, making it ideal for travel, office, and daily backup needs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775027198234-113233656.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 07:06:38','2026-04-01 07:06:38'),
(3427,'Selfie Stick R1',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Selfie Stick R1 is a versatile and portable photography accessory designed for capturing selfies, group photos, and videos with ease. It typically features a Bluetooth-enabled remote control, allowing users to take photos wirelessly from a distance of up to around 10 meters . Most R1 models come with a 3-in-1 multifunction design, combining a selfie stick, tripod stand, and mobile holder in one compact device. The stick is extendable, usually up to 2–3 feet or more, making it easier to capture wider angles and better shots','Built using lightweight materials like ABS plastic and stainless steel, the R1 selfie stick is easy to carry and durable for everyday use. It includes an adjustable phone holder compatible with most smartphones and often supports 360° rotation for flexible shooting angles. Some variants also come with additional features like LED fill light or enhanced grip for stability.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775028197100-842004143.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 07:23:17','2026-04-01 07:23:17'),
(3428,'Selfie Stick R1S',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Selfie Stick R1S is a multifunctional and portable mobile accessory designed for capturing selfies, group photos, and videos with ease. It features a 3-in-1 design, combining a selfie stick, tripod stand, and mobile holder into one compact device. Equipped with a Bluetooth remote control, it allows users to take photos wirelessly from a distance of up to around 10 meters, making it ideal for hands-free shooting. Many R1S models also include an LED fill light, improving image quality in low-light conditions.','The stick is extendable and foldable, typically reaching around 60–70 cm or more, while remaining compact enough to fit in a pocket or bag . It supports 360° rotation, enabling flexible angle adjustments for both portrait and landscape shots. Built using lightweight materials like ABS plastic and aluminum, it is easy to carry and durable for daily use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775029051491-14311404.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 07:37:31','2026-04-01 07:37:31'),
(3429,'Fitgear FG-9966 Tripod',NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,'The Fitgear FG-9966 Tripod is a professional and durable stand designed for photography, videography, and content creation. With a maximum height of around 2.1 meters (7 feet), it provides excellent elevation for capturing wide-angle shots, group photos, and studio-style recordings. Built using lightweight yet मजबूत aluminum alloy, this tripod offers both portability and stability.','It features adjustable legs with multiple height levels, allowing users to set the desired position easily. The tripod comes with a universal mobile holder and standard screw mount, making it compatible with smartphones, cameras, and ring lights. A 3-way pan head enables smooth 360° rotation and tilt adjustments for flexible shooting angles.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775032513179-557411120.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 08:35:13','2026-04-01 08:35:13'),
(3430,'Oneplus bullets wireless z3',NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,'The OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z3 is a stylish and performance-focused wireless neckband designed for everyday use. It delivers clear audio with enhanced bass, making it suitable for music, calls, and entertainment. The lightweight and ergonomic design ensures comfortable wear for long hours without strain. Equipped with Bluetooth connectivity, it offers a stable and quick pairing experience with smartphones and other devices.','The neckband features magnetic earbuds for easy control, automatically pausing music when clipped together. It also supports fast charging technology, providing several hours of playback with just a short charging time. The battery life is impressive, making it ideal for users who are always on the move. Built with durable materials, the Z3 is designed to withstand daily usage. It also includes intuitive controls for volume, calls, and music playback.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775035579816-123523926.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 09:26:19','2026-04-01 09:26:19'),
(3431,'Oneplus Bullets Wireless Z2 ANC',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The OnePlus Bullets Wireless Z2 ANC is a powerful wireless neckband designed for users who want immersive sound and noise-free listening. It features 45dB hybrid Active Noise Cancellation, which effectively reduces background noise, making it ideal for travel, calls, and music in busy environments. The device is equipped with 12.4mm dynamic drivers that deliver deep bass and clear audio output for an enhanced listening experience. It offers up to 28 hours of battery life on a single charge, ensuring long-lasting usage throughout the day.','One of its key highlights is fast charging, where just a 10-minute charge can provide several hours of playback, making it convenient for users on the go. The neckband also supports AI-powered call noise reduction, ensuring clear voice quality during calls. With Bluetooth connectivity and Google Fast Pair, it provides quick and stable pairing with devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775035743202-135022330.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 09:29:03','2026-04-01 09:29:03'),
(3432,'Lyne signal 48 Neckband',NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,'The Lyne Signal 48 Neckband is a budget-friendly wireless audio device designed for everyday use, offering a balance of sound quality, comfort, and battery efficiency. It features Bluetooth connectivity for quick and stable pairing with smartphones and other devices, making it convenient for daily music and calls. The neckband is equipped with ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation) technology, helping to reduce background noise and provide clearer voice quality during calls','This model delivers clear audio output with decent bass and treble, suitable for casual listening and entertainment. It comes with an ergonomic and lightweight design that ensures comfortable usage for long hours, whether you are traveling, working, or exercising. The magnetic earbuds add convenience by preventing tangling and allowing easy storage when not in use',NULL,NULL,'products/1775035917479-268836681.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 09:31:57','2026-04-01 09:31:57'),
(3433,'Boat Nirvana Venus Promax',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The boAt Nirvanaa Venus Promax is a premium-style wireless audio device designed to deliver powerful sound, advanced features, and long-lasting performance. Inspired by the Nirvana series, it focuses on providing an immersive listening experience with deep bass and crystal-clear audio output. It is suitable for music lovers, calls, gaming, and entertainment.','Devices in the Nirvana series typically offer long playback time and fast charging, ensuring uninterrupted usage. Some models even provide spatial audio and multi-device connectivity, enhancing the overall experience',NULL,NULL,'products/1775036225979-510113025.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 09:34:21','2026-04-01 09:37:05'),
(3434,'Boat Ragda - 261',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The boAt Rockerz 261 is a sporty wireless neckband designed for users who need secure fit, durability, and powerful sound during daily activities and workouts. It features 11mm dynamic drivers that deliver clear audio with punchy bass, making it suitable for music and calls. The earphones come with a secure earhook design, ensuring they stay in place during running, gym, or outdoor use.','One of its key highlights is IPX7 water and sweat resistance, which protects the device from sweat and splashes, making it ideal for fitness enthusiasts. The neckband offers up to 8 hours of playback time on a single charge, ensuring uninterrupted usage throughout the day',NULL,NULL,'products/1775036798157-303359825.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 09:46:38','2026-04-01 09:46:38'),
(3435,'Boat vibration ',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The boAt “Vibration” neckband is not a specific model name, but refers to boAt neckbands that include a vibration call alert feature—such as the boAt Rockerz 235 Pro. This feature allows the neckband to vibrate when you receive incoming calls, ensuring you never miss calls even when your phone is silent or in your pocket.','These neckbands are designed to deliver boAt Signature Sound, providing powerful bass and clear audio for music, calls, and entertainment. They typically come with Bluetooth connectivity, offering seamless wireless pairing and freedom of movement. Many models also include fast charging support, giving hours of playback with just a short charging time',NULL,NULL,'products/1775036933661-365098985.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 09:48:53','2026-04-01 09:48:53'),
(3436,'Zeb Lark Wireless neckband',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The ZebLark Wireless Neckband from Zebronics is a budget-friendly audio device designed for users who want reliable wireless performance and everyday comfort. It features Bluetooth connectivity, allowing quick and stable pairing with smartphones, tablets, and other devices.','This neckband delivers clear sound output with balanced bass and vocals, making it suitable for music, calls, and casual entertainment. It typically offers around 15–17 hours of playback time, ensuring you can use it throughout the day without frequent charging.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775037101780-107605338.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 09:51:41','2026-04-01 09:51:41'),
(3437,'ZEB Escape 10',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The Zebronics ZEB Escape 10 is a budget-friendly wireless neckband designed for users who need simple performance, long battery life, and everyday comfort. It comes with Bluetooth v5.3, ensuring fast and stable connectivity with smartphones and other devices. This neckband is equipped with 10mm drivers, delivering clear sound with decent bass, making it suitable for music, calls, and casual entertainment. It offers up to 20 hours of playback time and talk time, allowing all-day usage without frequent charging.','The lightweight (around 26g) and flexible design provides a comfortable fit for long hours, while the magnetic earbuds help prevent tangling and make it easy to carry. It also features inline controls for managing calls, volume, and music playback easily',NULL,NULL,'products/1775037224254-474117886.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 09:53:44','2026-04-01 09:53:44'),
(3438,' U & i Jakass Sports Neckband',NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,'The U&i Jakass Sports Neckband is a budget-friendly wireless audio device designed for users who want sporty performance, strong sound, and practical features for daily use. It comes with Bluetooth connectivity, allowing quick pairing with smartphones and stable wireless performance during calls and music playback.','This neckband delivers clear audio with enhanced bass, making it suitable for music lovers and casual entertainment. It is built with a sports-friendly ergonomic design, ensuring a secure and comfortable fit during workouts, walking, or travel.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775037656162-867350853.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 10:00:56','2026-04-06 06:42:01'),
(3439,'U & i Entry 62 Wireless Neckband',NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,'The U&i Entry 62 Wireless Neckband is part of the brand’s Entry Series, designed especially for users who want basic wireless audio at a very affordable price. It features Bluetooth connectivity, allowing easy pairing with smartphones and other devices for music and calling. This neckband delivers clear sound output with moderate bass, making it suitable for casual listening, calls, and everyday usage. Like most U&i products, it focuses on simplicity and value, rather than premium features.','Battery performance in Entry series neckbands is generally designed for all-day basic usage, with decent backup depending on usage conditions. U&i as a brand focuses on delivering affordable tech with practical features like decent battery life, easy usability, and durable build.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775037803715-860003114.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 10:03:23','2026-04-01 10:03:23'),
(3440,'U & i Entry 1 Wireless Neckband',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The U&i Entry 1 Wireless Neckband is a budget-friendly audio device designed for users who want reliable wireless performance and long battery backup at an affordable price. It features Bluetooth 5.3 connectivity, ensuring fast pairing and stable connection with smartphones and other devices. This neckband comes with a 10mm speaker driver, delivering clear sound with decent bass, making it suitable for music, calls, and everyday entertainment. It offers up to 30 hours of playback time along with around 300 hours of standby, making it highly efficient for long usage without frequent charging.','The design is lightweight and ergonomic, ensuring comfort during long listening sessions. It also includes magnetic earbuds, which help keep the earphones secure and tangle-free when not in use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775038355832-808659193.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 10:12:35','2026-04-01 10:12:35'),
