(3442,'OUD factory series neckband','OD-NB-80B/B4',NULL,NULL,999.00,'The OUD Factory Series OD-NB-80B / B4 Wireless Neckband is an affordable audio accessory designed for users who need loud sound, long battery life, and simple wireless performance. It comes with Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity, providing stable pairing and a wireless range of up to 10 meters for seamless use with smartphones and other devices.','This neckband delivers clear audio with deep bass, making it suitable for music lovers who prefer high-volume and punchy sound output. It also includes basic noise reduction, helping improve call clarity during everyday usage.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,'products/1775039396459-626266989.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-01 10:29:56','2026-04-01 10:29:56'),
