(3446,'Duracell 2x Longer battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The Duracell 2X Longer Battery refers to Duracell Ultra alkaline batteries, which are designed to last up to 2 times longer compared to standard zinc or basic alkaline batteries in high-drain devices. These batteries are ideal for powering devices like digital cameras, toys, wireless accessories, remotes, and flashlights.','Duracell Ultra batteries use advanced alkaline technology with Duralock power preservation, ensuring long-lasting and consistent energy output. This helps devices run smoothly for extended periods without frequent battery replacement.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775102780116-736181847.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:06:20','2026-04-02 04:06:20'),
