(3448,'GP Green Cell AA Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The GP Green Cell AA Battery is a cost-effective power solution designed for daily-use electronic devices. It belongs to GP’s Greencell (Extra Heavy Duty) range, which uses zinc-carbon technology, making it ideal for low to medium-drain devices such as remote controls, clocks, toys, flashlights, and radios. These batteries provide reliable and consistent power output, ensuring smooth operation for everyday gadgets. They are especially suitable for devices that do not require high power consumption, offering a balance between performance and affordability.','One of the key advantages of GP Green Cell batteries is their budget-friendly pricing, making them a popular choice for households and bulk usage. They are also mercury-free, making them safer for the environment compared to older battery types.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775103332026-759354913.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:15:32','2026-04-02 04:15:32'),
(3449,'GP Power HeavyDuty AA Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The GP Power Heavy Duty AA Battery (also known as GP Greencell Extra Heavy Duty) is a cost-effective and reliable power solution designed for everyday household devices. It uses zinc-carbon technology, making it ideal for low to medium-drain applications such as remote controls, wall clocks, flashlights, radios, and toys','These batteries provide stable and consistent power output, ensuring smooth operation of basic electronic devices. They are especially suitable for users who need affordable batteries for regular use, rather than high-performance or heavy-drain applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775103539681-201176335.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:18:59','2026-04-02 04:18:59'),
(3450,'zebronics K65 WIRED KEYBOARD',NULL,NULL,NULL,1200.00,'The Zebronics K65 is a budget-friendly wired keyboard designed for everyday use such as office work, typing, and basic home computing. It offers a full-size layout with essential features while keeping the price very low.','USB wired connectivity\r\nSimple plug-and-play support—no drivers required.\r\nUV-coated keys\r\nKeys are coated to prevent fading and improve durability over time.\r\nRetractable stand\r\nAdjustable tilt helps provide a better typing angle and comfort.\r\nSlim & lightweight design\r\nCompact and easy to place on any desk (approx. 390g weight).\r\nDurable key life\r\nSupports up to 5 million keystrokes.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775103668171-14138538.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:21:08','2026-04-02 04:21:08'),
(3451,'Panasonic Speciall AA Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The Panasonic Special AA Battery is a budget-friendly zinc-carbon battery designed for everyday low-power devices. It provides a reliable and economical power solution, making it ideal for household and office use. These batteries are commonly used in TV remotes, wall clocks, toys, torches, and radios, where consistent but low energy is required','The Panasonic Special AA Battery is a budget-friendly zinc-carbon battery designed for everyday low-power devices. It provides a reliable and economical power solution, making it ideal for household and office use. These batteries are commonly used in TV remotes, wall clocks, toys, torches, and radios, where consistent but low energy is required',NULL,NULL,'products/1775103698979-554513225.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:21:38','2026-04-02 04:21:38'),
(3452,'Duracell 2x Longer AAA Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The Duracell 2X Longer AAA Battery refers to the Duracell Ultra AAA alkaline series, which is engineered to deliver up to 2 times longer life compared to ordinary zinc-carbon batteries in high-drain devices. These batteries are ideal for powering gadgets like remote controls, wireless accessories, toys, cameras, and flashlights.','Duracell Ultra AAA batteries use advanced alkaline technology, ensuring strong and consistent power output for both everyday and high-performance devices. They are specially designed to handle high energy demand, making them a reliable choice for modern electronics.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775104023494-502494767.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:27:03','2026-04-02 04:27:03'),
(3453,'Zebronics KM2000 Wired keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,1140.00,'The Zebronics KM2000 is an affordable wired multimedia keyboard designed for daily typing, office work, and basic home use. It features a full-size ergonomic layout, extra hotkeys, and simple plug-and-play functionality, making it suitable for students and professionals.','Full-size 115 keys layout\r\nIncludes standard keys, numeric keypad, and additional function keys for productivity.\r\n8 dedicated multimedia hotkeys\r\nQuick access to functions like volume control, media, and shortcuts.\r\nUSB wired connectivity\r\nEasy plug-and-play usage without installing drivers.\r\nErgonomic design\r\nComfortable layout suitable for long typing sessions.\r\nLaser-printed keycaps\r\nEnsures durability and prevents fading of letters over time.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775104148285-782943422.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:29:08','2026-04-02 04:29:08'),
(3454,'Duracell Ultra AAA Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The Duracell Ultra AAA Battery is a premium alkaline battery designed to deliver long-lasting and reliable power for modern electronic devices. It is specially built for high-drain gadgets such as digital cameras, toys, wireless accessories, and gaming controllers.','With advanced technology and durable construction, these batteries ensure consistent performance, longer usage time, and dependable energy output compared to standard batteries.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775104159194-877781751.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:29:19','2026-04-02 04:29:19'),
(3455,'Duracell Heavy duty AAA Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The Duracell Heavy Duty AAA Battery is a reliable and cost-effective power solution designed for everyday low-drain devices. It uses zinc-carbon technology, making it ideal for products that do not require continuous high power, such as remote controls, wall clocks, radios, and basic flashlights. These batteries are built to provide stable and consistent energy output for regular household use. Compared to alkaline batteries,','Duracell Heavy Duty batteries are more affordable, making them a practical choice for bulk usage. They are lightweight and easy to install in all standard AAA-compatible devices. The batteries are designed with good leak resistance to help protect your devices during normal usage. While they may not last as long as premium alkaline options, they perform efficiently in low-power applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775104576006-816886307.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:36:16','2026-04-02 04:36:16'),
