(3457,'Zebronics K20 Wired keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,1140.00,'The Zebronics K20 is a standard full-size wired keyboard designed for everyday use in homes, offices, and basic computing tasks. It connects via USB and offers a simple, reliable typing experience with a durable build.','Full-size layout (104 keys): Includes all standard keys plus a dedicated ₹ (rupee) keyUSB wired connectivity: Easy plug-and-play, no drivers neededUV-coated keys: Helps prevent key fading and improves durabilityRetractable stand: Adjustable tilt for comfortable typingCompact & lightweight design: Suitable for desks with limited spaceCompatible with multiple systems: Works with Windows, Linux, and other OS',NULL,NULL,'products/1775104843150-818564750.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:40:43','2026-04-02 04:40:43'),
