(3461,'Skotch AAA Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The Skotch AAA Battery is a budget-friendly power solution designed for everyday household use. It is typically a zinc-carbon (heavy-duty) battery, delivering a standard 1.5V output, making it suitable for low-drain devices such as remote controls, wall clocks, radios, and small flashlights. These batteries are built to provide consistent and stable power for basic electronic applications.','Skotch batteries are known for their affordability and practicality, making them ideal for bulk usage in homes, shops, and offices where frequent battery replacement is needed. They are lightweight and compatible with all standard AAA battery slots, ensuring easy installation and wide usability.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775105458230-787014699.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:50:58','2026-04-02 04:50:58'),
(3462,'Enter Typist mini wired slim keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,1650.00,'The Enter Typist Mini Wired Slim Keyboard is a compact and lightweight keyboard designed for users who prefer portability and space-saving setups. With its slim profile and reduced key layout, it is ideal for laptops, small desks, and travel use.','Compact mini design (78 keys): Saves desk space while retaining essential keys\r\nSlim profile: Lightweight and easy to carry\r\nChocolate-style keys: Flat, soft-touch keys for smooth and quiet typing\r\nUSB wired connectivity: Plug-and-play (no drivers required)\r\nSilent keystrokes: Comfortable typing with minimal noise',NULL,NULL,'products/1775105529440-607292244.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:52:09','2026-04-02 04:52:09'),
(3463,'9V Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,299.00,'A 9V battery is a compact, rectangular-shaped battery that provides a standard output of 9 volts and is widely used in various electronic devices. It is commonly used in applications such as smoke detectors, wireless microphones, multimeters, toys, and portable radios, where a steady and reliable power supply is required. These batteries are available in different types, including alkaline, zinc-carbon (heavy-duty), lithium, and rechargeable variants like Ni-MH.','The most popular type is the alkaline 9V battery, which offers longer life and better performance compared to heavy-duty versions. A typical 9V battery has snap-type connectors on the top, making it easy to attach and replace. It is designed to deliver consistent voltage, which is important for safety devices and precision instruments.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775105643678-444456439.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:54:03','2026-04-02 04:54:03'),
(3464,'Dell KB216 Wired Multimedia keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,3000.00,'The Dell KB216 Wired Multimedia Keyboard is a full-size, reliable USB keyboard built for everyday computing tasks. It features a slim, modern design with chiclet-style keys, offering comfortable and quiet typing for office, school, or home use.','Full-size layout: Includes standard keys with a dedicated numeric keypad\r\nChiclet-style keys: Laptop-like keys for smooth and comfortable typing\r\nMultimedia hotkeys: Quick access to volume, play/pause, rewind, and forward functions\r\nUSB wired connectivity: Plug-and-play, no drivers required\r\nQuiet typing: Rubber dome (plunger) keys reduce typing noise\r\nSlim & ergonomic design: Comfortable for long typing sessions without wrist strain',NULL,NULL,'products/1775105799664-278440940.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:56:39','2026-04-02 04:56:39'),
(3465,'9V Battery charger',NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,'A 9V battery charger is a device used to recharge rechargeable 9V batteries (Ni-MH, Ni-Cd, or lithium types), helping save money and reduce battery waste. When choosing one, the most important factors are battery compatibility, charging slots, safety features, and charging speed.','A 9V battery charger is a compact electronic device designed to recharge rechargeable 9-volt batteries commonly used in devices like smoke detectors, microphones, multimeters, toys, and remote controls. It works with battery types such as NiMH (Nickel Metal Hydride) or Li-ion 9V batteries, ensuring safe and efficient charging.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775105841754-316496796.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 04:57:21','2026-04-02 04:57:21'),
(3466,'Eveready heavy duty big battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A heavy-duty 9V battery from Eveready is a reliable power source designed for everyday electronic devices such as smoke detectors, microphones, toys, multimeters, and radios. These batteries are typically made using zinc-carbon technology, offering steady performance and good power retention for low to moderate drain devices.','Eveready heavy-duty 9V batteries (commonly model 1216 / 6F22) are known for features like leak resistance, long shelf life (up to a few years when unused), and a sealed design that prevents spillage and damage. They are non-rechargeable and ready to use instantly, making them ideal for household and professional applications where dependable, cost-effective power is required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775106479112-910074838.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 05:07:59','2026-04-02 05:07:59'),
