(3468,'Eveready AA Small Battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'An Eveready AA small battery is a widely used 1.5V power source designed for everyday electronic devices such as remote controls, clocks, toys, flashlights, and wireless accessories. These batteries are available in different types like zinc-carbon for basic usage, alkaline for longer-lasting performance, and rechargeable NiMH for repeated use.','Eveready AA batteries are known for their reliable power, leak-resistant design, and long shelf life, making them suitable for both household and professional applications. They provide consistent energy output and are compatible with a wide range of devices, ensuring convenience and efficiency in daily use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775106627940-673555701.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 05:10:27','2026-04-02 05:10:27'),
