(3493,'Oswal 40g soldering lead',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The Oswal 40g soldering lead is a reliable solder wire designed for electronics repair, PCB work, and general electrical connections. It is typically made with a 60% tin and 40% lead (Sn60/Pb40) composition, which ensures strong joints, smooth flow, and good electrical conductivity.','This solder wire comes with a rosin core (flux inside the wire) that helps clean the surface and improves soldering quality, eliminating the need for extra flux in most cases. It melts at a low temperature of around 183–190°C, making it easy to use with standard soldering irons.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775115196052-915682199.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 07:33:16','2026-04-02 07:33:16'),
