(3532,'20mm LDR Sensor',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'A 20mm LDR sensor is an electronic component whose resistance changes according to the intensity of light falling on it. When exposed to bright light, its resistance decreases, and in darkness, the resistance increases significantly. This sensor is commonly used in automatic lighting systems, street lights, light-controlled switches, and Arduino-based projects','The larger 20mm size provides better light sensitivity and wider detection area compared to smaller LDRs. It usually has two terminals, operates in a wide temperature range, and can handle moderate voltage levels. Due to its simple working principle and low cost, the 20mm LDR is widely used in both educational and industrial applications',NULL,NULL,'products/1775129334720-634017217.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 11:28:54','2026-04-02 11:28:54'),
(3533,'Sm gold type c to aux jack',NULL,NULL,NULL,299.00,'The SM Gold Type-C to AUX jack is a compact and durable audio adapter that allows you to connect your 3.5mm earphones, headphones, or speakers to smartphones and devices that only have a USB Type-C port. It is specially designed for modern phones that do not include a headphone jack','This adapter ensures smooth audio transmission and lets you enjoy music, calls, and media without needing wireless devices. It is lightweight, easy to carry, and perfect for everyday use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775137802552-453618505.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 13:50:02','2026-04-02 13:50:02'),
(3534,'USB type c to hdtv multifunction adapter ',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'A USB Type-C to HDTV multifunction adapter is a versatile device that allows you to connect your USB-C enabled smartphone, laptop, or tablet to an HDTV, monitor, or projector using an HDMI connection. It not only mirrors or extends your screen but also provides additional ports like USB and charging for multi-purpose use.','This adapter is ideal for presentations, watching movies, gaming, and multitasking on a larger display. It delivers high-definition video and audio output while maintaining stable performance and convenience.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775138549491-961761036.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 14:02:29','2026-04-02 14:02:29'),
(3535,'Av to hdmi converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'An AV to HDMI converter is an electronic device that converts analog audio and video signals (RCA/AV) into a digital HDMI signal, allowing you to connect older devices to modern TVs, monitors, or projectors.','It is commonly used to connect devices like DVD players, set-top boxes, VCRs, CCTV cameras, and retro gaming consoles (with red, white, and yellow cables) to new HDTVs that only support HDMI input.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775139271291-346627769.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 14:14:31','2026-04-02 14:14:31'),
(3536,'Vga to hdmi converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'The Mexicom (Maxicom) VGA to HDMI converter is a compact and efficient device designed to convert analog VGA video signals into digital HDMI output, allowing you to connect older devices like computers or laptops to modern HDTVs, monitors, or projectors.','This converter supports both video and audio conversion, ensuring a complete multimedia experience on HDMI displays. It is ideal for upgrading legacy systems to work with the latest display technologies.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775139759317-660203964.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 14:22:39','2026-04-02 14:22:39'),
(3537,'Vga to hdtv converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'A VGA to HDTV converter is an electronic device used to connect old VGA-enabled devices (like desktops, laptops, or DVD players) to modern HDTVs or monitors with HDMI input. It converts the analog VGA video signal into a digital HDMI signal, enabling compatibility with newer display technology.','Since VGA supports only video, most converters include a 3.5mm audio input to combine sound with video and deliver both through a single HDMI output. These converters are widely used for upgrading older systems to work with modern TVs and projectors.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775140011534-299777363.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 14:26:51','2026-04-02 14:26:51'),
(3538,'Av to vga converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,699.00,'It is commonly used to connect devices like DVD players, set-top boxes, CCTV cameras, and gaming consoles (with red, white, yellow cables) to VGA monitors or projectors. The converter processes the analog signal and converts it into a compatible VGA format for display.','An AV to VGA converter is a device used to convert analog AV (RCA) signals into a VGA output, allowing you to connect older AV devices to monitors or projectors that support VGA input.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775140369504-568711693.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 14:32:49','2026-04-02 14:32:49'),
(3539,'hdmi to av converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'An HDMI to AV converter is a device that converts digital HDMI signals into analog AV (RCA) output, allowing you to connect modern devices to older TVs or displays that only support AV input.','It is commonly used to connect devices like set-top boxes, streaming devices, laptops, gaming consoles, and DVD players with HDMI output to CRT TVs or older televisions with red, white, and yellow AV ports.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775140838530-649083569.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 14:40:38','2026-04-02 14:40:38'),
(3540,'Au to hdtv converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'This converter is ideal for connecting devices like set-top boxes, streaming devices, laptops, gaming consoles, and DVD players to CRT TVs or older televisions with red, white, and yellow AV inputs. It converts high-definition signals into standard-definition output compatible with legacy displays.','An HDMI to AV converter (HDTV to AV converter) is a device used to convert digital HDMI signals into analog AV (RCA) output, allowing modern devices to work with older TVs that do not have HDMI ports',NULL,NULL,'products/1775141388512-75825754.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 14:49:48','2026-04-02 14:49:48'),
(3541,'hdtv to av converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,598.00,'An HDTV to AV converter (also known as HDMI to AV converter) is a device that converts digital HDMI signals from HDTV devices into analog AV (RCA) output, allowing you to connect modern devices to older TVs.','It is mainly used to connect HDTV set-top boxes, streaming devices, laptops, gaming consoles, and media players to CRT TVs or older televisions that only support AV input (red, white, yellow ports).',NULL,NULL,'products/1775141679058-544381837.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 14:54:39','2026-04-02 14:54:39'),
(3542,'hdmi  to vga converter ',NULL,NULL,NULL,598.00,'An HDMI to VGA converter is a compact device that converts digital HDMI signals into analog VGA output, allowing you to connect modern devices like laptops, set-top boxes, or gaming consoles to older monitors or projectors that support VGA input.','Since HDMI carries both audio and video while VGA supports only video, many converters include a 3.5mm audio output for connecting external speakers or headphones.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775141913704-63419726.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 14:58:33','2026-04-02 14:58:33'),
(3543,'Hdtv to vga converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,601.00,'An HDTV to VGA converter (also known as HDMI to VGA converter) is a device used to convert digital HDMI signals from HDTV devices into analog VGA output, allowing modern devices to connect to older monitors or projectors that only support VGA input.','It is commonly used with devices like laptops, set-top boxes, gaming consoles, and media players to display content on VGA monitors, LCD screens, or projectors.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775142245998-683943818.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-02 15:04:06','2026-04-02 15:04:06'),
