(3570,'Trueone Win/Mac Wired Mouse',NULL,NULL,NULL,399.00,'The Trueone Win/Mac Wired Mouse is a reliable and user-friendly input device designed for smooth performance across both Windows and macOS systems. Built for everyday use, it offers plug-and-play convenience, eliminating the need for additional drivers or software installation.','Universal Compatibility\r\nWorks seamlessly with Windows PCs and macOS devices, making it ideal for home, office, and student use.\r\nPlug & Play USB Connectivity\r\nSimply connect via USB port and start using instantly—no setup required.\r\nOptical Tracking Technology\r\nEquipped with a precise optical sensor for smooth cursor movement and accurate tracking on most surfaces.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775277981464-686913340.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 04:46:21','2026-04-04 04:46:21'),
(3571,'DPlus 4G Router',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'DPlus 4G Router is a SIM-based networking device designed to provide high-speed internet connectivity using 4G LTE networks. It allows users to convert mobile data into a wireless WiFi network, making it ideal for homes, offices, shops, and security systems.','4G LTE Connectivity: Provides fast and stable internet using mobile networks\r\nSIM Card Support: Works without broadband—just insert SIM and use\r\nWiFi Sharing: Connect multiple devices like mobiles, laptops, and cameras\r\nExternal Antenna Support: Improves signal strength and coverage\r\nLAN Ports: Allows wired connection for DVR, NVR, or PCs\r\nSecure Network: Supports WPA/WPA2 encryption for safe usage',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-04-04 09:51:52','2026-04-04 09:51:52'),
(3572,'Tv stick android tv ',NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,'An Android TV Stick is a compact streaming device that plugs directly into your TV’s HDMI port and converts a normal TV into a Smart TV. It runs on the Android TV operating system, allowing access to apps, streaming platforms, and internet features.','An Android TV stick is a simple and affordable way to upgrade any TV into a smart entertainment system. Devices like the Xiaomi TV Stick 4K support 4K streaming, Dolby audio, and voice control, delivering a premium viewing experience in a compact form.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775298741744-533660404.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 10:32:21','2026-04-04 10:32:21'),
(3573,'COFE Wifi 4G/5G Wireless Router',NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,'COFE WiFi 4G/5G Wireless Router is a SIM-based high-speed networking device designed to provide internet connectivity without the need for broadband. It converts 4G/5G mobile data into a stable WiFi network, making it ideal for homes, offices, shops, and surveillance systems.','4G/5G SIM Support: Works with all GSM SIM cards for instant internet access\r\nHigh-Speed Connectivity: Supports speeds up to 300 Mbps for smooth browsing and streaming\r\nWiFi + LAN Connectivity: Provides both wireless and wired internet options\r\nMulti-Device Support: Connect up to 10 devices simultaneously\r\nExternal Antennas: Enhances signal strength and coverage area (up to ~150–200 meters)',NULL,NULL,'products/1775299015792-318502432.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 10:36:55','2026-04-04 10:36:55'),
(3574,'Tenda wireless easy setup router ','Model F3',NULL,NULL,2999.00,'A Tenda wireless easy setup router is a user-friendly Wi-Fi router designed for quick installation and hassle-free internet sharing. It allows you to connect broadband internet and distribute it wirelessly to multiple devices with minimal configuration.','Tenda routers are known for their simple setup process and budget-friendly pricing. Users can quickly configure the router through a browser or app without technical knowledge. These routers are ideal for homes, shops, and small offices, offering stable internet and decent coverage.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775299366512-106378802.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 10:42:46','2026-04-04 10:42:46'),
(3575,'Techie 4G CPE Wireless Router',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'Techie 4G CPE Wireless Router is a SIM-based broadband device designed to provide reliable internet connectivity using 4G LTE networks. It converts mobile data into a wireless WiFi network, making it ideal for homes, offices, shops, and CCTV installations.','4G SIM Support: Works with major networks like Jio, Airtel, and Vi\r\nHigh-Speed Internet: Supports speeds up to 150 Mbps\r\nExternal Antennas: Usually comes with 4 antennas for better signal strength\r\nWiFi Sharing: Connect multiple devices like mobiles, laptops, smart TVs',NULL,NULL,'products/1775300186937-187811169.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 10:56:26','2026-04-04 10:56:26'),
(3576,'Syrotech Xpon Ont Wireless Router',NULL,NULL,NULL,3497.00,'Syrotech XPON ONT Wireless Router is a fiber broadband device specially designed for FTTH (Fiber to the Home) connections. It acts as a bridge between the fiber optic cable from your internet provider and your home network, converting optical signals into high-speed WiFi and LAN internet.','Fiber Internet Support (FTTH): Works directly with fiber optic connection\r\nDual Mode XPON: Compatible with both GPON & EPON networks\r\nHigh-Speed WiFi: Up to 300 Mbps / 1200 Mbps / WiFi 6 (AX1500) depending on model\r\nDual Band (2.4GHz + 5GHz): Better speed and less interference\r\nMultiple LAN Ports: Connect PC, CCTV, Smart TV, etc.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775301042927-246695739.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 11:10:42','2026-04-04 11:10:42'),
(3577,'syrotech xpon ont router ',NULL,NULL,NULL,3499.00,'A Syrotech XPON ONT router is a fiber optic broadband device used in FTTH (Fiber to the Home) connections. It converts optical fiber signals into internet (Ethernet/Wi-Fi) for home or office use.','The Syrotech XPON ONT router is a compact and powerful fiber internet solution that combines optical modem + wireless router in one device. It ensures high-speed internet, stable connectivity, and wide coverage, making it ideal for modern homes and businesses.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775301072644-701999327.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 11:11:12','2026-04-04 11:11:12'),
(3578,'Huawei Wifi AX3 Wireless Router',NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,'Huawei WiFi AX3 Wireless Router is a powerful WiFi 6 (AX3000) router designed to deliver ultra-fast, stable, and wide-range internet connectivity. It is ideal for homes, offices, gamers, and smart device users who need high-speed performance and seamless multi-device connectivity.','WiFi 6 Technology: Latest 802.11ax standard for faster speed and better efficiency\r\nUltra-Fast Speed: Up to 3000 Mbps (574 Mbps on 2.4GHz + 2402 Mbps on 5GHz)\r\nDual Band Connectivity: 2.4GHz for coverage + 5GHz for high-speed performance\r\nSupports 128 Devices: Smooth performance even with multiple users connected',NULL,NULL,'products/1775301562154-985655046.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 11:19:22','2026-04-04 11:19:22'),
(3579,'tp-link Wireless N Router',NULL,NULL,NULL,1498.00,'TP-Link Wireless N Router is a reliable and budget-friendly networking device designed to provide stable internet connectivity for homes, offices, and small businesses. It uses Wireless N (802.11n) technology, offering a good balance of speed, coverage, and affordability for everyday internet usage.','Wireless N Technology: Supports IEEE 802.11 b/g/n standards for stable WiFi\r\nSpeed up to 300 Mbps: Suitable for HD streaming, browsing, and online gaming\r\nStrong Coverage: Equipped with external antennas for better signal strength\r\nMulti-Mode Operation: Works as Router, Access Point, and Range Extender\r\nEasy Setup: Simple web interface or app-based configuration',NULL,NULL,'products/1775301978060-529145201.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 11:26:18','2026-04-04 11:26:18'),
(3580,'Walta mr link transmitter and recevier','Model BT-006',NULL,NULL,399.00,'The Walta Bluetooth transmitter & receiver is a 2-in-1 wireless audio device that allows you to send and receive audio via Bluetooth. It helps convert non-Bluetooth devices into wireless devices and vice versa.','The Walta Bluetooth transmitter receiver is a simple and useful wireless audio solution. It bridges the gap between old wired devices and modern Bluetooth gadgets, allowing seamless audio streaming. Devices like these can upgrade TVs, speakers, and car systems to support wireless audio easily.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775301988817-321786260.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 11:26:28','2026-04-04 11:26:28'),
(3581,'tp-link AC1200 Wifi Router',NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,'TP-Link AC1200 WiFi Router is a high-speed dual-band wireless router designed for smooth internet performance in homes and small offices. It uses WiFi 5 (802.11ac) technology, offering faster speeds and better connectivity compared to older Wireless N routers.','AC1200 Dual Band Speed:\r\n300 Mbps on 2.4GHz\r\n867 Mbps on 5GHz\r\nHigh-Speed Performance: Up to 1200 Mbps combined speed for streaming, gaming, and browsing',NULL,NULL,'products/1775302276314-412302860.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 11:31:16','2026-04-04 11:31:16'),
(3582,'Lapcare vga to hdtv converter with audio ',NULL,NULL,NULL,698.00,'The Lapcare VGA to HDMI converter with audio is a practical solution for connecting older VGA-based devices to modern HDMI displays. It combines video and audio signals into a single HDMI output, delivering clear visuals and sound. Users find it easy to use and reliable for Full HD display setups.','The Lapcare VGA to HDTV converter with audio is an active signal converter that allows you to connect VGA output devices (like PC/laptop) to HDMI input displays (TV/monitor/projector).',NULL,NULL,'products/1775302583165-555480479.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 11:36:23','2026-04-04 11:36:23'),
(3583,'Live tech nano usb wireless adapter',NULL,NULL,NULL,399.00,'The Live Tech nano USB wireless adapter is a compact and affordable networking solution designed to provide wireless internet access to computers. It offers stable connectivity and decent speed (150 Mbps), making it ideal for everyday tasks like browsing, streaming, and office work','The Live Tech Nano USB Wireless Adapter is a small Wi-Fi dongle that allows a desktop or laptop to connect to a wireless network (Wi-Fi). It is especially useful for devices that don’t have built-in Wi-Fi or need improved connectivity.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775304979377-182061360.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 12:16:19','2026-04-04 12:16:19'),
(3584,'Hammok usb lan ether adapter ',NULL,NULL,NULL,799.00,'The Hammok USB 2.0 to LAN adapter is a simple and affordable networking solution that provides stable wired internet connectivity. It is ideal for users who need reliable internet performance compared to Wi-Fi, especially in offices, homes, and technical setups.','The Hammok USB 2.0 to LAN Ethernet adapter is a wired network converter that allows you to connect your laptop or desktop to a wired Ethernet network using a USB port.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775306494339-405238390.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 12:41:34','2026-04-04 12:41:34'),
(3585,'Techine wireless nano usb adapter',NULL,NULL,NULL,799.00,'The Techie Wireless 150 Mbps USB WiFi Adapter is a compact and efficient networking solution designed to add wireless connectivity to desktops, laptops, and other compatible devices. With its ultra-small nano design, it can be plugged into a USB port and left in place without obstruction, making it ideal for both home and office use.','The device features plug-and-play functionality for easy setup, with driver support available for Windows, Linux, and Mac systems. It is also compatible with devices like PCs, laptops, and Android TV boxes, making it highly versatile.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775307194392-837737082.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 12:53:14','2026-04-04 12:53:14'),
(3586,'Techine HDTV to VGA cable connector ',NULL,NULL,NULL,699.00,'The Techie HDTV to VGA Cable Connector is a reliable solution designed to connect modern HDMI (HDTV) devices such as laptops, desktops, set-top boxes, and gaming consoles to VGA-supported monitors or projectors. It converts digital HDMI signals into analog VGA output, making it ideal for use with older display systems.','The plug-and-play design allows easy installation without the need for additional drivers, making it convenient for both home and office environments. Some variants also include audio output support (3.5mm jack) for connecting external speakers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775310600670-738311757.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 13:50:00','2026-04-04 13:50:00'),
(3587,'Tenda mini usb wireless nano usb adaptor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The Tenda Mini USB Wireless Nano Adapter is a compact and powerful device that enables desktops and laptops to connect to WiFi networks. Its ultra-small nano design allows it to stay plugged into your USB port without blocking other ports, making it perfect for both home and office use.','This adapter supports wireless speeds up to 150 Mbps (N150 models), suitable for browsing, email, video streaming, and online work. Advanced versions like the W311MI V6 also support Wi-Fi 6 with speeds up to 286 Mbps, offering faster performance and lower latency.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775312351585-39844101.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-04 14:19:11','2026-04-04 14:19:11'),
(3588,'Zebronics Dome Camera','AHDPDL24',NULL,NULL,7999.00,'The Zebronics ZEB-AHDPDSL24 Dome Camera is a high-performance CCTV surveillance camera designed for indoor security in homes, offices, shops, and commercial spaces. With its compact dome design and advanced imaging features, it delivers clear and reliable monitoring both day and night. This camera features a high-resolution CMOS sensor (up to 2MP/5MP variants) that captures sharp and detailed video. It supports multiple video formats like AHD, TVI, CVI, and CVBS, ensuring compatibility with most DVR systems.','Equipped with IR night vision up to 20 meters, the camera provides clear footage even in complete darkness. It also includes advanced image enhancement technologies like WDR, DNR, BLC, and AGC, which improve video quality in challenging lighting conditions.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775449455024-598062450.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 04:24:15','2026-04-06 04:24:15'),
(3589,'Desktop Switch ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'It helps expand network connectivity and ensures fast, stable data transfer between connected devices.','A TP-Link desktop switch is an easy-to-use networking device that expands your wired network by allowing multiple devices to connect simultaneously.','With plug-and-play setup, high-speed performance, and reliable build quality, it is perfect for homes, offices, and small business environments.',NULL,'products/1775449945865-535003702.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 04:32:25','2026-04-06 04:32:25'),
(3590,'Zebronics Dome Camera IPPDSL5','IPPDSL5',NULL,NULL,9999.00,'The Zebronics IPPDSL5 Dome Camera is a high-performance IP-based CCTV camera designed for advanced indoor surveillance. With its 5MP ultra-clear resolution, it delivers sharp, detailed video, making it ideal for homes, offices, shops, and commercial spaces.Equipped with a CMOS sensor and H.265 video compression, this camera ensures efficient storage and smooth streaming over networks. It supports IP (network) connectivity, allowing remote monitoring via mobile apps or NVR systems','One of its standout features is full-color night vision, powered by warm LED lights and IR LEDs, enabling clear footage even in low-light or complete darkness up to 20 meters range. The camera also includes advanced image processing technologies like WDR, DNR, BLC, AGC, and AWB, which enhance video quality in challenging lighting conditions',NULL,NULL,'products/1775450137362-531268479.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 04:35:37','2026-04-06 04:35:37'),
(3591,'Zebronics Bullet Camera','AHDPBSL24',NULL,NULL,8999.00,'The Zebronics AHDPBSL24 Bullet Camera is a powerful HD CCTV surveillance camera designed for outdoor security applications such as homes, shops, offices, and warehouses. With its rugged bullet design and advanced imaging features, it ensures reliable monitoring in both day and night conditions. This camera features a 5MP high-resolution CMOS sensor, delivering sharp and detailed video footage. It supports multiple video formats like AHD, TVI, CVI, and CVBS, making it compatible with most DVR systems.','The camera also includes advanced image processing technologies such as WDR, DNR, BLC, AGC, AWB, and HLC, ensuring better clarity in different lighting environments. Built with an IP66 weatherproof body, it is ideal for outdoor installation, offering protection against dust and rain.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775450327743-597064990.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 04:38:47','2026-04-06 04:38:47'),
(3592,'Zeb-Smart CAM 102 Smart WiFi PTZ Indoor Camera',NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,'The Zebronics ZEB-Smart CAM 102 is a compact and intelligent WiFi PTZ (Pan-Tilt-Zoom) indoor security camera designed for real-time monitoring of homes, offices, and shops. With smart connectivity and mobile app control, it allows you to keep an eye on your space from anywhere.This camera features Full HD 1080p resolution, delivering clear and detailed video footage. Its PTZ functionality enables remote control of pan and tilt movements through the mobile app, ensuring wider coverage of the room.','Equipped with IR night vision, the camera can capture footage even in complete darkness up to 5 meters, making it suitable for 24/7 surveillance. It also includes motion detection and motion tracking, sending alerts to your smartphone when activity is detected. The built-in microphone and speaker support two-way audio communication, allowing you to talk and listen remotely',NULL,NULL,'products/1775454207397-142587658.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 05:43:27','2026-04-06 05:43:27'),
(3593,'Desktop Top switch 5 port','DES-1005C',NULL,NULL,1.00,'A desktop 5 port network switch is a compact and efficient networking device used to connect multiple devices such as computers, printers, routers, and CCTV systems within a local area network (LAN).','It typically comes with five Ethernet ports that support automatic speed detection (10/100 Mbps or Gigabit), allowing smooth data transfer between connected devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775456362068-11313214.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 05:58:12','2026-04-06 06:19:22'),
(3594,'Mini Wifi Wireless pan-tilt IP Camera',NULL,NULL,NULL,12999.00,'A Mini WiFi PTZ IP Camera is a compact, wireless CCTV camera that connects to your home or office WiFi network. It allows remote viewing, pan-tilt control, motion alerts, and two-way communication through a mobile app.','These cameras offer wide-area coverage thanks to motorized movement (pan & tilt), enabling you to monitor an entire room without installing multiple cameras. Many models support HD/Full HD/2K resolution, ensuring clear video quality.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775455743677-944760926.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 06:09:03','2026-04-06 06:09:03'),
(3595,'Zebronics 4 Port Poe Switch',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'Zebronics 4 Port PoE Switch  is a compact networking device used to connect and power IP cameras, CCTV systems, and network devices through a single Ethernet cable.','It combines data + power (PoE – Power over Ethernet), making installation simple and reducing the need for extra wiring.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775455809679-617673348.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 06:10:09','2026-04-06 06:10:09'),
(3596,'Trueview all time color 4g camera',NULL,NULL,NULL,9999.00,'The Trueview All Time Color 4G Camera is an advanced SIM-based CCTV security camera designed for locations where WiFi or broadband is not available. It works using a 4G SIM card, allowing you to monitor your property remotely from anywhere through a mobile app. One of its main highlights is All-Time Color Vision, which provides full-color video even at night, unlike traditional cameras that switch to black & white. This ensures better identification of people, vehicles, and objects in low-light conditions.','The camera typically comes with 3MP (1296p) HD resolution, delivering clear and detailed footage. It also supports two-way audio, enabling communication through the built-in microphone and speaker.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775456457485-725431852.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 06:20:57','2026-04-06 06:20:57'),
(3597,'Tenda AC1200 Smart Dual-Bond Wifi Router','AC5',NULL,NULL,2099.00,'The Tenda AC1200 Smart Dual-Band WiFi Router is a reliable and affordable networking device designed for home and small office internet use. It supports the latest Wi-Fi 5 (802.11ac) standard, providing faster speeds, better coverage, and smoother connectivity for multiple devices.','Dual-Band High-Speed Performance\r\nCombined speed up to 1200 Mbps (AC1200 class)\r\n2.4GHz: up to 300 Mbps\r\n5GHz: up to 867 Mbps\r\nAutomatically assigns devices to the best band for performance',NULL,NULL,'products/1775456762125-157753178.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 06:26:02','2026-04-06 06:26:02'),
(3598,'Wifi smart Net camera',NULL,NULL,NULL,4997.00,'A WiFi Smart Net Camera is a compact and intelligent wireless IP CCTV camera designed for home, office, and shop security. It connects directly to your WiFi network, allowing you to monitor live video from anywhere using a mobile app.','A WiFi Smart Net Camera is a compact and intelligent wireless IP CCTV camera designed for home, office, and shop security. It connects directly to your WiFi network, allowing you to monitor live video from anywhere using a mobile app.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775457719784-197957766.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 06:41:59','2026-04-06 06:41:59'),
(3599,'HIKVISION DS-2CE76H0T-ITPFS Audio Camera',NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,'The Hikvision DS-2CE76H0T-ITPFS is a high-quality 5MP HD audio dome CCTV camera designed for indoor surveillance. It combines high-resolution video recording with built-in audio, making it ideal for locations where both video and sound monitoring are required. This camera features a 5MP CMOS sensor that delivers clear and detailed images with a resolution of 2560 × 1944 pixels, ensuring sharp video quality.','The camera is equipped with Smart IR night vision up to 20 meters, providing clear visibility even in complete darkness.It also supports 4-in-1 video output (TVI / AHD / CVI / CVBS), making it compatible with most DVR systems available in the market.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775458604825-298354401.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 06:56:44','2026-04-06 06:56:44'),
(3600,'Kensonic 4K–2K Splitter',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Kensonic 4K–2K HDMI splitter allows a single HDMI input source such as a set-top box, laptop, or DVR to be distributed to multiple HDMI displays simultaneously. It supports high-resolution output up to 4K × 2K Ultra HD, ensuring clear and sharp video quality with stable audio transmission.','The device is designed with advanced signal amplification technology to avoid signal loss and maintain performance over longer distances. Most splitters work in mirror mode, meaning the same content is shown on all connected screens.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-04-06 07:03:33','2026-04-06 07:03:33'),
(3601,'dahua IR Bullet Camera',NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,'The Dahua IR Bullet Camera is a reliable outdoor CCTV surveillance camera designed for homes, shops, offices, and industrial areas. It features a rugged bullet design and advanced imaging technology, making it ideal for day and night security monitoring.\r\nThese cameras typically come with 2MP, 4MP, or 5MP resolution, delivering clear and detailed video footage. Most models use HDCVI or IP technology, ensuring compatibility with DVR or NVR systems.','The camera also supports multi-format video output (CVI / TVI / AHD / CVBS), making it easy to integrate with existing CCTV setups. Built with an IP67 weatherproof body, Dahua bullet cameras are suitable for outdoor environments, offering protection against dust, rain, and harsh weather conditions.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775459202112-698679019.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 07:06:42','2026-04-06 07:06:42'),
(3602,'Lapcare LDF72 4G Modem',' LDF72 ',NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The Lapcare LDF72 is a compact and portable 4G LTE USB WiFi modem (dongle) designed to provide high-speed internet access anywhere using a SIM card. It works as both a USB data card and a WiFi hotspot device.','4G LTE High-Speed Internet\r\nDownload speeds up to 150 Mbps\r\nUpload speeds up to 50 Mbps (depends on network)\r\nWiFi Hotspot Function\r\nCan connect up to 10 devices simultaneously\r\nWorks like a mini portable router\r\nAll SIM Support\r\nCompatible with Jio, Airtel, Vi, BSNL',NULL,NULL,'products/1775459855170-459232206.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 07:17:35','2026-04-06 07:17:35'),
(3603,'Kensonic HD Audio Digital Surround Sound Decoder',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Kensonic HD Audio Digital Surround Sound Decoder is an electronic audio device used to convert digital audio signals into 5.1 channel analog surround sound output. It supports inputs like optical (SPDIF) and coaxial cables from TVs, set-top boxes, gaming consoles, and media players','The decoder processes audio formats such as Dolby Digital (AC3) and DTS, delivering clear, immersive sound through home theater speaker systems. These devices use digital signal processing to enhance sound quality and are commonly used in home entertainment setups.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775461228524-31642854.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 07:40:28','2026-04-06 07:40:28'),
(3604,'Hikvision Turbo HD DVR 7100 series','DS-7108GHI-K1',NULL,NULL,4999.00,'The Hikvision Turbo HD DVR 7100 Series is a reliable and widely used CCTV digital video recorder designed for small to medium surveillance systems. It supports HD-TVI, AHD, CVI, CVBS, and IP cameras, making it highly flexible for both new and existing CCTV setups.This DVR series supports high-resolution recording up to 5MP / 3K / 1080p, ensuring clear video quality for security monitoring. It also uses H.265 / H.265+ compression technology, which significantly reduces storage usage while maintaining video clarity.','It comes with HDMI and VGA output, enabling connection to monitors for live viewing and playback. The DVR supports hard disk storage up to 6TB, providing ample space for continuous recording.Advanced versions (AcuSense models) include smart features like human & vehicle detection, reducing false alarms and improving security efficiency.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775461623280-41114978.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 07:47:03','2026-04-06 07:47:03'),
(3605,'Dahua DH-XVR4B04-I Digital Video Recorder','DH-XVR4B04-I',NULL,NULL,5999.00,'The Dahua DH-XVR4B04-I is a compact and powerful 4-channel digital video recorder (DVR) from Dahua’s WizSense (AI) series, designed for small CCTV setups like homes, shops, and offices. It supports multiple camera formats and smart AI features, making it a flexible and modern surveillance solution.','This DVR is a penta-brid recorder, meaning it supports HDCVI, AHD, TVI, CVBS, and IP cameras, allowing easy integration with both old and new CCTV systems. \r\nIt uses H.265+ video compression, which significantly reduces storage usage while maintaining high video quality',NULL,NULL,'products/1775464951714-795481827.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 08:42:31','2026-04-06 08:42:31'),
(3606,'Kensonic HD Audio Digital Surround Sound Decoder',NULL,NULL,NULL,4498.00,'Kensonic 4K–2K Splitter is a high-quality HDMI video distribution device used to split one HDMI signal into multiple outputs without losing picture or sound quality. It is widely used in TVs, CCTV systems, projectors, and digital display setups.','These devices are widely used in entertainment setups where digital audio needs to be converted into analog output for amplifiers or speakers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775465157058-436798265.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 08:45:57','2026-04-06 08:45:57'),
(3607,'Zeb 8CHVS4TA5M 8 Channel XVR',NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,'The Zebronics ZEB-8CHVS4TA5M 8 Channel XVR is a versatile and reliable digital video recorder designed for medium-scale CCTV surveillance systems in homes, shops, and offices. It supports up to 8 camera channels with flexible configurations including IP and analog cameras (AHD, TVI, CVI, CVBS), making it suitable for both new installations and upgrades','The device supports cameras up to 5MP resolution, delivering clear and detailed video recording, while its H.265/H.264 compression technology helps reduce storage usage without compromising quality. It features HDMI and VGA output for display, supports one SATA hard drive up to 4TB, and offers functions like motion detection, scheduled recording, and remote monitoring via smartphone apps.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775465829548-472933390.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 08:57:09','2026-04-06 08:57:09'),
(3608,'Zeb 16CHVS6TA8M NVR ',NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,'The Zebronics ZEB-16CHVS6TA8M NVR is a powerful 16-channel Network Video Recorder (NVR) designed for advanced CCTV surveillance systems in large homes, offices, shops, and commercial setups. It supports up to 16 IP cameras, making it ideal for users who need wide-area monitoring with centralized control.','This NVR supports high-resolution cameras up to 8MP (4K), ensuring crystal-clear video recording and playback. It uses H.265/H.264 compression technology, which helps reduce storage usage while maintaining high-quality video output.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775466225475-278995139.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 09:03:45','2026-04-06 09:03:45'),
(3609,'HD Extender power supply ','QS80',NULL,NULL,3999.00,'An HD Extender Power Supply is a small AC-to-DC adapter used to provide power to HDMI extender devices (TX/RX units). These adapters typically convert mains electricity (100–240V AC) into low-voltage DC (commonly 5V/1A or 5V/2A) required for stable operation.','HDMI extenders rely on this power to transmit high-definition video and audio signals over long distances via LAN (Cat5/Cat6) cables without signal loss.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775466394577-759590408.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 09:06:34','2026-04-06 09:06:34'),
(3610,'Consistent 500 GB SATA Hard Drive',NULL,NULL,NULL,2199.00,'The Consistent 500GB SATA Hard Drive is a reliable internal storage device designed for desktops and surveillance systems.','It uses the SATA (Serial ATA) interface to provide fast and stable data transfer speeds, making it suitable for storing operating systems, software, documents, videos, and other files. With a storage capacity of 500GB, it offers sufficient space for everyday computing needs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775466910010-132825720.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 09:15:10','2026-04-06 09:15:10'),
(3611,'Artis PS-U-65W Laptop Adapter',' PS-U-65W',NULL,NULL,1399.00,'The Artis PS‑U‑65W Universal Laptop Adapter is a versatile 65 W laptop power charger designed to work with many different notebook computers using one universal unit. It’s especially useful as a replacement or spare charger if your original adapter is lost, damaged, or if you want one charger that fits multiple devices.','65 W Output Power — Delivers up to 65 watts of DC power, sufficient for the charging needs of most mainstream laptops.\r\nWide Compatibility — Comes with 8 interchangeable connector pins so you can match the adapter’s plug to a variety of laptop models and brands (e.g., Dell, HP, Lenovo, ASUS, Acer, Samsung, IBM, Toshiba).\r\nAdjustable Voltage — Supports multiple output voltages typically ranging from 14.5 V to 20 V, allowing it to adapt to the requirements of different laptops.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775466926764-420470979.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 09:15:26','2026-04-06 09:24:55'),
(3612,'Enter E-W400 Wireless Wifi Dongle',' E-W400',NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Enter E‑W400 is a USB 2.0 wireless network adapter (Wi‑Fi dongle) that lets a desktop PC or laptop connect to a Wi‑Fi network when it doesn’t have built‑in wireless, or its internal Wi‑Fi isn’t working. It’s a compact plug‑and‑play device with an external antenna that boosts wireless reception.','Model: E‑W400 USB 2.0 Wi‑Fi Adapter.\r\nInterface: USB 2.0 plug‑in (no extra power cable needed).\r\nWireless Standards: Supports IEEE 802.11b/g/n on 2.4 GHz Wi‑Fi.\r\nFrequency Range: 2.400–2.4835 GHz (standard 2.4 GHz band).\r\nMax Speed: Up to ~400 Mbps dynamic wireless data rate.\r\nAntenna: 5 dB external antenna for improved reception and range.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775472363515-899938644.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 10:46:03','2026-04-06 10:46:03'),
(3613,'Hammok card reader super speed USB 3 in 1 ',NULL,' ',NULL,1399.00,'The Hammok Card Reader Super Speed USB 3.0 (3-in-1 Type-C) is a compact and high-performance device designed for fast data transfer between memory cards and modern devices like laptops, PCs, and smartphones. Equipped with USB 3.0 and Type-C OTG support, it ensures seamless connectivity and ultra-fast file transfer speeds.','This 3-in-1 card reader typically supports SD Card, microSD (TF Card), and other compatible formats, allowing users to easily read and write data from multiple memory sources. It supports high-capacity storage cards up to 1000GB (1TB), making it ideal for handling large files such as HD videos, photos, and backups.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775476564380-907344782.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 11:56:04','2026-04-06 11:56:04'),
(3614,'Lapcare type c and USB 3 in 1  ethernet connector ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1699.00,'The Lapcare Type-C & USB 3.0 (3-in-1 Ethernet Connector) is a versatile networking adapter designed to provide stable wired internet connectivity along with additional USB expansion. It features a dual interface (USB + Type-C), making it compatible with a wide range of devices including laptops, desktops, and modern smartphones.','This adapter typically includes RJ45 Ethernet port + USB 3.0 ports, allowing users to connect to high-speed wired networks while simultaneously using peripherals like keyboard, mouse, or pen drive. It supports Gigabit Ethernet speeds (10/100/1000 Mbps), ensuring fast and reliable internet for streaming, gaming, video calls, and office work.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775477051558-290692122.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 12:04:11','2026-04-06 12:04:11'),
(3615,'4TB sata USB 3.0 to sata cable ','Model RXD-339U3',NULL,NULL,699.00,'A USB 3.0 to SATA cable is a portable adapter that allows you to connect a 2.5-inch SATA hard drive (HDD) or solid-state drive (SSD) directly to a computer via a USB port. It is commonly used for data transfer, backup, recovery, and drive testing.','A 4TB USB 3.0 to SATA converter cable is a fast, plug-and-play solution to use internal laptop hard drives externally, offering high-speed transfer, wide compatibility, and easy portability.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775481269730-36510523.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 13:14:29','2026-04-06 13:14:29'),
(3616,'USB wireless dogle ',NULL,NULL,NULL,299.00,'A USB Wireless Dongle is a small plug-and-play device that enables wireless connectivity on desktops, laptops, or other compatible devices. It is commonly used to add Wi-Fi or Bluetooth functionality to systems that do not have built-in wireless support.','This compact adapter connects through a USB port and allows users to access wireless networks or connect to Bluetooth-enabled devices such as keyboards, mice, headphones, and speaker.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775483660148-592480486.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 13:54:20','2026-04-06 13:54:20'),
(3617,'RD  wireless music recevier','Model DW-09',NULL,NULL,599.00,'The RD Wireless Music Receiver V5.2 + EDR is a compact Bluetooth audio adapter designed to convert wired speakers, car stereos, and home theater systems into wireless audio devices. It allows you to stream music directly from smartphones, tablets, or laptops without using cables.','Equipped with Bluetooth 5.2 + EDR (Enhanced Data Rate) technology, this receiver ensures faster data transmission, improved stability, and better sound quality compared to older versions. EDR enables higher-speed audio transfer, reducing lag and improving overall performance.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775484752278-559018940.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 14:12:32','2026-04-06 14:12:32'),
(3618,'ubest wireless music recevier ','Mode BT-B12',NULL,NULL,299.00,'The Ubest Wireless Music Receiver V2.1 + EDR is a compact Bluetooth audio adapter that enables wireless music streaming to wired speakers, car stereos, and home theater systems. It is designed to convert traditional audio devices into modern wireless systems without the need for complex installation.','Powered by Bluetooth V2.1 + EDR (Enhanced Data Rate) technology, this receiver provides stable connectivity, faster data transmission, and improved audio clarity. ',NULL,NULL,'products/1775485010357-784197650.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 14:16:50','2026-04-06 14:16:50'),
(3619,'Techie gigabite ethernet adapter ','Model CONV13',NULL,NULL,1399.00,'The Techie Gigabit Ethernet Adapter is a compact networking device that allows laptops, desktops, and other devices to connect to a wired internet network through a USB or Type-C port. It is especially useful for devices that do not have a built-in LAN (RJ45) port.','This adapter supports Gigabit Ethernet speeds up to 1000 Mbps, ensuring fast, stable, and reliable internet connectivity—ideal for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and large file transfers.\r\n\r\nIt features a plug-and-play design, meaning no external drivers are required for most operating systems like Windows, macOS, and Linux.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775485655359-143040295.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 14:27:35','2026-04-06 14:27:35'),
(3620,'Live tech dual band adapter BT4.2','Model WD06',NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Live Tech Dual Band Adapter with Bluetooth 4.2 is a versatile USB device designed to provide both high-speed Wi-Fi connectivity and Bluetooth functionality to desktops and laptops. It is ideal for systems that lack built-in wireless features or need an upgrade.','This adapter supports dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz & 5GHz), delivering speeds up to 600 Mbps—150 Mbps on 2.4GHz and 433 Mbps on 5GHz—for smoother browsing, streaming, and online gaming with reduced interference.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775486199589-581691914.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 14:36:39','2026-04-06 14:36:39'),
(3621,'Hammok VGA to HDTV with audio and power ',NULL,NULL,NULL,899.00,'The Hammok VGA to HDTV Converter with Audio & Power is a useful device designed to connect older VGA-output devices like computers and laptops to modern HDTVs, monitors, or projectors with HDMI input. It converts analog VGA signals into digital HDMI output, allowing seamless compatibility between old and new display technologies.','This converter supports Full HD 1080p resolution, ensuring clear and sharp video output. It also includes a 3.5mm audio input, which allows audio signals to be combined with video and transmitted through the HDMI output—since VGA alone carries only video signals.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775486695390-313833208.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 14:44:55','2026-04-06 14:44:55'),
(3622,'IC SN74LS83N',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The SN54/74LS283 is often recommended for new designs, as it is functionally identical but features a standard corner power pinout, unlike the 74LS83A, which has central power pins','The SN54/74LS283 is often recommended for new designs, as it is functionally identical but features a standard corner power pinout, unlike the 74LS83A, which has central power pins',NULL,NULL,'products/1775486819260-549236403.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 14:46:59','2026-04-06 14:46:59'),
(3623,'Enter usb bluetooth dongle',NULL,NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The Enter USB Bluetooth Dongle V5.0 is a compact and efficient device designed to add Bluetooth functionality to desktops and laptops that do not have built-in wireless connectivity. By simply plugging it into a USB port, users can connect various Bluetooth-enabled devices such as headphones, speakers, keyboards, mice, and smartphones.','This dongle features Bluetooth 5.0 technology, which provides faster data transfer speeds, improved signal stability, and better energy efficiency compared to older versions. It ensures a smooth and reliable connection for both data transfer and audio streaming.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775487132604-510556713.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 14:52:12','2026-04-06 14:52:12'),
(3624,'Wireless usb dongle ',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A Wireless USB Dongle is a compact plug-and-play device that enables wireless connectivity (Wi-Fi and/or Bluetooth) on computers and laptops.','A Wireless USB Dongle is used to add or upgrade wireless features on a device. It connects through a USB port and allows systems to access Wi-Fi networks or Bluetooth devices without internal hardware installation.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775487422850-886233466.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 14:57:02','2026-04-06 14:57:02'),
(3625,'Ravtron laptop mini stand ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The Ravtron Laptop Mini Stand is a compact and portable accessory designed to improve laptop usage comfort and airflow. When choosing one, the key factors to consider are build quality (metal/plastic), portability (foldable size), stability (anti-slip grip), and ventilation design.','It features an anti-slip design that keeps the laptop stable and prevents scratches. The raised structure improves air circulation, reducing overheating during long usage sessions. ',NULL,NULL,'products/1775488249897-389820536.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 15:10:49','2026-04-06 15:10:49'),
(3626,'IC L293D',NULL,NULL,NULL,199.00,'The L293D is a popular 16-pin, quadruple high-current half-H driver IC designed to control inductive loads like DC motors, stepper motors, and solenoids. It enables bidirectional control of up to two DC motors simultaneously, handling continuous currents up to 600mA at 4.5V to 36V, with built-in internal clamp diodes for transient suppression. ','Dual H-Bridge: Allows independent speed and direction control for two DC motors.\r\nVoltage Range: Wide 4.5V to 36V motor supply (\r\n), with a separate 5V logic supply (\r\n).\r\nCurrent Capability: 600mA output current per channel (DC), with a peak current of 1.2A.\r\nInternal Protection: Features internal clamp diodes and thermal shutdown protection.\r\nLogical Inputs: Compatible with TTL/DTL logic levels (0V to 1.5V for logic low).',NULL,NULL,'products/1775488581454-625947119.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 15:16:21','2026-04-06 15:16:21'),
(3627,'ideakard wireless usb adapter','Model XD300',NULL,NULL,998.00,'The Ideakard XD300M Wireless USB Adapter is a compact and efficient networking device designed to provide stable Wi-Fi connectivity to desktops and laptops. It supports wireless speeds of up to 300 Mbps, making it ideal for everyday internet activities such as browsing, video streaming, and online communication.','This adapter uses IEEE 802.11 b/g/n standards, ensuring compatibility with most routers and networks. Its plug-and-play design allows easy installation, while the lightweight and portable build makes it convenient to carry and use anywhere.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775488819940-439653223.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 15:20:19','2026-04-06 15:20:19'),
(3628,'Wireless USB dongle ',NULL,NULL,NULL,299.00,'A Wireless USB Dongle is a compact plug-and-play device that connects to a computer via a USB port and enables Wi-Fi connectivity. It works by receiving wireless signals from a router and converting them into internet access for your device.','Most dongles support 802.11 b/g/n standards with speeds up to 150 Mbps or 300 Mbps, suitable for browsing, streaming, and online work. These devices are widely used to upgrade older desktops or replace damaged internal Wi-Fi cards.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775489100232-20927275.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 15:25:00','2026-04-06 15:25:00'),
(3629,'panasonic wireless usb dongle',NULL,NULL,NULL,198.00,'Panasonic wireless USB dongles are special-purpose Wi-Fi adapters, mainly designed for Panasonic TVs, Blu-ray players, and cameras, not regular PC use like normal Wi-Fi dongles.','The Panasonic Wireless USB Dongle is a dedicated wireless LAN adapter that enables internet connectivity on Panasonic VIERA TVs and compatible devices. It allows users to access smart features like YouTube, streaming apps, firmware updates, and online services without using a wired LAN cable.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775489385191-559165101.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-06 15:29:45','2026-04-06 15:29:45'),
(3630,'Sony 4k Smart LED Projector','Sony 4k',NULL,NULL,8999.00,'The Sony 4K Smart LED Projector (commonly Sony 4K laser projector) is a high-end home theatre device designed to deliver ultra-clear, cinema-quality visuals on a large screen. It uses Sony’s advanced SXRD (Silicon X-tal Reflective Display) technology to produce true native 4K resolution, ensuring sharp details, deep contrast, and vibrant colours.',' Native 4K Ultra HD resolution\r\n Laser light source (long life, no bulb change)\r\n HDR support (better colours & contrast)\r\n High brightness for large screen viewing\r\n Large projection size (100”–300” screen)\r\n Multiple HDMI connectivity for smart devices',NULL,NULL,'products/1775536942765-116517737.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 04:42:22','2026-04-07 04:42:22'),
(3631,'Enter i/o card multi i/o solution',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,'The Enter Multi I/O Card (Multi I/O Solution) is a computer expansion card designed to add multiple input/output ports to a desktop system.','Installed in a PCI or PCIe slot on the motherboard, it allows users to expand connectivity by providing additional USB, serial (COM), and parallel (LPT) ports.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775543446315-891199589.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 06:30:46','2026-04-07 06:30:46'),
(3632,'D Plus CCTV Power Supply – 8 Channel','8 Channel D Plus CCTV Power Supply',NULL,NULL,1599.00,'The D Plus 8 Channel CCTV Power Supply is a centralized power distribution unit designed to supply power to multiple CCTV cameras from a single device.','It is commonly used in surveillance systems for homes, shops, offices, and commercial installations.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775544723577-556889753.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 06:52:03','2026-04-07 06:52:03'),
(3633,'Dell WM118 Wireless Mouse',' WM118 ',NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The Dell WM118 Wireless Mouse is a simple and reliable input device designed for everyday computing tasks at home, office, or on the go. It features a 2.4GHz wireless connection with a USB nano receiver, providing a stable and clutter-free experience without the need for cables.',' 2.4GHz wireless connectivity with USB nano receiver\r\n 1000 DPI optical tracking for smooth performance\r\n Plug & play – no driver required\r\n Ambidextrous design (left & right-hand use)\r\n 3-button control with scroll wheel\r\n Long battery life (up to 18 months)\r\n Lightweight and portable design',NULL,NULL,'products/1775545074783-209461923.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 06:57:54','2026-04-07 06:57:54'),
(3634,'USB-C to HDTV ',NULL,NULL,NULL,799.00,'A USB-C to HDTV converter (also called USB-C to HDMI adapter) is a device that allows you to connect a USB Type-C enabled device (like a laptop, mobile, or tablet) to an HDTV, monitor, or projector.','It converts the USB-C video signal into an HDMI output for display.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775545288418-91059853.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 07:01:28','2026-04-07 07:01:28'),
(3635,'Foxin FM 2100 HDMI Led Monitor',NULL,NULL,NULL,8999.00,'The Foxin FM 2100 HDMI LED Monitor (22” Crystal) is a budget desktop monitor designed for everyday use such as office work, billing systems, CCTV display, and home computing. It belongs to Foxin’s Crystal series, which focuses on affordability and basic performance.','This monitor features a 22-inch LED display with Full HD (1920×1080) support in most variants, offering decent clarity for daily tasks. It comes with HDMI and VGA ports, making it compatible with both modern PCs and older systems. The display provides a wide viewing angle (up to 178° in some models) and a 5ms response time, ensuring smooth visuals for normal usage',NULL,NULL,'products/1775545334602-965504972.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 07:02:14','2026-04-07 07:02:14'),
(3636,'Live Tech 2.5\" HDD External Case','HDC 01',NULL,NULL,1999.00,'A Live Tech 2.5-inch HDD external case is a storage enclosure that allows you to convert an internal laptop hard disk or SSD into a portable external hard drive.','It connects via USB and is widely used for backup, data transfer, and reuse of old hard disks.','Convert old laptop HDD into external storage',NULL,'products/1775545775803-111835315.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 07:09:35','2026-04-07 07:09:35'),
(3637,'Enter E-MO-A01 Monitor',NULL,NULL,NULL,7999.00,'The Enter E-MO-A01 is a budget desktop LED monitor designed for basic computing, office work, billing systems, and CCTV display. It features a 19-inch (48.26 cm) screen size with a resolution typically around 1366×768 or 1440×900, delivering clear visuals suitable for everyday tasks','This monitor comes with HDMI and VGA input ports, making it compatible with both modern computers and older systems. It offers a 60Hz refresh rate and 5ms response time, ensuring smooth performance for regular usage like browsing, data entry, and video playback.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775545824280-182544151.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 07:10:24','2026-04-07 07:10:24'),
(3638,'Zebster Zeb-VS17HD Led Monitor',NULL,NULL,NULL,9999.00,'The Zebster ZEB-VS17HD is a compact 17-inch LED desktop monitor designed mainly for basic computing, shops, CCTV display, and office work. It is part of Zebronics’ Zebster budget monitor series, known for affordability and simple performance.This monitor features a 17-inch (43.1 cm) display with a resolution of 1280 × 1024 (HD) and a 5:4 aspect ratio, which is slightly more square compared to modern widescreen monitors. It delivers clear visuals for text-based work, billing software, and surveillance screens','The ZEB-VS17HD comes with HDMI and VGA input ports, allowing it to connect with both new PCs and older systems. It also supports LED backlight technology, which ensures low power consumption (~20W) and decent brightness (~220 nits).',NULL,NULL,'products/1775545973698-732782812.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 07:12:53','2026-04-07 07:12:53'),
(3639,'Digital to Analog Audio Converter',NULL,NULL,NULL,899.00,'A Digital to Analog Audio Converter (DAC) is a device that converts digital audio signals into analog sound so you can connect modern devices (TV, set-top box, gaming console) to speakers or amplifiers.','High Audio Quality (up to 24-bit / 192kHz support)','Low Noise Signal Conversion',NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-04-07 07:15:16','2026-04-07 07:15:16'),
(3640,'USB 2.0 External Case',NULL,NULL,NULL,699.00,'A USB 2.0 external case is a storage enclosure used to convert an internal 2.5-inch laptop hard disk (HDD) or SSD into a portable external drive','It connects to a computer using a USB cable and allows easy data transfer and backup.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775546377935-543312374.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 07:19:37','2026-04-07 07:19:37'),
(3641,'foxin FM 1950 HDMI Monitor',NULL,NULL,NULL,10999.00,'The Foxin FM 1950 HDMI Monitor is a budget-friendly LED display designed for basic computing, office work, billing systems, and CCTV monitoring. It comes with a 19–19.5 inch screen size, offering a compact and space-saving solution for everyday use.This monitor typically features an HD resolution (1440 × 900), delivering clear and sharp visuals suitable for text work, browsing, and video playback. It supports a 60Hz refresh rate and 5ms response time, ensuring smooth performance for daily tasks without noticeable lag','One of its key advantages is dual connectivity (HDMI + VGA), allowing easy connection with both modern PCs and older systems. The monitor also includes LED backlight technology, which ensures low power consumption (around 15–45W) and longer usage life.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775546466073-293216871.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 07:21:06','2026-04-07 07:21:06'),
(3642,'Intel Core-i5 CPU Fan',' i5',NULL,NULL,799.00,'The Intel Core i5 CPU Fan (also known as a stock CPU cooler) is a cooling device designed to maintain safe operating temperatures for Intel Core i5 processors. It combines a heatsink and cooling fan to efficiently dissipate heat generated by the CPU during operation.','Type: CPU Air Cooler (Heatsink + Fan)\r\nFan Size: ~80–92 mm\r\nConnector: 3-pin / 4-pin PWM\r\nMaterial: Aluminum heatsink\r\nSocket Support: LGA 115x / 1200 (varies by model)\r\nUsage: Desktop processors',NULL,NULL,'products/1775546479979-251971933.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 07:21:19','2026-04-07 07:21:19'),
(3643,'4k Ultra HD Set-top TV Box',NULL,NULL,NULL,3099.00,'A 4K Ultra HD Set-Top TV Box is a smart media streaming device that connects to your television via HDMI and allows you to watch live TV channels, OTT apps, movies, and online content in ultra-high-definition (4K) resolution. It transforms a normal TV into a smart entertainment system with internet-based features.','Resolution: 4K Ultra HD\r\nOperating System: Android TV / Linux (varies)\r\nRAM: 2GB – 4GB\r\nStorage: 8GB – 64GB\r\nConnectivity: Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, USB, HDMI\r\nAudio Support: Dolby Audio / DTS (varies)',NULL,NULL,'products/1775553988501-966417823.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 09:26:28','2026-04-07 09:26:28'),
(3644,'ZOOOK Orbit Pro Wireless and Mouse Combo',' Orbit Pro',NULL,NULL,3200.00,'The ZOOOK Orbit Pro Wireless Keyboard & Mouse Combo is a modern and versatile input device set designed for seamless multitasking across multiple devices. It features dual connectivity (Bluetooth + 2.4GHz USB receiver), allowing users to connect and switch between multiple devices effortlessly, such as laptops, desktops, tablets, and smartphones.','Type: Wireless Keyboard & Mouse Combo\r\nConnectivity: Bluetooth + USB Receiver (2.4GHz)\r\nRange: Up to 10 meters\r\nKeyboard Type: Scissor-switch keys\r\nMouse: Optical sensor\r\nCompatibility: Multi-platform (PC, Laptop, Mobile, Tablet)',NULL,NULL,'products/1775555533268-206789171.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 09:52:13','2026-04-07 09:52:13'),
(3645,'Zebronics Graphics Card ',NULL,NULL,NULL,1299.00,'A Zebronics graphics card is a computer component installed in a desktop PC to improve display performance, video quality, and gaming capability.','It connects to the motherboard via a PCI Express slot and handles all graphics processing.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775555601726-205066236.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 09:53:21','2026-04-07 09:53:21'),
(3646,'ANT Esports Wireless keyboard with Built-in-Touchpad','WK100 ',NULL,NULL,2699.00,'The ANT Esports WK100 Wireless Keyboard with Built-in Touchpad is a compact and versatile 2-in-1 input device designed to provide complete control without the need for a separate mouse. It combines a full keyboard with an integrated multi-touch touchpad, making it ideal for use with smart TVs, laptops, desktops, tablets, and media systems.','Type: Wireless Keyboard with Touchpad\r\nConnectivity: Bluetooth + 2.4GHz USB receiver\r\nKeys: ~84 keys\r\nTouchpad: Multi-touch supported\r\nRange: Up to 10 meters\r\nBattery: AA / Rechargeable (varies)\r\nCompatibility: Windows, Mac, Android, Linux, Smart TV',NULL,NULL,'products/1775556972664-422087583.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 10:16:12','2026-04-07 10:16:12'),
(3647,'HP KM260 Wireless Keyboard and Mouse combo','KM260 ',NULL,NULL,2200.00,'The HP KM260 Wireless Keyboard and Mouse Combo is a practical and budget-friendly input solution designed for everyday computing tasks. It offers a 2.4GHz wireless connection via a USB receiver, ensuring a stable and clutter-free setup without the hassle of cables.','Type: Wireless Keyboard & Mouse Combo\r\nConnectivity: USB Nano Receiver (2.4GHz)\r\nMouse DPI: 800 / 1200 / 1600\r\nRange: Up to 10 meters\r\nKeyboard Layout: Full-size\r\nBattery: AA/AAA (non-rechargeable)\r\nCompatibility: Windows, PC, Laptop',NULL,NULL,'products/1775557350053-897227909.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 10:22:30','2026-04-07 10:22:30'),
(3648,'A539Y transistor',NULL,NULL,NULL,119.00,'The 2SA539 transistor (marked as A539Y on the body) is a PNP bipolar junction transistor (BJT) mainly used in low-frequency amplification and switching circuits. It is commonly found in audio equipment, small signal processing circuits, and general electronics.','It is highly recommended to check the manufacturer marking on the package (e.g., Toshiba, Samsung) to confirm, as \"A539Y\" may be a specific rank or date code variant of a wider transistor family.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775570647623-494616915.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 14:04:07','2026-04-07 14:04:07'),
(3649,'S8550D transistor',NULL,NULL,NULL,149.00,'The S8550 transistor (including variant S8550D) is a high-current PNP bipolar junction transistor designed for switching and amplification applications. It is widely used in audio circuits, power switching, and general-purpose electronics.','The S8550D (often marked as S8550D.116 or S8550-D) is a commonly used small-signal, low-voltage, high-current PNP bipolar junction transistor (BJT). It is frequently used in push-pull amplifiers, switching circuits, and driver applications',NULL,NULL,'products/1775570993040-67912686.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 14:09:53','2026-04-07 14:09:53'),
(3650,'AT89S52-24PU',NULL,NULL,NULL,199.00,'The AT89S52-24PU is a 40-pin Dual Inline Package (DIP) 8-bit microcontroller (MCU) manufactured by Microchip/Atmel, widely used in educational, industrial, and consumer embedded systems.','It is based on the classic 8051 architecture and features 8KB of In-System Programmable (ISP) Flash memory and 256 bytes of internal RAM. \r\nThis video explains how to connect and program an AT89S52 microcontroller using an Arduino Uno.\r\n',NULL,NULL,'products/1775571007046-432014757.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 14:10:07','2026-04-07 14:10:07'),
(3651,'A984Y transistor',NULL,NULL,NULL,149.00,'The 2SA984 (often marked simply as \"A984\" or \"A984y\" depending on the hFE classification) is a silicon PNP epitaxial planar transistor commonly used in low-frequency power amplifier applications. It is housed in a TO-92 plastic package and is designed for high-voltage, high-current, and low-saturation voltage operations. ','The 2SA984 transistor (marked as A984Y) is a low-noise PNP transistor mainly used in audio frequency amplification and signal processing circuits. It is commonly found in pre-amplifiers, tone control circuits, and consumer electronics.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775571330451-317417887.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 14:15:30','2026-04-07 14:15:30'),
(3652,'LM35CAZ transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,149.00,'The LM35CAZ is a precision integrated-circuit temperature sensor, often packaged in a TO-92 plastic transistor-style package, designed to measure temperature in degrees Celsius (°C) with an output voltage linearly proportional to the temperature. It is a popular, low-cost sensor widely used in, HVAC, power supplies, and battery management systems. \r\n','The LM35CAZ is a linear analog temperature sensor that outputs a voltage directly proportional to temperature in Celsius (°C). It is widely used in electronics projects, temperature monitoring systems, and automation circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775571624104-309275187.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 14:20:24','2026-04-07 14:20:24'),
(3653,'2222A transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,149.00,'The 2N2222A transistor, commonly marked as 2222A, is a general-purpose NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT). It is one of the most widely used transistors for switching and amplification in both hobby and industrial electronics due to its reliability, speed, and moderate power handling.','The 2N2222A is a widely used, NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) designed for low-power, high-speed switching and amplification applications',NULL,NULL,'products/1775571983027-138896172.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 14:26:23','2026-04-07 14:26:23'),
(3654,'BC557 transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,99.00,'The BC557 transistor is a general-purpose PNP bipolar junction transistor (BJT) used mainly for low-power amplification and switching applications. It is very popular in audio circuits, signal processing, and small control circuits.','The BC557 is a general-purpose, low-power PNP bipolar junction transistor (BJT) in a TO-92 package, commonly used for amplification and switching in electronic circuits. ',NULL,NULL,'products/1775572186523-249330817.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 14:29:46','2026-04-07 14:29:46'),
(3655,'7805CV transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The 7805CV belongs to the 78xx series of linear voltage regulators, designed to provide a stable +5V output from a higher input voltage. It is widely used in power supply circuits, microcontroller projects, and electronic devices.','The L7805CV is a 3-terminal positive linear voltage regulator IC, often referred to as a \"transistor\" due to its TO-220 package, designed to provide a stable fixed 5V output from higher input voltages.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775572474260-934717612.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 14:34:34','2026-04-07 14:34:34'),
(3656,'A966Y transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,149.00,'The 2SA966Y (often marked as A966Y or simply A966) is a PNP bipolar junction transistor (BJT) produced by manufacturers like Toshiba. It is primarily designed for high-voltage and power amplification applications, commonly packaged in a TO-92L (long lead) or sometimes TO-92 casing, making it suitable for through-hole PCB assembly.','The 2SA966 transistor (marked as A966Y) is a low-power PNP bipolar junction transistor (BJT) used for audio amplification and general-purpose switching.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775572945497-45005913.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 14:42:25','2026-04-07 14:42:25'),
(3657,'F422 transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The F422 transistor (commonly marked as F422) is a general-purpose NPN transistor used in low-power amplification and switching circuits. It is typically found in audio devices, signal circuits, and consumer electronics boards.','AI Overview\r\nBF422 NPN High Voltage Transistor - DatasheetThe BF422 is a high-voltage, silicon NPN bipolar junction transistor designed for high-voltage switching and amplifier applications, particularly in video output stages of televisions and monitors.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775574871389-223629167.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 15:14:31','2026-04-07 15:14:31'),
(3658,'BF494 transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The BF494 is a silicon NPN medium-frequency transistor designed for low-voltage, low-current applications, primarily in RF amplifiers, FM tuners, and AM mixers/oscillators','The BF494 transistor is a high-frequency NPN bipolar junction transistor specially designed for radio frequency (RF) and VHF applications. It is widely used in FM transmitters, RF amplifiers, and oscillator circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775575093264-101857829.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 15:18:13','2026-04-07 15:18:13'),
(3659,'F421 transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The F421 transistor (marked as F421) is a general-purpose NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) used in low-power amplification and switching applications. It is commonly found in **audio circuits, small electronic devices, and signal processing','The BF421 (often marked F421) is a high-voltage, low-current PNP transistor designed for high-voltage switching and amplification, typically packaged in TO-92. It is commonly used in video output stages, telephony applications, and industrial electronics requiring high \r\n up to 300V',NULL,NULL,'products/1775575327157-813263841.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 15:22:07','2026-04-07 15:22:07'),
(3660,'C2785F transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The 2SC2785 (often marked as C2785) is a silicon NPN epitaxial planar transistor designed primarily for use in driver stages of audio frequency (AF) amplifiers and low-speed switching applications. It is known for high voltage, low noise, and good linearity.','The 2SC2785 is an NPN silicon transistor designed for use in amplifier driver stages and low-speed switching. It has excellent high voltage performance with a minimum collector-emitter break.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775575598412-203908302.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-07 15:26:38','2026-04-07 15:26:38'),
(3661,'Panaphone KX-TS670',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The Panaphone KX-TS670 is a simple and reliable corded landline telephone designed for everyday communication in homes, offices, and commercial environments. It is a plug-and-play device that works directly with a telephone line without requiring any external power supply, making it highly convenient and maintenance-free. The phone features a compact and lightweight design with anti-slip support, allowing it to be placed securely on a desk or mounted on a wall using its adjustable stand.','It includes essential calling functions such as last number redial, hold option, and pause function, which make handling calls easier and more efficient. Built with durable ABS material and available in standard colors like black and white, the KX-TS670 offers a practical and long-lasting solution for basic telecommunication needs. It is commonly used in places like homes, hotels, shops, offices, and customer service counters where a dependable wired phone is preferred.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775621178563-384434098.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:06:18','2026-04-08 04:06:18'),
(3662,'LEBOSS B222 Desktop Phone',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The LEBOSS B222 desktop phone is a basic corded landline telephone designed for simple and reliable voice communication in homes, offices, shops, and reception areas. It operates directly through a telephone line without requiring an external power supply, ensuring uninterrupted performance even during power outages. The device features a compact desktop design with a sturdy body, making it suitable for everyday use on tables or counters','It typically includes essential functions such as last number redial, mute option, and call hold feature, allowing users to manage calls efficiently. The keypad is user-friendly with clearly visible buttons for easy dialing, and the handset provides clear audio quality for both incoming and outgoing calls. Like other Leboss landline models, it focuses on durability, ease of use, and affordability, making it a practical choice for users who need a straightforward wired communication device.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775621443065-40702050.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:10:43','2026-04-08 04:10:43'),
(3663,'LEBOSS B633 Desktop Phone',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The LEBOSS B633 desktop phone is a compact and durable corded landline telephone designed for basic communication needs in homes, offices, shops, and reception counters. It works directly through a telephone line without requiring an external power source, ensuring reliable operation even during power failures. The phone features a simple yet sturdy design that can be used as a desktop unit or mounted on a wall, making it suitable for space-saving installations.','It comes with essential calling features such as last number redial, mute function, and call hold option, allowing users to manage calls efficiently. The keypad is designed with clearly visible buttons for easy dialing, and the handset provides clear voice quality for both incoming and outgoing calls. Built for everyday use, the LEBOSS B633 focuses on simplicity, durability, and cost-effectiveness, making it a practical choice for users who need a dependable wired telephone solution.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775621628810-204857486.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:13:48','2026-04-08 04:13:48'),
(3664,'ANT Esports Pro Backlit Gaming combo kit','KM500W',NULL,NULL,2100.00,'The ANT Esports KM500W Pro Backlit Gaming Combo Kit is a stylish and performance-oriented wireless keyboard and mouse combo designed for gamers and everyday users. It offers a clean, cable-free setup with vibrant RGB lighting, responsive controls, and ergonomic comfort, making it suitable for gaming, office work, and multimedia use.',' RGB Backlit Keyboard – Multi-color lighting effects for a gaming look\r\n Full-Size Layout – Includes numeric keypad and function keys\r\n Ergonomic Design – Detachable wrist rest for comfort\r\n Wireless Gaming Mouse – Adjustable DPI for precision control\r\n 2.4GHz Wireless Connectivity – Stable, lag-free performance\r\n Power Efficient – Long battery life for extended use',NULL,NULL,'products/1775621746050-943001154.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:15:46','2026-04-08 04:15:46'),
(3665,'Panaphone KX-T580',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The Panaphone KX-T580 (similar to Panasonic KX-TS580 series) is a feature-rich corded landline telephone designed for both home and office communication. It operates on a direct telephone line without requiring an external power source, ensuring continuous operation even during power outages. This model comes with an LCD display that supports caller ID functionality, allowing users to view incoming call details','It offers convenient features such as a phonebook memory that can store up to 50 contacts, along with multiple redial memory options for quickly dialing recently called numbers. The phone also includes adjustable ringer volume levels, speakerphone (handsfree) capability, and clear keypad buttons for easy operation. Built with a durable and compact design, it can be used as a desktop unit or mounted on a wall, making it suitable for offices, shops, reception areas, and households where reliable wired communication is essential.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775621841293-52592370.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:17:21','2026-04-08 04:17:21'),
(3666,'Panaphone KX-T2017',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The Panaphone KX-T2017 is a feature-enhanced corded desktop telephone designed for efficient communication in homes, offices, and business environments. It operates directly through a telephone line without requiring an external power supply, ensuring reliable performance even during power outages. This model is equipped with an LCD display that supports caller ID functionality, allowing users to easily view incoming call details. It also includes a built-in data port, which enables connection to devices like modems or fax machines, making it suitable for office use where line sharing is needed.','The phone offers handsfree (speakerphone) capability for convenient calling, along with multiple one-touch memory buttons (such as M1–M7) for quick dialing of frequently used numbers. Additional features like redial, pause function, adjustable ringer volume, and clear audio output enhance usability. With its sturdy design, comfortable handset, and easy plug-and-play installation, the KX-T2017 is a practical and dependable wired telephone solution for everyday communication needs',NULL,NULL,'products/1775622026488-954902353.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:20:26','2026-04-08 04:20:26'),
(3667,'Panaphone KXT-3014 Desktop Phone',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The Panaphone KXT-3014 is a basic and dependable corded desktop telephone designed for simple communication in homes, offices, shops, and reception areas. It operates directly through a telephone line without requiring an external power supply, ensuring uninterrupted usage even during power cuts. The phone is built with a compact and sturdy design, making it suitable for both desk placement and wall mounting','It features essential calling functions such as last number redial, mute option, pause function, and tone/pulse switching, allowing compatibility with different telephone line systems. The device also includes adjustable ringer settings (high/low) and a visual ringer indicator for incoming calls, making it convenient in both quiet and noisy environments. Known for its clear audio quality and ease of use, the KXT-3014 is a practical and cost-effective solution for users who need a straightforward, reliable wired telephone for everyday communication needs',NULL,NULL,'products/1775622160437-749283064.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:22:40','2026-04-08 04:22:40'),
(3668,'re','tyhhh','re',NULL,12.00,'wdf','we','we',NULL,'products/1775622495440-960369986.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:28:15','2026-05-02 03:20:06'),
(3669,'WL Q8 Max TV Box','Q8 Max',NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The WL QB Max TV Box is a compact Android-based smart set-top box designed to convert a normal LED/LCD TV into a smart TV. It runs on an Android operating system, allowing users to install apps like YouTube, Netflix, and other streaming platforms directly from the Play Store. With support for 4K Ultra HD resolution, it delivers high-quality video output, making it suitable for home entertainment.',' 4K Ultra HD Support – Clear and sharp video playback\r\n Android OS – Access to apps via Google Play Store\r\n Wi-Fi Connectivity – Supports streaming and browsing\r\n Multimedia Support – Plays videos, music, and photos\r\n USB & HDMI Ports – Easy connection with TV and devices\r\n Remote Control – Some models include voice control\r\n Bluetooth (Optional) – Connect keyboard, mouse, speakers',NULL,NULL,'products/1775622603156-78031196.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:30:03','2026-04-08 04:30:03'),
(3670,'ANT Esports GP310 Wireless Gamepad',' GP310',NULL,NULL,2099.00,'The ANT Esports GP310 Wireless Gamepad is a budget-friendly gaming controller designed for smooth and flexible gameplay across multiple platforms. It features a 2.4GHz wireless connection with a USB receiver, ensuring stable and lag-free performance for PC, Android, and PS3 gaming.','\r\n 2.4GHz Wireless Connectivity – Stable, lag-free gaming using USB dongle\r\n Dual Analog Sticks – Smooth and precise movement control\r\n Dual Vibration Motors – Realistic in-game feedback\r\n Rechargeable Battery (≈350mAh) – Hours of gameplay on a single charge\r\n Plug & Play – No drivers required, easy setup\r\n Ergonomic Design – Comfortable grip for long sessions\r\n Wide Compatibility – Works with PC, Android, and PS3',NULL,NULL,'products/1775623385358-67967043.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:43:05','2026-04-08 04:43:05'),
(3671,'yj','l','l',NULL,10.00,'vhv','hvh','hjvhj',NULL,'products/1775623853718-252888495.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:50:53','2026-05-02 03:22:11'),
(3672,'KOAT JP250 Wireless gamepad',' JP250 ',NULL,NULL,1399.00,'The KOAT JP250 Wireless Gamepad is a budget-friendly gaming controller designed for smooth and responsive gameplay across PC and other compatible devices. It uses 2.4GHz wireless technology with a USB receiver, ensuring stable and lag-free performance without the hassle of cables. The controller features an ergonomic design with comfortable grips, making it suitable for long gaming sessions.',' 2.4GHz Wireless Connectivity – Reliable and lag-free connection\r\n Dual Analog Joysticks – Smooth and accurate movement control\r\n Vibration Feedback – Enhanced gaming realism\r\n Plug & Play Support – No drivers required for most systems\r\n Ergonomic Design – Comfortable for long gaming sessions\r\n Rechargeable / Battery Powered – Depends on variant\r\n Multi-Platform Support – Works with PC, Android (some models), and TV boxes',NULL,NULL,'products/1775623857122-253694037.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:50:57','2026-04-08 04:50:57'),
(3673,'Arihant 4440 double IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,1599.00,'The Arihant 4440 Double IC amplifier is a dual-channel stereo amplifier built using two LA4440 IC chips. It is one of the most common budget audio amplifiers used in India for small speaker systems, DIY projects, and shop audio setups.','Low cost & easily available',NULL,NULL,'products/1775623959182-311399383.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 04:52:39','2026-04-08 04:52:39'),
(3674,'e','e','e',NULL,123.00,'2fr','wd','we',NULL,'products/1775627793412-994991096.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 05:56:33','2026-04-08 05:56:33'),
(3675,'S.R.C - 008 car multimedia player small display',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The S.R.C 008 car multimedia player is a compact single-DIN car audio system designed for basic multimedia playback with a small digital display. It is commonly used in budget or entry-level car setups where a full touchscreen system is not required. The unit typically features a small LED/LCD screen that shows track details, FM frequency, and playback status, along with physical buttons for easy control while driving. It supports multiple input sources such as USB drive, memory card (TF/SD), AUX input, and FM radio, allowing users to play MP3 audio files directly from external storage devices. The SRC (Source) button is used to switch between different input modes like radio, USB, Bluetooth, or AUX.','In many models under this category, basic Bluetooth connectivity is included for wireless music streaming and hands-free calling. The player is powered by the car’s 12V supply and connects to speakers through standard wiring, making it compatible with most vehicles. Additional features may include remote control support, preset equalizer settings, folder navigation, and memory resume function. Due to its small display and simple interface, the SRC 008 is ideal for users who want an affordable, durable, and easy-to-use car audio player without advanced touchscreen features.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775629565165-764301519.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 06:26:05','2026-04-08 06:26:05'),
(3676,'S.R.C - 005 Car Multimedia speaker big display',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The S.R.C-005 car multimedia player is a large-display double-DIN car audio system designed for enhanced in-car entertainment and smart connectivity. Unlike small-display players, this model features a big touchscreen display (typically 7-inch or more) that allows easy control of music, videos, and settings. It supports multiple media sources such as USB, SD card, AUX input, and FM radio, along with Bluetooth connectivity for wireless music streaming and hands-free calling. Many variants also include mirror link or Android-based interface, enabling users to connect their smartphones and access apps, navigation, and media directly on the screen.','This type of multimedia player is powered by the vehicle’s 12V system and offers features like touch controls, remote control support, equalizer settings, reverse camera input, and steering wheel control compatibility. With its larger display and advanced functionality, the SRC-005 is ideal for users who want a modern infotainment system with better visibility, multimedia playback, and smartphone integration in their vehicle.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775630238679-710204324.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 06:37:18','2026-04-08 06:37:18'),
(3677,'Target TT-MS-103 Multimedia Speaker','TT-MS-103 ',NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The TARGET TT-MS-103 Multimedia Speaker is a compact and budget-friendly audio system designed for everyday entertainment needs. It delivers clear and balanced sound output, making it suitable for use with TVs, computers, laptops, and mobile devices. Built with a sturdy cabinet and simple controls, this speaker provides reliable performance for music, movies, and gaming.',' Speaker Type: Multimedia Speaker\r\n Configuration: 2.0 Channel Stereo\r\n Output Power: Approx. 10W – 20W (varies by variant)\r\n Connectivity: Wired (3.5mm AUX input)\r\nWireless Support: No (wired only)\r\nControls: Volume control knob/button \r\nCompatibility:TV\r\n                       Desktop / Laptop\r\n                       Mobile / Tablet',NULL,NULL,'products/1775630728458-845496358.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 06:45:28','2026-04-08 06:45:28'),
(3678,'Target TT-MS-104 Multimedia speaker','TT-MS-104 ',NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The TARGET TT-MS-104 Multimedia Speaker is a budget-friendly home audio system designed to deliver clear and powerful sound for everyday entertainment. It features a stereo speaker configuration with a total output of around 20W, providing balanced audio suitable for music, movies, and gaming. With support for both wired and Bluetooth connectivity, it allows users to easily connect devices like smartphones, TVs, laptops, and desktops.','20W RMS Output – Loud and clear stereo sound\r\n Bluetooth Support – Wireless music streaming\r\n Wired Connectivity (AUX) – Stable connection with devices\r\n Stereo Configuration – Balanced audio performance\r\n Compact Design – Easy placement on desk or TV unit\r\n Simple Controls – Easy volume and playback control\r\nConfiguration: Stereo (2.0 Channel)\r\nOutput Power: 20W RMS\r\nConnectivity: Bluetooth + Wired\r\nUsage: TV, PC, Laptop, Mobile',NULL,NULL,'products/1775631551036-821753691.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 06:59:11','2026-04-08 06:59:11');
INSERT INTO `product` VALUES
(3679,'Arihant Multimedia speaker','625',NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The Arihant computer multimedia speaker generally refers to desktop multimedia speakers sold or distributed by Arihant computer shops, rather than a single fixed branded model. These speakers are designed for use with PCs, laptops, and small entertainment setups, offering clear stereo sound with built-in amplifiers for everyday audio needs. Typically, they come in 2.0 or 2.1 channel configurations, where 2.0 includes two satellite speakers and 2.1 adds a subwoofer for deeper bass. Most models support 3.5mm AUX input, USB power supply, and sometimes Bluetooth connectivity, making them compatible with computers, TVs, and mobile devices','They are usually compact in size, making them ideal for desks, and are built with plastic or wooden cabinets depending on the variant. Some Arihant-supplied models also include volume control knobs, LED indicators, and bass enhancement features, providing a balanced audio experience for music, movies, gaming, and online content. In higher variants (like wooden or home-theatre style), you may also get strong bass output, better sound clarity, and wider sound coverage',NULL,NULL,'products/1775632262655-51726152.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 07:11:02','2026-04-08 07:11:02'),
(3680,'nchg','gcut','hvcyu',NULL,123.00,'gcg','gt',NULL,NULL,'products/1775633532358-205237240.png',0,1,'active','2026-04-08 07:32:12','2026-05-02 03:19:47'),
(3681,'Target TT-BK-IPL 3802 Multimedia player','TT-BK-IPL 3802',NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The TT-BK-IPL 3802 multimedia player (often sold under Target or similar brands) is a powerful FM USB multimedia speaker system designed for vehicles like trucks, tractors, autos, and also for small outdoor or shop use. It is an all-in-one unit that combines a built-in speaker, audio player, and amplifier, making it a convenient solution for loud and clear sound output. The device typically delivers around 40W output power and includes a 4-inch internal speaker, providing strong audio suitable for open environments.','It supports multiple playback options such as Bluetooth connectivity, USB drive, TF (memory card), AUX input, and FM radio, allowing users to play music from different sources easily. The system operates on 12V DC power, making it compatible with vehicle batteries and widely used in mobile setups. It also comes with a remote control for easy operation and simple front-panel controls for volume, track change, and mode selection.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775635850808-981663700.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 08:10:50','2026-04-08 08:10:50'),
(3682,'Target TT-BK-AMP-845 Hi power Amplifier',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The Target TT-BK-AMP-845 Hi-Power Amplifier is a multi-function audio amplifier designed for powerful sound output in home, shop, and outdoor audio setups. It belongs to the Target amplifier series (similar to models like 829 and 826), offering high wattage output suitable for driving multiple speakers and subwoofers. These amplifiers typically support stereo or multi-channel configurations, making them ideal for small home theatres, DJ setups, or public audio systems.','The amplifier comes with multiple input options such as Bluetooth, USB, AUX, and AV inputs, allowing users to play music from mobile phones, TVs, pen drives, and other audio sources. It also includes MIC (microphone) input with echo control, making it suitable for karaoke, announcements, and small events. Most models in this range are designed with built-in equalizer controls, bass/treble adjustment, and remote control support, providing flexibility in sound tuning.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775636132385-160932143.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 08:15:32','2026-04-08 08:15:32'),
(3683,'Target TT-BK-AMP-846 Hi power Amplifier',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The Target TT-BK-AMP-846 Hi-Power Amplifier is a multi-channel audio amplifier designed for powerful sound performance in home, shop, and outdoor setups. It belongs to the same series as models like 826, 829, and 845, offering high wattage output with support for multiple speakers and subwoofers. Typically, amplifiers in this range provide 5.1 channel surround sound capability, delivering immersive audio for music, movies, and public sound systems.','The unit includes versatile connectivity options such as Bluetooth, USB, AUX, and AV inputs, allowing playback from mobile phones, TVs, pen drives, and other devices. It also features microphone input with echo control, making it suitable for karaoke, announcements, and small functions. Similar Target amplifiers deliver around 300W RMS output with strong bass and clear sound performance, making them ideal for medium-to-large audio setups.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775636724290-199093975.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 08:25:24','2026-04-08 08:25:24'),
(3684,'Target TT-RS-MS312 Multimedia speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The Target TT-RS-MS312 multimedia speaker is a high-power 2.0 channel speaker system designed for loud and clear audio output in home, shop, and small event environments. It belongs to the Target RS multimedia speaker series (similar to models like MS310 and TT-305), typically featuring dual large speaker units (6”–8” woofers) with additional tweeters for enhanced treble and balanced sound. These speakers are built to deliver strong bass and wide sound coverage, making them suitable for music playback, TV audio, and small DJ setups.','This model generally supports multiple input options such as AUX and sometimes USB/FM depending on variant, allowing connection with TVs, computers, DVD players, and mobile devices. Similar Target models in this category provide around 80W–120W output power with good frequency response and stereo separation, ensuring decent sound clarity and volume for indoor and semi-outdoor use',NULL,NULL,'products/1775637528560-847400108.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 08:38:48','2026-04-08 08:38:48'),
