(3687,'Target TT-D5 198 5.1 channel multimedia speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,5999.00,'The Target TT-D5 198 5.1 channel multimedia speaker is a home theatre-style audio system designed to deliver immersive surround sound for music, movies, and TV entertainment. It consists of a subwoofer (bass unit) and five satellite speakers, creating a full 5.1 channel audio setup that enhances sound depth and direction. This system is ideal for users who want a cinematic experience at home or powerful audio for shops and small events.','It typically supports multiple input options such as Bluetooth, USB, AUX, SD card, and FM radio, allowing easy connection with TVs, mobile phones, laptops, and pen drives. Similar Target audio systems provide strong bass output with clear treble, making them suitable for both indoor entertainment and moderate outdoor use. High-power configurations in this category often deliver around 200W–300W output with multi-channel support, ensuring loud and balanced sound performance',NULL,NULL,'products/1775637893629-955836268.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 08:44:53','2026-04-08 08:44:53'),
(3688,'TARGET TT-MS-203 Multimedia speaker','TT-MS-203',NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The TARGET TT-MS-203 is a mid-level multimedia speaker system offering better sound power and bass than entry-level models, making it ideal for daily entertainment and small to medium room usage.','Speaker Type: Multimedia Speaker System\r\nConfiguration: 2.0 Channel\r\nOutput Power: Approx. 20W – 40W (varies by variant)\r\nConnectivity: Wired (3.5mm AUX / USB)\r\nCompatibility: TV, PC, Laptop, Mobile\r\nPower Source: AC Powered\r\nDesign: Desktop / Home audio setup',NULL,NULL,'products/1775637924624-653248878.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 08:45:24','2026-04-08 08:45:24'),
(3689,'MZ M307 8-inch mobile speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,4999.00,'The MZ M307 8-inch mobile speaker is a portable Bluetooth multimedia speaker system designed for loud sound output and karaoke-style entertainment. It features a large 8-inch woofer driver, which provides better bass performance compared to small speakers, making it suitable for outdoor use, small functions, and shop environments. The speaker supports Bluetooth connectivity, USB pen drive, TF (memory card), AUX input, and built-in FM radio, allowing flexible playback from multiple sources. It also comes with a wireless microphone, enabling karaoke singing, announcements, and event use.','This model typically delivers around 10W output power with stereo sound, includes RGB LED lighting, and has a rechargeable battery offering about 4–6 hours of playback depending on usage . The front control panel provides buttons for volume, track control, echo adjustment, and mode selection, along with remote control support for convenience. With its portable tower design, handle support, and compact size, the MZ M307 is easy to carry and widely used for parties, outdoor gatherings, and mobile audio setups.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775638225186-829507488.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 08:50:25','2026-04-08 08:50:25'),
(3690,'Target TT-RS-MS311 Multimedia speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The Target TT-RS-MS311 multimedia speaker is a high-power 2.0 channel speaker system designed for strong and clear audio output in homes, shops, and small event environments. It is part of the Target RS series (similar to MS310), which typically features dual mid-bass drivers (around 6-inch size) along with tweeters to deliver a balanced combination of deep bass and crisp treble. These speakers are usually built with a wooden cabinet design, which enhances sound quality and bass response.','This model is generally a wired AUX-based speaker system, focusing on stable and continuous performance rather than wireless features. It is commonly used with TVs, computers, DVD players, and amplifiers, making it a reliable choice for everyday audio needs. Similar models in this series offer around 100W–120W output power in 2.0 channel configuration, providing sufficient loudness for indoor and semi-outdoor use',NULL,NULL,'products/1775638431239-64316551.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 08:53:51','2026-04-08 08:53:51'),
(3691,'Target TT-MS-205 Multimedia Speaker','TT-MS-205',NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The TARGET TT-MS-205 is a 2.1 channel multimedia speaker system that offers powerful sound, deep bass, and multiple connectivity options, making it a great choice for affordable home theatre and daily entertainment use.','Type: Multimedia / Home Theatre Speaker\r\nConfiguration: 2.1 Channel\r\nOutput Power: Approx. 40W – 80W\r\nConnectivity: Bluetooth + AUX + USB\r\nSubwoofer Size: Around 5–6 inches (in similar models)\r\nCompatibility: TV, PC, Laptop, Mobile\r\nPower Source: AC powered',NULL,NULL,'products/1775638559505-889883721.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 08:55:59','2026-04-08 08:55:59'),
