(3693,'Target TT-MS-105 Multimedia speaker',' TT-MS-105 ',NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The TARGET TT-MS-105 is a 2.0 channel multimedia speaker that offers good sound clarity and improved bass, making it a solid choice for daily entertainment and budget home audio setups.','Type: Multimedia Speaker\r\nConfiguration: 2.0 Channel\r\nOutput Power: Approx. 20W – 40W\r\nConnectivity: Wired (3.5mm AUX)\r\nCompatibility: TV, PC, Laptop, Mobile\r\nPower Source: AC powered\r\nDesign: Desktop / Home audio use',NULL,NULL,'products/1775639356564-219298068.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 09:09:16','2026-04-08 09:09:16'),
(3694,'JBL A500HI 500W Max power threeway car speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,3999.00,'The JBL A500HI 500W three-way car speaker is a high-performance 6×9 inch coaxial speaker system designed to upgrade factory car audio with stronger bass, clearer vocals, and crisp highs. It features a 3-way speaker design, meaning it includes a woofer, midrange driver, and tweeter working together to deliver full-range sound reproduction. With a maximum power of 500W and around 75W RMS output, it provides loud and dynamic audio suitable for everyday driving as well as high-volume listening.','The speaker uses a polypropylene (IMPP) cone for durability and solid bass, along with a PEI balanced dome tweeter and super tweeter for clear high frequencies. It offers a wide frequency response of approximately 45Hz to 20kHz, ensuring good coverage of low, mid, and high tones. With 92dB sensitivity and 4-ohm impedance, it can perform efficiently even with standard car stereos, though pairing with an amplifier gives better output.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775639386746-505228820.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 09:09:46','2026-04-08 09:09:46'),
(3695,'Target TT-MS-116 Multimedia Speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The Target TT-MS-116 multimedia speaker is a high-power single tower speaker system designed for loud audio performance in homes, shops, and small event environments. It typically features a large 10-inch woofer with built-in tweeters, delivering strong bass along with clear mid and high frequencies. This model is a wired multimedia speaker with a built-in amplifier, making it a simple plug-and-play solution for TVs, computers, DVD players, and audio systems.','The speaker usually provides around 100W RMS output power, making it suitable for high-volume listening and small party setups. It offers a frequency response of around 150Hz to 18kHz, ensuring decent sound clarity across bass, mid, and treble ranges . Designed as a 2-way speaker system, it focuses on delivering powerful sound output rather than advanced connectivity features like Bluetooth.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775639554830-239907422.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 09:12:34','2026-04-08 09:12:34'),
(3696,'Target Car MP3 Player',' TT-CMS-767FM-UMB ',NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The TARGET TT-CMS-767FM-UMB Car MP3 Player is a feature-rich car stereo system designed to enhance in-car entertainment with modern connectivity and powerful sound output. It delivers up to 200W power (4×50W), providing clear and loud audio for music and calls. Equipped with Bluetooth functionality, it allows wireless music streaming and hands-free calling for safe driving.','Model: TT-CMS-767FM-UMB\r\nType: Car MP3 Player / Car Stereo\r\nOutput Power: 200W (4×50W)\r\nConnectivity: Bluetooth, USB, AUX\r\nDisplay: Color LCD\r\nFunctions: Music playback, FM radio, hands-free calling\r\nCompatibility: Smartphones, USB drives, car speakers',NULL,NULL,'products/1775640585422-757903930.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 09:29:45','2026-04-08 09:29:45'),
(3697,'Target Car MP3 Player',' TT-CMS-766FM-UMB',NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The TARGET TT-CMS-766FM-UMB Car MP3 Player is a budget-friendly in-dash car stereo designed to provide reliable music playback and modern connectivity features. It typically offers Bluetooth support for wireless music streaming and hands-free calling, making driving safer and more convenient. The unit also includes USB and AUX input options, allowing users to play songs directly from pen drives or mobile devices.','Bluetooth Connectivity – Wireless music & hands-free calling\r\n Power Output (Approx. 200W – 4×50W) – Loud and clear sound (similar models)\r\n USB & AUX Input – Multiple playback options\r\n FM Radio – Listen to local stations\r\n EQ Controls – Adjust bass, treble, balance\r\n Remote Control Support – Easy operation\r\n Digital Display – Clear interface for navigation\r\n Typical Specifications',NULL,NULL,'products/1775641211639-757936238.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 09:40:11','2026-04-08 09:40:11'),
(3698,'Target Car MP3 Player',' TT-CMS-765FM-UMB ',NULL,NULL,2999.00,'The TARGET TT-CMS-765FM-UMB Car MP3 Player is a compact and affordable Single DIN car stereo system designed to upgrade your vehicle’s audio experience. It supports Bluetooth connectivity for wireless music streaming and hands-free calling, allowing safe and convenient use while driving. The player also includes USB and AUX input options, enabling playback from pen drives and mobile devices.','Type: Car MP3 Player / Car Stereo\r\nSize: Single DIN\r\nConnectivity: Bluetooth, USB, AUX\r\nFunctions: Music playback, FM radio, calling\r\nCompatibility: Smartphone, USB drive, car speakers',NULL,NULL,'products/1775642753773-522135012.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 10:05:53','2026-04-08 10:05:53'),
(3699,'MAGNETZ Audio system-MG-222A','MG-222A',NULL,NULL,1699.00,'The MAGNETZ MG-222A is a budget 2.1 multimedia speaker system that offers good sound output, deep bass, and multiple connectivity options, making it a great choice for affordable home entertainment.','Model: MG-222A\r\nType: Multimedia / Home Audio Speaker\r\nConfiguration: 2.1 Channel\r\nOutput Power: Approx. 30W – 60W (varies by version)\r\nConnectivity: Bluetooth / USB / AUX\r\nCompatibility: TV, PC, Laptop, Mobile\r\nPower Source: AC powered\r\n',NULL,NULL,'products/1775644412326-291197037.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 10:33:32','2026-04-08 10:33:32'),
(3700,'C9014 transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,160.00,'The C9014 transistor is a widely used NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) designed for general-purpose amplification and switching applications. It is commonly found in audio circuits, small signal amplification, and low-power electronic devices','The C9014 transistor works like a switch or amplifier. A small current at the base controls a larger current flowing from collector to emitter, making it useful in many electronic circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775644424817-306876516.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 10:33:44','2026-04-08 10:33:44'),
(3701,'187P transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The 187P transistor (often marked as C187P / 2SC187P) is a general-purpose NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) used mainly for signal amplification and switching applications. The “P” suffix usually indicates a specific gain group or manufacturer variant of the standard C187 transistor.','The 187P transistor works like a mini switch or amplifier. A small current at the base controls a larger current between collector and emitter, making it useful in many low-power electronics.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775645254635-835239428.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 10:47:34','2026-04-08 10:47:34'),
(3702,'C828 transistor',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The C828 transistor (also known as 2SC828) is a general-purpose NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) widely used in audio, switching, and small signal amplification circuits. It is popular in consumer electronics due to its reliability and low cost','The C828 transistor acts as a small amplifier or electronic switch, where a tiny base current controls a larger current flowing from collector to emitter.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775645544364-587835183.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 10:52:24','2026-04-08 10:52:24'),
(3703,'BC327 transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The BC327 transistor is a PNP bipolar junction transistor (BJT) designed for general-purpose amplification and switching applications. It is commonly used in audio circuits, driver stages, and low-power control circuits.','The BC327 is a PNP transistor, meaning current flows when the base is pulled low. It is often used with an NPN transistor like BC337 to form push-pull or switching circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775645723403-27975221.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 10:55:23','2026-04-08 10:55:23'),
(3704,'iplay mp3 multimedia player',NULL,NULL,NULL,499.00,'The iPlay MP3 Multimedia Player is a compact and portable digital device designed for music lovers who want simple, on-the-go entertainment. It supports playback of MP3 audio files and often includes additional multimedia features like video playback, FM radio, and image viewing, making it a versatile pocket-sized gadget.','MP3 Audio Playback – Clear and smooth sound quality for music and recordings\r\nMultimedia Support – Plays MP3, WAV audio and sometimes MP4/AMV video formats\r\nBuilt-in Display – Small LCD screen for song navigation and media control\r\nFM Radio – Listen to local radio stations anytime\r\nUSB Rechargeable – Easy charging via USB cable\r\nExpandable Storage – Supports microSD/TF cards for additional storage\r\nLightweight & Portable – Easy to carry in pocket or bag',NULL,NULL,'products/1775646012244-605234897.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 11:00:12','2026-04-08 11:00:12'),
(3705,'C1674 transistor ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The C1674 transistor (also written as 2SC1674) is a low-noise NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) mainly designed for audio amplification and signal processing circuits. It is commonly used in pre-amplifier stages, tone control circuits, and radio frequency (RF) applications.','The C1674 transistor is mainly used where clean (low-noise) signal amplification is required. A small input signal at the base gets amplified into a larger output signal at the collector, making it perfect for audio circuits',NULL,NULL,'products/1775646167395-488766567.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 11:02:47','2026-04-08 11:02:47'),
(3706,'Arihant Digital Car Multimedia Player','0011',NULL,NULL,1399.00,'The Arihant Digital Car Multimedia Player is a modern in-dash entertainment system designed to enhance the driving experience with advanced audio, video, and connectivity features. It combines music playback, smartphone connectivity, and navigation support in a single compact unit, making it a popular choice for upgrading car interiors.','Digital Multimedia Playback – Supports MP3, WAV, WMA and video formats for full entertainment\r\nTouchscreen Display – Clear screen (commonly around 800×480 resolution) for easy control and navigation\r\nBluetooth Connectivity – Enables hands-free calling and wireless music streaming\r\nUSB & AUX Support – Connect pendrive, mobile, or other external devices\r\nFM Radio Tuner – Built-in radio for live channels and news\r\nAndroid-Based System (in many models) – Allows apps, navigation, and smart features\r\nMulti-Speaker Output – Supports 4.1 channel audio system for better sound experience',NULL,NULL,'products/1775646969145-769823230.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 11:16:09','2026-04-08 11:16:09'),
(3707,'XINIA Car Stereo Cabinet Multimedia Player',NULL,NULL,NULL,1199.00,'The Xinia Car Stereo Cabinet Multimedia Player is a car audio entertainment system that combines a multimedia player with an external cabinet (speaker box or amplifier enclosure). It is designed to deliver powerful sound output and enhanced bass performance, making it suitable for vehicles and custom audio setups.','Multimedia Playback – Supports MP3, USB, SD card, and AUX input\r\nHigh-Power Audio Output – Works with external cabinet speakers for strong bass and loud sound\r\nBuilt-in FM Radio – Tune into local stations\r\nBluetooth Connectivity (in some models) – Wireless music streaming and hands-free calling\r\nRemote Control Support – Easy operation from a distance\r\nMultiple Input Options – USB, AUX, and memory card support',NULL,NULL,'products/1775647498868-519357894.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 11:24:58','2026-04-08 11:24:58'),
(3708,'Oswal 109 car stereo cabinet with USB/MMC','109',NULL,NULL,1398.00,'The Oswal 109 Car Stereo Cabinet with USB/MMC is a budget-friendly car audio system that combines a multimedia player with a cabinet (speaker box) to deliver loud and bass-rich sound. It is designed for users who want simple music playback with strong audio output in cars or small outdoor setups.','USB & MMC Card Support – Play music directly from pendrive and memory card\r\nMP3 Playback – Supports common audio formats for easy music listening\r\nBuilt-in FM Radio – Tune into local radio stations\r\nHigh Sound Output – Cabinet speaker provides louder volume and better bass\r\nFront Control Panel – Buttons for play, pause, volume, and track control\r\nRemote Control Support (in some units) – Easy operation',NULL,NULL,'products/1775648475719-36597725.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 11:41:15','2026-04-08 11:41:15'),
(3709,'24C16N IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The 24C16N IC is a 16-kilobit (2KB) serial EEPROM (Electrically Erasable Programmable Read-Only Memory) that communicates using the I²C (Inter-Integrated Circuit) protocol. It is widely used in electronic systems to store small but important data permanently, such as device settings, calibration values, and configuration parameters.','The 24C16N IC stores data in memory cells that can be electrically written and erased. It communicates with a microcontroller using only two wires (SDA and SCL), making it simple and efficient for embedded systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775648567954-299539793.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 11:42:47','2026-04-08 11:42:47'),
(3710,'24C32N IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The 24C32N IC is a 32K-bit (4KB) serial EEPROM (Electrically Erasable Programmable Read-Only Memory) used for storing small amounts of data that must be retained even when power is turned off. It communicates using the I²C (Inter-Integrated Circuit) protocol, making it very popular in microcontroller-based projects.','The 24C32N is a serial EEPROM memory IC widely used in embedded systems for permanent data storage. It belongs to the 24Cxx family, where “32” indicates 32 kilobits (4KB) of storage.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775649358444-469365948.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 11:55:58','2026-04-08 11:55:58'),
(3711,'24C64BN IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The 24C64BN IC is a 64K-bit (8KB) serial EEPROM memory device that stores data permanently, even when power is removed. It is an improved version of the standard 24C64 series and uses the I²C (Inter-Integrated Circuit) communication protocol, requiring only two lines—SDA (data) and SCL (clock)—to interface with microcontrollers.','This IC contains 8192 bytes of non-volatile memory, organized into pages that allow efficient data storage and faster writing. It supports both byte write and page write operations, making it suitable for applications where small but reliable data storage is needed.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775650206616-311098227.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 12:10:06','2026-04-08 12:10:06'),
(3712,'24C08WP IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The 24C08WP IC is an 8K-bit (1KB) serial EEPROM memory device used for storing small amounts of data permanently, even when power is turned off. It operates using the I²C (two-wire) communication protocol, making it easy to interface with microcontrollers like Arduino, PIC, and AVR.','The 24C08WP is a compact, reliable EEPROM IC with 1KB storage, ideal for storing small but important data using a simple I²C interface, with added write protection for safety.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775650507042-601127414.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 12:15:07','2026-04-08 12:15:07'),
(3713,'93C46W6 IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The 93C46W6 IC is a 1K-bit (128 × 8 or 64 × 16) serial EEPROM memory device used for storing small amounts of data permanently. Unlike the 24C series, it uses the Microwire (3-wire) communication interface, making it suitable for systems that require simple and fast serial data transfer.','The 93C46W6 is a compact and reliable EEPROM IC with a Microwire interface, ideal for applications requiring small data storage with flexible 8-bit/16-bit organization and controlled write operations.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775650751702-182916718.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 12:19:11','2026-04-08 12:19:11'),
(3714,'OPTO COUPLER B321 IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The B321 IC is an optocoupler (opto-isolator) used to transfer electrical signals between two circuits while keeping them electrically isolated. It works using light (optical coupling) instead of direct electrical connection, which protects sensitive components from high voltage, noise, and spikes.','The B321 optocoupler IC is a simple and effective isolation device that safely transfers signals using light, making it essential in circuits where protection and noise isolation are required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775651602977-50665064.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 12:33:22','2026-04-08 12:39:56'),
(3715,'OPTO COUPLER P521 IC',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The P521 IC is an optocoupler (opto-isolator) used to transfer signals between two circuits while providing electrical isolation. It uses light to transmit signals, ensuring that high-voltage or noisy circuits do not damage sensitive components like microcontrollers.','The P521 optocoupler IC is a reliable isolation component that safely transfers signals using light, making it essential for protecting circuits and improving system stability in electronic designs.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775651858768-206502808.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 12:37:38','2026-04-08 12:37:38'),
(3716,'P522D ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The P522D transistor is a power transistor commonly used in electronic circuits for switching and amplification of high current signals. It is designed to handle more power compared to small signal transistors, making it suitable for audio, power supply, and control applications.','The P522D is a reliable power transistor used for handling higher current and voltage in electronic circuits. It is widely used in switching and amplification applications where durability and thermal stability are important.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775654481777-227350414.png',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 13:21:21','2026-04-08 13:21:21'),
(3717,'B340 ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The B340 (commonly BD340) is a PNP power transistor designed for medium-power amplification and switching applications. It is widely used in audio amplifiers, driver stages, and power control circuits due to its good current handling and reliability.','The B340 / BD340 is a PNP medium-power transistor suitable for amplification and switching, especially in audio and power circuits. It offers a good balance of performance, durability, and ease of use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775654979151-691605459.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 13:29:39','2026-04-08 13:29:39'),
(3718,'P321J',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The P321J transistor is a power transistor used for switching and amplification of medium to high power signals in electronic circuits. It is designed to handle higher current and voltage compared to small signal transistors, making it suitable for power electronics applications.','The P321J is a reliable power transistor used in circuits that require handling higher current and voltage, commonly applied in switching and amplification tasks in electronic systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775655208343-942160674.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 13:33:28','2026-04-08 13:33:28'),
(3719,'D2030A',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The D2030A (2SD2030A) is a high-power NPN transistor mainly used in horizontal output and power switching applications, especially in CRT televisions, SMPS circuits, and high-voltage sections. It is designed to handle high voltage and fast switching, making it suitable for demanding electronic circuits.','The D2030A (2SD2030A) is a high-voltage, high-speed NPN power transistor, widely used in TV horizontal output and power switching circuits, known for its durability and performance in demanding applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775656114276-748287772.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 13:48:34','2026-04-08 13:48:34'),
(3720,'TTA1943',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The TTA1943 (also known as 2SA1943) is a high-power PNP transistor widely used in audio amplifier output stages and high-power electronic circuits. It is designed for high voltage, high current, and excellent sound performance, making it very popular in professional amplifier designs.','The TTA1943 (2SA1943) is a high-performance PNP power transistor, mainly used in audio amplifier circuits, known for its high power handling, reliability, and excellent sound quality.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775656403582-811605278.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 13:53:23','2026-04-08 13:53:23'),
(3721,'BT136',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The BT136 is not a transistor—it is a TRIAC (Triode for Alternating Current), a power semiconductor device used to control AC loads. It can switch current in both directions, making it ideal for applications like light dimmers, fan regulators, and AC motor control.','The BT136 is a widely used TRIAC device for controlling AC power, offering efficient and simple switching for household and industrial applications like dimmers and motor speed control.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775656707894-937774719.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 13:58:27','2026-04-08 13:58:27'),
(3722,'LM2576T',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The LM2576T is a step-down (buck) switching voltage regulator IC used to efficiently convert a higher DC voltage into a lower, stable DC output. It is widely used in power supply circuits due to its high efficiency and simple design.','The LM2576T is a reliable and efficient buck converter IC capable of delivering up to 3A output current, making it ideal for power supply and voltage regulation applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775656912869-499984011.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 14:01:52','2026-04-08 14:01:52'),
(3723,'IRF3205',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The IRF3205 is a high-power N-channel MOSFET (Metal Oxide Semiconductor Field Effect Transistor) designed for high current and low resistance switching applications. It is widely used in inverters, motor drivers, SMPS, and power control circuits due to its very low ON resistance and high efficiency.','The IRF3205 is a high-performance N-channel MOSFET known for its low ON resistance and high current handling, making it ideal for power switching and inverter applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775657100607-300094893.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 14:05:00','2026-04-08 14:05:00'),
(3724,'P5460',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The P5460 transistor is a power transistor (generally PNP type) designed for high current and voltage applications such as amplification and switching. It is commonly used in audio amplifiers, power supplies, and control circuits where reliable performance and thermal stability are required.','The P5460 is a robust PNP power transistor suitable for switching and amplification in power electronics, offering reliable performance in circuits that require handling higher current and voltage.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775657650964-923910961.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 14:14:10','2026-04-08 14:14:10'),
(3725,'BD139 ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The BD139 is a medium-power NPN transistor widely used for amplification and switching applications. It is known for its reliability, low cost, and good performance, making it a popular choice in audio and general-purpose electronic circuits.','The BD139 is a versatile NPN transistor ideal for medium-power amplification and switching, commonly used in audio circuits and driver stages due to its stability and efficiency.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775657943368-501996397.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-08 14:19:03','2026-04-08 14:19:03'),
(3726,'ERD  switching mode power supply',NULL,NULL,NULL,1199.00,'An ERD Switching Mode Power Supply (SMPS) is a device that converts AC 230V electricity into stable DC power (mainly 12V) for CCTV cameras, DVRs, LED lights, and other electronic devices.','The ERD Switching Mode Power Supply (SMPS) is an electronic device that converts AC (230V) electricity into stable DC output (commonly 12V). It is widely used to power CCTV cameras, DVRs, LED lights, routers, and other electronic devices.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775706360718-995675060.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-09 03:46:00','2026-04-09 03:46:00'),
