(3738,'3055T',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The 3055T power transistor is a high-power NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) designed for general-purpose power amplification and switching. It is widely used in electronic circuits that require handling high current and high voltage, making it a popular choice in audio and power supply systems.','It is capable of delivering high output power with stable performance, making it suitable for audio amplifiers, voltage regulators, motor drivers, and inverter circuits. However, because of its low switching speed, it is mainly used in low-frequency and linear applications rather than high-speed switching circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775731549646-81153913.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-09 10:45:49','2026-04-09 10:45:49'),
(3739,'TTC5200',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The TTC5200 power transistor is a high-performance NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) designed mainly for audio power amplification and high-current applications. It is an improved and reliable version similar to the famous 2SC5200, widely used in professional amplifier circuits.','This transistor comes in a TO-264 package, which provides excellent heat dissipation and allows it to handle high power levels efficiently. Due to its high current capacity and low distortion characteristics, the TTC5200 is commonly used in high-quality audio amplifiers and sound systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775731781016-1165607.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-09 10:49:41','2026-04-09 10:49:41'),
(3740,'IRFBC40',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The IRFBC40 power transistor is a high-voltage N-channel MOSFET designed for fast switching and power control applications. Unlike bipolar transistors, it operates using voltage control, which makes it highly efficient and suitable for modern electronic circuits.','It is housed in a TO-220 package, allowing for easy mounting on heat sinks and efficient heat dissipation. The IRFBC40 is well-known for its high-speed switching capability, low ON resistance, and ability to handle high voltage loads, making it ideal for switching power supplies and inverter circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775731984150-622781117.webp',1,1,'active','2026-04-09 10:53:04','2026-04-09 10:53:04'),
(3741,'P213J',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The P213J power transistor is a general-purpose NPN bipolar junction transistor (BJT) commonly used in audio amplification and medium-power electronic circuits. It is designed to handle moderate voltage and current levels, making it suitable for both amplification and switching applications.','This transistor typically comes in a TO-220 package, which allows easy mounting with a heat sink for better thermal performance. The P213J is known for its stable operation and reliability, especially in low to medium power amplifier circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775732674535-486609025.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-09 11:04:34','2026-04-09 11:04:34'),
(3742,'L7808CV',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The L7808CV is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +8V DC output. It belongs to the widely used 78xx series of voltage regulators, where the last two digits indicate the output voltage (7808 = 8V).','This regulator is designed to deliver a constant output voltage even when there are fluctuations in the input voltage or load conditions. It is commonly used in electronic circuits where a reliable 8V power supply is required.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775733859217-555885936.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-09 11:24:19','2026-04-09 11:24:19'),
(3743,'L7805CV',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The L7805CV is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +5V DC output. It is part of the widely used 78xx series, where “05” indicates a 5V output.\r\nThis regulator is designed to maintain a constant output voltage even when the input voltage or load conditions change, making it ideal for powering sensitive electronic components like microcontrollers and digital circuits.','The L7805CV is one of the most commonly used 5V regulators, perfect for delivering a reliable and stable power supply in electronics projects and circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775735107494-648617180.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-09 11:45:07','2026-04-09 11:45:07'),
(3744,'L7806CV',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The L7806CV is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that delivers a stable +6V DC output. It belongs to the popular 78xx series of voltage regulators, where “06” represents a 6V output voltage.\r\nThis regulator is designed to provide a constant and reliable voltage, even when the input voltage fluctuates or the load changes. It is widely used in circuits that require a steady 6V power supply.','The L7806CV regulator is a simple and effective solution for providing a stable 6V output, making it useful in a wide range of electronic applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775735292158-911949677.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-09 11:48:12','2026-04-09 11:48:12'),
