(3747,'L805CV',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The L7805CV is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +5V DC output. It belongs to the widely used 78xx series, where “05” indicates a 5V regulated output.\r\nThis IC is designed to keep the output voltage constant and steady, even if the input voltage changes or the load varies. It is one of the most commonly used regulators for powering digital electronics and microcontroller circuits.','The L7805CV is one of the most popular 5V regulators, ideal for providing a reliable and stable power source in electronic circuits.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775736211470-642745655.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-09 12:03:31','2026-04-09 12:03:31'),
