(3749,'AS7821A',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'The AS7821A is a fixed positive linear voltage regulator IC that provides a stable +21V DC output. It belongs to the 78xx series family, where the number “21” indicates a 21V regulated output voltage.\r\n\r\nThis regulator is designed to maintain a constant output voltage even when there are variations in input voltage or load conditions. It is suitable for circuits that require a stable 21V power supply, especially in industrial and analog applications.','The AS7821A regulator is a reliable choice for generating a stable 21V output, especially in industrial and analog electronic applications.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775736950013-898281367.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-09 12:15:50','2026-04-09 12:15:50'),
