(3771,'SRC woofer and speaker ',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'An SRC 5-inch woofer speaker is a medium-small audio driver designed to produce clear sound with moderate bass output. It is widely used in multimedia speakers, car audio systems, and home speaker boxes.','The SRC 5-inch 4Ω woofer speaker is a compact and affordable speaker that provides clear sound with moderate bass, ideal for small audio systems and car speakers.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775828410478-79734963.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 13:40:10','2026-04-10 13:40:10'),
(3772,'SRC woofer and speaker ','Model : FW-S780',NULL,NULL,599.00,'The SRC FW-S780 is a multimedia speaker system (woofer + satellite speakers) designed for home audio, TV, and computer use. It delivers clear sound with decent bass output, making it suitable for music, movies, and daily entertainment.','The SRC FW-S780 is a 2.1 multimedia speaker system with a woofer and satellite speakers, offering good bass, clear sound, and multiple connectivity options, ideal for TV and home audio use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775828673375-378093546.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 13:44:33','2026-04-10 13:44:33'),
(3773,'SRC woofer and speaker ',NULL,NULL,NULL,599.00,'SRC woofer and speaker systems are budget multimedia audio devices designed for home entertainment, TV, and computer use. They usually come as a 2.1 speaker system (1 woofer + 2 satellite speakers) or as individual speaker drivers.','SRC woofer and speaker systems are budget multimedia audio solutions that provide good bass, clear sound, and easy connectivity, ideal for TV, computer, and home use.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775828912201-205146443.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 13:48:32','2026-04-10 13:48:32'),
(3774,'SRC  speaker plastic  grill ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'An SRC plastic speaker grill is a protective cover used in front of speakers and woofers to protect the cone from dust, damage, and physical contact. It also gives a stylish look to speaker boxes and car audio systems.','An SRC plastic speaker grill is a low-cost protective cover used for woofers and speakers, offering safety, durability, and better appearance for audio systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775829941839-427396572.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 14:05:41','2026-04-10 14:10:01'),
(3775,'SRC  speaker plastic  grill ',NULL,NULL,NULL,159.00,'An SRC 6-inch plastic speaker grill is a protective cover fitted in front of a speaker or woofer. It helps to protect the speaker cone from dust, damage, and accidental touch, while allowing sound to pass clearly.','The SRC 6-inch plastic speaker grill is a low-cost protective accessory that keeps your woofer/speaker safe and stylish, ideal for home and car audio systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775830149646-859386280.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 14:09:09','2026-04-10 14:09:09'),
(3776,'Argo subwoofer ',NULL,NULL,NULL,2299.00,'The Argo-type 120mm red subwoofer is a compact woofer speaker driver designed to deliver deep bass and clear mid sound in small audio systems. With its red cone design, it also gives a stylish look to speaker boxes.','The Argo 120mm red subwoofer is a small, stylish woofer that provides decent bass and clear sound, ideal for compact home and car audio systems.',NULL,NULL,'products/1775830598812-869121102.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-10 14:16:38','2026-04-10 14:16:38'),
(3777,'ss','ss','ss',NULL,13.00,'s','zz','z',NULL,NULL,0,1,'active','2026-04-13 10:53:27','2026-04-16 11:23:40'),
