(3779,'Sony sub woofer ','Model : XS-GTF840B ',NULL,NULL,799.00,'A Sony 8-inch 100W subwoofer is a compact yet powerful speaker designed to produce deep bass (low-frequency sound) for car audio systems or home theatre setups. It enhances music by adding strong punch and vibration, especially for beats and bass-heavy tracks.','Sony subwoofers are known for their solid build quality and clean bass performance. Some versions include a built-in amplifier (active subwoofer), while others require an external amplifier (passive subwoofer). They may also support frequency ranges around 25Hz–250Hz, focusing on low-end sound reproduction.',NULL,NULL,'products/1776248593405-271836069.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-15 10:23:13','2026-04-15 10:23:13'),
(3780,'Sony sub woofer ','Model : XS-GTF640',NULL,NULL,799.00,'A Sony 6-inch 80W subwoofer is a compact bass speaker designed to deliver clear and punchy low-frequency sound in small audio setups. It is ideal for car audio systems, mini home theatre setups, and DIY speaker projects.','The speaker usually features a durable cone material and strong magnet structure, allowing efficient vibration and better bass response. Compared to larger subwoofers (8\" or 10\"), a 6-inch version is more space-saving and can be easily installed in car doors, rear trays, or compact enclosures.',NULL,NULL,'products/1776249125832-200119189.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-15 10:32:05','2026-04-15 10:32:05'),
(3781,'jsjs','snns','sjsj',NULL,12.00,'kaka','snjs','sjsj',NULL,NULL,0,1,'active','2026-04-15 10:49:24','2026-04-16 10:05:55'),
(3782,'Walta spark speaker ',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'A Walta Spark speaker (commonly called Walta Elite Spark Bluetooth Speaker) is a portable wireless speaker designed for music, parties, and outdoor use. It combines stylish design with RGB lighting and delivers clear sound with decent bass.','Walta Spark speaker is a budget-friendly portable speaker with good sound, attractive lighting, and useful connectivity features—best for casual music and small party use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'active','2026-04-15 10:57:33','2026-04-15 10:57:33'),
(3783,'OUD megavoice handheld megaphone','Model : OD-BT1511',NULL,NULL,1699.00,'An OUD Megavoice Handheld Megaphone (24000mAh) is a high-power portable loudspeaker designed for long-distance voice amplification and outdoor announcements. It is commonly used in public events, schools, rallies, security, and emergency situations','This megaphone is built with a large-capacity rechargeable battery (around 24000mAh), providing long backup time for continuous use. It delivers powerful sound output that can cover a wide area, making it suitable for crowd control and outdoor communication.',NULL,NULL,'products/1776251513656-256322201.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-15 11:11:53','2026-04-15 11:11:53'),
(3784,'Akari rehone chargeable handheld microphone','Model : AK-123ssss',NULL,NULL,1299.00,'The Akari Rehone Chargeable Handheld Microphone 400W is a powerful all-in-one portable sound system designed for announcements, public speaking, events, and outdoor use. It combines a microphone, speaker, and rechargeable battery in a single compact device, making it easy to carry and use anywhere.','The microphone supports multiple connectivity options such as USB, memory card (TF), AUX input, and in some models Bluetooth, enabling users to play music or recorded audio directly. It also includes volume and echo controls to adjust sound quality according to the environment.',NULL,NULL,'products/1776252433720-794228160.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-04-15 11:27:13','2026-04-17 04:03:44'),
(3785,'MZ handheld megaphone ','Model : M1c11',NULL,NULL,699.00,'The MZ Handheld Megaphone 75W with 1200mAh battery is a compact and efficient portable voice amplifier designed for clear communication in both indoor and outdoor environments. It is widely used for announcements, crowd control, events, and emergency situations.','This megaphone delivers 75W power output, providing loud and clear sound projection suitable for medium-sized crowds. It offers an audible range of up to 500 meters, making it effective for outdoor use such as rallies, schools, and public gatherings.',NULL,NULL,'products/1776252678910-101189270.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-15 11:31:18','2026-04-15 11:31:18'),
(3786,'Milenium plastic grill  8\" inch ',NULL,NULL,NULL,89.00,'The Milenium Plastic Grill 8-inch Speaker is a durable protective cover designed to safeguard speaker cones and internal components from dust, damage, and external impact. Made from high-quality PVC or ABS plastic, this grill ensures long-lasting performance while maintaining clear sound output.','This round-shaped grill is specifically designed to fit 8-inch speakers and subwoofers, making it suitable for home audio systems, car speakers, and DIY speaker box projects. Its perforated mesh design allows sound waves to pass through with minimal distortion while providing effective protection.',NULL,NULL,'products/1776252962221-27212561.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-15 11:36:02','2026-04-15 11:36:02'),
(3787,'Milenium plastic grill  4\" inch ',NULL,NULL,NULL,89.00,'The Milenium Plastic Grill 4-inch Speaker is a compact protective cover designed to safeguard small speakers and tweeters from dust, physical damage, and external impact. Made from high-quality plastic (PVC/ABS), it offers durability while maintaining lightweight performance.','This grill is specially designed for 4-inch speakers, commonly used in home audio systems, car speakers, multimedia speakers, and DIY speaker boxes. Its perforated mesh design allows smooth sound transmission without affecting audio clarity while protecting the speaker cone.',NULL,NULL,'products/1776253107544-917746390.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-15 11:38:27','2026-04-15 11:38:27'),
(3788,'Speedon speaker and woofer',NULL,NULL,NULL,999.00,'The Speedon 8-inch Speaker & Woofer is a high-performance audio driver designed to deliver deep bass and clear sound output for home audio systems, car speakers, and DIY speaker boxes. It is widely used for building subwoofer cabinets and sound systems where strong low-frequency performance is required.','This 8-inch woofer is built with a heavy magnet structure and durable cone material, which helps produce powerful bass and long-lasting performance. It typically supports 4-ohm impedance, making it compatible with most amplifiers and audio boards.',NULL,NULL,'products/1776253318220-479646701.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-15 11:41:58','2026-04-15 11:41:58'),
(3789,'Kavoxtron woofer ',NULL,NULL,NULL,699.00,'The Kavoxtron 6-inch 40W woofer is a compact and reliable speaker designed to deliver clear bass and smooth mid-range sound for everyday audio applications. With a power handling capacity of 40 watts and typical impedance of 4 to 8 ohms, it provides balanced performance suitable for home audio systems, car speakers, and DIY projects.','Built with a durable paper cone, copper voice coil, and ferrite magnet, it ensures good sound quality, efficiency, and long-lasting use. This woofer is ideal for users looking for an affordable solution to enhance bass output in small to medium speaker setups while maintaining clear and distortion-free audio.',NULL,NULL,'products/1776258787802-750415276.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-15 13:13:07','2026-04-15 13:14:21'),
(3790,'panasonic woofer ',NULL,NULL,NULL,699.00,'The Panasonic 6-inch 40W woofer is a high-quality speaker driver designed to deliver smooth and balanced low-frequency sound for home audio systems and DIY speaker projects. Built with a durable paper cone and foam surround, it produces clear bass with minimal distortion','It features a copper voice coil and ferrite magnet, ensuring efficient performance and long-lasting durability. With a typical power handling of 40 watts RMS and impedance around 6 ohms, this woofer is suitable for both sealed and ported enclosures, making it a reliable choice for moderate bass applications and everyday listening',NULL,NULL,'products/1776259604758-578090730.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-04-15 13:26:44','2026-04-15 13:26:44'),
