(35,'Service','A System Note is an internal or technical message generated by a system or software to record actions, updates, warnings, or operational details.','Service Info refers to brief and important details that give quick knowledge about a product, feature, or system without lengthy explanation.','Covers multiple locations or regions\r\nProvides warranty and after-sales support\r\nEnsures quick service response\r\nMaintains product performance and reliability\r\nIncludes trained technicians and spare parts availability','A System Note is an internal or technical message generated by a system or software to record actions, updates, warnings, or operational details.','sector-titles/1771508495546-851931015.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,'','https://circuitpoint.in/service',1,1,'active','2026-02-19 13:41:35','2026-02-19 13:41:35'),
