(12,17,'Building Materials','Building Materials are the essential raw and manufactured materials used in the construction of residential, commercial, industrial, and infrastructure projects','These materials determine the strength, durability, safety, appearance, and cost of a building. They are selected based on structural requirements, climate conditions, and design needs.',NULL,NULL,'sub-sectors/1771505503669-468523875.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-19 12:51:43','2026-02-20 09:05:51'),
(13,18,'Network','Network & Network Accessories focuses on providing connectivity solutions, communication infrastructure, and essential accessories required for building and maintaining reliable computer and mobile networks.','They form the backbone of modern networking infrastructure, ensuring smooth and secure communication between multiple devices.','Speed measured in Mbps or Gbps\r\nLatency affects real-time applications\r\nUpload vs Download speeds vary by connection type\r\nIP Addressing: Static or Dynamic\r\nSecurity: Firewalls, encryption, ISP-level protection','Networking devices are hardware components used to connect computers, smartphones, and other electronic systems to create communication networks. These devices enable data transfer, internet connectivity, wireless communication, and resource sharing acros','sub-sectors/1771510507838-780933078.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-19 14:15:07','2026-03-09 11:30:40'),
(14,19,'Audio','The technology and recorded representation of that sound, making it portable, shareable, and manipulable. Audio refers to sound, especially when recorded, transmitted, or reproduced electronically, encompassing speech, music, and noise, and involves techn','Devices like speakers, headphones, and amplifiers play back these electrical signals as audible sound, creating immersive experiences like stereo or surround sound.','speakers, headphones, and amplifiers','MP3, amplifiers, speakers','sub-sectors/1771514103865-13433275.jpg',0,1,'active','2026-02-19 15:15:03','2026-04-18 04:50:44'),
(15,19,'Project Components','Electronics components are the essential parts used to build circuits and electronic devices. Each component has a specific function such as controlling current, storing energy, switching signals, sensing changes in the environment, or processing data.','Below is a single combined description covering all common electronics components used in circuits and projects.',NULL,NULL,'sub-sectors/1771577341637-749716788.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-20 08:49:01','2026-02-20 08:49:01'),
(16,19,'Mobile Phones','A mobile phone is a portable electronic communication device used for making calls, sending messages, accessing the internet, and running applications. Modern mobile phones, known as smartphones, combine communication, computing, entertainment, and produc','A mobile phone is a portable electronic device used for wireless communication. It allows users to make calls, send messages, browse the internet, and run various applications. Modern mobile phones, known as smartphones, function like small computers and ',NULL,NULL,'sub-sectors/1771577416253-688321111.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-20 08:50:16','2026-02-20 08:50:16'),
(17,19,'Computer','A computer is an electronic device designed to process data, store information, and perform a wide variety of tasks such as browsing, programming, designing, gaming, office work, and communication. Computers are available in different forms, mainly deskto','A desktop computer is a powerful, non-portable system used in homes, offices, schools, and industries. It usually includes a CPU cabinet, monitor, keyboard, mouse, and speakers. A laptop is a compact, portable computer with a built-in screen, keyboard, ba',NULL,NULL,'sub-sectors/1771577488765-89104852.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-20 08:51:28','2026-02-20 08:51:28'),
(18,19,'Video','This video showcases a complete range of mobile phone accessories designed to enhance the performance, protection, and convenience of smartphones. Viewers will get a detailed look at the most commonly used accessories such as chargers, cables, power banks','It helps users understand which accessories are essential, how to choose the right products, and the benefits each accessory offers. From fast charging solutions to protective gear and audio devices, this video provides a full overview of the modern mobil',NULL,NULL,'sub-sectors/1771577567478-221107515.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-20 08:52:47','2026-02-20 08:52:47'),
(19,19,'Printer','A printer is an electronic output device that converts digital documents and images from a computer, laptop, or mobile device into printed hard copies on paper.','Printers are widely used in homes, offices, schools, businesses, and industries for documentation, communication, and record keeping.',NULL,NULL,'sub-sectors/1771577628894-53738072.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-20 08:53:48','2026-02-20 08:53:48'),
(20,19,'Basic Electronics Components','Basic electronic components are the fundamental building blocks used to design and assemble electronic circuits. Each component has a specific function that helps control, store, or modify electrical signals in electronic devices.','Basic electronic componentss are the essential elements used to design and build electronic circuits. These components control the flow of electricity, store energy, convert signals, and perform switching or amplification operations in electronic systemss','All electronic circuits are built using basic components.Each component has a symbol, value, and specific function. Understanding basics is essential for electronics, ECE, and electrical studies','Basic components are the foundation of all electronic circuits. Each component has a symbol, value, and specific function. Used in power supplies, communication systems, control circuits, and devices','sub-sectors/1771577694778-688803778.jpeg',1,1,'active','2026-02-20 08:54:54','2026-05-02 09:27:48'),
(21,19,'Soldering Tools','Soldering is the process of joining electronic components by melting a filler metal called solder to create a strong, conductive, and permanent electrical connection','It is one of the most essential skills in electronics assembly, repair, and DIY projects.','Soldering Tools','Soldering Tools','sub-sectors/1772260479961-784724801.png',0,1,'active','2026-02-20 08:56:02','2026-03-12 09:43:44'),
(22,20,'Electrical Connectors','An electrical connector is a device used to join electrical circuits together, allowing electricity or signals to flow from one component to another safely and efficiently.','Connectors make it possible to easily plug, unplug, assemble, or replace electrical parts without soldering, making them essential in electronics, automotive, industrial, and home electrical systems.',NULL,NULL,'sub-sectors/1771577888638-332575982.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-20 08:58:08','2026-02-20 13:29:55'),
(23,20,'Electricals Tools','Electrical Tools are specialized tools used for installation, maintenance, testing, and repair of electrical systems and equipment.','They are essential for electricians, technicians, contractors, and maintenance professionals to ensure safe, accurate, and efficient electrical work in residential, commercial, and industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,'sub-sectors/1772810264803-2772054.png',1,1,'active','2026-02-20 08:59:07','2026-03-06 15:17:44'),
(24,39,'CCTV','CCTV (Closed-Circuit Television) is a video surveillance system used to monitor, record, and secure homes, offices, shops, factories, and public spaces.','Modern CCTV systems support high-definition video, night vision, motion detection, remote viewing, and cloud or local storage, making them a key component of security infrastructure.',NULL,NULL,'sub-sectors/1771578041051-368092120.jpg',1,1,'active','2026-02-20 09:00:41','2026-04-18 05:21:35'),
(25,18,'Network1','Network & Network Accessories focuses on providing connectivity solutions, communication infrastructure, and essential accessories required for building and maintaining reliable computer and mobile networks.','They form the backbone of modern networking infrastructure, ensuring smooth and secure communication between multiple devices.','Speed measured in Mbps or Gbps\r\nLatency affects real-time applications\r\nUpload vs Download speeds vary by connection type\r\nIP Addressing: Static or Dynamic\r\nSecurity: Firewalls, encryption, ISP-level protection','Networking devices are hardware components used to connect computers, smartphones, and other electronic systems to create communication networks. These devices enable data transfer, internet connectivity, wireless communication, and resource sharing acros','sub-sectors/1771578126796-606117563.jpeg',1,1,'inactive','2026-02-20 09:02:06','2026-04-09 08:22:25'),
